99.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,0,14.270365576459383,4.78,4.73,4.77,4.69,11374200,A great place to stay.  The flat looks very good. Delicious Japanese and Italian restaurants around. The only thing to warn about is that it´s at the basement so you need to have your curtains closed to get privacy which makes the flat quite dark even during a sunny day.,1,0.9283,Positive
