58.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,42,100.0,0,3.835736178845096,4.61,4.58,4.66,4.54,31629992,"i strongly recommend staying at pascal's apartment! it was cozy and clean, with every amenity you could need to have a nice stay in berlin. there are a few grocery stores within walking distance and is well connected to other parts of the city.",1,0.8883,Positive
137.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,1,2.759966591003808,4.94,4.92,4.94,4.81,768616,"The apartment was very nice in my favorite neighborhood in Berlin. Lots of great cafes and restaurants just arouny the corner. Though it was quiet in the apartment. It's on the top floor. <br/><br/>Cornelius was very helpful and well organized. I recommend this place",1,0.9581,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,8,100.0,0,6.206282481050937,4.33,3.82,4.09,4.18,3846150,"I spent a full month at Jürgen’s place and I had a great time. The flat is just about a few minutes walking distance from the U8 – probably the most important tube line in Berlin, connecting Wedding with Mitte, Kreuzberg and Neuköln. It is a fully furnished flat, with everything a traveler might need: a fully equipped kitchen, fresh bed linings, shower towels, good books and a very eclectic selection of DVDs. It is an old flat in an old building, it has wooden floors and high ceilings, typical of early 20th century Berliner architecture. Jürgen as been abroad during my whole stay and I didn’t have the pleasure of meeting him personally. He has always been extremely helpful and caring on his e-mails replies. Overall, everything ran smooth as smooth can get, from key delivery to key return. Thanks for making it so easy Jürgen.",1,0.9809,Positive
103.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,0,4.179832601624142,4.59,4.65,4.31,4.44,45809645,Clean and well equipped. Friendly staff. In a very convenient location.,1,0.7906,Positive
