154.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,38,50.0,0,5.139610454985951,4.86,4.86,4.75,4.57,612306708010903880,"Die Unterkunft ist sehr sauber, besonders stilvoll eingerichtet und einfach gemütlich. Sie ist sehr gut ausgestattet und wir fühlten uns total wohl. Alles verlief reibungslos und wir wären am liebsten noch länger geblieben. Wirklich ein Schmuckstück in Berlin!",1,-0.636,Negative
157.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,45,100.0,0,5.245003120876255,4.77,4.72,4.68,4.61,11914556,Dan war sehr freundlich und einfach zu erreichen. Die Wohnung ist super schön eingerichtet und praktisch ausgestattet und liegt perfekt direkt am Tempelhofer Feld. Es war ein super Aufenthalt für drei Personen in Berlin. Ich kann die Wohnung sehr empfehlen.,0,-0.8316,Negative
137.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,1.6809549157543209,4.96,4.95,4.95,4.83,2061212,"Es ist schon etwas ganz Besonderes, im Studio einer Künstlerin zu wohnen - tolle Atmosphäre und äußerst nette Gastgeberin, für die später Check-out kein Problem war. Herrliche, ruhige Hoflage mit jeder Menge netter Lokale rundum, nur 3 Stationen vom Alexanderplatz weg. Danke!",1,-0.8955,Negative
157.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,45,100.0,0,5.245003120876255,4.77,4.72,4.68,4.61,11914556,Uns hat es sehr gut gefallen.  Wir würden immer wiederkommen.,0,0.0,Neutral
230.0,4,2.0,1.5,4.0,30,100.0,0,2.3001902519789743,4.79,4.79,4.79,4.61,9289390,"We (a group of 5) had a great stay in the appartment of Gueno. Mailcontact was smooth and we were welcomed by a friend of hers. The rooms were really nice with a lot of light and good beds! Because of the wondefull weather we also enjoyed the little balcony. <br/>The area is very calm and all interesting places in easy reach through public transport. Some wonderfull breakfast places are in walking distance, and the Flohmarkt around the corner on Sunday is really worth a visit. As is the Bernauer Strasse, with al the Mauer-stuff. We made a good choice!",0,0.9848,Positive
231.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,53,100.0,1,4.10145600811456,4.84,4.91,4.79,4.64,39507430,"Great location and a clean modern flat.  It is right by the train which is great for getting places but does get a bid loud at night and early mornings.   I also wish that the kitchen would have been a little more equipped from plates to salt.  There were 4 dinner plates, 4 cups etc.  So for our family of 4 it was constant washing when we used dishes so we could have cleans ones on had always.",0,0.8591,Positive
131.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,7.712537245918594,5.0,4.57,4.71,4.71,923954631701758802,Oliver war ein guter Gastgeber und immer schnell zu erreichen und sehr zuvorkommend.<br/>Die Unterkunft ist wie beschrieben,1,-0.5994,Negative
148.0,5,1.0,1.0,5.0,53,100.0,1,16.15581114423226,4.82,4.92,4.78,4.63,3968204,"The apartment is located in a relatively quiet neighbourhood. The apartment was clean and spacious. Marco was a great host: he responded quickly and even let us host a 'lost' colleagues for one night. You can hear the train (I think) go by while in the apartment, but it did not bother us much. Great place to stay while visiting Berlin!",0,0.9169,Positive
62.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,45,100.0,0,2.1907320060884934,4.79,4.8,4.94,4.77,38729622,"Super quiet room in a spotless and stylish apartment that’s also perfectly located! I had a great stay and slept like a baby. Sabastian was very welcoming, reactive and accomodating. :)",1,0.969,Positive
