102.0,8,2.0,1.0,3.0,28,100.0,0,6.95769259327404,4.65,4.5,4.81,4.55,30756552,"This apartment is in a new part of Berlin I'd never visited, and was particularly lovely and extremely central, with a short walk to Tiergarten. The places is very cool, so perfect during the summer! Had a very good visit, thanks Jonas x",1,0.9607,Positive
143.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,0,9.97152540571894,5.0,4.94,4.88,5.0,651166131608872280,"Die Wohnung ist sehr schön und individuell ausgestattet. Die Lage in Charlottenburg ist ideal, ruhig und zentral. Wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt und kommen gerne wieder.",1,-0.6597,Negative
270.0,6,3.0,1.0,4.0,47,100.0,1,1.3910800100424443,4.86,4.75,4.91,4.72,4114966,"Fantastic apartment in an amazing spot. Gorgeous streets surrounding the apartment, lovely cafes and the wonderful Volkspark just there as well. The apartment is decorated with lots of taste and we felt so happy in Nassa’s space. Would recommend it to anyone wanting a taste of Berlin.",0,0.9822,Positive
52.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,27,100.0,0,13.913089981237064,4.54,4.52,4.72,4.44,38686018,"Accommodation was great, good location, the room was clean, ideal for two. The hostess responded almost immediately, perfectly describing the necessary information.",1,0.9518,Positive
68.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,3.902983824639757,4.91,4.92,4.92,4.92,14006299,"My friends and I loved the place, it is extremely central and was close to most of the places we wanted to visit. Mai and Herrmann were so helpful, they gave us a whole list of things and places to visit. They are extremely friendly people and it was really nice to talk to them!",1,0.9552,Positive
