64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,1,3.3887487396083724,4.8,4.78,4.79,4.71,14424131,"Best place in best neighbourhood in Berlin! Jan is a super great host, I’ll definitely come back! Thank you!",1,0.9735,Positive
107.0,3,0.0,1.0,3.0,18,93.0,0,2.373482401219675,4.74,4.7,4.77,4.67,17399068,Fantastisk tur :)<br/>Kotbusser er ett område der det skjer mye og det er enkel gå avstand til noen av Berlins største severdigheter.,1,0.0,Neutral
204.0,6,3.0,1.0,6.0,39,100.0,1,12.73132612473856,4.88,4.94,4.94,4.79,1389841007408876489,"Zum übernachten und um Berlin zu erleben ist die Wohnung perfekt. Dicht am Ku’damm aber trotzdem sehr ruhig gelegen.<br/>6 bequeme Betten, eine kleine Kochecke die alles hat was sie braucht und ein sehr sauberes kleines Duschbad. Zwei kleine Balkone und gutes W-LAN.<br/>Also insgesamt perfekt wenn man kein Wohnzimmer mit Heimkino benötigt.",0,-0.8316,Negative
76.0,2,1.0,3.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,5.28720619873499,4.79,5.0,4.87,4.74,933190058776550162,"Chantal ist eine total sympathische Gastgeberin, die Infos super schnell und proaktiv kommuniziert. Die Wohnung ist genau wie beschrieben in einer tollen Lage von Berlin.",1,-0.5994,Negative
120.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,1,1.62837340490416,4.82,4.87,4.84,4.73,847854968696512429,Unkompliziert und gut,1,0.0,Neutral
45.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,45,100.0,1,1.871566651765182,4.88,4.79,4.9,4.78,33996221,"Very comfortable room near public transit. I highly recommend it. Thomas was a very welcoming host and did his best to make me feel at home. Despite it being a sofa bed, it was comfortable. There was also a desk to work at and a reading chair. Very sunny bathroom and kitchen.",1,0.966,Positive
81.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,0,17.095465609287974,4.77,4.77,4.89,4.71,1147203957994247201,"place was okay, it would have been better if the owner would not be screaming in the middle of the night",1,0.717,Positive
98.0,6,3.0,2.0,6.0,23,94.0,1,0.9930406419174836,4.64,4.6,4.91,4.69,6232949,"Location! Location! Location! The unit is perfectly located to the trains, Museum Island, Alexanderplatz and the Hackescher Market for food and necessities. The unit is exactly as described with a total of 2-3 bedrooms and 2 baths. One of the bedrooms can be used as a living room. However, if you are looking to see Berlin and not sit in an apartment then this is for you!. Great communication with host and easily able to reach when needed.",0,0.918,Positive
96.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,1,4.50820087699075,4.98,4.85,4.85,4.9,51936171,"Nous avons passé un séjour de 4 jours à Berlin pour le festival Lollapalooza, et le logement était parfait pour ce petit séjour, très accueillant et chaleureux ! Justin est très réactif et sympa par messages, il n’hésite pas à s’inquiéter pour que tout se passe bien. L’appartement est bien situé, proche des transports en commun, ce qui nous a facilité nos déplacements dans la ville. Il est également propre, bien équipé et confortable, exactement comme décrit dans l’annonce. Nous recommandons vivement ce logement ! 😊",1,0.508,Positive
32.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,3.2159665482867226,4.77,4.71,4.88,4.65,17904,"Brilliant location, very close to several U-Bahn stops. Lots to see within a short walking distance too, and even more without the need of public transport if you enjoy walking like I do!<br/>The building superintendent who showed us around is really friendly and helpful and gave us some tips to start our holiday. There is a market on the street outside a couple of times a week which was a nice bonus. <br/>The apartment itself is great for a short stay, has pretty much everything you need. Cooking may be difficult with just a couple of hob rings and no oven, but it's so close to so many really wonderful places to eat that on a holiday that shouldn't really matter!<br/>Matthias was very quick and reliable with his communication. Will definitely look at staying here again if it's available next time I'm in Berlin. Thanks!",1,0.9864,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,52,100.0,0,18.623100777897022,4.94,4.95,4.79,4.92,229099,Alles gut gelaufen,1,0.0,Neutral
