88.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,100.0,1,1.881496822425637,4.71,4.61,4.93,4.66,44740912,"Perfecte locatie in Prenzlauer Berg. Doordat het huis een achterwoning was, was deze qua geluid rustig. <br/>Dit appartement bood ons alles voor een mooie tijd in Berlijn",1,0.0,Neutral
366.0,6,3.0,2.0,4.0,44,100.0,1,4.24670072100672,4.87,4.96,4.51,4.72,16245894,"The apartment was outstanding in every way. Very clean and everything was updated so that it appeared to be brand new. The beds were comfortable and the kitchen has everything needed. The location is perfect, short walk to Kreuzberg and Neukölln with all the clubs, cafe's, restaurants and bars.  First choice to stay in Berlin.",0,0.9324,Positive
