64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,9,100.0,0,4.385745271262368,4.67,4.67,5.0,5.0,16669441,"Clean, quiet, great for the tram and transport, and I really liked the style of the room - it's as it is in the photos. It's a good location to get around the popular Berlin areas but there's a few bars around if you want to stay local too.<br/>In addition Mea's a great host. Recommended!",1,0.9508,Positive
159.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,64,100.0,1,12.762537927344171,4.73,4.71,4.87,4.57,21431770,The most comfortable apartment in a great location with all the amenities that one needs,0,0.8268,Positive
118.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,24,93.0,0,2.2997563334626485,4.63,4.61,4.74,4.55,16951874,Martina and Charlotte’s place was exactly as advertised. We spent 12 days here while in Berlin. The apartment is secure and clean. It is fairly close to the city centre and there are plenty of great restaurants in the neighbourhood. It is also a close walk to public transit. Communication with the host was also simple and straightforward. Great apartment! Great hosts! I would definitely recommend this place!,1,0.9735,Positive
96.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,2.6441579309110788,4.94,4.95,4.85,4.88,8462220,"Jun's place was perfect for our longer (2 week) stay in Berlin. When we arrived we were surprised that the apartment was more spacious than we had imagined. It looked great in the photos, but was even better in real life! It was immaculately clean and had everything we needed. We loved the neighbourhood with a supermarket pretty much next door, Saturday food markets, plenty of walkable food and drink options and public transport nearby. It was wonderful to be able to be able to unpack and pretend we lived there for a couple of weeks. We really didn't want to leave! Highly recommend",1,0.9856,Positive
102.0,8,2.0,1.0,3.0,28,100.0,0,6.95769259327404,4.65,4.5,4.81,4.55,30756552,Nice place and good comunicate,1,0.6908,Positive
