122.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,3.146245412821909,4.77,4.68,4.85,4.52,44098912,"AMAZING!<br/>Brilliant location! Close to cool quirky bars! Easy to get around everywhere on foot. <br/>the flat is great, spacious, fresh, beautiful colours and atmosphere!<br/>So safe and secure - check in was easy! <br/>Caroline also gave us a huge list of bars, clubs, restaurants, and cool places near and around Berlin. This made our trip!",1,0.9808,Positive
47.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,26,100.0,0,13.72252668419708,4.51,4.6,4.69,4.51,7828523,"Great quiet location with a grocery store right at the corner. Easy check in, close to the metro station, and a cozy bed!",1,0.807,Positive
