95.0,1,1.0,1.5,1.0,14,92.0,1,2.217805555407905,4.86,4.89,4.97,4.77,1647378,We had a perfect 3-day stay at Katja’s apartment. The apartment is absolutely amazing and the location is in a very nice neighborhood. Katja was very quick to respond to our messages. Would absolutely recommend!  ,1,0.9322,Positive
