79.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,1.2471716314832575,4.46,4.19,4.87,4.22,967178200199695879,"Apartamento pequeño pero con lo necesario para pasar unos pocos días en Berlín. Zona residencial tranquila, con supermercado y línea de tranvía cerca. Disponía de champú, sal, aceite y café. Recomendable para pasar pocos días y recorrer la ciudad.",1,0.0,Neutral
215.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,55,100.0,1,9.076307917104932,4.77,4.74,4.73,4.5,44223516,"Great location, apartment, and front desk staff. Nice hotel amenities including outside patio and gym. Cleaning staff was a bit touch and go—didn’t clean or just did bare minimum on some days of our stay. Pool was closed for remodel, which wasn’t listed in the actual listing upon booking. Not a big deal, but would have been good to know before our stay.",1,0.8462,Positive
