35.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,1,12.910760097135975,4.89,4.78,4.81,4.88,24951430,"Nikolas is a wonderful host! The room was spotless and really cosy, Nikolas even had some sweets and a bottle of sparkling water inside as a welcome present! The communication was clear and he provided clear instructions and suggestions on how to get to the place. He also provided recommendations on what places to visit and in general was really nice to talk to! I would recommend him to anyone planning to visit Berlin!",1,0.9721,Positive
