64.0,5,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,0,6.504978165628203,4.6,4.75,4.59,4.58,252993,"Eenvoudige, maar schone en goede kamer met alles wat je nodig hebt. Goede prijs kwaliteit verhouding.<br/>In de buurt kun je fietsen huren.<br/>Vlakbij een bakker waar je heerlijk voor weinig geld kunt ontbijten.<br/>Veel leuke restaurantjes in de buurt en een heerlijk Italiaans restaurant in de straat.<br/>De straat en buurt zijn rustig, behalve dat er af en toe een tram doorkomt.<br/>We hebben het goed gehad.",1,0.0,Neutral
155.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,0,5.160368153320015,4.83,4.67,4.93,4.66,39686767,"Vincent’s place is perfectly located in one of the most interesting and well connected areas of berlin. The apartment is spacious, with lots of natural light and well isolated from the exterior sounds. It’s a very cozy place, ideal to rest, cook something and chill.<br/>The communication with Vincent was fast, open and easygoing.<br/>I definitely recommend it",1,0.9637,Positive
68.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,22,100.0,1,6.594298777125843,4.71,4.76,4.39,4.65,16469975,"We stayed in Berlin for two nights on an Interrail trip. The hostel was very conveniently accessible from the main train station by two S-bahn trains, which also ran frequently in the evening. Cold drinks were waiting for us in the fridge when we arrived. The apartment had plenty of space for four people. There was an organic food store on the same street, where we bought breakfast. It would have been possible to cook in the kitchen, but we ended up eating outside, as there were several different restaurants within walking distance. <br/>The ventilation in the apartment felt inadequate, especially on a hot day, and we ended up keeping the windows open in both rooms. The environment is relatively noisy and there were several emergency vehicles passing nearby during the day, so the windows had to be closed at night. Fortunately, they isolated the sounds from outside well.<br/>The area is very dirty and untidy, but the street was peaceful during our stay.",1,-0.8988,Negative
114.0,4,1.0,1.5,3.0,36,100.0,0,7.167460469824902,4.57,4.66,4.8,4.56,37071847,"Wohnung genauso wie beschrieben, sehr gut an die S Bahn angebunden. Auch Kommunikation war top! Empfehlenswert",1,-0.807,Negative
