170.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,51,100.0,1,1.4356958153593935,4.66,4.81,4.62,4.51,2396312,We had a great stay. Great host and great accomodation. Would recommend for sure!,0,0.9545,Positive
112.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,39,100.0,0,9.196890246654409,4.53,4.6,4.6,4.36,250729,"NON CONSIGLIATO <br/>Fatto il checkin alle ore 17.00, l'appartamento era completamente sporco, non erano state fatte le pulizie. L'agenzia  che gestisce l'appartamento ha cercato un addetto alle pulizie, che è arrivato alle 18.45. Siamo potuti entrare nell'appartamento solo alle 20.30.<br/>Dalla doccia esce un forte odore di fogna  che si diffonde per tutta la casa. Abbiamo quindi dovuto tenere sempre aperta la finestra del bagno.<br/>L'appartamento è al quinto piano, ma non c'è l'ascensore, per cui bisogna fare 5 piani di scale ogni volta che si esce e rientra a casa.",1,0.34,Positive
94.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,95.0,1,4.513443039819955,4.61,4.31,4.75,4.57,53961297,"ci siamo trovati molto bene.<br/>il posto è abbastanza centrale e ben collegato alla metro U6 e ai vari bus.<br/>per quanto riguarda il pernottamento, entra molta luce la mattina quindi abbiamo faticato un po’ a dormire.<br/>pulizia discreta: era presente qualche ragnatela.<br/>l’host è stato super disponibile e ci siamo trovati benissimo.<br/>abbiamo chiesto di allungare il soggiorno per qualche ora visto che avevamo trovato un volo di notte e ci è stato dato.<br/>grazie",1,0.5994,Positive
31.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,100.0,1,12.720083248666349,4.78,4.69,4.54,4.73,24154046,"The very nice hosts did write a reminder to only ring the doorbell on the correct house (there are two with the same number, in parallel rows, and many guests have gone to the wrong house, as I did). It depends on from which direction you arrive whether this is obvious or not. I found it difficult to find the right house in spite of the clear instructions only because I arrived from the ""wrong"" direction, in the dark, but got the doorbell message in time. <br/>Also, it is true that the bathroom lock does not work, but there is a sign you hang on the door (a temporary measure until the lock is repaired) and the hosts have proven to be perfectly trustworthy and considerate. <br/>I would stay at Phuong's & Martin's again.",1,0.9664,Positive
89.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,51,100.0,1,6.670122906813517,4.97,4.99,4.92,4.93,16608497,Rober è fantastico! Super cordiale e sempre pronto a consigliarti su cosa fare o dove mangiare! Le sue cartine poi sono top :) consigliatissimo!,1,0.8743,Positive
55.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,0.8025330705337501,4.79,4.94,4.83,4.77,11403270,"Konnte nicht zum angemeldeten Termin anreisen, Gastgeberin zeigte sich flexibel.  Zimmer sehr sauber, Matratze sehr gut, Lage zentral - <br/>rundum zufrieden.",1,0.0,Neutral
62.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,1,16.83773298442811,4.84,4.71,4.67,4.75,39345904,"Yana ist eine sehr nette Gastgeberin. Ich habe mich für die kurze Zeit, in der ich die Unterkunft gemietet habe sehr wohl gefühlt. <br/>Vielen Dank für alles!",1,-0.8439,Negative
125.0,5,3.0,1.0,2.0,69,0.0,0,6.651616906504804,4.82,4.73,4.55,4.3,14937304,Wir sind zu fünft bei Alina untergekommen und waren sehr zufrieden. Dank ihrer guten Erreichbarkeit haben wir alles schnell gefunden und uns gut aufgehoben gefühlt. Schöner Platten-Charme mit schicker Einrichtung. Gerne wieder.,0,0.0,Neutral
123.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,1,1.17460082517367,4.83,4.8,4.9,4.74,238396,"Henrik's place is centrally located, extremely clean and very comfortable. I enjoyed my stay in the apartment and wouldn't hesitate to stay there again or refer this place to friends / family.  Thank you!",1,0.9507,Positive
95.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,3.769411114551402,4.65,4.73,4.79,4.5,4869716,"The place was spotless, and confortable with a cute vegetable garden in the back. Jan's place was steps away from berlin's best restaurants and bars. only 15 minutes walk to cities murals and checkpoint charlie. The flea market on Saturdays offered one of kind clothes and accessories. Getting to Potsdam plaza was a 10 minutes train ride. We were able to experience the city with so much ease...",1,0.891,Positive
186.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,1.9612069952106024,4.95,4.96,4.96,4.79,588812803263378732,这套民宿在一个很安静的社区，虽然不在最繁华的地段，但是你可以在周围看到当地人的生活。我打开门就被美丽的室内设计吸引了，风格是日式风格，非常不错。必须要提到的是！床真的好舒服！！被子好舒服！！我和朋友睡眠质量都因此非常好👍谢谢 Hanna！,1,0.0,Neutral
