125.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,5,100.0,0,2.306386890376211,4.75,4.75,5.0,4.5,3613880,"We stayed at Eva's place with our two kids aged 1 and three and it was perfect for us. She even arranged a parking permit for us, which saved us a lot of trouble. The location is great: very nice neighborhood, good places to eat, shop and lots of great playgrounds. The appartment is spacious, clean, and nicely decorated, it was nice that the kids  had their own room ( they preferred to sleep together in the toddler bed in the end, but there was a cot available for our youngest too). The only downside, which wasn't really an issue for us, was that it's on the top floor, and there's no elevator. But given that we could leave the pram downstairs this was not a problem. I'd recommend it to anyone. ",1,0.8833,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,82.0,1,2.6808853188639663,4.67,4.68,4.92,4.59,43823296,"Alles sauber, ordentlich. Einfacher Check in. Zimmeraussicht aufs Wasser.",1,0.0,Neutral
225.0,6,2.0,2.0,5.0,43,96.0,0,6.1770612336798365,4.64,4.56,4.82,4.52,27018624,"Amazing place, effortless and exactly like the photos! Would 100% stay again.",0,0.7644,Positive
180.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,45,85.0,0,1.5095289909770313,4.75,4.84,4.9,4.6,45475252,"This place was really nice. <br/>Great location, right in front of a metro/tram stop. <br/>The interior was so cute... such a nice place. <br/>The check in and communication was very good.",1,0.8008,Positive
144.0,5,1.0,1.0,3.0,45,96.0,0,6.1770612336798365,4.51,4.41,4.8,4.36,27018640,"Logement spacieux, clair, proche du tram et du métro. Hôte très réactif, possibilité de laisser les affaires dans une consigne sécurisée. Tout est parfait.",1,-0.128,Negative
172.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,30,100.0,1,2.086859632126843,4.87,4.87,4.94,4.71,306312,"The reviews of Michels (and Martina’s) apartment describe it’s features accurately. <br/>It met all our requirements for a three week stay in Berlin. <br/>The Prenzlauer area has all the required facilities close by ( supermarket, restaurants, bakery, cafes, trams, trains and Saturday market)<br/>Our fascination with Berlin was enhanced  by our stay at Michels apartment. <br/>Try out Town Mouse and Five Elephant for good food and coffee.",1,0.7269,Positive
78.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,90.0,1,3.129468779717991,4.78,4.5,4.83,4.72,1011541280011940219,"Väldigt trevlig värd som svarade snabbt o var otroligt snäll, skön säng o förvånansvärt tyst mot innergården, sov med öppet fönster o njöt av tystnaden",1,0.0,Neutral
65.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,4.1903954031521735,4.75,4.86,4.65,4.65,499342,"We had a perfect experience at Karsten's place and can warmly recommend it. The apartment looks just as nice as on the pictures. Karsten was waiting for us when we arrived and shared with us the places he likes in Berlin. Good service!<br/>... but the best was of course Berlin itself!",1,0.95,Positive
40.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,0,4.397184687831313,4.72,4.81,4.5,4.71,30230330,"Brilliant apartment, great access to the city, shop right beside it so good for saving money on food. Would definitely recommend",1,0.9505,Positive
144.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,94.0,0,3.1018817858877528,4.67,4.76,4.77,4.56,720839766613886451,Alles wie zu erwarten,1,0.0,Neutral
76.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,55,100.0,1,8.18877499303922,4.93,4.94,4.82,4.82,607923280892227371,"This apartment is very well located for public transport, with the tram stop 2 minutes walk away (just across the street). The river Spree is 2 minutes walk around the corner. Aldi is just across the street.<br/>The apartment was spotlessly clean. The bed was big and very comfortable, with clean, fresh bedding. It was equipped with everything and more I needed for my 4 night stay: a fully equipped kitchen, washing machine, dryer, dishwasher and TV.<br/>It was very quiet at night and I slept well. <br/>There's a lovely private outside decking area to sit and enjoy. <br/>Micro is a great host; friendly and welcoming, he showed me where to find everything in the apartment and how to operate everything. <br/>I would definitely stay there again if I return to Berlin.",1,0.9859,Positive
118.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,97.0,0,1.941053289840044,4.58,4.53,4.8,4.36,735085199089327822,"God kommunikation, hjælpsom vært og dejligt område meget centralt beliggende.",1,0.2732,Positive
63.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,1,3.323332029049056,4.88,4.89,4.91,4.68,26674998,"lovely place set in a beautiful peaceful courtyard but only a short walk to all cafes, train etc. <br/>would highly recommend!",1,0.873,Positive
159.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,95.0,0,4.132850367965358,4.39,4.36,4.47,4.23,43811867,"Siamo state 5 giorni nell’appartamento, la stanza è spaziosa e la cucina è fornita dell’essenziale, molto più che nella media dei monolocali in cui ho soggiornato, ha il microonde, la lavastoviglie, la macchina per il caffè.<br/>Anche il bagno è grande e la doccia, pur avendo solo la tenda, nella nostra stanza, non bagna il resto del pavimento. <br/>La posizione è okay con vicine U7 e U8, e in generale Berlino è ben collegata tramite i mezzi. <br/>Uniche pecche un po’ la pulizia, le porte erano sporche di ditate, e il continuo passaggio di ambulanze, forse c’è un ospedale vicino. Nel complesso lo consiglio!",1,0.5562,Positive
50.0,2,1.0,0.0,0.0,21,80.0,0,7.789784347785215,4.68,4.84,4.89,4.78,14271096,"Great host, we felt like home. No disturbance during the 6 days stay in this lovely studio. ",1,0.8074,Positive
