64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,100.0,0,4.085072664813058,4.8,4.4,4.87,4.87,31049532,"The flat is perfect, located in a lively area but still feels very private and calm. I could chill, work a bit and just feel like home. The room is spacious and cozy. Friederike and Peter, the roommate, were super easygoing and friendly. Would absolutely come back!",1,0.9744,Positive
