58.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,42,100.0,0,3.835736178845096,4.61,4.58,4.66,4.54,31629992,"Pascal’s place was perfect for two of us, it would have been great for three as well. Everything was just like in the photos, nice big kitchen and bathroom, everything was clean and functional. It’s centrally located and near the tram to get wherever; I also found just a short walk into kreuzberg is an amazing neighborhood with tons of shops restaurant bars etc. would highly recommend.",1,0.9735,Positive
77.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,90.0,1,3.00130441228309,4.8,4.86,4.94,4.61,915716695194593283,"Si bien el apartamento es pequeño está a unos pasos de la estación de metro y tren por lo tanto la ubicación es genial para llegar fácilmente a cualquier lugar. Buena opción de hospedaje si vas solo(a) por unos días, la cama es muy cómoda.",1,0.4215,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,100.0,0,2.470169768821385,4.69,4.54,4.9,4.73,2377008,"The place was cozy and comfortable. I felt like staying my house. Kilian is nice and kind. He helped me to know good places to go. The location was so great that i didn't have to take a train or bus to go famous landmarks. If i visit Berlin one more time, i want to stay again. ",1,0.9671,Positive
98.0,6,3.0,2.0,6.0,23,94.0,1,0.9930406419174836,4.64,4.6,4.91,4.69,6232949,"Excelente atención, todo lo convenido previamente se cumplió.<br/>El departamente impecable, excelente vista e inmejorable ubicación.<br/>Limpieza perfecta, todo en correcto funcionamiento.<br/>Cada vez que necesitamos algo nos atendió inmediatamente y solucionó la petición.<br/>Lo super recomiendo!!!!",0,0.816,Positive
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,1,5.167258880847807,4.97,4.92,4.93,4.91,9938743,"Fantastic stay with Alexandros, a very friendly and warm host. Always reachable and welcoming. The flat is truly beautiful and the location was absolutely perfect. The public transportation was on strike but I didn’t even need to use it as the neighbourhood had everything to offer. Would 100% recommend this stay and would love to come again next time I go to Berlin",1,0.9673,Positive
90.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,36,94.0,1,3.3601837928593032,4.77,4.81,4.81,4.43,51169438,"The place was nice. Our room was smelling like cigarette and was located inside of another room, which was uncomfortable everytime we needed to  go outside our room.<br/>Besides that, the place was really clean!",1,0.7171,Positive
228.0,10,2.0,2.0,5.0,44,80.0,1,5.275405062836432,4.91,4.86,4.89,4.86,21075047,"We had a wonderful few nights at Fadeih’s stylish apartment Friedrichshain. The apartment was perfectly located, a short walk to bars, restaurants and shops. Highly recommend!",0,0.8997,Positive
125.0,6,3.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,0,5.093871755717938,4.87,4.68,4.93,4.8,4191881,"Wir hatten eine tolle Zeit in Berlin!!<br/>Marcel's Wohnung ist sehr schön, stilvoll eingerichtet und sauber, ruhig gelegen in einem Hinterhof mit Terrasse ideal für 4 Personen mit 2 Schlafzimmer mit jeweils einem Doppelbett. Wir haben uns auf Anhieb wohl gefühlt!<br/>Die Schlüsselübergabe hat einwandfrei funktioniert!<br/>Die Lage ist sehr gut , in der Nähe befindet sich die U-Bahn Station Warschauerstraße von der aus die ganze City leicht und in wenigen min. zu ereichechen ist , in ein paar Gehminuten ist man an der Spree und vor der Haustüre befinden sich ein paar nette Lokale!",0,-0.7627,Negative
281.0,11,3.0,1.0,7.0,54,100.0,1,9.658354112207396,4.93,4.94,4.45,4.76,918664903420838998,"Saubere Wohnung ,  leider für 7 Personen an der Höchstgrenze. Für 11 Personen nicht zu empfehlen",0,0.0,Neutral
