213.0,9,3.0,1.0,6.0,77,100.0,0,19.387942988970817,4.55,4.41,4.62,4.43,667065230104134766,"I had a fantastic stay at this Airbnb in Köpenick, and the hostess's quick response to messages made the experience even better. The location was ideal, especially for attending events at the Riot Games Arena in Berlin. The cozy and well-equipped accommodation, combined with the excellent communication, made my trip enjoyable. I highly recommend this Airbnb for its perfect location and responsive hostess.",0,0.9678,Positive
