228.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,1,7.42457626093921,4.87,4.88,4.87,4.76,648932373954864346,The apartment is super spacious has three floors and a beautiful and outstanding view of the city of Berlin. The location it’s excellent because it’s nearby very good restaurants and a very important shopping mall with the best brands. The host had an excellent communication with us. So we definitely recommend this apartment. We would will definitely come back!,1,0.9896,Positive
