93.0,3,1.0,1.0,0.0,33,90.0,0,0.5478160801241173,4.72,4.78,4.91,4.72,1120637206699677325,"Un lindo departamento, luminoso y limpio. Contaba con todo lo necesario (lavarropas, cocina, microondas, etc). La ubicación es genial para conocer la ciudad ya que está muy bien conectado con todos los transportes. Además, el anfitrión fue muy amable y flexible a te nuestras necesidades. Definitivamente recomiendo!",1,0.6114,Positive
117.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,0.6211895609232261,4.86,4.65,4.9,4.8,1175456528646587467,"I had a wonderful stay at this spacious studio. For the same price as most hotel rooms in the area, you get so much more: a regular sofa, a sofa bed, and a comfortable bed with a beautiful view over Berlin. The kitchen is well equipped, the bathroom is clean, and everything felt very well maintained.<br/>Mohammed was an exceptionally kind and welcoming host, making the whole experience even better. I highly recommend this Airbnb. You won’t find better conditions in the city center at this price point!",1,0.9856,Positive
