131.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,0,2.319079304594608,4.91,4.85,4.89,4.85,44363134,Wir hatten einen schönen Aufenthalt. Das Apartment liegt in einem ruhigen Kiez. Es ist sauber und sehr gemütlich. Die Küche ist sehr gut ausgestattet. Die kleine Terrasse lädt zum Sitzen ein. Für drei Personen ist ausreichend Platz. Es hat meine Erwartungen übertroffen und ich würde gerne wieder kommen.,1,-0.8316,Negative
172.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,90.0,0,15.933480285253465,4.5,4.5,5.0,4.33,1202053406525682307,"Sehr schönes Appartment, groß und sauber mit allen Annehmlichkeiten. Sehr gemütliches Bett und Sofa. Viele loben hier die Toilette, ich habe es als etwas störend empfunden dass sie von alleine öffnet, weil sie dadurch ständig offen ist, wenn man im Bad ist. <br/>Es gab keine Garderobe oder Möglichkeit Jacken aufzuhängen und die Fenster konnte man nicht kippen, was im Erdgeschoss etwas unangenehm ist. <br/>Alles in allem aber eine schöne Wohnung, danke!",1,-0.9117,Negative
113.0,6,2.0,2.0,3.0,31,100.0,1,1.0852899765964672,4.63,4.81,4.85,4.6,8822071,"We had a great week end at Daniele and Patrizia. It is very cosy, clean, well furnished and well located. It made our stay in Berlin wonderful",0,0.9383,Positive
85.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,0,4.628526975183625,4.73,4.8,4.93,4.57,4282156,"Everything was amazing,perfect apartment,perfect location",1,0.0,Neutral
172.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,30,100.0,1,2.086859632126843,4.87,4.87,4.94,4.71,306312,"The location of this apartment was fantastic. P’burg (as the locals say) is hip and trendy with an abundance of great restaurants, easy access to transit and grocery stores.<br/>The apartment is huge and be forewarned it’s a 3rd floor walk up and a high bathtub (we all had some graceful ways of getting in and out). Lots of light which means you might be up with the dawn if the light bothers you.<br/>It is also street-facing which increases the noise factor exponentially if you have the windows open. Also there aren’t any fans provided so it can get pretty hot.",1,0.9538,Positive
125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,21,100.0,0,6.911429863269977,4.67,4.74,5.0,4.6,2588197,"Alles perfekt, vielen lieben Dank für die spontane Zurverfügungstellung der Wohnung. Große Wohnung mit perfekter Verbindung und tolle und unkomplizierte Kommunikation.",1,-0.5994,Negative
103.0,1,1.0,0.0,1.0,11,100.0,0,1.652388057808875,4.42,4.64,4.62,4.3,51549694,Everything was as advertised. Got nothing to complain about. The walls are a bit thin but that is to be expected.,1,0.1419,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,1.3773060525895495,4.72,4.84,4.91,4.66,1461489656921679773,Zoe Apartments were perfectly located and very clean. The staff were friendly and really helpful.,1,0.9258,Positive
83.0,6,2.0,1.0,6.0,23,94.0,1,0.8141273036815293,4.68,4.58,4.93,4.68,6231989,"Was fairly smooth getting the key from the restaurant. I guess could be a challenge if you arrived after the restaurant was closed. So that may be an issue though potentially the host test solutions.<br/>There is no air conditioning, and we were there during a heat wave, so it was definitely warm. With using the fans and blackout curtains during the day, it was manageable, but we did have to ask the host to bring the fans which they did the next day so overall we were ultimately very comfortable. If you know what's going to be hot while you're there, I would definitely ask them to be sure to have the fans in place before you arrive. <br/>You truly cannot beat the location it was awesome. We had a beautiful view of the television tower which my son loved.<br/>We would absolutely stay there again on our next trip to Berlin!",0,0.9847,Positive
82.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,3.929915771235159,4.89,4.9,4.96,4.86,20660494,"Uta & Nora are very responsive. Starting from the convenience of giving us exact directions to the flat. And following with every little thing we needed. The appartement was great in every aspect - great location, very warm, and newly renovated.<br/>Plus - 2 key sets are very helpful to get by :) <br/>PS.<br/>If you are taller then 1.80m, the shower will probably not fit you..",1,0.9616,Positive
205.0,8,2.0,2.0,3.0,32,95.0,0,4.732874564416474,4.63,4.48,4.89,4.48,52762746,Clean apartment. Unbeatable location,0,0.4019,Positive
317.0,6,3.0,2.5,2.0,69,100.0,0,3.1891744937678803,5.0,4.92,5.0,4.54,22075653,"amazing Penthouse, highly recommended",0,0.7089,Positive
124.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,38,100.0,0,2.0913357382540902,4.59,4.59,4.85,4.52,36839962,good,1,0.4404,Positive
118.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,18,93.0,0,2.3360123395652144,4.78,4.65,4.76,4.63,17396668,"Appartement bien situé, dans un quartier animé de Berlin, mais au calme, au fond d’une cour intérieur.<br/>Très propre et fonctionnel <br/>L’entrée et la sortie ont été très faciles, MaCha sont très réactives et sympathiques ..<br/>Louer un vélo et vous profiterez au mieux de Berlin",1,0.4404,Positive
68.0,3,0.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,6.494077174348875,4.77,4.93,4.74,4.59,38562451,"Ulli’s place was exactly as described and shown in the pictures. Very cozy, the street was quiet. The location is super convenient. Everything you need is around the corner. <br/>When I come back to Berlin, I will try to book this place again.",1,0.5994,Positive
