132.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,1,3.220056431819407,4.79,4.83,4.84,4.55,43352497,"The apartment is very comfortable for a stay in Berlin. Very clean—nice bathroom and well stocked kitchen for cooking/dining in. Tall ceilings and windows. The area is Kreuzberg has lots of restaurants, bars, etc. Short walk to the U-bahn. Great area. No complaints…it’s a cool flat in a cool neighborhood. Just as in the photos.",1,0.9041,Positive
