64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,12,100.0,0,5.344011394870014,4.67,4.17,5.0,4.67,31303886,"Mike is perfect host!   <br/>She is so kind and easy to contact!<br/>The house was cozy and perfect for three weeks.  <br/>The sofa in the living room was good for relaxation, and the desk in the living room was also optimal for working. The Room is also great!!<br/>When I come back to Berlin, I will contact to Mike again!",1,0.9774,Positive
