216.0,10,3.0,2.0,5.0,41,100.0,1,6.297922554406096,4.55,4.72,4.22,4.48,39826933,Der CheckIn ist unkompliziert und reibungslos verlaufen. Für eine Gruppe von 10 Personen  war die Unterkunft sehr geräumig. <br/> Rundum gelungener Aufenthalt!,0,-0.8439,Negative
61.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,45,100.0,1,5.77706802024184,4.9,4.95,4.8,4.84,28953859,"Eine sehr schöne Unterkunft und alles genau, wie beschrieben.<br/>Es war sehr sauber, ordentlich und super ruhig gelegen. Die Parkplatzsuche kann etwas dauern, aber man findet was. Eine kleine Kochgelegenheit, ein Kühlschrank und Wlan wären wünschenswert. Es ist aber alles so, wie in der Beschreibung erwähnt....und man wird von Kathrin sehr freundlich beim Check-In in Empfang genommen und erhält nützliche Tipps! <br/>Gern wieder dort, 100%!",1,-0.6688,Negative
422.0,6,3.0,2.0,4.0,40,100.0,1,4.235442637482252,4.93,4.97,4.57,4.69,22077707,Such a great location - near a metro stop and in a very cool area that had lots to do (bars and food). Apartment had everything we needed - comfy and clean with good kitchen for self catering. Berlin in fabulous and this apartment is so close to really good transport that it makes exploring the city east. Communication from host very proactive with excellent instructions. Loved our stay and will recommend.,0,0.9832,Positive
99.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,44,100.0,0,2.054878408160895,4.88,4.86,4.92,4.76,1125473671995458320,Excellent apartment ! Clean quiet and had all the amenities you need. Location is off the main street so nice and calm.,1,0.9165,Positive
90.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,11,100.0,1,20.235266663439457,4.94,4.98,4.92,4.88,8495375,"Very friendly hosts. The place is idyllic and beautiful, well kept. The only downside: My partner and I were really banking on the wifi working. I would double-check with the host if they've gotten a router in/closer to the apartment since, and to run a speed check if that's something you care about.",1,0.8932,Positive
47.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,0,8.666232428420047,4.79,4.9,4.39,4.78,5476658,"Massimo and Lucia's apartment is perfect! It is very well located as it is only a ten-minute walk from the bus station and the neighborhood is quiet and peaceful. The apartment in itself is very well-equipped, modern and cozy. We particularly enjoyed the kitchen as it was nice to be able to cook a quick meal after a long day of sightseeing. Massimo was very nice and met us at the apartment when we arrived and showed us the place. We'll definitely stay there if we ever come back to Berlin! Thank you Massimo and Lucia! ",1,0.9737,Positive
