95.0,3,2.0,1.5,2.0,36,100.0,0,4.702149319843357,4.9,4.89,4.74,4.74,13336061,We are very happy with our stay at Salma's. We stayed there with two kids and had plenty of space. The flat actually felt bigger and lighter than it appeared on the photos. Roof windows gives plenty of light and the large window/ skylight in the livingroom gives a luxurious light and view over the Berlin rooftops. Only drawback was the dishwasher was broken. ,1,0.2247,Positive
