125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,0,7.720221143575125,5.0,4.67,4.33,4.67,944012829704309991,"I had a lovely time staying at Fernando's place. The apartment is nicely decorated and it had everything I needed - well equipped kitchen, comfy bed, washing machine. This is staying in a home, not a tourist apartment, and I felt very comfortable. Communication with Fernando was great. I definitely recommend staying here!",1,0.9682,Positive
