125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,8,100.0,0,5.492999725478081,4.0,2.33,5.0,3.67,45908093,"The apartment is very well located, close to stores, restaurants and supermarkets. It is in the 6th floor and warm, even in winter. I like that there is a balcony and a nice view. It is also very complete in terms of furniture, appliances and kitchen utensils.<br/>Vartan is very helpful and usually answers very fast.<br/>One negative thing is that the apartment was extremely dirty when we arrived. I mean, every room was dirty and we had to clean them but in general it was a nice stay. I would book it again. It was very ok for me.",1,0.8381,Positive
