80.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,14,100.0,1,4.719861097373951,4.94,4.93,4.86,4.72,50031221,I travelled to Berlin for a concert taking place at Huxley’s Neue Welt. Alexandre’s place was perfect for my stay as it was very close to the location. Loads of bars and restaurants close by. Very close to the U-Bahn. Alexandre’s flat was spotless and tidy. He was very welcoming and friendly. I can only recommend!,1,0.9209,Positive
72.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,100.0,0,16.020250074480927,4.85,5.0,4.59,4.78,23661086,"Michaela is welcoming and respectful of guest's privacy.  Her apartment is beautiful and clean.  Her rabbit is super cute too.  She is definitely a host I would recommend.  Overall,  it was good experience.  Her airbnb room is very nice.  She works really hard to make her guests feel comfortable.",1,0.9851,Positive
