270.0,6,3.0,1.0,4.0,47,100.0,1,1.3910800100424443,4.86,4.75,4.91,4.72,4114966,"The apartment is a beautiful home with high ceilings, enormous windows and two balconies, indoor plants and art, and in a gorgeous neighbourhood close to excellent cafes, restaurants, parks and transport and conveniences. We stayed with 2 children (3 and 5 years) who also  loved it - meals on balconies, lots of space to play and a wild park with red squirrels immediately across the road. Nour sent great suggestions for local cafes etc, and was very helpful when I couldn't work the washing machine! Would recommend in a heartbeat.",0,0.9816,Positive
