80.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,100.0,1,5.477094653089554,4.88,4.85,4.78,4.83,16470400,Everything was fine. Good location and nice room.,1,0.7579,Positive
113.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,0,5.555843907755284,4.91,4.91,4.83,4.78,34432500,we had a really nice stay in Sophies appartment. it was exactly what we were looking for! quiet and relaxing space with everything you need within walking distance or a quick tram :) well worth the money,1,0.9115,Positive
163.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,91.0,0,4.871252294318258,4.67,4.78,4.87,4.53,46864858,"Nice place in a great location. Clean, a big comfy bed, spacious. Fairly thin walls and situated in a party area, you will probably hear other guests having a pre-party. The chat service was quick to respond when our neighbours were loud late in the evening.",1,0.9062,Positive
38.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,0,3.4193947713157806,4.88,4.79,4.91,4.78,1396712,"The apartment and host are both fantastic. Poca was extremely responsive, kind, reliable and always helpful with any questions I had. Upon arrival in the apartment, there is also lots of documentation on the neighborhood as well as Berlin. The apartment itself is bright, beautiful and clean with all the amenities you would need. The internet connection is great. The bed and bedding is very comfortable, perfect for a solid sleep after a day visiting the city. The trail along the canal just steps outside is wonderful for jogging or simply an afternoon in the sun.  All in an excellent location!<br/>I would definitely recommend Poca and her apartment to anyone visiting Berlin. ",1,0.9938,Positive
