73.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,6.005461611108614,4.83,4.9,4.83,4.78,13798286,"Es ist das zweite Mal, dass ich bei Klaus wohne und das spricht für sich. Alles wie beschrieben: ein einfaches Zimmer, sehr zentrale aber ruhige Lage, gute Kommunikation. Gerne wieder!",1,0.0,Neutral
172.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,99.0,0,1.542372060755756,4.59,4.74,4.53,4.54,6697033,"I truly liked this hostel. <br/>The location is great, the staff is very welcoming. I also liked the lobby and the room itself. <br/>I traveled with a friend of mine and the room had 2 separate beds and a small room with a toilet and a shower. It felt like staying in a hotel.<br/>In a nutshell, Singer Hostel Berlin is a great place to stay in.",1,0.9769,Positive
