47.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,26,100.0,0,13.72252668419708,4.51,4.6,4.69,4.51,7828523,"Freundliche Gastgeberin und schöne Unterkunft! Top Lage, alle Ziele waren einfach und schnell per ÖPNV erreichbar. Gerne wieder! :)",1,0.658,Positive
63.0,2,1.0,0.0,1.0,36,100.0,1,4.697448788448945,4.76,4.59,4.76,4.71,31356953,"Mohhamad's place is really spacious, clean and quite. Rooms are comfy, bathroom is clean. There is a beautiful balcony with a view at the cobblestone street, perfect for drinking coffee. Location has a good connection with other parts of the city (U-bahn 10min walk and bus 5min walk; there is also a s-bahn nearby). There is a cheap supermarket in the street. We recommend it to everyone.",1,0.9581,Positive
84.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,1,3.2375488184892025,4.89,4.92,4.88,4.83,41651093,We enjoyed our stay. Everything was super clean and the space in general was lovely. Highly recommended.,1,0.9412,Positive
67.0,2,2.0,1.5,2.0,48,100.0,1,5.417787082194651,4.9,4.84,4.78,4.88,33905326,"Rudy was wonderful. An artist as well as a man of science, he has many beautiful items around the house that he has made himself. Thank you so much for welcoming us into your beautiful flat and for your friendliness and great restaurant recommendations!<br/>All the best!<br/>Leo and Ben",1,0.9797,Positive
84.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,62,100.0,1,10.20749415539876,4.95,4.96,4.93,4.89,1064617839709831509,非常好的房源，周边交通很方便，房间设备齐全，比较新；还能洗涤衣物，整体非常好,1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,6,4.0,1.0,2.0,36,100.0,0,26.3376386253476,4.91,4.78,4.9,4.92,20123845,Bel appartement très spacieux et original. Tout l'équipement est fonctionnel.<br/>Le quartier est composé de belles maisons de maître. On s'y sent en sécurité et au calme.<br/>Quelques restaurants agréables se situent à distance de marche.<br/>La station Nikolassee pour se rendre au centre de Berlin est accessible à pied en moins de 10 minutes.<br/>Lieu idéal pour accueillir 3 couples. Nous y avons passé 3 jours très agréables.,0,0.2023,Positive
125.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,17,100.0,0,4.720437320842506,4.85,4.9,4.7,4.75,554693813476271719,"Was soll ich sagen, vom Anfang bis zum Ende super. Alice war hilfsbereit, immer erreichbar, die Wohnung peeerfekt. Kann ich nur jedem empfehlen. Danke und hoffentlich bis bald",1,-0.5994,Negative
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,1,18.95052374878964,4.84,4.64,4.73,4.83,37558386,"Wir haben uns total wohl gefühlt. Schöne Wohnung in einer ruhigen Straße und trotzdem gut angebunden. Sven ist ein toller Gastgeber, super flexibel und hilft bei allem gerne weiter. Wir würden sofort wiederkommen!",1,0.636,Positive
70.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,100.0,1,3.0533340006135603,4.92,4.98,4.93,4.84,7925838,"A truly memorable stay at Katja's place. The most magical apartment which is soaked with natural sunshine and light. Private entrance and bathroom was fantastic along with the addition of a washing machine which was much needed at this stage of my trip! The neighbourhood is the best spot to be in Berlin during summer, lots to do and explore. Katja was a fantastic host, extremely responsive and accomodating. Would highly recommend and will be using the space again the next time that I'm in Berlin.",1,0.9773,Positive
87.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,1,3.0971227876855947,4.83,4.8,4.91,4.57,40167702,Die Unterkunft war super. Tolle Lage und eine nette Einrichtung.,1,-0.5994,Negative
373.0,12,4.0,2.0,14.0,30,100.0,1,2.6480538372543863,4.93,4.9,4.93,4.81,504259,"Really good stay. It took a day or so to get our bearings, but once sorted we realised how good the location is in terms of accessing the tram and also the shortcut roads to get into town. Highly recommended if you're visiting Berlin.",0,0.8412,Positive
25.0,7,1.0,1.0,6.0,18,93.0,0,4.132403574870102,4.51,4.55,4.61,4.58,41362381,Sehr bequeme ÖPNV-Anbindung (U-Bahn Station Möckernbrücke).<br/>Sehr angenehme Atmosphäre und schnelle Hilfe an der Rezeption.<br/>Man kann sein Gepäck abstellen. <br/>Check-In ist ziemlich easy und schnell.<br/>Angenehme Zimmerausstattung und comfy Betten.<br/>Attraktiver Preis. :),1,0.7096,Positive
