422.0,16,7.0,5.0,10.0,55,100.0,1,6.474155287757895,4.93,4.86,4.66,4.85,13666450,Werner's flat is flexible enough to accomodate all your needs. Great social space for breakfast and when you get home after a night out. Brilliant transport links to anywhere in the city. It was great to be able to run around the airport it is such a lively park. Good supermarket close by. The whole group had a fun time in Berlin and everyone commented on just how comfortable the beds were.,0,0.9783,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,9,100.0,0,5.234628780162243,5.0,5.0,4.5,5.0,22100349,"Everything was as good as expected. Maria was sweet and kind from the very beginning of the booking process. The flat was well prepared, we had a list with tips where to find different things we needed. The check-in was also adjusted to our arrival time. Thank you very much!",1,0.9336,Positive
58.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,0,18.77117911741297,4.7,4.71,4.52,4.69,3314419,"The listing was a short walk from Schonefeld Airport, very easy to find. Exactly as described, very clean and fresh. Had no issues with the apartment and shops/restsurants are a short walk in either direction behind the apartment. ",1,0.7615,Positive
52.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,6.089108840586048,4.9,4.57,4.85,4.83,897873050963171703,"The Daniele’s apartment it was a great place to rest and get a place where I can do my things also the location is near to public transport. Daniele is a great host, kind and gentle, he made me feel secure about my doubts and necessities. I loved it.",1,0.9618,Positive
