125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,20,0.0,0,8.05629405024424,4.53,4.68,4.67,4.54,15277811,"Great Airbnb and would highly recommend to anyone. The location isn't exactly central, but you are literally right in front of a train station that takes you to the city center within minutes. We actually enjoyed staying at a more ""local"" neighborhood. The host was very helpful as well",1,0.944,Positive
195.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,91.0,0,4.873172561853288,4.69,4.76,4.44,4.54,30881310,"Mir hat mein Aufenthalt und das Apartment sehr gefallen, eine wundervolle Alternative zum Hotel, man fühlt sich zu Hause. Das Apartment ist schön eingerichtet und hat viel Stauraum, sodass man alles ordentlich halten kann. Alles hat gut geklappt und die Kommunikation war top! Immer wieder gerne",1,-0.807,Negative
