55.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,8.583224631576245,4.79,4.79,4.72,4.62,53567975,Der Aufenthalt bei Dominique hat mir sehr gut gefallen. <br/>Die Kommunikation vorab und auch währenddessen war super nett und unkompliziert. <br/>Das Zimmer war völlig ausreichend und das Bett sehr bequem. Zimmer und Bad waren sauber. <br/>Check-in und -out waren denkbar einfach und haben gut funktioniert.<br/>Gern wieder :),1,-0.6597,Negative
132.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,1,3.220056431819407,4.79,4.83,4.84,4.55,43352497,"We've enjoyed our stay in the flat ! It was in good conditions and everything was clean and well-maintained. The flat in itself is well-equipped (diswasher, sheets and towel are provided) and conveniently located. Street is quiet and the district is very nice.<br/>The instructions to enter the building and the flat were very clear. Would recommend !",1,0.9342,Positive
170.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,100.0,1,6.547712743829179,4.73,4.84,4.61,4.65,28532851,Zimmer sind sehr modern und stylisch eingerichtet. Alles war sauber. Das Personal hilfsbereit und freundlich. <br/>Ich komme gerne wieder.,1,-0.5994,Negative
80.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,44,100.0,1,7.016086714529495,4.94,4.99,4.66,4.87,30466274,"It was our 25th wedding anniversary and we had always wanted to see Berlin. The moment we arrived at our apartment, we were welcomed immediately,  by a very friendly and informative host, who showed us around the flat and I was able to what's app any questions at any time.  The apartment was pristine and perfect, absolutely spotless and beautifully done. The walk in shower was a total dream and our hosts had all utensils and extras available at the property.  We even had a bottle a chilled water and chocolates in the fridge for when we arrived and when we opened our door to head out into Berlin on the day of our anniversary, our hosts had left us a very fine bottle of wine at our door to help celebrate this and I was able to get advice on a good restaurant for us to try as well. It was just perfect. The location was so peaceful and beautiful and about a 10min walk to the local tram service which we did daily, but you need to work out how to book the tram via the app first  - perfect 👍",1,0.9778,Positive
126.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,3.932286507593239,4.71,4.74,4.78,4.48,36648125,👍🏻,1,0.0,Neutral
318.0,8,3.0,1.5,5.0,53,100.0,1,3.7256422035937673,4.95,4.94,4.85,4.83,13320037,"The apartment is fantastic: impressively built, well taken care of and perfectly located for visiting Berlin. Communication was always swiftly answered, and the mini trouble we had with the TV (it turned out to be a problem with the nut at the end of the remote) was swiftly resolved.<br/>We had nothing but positive experiences; would definitely choose Sven's place for our next trip to Berlin!",0,0.7909,Positive
105.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,44,100.0,1,19.08203722075192,4.82,4.85,4.72,4.71,1107068843238730146,"Arwin is an amazing host. Responsive, proactive, friendly, and caring, Arwin is the best ambassador of Berlin. The apartment is well appointed, in a lively neighborhood with restaurants and cafes, and is situated on the ninth floor of an apartment building that sits atop a Rewe supermarmarket. Within walking distance from the Frei University, the Max Planck Institute, embassies, and museums, the apartment is the ideal location for short and longer term stays. A kitchenette, a study desk, and a balcony overlooking the neighborhood, it offers a quiet haven. Arwin, thank you very much for hosting me!",1,0.9832,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,65,100.0,0,4.408873190838907,4.9,5.0,4.95,4.88,20975388,Great location in Mitte in a gated community. Easily accessible from the airport and to the City center.  Quiet neighborhood but lots of restaurants nearby. Very clean. Great amenities. Lots of space. Well decorated and appointed. Would definitely return.,1,0.9642,Positive
