138.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,97.0,0,1.7945030515439095,4.7,4.84,4.93,4.58,11450430,"Alles bestens. Genaue Beschreibung. Tolle Lage. Gute Kommunikation. Problemloser Check-in/out. Gute, kompakte Küche. Funktionale Ausstattung/ Einrichtung. Kann bedenkenlos Weiterempfohlen werde. Besten Dank!",1,0.0,Neutral
126.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,54,100.0,0,5.92095527448895,5.0,4.88,4.88,4.94,1350644,"Fantastic house in Berlin <br/>Great restaurants around and coffee places <br/>Super well connected <br/>House fells like home, have everything and even a garden to relax <br/>I recommend this house a lot! Super good deal.",1,0.9622,Positive
54.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,11,100.0,1,5.259652982108338,4.82,4.9,4.9,4.81,2657671,"Todo perfecto, muy limpio y bien situado.",1,0.3182,Positive
318.0,12,5.0,1.5,7.0,57,100.0,0,5.204352041714769,4.6,4.42,4.71,4.58,1167288311968188692,"I recently stayed at Florian's apartment and had a fantastic experience! The apartment is spacious, beautifully maintained, and filled with all the amenities you could ask for, making it feel like a true home away from home. Located very close to the Berlin Train station, it’s surrounded by excellent restaurants, cafes, and shops—all within walking distance, which made exploring so convenient.<br/>Florian was an exceptional host, providing clear and timely communication from start to finish. He was always quick to respond and gave thorough information, ensuring a smooth and stress-free check-in and stay. I would highly recommend this place for anyone looking for a comfortable and stylish base near Berlin Train Station. Thanks, Florian, for a wonderful stay!",0,0.9864,Positive
