147.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,30,99.0,0,3.190774123407141,4.93,4.93,4.9,4.78,1049391586434394481,Super apartment <br/>Just like you see in pictures and the location is very convenient <br/>Loved it <br/>Great stay for a family,1,0.7506,Positive
37.0,6,1.0,1.0,6.0,28,99.0,0,1.3918005791420711,4.54,4.57,4.54,4.49,1565012,"Das hostel ist sehr sauber und modern eingerichtet. Check-in lief super und der Empfang war auch sehr feindlich. Wer Lust hat zentral in Berlin eine Bleibe zu finden und nicht viel Geld ausgeben möchte, dem kann ich dieses Hostel nur weiterempfehlen!!",1,0.0,Neutral
92.0,2,1.0,1.0,0.0,24,75.0,0,5.435781973525221,4.95,5.0,4.95,4.9,13640248,"Quiet, clean and pleasant place to stay for a city trip in Berlin.",1,0.7184,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,50.0,0,7.122109893992188,4.76,4.84,4.64,4.64,5610403,"Absolutely recommend! Super clean house, great location, and very respectful & kind host, Anthony :)<br/>Even though we had to suddenly ask for him a long stay which can be not an easy request to accept, he just let us stay with pleasure. Anthony’s was one of the cleanest house we’ve been stayed so far.<br/>You can also find all over the house, his artistic sense of interior - especially, beautiful kitchen! Most of the facilities are all nearby, so if you are finding a place in Neukölln we would definitely recommend his place. Anthony was always kind, friendly and responsive to us with a positive vibe and also a considerate person who respects each privacy.<br/>We really appreciate to let us stay and share your place, Anthony. It was a pleasure to know you :) Thank you so much!",1,0.9966,Positive
112.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,17,100.0,0,4.426291566458374,4.61,4.4,4.69,4.51,7838754,"Alles wie beschrieben, gerne wieder 👍🏻",1,0.0,Neutral
81.0,2,1.0,1.0,3.0,34,90.0,1,8.758840073119789,4.73,4.93,4.57,4.8,36612997,"Lovely, clean apartment with easily enough space and storage for two, or even three people. <br/>The apartment is inside of a house, with a non-lockable foldable door. <br/>It is well equipped, has good transport links within a 5-10 minute walk. Nearby there are plenty of shops, pharmacies, restaurants and bars.",1,0.9169,Positive
113.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,98.0,1,1.0001956178666358,4.83,4.91,4.96,4.78,127708,"Fantastic location, wonderful amenities, we especially loved the amazing shower! ",1,0.9505,Positive
140.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,1,1.5130716954922565,4.89,4.91,4.94,4.75,2394897,"Verda is a great host. She was very communicative and has eye for detail giving suggestions on places where you can eat/do grocery shopping and leaving some candy as a welcoming token. The appartment was spotless clean, bright and open. It has all the appliances and things you need to make your stay comfortable. It is located in a great neighborhood with plenty of restaurants and cafes nearby. If you prefer to cook yourself, that's also an option because the kitchen is well equipped. It is easy to travel from the apartment to other parts of the city by tram or do as the locals do and go by bicycle (you can rent bicycles in the neighbourhood). Just be aware that there is no elevator. So you get a free work-out to/from the 4th floor. I highly recommend this place! ",1,0.9846,Positive
125.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,1,3.490113958712961,4.84,4.57,4.82,4.68,52769628,Very nice apartment- near bus and bicycle rental. Close to good eating out places in Kreuzberg. Good advice from landlord.<br/>We really enjoyed our stay.,1,0.9097,Positive
96.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,33,96.0,1,3.788820414984087,4.81,4.85,4.83,4.71,26006558,"The perfect spot for a couple to stay in Berlin. Very conveniently location and it isn't more quiet as well which we appreciated! Close to transport and all necessary shops. The bathroom is beautiful and very clean. This studio has everything you need for cooking at home and they even have a washing machine! Lots of nice touches, would stay there again. 10/10!",1,0.9635,Positive
80.0,2,2.0,1.0,4.0,12,100.0,0,4.005191483175319,4.69,4.51,4.63,4.57,1632187,"Terrific apartment in the heart of East Berlin. Andre welcomed us happily even though a plane delay made us three hours later than expected. Clean and well equipped with great shower and washing machine. Close to restaurants, supermarket and u bahn.  Only suggestion we have is to upgrade the bed and bedding as not great if you have back problems.",1,0.9524,Positive
68.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,22,100.0,1,6.594298777125843,4.71,4.76,4.39,4.65,16469975,"Très satisfaite de cet appartement. L'entrée se fait avec un code donc pas de clé a récupérer/rendre. Bien placé avec le station de métro Neuhkölln à quelques pas, un supermarché et des petits restaurants à emporter. Nous sommes arrivés dans un appartement très propre, bien équipé. Notre hôte nous a indiqué le chemin pour venir depuis l'aéroport et était disponible en cas de besoin. Je recommande :)<br/>-----------------------<br/>Very satisfied of this flat. The entry is securised by a code so you dont need a key to enter/leave. Well placed with Neuhkölln metro station from a short walk, supermarket and small take out restaurants. We arrived in a very clean and well furnished flat. Our host gave us instructions from the airport and was available when needed. I recommend :)",1,0.9294,Positive
132.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,99.0,0,1.314663681707217,4.47,4.67,4.32,4.44,6098049,What a nice place! The staff is friendly and the location is perfect. <br/>And that for a very reasonable price.,1,0.8748,Positive
158.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,1,1.6592287277224604,4.94,4.96,4.92,4.77,39476966,"Von Anfang bis Ende hat alles super gepasst, toller Service und ein sehr angenehmer Aufenthalt, Danke!!",1,0.6688,Positive
203.0,6,3.0,1.0,3.0,43,100.0,1,4.140963863667464,4.89,4.92,4.89,4.78,4182815,"Nous avons passé 11 nuits dans l’appartement d’Elisa avec nos 4 ados. Nous avons apprécié le quartier pour son calme, la présence de nombreux commerces et restaurants, la table de Ping Pong au pied de l’appartement et la proximité du métro. <br/>Le logement était conforme au descriptif, bien pensé dans la gestion des espaces et très bien équipé : literie de qualité, électroménager Miele… serviettes et vaisselles en quantité…<br/>Elisa a toujours été réactive et facilitante avec nous.  Si vous souhaitez visiter Berlin, n’hésitez pas.",0,0.0,Neutral
