143.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,55,100.0,0,11.109016697300522,4.86,4.94,4.59,4.79,31433214,"We had a very good stay at Gritt's place. The house is very clean, very well equipped and very comfortable. It is about 15 mn walk from public transportation as mentioned on the site. Gritt was very responsive when we had questions. We will definitely book the house again in the future when we visit Berlin.",1,0.9511,Positive
