89.0,3,0.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,0,1.0054327061020718,4.76,4.65,4.92,4.68,25106503,"The apartment is in a very nice location. Super close to public transportation with easy access to the main sites. It’s clean and spacious. The bed is super comfortable and the kitchen is very nice, but bring your own basics. We didn’t find any oil, salt, pepper, etc… There were pots and pans for the stovetop, but we didn’t see anything for the oven. Only one dish towel that we could find, and no paper towels either. We also weren’t able to get much hot water in the shower. It did have a nice coffee maker!",1,0.9288,Positive
