64.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,1,3.969121758790188,4.53,4.41,4.76,4.4,37836,"The apartment is indeed perfectly situated with tons of cafes, bars, and clubs around (even though you should be prepared to meet a lot of drug dealers on the street). <br/>The apartment itself is fine as well but I felt not very comfortable there as everything is quite old and you have to be very careful when opening windows, taking shower, closing doors etc. <br/>Check-in, check-out and general communication with Desiree was good and easy and I hardly ever seen her or her roommate in the apartment, which is good if you're looking for some privacy. <br/>Overall, I liked my stay but didn't really feel cozy/home and disliked the fact there were so many rules to follow.",1,0.9344,Positive
