52.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,1,1.9543141166401723,4.83,4.8,4.91,4.82,16090762,"Highly recommended! The location is perfect, the apartment is stylish and clean topped with very friendly and flexible host. Ella is very nice cool person even though we only interacted with her twice.  She makes you feel welcome and encourage you to ask if you have questions about the city. My wife and I defiantly would stay again at her place if we every visited Berlin again.",1,0.9761,Positive
