76.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,90.0,1,3.8053934293318368,4.99,4.97,4.93,4.9,24111150,"We loved Jaqueline's AirBnB! We felt at home the moment we stepped foot inside. The apartment's decorated beautifully and we also love her vinyl collection. Such a warm and lovely home. It was the perfect haven to come home to after hours of exploring the city. Jaqueline is also very responsive and kind, we wish we could've met!  <br/>We cannot recommend this AirBnB enough. Looks even better than the pictures! Definitely one of the highlights of our trip.<br/>Thank you Jaqueline :)<br/>Love, <br/>Chaya & Bebe",1,0.988,Positive
