52.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,20,100.0,1,7.180141027082842,4.66,4.77,4.5,4.57,22802583,"Lovely little apartment that is ideally located for someone looking to get around Berlin easily. You get exactly what you see in the photos - simple, clean and spacious. Mina was very responsive to my questions and accommodated my additional requests instantly. The apartment is right next to a subway station and is within walking distance from everything you could need: laundry mat, coffee shops, grocery store, liquor store, etc. I would highly recommend this to someone looking for a reasonably priced private accommodation.",1,0.9459,Positive
