35.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,51,100.0,0,3.642892493197811,4.95,4.96,4.8,4.93,304904,"Wow,  what a lovely welcome I received by Nam,  Amdreas' wife.  She was very accommodating when my flight was delayed and so helpful when I arrived,  even showing me around the neighborhood. <br/>The apartment  is beautiful and just as described.  The location is amazing,  right next to Berlin Wall and schönhauser allee metro is just ten minutes Walk away. <br/>I would highly recommend Andreas' and Nam's place as a home away from home in Berlin! <br/>Them you for having me! <br/>",1,0.9746,Positive
