85.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,0,3.4642915058782253,4.8,5.0,5.0,4.8,1203632538235139547,Violeta's flat was an absolutely lovely place for us to stay for a few days in Berlin. Location was amazing with a great and vibrant neighbourhood and lots to see! The flat itself was great and had everything we needed - sofa bed was really comfy and decent size for 2. Communication was clear and check in was really easy and flexible. <br/>Thank you for an amazing stay!!!,1,0.9866,Positive
