125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,0,4.359597598058836,4.86,4.57,4.86,4.71,50501969,"My stay at Lisas was very nice. It is a great house, very nice and accommodating host, and a nice quiet neighborhood. The apartment is on the 4th floor with views of the neighborhood. Would recommend staying here any time!",1,0.9448,Positive
120.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,46,100.0,1,9.29605165579442,4.73,4.85,4.66,4.6,3047076,"Wir hatten einen schönen, angenehmen Aufenthalt in Fais Wohnung: Die Fotos entsprechen exakt der Ausstattung und der Raumaufteilung – für uns war es ein idealer Ort, um uns als Redaktionskollektiv schöne, inspirierende (Arbeits)Tage in Berlin zu machen. Die Wohnung war herrlich warm und liegt sehr gut öffentlich angebunden: von Berlin Südkreuz (wir sind von Wien mit der Bahn angereist) nur 5 Minuten mit der S-Bahn, Fußweg ebenfalls ca. 5 Minuten zu S-Bahn und U-Bahn. Die Kommunikation war – trotz Komplikationen wegen Verspätungen und Zug-Ausfällen – einwandfrei, freundlich und zuverlässig. Vielen Dank für den Aufenthalt!",1,-0.9744,Negative
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,16,100.0,1,4.009860827310783,4.91,4.92,4.9,4.83,16979933,"Wir hatten einen schönen Aufenthalt in einer sehr schönen Umgebung und einen sehr geschmackvoll eingerichteten Wohnung. Wir kommen jederzeit gerne wieder. Vielen Dank fürs Kümmern, es hat alles reibungslos funktioniert.",1,0.0,Neutral
112.0,2,1.0,0.0,2.0,19,100.0,0,3.883872869353541,4.27,4.17,4.56,4.33,265394,"I stayed in a double room with my boyfriend, the location is perfect, just a few minutes from Berghain and bars and restaurants were close. Staff was super friendly and we got everything we needed. Rooms, toilets and showers were clean. There is  <br/>free parking but its a few hundred meters away and there are not always free spots available, but if dont arrive too late you should be able to get a spot. All in all everything was perfect for a weekend Berlin trip! :)",1,0.9265,Positive
44.0,3,1.0,2.0,2.0,45,100.0,1,9.796369316399854,4.75,4.78,4.54,4.63,865222,Received a really warm welcome and was confident there was someone on hand if I was in difficulty. Helpful with directions to local shops and services. Neighbourhood felt very safe and is very peaceful.,1,0.9581,Positive
106.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,0,1.3267026286625432,4.68,4.73,4.91,4.41,1335529146665908596,Gran sitio,1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,10,100.0,0,6.242078658972374,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,40480297,"Amazing apartment with an artsy style and very cosy vibe ! Everything was available and in great quality, the guest was thoughtful and provided little touches that made our stay in Berlin much better ! The center is only 15 minutes away and the neighborhood was safe and clean, I totally recommend it !!",1,0.9718,Positive
105.0,5,2.0,1.5,3.0,37,100.0,1,7.34309172140751,4.93,4.89,4.95,4.85,18745287,"Im Vorwege gab es sofort eine reibungslose Kommunikation, alle Fragen wurden klar beantwortet, Kompromiss- und Hilfsbereitschaft gezeigt und eine klare Beschreibung  bis zur Wohnung gegeben. Es erwartete mich eine wunderbar geräumige Wohnung und ein erstklassiger CheckIn - Vielen Dank. Ich habe den Aufenthalt in dieser wunderschönen Wohnung sehr genossen! <br/>Vielleicht ja bis bald liebe Raffaela.",1,0.0,Neutral
274.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,0.924256148910964,4.65,4.76,4.81,4.43,42238664,Sehr gepflegtes Zimmer guter Service und die Lage ist top.,1,-0.4767,Negative
142.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,48,100.0,1,23.93754468628924,4.92,4.75,4.75,4.83,1363985791474119923,"Great.<br/>location (bus)<br/>-classy clean <br/>-big windows , sun is coming in , you feel like you live in a garden in a small room<br/>- nice bed matres<br/>-well prepaired<br/>- safe<br/>- Perfect 10-10",1,0.8934,Positive
86.0,3,0.0,1.0,4.0,46,100.0,1,8.07669206534954,4.94,4.85,4.79,4.81,45298444,"Our overall stay at Michael & Maike's place was great. Great location, great access to public transport which brings you into the city. The apartment is cozy, and had enough facilities. The bathroom is very nice and spacious. The kitchen also has all the utensils needed, but it would've been nice to have some instructions for the electric stove and microwave. There's a dishwasher which is a plus! The only negative thing we encountered was that the ground and some other surfaces were very dusty and looked like they haven't been vacuumed in a while. Thankfully the sheets and towels were clean! <br/>We enjoyed the city and our stay at this apartment!",1,0.9739,Positive
284.0,9,3.0,1.5,7.0,40,97.0,0,1.2426170637883316,4.56,4.47,4.76,4.54,1009239484480765860,"Bra läge, fin lägenhet jättenöjda",0,0.0,Neutral
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,0,4.706237947682096,4.82,4.71,4.78,4.76,5669402,This is a very nice apartment in one of Berlin's most beautiful neighbourhoods. Helene was easy to communicate with and very helpful in some things we needed during our stay. Recommended. Would gladly stay here again.,1,0.9475,Positive
195.0,7,3.0,1.0,4.0,45,98.0,1,9.70945718604513,4.87,4.91,4.7,4.74,845000090345734199,Tolle Wohnung mit sehr hochwertiger Einrichtung. In Real noch schöner als auf den Fotos. Super bequeme Betten. Direkt neben dem Bahnhof Lichtenberg gelegen. Perfekt für den Berlin Trip und eine sehr nette Gastgeberin. Jederzeit gerne wieder,0,0.5994,Positive
130.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,97.0,0,2.148340982642172,4.79,4.66,4.9,4.69,13838662,"Exactly what was needed for a few days  conference nearby. Thank you Stefan for the help with late check in & flexibility. Best wishes, Bart",1,0.9081,Positive
118.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,24,93.0,0,2.2997563334626485,4.63,4.61,4.74,4.55,16951874,Tolle Wohnung im schönen Kreuzberg. Sauber und zentral gelegen. Einzig störend die Lautstärke in der Nebenwohnung die die gesamte Nacht über anhaltend war.,1,-0.9485,Negative
279.0,7,2.0,1.0,2.0,59,100.0,0,5.775830790319319,4.7,4.83,4.61,4.57,24689832,good,0,0.4404,Positive
45.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,0,7.77209619010223,4.66,4.83,4.72,4.72,186851,"I stayed at Susannes place for a couple of months at the beginning of my move to Germany. It’s very difficult finding a flat in Berlin to rent as you need a lot of paperwork, so renting an Airbnb to begin with is one of the best options. <br/>Susanne was a brilliant and a very accommodating host. She was kind enough to let me register as a resident in her apartment, which is key to getting on the housing rental ladder and trivial things like opening German bank accounts. She was also happy for me to work at the flat which made my job as a tech freelancer much simpler. <br/>The apartment is a good size for a single person or a couple, and has all the necessities for a comfortable stay. The balcony on spring evenings is lovely.<br/>The area is very friendly and full of good places to eat and drink. The transport links are also excellent with several U-bahn stations within walking distance. There are tons of supermarkets too.<br/>The checking in and out process was very simple. Susannes neighbour Mr Gurke was on hand to make sure my stay in the apartment was comfortable. He works as the building janitor and lives on the same floor which is handy.<br/>I really enjoyed my stay here, and really recommend Susanne as a really good host. She was always on hand with speedy email replies to offer  advice and guidance, often going out of her way to help me through the bureaucratic process of registering in Germany. <br/>Thanks for a great stay Susanne!",1,0.9959,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,0,2.874282790888489,4.69,4.42,4.92,4.71,31411458,"Anja ist eine hervorragende Gastgeberin. Gemeinsam mit einem Kumpel habe ich Anjas Unterkunft für 2 Nächte beansprucht. Die Lage ist super (hervorragende S-Bahn Anbindung) und das Appartement liegt in einer ruhigen Wohnlage. Zwei Einzelbetten für ein privates Zimmer waren purer Luxus. Wir hatten sogar ein eigenes Bad. Da wir aufgrund von Wohnungsbesichtigungen in Berlin waren, haben wir uns größtenteils nur zum Übernachten in der Wohnung aufgehalten und hierfür wurden wir mehr als gut bedient. Ich kann Anjas Angebot bedenkenlos jedem ans Herz legen, der ohne großen Stress einige Tage im Herzen des Prenzlauer Bergs in Berlin verbringen möchte.",1,-0.743,Negative
66.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,97.0,0,5.263167830742884,3.9,3.9,4.7,3.7,970426616171942794,"Good (five-week) stay overall. The place is quite well-located (easy access to public transport and the vibrant Fhain neighborhood) and the host and their reps were always responsive. (There were some things missing when I arrive - broom and fan - but upon requesting, I had the both within a few hours.) The photos definitely use wide-angle and convey a larger space than is the case, but still, it's a comfortable flat with comfortable sofa, table, chairs, and bed. The front of the apartment faces the main ground-floor entrance area, so not very private (but thankfully there are good curtains). Shower leaks into main bathroom floor, but it's manageable. Minor issues aside, this place is a good deal and is comfortable for one person, well-located, and comes with a response and friendly host.",1,0.9905,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,20,0.0,0,8.05629405024424,4.53,4.68,4.67,4.54,15277811,Great,1,0.6249,Positive
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,0,5.800571766662601,4.76,4.85,4.51,4.72,816748,"We absolutely loved our stay at Tiziana’s cosy place near the heart of Neukölln. Though I have family in Berlin, I stayed at Tiziana’s place as  two friends were visiting from the US and we decided to get an Airbnb to spend more time together.<br/>Tiziana is a great host and was outstanding at communicating and the check in was very well organised. The flat was super cosy and homely and well equipped. Coffee and a mini welcome bottle of sparkling wine were a nice touch. <br/>The flat is in a great location, outside the tourist hustle and bustle, and offers great surroundings (beautiful canal, parks, Tempelhofer Feld). It’s close to Neukölln and Kreuzberg and other handy spots (super market, nice cafes, restaurants and shopping centre) are all close by too.<br/>Highly recommend the place to any Berlin traveller who wants to explore a real Berliner Kiez and venture a little off the beaten track.",1,0.9918,Positive
123.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,1,1.17460082517367,4.83,4.8,4.9,4.74,238396,"Really great time in Prenzlauer Berg! Henrik and Sven's little apartment is very clean and comfortable, well connected to the city, and quiet at night. Super excited to come back and stay again :)<br/><br/>Eine ganz gemütliche Wohnung mitten in Prenzlauer Berg - super sauber und bequem, gute Verbindungen zu öffentlichen Verkehrsmitteln, leise in der Nacht. Ich freue mich auf den nächsten Besuch nach Berlin :)",1,0.9827,Positive
116.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,3.4220599717130984,4.92,4.97,4.86,4.83,362701,"Es war alles superschön, wir würden jederzeit gerne wiederkommen!<br/>Die tolle Wohnung ist natürlich, solange man Kreuzberg mag, unheimlich gut und zentral gelegen!<br/>Cheers<br/>Knut und Akhona",1,-0.6688,Negative
77.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,0,11.814165523307237,4.21,4.14,4.58,4.32,49933100,"hotel muy bien ubicado, lamentablemente el tiempo de respuesta un poco lento, pero todo bien, la ubicaciónes realmente genial solo a pasos de un metro y de muchos restaurantes muy buenos. <br/>La habitación buena para el precio, esta a 100% seguro que tenia aire acondicionado, pero cuand llegue no había.",1,0.1531,Positive
