66.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,0,7.063109677111053,4.76,4.78,4.75,4.71,12488930,"I stayed at Jocelyne’s home for one month at it was a very pleasing stay. Jocelyne has everything in her apartment that you need for the great hospitality — starting from kitchen amenities to extra towels, bed sheets, and pillows. Everything was well organized before my arrival. Communication was easy and smooth. The host is amiable and answered to me quickly. I highly recommend this place to other visitors.",1,0.9391,Positive
