125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,5,100.0,0,7.29892356587585,5.0,4.67,4.67,5.0,9898432,"Pasamos la semana de fin de año en Berlín...fue una excelente experiencia, el apartamento correspondía  tal cual al anuncio, espacioso confortable, cómodo muy luminoso y bien equipado, aunque no conocimos directamente a Kerstin estuvo muy pendiente de nuestra llegada...en cuanto a la ubicación muy practico, hay muchos comercios  cerca, además de tener una estación de metro a pocos pasos. Sin duda alguna recomiendo el lugar y a su anfitriona :)",1,-0.4215,Negative
75.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,24,100.0,0,4.4202884323310805,4.3,4.36,4.58,4.4,23071933,"Für mehrere Personen als Übernachtungsmöglichkeit super. TV und wlan  vorhanden, Bad sauber und ne kleine Küche. Würden wieder die Wohnung nehmen bei Bedarf.",1,-0.5423,Negative
114.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,96.0,1,3.789208338034772,4.84,4.86,4.88,4.74,25970203,"Julian's place is a perfect 2-room apartment for either working or holiday in Berlin. The communication with him both before and during check-in were smooth and easy. Also, the darkening blinds on the windows make it very easy to sleep, which is a huge plus :)",1,0.9477,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,1,7.708960468675421,4.91,4.77,4.98,4.79,632287508551006762,"Alles perfekt. Unterkunft sehr schön eingerichtet. Lage in altem, gewachsenen, sehr ruhigem Kiez mit gemütlichen kleinen Cafes und Restaurants. U Bahn um die Ecke, Supermarkt, etc fußläufig zu erreichen.",1,-0.5994,Negative
197.0,13,4.0,2.0,12.0,32,100.0,0,6.050506553876262,4.63,4.46,4.71,4.58,44298927,Ruim verblijf met alles wat je nodig hebt. De bedden zijn prima. Het appartement is heel dichtbij verschillende bushaltes en een klein stukje lopen naar de U-bahn. Er had wel wat beter schoongemaakt kunnen worden.,0,0.0,Neutral
194.0,6,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,0,7.033901930294361,4.59,4.52,4.57,4.48,32510629,"L'emplacement est parfait, dans une rue très calme. L'appartement est spacieux, bien agencé. Rien d'exceptionnel mais fonctionnel, confortable et agréable.",1,0.0,Neutral
64.0,2,2.0,1.0,2.0,22,100.0,0,3.158943186526161,4.58,4.51,4.72,4.62,19406486,Andrzej ist sehr nett und zuvorkommend. Wir haben uns bei unserem Aufenthalt sehr wohl gefühlt.,1,0.0,Neutral
40.0,2,2.0,1.5,3.0,57,100.0,1,1.1008973061098215,4.97,5.0,4.92,4.96,31466784,"Hôte très accueillante et chaleureuse, le logement est bien placé, propre avec tout le nécessaire. Monika est de bon conseil et très réactive par message.",1,-0.128,Negative
140.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,1,1.5130716954922565,4.89,4.91,4.94,4.75,2394897,"A fantastic apartment, centrally located from everything you to see and do in Berlin.  Our host was very accommodating and had the apartment kitted out with everything we could have needed.  There are 4 flights of stairs up to the apartment, which we didn't mind at all but might be good to make potential visitors aware of. <br/>Highly recommend staying with Verda if visiting Berlin for a city break.",1,0.8555,Positive
111.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,48,99.0,1,3.802991862862613,4.74,4.76,4.85,4.55,39718259,"Easy to reach by public transport, and within walking distance from the very heart of Berlin. The miniloft has everything you need for a few days’ stay. Clean bathroom, good shower, comfortable bed, small kitchen with all facilities, free coffee and tea. Any questions we had in advance were promptly answered by the host, and the self check-in was well-explained.",1,0.9349,Positive
250.0,11,2.0,1.0,11.0,36,73.0,0,6.366676631758508,4.75,4.75,4.5,5.0,1408504619659460857,We loved our stay here for the weekend . Everything was very clean and exactly how it looked in the pictures . And the beds are very comfy ! Easy walking distance to the metro so could easily get around to wherever we wanted and good food near by . It was a great stay !,0,0.9654,Positive
58.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,42,100.0,0,3.835736178845096,4.61,4.58,4.66,4.54,31629992,"Gute Bahnverbindung, Top Wohnung für einen guten Preis.<br/>Wände etwas dünn, aber trotzdem OK.<br/>Matratze für meinen Geschmack zu weich, aber ist ja Geschmackssache",1,0.2023,Positive
59.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,83.0,0,20.638103913453502,4.82,4.69,4.85,4.8,17403218,"Wir danken nochmals für die herzliche Aufnahme und die netten Gespräche in dem idyllisch gelegenen Heim. Ihr liebevoll eingerichtetes Haus lädt zum Träumen ein. Die herrliche Lage des Hauses zeigt die schönste Gegend des grünen Berlins und ist trotzdem durch öffentliche Verkehrsmittel (U-Bahn, Bus) direkt mit der Innenstadt verbunden.",1,-0.9485,Negative
153.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,41,100.0,1,3.525454013230139,5.0,4.96,4.96,4.88,53584625,Vi havde nogle super dejlige dage i Antjes lejlighed. Vi følte os meget hjemme. Vi havde vores 1 årige søn med og antje var super betænksom og havde fundet en stol til ham. Vi kan virkelig anbefale stedet :),1,0.8957,Positive
106.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,15,97.0,1,3.587299160900769,4.83,4.82,4.72,4.8,21018456,great,1,0.6249,Positive
53.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,5.05383733211442,4.87,4.9,4.69,4.68,1073953540356564098,"Great and cozy place. Came for a concert at Velodrom so the Airbnb was situated very close to it which was very convenient. I will definitely come back if I go to a concert in Berlin ever again. Loved staying here, can only recommend it. The next bus station is also very close to it.",1,0.9255,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,44,40.0,0,5.24496717963041,4.96,4.84,4.73,4.73,51936436,"We had a wonderful stay at Philip and Oskars’. The flat was more than big enough for four adults and we were able to cook on several nights in the well equipped kitchen. The apartment is right next to the S-Bahn station which meant easy access to everywhere else in Berlin, we had no issues with noise pollution and all slept soundly. Philip was very helpful with tips and provided clear instructions throughout the process, would definitely stay again on a future trip to Berlin.",1,0.9312,Positive
50.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,0,4.231097673854453,4.73,4.75,4.55,4.68,30384248,"Sehr entspannt, einfache An- und Abreise und sehr gutes Preis-Leistungs-Verhältnis",1,0.0,Neutral
386.0,6,3.0,3.0,3.0,53,100.0,1,5.61647989496104,4.75,4.54,4.91,4.53,558489051475905817,"Great location, plenty of restaurants around.",0,0.6249,Positive
135.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,87.0,1,11.377361200205224,4.78,4.87,4.82,4.67,917109042412215124,"Der Aufenthalt war angenehm. Wir konnten morgens auf dem Zimmer direkt mit einem Kaffee in den Tag starten. Zu Halloween gab es eine kleine Aufmerksamkeit die für uns bereit lag - sehr aufmerksam. Das Personal ist sehr freundlich und die Möglichkeit unten zu frühstücken sehr praktisch. Das Zimmer war sauber, die Einrichtung wie neu. Anbindung an U- und S-Bahn war auch super. Wir kommen gerne wieder!",1,-0.9726,Negative
222.0,14,4.0,3.0,7.0,40,100.0,0,4.241687052070171,4.59,4.5,4.78,4.56,22370109,"If you're looking for a larger AirBNB, with a need for 4 rooms (that would easily fit 8 people), in a quiet neighborhood: this may be one of the few places you can book in Berlin. It's in an _excellent_ location. And when I say quiet, I mean: dead quiet at night. You'll sleep like a rock on comfy beds, ease of access for multiple people with 4 sets of keys, and right around the corner from multiple shops, restaurants, bars, cafes and ease access to the Ubaun. The host, Max, was very responsive on WhatsApp, making communication a non-issue.<br/>You may notice that I granted this AirBNB a rating of ""Good"" as opposed to excellent, due to some awkward decisions in the space. Keep in mind that though this apartment is ideal for over 4 people, you may face some challenges if you have more than 4:<br/>As some others have noted: 3 of bedrooms have transparent glass doors, that don't fully close. It's certainly an odd decision for internal doors. This caused some laughter between me and my other three guests. However, if you are a little more private that some, one of the bedrooms does have a traditional door that you can stay in. That particular room is also the ""kitchen and laundry room"", but I use this term rather loosely: The kitchen had a microwave, a coffee pot and a selection of already-opened bags of pasta and espresso. Also a selection of bags of tea of questionable age. I think it's reasonable to say that neither the Host or you will actually decide to cook a meal here. And for us, that was perfectly acceptable. Also, all the beds come with two sets of duvet covers and no top sheet. This is likely a non-issue in cooler months, but in the humid and hot days of early September, we found this bedding arrangement to be VERY toasty.<br/>There are two sets of laundry machines in that bedroom as well (yes, in the bedroom): at the time of writing, one of the washers is broken. Both drying machines work.<br/>There are two restrooms, side-by-side. They're fine. But only one, rather large, shower (no bathtub). In fact, the shower reminded me of ones you see in hotels in the US that are ADA compliant. So, if you have some minor disabilities, this may come as a bonus feature for you. <br/>The only minor set of issues we ran into were: lack of soap (no big deal, we bought some around the corner. And for the record, Max did offer to deliver some), and really spotty WIFI. If you intend to stay here with 4 or more people and plan to get some telecommuting done, you're probably out of luck. A single FaceTime or Zoom video call would completely hog the bandwidth of the supplied internet connection, rendering it unusable for everyone else. It's still appropriate for light use between devices or everyone huddling around the Laptop to watch some YouTube videos, etc. But your Twitch stream is going to suffer, if you arrived with high expectations.<br/>Overall: our booking options were severely limited for a 4-bedroom stay in Berlin and Max's apartment turned out to be a good place to stay. If you can find more competitive options, you may want to consider them as this apartment is a little steep in price for it's provided amenities. But if it's the only option available, it's still not a bad option at all.",0,0.97,Positive
