64.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,15,100.0,0,6.963014548544917,4.82,4.47,4.71,4.76,1431327998161850521,"We had a really great stay in this apartment. Everything was clean and nice, the hosts were very friendly and helpful with everything. The place was very cozy, the area around is calm and you can find a lot of restaurants close by. Also the tram and train is easily accessible from the apartment. Overall, we had a really good time here and enjoyed our stay at this lovely apartment!",1,0.9854,Positive
