209.0,3,1.0,1.5,2.0,49,100.0,1,13.902035726561811,4.85,4.85,4.71,4.71,926151075715567943,"An extremely rude host that is impossible to communicate with. The house is on the far west end that takes so long to commute back and forth from downtown. The dirty bed linens was all messy and packed on the bed when we got there, and stayed the same the night we got back. No one’s there to clean it up so you have to wait in the house because there’s only 1 set of keys for you and the cleaners. 300 euros for a house like that? I’ll suggest everybody to get a hotel instead, at least you won’t be yelled at in a hotel : )",1,-0.6901,Negative
