65.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,4.1903954031521735,4.75,4.86,4.65,4.65,499342,"I really, really liked this place.  Very clean and well taken care of.  The shower was great, sufficient kitchen, nice big dining room table.  There are giant windows right out onto the street, so if you are looking for something super private, this could be an issue for you.  But there are drapes.  Very close to the train.   Karsten is super nice and accommodating as well.  He even left me two big yummy German beers, which I only had one of so the next person is in luck.  My plane was late and he was very flexible and affable when I got there.  Can't recommend it highly enough.  ",1,0.9869,Positive
159.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,95.0,0,4.132850367965358,4.39,4.36,4.47,4.23,43811867,"Clean, and triple isolation so quiet place right next to the UBahn. It also had a nice coffee machine and huge bathroom which were great. I think it's more of a hotel since they had many rooms but it's an excellent place to stay.",1,0.8793,Positive
