75.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,1,3.7465670354738254,4.89,4.91,4.74,4.8,4581049,Really close to the tram and the prenzlauer berg area with nice cafes and shops. The flat is located on the highest floor so be prepared to climb stairs to get to your room. This is common for any older german housing in Berlin. The room is clean and well decorated for a short stay. Appreciated having nice teas and beer.,1,0.9346,Positive
78.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,7.443244193575699,4.84,4.84,4.68,4.76,42858136,Was a great apartment in a great city. Would definitely recommend Ben’s apartment for the duration of your stay. Had everything you needed for a weekend away,1,0.9246,Positive
