64.0,2,2.0,1.0,1.0,16,100.0,0,9.983538326915731,4.83,4.86,4.6,4.84,12245034,"Suse s apartment itself is a little museum I would say. Every thing in her apartment is very different and attractive. We couldn't spend much time with her. But with the time we spent, she seems to be fantastic, lovely and very friendly. I would highly recommend her apartment.",1,0.9706,Positive
