64.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,0,12.1545859613401,4.89,4.84,4.77,4.7,561487373528647719,"We enjoyed our stay with Ana and her partner! The room and the house itself was very bright and welcoming. Their home has a very nice atmosphere, and it was also aesthetically pleasing to rest in! <br/>I would definitely come back if the room is ever available in the future :)",1,0.9699,Positive
54.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,18,80.0,1,7.57272271382633,4.86,4.91,4.91,4.83,7518928,"We hebben het heel leuk gehad in de ruimte van Susanne. Alles was dichtbij. Midden in de stad, maar toch rustig. Je kon goed even tot rust komen in de tuin. We hadden pech met de boiler, maar dat werd snel opgepikt en binnen een dag was er weer warm water. Kortom: dit is een plek waar vandaan je Berlijn goed kan ontdekken en die wij kunnen aanraden.",1,-0.4588,Negative
107.0,6,0.0,1.0,3.0,31,100.0,1,6.4861685330092405,4.6,4.45,4.56,4.54,13812209,"The apartment is well located, clean, very functional. It suits well for a group of friends who plans to spend most of the time outside since it's not that cozy.<br/>It's a bit noisy (we heard doors slamming and children shouting in the backyard) but it was not disturbing too much.<br/>We did not meet Alex, but he was very reactive when we had questions.<br/>We enjoyed our stay and would recommend this apartment.",1,0.9423,Positive
