144.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,45,100.0,0,2.213206395164836,4.96,4.78,4.97,4.77,39428608,"A very good place to stay where you can experience the real Berliner atmosphere in the nice area Prenzlauer Berg. Close to transportation, both tram and Sbahn. many restaurants ,cafes, shops etc near by. Sun from morning until evening. <br/>We loved our stay at this apartment. It was also very stylish and nice decorated. Perfect apartment, and very central.",1,0.9468,Positive
