69.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,1,3.892067443018064,4.9,4.88,4.83,4.79,10557892,"The flat was clean and equipped with all necessary utilities, our room was quite comfortable and spacious. Very good location next to Hermannplatz.",1,0.8586,Positive
131.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,36,100.0,1,4.248347186024305,4.63,4.75,4.72,4.5,13507504,"Spotless apartment newly refurbished, lovely bathroom and very comfy beds. If you like a dark space to sleep in bring an eye mask as the frontage is all windows, lovely and bright in the day, but not dark enough for me at night...probably wouldn't bother most people though. ",1,0.8424,Positive
214.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,1,5.709707531854269,4.89,4.96,4.74,4.81,828092897899521161,"What a beautiful apartment. It was very comfortable, clean and quite. Very close to the station with great transport links and a lovely coffee shop downstairs. Otherwise the area is a little rough around the edges so not sure if I would have felt safe walking home at night if I was on my own. <br/>As many other comments mentioned, the communication was a little slow and we had some issues with the check in. We arrived at 11.30pm and the instructions shared via Airbnb on the morning of check in suggested to pick up the key from the listening bar next door. Apparently that was not the case and there is a little key safe by the gate outside. This was communicated to me via Whatsap message at 10pm on the night which I haven’t seen until we spent 30 minutes wondering around the building and trying to contact the host. <br/>There was also no body lotion or hair conditioner provided so the listing is not accurate. I would have brought my own if I knew in advance.",1,0.9724,Positive
108.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,21,100.0,0,8.162082097289664,4.55,4.82,4.27,4.09,27657259,Wunderbare Wohnung mit sehr guter Ausstattung. Leise und kein treppensteigen da im EG Hinterhof. Schlafzimmer hat Türe somit stört keiner den anderen. Vom Hauptbahnhof leicht zu erreichen und nach Mitte auch ganz einfach und schnell.,1,0.0,Neutral
