96.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,2.747810548873532,5.0,4.97,4.92,4.9,762689485684389273,"Saskia's place was everything I hoped it would be! It's the loveliest peaceful oasis and I thoroughly enjoyed my stay. It was the perfect base to explore Berlin from, and Saskia was a warm, helpful host who made me feel at home right away. Highly recommend!",1,0.9646,Positive
