293.0,6,2.0,1.5,3.0,47,100.0,1,2.826856216058209,4.87,4.82,4.89,4.73,83614,"When we arrive at Andrea's place, we felt like home right away. It was exactly like in the decription, it was clean and well orginaized.<br/>We enjoyed so much that we will surely come back in the near future.<br/>The appartment located in an excellent location - just 4 mintues walk from the ""U2"" (Red) U-Bhan, that goes to Alexander Plaz in 7 min.<br/>There are many stores, resturants near by and 'LIDL"" is only 10min away by foot.<br/>To Sum: Great apartment, great location, A+++ HOST!!! <br/>",0,0.9814,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,0,9.665864767443152,4.89,4.92,4.81,4.94,716448591365879416,"We had a great stay here :) The place is beautiful, clean and comfortable, and also very close to a well connected train station (though the neighborhood is quiet). The room was actually a bit bigger than we thought from the photos, and the bed was very comfortable! Hannah and her partner were lovely and very helpful with anything we needed. There was a minor plumbing issue with the sinks, which they did their best to get fixed ASAP while being very transparent and apologetic about the potential inconvenience. It was not a big deal at all, but we appreciate the care with which they handled the situation :) <br/>We would definitely recommend staying here, and would happily stay here again!",1,0.9914,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,13,100.0,0,10.275274556550752,5.0,4.94,4.58,4.94,32773523,"Sehr angenehm und ruhige Wohnung, für meine Programme in beste Lage.<br/>Gerne wieder",1,0.0,Neutral
162.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,7,92.0,1,1.3308958103499828,4.72,4.7,4.81,4.57,53391764,"We had a great stay here. Check in was incredibly easy and the listing is accurate. The bed was also very comfortable which was a huge plus. The room was small so I wouldn’t recommend longer stays, but perfect for a short layover!",1,0.9303,Positive
108.0,3,1.0,1.0,5.0,38,100.0,0,2.074839566846822,5.0,4.71,5.0,4.86,1374511563330192166,"Tobias is so friendly and accommodating, the flat is beautifully tasteful, excellently located and wonderful to stay in. A fair price for three students to come and explore such an amazing city, we cannot praise this airbnb enough! :)",1,0.9722,Positive
181.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,0,5.43124633351311,4.85,4.69,4.93,4.6,54056801,"Der Checkin war super, die Anweisungen für Müll/Fernseher etc. Waren etwas schwierig, da mussten wir mal nachfragen.<br/>Für Berliner Verhältnisse ein gutes Preis-Leistungsverhältnis. Gute Anbindungen, und gepflegte Gegend. Linda war immer schnell erreichbar, vielen Dank. Ich finde Putzmaterial wäre ganz gut gewesen, wenn mal was runter fällt oder ein Abzieher fürs Bad.",1,-0.9062,Negative
57.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,22,100.0,1,15.50671922833448,4.9,4.89,4.8,4.86,17913499,Moderne kleine Holzhütte die gut beheizt und gedämmt ist . Sehr sauber und an alles gedacht . Wir waren sehr zufrieden .,1,-0.5994,Negative
66.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,6.244246865563971,4.93,4.97,4.82,4.69,637506338242607868,Sehr nette Familie und schöne Wohnung - man fühlt sich gleich wie zu Hause,1,0.0,Neutral
67.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,31,100.0,1,0.7518298030804867,4.84,4.68,4.86,4.75,27120381,"Ivos helped us with everything and was patient with us. The apartment is big and beautiful, very well located. Thanks Ivos!",1,0.8673,Positive
137.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,1,3.2252377063559527,4.8,4.79,4.86,4.63,27120196,"We were visiting Berlin with our six month old baby during some very hot days, and this apartment was just perfect for us, even nicer than in the photos. Some reviews say it is small but I thought it was actually pretty large by European standards and the nice high ceilings and big windows make it feel even bigger. There are many small details that made it very comfortable for us, including fans, silent windows, blackout shades and very comfortable bed with great pillows and a plush topper. The surrounding neighborhood is really fabulous, full of all kinds of great restaurants, parks, and public transit options and you can even reach Alexanderplatz by walking. TLDR, I highly recommend staying here!",1,0.993,Positive
183.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,53,100.0,1,5.599016268041934,4.95,4.96,4.44,4.79,42697557,"Coole Bude im ""echten"" Berlin. Der Wedding ist ein harter Kiez, in dem (auch) ums Überleben gekämpft wird. Wer den Mut hat, die Stadt abseits des schicken Regierungsviertels und abseits der ""Museumsinseln"" zu erleben, der ist hier richtig. Ansonsten: Wirklich gute Apartments mit Wohlfühlcharakter! Hohe Standards in allen Bereichen... Und eben LAUT, so, wie es in der Großstadt nun mal ist. Die Concierge-Leute übrigens haben tatsächlich große Herzen, Augen und Ohren für ihre Gäste-das ist schön! Und unser Hund war auch zufrieden ;-)",1,-0.9059,Negative
197.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,45,98.0,0,7.499888635971884,4.18,4.06,4.71,4.29,1284045464464850731,Die Unterkunft ist leider nicht im guten Zustand. <br/>Die Möbel sind beschädigt und Fleckig. <br/>Die Sauberkeit ist sehr schlecht z.B die Pfannen lagen mit Fettresten in der Schublade. <br/>Außerdem ist die Ausstattung der Küche sehr mager bzw nicht Vollständig. <br/>Lg Jan,0,-0.9136,Negative
51.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,9,70.0,1,5.069122935735952,4.89,4.84,4.8,4.75,698419375578435815,"L'appartement est sublime et assez grand, au dernier étage (5e sans ascenseur, peut être un problème pour certains). Le balcon est très agréable et représente un gros plus pour ce Airbnb !!! La salle de bain est grande, la cuisine bien équipée. <br/>L'appartement est un peu excentré (entre 30 et 45min en transport de la gare centrale) du centre de ville se Berlin mais se trouve donc dans un quartier plutôt calme mais avec pas mal de commerces autour.<br/>Elisa a été très agréable ! <br/>Je recommande largement  l'appartement d'Elisa <br/>(seul petit défaut qui pourrait gêner certaines personnes, légère odeur de tabac froid dans les espaces communs)",1,0.6331,Positive
54.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,1,6.033955609821909,4.99,4.95,4.94,4.94,18956417,"René is a very friendly and welcoming host. We really enjoyed staying in his beautiful spacious apartment. The apartment is very well equipped and located superbly: in a lively area with restaurants and bars, and in walking distance to the supermarket and the Ostkreuz station. Luckily there was no evening lockdown when we visited Berlin, but if so, this apartment would still be a perfect spot to enjoy your holidays - large kitchen to cook, cosy and spacious living room to chill and social host to have a conversation with. Thanks again, René!",1,0.982,Positive
