237.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,52,88.0,1,13.09986889971805,4.78,4.89,4.94,4.11,1016507879226379809,The customer service people who manage this apartment are really the best. They answer questions quickly and in a super friendly manner. They are really helpful and so efficient. I hadn’t realised the apartment would also be cleaned mid week and it was a lovely surprise.  Try professional from start to finish. The apartment seemed bigger than the photos and was in pristine working order.,1,0.974,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,8,100.0,0,3.388873810722848,4.56,4.44,4.88,4.64,15940518,"Alex's place was the perfect spot for a quick trip to Berlin. Really great neighborhood, so close to public transportation, lovely apartment and very sweet host! Alex was super helpful suggesting places to grab food and coffee and made me feel very at home in her apartment. She was also so helpful with a flexible check-in. All in all, a great place to crash when passing through Berlin. Thank you, Alex!",1,0.9857,Positive
