104.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,1,5.570797177002543,4.95,4.99,4.84,4.86,28907785,The space and location isn’t justified until seen in person. <br/>Outstanding and highly recommended to anyone willing to visit Berlin in comfort for a short stay or an extended one.<br/>Conveniently located outside the centre but more than enough access to local transport and necessary amenities to thoroughly enjoy. <br/>Would recommend to anybody to stay here and highly consider staying here again my self.,1,0.9106,Positive
