419.0,14,4.0,2.0,6.0,49,100.0,1,5.961083106152229,4.98,4.95,4.56,4.84,44472274,"A great place to stay with a large group of friends. Clean, modern and a quiet area. Very close to a train station, which makes it a perfect location for getting around the city.",0,0.9274,Positive
218.0,6,3.0,2.0,6.0,36,100.0,1,3.003280992717941,4.82,4.78,4.83,4.62,14649703,good flat central kreuzberg  ,0,0.4404,Positive
78.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,90.0,1,11.217254094674924,4.95,4.97,4.9,4.92,6011824,"Der beste Aufenthalt jemals in Berlin :)<br/>Perfekt Lager, wunderschöne und stylische Wohnung. Barbara ist auch ganz nett und freundlich!<br/>Kann ich nur empfehlen.",1,0.0,Neutral
241.0,6,3.0,1.0,4.0,52,100.0,1,1.3558603428081426,4.87,4.91,4.78,4.74,13761071,"The apartment is spacious, light and well appointed.  It is close to a U-Bahn stop and not far from an S-Bahn stop. I didn't try the buses and trams but they were nearby.  It is also very energy efficient.  I didn't use the heating even though I was there on a day when the maximum was 1.  They also encourage recycling which is great.<br/>There is a supermarket and 2 organic food shops very close by open long hours, except maybe Sunday - can't remember - but many stores are closed on Sundays.  Didn't affect me as I was not in Berlin on the Sunday I was there.  These shops have everything you need to self cater.<br/>I did lots of walking and there is so much to see and do within a 40 minute walk.  <br/>Sven was very responsive right from the initial enquiry.  He arranged for someone to meet me at the apartment and show me around.  This was greatly appreciated as I had a 28 hour journey.<br/>Would definitely recommend staying there - it will comfortably hold up to 6 people although I was by myself.",0,0.985,Positive
112.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,48,100.0,1,4.145972522810424,4.93,4.93,4.67,4.8,1170742456080659228,"Lejligheden er et fint udgangspunkt for ture. Det er nemt at komme rundt i Berlin. Alt er nyt og fint i lejligheden. Det er et lidt kedeligt kvarter, men dejlig roligt. Kastaniealle og sidegader er hyggelige med gode spisesteder.",1,0.0,Neutral
316.0,8,3.0,2.0,4.0,45,100.0,1,1.2937250483136316,4.73,4.76,4.9,4.61,12048269,"super lage, schöne wohnung in ruhigem innenhof!",0,0.636,Positive
60.0,3,1.0,1.0,3.0,23,100.0,1,7.122161533256396,4.75,4.83,4.53,4.64,25120680,Familienangelegenheiten haben mich her geführt. Das nächste Mal komme ich im Sommer und nutze den schönen Garten! Die Wohnung 10 ist geräumig und gut eingerichtet,1,-0.636,Negative
52.0,4,0.0,1.5,4.0,35,100.0,1,8.047733173173757,4.92,4.96,4.62,4.8,35348359,"Uğur was an incredible host, he made sure we had accommodations and gave us a tour of the house right when we got there, as well local recommendations. The location is amazing we were able to get downtown on the east and west side within ten minutes.",1,0.802,Positive
161.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,91.0,0,4.871252294318258,4.65,4.79,4.85,4.47,46865074,"comfy bed and lovely looking room, very cool spot, but the soundproofing is terrible. could hear the guy in the room next door snoring.",1,-0.2391,Negative
140.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,45,100.0,0,2.416427424980613,4.95,4.93,4.93,4.87,49857753,"The location is convenient, with many restaurants around, and it's also quiet and comfortable.",1,0.5106,Positive
143.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,90.0,1,11.510851452846596,4.75,4.76,4.8,4.54,699809535745814134,"The apartment is great and very well equipped with everything you need, but it was a bit hot and stuffy and the days were not that warm. Great location and close to many great places. But air conditioning in the summer is essential.",1,0.5356,Positive
389.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,18,100.0,1,0.5214696832030614,4.87,4.8,4.95,4.7,16627622,"This Apartment is extremely well located in a very interesting with a subway station, huge supermarket, many restuarants, and lots of interesting shopping very close by.  While very close to all the action, the bedrooms face the back courtyard and remain quiet.  While the apartment would benefit with more modernization it is kind of nice to still have some of the feel of what old East Germany was like.  It would definitely be a plus to travellers if the microwave oven were either fixed or replaced.  Berlin is a wonderful city and it was great to stay in the middle of it.",0,0.9802,Positive
149.0,9,4.0,1.5,11.0,30,100.0,0,10.01572830458666,4.92,4.86,4.65,4.93,35060094,"Serhat hat uns sehr herzlich willkommen geheißen. Die Wohnung war groß und hell, ausreichend für unsere Jugendgruppe von 11 Personen, aber auch etwas hellhörig. Die Innenstadt ist gut erreichbar und die Unterkunft war blitzsauber. Preis - Leistung ist kaum zu schlagen. Vielen Dank!",0,-0.9785,Negative
74.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,4,100.0,0,2.3564188928118805,4.79,4.87,4.72,4.81,302167,"Première fois à Berlin très réussie. On a très envie d'y revenir et tres certainement chez Hendrick car l'appart est très agréable et on s'y sent vite très bien, sans parler du quartier! ",1,0.0,Neutral
206.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,91.0,0,1.3231577133885242,4.84,4.87,4.9,4.5,39886151,"Schickes Apartment, schönes Haus, Zutritt vollautomatisiert, perfekte Kommunikation, gute Lage. Gut wäre noch ein Pfannenwender in der Küchenausstattung, ansonsten alles bestens. 👍🏻",1,0.0,Neutral
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,0,3.231579661094454,4.91,4.74,4.88,4.9,14548616,"Very good place, in a nice naberhood, where you get what you see. Specially our host Mary was very nice and helped us to find our way.",1,0.8313,Positive
