64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,0,6.614399191355324,4.83,4.57,4.71,4.86,22355694,"Johans Mitbewohner Petar war sehr freundlich und hilfsbereit. Er hat uns alles genau erklärt und gezeigt. Das Zimmer ist eher klein aber sehr sauber und das Bett bequem, man darf sich wie zu Hause fühlen. Super Preis-/Leistungsverhälltnis.",1,0.0,Neutral
52.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,5.476854188619901,5.0,5.0,4.97,4.94,1360289262088862736,"The room is spotlessly clean and well equipped with everything you'd need. the area is a little out of the center but is very quiet and safe, and public transport means it's easy to get into the more lively areas. Miriam was super welcoming, communicative and an excellent host.",1,0.9849,Positive
240.0,6,3.0,1.5,6.0,68,100.0,0,8.6581709098516,4.86,4.79,4.67,4.69,15993543,"This is a lovely, warm and spacious apartment with everything you need for a comfortable stay. The local area has great restaurants, cafes, shops and U and S-Bahn links which made getting around easy. We really enjoyed the local area and the suggestions from Helmut. Be mindful of neighbours in the building and be clear about your arrival and you'll have a fantastic stay!",0,0.9778,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,0,6.140127936530081,5.0,5.0,5.0,4.83,38974537,"The apartment is fantastic. Very beautiful, spacious, super clean and the terrace is just great. Katja is very attentive, and a super host. No need to walk far to eat in a nice restaurant or shop at the 3 nearby supermarkets. This is the place to be in Berlin - for a German as well as for a tourist.",1,0.979,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,6.432065367275135,4.89,4.89,4.86,4.85,6599218,The room was exactly as described. Very quiet and clean. The nearby subway is a plus. The communication went smooth. We can recommend this place!,1,0.6962,Positive
