46.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,55,100.0,1,9.21710508242704,4.91,4.8,4.74,4.8,37709280,"Small apartment in a quiet part of Berlin.  Very well equipped, very comfortable beds.  Hosts very friendly and responsive.  Apartment was smaller than I had imagined from the description but since we were only sleeping there, this was no problem.  Definitely recommend it.",1,0.763,Positive
111.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,51,100.0,1,3.4156959509415743,4.85,4.89,4.82,4.77,14804266,"Great spot with lots of things to see and do in the surrounding area. Hosts Jana and Paul were clear and friendly communicators and the apartment was a nice place to sleep. Being a converted cellar, it is not full of natural light or ventilation, but the door and windows allow for enough to be comfortable. <br/>Perfect for one person and cosy with two.",1,0.9117,Positive
