126.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,20,100.0,1,2.247922934088075,4.94,4.94,4.94,4.85,40730061,David’s place was an amazing spot to be in! We were close to a lot of stuff & public transportation but when we were back at the bnb it was quiet and felt like an escape. <br/>The apartment itself felt quite luxurious! David accommodated us since we got into Berlin early and we appreciated his help prior to booking! Highly recommend you book here with him!,1,0.9664,Positive
