156.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,0,2.2531285722967658,4.58,4.63,4.73,4.47,49844243,"Modern apartment with high ceilings and all the mod-cons you need. There isn't much kitchen storage space, but there is heating and window shutters and a new bathroom. Location is a couple of minutes from the station in a quiet location.",1,0.0,Neutral
