210.0,4,2.0,2.0,2.0,62,100.0,0,2.2389327358587434,4.78,4.79,4.81,4.66,50473684,"Reasonably priced and well worth it! Located in the heart of Berlin Mitte. Windows and doors were of the ultra-sound-deadeningly-isolated-makes-you-think-you're-deaf-type (meaning it is super quiet!). Conveniently sleeps four adults. Two showers, two toilets and a bathtub.<br/>Apartment was clean and Check-In was straight forward :-)<br/>I would book it again anytime *thumbs up*",0,0.9018,Positive
