54.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,1,8.127615937955055,4.91,4.95,4.86,4.9,22779598,"We had a wonderful time.  Tina  was a  wonderful host.  We loved  the apartment.  It was spacious, stylish,  relaxing and all our needs were catered for.   Would definitely come back again.",1,0.9531,Positive
