102.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,0,2.7824750390490918,4.95,4.97,4.94,4.86,10033310,"Jessy is definitely a super host and her apartment is a testament to her. A folder with all you need including washing machine instructions is thoughtfully provided. We took 3 of the eating recommendations and they were spot on. The apartment is clean and exactly as the pictures show.  The shower has strong water pressure, the beds comfortable, the kitchen had everything we needed for a family dinner in. The location of the apartment is great for getting to all the major sights and those further afield.  We thoroughly enjoyed our time and hope to be back.",1,0.9798,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,20,100.0,0,4.333107470591988,4.81,4.84,4.92,4.82,19803075,Great location. Friendly and helpfull host. Lovely cat.,1,0.9022,Positive
131.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,7.304427848394459,4.97,4.68,5.0,4.79,2006060,"Loretta’s apartment is beautiful, very quiet, and yet extremely well connected to public transportation in a lovely and  lively neighborhood. It’s a great place from which one can easily explore Berlin, rest up after a long day, and go out again the next morning.  Lots of restaurants and supermarkets are close by, making it easy to stock up on necessities.  Loretta is friendly, uncomplicated, and a very welcoming host.  Everything in the apartment works well, the bed  is comfortable, and the view from the balcony is just wonderful.  I highly recommend the place.",1,0.9906,Positive
101.0,2,0.0,8.5,2.0,35,100.0,0,2.496114582405734,4.64,4.56,4.81,4.55,45354619,Alles war wie beschrieben. Das Zimmer hat völlig ausgereicht. Die Badezimmer waren fast alle komplett sauber. Auf die Nachrichten wurde sehr schnell geantwortet und die Mängel behoben. Gerne wieder!,0,-0.9508,Negative
105.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,44,100.0,1,19.08203722075192,4.82,4.85,4.72,4.71,1107068843238730146,"Blick über gefühlt ganz Brandenburg, echt beeindruckend. Wohnung ist super ausgestattet, war sauber, Optimierung noch möglich, aber alles in allem Okay.",1,0.2263,Positive
66.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,25,100.0,1,12.69261644647349,4.9,4.89,4.68,4.85,2602460,"Flora was super responsive and very accommodating. The place has everything you need and super clean. It was close to the train station and underground.<br/>There is also a grocery store very nearby, which was super convenient.",1,0.9509,Positive
87.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,0,13.177318284358924,4.61,4.47,4.74,4.53,31441769,"Frank is an incredibly kind person! We had e delay and he awaited us till late with no complaints. His house is very cozy, clean and organized. Very much recommended!!!",1,0.56,Positive
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,2.0387590917028584,4.87,4.93,4.79,4.82,1146439,"Birgit is a warm and enthusiastic host, also her husband is very friendly and helpful. Though in the middle of Kreuzberg, the location is safe and quiet. The place was very clean, has a beautiful view from the fifth floor (no elevator!). Walking distance from Oranienstrasse, U-Bahn, nice restaurants, musea. I enjoyed my stay very much and recommend it definitely!!!",1,0.9866,Positive
