125.0,5,3.0,1.0,2.0,65,100.0,0,5.4191851787607,4.83,4.77,4.77,4.83,6568956,"Staying at Florian's rooftop apartment was really not far from a dream - it is spacious, bright, with a nice design, fully equipped kitchen and great sound system. Very comfortable apartment for 4 person stay. Fantastic terrace was perfect for the morning coffee. Neighbourhood was calm and quiet even on the weekend, at the same time many cool cafes nearby - location is just great. Although we met the host only for a short while, our communication with Florian was very smooth, he was very helpful and provided us with all info needed for a perfect weekend in Berlin.",0,0.9877,Positive
