188.0,2,0.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,0,9.518637747787295,4.49,4.56,4.68,4.45,45905820,Je recommande chambre très propre et confortable. Cordialement,1,0.0,Neutral
209.0,10,2.0,2.0,4.0,25,95.0,0,3.389272243665802,4.63,4.66,4.75,4.42,832538204717853678,"Phenomenal location in Kreutzberg walkable to the u-Bahn, and some great bars and restaurants.  The flat is very cool layout wise. We had an issue with the WiFi and the owner was on the case immediately and got it fixed for us.  I saw some reviews talked about noise from neighbors but we didn’t have that problem at all.  We were a group of 4 and the space was perfect for that. More than that might have felt a bit tight.  Bathrooms are a bit small but the main shower is great!  Laundry machine / dryer worked perfectly and helpfully.  Would certainly recommend you based your time in Berlin here.",0,0.9856,Positive
159.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,20,99.0,0,1.3477452520784734,4.64,4.8,4.35,4.45,15363472,"Great hostel. The rooms are spotless and really cool stylish. Looks exactly like pictures. Beds were so comfortable . Check in was easy, and the bar is really cheap. Breakfast is  great value at 5 euros for a whole buffett of things. The best part was the helpfulness of the staff at reception who gave us a lot of advice and tips about our time in Berlin. My only complaints would be the room was kind dark (lights were dim) and the shower takes a while to heat up (however it is great once it does). Location is easily accessible with by S train.",1,0.9892,Positive
38.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,0,8.794289797931516,4.8,4.74,4.67,4.84,35396598,"Mon fils et moi avons passé un très bon séjour dans ce studio fonctionnel et bien relié au centre de Berlin par le métro. Il n'y a pas de cuisine, mais vous pouvez prendre un très bon petit déjeuner au café juste en face. Nous reviendrons!",1,0.0,Neutral
422.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,0,0.9893581373798054,4.8,4.88,4.9,4.71,28004334,"Very good spot in Berlin. Lovely Mitte! Room is better then I expected. I actually thought it were Photoshop photo’s, but it was exactly the same 😊",1,0.6945,Positive
