105.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,3.7258936986049145,4.91,4.83,4.82,4.8,19781919,"Fritz’s apartment was true to the pictures (if not a bit more impressive in person) and perfectly situated in a lively, down-to-earth and diverse part of Kreuzberg, very close the park and lots of restaurants, bars, and public transportation.  <br/>Communication and logistics went smoothly and I felt welcome in the space. All the amenities functioned well.<br/>I highly recommend the space !",1,0.9196,Positive
125.0,1,2.0,1.0,2.0,20,100.0,0,2.21575852316956,4.9,4.71,5.0,4.62,24057633,"If you're looking for a quiet and cozy place close to Mitte with also good connections to elsewhere in Berlin, I recommend Leonardo's flat.",1,0.6597,Positive
64.0,3,0.0,2.0,2.0,19,100.0,0,4.853538051906053,4.51,4.48,4.76,4.55,20745478,Philipp's place is an ideal spot to explore Berlin. Great local spots within walking distance and public transport 2 mins away to see all of the city. Room is as described and comfortable for three adults guests. Philipp replies very quickly and was flexible with holding our luggage for a late flight. If I visit Berlin again I will look to stay at Philipp's place again!,1,0.9184,Positive
118.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,20,93.0,0,2.347776216465179,4.76,4.76,4.73,4.65,18120892,"My friends and I had a great time exploring Berlin and the Kreuzberg neighborhood from this flat! it is clean, convenient and well-located",1,0.8805,Positive
95.0,7,1.0,1.0,3.0,33,100.0,0,4.793849952314026,4.57,4.28,4.88,4.5,12723428,The right place and apartment for those looking for a great Berlin experience.<br/>Emanuela communicates very well and promptly answered all my questions.<br/>I totally recommended… only if you want to live a real city experience.. and not a tourist experience ;) <br/>I will definitely book it a next time !,1,0.845,Positive
