100.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,3.091836209520125,4.86,4.9,4.86,4.77,869793,"We had a wonderful time at Kirsten’s and hope we can come back anytime soon. The place is bright and spacious, the neighbourhood is cool, there’s lot to do in walkable distance. Place is better than on the photos. Kirsten recommendations are great.",1,0.9571,Positive
163.0,8,3.0,1.0,4.0,39,100.0,0,1.6941036587530651,4.57,4.65,4.92,4.49,929013826831725263,"We hebben een goed weekend gehad met ons gezin. We waren met 8 personen, allemaal volwassenen. Het appartement is modern ingericht en netjes. De wijk is erg gezellig en de ligging is goed.<br/>De extra single sofa bedden zijn niet comfortabel voor volwassenen. Een extra toilet was ook prettig geweest maar dat wisten we.<br/>We hoorden in de ochtend de bovenburen lopen.<br/>We misten instucties voor de tv. We wisten ook niet wat we moesten doen met afval en wasgoed voor het uitchecken.<br/>De ventilatie in de badkamer werkte niet en we konden niet vinden hoe deze aan te zetten.<br/>Tip voor andere gasten: na uitchecken kan je bagage in een kluis op het station brengen.",0,0.0,Neutral
112.0,4,1.0,1.0,5.0,61,100.0,1,33.19526042209198,4.8,4.85,4.7,4.6,27905841,Sehr schöne Unterkunft. Man fühlt sich heimisch und gut aufgehoben. Es ist sehr gemütlich eingerichtet und die Sauna ist purer Luxus. Haben zwei Teamtage zu viert dort verbracht und waren  sehr zufrieden.,1,-0.5994,Negative
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,1,5.437184847115358,4.92,5.0,4.94,4.86,22676690,"Jeg er kjempefornøyd med oppholdet mitt hos Maria! Det ser akkurat ut som det gjør på bildene, det luktet veldig rent og godt og sengen var helt himmelsk. Jeg har aldri opplevd en så deilig seng før! Nabolaget er også stille. Det var lett å spørre om ting og det var lett å komme seg fra sted til sted. Det var også veldig hyggelig å gå langs kanalen rett utenfor. I tillegg er det en super hyggelig café rett til høyre for bygningen hvor du kan sitte både inne og ute.",1,0.6688,Positive
77.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,0,6.266793012378933,4.7,4.65,4.53,4.7,6264703,"Nice apartment, close to the public transport. It had everything we needed for a weekend trip. Very clean and nicely furnished.",1,0.8384,Positive
67.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,6.470201044766659,4.84,4.8,4.79,4.76,18052482,"Ettienne's place is great! It's tidy, the neighbourhood is cool and Ettienne is friendly and super helpful. Highly recommended!",1,0.9582,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,12,100.0,0,4.937460172072029,4.75,4.75,4.75,4.75,22334909,"The owner is very kindly. Check in and check out were also flexible. You could even cook by yourself. If you don’t mind the smell of cigarettes, that’s a very good apartment for traveling.",1,0.8218,Positive
51.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,20,100.0,1,6.594889413391792,4.91,4.85,4.87,4.75,1191033331807899605,great spot,1,0.6249,Positive
213.0,5,1.0,1.0,2.0,45,100.0,1,2.2263725456111603,4.98,4.98,5.0,4.85,952664615688915148,Mycket trevlig lägenhet i utmärkt läge! Frederik gav tydliga instruktioner och bidrog med värdefulla lokala tips. Perfekt boende för några dagar i Berlin,1,0.0,Neutral
422.0,6,3.0,2.0,4.0,40,100.0,1,4.235442637482252,4.93,4.97,4.57,4.69,22077707,"This was such an awesome spot!! My family and I absolutely loved it. It was spick-and-span, and supremely trendy. The place came stocked with necessities that many others don’t like shampoo and body wash, coffee and tea. It comfortably fit 6 people and we all felt cozy and at home. Trudy is a great host. I highly recommend checking this spot out if you are coming to Berlin with a group. Side note ...It is also a short walk from a metro-stop that gets you all around the city.",0,0.9804,Positive
257.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,42,100.0,0,1.2937250483136316,4.63,4.63,4.85,4.51,12047604,"Misha was a very responsive host during the booking period. The apartment was in a very central location, easy to get anywhere, and close to good coffee and places to eat. Torstrasse is a main thoroughfare but noise was not a problem. The apartment was spacious and had useful equipment like a dishwasher and washing machine. It is four flights up, which was not a problem for us and gives good views of the TV tower, but wouldn't be suitable for people with mobility issues. A comfortable and very good value optionin central Berlin.",0,0.9867,Positive
122.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,96.0,0,3.128194469226722,4.61,4.66,4.86,4.54,47215807,Alt var super,1,0.5994,Positive
68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,0,6.064974723523067,4.89,4.91,4.8,4.73,25441857,"I had a fantastic stay! Milijan  was super friendly and very responsive, always quick to answer any questions and made sure everything went smoothly. The location was perfect — close to bars, with easy access to the metro, and in a safe, quiet neighborhood. The house itself was spotless, spacious, and very comfortable. I would definitely stay here again and highly recommend it to anyone visiting the area!",1,0.9875,Positive
99.0,2,1.0,1.0,3.0,46,100.0,1,11.604485324856196,4.79,4.93,4.81,4.68,4462848,Eine schöne Wohnung in Toplage mit einer netten Vermieterin. <br/>Besonders die Einkaufsmöglichkeiten und die Nähe zu verschiedenen öffentlichen Verkehrsmitteln machen die Lage attraktiv.<br/>Die Wohnung ist sehr gut ausgestattet.,1,-0.9136,Negative
156.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,0,2.2531285722967658,4.58,4.63,4.73,4.47,49844243,Great location for clubs and bars but also very easy to get into central as there is a train station right outside. The apartment was very clean and well equipped with comfy beds. It was also in a very secure building with concierge so felt safe staying there. The apartment itself was minimalist and functional which is just what we needed for a weekend city break. Would stay here again.,1,0.9708,Positive
59.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,1,15.704190402628244,4.96,4.98,4.63,4.91,12337676,"Waren für ein Wochenende (Festival Lollapalooza) zu Gast bei Sabine und Ihrem Mann.<br/>Beide sind super freundlich und man kann sich super mit beiden Unterhalten.<br/>Vom Berliner Hauptbahnhof ist das Zimmer sehr gut zu erreichen. <br/>Die Gegend ist zwar etwas abgelegen, aber man kommt super überall hin. Die Bahnverbindung sind perfekt, auch wenn man abends mal etwas länger unterwegs ist. <br/>Das Zimmer war wie beschrieben und war sehr sauber.<br/>Danke für den tollen Aufenthalt :)",1,0.4588,Positive
83.0,2,1.0,1.0,0.0,37,80.0,1,14.050708569763955,4.98,4.95,4.86,4.84,1066796495811017372,"Der Aufenthalt bei Tina war wirklich schön. Ich kann die Wohnung nur weiterempfehlen, alles war mit Liebe eingerichtet und sauber. Tina ist super lieb und man fühlt sich wie zuhause! Die Gegend ist sehr schön und ruhig. <br/>Danke :)",1,-0.8748,Negative
152.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,35,100.0,1,2.3903290096761856,4.95,4.84,5.0,4.95,31049161,"I absolutely loved the space. Extremely big. The location was perfect there were cafes, grocery store options , shopping and historical sites right in your front yard. I was there for the new year holiday and the fireworks were amazing to watch just from the balcony. Thank you for the hospitality .",1,0.9509,Positive
54.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,18,80.0,1,7.57272271382633,4.86,4.91,4.91,4.83,7518928,"I highly recommend it here, but I don't want to recommend it because I would love to come back to this flat again and again. Especially during the Berlinale. This apartment is beautiful, quiet, and spacious, It was raining every day during my stay, but someday in summer, I want to come back and enjoy the garden.",1,0.9697,Positive
154.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,0,1.0747930019316592,4.84,4.66,4.91,4.75,2076483,"Très joli appartement, très bien situé et très calme. Jacopo a répondu à toutes mes questions et de manière très rapide . <br/>Merci pour la bouteille de prosseco, ventait une très belle attention ! Je recommande Jacopo et son appartement à 100%!! Merci",1,0.0,Neutral
149.0,6,1.0,1.0,3.0,45,100.0,1,3.2543180393984152,4.88,4.94,4.86,4.6,52142935,It's located close to S and U trains. The street of the location is very peaceful. Arriving in the evening to find that there were teabags and coffee cartridges waiting for us was very nice. Everything in the appartment was clean and in mint condition.,1,0.8514,Positive
