65.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,1,7.994559142347801,4.97,4.98,4.82,4.93,22154155,"This tiny house is amazing! Great location, not far from the centre because of the tram line that's a 10 minute walk away! Lovely hosts, beyond helpful and the breakfast was so delicious. Would definitely stay here again, thank you so much!",1,0.979,Positive
