221.0,6,3.0,1.0,4.0,29,100.0,0,3.811094276989304,4.71,4.79,4.75,4.65,31467134,"De locatie was ideaal, op loopafstand van het openbaar vervoer en diverse bezienswaardigheden. De binnenkomst verliep soepel en de instructies waren duidelijk. De bedden lagen comfortabel en de keuken was goed uitgerust met alles wat we nodig hadden. <br/>Een kleine aanvulling zoals een informatieboekje met praktische zaken (zoals het gebruik van de sleutel, afval en wasmogelijkheden) zou het verblijf nog net iets makkelijker hebben gemaakt. Ook zou een extra handdoek in de keuken handig zijn geweest. We merkten dat het binnen wat aan de vochtige kant was, maar dat deed verder niet af aan het fijne verblijf.",0,0.0,Neutral
44.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,20,100.0,1,17.42372473266546,4.78,4.86,4.77,4.69,894766660158220578,"Michaela is a proactive host.  The room is located in an exceptional environment, very quiet, yet well connected to the city.  All recommendations!",1,0.6658,Positive
81.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,0,8.557234487362068,4.97,4.97,4.92,4.88,1157039785783407352,"İnanılmaz bir konum,inanılmaz bir ev sahibi… Berlin’e gelirsek Ben’den başka hiçbir yerde kalmayacağım.",1,0.0,Neutral
88.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,21,96.0,1,6.468975722392195,4.8,4.71,4.84,4.7,42703957,This flat is very nicely located ! It was clean and corresponded to what we were expecting! Would recommend!,1,0.8507,Positive
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,2.0387590917028584,4.87,4.93,4.79,4.82,1146439,Birgit was absolutely amazing! An amazing host and centerpoint for a solo traveler like me. I was solo traveling in Germany for the first time and she was willing to go above and beyond to accommodate me and to make me feel comfortable. And now I glad to say that I have a contact for life in Germany 🥰. <br/>Also the area is 5 minutes away from the train so it was very easy to get around.,1,0.966,Positive
127.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,60,100.0,0,5.41749734445679,4.57,4.42,4.37,4.48,53491060,Alex has been a very kind and communicative person. His apartment is good equipped and it is situated in a quite place near a park. In 10 minutes by walk you arrive at the metro station and then visit Berlin and the surrounding easly and quickly.,1,0.7645,Positive
77.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,23,96.0,0,13.06909762308404,4.81,4.8,4.59,4.73,24328002,Top Unterkunft & nette Gastgeberin.<br/>Gerne wieder.,1,0.2023,Positive
422.0,10,5.0,3.0,7.0,41,100.0,1,4.239905926975667,4.91,4.98,4.54,4.76,9268629,"Alles gut, abgesehen davon dass der Code für den automatischen Schlüsseltresor wegen der Zeitumstellung nicht funktionierte und wir eine Stunde warten mussten. Kam wohl das erste mal vor und sollte sich nicht so schnell wiederholen.",0,0.0,Neutral
75.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,6.379603690669542,4.8,4.68,4.8,4.76,48673134,"The location of Frank's place is great. Very close to the metro. Check-in/checkout  was easy and the apartment is quiet for a good night's sleep.<br/>The apartment was not very clean and decorated with old and dusty furniture. It felt like it needed a deep clean. We didn't feel like spending much time or eating in the apartment. It was not very inviting. <br/>That being said, if you are in need of a central place to sleep and shower, I recommend this place.",1,0.8826,Positive
293.0,6,2.0,1.5,3.0,47,100.0,1,2.826856216058209,4.87,4.82,4.89,4.73,83614,"Sehr schönes Zimmer in zentraler Lage, U- und S-Bahn in nur wenigen Minuten erreichbar.<br/>Küche wurde von uns nicht genutzt, da viele Cafés und Lokale sich in unmittelbarer Nähe  sich befinden. Für unseren Kurzaufenthalt von 2 Tagen optimal.",0,0.3612,Positive
84.0,4,1.0,2.0,3.0,23,100.0,0,5.545645678759754,4.13,4.1,4.75,3.99,54034354,Perfekte Lage um Berlin bei Tag/Nacht zu erleben!,1,0.0,Neutral
50.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,34,83.0,1,2.563400508484748,4.9,4.97,4.96,4.92,29732182,"El lugar es perfecto, siempre hubo respuesta oportuna. Encontramos todo limpio con detalles y fueron muy amables. Definitivamente volveremos :)  gracias por todo Fyno!!!",1,0.7332,Positive
105.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,31,100.0,1,4.377467638829597,4.92,4.97,4.86,4.86,46390721,"Departamento súper bien ubicado, limpio y seguro. La zona de Kreuzberg tiene restaurantes y bares para todos los gustos y presupuestos, ¡todo a una distancia razonable para caminar! A todas horas nos sentimos seguros. También muy cerca se encuentran paradas de camión, del tren y mini mercados y licorerías. <br/>Ute se mostró muy amistosa, nos recibió en persona y a pesar de nuestra barrera de lenguaje (ella Alemana y yo Mexicana) las dos pudimos comunicarnos en inglés y nuestra anfitriona siempre hizo el esfuerzo de hacernos sentir como en casa: nos dejó una carpeta con recomendaciones de restaurantes, lugares para visitar, entre otras cosas. Nos dejó también 2 juegos de llaves y una cocina y baño súper equipados. <br/>Recomendada como anfitriona!! La pasamos súper en Berlín. Definitivamente regresaríamos a su alojamiento. Gracias!!",1,0.0,Neutral
100.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,3.091836209520125,4.86,4.9,4.86,4.77,869793,"Die Wohnung ist wirklich toll! Liebevoll , aber nicht überladen eingerichtet mit Geschmack und Stil. Sie liegt mitten in einem sehr lebendigen Teil von Kreuzberg, daher kann es beim schlafen mit offenen Fenster laut sein. Uns hat das nicht gestört, eher im Gegenteil. Ansonsten wirklich ein echtes Zuhause in dem man (und frau) Energie tanken kann.",1,-0.636,Negative
226.0,6,3.0,1.0,3.0,42,100.0,1,11.632050742075618,4.94,4.84,4.82,4.8,1185371951337071545,"This is the place to stay in Berlin, we loved it! Close to so much but felt private. It was beautifully furnished and near coffee shops, parks, shopping, everything!",0,0.8436,Positive
175.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,91.0,0,4.861047682375263,4.69,4.77,4.83,4.57,53744550,"Great place to stay within walking distance of plenty of restaurants, bars and clubs. The room was very modern and warm with a very comfortable double bed.",1,0.8707,Positive
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,1,5.167258880847807,4.97,4.92,4.93,4.91,9938743,"Exceptionnel !!<br/>Tout d'abord, l'appartement est très joli, spacieux, lumineux et commode, dans un des quartiers les plus sympas de Berlin, super commerces et restos et transports tout proches.<br/>Très pratique !<br/>Ensuite, propreté impeccable, lit confortable, calme j'ai trouvé malgré les nombreux bars en effet du quartier.<br/>Alexandros est super sympa, arrangeant, très disponible pour les questions d'ordre pratique ou culturel sur la ville et ses bons coins, et il se plie en quatre pour rendre le séjour encore plus agréable !<br/>Alors là, je dis : chapeau et MERCI !<br/>Magnifique séjour grâce à lui et sa chambre !<br/>Exceptional!!<br/>First of all, the apartment is very attractive, spacious, bright and convenient, in one of the most nice districts of Berlin, great businesses and restaurants and quite close transport. Very practical! <br/>Then, impeccable cleanliness, comfortable, quiet bed I found in spite of the numerous bars indeed of the district.<br/>Alexandros is very nice, make his best, very available for the questions of practical or cultural order on the city and his good places.<br/> Magnificent stay thanks to him and its room !<br/>THANKS !!<br/>More than recommended.<br/>(Sorry for the bad translation...)",1,0.9886,Positive
48.0,6,1.0,1.0,6.0,29,99.0,0,1.4480502011325729,4.62,4.57,4.62,4.68,9536240,Gut,1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,1,3.42434910048599,5.0,4.94,4.94,4.96,34460859,"Florian‘s Wohnung ist die perfekte Basis für ein Aufenthalt in Berlin! Sie liegt super zentral und doch ruhig und hat mit Balkon und Dachterrasse auch die Möglichkeit, die Sonne zu genießen, ohne das Haus zu verlassen. Sie ist zudem toll eingerichtet, sodass man sich gleich wohl fühlt.<br/>Florian ist ein super Gastgeber, der gut erreichbar ist und viele Tipps bezüglich parken, Restaurants und Unternehmungen hat. <br/>Wir würden jederzeit wieder hierher kommen, denn auch preislich ist es fair und angemessen. <br/>Vielen Dank für deine Wohnung, Florian!",1,-0.4912,Negative
158.0,8,2.0,1.0,4.0,45,90.0,1,2.5113494269416043,4.79,4.75,4.78,4.65,665666969293201423,"We loved Jelo’s place.  Super clean, spacious, lots of restaurants, supermarkets, and public transportation close by.  We had a great time.",0,0.9393,Positive
97.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,8,100.0,1,4.638119293679826,4.86,4.93,4.79,4.71,29100712,"I had a great month-long stay at Marie's apartment. She was incredibly accommodating, even letting me come by and check out the place before I moved in, which I appreciated alot. She offered lots of recommendations and was always available to answer any questions I had. <br/>The apartment was great for myself, however I think if you come as a couple, be aware that it is quite small. Also unfortunately due to the noise/smells from the main road, having the bedroom window open at night was difficult.<br/>All of that aside, it was well equipped and comfortable, even luxurious feeling! The furniture was in great shape and looked brand new.<br/>Also the kitchen is excellent (even though there are no pictures featured on the ad). It had everything I needed bar a few small items (like sharp knives and a big mixing bowl). <br/>I would definitely stay here again and recommend to anyone looking for a short term stay in Berlin.",1,0.9795,Positive
60.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,7,100.0,0,1.4756436897150311,4.83,4.75,5.0,4.67,4804458,"Excellent location, apartment and host! Jochen was very arranging and communicating. The apartment has a lot of amenities, really nice decorations and cozy. I had an amazing stay!",1,0.9038,Positive
212.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,62,100.0,1,3.582537934795335,4.86,4.95,4.86,4.5,707932566251791645,"Kathrin’s place looks better in real life than in pictures and way more cozy than I expected ! The location is great and you have everything in walking distance. She was very very friendly and made sure I got everything I needed, couldn’t have a better host :)",1,0.9599,Positive
46.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,25,100.0,0,13.329101896470748,4.48,4.52,4.68,4.42,19614279,I enjoyed my stay here. Mostly used it to put my head down as I was spending the day exploring Berlin. Would recommend for someone who is looking for a place to rest after walking all day.,1,0.7003,Positive
