90.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,15.04840816599569,4.86,4.87,4.72,4.71,835890784607383035,Alles wie versprochen.<br/>Check-in unkompliziert.<br/>Sogar ein (öffentlicher) Parkplatz vor dem Haus war gerade frei.<br/>(Ansonsten hätte die Charité viele kostenpflichtige Parkplätze in der Nähe),1,-0.8316,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,100.0,0,2.781696542058116,4.88,4.88,5.0,4.73,7402027,"Great location, you’ll feel right in the middle of history since you are basically sleeping on the Berliner walls ground itself",1,0.6249,Positive
95.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,3.1833669854420146,4.83,4.85,4.8,4.58,34018418,A beautiful apartment in a great location! Loved staying here it.,1,0.9215,Positive
80.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,56,100.0,1,2.2102820475445166,4.85,4.82,4.88,4.76,3904895,"Carolina’s apartment is pretty, very quiet as it is over a courtyard and in just a fabulous part of the city. It is a pleasure to live in the area and in her apartment which is great for a couple. It is not big, but that suited us as it is very comfortable and nicely furnished and she has an arty touch. We would have preferred a fixed shower over the bath as we are an older couple but we managed and thoroughly enjoyed getting to know Berlin from this well situated base.",1,0.9783,Positive
77.0,3,1.0,0.0,3.0,30,98.0,1,12.36671538964168,4.76,4.86,4.55,4.77,26950491,"Me Hien fue amable, nos dio instrucciones claras y nos recibió sin ningún problema.",1,-0.5574,Negative
115.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,1,2.112162880935192,4.78,4.81,4.84,4.67,16695157,"Das Airbnb liegt in einer Super Lage und ist Top ausgestattet. Alle Probleme wurden sofort und freundlich gelöst ( die Heizung war anfangs etwas kalt) daher können wir die Gastgeber und die Wohnung nur empfehlen, wir kommen gerne wieder ! Barbara & Ronny",1,-0.9041,Negative
201.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,28,100.0,1,3.120633279720611,4.59,4.63,4.9,4.45,27955603,"Great place, lots of space and great location.",1,0.8481,Positive
51.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,11,100.0,1,1.561596824087388,4.86,4.91,4.92,4.78,731285,"Staying at Jay's and Katjas flat was wonderful. They have a very bright and clean flat with an super modern furniture, which is locatet in a clean and beautiful neighborhood. The next subway or tram stations are only a max. 5 min walk away. It is possible to reach the Center of Berlin comparativley within a short amount of time.<br/>Making my visit as pleasant as possible was very importatnt to them. The girls were so courteous, I felt very well!<br/>Party nights with Jay and Katja in Berlin are also unique. They know the best spots and restaurants.<br/>They could tell me so much about music business in Berlin, it was magnificent.<br/>I would absolutley recommend this accommodation for an exciting short- or longterm stay at one of the most beautiful districts of Berlin.<br/>Thank you so much, J. and K.!!<br/>PS: Where do I get this incredibly comfty mattress???",1,0.9925,Positive
80.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,3.9850852018247895,4.95,4.87,4.86,4.84,42639322,オシャレでとても素敵な家でした。部屋は広くて自然光が入り、清潔でした。<br/>ありがとうございました。,1,0.0,Neutral
