64.0,5,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,0,6.015018717053421,4.43,4.14,4.71,4.57,36088682,"The space was very nice with a comfortable living room and balcony. Very close to a few bus lines, s Bahn, and gorlitzer park. We had some issues with the roommate living there. Upon our arrival the kitchen was very messy to the point of being unusable and it took a few days and communications for her to clean it. Also she had a friend come stay in the living room for 3 nights during our stay which blocked off a big part of the apartment. Luise was extremely accommodating and communicative though.",1,0.8255,Positive
