380.0,4,2.0,2.0,3.0,48,100.0,1,1.1071575355391072,4.95,4.99,4.91,4.78,16091735,"Great location close to a subway line.  Communication with host was always prompt except, unfortunately, when the hot water went off while he was flying on vacation.  I put most of the blame on the hot water situation on the management company for the whole building complex not posting any signs saying the water was out for the whole building and when it would return.  Other than that incident everything was outstanding!",0,0.6518,Positive
95.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,9,100.0,0,11.594555037827089,4.09,3.85,4.57,4.16,53104636,"Hotel in an excellent location! The hotel is located in Charlottenburg, near the Kurfürstendamm, the subway and a Rewe City. The hotel and the interior is a bit older, but it was very clean and nicely decorated when we arrived. The high ceilings and the special interior style were also an eye-catcher! All in all very friendly staff and really highly recommended :)",1,0.9823,Positive
