64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,16,100.0,0,3.66652692477493,4.91,4.93,4.82,4.77,49788211,"Sharna was a lovely host and helped us with recommendations and everything. She was easy to communicate with and we felt like being at home. Apartment was stunning. There’s a park nearby which was pretty scary after sunset. Walk distance to tons of restaurants and cafes. We were looking for bohemian place to stay and definitely found it. Thanks, Sharna!",1,0.9493,Positive
