179.0,4,2.0,2.0,2.0,61,100.0,1,0.921623581729306,4.95,4.86,4.94,4.84,34997076,"We had a fantastic stay in Susan’s home in Berlin. Her home was clean, comfortable and spacious with beautiful plants and artwork all around, making the space feel super relaxing. The location of the home was perfectly central, and the strip of cafes, shops and restaurants meant we always had something to see and discover on our doorstep. Thanks for being such a great host Susan - you accommodated our delayed check in and made our stay so easy!",0,0.9881,Positive
