76.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,1.983582423016539,4.79,4.72,4.94,4.73,31900671,Beautiful neighborhood. Maja’s room was lovely. Cute and comfortable and located in one of my favorite parts of Berlin. Stay here if you can.,1,0.9517,Positive
64.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,1,1.17844157767783,4.9,4.91,4.87,4.75,53536574,"Very nice space with dimmable mood lighting that can be controlled with a remote. Nice bathroom with bold minimal color scheme and shower that quickly gets hot.<br/>KitKat, Tresor, a beer garden, and two convenience stores are across the street. A fancy grocery store is downstairs and a cheaper one is a long block away.<br/>The host was very responsive and quickly communicated that I could get a later checkout time when there was a delay with the maid.<br/>The only minor drawback, which the host can obviously not control, was a few moments of a child running around and crying in the apartment upstairs.",1,0.4563,Positive
142.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,49,91.0,0,6.115210424417201,4.74,4.85,4.76,4.47,32539441,Loved staying here. Perfect for workation,1,0.8225,Positive
42.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,8.241604614879243,4.7,4.65,4.88,4.66,23451359,"Es war nur eine kurzer Zwischenstopp in Berlin… es war alles super.<br/>Sehr nette, herzliche Begrüßung durch die Gastgeberin Nicole.<br/>Die Wohnung, das gemütliche Zimmer liegt sehr ruhig. Auch für einen längeren Aufenthalt als nur eine Nacht zu empfehlen, da man sich gleich heimisch fühlt und eingeladen ist, in der Küche als Mittelpunkt zu verweilen. <br/>Für meine Anforderungen perfekt.",1,-0.9136,Negative
