148.0,5,1.0,1.0,5.0,53,100.0,1,16.15581114423226,4.82,4.92,4.78,4.63,3968204,"First Airbnb experience. Great neighborhood. Nice restaurants nearby. Marco is a friendly guy who helps you if needed. The appartment had all the stuff we needed, and he bought some good coffee beans for us. Also some movies. <br/>Appartment was totally clean. Only the square toilet freak me out a bit haha. <br/>See you next year Marco! <br/><br/>regards, <br/><br/>Gijs. <br/>",0,0.9583,Positive
