64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,34,100.0,0,11.526044273184215,4.97,5.0,4.79,4.79,26871219,"Marias Wohnung ist unfassbar schön und gemütlich, man fühlt sich dort einfach wohl! Die Lage ist auch total toll, und ich habe mich in einen Stadtteil Berlins verliebt, den ich vorher nicht so sehr auf dem Schirm hatte. Ich hoffe, dass ich nochmal zurückkommen kann und empfehle die Unterkunft wirklich jedem, der sich überlegt Zeit in Berlin zu verbringen :)",1,-0.7263,Negative
122.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,1,9.26895289552161,4.99,4.96,4.79,4.85,827512903801349124,"Very cosy and nice apartment!<br/>Johannes was a great host, very friendly and welcoming.<br/>Silent and well located street, very close to UBahn and SBahn stations.<br/>Would surely consider this as a safe option for when I came back to the city.",1,0.9574,Positive
55.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,49,100.0,1,22.12570946122336,4.92,4.96,4.47,4.89,551948848079907495,"Clean, quiet and a short ride from Brandenburg (BER) airport",1,0.4019,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,0,10.023228212367442,4.86,4.95,4.74,4.84,17278413,"Nice cozy apartment! <br/>Уютное тихое место, хозяева приветливые. С транспортом проблем нет. Метро, автобус, электричка рядом. (Если часто ездить, есть смысл взять Берлин велком кард). Сабрина готовила завтраки каждое утро, что радует. Рекомендую",1,0.4753,Positive
125.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,0,1.6461356136117251,4.47,4.59,4.75,4.59,20281627,"A few minute walk from the Spittelmarkt U2 U-bahn stop. Easy to get to anywhere across town- short hop to Alexanderplatz to bus connections to Museuminsel or go the other way to Potsdamerplatz, Brandenberger Tor. We now actually prefer staying on the east side of Berlin over the west side.",1,0.1779,Positive
45.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,0,8.68027728801897,4.67,4.45,4.77,4.68,2529429,"Great communication, everything went really smoothly and the check-in times were able to be changed slightly to accommodate our ETA. Overall, a great value for a few nights in Berlin.",1,0.891,Positive
220.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,1,1.0356722338650006,4.96,4.87,4.99,4.77,26824121,Very nice and big apartment in a quite and nice neighbourhood. We would sure like to come back !!! Philip answers quick all your questions . A perfect host .,1,0.9389,Positive
37.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,0,5.662533986282327,4.74,4.77,4.33,4.71,589285,"Lovely apartment and great value for money. Very private and close to some lovely restaurants for breakfast, lunch and dinner. Very easy to get to from Berlin Schönefeld airport. Lovely big windows and peaceful balcony. Great water pressure for the shower. Very happy with our stay.",1,0.9851,Positive
163.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,91.0,0,4.871252294318258,4.67,4.78,4.87,4.53,46864858,"Più un hotel che una casa. Tutto è perfetto. La comunicazione, la posizione e gli spazi comuni sono impeccabili. Torneremo sicuramente.",1,0.0,Neutral
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,55,100.0,1,5.631561089826148,4.93,4.98,4.91,4.83,725003625720262728,"Mor and Lena were very kind and considerate hosts. Thanks to them, I was able to rest comfortably at the accommodation. The accommodation was spacious, bright and cozy. I was very happy when I ate dinner watching the sunset from the balcony. Thanks to Mor and Lena for a great experience!",1,0.9793,Positive
