58.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,0,18.77117911741297,4.7,4.71,4.52,4.69,3314419,"Great place. Horst and Gisele were very friendly. I was travelling with a friend and as the bed was a double not two singles, they arranged another matress without any fuss. Great for airport stopovers, not bad for city sightseeing either as the S-bahn is less than 10 minutes away, gets you to the centre quickly and it runs 24 hours, at least it did over the weekend.",1,0.9568,Positive
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,16,100.0,1,6.361542574957824,4.89,4.66,4.79,4.73,33634726,"We had a lovely few days staying in Konstantin's apartment and felt very at home there. The flat is spacious and airy with all the essentials. The bed was really comfortable. This was an ideal base for exploring the city as it has convenient transport links (U-bahn and S-bahn stations are walkable from the flat.) Lots of little cafes, bars and restaurants to enjoy in the lively Neukölln area. Konstantin was a helpful and friendly host and was very flexible. Communication was easy and we were able to contact him when needed. Thanks so much for having us!",1,0.9837,Positive
41.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,1,8.831363274433173,4.94,4.94,4.8,4.9,24348019,I had a great time at Antonio’s place.<br/>The apartment is welcoming and the cat is adorable!!,1,0.8953,Positive
65.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,90.0,1,1.942933168845537,4.91,4.95,4.95,4.65,43719623,Es war wirklich ein Vergnügen bei Marina zu wohnen. Durch ihre freundliche und zuvorkommende  Art und das schöne Zimmer in zentraler Lage war es der perfekte Rückzugsort nach langen Tagen in Berlin!<br/>Gerne wieder 😊,1,-0.8439,Negative
140.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,91.0,0,4.871252294318258,4.72,4.78,4.85,4.58,46812239,"All basics included<br/>Welcome drinks, which is a surprise.<br/>Available small fridge, but temperature was too warm, couldn't change that.<br/>location is ideal, and security solutions was great.<br/>Overall, 5 stars",1,0.9022,Positive
