333.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,57,100.0,0,0.7735691013482425,4.65,4.71,4.98,4.43,857975239099139321,"We had an amazing time at Darius's apartment. He was very easy to get a hold of and provided really clear instructions on how to get the key and enter the apartment.<br/>The apartment itself was great for our group of three and we loved having the private outdoor space. We especially appreciated the recommendations that Darius left for places to eat nearby, we tried almost all of them!<br/>Would happily stay here again whenever we come back to Berlin :)",0,0.9824,Positive
32.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,3.2159665482867226,4.77,4.71,4.88,4.65,17904,"Max haben wir als netten, hilfsbereiten und sehr zuverlässigen Gastgebeber kennen gelernt. Die schicke kleine Wohnung hat alles geboten, was wir gebraucht haben. Ideale Lage - nur wenige hundert Meter entfernt vom Zentrum Kreuzberg entfernt und trotzdem in sehr ruhiger Lage am Kanal. Die regelmäßigen Märkte vor der Haustür haben wir als eine echte Bereicherung empfunden. Insgesamt sonnige Wintertage in Berlin.",1,-0.8316,Negative
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,34,75.0,0,4.610063059362567,5.0,5.0,4.74,4.89,51686285,"It’s a lovely open plan apartment with two large balconies, one to catch the morning sun and the other facing west which gets evening sun.",1,0.5859,Positive
84.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,1,4.00787800065126,4.73,4.67,4.9,4.65,1282857,"Vincent's place is special because the hosts display their artwork on the walls of the apartment. It was a really unique experience to wake up in an art gallery! <br/>We loved the location of Vincent's place. It's on a quiet street, but not far from restaurants and bars.  Check in was very convenient with Ina who owns an art shop across the street.",1,0.5562,Positive
207.0,5,2.0,2.0,4.0,33,100.0,1,6.879844561652518,4.96,4.93,4.62,4.81,14865350,"We - a family of five - very much enjoyed our stay in this very unique place and apartment.<br/>The two-story apartment is very spacious with no less than two bathrooms and one toilet and all the kitchen equipment you need (among other things, three different coffee/espresso machines). The place was clean and tidy. The courtyard is a huge bonus - a quiet and place place away from the traffic noise.<br/>We would definitely like to come back!",0,0.9338,Positive
85.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,0.0,0,8.038293829339684,4.49,4.58,4.7,4.46,13668880,"I loved this place! We are first time users of air bnb and was worried about the new laws passed in Germany. We were assured with this apartment and I'm so glad we stayed here. The apartment is exactly how it looks in the pictures, it is up some floors though so carrying luggage wasn't ideal but Maximus helped! It is right near the U so we were able to hop on and travel the city. Will book again when we come back! Thank you for a wonderful stay in Berlin :)",1,0.954,Positive
