174.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,61,100.0,0,5.318530801048644,4.96,4.87,4.82,4.78,7367476,"Agnieszka's place is a wonderful place to stay in a wonderful city. The flat was big, quirky, clean, comfortable and full of family life; the neighbourhood was buzzy and independent whilst being within easy reach of the city centre and some amazing parks. I would strongly recommend this place for people who are bored of the standard 'sterile' places they often rent.",0,0.9709,Positive
157.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,45,100.0,0,5.245003120876255,4.77,4.72,4.68,4.61,11914556,"We really enjoyed our stay here! Location in Neukölln is super nice, the area is calmer than more central areas but with public transport you can get to the heart of Berlin in no time. The area has a lot of nice cafes, restaurants and shops and the people are really friendly. <br/>The bedroom is a bit bright without possibilities to make it dark, but the ‘main’ room that also provide sleeping spots offers the possibility for shutting out the light. Check in was super smooth and there was almost no need for communication with the host since all information was provided very clearly. Would definitely recommend this place to my friends and family!",0,0.9894,Positive
