106.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,4.055194475425411,4.9,4.92,4.93,4.73,999731806391201567,"A wonderful apartment. Well decorated, clean and had everything you need. In a great location, very walkable and lots of nice cafes and places to eat near by. The neighborhood had a lot of character. The beautiful courtyard with vines growing up the walls is a nice touch when you come and go from this place. The hosts were very responsive and made us feel welcome. I would 100% stay here again next time I’m in Berlin.",1,0.981,Positive
137.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,91.0,0,4.861047682375263,4.71,4.76,4.86,4.54,53733380,"De accomodatie bevindt zich in een zeer leuke buurt, er is zeer veel te doen. Het was makkelijk inchecken en de instructies waren duidelijk. De kamer was zeer netjes, echter wel aan de krappe kant, maar zeker doenbaar. Ik zou zeker terug komen.",1,0.0,Neutral
