151.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,40,100.0,0,1.7407912024593124,4.79,4.82,4.9,4.67,928772491576618227,"We very much enjoyed staying in the flat. Only two minor things: Polina was a bit standoffish when we asked for an early arrival; and mentioning the many beds was a bit misleading, there was only one proper bed. Otherwise fine; and a fantastic neighborhood.",0,0.7414,Positive
130.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,0,6.976213743299643,4.96,4.93,4.97,4.86,32987496,"Die Wohnung hat eine tolle, zentrale Lage und war sehr sauber. Der Gastgeber war jederzeit gut erreichbar, hat schnell geantwortet und war sehr flexibel. Wir haben uns rundum wohlgefühlt und können die Unterkunft absolut weiterempfehlen!☺️",1,-0.9674,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,6,100.0,0,4.519329251670062,4.63,4.75,4.88,4.5,2056917,"My stay at Marieke´s place was wonderful. I found very easy to comunicate with her since the first contact, she gave me a super precise indication on how to get to her house since i stepped on Berlin, The house is awesome, full of creativity and positive energy and her flatmates are really nice, polite and kind.<br/>  The flat is located on an ideal place, Facing Görli Park. Seven minutes walk to The trains (S-bahn, U-bahn) in a boiling cultural and creative enplacement. Lots of very nice places to eat or enjoy a Berliner (The local beer) on the same road as the house. <br/> At night it´s very nice and calm, but you just have to walk a couple of minutes to find really good night life. I really reccomend this place, hope to come back soon. Thanks for everything. ",1,0.9886,Positive
68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,0,7.131858363401936,4.97,4.97,4.95,4.86,1172431080955868883,Čisté a klidné ubytování 💓,1,0.0,Neutral
158.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,98.0,0,4.767655843053005,4.46,4.61,4.37,4.33,685224054858608898,"The place looked just like the pictures and was easy to access. I felt safe during my stay. You will occasionally hear firetrucks, but the location is walkable to stores and restaurants. It’s a great area if you want to visit the Berlin Mall, cathedral, tv tower.or explore other nearby attractions only about a 10-minute Uber ride away. Overall, a very convenient location.",1,0.9377,Positive
87.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,21,90.0,0,3.196091525660409,4.72,4.86,4.67,4.6,541569,"La signora Silke è stata gentilissima e molto amichevole, sempre disponibile e veloce nel rispondere ai nostri messaggi. L’appartamento era pulitissimo e molto ordinato e lo stesso vale per il suo bar, altrettanto confortevole e con colazioni ottime. La zona è molto tranquilla e ben collegata con tutti i luoghi principali. Siamo stati molto bene e l’atmosfera era quella di casa!",1,0.0,Neutral
160.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,15,91.0,0,6.748315601345057,4.0,4.12,3.94,3.88,1206341839388252549,"it was as shown on the photos. clean and compact. it was easy to find, instructions were quite clear.",1,0.8173,Positive
80.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,56,100.0,1,2.2102820475445166,4.85,4.82,4.88,4.76,3904895,"Leider haben wir Carolina selbst nicht getroffen, aber wir wurden von ihrer Nachbarin super nett empfangen. Der Kontakt mit Carolina war total nett, sie war super flexibel und hat uns viel geholfen. Die Wohnung liegt sehr gut, man kommt schnell überall hin und die Ecke ist auch toll. VIELEN DANK",1,-0.8316,Negative
175.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,54,100.0,1,1.816434876784729,4.91,4.82,4.95,4.72,17876581,"We had a great time, I wish could stay for more days, the place is quite big and has a great view & balcony. The neighborhood is full bar & restaurants and closes to public transportation. <br/>The only downside is that like other historic building in Berlin you need to climb a lot of that the stair.",1,0.9081,Positive
129.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,2.400682342204919,4.98,4.98,5.0,4.68,825308022126453828,"We had a fantastic time at this centrally located Airbnb in Berlin. The apartment is right in the heart of the city with easy access to everything.<br/>The best part was the beautiful rooftop terrace with a stunning view over Berlin. You can see the TV Tower, the Red Town Hall, and even the Bundestag.<br/>The place was clean, comfortable, and had everything I needed. Highly recommended for anyone visiting Berlin.",1,0.9758,Positive
110.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,1,2.106930002562863,4.6,4.77,4.84,4.57,198239,"Très bonne expérience, excellent emplacement pour vivre l'expérience berlinoise, proche des transports et de nombreux restaurants/bars. <br/>Boris a également été très disponible, et sympa par message !",1,0.6114,Positive
160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,87.0,0,3.4802565088356308,4.54,4.54,4.6,4.41,43798011,Good spot in a really nice neighborhood,1,0.7178,Positive
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,0,4.463627999116909,4.67,4.61,4.55,4.71,30341837,"Искали с женой жилье в Берлине. Увидели этот вариант и забронировали. Кристина сразу же вышла на связь и сообщила первую информацию. По приезду все было аккуратно убрано и подготовлено к нашему приезду. Комната небольших размеров, но кровать большого размера была в самый раз. Я высокий 202 см. Все очень удобно и под рукой. Ванная комната отдельная для каждых постояльцев, что было отличным решением. Хорошая кухня, со всем чем нужно для приготовления пищи. Остались отличное впечатление. Очень благодарны за такой отличный прием.",1,0.0,Neutral
