45.0,7,1.0,1.5,3.0,43,100.0,1,10.276548392981908,4.65,4.46,4.81,4.58,9136533,"La descripción del alojamiento se ajusta a la realidad. Tienes que compartir todas las zonas comunes que por el precio está bastante bien. Claudio es muy cordial y todos los servicios funcionan a la perfección, y el lugar está cerca de todo teniendo en cuenta además, que el transporte en Berlín es inmejorable.",1,0.0,Neutral
130.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,1,2.669079881682033,4.97,4.98,4.84,4.86,26180749,"Our stay at Jürgen and Denise’s Airbnb was perfect. The location is great to discover Berlin and it was located in a nice neighbourhood - perfect for exploring Friedrichshain. The room was super spacious and the bed very comfortable, plus there even was a fridge in the room. Communication was great and I will definitely love to come back to this place. I highly recommend staying in this Airbnb:).",1,0.9887,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,0,3.607414614374613,4.85,4.94,4.81,4.76,41954411,A great apartment in a great location. Lots of fantastic food nearby and it was near the happening areas of Berlin. Tom and Miriam were accomodating and very friendly. We would definitely stay here again.,1,0.9583,Positive
157.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,89.0,0,4.068771463428812,4.67,4.7,4.76,4.62,1264387511715820970,"Peaceful location - it was quiet yet close to transport and activities. Seamless check-in with the pinpad. Comfy place to came back and crash - the ceiling fan was great in the heat and the TV had a wireless connection (make sure you have ad-free netflix subscription if you want to share the screen). There are a couple of good restaurants/cafes to grab a quick bite as soon as you walk outside so we could easily adapt our holidays plans without worrying about how long to travel for a good meal. The bathroom was more beautiful than the photos - loved the warm wood interior and green tiling/fixtures. On check out, we could use the lockers downstairs to store our belongings while we made the most of last day in Berlin. Travel to and from the airport was easy, only 1 short stop after getting the main train into Berlin. In our room, there wasn't a lot of room for the chair to pull out from the desk so be aware layouts might be a bit different from the photo. Overall, I would highly recommend",1,0.9885,Positive
110.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,1,1.0402259311684183,4.96,4.98,4.97,4.88,934801746069287340,"Dominik was very friendly, and the apartment is cozy and excellently located!",1,0.8353,Positive
164.0,5,2.0,2.0,3.0,30,100.0,1,1.753209774100189,4.83,4.72,4.83,4.75,3188899,房间非常舒适，进出非常方便，位置也很好找，最让我难忘的是我们到达的时候已经很晚了 Aglaja的老公Ronald一直在等我们到达，并且非常热情且细致的给我们介绍了房间的信息，让我感觉到非常温暖且愉快，再次感谢你们。期待下次相见。,0,0.0,Neutral
194.0,5,2.0,1.5,3.0,26,100.0,1,3.829066431977836,4.77,4.83,4.84,4.64,19395636,"* Beautiful space, would stay again.<br/>* The couple 24/7 corner stores and night bus stop down the street will aid any night owl. <br/>* Internet connection was stable.<br/>* Two foldable drying racks was very helpful to those with longer stays.<br/>* Don't think twice; book this spot and enjoy Berlin!<br/>Note that this building is a walk-up: it has no lift and is located up a few floors (~3rd floor for Americans).",0,0.7955,Positive
30.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,10.0,0,4.566149972406102,4.54,4.65,4.7,4.7,39560057,Only the strict necessary at Ana’s place (no towel for guests). Sometimes the nightlife was too loud to sleep. It was ok,1,0.296,Positive
189.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,91.0,0,1.3231577133885242,4.77,4.8,4.93,4.63,39885618,"Excellent check-in, very easy to use the self-checkin system Great location in Prenzlauer Berg and the room was fantastic.",1,0.9392,Positive
180.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,45,85.0,0,1.5095289909770313,4.75,4.84,4.9,4.6,45475252,"our stay at Numa Nook in Berlin Mitte was very enjoyable. The location is ideal for someone looking for easy access to all parts of Berlin and the restaurant and shopping options were ideal. <br/>The property itself was very cozy and clean. The access to laundry facilities along with extra towels and coffee was a real bonus. Finally, the luggage storage option for after checkout while waiting to depart to the airport was a real A+ feature! <br/>Numa Nook Berlin Mitte  is definitely on my list of spots to book again!",1,0.9707,Positive
119.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,6.121786157144007,4.81,4.66,4.86,4.72,23747428,"Heiko was a great host, responding to queries straight away. Flexible moving in times. Large appartment, centrally located for all attractions. Very well stocked with all you can possibly need and more. Very comfortable and spacious. No hesitation to book the apartment again should I want to come to Berlin again and would recommend it to friends too. We really enjoyed our stay there.",1,0.9689,Positive
91.0,6,3.0,1.0,6.0,34,100.0,1,3.8710959645000753,4.77,4.82,4.78,4.73,1052541605853259851,"There was no information on how to lock the front door. We had friends on our trip staying in the same building but we were never told not to use the back door. When we used the back door we were told we weren’t supposed to use. If we had known this Airbnb refused anything but silence we would have booked somewhere else. Further, there was only one bathroom and while we only had a group of 5, the apartment could accommodate 6-7 or more, which is insane for only having a single bathroom. The apartment was also smaller than the pictures indicated which did not please us upon arrival.",0,-0.8289,Negative
61.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,1,3.347640201769396,4.91,4.96,4.86,4.82,50700578,"Me parecio muy buena la ubicacion, el alojamiento estuvo excelente y Jonas siempre estuvo al pendiente.",1,0.0,Neutral
141.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,43,94.0,0,7.131273504704622,4.74,4.82,4.79,4.62,49070135,"Great accomodation, clean rooms, shower, microwave and a freezer, highly recommended.",1,0.8357,Positive
