75.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,0,7.827951849941275,4.34,4.6,4.33,4.27,18798641,Die Wohnung von sich für Preise in Berlin  war in Ordnung. Es gab paar Unstimmigkeiten in der Wohnung selbst. Die Lage ist gut.,1,-0.9136,Negative
52.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,6.296102388049414,4.82,4.77,4.72,4.77,16305782,"The place was super convenient and a really great value! Check in was a breeze because we were able to do self check in, and we also had a washer and dryer! This was our third stop in Europe so it was such a great amenity. For my personal taste, the bed was a little hard, but the rest of the amenities were very nice and there was also a lot of storage and a kitchen with everything we needed to prepare some light breakfasts / lunches. Overall, would recommend.",1,0.9433,Positive
