132.0,6,1.0,1.0,4.0,28,98.0,0,2.774133008375683,4.43,4.2,4.72,4.31,53653291,"Schön große Unterkunft in schöner Lage, es ist viel zu Fuß erreichbar. Es war größtenteils sauber,  da besteht aber noch Verbesserungspotential. Es gab alles was wir benötigt haben. Die Betten waren gemütlich, die Schlafcouch allerdings sehr ungemütlich und sollte definitiv ausgetauscht werden. In der Hälfte der Länge sackte sie um ein paar Zentimeter ab, ein „normales“ Schlafen darauf war nicht möglich.",1,-0.9485,Negative
85.0,3,2.0,1.0,4.0,19,100.0,0,14.438628822769202,4.86,4.79,4.79,4.93,40527823,"We spent 4 days with them. We have a room on the top floor. The rooms have no air conditioning, only a fan. The house is outside in the garden city, close to the airport. The beds are comfortable. Our hosts are direct and friendly. Rooms have a TV and parking is free.",1,0.8934,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,44,100.0,1,6.299157580819726,4.96,4.94,4.82,4.88,37968286,"a little hidden gem in Berlin. Very open and large flat where you feel at home right away :) We totally loved the place, the space and the welcome. The location is a only little of the beaten path, which adds to the charm and peacefulness when you are there after a visit in the busy town. A place which makes a city visit so much better",1,0.9488,Positive
