43.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,100.0,1,19.2169004458318,4.91,4.97,4.85,4.79,617227640583218025,"Ich hab mich sehr wohl gefühlt, es war alles wie beschrieben. Kann ich nur empfehlen",1,-0.5994,Negative
83.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,1,3.102509371524417,4.92,4.98,4.92,4.81,18506873,"Frank's apartment is fantastic!  Comfortable, bright, clean, and in a perfect location for trains and trams.  The neighborhood is wonderful, with meat, cheese, bread, and grocery within a a block, and many good restaurants and cafes near.  Stay here!",1,0.9661,Positive
214.0,4,2.0,1.5,4.0,34,98.0,0,1.0407544919436775,4.61,4.72,4.75,4.55,34294699,Friendly and attentive staff.  It is an aparthotel with a very spacious layout with a central location (close to local public transport and Christmas markets).  The apartment was clean and accessible.,0,0.7096,Positive
99.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,34,100.0,0,2.493338849638266,4.5,4.5,4.81,4.08,1346551135313030890,"Все понравилось, пространство очень маленькое, как комната в отеле, но вполне продуманное, есть все необходимое — от техники (фен, чайник, плитка, холодильник...) до расходников (средство для посуды, ватные палочки, щетки...). Смогли без проблем заселиться и выехать самостоятельно.",1,0.0,Neutral
186.0,6,2.0,1.5,3.0,39,100.0,0,5.538943551470177,4.96,4.86,4.88,4.86,817200066944099193,"I booked this airbnb for my parents visiting me and everything was perfect and communication was very quick! This is what they had to say: My husband and I stayed at the Airbnb. The apartment was true to the photos. Even better. Modern with clean lines and large spaces. There was attention to very detail.  The refrigerator stocked with sparkling water and beer. Crisp white sheets. Super comfortable mattress. The restrooms were impeccable. Stocked with shampoo and soap. The kitchen was ample also stocked with coffee, cream and sugar. Found all the necessary utensils, pots and pans should I had been inspired to cook a complete meal. Quiet street accessible to a supermarket, neighborhood restaurants and corner stores. Very walkable. Train near by. It was a superb experience. Most places use the lower quality paper goods. The tissue and paper towels were substantial. I was impressed. This is an excellent property. Would stay again.",0,0.9877,Positive
86.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,0,17.660111302321962,4.8,4.8,4.7,4.6,49707808,"Reinhards Appartment befindet sich im grünen Berliner Südwesten. Die Wohnung ist 5 min zu Fuß von einer S-Bahn-Station entfernt, und man ist in 20 Minuten am Potsdamer Platz und in 25 Minuten an der Friedrichstraße. In fußläufiger Entfernung gibt es Supermärkte, Bäckereien und andere Geschäfte. Die Wohnung ist sehr ruhig, schön eingerichtet und bietet alles, was man für einen angenehmen Aufenthalt braucht.<br/>Reinhard konnte uns nicht persönlich in Empfang nehmen, aber eine Bekannte von ihm war in der Wohnung und der Check-In verlief perfekt. Alles in allem: Empfehlenswert!",1,-0.9184,Negative
108.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,3.617893966015014,4.74,4.78,4.82,4.57,18443210,"Perfekte Lage im schönen Bergmannkiez. Wohnung ist ein totales Schmuckstück und perfekt für jeden, der es gerne speziell mag. U-Bahnhof in unmittelbarer Nähe. Top saubere Wohnung mit praktischer Ausstattung.",1,0.2023,Positive
91.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,0,4.511823268613172,4.68,4.74,4.5,4.65,30319167,"The apartment was very clean and quiet. The hosts were super responsive and put out little snacks, which was great after traveling for a long time. I would definitely stay here again in the future!",1,0.9476,Positive
121.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,27,100.0,0,4.472653939309849,4.88,4.9,4.81,4.78,10122398,siehe vorangehende Bewertung.  Martin ist ein Super-Gastgeber. <br/>FYI: Studio 3 liegt zwischen Studio 1 und 2. Also falls ihr 2 Studios nebeneinander buchen wollt dann z.b. Studio 1+3 😀,1,0.0,Neutral
