207.0,4,2.0,1.5,3.0,47,100.0,1,11.940515173647206,4.92,4.86,4.91,4.79,3976211,"Anna's Berlin apartment was simply perfect for our family: my husband and I loved the light-filled, beautifully designed place; my kids loved the glass elevator up to the 5th floor and the giant bathtub. The apartment was spotless, had everything we needed from kids cutlery to incredible views of the sun setting on Berlin from our bedroom window. Highly recommended!",0,0.9558,Positive
115.0,5,1.0,1.0,3.0,49,100.0,1,5.871560485458869,4.83,4.77,4.61,4.65,48181556,"Wir haben eine Nacht in der Wohnung von Gini und Eric verbracht, weil wir für ein Konzert in der Uber Arena in Berlin waren, die in ca. 20 Minuten Fußweg zu erreichen ist. <br/>Die Kommunikation mit den Gastgebern lief super. <br/>Die Wohnung ist geschmackvoll eingerichtet und hat alles, was man für einen Städtetrip braucht.",1,0.0,Neutral
