201.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,54,100.0,1,1.3558603428081426,4.88,4.9,4.77,4.74,13755615,"The apartment is wonderful. It was super clean and organized and exactly matched the photos. Sven sent clear instructions on how to get there and his colleague welcomed us personally. He was also very available during the time we were there. <br/>But the truth is that we didn't need anything, the apartment had everything. The shower was great, the beds were great and at night it was very peaceful and quiet to sleep. Super efficient heating.  Well located, in a wonderful neighborhood and amidst buildings with a lot of history. And with everything we need nearby (restaurants, market, metro station). I really want to go back to Berlin and I'm sure when that happens we'll want to stay there again.",0,0.9924,Positive
248.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,2.942766383999945,4.96,4.98,4.86,4.74,28091977,"This apartment is in a great location; bar downstairs, plenty of places to eat in walking distance, subway and other forms of transit right outside. Check in/ out was simple and easy. Place was very clean. We really enjoyed our stay here.",1,0.9272,Positive
318.0,8,3.0,1.5,5.0,53,100.0,1,3.7256422035937673,4.95,4.94,4.85,4.83,13320037,"Sven’s apartment in Mitte is a fantastic location, value, and setting. Me and some colleagues took time off here for a couple days on a work trip and we were blown away by the space and comfort. Thanks Sven! I’ll be back for sure.",0,0.9184,Positive
166.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,1,12.061827602602534,4.96,4.94,4.62,4.7,25106713,"Ruhige Lage, nette Gastfreundschaft, sehr schön eingerichtetes und bequemes Appartement. Immer wieder gerne !!!",1,0.0,Neutral
