104.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,2.8898428737556667,4.98,4.96,4.96,4.81,1121124282060814528,"Florian’s place is super great! In amazing area, which combines quiet but also very social at the same time. Easy to connect to many areas!<br/>Florian was very responsive, and easy and clear to communicate with. Super adaptive to check-in / check-out when/if needed. <br/>Flat is very beautiful, clean and quiet. Bedroom is very big with small private balcony. Also private super clean bathroom and shared large shower room/bathroom. <br/>Great place when in Berlin! Will very happily book again when back to town! <br/>Thanks a lot Florian!",1,0.9959,Positive
33.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,1,3.479389684243167,4.95,4.85,4.89,4.87,51241057,"Marcello is super lovely and so is his house. We felt very welcome and slept amazing in the bed. The bikes were also really nice, we were really flexible through Berlin. Would 10/10 recommend!",1,0.9715,Positive
85.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,54,100.0,1,9.09222079050002,4.97,4.99,4.9,4.87,5682500,住处干净整洁，设施齐全，位置靠近市中心，环境宜人和安静，入住和退房沟通顺畅，我的父母在我这里度过了很愉快的时光。,1,0.0,Neutral
