68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,1,5.810529559225474,4.95,4.97,4.91,4.76,1066641196227035034,"Wir hatten ein schönes Wochenende bei Luisa und Utobong! Die beiden sind uns sehr entgegengekommen bezüglich der Zeiten des Ein- und Auscheckens und waren jederzeit gut zu erreichen. Die Wohnung ist wirklich schön, sauber und super gelegen.",1,-0.636,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,12,100.0,0,4.61111595595906,4.52,4.48,4.74,4.58,14830887,"Spotless, easy to get to, lots of things to do in the area, perfect!",1,0.784,Positive
137.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,26,100.0,1,3.5275124143940824,4.87,4.93,4.89,4.65,19651064,"We were so happy with our choice of Airbnbs.  I originally chose it primarily for its location, which is very close to my son’s apartment, but in the end, we would choose it again because Martin is a wonderful host and he has created a well thought out , clean, welcoming space.  (We loved the location as well - it was so easy to get around and we felt very safe).  One note of warning for those who may fear heights or who may be unsteady on their feet - both beds are located up steep steps in loft areas.  We had no problems with it, but might hesitate if we were not very agile!  I found out on this trip trip that I will soon be a grandmother to a German baby, so I expect we will want to stay here in the near future and beyond.  Thanks, Martin!!!",1,0.9768,Positive
111.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,0,5.463369258195954,4.92,4.96,4.93,4.79,2027140,Julia’s place was in the soul of Berlin. Loved the area and felt at home. Julia was a very responsive host and was available when any questions arose. Thank you Julia ✨,1,0.8479,Positive
165.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,49,100.0,1,1.9500965745313548,4.91,4.89,4.97,4.82,1915904,"Adrian and Bernd are super helpful and responsive and gave us a lot of tips and recommendations for the area in terms restaurants, sights, and grocery shopping. All of their recommendations were spot on, had an amazing time drinking across the street and some of the best sushi down stairs. The apartment is absolutely incredible and has everything we needed for our long stay in Berlin. The location has lots of bars and restaurants and it’s quite a vibey neighbourhood. I am really going to miss waking up and looking out at the streets below buzzing with activity! Thank you again Adrian and Bernd for making up first trip to Berlin so special!",1,0.9716,Positive
