62.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,100.0,1,25.552804702485783,4.96,4.98,4.75,4.9,916385712990982106,Marion在我們入住時親切地迎接我們，儘管我們晚到了。他充份的信任我們，讓我們自由的使用他的空間，並且在退宿時簡單的便可離開。房間就如同照片所拍攝的溫暖寬敞且寧靜。房子的後方有個安靜的森林，是社區居民蹓狗的場所。,1,0.0,Neutral
174.0,7,3.0,2.0,3.0,31,100.0,1,8.08686445377939,4.92,4.85,4.84,4.88,23451726,All good,0,0.4404,Positive
96.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,39,94.0,1,4.573119588414803,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,1285489270577060131,"The hostel is brand new and nicely designed, the owner super friendly - we had a really comfortable stay! Apparently, we were one of the first guests there, and new things kept popping up while we were there, so some things might look a little different later on. <br/>We stayed in a private room for 2, which was quite big and comfortable. Since we travel for dancing and go through a lot of nice clothes, we really appreciated a good clothing rack with many, many hangers, which also helped in keeping the room tidy. We could control the heating in the room, and all the shared facilities were very close. <br/>If you plan on sleeping in, I'd recommend a good pair of earplugs in case there's a big group staying at the same time, as the soundproofing of the rooms could use some upgrading. At the same time, the owner did their best not to wake me up when I came back late at night, closing doors that were usually open etc., which I appreciated a lot. <br/>All in all, we were really happy with our stay!",1,0.9933,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,0,3.100493678368544,5.0,4.94,4.94,4.83,11998186,"If you’re ever in Berlin and you want to feel at home , and close to all kinds of food and many things to do,  and the metro (which can take you anywhere) this place has it all. <br/>It feels like home; walk to the bio market to make use of the kitchen (which has everything)<br/>Kreuzberg is full of great places, and the people are friendly!<br/>I am making this a fav so I can maybe make this my regular Berlin place.",1,0.8932,Positive
256.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,62,100.0,0,1.4337681418206727,4.62,4.56,4.93,4.61,35242748,"This apartment is perfectly situated right next to Hackescher Markt and has an endless amount of restaurants, bars, shops, museums and cultural experiences steps away. The space itself is roomy and well laid out (cool view of the station/square but bedrooms on the opposite side so you aren’t disturbed by the noise). We didn’t use the washer during our short stay but loved that it was there. Peter & Dennis were also very gracious in allowing us to drop our luggage off early and check-out a bit later.",0,0.8553,Positive
183.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,53,100.0,1,5.599016268041934,4.95,4.96,4.44,4.79,42697557,"Apartment ist großartig ausgestattet, mit genug Platz und schick. Sehr ruhig trotz Bar im EG (Ich bin sehr Geräusch empfindlich). Bis zur U-Bahn sind es ca. 8 Minuten Fußweg. Das Lokal Oeff ist ein Besuch wert!",1,0.0,Neutral
26.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,0.0,0,4.347996952448364,4.7,4.19,4.88,4.74,4804494,Stayed 1 week in the flat. Being able to live in the center of the city is very nice. Robert is kind and welcoming. The flat is conform to description.,1,0.8553,Positive
95.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,0,0.7915420818247044,4.76,4.6,4.91,4.68,20205689,"Удобно расположенная квартира. 900 метров до Александрплац. Два супермаркета рядом, один в 30 метрах, второй за углом. Две станции метро в 5 минутах ходьбы. Оборудованная и снабженная всем необходимым кухня (кроме масла для жарки), посудомойка, кофемашина, большой холодильник. Хорошее отопление. Немного тесновата душевая кабина. Нам понравилось здесь останавливаться.",1,0.0,Neutral
77.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,0,6.266793012378933,4.7,4.65,4.53,4.7,6264703,"The location is fantastic- one bus from Schoneberg airport, and very close to a bus stop which takes you to the city in a short time. We recommend exploring Neukoln and walking up to the old airport runway - there are lots of great little spots on the way! David left us some Berlin guides which also had good tips- thanks! ",1,0.937,Positive
154.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,1,4.7401695821248655,4.99,5.0,4.91,4.74,22181575,"Wir haben uns hier sehr wohlgefühlt! Die Unterkunft ist ein echter Rückzugsort - top angebunden und dennoch ruhig , genau das was für uns richtig war. Die Wohnung ist sauber, ordentlich und sehr gemütlich. Alles nötige ist vorhanden, ohne dass es überladen ist. Auf dem kleinen Balkon lässt es sich gemütlich lesen oder das Treiben beobachten.<br/>Alina ist sehr freundlich, flexibel und antwortet schnell. Wer kann, sollte hier unterkommen :)",1,-0.8478,Negative
179.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,56,100.0,1,4.640101639333407,4.88,4.9,4.76,4.73,52545881,"We had a wonderful stay in Torsten & Jan's place. Located in a very quiet neighborhood, with a private terrace and green garden. Lots of free parking space right in front of the apartment. The apartment was very clean, practical and had everything you need for a perfect stay.<br/>The metro or bus are within walking distance and perfect to discover Berlin all day, then come back to the homey feeling and relax.<br/>We had perfect clear & friendly communication with Torsten, making us feel very welcome. Jan dropped by once to check if we settled in all right, which was very kind. <br/>Overall, we highly enjoyed it and would definitely come back to Torsten's place when visiting Berlin.",0,0.991,Positive
104.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,31,100.0,1,4.2642040908590895,4.8,4.63,4.66,4.6,668570668765950332,Super Unterkunft<br/>Tolle Lage und eine super<br/>nette Kommunikation <br/>Danke für den Aufenthalt ❤️,1,0.5994,Positive
340.0,7,3.0,2.0,6.0,70,100.0,1,3.241255499524776,4.81,4.97,4.79,4.66,176342,A spacious apartment in a great location near many landmarks in Berlin. Definitely worth staying here!,0,0.8398,Positive
125.0,8,3.0,1.0,2.0,17,100.0,0,6.117673237767841,4.42,4.43,4.78,4.49,18659651,Die Wohnung ist super groß und die Lage ist ausgezeichnet - es ist nah zum U-Bahn und der Stadt.,0,-0.6486,Negative
352.0,8,4.0,2.0,6.0,33,100.0,1,7.070529925741001,4.95,4.94,4.57,4.82,35955578,"The place is incredibly perfect! the beds are great and the rooms are dark at night, the kitchen is fully equipped and it even has a very nice balcony. We spent wonderful days there! Thanks Stephan and Babett!",0,0.9621,Positive
197.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,1,3.58830931137498,4.92,4.86,4.87,4.77,53287157,This loft is huge and absolutely beautiful.   The floor to ceiling windows gave us tremendous sunlight.  Sabine was very responsive and even sent us an extra set of keys via Uber when we locked ourselves out.  I will definitely staying here on our next trip to Berlin,1,0.8998,Positive
120.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,0,6.356331916640392,4.78,4.78,4.88,4.69,19099053,"Leiligheten ligger i et rolig, barnevennlig nabolag. Kort vei til lekeplasser, butikker, restauranter og offentlig transport. I selve leiligheten er det også et fint lekeområde for barn. Leiligheten har inngang på bakkeplan, noe som var praktisk med barnevogn.  Det er ikke dør mellom stue/kjøkken og soverom, bare en gardin. Vi hadde problemer med en barneseng som ikke var i leiligheten, men husvert løste dette greit med en refusjon i etterkant. Alt i alt hadde vi et fint opphold i Schreinerstrasse.",1,0.0,Neutral
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,7.814290679179861,4.9,4.77,4.69,4.69,937001075541410895,卫生：很干净<br/>位置：方便，地铁就在旁边,1,0.0,Neutral
68.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,20,100.0,1,6.801132231621815,4.75,4.79,4.43,4.64,15985692,"Sehr gute Einkaufslage für diese sehr funktional ausgestattete Wohnung direkt an der S Bahn Neukölln.<br/>Ausstattung mit Geschirr Gläsern und Besteck nur für einen Kurzaufenthalt ausreichend. Sonstige Ausstattung und Einrichtung nicht nur ok, sondern geschmackvoll und zum Wohlfühlen. Also insgesamt sehr empfehlenswert!<br/>Vielen Dank!",1,0.4184,Positive
199.0,3,2.0,2.0,4.0,24,67.0,0,1.6734397696956833,4.97,4.94,4.95,4.86,6290291,"We stayed in Andre's place for 2.5 weeks. The apartment was perfect and everything worked out very well with Andre. Apartment's location is optimal. Best thing was that before our arrival I told Andre that since we are coming with our 1 year baby, we need to figure out how to get a bed for the baby and a highchair. Soon after that Andre told me that he had organised them so that they were waiting for us when we arrive.",0,0.9152,Positive
145.0,9,4.0,2.0,8.0,33,100.0,1,7.6866045365292734,4.87,4.78,4.57,4.75,32394837,Die Wohnung von Jörn ist absolut empfehlenswert. Wir waren zu sechst in der Unterkunft und hatten genug Platz da die Zimmer sehr groß sind. Die Lage ist perfekt wenn man nicht direkt in der Stadt wohnen möchte. Eine halbe Stunde fährt man mit den öffentlichen Verkehrsmitteln und ist dann mitten im Geschehen. Jörn ist ein sehr freundlicher und unkomplizierter Gastgeber. Würden immer wieder bei ihm buchen:),0,-0.9136,Negative
