300.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,56,100.0,0,4.473414028323519,4.84,4.55,4.94,4.63,46631816,Fantastic place steps away from Boxhagener Platz. The place is exactly as it looks and described on the photos. The balcony is also nice addition. I loved the interior and the lighting at night is very pleasing. In my opinion the place better cleaning. There was  lots of dust flying in the house which I didn’t enjoy for the money we spent. Denise was very nice and helpful and we really enjoyed the amazing coffee experience every morning. If u love coffee this is your place.,1,0.9897,Positive
116.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,3.4220599717130984,4.92,4.97,4.86,4.83,362701,Good apartment in a nice neighborhood.  Great host in Ursula.  I would stay again.,1,0.8689,Positive
100.0,6,1.0,1.0,4.0,37,100.0,0,7.925475010149213,4.75,4.7,4.38,4.6,50724159,"Für ein großes Event waren wir über ein verlängertes Wochenende in Berlin als Familie. Die Wohnung ist hierfür super geeignet. Schön gestaltet, ordentlich und sauber. Die Betten sind sehr bequem, das Doppelbett auf der Empore ist nicht ganz einfach zu erreichen, wenn man jung und fit ist, aber kein Problem. Die Ubahn ist ganz in der Nähe, wird aber zurzeit in Stand gesetzt, weshalb wir ein Stück weiter zur nächsten Station gelaufen sind. Die Gegend ist etwas gewöhnungsbedürftig und lädt nicht unbedingt zum Verweilen ein, hier war im Gegensatz zur sonstigen Stadt nichts los. Die nahegelegenen Parks haben wir nicht genutzt. Insgesamt ist man recht schnell im Zentrum. Kostenfreie Parkplätze sind in ca. 10 min Entfernung zu Fuß verfügbar. <br/>Wir würden die Wohnung für einen Kurztrip, wie wir ihn gemacht haben für Familien oder kleine Freundesgruppen auf jeden Fall empfehlen.",1,-0.9766,Negative
131.0,1,1.0,1.0,8.0,30,99.0,0,1.556410002666394,4.71,4.76,4.65,4.7,6097880,Good and cosy place to rest after a long day. Near to public transports. Good hospitality. Would recommend it to anyone. Thank you:),1,0.8689,Positive
226.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,100.0,1,5.186577238960229,5.0,4.96,4.88,4.75,28534517,"Clean, amazing view, central location, friendly staff.",1,0.8658,Positive
162.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,51,100.0,1,3.2543180393984152,4.9,4.97,4.79,4.68,52608076,"Very nice apartment, close to lots of restarurants, stores and the Subway.<br/>Markus was very helpful and went out of his way to make sure we had everything we needed.<br/>The apartment was very clean.<br/>We had a super good time, it was the perfekt place for four people to stay in Berlin.",0,0.9387,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,21,100.0,1,8.187543141932318,4.92,4.93,4.9,4.8,1266630,"Roi's Berlin apartment was superb. It is clean, new, stylish and in an excellent location. The bakery three doors down offers the lowest cost breakfast in all of Europe, I think. Also, Roi is an excellent host who gave us great travel tips and quickly and personally took care of a minor problem we had at the beginning of our stay. I would highly recommend this place to anyone and we would certainly stay there again. Thanks Roi!",1,0.9766,Positive
18.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,16,100.0,1,3.5617393850761867,4.9,4.73,4.94,5.0,5521732,"Constantin's place is beautiful and feels very much like home and it is a very peaceful space. The bedroom is a lot bigger than the photos suggest too, with a desk, reading chair, cushioned area for sitting by the window, as well as a bed. Constantin himself is a very helpful, friendly and interesting person.<br/>A quick U-Bahn ride to Warschauer Straße opens up a lot of transport options. A warning that there are a lot of stairs which are a bit difficult with big bags, but this is worth it as there are lovely views from the apartment.<br/>I really enjoyed my stay, it was very restful.",1,0.9775,Positive
106.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,15,97.0,1,3.587299160900769,4.83,4.82,4.72,4.8,21018456,Sauberes Apartment perfekt für ein verlängertes Wochenende in Berlin. gerne wieder.<br/>Vielen Dank,1,0.0,Neutral
