313.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,21,82.0,1,2.6774214719576683,4.87,4.84,4.95,4.77,43824448,Die Wohnung ist zentral gelegen und trotzdem ruhig. Wir wurden freundlich empfangen und es war alles sauber und ordentlich. Die Betten waren bequem und die Wohnung hat einen kleinen Balkon mit Blick auf die Spree. Alles in allem ein gelungener Aufenthalt,1,-0.9661,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,82.0,1,2.6808853188639663,4.67,4.68,4.92,4.59,43823296,"The host was super responsive & accommodating. I don't think the pictures look anything like the place though, would be mindful of this.",1,0.836,Positive
125.0,2,2.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,0,12.810166829299993,4.8,4.52,4.92,4.72,21316656,"Lovely space in the Steglitz area, SW of Berlin. Takes about 30-40m to Mitte on the Bahn. Large basement flat, with good light. Nice kitchen with good amenities. I unfortunately had to leave early due to personal circumstances, but Christian was very understanding, and I would recommend this place to anyone.",1,0.8248,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,1,4.426675048417633,4.83,4.79,4.96,4.7,32417594,"Lovely flat in excellent location for alternative Berlin. Close to U-Bahn, Tram and places to eat/drink/go out. Carolina is a very responsive, helpful host! We had a great stay here!",1,0.9587,Positive
20.0,6,1.0,0.0,6.0,21,100.0,0,3.818785253820972,4.47,4.45,4.56,4.55,30759237,The hostel is located not so far from the station. It is near restaurants and a mall. There is a good vibe when you get in the hostel. Cool and free vibes. The staff is friendly and attentive which was also one of the highlight for me. The room that we stayed in was big enough for the six occupants in it and it was sparkling clean and nice! The toilets near our rooms were clean however the other toilets going to our room smelled a bit. But in general our stay was great!,1,0.9583,Positive
105.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,1,3.52244372935394,4.98,4.98,4.97,4.93,25053189,"Alles gut, hatten einen schönen Aufenthalt. Nun schon zum zweiten Mal. Gerne wieder.",1,0.0,Neutral
422.0,16,7.0,5.0,10.0,55,100.0,1,6.474155287757895,4.93,4.86,4.66,4.85,13666450,"We were 14 guys for a Bachelor Party and had a wonderful stay! Werner allowed us to move in earlier and stay longer than usual! He provided us with all the necessary information and gave us tips for Berlin. He is a very nice guy.<br/>The apartment is very well equipped, we did not miss anything!!!<br/>Even though the location is a little bit far from the city center (which makes it legal by the way!!), you have a perfect train connection and you are everywhere in about 20 minutes!<br/>We can highly recommend that place!!!",0,0.9661,Positive
