101.0,2,0.0,8.5,2.0,35,100.0,0,2.496114582405734,4.64,4.56,4.81,4.55,45354619,"A clean and comfortable stay located in a great neighborhood. Many parks, supermarkets, cafes and restaurants all accessible by foot or bike. The communal areas were all maintained daily and kept clean. <br/>Only negative was our check-in process, where we only received the first half of information to self check-in, leaving us stuck for 2 hours trying to get wifi to be able to communicate with reception, who is hardly around in person. Once you can get ahold of them, however, they are of good help.",0,0.9136,Positive
125.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,1,100.0,0,6.5343485430456365,5.0,5.0,4.83,5.0,8010771,"Wir hatten zu viert eine wunderschöne Zeit in Berlin. Vor allem die nette Kommunikation, das entgegengebrachte Vertrauen, die schöne Wohnung in toller Lage haben dazu beigetragen. Vielen lieben Dank an Tine & Lara!",1,-0.8439,Negative
100.0,3,2.0,1.0,3.0,42,100.0,1,31.068770896302222,4.93,4.91,4.81,4.75,3124110,"Die Wohnung ist idyllisch gelegen, gemütlich eingerichtet und lädt durch viele liebevolle Details ein, sich sofort wohl zu fühlen. <br/>Katrin ist eine sehr offene und hilfsbereite Gastgeberin, wir haben uns in jeder Hinsicht willkommen gefühlt. <br/>Sehr zu empfehlen.",1,-0.5994,Negative
82.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,11,100.0,1,2.1954868166555097,4.97,4.98,4.96,4.84,725973277956407623,"Heike was a wonderful host. She was very easy to reach and always replied very quick to my messages. Just a perfect host. <br/>The place is just unique very cozy and clean. It is located in a superb location with many restaurants, bars, coffee shops, parks and very well connected to the different areas in Berlin. <br/>If I will be back in Berlin again in the future, I will definetely come back to Hike's accommodation.",1,0.9657,Positive
120.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,2.602757162233737,5.0,5.0,4.93,4.79,1164178830365850569,"Had an incredible stay at Alisa & Dan’s! Their place is extremely clean, cosy, and looks just like the photos! The apartment is also very centrally located which makes it easy to walk around the neighborhood or hop on public transit! They were always responsive and provided great local recommendations. Would not hesitate to book again if I’m ever in Berlin!",1,0.9515,Positive
