223.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,49,100.0,1,5.599016268041934,4.9,4.86,4.62,4.71,42269510,"Very highly recommend staying here! The apartment itself is well laid out to maximize the studio space, with a small living and dining area in addition to the bed area. The unit was updated, clean and comfortable (the bed was especially comfortable) and notably it has an AC unit, two person balcony, keurig and dishwasher in the kitchen, very high water pressure with a waterfall showerhead in the bathroom, plus laundry facilities available in the basement. <br/>The location is about a five minute walk to the Wedding station which serves both the U-bahn and S-bahn making it convenient to get around the city. Just below the apartment are a number of small shops and restaurants as well. <br/>Finally, the downtown apartments team was always super quick to respond to any messages. 10/10 will be staying here again!",1,0.9392,Positive
