219.0,6,2.0,1.5,3.0,37,100.0,1,2.1338416138370477,4.88,4.95,4.95,4.65,1215871078086574332,"Schöne Wohnung in toller Lage. Das Hauptschlafzimmer hat ein sehr gemütliches Doppelbett, gute Verdunklung, wir haben wunderbar geschlafen. Das zweite Schlafzimmer ist mit einer lichtdurchlässigen Tür vom Wohnzimmer abgetrennt. Hier schläft man in einem ausziehbaren Ikea Bett mit bekannter harter Matratze. Für unsere 12 jährige kein Problem, 2 Erwachsene hätten es nicht sehr bequem.<br/>Insgesamt ist die Wohnung geschmackvoll eingerichtet und gepflegt, wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt.<br/>Leider war niemand da beim Check in und nach Anruf kam die Dame nach 30 Minuten. Und wir haben auf unsere Frage nach einem Late Check Out leider nie eine Antwort bekommen.",0,-0.9371,Negative
340.0,7,3.0,2.0,6.0,70,100.0,1,3.241255499524776,4.81,4.97,4.79,4.66,176342,"The building and apartment are lovely and very comfortable; but way too many rules and regulations; 5 single spaced pages; which made it very difficult to relax. I kept worrying about what garbage to put in to which bin and then getting 'fined' and having to pay to have someone else do it. I should not have to worry about leaving a few dishes in the sink before leaving for the airport at 5am; why are we paying a cleaning fee? I felt like we were being watched all the time. I don't feel like the guests should have to pay the Berlin city tax; that should be included. We had to book the washing machine and drier for a day ahead, at a specific time. The bathrooms and showers are great. The TV did not work; but Nino was very responsive and did try and fix it, unsuccessfully. I understand the status of the building; but would not choose to stay here again",0,0.9464,Positive
81.0,5,0.0,1.0,6.0,33,100.0,0,6.519360364521975,4.78,4.59,4.84,4.64,44872206,"Small but fully functional apartment with everything you would need for a short trip, great location for our needs.",1,0.7684,Positive
