119.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,51,100.0,1,3.2984353664881243,4.88,4.85,4.89,4.74,31480066,"Vielen, vielen Dank, Anette!",0,0.0,Neutral
59.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,0,2.3819185302817485,4.79,4.34,4.9,4.77,15850068,"Alexander is an amazing host. We came into Berlin a little earlier than expected. He was kind enough to store our luggage until our check in. He also let us check in a little earlier than the mentioned time. He gave us plenty of recommendations and a little history of how it was growing up during the Cold War and the Berlin Wall. Good place is conveniently situated very close to everything. U-Bahn and tram stations are within 5-6 min walk. All in all, it will be really fun staying here. I certainly will if it’s available next time I visit Berlin.",1,0.9168,Positive
