79.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,63,100.0,1,3.3519237763680656,4.83,4.87,4.83,4.71,35731198,"Wonderful location. Quiet street near lovely restaurants, shops and a small park. Exactly as pictured. Everything I needed. Super easy checking in and out. Yes the walls are a bit thin but it is a quiet building on a quiet street.",1,0.8402,Positive
