64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,7.814290679179861,4.9,4.77,4.69,4.69,937001075541410895,"Loved the stay at Khan’s place. Everything was great - the apartment is in a nice, very peaceful neighbourhood that is close to the U-Bahn and the city center. There is a store close by, as well as multiple restaurants if you want to grab something to eat on the way home. The apartment was very clean. <br/>Khan was super friendly and responsive, helpful with everything, recommended places to go - all in all, a great host.",1,0.9891,Positive
217.0,5,2.0,2.5,3.0,39,100.0,1,3.5358295153616246,4.81,4.72,4.88,4.62,36266731,"I recently had the pleasure of staying at Arthur's Airbnb, and it was a delightful experience. The place was beautiful and spacious, with a clean and well-equipped apartment that had everything we needed. The large windows offered a stunning view, and Arthur was incredibly nice, providing us with great recommendations.",0,0.9747,Positive
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,2.142649937740168,4.91,4.94,4.96,4.89,446975,"Kerstin was a great host! The flat was close to lots of public transport but quiet and tucked away from the main road, which was very nice. I would recommend this place to my friends if they were to visit Berlin. I had a lovely time! The underfloor heating was a bonus 😊",1,0.9799,Positive
114.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,96.0,1,3.789208338034772,4.84,4.86,4.88,4.74,25970203,Sehr netter Kontakt. Klasse Unterkunft. Absolute Empfehlung. Gerne wieder.,1,0.0,Neutral
36.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,1,20.10572353840828,4.92,4.91,4.68,4.89,13070266,"Die Unterkunft war sehr einfach mit der Straßenbahn zu erreichen und sehr sauber. Die Besitzerin hat immer schnell geantwortet und Probleme wurden so schnell wie möglich behoben. Das Zimmer war groß genug und es gab reichlich Steckdosen sowie Ablageflächen. Auch das Bad war sehr geräumig und sauber, die Dusche war schön groß.",1,-0.9859,Negative
268.0,10,2.0,2.0,5.0,42,100.0,1,2.4655472759450765,4.91,4.93,4.93,4.74,1062996724116035533,"Super schöne und stylischer Unterkunft. Sehr sauber und gepflegt und gut ausgestattete Küche. Perfekt, um ein paar Tage in Berlin zu verbinden. Wir kommen gerne wieder :)",0,0.7845,Positive
