125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,8,100.0,0,6.207175777646694,4.94,4.88,4.76,4.76,578612,"The location of the apartment was very nice. We were in between many good Turkish shops and places to eat on the one side and the fantastic Tempelhofer Park (former airport) on the other side.  We felt very comfortable in the well furnished apartment with great views (gardens and sunset). The contact with Bastian was very nice. We stayed there with our two kids, who had a great time as well. We warmly recommend the place.",1,0.986,Positive
