73.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,2.27336048441501,4.89,4.87,4.95,4.82,16155678,The location was great. Everything we wanted to see was either within walking distance or easily accessible by train. Jo and Fran were really nice and helpful. Thank you so much!,1,0.9377,Positive
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,1,5.657990882601867,4.92,4.98,4.79,4.79,9184413,"Ulrike's apartment was amazing, super clean, stylish with all the amenities we could think of. Ulrike was very attentive and quick to response and had prepared helpful tips for the area and the apartment that we found very helpful. the apartment was close to an U-bahn and situated in a quiet and very lovely neighborhood. Would definitely come back!",1,0.975,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,20,99.0,0,2.1897939786653327,4.41,4.5,4.83,4.42,37113779,Okay. The room is small and low budget. Wi-Fi was very slow so I was unable to work from there (even if they show laptop and desk on the picture). Host said will look into it but then did nothing to support and was not helpful in this situation. Luckily I found a coworking space nearby at Coffee Fellows where I ended up working the whole day. Location and surrounding is great and suitable for a city trip in general. In my opinion the place is way overpriced for what it offers.,1,0.7282,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,1,4.412429612327707,4.99,5.0,4.9,4.95,1037272492882778968,"l'accueil a été parfait. Stefano et Marco sont extrêmement sympathiques , très réactifs .<br/>Le logement est spacieux , très propre .<br/>L'accès aux transports est à proximité de l'appartement. <br/>Je vous recommande fortement cette location .",1,0.0,Neutral
120.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,46,100.0,1,9.29605165579442,4.73,4.85,4.66,4.6,3047076,"Bon weekend. Fai n'était pas sur Berlin mais très facilement joignable le check-in et Check se sont très bien passé .<br/><br/>L'appartement est plutôt bien placé avec le métro à proximité. Accès très facile au centre de Berlin .<br/><br/>Concernant l'appartement, conforme aux photos, propre, aucun problème à 4 personnes.<br/><br/>J'y retournerais sans souci.",1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,26,100.0,0,9.644762661947714,4.64,4.58,4.81,4.55,3700984,Tout était parfait !,1,-0.2003,Negative
57.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,12.686180239299691,4.91,4.94,4.95,4.9,1880216,"Une grande chambre, décorée avec goût dans un très joli appartement. Le quartier est pratique, joli, vivant et calme.<br/>Sophia a été très flexible pour mon arrivée. Elle est de très bon conseil pour tout ce qui concerne Berlin qu'elle connaît parfaitement. Elle m'a raconté un peu d'histoire du quartier. Elle m'a aussi prêté un vélo et emmené faire un tour. <br/>Et la cohabitation avec elle est très facile, je me suis sentie tout à fait à l'aise.  Sophia est à la fois discrète,  respectueuse et ouverte au contact.",1,-0.0258,Neutral
260.0,8,4.0,2.0,7.0,50,100.0,1,2.6302702497082326,4.88,4.92,4.85,4.71,1488624,"EXcellent communication with Alexamdra who is a charming hostess and was there to greet us with wine, water, chocolates and nuts.  The apartment was as on the website.  One of the double bedrooms was very small and really only suitable as a single.  Modern bathrooms with lots of towels, washing machine and tumble dryer. One of the basin taps wasn't working properly and we had hoped this would have been fixed during our stay.<br/>The flat is  on the ground floor of a four or five story building, with an inner courtyard.  Our main problem was the noise from other residents at night.  In particular the people in the flat directly overhead seemed to be moving furniture constantly during the night. Consequently none of us slept that well.....the beds themselves were very comfortable.",0,0.8999,Positive
90.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,54,100.0,1,14.82311742105898,4.82,4.68,4.56,4.7,20227733,Dorothea ist sehr freundlich und hilfsbereit.<br/>Eine wunderbare Gastgeberin,1,0.0,Neutral
