88.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,1,6.506839503553221,4.8,4.79,4.8,4.69,53503896,"Simons place was great and as pictured. The kitchen was very well stocked you can cook pretty much anything. The apartment is really nice and clean. The area had a lot of restaurants and grocery stores. There’s 2 train lines within a few blocks walk. Probably 20 minute walk to the center. Would stay again, it’s a great value in Berlin.",1,0.9655,Positive
