78.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,35,100.0,1,4.609388669014022,4.93,4.73,4.95,4.81,639868019000226796,I have to thank Anna and her husband for their hospitality and warmth during my stay.<br/>The room was excellent and the location couldn’t have been any better. I would recommend her place  to anyone looking to have a great time in Berlin. I also got to learn many things just by chatting with them. And  they were flexible and relaxed with checking in and out as well. Not to mention thank you for letting me use the washer and dryer. Really great all around experience.,1,0.9842,Positive
