59.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,1,15.704190402628244,4.96,4.98,4.63,4.91,12337676,"Eigentlich fehlen uns die Worte, weil es so super war, aber wir versuchen doch ein paar nette Worte zu finden ;-)<br/><br/>Die Gastgeber waren überaus nett und freundlich, aufgeschlossen und hilfreich.<br/><br/>Wir waren sehr zufrieden und würden und WERDEN die Unterkunft auf jedenfall erneut buchen!<br/><br/>Vielen Dank für Alles und bis bald.",1,-0.7414,Negative
348.0,6,3.0,2.0,6.0,46,100.0,1,1.010749324263853,4.79,4.75,4.79,4.61,26508423,"We had a wonderful experience with this apartment! We were five adults and one child, five years old, on a family vacation. The apartment was clean and had all that we needed. The location was perfect and very close to the center and a subway station. When we arrived they helped us get an early check in and also explained us about Berlin and the transportation in the city. It was a great experience and we were very happy with this apartment. The only thing that was a bit hard for us was that it was located on the third floor and with the trolley it was a bit hard every time to lift it up in the stairs. Other than that, perfect and comfortable and great hospitality! Will be back again for sure!",0,0.9857,Positive
422.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,53,100.0,0,3.756570951732456,4.97,4.93,4.99,4.81,28432988,"Ana and Nik are supremely hospitable.  Their home is spotless, new, and beautiful.  It is very well situated with excellent access to public transport.  Ana was very friendly and helpful with local knowledge. I would definitely go back!",1,0.9727,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,6.432065367275135,4.89,4.89,4.86,4.85,6599218,"Super entspannter Aufenthalt. Die Kommunikation war unkompliziert und nett, genauso wie das Ankommen. Die Unterkunft hat alles was man braucht, ist voll groß und liegt direkt an der U-Bahn Haltestelle.",1,-0.8316,Negative
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,0,0.7634581291070147,4.79,4.51,4.93,4.67,44601355,Mischo’s apartment is beautiful and has all that you need for a comfortable stay. It is in a perfect location right in the centre of Berlin close to public transport to take you anywhere. We had a great time and would recommend to anyone.,1,0.9552,Positive
