125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,54,100.0,1,6.717131043250603,4.88,4.92,4.84,4.75,14053917,Great little place in a cute quiet neighborhood. Stephan and Rene were very responsive and friendly. Had to kinda scavenger hunt for our keys to the lock box but we found it! Place was very clean and comfortable!,1,0.9514,Positive
94.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,47,100.0,0,2.573794892526899,4.65,4.79,4.93,4.56,42972615,Schöne kleine Wohnung in schöner Lage. 👍,1,0.0,Neutral
333.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,57,100.0,0,0.7735691013482425,4.65,4.71,4.98,4.43,857975239099139321,"Great 3 night stay, would return again! Furniture is unique and stylish, so many amenities you don’t often find in Germany. Stairs down to the sleeping areas are a bit steep but we got used to it. Some light switches are hidden but we got it figured out. Street parking is limited and expensive so be prepared for what to do if you have a car! Really cool part of Berlin and we easily found good places to eat nearby.",0,0.9312,Positive
119.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,28,100.0,0,7.700662899906459,4.18,3.91,4.35,4.09,53539095,"Vi var 2 voksne og 3 børn en enkelt nat i lejligheden og var godt tilfredse. <br/>Vi skulle have haft ørepropper med, da der er en del larm fra gaden, men det skulle vi have forudset i så stor en by. <br/>Det er vist et stykke tid siden. Billederne i annoncen er taget og enkelte ting trænger til forbedring for at matche beskrivelsen. <br/>Vi satte stor pris på aircondition, mørklægningsgardiner og fleksibel indtjekning. Kommunikationen med medværten gik godt og vi fandt super lækker afrikansk, vegansk mad i nærheden og en kiosk tæt på.",0,0.1779,Positive
100.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,15,100.0,0,9.035080903456278,4.82,4.78,4.92,4.7,39484375,"Recommended. Well organized, clean apartment in a nice area with plenty of supermarkets, cafes, restaurants, bars etc. Some very nice things for me were the balcony and the quietness of the building",1,0.8807,Positive
160.0,6,3.0,2.0,3.0,46,100.0,1,5.93071369172379,4.79,4.75,4.74,4.67,685944,The studio is very cosy and comfortable with plenty of space to relax in. It's a short walk to the centre and there are a few good restaurants nearby. If you are arriving on a Sunday be aware that there are no grocery stores open and make sure you take cold hard cash as many smaller  places did not accept cards.,0,0.7833,Positive
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,31,100.0,0,1.4763855426339394,4.81,4.64,5.0,4.57,36249386,Todo estuvo muy bien. La ubicacion buena y el apartamento tenia lo que necesitabamos,1,0.0,Neutral
95.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,32,100.0,0,5.528260251923685,4.68,4.57,4.84,4.59,45998917,"The AirBnB was located at a calm street compared, a 500-600m away from a very noisy main street. Its just few bus stops or train stations away, making it easier to reach the center. The rooms were well furnished and the Kitchen was furnished sufficiently to do self cooking. The only issue we had was that the main bed room and the living room were right next to the road and walking pavement. It was noisy during the day and to some extent at night too. As it is summer, we couldn't afford to keep the windows closed. The 2nd bedroom inside was quiet though. But as we were tired of going around the city the whole day, we had a good sleep despite the noise. The beds and the quilts were really comfortable.",1,0.7748,Positive
85.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,41,100.0,1,20.002682469556188,4.94,4.97,4.94,4.69,1247687868662918683,"Wir wurden sehr freundlich und persönlich empfangen. Alles verlief absolut reibungslos. Die Wohnung war schön und sauber, uns hat es an nichts gefehlt, wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt.  Top Lage um mit S-Bahn nach Berlin Zentrum zu kommen. Der Vermieter war sehr hilfsbereit.  Wir würden sofort wieder kommen.",1,-0.8979,Negative
111.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,0,5.463369258195954,4.92,4.96,4.93,4.79,2027140,"Light, bright and serene apartment in the coolest part of Berlin. We really enjoyed our stay. Very easy to find and the key pick-up process was very straightforward. Very spacious, the photos do not show how big it is. Great kitchen facilities if you want to stay in and cook. Plenty of excellent food options right on your doorstep.<br/>Highly recommend staying at Julia's beautiful apartment.",1,0.9802,Positive
135.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,1,0.4966713574384375,4.86,4.77,4.95,4.73,1137776878165025862,"Very friendly host and good location. We were disappointed that the washing machine was broken as it was a big part of why we booked this. However, we do understand these things can happen. <br/>Quite noisy at night as it was right next to a police station? So bear this in mind. <br/>Overall did enjoy the stay!",1,0.4561,Positive
20.0,8,1.0,1.5,8.0,18,93.0,0,4.065511825937199,4.47,4.36,4.4,4.54,41420913,Yataklara perde takılsa daha iyi olabilir mahremiyet açısından,0,0.0,Neutral
140.0,8,1.0,1.0,5.0,30,99.0,0,1.664793290368075,4.58,4.61,4.73,4.48,791921785972465654,"Vi var två vuxna och två barn. Allt funkade fint. Lite skralt utrustad kök, men inget större problem. Närområdets restaurangutbud var kanonbra.",0,-0.4019,Negative
147.0,6,1.0,1.0,4.0,22,99.0,0,2.353100516764864,4.78,4.68,4.84,4.64,30389555,"Die Wohnung ist sehr schick eingerichtet. Man fühlt sich dort sofort sehr wohl. Besonders pfiffig ist die Empore mit weiteren Betten. Küche und Bad sind ebenfalls sehr schön. Das Bett im EG ist sehr bequem und schön groß. Da sich die Wohnung in einer wenig befahrenen Straße befindet, ist es nachts sehr ruhig. Die nächste Straßenbahnhaltestelle ist ca. 300 m entfernt und von dort gelangt man in wenigen Minuten zum Alexanderplatz. In der Umgegend gibt es einige schöne Lokale und Cafés.<br/>Diese Location kann ich auf jeden Fall weiterempfehlen.<br/>Bis zum nächsten Mal!",1,-0.9656,Negative
114.0,4,3.0,1.5,4.0,40,100.0,1,7.0719822212588905,4.91,4.61,4.72,4.83,4847553,"The apartment was so much better and more spacious than we imagined, it housed 3 adult males and could have easily housed 4. Verena and Carsten were very responsive and helpful through the entire trip and checked up on us over text to see if we needed anything, the apartment is lovefully and is located a 2 minute walk from the nearest S Bahn station which made it extremely easy to get around the city",0,0.9278,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,0,3.5242559641751665,5.0,4.85,5.0,4.62,1018858743353335122,"This apartment is an absolute gem and hands down the best Airbnb we've ever stayed in! Spotlessly clean, stylishly decorated, and equipped with everything needed for a comfortable stay. The space is cozy and inviting, and from the moment we arrived, everything exceeded our expectations. Hinrika and Matthias were exceptional hosts - welcoming, responsive, and genuinely invested in making our stay perfect. They offered fantastic recommendations, from hidden gems to popular spots. The apartment’s location in the heart of Kreuzberg is unbeatable, surrounded by great cafes, restaurants, and bars. Public transport (bus and metro) is just a short walk away, making it easy to explore Berlin. The combination of a beautiful apartment, fantastic hosts, and perfect location made this an unforgettable experience. I would highly recommend this Airbnb to anyone visiting Berlin! THANK YOU, 정말 감사합니다~~",1,0.9945,Positive
137.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,1,3.2252377063559527,4.8,4.79,4.86,4.63,27120196,"We had a great stay in Berlin. We stayed in the appartment with 3 adults, it was perfect.",1,0.8316,Positive
