54.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,11,100.0,1,5.259652982108338,4.82,4.9,4.9,4.81,2657671,"Sehr angenehme, junge Familie.<br/>Total unkompliziert und relaxt.<br/>Der separate Eingang ist ne feine Sache.<br/>Die Wohnung ist wirklich sehr zentral in Friedrichshain gelegen. Alles ist gut fussläufig zu erreichen.<br/>Ich würde Ivo und seine Familie auch bei meinen Freunden und Bekannten weiterempfehlen.",1,0.0,Neutral
160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,98.0,0,1.0407544919436775,4.54,4.66,4.77,4.45,34294913,"Very good appartment. Very close to a ubahn station (Heinrich-Heine-strasse). Berlin is such a huge city it's difficult 5o be at walking distance from anything, but this appartments are at a central position so it doesn't take much time to get anywhere.<br/>Very clean appartment and friendly staff.",1,0.8704,Positive
243.0,6,2.0,2.0,4.0,41,100.0,0,1.7630158338766606,4.78,4.76,4.73,4.63,12548871,Great location to stay. Close enough to walk to most places we wanted to go to and public transportation was close by for further away destinations. Place was clean and check-in and out was easy.,0,0.8658,Positive
