180.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,45,85.0,0,1.5095289909770313,4.75,4.84,4.9,4.6,45475252,Die Lage ist sehr gut und das Appartement war schön. Check in und Check out waren sehr einfach.,1,-0.8316,Negative
68.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,1,6.90471429274215,5.0,4.99,4.94,4.91,22632636,"I absolutely enjoyed my stay at Tanja’s place. The location was awesome, 2 min away from the subway with restaurants/coffee shops nearby. Tanja as a host was fantastic, she was very friendly/accommodating. She made me feel very welcome. The guest room I stayed in was exactly the same as described on her posting, everything in her flat was extremely clean as well. I’d recommend Tanja’s place to anyone traveling to Berlin!",1,0.971,Positive
