158.0,6,2.0,2.0,3.0,35,100.0,0,6.528677763046801,4.67,4.66,4.84,4.65,40414534,An absolute gem of a place on a peaceful street yet near to the buzzy Friedrichshain. This was the perfect stay for the 4 of us (2 couples) and a great base to explore Berlin. Will be back!,0,0.906,Positive
84.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,1,3.522215927963612,4.97,4.97,4.75,4.83,52653830,"Such a lovely stay for my mother, sister and I.  70yr old mom enjoyed the walk up!  Djordje is a kind, communicative, not to mention stylish, host.  :)  Beyond clean and has everything you could need for a pleasant stay.  Priced very well for the area too!",1,0.9701,Positive
65.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,4.1903954031521735,4.75,4.86,4.65,4.65,499342,"Karsten was an amazing, friendly host - very accommodating! Met us when we arrived, provided a detailed map as well a list of nearby bars and restaurants. The space was cozy and well equipped, very close to the subway making travelling easy. ",1,0.9245,Positive
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,31,100.0,0,6.74096529690697,4.82,4.73,4.73,4.77,51400165,"Overall the stay was 3.5/5. <br/>The bedroom and kitchen spaces were clean and very accessible. Elias gave me a shelf to store my groceries as well as my own space in the fridge. They were very friendly and allowed me to use their spices/oils. The location is accessible as well (just 3 mins walk from a major UBahn stop with lots of places to eat/get organic groceries). The only drawback about location is that the bedroom faces a noisy street with a lot of construction in the morning.<br/>If you are sensitive to cigarette smoke, this is not the place for you. On my first day I had to ask Elias not to smoke indoors. He switched to smoking outside but I had to ask a second time halfway through my stay to mind his cigarette smoking because the smell was quite obvious to me in the kitchen space. As someone with asthma this was a difficult lifestyle to accomodate. <br/>Also, the livingroom/backyard was rarely accessible because Elias was almost always occupying this space for work, video games, or sleeping. However there is a couch in the bedroom where you can take your meals/relax.",1,-0.0009,Neutral
53.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,4.795358275165721,4.73,4.57,4.86,4.75,18547011,"Kommunikation und Check-Inn optimal, Wohnung sauber, zweckmäßig eingerichtet und ideal für einen Berlintrip....in der Nähe: U-Bahn-Station, Restaurants, Kneipen, Spätis und Dönerläden.....Columbiahalle fussläufig zu erreichen.....gerne wieder...",1,0.7096,Positive
60.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,100.0,0,1.7776489719846733,4.8,4.73,4.82,4.36,335273,Greg has a great apartment at the 4th floor in the middle of the vibrant Prenzlauerberg - though very hot during the summer. The apartment is located in the backyard so there is no noise from Kastanienallee. It was easy to communicate with Greg and he was flexible in regard to picking up and delivering the keys. We can definitely recommend this apartment!,1,0.9363,Positive
58.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,0,18.77117911741297,4.7,4.71,4.52,4.69,3314419,Nous avons été très bien acceuillis par la femme de Horst par deux pars de gâteaux. La terrasse est agréable pour les repas. Il est très facile de se rendre à Berlin en voiture car l'autoroute est juste à côté,1,0.0,Neutral
180.0,8,1.0,1.0,8.0,28,99.0,0,1.3815612224222242,4.67,4.66,4.58,4.69,6663931,Hostel mit Hotel-Standard. :),0,0.4588,Positive
171.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,100.0,1,2.638829312933958,4.75,4.84,4.89,4.62,28510951,Location was great.<br/>And I love the self check in system!,1,0.6696,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,6,100.0,0,2.427996553745734,4.9,4.8,4.9,4.85,5710845,"What a wonderful little place in the heart of Kreuzberg<br/>Beautiful bright flat, very cosy and nicely decorated. <br/>And everything you could need right around the corner.<br/>We very much enjoy d our stay there and hope to return some time soon.",1,0.9446,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,1,6.406022834833479,4.97,4.97,4.78,4.82,764305057139406056,"Florian’s place was in a peaceful area in Neukölln, yet very close to two metro stations. Check in instructions were clear, and everything was clean. Florian was a great host and was very flexible and accommodating with our check in and check out times. There is no AC but opening the windows provided a great breeze, so that was no problem. Lots of space to put clothes, and a large mirror in the hallway. Kitchen was nice to hang out in.<br/>The only thing to be mindful of is that the unit is on the fifth floor, with no elevator. It was a bit tiring to walk up the stairs, but it was no issue for us as we were staying only a couple of days. Would not recommend if you have big suitcases! Great views from the unit though :)",1,0.9322,Positive
164.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,1,3.654498009172436,4.88,4.81,4.69,4.75,1149434434951097425,"My parents stayed for a couple of days in this apartment. It’s nicely furnished and has very comfortable beds. It was a little disappointing that the shower isn’t working sufficiently, the water didn’t really get warm so they had to take cold showers.",1,0.697,Positive
104.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,3.614936598767828,4.76,4.78,4.87,4.71,640160204406168059,"Virkelig et skønt sted! Lejligheden var både smuk, ren og rummelig - og Jan var en rigtig god vært :)",1,0.6588,Positive
152.0,5,2.0,1.0,5.0,40,100.0,1,1.5968425433019005,4.81,4.77,4.93,4.69,22677,"We felt very much at home in the flat, which worked perfectly for four persons. Simple and at the same time cozy with everything we needed. Prenzlauer Berg is a favorite area of ours, so the flat couldn’t be located more perfect. Will definitely book again. Can only recommend.",0,0.949,Positive
89.0,6,1.0,1.0,3.0,57,100.0,1,20.240640244355667,4.96,4.96,4.73,4.85,786833707781544447,"Yannik was een vriendelijke gastheer die direct reageerde bij vragen of opmerkingen. Erg prettig! Het huisje is van alle gemakken voorzien en de kruiden, koffie, fles heerlijke rooie wijn en pretzels stonden klaar bij ontvangst. We hebben ook genoten van het zwembad, dit vonden de kinderen ook helemaal geweldig. Met kleine kinderen moet je wel allert zijn bij het zwembad (logisch!) en in het huisje i.v.m. de hoge zolder ( slaapkamer) met de losse trap. Trap kan er af als je hem iets om hoog duwt, het is nogal een leuk attribuut midden in de kamer, dus goed om bewust van te zijn:).",1,-0.8436,Negative
