132.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,56,100.0,0,21.38929830525764,4.77,4.44,4.77,4.69,32511013,This is a house that is usually inhabited by a family - not the usual hotel-type commercial AirBNB. Keep this in mind when you see the small imperfections that are totally normal in such a case. The only thing that I personally did not cope well with was the matress which was way too soft for me but I was told I was the first to complain. The bathroom is really spacious and great and the kitchen offers all amenities. The garden and terrace are terrific. You need to walk to the tram or better bring a car as there are few things in the vicinity.,0,0.9079,Positive
125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,1,4.126131739074772,4.93,4.92,4.87,4.82,26768369,"Beautifully furnished and equipped, bright and clean apartment in the heart of Kreuzberg. Communication with Doro was great. Only small negative note is the noise coming from the street during the night which can be bothering if you are more of a light sleeper.",1,0.7964,Positive
97.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,1,2.186044325557003,4.98,4.9,4.98,4.92,15645656,"A great place to stay in Berlin, in the very nice neighborhood of Prenzlauer Berg. It's easy to get to the Brandenburg Gate by public transportation in 20 minutes. The neighborhood is very safe and quiet at night and there is a great breakfast place, Krone, 100 feet from the door of the apartment. The apartment is very nice and large with a comfortable bed and large bathroom as well with a nice shower/tub. Communication with Atto is very good, self check in is fine (pay attention to the video), and the Wifi is good too. I highly recommend staying there and this is my second stay. If I return to Berlin, I would like to stay there again if the apartment is available.",1,0.9909,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,1,11.563597161884616,5.0,4.75,5.0,5.0,812470998292732329,Great host. Easy to get a hold of and very responsive. Great stay and would recommend a stay here to anyone.,1,0.9468,Positive
