119.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,1,8.685360716049777,4.93,4.95,4.89,4.81,44402979,"Wir hatten vier tolle Tage in Berlin. Das  Tiny House befand sie - wie beschrieben - in einer tollen und ruhigen Lage. Die Straßenbahn war 5 Minuten entfernt. Alles wie beschrieben, freundliche und schnelle Kommunikation. Wir werden es weiterempfehlen. Vielen Dank für die schöne Zeit.",1,-0.9136,Negative
123.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,44,100.0,0,7.545597664880639,4.86,4.89,4.71,4.82,1423811615755829580,"Stylish and spacious apartment in a great location!<br/>The place was spotlessly clean and had everything I needed for a comfortable city break—including a dishwasher, TV, washing machine, fully equipped kitchen, and a modern bathroom. I really appreciated the quiet neighborhood, which was just one stop from the central station—perfect balance of calm and convenience. Thanks so much for hosting, I’d be happy to come again!",1,0.9682,Positive
180.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,45,85.0,0,1.5095289909770313,4.75,4.84,4.9,4.6,45475252,"Ci siamo trovate molto molto bene. Ottima posizione: centrale, vicinissimo alla stazione del tram, silenzioso, bello, comodo, spazioso e pulito. Possibilità di deposito bagagli. Lo consiglio caldamente a chi vuole fare il turista a Berlino per qualche giorno.",1,0.0,Neutral
100.0,6,1.0,1.0,4.0,37,100.0,0,7.925475010149213,4.75,4.7,4.38,4.6,50724159,"Sehr netter Kontakt, Martin hat immer zügig und sehr freundlich und hilfreich auf meine Anfragen reagiert. <br/>Die Nähe zur Ubahn Seestraße und Leopoldplatz ist super.<br/>Die Wohnung roch etwas muffig und es war sehr laut.<br/>Ansonsten war alles soweit  in Ordnung",1,-0.8316,Negative
