112.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,51,100.0,1,7.069783798568355,4.81,4.92,4.62,4.73,221015,"A spacious two room apartment, with friendly hosts next door. As the photos show, it is a bit empty, with basic furniture, but nice when the sun shines in. <br/>The walk along the canal, towards the city centre was lovely in springtime.",1,0.891,Positive
