171.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,44,90.0,1,11.510851452846596,4.78,4.8,4.79,4.66,699820589487993617,Numa was located conveniently within walking distances to bus stops and train stations. Many food and supply amenities located nearby,1,-0.1531,Negative
