79.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,0,3.0459111945028674,4.71,4.55,4.84,4.66,32403757,"We enjoyed a lovely stay in this apartment! Felt really spacious and bright. We really liked the local area, loads of cool bars and places to eat. Will definitely be back to Berlin :)",1,0.9668,Positive
170.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,39,100.0,0,4.862761524781926,4.76,4.67,4.67,4.6,714537613621675722,"I really enjoyed my stay at this Airbnb. The apartment's design is impressive, and its aesthetics are charming. The kitchen is well-equipped with complete appliances, enhancing the overall experience. However, one drawback was the water in the shower was barely warm. Communicated this to the host and Fabian was responsive and asked a technician to look into it, so appreciate the gesture but nonetheless came home still to the shower with barely warm temperature. Was staying with 2 other girls and the 3 of us were feeling so cold after the shower especially on this autumn/winter so would be way better if the shower can be actually warm. Additionally, to have a larger mirror would be beneficial. There was only one small mirror in the toilet. Lastly, we were instructed to use the dishwasher to clean the dishes, but unfortunately, there were no pods provided. Overall, a pleasant stay with a few minor improvements needed. There are supermarkets nearby and many public transportations",0,0.9787,Positive
124.0,3,0.0,8.5,3.0,34,100.0,0,2.6157359022078506,4.67,4.51,4.75,4.59,45354685,Perfect,0,0.5719,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,21,100.0,1,8.187543141932318,4.92,4.93,4.9,4.8,1266630,"Nous avons reçu un accueil très chaleureux et sympathique de la part de Roi, avec beaucoup d'informations sur le quartier, les restaurants,...<br/>Roi parle très bien anglais ce qui facilite les échanges !<br/>L'appartement est très bien situé, proche du grand magasin KADeWe et des transports, dans une rue très calme et agréable.<br/>Le logement correspond parfaitement aux photos et au descriptif.<br/>rien ne manque pour y passer un séjour très confortable dans un cadre cosy et chaleureux.",1,0.5093,Positive
161.0,8,3.0,2.0,3.0,35,100.0,1,6.906667346101181,4.78,4.72,4.69,4.75,5977917,"This was the perfect place to stay for me and my two friends. We each had our own room and never were crowded for space due to there being two bathrooms with showers. Michele was very flexible about check-in and check-out, a super communicator, and very friendly.",0,0.9467,Positive
37.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,44,100.0,1,16.44304519810415,4.91,4.97,4.87,4.89,9165505,"Staying at Angela's home was really good! Definetly coming back if ever I'm going to Berlin. The room and the bathroom are nice, and her home has an artsy aspect, so lovely :) Angela was as well a wonderful host, always here to help us around! Thanks again Angela for your great hospitality!",1,0.9842,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,4.795405551149841,4.95,4.92,4.81,4.89,13243503,"L'appartement est magnifique ! Daniela est une très bonne hôte, agréable et disponible. L'appartement se situe tout près des transports en commun.  Je recommande sans hésiter",1,-0.2003,Negative
63.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,9.540851598490788,5.0,5.0,4.83,4.93,1220942941722244719,"Amazing hosts! Communicative, ready to help. Accomodation is very very clean and comfortable! Probably it's gonna be again my choice for next visit to Berlin!",1,0.9494,Positive
47.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,54,90.0,0,3.8540959910854826,4.94,4.9,4.84,4.91,27122904,Super komfortabele Unterkunft. Die Gastgeber haben sich viele durchdachte Details einfallen lassen die sich einem schnell zurecht finden lassen und den Aufenthalt äusserst angenehm gestalten. Beide Gastgeber helfen gerne und sind offen für einen Plausch. Tolle Dusche!,1,-0.636,Negative
