324.0,4,2.0,2.0,2.0,55,100.0,0,1.964395577601865,4.87,4.74,5.0,4.83,1239724435193172776,"Great place, good location, central but quite. Comfortable and spacious apartment. Check in and Communication was great .Host is very welcoming, lots of thoughtful little extras which we felt was a nice touch.  Good selection of cafes and restaurants close by. Walkable distance to points of interest for sightseeing . Easy  access to public transport.Really enjoyed our stay, can recommend and hope to be back .",0,0.9945,Positive
