174.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,28,98.0,0,0.8410052109848984,4.77,4.93,4.87,4.7,693875439205002933,"Se trata de un apartamento muy práctico, con entrada flexible, en una zona bonita de Berlín. Las instrucciones fueron muy claras en todo momento. No obstante, son instrucciones impersonales, eché en falta recomendaciones locales que son frecuentes en Airbnb.",1,-0.0772,Negative
113.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,98.0,1,1.0001956178666358,4.83,4.91,4.96,4.78,127708,Stephanie is a great host. Very quick to respond to any concerns we had. Apartment is very clean and close to a train station which was perfect! Also close to a great range of shops. ,1,0.945,Positive
77.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,1,7.5529282602310275,4.81,4.84,4.6,4.69,1346757,"It is a super apartment for a weeks trip! You have a good bathroom, bed, sofa bed and kitchen with a fridge +freezer. The surrounding area feels safe and calm and ther Eid enough to see there for the first day. Easy to get to both busses and the metro. <br/>The host also responds immediately so I would definitely recommend this Airbnb!",1,0.9649,Positive
227.0,8,5.0,2.0,8.0,42,100.0,0,16.161495501888606,4.8,4.84,4.77,4.82,11010163,"Fred and Rita have been friendly ans helpful. Rita came to pick us up at the train station to take the suitcases by car, because the station is about 10 minutes walk. She also brought us to the supermarket upon arrival.<br/>The house is correct, adequate temperature and cozy house. But we have missed a sofa in the living room where we can rest, the wifi has not worked well by not letting connect several devices, nor do we find a broom to be able to sweep when we leave.<br/>It is somewhat far from the center of Berlin, but in a quiet residential area.",0,-0.1459,Negative
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,7,100.0,0,5.357726240571048,4.57,5.0,4.86,4.29,1897064,"L’appartamento di ROM è perfetto per una o due persone. Moderno ed accessoriato. Posizione perfetta vicino a due fermate della metropolitana che ti portano dovunque: in centro ci arrivi in 4 fermate. Zona residenziale tranquilla vicino a due parchi. C’è un piccolo negozietto di alimentari a due passi che fornisce i prodotti base ma per la spesa ( carne , pesce, verdure…) bisogna spostarsi e non è facile tornare con le borse piene. Ci tornerei di corsa!!! <br/>Grazie Roma e Mayke .",1,0.0,Neutral
161.0,10,4.0,2.0,4.0,25,100.0,1,7.731041071020152,4.6,4.72,4.48,4.57,2599765,"We were so thrilled with the apartment, it was perfect for our needs. Warm and cosy which was ideal for a December visit. The decor and design was lovely and we spent a lot of time sat at the huge dining table.<br/><br/>We really loved the apartment and it was great to have so much space. <br/><br/>Our welcome host was so friendly and when we made contact over the holiday with Daniele and Patrizia we received quick responses. <br/><br/>We were allowed to stay in the apartment for a late check out on our last day which was so useful as we were travelling with a family. <br/><br/>Thanks for making us feel so welcome.<br/><br/>",0,0.9921,Positive
95.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,17,100.0,0,4.191690841311009,4.74,4.75,4.71,4.67,1015879249578929490,For what it was worth it was fantastic! We had to book it at the last minute due to train strikes,1,0.5093,Positive
116.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,23,99.0,0,4.444732321805399,4.68,4.57,4.55,4.5,29527972,"bagno con wc che perde, doccia con peli di ospiti precedenti, le stoviglie hanno necessitato di un lavaggio prima dell’uso (erano sporche), il divano era sporco. Host molto disponibile e cordiale purtroppo la posizione dell’appartamento è in un punto dove c’é molta criminalità, il mio appartamento si affacciava direttamente con le finestre sulla strada. Scarsa illuminazione per il locale.",1,0.0,Neutral
