86.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,52,100.0,1,14.876814991832068,4.83,4.74,4.5,4.65,53080223,"Villiam was a great host. He even let us into the property before the arranged time. The place was very comfortable, just a bit away from the city centre. Once we had worked out the route all was fine thou. Thanks, Villiam! We had a great time",1,0.95,Positive
