130.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,32,100.0,1,5.946969070350237,4.71,4.66,4.78,4.67,31385396,"We had a lovely stay at Bert's AirBnB. The apartment was clean and quiet, and it was a short walk to the trains and the nearby market at Boxhagener Platz. Bert was helpful and friendly, instructions were clear, and we had a stress-free stay :)",1,0.9524,Positive
57.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,7.349206308738338,4.93,4.95,4.67,4.86,36268374,"What a wonderful place!!!! Unfortunately I didn‘t get to meet Allen, but her boyfriend Roland was there, to welcome me. Allen explained to me how to get there from the airport, so it was very easy. The room is very cosy, bed is so comfortable and the view is amazing! The whole place is sparkling clean, ask your hosts for anything, they will be able to help you with it. Will come again for sure!",1,0.9891,Positive
