153.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,98.0,1,3.3280084328811608,4.89,4.9,4.83,4.77,1182435035023787880,"Thank you for letting us stay at Locke. Our apartment was beautiful and had everything we needed! The local area was quiet and great to retreat to after busy days in the centre. Being only a 10 minute walk to the station, it meant we were in the centre in 15-20 minutes.",1,0.9117,Positive
