64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,1,3.6258890360571896,4.92,5.0,4.92,4.96,989729998827676144,"It was lovely! Anna is an adorable and understanding person. Staying at her place was exactly what I needed, in a quiet area and with easy access to public transportation. Next time I’m in Berlin, I’d gladly come back there!",1,0.9167,Positive
200.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,1,4.947907019791349,4.91,4.85,4.93,4.71,42809,"Great place to stay in Berlin!<br/>Although there are many bars & restaurants around the apartment is very quiet. It is stylish an quaint. The master bedroom is huge with a very comfortable big bed and the second bedroom is small and consists of more or less one bed, but is cozy. Our kids liked it and called it their „sleeping cave“",1,0.8587,Positive
160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,87.0,0,3.4802565088356308,4.54,4.54,4.6,4.41,43798011,Easy entrance and was close to City center.  Room was quite clean. But in backside  there was building make noisy only. The others was ok. <br/>Thank you,1,0.5714,Positive
112.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,15,100.0,1,7.070036931233181,4.86,4.89,4.62,4.71,1084512,"Very cosy place, just like in the pictures. Very clean and with some details to make your stay more easy and pleasant. Not in the center but very well connected, nice and quiet street, with a few nice places to have a drink or to eat. We went with two kids, just the right size, and easy going for them. Karl had  everthing well organized and all went perfect. ",1,0.9846,Positive
55.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,1,10.41352668784684,4.85,4.83,4.51,4.84,237670,"Great appartment, close to the Ubahn and very clean! Ursula was really helpful.",1,0.888,Positive
160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,98.0,0,1.0407544919436775,4.54,4.66,4.77,4.45,34294913,"Pros: Close to the public transportation, walking distance to many tourist destinations, uncluttered, comfortable bed. Convenient to restaurants and market. <br/>Con: Not all amenities listed were present (no hair dryer, no washer/dryer anywhere near room), no elevator, shower leaked.",1,-0.34,Negative
96.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,0,4.580556858036055,4.72,4.68,4.28,4.55,1182696650240026889,The apartment is very clean and corresponds perfectly to the photos in the advert. Arrival was easy and the hosts were very welcoming. Good location for easy access to the city center and sightseeing. Highly recommended!,1,0.9672,Positive
100.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,3.091836209520125,4.86,4.9,4.86,4.77,869793,"Nice, clean, everything good. Perfect location. For sensitive persons - there's a bar downstairs, the noise from inside the bar is no problem at all, but people stepping outside to the street can be a bit loud late at night. Nevertheless - we would definitely stay here again.",1,0.7992,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,100.0,0,6.152156850447227,4.94,4.84,4.82,4.88,16702548,"We hebben een super fijn verblijf gehad, de ruimte en het appartement waren heel mooi en schoon. Rustige buurt en dichtbij openbaar vervoer. Heel fijne en rustige huisgenoten! <br/>We hebben genoten!",1,0.6688,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,6.303469422976989,4.92,4.81,4.59,4.84,1521826,"You get what you see, the pictures are very correct. David’s flat was neat and communication went very smoothly. We extended our stay without any problem. <br/>We rented bikes close by because the flat is not super centrally located. All necessary services are around though. ",1,0.276,Positive
73.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,0,1.9561377920018532,4.81,4.69,4.97,4.75,16222479,"Wir haben großartige 5 Tage in der im Hinterhaus gelegenen und somit sehr ruhigen Wohnung verbracht. Das Bett ist super bequem und die Wohnung mit allem was man benötigt eingerichtet. <br/>Die Lage, umgeben von vielen kleinen Cafés, Restaurants und Geschäften ist der ideale Startpunkt um den Prenzlauer Berg und ganz Berlin zu erkunden. <br/>Auch die freundliche und unkomplizierte Schlüsselübergabe mit Alena war toll, da es hier nochmal unzählige, echte Insidertips für die nähere Umgebung gab. Wir kommen gerne wieder!!",1,-0.9229,Negative
137.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,1,3.2252377063559527,4.8,4.79,4.86,4.63,27120196,This apartment is the perfect space for traveling with friends. Prenzlauer Berg is a super fun neighborhood to explore and it is very easy to use the public transit system to reach the rest of Berlin. I broke my hand while in Berlin and Alan & Kasia responded to my messages almost immediately and kindly directed me to a local hospital. Would definitely stay in their lovely space again!,1,0.9807,Positive
150.0,1,0.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,0,9.387515191508518,4.36,4.39,4.71,4.29,1055746491460468407,cozy place clean and well located thank you for the stay !!!,1,0.8007,Positive
20.0,6,1.0,0.0,6.0,21,100.0,0,3.818785253820972,4.47,4.45,4.56,4.55,30759237,Best location ever,1,0.6369,Positive
94.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,1.7669306902363546,4.88,4.91,4.98,4.78,9599108,"Sehr Schönes Appartement, mitten in Berlin und trotzdem sehr ruhig. Komme gerne wieder!",1,0.0,Neutral
72.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,41,83.0,0,20.63444608322689,4.74,4.72,4.82,4.77,2760114,"Die Unterkunft ist absolut super! Meine Gäste haben sich sehr wohl gefühlt und waren absolut zufrieden. Lage ist super, Wohnung ist sauber und geräumig und mit allem ausgestattet was man braucht. Auch die Kommunikation und Schlüsselübergabe waren problemlos und unkompliziert. Gern wieder!",1,0.0,Neutral
293.0,6,2.0,1.5,3.0,47,100.0,1,2.826856216058209,4.87,4.82,4.89,4.73,83614,The apartment was beautiful and conveniently located. The bathroom and kitchen were attractive and well stocked. ,0,0.836,Positive
110.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,61,100.0,1,9.348496837727636,4.98,5.0,4.83,4.83,21252188,"Tolle Unterkunft, alles was das Herz begehrt. Ein ganz besonderer Tipp für Kulturliebhaber. Sehr zu empfehlen!",1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,0,2.2236669090713965,4.84,4.87,4.95,4.59,2718380,"I had a fantastic time here. The apartment feels very spacious, and at least as good as pictured. The space is modernly decorated and will feel like a home.<br/><br/>We arrived earlier than the check-in time, and Anh was able and willing to welcome us at the perfect time.",1,0.9403,Positive
101.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,3.078352015251089,4.83,4.81,4.81,4.66,20282379,"Philipp's place was an ideal headquarters for our stay in Berlin. The space is stylish and modern, while also being very comfortable. It also has an awesome view of the city. <br/>Philipp left plenty of tips regarding places to go — to eat, to hang out, to get coffee. But the apartment is also so well located that it's easy to just walk out the door and explore. <br/>As much as we enjoyed the apartment, my appreciation for Philipp was solidified when one of the keys to the door broke. I texted Philipp and moments later he was at the door with a replacement key. <br/>Thanks, Philipp, and thanks again for a lovely stay in Berlin.",1,0.983,Positive
98.0,6,1.0,1.0,3.0,38,100.0,0,4.479387416975665,4.85,4.73,4.84,4.73,798416193829159604,"Sehr netter Kontakt, saubere Wohnung, unproblematischer Check-in/-out",1,0.0,Neutral
116.0,5,1.0,1.0,4.0,29,100.0,0,2.281356512252844,4.49,4.56,4.75,4.42,16299453,recomiendo a Duc Son!!,1,0.0,Neutral
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,7,100.0,0,3.7764002646564983,4.85,4.97,4.85,4.84,16554581,Marius's place is exceptionally clean and the bedroom is spacious and plain but has everything you would need for a few nights or longer stay. Marius was very hospitable and seemed flexible. The neighborhood of Prenzlauer berg is calmer than other areas  and there are some good shops and cafes within walking distance. Public transportation is only a few minutes walk but you would definitely have to take it to get closer to the city center. Overall we felt very comfortable here and would book again. Thank you!,1,0.9733,Positive
69.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,6.409080116623725,4.8,4.78,4.86,4.75,24216126,"Very good apartment, quiet neighbourhood, good transport links to the city center and to the airport.",1,0.7496,Positive
218.0,6,3.0,2.0,6.0,36,100.0,1,3.003280992717941,4.82,4.78,4.83,4.62,14649703,We had a great stay here! Big apartment in a nice neighborhood.,0,0.8016,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,0,2.844436022271926,4.67,4.67,4.76,4.57,8247088,"Anna's place is as good as described. Very close from the subway, the appartment is very well located. <br/>Communication was perfect. Very fast responsing time!<br/>Definitely recommend for anyone visiting Berlin.",1,0.8953,Positive
