153.0,8,3.0,1.0,4.0,31,100.0,0,1.5581206607608804,4.25,4.04,4.75,4.25,1273151223432730759,"there is self check in process to home. very important info is missing during the checkin process which is asking the arrival time but only options are plain hours like 13:00 14:00 16:00 etc.. we were arriving like 15:00 ish but did not know exact time and there was no 15:30 option that is why I chosed the hour 16:00. when the check in completed it is occured the access code for house will be visible on the exact arrival time by 16:00. I asked to the owner to change the arrival time because i did not know this info while checking in, he said it is impossible. we had come earlier than we expected that is why we had to wait 1 hour outside. <br/>besides, beds and the pillows were unbelievably uncomfortable. specifically one of them was noisy and super discomfort.<br/>all tree night sleeps were painful. When we first entered the house we wanted more pillows and towels, they ignored the pillow and just brought the towels. we do not have any other complaints other than these ones.",0,-0.7386,Negative
119.0,6,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,80.0,1,5.419875510101854,4.86,4.9,4.92,4.7,21689254,"Nous avons passé un agréable séjour en famille dans l’appartement (couple + un bébé et un enfant de 3 ans). <br/>Il est très propre et bien décoré. La localisation est parfaite ! <br/>Malgré un souci de clé à l’arrivée, Fadeih a été super réactive pour trouver une solution rapidement. <br/>Elle et son mari sont très accueillants.<br/>Je conseille cet appartement ++",1,0.7574,Positive
161.0,4,1.0,2.0,2.0,56,100.0,1,2.045183840821759,4.95,4.97,4.94,4.88,637575697682777608,"Simons residence is exceptional. After getting a workout climbing seven flights of stairs you’re transported in to his majestic oasis. From the fine details to the gorgeous views and accent lighting. This apartment has it all. The location is surrounded by many restaurants and local markets for shopping. The metro is a short eight minute walk away, making this location highly convenient. I would absolutely stay here again. Simon is a superb host and I wish all those reading this a Happy New Year.",1,0.9515,Positive
159.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,95.0,0,4.132850367965358,4.39,4.36,4.47,4.23,43811867,"Kleine aber feine Wohnung.<br/>Eine Riesen Dusche ist auch dabei.<br/>U-Bahn direkt vor der Tür.<br/>Alles da was mach braucht Supermarkt, Sekt guter Bäcker und Bank  direkt um die Ecke.<br/>Für einen Trip nach Berlin ideal.",1,-0.128,Negative
