112.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,95.0,0,11.820461804372655,4.69,4.72,4.85,4.53,1039709337375906815,"The apartment is located near the Opera Haus in Berlin, 200 mt. from the U2 U bahn, from there you can travel everywhere in Berlin.<br/>The check in very easy, Alessa gave you all the infos and help, in case. We spent three days in the flat, it is very silent and with all the confort, very clean. Only if I can suggest to the owner to use cotton sheets for the bed and the sofa bed, and please change the pillows. They are not very comfortable. All the rest is perfect, I really suggest this place for a short holiday in Berlin!!! <br/>Paolo and family",1,0.9387,Positive
