125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,89.0,1,5.370479746698947,4.7,4.25,4.8,4.6,11374922,"The flat is exactly as described and Gregor was a great host! We got the keys a few days in advance, during our stay he checked with us that everything was fine, and leaving the flat was also very easy. <br/>The location of the flat is fantastic! Right at the canal, very close to supermarket, a park, bars, restaurants, etc. <br/>Just behind the building, there's a little private park with no car access. We enjoyed many picnics there and our son loved exploring it. <br/>The flat is quite small but there's everything you need! It's build in a very smart way. <br/>The only thing that made it a bit stressful for us was the fact that our son is now starting to walk and we had to be very careful with the stairs and the little platform to make sure he didn't hurt himself. But for families with a smaller baby who doesn't walk or crawls, or an older kid, it shouldn't be a problem. In any case, I'd recommend this flat especially for singles or couples. ",1,0.9746,Positive
72.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,13.967797942384964,4.96,4.96,4.88,4.92,11386702,"Eine sehr schöne Wohnung, mit toller überdachter Terasse.  Monika und Uve sind tolle Gastgeber.<br/>wir kommen gerne wieder.",1,0.0,Neutral
