64.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,1,1.5608226231060494,4.83,4.61,4.79,4.79,48868784,"The Airbnb was superb! It was clean and spacious, and the amenities provided were great! There was a wide range of tea and coffee provided as well. The common space was big and spacious, very warm and inviting.   The room was clean and very comfortable for two persons. We’ve had a great night’s rest, albeit a short one. Ms Wibke was a superb host and went above and beyond for us. Should we visit Berlin again, we’d definitely book her Airbnb again! Thank you once again for your hospitality!",1,0.9896,Positive
31.0,6,1.0,1.0,6.0,29,99.0,0,1.5518343874590943,4.55,4.64,4.6,4.63,6110762,"The room was very clean, the staff were overall really helpful and kind. Most important of all, I met one of the most interesting group of people I've ever met in my hostel experience. Highly recommened!",1,0.934,Positive
