167.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,0,4.149945021768397,4.93,4.88,4.89,4.74,701909,"We traveled on short notice to Berlin, two people didn't reply. <br/>But Lorant did, and put in a lot of effort to make our stay possible. <br/>The loft itself is very nice, with a very good overall quality. <br/>It is definately worth a stay, and I can only recommend it to everyone looking for a loft in Berlin. You will not regret it!",1,0.9064,Positive
