125.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,0,7.669090893821904,4.77,4.52,4.92,4.61,19501540,"Wolfram's place was the perfect home for us for a week in Berlin. Quiet and cozy, beautiful sunlight, a special and warm aesthetic, gorgeous photos on the walls.... As two creatives both working in and exploring the city, the apartment was both a comfortable workspace for us and a great home base for enjoying the rest of the city. And the five flights of stairs made for a great daily mini-workout ;) We agreed it was one of our favorite Airbnb's we've ever stayed in!<br/>A gorgeous neighborhood with especially fantastic access to the U7 Eisenacher Strasse stop. And we discovered a new favorite cafe (Mattea) and cocktail bar (Fabelei) just one block away.<br/>Wolfram was very responsive and warm, truly an excellent host. We would happily come back here for our next trip to Berlin!",1,0.9956,Positive
