215.0,3,2.0,1.5,2.0,35,100.0,0,1.0261312135393674,4.76,4.78,4.91,4.55,8918586,"Really enjoyed our stay in Stefan’s apartment in springtime in Berlin. The location is incredible with the best restaurants, cafes,  bakeries, markets and other destinations in Prenzlauer Berg all within 10mins walk. For those staying longer there are also multiple grocery stores in easy walking distance too and transport options on tram and subway to elsewhere in Berlin are also very convenient. The apartment is very spacious and private with the courtyard garden truly a green oasis at this time of year.",1,0.9273,Positive
