57.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,1,14.05197618587947,4.86,4.75,4.88,4.82,880324454862645598,"Katie was so sweet and welcoming, I felt right at home. The bed was super comfortable and the space was large and welcoming, with lots of windows and a beautiful garden outside. <br/>If you're a light sleeper like me, however, I would recommend you pack earbuds or earplugs, because the walls are rather thin so any sign of life will be audible from your room. Thankfully, I did, so it didn't bother me any.<br/>I would happily stay with Katie again!",1,0.9875,Positive
136.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,95.0,0,0.8707832520316201,4.73,4.81,4.88,4.55,1211490901429811494,Excelente estancia,1,0.0,Neutral
145.0,3,1.0,1.0,3.0,21,97.0,1,1.9977573269292777,4.75,4.74,4.76,4.68,36038064,Bel emplacement proche du centre et bon hôtel,1,0.0,Neutral
49.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,26,100.0,0,4.987564125241969,4.55,4.5,4.27,4.45,415218,"I came to Berlin for my new work contract, first time traveling here and didn't know what to expect but soon enough once I arrived to the flat it really felt like home.<br/>I arrived easily to the flat which had a really good location connected with U-Bahn, S-Bahn and bus service it was easy literally to get anywhere around the city in 20-25 mins.<br/>The host onboarding process was great, I was showed around the flat which was packed with all different t amenities and utilities you will ever need! From a washing machine detergent to an umbrella that you could use in unexpected Berlin rainy day!<br/>Mahir (Murat's) brother was a great host, he explained everything in details about the flat and neighborhood and recommended places for shopping, grocery and where to get a sim card. There are too big supermarkets 5 min walk from the flat. He also signed and sent me the paper I needed for my address registration (Anmeldung) really quickly. You only need that if you are going to live in Berlin by the way.<br/>The flat itself as you can read in other reviews is spacious, bright, modern and very comfy. There is a ton of towels, linens, cleaning equipment, iron, etc..<br/>The Murat had a really good gesture, I arrived one day before my actual rental period starts because of the flight pricing, I was planning to stay in a hotel for 1 night but he offered me to checkin a day earlier and sorted out the cleaning and everything (I didn't pay any extra fees for that).<br/>I recommend Murat's place whether you are coming for work or vacation to Berlin.",1,0.992,Positive
45.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,13,100.0,1,6.509304433578063,4.89,4.88,4.77,4.84,24764185,"Angela ist eine super Gastgeberin und das Zusammenleben mit ihr gestaltete sich als sehr unkompliziert. Das Zimmer befindet sich im 4. OG - Hinterhof und ist daher ruhig gelegen, trotz der generell super Lage der gesamten Wohnung. Immer gern wieder.",1,0.8316,Positive
