68.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,22,100.0,1,6.594298777125843,4.71,4.76,4.39,4.65,16469975,"Flat is clean. Location is very central. Very close access to S-Bahn for city.  Quarter has lots of muslim foreign citicen. Street is a rather dirty side street. I would not recommend it for my daughter but all of this was not at all a problem to us. Shopping of all goods and food is also very close. Door to pavement is direct door to living room with direct view to bed. Bed room for two people is behind. <br/>In short: <br/>clean flat, very central and close to food shop. best for two people, who do not care of a bit dirt in the street and walk along with foreigners.",1,0.3591,Positive
48.0,2,1.0,2.0,2.0,29,100.0,0,13.916102626188213,4.63,4.61,4.66,4.59,7824562,Schön gelegene Wohnung.Ca.5-7min.zur U/S-Bahn.Zentrum von Berlin etwas entfernter aber Top zu erreichen.Mit Kind habe ich mich trotz Großstadt sehr sicher in Charlottenburg gefühlt.Lidl/Rewe sind auch direkt in der Straße gut zu Fuß zu erreichen.Bäcker direkt um die Ecke.Top.Leider hat Berlin allgemein viele Baustellen auch in der Straße.Unser Zug fuhr erst Abends...wir konnten unser Gepäck aber bis dahin in der Küche lassen und haben uns somit Geld und sorge gespart; -),1,0.0772,Positive
