407.0,6,3.0,3.0,4.0,44,100.0,0,8.355204841259384,5.0,4.95,4.8,4.95,26800964,"This apartment was everything we hoped for and more for our family of five. A beautifully appointed and spacious loft apartment, it also felt like a real home. The beds were comfy, the bathrooms sparkling clean, the heating perfect, the views and light gorgeous, and the decor and record collection were on point!<br/>The apartment is in such a good location for a stay in Berlin for a family or group. Schöneberg is a fabulous area and not too touristy. The train is just nearby, but it’s also only 2km to walk to the KaDeWe and 3-4km walk to the Philharmonie and Potsdamer Platz if you’re up for it! Lots of good eateries not far from the apartment, and a good market on Saturday too. <br/>Communication with the hosts and their support crew was easy and prompt, which made check-in a breeze. They were super lovely. Highly recommended.",0,0.9924,Positive
