125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,0,3.036276112691593,4.74,4.9,4.75,4.69,2981102,"We had a great vacation in Gabriele's apartment. She is a very good and helpful host and recommended a great small Italian restaurant just across the street.<br/>The apartment is perfect for 3 families. Spacious rooms, working Internet and the location is also great. I would recommend this apartment anytime.",1,0.9789,Positive
