68.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,0,19.49595006982221,4.57,4.46,4.58,4.58,23782669,"It was perfect for us. Samuel impressed with great hospitality, quick responses, local tips,  flexibility with check in. Nice location, good supermarket 5 mins away. Train station 8. And from there it’s only 25 mins to downtown. Very convenient location if traveling on a budget but used to live in good conditions.  There is only a small kitchenette. But That’s was enough for us.",1,0.9239,Positive
112.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,1,7.03606664813505,4.84,4.94,4.63,4.75,926670,Super. Unkompliziert. Sehr gastfreundlich!,1,0.636,Positive
112.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,1,7.03606664813505,4.84,4.94,4.63,4.75,926670,"The apartment is very nice. It has great conditions (toilet, heaters, kitchen). Arzu & Tom were very nice and the communication was easy and efficient. It's not close to the city center but you can reach it by public transportation very easily. Will recommend to our friends!",1,0.9651,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,6,100.0,0,4.274320744562876,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,42834377,Great stay :) the room is very comfortable and the area is cool,1,0.9184,Positive
337.0,11,3.0,2.0,4.0,50,100.0,1,5.961083106152229,4.94,4.96,4.65,4.74,44443548,"Simon’s place was beautifully modern, well decorated, it had all the features of a beautiful apartment, a large apartment being 3 bedrooms it would easily take a big group. The treats on arrival made you feel welcome, it was homely and comfortable for a night on the couch. We had to search restaurants around the area, but that was the cost of a calm, peaceful neighbourhood. It was close to the metro, and Uber made it inexpensive to reach the city and icons of the city. We would definitely stay again.",0,0.9645,Positive
92.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,0,2.7850220743469896,4.82,4.83,4.89,4.68,249419,"Das Studio ist wunderbar eingerichtet und war bei sommerlicher Hitze angenehm kühl. Bestens ausgestattet und tolle Kommunikation, dazu herrlich gelegen. Allerwärmste Empfehlung!",1,-0.636,Negative
238.0,3,2.0,1.0,0.0,35,100.0,1,5.580334812061375,5.0,4.67,4.71,4.71,1065750598125434517,Sehr schöne und lichtdurchflutete Wohnung mit schönem Interieur. Wir haben uns super wohl gefühlt und die Lage ist total zentral. Gerne wieder!,1,0.0,Neutral
100.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,41,100.0,1,1.9469096234802603,4.85,4.92,4.91,4.75,408756,"The inside space is as shown. It was very quiet in the flat, the locations is amazing- so easy to get everywhere from there. The inside of the building is not what you’d expect from the outside, but we actually liked the vibe.",1,0.8162,Positive
89.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,1,2.692024625165537,4.82,4.64,4.91,4.76,29383900,"Birte ist sehr lieb und wir haben uns wohlgefühlt bei ihr, super Lage!",1,0.636,Positive
104.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,62,100.0,1,32.30019950005251,4.87,4.63,4.91,4.69,53425927,"A really lovely place for a weekend getaway. We enjoyed watching the boats go by from the front, and the fireplace made it super cosy. Maarten is a bit slow to read AirBnB messages, but is usually available somewhere in the garden if you need him. Would stay again.",1,0.7308,Positive
136.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,1,3.2900161245726496,4.58,4.66,4.94,4.61,4636280,"Very well located (in front of Sammlung-Boros), large appartment close to the tube.",1,0.3384,Positive
136.0,5,1.0,1.0,4.0,18,81.0,0,1.7732750227734309,4.09,4.21,4.44,4.09,1216465253515023473,"Nice experience, good value. And, the extendable couch can take 3 children comfortably. However, no extra blanket.",1,0.8271,Positive
129.0,2,1.0,1.0,0.0,35,100.0,1,11.120441584302393,4.98,5.0,4.89,4.86,49432374,"Super schöne Wohnung, sehr modern eingerichtet, sehr sauber,  alles vorhanden in edlem Design. Ich kann die Wohnung wirklich weiterempfehlen für alle Berlin Besuchenden. Ein großes Dankeschön an die Gastgeber!",1,-0.636,Negative
73.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,1,9.041027338527478,4.95,4.92,4.83,4.88,40675473,"Wir (1 Erwachsene, 2 Kinder) haben  den Aufenthalt bei Chris sehr genossen. Die Wohnung ist superschön, hell, gemütlich, sauber und Chris hat alles mögliche parat falls man etwas vergessen haben sollte ... Schirm, Schlappen, Kaffee, Duschgel, Bücher etc alles da. <br/>Der Bus 245 fährt von Washington Platz/ Hauptbahnhof bis vor die Haustüre und es gibt noch weitere fußläufige Optionen für den ÖPNV.<br/>Die Strasse war zwischendurch etwas laut, aber wenn man die Fenster schließt, hört man gar nichts mehr. <br/>Empfang durch und Kontakt mit Chris war sehr nett und unkompliziert.<br/>Ich würde diese Wohnung wieder wählen.",1,-0.9779,Negative
54.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,15.507270682054347,4.96,4.99,4.64,4.92,17955217,"Sabine and her husband were amazing hosts! Our train was late, and they were quick to reply to all our worries, and when we arrived, she was waiting for us with all the info to move easily around the city, and the beautiful room she offers. <br/>The room and the bathroom are beautiful, and the rest of the house is extremely cosy as well. I personally recommend staying with her. Even thought the house is a bit far from the main touristic points in the city, getting there is super easy and the trams and buses go every 10 minutes. 100% recommended :)",1,0.9798,Positive
185.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,40,100.0,0,12.4571539611784,4.88,4.91,4.83,4.72,159454,Dit is een mooie locatie voor een gezin met wat kleinere kinderen. Het belangrijkste is de snelle toegang tot de S en U bahn waardoor je snel bij de bezienswaardigheden bent.,1,0.0,Neutral
151.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,28,97.0,0,3.918641789625612,4.72,4.74,4.79,4.58,11450419,"Metro and supermarkets nearby, spacious apartment. Everything you need.",1,0.0,Neutral
184.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,1,1.859658170121276,4.96,4.87,4.94,4.82,878074,"Camilla's apartment is a wonderful spot from which to explore Pburg + Berlin. We stayed for a month and enjoyed her attention to detail around interior design. The apartment has everything you need. The unit is two flights of stairs up and faces a courtyard. So you will have plenty of light and enjoy quiet at night. For two people staying longer term, there really isn't enough storage since Camilla uses a closets and cabinet in the bedroom, bathroom and kitchen for her own things. Not a big deal for us since we travel light. Like most apartments in Berlin, there is no A/C but she provides a fan. The apartment will get warm in July and August even at night. Highly recommended!",1,0.9183,Positive
125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,0,2.295753994769258,4.81,4.84,4.93,4.75,9839151,"Comunicazione immediata e completa, accoglienza perfetta. L'alloggio è piccolo, ma completo di tutto; per tre persone è appena sufficiente, il terzo ospite è un po' sacrificato, ma ci si adatta senza problemi. <br/>Tutto è vicino, il centro (Alexanderplatz), i supermercati, bar, pub e ristoranti, nonostante ciò è tranquillissimo!<br/>Manye è stata fantastica e ci ha dato risposta immediata a tutto.<br/>Grazie! ",1,-0.4184,Negative
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,8,100.0,0,8.014135198491399,4.0,3.75,3.5,4.75,11940840,"Es war Alles bestens. Wir konnten unseren Aufenthalt in vollen Zügen genießen. Waren nur zum Schlafen in der Wohnung.  Diese war sauber und sehr hell. Dies führte zu sehr frühem Aufwachen unserer Kinder, dass keine Abdunkelungsmöglichkeit der Fenster gab. Aber so hatten wir Viel vom Tag ☺",1,-0.8807,Negative
158.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,59,100.0,1,4.991403538585387,4.92,4.93,4.84,4.72,551368642825868589,Mara's spacious place had everything we needed in the apartment.  It's also in a good location to access local transit. Easy to walk around the area. A large shopping mall is within walking distance and has reasonable parking rates.  Mara was helpful in suggesting points of interest for us.  We enjoyed our stay and recommend the apartment.,0,0.9468,Positive
201.0,7,2.0,1.0,6.0,30,100.0,0,3.7792785408916494,4.6,4.6,4.68,4.48,17948177,"Loved this place. I stayed with 4 other friends and we had so much fun just hanging out in our downtime here. The ""dungeon"" bedroom is super cool and gave the whole place an unexpected bit of personality after already being awed by the main kitchen area. The location couldn't be better. You're in direct proximity to a grocery store, mall, lots of restaurants, and the Hermannplatz U-Bahn station, which takes you basically anywhere in the city. Urbanstraße is nothing special, though all the parallel streets to it are charming and full of the area's great culture. Neighbors are quiet and chill, so you'll get lost of uninterrupted rest. Would totally recommend this place to groups of friends looking to visit the gritty and authentic fringes of Kreuzberg and Neukölln, and well outside of the tourist areas.",0,0.9787,Positive
108.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,70,100.0,1,2.641127618215382,4.96,4.94,4.95,4.88,267951,"We had a great time at the apartment , the location is amazing , the apartment is clean and equipped with everything we needed . We stayed with our 4 children for two weeks and it was fantastic and frank was extremely helpful with everything we needed . We will definitely stay there again",1,0.9638,Positive
90.0,7,2.0,1.0,4.0,31,96.0,0,31.826741126928464,4.23,4.08,4.69,4.0,1175489093358086077,"A beautiful little house at the canals of the lake, everything was perfect! Amazing place 5-6 people for a relaxed weekend or longer. We made a barbecue and took a tour with the boats provided - we loved our stay!",1,0.9642,Positive
71.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,44,100.0,0,8.68903509473006,4.63,4.57,4.56,4.45,968877295746673943,"Tolles Zimmer, leicht zu finden.<br/>Alles hat problemlos geklappt.",1,0.0,Neutral
101.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,22,100.0,0,7.249820268593237,4.68,4.65,4.22,4.46,52967492,"Very nice place, just a bit far from public transport options. (15 minute walk).<br/>For the rest perfect place to stay with good facilities :)",1,0.9134,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,12,100.0,0,3.1997532400486883,4.97,4.7,5.0,4.91,17767954,"Marc is a host that gives you the time and place to discover Berlin at your own place. It's never too late to enter discretely, and there's nothing that they don't talk about.<br/>The inhabitants of Berlin seem to be a reflection of their city: open, discrete, full of creativity and filled with energy. <br/>With Marc's offer, you will discover a cosy appartement with  price that does not suggest it's comfort range. You'll be in the vicinity of bars, restaurants and the U-bahn which will take you swiftly across Berlin. Just do it.",1,0.5845,Positive
48.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,0,4.230279756706139,4.76,4.76,4.48,4.74,31006339,Anfitrião super atencioso.,1,0.5994,Positive
85.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,34,95.0,1,4.724429146468118,4.76,4.57,4.76,4.72,53962004,"Nice, clean apartment in a good location close to the Ubahn and walking distance to many interesting Berlin sights.",1,0.8779,Positive
155.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,47,99.0,0,6.070945397633094,4.81,4.6,4.79,4.68,909318377890699731,It was really nice and well located.,1,0.6659,Positive
70.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,0,4.4389523138910185,4.9,4.94,5.0,4.84,11291073,"Super Aufenthalt, alles tip-top! sehr gute Schlafatmosohäre: ruhig, gute Matratze, Feder Bettdecke+Kissen, sauber. Lediglich die Vorhänge verdunkeln nicht vollständig, aber da hat Susanne bereits was geplant. Stilvoll eingerichtetes Zimmer, kleine Kochecke, in schönem Mehrfamilienhaus in super gelegener Straße. Den Kinderwagen konnte ich separat in einem ebenerdigen Raum abgeschlossen unterstellen. Susanne ist eine sehr offene, freundliche, interessante Gastgeberin und hat mir die erste Reise alleine mit meiner kleinen Tochter einfach und warmherzig gestaltet! Danke- wir kommen wieder :)",1,0.555,Positive
138.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,53,99.0,1,3.856396243645088,4.82,4.81,4.72,4.62,30515744,A great experience for longer stays.,1,0.6249,Positive
64.0,2,2.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,0,15.596949726924144,4.81,4.96,4.7,4.85,5132173,"Das Zimmer ist genau wie beschrieben, es war alles (Bad, gut ausgestattet Küche, Bett) tip top sauber !!! Bett ist gemütlich und zum Zeitvertreib stand ein Kicker parat. Wir trafen die sehr nette Helena zeitlich bedingt erst bei Abreise aber sie fragte uns vorher schriftlich, ob alles passe und wir noch etwas bräuchten und gab uns ausführliche Details zum problemlosen Check-In. Vielen Dank",1,-0.8349,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,7,100.0,0,3.5683245808085573,4.8,3.6,5.0,4.6,3634157,"Peters place is nice and comfortable. Large bright kitchen, huge bathroom, big living and a bedroom. It is basic but enough for a few days in Berlin. Having a coffee on the sunny balcony in the morning was the best. It was a pleasant stay and a great location in a very nice neighborhood. Thank you Peter. Always again!",1,0.9881,Positive
25.0,3,1.0,1.0,3.0,16,100.0,0,3.756311178403917,4.51,4.38,4.66,4.57,30758989,"Great stay for the price, would recommend!",1,0.784,Positive
47.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,22,100.0,0,13.138017956952291,4.4,4.36,4.6,4.27,18610999,"Соотношение цена-качество не оправдало наши ожидания. В спальне вентиляционные трубы были прикрыты простыней. В стенах торчащие провода из отверстий. Холодно и сыро. Из плюсов: комфортное спальное место , места общего пользования и время прибытия . ",1,0.0,Neutral
209.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,42,100.0,0,5.703512471819497,4.71,4.63,4.27,4.56,26051342,"Ein niedlich gestaltetes Hotel mit exzellentem Frühstück und sehr netten Personal. <br/>Die Zimmer sind schlicht und einfach, aber man hat alles was man braucht.<br/>Der Parkplatz/Tiefgarage für das Auto kostet extra (16€), das wäre nett gewesen vorher zu wissen, ansonsten war alles toll.",0,-0.5994,Negative
81.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,1,2.618142013757112,4.87,4.9,4.91,4.75,3717751,"The place is so nice, I will definitely come back,  everything is so modern, artsy and convenient.",1,0.7636,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,6,100.0,0,4.412628081914574,4.5,3.0,4.5,3.75,7908421,"entspannte Atmosphäre, unkomplizierte Gastgeber, reibungsloser Ablauf, fairer Preis, gerne wieder :)",1,0.4588,Positive
119.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,51,100.0,1,3.2984353664881243,4.88,4.85,4.89,4.74,31480066,"Eine sehr schöne ruhige großzügig geschnittene Wohnung in toller Lage. Ein sehr leckeres Café und Bäckerei sind gleich gegenüber zur Schönhauser Str. ist es auch nur ein Spaziergang man ist gleich in der Innenstadt, wir kommen bestimmt wieder 👍",0,0.0,Neutral
54.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,17,100.0,1,6.9953085951227845,4.74,4.84,4.46,4.71,22483099,Alles super geklappt! Schöne Wohnung 😊,1,0.636,Positive
46.0,2,1.0,1.0,0.0,28,0.0,0,12.065363217010958,4.93,4.96,4.96,4.86,1255664,"The apartment was exactly as described.  Very comfortable, close to pubic transport, quiet and well-appointed.  Nik met me at check in and was available if I needed anything.  I will definitely stay here again if ever back in Berlin.",1,0.7425,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,0,1.5074881752639435,4.76,4.88,4.82,4.6,1445668833818929312,Nice and comfortable place to stay with good restaurants within walking distance,1,0.8402,Positive
254.0,9,5.0,1.0,5.0,55,100.0,0,2.5444915248131554,4.72,4.7,4.87,4.66,1216584442123381709,"Für eine fünf köpfige Gruppe perfekt! Perfekt für Konzerte in der Max-Schmeling-Halle. Auch nicht sehr weit von der Innenstadt per Uber. Also sollten wir noch als dort ein Konzert oder ähnliches besuchen, werden wir hier wieder Buchen!",0,0.0,Neutral
85.0,5,1.0,1.0,6.0,29,100.0,1,2.9368733160629987,4.5,4.68,4.56,4.5,341910,"This place was great! It had a cat themed pinball machine (called ""Bad Cats"") and was across the street from a circus! Super spacious and interesting architecture. Some potential drawbacks might be that it is a 6th floor walk up that doesn't have wifi but those things didn't bother me at all.<br/><br/>It is located between a couple of different neighborhoods but isn't smack dab in the middle of one which means the neighborhood is fairly quiet. Since the apartment is so high up you wouldn't be able to really hear the street level stuff anyway.",1,0.7742,Positive
175.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,91.0,0,4.861047682375263,4.69,4.77,4.83,4.57,53744550,"Erittäin hyvä sijainti, helpolla sisäänkirjautumisella. Ainoat ongelmat  epämukava lisävuode ja pieni suihku. Yöpyminen oli sujuvaa ja kaikki ohjeet selkeät.",1,0.0,Neutral
76.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,100.0,1,5.169307301776869,4.86,4.89,4.79,4.76,16119275,We really enjoyed our stay in Birte's house. It looks like just like the photos and it was clean. The neighbors that welcomed us were really kind and communicative. I would definitely propose it in a friend that would like to visit Berlin.,1,0.9744,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,14,100.0,0,4.133979930974541,4.8,4.7,4.6,4.6,27187316,"Die Wohnung war sauber und liebevoll sowie stilvoll eingerichtet. Die Angaben waren korrekt und Alice war leicht zu erreichen und sie antwortete schnell. <br/>Die Gegend ist in Ordnung, sicherlich nicht die schönste Berlins aber dafür ruhig. Die Anbindung an U-Bahn und Tram ist okey, um die zehn Minuten entfernt. <br/>Der Checkout ist um 11 Uhr und somit etwas zu früh meiner Meinung. <br/>100€ pro Nacht für diese Wohnung in dieser Gegend sind schon nicht wenig, aber noch annehmbar, insgesamt schon empfehlenswert.",1,-0.9823,Negative
171.0,7,2.0,1.0,4.0,43,100.0,0,5.310747178957121,4.76,4.64,4.75,4.67,46864073,Really enjoyed our stay. The accommodation was perfect for our group and had everything that we needed. Highly recommended!,0,0.865,Positive
