60.0,2,0.0,1.0,2.0,31,100.0,0,6.60208387704164,4.89,4.78,4.78,4.61,19655083,"the place was very nice, very comfy and cute. Close to a metro station (10min. walk), everything we needed was not far, and Thibault was very helpful.",1,0.8573,Positive
