125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,0,4.496020436542058,4.94,4.85,4.79,4.82,27226460,"If you’re looking for a sanctuary for your stay in Berlin then look no further. Alexandra’s place is beautiful, stylish and has felt like it was only 30 mins from anywhere in the city by u-Bahn. <br/>I spent almost every night soaking in the atmosphere on the balcony and loved it. Whenever I’m back in Berlin this will always be the place I look to book first! <br/>Thanks again!",1,0.8652,Positive
