226.0,6,3.0,1.0,3.0,42,100.0,1,11.632050742075618,4.94,4.84,4.82,4.8,1185371951337071545,"Wir hatten einen sehr schönen Aufenthalt in Berlin und die Wohnung war mindestens so gut wie erwartet.<br/>Wir waren zu viert dort, die Kinder hatten so jeweils ein eigenes Schlafzimmer, viel besser als im Hotel.<br/>Die Küche und die Wohnung insgesamt sind super ausgestattet, man fühlt sich wie zu Hause.",0,-0.8591,Negative
75.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,39,100.0,1,4.996101482536838,4.94,4.91,4.92,4.82,791267392051140941,"We arrived late at night and were welcomed by the host’s girlfriend, who kindly helped us check in, as the host wasn’t available. Since it was quite late, she ended up staying in one of the other rooms that night. Unfortunately, the noise from her cooking in the kitchen the next morning woke us up, which was a bit unpleasant. Still, the neighborhood was quiet and felt safe. There was a slight smell coming from uncovered food in the fridge, but overall, the bathroom and all shared spaces were clean and well-maintained.",1,0.8248,Positive
