141.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,43,94.0,0,7.131273504704622,4.74,4.82,4.79,4.62,49070135,"I was pleased with my stay, check in and all other instructions given were helpful. The only thing I could fault was that I was under the impression I would be staying in an apartment were I’d be able to cook / prepare food but it was essentially a small hotel room / hotel feel with a tiny microwave and fridge. I was only staying for a few days though and was not in the room a lot so I overall did have a good stay.",1,0.743,Positive
