85.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,20,100.0,1,12.132524029038608,4.81,4.73,4.81,4.78,10644579,"Zuverlässige Kommunikation. Saubere, schöne Wohnung.",1,0.0,Neutral
88.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,1,2.7348204012292734,4.85,4.96,4.85,4.68,937557263289597139,"Till was een fantastische host. Hij heeft ons goed ontvangen en de accommodatie getoond. Deze was volledig in orde en naar verwachtingen, we voelden ons er meteen thuis. De accommodatie wordt elke dag schoon gehouden. Till was altijd bereid om ons te helpen en reageerde altijd snel. De kamer zelf was fantastisch, comfortabele bedden en alle voorzieningen waar je maar aan kunt denken waren aanwezig. We komen zeker terug naar Till zijn appartement wanneer we nog eens naar Berlijn gaan. De buurt waar het appartement gelegen is, is heel rustig, met super gezellige cafeetjes en restaurants. De accommodatie is dichtbij het openbaar vervoer en in no-time sta je overal in Berlijn. Heel erg bedankt Till!😊",1,0.636,Positive
116.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,3.73414624700186,4.73,4.61,4.82,4.54,36651479,"Amazing and beautiful decorated place! The location is unbeatable, and the place is super comfortable. We were three people and we all felt we had enough space. Everything is well-thought, the light is great, and the beds are super comfy. We would definitely come back! Thank you.",1,0.9829,Positive
32.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,3.2159665482867226,4.77,4.71,4.88,4.65,17904,"Max' studio was lovely and super comfortable. Although it is located in a lively area, the flat is really quiet and i could sleep with the windows open without ever been disturbed (and i'm a light sleeper!)<br/>Communication with Max was fast and easy. He is a very accommodating and friendly host.",1,0.971,Positive
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,2.0387590917028584,4.87,4.93,4.79,4.82,1146439,"Birgit ist eine offene und herzliche Person, sehr angenehm. In der Unterkunft habe ich mich gleich wohl gefühlt.",1,0.0,Neutral
57.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,7.349206308738338,4.93,4.95,4.67,4.86,36268374,"Allen and her family are some of the nicest people I have ever had the pleasure of meeting. I would recommend anyone who wants to stay in Berlin, stay with them. They are gracious host, and amazing people. The apartment is in fantastic condition. The location is perfect for anyone looking to explore what Berlin has to offer. I will definitely be staying with them again, when I come back.",1,0.9794,Positive
