65.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,4.1903954031521735,4.75,4.86,4.65,4.65,499342,"Well located, close to the metro and has everything needed for a comfortable working stay in the city",1,0.6597,Positive
52.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,6.296102388049414,4.82,4.77,4.72,4.77,16305782,"Serkan's home is compact, beautiful and has everything equipped. The house is 3 bus stops away or a 12-15 mins walk from the station. We had a good stay over his place. ",1,0.7351,Positive
162.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,30.0,0,4.403520802131898,4.93,4.87,5.0,4.73,822941107460488841,"I had a wonderful stay at Aliaa's place. Aliaa was most welcoming and responsive to anything and everything I needed. The flat is bright, colorful and cozy. I would definitely stay there again.",1,0.9355,Positive
