64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,0,7.781452884124446,4.45,4.55,4.54,4.36,993380042593079111,Unfortunately Hotel Ambiente do not cater for food intolerances and were uninterested in making their breakfast safe for me to eat. A bag of gluten free rolls doesn't take up much space in a freezer. Most other hotels offer this so I don't understand why  Hotel Ambiente can't. Luckily it is situated on top of a supermarket so I could buy my own food there and eat it in my room. But this was disappointing.,1,-0.5189,Negative
110.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,1,6.789020797802863,4.94,4.94,4.94,4.94,1218202538733167720,très bien <br/>très bon échange avec Ghislain<br/>a 5 mn du SBahn ring S41/42 pratique pour les visites de Berlin et des alentours. <br/>On reviendra.,1,0.0,Neutral
126.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,0,7.396661717518644,4.4,4.57,3.91,4.2,13742979,"The house looks just like how you see in the pictures, it might seem smaller, but it's about perspectives. The house has supermarkets near it as well as cafes and restsurants. It's about 10 mins far from the S-bahn. We happened to be four girls and experienced various catcalling episodes while walking those 10 mins to the station. The house is clean enough not to have problems, but it could be, in my opinion, cleaner.",1,0.8976,Positive
50.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,17,100.0,0,2.0097551611326496,4.89,4.97,4.88,4.88,3152463,"Perfect experience in this flat. Wolf was extremely responsive and available, as well as very friendly. The flat is very comfortable and perfectly located in the heart of Berlin. Many thanks Wolf for this wonderful stay!",1,0.9812,Positive
243.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,8,88.0,0,3.560186030012189,4.42,4.53,4.81,4.24,854251028991888522,"Ich würde die Wohnung für Städtereiser empfehlen. Fußläufig ist alles gut zu erreichen. Einkaufsmöglichkeiten, Restaurant,… in der Nähe. <br/>Rezeption ist sehr freundlich und hilfsbereit.<br/>Die Unterkunft war bei unserer Ankunft leider verstaubt, dreckige Handtücher waren unter dem Bett und die Wände im Bad waren auf keinen Fall geputzt. Nachdem wir es gemeldet haben, haben wir einen Staubsauger erhalten und es sollte nochmal die Reinigungsfirma kommen. Leider war die Wohnung danach nicht sonderlich sauberer, sondern hat nur danach gerochen. <br/>Küche ist minimal eingerichtet und einige Sachen waren bei der Anreise leider auch noch verschmutzt.<br/>Alles in allem eine top Lage, netter Austausch, jedoch leider nicht sauber und nicht zu empfehlen für Reisen mit Babys die gerade anfangen zu krabbeln :)",1,-0.9818,Negative
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,9.073028170952616,4.94,4.97,4.84,4.8,38254770,Super clean and comfy house in a beautiful location.<br/>Alexey is a very respectful host who make you feel at home.<br/>The room has all that you need to enjoy your stay.<br/>A five stars experience,1,0.9516,Positive
205.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,52,100.0,1,1.372412995603046,4.89,4.9,4.75,4.7,33006441,Sven and Shpresa were great hosts.  Great communication all the way through.  Nice apartment and great  geographical location that is very close to train/ subway stations. You can be in downtown Berlin in 15-20 minutes at a comfortable pace. Nice Doner food and pizza/pasta around the corner.  Huge grocery store  about 300 meters away with everything you need. <br/>Highly recommended <br/>Dan Belo,0,0.9758,Positive
88.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,100.0,1,1.881496822425637,4.71,4.61,4.93,4.66,44740912,Schöne Wohnung und sehr netter Kontakt. Wir hatten ein schönes Wochenende in Berlin !,1,0.0,Neutral
217.0,12,3.0,1.0,7.0,28,99.0,0,5.532921273123223,4.28,4.0,4.7,4.29,928114741395000896,"Super Lage. Saubere, moderne Wohnung. Optimal für die Reise mit der Familie oder Freunden.",0,0.3612,Positive
140.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,1,1.5130716954922565,4.89,4.91,4.94,4.75,2394897,"Verda was the perfect host, gave amazing local recommendations and the apartment was simply stunning! Also she was very understanding when our flight came in late and couldn't be any more helpful.<br/><br/>The apartment was perfectly situated and well connected to all transport links, we would love to go back and explore more in the not so distant future!",1,0.9758,Positive
