70.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,12.86304269897694,4.93,4.97,4.89,4.88,18014187,"We have had a really nice stay at the beautiful apartment of Patrick & Kate. The apartment was nicely decorated and had everything you needed, including a large bathtub. Thereby it was very clean. It was also useful that we had our own entrance, which gave a lot of privacy. The communication with Patrick & Kate was very easy. They responded very fast and accurate. <br/>The location of the apartment was good, in a +-5 minute walk you're at the trainstation where the train takes you in 10 minutes to hauptbahnhof.",1,0.9678,Positive
64.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,0,1.3794339384687275,4.92,4.9,4.97,4.76,19237459,"Jan and Junia are extremely welcoming and will make you feel completely at home. Communication with them was easy and me and my friend felt we could come and go as we pleased, tag along to their plans, etc. You can feel they want their guests to feel comfortable and that they love meeting new people!<br/>I highly recommend this house if you want local tips, laugh a lot and a really central location.",1,0.9798,Positive
