137.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,1,2.759966591003808,4.94,4.92,4.94,4.81,768616,Short distance in pleasant places to eat and short in all transportation. It was wonderful to sit on the balcony in the evening in the heat. There is also a great advantage of the apartment how easy to was to get fresh air in the heat. The bathroom is tidy and a nice shower. Nice to be in the kitchen. We loved the apartment and did not want to leave.,1,0.9793,Positive
