237.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,31,98.0,0,0.9333653060276148,4.18,4.33,4.58,4.0,693914756024294308,"We loved our staying at this apartament in the heart of Berlin. It was super convenient for getting almost anywhere, very spacious, tidy and comfortable. The only notable thing missing is any kind of AC, as it probably could prove problematic in the summer due to the fact the apartament is on the top floor. Which also takes quite a lot of effort to get to, due to lack of elevators. But overall, really good place and would come back again.",1,0.8196,Positive
