37.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,0,5.662533986282327,4.74,4.77,4.33,4.71,589285,"My husband and I spent one day in Hana-Kos and Martins apartment. We already live in Berlin, but we wanted to know a new neighborhood and to rest one day from our 24 hours non stop parenthood. We have three little vital and joyful children who require the whole time our entire attention and we were very happy to leave them one day with my mother. Martin was so nice to come in the morning to our own apartment, and gave us the key, the check in was very easy.  Hana-Kos and Martins apartment was cozy and quiet, exactly what we needed. From the bed you can see the sky, through a very big window/ door that goes to the balcony. The apartment is decorated with much love. The neighborhood is quiet, but you are very fast in the bustling Kreuzberg. In the evening we made a wonderful walk from the apartment to the heart of Kreuzberg, following the river, and we returned also walking. It was a great stay!",1,0.9908,Positive
