64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,50,70.0,0,9.476281218800926,4.78,4.42,4.57,4.71,51558001,"As soon as I got there, I immediately felt at home. Such a beautiful big room, so light and gorgeous. The flat is a 5/10 min walk to the nearest underground which is connected to the whole city, and a 2 min walk to the tram. Location is very good! Quiet and lovely. When me and Sarah got speaking,it was like I knew her my whole life and been friends for ages :) such an amazing, kind, funny soul. So enjoyed my time there, I would love to see her again in the future! (Oh yes... And obviously the cat. The cat really lives up to everyones reviews haha he is absolutely gorgeous)",1,0.9929,Positive
