57.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,39,100.0,1,12.15652849511375,4.98,4.95,4.83,4.9,760108563556107857,房間非常舒適。最重要的是房子附近有一間非常美味的小吃攤！,1,0.0,Neutral
67.0,6,1.0,1.0,3.0,44,70.0,0,6.808312019480818,4.43,4.17,4.4,4.49,1405939,"Bee is a really really nice host. She helps us a lot and very easy to communicate. The place is large and comfortable. The entrance is a separate one so we had our privacy. At the same time it is also close to where Bee lives so you can find her anytime you need help. The location is nice, not in central Berlin but quite close to U-Bahn and S-Bahn station so you get to go to everywhere you want easily. There are also a supermarket and nice food near the place. I would definitely recommend it to those who come to Berlin.",1,0.9755,Positive
161.0,10,4.0,2.0,4.0,25,100.0,1,7.731041071020152,4.6,4.72,4.48,4.57,2599765,"Super Great designed place.  Even, that we arrived a bit to early everything works fine good communication.  Everything was fine , clean  and the beds ...we sleeped good. We will book it again.",0,0.959,Positive
67.0,6,1.0,1.0,3.0,44,70.0,0,6.808312019480818,4.43,4.17,4.4,4.49,1405939,"This is a beautiful apartment with a lot of light in a peacefull neighborhood. The room was really nice and cosy. Bee is easy and calm. She gave us our intimity, but it was really simple to have discussions. The apartment is very close to a subway and bus station. It is very simple to go to downtown. There are not many restaurants and bars in this area, so it's good to be near of the subway.<br/>I pass a good time in this apartment. Perfect for young travelers !",1,0.9681,Positive
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,100.0,0,8.858712573291939,4.47,4.52,4.81,4.47,21276630,"Great place, neat and quiet.<br/>Amazing location close to everything!",1,0.8122,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,0,3.89941119978407,4.96,4.97,4.82,4.92,5368270,The apartment is so cute and Sol and her husband are very sweet! I really enjoyed my short stay with them and I hope I can stay with them again next time I'm in Berlin. The location is great and there are many restaurants around so you will never feel hungry.,1,0.9602,Positive
60.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,3.4424793835984366,4.59,4.43,4.62,4.5,40961984,J’ai bien aimé mon séjour.<br/>L’appartement été super propre. <br/>Très facile à trouver et y accéder<br/>L’appartement se trouve prêt du transport en commun pour soit aller au centre-ville ou les quartiers pour sortir le soir. <br/>Sécuritaire.<br/>J’ai vraiment aimé mon expérience.<br/>Je recommande tout à fait cet appartement pour votre visite à Berlin.,1,0.5267,Positive
125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,4,100.0,0,2.309470705464542,4.7,4.4,5.0,4.4,52643602,"Super Lage, hübsche Wohnung, unkomplizierter Host 😊",1,0.5994,Positive
281.0,6,3.0,1.0,5.0,36,100.0,1,6.9684418232558265,4.9,4.9,4.55,4.75,16209988,"Eine sehr schöne, sehr gut ausgestattete Wohnung! Es ist alles da um z.B. auch Mal zu kochen, neben Kochgeschirr auch Basisgewürze etc.<br/>Die Wohnung ist durch die vielen Fenster wunderbar hell und sehr gemütlich eingerichtet. Im Sommer ist bestimmt auch der Balkon toll.<br/>Wir waren zu 6., was von der Aufteilung der Zimmer perfekt gepasst hat - einzig ein zweites Bad/Toilette wäre ab und an praktisch gewesen.<br/>Nicht zu unterschätzen ist der 5. Stock ohne Aufzug, insbesondere mit Gepäck ;)",0,-0.8356,Negative
145.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,39,100.0,1,7.283454106561697,4.77,4.8,4.77,4.57,923013237667372980,Thoroughly enjoyed our stay at the Habyt. Located very conveniently between two train stations. Habyt was kind enough to offer us an early check-in and the receptionist was friendly and helpful. The rooms are adequate and ours was facing the waterfront (highly recommend to take a walk along the waterfront). Room has all the amenities for a nice short stay 1 including a functional kitchen and a smart TV. Loved the stay at this very beautiful stay and the quiet and peaceful neighbourhood!,1,0.9867,Positive
87.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,21,90.0,0,3.196091525660409,4.72,4.86,4.67,4.6,541569,"Silke was very friendly and responsive. She offered to hold our bags as we were arriving prior to check in time and allowed us to check in a little bit early.<br/>The place looks exactly like the photos however had more room than expected as there is an entrance room which separates the bathroom from the studio and bags can be stored here to save space. The bathroom is large. There is a small kitchenette which has enough utensils to make simple dishes which was helpful. Overall the place was very comfortable, clean, and tidy. <br/>The location is okay with the train approximately 10-15 minutes walk away, which was convenient for accessing other areas. <br/>Thank you Silke!",1,0.9702,Positive
68.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,19,100.0,1,7.221066332038413,4.94,4.94,4.73,4.86,16684717,"Tolle Unterkunft in guter Gegend. Theo ist ein Top Gastgeber, sehr freundlich, kennt die Gegend gut und hat tolle Tipps gegeben. Vielen Dank, komme gerne wieder.",1,-0.4767,Negative
121.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,27,100.0,0,4.472653939309849,4.88,4.9,4.81,4.78,10122398,"The location of the studio is just great, it is situated in the very calm street and only 5-7 minutes by walk from Potsdamer Plaz and few minutes by walk from the big mall with supermarket Rewe and many cafes and shops.The U-bahn station Mendelssohn-Bartholdy-Park is really 200 metres from the studio. The Brandenburg Gate can be easily reached by foot (15-20 minutes). Besides, if you are traveling by car you are lucky, because there is a free street public parking right near the building. The studio itself looks like on the photos, it is very clean and big for 2 person. The wi-fi works good. The kitchen is well equiped so you can prepare food by yourself. Martin is very nice and easy-going person, he reponds extremly quickly and friendly on every request and he were so kind with the very flexible time of check-in and check-out. Actually we had check-in pretty early in the mornig and besides Martin allowed us to left our luggage for sereval hours after check-out time. At the check-in Martin met us by himself at the stidio and showed us everything and he came at the check-out time wich were convinient for us. Besides, he prepared water and milk in the refrigerator like a compliment for guests, and also many brochures and maps of Berlin so they can be very useful for tourists. The only little notice is that the studio has it's big windows and entrance from glass till floor and the studio is situated on the way of the people who go to the next entrance of the building - so from time to time there could be some residents of this bulding going in front of your big windows, so you may want to put your curtains always on the window, which could make some darkness during the day. But I'm sure you are not spend your days in Berling sitting at home so it is not a big problem :-) So, this place is higly recommended to stay in Berlin! Thank you very much for your studio and your hospitality, Martin!",1,0.9868,Positive
140.0,3,2.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,0,10.023277382034683,4.93,4.98,4.88,4.8,2421445,"Very very clean and lovely apartment. Beautiful kitchen with EVERYTHING one needs and a very nice bathroom. Parking can be a bit tricky but a car is anyway not really needed as the S-Bahn is 2 mins away on foot. Local shops are also very conveniently located just around the corner,  with a bakery next door and a small supermarket 2 mins away, again on foot. We really enjoyed our stay here and will be back:)!",1,0.9193,Positive
41.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,15,100.0,0,3.558265973195314,4.77,4.84,4.88,4.79,19666219,Een prima prive kamer bij Günter thuis. Een vriendelijk ontvangst en flexibele incheck (wij hadden 4 uur vertraging door de trein).<br/>Je deelt de wc en de badkamer die op de gang zitten. Maar wij hebben in 5 dagen nog geen een keer gehad dat deze in gebruik was. Het voelde dus eigenlijk als een prive badkamer/douche. De badkamer is niet luxe maar gewoon normaal.<br/>Günter geeft veel privacy wat wij konden waarderen. <br/>De locatie is op een stukje lopen van Tempelhof en om de hoek bij heel veel leuke horeca! <br/>Prijs kwaliteit is dit een top verblijf!,1,-0.5696,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,0,2.728500570972652,4.98,4.94,4.95,4.88,8775701,"Arthur and Marina were so warm and receptive to us that we felt comfortable and at ease from the moment we arrived.  They opened their home and their space to us and were eager to respond to all of our requests. <br/>We found our room very comfortable. We were a bit concerned when we learned the temperature would exceed 30 degrees during our stay but the large windows and Arthur’s trusty little fan kept us very comfortable. If we ever returned to Berlin, we would not hesitate to stay again with Arthur and Marina.",1,0.9639,Positive
