129.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,21,100.0,0,6.825652376645098,4.89,4.92,4.9,4.76,21237781,"Apartment is a great space , extremely clean , comfy beds and I loved the location - lots of nice places to eat near by (in an area of Berlin I haven’t stayed in before) - particular liked the balcony - which was most welcome on a couple of very hot Berlin nights",1,0.9632,Positive
91.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,1,1.879148370938034,4.96,4.94,4.96,4.9,344986,"Pragtfuld lejlighed, god seng og meget, meget søde værter, der gør det nemt at føle sig godt tilpas i deres private bolig. Lejlighedens beliggenhed er i top, og selvom man bor så centralt er der helt mørkt og roligt, når man vil sove. Vi kan varmt anbefale dette sted.",1,0.4404,Positive
25.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,10,100.0,1,12.411049431736249,4.74,4.36,4.76,4.77,1883235,"Cheap, big room, friendly and very hospitable host, I'd book again if I could. The flat is about 5 minutes away from the Charlottenburg palace and has an amazing view out of the window. This has to be the best value airbnb in Berlin.",1,0.9274,Positive
118.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,18,93.0,0,2.315150552188887,4.79,4.73,4.74,4.68,16821725,"Wir haben zwei Nächte in dem Apartment verbracht und alles lief super - präzise Beschreibung der Lage des Apartments und unkomplizierte Schlüsselübergabe, die Räume waren sauber und gemütlich, ausgesuchte Dekoration und vollständige Ausstattung. Wir waren 2 Erwachsene + 2 Schulkinder und es gab genug Räumlichkeiten zum Ausruhen und gemeinsam zu sein. Zentrale Lage, dennoch kein Problem mit kostenlosen Parken.",1,-0.4019,Negative
124.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,52,100.0,1,1.65162815442783,4.86,4.79,4.92,4.69,2045192,"Kinga's place is nicely located. You can get to Berlin's downtown in 15/20 minutes walk. Kinga is a great communicator, he sent detailed messages about everything I needed to know for my stay at his place.",1,0.7906,Positive
107.0,6,0.0,1.0,3.0,31,100.0,1,6.4861685330092405,4.6,4.45,4.56,4.54,13812209,Place is nice as described and as per pictures <br/>i would love to stay again.,1,0.7906,Positive
294.0,5,1.0,1.0,3.0,48,100.0,1,1.5972714870366067,4.71,4.69,4.89,4.4,17020147,Alles super geklappt :) gerne wieder!,0,0.8016,Positive
125.0,2,2.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,0,3.036032627048052,4.7,4.7,4.63,4.68,22438,We stayed here for a week and couldn't recommend it enough. It was very clean and in a great location. It's a short walk to the station as well as many places to eat and drink. Javier was always very communicative with any questions we had. The place is very well furnished with anything you might need. We had a great time and we'll definitely be reserving this place again the next time we're in Berlin. Highly recommended!,1,0.9543,Positive
149.0,4,3.0,1.0,5.0,31,0.0,0,8.155448061817273,4.6,4.73,4.71,4.59,14618013,"This was a lovely apartment, in a great location. Station across the road and amenities close by. We would highly recommend the restaurant opposite but beware they are very big portions so you must be starving! Also the kebab hut opposite the station was to die for! The only down sides we would add is a lack of glasses (we had to go out and buy wine glasses) also a lack of basics (we were left with half a toilet roll between 6 women) and a tiny amount of washing up liquid, therefore an immediate shop was required. The lift was also out of order so a climb up to the 5th floor was a challenge (for us that are less fit than others). Apart from that we would highly recommend this apartment. Maximilian was a good host also. ",0,0.3139,Positive
98.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,16,90.0,1,10.994483825646318,4.91,4.97,4.86,4.85,6035999,"Very nice and romantic place. The beds are great, and the breakfast nothing less than wonderful! I can really recommend for you to stay at this magic place. ",1,0.8873,Positive
123.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,0,7.774560523766015,4.59,4.66,4.71,4.55,21443258,"Très bon séjour passé dans cet appartement, assez de place,  même pour 4 adultes, proche des Bus, tram et métro. Un supermarché est à 300 mètres et une très bonne boulangerie à 200 mètres. <br/>Tout était impeccable dans l appartement et la communication avec Serpil très simple et facile. <br/>Si je reviens  à Berlin je relouerai l appartement!",1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,0,6.366394331566418,4.89,4.89,4.62,4.73,4100032,Raimund’s attention was remarkable and his flat is lovely and super clean. Would recommend it.,1,0.9477,Positive
99.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,1,1.4854889925211936,4.82,4.89,4.88,4.79,41918424,Facilité de l'accueil pour la remise des clés.,1,0.0,Neutral
59.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,1,15.704190402628244,4.96,4.98,4.63,4.91,12337676,Meine Freundin und ich waren über's Wochenende in Berlin. Für einen ruhigen Abend nach einem langen Tag in der Stadt eine ideale Unterkunft. Wir haben uns wie zu Hause gefühlt. Danke Sabine! Die Ausstattung ist super. Wir können sie rundum empfehlen. ,1,0.0,Neutral
110.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,55,100.0,1,11.59644426923647,5.0,5.0,4.8,4.93,1249106973521025839,"I was travelling from the Uk and Chris had noticed that and prompted the conversation. He had kindly set up an easy to follow pdf guide that entails the check-in process with pictures. Absolutely phenomenal host, the communication, hospitality, the stay was exactly as described or even better than described. It truly made my trip at Berlin an even better experience.<br/>I also had forgotten to bring an adapter and Chris responded at late hours giving me an alternative solution! <br/>I highly recommend the stay, I will be sure to come back again.<br/>P.s.  The cinnamon powder of yours greatly helped, it was the missing ingredient to the porridge we cooked. Thank you!",1,0.9705,Positive
114.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,47,100.0,1,16.22805984481168,4.86,4.69,4.83,4.79,889232333992340685,"Our experience was very positive. The Check-in /out was easy, and the apartment is very calm. Ron is a very nice person and had a good energy. We were there for only two nights, but we felt like at home.",1,0.8998,Positive
67.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,31,100.0,1,0.7518298030804867,4.84,4.68,4.86,4.75,27120381,Had a great stay at this place. Even better than the pictures. GREAT location great communication from host. Place was clean and had everything we needed. many stores very close by. Will absolutely love to stay again.,1,0.9754,Positive
48.0,6,1.0,1.0,6.0,29,99.0,0,1.4480502011325729,4.62,4.57,4.62,4.68,9536240,great location !! super clean !!!i recommend !!,1,0.9368,Positive
116.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,53,100.0,1,14.27711203868629,4.94,4.88,4.81,4.75,579662998059272323,"Недавно снимал эту квартиру в Берлине и остался очень доволен!  <br/>📍 Расположение – тихий и уютный район Берлина, до остановки общественного транспорта 10 минут не быстрой походкой .  <br/>🏡 Квартира – чистая, светлая. Всё необходимое есть: хорошая кухня, удобная кровать, быстрый Wi-Fi. Отдельно порадовало наличие стиральной машины и посудомойки.  <br/>💡 Хозяин – очень отзывчивый и коммуникабельный, вопросов дополнительных у нас не было - но если бы возникли - думаю решилось бы это минут за 5 . Заселение прошло без проблем.  <br/>🌿 Тихий двор – окна выходят на улицу - но она не проездная и очень тихая, тихо было круглые сутки, что для  этого района Берлина обычное дело.  <br/>Однозначно рекомендую эту квартиру для поездки в Берлин – будь то туризм или командировка. Обязательно вернусь снова!  <br/>Минусы: не обнаружил (разве что лестница без лифта, но это частое явление в старых домах Берлина).  <br/>Если вы ищете жильё в немецкой столице – этот вариант один из лучших по соотношению цены и качества!",1,0.0,Neutral
99.0,4,3.0,2.0,2.0,63,100.0,0,18.289475759845857,4.9,4.87,4.84,4.92,12226042,"Das Haus ist Klasse. Sehr geräumig und gemütlich. Im Sommer lädt der Garten zum Verweilen ein.<br/>Man fühlt sofort heimisch und der Urlaub kann beginnen. Kein Parkproblem.<br/>Das Haus ist geschmackvoll eingerichtet.<br/>Gaby ist diskret immer im stand by, um behilflich zu sein.<br/>Wir kommen gern wieder.",0,0.0,Neutral
137.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,1.189406824976013,4.86,4.84,4.93,4.79,264459,"Fantastic location, clean and well supplied. Responsive and accommodating host",1,0.872,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,0,6.16237661417251,4.69,4.83,4.7,4.72,1192961,할아버지께서 짐을 가지러 밑에까지 내려와주셨어요. 독립적으로 사용이 가능하였습니다. 그으러어나아 키이치인 쓰으는것이 조오그음 부울펴언 했습니다. 밖에서 바압을 먹는게 나았습니다. (누운치이가아 보오입니다. 그러어나 저어는 걍 머억어었습니다:)),1,0.0,Neutral
180.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,45,85.0,0,1.5095289909770313,4.75,4.84,4.9,4.6,45475252,"The apartment was perfect in terms of location being close to public transport, sights, restaurants and shopping. Within it has all the modern practicalities right down to a nespresso type coffee maker. The bed was very comfortable. <br/>My only niggle was that there were no instructions on how to operate the temperature control panel but I eventually managed to set it at a suitable temperature. <br/>Check in and check out was also very efficient and straightforward.",1,0.8012,Positive
174.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,24,100.0,1,0.9258524571982032,4.69,4.81,4.73,4.57,31248515,"Het appartement ligt dichtbij verschillende mogelijkheden om het openbaar vervoer te nemen. Het verblijf was ook zeer rustig. De ruimtes waren enorm proper en de host is proactief in haar communicatie. Het is een zeer huiselijke sfeer. Heb je een donkere kamer nodig om te kunnen slapen, neem dan best een ooglapje mee. De instructies om de sleutel af te halen zijn duidelijk. Er is ook een mogelijkheid voor een extra sleutel.",0,0.6369,Positive
