170.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,51,100.0,1,1.4356958153593935,4.66,4.81,4.62,4.51,2396312,Our Berlin host were quick to respond and met us on time for the keys and instructions. Spacious apartment with a well appointed kitchen for our early morning needs. Quiet neighborhood with small food and liquor stores nearby.  Within ten minute walk to tram station.,0,0.2732,Positive
