64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,53,100.0,0,3.478454873446239,4.75,4.94,4.84,4.73,20378421,"The apartment is fabulous, big, clean and Theresa is an amazing person. She welcomed us, made us a tour of the apartment and gave us a few tips and tricks to make our stay in Berlin a perfect one. 5 star is not enough. Will book it again if we will come back to Berlin.",1,0.9382,Positive
