143.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,55,100.0,1,1.1060094707808927,4.91,4.94,4.81,4.8,878313640342175143,"L'appartement est très bien situé pas loin de l'île aux musées et de l'hypercentre.<br/>Il est très propre, bien équipé, la literie est excellente. Le cadre de vie est agréable dans l'appartement.<br/>Mais il faut de l'entrainement pour monter les 3 étages dans un escalier aux marches hautes et mal entretenues.<br/>Nous regrettons seulement que Thomas n'ait pas répondu à notre demande concernant un drap manquant sur le canapé-lit alors qu'il nous a envoyé tous les jours un message automatique nous souhaitant un bon séjour.",1,0.0,Neutral
12.0,8,1.0,0.0,8.0,16,100.0,0,3.891225125445868,4.33,4.16,4.54,4.42,3108686,"This was the first time I stayed at the Hostel and honestly it was a great experience. The bathrooms were really clean and the rooms are nice. For a hostel, this exceeded my expectations. The workers are also helpful and offer great advice when it comes to things to do around the city.",1,0.9628,Positive
66.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,45,100.0,1,8.230717363177027,4.89,4.88,4.84,4.76,34243172,"Lovely apartment, very clean with everything we needed. Short walking distance to public transport and amenities. The host is very responsive. <br/>We loved our stay and would come again if visiting Berlin. <br/>Thank you Thekla!",1,0.933,Positive
75.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,28,100.0,0,7.600554526565933,4.89,4.76,4.94,4.76,13554198,Man erhält ein super hübsches Zimmer bei Michael in einer tollen Lage in Berlin!,1,0.636,Positive
74.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,4,100.0,0,2.3564188928118805,4.79,4.87,4.72,4.81,302167,"This is a very comfortable apartment that has all you need, even sugar, coffee filters and olive oil as basic supplies! It is in a quiet part of Prenzlauer Berg and the M10 tram in Danziger Straße gives easy access to U2 line or you can walk. Lots of Kneipes, a Kaisers and restaurants nearby. Hendrik is very helpful. I was there a month and the longer term rate was very reasonable. My wife loved the ""wonderful"" high ceilings.",1,0.9297,Positive
