191.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,62,100.0,1,12.179172834399235,4.97,4.99,4.61,4.81,1040321621709668304,"Wir hatten eine großartige Zeit in der Unterkunft! Die Ausstattung war top, alles war sauber und bestens durchdacht. Besonders hervorzuheben ist Sebastians Hilfsbereitschaft – er hat sich immer direkt zurückgemeldet und war unglaublich zuvorkommend. Man merkt, dass ihm das Wohl seiner Gäste wirklich am Herzen liegt. Wir haben uns rundum wohlgefühlt und würden jederzeit wiederkommen. Klare Empfehlung!",0,-0.9467,Negative
104.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,3.614936598767828,4.76,4.78,4.87,4.71,640160204406168059,"L’appartement est top, semblable à la description, Jan est très gentille et prend soin de ses hôtes, je recommande vivement pour un séjour à Berlin",1,0.2023,Positive
119.0,7,3.0,1.0,4.0,53,100.0,1,4.301193855117379,4.85,4.92,4.79,4.65,42486076,"Nos gustó mucho el apartamento. Cosas a mejorar: las persianas (poco funcionales y alguna rota), falta microondas, las luces del portal estaban fundidas y para entrar necesitábamos linternas. Cosas a destacar para bien: nos dejaron café y leche, las camas cómodas, casa limpia y muy silenciosa, buena ubicación con el tranvía cerca. Muchas gracias!",0,0.0,Neutral
96.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,63,100.0,1,6.218879326348291,5.0,5.0,4.99,4.98,48916310,"A perfect place in Friedrichshain. Everything in the apartment was awesome -- including a great little private bathroom -- and Francesco was kind enough to allow use of other spaces, and a few chats to get to know one another. The location is right in the middle of one the most happening areas of Berlin and well-connected to virtually everything. Highly recommended!",1,0.9617,Positive
61.0,3,1.0,1.5,3.0,52,100.0,0,9.33809190104738,4.7,4.65,4.56,4.53,49493260,Had a very nice stay! I absolutely recommend it !😊,1,0.7558,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,0,0.9723023441808696,4.9,4.82,4.98,4.88,39920002,"* Julian does not live in this house.There are people you don't know at home who are constantly changing. You don't see the person you see one day the next day. This gave me security concerns and I always had to carry my valuables. <br/>** The kitchen is always full at meal times. I wasn't going to use it anyway, but if you're thinking of using it, it would be very difficult. <br/>** I always paid attention to cleanliness at home. Unfortunately, I even had to clean other people's dirt before using the toilet. (This includes blood!) However, they reported me to Julian about the toilet rules, and this undeserved slander for a mess they or the people in the house had made was very disturbing. You don't want to encounter something like this on your holiday.<br/>* There are dozens of plants in the room. Allergies! <br/>** Since the wardrobe in the room is completely full of other people's belongings, you have to keep your belongings in your suitcase at all times. There isn't even room to hang anything.",1,-0.8859,Negative
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,1,3.3839110533522265,4.76,4.57,4.71,4.72,722871,"Lasse ha sido muy amable con nosotros, nos dio indicaciones para todo, y aunque tuvimos algunos problemas al llegar con las llaves en seguida nos pudimos poner en contacto con él y nos lo resolvió.<br/>Tanto el barrio y la zona del apartamento es agradable y tranquila. El piso estaba limpio y es tal cual las imágenes muestran. <br/>¡Nos llevamos una buena experiencia!",1,0.4003,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,0,10.023228212367442,4.86,4.95,4.74,4.84,17278413,"Sabrina's was so helpful. The house was really clean, and comfortable. The appartment is close to the city center, so it was pretty easy to arrive there with out loosing to much time. We highly recommend this appartment! Thanks for all Sabrina",1,0.9703,Positive
