48.0,2,1.0,2.0,2.0,29,100.0,0,13.916102626188213,4.63,4.61,4.66,4.59,7824562,"Die Unterkunft liegt verkehrsgünstig und mit Bus und U-Bahn ist Berlin leicht zu erkunden.<br/>Die Wohnung hat drei Zimmer. Die beiden anderen waren auch belegt, was aber nicht störend war, da alle sehr rücksichtsvoll waren. Parwana war immer sehr gut zu erreichen um Fragen zu beantworten und auch Hilfe zu leisten.",1,-0.9485,Negative
223.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,33,100.0,1,9.786517555749825,4.92,4.96,4.95,4.83,23077467,"Apartment is really lovely, beautifully furnished and has a good sized balcony. Location is reasonably central, yet still feels peaceful during the evenings/mornings. Cleaned to a high standard. <br/>The host was responsive and friendly. A degree of flexibility around check-in time was offered when requested. <br/>Would recommend as overall it was of a high quality, but does have the price tag to match.",1,0.9078,Positive
