53.0,2,1.0,1.0,0.0,33,100.0,0,1.7381129152330592,5.0,5.0,4.95,4.95,13326488,"Christoph’s apartment was perfect for our first visit to Berlin. The location is perfect with plenty of cafes and restaurants close by that were superb.  Close to transit as well.  The apartment was exceptional in cleanliness, style and comfort.  The bath was perfect after a chilly day in Berlin. Would recommend his place to anyone!",1,0.9705,Positive
