99.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,44,100.0,0,2.054878408160895,4.88,4.86,4.92,4.76,1125473671995458320,"Everything went well. The place is located in the best area with all kinds of cafes, restaurants, small shops, groceries, playgrounds. Everything is right nearby. There is a tram, subway and bus stop right outside the door. We loved it and will definitely come back.",1,0.8934,Positive
