70.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,0,8.122838708117735,4.38,4.61,4.31,4.3,18150458,"One of the advantages of the appartment is that it's warm - the heating is autonomous and is regulated by a gas boilet. Good wifi. Outside is the quiet courtyard. 7 minutes walk to U6 Seestraße - for us the proximity to this line was very important.<br/>Of the minuses - the general non-comfort atmosphere at the house, there is no sense of security. The house is old and the staircase is dusty and shabby, the smell of the basement. Looking at some  doors, it seems that not all apartments are occupied. Somewhere there is a repair. Uncomfortable to return in the evening. And when about 1 a.m., when we were already asleep, someone started severelly ringing the door bell ... Me and my children almost died of fear. Just like in a horror movie: a half-empty old house, the wooden floor has cracked and squeaks treacherously, so it’s unnoticeable to go to the door to see who’s there. There was darkness on the staircase, but someone stood silently. Then he starts ring again doing it for 10 min!! When I asked frightened :who is it? Noone answered! The door is old, seems like it is so easy to breake it and enter. The Primeflats manager, as luck would have it, sleeps sweetly and does not answer my calls, no support ... the children quickly found the police phone on the Internet, and hoping for it, in case the situation worsens, we fell asleep.. after 2 hours :) in addition in the afternoon,  2 stern guys in black appeared, roughly pounding at the door and not showing documents, said they want to come in to check the heating system.<br/>From small things - there are no usual trifles, such as sugar, salt, vegetable oil, tea. It would be nice to put at least some shampoo. The surfaces in the flat is not that new as it shown at the pictures. We brought a hair dryer with us and it turned out that it was in the apartment, although it was pointed out it was not",1,0.9608,Positive
18.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,16,100.0,1,3.5617393850761867,4.9,4.73,4.94,5.0,5521732,"I had a really enjoyable 5-week stay at this listing. The room is spacious and as it faces into a courtyard it's pretty quiet. It's also well located in a busy and interesting part of the city that's only a few minutes walk from the U-Bahn station. I didn't see a huge amount of Constantin, but whenever I did he was very affable and helpful. Would definitely recommend this listing!",1,0.946,Positive
52.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,1,11.309392358305647,4.93,4.97,4.56,4.89,19215782,Susanne was a very kind and helpful host. The room is so clean and comfortable and the house is very well located to access easily to the public transportation. I recommend this place.,1,0.9643,Positive
125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,0,2.295753994769258,4.81,4.84,4.93,4.75,9839151,"We stayed in Finn's flat two nights and we really enjoyed it. The flat is located in the downtown area and provides easy access to the public transportation, U8 and trams are not so far from it.<br/>Close to lot of bars and restaurants so perfect for a (young) couple.<br/>She was a very kind host and her flat was a very clean and even prettier than the pictures.<br/>",1,0.9683,Positive
114.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,67,100.0,1,32.29350043093033,4.85,4.69,4.87,4.74,36360929,"Wir wurden sehr freundlich empfangen. <br/>Haben uns noch mit Herrn Maarten und seiner Frau im Garten unterhalten. Unser Kinder haben in der Zeit im Garten mit den tollen Sachen, die im Garten stehen gespielt. <br/>Wer nicht auf Schnick Schnack steht, ist dort richtig. <br/>Angereist als Familie mit 3 Kindern.",0,-0.1779,Negative
134.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,48,100.0,0,8.344483157595814,4.63,4.73,4.5,4.63,11579227,"Alles tip top! Das Zimmer war allerdings extrem heiß (weil Sonnenlage) und wir konnten den Raum trotz geschlossener Vorhänge auch in der Nacht nicht kühlen.  Siridin ist ein super Gastgeber, sehr freundlich. Empfehlung :)",1,0.6239,Positive
