52.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,26,100.0,0,13.747094209166455,4.52,4.43,4.69,4.37,20166135,"the location is excellent, well connected to S and U bahns and was easy to find. auto check in and check out was smooth and allowed for flexible timings. the hosts also let you keep your luggage in the common area post checkout, which was very useful for me. <br/>regading the room, it was quite small. in my opinion it should not have a double bed, it would have been very difficult for two people to stay in it. ideally it should have a single bed and be let out accordingly with a lower rental. there was barely any space for me to keep my suitcase. because of this big bed, the plug points on one side were rendered useless. the window opens to the main road, so it became a choice between a warm night and constant street traffic sounds for me. the bathrooms were clean and well maintained, but the shower area does need a shelf to keep ones's things.",1,0.775,Positive
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,1,5.167258880847807,4.97,4.92,4.93,4.91,9938743,"Alexandro is an all-star host/person. I really enjoyed chatting and getting to know him, and had a blast! The room is one of my favorites I've had (high ceilings, terrace, very sizeable), and I love the area--very central. I 100% recommend!!",1,0.9353,Positive
