120.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,46,100.0,1,9.29605165579442,4.73,4.85,4.66,4.6,3047076,"It was our first time in Berlin and we enjoyed it a lot. Fai's place had everything we needed and we managed very well using the train and buses. It is very easy to commute as there is an underground and train station 5 minutes away. It connects easily with the airports, main train station and Berlin in general. We also went to the close park several times as our 2 years old son loves these places. Fai also provides you with a big written manual with handy stuff to do in Berlin and also how the house works in general and what the rules are. We recommend without doubts to stay here.",1,0.9543,Positive
256.0,5,2.0,1.5,3.0,41,100.0,0,11.149123650324338,4.52,4.56,4.85,4.47,22183259,I booked this place for my parents who were visiting Berlin for the first time. They were super happy with the size and the cleanliness of the place. The location they also said was perfect as it is located in Charlottenburg which is a very convenient location for shopping and reaching any tourist sites from.,0,0.9201,Positive
