109.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,3.5991715456162776,4.85,4.8,4.88,4.69,38967379,"Awesome apartment!!! Loved everything about it and would go back in a heartbeat. Everything looked exactly like in the pictures, even better. Highly recommended!",1,0.949,Positive
163.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,91.0,0,4.871252294318258,4.67,4.78,4.87,4.53,46864858,"Die Unterkunft ist perfekt. Tolle Läden und Restaurants in unmittelbarer Nähe und auch UBahn, Straßenbahn und Bus verbinden einen mit den schönsten Spots Berlins. Dazu ist die Unterkunft stylisch und der Checkin und Checkout sind super unkompliziert. Sehr zu empfehlen.",1,-0.5994,Negative
231.0,5,2.0,1.0,1.0,47,95.0,0,4.154492495352003,4.13,3.99,4.39,3.97,699117423589365431,"I have booked and paid for 3 rooms, two bedrooms apartament more than a month before arrival. I was traveling with my friends and wanted to stay together. The day before arrival owner sent me a message that the apartment I booked is not available and they can offer me a 2 room apartment with single bedroom plus additional studio. They didn’t want to explain why they’re changing the offer in the last moment. I wasn’t happy about it - staying together was the main reason we decided on this offer. When we arrived, they changed the offer again - my friend had to sleep on a cheap couch in the living room. We did receive the keys to the studio next evening. The same day in the morning we were  woken up by the sirens and smoke - the motorbike was burning right under our window and next to our car. I honestly recommend to avoid Nena Apartments if you want to enjoy your stay in Berlin.",0,0.9524,Positive
49.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,0,8.092180844920643,4.73,4.78,4.59,4.68,222784,"Très bon accueil de la part de Kelly qui a pris le temps de nous expliquer où trouver les commerces alentour (restaurants très bien notamment), et tous les monuments et sites à voir dans Berlin. L'appartement correspondait tout à fait à la description, était très propre et très bien situé par rapport à l'aéroport et au centre ville. ",1,-0.128,Negative
232.0,7,3.0,2.0,9.0,49,100.0,1,5.724698314400603,4.86,4.82,4.7,4.71,30078342,"Sehr gut gelegen, einfacher Check-In, alles sauber und ordentlich. Gerne wieder!",0,0.0,Neutral
58.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,0,18.77117911741297,4.7,4.71,4.52,4.69,3314419,"Die Beschreibung ist sehr passend und insgesamt war es sehr nett.<br/>Durch die guten Parkmöglichkeiten vor Ort und da es etwas abgelegener liegt, ist es selbst als ""Landei"" gemütlich mit dem Auto erreichbar ohne den Großstadt-Verkehrstress.<br/>Die Anbindung per Bus in die Stadt und auch Einkaufsmöglichkeiten sind bequem zu Fuß erreichbar.<br/>In der Nähe fährt tagsüber immer mal ein Zug vorbei, nachts ist es aber ruhig.<br/>Alles in allem eine gute Möglichkeit für ein paar Tage Berlinurlaub :)",1,-0.9274,Negative
125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,1,4.9938298863871085,4.88,4.89,4.94,4.56,40578087,"very nice, calm and international neighbourhood with lots of cafes and shops. easy to take the underground train to everywhere you need to go.",1,0.8211,Positive
125.0,8,5.0,1.0,2.0,60,100.0,1,19.097033863993097,4.8,4.76,4.59,4.74,16688037,"Sehr schöne Wohnung, viel Platz, alles da, geschmackvoll",0,0.0,Neutral
226.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,31,100.0,1,7.356488886180644,4.96,4.97,4.96,4.88,22382672,房间和照片一模一样，各方面都很棒，Andrew也非常友好，总之是非常舒适的居住体验！,1,0.0,Neutral
79.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,11.00520151279848,4.92,4.96,4.81,4.81,5410909,"The apartment is quiet, nicely located very close to the subway U3 & U7 station and fully equipped. It's a studio apt attached to Alice main apartment. The separate entrance is also very convenient.  I especially like the full kitchen and bathroom. Alice is very helpful and make sure everything is there for me. I enjoyed my stay there and would recommend others! :)",1,0.9609,Positive
58.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,0,4.274581176220852,4.72,4.93,4.79,4.67,117649,Ralph and Maria were very easy to contact and were very happy to accommodate our needs and provide suggestions for the area. The apartment was great for our stay in Berlin. As we were there for 5 nights it was nice to stay somewhere away from all the tourist sites and in such a cool area! The apartment has everything you need for a great stay and there are lots of great restaurants and bars in the area. Would definitely recommend a burger from Burgermeister and breakfast or lunch from New Deli Yoga! Also very close to public transport which made it easy to navigate our way anywhere in the city.,1,0.9868,Positive
238.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,53,100.0,1,8.843473865964748,4.97,4.99,4.7,4.77,48651189,A lovely place to stay by the water,1,0.5859,Positive
149.0,4,3.0,1.0,5.0,31,0.0,0,8.155448061817273,4.6,4.73,4.71,4.59,14618013,"We loved Maximilian flat, it is very clean, modern, very confortable and very well located. It is closed to stores, restaurants, and the train station which is just steps away. Checkin and checkout process were smooth. My family and I had a great time. I recommend this place.",0,0.9421,Positive
182.0,6,1.0,1.0,3.0,43,91.0,0,4.871252294318258,4.67,4.75,4.85,4.55,46866971,Modern and cozy room for my family.<br/>I loved common spaces and neighborhood.,1,0.5994,Positive
180.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,43,100.0,1,4.206643579256427,4.89,4.88,4.94,4.67,37359998,Elisa’s place was so perfect for our stay!! It is in a prime location right next to a ton of restaurants and great bars (Clash). It’s easily walkable (5min) to multiple U-Bahn lines which made seeing the rest of the city easy as well.<br/>Great water pressure btw!!! <br/>The apartment was clean and as spacious as I have seen in such a good location. Highly highly recommend if you are looking to travel to Berlin!,0,0.9712,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,0,2.768868245510529,4.84,4.95,4.95,4.63,36584331,Prachtig appartement op een prachtige locatie. Fijne plek om een paar dagen te verblijven,1,0.0,Neutral
84.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,1,4.00787800065126,4.73,4.67,4.9,4.65,1282857,Apparemment très sympa et très bien placé. Une belle décoration et un bon confort. Recommandé à 100%,1,0.0,Neutral
147.0,6,1.0,1.0,4.0,22,99.0,0,2.353100516764864,4.78,4.68,4.84,4.64,30389555,"The place and location was great, clean and had good beds and shower. The highlight for me was the amazing, thoughtful and fast communication with the hosts. Can definitely recommend!",1,0.9719,Positive
77.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,34,100.0,1,2.8922606535545543,4.92,4.78,4.84,4.8,856313349603216852,"The apartment was very cozy and clean with a beautiful terrace. It was exactly as in the photos and we had everything we needed. Tina was a kind host and always available. Will definitely like to come back here on my next visit to Berlin, thank you for the stay.",1,0.9514,Positive
165.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,59,100.0,1,22.45533785958252,4.87,4.75,4.96,4.77,6733959,"This morning I said goodbye, with a heavy heart, to Antje’s lovely flat.  It’s a great place to stay for anyone who likes calm and space.  The flat is generously proportioned, extremely well equipped and beautifully decorated, with tasteful artefacts in every room.  And although it’s some distance from the city centre, the transport connections are extremely good.  (In fact, I found it more convenient than some places in Berlin that are much closer to the centre.)  I was there in the middle of winter, but could imagine it being an absolute delight when one can take advantage of the lovely garden.  Antje was a great host, always quick to respond to messages and very keen to make my stay as pleasant as possible.  Highly recommended!",1,0.9924,Positive
50.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,0,4.231097673854453,4.73,4.75,4.55,4.68,30384248,Na,1,0.0,Neutral
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,5.429459337365097,4.98,4.98,4.91,4.96,711975137721582244,"Erez’s place was as described, great facilities and good location 5-10 mins walk to S and U bahn. Erez was incredibly helpful with great recommendations for food.",1,0.9348,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,0,5.089878826396497,4.95,4.97,4.83,4.92,44525002,"I really enjoyed being at Tony’s. It was clean, amazing location, and very easy to communicate with her. I highly recommend it.",1,0.944,Positive
