77.0,3,1.0,0.0,3.0,30,98.0,1,12.36671538964168,4.76,4.86,4.55,4.77,26950491,"To be fair, super clean place, responsive host and place right next to the Sbahn so very well connected to the city. <br/>On the other hand, wifi was not stable at all. Another thing worth mentioning, the host was always commenting on anything possible that was a bit annoying for a short holiday stay.",1,0.9458,Positive
