95.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,0,4.691964222849626,4.76,4.77,4.81,4.67,28168852,"We loved the location, it was very close to a great little neighborhood with lots of great restaurants  and really accessible public transportation. The place itself was very clean with plenty of kitchen amenities. That being said, this is really a place for just 2 people(couple) because the pull out bed is very uncomfortable.",1,0.9291,Positive
