53.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,1,1.9136892540066155,4.82,4.73,4.95,4.74,851577798843640421,"We really enjoyed our stay at Roxanne and Kiril’s lovely place! It’s just as described and in a prime location - easy access to many other areas, on top of it having great places just outside to visit. Would definitely stay again if we’re ever in Berlin once more ✨",1,0.9595,Positive
236.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,76,100.0,1,1.390567313580942,4.83,4.84,4.96,4.76,1701332,"Everything others have said about this apartment is true. It's location is spot on, we walked easily to the majority of the tourist attractions from the apartment. The apartment itself was spotless, warm and extremely quiet which was great bearing in mind it's location.   The area has a really relaxed vibe and was a great  setting for shops ( both local and upmarket), bars and restaurants and there is a market 2 minutes away on a Thursday and Saturday. Although I didn't see our hosts they answered everything I asked promptly by email/text and I felt very comfortable  that if I needed anything on my trip they would sort out for me straight away.  If I go back to Berlin I would definitely stay in the same apartment. ",0,0.9814,Positive
87.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,10.082429401037324,4.86,4.86,4.77,4.78,731042640553523310,"Had a wonderful time! The place is ideal for a short stay while exploring Berlin, as it is quite small and cosy but still has a kitchen to prepare dinner after a long day out. Bakery, supermarket and train/subway station are within walking distance. The hosts were super nice and even stayed up late for us to be able to check in. Would recommend!",1,0.9548,Positive
