125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,11,100.0,0,4.355325714961062,4.67,4.72,4.88,4.71,7910127,"We had a very comfortable and enjoyable stay at Tobias's apartment. Clean, spacious for two and a very comfy bed. Easy to prepare meals with a decent sized kitchen! The apartment is in an excellent location with lots of trendy cafes and bars with a great transport link making it easy to explore Berlin. ",1,0.9739,Positive
97.0,2,1.0,1.0,0.0,23,100.0,0,1.0368255639209347,4.7,4.86,4.9,4.66,1141827850047916008,"We stayed in ‘Little’ - room 00:04<br/>It is very well placed for Alexanderplatz and Hackesher Market. <br/>The whole place felt very clean and modern and access to the communal kitchen, lounge, bar, and water was great for our stay. The room itself was perfect for our needs as a couple visiting Berlin for 3 nights. We were impressed by the simplicity and comfort of everything and would definitely stay again.",1,0.9661,Positive
