82.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,3.929915771235159,4.89,4.9,4.96,4.86,20660494,"Uta's apartment was very clean, warm and comfortable and just as expected.  The bathroom is small as indicated but was perfectly adequate for a short stay.  The kitchen has everything needed and was very functional.  We were able to store our clothes in the wardrobes and drawers so we didn't have to live out of suitcases.  The sitting room is nicely laid out for comfort and dining/laptop use.<br/>Any issues raised, were acknowledged and addressed very quickly by Uta, so we have no concerns about staying in this apartment again in the future.",1,0.9501,Positive
