190.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,99.0,0,2.757489559962004,4.87,4.8,4.93,4.74,1071654509606077535,"The loft is very well located and was super clean. Between the living room and the bedroom you'll find the kitchen, and there are glass door from and too each room. It's well suited for a couple, or a group of 4 people if it's a short trip. The appartment is on the ground floor.",1,0.8856,Positive
67.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,38,100.0,1,9.589987916493834,4.79,4.49,4.68,4.78,26546193,"Hans a été vraiment accueillant et très sympathique. il est prévenant et l'appartement correspondait au descriptif. il est situé à 15 minutes à pied de la gare, où de nombreux trains permettent de rejoindre le centre -ville très facilement.<br/>il n'y a pas de commerces à proximité car c'est un quartier résidentiel. il faut simplement faire les courses à Berlin.<br/>nous avons passé un très agréable séjour chez Hans!",1,0.0,Neutral
246.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,42,99.0,0,10.626655381583292,4.76,4.85,4.79,4.55,1292709267906366858,"We had an amazing stay at Noams place, everything was clean and the location was perfect!<br/>Can definitely recommend!",0,0.9059,Positive
126.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,98.0,1,1.1296896945466344,4.83,4.93,4.83,4.78,898530900032595096,"The place was really clean, and bob was very responsive and helpful. <br/>Overall I enjoyed staying there and it’s in a nice area as well",1,0.9437,Positive
290.0,4,3.0,2.0,4.0,61,90.0,0,5.391524126191458,4.97,4.85,4.81,4.73,1852328,"Staying at Li's apartment was one of the best Airbnb's experiences that I have ever had. I arrived there with three of my friends, and it actually felt like someone welcomed us to one's home.<br/>The apartment looks and feels even better than it do in the pictures. The design is very personal and unique, and feels cozy all around. Three comfortable bedrooms, two very comfortable bathrooms, spacious living room and well-equipped kitchen, huge balcony overlooking the park. <br/>The apartment was very well heated the whole time, and both shower and bath could supply hot water simultaneously without any problems. Free coffee and various kinds of teas, fruits and other things which you can hardly find in airbnb apartments these days. It all felt very generous and welcoming. <br/>Location was very good, close to the metro and the vibrant streets of Kreuzberg. The parks around are beautiful.<br/>Li was an amazing host. Correspondence was super friendly, accurate and fast. We all felt very lucky to have found such a great place to stay at, and we would love to stay there again next time we are in Berlin. ",0,0.9959,Positive
124.0,3,1.0,1.0,3.0,65,100.0,1,12.581113618062616,4.8,4.77,4.75,4.69,17581450,Very nice place to stay just near the castle!,1,0.5244,Positive
62.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,6.602459616756402,4.74,4.74,4.84,4.76,13704364,"1 month stay near central Berlin in June near Tiergarten, sehr güt! Paid a bit more to be near Centre plus 2 v.close U-Bahn stops (5+8 min walk) so getting into Brandenberg Tor einfach!<br/>Sabine’s apartment is your classic Berliner court-yarded apartment with wooden floors, high ceilings with large windows letting a lot of light. Neighbours quiet so got good night’s sleep all the stay. Edeka & Rewe supermarkets also close.<br/>Sabine is a good responsive host with a lot of local knowledge if you want any recommendations. Her dog Elouna has a lovely character too and this makes the place feel like a home.<br/>Will return one day as still a lot to discover and ja, ich bin ein Berliner jetzt!",1,0.9406,Positive
94.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,1.7669306902363546,4.88,4.91,4.98,4.78,9599108,"This flat is very nice, clean and conveniently located!<br/>We enjoyed very much!",1,0.8737,Positive
156.0,6,2.0,2.0,4.0,51,100.0,1,2.784593796049624,4.88,4.78,4.9,4.77,3378027,"We loved to stay in the flat.<br/>It is very cosy, and the street is a nice part of Prentzlauger Berg! <br/>Nour and Nassa was very helpfull and flexible!",0,0.8572,Positive
174.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,1,1.6592287277224604,4.91,4.92,4.94,4.76,39474542,Wir haben uns hier pudelwohl gefühlt. Zentral gelegen und doch ruhig. Geschmackvolle moderne Ausstattung. Die Kommunikation war nett und schnell. Gerne wären wir noch länger geblieben als eine Nacht. Wir werden das mit Sicherheit nachholen.,1,-0.8316,Negative
