59.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,50,100.0,1,6.553717964125431,4.89,4.8,4.82,4.82,45522353,"We really liked Ahmed's place, it's exactly as announced! Well located, right in front a beautifull park, walk distance from the most famous sightseeing and it is also near from train station and bus stop.",1,0.5081,Positive
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,0,1.0729754843495325,4.68,4.68,4.76,4.56,997794778761639504,"👍👍👍 Alles an der Unterkunft hat mir sehr gut gefallen! Natascha und Elisabeth sind super Freundlich, die Kommunikation hat schnell und problemlos geklappt. Ich werde sehr gerne wiederkommen! <br/>Danke für den schönen Aufenthalt!",1,0.0,Neutral
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,4.190972540353783,4.93,4.96,4.73,4.92,17688829,"This was a perfect stay from the beginning and throughout. Stefanie is an amazing host, really attentive, nice and always there to help you with anything you need. I totally recomment this to anybody coming to Berlin, not only the host will make your stay lovely but the location is also amazing.",1,0.9353,Positive
312.0,11,3.0,1.0,4.0,42,100.0,1,9.660413858650209,4.92,4.94,4.44,4.83,16237757,"100% satisfaction, good place, good contact, nothing missing",0,0.8621,Positive
349.0,6,2.0,2.0,5.0,53,100.0,1,2.231189737001253,4.94,4.94,4.92,4.67,618076074358675519,We had a wonderful stay at Frieda’s place. The location is excellent for exploring Prenzlauer Berg. A bus stops almost in front of the apartment which makes it easy to commute to other districts. The apartment is nice and comfortable. Our children were sad to leave and so were we. Love to come back.,0,0.9514,Positive
64.0,2,2.0,1.0,2.0,22,100.0,0,3.158943186526161,4.58,4.51,4.72,4.62,19406486,"Clean, comfortable place, close to public transportation <br/>Nice balcony for two and feeling of being at home in an actual apartment <br/>It's a bedroom and a couch for beds and one of the few places out there  with an actual shower and bath <br/>Looks and smells nice <br/>Guy was very nice to do business with",1,0.9022,Positive
44.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,10.003634322624707,4.71,4.72,4.65,4.61,8244352,"Judith fue muy amigable, incluso me recibió hablando en español ❤️. Me sentí siempre como en casa, mucha privacidad, la cama era muy cómoda, el balcón era muy bello y la habitación era exactamente como se veía en las fotos. También me tocaron unos excelentes vecinos. Si bien es un poco lejos del centro (mejor, porque solo escuchas el ruido de los pájaros), la conexión con el Tram es rápida, fácil, y en 20 minutos estás cerca del centro, incluso durante la noche. Sin dudas si vuelvo a Berlín, volveré con Judith!!",1,-0.6351,Negative
243.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,64,100.0,0,3.325586675460729,4.87,4.79,4.91,4.78,39533227,Perfect little crash pad for a busy weekend in Berlin; was a relief to come back to this plush sanctuary. So stylish and comfortable and amongst everything that is happening in the city with a gorgeous view. Great location and Kent was lovely and flexible with checking out. Really thoughtful nice host ~ thank you Kent can’t wait to stay again <3,1,0.9863,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,4,100.0,0,3.5820609796313554,4.8,4.71,4.65,4.78,1258253,Super Wohnung. Ruhig und sauber... Wir haben uns sehr wohl bei Andrea gefühlt. ,1,0.5994,Positive
63.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,0.0,0,8.094185531139052,4.43,4.58,4.69,4.36,14927090,Appartement bien placé et dans un environnement calme. <br/>Tout à fait adapté pour visiter Berlin sur plusieurs jours. <br/>Conforme à la description. <br/>Bonne communication avec la propriétaire.,1,0.0,Neutral
130.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,97.0,0,2.148340982642172,4.79,4.66,4.9,4.69,13838662,"Ottima posizione, ben arredato, strutture efficienti e comode. Un soggiorno perfetto",1,0.0,Neutral
136.0,2,0.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,1,1.977233020880486,4.91,4.93,4.72,4.73,533864,"Apartment is totally wonderful. More spacious than photographed, very comfortable for two people, very high ceilings and tons of natural light, the balcony is also quite spacious and generous. There’s also a little office space and a walk-in closet not pictured online. Excellent water pressure and very hot water. Beautifully maintained building. Loved the location. Very comfortable beds. Absolutely would stay again.",1,0.9679,Positive
145.0,8,4.0,2.0,5.0,35,100.0,0,12.008192425426463,4.44,4.33,4.75,4.04,1064342235550660801,Everything as described - and even though we were just two people using two of the four bedrooms it was among the best value we could find in Berlin when we were traveling. Flo and Friedl manage the expectations really well on their listing and the place was exactly as we thought it would be. Great location and value - quirky and clean place. Beds were comfortable and the shower was surprisingly great!  <br/>Very happy with our short stay overall and would happily return.,0,0.9876,Positive
40.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,11,98.0,0,2.4809600042725424,4.56,4.5,4.85,4.64,35816059,"Perfect location, professional staff and people there. Good value",1,0.8402,Positive
