161.0,10,4.0,2.0,4.0,25,100.0,1,7.731041071020152,4.6,4.72,4.48,4.57,2599765,"This is a really nice, spacious appartment with a good location close to the city centre. Parking is free in front of the house but there is also a parking garage further down the street. Hosts are very helpful! <br/><br/>The appartment is great for a groups of friends or large family, but be aware that it is not so ""private"" - two of the bedrooms are open. Also, it says there is a dishwasher but there isn't -  it's a washing machine. We would definetely consider staying here again. ",0,0.9656,Positive
112.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,17,100.0,0,4.426291566458374,4.61,4.4,4.69,4.51,7838754,The apartment is a perfect place to use as a base to explore Berlin and the surrounding area. There is a supermarket within a few minutes walk away as well as the tram stop which is just up the road. The train station is a slightly further walk away - say 8-10 minutes. There are a variety of good restaurants nearby.,1,0.7579,Positive
116.0,5,1.0,1.0,3.0,28,100.0,0,10.053768739007008,4.7,4.77,4.74,4.7,1166057732228100696,Empfehlenswert,1,0.0,Neutral
215.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,55,100.0,1,9.076307917104932,4.77,4.74,4.73,4.5,44223516,"Great place to stay! Close to public transport, nice facilities like a fitness room, sauna and indoor pool, very helpful and friendly staff, and pleasant residence to stay in.",1,0.9668,Positive
49.0,2,1.0,1.0,0.0,22,100.0,1,3.502702745823685,4.78,4.84,4.74,4.56,25735914,"The location is pretty prime and the host is kind and friendly. That being said the room was not set up for me to stay (I had to pull the bed out and set out the linens both nights I stayed). Additionally, one night after coming back after the time indicated (8pm), her children were in my room playing and her husband was not very friendly to me (he criticized me for being not economical for leaving the ventilation on in the bathroom to keep the humidity lower because a towel got more wet than I expected). Of course she apologized for not preparing the rooms for me. Last, the “kitchenette” with the boiler for water was covered in dust like it had not been cleaned in a long time. I felt the cleanliness other than the floors was not up to par. For the expensive price, and the fact that I could not be in the room readily all the time and abide by their curfews I hoped the place would feel more welcoming and clean for the time I was there.",1,0.9707,Positive
331.0,5,2.0,2.0,3.0,53,100.0,1,5.59894475162521,4.87,4.98,4.19,4.7,42786348,Lovely easy stay ! Would book again,0,0.7901,Positive
77.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,0,6.266793012378933,4.7,4.65,4.53,4.7,6264703,"David é um excelente anfitrião e o flat é ótimo. Ficamos muito bem nós 4, casal e dois adolescentes, o sofá cama é grande e muito confortável, excelente, o banho é muito bom também. A localização é segura e perto da parada de ônibus com fácil acesso ao centro de Berlim e também tem um Lidl próximo. Tivemos dias ótimos lá, muito obrigada David!!",1,0.0,Neutral
