95.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,0,0.7915420818247044,4.76,4.6,4.91,4.68,20205689,Asunto vastasi kuvausta. Sijainti hyvä lyhyt kävelymatk lähimmälle metroasemalle. Alexanderplatzillekin kävelee reilussa 10 minuutissa. Asunnon varustelu Ok. Kylppärissä olisi voinut olla perus suihkusaippuat. Edeka ruokakauppa aivan vieressä.,1,0.296,Positive
422.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,31,100.0,1,2.9093444057525217,5.0,5.0,5.0,4.71,1344788586014377169,"What an absolute treat of an apartment it was, we had a lovely time whilst we were there. Dorian and his friends were excellent in accomodating us with plenty of information prior to us coming over, a load of different recommendations as to what was nearby. The apartment was excellent to all four of us, providing plenty of space and a wonderful view of Kreuzberg. I can highly recommend this place!",0,0.9744,Positive
95.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,1,3.907468030579391,4.72,4.83,4.9,4.6,20943832,Mia's place was super cute. Easy check in and a nice location. There is a coffee shop downstairs and lots of restaurants/bars that you can walk to. Everything was clean.,1,0.936,Positive
76.0,4,1.0,1.5,2.0,60,100.0,1,3.624198275329287,4.85,4.91,4.81,4.69,2137277,"It was as always a pleasure to stay in this comfy and stylish place. Recommend highly. Great communication and support before, during and after stay. Thanks again!",1,0.9476,Positive
171.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,27,100.0,1,5.161708742534168,4.97,4.84,4.81,4.71,1049251357871161053,"Excelente estadia. Local bom com acesso fácil ao transporte público e acesso a toda a cidade.<br/>Limpo e organizado, Roman sempre muito atencioso.<br/>Voltaria com certeza.",1,0.0,Neutral
