60.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,18,100.0,0,10.02194221700588,4.78,4.89,4.68,4.69,321308,"We enjoyed our stay here in Berlin with a friend. The location is great, near shops to do the groceries and  buses stops, which are very convenient to reach the city core. The apartment is big, clean and well equipped. We were warmly welcomed, we do highly recommend this place !",1,0.9696,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,4.795405551149841,4.95,4.92,4.81,4.89,13243503,"This is a lovely place to stay in Berlin! Alex and Dianela were very friendly, welcoming, and helpful during my stay. The room was very spacious and sunny, and it was great to relax on the balcony in the morning. The location is good as the apartment is very close to a train station and there are some nice bars/cafes/restaurants nearby, but it's not too busy or touristy. Overall, excellent!",1,0.9668,Positive
123.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,32,100.0,0,5.086004020180417,4.79,4.88,4.78,4.75,7543419,Great place to stay! Easy to move around the city and Martin is great with recommendations for places around the city.,1,0.908,Positive
85.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,20,100.0,1,12.132524029038608,4.81,4.73,4.81,4.78,10644579,"Great value, spacious one room<br/>apartment.",1,0.7579,Positive
124.0,6,3.0,1.0,3.0,40,100.0,1,4.5882045696329525,4.73,4.63,4.58,4.58,606926,"Tolle, recht große Wohnung in toller Lage! Alles sauber und i.O.",0,0.0,Neutral
365.0,15,4.0,4.5,8.0,25,100.0,1,7.162089617709464,4.79,4.67,4.78,4.73,1838879,"Super Unterkunft mit sehr grosszügigen Zimmern. Auch der Gemeinschaftsraum bietet alles, was sich eine Gruppe wünscht - Beamer, Soundanlage, Tischfussball, grosser Esstisch und gut ausgerüstete Küche. <br/>Der Innenhof ist bei warmen Temperaturen ideal um in der Gruppe anzuhängen und die Zeit zu genissen. Achtung: Tagsüber teilt man sich den Platz mit einem Café, hat uns aber nie gestört. Wir haben sogar gerne von dem Angebot profitiert und den excellenten Kaffee und Kuchen genossen.<br/>Wir würden immer wieder gerne in die Remise kommen! ",0,-0.2714,Negative
89.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,7.289170629982721,4.87,4.77,4.77,4.8,533523,Lovely apartment in peaceful neighbourhood.  Great public transport links too.  Had a very enjoyable stay thank you!,1,0.9542,Positive
158.0,8,2.0,1.0,4.0,45,90.0,1,2.5113494269416043,4.79,4.75,4.78,4.65,665666969293201423,"Le logement était adéquate à nos attentes, très bien placé et facilement accessible, les lignes de transports principales sont très proches. Le quartier est calme et très sympathique, et la communication avec l'hôte très facile, merci.",0,0.0,Neutral
103.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,1,6.782182931571986,4.95,4.93,4.69,4.84,51181494,"A really cool flat - well located for seeing some of Berlin's best independent bars, restaurants and open spaces.",1,0.8464,Positive
306.0,8,3.0,2.0,5.0,44,100.0,1,6.90827181205849,4.86,4.8,4.85,4.68,311703,"We had a really nice stay, everything was great, the apartment, it's location as well as the weather... 🤩👍🏼<br/>On behalf of our group, big thank you for being a wonderful host!",0,0.9412,Positive
50.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,22,100.0,0,13.185867352119894,4.6,4.53,4.64,4.46,17819100,"Wonderful experience, thank you so much :)",1,0.8583,Positive
151.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,94.0,0,3.1018817858877528,4.67,4.77,4.78,4.52,721527807549293451,"The room is great and the location couldn't be better. You're super well connected to every other place in Berlin. However, the entry process is fully automated, and there's an AI that contacts you. Other than the fact that it's impersonal, which is just a matter of preference, what I didn't like is that most of the time when you ask questions it just doesn't understand and keeps sending you back to the entry instructions. But as I said, it's really a great option in terms of the room itself and of the location, I would choose it anytime when coming back to Berlin.",1,0.8534,Positive
156.0,6,2.0,1.0,5.0,41,96.0,0,6.1770612336798365,4.42,4.39,4.7,4.29,27018621,"Good location, close to a lot of great locations and bars. <br/>The appartment layout itself is great for 4 people, but would be pretty uncomfortable for 6. <br/>The kitchen is okay, but you have to double check the cutlery/dishes as some of them weren't clean. <br/>The communication can be slow at times and unclear, especially if you need a change of sheets/towels during a long stay",0,0.6011,Positive
98.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,1,3.617893966015014,4.71,4.68,4.85,4.56,43466060,"Das Appartement ist klein aber funktional und bietet alles, was man für einen kurzen Aufenthalt bietet. Pluspunkte waren definitiv ein super bequemes Bett und ein Fernseher mit Netflix, die Küchenzeile war soweit auch ausreichend ausgestattet um ab und an mal eine Kleinigkeit zu kochen.<br/>Die Kommunikation verlief stets reibungslos. Ein hilfreiches Detail ist auch ein kleines Booklet auf dem Tisch mit allen Infos zur Unterkunft, Kontaktinformationen sowie Informationen zur Umgebung.<br/>Ich würde auf jeden Fall wiederkommen :)",1,-0.2263,Negative
85.0,2,1.0,1.0,4.0,40,100.0,0,22.758962355015388,5.0,4.94,4.75,4.81,50337519,Alojamiento muy limpio. Totalmente equipado. Anfitriones muy amables.Ubicado en un vecindario muy tranquilo. Supermercado y tiendas cerca .Buena conexión con el centro de la ciudad y también con el aeropuerto. <br/>Estancia totalmente recomendable.,1,0.0,Neutral
406.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,52,100.0,1,10.4862063301987,4.97,4.94,4.97,4.83,1046047893342301220,Wir waren zum dritten Mal in der Wohnung und haben uns wieder super wohl gefühlt. Wir sind sehr gerne Gast bei Antonia. Sie ist eine tolle Gastgeberin und die Wohnung ist sehr sehr schön. Wir kommen sehr gerne wieder.,0,0.0,Neutral
76.0,2,0.0,3.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,3.016097343290094,4.91,4.84,4.95,4.78,44384926,"Super céntrico y limpio el lugar, posee metro cerca del hospedaje, la anfitriona muy simpática y nos ayudo a ubicarnos en el metro, 100% recomendado",1,0.5994,Positive
95.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,54,100.0,1,5.879887825868721,4.96,4.98,4.91,4.83,31711514,호스트와 같이 머무르는 공간이지만 개인 욕실도 있고 항상 조용하셔서 편하게 머무를 수 있었다.<br/>중앙역에서 도보로 10분 정도밖에 안 걸리고 집 앞에 밤까지 하는 슈퍼도 있어서 위치도 좋았다. 무엇보다 숙소가 정말 청결해서 좋다.,1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,1,5.797357429941702,4.64,4.58,4.9,4.49,29172413,"Great apartment with great hosts, who were highly attentive and responsive all the way through our stay. Apartment is very clean and stylish, fully packed with anything a traveller might need. Location couldn't be better with Ostkreuz station being 5 min away, which can get you anywhere you want in Berlin. Overall, great experience, thanks!",1,0.9645,Positive
77.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,1,7.5529282602310275,4.81,4.84,4.6,4.69,1346757,"Bella casa, spaziosa per 2 persone e ben arredata. Francesco è una persona gentile e disponibile. ",1,0.0,Neutral
111.0,3,1.0,1.5,1.0,51,100.0,0,2.5346297667509567,4.84,4.79,4.89,4.58,52149143,Amazing location! Great appartment!,1,0.8585,Positive
187.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,1,1.4503062227335417,4.87,4.79,4.93,4.76,1094269515845154731,"Very nice place, as described!",1,0.5244,Positive
156.0,6,2.0,2.0,4.0,51,100.0,1,2.784593796049624,4.88,4.78,4.9,4.77,3378027,"Our stay at Nassa's flat was absolutely perfect. It was pretty much exactly as it looked in the pictures: bright, airy, high ceilings and plenty of kitchenware etc. The flat is in a great part of town and is handy for the city centre. There are several amazing cafes and restaurants very nearby and an aldi about 10 minutes walk away if you wanna just cook from home. It rained one day we were staying there and when one of the umbrellas they'd left for us turned out to be broken, they immediately found us a new one! We'd absolutely stay here again.",0,0.945,Positive
104.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,0,2.597436525384142,4.85,4.66,4.94,4.72,251486,Wir haben uns sehr wohlgefühlt in der Wohnung. Super Lage und Gegend. Gerne nächstes Mal wieder!,1,0.636,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,1.3773060525895495,4.72,4.84,4.91,4.66,1461489656921679773,"place was clean and in a good area, but very dark. the hotel room itself is very small and it’s just dark, but i mean the whole hotel is dark. overall it was okay and worked for us.",1,0.631,Positive
91.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,26,100.0,0,7.579291414010911,4.61,4.57,4.89,4.6,15868988,"Eine perfekt gelegene Wohnung für einen Kurztrip nach Berlin. <br/>Die Lage ist ideal in Nähe der S-Bahn Bellevue, viele gute Lokale in der Nähe, auch Cafés fürs Frühstück. Die Unterkunft ist nicht top-modern, dafür sehr sauber, sehr ruhig und mit sehr nettem Kontakt. Wir können Sie nur empfehlen und kommen auch gerne wieder.",1,-0.128,Negative
115.0,5,1.0,1.0,3.0,49,100.0,1,5.871560485458869,4.83,4.77,4.61,4.65,48181556,"great space, super location and lovely hosts- ideal air bnb!",1,0.9476,Positive
98.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,16,90.0,1,10.994483825646318,4.91,4.97,4.86,4.85,6035999,Toller Aufenthalt,1,0.0,Neutral
68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,13,87.0,0,7.867349248126775,4.54,4.66,4.52,4.53,3970161,"Es war alles super, gute Kommunikation, Zimmer perfekt als Startpunkt für Ausflüge in die Stadt.",1,-0.5994,Negative
76.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,99.0,0,2.2563613563655625,4.33,4.51,4.69,4.29,37616627,It was advertised as expected. Small but had all you’d need. Location seemed good with lots to offer. <br/>I wouldn’t suggest staying here when it’s hot outside though. It was absolutely unbearable inside with it being so hot outside. We left early after not being able to sleep here. Maybe a fan would help? There was no airflow at all. <br/>Opening the window wasn’t helpful and also people were up being extremely loud all night at the train station directly across the street.,1,0.9052,Positive
101.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,22,100.0,0,7.249820268593237,4.68,4.65,4.22,4.46,52967492,Wir waren sehr zufrieden mit der Wohnung. <br/>Außerdem hat Kathrin auf einen Fehler von uns sehr kulant reagiert.,1,0.0,Neutral
44.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,28,99.0,0,1.5462841842625876,4.63,4.69,4.62,4.62,1564917,"Not bad, people are nice n helpful.",1,0.8151,Positive
125.0,4,3.0,1.0,2.0,41,100.0,0,10.396055739505224,4.92,4.96,5.0,4.85,5416389,"Fantastic apartment right next to Savignyplatz train station on the S-bahn. Super convenient to get around town, cool area with lots of restaurants, bars and cafes. Andreas' communication was first rate and the apartment itself was great: large living room and master bedroom with two smaller bedrooms so plenty of space! Lots of light, cool furnishings. Thanks Andreas.",1,0.9606,Positive
68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,3.194253694245239,4.93,4.95,4.89,4.86,81081,Couldn’t reccomend the apartment and hosts more :),1,0.5095,Positive
55.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,1,1.4704282742450985,4.92,4.86,4.98,4.9,51669381,"Vielen Dank für die aufmerksame Gastfreundschaft! Eine tolle Gegend mitten in Berlin! Und dabei ist das Zimmer absolut ruhig und sauber. Hilfreiche Tipps und angenehmes Gespräch und vor allem immer schnell erreichbar!<br/>Ordentliche Wohnung, einfach zu erreichen und ruhig. Einfach top! Danke :-)",1,-0.453,Negative
419.0,14,4.0,2.0,6.0,49,100.0,1,5.961083106152229,4.98,4.95,4.56,4.84,44472274,Todo estuvo perfecto! Y siempre estuvieron pendientes de los mensajes.,0,0.3802,Positive
31.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,100.0,1,12.720083248666349,4.78,4.69,4.54,4.73,24154046,Ich habe auf meinem Berlintrip 2 Nächte bei Phuong und Martin verbracht. Beide waren super freundlich und haben mir schon vor meiner Ankunft hilfreiche Tipps zur Anreise gegeben. Auch auf Empfehlungen der Beiden war Verlass. Das Zimmer war sauber und süß eingerichtet. Die Lage ist ebenfalls gut und mit der Bahn braucht man keine 20 Minuten ins Zentrum. Ich würde jeder Zeit wiederkommen und bedanke mich herzlich!,1,-0.8439,Negative
203.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,47,100.0,1,1.0082912762193283,4.91,4.93,4.95,4.72,5494100,Carolins place is lovely and the location is perfect for getting around Berlin . The apartment was very cool and spotless with plenty of room for the four of us .<br/>There is only a few tiny things I think would improve the apartment and those are more comfortable Sofas and   better quality pillows but we had a great stay and Carolin was a wonderful host <br/>Thank you,0,0.97,Positive
59.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,0,2.3819185302817485,4.79,4.34,4.9,4.77,15850068,"Very centrally located in one of the most vibrant Berlin neighbourhoods. <br/>The room is located in a very charming house, it is very spacious, and although it lacks daily light, it is very pleasant and it has many lamps that one can use to adjust the lighting. Bed is very comfortable, and work area/ desk are quite comfortable and spacious as well. In front there is a bike parking area, and all the great cafes and restaurants are walk-distance away. Highly recommended for both long-term and short-term stays.",1,0.9796,Positive
82.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,5.189340223814515,4.79,4.85,4.83,4.69,1033506,"Hübsche, kleine Wohnung, sauber, hat alles Nötige für ein paar Tage, kann ich nur empfehlen.",1,0.0,Neutral
84.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,47,100.0,1,5.089187673529073,4.94,4.96,4.96,4.85,1757613,Apostolos ist ein sehr angenehmer und freundlicher Mensch. Er ist sehr zuverlässig und diese Wohnung Ist ein Traum.ich würde jederzeit wieder bei ihm unterkommen!!!,1,0.0,Neutral
94.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,0,7.207149198453504,4.14,4.1,4.32,4.19,818630719501735634,"Great place to stay, lots of restaurants and shops to buy from. Great Wifi. Overall what you need you will find here.",1,0.8481,Positive
79.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,100.0,0,2.031037950309696,4.9,4.89,4.94,4.82,751825079782398231,"Sehr schöne Wohnung; es war alles wie beschrieben; Christoph und Familie sehr nett und zuvorkommend. Die Wohnung ist super gelegen und sehr gut mit Tram etc zu erreichen. Tram Haltestelle ist vor der Tür, dadurch ist es auch nachts nie wirklich ruhig - nur als Hinweis für Menschen mit leichtem Schlaf. Ansonsten kann ich die Unterkunft sehr empfehlen.",1,-0.8316,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,0,3.9073828934468455,4.52,4.5,4.84,4.59,26351609,We only booked for one night but had a great experience. The location is convenient and the host was very nice,1,0.8954,Positive
365.0,15,4.0,4.5,8.0,25,100.0,1,7.162089617709464,4.79,4.67,4.78,4.73,1838879,Just perfect! Super nice house wonderfully furnished. A very comfortable and charming place. We will sure repeat!,0,0.9772,Positive
62.0,1,2.0,1.5,4.0,54,100.0,0,7.69016531635679,4.71,4.86,4.46,4.56,769334,"Gute Lage, hervorragende Ausstattung - alles bestens!",1,0.0,Neutral
172.0,8,2.0,1.0,4.0,31,100.0,1,2.87994778280774,4.8,4.75,4.88,4.73,30295,Great comfortable apartment n a nice area with great transport at the door. Well equipped for our family of four.<br/>Really good communication from the host which was appreciated.,0,0.9705,Positive
422.0,16,7.0,5.0,10.0,55,100.0,1,6.474155287757895,4.93,4.86,4.66,4.85,13666450,"Der Aufenthalt in Berlin war sehr schön! Werner hat sehr schnell geantwortet, es hat alles super geklappt. Für eine grosse Gruppe (wir waren 16) ist die Unterkunft perfekt.<br/>Alle interessanten Orte sind vom Airbnb aus sehr gut zu erreichen!",0,-0.6688,Negative
190.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,52,100.0,1,5.999075895235788,4.78,4.8,4.54,4.7,3242577,"Sebastian's flat was beautiful and located very close to a metro stop making it extremely easy to get around the city. He was easy to communicate with and have some great tips for things to do. The neighborhood is relatively quiet, so not great for nightlife. And just be sure to  check in before late check-in.  ",0,0.9617,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,1,5.269817323835547,4.98,4.98,4.75,4.89,821670157069145247,"Very good place and Matteo is really nice , close to the metro and easy to get around",1,0.8476,Positive
419.0,6,3.0,2.0,4.0,73,100.0,1,1.4254755529643226,4.98,4.98,4.94,4.8,50998500,great stay,0,0.6249,Positive
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,51,99.0,1,3.0757283324702183,4.8,4.74,4.82,4.5,33792196,"Super logement. En tant qu'architecte, l'histoire du projet et du bâtiment sont très intéressante.<br/>On y trouve les commerces qu'il faut à proximité.<br/>Il est situé dans une zone calme mais très proche des lieux plus animés.<br/>Très bonne situation par rapport aux transport en communs (métro et bus à trois minutes à pied).<br/>On a testé la terrasse en toiture pour l'apéro. Parfait.<br/>Bagagerie gratuite et dans le bâtiment, ce qui est très bien aussi.<br/>Merci à l'équipe de miniloft et à Mathew!",1,0.636,Positive
242.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,27,100.0,1,3.959947518856667,4.89,4.86,4.86,4.84,1050552008603289410,"We stayed in Mia’s place for 4 nights. <br/>Everything was great. Lots of amenities, clear check in instructions, clean and tidy, very welcoming. <br/>Super close to a U-bahn station and a Tram station. <br/>We loved Mia’s place and recommend it very much if you’re looking for a big apartment.",0,0.9583,Positive
373.0,12,4.0,2.0,14.0,30,100.0,1,2.6480538372543863,4.93,4.9,4.93,4.81,504259,"Alexandra was a fantastic host. She met us at the place and gave us a quick tour and was available after if needed. Luckily we didn't really need to get in touch with her :) <br/>The space is really cool and the pictures describe it well. The location is absolutely fantastic, in the middle of Prenzlauerberg. Easy access to public transportation just a few blocks away and lots of cute restaurants and cafes in walking distance. We loved the pizza place across the street and Benedicts for breakfast.",0,0.9778,Positive
134.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,1,1.205664913522738,4.79,4.61,4.92,4.72,30527210,"Clean , and tidy place <br/>Highly recommended",1,0.5423,Positive
113.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,28,100.0,0,8.005229742563792,4.63,4.49,4.83,4.49,975500812751010040,Super,1,0.5994,Positive
64.0,3,2.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,7.079717957334195,5.0,5.0,4.97,5.0,1202907376372166581,"Der Aufenthalt bei Armin war sehr angenehm. Armin war sehr hilfsbereit  bei der Anreise mit den Tipps, wie man am besten ankommt (wegen dem Streik).<br/>Lockerer unkomplizierter Umgang. <br/>Die Wohnung war wie Beschrieben, es fehlte an nichts. <br/>Was besonders gut war, dass Bus, U-Bahn e.t.c. gut zu Fuß zu erreichen war und die Lage trotzdem ruhig ist.",1,-0.9761,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,1,2.4282218534972566,4.76,4.72,4.76,4.67,1414395977088158733,"Great hotel for a bargain, spotless, helpful staff, cool vibe and a great bar at the top. Loved my stay here!",1,0.9642,Positive
293.0,6,2.0,1.5,3.0,47,100.0,1,2.826856216058209,4.87,4.82,4.89,4.73,83614,"My family of four spent a week in Louis's flat and it was perfect for us!  Lots of space, a very well equipped kitchen (the nicest pans and knives I have ever encountered in an Airbnb) and somehow the street was lively during the day and 100% quiet at night. Louis was super responsive and even helped arrange to have some groceries waiting for us on arrival.   Highly recommended.",0,0.9637,Positive
121.0,6,1.0,1.0,4.0,23,99.0,0,4.460781901528047,4.74,4.58,4.55,4.63,28248485,"Great place for those looking for this type of accommodation, nothing fancy but practical and easy, with all the basics and clean sheets and towels. <br/>A little smell of humidity when entering but I got used to it after a while. Heating is turned off in June but the nights were cold so I had to grab two blankets. <br/>Also please note: do not leave any valuables in your car if you park near the Grolitzer, my car got broken into. Not the host's fault of course and it is a relatively safe area but there is theft.",1,0.9077,Positive
67.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,0,14.326756885017558,4.82,4.85,4.81,4.64,29453880,Cet appartement est conforme à ce qui était annoncé sur Airbnb.,1,0.0,Neutral
113.0,6,2.0,2.0,3.0,31,100.0,1,1.0852899765964672,4.63,4.81,4.85,4.6,8822071,"The apartment is located within a very short walking distance of 2 U-Bahn station which made getting around Berlin so easy.  The area is pleasant, mostly residential but - as in all of Berlin - there is building work in the vicinity, although it did not disturb us over a weekend.  <br/>The apartment was very clean, just as described and worked for 2 couples as we each had our own WC and shower. The beds were comfortable and the kitchen equipped with all we needed.<br/>There are cafes and restaurants on Inselstrasse, although some were not open at the weekends.  We ate at the Italian restaurant - Dolcette - which was excellent, but busy so book ahead for a Saturday!  The Bakery by the Museum U-bahn was also very good!",0,0.9794,Positive
140.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,1,1.5130716954922565,4.89,4.91,4.94,4.75,2394897,"Sehr tolle Wohnung: klasse gelegen, ruhig, sonnig, sauber. Kommunikation mit Verda war auch einwandfrei und sehr nett. Ich empfehle das Airbnb herzlist weiter!",1,-0.636,Negative
208.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,0,2.314204124898978,4.62,4.68,4.87,4.55,1273930,Ubicación privilegiada <br/>Tranquilidad<br/>Cercanía a transportes públicos,1,0.0,Neutral
