24.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,12.219925420394336,4.6,4.31,4.86,4.72,1274387,"This apartment was build perhaps around the 50s or the 60s. This place feels like history and I really liked the opportunity to sleep inside. It was pleasant, clean, the owner - Christian - gave us everything we asked for. He was very helpful and friendly. You should have in mind that the Wi-Fi is kind of discontinuous and unstable.",1,0.9566,Positive
