59.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,0,2.3819185302817485,4.79,4.34,4.9,4.77,15850068,"Very nice, artistic place to stay. Alexander is  very chill and the location is great! Definitely would recommend to anyone",1,0.9133,Positive
158.0,5,1.0,1.0,3.0,34,100.0,1,1.1883222668954112,4.86,4.88,4.96,4.78,16152597,"Kristian’s place was absolutely perfect for our long weekend in Berlin. The interior was beautiful, clean, and just as described. The location was also so great and incredibly close to lots of different transport links. Also plenty of cute cafes, restaurants, and bars nearby. Kristian and Peggy were also very responsive and helpful which meant everything was easy and smooth. Would definitely stay here again!",1,0.9843,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,36,100.0,0,0.7567571024449841,4.81,4.96,4.84,4.66,493539,Marius is a perfect host and his flat makes you feel like home or...even better :),1,0.9022,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,14,100.0,0,6.068151934988203,4.88,4.76,4.85,4.78,20767601,This was my first Airbnb experience and I really loved it. Ruediger's place is comfy and clean. I 100% recommend it.,1,0.8553,Positive
135.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,35,100.0,0,4.656801244201789,4.56,4.67,4.39,4.4,42981075,"Enjoyed our stay. The apartment has lots of natural light, is comfortable and spacious and is well equipped.  Close to trams and buses so easy to get to other areas.  Hosts are fabulous .",0,0.9541,Positive
122.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,45,100.0,1,15.46531196615534,4.86,4.83,4.81,4.75,19499351,"Wir haben uns wohl gefühlt. Es war alles wie beschrieben.  Besonderes Highlight war die Sauna. Man sollte bei der Buchung lediglich wissen, dass das 2. Schlafzimmer im unteren Bereich das Durchgangszimmer zum Bad ist, falls man zu viert anreist. <br/>Gute Verkehrsverbindungen in unmittelbarer Umgebung.",1,-0.93,Negative
66.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,11.895693716152222,4.82,4.74,4.91,4.75,34405060,"Die Kommunikation mit Uwe war unkompliziert, Uwe war sehr bemüht und immer schnell zu erreichen.<br/>Die Unterkunft ist wie beschrieben. Nichts zu beanstanden und gerne wieder.",1,-0.9136,Negative
232.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,36,100.0,1,4.6007891860802905,4.91,4.88,4.88,4.82,1260623860135528737,"absolutely brilliant stay, amazing place, great food recommendations, couldn't fault a thing. Thanks Natasha!",0,0.9246,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,1,4.625473353777098,4.96,4.84,4.77,4.79,37831600,"Elias war sehr freundlich und hat sich Zeit genommen, die Wohnung zu zeigen und auch gern Tipps für die Umgebung zu geben. Es war alles wirklich sehr ordentlich, sauber und ich habe mich wohl gefühlt. Die Lage ist super um mobil zu sein, die U-Bahn ist quasi gleich vor der Tür. Die Umgebung ist schon sehr belebt und mir war es zu viel Trubel, das ist aber natürlich ganz individuell. Die Straße in der sich die Wohnung befindet ist jedoch recht ruhig , sodass man gut schlafen kann :)",1,-0.9873,Negative
75.0,2,0.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,0,3.526516085976624,4.65,4.55,4.92,4.4,922893196670431337,Hat alles super geklappt und die wohnung war gut gelegen und sehr ruhig.,1,-0.5994,Negative
138.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,0,1.922981274848583,4.58,4.44,4.73,4.44,546417520591682575,Good communication with Markus<br/>Nice localisation to spend a few days in Berlin,1,0.4404,Positive
79.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,33,50.0,0,20.17630463210002,4.97,4.91,4.92,4.86,28142296,"I really enjoyed my stay at Karin & Bernd's flat! It's in a quiet area, surrounded by trees and in easy walking distance of the Grunewald forest, but it's still easy to get into the city centre if you want. The flat itself is also very quiet, thanks to the double glazing which also keeps it nice and warm. It's also very well equipped, plus Karin & Bernd are great hosts, so I definitely recommend a stay here and hope to come back myself!",1,0.991,Positive
164.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,46,94.0,0,7.131273504704622,4.67,4.77,4.8,4.51,49086780,"The place was near shopping, did transportation, good location for historical sites.",1,0.4404,Positive
145.0,6,2.0,2.5,4.0,43,100.0,1,1.8267932703234075,4.89,4.74,4.92,4.82,48864380,"Appartamento molto ben posizionato. Abbiamo raggiunto i luoghi classici di Berlino a piedi. Molto comodo. Quartiere bellissimo, tranquillo  e molto easy. L'alloggio è spazioso. Nonostante si trovi in un piano semi interrato,  abbastanza luminoso.",0,0.4404,Positive
48.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,63,90.0,1,12.572987688254685,4.88,4.85,4.71,4.79,47488393,"beautiful - clean - natural - lovely - space!<br/>a lovely relaxed part of Berlin - perfect for anyone who likes being in nature or enjoys a nice garden view. beautiful beautiful nature, woodsy area that is very close to the house. Felt very safe here! Willi is friendly and accommodating, a chill host. gorgeous garden, clean bathroom, nice bath-tub. felt like I was staying at a palace or a spa!<br/>friendly hosts, willing to help with any questions, yummy coffee<br/>Thanks Willi and Vanessa for a wonderful stay!!",1,0.9968,Positive
305.0,9,2.0,2.0,9.0,29,99.0,0,8.905377534529459,4.3,4.5,4.71,4.41,45854967,Alles war gut. Wir waren sehr zufrieden. Nur der Gang hat oft nach essen gerochen aufgrund des Restaurants nebenan.,0,-0.5994,Negative
103.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,0,4.179832601624142,4.59,4.65,4.31,4.44,45809645,"The apartment is nice, in a quiet place of Berlin. It is very close to a bus stop which brings you to the town center. Check-in is available even at late hours with a key safe wich is very comfortable for tourists.",1,0.796,Positive
79.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,0,5.934479669817198,5.0,4.75,5.0,5.0,1471139176126405023,"We absolutely loved our stay :)) , the hosts are very friendly, warm and fun people. The room is big and cosy, just like coming home. The location is close to a lot of nice (vegan and vegetarian) restaurants and easy to travel through. We would definitely come back !",1,0.9731,Positive
64.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,9,100.0,0,7.374471271637034,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,15245252,We felt there like we were staying at our friend's apartment. Thanks a lot!,1,0.69,Positive
201.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,54,100.0,1,1.3558603428081426,4.88,4.9,4.77,4.74,13755615,"Nous avons passé un agréable séjour à Berlin  dans cet appartement. Situé à deux pas de l'U-Bahn dans un quartier calme,  il est parfait comme pied à terre. Hygiène et couchage irréprochables, bien équipé, je recommande ce logement sans hésitation.",0,0.0,Neutral
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,13.088231838082732,4.89,4.76,4.67,4.83,18195157,"Really cozy room, check in and check out was really easy going which is nice! Location is great and very close to the train station!",1,0.8928,Positive
226.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,1,5.186577238960229,4.7,4.74,4.58,4.65,28533803,Sehr sehr schönes Zimmer mit sehr großer Dachterasse! Matratzen und Decken für draußen waren auch bereitgestellt im Zimmer und die Aussicht ist umwerfend. Empfehle ich jedem der ein kurz Trip nach Berlin macht oder ein Date-Night mit seiner Freundin!,1,-0.6688,Negative
68.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,50,100.0,0,6.026516407626963,4.74,4.76,4.48,4.7,6808626,"The location is very close to the M2 tram station Rottenbach and you can reach Alexanderplatz in about 25'.<br/>The little cottage is great, equipped with everything you might need, including toothpaste and toothbrushes if you forgot yours. We only missed our slippers to feel like home :)<br/>The accomodations are homey and the yard is wonderful, well kept and clean.<br/>There is a great discount supermarket just around the corner and you needn't buy from anywhere else.<br/>There is little interaction so you will not feel overlywatched or under supervision.<br/>There is a mutual trust between the owner and the guests so please don't take anything you don't need...others might appreciate it.",1,0.9578,Positive
44.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,1,4.948763181664733,4.54,4.16,4.79,4.58,22736888,"Louis's place is in a great location! Just a couple blocks near the metro stop in a nice neighborhood with lots of shops and cafes nearby. The bedroom was very spacious, and he facilitated our check in nicely, allowing us to drop our luggage off early. The kitchen wasn't spotless, but our bedroom space was clean.",1,0.7678,Positive
132.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,27,100.0,0,4.462782849034317,4.86,4.89,4.8,4.81,10103689,"Good location, approachable to different sites, flexible check-in and check-out time. The host is professional, nice.",1,0.765,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,1,1.7276998357571232,4.73,4.81,4.84,4.67,1029536206861461447,"Sehr freundliche Mitarbeiter, schickes Zimmer, ruhige Lage nach hinten raus. Wir haben zum Glück einen der wenigen Tiefgaragenplätze bekommen können für eine Zusatzgebühr. Uns hat alles sehr gefallen.",1,0.0,Neutral
79.0,4,1.0,1.5,2.0,60,100.0,1,3.902646890139105,4.84,4.88,4.9,4.71,8386451,This is a chic modern flat in a great part of Berlin near Kreuzberg. Great for food and drink and quick access to all parts of Berlin and major attractions . If you are a parkrun tourist it’s right there at the end of the street,1,0.9201,Positive
365.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,58,100.0,0,3.2154915941596065,5.0,5.0,4.96,4.86,48655374,The apartment was as beautiful in person as it was in the photos. You can tell the host put an insane amount of love and money into the details of this home. It's also conveniently located near a food market and delicious coffee shop. Easy to get around and felt super safe.,1,0.9628,Positive
145.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,48,100.0,0,4.281206110490364,4.8,4.53,4.83,4.55,19727214,"Pablo’s place was great: spacious, clean, had a lot of appliances and was close to the subway. Pablo is easy to communicate with and a great host! Would stay at his place again.",1,0.9336,Positive
165.0,6,1.0,1.0,6.0,27,99.0,0,1.4908853753728162,4.61,4.55,4.6,4.57,15135834,"Von Ankunft über Aufenthalt bis zum Check-Out war alles super einfach und angenehm. Das Personal war sehr freundlich und hilfsbereit. Da unser Zug erst sehr spät ging, durften wir unser Gepäck in einem Abgesperrten Raum abstellen. Und egal wie oft wir nochmal ans Gepäck mussten, das Personal was immer freundlich! <br/>Danke für den unkomplizierten und angenehmen Aufenthalt. :)",0,-0.2942,Negative
151.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,28,97.0,0,3.918641789625612,4.72,4.74,4.79,4.58,11450419,"Schöne Wohnung für Familie. Leider gibt's dort keine Parkplätze, bzw nur für 2€ pro Stunde, was uns anders vermittelt wurde.<br/>Kontakt mit Stefan bei Fragen hat gut geklappt.",1,0.0,Neutral
87.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,11,100.0,0,5.7450396008039535,4.73,4.45,4.91,4.64,53332699,"Max was very available and it was very easy to communicate with him.<br/>The location is really convenient. S-bahn, U-bahn and supermarkets are nearby. The appartment doesn't include the bedroom, but we were very comfortable in the sofa bed set up in the spacious living room, and the whole place is really charming and sunny. The kitchen was also well equipped and had natural light. It could have been a little cleaner, as we found dust here and there, but overall it was a good place to stay :)",1,0.9862,Positive
82.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,0,8.478940305253754,5.0,4.86,4.93,5.0,1446993798027111825,"Der Aufenthalt bei Tatjana & Co war eine wunderbare Erfahrung ! Man lebt auf dem süßen Boot, was alles hat, was man benötigt und man kann morgens traumhaft auf der ""Terasse"" sitzen und das Treiben und die Natur auf der Bucht beobachten und Abends den Sonnenuntergang genießen. Außerdem ist man fußläufig super schnell in der Stadt und auch der Bus ist nur ein paar Meter entfernt.<br/>Die Kommunikation war super entspannt und schnell. Eine absolute Empfehlung.",1,-0.636,Negative
340.0,7,3.0,2.0,6.0,70,100.0,1,3.241255499524776,4.81,4.97,4.79,4.66,176342,"the living space was high quality finishes...cabinets, bathrooms, all high end fixtures.  furniture and beds were nice.    Please read all the guest requirements including garbage requirements so that you are not surprised.  washer and dryer are in a shared common area of building and require a fee.  Nino is kind and a good host.  The space was quiet and we felt safe.",0,0.9329,Positive
422.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,34,100.0,1,3.493881504023501,4.97,4.9,4.9,4.71,663684201927336298,"I loved this place so much! Spacious rooms, lots of light, super central yet quiet, amazing and quirky and loving decor, a consciously stocked kitchen… check in and check out was so easy and Ronen was super helpful and kind. Location unbeatable. Top score.",0,0.9854,Positive
366.0,6,3.0,2.0,4.0,44,100.0,1,4.24670072100672,4.87,4.96,4.51,4.72,16245894,"Mooi appartement dichtbij metrostation. Het appartement was schoon en verzorgd. Fijne bedden en een complete keuken. Het contact met de verhuurder was fijn, ze reageerde altijd heel snel op onze berichten.",0,0.0,Neutral
103.0,1,1.0,0.0,1.0,11,100.0,0,1.652388057808875,4.42,4.64,4.62,4.3,51549694,"A great place, super clean and exactly as described. Good neighbourhood and friendly staff. Recommend!",1,0.9617,Positive
140.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,91.0,0,4.871252294318258,4.72,4.78,4.85,4.58,46812239,Top Lage im Epizentrum eines Ausgeh- und Feierbezirks und das zu einem sehr günstigen Preis.,1,0.2023,Positive
179.0,5,1.0,1.0,2.0,63,100.0,0,8.789833766943357,4.78,4.9,4.66,4.52,243057,"Arne and Ute were very helpful, flexible and friendly. We had a great time in Berlin, and the location is not that far away from the liveliness of Berlin... The apartment was very high tech and new, and if we needed anything Arne and Ute was just next door (the apartment is connected to theres, but with it´s own entry). A really good experience.",1,0.9076,Positive
366.0,6,3.0,2.0,4.0,44,100.0,1,4.24670072100672,4.87,4.96,4.51,4.72,16245894,"Werkelijk een prachtig appartement, mooi ingericht, en alles wat je nodig hebt is aanwezig. Het assortiment thee en koffie is bijna te groot om te kiezen,en er staat olie, azijn zout en peper en nog wat keukenkruiden. Badkamers om jaloers op te worden met meer dan genoeg handdoeken,douchegel en shampoo. Als ik dan een puntje moet noemen dan is dat het geluid van de straat, veel sirenes,vrachtverkeer en schreeuwende mensen. De ramen konden we s nachts niet open laten,zowel voor als achter. Maar wij komen van het platte land en zijn dat niet gewend, dus als je dat geen punt vind dan is dit echt een aanrader! Metro U 8 om de hoek en je staat zo op Alexanderplatz! Ook een aanrader: ontbijt bij het bakkertje om de hoek!",0,0.0,Neutral
62.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,15.65506730661029,4.95,4.97,4.93,4.88,23096426,"Great place! I can recommend to everyone who wants a nice, quiet place to stay. Easy access to U-Bahn.",1,0.9117,Positive
163.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,91.0,0,4.871252294318258,4.67,4.78,4.87,4.53,46864858,Really nice and comfy place to stay. Great location.,1,0.8016,Positive
150.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,29,99.0,0,1.5987121570189835,4.61,4.72,4.53,4.63,9540682,"Das war beste Hostel, das ich bis jetzt übernachtet habe.<br/>Empfohlen",1,-0.5994,Negative
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,0,3.326677407398734,4.96,4.98,4.93,4.8,7683523,The apartment is very cozy and well-located. The host is very helpful. Highly recommend it!,1,0.7537,Positive
145.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,59,100.0,1,7.17316663043628,4.94,4.95,4.82,4.9,17002284,"The description “comfortable, fully-equipped, spacious and light” is completely correct. The apartment is located on a beautiful, tree-lined street, a few minutes' walk from the large Südkreuz train station, which provides quick access to all of Berlin's central locations.<br/>The apartment itself is a combination of the charm of an old building combined with high-class modern equipment. Everything works, very clean, very spacious - maybe with the exception of the bathtub, which is a bit small for a bigger person to take a shower.<br/>All in all, a very pleasant experience, including hosts and the flexibility of the check-in. My brother and I  warmly recommend this apartment to travelers to Berlin, and we send our warmest thanks to the hosts for their hospitality.",0,0.9761,Positive
138.0,10,3.0,2.0,5.0,38,100.0,0,5.652601408210154,4.76,4.63,4.54,4.7,44483955,Sehr gut!,0,0.0,Neutral
25.0,7,1.0,1.0,6.0,18,93.0,0,4.132403574870102,4.51,4.55,4.61,4.58,41362381,"It was fine. Showers were weird, but everything was nice and clean. Room was quiet and the stuff was helpful",1,0.9001,Positive
