137.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,1,2.759966591003808,4.94,4.92,4.94,4.81,768616,"We stayed here on a vacation traveling across Europe, and we enjoyed our stay in the apartment. The place is clean and comfortable, and we had everything we needed in the kitchen, bathroom, etc. There is one large comfortable bed in the bedroom, and there's a pull out sofa bed in the living room which was also quite comfy. The outdoor space is really cute! The host left us a great little book that explained everything about the apartment. The neighborhood has some nice shops and restaurants and is conveniently located near public transit. ",1,0.9722,Positive
280.0,7,2.0,2.0,6.0,42,96.0,0,6.1770612336798365,4.52,4.47,4.8,4.46,27018623,"We caught on that the train was best to link up with main places to see and then walk<br/>A lively area and very multicultural eating<br/>Accommodation was easy to access with a lift <br/>Cheaper places if you want to walk up 4 flights<br/>Appliances were basic but main comforts meant heating , shower and comfortable bedding made for a pleasant stay and recommended",0,0.9678,Positive
