38.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,100.0,1,2.272092998206821,4.87,4.68,4.82,4.82,7165718,"Oliver was a great host. Waited up late for me to arrive from Airport, gave me tour of flat and important info, then let me get on with it! Brilliant flat, excellent location, great room, couldn't have asked for more. Will be staying here when I'm back in Berlin.",1,0.9571,Positive
