82.0,2,0.0,1.0,6.0,39,100.0,0,7.593507322759444,4.63,4.61,4.89,4.62,19753755,"Value for money for our 2 night stay at Gisella's place. The apartment is less than 500 metres from Nolendorfplatz U-Bahn station which ensured we were just 15-20 minutes from the heart of Berlin, either via U-Bahn or by Bus. There are some good restaurants & supermakets (inlcuding Lidl) at few minutes walk. Jens also gave us a good overview of the locality which helped us during our stay there.",1,0.802,Positive
