198.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,39,100.0,1,3.617036290600905,4.86,4.85,4.9,4.75,27627221,"I agree with all the positive comments others have left, so I won’t repeat them.  One thing not mentioned is how spacious it is.  It feels more like a house than an apartment.  The terrace was a quiet and peaceful oasis after a long day of walking and sightseeing.  Totally private. So many great restaurants in the neighborhood to choose from that are only a short walk away.  Egil is a great host and keeps his place in top shape.",1,0.9707,Positive
