113.0,3,1.0,1.0,3.0,15,100.0,0,12.54491858158529,4.25,4.5,3.13,4.0,1076046241733584837,We had a lovely time at our accomodation. Our host was very lovely and the staff downstairs at the restaurant were very kind too. The room was beautiful and exactly like the photos. It was a 35 min commute to the city but transport was very easy and on time. It was nice staying out of the chaos and busy life of the city. We would definitely recommend to any staying in Berlin.,1,0.9589,Positive
