123.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,1,2.7486258312471903,4.76,4.28,4.82,4.73,6232450,"Το διαμέρισμα του Andreas είναι υπέροχο: φωτεινό, με όμορφα αντικείμενα και πολύ άνετο για τρία άτομα. Είναι ακριβώς όπως απεικονίζεται στις φωτογραφίες. Στη γύρω περιοχή υπάρχουν καταστήματα κι εστιατόρια και η στάση για τη δημόσια συγκοινωνία είναι κοντά.<br/>Ο Andreas ανταποκρίθηκε άμεσα και με ευγένεια κάθε φορά που επικοινωνήσαμε μαζί του. Πρόκειται για έναν άριστο οικοδεσπότη!<br/>Andreas, ευχαριστούμε πολύ για την άψογη φιλοξενία σου!",1,0.0,Neutral
380.0,4,2.0,2.0,3.0,48,100.0,1,1.1071575355391072,4.95,4.99,4.91,4.78,16091735,The apartment simply perfect all u need is there from A to Z. Huge apartment with big bathrooms. Location is so good 2 minutes walk of Metro station. marc was very helpful and flex with timing. If you wana see Berlin and have a good place to stay at definitely this is what you looking for.,0,0.96,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,31,100.0,0,11.141839187854034,4.94,4.88,5.0,4.75,22382534,"Camilla’s apartment is really cozy, beautiful and vibrant, with amazing photos, books and other stuff, which increases home atmosphere. It is very nice to relax in it after a hard touristics day, and the view from the balcony is just wonderful! There is a bus stop right outside the house from which you can get to S-Bahn and U-bahn stations. In walking distance (about 7 minutes on foot which are nice to walk in good weather) is S-bahn station. And from the stations you can reach the city center in 15 minutes. In fine weather, you can easily walk 15 minutes to the street with lots of high-level shops! Camilla provides all the necessary things for living: dishes, umbrellas and much more. Cons: the bed creaks when tossing and turning in a dream. Also you'll could not find open shelves on which to put your own things)",1,0.9843,Positive
62.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,91.0,0,14.746565616939948,4.9,4.6,5.0,4.6,873758796090219151,It is a really nice and quiet place with very kind staff.,1,0.7774,Positive
