100.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,17,100.0,0,4.347907547706215,4.64,4.75,4.79,4.68,1015884445657478456,"Good hotel in one of the busiest areas in Berlin, Kreuzberg is around the corner and the connection to the rest of the city is very good. The room was according to the pictures and very clean. I did not make use of the breakfast facilities so cannot comment on that.",1,0.8437,Positive
68.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,50,100.0,0,6.026516407626963,4.74,4.76,4.48,4.7,6808626,"Birgit ist eine wirklich nette Gastgeberin.<br/>Hilfsbereit und gibt einen sehr gute Tips mit Birgit hat man Spaß auf jedem Fall.<br/>Eine ganz liebe Frau die man schätzen kann , auf jedem Fall.<br/>Wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt und alles war wie auf den Bildern vorhanden.<br/>Ihre Unterkunft ist sehr nett, sowie gemühtlich eingerichtet und alles da was man so im Altag braucht.<br/>",1,-0.8316,Negative
80.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,0,16.324415304843132,4.78,4.72,4.61,4.6,594008251420806587,Der Aufenthalt war sehr angenehm und die Wohnung genau wie auf den Fotos. Alles war sauber und es gab ausreichend Küchenausstattung. Wir waren zu zweit und würden gerne wieder buchen!,1,-0.9184,Negative
68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,13,87.0,0,7.867349248126775,4.54,4.66,4.52,4.53,3970161,"Super Unterkunft, optimale Lage, Öffis in unmittelbarer Nähe; alles sauber, es hat alles gepasst, danke - wir kommen sehr gerne wieder!",1,0.636,Positive
66.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,25,100.0,1,12.69261644647349,4.9,4.89,4.68,4.85,2602460,recommended  guest<br/>very kind and helpful<br/>despite the very short stay we had a really good time<br/>we immediately felt the feeling of tranquility upon entering the house.<br/>I would choose Flora's house again,1,0.8932,Positive
82.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,44,100.0,1,6.735519877930783,4.8,4.54,4.86,4.71,863106789917399523,"This was a great place to stay as a solo traveller visiting relatives. Ashley was a helpful and responsive host and it was a great location. I had a comfortable bed in a nice room, the whole apartment felt very welcoming and cosy and looked exactly as the photos. There was no problem sharing the bathroom with the host (there is an extra toilet if needed). The hosts very much respect a guest's privacy but are available if needed. I would definitely stay there again.",1,0.944,Positive
96.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,53,100.0,0,3.047161883343627,4.61,4.77,4.61,4.5,687582,This place was very spacious and comfortable. I had an amazing 5 days in Berlin and discovered so much around Kreuzberg because of the location in this amazing neighborhood. It was a good walk to the trains and main shopping streets but I loved the location near the park anyway. Berlin was going through a heat wave when I was there so the apartment was very hot but no apartments have AC in Berlin anyway.  ,1,0.8803,Positive
30.0,1,1.0,1.0,2.0,21,100.0,0,10.723701440323534,4.89,4.86,4.9,4.92,25765982,Mir hat die Wohnung von Isabella sehr gut gefallen. Ich fühlte mich sofort wohl und willkommen. Herzlichen Dank liebe Isabella 😁,1,-0.5994,Negative
92.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,48,100.0,1,5.680240486188183,4.79,4.75,4.68,4.62,980911162110151558,"The neighbourhood and Villiam’s flat were just the edgy, happening vibe I was searching for( with great amenities)!",1,0.6588,Positive
89.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,20,100.0,0,13.663655677178726,4.46,4.48,4.57,4.29,44297296,Good find in Berlin! Close to lots of public transport options. Excellent for 4 people for 2 nights. The beds were very comfortable! A little bit loud as on the ground floor right next to a street. Good communication from host.,1,0.9284,Positive
195.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,91.0,0,4.873172561853288,4.69,4.76,4.44,4.54,30881310,"Great stay, very easy check-in/check-out with the mobile app.",1,0.807,Positive
37.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,7.258519499353832,4.89,4.92,4.8,4.89,2591901,"Мы останавливались у Клауса на 3 ночи. Квартира расположена в минуте от метро в хорошем районе,  рядом есть супермаркет. Очень удобно ехать в центр, до аеропортов и вокзалов. Клаус подсказывал как лучше всего добираться в те или иные места. В квартире чисто и уютно. Комната небольшая, но вполне хватает места для двоих людей. Мы здесь отлично провели время. Очень рекомендую эти аппартаменты.",1,0.0,Neutral
31.0,6,1.0,1.0,6.0,29,99.0,0,1.5518343874590943,4.55,4.64,4.6,4.63,6110762,It's a clean place and the service at reception desk is generally good.,1,0.6808,Positive
125.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,41,99.0,1,3.0808579330861074,4.69,4.71,4.75,4.46,34994590,I loved staying at the mini loft! Loved the location and the sustainable background of the building!,1,0.855,Positive
54.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,97.0,0,9.886537952817571,4.5,4.67,4.83,4.33,1042713654587423165,"Appartement spacieux , très propre et très central.  J’y suis resté 2 mois.  Calme avec une grande télévision. Lit confortable. Lumineux.   Bonne communication avec l’hôte.  Je le recommande vivement.",1,0.0,Neutral
145.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,71,100.0,0,1.8454547012862048,4.78,4.9,4.88,4.59,1176655,"Stephanie was a friendly and helpful host. The flat was spacious, clean and  modern. If you want to cook the kitchen is fully equipped. We came when Berlin was already quite cold and the the heating in the flat was was wonderful. The building was very secure and quiet. It was a pleasure to stay in this accommodation. As soon as you stepped out there were lovely cafes bars and interesting shops and we were able to walk to many hsitoric sites we wished to visit, however a train station is also just a minute away. As well, there is lovely park across the road which makes for a lovely place to sit and relax on a sunny day. All in all we had a wonderful experience.",1,0.9921,Positive
119.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,54,100.0,1,7.664959909386412,4.98,4.98,4.93,4.92,15660868,"Wahnsinn! So ein zauberhaftes und mit extrem viel Liebe zum Detail eingerichtetes Kleinod im Herzen von Berlin. Tanja ist zu Recht ein Super-Host. Sie erfüllt Wünsche, bevor man sich deren bewußt wird. Sie bietet Lösungen, bevor sich das Problem stellt. Wohnen beginnt einfach sofort nach ihrem herzlichen Willkommen, Tanja bietet Gastfreundschaft der gehobenen Luxusklasse. Tausend Dank für die tollen Tage ""woanders""!",1,-0.8011,Negative
266.0,14,3.0,2.0,11.0,24,86.0,0,8.703751291771198,4.36,4.67,4.18,4.27,31500359,"Super appartement pour découvrir Berlin en famille ; à proximité du métro, proche de parc Tempelhof ! Seuls (petits) bémol : le matériel de la cuisine est minimaliste (par exemple : pas de ciseaux) et le nettoyage du sol était approximatif. Mais on retiendra surtout les nombreux bons côtés de cette location. Merci Olivier !",0,0.6688,Positive
241.0,6,3.0,1.0,4.0,53,100.0,1,1.3558603428081426,4.89,4.89,4.78,4.75,13663197,Excellent place to stay with U Bahn not far away. Which we used often as it’s a BIG city!,0,0.6114,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,11,100.0,0,2.0751585817954608,5.0,4.75,5.0,5.0,19898362,"Perfect location, surrounded by great places to eat and drink, walking distance to most attractions and a u-bahn nearby if you prefer. Bright, spacious, quirky (in a good way!) apartment. Lovely stay",1,0.9674,Positive
