112.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,1,3.5872254876023093,4.58,4.75,4.67,4.46,744264,"Nice apartment, very good location, Easy check-in & check out, friendly host. I Just didn't noticed from the photos/description that it's a basament.<br/>Anyway, it has been a good stay.",1,0.9387,Positive
