54.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,7.403263725526816,4.91,4.92,4.78,4.85,23477057,"Andre’s place was so beautifully decorated. It was pristine clean , great location , lots of extras. They had a fancy coffee machine as well as a fridge in the room . Very well equipped . Walking into the apt was a Wow moment . Very generous hosts .",1,0.9724,Positive
