422.0,6,3.0,1.5,3.0,21,100.0,1,2.1180873876448287,4.95,4.89,4.95,4.86,12120894,"Really spacious, great for a group. Relaxing space to enjoy at the end of busy days. Useful to have one and a half bathrooms when going as a group. Location is brilliant with lots to see and do locally and very convenient for public transport. Nice to have two balconies to enjoy for a drink and a peaceful read. A very comfortable home from home. Thank you for a great stay.",0,0.9892,Positive
120.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,39,100.0,0,7.746932465756848,4.93,4.53,4.73,4.8,645341477538374053,"We spent a great moment in Leila 's place , very good vibes in the apartment , it's very quiet , lot of space and it's close from the subway . You can go swimming at the lake nearby . Leila has been very nice , reactive and always ready to answer and give good advices . It was a great spot to spend few days in Berlin .",1,0.9647,Positive
125.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,7,100.0,0,5.7711713895621255,4.94,4.76,4.65,4.82,3748373,"Die Zeit bei Cayan war wirklich toll. Er hat sehr kurzfristig auf unsere Anfrage geantwortet und war immer sehr gut erreichbar und zuvorkommend. Die Schlüsselübergabe wurde unkompliziert organisiert und vor Ort hat sich ein Freund von Cayan, der ebenfalls sehr nett war, um uns gekümmert. Cyan hatte zudem non kleine Tips und einen Reiseführer für das Viertel in der Wohnung hinterlassen. Die Wohnung war dann noch viel, viel schöner als auf den Bildern- eine positive Überraschung ! Alles war sauber und gut hergerichtet. Die Wohnung ist zudem ruhig und hell, sehr gut angebunden mit vielen netten Cafés in der Umgebung. Ich kann nur jedem empfehlen zu bei Cayan unterzukommen! Top!",1,-0.99,Negative
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,10,100.0,0,5.775098309786971,5.0,4.86,4.71,4.86,14908272,"Super lovely apartment, very close to public transport and nightlife, and a great host! Thank you for everything Sascha, I'll definitely stay here again on my next visit.",1,0.9538,Positive
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,100.0,0,6.9835159306468215,4.91,4.86,4.73,4.78,51581251,"Very friendly host, cozy and comfortable room, fair price, couldn't ask for more.",1,0.8439,Positive
40.0,3,0.0,1.0,4.0,31,100.0,1,5.883884268449321,4.89,4.96,4.77,4.79,26419059,"Ich habe mich sehr wohlgefühlt. Alles war frisch, sauber und ich habe mich direkt wohlgefühlt.<br/>Für mich war die sehr gute Erreichbarkeit zum Bus wichtig und hat sogar meine Erwartungen übertroffen. Tipptopp 😁",1,-0.9136,Negative
59.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,90.0,0,5.089314048946627,4.97,4.97,4.81,4.85,672856416916705202,"War wirklich super schön, gerne wieder",1,0.0,Neutral
137.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,1.189406824976013,4.86,4.84,4.93,4.79,264459,"Great place, close to Torstrasse, very central. In the first floor, above the tea shop, with great mini garden behind one of the window. Nice clean flat, feels like at home. Henrik was very quick with his replies, flexible with the handing over the keys, rounding a perfect experience I had in this flat. Recommended to everyone looking for a place to stay in the Mitte.",1,0.9705,Positive
91.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,35,94.0,0,5.406665066832042,4.59,4.7,4.81,4.41,2850204,"Great apartment, lots of space, and very clean. Great area for cafés and other positions. Fulvia was helpful and on time when meeting us at the apartment.  ",1,0.9324,Positive
129.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,1,5.173752020912449,4.76,4.68,4.76,4.76,1016117104569828264,"Great host. we felt like home,  place was clean with all amenities as listed. <br/>Will book them next time in Berlin as well.",1,0.886,Positive
109.0,3,2.0,1.0,4.0,48,100.0,0,3.188050631028608,4.94,4.69,4.94,4.81,50479632,"Heel fijn contact gehad met Juliane! Ze heeft me zelfs een document doorgestuurd waarin ze had gezet hoe we alle apparaten in huis konden gebruiken. <br/>Het aankomst verliep een beetje stroef met de sleuteloverdracht met de vrouw van het ijscafé, maar dit ligt buiten Juliane haar service. <br/>Heel erg naar ons zin gehad, en echt een top locatie met erg leuke tentjes in de buurt! Een heerlijk authentiek apartement.",1,0.3365,Positive
73.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,1,0.6553720502126151,4.76,4.76,4.95,4.67,2317701,"What a great apartment! It is exactly as described and looks the same as the photos. Very stylishly furnished, all the necessities provided. Nadia's friend Sofi met us at the apartment and showed us how everything worked and Nadia sent us a great list of things to do and explore. The area is so great, heaps of cool restaurants and shops and lots of public transport but also very central and walkable to lots of sights. A winner! ",1,0.9449,Positive
