85.0,6,2.0,1.0,5.0,23,100.0,0,9.797881642408234,4.61,4.56,4.65,4.52,7963887,"We really enjoyed our time at Jörn's, who was a friendly and helpful host.<br/>The window shutters ensured that the 32⁰ temperatures did not roast the apartment when we were out during the day, so we came back to a cool apartment.<br/>Around a 30-second walk to Güntzelstr Station,  which was an ideal station to start your day out in Berlin. Also meant an easy journey to the Olympic Stadium, a 30-40 minute journey away. <br/>Would definitely stay again.",1,0.9633,Positive
