105.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,50,100.0,1,1.7477907873087046,4.94,4.8,4.88,4.67,50686128,"There is nothing that Askan hasn't thought of!!! We had all the amenities you could wish for and more. We felt totally at home and looked after and nothing was missing. The bathroom supplies (shampoo, hairdryer, handwash etc) were high quality and felt luxurious. The way the apartment has been set up is brilliant, from the positioning of the lighting (including motion sensors on the steps) and the little fan attached to the bed. Thank you for hosting us.",1,0.9148,Positive
