300.0,5,2.0,2.0,3.0,71,100.0,1,9.260527967950802,4.97,4.97,4.92,4.85,1977882,"We have just arrived back after a wonderful trip to Berlin, which was made all the better by the welcome we received from Frank, and his truly exceptional apartment we were lucky enough to stay in.<br/>There were absolutely no navigational problems in finding the location, thanks to the comprehensive instructions given to us.<br/>We were rather late in arriving, but Frank met us and greeted us with freshly squeezed orange juice and fantastically a bottle of Prosecco also!<br/>The apartment itself is luxurious in every way, spotlessly clean and the four of us felt at home immediately<br/>We did not use the TV, but thoroughly enjoyed the high-end hi-fi system<br/>There was a huge selection of crockery and cutlery, we lacked for nothing<br/>There were travel guides and maps galore<br/>Nothing appeared to be too much trouble for Frank<br/>The district itself is quiet, and the apartment block is set back from the road. <br/>Within a two minute walk are an excellent selection of shops and restaurants. The underground is a one minute walk further on.<br/>In conclusion all four us unanimously praised the excellence of the accommodation and the warmth of Frank's greeting.<br/>If we have one complaint: it is that our four day stay went too quickly and Great yieldsin a flash. <br/>I think there is only one way to rectify that and that is to return as speedily as possible<br/>Many thanks indeed for a great holiday!<br/><br/>",0,0.9954,Positive
210.0,12,3.0,1.0,6.0,42,100.0,1,6.346740834948324,4.77,4.79,4.75,4.75,1289303037561947058,Super Unterkunft und sauber. Nur eine Toilette für 8 Personen war zu wenig. Sonst war alles top. Würde ich bedenkenlos weiterempfehlen. <br/>Danke! 👍🙋🏻‍♀️,0,-0.5255,Negative
