422.0,6,3.0,2.0,4.0,60,100.0,1,3.559770173058828,4.94,4.96,4.93,4.77,11483775,"Great and very comfortable apartment with lots of space. We went in winter, but I am sure we would have enjoyed it even more in warmer weather with the lovely roof top and balconies. Really well located. We walked to the main sights in Berlin, but the U-Bahn is literally outside the door. Lots of great restaurants on the door step.",0,0.9856,Positive
118.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,24,93.0,0,2.2997563334626485,4.63,4.61,4.74,4.55,16951874,"We had a fantastic stay here, and would definitely recommend. The apartment itself is great, lovely space with everything we needed. Charlotte gave us some great tips for things to do in the area and where to go as well, which was much appreciated on our first trip to Berlin.<br/>The apartment is in a cool area, very close to lots of the good bars and clubs, as well as museums and cultural sites. It is a short trip into the centre via public transport, or alternatively a nice 20-30 minute walk.",1,0.9875,Positive
