282.0,9,4.0,2.0,6.0,65,100.0,1,13.891160580271904,4.81,4.67,4.72,4.66,21431134,"The apartment is great, the beds are very comfortable and all of the rooms are spacious. There were 10 of us and we didn't feel squished at all. We had a wonderful stay and found the code instead of a key was really useful with such a big group of us. The bathrooms were great - lots of towels and the water was hot. Would happily recommend this to a friend.",0,0.9817,Positive
87.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,8.219842297301085,4.91,4.74,4.7,4.71,18444663,"We so enjoyed our time in Rainer’s beautiful space. The decor was lovely and eclectic, and the apartment was clean and cozy. There were several great cafes and restaurants nearby but it still felt private on a quiet street. Conveniently located near grocery stores as well as public transit which made getting around the rest of the city a breeze. Thanks again!",1,0.9463,Positive
