136.0,5,2.0,1.5,3.0,55,100.0,0,1.753668621661444,4.93,4.97,4.94,4.75,648256211993106145,"We had the best time at Stephan’s place and absolutely didn’t want to leave! The location is perfect, quiet yet still within easy walking distance of plenty of lively neighbourhoods and  the city ‘centre’. There are also great public transport links to and from the airport and for exploring further afield. The flat itself is beautiful and all furniture and fittings are of a really high spec. I actually enjoyed the 80 plus steps to the front door but it’s something to bear in mind if you’re not great on your feet.",0,0.9644,Positive
