64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,0,2.6356598813200662,4.85,4.85,4.93,4.79,20069680,Really good experience staying at Irem's place. Great location - central to many of the important parts of Berlin that I wanted to experience. About a 9-minute walk from the train station and Xberg is great for a younger crowd. Irem was able to accommodate my stay on short notice - I appreciate it!,1,0.945,Positive
54.0,1,1.0,0.0,2.0,25,100.0,0,6.712577401117852,4.87,4.76,4.73,4.79,830575419710014519,"I really enjoyed my stays at Mohammad’s place. The room is spacious and cozy. Mohammad kindly prepared both tea and a kettle in my room. The neighborhood has easy access to public transportation. There are two big parks just 1km away for runners like myself. Mohammad is friendly and helpful. He suggested that I visit Potsdam which is only an hour away by public transportation, which is a great idea! My only regret is that my stays in Berlin were too short.",1,0.9669,Positive
87.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,21,90.0,0,3.196091525660409,4.72,4.86,4.67,4.6,541569,"Silke's place is really nice and well kept. I've stayed there for 4 days with 3 girl friends and I must say it's perfect for a long weekend: comfy enough, quite large bathroom, conveniently close to public transport. Silke is lovely and very helpful, she runs a cafe' right next to the flat, where you can get some good breakfast ;) overall highly recommended!",1,0.9759,Positive
74.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,70.0,0,6.9301011634210585,4.49,4.57,4.23,4.37,786785762986729653,Wir wurden extrem freundlich empfangen und haben uns gleich sehr wohl gefühlt. Das Zimmer war sehr sauber.,1,-0.5994,Negative
298.0,8,2.0,1.0,2.0,45,100.0,1,1.6592287277224604,4.93,4.91,4.91,4.75,39529039,"Top Lage, alles sehr sauber, schnelle Antworten vom Gastgeber bei Fragen, kontaktloser Check-in hat problemlos funktioniert.<br/>Insgesamt eine sehr gute Unterkunft für ein paar Tage in Berlin.",0,0.2023,Positive
283.0,8,4.0,1.5,5.0,48,100.0,0,4.127391754068874,4.68,4.63,4.68,4.53,1173131686369315331,"Wir waren beruflich in Berlin und haben uns sehr wohlgefühlt in der Wohnung. Haben gut geschlafen, es war schön ruhig, sauber, toll eingerichtet und alles genau wie beschrieben. Kommen gerne wieder :)",0,-0.2263,Negative
130.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,1,2.669079881682033,4.97,4.98,4.84,4.86,26180749,"The location is superb, close to u-bahn (strausberger platz is the closest station), everything in reach, yet quiet. Room is nice, quite private, well equipped. Perfect communication. Bakery (within the same building) where you can sit and have sandwich and coffee for breakfast is a great plus.",1,0.953,Positive
45.0,3,1.0,1.5,2.0,44,100.0,1,13.335712033183713,4.95,4.95,4.77,4.9,19619437,"We had a wonderful stay in Mona and Ahmed's home. They were super friendly, welcoming and helpful, even picked us up from the tram station when it was raining and gave us nice recommendations. The room was so cozy, super clean and beautiful. We had a very comfortable and smooth stay, would recommend and would come back if we are ever in Berlin again.",1,0.9884,Positive
193.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,0,4.581414435673839,4.73,4.71,4.82,4.65,6107182,Great place. Local area has loads of cool little bars and cafes. Guillaume and Ana are great hosts - very responsive and friendly.,1,0.9498,Positive
