137.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,1.6809549157543209,4.96,4.95,4.95,4.83,2061212,"Kitty's flat was exactly as described. A very well designed studio with beautiful paintings of her own perfectly located to experience Berlin. My girlfriend and I stayed 3 nights at Kitty's flat to visit Berlin, it was perfectly located at 10 minutes from Mitte. I highly recommend Kitty's place because the neighborhood is fantastic, you will experience the real sweetness of the Berlin life. All good things!",1,0.9808,Positive
