64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,1,2.501573077242212,5.0,5.0,4.95,4.95,929799274069481852,"I had a wonderful stay at Natascha's place. The space was spotless, beautifully decorated, and very comfortable. Natascha was an excellent host, always responsive and helpful. I'd definitely stay at her place again when I'm around.",1,0.9709,Positive
