136.0,4,2.0,1.5,3.0,55,100.0,1,15.609089248851344,4.85,4.77,4.68,4.72,35018575,"Beatiful house, nice neigbourhood, easy travelling to center by S-bahn. The house is really nice, open and stylish. Very easy incheck also!",0,0.8932,Positive
