126.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,96.0,0,3.2108386176980583,4.7,4.76,4.93,4.62,50931491,"For the price,. it's a great hotel. Tiny rooms but very clean, and the location is pretty perfect. you're in the middle of the city,close to most touristy things and all the shopping. would definitely recommend.",1,0.9741,Positive
155.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,31,98.0,0,5.719687592744844,4.7,4.79,4.43,4.53,693935596472501414,"Super net appartement. Vlakbij de metro, dus ideaal!<br/>Van alles te doen in de buurt. <br/>Supermarkt ook dichtbij. <br/>Top!",1,0.6688,Positive
