126.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,20,100.0,1,2.247922934088075,4.94,4.94,4.94,4.85,40730061,Great little place! Super clean and tidy. Bathroom was pristine which I always appreciate in a rental. Bed was super comfortable with cozy linens. The standout was the bookshelf curation! So many cool coffee table books about the area and Berlin culture. Would definitely stay here again.,1,0.9774,Positive
