76.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,100.0,1,5.169307301776869,4.86,4.89,4.79,4.76,16119275,Excelente espacio y con mucho estilo. El barrio es muy tranquilo y está ubicado cerca de varios puntos de interés en Berlín. Birte es una anfitriona sobresaliente.,1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,0,8.468330258374564,4.64,4.57,4.71,4.21,19283196,"Camilla’s apartment is in a really nice neighborhood. This was my first time in Berlin and I felt really comfortable with everything around me.<br/>The apartment is really clean and you have everything you need for a long-term stay. The wifi is awesome and if you are working from home this is the place that will definitely suit you. <br/>Camilla was a great host and her response rate is amazing! She provided me with everything I asked for!<br/>I would recommend her place to anyone! <br/>Since I was here in a Covid period when most of the things were closed I spent most of my time inside the apartment or walking and biking around the neighborhood. And I wasn’t bored at all! There are a lot of beautiful locations nearby! <br/>Also, the public transport stations are close as well as all kinds of stores. One more thing about this location that I adored is an awesome coffee place just five minutes from the apartment with quality coffee. <br/>Since I loved everything about it, I’m extending my stay in her apartment!<br/>Thanks, Camilla!",1,0.9922,Positive
62.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,98.0,1,12.355880726366824,4.72,4.85,4.5,4.7,26975349,Sehr angenehm,1,0.0,Neutral
70.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,1,2.5329341972975428,4.86,4.8,4.93,4.8,19976281,"Enrique Es mu buena gente, atento y se encarga de orientarte e informarte a cerca de los  lugares turísticos y transporte. Muy buena atención!!",1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,16,100.0,1,4.009860827310783,4.91,4.92,4.9,4.83,16979933,I had a lovely stay at Joseph’s apartment during a recent work trip. The apartment is in a great location in Kreuzberg and nearby to U-Bahn. This will give you access to all the best attractions Berlin has to offer.<br/>The apartment is nearby to great restaurants so catching a bite to eat on your way home will be no trouble!<br/>The apartment itself has a beautiful open plan sun room to enoy your morning coffee at and a nice comfortable bed to recharge.<br/>I’ll most definitely be back to Joseph’s when I am back in town!,1,0.9854,Positive
126.0,5,1.0,1.0,3.0,38,100.0,1,2.459926794886368,4.93,4.97,4.8,4.87,3973420,"The location was perfect. The public transport connections were nearby and there were lots of supermarkets nearby. The house interior was very pretty, and the split floor levels made it seem spacey and wide. Great e-mail communication with the host when we had questions. The building itself was very noisy, but since the neighbours themselves were quiet so this wasnt that big of a deal. During summer the house was kind of hot. Overall we give it 4,5 out of 5 stars.",1,0.6858,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,13.088231838082732,4.89,4.76,4.67,4.83,18195157,"Es war alles super, schönes Zimmer und sehr liebe Gastgeberin! :)",1,0.5093,Positive
99.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,0,14.270365576459383,4.78,4.73,4.77,4.69,11374200,Nicole and her husband Dirk were so great! They greeted us right when we got there. We drove and they had a spot for us to park our car.<br/>The apartment was very nice and clean. They even welcomed our 2 dogs that go everywhere with us.<br/>It was a short walk to subway. Great places around the apartment too.<br/>,1,0.9659,Positive
243.0,6,3.0,1.0,4.0,51,100.0,1,1.372412995603046,4.9,4.94,4.78,4.75,13739449,"Great place, easy to get around, and Sven was a great host! Would visit again",0,0.908,Positive
44.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,98.0,1,11.945313826388132,4.75,4.85,4.56,4.76,26952394,"The accommodation was in a perfect location, and the house was very clean.",1,0.7713,Positive
20.0,6,1.0,0.0,6.0,21,100.0,0,3.818785253820972,4.47,4.45,4.56,4.55,30759237,A great place to stay! I needed a place to sleep for one-night and Sunflower Hostel was perfect. Quick and easy to get to on the S-Bahn and in a very groovy area. The hostel seemed alive with activity. They provide a lot of amenities and have a fun social space that I would've loved to explore more if I wasn't tired!,1,0.9743,Positive
39.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,1,6.582330417299593,4.74,4.62,4.75,4.58,38976821,"The apartment was extremely clean and well put together. The minimalist design was a particular highlight for me. Besides, the host was very friendly and welcoming. Internet speed of 50 MBit should be sufficient for video calls or streaming, so ple ty for most purposes.",1,0.9459,Positive
185.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,47,94.0,0,7.131273504704622,4.69,4.77,4.74,4.55,49087087,"Great, modern accommodation conveniently located in the Schöneberg district. Communication was easy and we appreciated being able to park our car.",1,0.8834,Positive
38.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,40,71.0,0,6.7424915099087634,4.72,4.28,4.92,4.75,26346833,Logement bien situé á part sa la propreté laisse á desirer et l'etat de l'appartement en generale est pas tres propre.Serviertes et draps tres vieux et usé . Internet marche que ponctuelement et pas tres fort car la box  est dans l'apartement á coté.Communication avec hote quasi inexistante.Je retournera plus.,1,0.0,Neutral
56.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,8.674910442002028,4.96,4.97,4.81,4.88,607836165565073961,"A great place to stay for a week in Berlin as I figured out longer term plans. Huge room with great light. The apartment was spotless and had everything I needed; it's located next to parks and S-Bahn/ many bus lines. I barely interacted with William but he was very nice and flexible, allowing me to check in early with his mother while he was out of town.",1,0.9124,Positive
68.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,22,100.0,1,1.5015867319599838,4.82,4.88,4.9,4.77,4362839,"Sabine was a very nice and kind host, her apartment totally corresponded to the website offer. It was a pleasure to live some days in this apartment!",1,0.8945,Positive
66.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,11.895693716152222,4.82,4.74,4.91,4.75,34405060,"Uwe ist ein sehr freundlicher Gastgeber, der immer schnell erreichbar war und uns mit Tipps für die Umgebung versorgt hat. Die Wohnung ist dank der Ausrichtung zum Hinterhof sehr ruhig und super angebunden mit U-Bahn, S-Bahn und Bus in der Nähe. Für ein paar Tage Sightseeing in Berlin sehr empfehlenswert!",1,-0.8439,Negative
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,13,97.0,1,3.4267050167762894,4.88,4.85,4.71,4.83,21291976,David ist super nett und hilfsbereit. Die Zimmer sind Top und Sauber. Gerne wieder!,1,0.2714,Positive
48.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,8.38062533349986,4.75,4.84,4.54,4.67,22318827,Excelente ubicación. Muy cómodo el lugar. Recomendado.,1,0.0,Neutral
31.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,20,100.0,1,12.389708472442326,4.76,4.74,4.59,4.81,31116923,"Brigitte ist eine sehr nette Gastgeberin, Check-in konnte ich ganz flexibel angehen, so wie auch den Check- out",1,0.0,Neutral
167.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,39,97.0,0,5.365355387714029,4.69,4.76,4.25,4.5,1005601515937305762,alles ok bis auf die Tatsache dass die Fotos nicht so ganz zur Wohnung passten,1,-0.765,Negative
90.0,6,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,0,6.400823146055228,4.52,4.37,4.72,4.42,27512181,"Had a very nice stay, Alex is an amazing host! Only problem I had by being tall is that the covers and the bed were a little too short for me but some creative thinking fixed that. All in all I'd definitely recommend this place as it's close to Bellevue station and the beautiful Tiergarten.",1,0.9632,Positive
115.0,2,1.0,0.0,2.0,16,100.0,0,1.6522173823377917,4.45,4.57,4.64,4.47,51795737,"Wir waren sehr zufrieden mit dem Preis-Leistungsverhältnis. Das Hotel liegt im ruhig Hinterhof und es gibt kaum Strassenlärm, nur Geräusche von Menschen im Hinterhof. Alles war leicht zu finden. Checkin und out war auch einfach. Die anderen Gäste um uns herum waren auch angenehm leise. Die Gemeinschaftsduschen und Toiletten waren immer frei, wenn wir sie brauchten. Wir brauchten kaum etwas mitnehmen, denn es gab Handtücher, Fön, Seife und Cremes ;) Die Einrichtung in Schwarzweiß ist schlicht, einfach und angenehm.<br/>Die Umgebung bietet alles was es für einen Stadtbesuch braucht; einen Park zum Erholen, ein Kino nah bei, Tramm- und Bushaltestellen, Kneipen, Restaurants, Späti, Waschsalon... . <br/>Ich würde wieder im Avalex übernachten, wenn mal wieder in Berli",1,-0.9638,Negative
64.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,0,12.1545859613401,4.89,4.84,4.77,4.7,561487373528647719,"숙소의 첫인상이 정말 좋았습니다! 넓은 방과 욕실, 주방이 모두 깨끗하게 정돈되어 있습니다. 아기자기하고 사람 사는 냄새 나는 숙소였어요. 감성 풀충전.. 관광 위주의 여행을 생각한다면 중심부까지는 조금 시간이 걸리지만, 하루쯤은 어디 가지 않고 숙소 주변 쇼핑센터와 마트를 구경하며 시간을 보내는 것도 추천합니다. 호스트는 숙박 기간동안 숙소에 없었지만, 항상 빠르게 답변해줬고 생각지도 못한 세심한 부분까지 배려해주는 좋은 호스트였어요.",1,0.0,Neutral
81.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,0,15.758793180824542,4.8,4.88,4.51,4.82,5133260,"Helena è stata molto gentile e disponibile, e ci ha dato ottime indicazioni per trovare l'appartamento. La stanza è moderna e confortevole. Ci siamo trovati davvero bene!",1,0.4003,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,100.0,0,5.638345930536841,4.96,5.0,4.92,5.0,30320486,"Sehr moderne, schicke und saubere Unterkunft. Die Gastgeberin war sehr freundlich und auch entgegenkommend bei den Check-in Zeiten. Die Lage ist ideal, um Berlin zu erkunden. Die Ubahn Ostkreuz ist 10-15min entfernt, von dort kann man in fast jede Richtung umsteigen. Die Ausgeh-Viertel Ostkreuz oder Warschauerstr. sind ebenfalls in Laufweite.<br/>Ich komme auf jeden Fall gerne wieder.",1,-0.9524,Negative
123.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,0,7.774560523766015,4.59,4.66,4.71,4.55,21443258,A great and very nice place to stay.<br/>Very near to the station.<br/>Place is clean and cozy and got all you need.<br/>I stayed for 7 nights and it got a lot of comfort.<br/>Thanks Serpil and Michael 🌸,1,0.8718,Positive
164.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,98.0,0,0.9333653060276148,4.31,4.31,4.81,4.27,693929358810156249,"Nice and clean place in central location, very recommended!",1,0.7836,Positive
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,0,5.800571766662601,4.76,4.85,4.51,4.72,816748,Ein alles in allem schöner Aufenthalt in dieser Wohnung.,1,0.0,Neutral
167.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,50,100.0,1,5.50328507380831,4.93,4.93,4.78,4.79,10226031,"A perfect stay. Stefan's apartment is even nicer than the photos: clean, tastefully decorated, and located inside a highly functional modern apartment building right next to Gleisdreieck park. We had an incredibly easy time checking in and out and felt right at home for the week that we were there.",1,0.9099,Positive
373.0,12,4.0,2.0,14.0,30,100.0,1,2.6480538372543863,4.93,4.9,4.93,4.81,504259,A lovely stay in a beautiful neighbourhood with a great host!,0,0.92,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,0,5.089878826396497,4.95,4.97,4.83,4.92,44525002,Tony ist ein super freundlicher und aufmerksamer Gastgeber. es gibt eine Pad Kaffeemaschine mit Kaffee und auch eine Auswahl an Tees. Es ist an sich alles wie beschrieben vorhanden und war ein schöner Aufenthalt in einer guten Gegend Berlins.,1,0.0,Neutral
61.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,2.188319042758802,4.82,4.91,4.88,4.71,37443723,"Buen y económico apartamento. El alojamiento de Burak es tal cual lo que se ve en las fotos. La habitación  tiene calefacción central, algo muy cómodo. Sin embargo el colchón deja mucho que desear. El cuarto tiene llave y cerradura, así que puedes marcharte y dejarlo todo ahí sin problema.  El piso está limpio y en buenas condiciones, pero como en la mayoría de casas ajenas, cada uno tiene sus hábitos. Pudimos utilizar la cocina al completo: nevera, baldas, menaje y la vitrocerámica. El baño bastante limpio también. Burak nos proporcionó toallas y nos ofreció más por si las necesitábamos. En general es una buena opción para pasar unos días en Berlín sin querer gastar demasiado a la vez que disfrutando de todas las necesidades básicas.  Burak fue súper atento y nos ayudó tanto en llegar del aeropuerto al alojamiento, como en recomendarnos sitios para salir.",1,-0.8957,Negative
96.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,6.753647389093091,4.84,4.84,4.86,4.69,37703913,The apartment is huge and very sofisticated! It has all you need to spend some days in Berlin. Stefanie was a good host!,1,0.6988,Positive
97.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,2.157577329691436,4.94,4.87,4.97,4.78,31084288,"Stayed in Thomas's place for about a week with my partner during December. We absolutely love the area and think the apartment is charming - Private and plenty of space but still close to restaurants, cafes and shops. The balcony is also a lovely area that we were still able to use despite the -8 degree weather. We definitely stay with again!",1,0.9347,Positive
195.0,8,2.0,1.0,6.0,33,98.0,0,6.779920323065556,4.38,4.17,4.36,4.25,751276921166035373,Sehr sauber Wohnung,0,0.0,Neutral
175.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,54,100.0,1,1.816434876784729,4.91,4.82,4.95,4.72,17876581,"Everything within the description is correct, total friendly, well organised and uncomplicated! I can recommend to stay at here when you want visiting Berlin!",1,0.8264,Positive
238.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,53,100.0,1,8.843473865964748,4.97,4.99,4.7,4.77,48651189,"La oferta sobre las actividades que hacer cerca no fueron reales , el lugar se encuentra en una área industrial , y no turístico. Realmente el bote estaba muy bien pensado en su decoración interior, el exterior no ayuda a generar una experiencia ofrecida.",1,-0.6808,Negative
87.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,0,7.498812090064871,4.93,4.91,4.74,4.79,40703325,Great space to feel at ease. Daniel is a warm-hearted host. One feels really welcome in his apartment. Thanks again.,1,0.9152,Positive
121.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,5,100.0,0,3.7597377799526983,5.0,5.0,4.75,5.0,1140574899469646971,"Claudia fue súper amable desde el inicio de la reservación, estuvo al pendiente de cuando llegamos y nos recibió para darnos las llaves y nos mostró la habitación, el lugar es muy cómodo y no se escucha nada de ruido desde el exterior, excelente lugar para descansar después de un día de mucho caminar, está cerca de las estaciones del metro lo cual facilita mucho el moverse.",1,-0.296,Negative
