55.0,2,1.0,1.0,0.0,19,100.0,0,1.1163752917367462,4.95,4.84,4.93,4.84,50887156,"Overall good, pleasant the stay and the homey feeling that I encountered thanks to the host and his discreet and kind presence.<br/>Location very convenient and close to public transports, resto/bars & facilities.<br/>Bedroom very spacious with twp big windows and sufficient clothing storage.<br/>Would have enjoyed a microwave in the kitchen but I managed in all cases with what was already present.<br/>Possibility to park bicycles in the inner courtyard definetely a plus.",1,0.8248,Positive
67.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,31,100.0,1,0.7518298030804867,4.84,4.68,4.86,4.75,27120381,"Thank you for hosting us! We found the Airbnb to be clean, functional and perfect for our stay in Berlin. The host was responsive and very helpful! Thanks again!",1,0.9555,Positive
105.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,0,7.833386708780405,4.71,4.7,4.61,4.59,18863113,The host was very friendly and helpful with everything that we asked about or needed help with,1,0.8503,Positive
