90.0,3,2.0,1.0,3.0,12,100.0,1,2.1522006943825973,4.94,4.87,4.93,4.9,3783117,"Bettina‘s place is cosy is very well located. We found everything we needed in the apartment, the kitchen is fully equipped and the sleeping arrangement was flexible. Everything was really clean. Bettina is really friendly and helpful - she even got a travel cot for my daughter when I asked if it was possible to have one. Thank you Bettina - maybe we stay again one day!",1,0.9396,Positive
90.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,42,100.0,1,1.9905011360206333,4.92,4.95,4.99,4.84,16279620,tolle Gastgeberin,1,0.0,Neutral
306.0,8,3.0,2.0,5.0,44,100.0,1,6.90827181205849,4.86,4.8,4.85,4.68,311703,"kathrin's place is a perfect base for exploring Berlin! It's really spacious, beautifully decorated and has everything you need. The neighbourhood is brilliant - easy distance to public transport and great restaurants and cafés if you want to stay local. Would definitely recommend and stay here again. The only thing I would note is that there is one a door separating two of the bedrooms, so for those sleeping in these two bedrooms, there is not much privacy - it wasn't an issue for us though.",0,0.9758,Positive
146.0,2,1.0,2.0,2.0,24,100.0,1,4.75828634214059,4.77,4.63,4.91,4.58,242794,"To make it short: the flat is just as nice, as shown on the pictures.<br/>I stayed for over 2 weeks and was happy with it throughout that time.<br/>Be aware that the flat is only being rented out and no one actually lives there. <br/>The kitchen is well equipped!<br/>The flat is perfectly located in Friedrichshain and only a 10 minute walk from Kreuzberg, 10 min by metro to Alexanderplatz.<br/><br/>Everything went fine concerning the handover of the keys; it's a little team that looks after the flat.",1,0.9134,Positive
211.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,28,100.0,1,3.98074662102462,4.76,4.82,4.84,4.57,37077823,"the place was great location, and it was super clean and nice place.  We would stay there again.  The host was very nice and quick to respond.",1,0.946,Positive
131.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,26,100.0,0,1.6828544498555562,4.79,4.74,4.92,4.56,45802199,"Sehr schöne Wohnung im Gebiet Prenzlauer Berg. <br/>Wir waren zu zweit für eine Nacht dort und dafür war es wirklich perfekt. <br/>Das einzige, was etwas gestört hat war, dass die Fenster der Wohnung auf Höhe des Bürgersteigs waren und die Wohnung somit gut einsehbar war von außen. Es gab Vorhänge, die das vermieden haben. Jedoch handelte es sich dabei um Verdunklungsvorhänge, womit die Wohnung direkt sehr dunkel wurde. Dieses Probleme ließe sich vielleicht noch mit lichtdurchlässigen Vorhängen oder Plissees beheben. Da die Wohnung jedoch in einem sehr interessanten Viertel liegt, waren wir ohnehin viel unterwegs und es hat uns nicht groß beeinflusst in unserem Aufenthalt.<br/>Wir fanden die Wohnung vor allem sehr stilvoll und chic eingerichtet.<br/>Wir würde wiederkommen.",1,-0.9882,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,16,100.0,0,6.429700749840484,4.57,4.29,4.57,4.86,40741736,"The place is clean and comfortable. Easy to find and the train station is just nearby, so it is easy to go to anyplace.",1,0.9014,Positive
115.0,2,1.0,0.0,2.0,16,100.0,0,1.6522173823377917,4.45,4.57,4.64,4.47,51795737,Muy bien ubicado,1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,44,40.0,0,5.24496717963041,4.96,4.84,4.73,4.73,51936436,Great hosts!,1,0.6588,Positive
114.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,14,100.0,0,4.700218292856508,4.61,4.6,4.74,4.44,18473062,"Good location and spacious house. <br/>Record player was a nice extra touch! <br/>Check-in went very smooth. <br/>Stores and subway close by.<br/>Kitchen equipment could be better, and some extra clean cloths and drying towels would have been nice.",1,0.9245,Positive
68.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,28,100.0,1,6.576517854147013,4.72,4.76,4.31,4.63,36310980,房子很棒，性价比高，但是离中心位置稍远,1,0.0,Neutral
70.0,1,0.0,1.0,1.0,14,80.0,0,3.095255848504089,4.66,4.84,4.69,4.26,28156,"A great apartment in a nice and quite central neighbourhood. The apartment has bicycles for rent, which I really recommend. There is also Wi-Fi which is a great bonus.<br/><br/>Overall our experience was great, and we will certainly consider staying here again the next time we're in Berlin.<br/><br/>Side note: The hamburger at The Bird, 100 meters from the apartment, is AMAZING! Try it.",1,0.9828,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,1,4.810660731926917,4.96,4.98,4.89,4.97,10325781,Cool place,1,0.3182,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,6,100.0,0,4.9128586206506695,4.67,4.22,5.0,4.44,9931207,"Это был первый опыт использования сервиса и он оказался крайне положительным, не в последнюю очередь, благодаря хозяину квартиры Майку. Квартира действительно очень чистая и ухоженная. Располагается удобно, если вы приезжаете в Берлин погулять, то эта квартира лучший выбор. Близко метро и электрички, с помощью которых легко и быстро добраться в не только в любой район города, но и по прямой можно доехать до Потсдама, где есть что посмотреть.<br/><br/>Иными словами, квартира стоит запрашиваемых денег. ",1,0.0,Neutral
