64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,0,5.334135742850718,5.0,4.98,4.95,4.9,799181725836295737,We loved our stay. Nice house and confortable bed in a very lively neighborhood. And the hosts were really friendly and helpful before and during our stay. 100% recommend!,1,0.9598,Positive
