125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,44,100.0,0,10.589555736276225,4.25,4.0,4.0,4.75,19874179,Das Haus war während unseres Aufenthaltes ein gemütliches und schönes Zuhause. Stilvoll eingerichtet. Und sehr freundliche Gastgeber. Dankeschön!,1,-0.636,Negative
35.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,1,12.910760097135975,4.89,4.78,4.81,4.88,24951430,"Nikolas' place is really nice and clean. It looks exactly like in the pictures and as described. You basically sleep on a cozy bed in the cellar, which is equipped with a nice private bathroom. You also have a microwave, a water boiler, and a fridge. Nikolas also gave many things like chocolates, tea, and coffee. The area is very peaceful and is easily reachable with the U-Bahn (around 40 minutes from Alexanderplatz). Overall a highly recommendable place.",1,0.9586,Positive
103.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,0,4.179832601624142,4.59,4.65,4.31,4.44,45809645,"Stanza pulita, calda e dotata di tutto il necessario. Zona molto carina, vicina ad un parco e a molti locali. Consiglio!",1,0.0,Neutral
97.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,6.039969405427581,4.9,4.86,4.8,4.82,31382644,"Beautiful space, right next to subway and S train, so convenient to get to and from. Newly renovated with balcony and super comfortable beds. Benjamin was great in communicating with us and help us with beautiful local tips, and they were so good! Would recommend and hope to stay there again in the future!",1,0.9859,Positive
118.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,15,93.0,0,2.300393790485076,4.71,4.62,4.74,4.62,16951349,"Es war alles da was man braucht. Kommunikation war nicht sehr persönlich, aber ausreichend und freundlich. Die Lage war gut, nah am Bahnhof aber haben uns nachts nicht sehr wohl in der Umgebung gefühlt. In der Wohnung war aber alles gut und ruhig.",1,-0.9678,Negative
99.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,1,12.77543094468834,4.93,4.91,4.79,4.86,16633391,"Besser hätten wir es nicht treffen können! Die Wohnung ist ein gemütliches Zuhause mit Berliner Altbau-Charme, die Ausstattung ist sehr gut, es fehlt an nichts. Die Lage im Mierendorff-Kiez bietet Ruhe nach einem erlebnisreichen Tag in der Stadt. Charmant ist die Nähe zum Schloss Charlottenburg - bei einem nächtlichen Spaziergang durch den dunklen Schlosspark konnten wir die aufwändige Pflege der Pflanzen und Bäume über ein ausgeklügeltes, weitverzweigtes Bewässerungssystem erleben. Interessante Geräuschkulisse bei Dunkelheit 😊 Am nächsten Morgen, am Frühstückstisch, freut man sich über ein tolles Vogelkonzert im Hinterhof! Einkaufsmöglichkeiten befinden sich in Laufnähe. Wir sind mit eigenen Fahrrädern angereist, die wir sicher im Hinterhof unterstellen durften. In 15 Minuten gelangt man radelnd, beschaulich entlang der Spree, zum Bahnhof Zoo und ist mittendrin im bunten Treiben der Großstadt. Heiko ist ein überaus netter, aufmerksamer Gastgeber, der sich flexibel auf seine Gäste einstellt. Wir fahren regelmäßig nach Berlin, und haben hier alles gefunden was wir uns gewünscht haben. Wir kommen wieder! Lieben Dank an dich, Heiko!",1,-0.9789,Negative
23.0,1,0.0,1.0,1.0,24,100.0,0,10.52476842664997,4.62,4.32,4.71,4.39,25202253,A terrible experience. Dirty. Beer and alcohol bottles everywhere. Loud music. Nothing was prepared. Room mates under influence of alcohol. I reported the matter with photos and got full refund. Not for for Air BNB,1,-0.7626,Negative
270.0,6,3.0,1.0,4.0,47,100.0,1,1.3910800100424443,4.86,4.75,4.91,4.72,4114966,Fantastic appartement and neighbourhood!,0,0.5983,Positive
155.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,47,99.0,0,6.070945397633094,4.81,4.6,4.79,4.68,909318377890699731,Alles verlief unglaublich unkompliziert 🤗,1,0.0,Neutral
54.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,1,3.964172733559853,4.93,5.0,4.93,4.8,1282751812674090356,"Eine charmante Wohnung, mit alten Holzdielenböden, hohen Decken, geschmackvoll eingerichtet, mitten in Kreuzberg, Susanne ist eine sehr zugewandte, umweltbewusste Gastgeberin. <br/>Die einzige Einschränkung für mich war die Lage des Zimmers, direkt an den Flur, die Küche, das Bad der Wohnung angrenzend. Dadurch, dass die Böden knarren, die Türen nicht wirklich gut schließen, ist die Wohnung hellhörig, d.h., wenn Susanne oder Lean früh aufstehen oder spät nach Hause kommen, bekommt man das im Zimmer mit, je nachdem, wie gut oder tief der eigene Schlaf ist.",1,-0.9816,Negative
137.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,1.189406824976013,4.86,4.84,4.93,4.79,264459,Good location with a variety of restaurants and markets nearby.  Everything you need for a short trip. Henrik is super friendly and flexible with chek-in and check-out. He responded quickly to our questions and he had good suggestions for Berlin. Recommended! (:,1,0.9589,Positive
70.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,7.041900626314951,4.89,4.97,4.79,4.81,15107151,"We had a wonderful stay at Michael's! He welcomed us as soon as we arrived in Berlin although it wasn't the check-in time yet. Our hosts made us feel at home, made sure we had everything we needed, and gave us advices about visiting attractions in Berlin and Potsdam. The place is in a quiet area, but near tram and bus stops and a supermarket. <br/>",1,0.6114,Positive
64.0,2,2.0,1.0,1.0,10,100.0,0,11.196854566622646,4.64,4.85,4.88,4.75,7037153,"Perfect sray. Frauke was very kind and helpful. Her apartment is very cosy, we felt like home.<br/>Perfect location close to S-bahn and the city center. Everything was perfect. Highly recomend!",1,0.9513,Positive
127.0,7,3.0,1.0,4.0,41,100.0,0,4.334292034577571,4.7,4.56,4.77,4.71,1159572,"Great accomodation in a quiet neighbourhood. At first we couldn't find the front door, because the description told us to ring a specific bell but nobody answered. Eventually a friend of Ralph opened the door for us and shown us around the accomodation. <br/>It was very spacious, but very very damp as it was located in the cellar. If we didn't empty the dehumidifiers every day, it was like walking into a pool. One of the rooms didn't have a window which made it very warm there. However it was very cool in the rest of the accomodation! A lot, and I mean a LOT of insects, mosquitos, spiders, moths. Apart from that everything was very clean, nice beds, nice living room.<br/>Unfortunately at the time, construction was going on outside which made a lot of noice, especially early in the morning. <br/>One of the nights at I think 01:30 we had some music playing and Ralphs friend came very angry knocking at our door to tell us to put it off as if we were having a party.<br/>All in all, nice place to stay!",0,0.9888,Positive
153.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,55,100.0,1,2.349349810159802,5.0,5.0,4.98,4.77,37412496,Second séjour dans cet appartement berlinois ! Très bon emplacement et très bonne communication ! Merci encore :),1,0.555,Positive
76.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,93.0,0,12.41205891247695,4.51,4.87,4.38,4.64,44054396,"Zur Zeit werden noch weitere Zimmer hergerichtet, wenn Alles fertig ist und die Preise bleiben so ist es sehr gut.",1,-0.5994,Negative
223.0,4,2.0,2.0,2.0,46,100.0,0,4.535522596548142,5.0,5.0,4.83,5.0,893200152066638324,We enjoyed our stay at Barbara's apartment. It was nice to return to after a busy day in the city. The place was immaculate and spacious. Having two bathrooms was a nice luxury. We enjoyed going to some of the local places for dinner at very reasonable prices as well. Would recommend.,0,0.9413,Positive
55.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,0,1.354221835889287,4.91,4.71,4.96,4.9,14257495,"L'alloggio è una casa della ""Berlino Est"" restaurata in modo molto attento, con oggetti di design molto belli, ha un bellissimo spazio esterno che noi non abbiamo goduto vista la neve. L'host è davvero una bellissima persona, amichevole e attenta ai bisogni. Cucina a disposizione per il caffè e altro, bagno molto pulito e comodo. Letto altissimo, attenzione se ci sono problemi di deambulazione.<br/>Posizione comodissima per i mezzi, team e metro. A piedi si può arrivare in tutti i luoghi da visitare...Berlino è bellissima!",1,0.4003,Positive
90.0,2,3.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,1,0.7053599912648324,4.98,4.96,4.93,4.87,1081373049142109426,집이 새로 생긴 곳인지 정말 너무 깨끗하고 예뻤어요! 화장실은 크고 깔끔하고 모던함! 저희 집 화장실보가 깨끗해요 진짜   방도 크기도 적당하고 너무 좋아요! 완전 추천! <br/>위치도 어딜가든 몇 분 안걸렸고 근처에 역도 많아서 좋았어요 알렉산더 광장까지 9분? 정도 도보로 이동가능해서 최고의 위치였습니다 <br/>주인 아저씨는 정말 친절하고 항상 필요한것이다 질문이 있는지 또는 아침에 커피가 있으니 마셔도 된다고 물어봐주시고 말해주세요!! 아저씨가 옆 방에 있으셔서 언제든 문제 생기면 바로 해결해 주실수 있을거 같아요!<br/>집이 일층 (한국으로 치면2층) 이라 앞에 공사(?)하는 사람이랑 눈 마주칠수 있는데 아침에만 커튼치면 괜찮아요! 다음에도 올거 같아요 가격이 중심지에 있는거 치고 너무 저렴한데 집이 너무 좋아서 진짜 놀라워요!,1,0.0,Neutral
70.0,4,2.0,1.0,1.0,39,100.0,1,4.21217404355417,4.83,4.89,4.74,4.76,19580816,"Sehr nette Vermieterin mit persönlichem Empfang, gut erreichbare Unterkunft mit Aufzug. Schnelle Reaktion der Gastgeberin, falls etwas nicht passen sollte. Wir haben die beiden Balkone sehr genossen, da man je nach Tageszeit aussuchen kann wo man sitzt.",1,-0.5994,Negative
