80.0,5,2.0,2.0,2.0,29,100.0,0,1.018201614464904,4.81,4.87,4.77,4.83,173153,"6 girls in Berlin for a birthday - fantastic apartment in an excellent location, close to both Mitte and Prenzlauer berg, so ideally placed for sights, bars, restaurants etc. The apartment is beautifully and carefully decorated, with modern furniture, but retaining its characcter and charm. Two of the beds are in the living room shown, but the kitchen/dining space is even larger than it appears so we used this area for relaxing, eating etc. Wolfgang could not have been more helpful, from adding on an extra person for whom he also got a mattress, very kindly looking out for our lost luggage which was being delivered, and e-mailing us to send back some jewellery we'd left. We even popped into his party on the Friday evening! Could not recommend highly enough!",1,0.9772,Positive
