80.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,16,100.0,1,1.739092654978246,4.85,4.87,4.92,4.77,29892626,"Ev temiz, düzenli ve sıcaktı. Konumu gayet iyiydi, evin hemen önünden tramvay geçiyor. Sadece giriş saati daha erken olabilir, ancak bu da zaten ev kurallarında belirtilmişti, biliyorduk ve herhangi bir sürprizle karşılaşmadık.",1,0.0,Neutral
181.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,1,13.645787798249891,4.89,5.0,4.67,4.56,31427769,Alles prima.,1,0.0,Neutral
108.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,70,100.0,1,2.641127618215382,4.96,4.94,4.95,4.88,267951,"PLEASE PLEASE PLEASE....stay at Frank's flat. It is amazing and super big. Frank is a great host and he was waiting for us after an hour and half of my arrival with a cold refreshment pitcher of water. The amenities are amazing. Frank really think about everything and every single detail like coffee, muesli, tea, shampoo, laundry service,speakers for your phone, guide tours flyers(in most languages) a huge map of Berlin in the kitchen wall and much much more so you can have the best time in Berlin without any worry. Public transport is all around the flat. From tram, train and underground. You can even see the television tower from the balcony. The neighborhood is hipster and very urban with great and tons of bars, coffee shops and supermarkets. Please please again STAY AT FRANK'S FLAT! HE WAS AN AMAZING AND SUPER HOST AND VERY WELCOMING. You will no regret it. I will go back to Berlin and definitely come back to his flat. DANKE Frank!  :)",1,0.9956,Positive
50.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,1,11.950234688344011,4.94,4.91,4.9,4.88,8331619,"Sabrina ist eine sehr freundliche Gastgeberin. Wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt. Das Haus hat einen tollen Charme und man hat viel Platz. Parken direkt vor der Haustür möglich. Ruhige Lage, trotzdem zentral. <br/>Wir kommen gerne wieder! <br/>Ralph",1,0.0,Neutral
127.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,1,1.4421228333958134,4.85,4.85,4.9,4.78,11648023,"Great, tidy and smart apartment to stay in. Great location with all sights within walking distance or easily accessed by the underground which is opposite the apartment.",1,0.9231,Positive
103.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,0,4.998950809232622,4.74,4.56,4.71,4.58,975215450105675415,"Studio remarquablement calme, à une dizaine de minutes de marche d’une station permettant un accès très facile et rapide aux principaux points d’intérêt de la ville. Aussi un arrêt de bus encore plus proche.",1,0.0,Neutral
88.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,0,12.760805103334942,4.7,4.76,4.71,4.68,1574592,"Anton’s apartment is the perfect basecamp for excursions in Charlottenburg and for a trip to Spandau. You feel safe and comfortable in the apartment. If you want to cook you have access to a well equipped kitchen and a gas stove.  You have U-Bahn and S-Bahn just a stone throw away.  You can buy your tickets on the platform.  The interaction with Anton and the personal meeting with Barbara went well. If you are fond of beer we recommend the Lemke am Schloss ( they offer delicious Flammkuchen too!), Brauhaus Spandau (Spandau) and the local Raucherkneipe  Lilliput( just around the corner from Olbersstraße). All in all we enjoyed the stay in the apartment. <br/>Peter and Kerstin<br/>Linköping <br/>Sweden",1,0.9778,Positive
152.0,5,2.0,1.0,5.0,40,100.0,1,1.5968425433019005,4.81,4.77,4.93,4.69,22677,It was very comfortable and relaxing staying thanks to Ramfis.<br/>Everything is equipped and convenient. Best staying Mitte! I'd like to visit again.,0,0.9513,Positive
150.0,1,0.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,0,9.387515191508518,4.36,4.39,4.71,4.29,1055746491460468407,"L'angolo cottura piuttosto piccolo e poco attrezzato e alcuni piatti e posate erano da lavare una seconda volta. Ma il letto era comodo, la stanza luminosa e internet veloce. Ci tornerei",1,0.0,Neutral
139.0,2,2.0,1.0,2.0,13,100.0,1,1.3840155362476008,4.76,4.62,4.9,4.34,1252712776956688251,"Super Unterkunft, im Hinterhof, sehr ruhug bis auf normaler Wochenend-Palaver der Nachbarn. Der Hinterhif ist begrünt und dadurch selbst in der Sommerhitze angenehm schattig und kühl. <br/>Die Unterkunft ins von der Fläche her sehr grosszügig und luftig gestaltet. Die eine oder andere Kleinigkeit könnten verbessert werden (Kleiderhaken, Ablage für Koffer und Schuhe), aber Ralf hat das schon selbst gesagt, dass er noch an der weiteren Möbilierung arbeitet. Das Bett war gross mit angenem fester Matratze. Die Wohnung ist absichtlich schlicht und sehr stilvoll eingerichtet. Die Küchenzeile todellos und mit allem bestückt, was man braucht. Das Bad ist sehr grosszügig, hell und luftig. <br/>Die Unterkunft war tip top sauber und das Service-Team von Ralf war jederzeit erreichbar.<br/>Ich komme gerne wieder zurück!",1,-0.9851,Negative
63.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,14,100.0,1,6.073041693624513,4.82,4.74,4.81,4.77,7233314,"Ich habe den Aufenthalt sehr genossen, nur ans Stiegen-steigen musste ich mich gewöhnen.",1,0.0,Neutral
