118.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,20,93.0,0,2.347776216465179,4.76,4.76,4.73,4.65,18120892,Evi çok beğendik. 4 kişi rahatlikla kalabilir. Sessiz rahat bir daire. Metroya yakın olması oldukça avantajlı.<br/>Mutfakta yemek yapabilecek her türlü alet var. Kesinlikle tavsiye edebileceğim bir yer.,1,0.0,Neutral
93.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,28,100.0,0,7.258758486122637,4.68,4.71,4.21,4.47,1196392469976086264,"Owner is very kind and replies very quick. We will definitely recommend this accommodation to our friends who want to visit Berlin. Just enough place for four people! Very easy to find and nearby have supermarkets, very convenience place.",1,0.9411,Positive
90.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,34,100.0,0,18.49343314749856,4.74,4.77,4.5,4.81,5065008,"Prima appartement met zelfs een buitenruimte, waar we vanwege het regenachtige weer geen gebruik van hebben gemaakt. We hebben twee fietsen mogen gebruiken en hadden nog twe fietsen bij ons. Het is een uur fietsen naar het centrum van Berlijn. Dus we hebben aardig wat kilometers gemaakt. Alles was brandschoon, netjes en ruim. Alles wat je nodig hebt, was aanwezig. De ontvangst vriendelijk, alhoewel we al eerder (12.00 uur) aankwamen dan de bedoeling (15.00 uur). De gastheer stond gelijk voor ons klaar.",1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,10,3.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,0,2.0707010580233627,4.66,4.66,4.67,4.55,46794943,"Tolle Unterkunft, sehr gute Verkehrsanbindung. Gerne kommen wir wieder 😊",0,0.0,Neutral
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,13,100.0,0,11.00342193785659,4.0,4.0,4.0,4.0,34935431,"Nur kurz bezogen, wegen Unsauberkeit bzw. extrem schlechter Reinigungsleistung, Wäsche mit deutlichen Gebrauchsspuren sofort wieder Räumlichkeiten verlassen.<br/>So stelle ich mir eine Unterkunft in Bezug auf Sauberkeit nicht vor.",1,0.0,Neutral
69.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,6.409080116623725,4.8,4.78,4.86,4.75,24216126,"Die Kommunikation mit Frank lief reibungslos. Die Wohnung ist sehr gut gelegen, sowohl Supermarkt als auch die Öffentlichen sind in ein paar Minuten zu Fuß erreichbar. Die Wohnung, vor allem die Küche, hätte etwas sauberer sein können. Ansonsten war alles top und wir würden wieder kommen.",1,-0.9738,Negative
174.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,1,5.572103261112622,4.91,4.89,4.87,4.72,638929182228409025,"Wir waren mit unseren beiden Kleinkindern in Berlin unterwegs und die Unterkunft war ideal für uns: Im Parterre, super mit dem Kinderwagen, grosse& gemütliche Wohnküche, gut ausgestattet und gemütlich. Zwei Zimmer mit Doppelbetten, sogar ein Babybett war vorhanden. Ein Kinderhochstuhl gab es auch und Remy hat uns netterweise sogar ein paar Spielsachen zur Verfügung gestellt! <br/>Die Unterkunft von Remy liegt in unmittelbarer Nähe des Boxhagenerplatzes. Ebenfalls um die Ecke gibt es viele Restaurants, Cafés und kleine Shops. <br/>Wir können die Unterkunft sehr empfehlen und würden jederzeit wiederkommen! Danke Remy für deine Gastfreundlichkeit!",1,-0.9334,Negative
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,52,100.0,1,4.839723855066247,4.96,4.89,4.8,4.88,25151856,Tolle Wohnung in guter Lage!,1,0.0,Neutral
301.0,5,3.0,2.0,3.0,75,100.0,1,4.454494309278697,5.0,4.89,4.68,4.75,50729742,"Een zeer luxe en groot appartement. Zeer goed uitgerust, alles is aanwezig. Een eigen terras, ruime woonkamer en keuken en een enorme badkamer met ligbad, toilet en douche en een kleinere met douche en toilet. Alles hagelnieuw. <br/>Het is ongeveer een kwartiertje fietsen naar Berlin Mitte. Een Lidl zit op 200 meter en genoeg leuke horeca in de buurt. Toplocatie.  <br/>De communicatie met Helena is prima.",0,-0.6124,Negative
115.0,5,1.0,1.0,3.0,28,100.0,1,2.8150039882208566,4.84,4.85,4.88,4.79,425487,Fint til 4 personer - central beliggenhed i rolig gade. Fin gratis parkerinsmuligheder i gå afstand fra boligen.,1,0.0516,Positive
117.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,0,4.541309535464388,4.83,4.79,4.65,4.63,43522753,"The apartment was very clean and spacious, perfect for three people. We felt very comfortable and really enjoyed our stay!<br/>The host was kind and responded quickly to all our messages, which made us feel at ease.<br/>If we have the chance to visit Berlin again, we would definitely love to stay here 😊",1,0.9787,Positive
239.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,30,88.0,0,3.686748663714778,4.43,4.61,4.79,4.15,957737492041138566,"Appartement spacieux, très propre et bien situé, mais service minimum",1,0.0,Neutral
70.0,4,2.0,1.0,1.0,39,100.0,1,4.21217404355417,4.83,4.89,4.74,4.76,19580816,Meine Eltern haben über die Weihnachtstage 2019 bei Aneres übernachtet. Sie waren zufrieden und haben mir gesagt es sei sauber und gut.,1,-0.5994,Negative
137.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,1.189406824976013,4.86,4.84,4.93,4.79,264459,"Henrik's place was absolutely lovely! A petite apartment not 2 minutes away from the U-Bahn, the amenities were all included, Henrik's Wohnung had everything you could want! We ate breakfast every day at the apartment, and the dark curtains were nice for sleeping in. If you want to be one stop away from the city center while living in a quiet neighborhood, I would thoroughly recommend his place!",1,0.8739,Positive
163.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,29,89.0,0,4.611889360258852,4.51,4.68,4.75,4.3,771649342687823471,"This is basically a hotel, don’t expect an Airbnb experience. The location was great though. It’s also a bit pricey for the area and space",1,0.6249,Positive
101.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,1,0.5862334458214636,4.93,4.91,4.98,4.8,5632897,"Super liebe Host, sehr hilfsbereit.<br/>kann ich nur weiterempfehlen!",1,0.636,Positive
72.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,1,7.363278935671278,4.83,4.84,4.86,4.74,250007,Ottimo alloggio e soprattutto pulito. Ulteriore valore aggiunto è il letto comodo. Quartiere signorile con locali non banali. Il padrone di casa è molto gentile. Rapporto qualità prezzo eccellente.,1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,8,3.0,1.0,2.0,45,100.0,1,5.451670615848214,4.87,4.87,4.79,4.68,9770154,"Riccardo was a perfect host. Great communication, really friendly and accommodating. The apartment is gorgeous -- three big bedrooms, cool design, clean, lovely communal spaces. Right beside Viktoriapark, shops, cafes, bars. I wish I lived there! Highly recommended. Thanks! ",0,0.9857,Positive
85.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,4.812972415804947,4.72,4.64,4.75,4.69,16050858,this a beautiful little gem in a great neighbourhood with all the essentials and very attractive interior. check in was very smooth.,1,0.8985,Positive
405.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,59,100.0,1,2.439533040276054,4.94,4.93,4.97,4.77,19455026,"Great location, responsive host, and cool , clean apartment. Easy check-in with the Stephan's friendly co-host.",0,0.9493,Positive
92.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,4.3797985986367935,4.87,4.84,4.87,4.75,31401028,"Really responsive host, clean and tidy. Lots of stairs hahaha. Only minus was it was super hot in Berlin.",1,0.9225,Positive
46.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,1,11.322410583731694,4.81,4.65,4.85,4.79,1272125,"A stylish apartment in a good location within Berlin, approximately 20 mins away from the main tourist attractions. We had the apartment to ourselves for the week so the main interaction with the host was over message. The host was very quick at replying and very helpful. Would 100% recommend to all future travellers.",1,0.8832,Positive
55.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,0,1.354221835889287,4.91,4.71,4.96,4.9,14257495,"Wibke's place is really nice to stay with beautiful terrace and garden and full of light. The neighborhood is full of restaurants and bars. She was great with us, she recommended some authentic places of the city  and she made us feel really comfortable. I recommended 100% Thanks a lot!",1,0.966,Positive
60.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,83.0,1,2.354783050070512,4.95,4.84,4.98,4.82,804280035406038907,"Frauke was an amazing host, always friendly and gave us recommendations for great spots near by for food and markets. If you want to go to mauerpark market on Sunday it’s only a five minute walk. Frauke’s pup 🐶 was so well behaved always quiet and friendly. There is quite a lot of stairs to her apartment if that’s something you want to avoid.",1,0.9472,Positive
129.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,1,5.219581292258965,4.85,4.91,4.88,4.63,632286550077681311,"L’appartement était bien situé, très propre. La literie était confortable. Au calme malgré l’activité du quartier. Nous avons passé un très bon moment dans ce cocon.",1,0.0,Neutral
108.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,45,100.0,1,14.016965070403124,4.97,4.97,4.87,4.89,43340179,Wir hatten eine wunderbare Zeit im AirBnB die Hosts waren immer sehr freundlich und haben immer schnell geantwortet. Die Wohnung ist sehr schön und geschmackvoll eingerichtet. Zusätzlich wurden wir herzlich empfangen.,1,-0.8316,Negative
203.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,47,100.0,1,1.0082912762193283,4.91,4.93,4.95,4.72,5494100,Family of 3 stayed in this 2 bedroom apartment for 5 nights. Easy to locate on google maps and the apartment is in a secure building on the ground floor with only 5 steps to the entry. Beautiful location with train station 5 minutes away. Parking available in the street or cheaper parking one km away for 8 euro a day. The photos on Airbnb do not show the quality or large size of the apartment. The furniture and fittings are all beautiful quality. The small kitchen is functional with all utensils including a Nescafé coffee machine. The shower is marble with a wonderful rain shower head. Quiet at night and light filled and airy during the day. Linen on the beds is excellent quality and plenty of storage too. The laundromat is 2 streets away as there is no washing machine on site. Parks close by for the kids to play. The host is very welcoming and helpful too. 5/5 and worth the $ to be comfortable in a beautiful and quiet neighbourhood.,0,0.9883,Positive
89.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,1,18.71252726233616,4.88,4.75,4.69,4.88,1302024321425498513,What an amazing place! A beautiful experience in a most wonderful part of Berlin close to nature.,1,0.9183,Positive
190.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,99.0,0,2.757489559962004,4.87,4.8,4.93,4.74,1071654509606077535,Thank you so much! Looking forward for the next visit soon,1,0.4199,Positive
77.0,4,2.0,1.5,4.0,36,100.0,1,12.64762879738749,4.62,4.74,4.6,4.52,243238,"The apartment is big, clean, comfortable, with all amenities. The host was wonderful, the garden around the house is amazing.",1,0.926,Positive
111.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,1,2.7911715335500924,4.82,4.9,4.95,4.61,21458398,"Axel was a great host, perfect location and just what you need to explore Berlin. He also gave us recommendations !",1,0.8439,Positive
156.0,6,2.0,1.0,5.0,41,96.0,0,6.1770612336798365,4.42,4.39,4.7,4.29,27018621,El departamento es cómodo y estuvimos muy agusto.,0,0.0,Neutral
77.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,39,100.0,0,3.130777776464285,4.61,4.52,4.72,4.53,572154090232449167,"Laura's place was great. Very easy to get into. I enjoyed the more private space. was a bit confusing which doors led to common space or if they led to other apartments or other airbnbs? floor plan might be helpful. also be warned how low the ceiling is in the loft haha. I banged my head a few times, although the bed is very comfortable! it is nicely located to east side gallery and treptower park. I highly suggest going to Dark Matter too. it was only a €13 Uber ride.",1,0.9594,Positive
127.0,7,3.0,1.0,4.0,41,100.0,0,4.334292034577571,4.7,4.56,4.77,4.71,1159572,El apartamento es muy amplio y está muy bien ubicado. El barrio es seguro y con muchos lugares para comer y cenar. Además no hay nada de ruido. Muy buena comunicación con el anfitrión siempre contestaba rápido. Muy recomendable,0,-0.296,Negative
330.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,44,100.0,0,1.836639153453755,4.86,4.88,4.93,4.75,32287732,"all was as expected, great location, attentive hosts! Would have liked to see little welcome snacks as is the case in many other places, but that’s a detail. Overall, worth the price.",0,0.7873,Positive
164.0,6,2.0,1.5,3.0,42,100.0,1,2.561101005915228,4.82,4.76,4.66,4.69,31014654,"This place is great if you are trying to go to Berghain. You can easily walk there. The shower is absolutely amazing and was perfect after a long night of dancing. I wish the grocery store and food restaurants had been a little closer, but it really wasn’t so bad. Overall, it was a nice spot. My only complaint would be that it feels a bit cluttered in some areas. Especially the bigger room, and the  closet with the washing machine and dryer. Aslo, there was some paint flaking off the wall. Otherwise, it’s a beautiful apartment. Thank you for hosting us!",0,0.9013,Positive
208.0,7,1.0,1.0,5.0,40,100.0,1,12.522069218466587,4.85,4.85,4.89,4.7,861989902104474055,"Schöne Unterkunft und schöne Gegend. War super zu erreichen und Bus/Bahn gleich in der Nähe. Der Check In war sehr einfach, da es eine super Anweisung vorab vom Gastgeber gab. Einziges kleines Makel wäre die Badezimmertür, diese ließ sich schwer schließen und öffnen, aber sind trotzdem damit klar gekommen. Würden die Unterkunft jederzeit wieder besuchen.",0,-0.8316,Negative
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,22,100.0,0,2.8876798803195003,4.83,4.52,4.78,4.87,22739598,"Fantastic apartment, great location and lovely host!",1,0.9151,Positive
55.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,0.8025330705337501,4.79,4.94,4.83,4.77,11403270,"Super close to Alexanderplatz! easy to get around, and is right next to 2 supermarkets.",1,0.7959,Positive
68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,0,7.131858363401936,4.97,4.97,4.95,4.86,1172431080955868883,Wir waren 2 Nächte hier in Berlin. Super hosts und alles vor Ort was man brauchte . <br/>Super Lage !,1,0.636,Positive
