51.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,11,100.0,1,1.561596824087388,4.86,4.91,4.92,4.78,731285,"Very cool and chill flat. I rented the room for a month after arriving in Berlin, and it was just perfect. Cool neighborhood with bars, restaurants, vintage shops..",1,0.8221,Positive
28.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,27.374398469506133,4.9,4.9,4.49,4.84,21194616,"Dirk and Kathrin are very nice people. Super friendly, welcoming, and accommodating. They went out of their way to help me. <br/>I was very comfortable in my room. There is a nice garden in the back, and I loved opening the windows in the morning to enjoy the summer weather and the garden view.<br/>The bathroom was very spacious and clean. I liked that the shower had really good water pressure, which is something I lack at home.<br/>The house is near a supermarket (a few blocks away) and a few minutes away from the M49 and X49 bus, which runs very often and at all times. I never had to wait to wait too long for the bus.<br/>Staying with them felt like being at home. I would definitely stay with them again.",1,0.9894,Positive
76.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,99.0,0,2.1897939786653327,4.2,4.3,4.67,4.18,38971259,Good room in nice area!,1,0.7177,Positive
151.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,28,97.0,0,3.918641789625612,4.72,4.74,4.79,4.58,11450419,"Appartement idéal pour une famille avec 2 enfants. Situé proche du métro, il permet d’accéder rapidement au attractions principales de Berlin. Super marché et restaurant à proximité pour varier les plaisirs. Le logement est spacieux, calme et très bien équipé. Je recommande aux familles.",1,0.7717,Positive
218.0,6,3.0,2.0,6.0,36,100.0,1,3.003280992717941,4.82,4.78,4.83,4.62,14649703,Great space and easy to find and check in. The host was always responsive to questions and concerns. The location was easy to get to as well from the station.,0,0.926,Positive
