80.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,0,16.324415304843132,4.78,4.72,4.61,4.6,594008251420806587,"Toller Aufenthalt in einer sehr sauberen und süßen Wohnung! Einchecken schnell und unkompliziert, gute Anbindung an den ÖPNV. Ideal für einen Kurztrip zu Zweit. Wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt und hatten ein tolles Wochenende!",1,0.6103,Positive
64.0,2,2.0,1.0,1.0,8,100.0,0,2.256237125171232,4.17,4.17,4.0,4.17,15034680,"Andreas was very good in his communication, we felt at home the first second we arrived. At the corner there was a really nice breakfast place. If you are going to Berlin I would recommend staying at this place.",1,0.831,Positive
125.0,6,3.0,1.0,2.0,19,100.0,0,4.18885293134062,4.9,4.9,4.7,4.65,10893006,"Thomas' place was an incredible and ideal resting spot for our trip to Berlin. Generously spacious and replete with amenities, it is located in the district of Friedrichschain, which itself is worth walking around for its selection of restaurants, bars and cafes. Getting to and from rest of the city was easy due to a host of available connections. Key exchange was a breeze and communication was clear and succinct.<br/>I wholeheartedly recommend Thomas' place to anyone visiting Berlin.",1,0.9337,Positive
68.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,45,100.0,1,35.229987694282585,4.82,4.61,4.89,4.68,1242815787146152998,ich war zum zweiten Mal bereits da- alles wunderbar!,1,-0.636,Negative
