73.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,33,100.0,0,6.432398665886561,4.53,4.44,4.71,4.48,43864181,"Alex’s place was a great place to base yourself in Berlin, with easy access to public transport to get around. Alex’s place was clean and tidy and good value for money.",1,0.9325,Positive
130.0,6,3.0,1.0,4.0,54,100.0,0,30.77281964045051,4.52,4.61,4.68,4.2,4102472,"Die Wohnung war wie beschrieben, sauber und alles was man benötigt.<br/>Der See dahinter mit direktem Zugang spitze allerdings ist Rolando sehr unzugänglich wir hatten für die Montage 7 Nächte gebucht sind aber nur 4 Nächte dort geblieben.<br/>Rolando hat mir 450 Eur extra abgenommen weil in der Woche<br/>4 Personen vor Ort waren.<br/>Als ich gefragt habe ob er mir für die 2. Woche wenigstens die 450 Euro erstattet bekommen könnte wurde dieses leider strickt abgelehnt <br/>Schade eigentlich da fahre ich nie wieder hin",0,-0.9661,Negative
95.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,1,3.2655381260982392,4.91,4.87,4.87,4.82,456902,"Stefan's apartment is perfectly located in a lively - yet quiet at night - neighbourhood. Shops, restaurants and public transportation are easy to access. The apartment itself is stylish, comfortable and has everything it needs. We enjoyed relaxing inside. Stefan has been super responsive and helpful before and during the stay. Highly recommended place!",1,0.984,Positive
40.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,11,98.0,0,2.4809600042725424,4.56,4.5,4.85,4.64,35816059,Great,1,0.6249,Positive
145.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,1,6.881210243394802,4.87,4.6,4.57,4.69,1468872,"Eine wirklich schöne Unterkunft, die vor allem durch eine Menge Licht und die persönliche Einrichtung heraussticht. Wir haben uns gleich zu Hause gefühlt und ausgiebig die Möglichkeiten der voll ausgestatteten Küche genutzt. <br/>Für persönliche Anliegen war Fritz stets erreichbar und hat umgehend und hilfreich geantwortet. <br/>Wenn man außerdem so wie wir nur in Neukölln unterwegs ist, kann man alles zu Fuß zu erreichen. <br/>Ich kann die Unterkunft allen wärmstens empfehlen, die mehr als nur einen Schlafplatz im schönen Neukölln suchen.",1,-0.9761,Negative
171.0,7,2.0,1.0,4.0,43,100.0,0,5.310747178957121,4.76,4.64,4.75,4.67,46864073,"The area is nice and cozy  , close to Tempelhof park and some really good restaurants close by and in general walkable to all the nice parts of neukolln and  kreuzberg. it can also be a bit dirty , people leaving bottles and clothes outside on the streets",0,0.7089,Positive
72.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,0,4.826947409005062,4.74,4.63,4.86,4.7,40881486,"It’s very well located, right next to the subway and many restaurants, clean and easy to check in and out. It’s small but it has a fair price and for one or two people on a short stay it’s very good. I’d recommend it.",1,0.9369,Positive
179.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,98.0,0,1.086656671143422,4.66,4.68,4.68,4.41,693907181004707396,Great room in a really nice area!<br/>Everything was perfect clean and you really feel like home.<br/>I would go back for sure,1,0.9582,Positive
125.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,0,4.288663663614089,4.83,4.67,4.83,4.83,566559951780848779,"Schöne Wohnung in Neukölln, absolut Empfehlenswert!",1,0.0,Neutral
190.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,41,100.0,1,4.114262881105487,4.92,4.94,4.91,4.8,1177924,"The apartment become our home away from home for a week and was very comfortable with all of the necessities and a few nice to haves. Doerthe meet us and provided a bottle of champagne and some lovely food for us. We arrived on new years eve not realizing that shops would be closed. We enjoyed the food and treats over the course of the next day. The apartment is well located within a 5 minute walk to the train station & supermarkets, restaurants & shops are also a couple of minutes away. We had a great time.",0,0.9678,Positive
161.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,91.0,0,4.871252294318258,4.65,4.79,4.85,4.47,46865074,Easy check in and great area !!,1,0.8217,Positive
103.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,20,100.0,0,5.515465796548925,4.91,4.68,5.0,4.45,20132686,"Amiram's flat in Berlin is quiet, comfortable and in a vibrant kiez full of restaurants, bars and cool cafes, though none of the noise reaches the apartment as it's in the quiet back building. <br/>Everything you need is nearby. Upon arrival, the host greeted us with a nice spread of bread, cake, and cheese. <br/>Unfortunately, the flat wasn't as clean as possible, but a cleaner was promptly arranged to come. Amiram was easy to contact, and quick to respond. <br/>The living room is dark - not much natural light gets into the place, so it's not really somewhere you'd want to chill for long periods of time. But there's so much to do around that you wouldn't want to anyway.<br/>Some of the bedding and kitchen stuff could do with an update, and a deep clean would serve the place well, but otherwise, it was a good stay and the neighbourhood is a buzz!",1,0.9408,Positive
209.0,3,1.0,1.5,2.0,49,100.0,1,13.902035726561811,4.85,4.85,4.71,4.71,926151075715567943,"Super Wohnung, sehr gepflegt und wir fühlten uns von Tonja sehr aufmerksam betreut. Gerne wieder und Danke Tonja",1,0.5994,Positive
40.0,2,2.0,1.5,3.0,57,100.0,1,1.1008973061098215,4.97,5.0,4.92,4.96,31466784,"Great location and close to transportations, supermarket and Alexanderplatz",1,0.6249,Positive
125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,0,5.252315917422114,4.92,4.74,4.85,4.85,5655048,"I’m a big fan of AirBnB’s with a personal  touch, which was definitely the case with Adi’s flat. His personal welcome, his enthusiastic explanations, his caring messages during the stay all added to the feeling of ‘coming home’ to Berlin. The flat itself is well-situated, charming, has every comfort and was spic & span when I arrived. I warmly recommend!",1,0.9769,Positive
70.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,1,2.5329341972975428,4.86,4.8,4.93,4.8,19976281,"Excelente apoyo y tips por parte de Enrique, recomendado",1,0.0,Neutral
20.0,8,1.0,1.5,8.0,18,93.0,0,4.065511825937199,4.47,4.36,4.4,4.54,41420913,"i stayed for three nights and only ever came to the room very late at night and then left really early so i really just slept there. and that was exactly what i was looking for. the rooms where clean und the bed wasn’t too uncomfortable. there was only thing that annoyed me, which isn’t the hostel’s fault at all but in the bed above me there was a middle aged man and everynight he snored so loud that i couldn’t believe it was real. i’m not a sensitive sleeper but because of him i kept waking up randomly in the night, it was insanely loud. i know there’s nothing you can do about it, but if there is a solution maybe consider it because i’m pretty sure the other people in the room were disturbed too. but aside from that it was very good and staff was incredibly friendly and helpfull, they even let me put my stuff in the back after i had checked out already and i got it back later that day.",0,0.9352,Positive
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,0,2.8327811922008834,4.68,4.64,4.67,4.65,705644826442232554,A lovely and comfortable place in a great spot in Kreuzberg. Close to everything and very easy to get around. Host was super friendly and communicative. I really loved my stay here!,1,0.9798,Positive
101.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,15,25.0,0,4.8427137448851765,4.81,4.87,4.59,4.72,19382941,"Jörgs Appartement ist sehr sauber, mit einem tollen Ausblick über Berlin. Wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt.",1,0.0,Neutral
70.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,100.0,1,3.0533340006135603,4.92,4.98,4.93,4.84,7925838,"Aufmerksame und diskrete (zurückhaltende) Gastgeberin, die mir Privatsphäre und Rückzug ermöglicht hat.<br/>Habe mich über die kleinen Aufmerksamkeiten sehr gefreut und würde auf jeden Fall wieder buchen. Vielen Dank für den angenehmen Aufenthalt!",1,-0.8439,Negative
150.0,6,3.0,2.0,4.0,44,100.0,1,5.139349865848991,4.94,4.85,4.97,4.91,5766122,Super schöne Wohnung mit tollen Details und guter Ausstattung. Wir haben uns mega wohl gefüllt .... fast wie Zuhause! <br/>Und würden diese Wohnung jederzeit wieder mieten.,0,0.636,Positive
69.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,0,3.077053794701885,4.8,4.71,4.93,4.7,1162120680748466012,"Es war so wie beschrieben. Sehr nett, ordentlich und sauber. Die Straße ist angenehm ruhig. Das einzige was nicht ganz so toll war, ist das Nebenzimmer, welches durch eine Tür getrennt ist und so die Nachbargeräusche mitteilt.",1,-0.9565,Negative
175.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,1,2.0003755294694376,4.8,4.9,4.84,4.64,23481275,Ok,1,0.296,Positive
312.0,11,3.0,1.0,4.0,42,100.0,1,9.660413858650209,4.92,4.94,4.44,4.83,16237757,This was our second stay with Ben & Simon. And it was once again a fabulous stay.  The beds are comfortable.  The place is clean and spacious.  With nice touches that make it an easy and comfortable stay.  We love the location and found great places near by. I would highly recommend this place to our friends that travel to Berlin.  ,0,0.9856,Positive
97.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,0,13.347444227266896,4.79,4.74,4.95,4.76,1322780,"Our stay in this charming apartment was brilliant! The location is just as lovely, clean and comfortable as described. We had everything we needed: fridge, coffee-machine, hairdryer,... Gunilla was a great host.<br/>In this urban and creative area of Charlottenburg/around Stuttgarter Platz you can find nice restaurants, bars, galleries and shops. By S-Bahn you are in Mitte or central station within 10 minutes. <br/>All in all: the perfect place for a trip to Berlin!",1,0.9863,Positive
102.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,5.980380964128161,4.93,4.99,4.84,4.8,748442565689302326,"Theo and Ann-Cécile were wonderful, wonderful hosts! My brothers and I thoroughly enjoyed our stay. The room was beautiful, well-lit and had everything we needed, and the neighborhood was beautiful, walkable, metro-accessible and near many good restaurants. Theo and Ann-Cécile provided us with everything we needed, and we really appreciated their flexibility with early check-in and luggage drop-off at the end of our trip. Overall, we could not have asked for a better first-time experience in Berlin, and if I ever come back, I will certainly be looking to stay in the same place!",1,0.9871,Positive
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,2.142649937740168,4.91,4.94,4.96,4.89,446975,"Kerstin's place is perfectly placed,just a 15 minute tram ride from Hauptbanhof to a 2minute walk to the apartment. Vibrant area with loads of restaraunts and bars within a five minute walk.But when you go through the gates it is an oasis of calm. The apartment is just as described,and has all you could need. If we visit Berlin again Kerstins place will be the first on our list to book.",1,0.872,Positive
63.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,54.0,1,3.6117169015301593,4.89,4.78,4.78,4.73,53937475,"We were not sure about booking a room with no reviews, but guess what? This was the best choice we made! Nils and Melania are a great couple, super friendly and we even got to spend new years eve with them. The room and the apartment are exactly as seen in the photos, with everything you need for a comfortable stay. The location is great, close to public transportation and easy to get anywhere in the city. There are supermarkets, restaurants and all you need within walking distance. Totally recommended!",1,0.9913,Positive
97.0,2,1.0,1.0,0.0,23,100.0,0,1.0368255639209347,4.7,4.86,4.9,4.66,1141827850047916008,I really enjoyed my stay here! The self check-in was so easy and the room was perfect for my solo trip in Berlin! I also really appreciated being so close to the train station and the neighbourhood felt very safe. Thanks for having me!,1,0.9715,Positive
98.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,1,3.500225852970612,4.83,4.85,4.94,4.78,630486381746781484,"Great place to stay, really enjoyed.",1,0.8268,Positive
