125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,8,100.0,0,2.867018267277232,5.0,4.33,5.0,5.0,11486707,"Tim's place is in a really cool location. It's so artsy and is really great. There were 5 of us, and there was definitely sufficient space. Like my friend said, the apartment has a lot of character. Even though we didn't meet Tim, I feel like we know him quite well through his apartment! Thanks Tim!",1,0.9711,Positive
