112.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,1,1.850891633131909,4.81,4.71,4.95,4.72,1205350,"Appartement, confortable et bien meublé, très bien situé dans un quartier agréable et proche de tout (club, Mauerpark et métro qui relie le centre...). Petit plus : les lits sont grands.<br/>Point négatif : le hall de l’immeuble est envahie par l’odeur des poubelles proches.",1,-0.128,Negative
195.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,60,100.0,0,10.78107435529956,4.95,4.87,4.72,4.72,837034579252960253,"""Heaven on earth"" would be an understatement. The place is AMAZING. It's rare to find such a pristine gem! The house, the furniture, the love for details, the amenities, the peacefulness, the greenery. I cannot wait to come again! The hosts are super super friendly, approachable and flexible. A true jewel this place!",1,0.9874,Positive
60.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,0,7.849032044380452,4.85,4.81,4.89,4.78,11603400,Me sentí como en casa. La habitación era amplia. La ubicación cerca de la U6 es súper práctica. Margarete es una anfitriona maravillosa. Volvería a quedarme en su casa.,1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,36,100.0,1,19.30343504577633,4.97,4.96,4.99,4.84,33847538,"You won't find a better host than Inga, she truly cares about the people who stay there and goes out of her way to make them comfortable.",1,0.7779,Positive
131.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,36,100.0,1,4.248347186024305,4.63,4.75,4.72,4.5,13507504,"Die Lage zur Tram ist einfach unschlagbar, innerhalb von einer Minute ist man an der M10. Es ist trotzdem sehr ruhig gelegen und man hat um sich herum alles was man braucht: einen Bäcker, einen Kiosk der sogar Bio-Eier im Angebot hat, einen Späti, einen Edeka und vieles weiteres. Die Wohnung an sich ist klein, aber fein. Das Bad ist top und modern. Der Wohnraum hat ein sehr gemütliches Bett und eine Couch, eine neue und geräumige Küche und einen großen Esstisch. Es sind hier wirklich nur Kleinigkeiten, die einen stören. Zum Beispiel, dass für 3 Personen oder mehr kochen zu einer kleinen Koordinationsaufgabe wird mit zwei Herdplatten ohne Backofen und Pfannen die dafür nicht die Größe besitzen. Es fehlen essenzielle Bestandteile wie ein Sparschäler und weiteres. Aber das sind wirklich nur Kleinigkeiten, die Wohnung ist wirklich zu empfehlen. Vielen Dank! :)",1,-0.9761,Negative
56.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,0,8.253434016995653,4.52,4.38,4.64,4.48,48135198,Nice and cosy. Everything as expected. Recommend! :),1,0.8221,Positive
66.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,45,100.0,1,8.230717363177027,4.89,4.88,4.84,4.76,34243172,"The apartment very lovely. Everything was in order, there’s a food store close to the apartment. I stayed here together with my partner. Highly recommended!",1,0.7564,Positive
170.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,51,100.0,1,1.4356958153593935,4.66,4.81,4.62,4.51,2396312,"I loved being within the hustle and bustle of the neighbourhood. Very local to Ubahn stations and the larger areas of Berlin such as Alexanderplatz & Friedrichshain by foot also. <br/>Local shops close by and neighbour very friendly when we accidentally double locked the door and struggled to get in! 😬<br/>Note for future - the door locks itself as you exit and you don’t need to use the key ! <br/>The kitchen was well stocked with crockery, cutlery and cooking utensils. Coffee percolator, all important kettle for a cuppa, shower is very powerful and the giant fans provided were a godsend in the boiling weather <br/>Also - a massive amount of plug sockets and lamps which was very helpful. There was extra bedding and pillows and the building was quiet at nighttime with very respectful residents. <br/>Would def return as love the neighbourhood and the apartment is so spacious with a lovely calm energy",0,0.9861,Positive
68.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,22,100.0,1,6.594298777125843,4.71,4.76,4.39,4.65,16469975,"We stayed in Apartments in a group of 3 friends, needed to be close to Körnerpark, so the location was perfekt for us! Located in a quiet and clean Part of a Neukölln. Streets are cosy, nice and the lindes were bloomed. The Apartments was clean and cosy, everything we needed, was in there. Even the hairdryer was with a diffuser. Easily accesed from the street, the separate entrance and a code instead of keys, so no need to share keys. Comfortable beds and Couch. Adorable inner Yard, like a Patio. A bit Dark incide, but it's a first floor. We would be glad come again next time and thanks for hosting!",1,0.961,Positive
126.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,38,97.0,0,1.7520993087590884,4.75,4.77,4.93,4.65,18382782,"Ev; konumu gereği parkın yanında ve çok güzel manzarası var, bunun keyfini de balkondan çıkarabiliyorsunuz. Yatak odası, salon bir arada. Mutfak ayrı, masa salonda. Banyo ve tuvalet bir arada. Kullanışlı ve kutu gibi bir daire. Banyo kapısı ahşap olduğu ve alttan şiştiği için kapı tamamen kapanmıyordu. Bu sorundan ilk gün Stefan'a bahsettim ve ertesi gün gelip kendisi gördü. 1 gün sonra da ustaları gönderdi ve kapıyı tamir ettirdi. Mutfakta yeterince mutfak aleti ve ekipman var. Banyoda da havlu, sabun, şampuan ve saç kurutma makinesi bulunmakta.<br/>Anahtarı teslim alma; Apt. kapısına şifreli kilit konmuştu, Stefan'ın bize verdiği şifre ile kilidi açıp anahtarı aldık ve kolayca giriş sağladık. <br/>Evin konumu; merkeze 15-20 dk yürüme mesafesinde. Metroya 5 dk yürüme mesafesinde. Sakin, huzurlu ve güvenli bir muhit. Tekrar kalmak isterim.<br/>Çöplerin atılması; bu konunun daha açık bir şekilde yönergelerde belirtilmesini rica ederim. Çöpü her yere atamıyorsunuz.<br/>Stefan; yardımcı bir ev sahibi.",1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,16,100.0,0,8.863882394780532,4.79,4.74,4.42,4.84,18093451,"Very nice host, always helpful. Good apartment, with a really nice balcony. Can recommend this place. Easy access to S and U-bahn.",1,0.9459,Positive
150.0,3,3.0,1.0,3.0,15,100.0,0,3.915572947615962,4.42,3.58,4.83,4.33,27775143,"Wir hatten die Ehre beim lieben Jens unterzukommen. <br/>Wir haben uns super herzlich empfangen gefühlt. Jens hat uns mit Bedacht Sachen und Notizen hinterlegt, damit wir uns bei ihm zuhause zurechtfinden. <br/>Das Loft ist sehr heimisch eingerichtet und dank den großen Fenstern kommt sehr viel Tageslicht rein.<br/>Wir empfehlen sein Loft und hoffen selber bald wieder vorbei schauen zu dürfen. <br/>Schöne Grüße aus München!",1,0.0,Neutral
279.0,6,3.0,1.5,5.0,47,100.0,1,2.705723759735617,4.85,4.84,4.93,4.72,12015708,Tolle Wohnung in hipper und lebhafter Umgebung! Kommunikation mit Marcus lief völlig problemlos...wir konnten sogar spontan morgens schon einchecken!  Sehr zu empfehlen!,0,0.0,Neutral
