124.0,3,0.0,8.5,3.0,34,100.0,0,2.6157359022078506,4.67,4.51,4.75,4.59,45354685,"Very likeable place to stay, reception were helpful and and sorted us right out. The room had clothes left over from previous tenants but other than that it was spotless. Very good location with local food spots and bars. All in all very decent.",0,0.8093,Positive
