158.0,5,1.0,1.0,3.0,34,100.0,1,1.1883222668954112,4.86,4.88,4.96,4.78,16152597,What a nice apartment in Berlin!! Wonderful area and amazing decorations. Can’t find any place bigger than this in the center area and under this price. The host is very friendly and always helps me to solve the problem on time. Thank you!,1,0.9576,Positive
198.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,39,100.0,1,3.617036290600905,4.86,4.85,4.9,4.75,27627221,Super schicke Wohnung mit toller Dachterrasse in einer perfekten Lage. Ganz zentral und trotzdem ruhig. Unkomplizierter Checkin. Wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt. Alles hat gepasst. Wir würden jederzeit wieder in dieser Wohnung übernachten. Dankeschön Egil!,1,0.636,Positive
39.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,100.0,1,8.526578777311437,4.93,4.99,4.85,4.94,21545063,"Ulrichs flat is right in the middle of Berlin. He and his partner are very nice and two mornings we had a nice chat with  cup of coffee on the balcony. When I arrived in Berlin I missed our appointment by one hour but Ulrich was nice enough to wait and let me in one hour later. During a very busy week in Berlin the flat was a good place to rest, no problems at all. If you need highspeed-internet or have to down-/upload larger files the Wlan is maybe not for you.",1,0.6289,Positive
108.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,24,100.0,1,7.19555434532373,4.93,4.93,4.81,4.84,36471954,"Great location; very close to the station Südkreuz and in a quiet area. There were everything we needed in the apartment for our stay, and things were clean and cozy at the same time. … We recommend to bring a pair of warm socks, as the old floor can feel a little cold. But otherwise the apartment was warm, and with good shower and cooking facilities. We would like to come back.",1,0.9331,Positive
217.0,9,4.0,1.5,7.0,26,100.0,1,10.11202597942191,4.9,4.89,4.75,4.7,698727,We very much enjoyed our stay at Roumiana's place.  She was a very communicative host and also was always happy to help.  The house was clean with many thoughtful touches.,0,0.9358,Positive
116.0,5,1.0,1.0,4.0,29,100.0,0,2.281356512252844,4.49,4.56,4.75,4.42,16299453,"This place was perfect.  When we arrived, I found the apartment to be even bigger than the photos seemed to show.  There was a lot of light and great airflow with the windows opened so it remained very cool.  We closed the windows at night because the street can be a bit noisy.  The location was close to so many amazing restaurants that we ate.  There is a tram on the street and another one running perpendicular on the corner so you can get anywhere easily.  Our host responded back quickly when we had a question.  ",1,0.9448,Positive
207.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,58,100.0,1,2.222288195756644,4.89,4.97,4.93,4.73,11031031,"Had the opportunity to stay 3 days / 2 nights at that indescribable location. Guess, it is for all those a more than perfect stay, who are looking for a unique experience. Truly Berlin. Thanks Julius for the nice place.",1,0.9369,Positive
72.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,1,7.363278935671278,4.83,4.84,4.86,4.74,250007,Wir haben uns in der Wohnung sehr wohl gefühlt. Ankunft und Abreise waren gut organisiert.,1,0.0,Neutral
180.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,45,85.0,0,1.5095289909770313,4.75,4.84,4.9,4.6,45475252,"Wir würden es weiter empfehlen, da es sehr zentral ist 5min. zur ÖV. Die Unterkunft war modern eingerichtet. Leider finde ich, wenn es eine Küche hat, sollte man sie brauchen können ohne dass man zuerst die Fenster weit aufsperren muss. Irgendwie schade, oder nur angstmacherei?",1,-0.9136,Negative
137.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,1.189406824976013,4.86,4.84,4.93,4.79,264459,"I cant recommend this place enough! It's situated perfectly in beautiful Prenzlauer Berg and the apartment itself is spacious, well equipped and really really nice to spend time at. Both Henrik & Sven are great with communication and always willing to help. Getting to the apartment is quite easy also: its about a 20min walk from Alexander Platz, where the txl bus from Tegel airport drops you. <br/>Stay here, trust me, you wont regret it!",1,0.9812,Positive
33.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,1,6.809556888557899,4.95,4.93,4.86,4.94,7806721,Alles tip top! :),1,0.6239,Positive
121.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,27,100.0,0,4.472653939309849,4.88,4.9,4.81,4.78,10122398,"Martin is a kind, accommodating host. You get everything you need in the cute studio, and the bathroom is clean, nice and big (which can be very important to some people like me)! He also replies to your inquiries quickly so you'll never be left worrying about something. Highly recommend",1,0.9618,Positive
422.0,6,2.0,2.0,4.0,68,100.0,1,16.10146410745308,5.0,5.0,4.78,4.84,1055626771172725060,"Unser Aufenthalt war einfach perfekt! <br/>Die Unterkunft war makellos sauber, minimalistisch, aber stil- und liebevoll eingerichtet und bestens ausgestattet – ein Ort zum Wohlfühlen!<br/>Die Lage vereint Ruhe und gute Erreichbarkeit, ideal zum Entspannen und Erkunden.<br/>In die Innenstadt braucht man nur ca. 20 Minuten mit dem Auto und für Berlin-Verhältnisse ist das echt top.<br/>Wir haben zu sechst die Unterkunft gebucht und für jeden gab es einen gemütlichen Schlafplatz.<br/>Da wir alle Musik machen, war die Unterkunft besonders wegen dem sehr hochwertigen Musikstudio für uns sehr attraktiv.<br/>Das Studio hat High-End Abhörmonitore (Neumann KH 310 A) und eine top Isolierung, sodass man ohne Probleme relativ laut Musik hören kann, ohne die anderen und vor allem die Nachbarn nicht zu stören.<br/>Wir konnten dort gut und ohne Probleme arbeiten. <br/>Besonders beeindruckt hat uns die herzliche Gastfreundschaft. <br/>Die Kommunikation war schnell, freundlich und äußerst hilfsbereit. <br/>Man spürt, dass hier mit viel Lieb",0,-0.9894,Negative
86.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,6.919397234051426,4.86,4.88,4.51,4.74,20942536,"Très bel appartement, très propre. Dans un quartier très calme, proche de toute commodité.  Je recommande fortement !",1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,18,100.0,0,2.368337629837078,5.0,4.8,4.6,4.6,751944845819105789,Saskia was a friendly host and the apartment is a cute alt-bau (a nice way to stay in Germany if you’re considering your options). It was easy to feel at home here and I’d definitely recommend.,1,0.9442,Positive
