141.0,3,0.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,1,8.424857076965763,4.77,4.65,4.77,4.72,17688899,"I had a fantastic stay at Thomas’ Airbnb in Berlin. The space was clean, cozy, and beautifully decorated. His communication was prompt and friendly, making everything seamless. I felt right at home and would definitely stay again! Highly recommended!",1,0.9557,Positive
63.0,6,3.0,1.0,4.0,67,100.0,0,5.897847932678537,4.43,4.3,4.02,4.27,2820362,"Appartement convivial et fonctionnel<br/>Bien desservi par les transports à proximité (tram, bus et train)<br/>L'accueil de Javier a été très sympathique. Nous avons passé un très agréable séjour à Berlin.",0,0.296,Positive
51.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,9,70.0,1,5.069122935735952,4.89,4.84,4.8,4.75,698419375578435815,"Die Wohnung ist sauber, sehr warm, gemütlich. Inserat/Fotos suggerieren jedoch mehr (Wohnzimmer, Dachterrasse) als tatsächlich zur Verfügung stand (Zimmer, Küche, Bad). Die Türen zu allen anderen Zimmern waren stets zu. Das Zimmer ist spartanisch eingerichtet. Elisa ist professionell freundlich, alles easy going. 100% willkommen habe ich mich jedoch nicht gefühlt.",1,-0.6124,Negative
76.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,29,90.0,0,14.020278434129931,4.66,4.69,4.65,4.72,2079942,"A beautiful, peaceful apartment, which looks exactly like the pictures. Every morning, you can see red squirrels and woodpeckers wandering around the big, tall trees that face the large windows. The apartment stays fresh and cool even when it’s hot outside, and the balcony is nice to have a drink on ; the mellow light in the evening is perfect for pictures. The neighborhood is very quiet and calm, and there’s a cute park nearby. Thalia was always quick to answer any questions. The key-box is very practical to check-in, and the apartment was easy to find.",1,0.9802,Positive
160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,87.0,0,3.4802565088356308,4.54,4.54,4.6,4.41,43798011,waren sehr zufrieden,1,0.0,Neutral
