87.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,44,100.0,0,26.07413943568224,4.96,4.85,5.0,4.8,680182172356497351,"Abbiamo trascorso un piacevole soggiorno dal 25 al 30 Giugno 2025 nell'alloggio di An der Rehwiese. Abbiamo fatto il Checkin telefonicamente guidati da Beatrice, che abbiamo incontrato in giardino al ritorno da una passeggiata e che è stata gentilissima. C'erano tutti i servizi come da annuncio e l'appartamento era perfettamente pulito, a parte la presenza di qualche formica. Nelle foto della cucina e zona pranzo,  non si vede la grande credenza con tutto l'occorrente elencato nell'annuncio. L'appartamento era freschissimo rispetto alla temperatura esterna molto calda. Il lago Schlachtensee è abbastanza vicino da raggiungere a piedi. <br/>Grazie mille per la cordialità. <br/>Antonio e Piera",1,0.0,Neutral
81.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,6.919397234051426,4.82,4.86,4.48,4.7,20890869,"My stay at this apartment was great: the hosts were nice and accommodating. The place is modern, clean and equipped with everything that one may need. The location is perfect to explore Berlin and several supermarkets, cafes, etc. are also just some streets down and within walking distance.",1,0.9231,Positive
62.0,1,1.0,0.5,1.0,7,100.0,0,3.834366751003215,4.86,4.97,4.83,4.75,1352145343408864167,"This place is top-notch. Great location, spotless room and totally worth every penny.",1,0.7425,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,5.429459337365097,4.98,4.98,4.91,4.96,711975137721582244,"Erez truly is a super host!! he was so lovely and welcoming :) and really helped us out with everything we needed. His apartment is beautiful and very unique. We felt at peace here! It’s in a great location, with only a short walk to the shops and also to the gallery wall ! Will definitely be returning to stay here :)",1,0.9892,Positive
140.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,91.0,0,4.871252294318258,4.72,4.78,4.85,4.58,46812239,"Very comfy Airbnb and easy to access! The elevator was broken, but getting to and from the unit wasn't too bad with the stairs. Close to the S-Bahn so getting to and from the airport is very quick and easy. Lots of restaurants nearby as well!",1,0.8947,Positive
