108.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,70,100.0,1,2.641127618215382,4.96,4.94,4.95,4.88,267951,"Frank and Dirk were such gracious hosts, meeting us at check in and showing us around. The neighborhood is in the perfect location, super family friendly, with lots of restaurants and trams within walking distance. We would definitely stay here again!",1,0.9545,Positive
