91.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,1,7.040723000153959,4.89,4.86,4.82,4.78,27246434,"Das Appartement ist genauso wie beschrieben und auf den Fotos zu sehen. Wir haben uns über unseren Weihnachtsaufenthalt dort sehr wohl gefühlt. Es ist kein nüchtern-unpersönliches Appartement sondern individuell eingerichtet und dadurch behaglich. Alles war sehr sauber und gepflegt. Die Größe war für uns zu zweit optimal. Es ist wirklich sehr ruhig. In der Umgebung ist alles, was man braucht, gute Einkaufsmöglichkeiten, Cafés, Restaurants, sehr gute U-Bahn-Anbindung. <br/>Wir kommen sicher gerne wieder!",1,-0.8883,Negative
132.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,27,100.0,0,4.462782849034317,4.86,4.89,4.8,4.81,10103689,"We were a group of 4 and we only stayed in Berlin for one night so we could explore the city a little on our way to Poland. We booked Martin's place mainly because of all the great feedback from previous travellers. And our experience was no different! <br/>It was a great place, looked just like on the pictures, very clean, cozy, and just what we needed. The location is just amazing! Walking distance to postdamer platz, right in front of the U bahn, so really really handy! <br/>And Martin was a great host! Well prepared with maps and recommendations, very easy going, and was super easy to get in touch with! So I would recommend this place to anyone. <br/>Definitely coming back to Berlin in the summer and hopefully staying at the same place again :) <br/>",1,0.9919,Positive
167.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,50,100.0,1,5.50328507380831,4.93,4.93,4.78,4.79,10226031,I really enjoyed this location as a solo traveler. The space was immaculate and perfect for one or two people. I use the kitchen and washing machine and had no issues<br/>The location itself was very near public transit and multiple neighborhoods I visited frequently.,1,0.7264,Positive
