60.0,3,1.0,1.0,3.0,23,100.0,1,7.122161533256396,4.75,4.83,4.53,4.64,25120680,"This place was just what I needed for my short trip. Mina was super helpful and responsive. She worked with my arrival times for checking in, and I was able to get the rest that I needed. There are plenty of grocery stores nearby, and you can buy your ingredients and cook at the apartment, saving you lots of money. The U Bahn and Bus station is a 3 minite walk from the hostel. I'll definitely be coming back.",1,0.8979,Positive
