68.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,2.3978972662935325,4.97,4.94,4.95,4.92,1011735260949312503,Tolle besondere Wohnung. <br/>Geschmackvoll eingerichtet.... alles da was man braucht. <br/>Bank im Hof bei gutem Wetter sehr nett. <br/>Im Schlafzimmer war es ruhig... obwohl die S Bahn ganz nahe am Haus vorbei fährt ( darüber wusste ich Bescheid). <br/>Tram auch  fußläufig leicht erreichbar. <br/>Sehr freundliche Vermieter... jederzeit erreichbar und  hilfsbereit. <br/>Ist echt zu empfehlen.,1,-0.8316,Negative
66.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,45,100.0,1,8.230717363177027,4.89,4.88,4.84,4.76,34243172,"Thekla was an excellent host. She was easy to communicate with and was very helpful offering local knowledge and allowing for flexible check-in and luggage storage on our final day so we didn't have to carry our bags around when we explored the city. The space is stylish and has all the amenities you need, it suits couples or a single person perfectly. The area is very peaceful and in a lovely spot close to the river. There is a supermarket close by and S-bahn station within 10 mins walk of the apartment. There is also a very cool bouldering gym just down the road by the river which is excellent if you are into climbing or want a rainy day activity. I would definitely recommend this place as a lovely, peaceful spot from which to explore Berlin.",1,0.9911,Positive
