64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,39,100.0,1,2.965842315599996,4.91,5.0,5.0,4.73,24341628,"Kathrin is the kind and generous host of a lovely hostel in the charming Kreuzberg neighborhood in Berlin. The location is simply top-notch, in the middle of a hip trendy area with easy access to the U1 and U8. The hostel is well stocked, and each room has unique decor and style. Would definitely stay again!",1,0.9694,Positive
