125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,0,22.327962883713774,4.71,4.73,4.53,4.73,27073991,"Die Unterkunft liegt sehr ruhig am Ende einer Sackgasse. Parken ist problemlos möglich. <br/>Aufgrund unserer sehr späten Anreise, war ein flexibler Check-In notwendig, was aber problemlos funktioniert hat. Neben einer kleinen Aufmerksamkeit, über die sich meine Tochter sehr gefreut hat, war auch Kaffee und Tee verfügbar. <br/>Uns hat es sehr gut gefallen und wir würden diese Unterkunft jederzeit wieder buchen.",1,-0.9485,Negative
171.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,3.298740908664913,4.97,4.88,4.98,4.86,49413860,"Caroline’s flat is fantastic. It is spacious, beautifully decorated and has all the amenities we needed. It is well-located in a lively, interesting neighborhood with plenty of great restaurants nearby. Despite the lively neighborhood, her flat was in a lovely courtyard that was quiet. <br/>Caroline provided clear instructions and answered our questions promptly. <br/>We hope to return someday and highly recommend staying in her flat.",1,0.9848,Positive
114.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,35,95.0,1,4.534008835390387,4.69,4.48,4.73,4.72,53961638,"This place is at a perfect location, very easy to get around with public transportation and walking distance to awesome places, not only every day needs but also famous historic places. Simon’s place is great, very clean and has everything you need. Simon was also very helpful since the beginning, available at all times whenever I had any questions. Totally recommend it.",1,0.9763,Positive
