112.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,42,100.0,1,2.97782445506794,4.86,4.91,4.87,4.74,22275529,"Gregor’s place was just like in the pictures.  Surprisingly quiet for being so centrally located.  We had a nice stay.  Gregor was very quick to respond to questions and the check-in process was easy.  The basement (bedroom) floor and bathroom required some ducking through doorways for us (for those over 6’), but not a big adjustment.  We had very hot days during our stay and the inner courtyard does limit the breezes from outside, so the upper floor stayed quite warm.  The basement was pleasantly cool (although a bit damp).  All in all a good value for a wonderful location !",1,0.9806,Positive
76.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,1,5.339352686328167,4.8,4.87,4.74,4.63,2098124,"Very nice area, safe, super clean, beautiful.  Has everything you need for a great weekend in Berlin. Totally recommend it.",1,0.974,Positive
156.0,6,2.0,1.5,2.0,37,100.0,1,9.644257616194537,4.84,4.95,4.46,4.57,1339691709963515386,"5 of us had a fantastic stay at this apartment. Clean, comfy and modern and perfect for a group of friends. Very handy having a pin code to get in and out! Excellent, reliable communication and flexible check in and check out which was much appreciated! Moabit is a great up and coming location but be prepared to travel a lot in metro etc if you plan to see the sights while in Berlin... worth the price though. Thanks to Staycation Suites :)",0,0.9781,Positive
