200.0,8,3.0,2.0,5.0,33,100.0,1,3.3291527772246265,4.65,4.56,4.76,4.56,19173973,"L’appartamento era come da descrizione, accogliente e pulito. Si vede che l’host ha curato di sua mano il posto. L’host è stato amichevole e disponibile. Il quartiere è più adatto a ragazzi, non a famiglie, però comunque ben collegato a tutte le attrazioni principali.",0,0.34,Positive
108.0,4,2.0,2.0,2.0,24,100.0,0,15.738239112308683,4.85,4.92,4.69,4.82,5123152,"The flat is well- equipped and located in a very good neighborhood. The lake is nearby and it is very easy to enter the city by bus. Personally, the price is matched the value. Helena is very friendly and helpful. It was a pleasant time staying at her flat.<br/>Just for a side note that you/travelers must have a capability to walk to get to transportation e.g. bus/sbahn/ubahn. The nearest distance would be a bus stop which will have you walk for a bit. <br/>The rest is simply good and comfortably homey flat to stay!",1,0.9745,Positive
62.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,45,100.0,0,2.1907320060884934,4.79,4.8,4.94,4.77,38729622,Haider and his girlfriend made me feel home right away. It's a lovely place and friendly people. I'd stay here again.,1,0.7906,Positive
68.0,3,1.0,1.0,3.0,29,90.0,1,5.477562539569938,4.71,4.52,4.94,4.62,13706588,Very beautiful apartment in one of the coolest regions of Berlin! The host is very helpful an clear about things to know and do.<br/>We enjoyed our stay and miss Berlin already. We're coming back for sure and hopefully again in this place.,1,0.9527,Positive
114.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,1,3.268352166045826,4.8,4.74,4.89,4.71,11294240,"Beautiful neighborhood,  safe area, lots of amenities close by,very close to U bahn, S bahn. great apartment, comfortable beds.  Prompt response to any questions. Would totally recommend staying at Ellen's place.",1,0.9516,Positive
99.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,0,15.11918943238052,4.92,4.87,4.86,4.77,26222336,Wir haben uns sehr heimisch gefühlt. Wenn wir wieder in Berlin übernachten ist es die 1. Wahl.,1,-0.5994,Negative
87.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,10.082429401037324,4.86,4.86,4.77,4.78,731042640553523310,We had a lovely stay at this cosy apartment. Everything we needed was there and we felt very comfortable. The neighborhood was quiet and safe with a few restaurants nearby.,1,0.8832,Positive
68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,0,13.726146405400865,4.94,4.97,4.91,4.86,1648222,"Marria is very kind.Nice hause is closed to Messe, and easy to walk to shopping center. We'll come again.",1,0.4404,Positive
150.0,5,1.0,1.5,3.0,42,100.0,1,12.476267915226162,4.85,4.91,4.84,4.75,6800795,Det var et super godt område at bo i og lejligheden var dejlig at bo i :),1,0.7845,Positive
328.0,9,3.0,1.0,5.0,51,100.0,1,12.137893445738356,4.9,4.92,4.83,4.74,38450542,"Die Wohnung ist sehr schön und entspricht den Bildern. Die Küche ist sehr gut ausgestattet und die Wohnung ist sauber. Dank dem Türcode lief der Check-In problemlos ab und besonders für größere Gruppen ist der Türcode sehr hilfreich, da kein Schlüssel benötigt wird. Wir hatten ein kleines Problem mit dem Wasser im Bad, welches aber nach einer Nachricht und einem kurzen Telefonat schnell gelöst werden konnte. Vielen Dank für die unkomplizierte Kommunikation!",0,-0.9722,Negative
87.0,4,0.0,3.0,4.0,28,100.0,1,3.177015077868048,4.94,4.9,4.88,4.87,44385170,Wirklich wirklich tolles Hostel! Super liebevoll und schick eingerichtet und super sauber! Kathrin war super entgegenkommend und sehr lieb! Gerne wieder :),1,0.9131,Positive
260.0,8,4.0,2.0,7.0,50,100.0,1,2.6302702497082326,4.88,4.92,4.85,4.71,1488624,"The apartment was great and just perfect for our group. Enough space for everyone and great to have two bathrooms. Alexandra was a great host, welcomed us and gave us great tips about Berlin. <br/>Great location and well recommended! <br/>",0,0.9792,Positive
323.0,6,3.0,1.0,4.0,8,88.0,0,3.5848705795468696,4.36,4.52,4.84,4.18,854259609751966037,"Gute Kommunikation mit der Unterkunft und leichter check-in. Die Lage der Unterkunft ist wirklich sehr zentral und dadurch viele Sehenswürdigkeiten der astadt gut zu Fuß oder mit den öffentlichen Verkehrsmitteln erreichbar. <br/>Da der Vermieter mehrer Appartments in dem Gebäude hat, können die tatsächlichen Appartments leicht von den Bildern des Inserates abweichen.Das ist jedoch kein Problem.<br/>Insgesamt waren wir aber sehr zufrieden und haben ein unserer Buchung entsrprechendes Appartment bekommen. Da wir zu dritt gereist sind, war es auch kein Problem 3 Schlüssel für die Unterkunft zu bekommen. Ich würde die Unterkunft sehr empfehlen!",0,-0.9735,Negative
260.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,91.0,0,4.81020597174384,4.59,4.7,4.4,4.44,28299765,"kleines, aber sauberes Zimmer. Direkt an der tram und S-Bahn gelegen und von daher gut angebunden. Man sollte nur beachten das mit offenem Fenster zu schlafen aufgrund der nahen bahnstation schwierig ist. <br/>Von der Art des Zimmers eher ein Hotelzimmer mit kochzeile als ein Apartment.",1,0.0,Neutral
124.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,22,90.0,1,0.9184054408592692,4.65,4.48,4.86,4.7,36445603,"Todo muy bien, céntrico y muchos sitios para poder comer cerca. Gracias!",1,0.0,Neutral
180.0,3,1.0,1.0,3.0,36,100.0,1,6.547113367092668,4.82,4.78,4.68,4.66,874282587412354154,Better than expectations! The location was awesome and we were able to walk to so much and use public transit so easily. <br/>Very accommodating and great for our family. Would definitely stay again.,1,0.9532,Positive
112.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,1,3.5872254876023093,4.58,4.75,4.67,4.46,744264,"Fantastic place, very great location for the whole of Berlin and has bags of character!",1,0.8513,Positive
96.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,1,6.518892376880439,4.85,4.89,4.26,4.7,1305012221376378581,"l'appartamento corrisponde a quanto riportato nell'annuncio. lo abbiamo trovato molto pulito, ben attrezzato ed arredato con gusto. la camera matrimoniale è molto spaziosa. l'area living è dotata di un comodo divano letto e di una cucina ben attrezzata, ci sono più elettrodomestici che a casa mia! il bagno è piccolo ma ha una doccia spaziosa. la zona è fuori dai classici percorsi turistici ma ben servita dalla presenza di 3 fermate della metro a pochi minuti a piedi. vicinissimi anche buoni ristoranti. ottima comunicazione con gli host.",1,0.126,Positive
209.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,50,88.0,1,12.884615114477809,4.93,4.83,4.83,4.69,1016491862656770916,This place was better than the photos. Calm and peaceful space and great design. Felt very luxurious - loved the bathroom and the bath. Also the trees outside the window. <br/>Great cafe below and lovely neighbourhood restaurants. I hope to return. Thank you.,1,0.9773,Positive
132.0,7,1.0,2.0,6.0,22,99.0,0,4.341345093781891,4.71,4.65,4.58,4.67,28424899,-Apartment gut geeignet für größere Gruppen. <br/>- gute Lage<br/>-ausgezeichnete Gastfreundschaft <br/>-schnelle Antworten,0,0.0,Neutral
131.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,36,100.0,1,4.248347186024305,4.63,4.75,4.72,4.5,13507504,"Die Wohnung war ok, allerdings war sie nur grundlegend gereinigt. Wir mussten den Boden saugen, weil er sehr dreckig war. Außerdem waren Spinnweben über dem Bett.<br/>Die Lage ist in Ordnung, aber die Wohnung befindet sich im Erdgeschoss und lässt sich schwer lüften. So muss man nachts lüften, weshalb man durch den Straßenlärm schlecht schlafen kann. Die Kommunikation mit dem Gastgeber war sehr mechanisch und teilweise im Widerspruch zu den Aushängen in der Wohnung.<br/>Alles in allem eine Wohnung, die ok ist, aber in Punkto Sauberkeit und Kommunikation ist noch sehr viel Luft nach oben.",1,-0.9831,Negative
99.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,0,2.34460980914328,4.77,4.65,4.89,4.78,995401897371124702,"Very friendly host and an open, comfortable space right near Checkpoint Charlie. The street was very quiet and close to U-Bahn stations. Staying here made my first time in Berlin very stress-free!",1,0.7955,Positive
60.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,1.1530597508367482,4.91,4.83,4.97,4.85,229776,"Arne is an amazing host and has a very cozy, welcoming home. The location in Mitte is perfect, and we loved the sunny balcony. Would come back 100%!",1,0.9563,Positive
198.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,11.500551871319264,4.84,4.87,4.81,4.72,28537085,"The afternoon sun on the front of the hotel was very direct through the wall of windows in  my room. It made the small room quite warm and almost unbarebly lit. Sheers may have helped to mitigate, but there were only black out curtains.<br/>Otherwise, it was a lovely 3 days.",1,0.778,Positive
50.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,0,4.231097673854453,4.73,4.75,4.55,4.68,30384248,It will be my first choice.,1,0.0,Neutral
306.0,8,3.0,2.0,5.0,44,100.0,1,6.90827181205849,4.86,4.8,4.85,4.68,311703,"Great place in charming neighborhood, clean and spacious! Definitely would recommend",0,0.9441,Positive
70.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,1,7.896648596385876,5.0,5.0,4.93,4.89,2053014,"Ich war mit meiner Mutter 5 Tage in Rositas Appartment und es war wirklich sehr gemütlich.<br/>Da Rosita nicht da war, haben wir einwandfrei die Schlüssel von einer Nachbarin bekommen.<br/>Die Wohnung war sehr sauber und ist sehr gemütlich. Die Küche ist vollkommen ausgestattet und ist sehr nett eingerichtet. <br/>Ich kann die Wohnung nur weiter empfehlen! <br/>Gracias Rosita!",1,-0.9832,Negative
74.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,11,100.0,1,5.182484562003074,4.75,4.75,4.71,4.71,7653603,"Alles bestens - tolle Lage, gute Kommunikation, nette Wohnung! Gerne wieder :)",1,0.5093,Positive
81.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,6.17502338056302,4.66,4.67,4.79,4.6,255557,Perfect location in Friedrichshain with easy check in. Would definitely be back.,1,0.8519,Positive
79.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,1.4919663562559944,4.61,4.59,4.97,4.52,2201228,"Dans un quartier ""in"", tres vivant et tout ce qu'on aime de Berlin. Plein de petits cafés et bars, au centre et proche de tout, cet appartement est vraiment idéalement situé. Un beau plancher, un ameublement très sobre, des hauts plafonds, plein de lumière, on aimerait y rester bien plus longtemps (et ajouter un fauteuil ou un canapé, des chaises qui fonctionnent, un rideau de douche propre, un crochet pour la pomme de douche, des rideaux pour assombrir la pièce la nuit, des plaques de cuisine dignes de ce nom, au moins un torchon et un matelas plus correct). Je suis resté deux semaines et avais droit a 3 serviettes qui ne sentaient pas bons dès le départ, la 4e a dû servir à la cuisine. Je m'était annoncée seul et l'appart était équipé pour 1 personne sans avoir la possibilité d'avoir un invité, meme pas pour une nuit. Malheureusement, Howy n'était pas dispo pour m'apporter ce qui manquait. J'ai l'impression que l'équipement est majoritairement issu des encombrants ou des hôtes eux-mêmes. Le séjour aurait pu être parfait s'il y avait un tout petit peu de générosité qui justifierait le prix d'un petit hôtel. ",1,-0.8225,Negative
52.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,1,29.346232859094503,4.87,4.88,4.78,4.84,34595902,Sehr nette Familie ☺️<br/>Das Zimmer ist sehr schön und die Umgebung noch besser. <br/>Ich würde es nur weiterempfehlen. ☺️,1,-0.5994,Negative
31.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,20,100.0,1,12.389708472442326,4.76,4.74,4.59,4.81,31116923,"Really loved my stay! In particular, the privacy that comes with the room and smooth access to shared spaces. The room looks different now,  significant improvements have been made and would do with an updated photo. The neighborhood is serene and quiet. In terms of, location...it's about an hour or so from the city center but still very well connected. Brigitte's place is good bargain and she makes an incredible host. I would definitely consider staying here again.",1,0.9603,Positive
92.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,0,2.7850220743469896,4.82,4.83,4.89,4.68,249419,"We were staying in Berlin for two nights after attending a nearby music festival so needed somewhere to (firstly) relax and revive ourselves, in an area with lots to explore and with easy access to the rest of Berlin, and Frank's studio was absolutely perfect. It was comfortable, a good size and all the art/interior design bits and bobs dotted about were awesome. The street was quiet but the surrounding area of Prenzlauer Berg had lots  going on, loads of great bars, cafes and shops all in walking distance. Frank was a great host, friendly and answering our queries quickly. Would highly recommend!",1,0.9877,Positive
62.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,3.030265439362758,4.95,4.97,4.9,4.82,752312082907975460,"Dave est tres agréable,logement<br/>fonctionnel,très bon emplacement,<br/>Tout était parfait",1,0.0,Neutral
79.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,1,9.403941552737663,4.88,4.74,4.84,4.8,17071054,"The room was maintained perfectly, a stunning view over the city, which you can do sitting on the balcony. You can sleep in the very soft kingsized bed. <br/>The bathroom was almost better than at home. The host is educated and well mannered person with great tips for good and bad weather. The only downside to this room is the stairs you need to walk to get there, 5th floor with no elevator. The upside is that it is good for the bum. <br/>Everything considered, we had a wonderful stay.",1,0.9546,Positive
137.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,1,3.2252377063559527,4.8,4.79,4.86,4.63,27120196,Great stay in a a quiet neighborhood,1,0.6249,Positive
127.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,1,1.4421228333958134,4.85,4.85,4.9,4.78,11648023,"Logement bien placé, proche du centre, propre <br/>Bon accueil",1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,19,100.0,0,4.427699841147383,5.0,4.9,4.7,4.9,37029607,We had a good time in the apartment. It is very clean and there's everything you need. I recommend it! :),1,0.893,Positive
188.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,6.547712743829179,4.79,4.86,4.62,4.54,28528251,"sauber, schönes design, nette rezeption, angenehmes bett und gute lage",1,0.0,Neutral
52.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,1,1.9543141166401723,4.83,4.8,4.91,4.82,16090762,"Ella ist eine sehr informative Gastgeberin und entspannte Mitbewohnerin. Die Lage der Unterkunft mitten im Szenekiez Prenzlauer Berg mit Direktanbindung an den Hauptbahnhof ist perfekt.<br/>Zwei kleine Einschränkungen, mit denen sich aber gut leben ließ: Die ruhige Lage im Hinterhaus wird durch den benachbarten Schulhof unterbrochen und die Schlafcouch ist bei längeren Aufenthalten eher etwas für kleinere und leichtere Menschen.",1,-0.9136,Negative
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,0,2.715727914574357,4.72,4.77,4.8,4.59,1867179,"DieWohnung ist super gelegen,  sehr geeignet mit Kindern, wegen des Spielplatzes. Alles lief einwandfrei, gerne wieder.",1,0.5994,Positive
108.0,2,2.0,1.0,4.0,50,100.0,0,6.92452386369646,4.76,4.82,4.88,4.71,1116591273925318726,A fantastic stay in a hot summer because of two fantastic roof terraces were you can relax and enjoy Lise’s plants.<br/>Easy to reach city center although the apartment is in a very calm surrounding.<br/>And Lise is a very nice host.,1,0.9589,Positive
173.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,41,70.0,0,14.8762311082289,4.74,4.74,4.39,4.54,874499751843120722,gerne wieder,1,0.0,Neutral
165.0,7,2.0,1.0,2.0,43,90.0,0,2.2144444360828826,4.59,4.51,4.85,4.47,8063187,Wir waren für eine Nacht geschäftlich in Berlin und für uns war das Apartment von der Größe und Lage ideal!,0,-0.2003,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,20,100.0,0,4.333107470591988,4.81,4.84,4.92,4.82,19803075,"The cat is beautiful and friendly. Vural is very friendly, and keeps to himself. This is in a quieter part of Kreuzberg. Very close to the U-Bahn. It's easy to get everywhere and very central. The apartment is beautiful and old. The room is huge and has a nice big closet and desk. This was a really wonderful place for us to stay and we would come back.",1,0.9781,Positive
70.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,0,4.219966140444734,4.83,4.75,4.96,4.65,680999,"Great apartment in a central part of the city.  Easy walk to grocery stores, bars, and cafe.  Howy was a great host.  Would recommend!",1,0.9312,Positive
253.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,56,100.0,1,1.6793067436589162,4.82,4.84,4.98,4.65,35911615,Nina was a fantastic host. Her apartment was just as she described and was sparklingly clean and comfortable. It was a really great place to explore Berlin from. Nina was helpful and responsive – a great communicator. Easy self check in which was helpful with arriving late in the day. <br/>Would highly recommend staying at Nina's place.,0,0.9851,Positive
41.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,15,100.0,0,3.558265973195314,4.77,4.84,4.88,4.79,19666219,"Günter was a great host. He was very flexible with the check in as we arrived to his place very late at night.<br/>The room and apartment matched with the description. Everything was very clean and organised.<br/>Location is good, the train/metro station is very close and buses also stop nearby. <br/>Highly recommended!",1,0.9017,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,55,100.0,1,5.631561089826148,4.93,4.98,4.91,4.83,725003625720262728,"Das Zimmer bei Mor ist sehr gemütlich und das Bad, das man nutzt sehr geräumig und angenehm zu benutzen. Die Wohnung und der Balkon sind wirklich herausragend und die Gastgeber/innen sind sehr zuvorkommend und freundlich. Man fühlt sich direkt wie zuhause.",1,-0.9062,Negative
90.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,21,100.0,1,2.4398880685801423,4.71,4.62,4.85,4.6,44723033,"David was friendly and communicative. The place was very clean and cute, perfect for our week stay in Berlin. It’s in a lovely area right near buses, metros and the park. There are lots of bars around, nice cafes and cute restaurants. There is also a movie theatre around the corner! The apartment was cosy and good to come home to after long days of walking.",1,0.9781,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,80.0,1,3.3088530361417954,4.74,4.64,4.87,4.77,16007104,"Chambre très spacieuse, bien chauffée (appréciable en hiver) et tranquille, à 5mn à pied de Checkpoint Charlie, idéal pour partir découvrir Berlin en marchant ou/et en transports publics. Bella vous accueille chaleureusement dans son appartement, avec son adorable jeune félin, on se sent vite à la maison ! Je recommande les yeux fermés et j'espère avoir la chance de pouvoir y séjourner à nouveau.",1,0.6696,Positive
140.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,49,100.0,1,3.2254531575112866,4.87,4.87,4.92,4.76,11665059,"Our family had a great stay at Apartment Rodenberg. Had just spent the previous week in hotel rooms, so really enjoyed the space of the apartment. Location excellent - close to public transport, shopping precinct, eating options etc. All communication was top notch & helpful, including assisting us when our DB train reservations were not clear to us. Great local recommendations for Berlin attractions that are outside the generic tourist stuff. Highly recommend 👍",0,0.9744,Positive
287.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,1,1.973935897573968,4.98,4.96,4.98,4.82,33544257,"Fab apartment in fab neighborhood with fab cafe at doorstep and fab vintage shops, restaurants etc. Walk to the amazing Die Mauer monument. Excellent transport connects. Wunderbar!",1,0.9422,Positive
139.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,1,3.5852919241394265,4.61,4.65,4.56,4.53,969200,Alan and Kasia's apartment was perfect for me. Clean and organized with a very homely feel. Alan was there to greet me and give me advice on all the best places and local pubs to check out. Highly recommended!,1,0.9358,Positive
118.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,24,93.0,0,2.2997563334626485,4.63,4.61,4.74,4.55,16951874,"Nice, large apartment. Pictures are true to life. A good amount of space. If using back bedroom, consider bringing earplugs as neighbor running water can be loud (at least I think it was running water). I would recommend this apt.",1,0.875,Positive
100.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,41,100.0,1,1.9469096234802603,4.85,4.92,4.91,4.75,408756,"Loved Prenzlau Berg, the unit is in a fantastic spot with access to tram, train and bus. We opted to walk to Alexander Platz for all the sight seeing which was 1.6klms. But loved that we came back to this beautiful neighbourhood with plenty of restaurants, cafes and bars. Unit was in a compound of 3 blocks and was quiet. Bedrooms overlook the greenery of a community garden. Well equipped. It’s an artistic entrance & building but that adds to the charm. Bjorn a great host. Would def come back.",1,0.9818,Positive
71.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,56,100.0,1,25.264108789043384,4.96,4.96,4.84,4.92,696110248643795731,"Bij aankomst begreep ik pas hoe uitgestrekt Berlijn is. Het appartement te ver uit de stad? In eerste instantie dacht ik van wel. Maar nee, het was heerlijk. Een mooie en rustige buurt, prachtige huizen, natuur en vol geschiedenis. Het openbaar vervoer is zeer goed. De stad is dus niet echt ver weg.<br/>Echter, wat me het meest trof was de leuke sfeer met en bij de buren. Een gezamenlijke zitje in de tuin, bij mooi weer kwam men samen en praatte met elkaar. Ik was welkom in hun midden. <br/>En het appartement voldeed zeer goed. Nog een goed keukenmes en een leeslamp bij de bank en het is perfect.",1,0.5719,Positive
140.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,1,3.2989117833003925,4.64,4.71,4.63,4.57,322463,"Stayed with Alan and Kasia for 26 days and for those that want the quick review:<br/>Simply awesome place and hosts, excellent in all aspects, absolutely recommend for any trip to berlin. Highly professional yet approachable and friendly.<br/><br/>Long review<br/>Apartment: In Pberg which is the hip younger part of berlin, the place is centrally located next to a big commerical hub but is on a lovely quiet street where the noise level is very low. The  apartment itself is beautiful, modern, clean and well equipped for both long and short stays. There is a 24hr supermarket 2 min walk away as well as a large metro station. Lots of local shops near by for haircuts and other services that are reasonably priced and with out most of the pomp of alexanderplatz or the mitte. <br/><br/>Hosts:<br/>Alan- love this guy, easily could spend 10 hours talking about all sorts of stuff and did. He is ultra friendly and is highly knowlegeable about all the good stuff to do in berlin both for tourists or those that want a more engaging experiance. <br/>Kasia- a lovely and extremely well organized lady. She is friendly yet logical and engaging. If I needed a manager for anything I'd hire her in a heartbeat. <br/>A&K:Can't say enough good things about her and alan (only have a 1000 words in a review) Though they had me seriously consider moving to berlin lol!<br/>Berlin: its quiet a city, always fun and unrestrained.<br/>Value: I found it a great value for europe both the city and especially the apartment. Had several friends ask me for their card after they saw the apartment because they found it so superior to their accomodations (both hotels and other airbnb places).<br/>overall: simply awesome, thoughly enjoyed the experiance. Highest recommendations to anyone looking to stay in berlin buy wants to have a more real experiance where you can feel at home and go at the pace and style you'd prefer. After this I would never consider staying at a hotel or another airbnb in berlin. Planning on a return trip very soon and most certainly will only consider A&K for my accomodations.",1,0.9988,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,18,100.0,0,7.046055128737157,4.6,4.13,4.67,4.27,20494258,"L'appartement est très bien situé, à 5 minutes à pied de la station de métro Kleistpark. Il est lumineux, fonctionnel et propre. Le lit est un peu étroit pour y dormir à deux mais l'appartement dispose d'un canapé clic-clac. Gsus a été arrangeant pour la remise des clés et s'est rendu disponible par messages.<br/>Par contre, l'immeuble est actuellement en travaux, et nous en avons subi les désagréments (bruits à partir de 7h du matin en semaine, fenêtres condamnées par des bâches donc impossibilité de les ouvrir, entrainant une forte humidité dans l'appartement).<br/>Gsus n'est pas responsable de cette situation, mais pensez à lui demander où en sont les travaux avant de réserver.",1,0.0,Neutral
64.0,2,2.0,1.0,2.0,22,100.0,0,3.158943186526161,4.58,4.51,4.72,4.62,19406486,"Расположение отличное, ко многим достопримечательностям можно добраться пешком. Метро рядом, тихий район, супермаркеты рядом. Хозяин простой добродушный человек старается идти на встречу своим гостям. Были в Берлине первый раз остались довольны!",1,0.0,Neutral
120.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,35,90.0,0,1.8288306911790488,4.65,4.44,4.94,4.51,5060152,"Gemütliche Dachgeschosswohnung mit Fahrstuhl und kleiner, schöner Dachterrasse in Toplage! Wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt. Alles war da, was man für den täglichen Bedarf braucht.",1,-0.636,Negative
84.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,26,100.0,1,12.741124930844965,4.84,4.77,4.73,4.66,220445,Very nice place cute and clean highly recommend,1,0.8968,Positive
164.0,5,2.0,2.0,3.0,30,100.0,1,1.753209774100189,4.83,4.72,4.83,4.75,3188899,"We had a fantastic time in this gorgeous apartment in the heart of Berlin. It was so close to public transport and grocery shops and made our trip extremely convienient and enjoyable. Ronald was extremely generous and accommodating. Would definitely recommend, an amazing experience",0,0.9753,Positive
