44.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,0,12.46974711411576,4.54,4.41,4.54,4.27,214518,"Helen was an amazing host! She made me feel like home all throughout my stay. She even came all the way to my new AirBnb to help me with my luggage. This is by far one of the sweetest AirBnb hosts I have ever encountered. 10/10 would highly recommend staying with her! <br/>Added bonus: she tells you about her life stories from when she moved into Germany, and they are so interesting.",1,0.9605,Positive
125.0,9,4.0,1.0,2.0,58,100.0,1,2.1148529704210954,4.91,4.81,4.96,4.77,5161247,"It's a very big and beautiful appartement, with a lot, nice furnished and clean rooms.  Also there are beds with a good mattrass. Especially the light incidence in the living room and kitchen, and the big terrace decorated with plants and flowers is very special. The location off the appartement is also perfect. In the neighborhood are a lot off restaurants, with various sort off foods. You can eat a meal from 10/15 euro's. Finding a parkingplace and a place to football was more difficult. However in the appartement was a lot off space. So the children played there (not football, but PS 4, card etc.).",0,0.8612,Positive
