89.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,51,100.0,1,6.670122906813517,4.97,4.99,4.92,4.93,16608497,"Robert and Jack are so welcoming, the apartment is amazing and has all the finishing touches. Robert offered us lots of advice on what we could do and what is in the area, supplied us with maps pointing out all of the key sites and was available to answer all of our questions. We had the best stay!",1,0.9191,Positive
