201.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,54,100.0,1,1.3558603428081426,4.88,4.9,4.77,4.74,13755615,"When I first booked this Airbnb less than one month before our trip, Ayse was very communicative. Anytime I needed to ask a question about the place, she quickly responded. It was also help to give us recommendations for areas to watch the Festival of Lights.<br/>Although I never got to meet Ayse, I got to meet Shpresa and she was very welcoming. It was also a welcome sight to see the apartment complex was walking distance to Alexanderplatz and the Berliner Fernsehturm. It was very spacious especially for four guys with 4 big check in luggage.<br/>I would definitely recommend anyone going to Berlin to use this apartment complex.",0,0.9459,Positive
90.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,42,96.0,0,6.177149581820329,4.51,4.53,4.76,4.37,40607563,"Spacious studio, good location, all facilities present. Pretty quiet as well, not a lot of street noises while still being in a busy location. It was clean, communication was easy and fast. Only negative point were the flickering lights right outside our window.",1,0.8442,Positive
90.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,45,100.0,1,3.6178758418911023,4.85,4.82,4.9,4.73,540335929043609328,"Anca’s place was perfect for a short stay in Berlin! Located in a great neighborhood with lots to do with easy access to the rest of the city. The host was very responsive and I loved that they included a book with everything you might want to know from places to eat, transportation, etc. Would highly recommend",1,0.9684,Positive
