94.0,5,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,1,2.1120432937326656,4.78,4.65,4.89,4.72,1814192,"Super nice host. Nothing fancy but all the basic facilities are there. Extensive from-guest-to-guest on city guides and all the annoying small things if you had to buy it for your own use (oil, salt, spice, soap,...).  <br/>I recommend to try the TimeRide Virtual Reality experience as the virtual busride takes you on Leipziger Strasse and passes the building. <br/>I will use Frank's apartment again.",1,0.4678,Positive
