223.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,49,100.0,1,2.573289565070358,4.97,4.99,4.84,4.91,686752584391406378,"I had an amazing weekend with my brother and my to children at this Airbnb! The apartment was very clean and modern, and it had everything we needed for a comfortable stay. The location was perfect - on a quiet street but still very central, and easily accessible from the airport. The clear instructions provided by the host made our arrival and check-in a breeze. The decor was also lovely and added to the overall ambiance of the apartment. The host was very welcoming and made sure we had everything we needed. Overall, I would highly recommend this Airbnb to anyone looking for a great place to stay in the city!",0,0.99,Positive
