138.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,0,3.5147714958110643,4.54,4.54,4.69,4.46,1274600208766425489,The location of this airbnb is perfect. It is right across from the Berlin wall where the art gallery is painted. A quick walk from the train station with a shopping center close by. I would recommend this location for those that want to easily access Berlin with a more quiet surroundings.,1,0.836,Positive
45.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,25,100.0,0,13.538039905399945,4.65,4.62,4.7,4.58,50789984,"These AirBnB is just stunning. You have an amazing room , really comfy bed and a big big big TV as well with lots of features like Netflix, Sports TV etc etc . As well you have a sweet Bathroom with a Rainshower. A small cooking area was making the stay perfect ! The Check in is super easy everything you need will be send to you. Also for special requests you can call or text day and night. Always again ! <br/>Thanks a lot Frank !",1,0.9821,Positive
101.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,47,100.0,1,2.4379931445759557,4.93,4.93,4.97,4.83,1350792206249789489,"Das Apartment war super sauber und sehr gemütlich. Die Lage im Kiez ist perfekt – viele Cafés, Restaurants und tolle Stimmung direkt vor der Tür, und trotzdem schnell in der ganzen Stadt. Ana war eine sehr aufmerksame und freundliche Gastgeberin, die alles unkompliziert gemacht hat. Ich habe mich richtig wohlgefühlt und komme gerne wieder!",1,-0.9184,Negative
101.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,55,100.0,1,7.229980207068463,4.92,4.91,4.76,4.81,3974304,Great place in a calm location. Close to public transit. The balcony is a huge plus. Overall would book again.,1,0.8271,Positive
128.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,61,100.0,1,4.880214568244147,4.95,4.99,4.9,4.88,24423970,"Gunnar and Istvan were amazing hosts and their apartment was the perfect place to stay while in Berlin! Super clean, in the perfect location, and it they made sure you had everything you'd need. Check in was also completely hassle free and easy. I would recommend this Airbnb anyone without hesitation!",1,0.9841,Positive
56.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,16,100.0,0,10.265474980306797,4.96,4.9,4.74,4.86,37087005,"Ich habe eine Unterkunft für einen Kongress-Besuch im Estrel benötigt und dafür war's super. Zimmer schön groß; Unterkunft so, wie es die Bilder erwarten lassen. Schöne Altbau-Wohnung. Kontakt mit Marcus war nett und unkompliziert. Ich kann die Unterkunft empfehlen!",1,-0.8631,Negative
