97.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,51,100.0,1,7.205805476037972,4.91,4.91,4.49,4.74,28863960,"Such a wonderful stay in Berlin! Nathalie was extremely accommodating with our early check in time, super responsive, and gave some amazing recommendations for local restaurants! The stay itself was quite spacious, incredibly clean, and super modern with all the necessary amenities for our stay. It was also super close to multiple public transportation options and some wonderful parks! I would highly recommend this stay for anyone looking to travel to Berlin and J really enjoyed my time there!",1,0.9893,Positive
