196.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,44,100.0,1,0.8343376118810685,4.72,4.79,4.86,4.6,9292804,Wir hatten eine sehr schöne Zeit in Berlin. Das Studio Plus Appartement hat viel dazu beigetragen. Die Anreise und Schlüsselübergabe war problemlos und der Kontakt im Büro sehr nett. Das Appartement hat eine wundervolle zentrale Lage und ist vollständig ausgestattet. Selbst Kaffee und Filter für die Kaffeemaschine waren vorhanden. Nebenbei gibt es auch eine gute Lösung für die durchweg kostenpflichtigen Parkplätze in der Umgebung. Wir kommen gerne wieder.,1,-0.9485,Negative
115.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,30,80.0,0,6.188901033018674,4.92,4.83,4.84,4.78,11833825,"We had the greatest time in the apartment of Linda, such a nice person. We arrived in Berlin a couple of hours before the ""official"" check-in time, but it was no problem to check in earlier. We felt so welcome and Linda also gave us some good tips about the neighbourhood. We will defenitly come back to Berlin and we would like to stay again in this nice apartment ""Bei Otto""!",1,0.9387,Positive
40.0,1,0.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,11.034398061498583,4.65,4.83,4.45,4.68,714312,"Oksana's place was ideal for a weekend away in Berlin, especially flying to and from<br/>Schonenfeld. Super close to a U bahn station and perfect size for 2/3 people. Oksana's communication was great and was very accommodating even with our awkward flight times! Would recommend!",1,0.9558,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,5.0164426287594495,5.0,4.96,4.78,4.96,1100128181715688259,"Séjour très agréable chez Christof et David, <br/>Le airbnb est très soigné et magnifique.<br/>Je recommande fortement!",1,0.0,Neutral
