142.0,7,3.0,1.0,5.0,39,100.0,0,3.332400560475761,4.79,4.68,4.93,4.57,1381635588538869592,Det er en koselig leilighet med god plass. Leiligheten var ren og fin og kommunikasjonen med Berlinapartsments gikk raskt og greit. God beliggenhet i en rolig gate og fint strøk i grei avstand til transport. <br/>Det var varmt i Berlin under vårt opphold og det ble veldig varmt på soverommene. Det var ikke mulig å lufte på to av soverommene. Vi hadde små vifter på alle rom noe som hjalp litt mot varmen.,0,0.4939,Positive
47.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,30,100.0,1,18.53574881495984,4.85,4.89,4.86,4.77,30495280,"Sehr zuvorkommende, interessierte und herzliche Gastgeberin!<br/>Vielen Dank",1,0.0,Neutral
152.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,36,99.0,0,1.6727611612237951,4.73,4.76,4.67,4.58,45011020,"Great find in a good area of Berlin with some outstanding restaurants in the local area and very good links for public transport which made seeing other areas of the city a breeze. <br/>Most other Airbnbs at the time of booking involved sofa beds to make up the extra sleeping spaces for 4 people, this is not the case with Stella's place, the multiple actual beds was lovely. <br/>Space was nice and warm especially helpful for cold winter visits.<br/>Stella and co were always helpful and responsive.",1,0.9835,Positive
155.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,0,5.160368153320015,4.83,4.67,4.93,4.66,39686767,"Beautiful apartment, vibrant neighbourhood, very friendly host. Would love to stay there again.",1,0.9432,Positive
99.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,0,15.11918943238052,4.92,4.87,4.86,4.77,26222336,"Wir hatten einen absolut perfekten Aufenthalt bei Nina. Die Wohnung ist absolut wunderschön, ruhig und perfekt zum Entspannen nach einem anstrengenden Tag in einer so aufregenden Stadt wie Berlin. Nina ist ein unglaublich toller Host, ich hab mich selten so warm und herzlich empfangen gefühlt. Ich war tatsächlich traurig, als wir wieder abgereist sind. Wir kommen beim nächsten mal definitiv wieder!",1,-0.765,Negative
