125.0,11,4.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,0,13.967903617612226,4.79,5.0,4.58,4.67,28828410,"We have traveled extensively and stayed in many vacation rentals, but never one so immaculate and welcoming.<br/>Andrea's love for her home was clear in its cleanliness, decoration, and in her communication with us. We felt as though we were visiting a family member and had everything we could possibly need. <br/>If we didn't live far, we'd be back as as possible and we highly recommend others stay here!",0,0.9347,Positive
