160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,98.0,0,1.0407544919436775,4.54,4.66,4.77,4.45,34294913,"I enjoyed my stay, it’s somewhat close to exploring the city so the location is pretty good but not amazing. However, it’s really easy to Lime scooter anywhere. The home had no issues except a slow shower drain but it was dealt with so overall a good stress free stay I would recommend it if you’re ok with small commute to main tourist attractions.",1,0.948,Positive
