283.0,8,4.0,1.5,5.0,48,100.0,0,4.127391754068874,4.68,4.63,4.68,4.53,1173131686369315331,"We had a good stay at Andrej's place! Overall it was spacious, well located and he was very responsive when we had questions. <br/>The only downside was a bit of miscommunication around the key and the apartment entrance door, however this was quickly resolved, as well as issues with the heating. But this was also resolved with quick communication from Andrej!",0,0.7529,Positive
