68.0,3,1.0,1.0,3.0,29,90.0,1,5.477562539569938,4.71,4.52,4.94,4.62,13706588,"Lola has an amazing eclectic eye as you can see through the way she decorated the home. I loved that it felt like a home away from a home. We easily got there from the airport. Remember to validate your ticket at the machines on the platform before boarding. The location made it easy for us to travel to other districts for sight-seeing and shopping. There are a few cool thrift stores nearby, famous clubs, and bars if the night life is your thing. The other guests we met were super friendly, everyone was respectful and quiet so you don't hear others. There is an amazing towel warmer in the bathroom. My last advice is to please double check the time of your arrival as to not let the host waste time waiting for guests. We accidentally sent him our departure time as opposed to our arrival and Javier had to wait hours for us to check-in. Thanks again for your patience!",1,0.9879,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,0,13.811832052182714,4.55,4.6,4.73,4.62,1273287,"Netter Empfang, alles nötige wurde erklärt. Gute Lage, wenn man im Berliner Westen eine Bleibe sucht der etwas zu erledigen hat. Die Wohnung hat alles, was man für einen kürzeren oder etwas längeren Aufenthalt braucht. Während das Gebäude insgesamt einen etwas limitierten Charme hat, ist die Wohnung voll funktional, und sie hat auch eine schöne Aussicht. Insgesamt voll zu empfehlen.",1,-0.8316,Negative
