139.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,1,3.3244676042943366,4.95,4.92,4.91,4.79,19652167,"Martin is one of the best hosts i’ve ever met with Airbnb experiences.  He responds fast, fix the issue right away, very easy to communicate and helped us with luggages :) check-in and out is easy and smooth, place is spacious, cozy and looks better than pictures. I highly recommend Martin’s place to everyone. Flat is located in residential area.",1,0.96,Positive
