62.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,15.65506730661029,4.95,4.97,4.93,4.88,23096426,"Our stay at the apartment of Heike was great. In advance, communication was good and fast - Heike was very supportive. Check-in and check-out were easy and everything worked out as agreed. The flat was clean and we had everything we needed (towles, kitchen utensils...). The location of the flat is perfect! There are shops and restaurants nearby and, more importantly, there is an underground station very close to the apartment that takes you to a lot of sights and popular places. We totally enjoyed our stay and do recommend the apartment!",1,0.9848,Positive
