73.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,1,0.6553720502126151,4.76,4.76,4.95,4.67,2317701,"Perfect location!  The apartment is right in the center, close to everything.  Great restaurants downstairs, supermarket nearby.  We haven't met Nadia, but her friend Sofi met us at the apartment and made us feel welcome.  The place is comfortable and tastefully decorated.  Thanks!<br/>",1,0.9722,Positive
