351.0,13,6.0,2.0,6.0,43,100.0,1,6.545671505850361,4.67,4.48,4.73,4.38,11079277,"We had a great time at this location. The pictures matched the unit. It is very old and feels like a college dorm but that is its charm. The location is fantastic and there was plenty of room for the 5 of us. <br/>My only complaint was that it was a 7 bedroom location but when i booked I told them there were 5 of us. Only 5 beds had linens or towels. No extra linens. The beds only had a mattress covering sheet and undersized blanket. No sheet between them and the blankets appear to be for a single bed while the beds themselves appeared to be doubles. The blankets did not fully cover the beds. Some in our group were fairly cold at night due to this. When I inquired about potentially getting additional sheets or another blanket, the response was overly direct and demanded an extra $50. <br/>Our stay was very enjoyable but not having the proper bedding for the beds and then charging if a guest says they are not able to cover themselves with the small blanket was a little odd.",0,0.6984,Positive
35.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,6,100.0,1,12.35232617655509,4.8,4.55,4.64,4.85,17503717,Sehr gastfreundlich und angenehm von der Lage her - alles super!,1,0.636,Positive
241.0,6,3.0,1.0,4.0,53,100.0,1,1.3558603428081426,4.89,4.89,4.78,4.75,13663197,Sven's place was amazing.,0,0.5859,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,24,0.0,1,4.103393166209834,4.93,4.98,4.81,4.85,17544847,Thi Kim Chung's apartment is a wonderful quiet sanctuary in the middle of Berlin. We were a family of 4 and the stay was very comfortable for all. Everything was spotless and the communication perfect. If you look to recuperate after a day in the city this is a perfect spot. ,1,0.9402,Positive
176.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,2.6109738907158704,4.83,4.91,4.9,4.75,28510664,"Nice clean rooms, really good location around 20 mins walk to the tv tower and loads of restaurants closer than that. One problem we had was noisy neighbouring guests during our stay, we appreciate this is in no way the hotels fault but there weren’t any staff on site to contact, we eventually called the hotels central phone number and were told someone would come and talk to the guests next door, although this likely didn’t happen as I was never asked for a room number.  To her credit Sina on the front desk the next day was very apologetic and arranged a new room for us no problem.",1,-0.0009,Neutral
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,16,100.0,1,4.009860827310783,4.91,4.92,4.9,4.83,16979933,"I'm happy to recommend this secluded, quiet flat high above vibrant Görlitzer Park with its colourful mix of dreamers, hippies and street vendors. Close to virtually everything, the location is central and the flat itself well-appointed with everything you might need. For a quiet night's rest, you won't hear a peep from the street as the bedroom is facing the inner courtyard. My check-in and check-out experience was hassle-free and friendly, the communication prompt and easy. Joseph is a pro – you'll be in excellent hands and have a superb base from which to explore the delights of the German capital.",1,0.9788,Positive
140.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,1,3.2989117833003925,4.64,4.71,4.63,4.57,322463,"Met Alan during the check-in. Lovely friendly guy who introduced us to the Berlin sights and neighbourhood. The place was spacious, clean and cozy. Excellent!!",1,0.9323,Positive
