156.0,6,2.0,1.5,4.0,53,100.0,1,4.399584803649054,4.86,4.74,4.87,4.76,13080698,"Beyond our expectations !  Everything about our trip to Berlin was exceptional thanks to Felix’s hospitality and care. The apartment is gorgeous, spacious, beautifully renovated, natural light and nature from all windows. The kitchen was a delight to cook in and the location is prime, hip, & QUIET.  Close to everything that you’d want access to in Kreuzberg. Truly a gem, we will be coming back and staying here.  You have 2 of the best parks literally steps away and then of course the pleasure of everything that Berlin has to offer. <br/>Felix was magnificent with all of our needs for neighborhood suggestions and having bikes rented for us when we checked-in as well as having coffee prepped knowing that we would arrive with jet lag !<br/>SUPERBLY RECOMMENDED !!",0,0.9903,Positive
