55.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,0.8025330705337501,4.79,4.94,4.83,4.77,11403270,"Ece is great! That's actually all you need to know if you are still hesitating) Great, awesome, super hospitable!<br/>Had a great time and regret only I stayed not for a long time - needed to go back home.<br/>A pleasant place, spacious, clean, cosy - homelike!<br/>1 minute walk from the U-Bahn (metro) and right at the center.",1,0.9785,Positive
101.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,3.078352015251089,4.83,4.81,4.81,4.66,20282379,"The apartment was amazingly decorated and had tons of natural light - it looks even better than the photos. There is a sofa bed in the living room for 1-2 people more to stay on. The WiFi worked well. The downside was that the 6 floor walk up was a TON of stairs, so be prepared. Easy self check in. I would recommend this place if you’re young!",1,0.9124,Positive
95.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,0,4.691964222849626,4.76,4.77,4.81,4.67,28168852,"Es war eine sehr kalte Unterkunft, also aufjedenfall warme Kleidung und decken mitbringen, der Kühlschrank war auch nicht richtig kalt. Nächstes mal würde ich mich für eine andere Unterkunft entscheiden",1,-0.8316,Negative
