140.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,1,1.5130716954922565,4.89,4.91,4.94,4.75,2394897,"Great neighborhood, we really enjoy walking around, plenty of restaurants, bars, coffee shops, boutique stores, grocery stores…<br/>The apartment was perfect for family of four that includes a 1 year old baby, we were very comfortable and had everything we needed it for our stay.<br/>Keep in mind to get to the apartment there are lots of stairs and no lift, I would recommend this place for guest that are fairly fit. Overall I give this place 5 starts !!!",1,0.9616,Positive
122.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,96.0,0,3.128194469226722,4.61,4.66,4.86,4.54,47215807,"We sayed at junior suite. Perfect location, really! Quick and good communication with staff, no misunderstandings. Clean room, good room service every day. Good price and value combination. Very quiet in the room, no voices from the street or neighbour rooms. King size bed was very good, not too soft and good for 2 person. Blanket could be a bit lighter. The air was a bit dry because of heating sustem, but we kept window open time to time. Reccommend!",1,0.89,Positive
