81.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,1,2.618142013757112,4.87,4.9,4.91,4.75,3717751,"This is a great little Airbnb perfect for couples. It’s a very trendy space and in a great location. Not only does it front the Berlin Wall Memorial Park, but is in such a great district of Berlin, Mitte. This area has so many great cafes and restaurants to choose from. I fell in love with Berlin because of this location.<br/>The hosts were wonderful too. Even though they live in the same building, you wouldn’t know it.",1,0.9855,Positive
