98.0,6,1.0,1.0,3.0,38,100.0,0,4.479387416975665,4.85,4.73,4.84,4.73,798416193829159604,"Es un apartamento muy cómodo, las camas muy cómodas, tiene calefacción, la cocina tiene todo lo necesario para preparar comida, el lugar muy tranquilo, nada de ruido. Está a 10 minutos de una estación de tren.<br/>recomiendo el apartamento, amplio, agradable, muy bonito, muy comodo.",1,0.0,Neutral
79.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,63,100.0,1,3.3519237763680656,4.83,4.87,4.83,4.71,35731198,"Would highly recommend Natalia’s apartment. Perfect location, easy to reach from the airport, and close to the U/S Bahn station making travelling around Berlin easy. The apartment was perfect for us as a couple, and had space to host a third person. Lovely touches including a Nespresso machine, pods included. A lonely planet travel guide, and 2 bottles of sparkling rose were left on arrival as it was our 9 year anniversary. Sparkling clean, and the bed was so comfy! Check in and out was easy, fast responses from host. Can’t recommend this place enough!",1,0.9831,Positive
