100.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,41,100.0,1,1.9469096234802603,4.85,4.92,4.91,4.75,408756,"Nous remercions Björn pour ce logement et le recommandons vivement. Il est placé dans un quartier vivant avec de bons restaurants. Les transports en commun, boulangeries et supermarchés sont à proximité. Et malgré tous ces avantages urbains, il est dans une cours intérieure très calme. Nous n’entendons pas les voisins. Il est spacieux, propre, bien équipé pour les bébés. Les hôtes sont très accueillants.",1,0.0,Neutral
64.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,0,2.954952343867065,4.08,3.83,4.5,4.08,1143406174470764684,"El sector es muy bueno, hay restaurantes y cafés alrededor, la pieza muy cómoda y el baño está bien, lo único malo es que hay que subir 4 pisos por escaleras, no hay ascensor y si llevas maletas se complica un poco, lo demás todo bien",1,-0.296,Negative
48.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,8.38062533349986,4.75,4.84,4.54,4.67,22318827,"I had a great stay here. It is a bit far out and there are no great cafes around the apartment, but the friendliness of the staff, large apartments and amazing value make up for this. On the whole I was very happy. Just remember to lock the door when you go out :)",1,0.9804,Positive
96.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,6.753647389093091,4.84,4.84,4.86,4.69,37703913,"Apartamento excelente, muito limpo e com todas as comodidades necessárias. A host foi super gentil e me auxiliou com tudo que precisei. Já fiz uma nova reserva para o espaço para minha próxima viagem!",1,0.636,Positive
138.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,52,100.0,1,8.608505724880466,4.88,4.69,4.76,4.85,18605817,Geräumige Wohnung mit guter Anbindung. Praktisch für einen dienstlichen Aufenthalt mit mehreren Leuten. Der Gastgeber ist sehr kommunikativ und gut erreichbar.,1,0.0,Neutral
131.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,0,4.709757156582104,4.91,4.91,4.77,4.66,17667654,"Wir waren nun schon das zweite Mal bei Ailon & Naama in der Wohnung und es war wieder ein super Aufenthalt, alles sehr sauber, es ist eine wunderschöne Wohnung in bester Lage in Neukölln, kommen sehr gerne wieder",1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,1,12.42864799230006,4.67,4.83,4.58,4.56,26070220,"Apartment is not small, there's comfortable bed and sofa, is a quiet area was quite a good transport network to the center or it would've been under normal circumstances Unfortunately the day we arrived there was a strike, surprisingly happens in Berlin quite a lot We got there quite late gone midnight almost 1 o'clock  although flexible arrival schedule is indicated in the apartment description we were confused a lot  As for the apartment itself.. it is so quiet it was nice to be woken up either bird singing at morning dawn if there was not drown out by the noise I think it is reasonable  to know that they're there is a house being built right opposite the plot where the workers began at 8 o'clock every morning with their mixers  Going upstairs is quite risky, you have to move by touch because the lighting so unfortunate that you off to walk back along a completely dark staircase to the third floor before you can turn the lights off or on Philip was quite disappointed with the lack of crockery and pans also the utensils very poorly equipped and refuse the idea to cook a romantic dinner at home If your a touridt and only want to eat out the area is full a little tapas bars & bistros, this will serve you best...",1,-0.712,Negative
173.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,57,100.0,1,6.93795828166316,4.65,4.63,4.63,4.55,2485124,"Emplacement au top, appartement très fonctionnel même pour 4, qualité de l’accueil et disponibilité de  Sebastian confirment son statut de superhost, n’hésitez pas !",1,0.2714,Positive
108.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,3.617893966015014,4.74,4.78,4.82,4.57,18443210,"Consiglio vivamente questo alloggio . È in un’ottima posizione con facilità di spostamento, il check in è facile e comodo , la casa accogliente e confortevole",1,0.0,Neutral
156.0,6,2.0,2.0,4.0,51,100.0,1,2.784593796049624,4.88,4.78,4.9,4.77,3378027,"We decided to spend a weekend in Berlin and didn't like the idea of a hotel. Nour was a great host and her apartment was perfect. It was well furnished and comfortable for the three of us. Nour even gave us a list of recommended restaurants in the area. The neighbourhood is a nice mix of cafes, parks, restaurants and some shops. Would definitely recommend for a nice relaxing weekend.",0,0.9774,Positive
68.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,22,100.0,1,6.594298777125843,4.71,4.76,4.39,4.65,16469975,"Unser Aufenthalt hätte nicht besser sein können. Wir haben uns gleich heimisch und wohl gefühlt. Die Ausstatung des Appartements war einfach wunderbar. Man hatte alles was man so braucht. Ganz besonders toll fanden wir , daß Kaffee,Tee etc gestellt wurde. Alles in allem war es Top. Berlin Surf hostel würde ich jedem weiterempfehlen.<br/>Viele liebe Grüße von Björn und Nathalie",1,-0.8979,Negative
