259.0,4,2.0,2.5,2.0,41,100.0,0,7.843524221419966,4.96,4.89,4.94,4.87,511935,"Manuel’s apartment is great! Spacious and nicely decorated - perfect for us (fam of 4, two teenage girls). Easy to get around, nice neighborhood with lots of good restaurants. We used the bus, the tube and bikes to get around - easy and nice! Enjoyed very much the good coffe machine and the good stuff Manuel had out in the fridge for breakfast etc. Highly recommend!",0,0.9889,Positive
