68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,92.0,1,4.424176503712602,4.91,4.98,4.81,4.79,23298585,"Beautiful light apartment decorated in typical Berlin style! We loved all the plants and the bed was really comfy! It was a great stay and perfect as we already knew the city well so could enjoy the lovely room, relax and hang out in the area. We were right next to the u-Bahn heading to other areas too! Thanks!",1,0.9861,Positive
