139.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,1,3.5852919241394265,4.61,4.65,4.56,4.53,969200,"The apartment is perfectly located, just two minutes walk from S-bahn and trams, and there are two supermarkets, a drugstore and more service very close.  The apartment is small, but well equipped with everything you need and it is fresh and clean. The windows are facing the street, but we felt comfortable with this even if it is a ground floor apartment, since the window panes have a pattern that prevents people passing by to look inside, and there are also metallic blinds for your safety at night. We had a good time in Grellstrasse 34.",1,0.9756,Positive
37.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,1,20.10572353840828,4.88,4.88,4.75,4.83,16632030,"Helen hat uns freundlich empfangen, der Check-In und Check-Out konnte nach meiner/unseren Vorstellungen angepasst werden. Die Räumlichkeiten waren sauber und frisch renoviert. Wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt! ",1,-0.636,Negative
