140.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,49,100.0,1,3.2254531575112866,4.87,4.87,4.92,4.76,11665059,"Great location, public transport is very close and brings you everywhere. Grocery shopping and a mall is close by. Restaurants, bakeries, pharmacy, all around the corner. My teenage boys liked the currywurst booth at the U-Bahn station, on the opposite side of Schönhauser Allee. We also liked the Vietnam Aroma restaurant and the Italian food at Antichi Aromi Trattoria, at the corner of Kuglerstrasse and Greifenhagener Strasse. <br/>And a big plus - The apartment was not too hot, even during very hot August temperatures.",0,0.8658,Positive
64.0,3,2.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,0,2.2993654688631877,4.06,3.25,4.94,4.25,8052074,The location of the house is good. You can visit most scenic spots in Berlin.,1,0.4404,Positive
108.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,41,94.0,1,0.6378915892111641,4.88,4.91,4.92,4.74,839069734231196810,"Das Appartement liegt 4 Min zu Fuss von einer zentralen S/U-Bahnhalte mit zahlreichen guten gastronomischen Angeboten direkt vor der Tür, dabei ruhig mit kleinem Balkon nach hinten raus. Für einen Aufenthalt zu zweit können wir das Appartement uneingeschränkt empfehlen.",1,0.0,Neutral
142.0,4,2.0,2.0,2.0,19,100.0,1,6.608155925105233,4.83,4.94,4.85,4.76,10423394,"This place is gorgeous and a large two bedroom apartment! The design is very industrial, with modern touches like multi lock window frames. Located close to two metro stations and several bus routes, but very quiet. The washer/dryer were out of service during our visit, but Stefanie arranged four our washing to be done anyway. Great service!",1,0.8881,Positive
