72.0,3,0.0,1.0,3.0,45,100.0,0,2.807912350715161,4.8,4.61,4.95,4.75,599233306331597354,"Jot was kind and flexible allowing us to go into the apartment early. Location is good, close to public transit and a fun neighborhood but on a quiet street. The apartment itself was not good for us. The floors had not been swept and bathroom and kitchen sink were dirty. There was clutter everywhere. The pots/pans and such were kept in the bathroom and there was no cutting board/knife (only a bread knife) - all this made cooking hard and unsanitary.",1,0.1531,Positive
