43.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,4.980177142964137,4.93,4.92,4.61,4.81,22315950,"Marvi's place is specious, sparkling clean and beautifully decorated. It is in a great location, in a quiet residential area yet very close to the trendy neighbourhoods. The transport from the airport couldn't be easier, direct bus (171) takes you right in front of Marvi's place.  I highly recommend this place, and especially Marvi as a host. She was amazing, super friendly and helpful.",1,0.9796,Positive
422.0,6,2.0,2.0,3.0,25,100.0,0,12.679445654101194,4.35,4.13,4.7,3.83,913379,"This  apartment is priced near the top end for serviced apartments and at about the same cost as two 4-star hotel rooms.  In exchange for the money, you get a well laid out apartment, in a 4 storey house located on a quiet street, less than 10 mins walk from the U-Bahn. <br/><br/>Unfortunately however, the building suffers from neglect and has no one in Berlin managing it (the building owner lives in London, her mother about 3 hours’ drive away).  With no one in Berlin responsible, we were inconvenienced on multiple occasions, dealing with issues we would normally expect the landlord to handle (especially given the prices charged).  For example, during our 3 month stay:<br/><br/>•The heating failed on two occasions, and we had no heating and hot water for a total of 4 days with external temperatures falling to 4 degrees centigrade at night.  One occasion was because the house ran out of heating oil.  We then had to rearrange our schedule to stay at home and supervise both heating repairs and oil delivery. <br/><br/>•The water company visited us at 8am one morning to say that unless their bill was paid within 3 days, they would cut off the water supply<br/><br/>•The internet was unreliable throughout our stay, and stopped working for a full week, despite several requests to get it fixed<br/><br/>•The apartment has a large number of unresolved minor repair issues (for example, the water hoses leading to both shower heads leak; I had to unclog both shower drains; one of the radiators started leaking and had to be removed; half the fabric blinds in the living room don’t raise because the mechanism is broken; etc etc)<br/><br/><br/>In addition, the apartment above us (belonging to the same landlord, although rented through a different website) held a party one weekend with loud music from 22:30 to 04:30.  The vomit had still not been fully cleaned from the staircase and entrance hall carpet when we moved out 2 weeks later.<br/><br/>Bottom line: this apartment is suitable for people who enjoy home maintenance (and parties).  However, if you want a trouble free and quiet stay, you might want to choose somewhere else.<br/>",0,-0.8885,Negative
78.0,1,1.0,1.5,1.0,30,100.0,0,2.1459403526192986,4.9,4.89,4.91,4.79,2449808,"We loved to stay in Gundulas place, the skyline over Berlin was fantastic. Good space, nice and clean and we had a warm welcomming. We hope to stay there next time we go to Berlin. ",1,0.9623,Positive
120.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,35,90.0,0,1.8288306911790488,4.65,4.44,4.94,4.51,5060152,"Die Wohnung ist sehr schön und liegt in einer sehr guten Gegend. Wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt, mussten den Gastgeber aber darauf hingewiesen mehr Sorge zur Reinigung zu tragen.",1,-0.5994,Negative
164.0,7,4.0,2.0,7.0,34,94.0,0,7.060506092795291,4.6,4.6,4.37,4.71,1349228471698913628,"The apartment was spacious and comfortable. It was spotless. The water was hot and the heaters worked perfectly throughout the flat as the weather was cold outside. The flat suited our needs perfectly.  I would highly recommend it for a large family or group. Two minor issues. The site advertised a greeter but we found only a lock we couldn’t open and needed to call for assistance. Someone, however,  arrived within 30 minutes to show us how it worked. Secondly, the neighborhood was not in Mitte as described. It was on the border according to our taxi drivers. It didn’t feel like a nice area, not unsafe, but a bit shabby, in transition. It was fine for us because we came  we came and went in taxis.  We don’t know how public transport around there worked. <br/>The managers were kind and helpful when we reached out and allowed us to check out a bit later that the 10 am time, as one of us was in a wheelchair are required more time for check out.",0,0.9783,Positive
243.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,8,88.0,0,3.560186030012189,4.42,4.53,4.81,4.24,854251028991888522,"El apartamento está estupendamente situado en la zona de la puerta de Brandenburgo, con restaurantes cafés y supermercado al lado (hit Ulrich) Y cerca de estaciones de tres, metro y tranvia y alquiler de bicis al lado.<br/>Esta bien equipado, pero le falta microondas, un cubo y fregona y 4 buenos vasos para disfrutar de la excelente cerveza local.",1,0.0,Neutral
148.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,44,94.0,0,7.131273504704622,4.73,4.83,4.83,4.56,49086464,Alles super wie immer :),1,0.7845,Positive
64.0,2,2.0,1.0,1.0,8,100.0,0,1.1089699971149662,4.73,4.72,4.87,4.82,191023,Anne hat immer schnell und freundlich geantwortet und war auch sehr flexibel als ich etwas zu spät kam ;-). Location ist wirklich sehr zentral und ein paar gute Tipps hatte sie auch noch - alles in allem war ich sehr zufrieden!,1,-0.8439,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,0,3.9335054823912654,5.0,4.5,4.67,4.83,650033757754458542,"Very nice place to stay and amazing location, the owner is a nice person and always responds!",1,0.8828,Positive
150.0,6,3.0,2.0,4.0,44,100.0,1,5.139349865848991,4.94,4.85,4.97,4.91,5766122,"The hosts' mom greeted us and was very sweet. We felt welcome right away. The apartment was huge and very modern. Excellent design. Excellent location. This was the best airbnb apartment I have stayed in. Next door is a bodega with bike rentals and that was perfect. Also, only a 5 minute walk to a great bier garten in Viktoria Park. Kreuzberg is the hip area and has many interesting shops, restaurants, cafes and bars. Highest recommendation possible for this apartment! ",0,0.9868,Positive
63.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,33,100.0,1,0.8841099481967127,4.9,4.78,4.89,4.8,29000041,"Had to stay an extra night due to a strike at the airport, but communication with this change was very easy. Would definitely come back",1,0.8396,Positive
142.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,49,91.0,0,6.115210424417201,4.74,4.85,4.76,4.47,32539441,"Great location, easy check in process, solid wifi, well run overall, would def stay again",1,0.8658,Positive
102.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,1,8.562971671773859,4.86,4.94,4.78,4.7,38590769,"Wir hatten einen sehr schönen Aufenthalt hier.<br/>Gute freundliche Kommunikation, tolles Loft, mit gutem Geschmack eingerichtet, gut erreichbar über die S-Bahn oder Bus. Sehr sauber und fast alle Basics vorhanden.<br/>Negativ war, dass nicht vorher informiert wird, dass es sich um ein aufblasbares Bett handelt, nicht um eine normale Matratze. Wir konnten gut drauf schlafen, deswegen haben wir uns auch nicht beschwert. Das die Küche und das Bad gemeinschaftlich genutzt wird, ist auch nicht offensichtlich durch die Anzeige, nach Rücksprache stand sie jedoch ausschließlich uns zur Verfügung.<br/>Wir würden die Wohnung definitiv weiterempfehlen, man sollte jedoch oben genannte Punkte beachten.",1,-0.975,Negative
44.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,23,100.0,0,13.157059293117056,4.44,4.33,4.64,4.44,18066481,Nice place on the ground floor in a quiet residential neighborhood with historic buildings. Close to Charlottenburg castle. 10-15 min distance from two different U-bahn lines.,1,0.4215,Positive
59.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,1,3.505087549548663,4.94,4.96,4.95,4.94,21072638,"What an increable stay.. Sigbert is one fantastic person and has a beautiful home!!  We had such a fantastic stay at his home, we would not want to stay anywhere else!!  If we could give him 100 stars, we would!  Incredable stay!!",1,0.9193,Positive
206.0,6,2.0,1.0,6.0,40,100.0,0,10.987804722873529,4.57,4.34,4.67,4.43,42045052,"Lage Top, das Appartement liegt ruhig, die Dusche ist sanierungsbedürftig, der Rest ist super.",0,0.2023,Positive
148.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,26,100.0,1,3.2241984489947213,4.88,4.93,4.76,4.71,16821096,"Babett’s place is as fantastic as it looks, in fact even better. Classy. Stylish. The wood theme gives the place a homey feel. I can still smell the wood planks and panes. <br/>The apartment seems smallish at first but once you get settled in, there’s really plenty of space to move about. <br/>Location is topnotch. You can walk your way to the major sights and spots. If you’re not up to walking, transport stops are just nearby. <br/>Stephan is a great host too!",1,0.8818,Positive
78.0,3,1.0,1.0,4.0,45,100.0,0,8.929747452022347,4.81,4.86,4.69,4.76,14999599,"Zentrale Lage, sehr netter Empfang durch Nadja, saubere Wohnung, bequeme Betten (sehr gut geschlafen) Sehr kulantes Ein-, und auschecken. Wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt und würden jederzeit wieder kommen. <br/>Liebe Grüße",1,0.0,Neutral
113.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,98.0,1,1.0001956178666358,4.83,4.91,4.96,4.78,127708,"This apartment is very well located in the popular Mitte area and is well equipped - close to plenty of restaurants, shops and Museum Island. The apartment is around 10 minutes walk from Alexanderplatz station if arriving by bus from the airport. We can highly recommend this apartment and Stephanie is an excellent host with good communication.",1,0.943,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,12,100.0,0,4.61111595595906,4.52,4.48,4.74,4.58,14830887,posizione ottima.pulizia e serietà.,1,0.0,Neutral
87.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,0,2.505218606030047,4.77,4.79,4.96,4.72,42243841,"I have been to a lot of AirBnB’s and I can safely say that Alex’ place has been one of the most well equipped places I have stayed at. Also, the location of the apartment is great for exploring the city. There are a lot of shops and restaurants in the area. Alex is a great host and will provide you with tips and recommendations upon request.",1,0.9299,Positive
363.0,16,5.0,1.5,10.0,49,93.0,0,9.499488236705036,4.47,4.3,4.34,4.26,17077519,Aleks was quick to respond to any questions and was really helpful and friendly. The apartment is unusual and fun and perfect for a group of friends exploring the city. We loved our stay.,0,0.9664,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,9,100.0,0,1.4819281552421444,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,20048414,"I had a great time at Valerie's place.<br/>The place is beautiful and furnished with taste.<br/>The room is bright and spacious, and the flat mates friendly.<br/>I also really liked the location, with hip places at walkable distance, and transport very close.<br/>Totally recommended.",1,0.9439,Positive
422.0,6,3.0,3.0,3.0,59,100.0,0,1.446201657247705,5.0,5.0,5.0,4.83,968576077766653158,"Beautiful penthouse, inside and out, on the ample balcony. <br/>Location is perfect with all you need within a 1-5 minute walk: coffee, pastries, beer, wine, food, snacks, bike rentals, subway station. <br/>We were a family with 3 kids, and the highlights were the ice cream shop and playground literally across the street. <br/>Beds were very cozy, windows let all the breeze in, and the combo washer/dryer was perfect. <br/>Would absolutely stay here again, although it was a bit pricey.",0,0.9062,Positive
106.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,0,4.998950809232622,4.73,4.57,4.77,4.63,969517965913905576,Alles war ok!,1,-0.4574,Negative
95.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,0,4.691964222849626,4.76,4.77,4.81,4.67,28168852,"Tolle unkomplizierte Gastgeber, gute Erreichbarkeit und alles, wie beschrieben.<br/>Gute zentrale Lage und trotzdem für Berliner Verhältnisse sehr ruhig.<br/>Immer wieder gerne!",1,0.0,Neutral
55.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,0.8025330705337501,4.79,4.94,4.83,4.77,11403270,Ich hatte einen sehr netten Aufenthalt in der Wohnung. Die Wohnung liegt perfekt. Die Kommunikation hat perfekt geklappt. Einzige was man wissen muss es ist einfaches Zimmer.,1,-0.8316,Negative
76.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,99.0,0,2.1897939786653327,4.2,4.3,4.67,4.18,38971259,"The room was smaller than it looked in the pictures. The bed (double) had two single mattresses, resulting in a gap in-between,and was extremely squeaky. The ventilation in the bathroom was very loud, and generally the room was quite makeshift. Nevertheless, the location is very convenient.",1,0.0,Neutral
72.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,13.967797942384964,4.96,4.96,4.88,4.92,11386702,"We stayed 5 nights in this beautiful cottage to explore Berlin by public transport. It is about 20 mins by S1 from the main city area. The station is about 5 mins walk on cobbled street but we have no problem with our luggage.<br/>It is in a safe, peaceful and calm neighbourhood. We felt very comfortable staying here. The host Uve is very friendly and responsive in communication. <br/>The cottage is amazing! Clean, cosy, well decorated, super comfy (especially the bed!) and with plenty of hot water. It is so well equipped in EVERY way. The hosts thought of all the small details to provide for his guests. They even did a load of laundry for us, retuning us with clean, nice smelling clothes.<br/>Is it worth staying 20 mins away from central Berlin ? Absolutely yes for us! Value for money and one of the best Airbnbs we have stayed!! <br/>Thank you for having us.",1,0.9967,Positive
66.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,0,7.063109677111053,4.76,4.78,4.75,4.71,12488930,Appartement très pratique et convivial situé dans un quartier qui l'est tout autant. Parfait pour un séjour d'une semaine à Berlin. Bravo!,1,0.2481,Positive
57.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,22,100.0,0,3.8737742085599214,4.73,4.77,4.79,4.65,1144212829079606426,Me ha encantado el alojamiento.,1,0.34,Positive
67.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,1,7.306691669216258,4.9,4.9,4.55,4.41,45475789,Really nice place! Clean and new place to stay,1,0.7468,Positive
63.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,33,100.0,1,0.8841099481967127,4.9,4.78,4.89,4.8,29000041,"I stayed here about a month. This accommodation is in a really great location. If you come from Berlin Central Station, you can get here in about 10 minutes by S-bahn, and the subway station is right in front of the accommodation. There are two supermarkets(edeka/netto) right in front of the accommodation and the shopping center(alexa) is also nearby, so if you stay in Berlin for a long time, I really, really recommend this place. And the accommodation has everything you may need during your stay. It is also close to Mitte, so it is a good location to go shopping anytime. Ivos is also friendly, and the check-in and check-out went smoothly. It's a different story from the accommodation, but the neighbors in the apartment were also very kind. If I come to Berlin again, I really want to stay here again.",1,0.9306,Positive
90.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,34,100.0,1,4.400439430659227,5.0,4.95,5.0,4.86,44007588,"This flat is absolutely perfect, open, bright and clean. It has everything you could possibly need. The neighborhood is great, there is a small shop around the corner where you can buy basic things if you don’t want to go all the way to the supermarket. Boxi is within walking distance and public transportation is very close. Sascha is such a wonderful and thoughtful host. I loved meeting him and staying at his place, I truly felt at home. I would absolutely stay here again. Highly recommend. Thank you, Sascha ❤️",1,0.986,Positive
60.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,20,93.0,0,4.065511825937199,4.59,4.63,4.4,4.47,41422691,Excellent spot for a stay near Hermannplatz!,1,0.6114,Positive
243.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,8,88.0,0,3.560186030012189,4.42,4.53,4.81,4.24,854251028991888522,Nice apartment close to Brandenburg Tor. Quiet place. Good communication with  the host although a bit impersonal. A good option for accommodation in Berlin.,1,0.743,Positive
75.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,1,3.7465670354738254,4.89,4.91,4.74,4.8,4581049,"My experience here was perfect.  Etienne took a last minute booking from me when I found myself in a jam.  He responded to my request lightning fast and I was on my way to the apartment within minutes of communicating with him.  I was very lucky this beautiful space was available as it was booked for several days afterwards, otherwise I would have extended my stay. It is a beautifully designed space with a comfortable bed and all the things you need for a comfortable stay.  <br/>The location is well connected to 24 hr transit, which is important in Berlin because there is always something fun to do.  You can walk to the grocery store or to some nice restaurants.<br/>I cannot say enough great things about my stay here. If you can find availability, don't hesitate to book this amazing little space. <br/>Thank you Etienne and Judith for welcoming me on such short notice.",1,0.9891,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,1,5.336391697711564,4.93,4.85,4.76,4.7,27288541,"Eugenia’s apartment in Neukölln was the ideal resting place for my wife and I during our 4 day stay in Berlin. The space is clean, appointed with all the amenities we needed, aesthetically pleasing, and very well located close to restaurants, cafes, parks, & public transit. I would recommend this listing to anyone visiting Berlin!",1,0.9285,Positive
51.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,0,5.45266710386518,4.77,4.88,4.59,4.66,30034739,Dawid was very quick at responding. The location of the place was excellent—very close to public transportation and convenient. We had a good stay.,1,0.4404,Positive
