64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,0,2.7158957748781662,4.95,4.98,4.88,4.88,33647437,"Maike and Simon’s room was perfect. Big, bright, airy, very comfortable, with a great open view. Very clean and welcoming.<br/>Maike and Simon were excellent hosts, always friendly and helpful with recommendations, but also very quiet and considerate. The room is on one end of the long apartment and they live on the other, so most days I barely saw them.<br/>The noise from the metro outside the window is significant when it passes by, but the windows are incredibly sound proof. Usually I’d keep the windows wide open in the daytime and closed at night.<br/>Overall this is a great Airbnb, and I look forward to staying here again next time I’m in Berlin.",1,0.9801,Positive
