109.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,0,13.53047042591278,4.79,4.67,4.85,4.6,20185864,Wow! Fabian’s place is gorgeous! And spotlessly clean! It has everything you could want when away from home and the apartment is great for either a business trip or for fun. It is situated in a very transport friendly locality. Fabian was a very gracious host who met us on arrival with lots of local information and helpful tips. He always answered queries very promptly too. Would definitely stay here again. Thanks for everything Fabian! ,1,0.9883,Positive
51.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,6.507053849431365,4.88,4.68,4.88,4.84,1300487,"Ich hab mich bei Katrin rundum wohl gefühlt. Das Zimmer ist total schön, sehr groß und ruhig. Das Bett fand ich superbequem und ich habe hervorragend geschlafen. Katrin denkt an alles und ich hab mich sehr über die vielen kleinen Goodies gefreut; man hat alles was man braucht. 5 Minuten zur U-Bahn mit direkter Verbindung zum Hauptbahnhof. Alles perfekt. Vielen Dank!",1,-0.636,Negative
96.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,48,100.0,1,6.700512034911939,4.98,4.99,4.93,4.94,12967814,"I have been to three different Airbnbs in total now and this one is by far the very best that I have ever been to. The whole place is nothing short of amazing! But let's get right into the facts which make this place so special:<br/>Cleanliness: The whole Loft is super clean and tidy. Even my own room at home after a serious cleanup would have a hard time compared to this place.<br/>Hospitality: It's hard to describe how friendly Robert and Jack (his Labrador Retriever) really are without meeting them in person. He actually sent me very detailed instructions on how to get to the appartment from various different locations (airports etc.) in advance so I had no troubles finding it. Another benefit is the great connection to local transport. Within just a few minutes I was out and about on the s-bahn every day and the bus stop is also right around the corner. Another aspect is the sheer size of the appartment, the room itself and, of course, the ginormous bathroom! I have yet to find a hotel room this big and comfortable. Speaking of comfortable: for some reason I have missed that this room features a really comfortable waterbed. I really didn't feel like leaving the place just to return to my regular spring bed at home. The rediculous height of the rooms (the ceiling is really high) gives you the impression of being the king of a huge house.<br/>Overall this appartment is really one of a kind and I cannot recommend it enough! I really couldn't come up with any disappointments which means that this place is really quite a gem compared to many others (and especially pretty much every single hotel at this price point). I will definitely visit this place again and hope many others will too!",1,0.9912,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,82.0,1,2.6808853188639663,4.67,4.68,4.92,4.59,43823296,Excelente ubicación,1,0.0,Neutral
