92.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,0,2.7850220743469896,4.82,4.83,4.89,4.68,249419,"Super place, super gast geber :)",1,0.8957,Positive
80.0,1,0.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,8.131943711690111,4.89,4.85,4.68,4.79,42301772,"Overall, my experience was okay. The apartment was as described and was really peaceful because it overlooks the courtyard. It also gets a lot of sunlight during the day, which was nice. There are multiple grocery stores within walking distance and a nice park close by. That being said, there were several things that made the stay less than ideal. The towels provided were extremely thin, the shower water temp changes from hot to cold randomly and the drain didn't work well. There were no toiletries, so make sure you bring your own or plan on buying some from nearby stores. There were also spider webs in the bathroom and some of the kitchen items were greasy. The lack of a bed frame wasn't a problem for me, but you can feel the floor wobbling from neighbors walking so if you're a light sleeper, like I am, it can wake you up. Lastly, the pillow was really flat, so be aware if you prefer a firm pillow. The location worked well for me, but I'll probably stay elsewhere next time.",1,0.8099,Positive
