68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,3.194253694245239,4.93,4.95,4.89,4.86,81081,"This place is a little gem. <br/>We felt so at home, both in the apartment and in the neighbourghood. <br/>Bernd and Katja made us feel so welcome, and every detail was thought of. Little personal notes, good guides to how to get around and what to visit. We especially enjoyed Pakolat, the little bakery and kaffeerösterei on Raumer strasse. And the postershop right next to it. Everything was easy and comfortable.    ",1,0.9459,Positive
