114.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,67,100.0,1,32.29350043093033,4.85,4.69,4.87,4.74,36360929,"Beautiful and quiet location in a short distance from Berlin and sandy beaches in Wannsee. Very friendly and always helpful host, plenty of options to spend your free time from hot tub to barbecues and parties. Excellent accessibility by car, bus and train. Retro village style and beautiful antique furniture with attention to detail. Clean accommodation and many nice touches from the owner. I can only recommend it and next time we will definitely come for longer than a week!",0,0.987,Positive
35.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,0,18.784010280879883,4.75,4.7,4.54,4.67,26177003,Veldig koselig rom med bad og et lite kjøkken/fellesområde. Beliggenheten er et fredelig villastrøk og er i gåavstand fra busstoppet. Suzanna svarte raskt på alle spørsmål og var veldig til hjelp. Alt i alt en veldig fin opplevelse! ☺️,1,-0.5848,Negative
