69.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,0,10.192916833772689,4.9,4.91,4.79,4.87,1863324,The experience is fantastic. The apartment locates at a quite neighbourhood. It's very clean and feels like home. The hospitality of Rainer and Olga made us feel so welcome. Rainer was extremely kind and helpful. He's also very enthusiastic and we had a lot of fun getting to know each other. We are most impressed by his garden and the fresh fruit picked from it. It's a wonderful place to stay in Berlin and I'd strong recommend.,1,0.991,Positive
