63.0,2,1.0,0.0,1.0,36,100.0,1,4.697448788448945,4.76,4.59,4.76,4.71,31356953,"El alojamiento de Mohammad es tal cual se describe, en una perfecta ubicación. Si te gusta experimentar un barrio con gente de muchos lugares y comer a precios accesibles en Berlin, Neukölln es la zona ideal. Hay infinidad de formas de llegar en bus, U-Bahn y S-Bahn, todas a 4 minutos caminando desde la casa de Mohammad, quien da unas recomendaciones espectaculares. <br/>IMPERDIBLES:<br/>Pollo : City Chicken<br/>Kebabs: Sonne City<br/>A 20 mts de la casa!",1,0.7263,Positive
180.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,1,6.165406546084308,4.75,4.8,4.9,4.54,797758856144797765,"My family of four stayed here for about two weeks. Excellent location near restaurants and shops, but still very quiet at night and comfortable. I've stayed in some locations in this neighborhood that can get a bit loud from restaurants and bars, but this was very quiet because the windows face the interior courtyard. The rooms feel spacious and the beds are very nice. It felt good to come back from a long day of sightseeing and have a cozy place to sleep. The hosts are excellent--very responsive and organized. We needed a few towels one day and Steve came by within minutes.",1,0.9586,Positive
