64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,1,5.269817323835547,4.98,4.98,4.75,4.89,821670157069145247,"Very nice place. Super tidy, strong WiFi, & great kommunikation. Matteo also helped Me in a trikky situation which was My fault. I really appreciate that.<br/>The room is well aired, bright & well organised. Nice & near to the centre by publik transport.<br/>Would stay again, for sure.",1,0.978,Positive
