47.0,2,1.0,0.5,1.0,38,100.0,1,6.365795800114372,4.95,4.87,4.74,4.96,885205013477522768,"Io e la mia fidanzata siamo stati un paio di giorni nell'appartamento di Avi. Abbiamo avuto l'alloggio tutto per noi, atmosfera molto piacevole e rilassante casa eccentrica e massimalista, entrando ci si sente accolti e c'è una bella atmosfera. Il giardino aggiunge molto.",1,-0.296,Negative
195.0,4,3.0,1.5,3.0,41,100.0,1,2.9858830817363757,4.96,4.99,4.95,4.83,929443,"A wonderful funky and peaceful place in central Berlin. It really is beautifully spacious and full of quirky art and artifacts, and SO quiet, and easy to walk everywhere.  One thing to be clear on, though, is that the bath has a handheld showerhead, which was fine for me but my teenage children found it a bit tough. There are two bathrooms which is very convenient, and we loved the area. Thomas is a very thoughtful and responsive host and this is an absolutey fabulous place to stay.",0,0.9799,Positive
182.0,6,1.0,1.0,3.0,43,91.0,0,4.871252294318258,4.67,4.75,4.85,4.55,46866971,"Nice room, good host who responds quickly. Spacious room And well epuiped although kitchen facilities are very limited. Very good situated. Nice neighbourhood and good transportation.",1,0.9218,Positive
125.0,8,3.0,1.0,2.0,17,100.0,0,6.117673237767841,4.42,4.43,4.78,4.49,18659651,Hat uns sehr gut gefallen!,0,0.0,Neutral
73.0,1,0.0,8.5,1.0,33,100.0,0,2.496114582405734,4.63,4.55,4.78,4.5,45339029,"Fantastic location, everything is cleaned and taken care of daily. I ran into the manager in the kitchen one morning during breakfast and she was nice enough to check in on me and make sure everything was going well.<br/>I guess my only real complaint was that the beds are a bit uncomfortable, and decor wise the rooms aren’t big on the ambience, but you’re in such a great location you don’t need to spend loads of time there. I liked their little library room off of the kitchen as well.",0,0.9559,Positive
306.0,8,3.0,2.0,5.0,44,100.0,1,6.90827181205849,4.86,4.8,4.85,4.68,311703,"Kathrin’s apartment was in a very nice, very convenient area of Schöneberg.  The nearby U-Bahn whisks you into the historic center of Berlin in 15 minutes or to City-West, the glittering area around the Kurfürstendamm.   The neighborhood itself is filled with restaurants and lots of unique cafes. <br/>The apartment itself was very spacious, clean and located in a beautiful, old apartment building from the late 1900’s.   The bedrooms are all large and have very comfortable, firm beds.  The kitchen is small but workable and we ate several meals in the apartment.  One bathroom is rather small, but fully equipped, while the other bathroom is very large and has a clothes washer.  There is no dryer., so we used the large drying racks provided.  Water pressure was terrific.  The decor is lovely, and the high ceilings and large windows add to a feeling of lightness.  <br/>Kristen was a very friendly, responsive host who really wants to make her guests as comfortable as possible.  We appreciated her level of care very much.  Her apartment is a great base for adventures in Berlin.",0,0.9932,Positive
139.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,96.0,1,4.279858775670925,4.8,4.82,4.89,4.66,54126149,"Herzlichste Kommunikation, supersuper Lage im Bergmannkiez und sehr schöne Zimmer:)",1,0.0,Neutral
102.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,57,100.0,1,6.359076554378813,4.97,4.97,4.76,4.89,923758042096702482,"My friend and I had such a great time at Simon’s place. It’s even bigger than it looks in the photos, super comfy, and the perfect spot to chill after a long day in the city or a night out. Simon was really easy to communicate with, super friendly, gave us great tips, and always replied quickly. The apartment is a bit further from areas like Kreuzberg, but with the U-Bahn and bikes, it was no problem at all. Thanks a lot, Simon, hope to stay at your place again!",1,0.9586,Positive
422.0,8,3.0,2.0,3.0,19,93.0,0,3.482995702581734,4.71,4.73,4.69,4.6,45780452,comfortable and functional apartment for 3 singles.  excellent showers and comfortable beds. good blackout curtains and good to have 2 small balconies. we loved the Vietnamese restaurant  next door but one - great food and lovely staff. would recommend.<br/>the only negatives were the very noisy pipes gurgling through the night in 2 rooms and the bad damp smell in the shared hallway.,0,0.9566,Positive
66.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,0,3.3157528272323247,4.88,4.8,4.81,4.6,8705386,"Nice and tasteful place in very good location. We disliked that the TV did not work. Also, the WLAN is very weak and did not work for streaming. In the end we had to watch Bundesliga via iPad and LTE. No other disappointments.",1,-0.6249,Negative
83.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,1.6348487577751798,4.96,4.91,4.89,4.8,589827311095896853,"Ideal location. Next to public transport, leafy area with heaps of cafes and restaurants nearby. <br/>But as other people pointed out, if you’re mega sensitive to tram noise, maybe not for you. I stayed 4 nights. The first night I was really aware of it, (as it’s right outside) and then the next three not at all, I just got used to it.<br/>I would stay here again and recommend it.<br/>The bedroom is super spacious, light with a sweet little balcony.",1,0.9153,Positive
68.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,50,100.0,0,6.026516407626963,4.74,4.76,4.48,4.7,6808626,Birgit ist wirklich eine super freundliche und herzliche Gastgeberin. Wir haben uns wirklich sehr wohlgefühlt. Die Hunde waren ein willkommenes Extra und wir würden jedesmal wieder dorthin!,1,0.0,Neutral
