68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,13,87.0,0,7.867349248126775,4.54,4.66,4.52,4.53,3970161,Alessandro was very considerate!<br/>Kind and friendly!<br/>Neighborhood was cool! “Off beat” and cultured.<br/>It was the perfect ending of my two week trip.,1,0.783,Positive
50.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,34,83.0,1,2.563400508484748,4.9,4.97,4.96,4.92,29732182,"My partner and I stayed at airbnbs throughout Europe and this was maybe the best. Spacious room with great amenities in a wonderful location right near the museum island and close to Brandenburg Tor. Spotlessly clean. You won't regret it, trust me.",1,0.9364,Positive
