125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,21,100.0,1,8.187543141932318,4.92,4.93,4.9,4.8,1266630,"Here are a few of the features of Roi's modern studio/loft apartment that make it a great place to stay:  king size bed, big screen tv, fully furnished user friendly kitchen,  big bathroom with a washer AND A DRYER, elevator, location, proximity to public transportation (U bahn, S bahn, taxi's), grocery shopping, Victoria-Louise Plaza, high end neighborhood, bakery next door and more.  You will love it.",1,0.919,Positive
54.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,1,8.127615937955055,4.91,4.95,4.86,4.9,22779598,"It's really beautiful, comfortable, clean place. Very good location, a lot of restaurants near at hand, and metro station is close. Easy to find and convenient to get anywhere in the city. Great opportunity to feel like a Berliner. Tina is a great host. Our best recommendations.",1,0.9897,Positive
138.0,7,1.0,1.0,3.0,67,100.0,1,12.18456689720396,4.89,4.79,4.89,4.89,1272525072465188986,Best !,0,0.6696,Positive
79.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,1,24.74326903682093,4.93,4.93,4.88,4.85,24790763,"Sehr stylisches, ruhiges Appartement. Top eingerichtet, sehr komfortabel und hochwertig. Wird einer meiner TOP-Favoriten ",1,0.2023,Positive
118.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,24,93.0,0,2.2997563334626485,4.63,4.61,4.74,4.55,16951874,"We enjoyed the apartment very much, and were so happy to have had a lovely winter snow while we were there! The access to the metro station was easy. The Lidl around the corner was super convenient for picking up groceries. The apartment is very quiet on the inside courtyard. We’d go back!",1,0.9649,Positive
95.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,0,4.691964222849626,4.76,4.77,4.81,4.67,28168852,Great host in a fantastic location,1,0.8271,Positive
142.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,49,91.0,0,6.115210424417201,4.74,4.85,4.76,4.47,32539441,"Alojamiento muy comodo y coqueto, ideal para pasar unos dias conociendo la ciudad ya que hay paradas de tram justo al lado. Tiene zonas comunes que pueden servir para trabajar o relacionarse con otros inquilinos, incluso tiene maquinas expendedoras de comida y bebida y cafetera.<br/>Totalmente recomendable.",1,0.5267,Positive
40.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,0,5.320565328468804,4.69,4.39,4.78,4.68,20758275,"Der Aufenthalt bei Heidi hat uns sehr gut gefallen! Alles lief genau so, wie man es sich für eine tolle airbnb wünscht- von der super Gastfreundschaft ganz zu schweigen. Durch unseren Flug konnten wir erst nachts einchecken, das stellte für Heidi jedoch kein Problem dar. Auch wenn unser Besuch nur sehr kurz war,  steht für uns fest, dass wir aufjeden Fall wieder kommen werden!☺️",1,-0.508,Negative
60.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,45,100.0,1,3.689600261518912,4.74,4.55,4.76,4.65,16237052,Die Lage war top! Die Wohnung sieht sehr gemütlich aus. Das einzige minus ist die Sauberkeit.,1,-0.9441,Negative
422.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,51,94.0,0,7.131273504704622,4.7,4.47,4.84,4.47,49087490,"Five stars! <br/>I would recommend Numa to everyone visiting Berlin. <br/>The check in was easy, the host delivered clear information and were a text message away, the apartment was very beautiful and clean and I wanna go back!",1,0.9407,Positive
162.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,64,100.0,1,2.161724133435209,4.97,4.97,4.97,4.93,1342827795974739067,"Die Wohnung war super – sauber, gut ausgestattet und gut gelegen. Der Gastgeber war gut erreichbar und der Check-in verlief dank der klaren Beschreibung unkompliziert.",1,-0.8316,Negative
68.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,22,100.0,1,1.5015867319599838,4.82,4.88,4.9,4.77,4362839,"Had a great stay at Sabine's place. The room offers everything you need and the location is beyond great! About the host personally, I cannot say much, as we've only met when she showed us the room. She and her son already slept when we got home at night, and they were already gone when we woke up. <br/>Two tiny negatives:<br/>- the bed gave us both a little soreness in the back.<br/>- we woke up every morning when they we're getting ready for school/work.<br/>Anyway, we had a GREAT stay! ",1,0.9525,Positive
151.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,28,98.0,0,0.9333653060276148,4.54,4.49,4.73,4.33,693923313653482667,"vom Ablauf sehr klar, Unterkunft angenehm, ruhiges Umfeld",1,0.0,Neutral
