82.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,44,100.0,1,6.735519877930783,4.8,4.54,4.86,4.71,863106789917399523,"An ideal location to visit Berlin city. Less than 5minutes walk to train /metro station to any part of the city. The host is very accommodative. my flight arrived late night, but the host wait for me to get to the house around 11pm and see that I am ok. I highly recommended it for your short stay.",1,0.7677,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,37,67.0,0,5.346983659639468,4.72,4.72,4.84,4.52,787492130913358786,Vivian’s home was good for my short work trip. Vivian was responsive and friendly. Easy to check in and out. Easy access to public transport. A peaceful and friendly neighbourhood.,1,0.9628,Positive
209.0,8,4.0,2.5,4.0,72,100.0,0,12.809254275601033,4.8,4.61,4.48,4.73,53720272,Wonderful house very spacious just as described. Lisa was very responsive and helpful. The whole trip. Highly recommended.,0,0.8922,Positive
190.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,92.0,0,3.7621042521440935,4.96,4.96,4.96,4.79,1208505072369670500,"We loved the place, perfect space for 2 people. Close to a trainstation and lots of restaurants. Lot of sunlight in the morning, super nice to wake up. Very responsive and friendly. Perfect apartment for our first time Berlin!!",1,0.9772,Positive
129.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,55,83.0,0,6.567199125784508,4.84,4.76,4.78,4.71,819740,Liobas home was the perfect location for our first travel as a family of four. The area is great with lots and lots of playgrounds. We took long strolls from playground to playground and checked out many to-go coffees along.  The area has lots of nice restaurants and cafés and the S-bahn is just nearby for visiting the rest of Berling. <br/>The appartment feels very homely and has lots of space and everything we needed. It was clean and cosy. The morning sun on the balcony is a great place to start the day. And there is no noise from neighbors. <br/>Lioba was easy and good to communicate with. She gave us tips for the best playgrounds and was kind took our needs into account.<br/>We just want to go back.,1,0.9833,Positive
160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,96.0,1,4.5324163943313245,4.69,4.54,4.77,4.38,1295645599247041738,"Wir waren zufrieden mit der Unterkunft ,die Lage war für uns ein guter Ausgangspunkt für unsere Unternehmungen.Die Größe des Zimmers und des Badezimmers war sehr angenehm,da auch unser Hund mit reiste.Das Zimmer lag ruhig in einem Hinterhof.",1,-0.9337,Negative
301.0,6,2.0,2.0,3.0,39,93.0,0,1.5855808977468837,4.5,4.29,4.93,4.29,43923420,"The rooms of Gold Palais Hotel are definitely beautiful: big rooms, perfect bathroom (with awesome hot water) and with a thermostat that you can regolate as you wish.<br/>On the other point, the cleaning, the organization and the communication are one of the worst in my life, honestly.<br/>- Once we arrived the receptionist wasn't so welcoming, she didn't told us all the infos about the city or about the check-in and check-out - not even the Wi-Fi password.<br/>- The room wasn't so clean: dust in many places, and there was even a bottle of beer (opened) in our room.<br/>- The reception was totally disorganized, they told us that we were going to stay in one room of five people but in the end we were in two separated rooms, then they told us to go to the room but there was still a woman cleaning one of the rooms.<br/>- The reception is only open from 10 to 20, if you have any problems in other hours you must solve it by yourself - they are not going to answer you in Airbnb in these hours.<br/>Cool place but so bad organization, cleaning and cleaning.<br/>So sorry about it.",0,-0.843,Negative
55.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,8.583224631576245,4.79,4.79,4.72,4.62,53567975,"The room was perfect! It was comfortable and private. Easy access to public transportation, and the nearby parks are nice places to relax. It is a great place to stay.",1,0.9638,Positive
64.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,0,9.70901866979358,4.85,4.92,4.54,4.85,20520109,"One of the best airbnbs I stayed in!<br/>Carolin is an amazing and loving host. Her hospitality is priceless. The apartment is unique, comfortable and very stylish I loved it. Thanks Carolin for making our stay an unforgettable experience!<br/>Highly recommended!",1,0.9775,Positive
