64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,54,100.0,1,3.2128860570955378,4.95,4.93,4.84,4.78,64245,"My brother and I felt right at home in Christian’s apartment during our two night stay. The bedroom is clean and spacious, and has a little private balcony where we enjoyed our morning coffees. The bathroom and kitchen had everything we needed as well. We absolutely loved the area near Christian’s apartment, with easy train access and wonderful shops, parks, and restaurants. Communicating with Christian was a breeze and we appreciated his flexibility around check in/out times. The apartment is on the 4th floor (5th for Americans) and there’s no elevator, so I wouldn’t suggest bringing heavy luggage. Would highly recommend this for any solo travelers or two people okay with sharing a bed.",1,0.9816,Positive
