149.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,38,94.0,0,3.1018817858877528,4.65,4.76,4.76,4.6,721515853504302012,"Generally great. Good location, smart and with free coffee/snacks. Only downside was that both lifts were broken (which from other reviews seems to be a recurring problem) for the second half of our four day visit.",1,0.836,Positive
