64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,0,5.448425021636805,4.5,4.25,4.75,4.58,51719118,"I had a very busy time during my  2 weeks stay at Grasiele Flat, but I really felt at home   When I came back. Very nice  and friendly environment.",1,0.87,Positive
97.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,1,2.186044325557003,4.98,4.9,4.98,4.92,15645656,"Wir haben uns während unseres Aufenthaltes in Berlin sehr wohl in Attos Wohnung gefühlt. Es ist wirklich alles vorhanden, sehr gemütlich eingerichtet und alles war blitzsauber. Die Lage ist einfach großartig, man kann wirklich von der Haustür aus vieles unternehmen und gleichzeitig ist die Wohnung sehr ruhig zum Hinterhof hinaus gelegen. Perfekte Anbindung mit den öffentlichen Verkehrsmitteln gibt es zudem für weitere Ausflüge. Ich kann die Buchung dieser Wohnung uneingeschränkt empfehlen. Atto war ein sehr aufgeschlossener, hilfsbereiter und netter Gastgeber.",1,-0.9661,Negative
103.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,0,12.008373900915986,4.81,4.97,4.83,4.69,20967430,Beautiful place with lovely hosts . highly recommended!,1,0.8775,Positive
81.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,1,2.618142013757112,4.87,4.9,4.91,4.75,3717751,Yvonne and Vincent's place is definitely as pictured. A really trendy studio practically in the Berlin Memorial. I found them very helpful and responsive. I loved my time in Berlin.,1,0.9092,Positive
71.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,92.0,1,4.49512738085394,4.89,4.98,4.75,4.68,34091731,"With cleaning costs etc it was a rather expensive place to stay, especially for not having a private bathroom, no coffee or tea offered... But the beauty of the appartement, the hospitality, flexibility and the prime time location make up for it. Very tasteful decoration. Thanks.",1,0.9177,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,20,100.0,0,3.0125604494516,4.92,4.74,4.88,4.92,30358711,"La habitación es tal cual la foto, esta cerca del muro con graffitis y un poco más lejos de lo demás, a dos paradas de metro. Todo está muy limpio. Lo único que la ventana tiene cortinas blancas y en verano a las 5 de la mañana tienes una luz allí que te despierta... Llevar antifaz! El perro precioso y muy educado, de llama Juan... Y Marcel muy bien también.",1,0.0,Neutral
70.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,17,100.0,0,4.150324436872424,4.82,4.57,4.84,4.75,31562363,"Good host, great communication. A decent appartment at a perfect place. Just within the two first zones of the underground/trams/busses of berlin. And thanks for the restaurant advice, we enjoyed it a lot!",1,0.9531,Positive
143.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,1,3.291202411050151,4.87,4.83,4.84,4.75,16543844,"We all had a fantastic stay at Alexander’s lovely and stylish apartment. Quick communication and easy check-in process. In convenient location and great neighborhood. A convenient store, a neighborhood bar and bus stops are just steps away. Spotless clean, spacious, fully equipped kitchen and modern decor. Excellent place to stay when visiting Berlin.",1,0.9648,Positive
159.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,95.0,0,4.132850367965358,4.39,4.36,4.47,4.23,43811867,"Cooles Apartment, die Mitarbeiter an der Rezeption waren sehr freundlich, und das Apartment lag direkt am Hermannplatz, sodass es einfach zu erreichen war. Alles super :)",1,-0.5106,Negative
68.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,22,100.0,1,1.5015867319599838,4.82,4.88,4.9,4.77,4362839,Ich habe mich sehr wohl gefühlt. Die Lage war sensationell!,1,-0.8439,Negative
236.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,76,100.0,1,1.390567313580942,4.83,4.84,4.96,4.76,1701332,Great location. Beautiful apartment.,0,0.8402,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,36,100.0,1,5.679605238112949,4.89,4.82,4.97,4.76,30980628,"Excellent séjour à Berlin chez David ! Très bonne communication avec lui également. En plus, le quartier est top ! :)",1,0.8436,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,2,100.0,0,4.357646957350326,4.5,4.75,5.0,5.0,1466154,"Wow...I had absolutely no idea how cool this neighborhood was when I booked this.  Bergmanstrasse is the center of a really great neighborhood, lively in the day and quiet and peaceful at night.  During the week I was there I didn't venture too far out of this neighborhood I liked it so much.  The trains were very close and made it easy to get around to the rest of Berlin when I did venture out.  I've now moved over to Fredrichshain, and I miss my little short term home on Bergmanstrasse.<br/><br/>As for the actual place, it's great.  It's exactly what you'd expect from a 19th century building, charming in a very Berlin way.  It had everything I needed, was quiet at night, and was a very easy place to live with all the great food nearby.  I'd highly recommend this place if you're coming to Berlin for a bit.  ",1,0.9872,Positive
64.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,20,100.0,0,4.993723336849769,4.7,4.57,4.44,4.66,17250059,Raissa is very thoughtful and helpful. The room is clean and perfect for two person living.,1,0.9073,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,1,3.1045385291498,4.93,4.84,4.76,4.76,825139109379480058,"Alessandro was superfast in communication, quick to answer, solved the issue if key pickup without any issues. All went well, and the neighborhood was all good and friendly. <br/>Thanks again for the quick solution on getting you place, and hosting me.",1,0.891,Positive
55.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,0,1.354221835889287,4.91,4.71,4.96,4.9,14257495,"We liked our stay at Wibke's appartment very much. It is a cosy appartment in the middle of the city and still very quit and peaceful to stay and sleep. The appartment has a lot of daylightr which makes it very nice to eat breakfast or sit in the living room. Really everything you need is there from all kinds of kitchen equipment, over board games to a very good cd collection! We did not spent a lot of time in the appartment but the short times we did, we really felt like being at home. The bedroom is very neat as well and we slept very good.<br/>The apprtment is very centrally located into the city of Berlin, very close to 2 metro stations and around a nice neighbourhood with plenty of restaurants, shops and bars. The mittle of berlin (dome, museum area, ...) is only a 15 minute walk.  Therefore the location of the appartment is ideal when exploring the city of berlin!",1,0.9813,Positive
123.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,28,100.0,0,4.462782849034317,4.86,4.88,4.83,4.82,9994644,"Place was good for our needs for a one night stay, Martin was responsive and helpful.",1,0.802,Positive
65.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,0,3.715408939134692,4.76,4.83,4.76,4.75,749508,"I did a lot of research before opting for Michael's apartment in Kreuzberg, Berlin. It was modern, clean, bright, neat and tastefully furnished. I liked its quirkiness too. The wifi worked well and the logistics of access were well done. When I ran into difficulties on the last day, almost the last hour, Michael was calm and helpful. The apartment is well located, and is easy to get to, with Ubahn stops for two different lines easily within walking distance. One nice touch is that there was a bottle of wine, a box of chocolates and some bread rolls waiting for me when I arrived. Even if I didn't drink the wine, it felt like a warm welcome. Michael is a welcoming host. <br/>In April I plan to return to Berlin and to this lovely apartment again. ",1,0.9898,Positive
113.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,34,100.0,0,8.128444813154763,4.56,4.46,4.9,4.45,27870140,The room looks smaller in the pictures. <br/>It's very easy to reach all the cool spots of Berlin. <br/>We've had a pleasent stay.,1,0.7056,Positive
131.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,0,4.263251204069727,4.62,4.68,4.41,4.45,46113337,nice apartment. the neighbourhood has room for improvement,1,0.7003,Positive
58.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,11,100.0,0,2.414218103237951,4.7,4.26,4.72,4.61,9460079,"Maria mi ha accolto amichevolmente, molto discreta mi sono sentito a mio agio. Il quartiere ha ottimi collegamenti ed è facile spostarsi con i mezzi. La stanza è molto ampia ed ha un piccolo frigorifero e un microonde. Silenziosa. Per alcuni potrebbe essere un problema fare i 5 piani di scale senza ascensore. Bagno piccolo ma adeguato.<br/>Tutto è andato bene e mi sono goduto la mia vacanza",1,0.6124,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,1,6.3796568015063695,4.85,4.9,4.68,4.77,6658190,"Great apartment, well equipped. Short walk to public transport, lots of bars and restaurants and a great bakery nearby. We had a great stay in Berlin!",1,0.9402,Positive
68.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,45,100.0,1,35.229987694282585,4.82,4.61,4.89,4.68,1242815787146152998,"Haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt, vielen Dank. :)",1,0.4588,Positive
74.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,1,5.595938481907904,4.82,4.65,4.73,4.74,4563394,"Wirklich sehr schöne Wohnung mit interessantem, geschichtlichem Hintergrund. Super Lage am Rand eines Parks mit unmittelbarer Nähe zur S-Bahn. Wir haben uns rund um wohl gefühlt und kommen gern wieder. Danke, Anna!",1,0.636,Positive
122.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,96.0,0,3.128194469226722,4.61,4.66,4.86,4.54,47215807,"Wir hatten bezüglich der Anreise keinerlei Probleme. Innerhalb der Unterkunft ist alles gut ausgeschildert auch in Englisch und weiteren Sprachen. Es ist also auch für internationale Gäste ausgelegt.<br/>Uns hat es im Zimmer an nichts gefehlt. Für 1-2 Nächte reicht der Platz aus, darüber hinaus könnte es zu zweit in einem Doppelzimmer etwas zu eng werden.<br/>Insgesamt waren wir zufrieden.",1,0.0,Neutral
50.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,2.7124641454032274,4.82,4.58,4.93,4.66,31203061,Very nice room! Quite large space and the convenient transportation! I love the style of the apartment! Had a very good time there (*≧∀≦*),1,0.9074,Positive
122.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,96.0,0,3.128194469226722,4.61,4.66,4.86,4.54,47215807,It was an overall nice stay perfectly located in the middle of Berlin with a friendly staff and cool facilities/ rooms (:,1,0.9403,Positive
143.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,59,100.0,1,4.082628890408757,4.9,4.73,4.92,4.71,603656499321928631,Janas home was nice and comfy. The neighborhood was quiet and well connected with public transportation.,1,0.5994,Positive
77.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,3.9090703122997335,4.91,4.86,4.96,4.8,34172297,"Toll, toll, toll!<br/>Die Wohnung ist perfekt für einen kürzeren oder längeren Aufenthalt. Die Kommunikation verlief reibungslos, Claudio ließ mich sogar schon am Mittag hinein - großartig! Der Wrangelkiez am ""Görli"" ist jetzt nicht gerade das Schmuckkästchen Berlins, aber Claudios Wohnung ist herrlich, um graue Berlin-Tage zu überstehen. Fette Empfehlung!",1,-0.6981,Negative
73.0,2,0.0,1.0,3.0,41,100.0,0,7.593507322759444,4.72,4.68,4.87,4.7,20632571,"Great apartment, short distance from the public transport connections (less than 5 min walk). Reliable communication and good local tips. Apartment was fully equipped even for some basic cooking etc., just as stated. Recommended!",1,0.8439,Positive
307.0,5,3.0,2.0,4.0,77,100.0,1,5.3390203840216754,4.91,4.98,4.68,4.81,901837,"Morga’s apartment was absolutely amazing, everything you could need from a stay during a city break. <br/>The apartment is so well equipped, coffee machine, soap and shampoo, lots of towels, water on arrival etc.. you couldn’t ask for anything more. <br/>The pool was a wonderful extra as well!<br/>I would highly recommend staying here!",0,0.9314,Positive
135.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,47,99.0,1,3.1208071542921334,4.89,4.79,4.77,4.59,34271196,"Alles perfekt, wir hatten einen super Aufenthalt !:)",1,0.636,Positive
123.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,1,5.647612369878072,4.88,4.79,4.84,4.68,52111736,"The studio was amazing, really clean, nice, modern place. Smart TV for late nights. Check in was easy with the door code. Helped us get back without keys.<br/>Location showed me a new part of Berlin I hadn’t seen before. Overall worth it for a group of 4!",1,0.949,Positive
44.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,23,100.0,0,13.157059293117056,4.44,4.33,4.64,4.44,18066481,great place,1,0.6249,Positive
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,58,100.0,0,4.380372229114377,4.9,4.87,4.68,4.65,12374785,"Alles wunderbar, gleich an der S-Bahn Station. Für Kinder eingerichtet und diese durften sogar das vorhandene Spielzeug benutzen. Alles da was man braucht in der Küche. Wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt und wenn alles klappt, kommen wir nächstes Jahr gerne wieder.",1,0.4939,Positive
94.0,2,2.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,0,3.655795574221757,4.74,4.79,4.91,4.68,85560,"Die Lage des Apartments ist nicht zu übertreffen, sehr zentral: U-Bahn, Tram, Restaurants, Frühstücksbäckerei vor der Tür, aber idyllisch und ruhig in einem sehr schönen Hinterhof gelegen.<br/>Die Wohnung ist gut ausgestattet.<br/>Das Ehepaar Müller ist sehr freundlich, unaufdringlich und hilfsbereit.<br/>Wir freuen uns schon auf unseren nächsten Berlinaufenthalt bei ihnen.",1,-0.5994,Negative
157.0,8,2.0,1.0,7.0,48,100.0,0,8.94968963214356,4.7,4.72,4.43,4.49,14381251,"The apartment was good. It was clean, there was enough space for 6 adults and 2 children. The communication with the host and his wife was very good and they where helpfull.<br/>Only disadvantage was the small bathroom where also the toilet was and that there was only one toilet.  <br/>The location was also good; near the u- and s-bahn and a supermarket and bakery. Parking for the car was easy and free nearby on the P+R.",0,0.93,Positive
288.0,8,2.0,1.0,7.0,54,100.0,1,1.6226420447109429,4.79,4.71,5.0,4.58,1109468874804058014,"Logement au top ! Tout était très propre et grand, et l’emplacement est plus que parfait ! <br/>Douglas aura été aux petits soins avec nous, il est très réactif. Si je devais revenir, ce serait avec grand plaisir que je reprendrai ce même logement !<br/>Le seul bémol trouvé serait l’isolation de la douche qui nous a trempé complètement le sol durant tout le séjour. Et lorsque les toilettes sont au même endroit, cela devient un peu délicat...",0,0.6341,Positive
225.0,6,2.0,2.0,5.0,43,96.0,0,6.1770612336798365,4.64,4.56,4.82,4.52,27018624,the apartment is on a great location if you will focus your stay on east Berlin. Well connected and close to multiple very lively spots within the neighborhood.<br/>The apartment itself was as advertised.,0,0.8553,Positive
