40.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,0,3.5930506255270385,4.74,4.53,4.89,4.79,21417127,"The location is good, very close to U8. However, the corridor is full of smell of cigarette smoke. If you are sensitive to it, it might not be a good choice for you. Also, apart from the room, the apartment is a little bit old and so be prepared to it.",1,0.7893,Positive
