81.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,12,100.0,1,23.433567641153218,4.8,4.91,4.62,4.52,23623112,Waren alles wunderbar bei Jürgen übernachten zu können. Tolle Lage am See..,1,0.0,Neutral
100.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,1,4.210492640107876,4.86,4.84,4.77,4.73,12060184,Perfekte Lage. Perfekte Gastgeber. Schnelle und unkomplizierte Kommunikation. Schöne Wohnung exakt wie auf den Bildern. Alles was man braucht ist vorhanden. Gerne wieder.,1,0.0,Neutral
92.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,0,2.7850220743469896,4.82,4.83,4.89,4.68,249419,"The perfect introduction to the creative heart of East Berlin. We were able to get under the skin of this amazing city and Frank’s house set the tone. <br/>If you have a penchant for the creative and philosophical, or if you would just like to stay at a cool city pad then this is the place for you.",1,0.9571,Positive
84.0,3,1.0,1.5,1.0,14,100.0,1,8.424857076965763,4.73,4.64,4.79,4.7,17687950,"Thomas is really nice and friendly. It let the apartment really clean and i loved the time there. He replay always in 0 time, really appreciate",1,0.9494,Positive
57.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,14,0.0,0,1.9959423571330963,4.78,4.7,4.83,4.68,1310620,"Die Lage der Wohnung ist super, man ist überall sehr schnell! Ein grosses Plus ist natürlich auch der Balkon. Zu bemängeln war einzig das Bettsofa, was für eine Woche dann doch ein bisschen unbequem war, für ein paar Tage aber völlig ok.",1,-0.8268,Negative
111.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,18,100.0,1,16.63557299959969,4.88,4.91,4.66,4.79,614980041642727308,"Beautiful apartment, the check in was the best part. Super flexible and easy to do. Cool set up of 6 houses with the main house having free coffee and tea near the reception. The area is nice but far from Berlin central. However I thought the apartment was perfect so that’s all that matters.",1,0.9571,Positive
78.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,100.0,1,2.4775921091657027,4.92,4.91,4.95,4.88,1172856,"I stayed in Gerit's apartment for 4 days. The room is very comfortable, big bed, large window, a lil table and a wardrobe - you have everything you need, also if you're staying more than a couple of days.<br/>Gerit is super nice, she's a great host!! We had tea as soon as I arrived and then she was very helpful for everything I needed and she gave me very good advices. She makes you feel at your leisure, like you're at home :)<br/>The house is in a very good location, you can reach almost every point of interest by walk. <br/>I absolutely recommend it. If I ever come back to Berlin I would definitely ask Gerit :)<br/>",1,0.9878,Positive
202.0,8,2.0,2.5,3.0,67,100.0,1,8.840335265661796,4.92,4.73,4.82,4.81,31141186,"Great apartment, great host. The apartment is very comfortable, and the host was very nice and helpful.",0,0.9581,Positive
270.0,6,3.0,1.0,4.0,47,100.0,1,1.3910800100424443,4.86,4.75,4.91,4.72,4114966,"Beautiful apartment, brilliant location. On the third floor this is a lovely big space to stay in. High ceilings, loads of natural light, tastefully furnished, two balconies, great views of the TV tower and an excellent bathroom. We were a family of 4 and felt we had plenty of room. The local area is fantastic for bars, cafes, restaurants and street life and a short trip to the city centre although we liked it more around the apartment. Nassa and his girlfriend also gave us a warm welcome and lots of tips.",0,0.9862,Positive
165.0,7,2.0,1.0,2.0,43,90.0,0,2.2144444360828826,4.59,4.51,4.85,4.47,8063187,"Flat in good neighborhood, plenty of space, bright flat, sunny side balcony. Great host. Recommended!",0,0.9299,Positive
60.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,45,100.0,1,3.689600261518912,4.74,4.55,4.76,4.65,16237052,Very pleasant stay. Thank you!,1,0.7683,Positive
172.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,8,93.0,0,2.528112421649852,4.28,4.19,4.82,4.33,36339392,"Staff at the front desk is very nice! Other than that… our stay was rough. There were loads of rude guests making noise and literally peeing in the stairwell which I understand it hard to control, but it never was cleaned up all weekend. The elevators were also down so there was no avoiding it. While we expected some noise, we didn’t expect to hear the harmonica played outside our door and men screaming ALL NIGHT (I’m not kidding they were there till 10am). I also watched a cop chase happen through the hostel due to guests behaviors and the staff acted like it was a normal thing… when we originally got our room we had to switch because of the jarring smell of urine and unclean sheets. While the front desk was incredibly helpful to switch our room, it just was so obviously not worth the money paid. I have stayed at generators in the past that have been great so I think this one could really just benefit from more security and cleaning staff!!",1,0.945,Positive
175.0,6,2.0,1.5,2.0,21,100.0,0,6.688394137444405,4.8,4.9,4.85,4.6,48387556,"Stefanie’s place was INCREDIBLE! Location, neighborhood, loft vibes, kitchen, etc everything was amazing. I loved Berlin and a big part of it was her place. Can’t wait to stay here again!!",1,0.8617,Positive
190.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,71,100.0,1,4.667762360210741,4.99,4.86,4.79,4.82,534750508720710490,Wir wurden sehr lieb empfangen und konnten Lennard bzw Michelle immer gute erreichen. Check In sowie Checkout verliefen reibungslos und die beiden waren sehr verständnisvoll. Die Wohnung ist in einem Top Zustand und man hat alles was man braucht. Ruhige und schöne Gegend. Wir haben nichts zu meckern. Unsere Familie hat sich beim Besuch auch sehr wohl gefühlt. Wir würden immer wieder her kommen! Danke!,1,-0.8217,Negative
52.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,10.552267411509238,4.88,4.85,4.77,4.85,15652886,"Es war super! Das Zimmer war sauber, Bett gemütlich, das tägliche Frühstück von Hardy war lecker. Toller Gastgeber, gab Tipps für Berlin. Das Zentrum ist sehr leicht per U-Bahn in wenigen Minuten erreichbar. Ich freue mich schon auf das nächste mal.",1,-0.75,Negative
51.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,13.650008312470083,4.98,4.95,4.93,4.91,1185916,"Andrea ist eine nette und offene Gastgeberin. Der Check-in und die Kommunikation waren einfach und unkompliziert. <br/>Das Zimmer ist sehr groß und bietet alles, was man benötigt. Die Umgebung ist ruhig. Kleine Restaurants sind in der Nähe. Der Lietzensee ist um die Ecke. S-Bahn Charlottenburg ist 11 Min entfernt, U-Bahn Sophie-Charlotte-Platz 15 Min. Ich habe mich sehr wohl gefühlt und komme gerne wieder.",1,-0.9136,Negative
65.0,2,0.0,1.0,2.0,36,100.0,1,13.696430101312991,4.97,4.98,4.71,4.81,3700907,,1,0.0,Neutral
286.0,6,3.0,2.0,5.0,35,100.0,1,6.97282351203588,4.96,4.96,4.55,4.83,14327015,"Absolutely stunning apartment that perfecltly matched the description.<br/>Everything spotlessly clean and of a very high standards with all of the facilities and equipment you would ever need.<br/>Arrived early, soaking wet through and the host was more than happy to let us in early which was such a relief.<br/>Really friendly and helpful staff on check in and check out and the offer to leave luggage securely both on arrival and departure was a real help to enjoy the stay.<br/>Great base for Berlin with amenities and transport easily accessable.<br/>Could not recommend more highly!",0,0.9728,Positive
110.0,6,1.0,1.0,3.0,28,98.0,0,5.872328813663611,4.27,4.1,4.61,4.23,751277762483967066,Die Wohnung war sehr schön und alles war so wie angegeben.<br/>wir haben uns sehr wohlgefühlt und waren sehr zufrieden.<br/>Die Tram war nur einige Gehminuten entfernt und waren von dort aus in 20 min am Alexanderplatz ohne Umsteigen.<br/>Edeka und Späti waren gut zu erreichen und selbst zu später Stunde war man im Späti gut versorgt.<br/>Alles in Allem eine sehr gute Unterkunft für einen guten Preis,1,-0.9661,Negative
114.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,1,3.268352166045826,4.8,4.74,4.89,4.71,11294240,Super beliggenhed i mit ynglings område af Berlin - Prenzlauer Berg.<br/>Fin Lejlighed med hvad man behøver til et ophold.<br/>Rigtig god seng.<br/>Desuden virkelig fin kommunikation med udlejer.,1,0.7184,Positive
95.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,0,10.52862062119263,4.75,4.25,4.75,4.75,1426159011212341627,"Apartamento super espaçoso em todos os cômodos, cozinha completa e bem funcional, bairro extremamente tranquilo e muito bonito. Berlim é uma ciadade maravilhosa, como gostamos muito de caminhar, achei um pouco distante dos lugares e pontos turísticos que gostaria de ir, mas nada que não desse para resolver com transportes públicos ou serviço de Uber, utilizamos demais o Bolt (serviço de táxi como Uber) que era mais barato. <br/>ficarei novamente neste apartamento quando voltar a Berlin",1,0.6808,Positive
85.0,3,0.0,1.0,1.0,28,50.0,0,9.926552918477975,4.59,4.63,4.83,4.44,23120023,"Außergewöhnliche Unterkunft, passend zu Berlin.Sehr gute Anbindung an U Bahn und Einkaufsmöglichkeiten in der Nähe. Wohngegend mittendrin und doch ruhig. Wir hatten alles um uns gut zu fühlen, die Wohnung ist gut ausgestattet und sauber.Definitiv empfehlenswert.",1,-0.5994,Negative
79.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,9.205613934474908,4.72,4.57,4.52,4.68,2191449,"The location was very nice, the price was super great and the apartment itself was very nice :) Thomas was always there if we would need something.",1,0.955,Positive
114.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,1,4.105161338425043,4.86,4.77,4.88,4.71,48732044,"Die Unterkunft war top, sah genauso aus wie auf den Bildern und die Lage ist super. Kommunikation war hervorragend und sehr nett. Wir kommen gerne wieder!",1,-0.9041,Negative
80.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,90.0,0,1.4716913138627066,4.89,4.88,4.96,4.83,13593823,"Beautiful, clean room near so many attractions. This has been my best Airbnb to date with such a beautiful, spacious room and apartment. Host was very helpful and generous and her son was very sweet!",1,0.9818,Positive
241.0,6,3.0,1.0,4.0,53,100.0,1,1.3558603428081426,4.89,4.89,4.78,4.75,13663197,Very nice place! Ayse is very responsive! Everything is clean and well-organized. You can find everything you need for daily life. Strongly recommend!,0,0.9195,Positive
25.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,10,100.0,1,12.411049431736249,4.74,4.36,4.76,4.77,1883235,"Christian is a very friendly and accommodating host. The flat is in perfectly central location. The room was also very nice and clean, even with balcony looking out to the river, would be very beautiful in the summer.<br/>We came in winter when It was freezing cold outside (Berli had a few very cold days -10 degrees, but felt temperature -241), but the room was still nice and cosy warm, really well insulated with double glazed windows/balcony doors.<br/>My boyfriend and me just stayed for one night, but it was very pleasant, all in all a short and sweet stay. I would definitely recommend. Thanks Christian!",1,0.9904,Positive
250.0,7,3.0,1.0,6.0,40,97.0,0,1.8453795902196852,4.42,4.35,4.86,4.31,662129063586725752,"This was a very nice, clean, spacious apartment. We loved the sofa in the living room especially! It was well equipped and as described. Great neighbourhood for places to eat and getting around. Lana was helpful and replied quickly to all messages.<br/>The only tiny niggles we had were from the largest bedroom, despite the double glazing, sirens could be heard loudly. And from one of the other bedrooms the clanking of the main door was a bit annoying. Although everything was very clean, some of the furniture / furnishings were a bit tired and not in perfect condition (only aesthetic though - everything was functional.<br/>None of these minor issues really affect our enjoyment and I would highly recommend staying here.",0,0.9664,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,5,100.0,0,6.840973855935876,4.69,4.62,4.55,4.45,8063918,"I had a great stay at Dominik's place. The bedroom was very big, with a comfortable bed, excellent wifi, and easy access to the kitchen and bathroom. <br/><br/>Dominik was unfortunately not around during my stay, but his flatmate was a great host who provided some helpful information and made my stay very comfortable. <br/><br/>I'd definitely recommend this listing :) ",1,0.9866,Positive
142.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,49,91.0,0,6.115210424417201,4.74,4.85,4.76,4.47,32539441,Wir waren zufrieden mit dem Aufenthalt in der Stayery. Das Personal war sehr freundlich.,1,-0.5994,Negative
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,51,99.0,1,3.0757283324702183,4.8,4.74,4.82,4.5,33792196,"We stayed there for two nights and it was exactly what we needed for a short break. The location is perfect as we like to walk and it was very easy go different places from there. The place was clean, tidy and comfortable. We will definitely be back if we do another short break in Berlin.",1,0.9524,Positive
61.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,7,100.0,0,4.279959254508732,4.84,4.84,4.87,4.67,1194746461930396249,the place was nice and the room was clean. But there was no way to lock our rooms door even though it said it had a lock in the description and the host would come inside our room while we were away.,1,-0.0129,Neutral
138.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,56,100.0,1,2.8661586391717453,4.91,4.92,4.9,4.79,1946067,"The apartment is clean, functional, new and cosy, as shown in the pictures. I can only recommend it. I spent a wonderful month in it. Axel was a friendly and ready to provide any help. Its location is well conected to the public transport and a stone's throw away from the lively Mauerpark.  ",1,0.9652,Positive
151.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,94.0,0,3.1018817858877528,4.67,4.77,4.78,4.52,721527807549293451,Top Unterkunft. Alles wie beschrieben. Super Lage. Ich komme gerne wieder.,1,0.6908,Positive
38.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,0,8.794289797931516,4.8,4.74,4.67,4.84,35396598,Elena und Mike waren sehr zuvorkommend und hilfreich. <br/>Die Unterkunft hatte alles was man benötigt und mehr.<br/>Wir waren sehr zufrieden und hatten einen sehr schönen Aufenthalt.,1,0.0,Neutral
