104.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,0,5.805971161011836,4.56,4.53,4.83,4.47,554765041888369644,Für Berliner Verhältnisse ist die Wohnung echt gut nur etwas kalt aber mit einer warmen Decke ist das auch nicht schlimm.,1,-0.5994,Negative
77.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,34,100.0,1,4.4625182162657095,4.52,4.61,4.77,4.48,11078656,"Place was clean, location was great",1,0.7783,Positive
144.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,1,3.4508030907894973,4.99,5.0,4.96,4.94,64590,"We spent a very cool stay in Mirjam's place. Cozy, well located, i highly recommend this place to discover Kreuzberg and Berlin :)",1,0.8586,Positive
144.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,94.0,0,3.1018817858877528,4.67,4.76,4.77,4.56,720839766613886451,"We visited Berlin for 2 days and stayed at Numa Arc Checkpoint Charlie. Everything was stunning—the room felt like a hotel, with a soft mattress, clean bed sheets, a spotless bathroom, and a cozy atmosphere overall.<br/>If I have the opportunity to visit Berlin again in the future, I would love to stay here!<br/>The prices were actually pretty decent for accommodation located near the center of Berlin.<br/>It’s about a 25-minute walk to the Brandenburg Gate and around 30 minutes to the Parliament.",1,0.9402,Positive
175.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,64,100.0,1,6.045947466071451,4.96,4.98,4.7,4.84,18659334,"Een hele fijne plek om te verblijven. Christoph is een prettige host. Aardig en zeker niet opdringerig.<br/>Het appartement was bij aankomst super schoon. Alles wat je nodig hebt is aanwezig, een goed uitgeruste keuken, een fijne badkamer en de bedden zijn prima. Het appartement biedt volledige privacy en ligt in een rustige wijk. Niet super centraal maar wel met een prima aansluiting op het OV om de hoek. Ook kun je fietsen huren bij het appartement. Na een kleine fietstocht zit je zo in Prenzlauerberg of Mitte.",1,0.8316,Positive
107.0,2,0.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,0,5.485868969461663,4.97,4.97,4.93,4.84,50973817,We stayed 3 nights in the apartment. It is very Nice and full of light. Very silent. The small kitchen and the bathroom are very convenient. Katja and Torsten were extremely helpful and sweet. Would definitely recommend this place to anyone coming to Berlin !,1,0.9318,Positive
259.0,4,2.0,2.5,2.0,41,100.0,0,7.843524221419966,4.96,4.89,4.94,4.87,511935,"This is a really nice apartment, and Manuel himself is a great host.  He gave a detailed guided tour and also provided useful advice on local shops, restaurants and cafes etc (with a specially marked-up map).  Being on the top floor, the apartment has great views, and has 2 lovely leafy terraces for sitting outside.  The property is very well-equipped, with excellent cooking facilities and a great coffee machine.  It also has two bathrooms, both with a shower, and the beds are super-comfy.<br/>The local area is nice with plenty of cafes, interesting small shops etc.  It also felt very safe, and a nice place to walk around in the evening.  There is also a small supermarket within an easy walk, which is great if you are mostly self-catering (as we were).  There is a U-Bahn station that is only about 2 minutes walk away, that connects into the Berlin transport network.  There are also bus lines nearby to various parts of the city.<br/>A great apartment, a great host, and a great city to visit!",0,0.9959,Positive
77.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,1.8784168293806285,4.64,4.8,4.91,4.46,13559199,"This is a very tidy, fairly spacious apt in a great part of town. Everything is clean and recently renovated. One couldn't ask for more from an apt, really. BUT, there is one serious flaw - the noise from upstairs. This is very typical of all Altbau apts in Berlin, but my experience here is a more concerning. The upstairs neighbor has a penchant for walking in shoes at all times of the night, and I found this incredibly jarring. Even conversation can easily be heard. If this concerns you, I think you should consider other options. If not, you will find yourself in a great, clean apt in one of the best parts of town.",1,0.9721,Positive
138.0,5,0.0,1.0,3.0,39,100.0,1,2.860188071088701,4.95,4.96,4.94,4.84,17855915,As last time my parents really enjoyed the stayed in a cleaned and well located apartment!,1,0.7171,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,0,3.29904028868549,5.0,4.67,4.67,5.0,880854026585355914,"I absolutely loved my stay! The place is so warm, calming, and spacious. As a woman travelling alone, I felt safe coming and going at all times of the day and night.<br/>Isabell was easy to contact and her friend was also very helpful and responded promptly.<br/>If I return to Berlin, I would definitely stay here again.<br/>Thank you for a wonderful stay.",1,0.9787,Positive
57.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,23,100.0,0,13.39399800179539,4.54,4.56,4.68,4.48,17863035,Goede kamer op top lokatie. Kamer is wat klein maar daar is de prijs ook naar.,1,0.2023,Positive
138.0,5,0.0,1.0,3.0,39,100.0,1,2.860188071088701,4.95,4.96,4.94,4.84,17855915,"Everything is as described, the place is lovely and very clean.<br/>Natalie is wonderful and always willing to help.<br/>The shower was big and nice and the bed was really comfortable.<br/>And the cold drinks in the fridge were an extra delight in the warmth.<br/>Absolutely recommended.",1,0.9457,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,14,100.0,0,0.5784026701182039,4.46,4.52,4.72,4.41,1101241838417054700,"excelente hospedaje. volveria cada vez que visito Berlin. descanso impecable, ducha excelente, habutacion limpia y comida, seguridad 10 puntos, empleados unos genios muy buena onda.",1,0.0,Neutral
