64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,1,5.677789751945836,4.86,4.86,4.86,4.36,1140594287811488604,"Alloggio comodo per spostarsi ovunque,  vicino a ristoranti e supermercati.  Eravamo i soli ospiti, l'host non l'abbiamo vista. Qualche difficoltà al check in, ma risolvibile. Il bagno è minuscolo (no phon e un lavandino 15x30), la cucina ancora più piccola, enorme il frigo che era in sala (che era la nostra camera), un divano per dormire (niente letto). Le tende non oscuravano (per noi non è stato un problema, lo dico nel caso abbiate bisogno del buio per dormire).",1,0.0,Neutral
61.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,1,3.347640201769396,4.91,4.96,4.86,4.82,50700578,Alles war leicht zu finden und die Schlüsselübergabe komfortabel geregelt. Sehr sauberes modernes Bad und Zimmer. Dies war einfach ausgestattet. Insgesamt alles bestens.,1,-0.9451,Negative
171.0,3,2.0,1.0,1.0,58,100.0,1,3.4077284564669457,5.0,5.0,5.0,4.78,919680940551799323,"To say this Airbnb is amazing is an understatement. The flat is absolutely wonderful and the location is an absolute dream. The flat is beautifully designed with everything carefully chosen. Right outside your door is a host of coffee shops, bakeries and restaurants...easy to get around. The bedrooms are not on the road side so it is very quiet and you are awoken with the smell of fresh croissants. Once of the best Airbnb's I've stayed in.",1,0.9661,Positive
