96.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,33,96.0,1,3.788820414984087,4.81,4.85,4.83,4.71,26006558,"Outstanding flat for a three-day trip in Berlin. Julian is the perfect host you would want to have: he will give you accommodations, local tips and quick responses. The flat is amazing and located 3 stations away from Alexanderplatz. Thanks again !",1,0.9432,Positive
