135.0,5,2.0,2.5,2.0,30,100.0,1,13.475852084261728,4.84,4.88,4.85,4.71,13254923,"Light-filled, spacious flat well-situated a few minutes from an S-Bahn stop just off Ku'Damm in SW Berlin. Very convenient to CityCube/Messe.<br/>This is a VERY large 2 BR, 2.5 bath apartment with high ceilings, high quality furnishings, interesting art and antiques, and a very well-stocked fully functional kitchen, as well as a laundry room. I stayed with a work colleague and my daughter for 5 nights, and we all had plenty of privacy and room to work. We cooked in several nights, saving money and having a wonderful time shopping locally. <br/>Mark was prompt and accurate with communication and the flat is exactly as represented in the photos and listing info. Beds and linens were very comfortable, and except for a little morning traffic, the neighborhood is very quiet. Highly, highly recommend.",0,0.918,Positive
85.0,6,3.0,1.0,5.0,24,100.0,0,9.802619636187435,4.45,4.34,4.59,4.46,7956833,Good value for money. We stayed here with 2 adults and 2 kids. A nice park with a playground south of the place within a walking distance. Great location with just a short walk from U bahn.,0,0.9042,Positive
144.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,94.0,0,3.1018817858877528,4.67,4.76,4.77,4.56,720839766613886451,"We had a great time at Numa Berlin Arc. The room was really nice (although we did have to dispose of a small amount of rubbish on arrival!), the bed was very comfortable and the location was absolutely brilliant for the price. We were able to leave our luggage in lockers free of charge after checking out (although not all the lockers were working), which was also very handy. <br/>They were also excellent communicators. They replied very quickly to any queries I had (even in the middle of the night!) and were quick to extend our check out time when we had two false fire alarms on our last morning that prevented us from checking out on time. Although there weren’t any physical staff on hand (apart from during the fire alarms), the customer service still worked well. <br/>Would 100% come back!",1,0.9743,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,8,100.0,0,10.4089472760363,4.65,4.62,4.79,4.77,4898739,Mirjam has a great place and very lean room and bathroom. She was easy to communicate with. The house is very well located. Recommended to stay here as you also get your own bath. but you should like cats. 😄,1,0.8393,Positive
66.0,6,1.0,1.0,3.0,31,97.0,0,5.956202262500981,4.65,4.19,4.13,4.63,1374721017883659820,"Wir haben 4 Nächte in der Unterkunft verbracht, die Beschreibung der Unterkunft trifft gut zu. Es war sauber und gut ausgestattet, auch platztechnisch ist die Unterkunft für 6 Leute in Ordnung. Die Anbindung ist gut, die Umgebung (abgesehen von der aktuellen Baustelle) relativ ruhig. Die Parkplatzsituation gestaltete sich schwierig, ich würde empfehlen, mit öffentlichen Verkehrsmitteln anzureisen. <br/>Supermärkte sind in unmittelbare Nähe. Ich kann die Unterkunft klar empfehlen. Vielen Dank :)",1,-0.9783,Negative
189.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,56,100.0,1,3.2993212861586296,4.92,4.97,4.94,4.75,2650663,"Great apartment! Modern, clean with everything it promised in he add. Good bed, a dishwasher and a washingmachine. In the middle of Mitte, close to tram and underground, and a lot op shops and nice restaurants.<br/>The owner gave good and friendly instructions, and the key change was done by a friend of the owner, who was very friendly. We can recommend this place to everybody looking for a comfortable stay in Berlin.",1,0.9856,Positive
71.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,34,100.0,1,4.676275073675155,4.92,5.0,4.79,4.79,1288153085553971017,"Merci Joanna pour votre accueil, nos filles ont été enchantées de leur séjour",1,0.0,Neutral
