60.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,45,100.0,1,3.689600261518912,4.74,4.55,4.76,4.65,16237052,"Top 👍 <br/>Le quartier est sympa avec de nombreux restaurants et bars accessibles à pied. <br/>Il y a aussi de quoi faire quelques courses juste en bas de la rue et de quoi se poser pour déjeuner à quelques pas. <br/>Bref, idéal pour visiter Berlin. <br/>Je recommande ! Merci à Dietrich pour la réactivité 😉<br/>Anaïs et Marie",1,0.2714,Positive
30.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,80.0,0,19.45903731603653,4.71,4.56,4.72,4.79,2682379,if you are at Berlin airport and need to overnight this place is perfect. .. a mere 800 meters from the s bahn station and in a safe area at all times of the day. s barn is 4 euros.  I got a taxi and it cost me 25 but in daytime it s so easy to find. I arrived very late so took the taxi  Dagmar is a lovely lady. highly recommended. the area is great for a longer stay too. it s peaceful and the room is superb,1,0.9881,Positive
83.0,3,1.0,1.0,3.0,46,100.0,1,2.9841501024745734,4.79,4.75,5.0,4.58,53485738,"Logement conforme à la description, bien placé pour visiter la ville, restos sympas aux alentours et Maurice à l’écoute 👍",1,0.0,Neutral
182.0,4,1.0,1.5,2.0,25,0.0,1,4.972254137451247,4.96,4.96,5.0,4.91,1210681389365702458,"Fantastic, modern and clean apartment with lots of space.  <br/>Milosz is an excellent host.  welcoming and always fast and positive communication.<br/>Frederichshain is a good neighborhood with many good restaurants, bakeries and local shops.  There are good transport options close by, and you can quickly get around the neighborhood by Ubahn, tram and on foot.",1,0.9756,Positive
95.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,3.769411114551402,4.65,4.73,4.79,4.5,4869716,"The apartment was very nice and Jan was a good host! Unfortunately we did not get the chance to meet him personally, but he was still very helpful and always available if we had questions. <br/>The apartment was quite small, but it is perfect for two friends or a couple! The location of the apartment is absolutely great. Very easy to find, good connections and a quiet neighborhood. :) ",1,0.9895,Positive
118.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,18,93.0,0,2.3052158670724103,4.8,4.79,4.77,4.7,16922853,"Ok sted til prisen. Centralt i Kreuzberg. Fungerer fint til korte ophold hvor man spiser ude og en gruppe, der kender hinanden godt. <br/>Mindre egnet til ophold hvor man skal bruge et køkken eller opholde sig meget indendørs. <br/>Tidligere lejere havde røget, så der lugtede af røg i lejligheden. <br/>Området er fedt og der var roligt i ejendommen.",1,0.296,Positive
214.0,4,2.0,1.5,4.0,34,98.0,0,1.0407544919436775,4.61,4.72,4.75,4.55,34294699,Great place in close distance to the center. Surrounded by restaurants and shops just a walk away while also being in a quiet and tranquil part of then neighborhood. Staff was very helpful with our late checkin.,0,0.8122,Positive
157.0,4,0.0,1.0,3.0,27,100.0,1,3.932306873935366,4.86,4.86,4.82,4.69,37737152,This place is perfect for a 2-person stay. It’s close to so many spots and has such a nice quiet balcony/square. Maria (host) is very responsive and helpful — I would return in a heartbeat.,1,0.9073,Positive
