97.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,0,13.347444227266896,4.79,4.74,4.95,4.76,1322780,"Ich hatte eine sehr schöne Zeit bei Gunilla. Die Wohnung ist sauber und stilvoll eingerichtet und man fühlt sich sofort sehr wohl.  Gunilla ist sehr lieb und kümmert sich sehr gut um die Gäste.  Ich freue mich, dass ich dort wohnen durfte und würde jederzeit wiederkommen.",1,-0.8316,Negative
135.0,2,0.0,1.5,2.0,38,100.0,1,1.9797577383607676,4.81,4.9,4.91,4.6,257373,"Cómodo departamento, y bonito barrio. Fácil de conectar con sistema de transporte.<br/>El domingo pudimos disfrutar del mercado en el parque ubicado a pocas cuadras.<br/>La información entregada por David fue útil y precisa. También sus respuestas oportunas.",1,0.0,Neutral
77.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,38,100.0,0,3.130777776464285,4.77,4.59,4.83,4.6,612157073909883323,"The perfect location for us as my husband payed a show at Madame Claude’s one night and recorded at Patch Point another day, both in Kreuzberg. Can’t beat the convenience of close Lidl, Aldi, and the Markethalle Neun. With the fully equipped kitchen we made several amazing meals in the flat. If you don’t have the desire to cook there are so many fabulous restaurants near by. We had pizza and pasta from Cantucci on Lubbenerstraße, and tapas at Bar Raval. Laura was helpful and responsive - if you need assistance with the washer/dryer combo just send her a picture of the dial and she will talk you through it. Our room had direct access to the interior garden which we did not know ahead of time and were delighted to find. It’s not the most quiet place due to the apartment being in an active home with many others living above and in connected buildings but the soaring ceilings, beautiful art, and prime location make up for it. Bed, pillows, linens, and towels all very comfy.",1,0.958,Positive
103.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,21,100.0,0,6.349585383409171,4.66,4.63,4.67,4.41,25032777,amazing place.. spacious.. in a small side street of busy Sonnenstrasse with bus stops and allWorld stores..  what I loved most was a small beer garden… an oasis.  next to beer garden  you can improve your putting qualities.. the sweetest Minigolf place. A superplace…,1,0.875,Positive
115.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,22,90.0,1,10.750545351348627,4.94,4.83,4.91,4.77,28044368,"I really enjoyed staying at Veronica’s place. It was very comfortable, quiet, and spacious. I would highly recommend it.",1,0.8744,Positive
87.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,1,3.0971227876855947,4.83,4.8,4.91,4.57,40167702,"The apartment is perfect, it’s in the beautiful neighbourhood of Kreuzberg surrounded by lots of bars and restaurants. It’s equipped with everything you’ll need and very clean. Communication with the host was also perfect and gave us great recommendations!",1,0.9622,Positive
97.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,60,100.0,1,5.957143631808804,4.82,4.8,4.64,4.75,772627,"***** Sterne absolut verdient!<br/>Wir wurden super empfangen und André hatte viele Tipps für uns. Die Wohnung ist sehr liebevoll, modern und großzügig eingerichtet. Da am Abreisetag kein Nachmieter gebucht hatte, durften wir auch länger die Wohnung nutzen.<br/>Tausend Dank",1,-0.636,Negative
129.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,1,1.845762124055973,4.93,4.93,4.98,4.76,4830714,Hele rustige mooie en aangename verblijfsplek in een mooie buurt met veel restaurants en cafés. Ideaal om na een dag in Berlijn op 5 min  stappen nog iets te gaan eten/drinken in de buurt.,1,0.0,Neutral
118.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,0,8.01742488509254,4.46,4.48,4.88,4.41,27869320,"Lo mejor del apartamento es su fantástica ubicación. Todo muy limpio también, aunque hubieron varias cosas que no nos gustaron: no nos funcionaba la cafetera ni la luz del baño y aunque llamamos para que nos la arreglaran, nadie vino a hacerlo.<br/>A la habitación le falta también un armario donde colgar la ropa y un espejo. En el baño con un espejo pequeño y sin luz era muy difícil arreglarse. Podéis imaginaros el desastre siendo tres mujeres que íbamos a Berlin para una boda!<br/>  Para entrar en los apartamentos tienes siempre que llamar a un teléfono, y marcar tres claves diferentes, por lo que siempre tienes que tener el móvil con batería  y a disposición para entrar.",1,-0.807,Negative
110.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,38,80.0,1,5.411282332211047,4.89,4.92,4.91,4.81,21259057,"The apartment was everything that we expected. Stylish apartment in a great location, very comfortable and clean and great amenities.  Communication with Fadeih was excellent. The only thing that was missing for us was a washing machine.",1,0.9535,Positive
72.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,27,100.0,1,13.673862168326844,4.88,4.87,4.53,4.73,50354450,Best Airbnb in my experience,1,0.6369,Positive
