76.0,4,1.0,1.5,2.0,60,100.0,1,3.624198275329287,4.85,4.91,4.81,4.69,2137277,"Great location, easy check in, recommended.",1,0.8316,Positive
149.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,2.0686308554688693,4.99,4.99,4.99,4.83,23315743,"Stunning apartment in a great location. <br/>Loved the decor of this large apartment. Two bathrooms was perfect and easy to use lift for our five months worth of travel gear. <br/>We were desperate for healthy food options when we got here, go to Holy Flat for their bowls. Soooo delicious and I miss them already. <br/>We didn’t meet Damian but we’re met by his friend Pero who was very helpful explaining the apartment and everything there. Damian was always helpful with quick responses to our questions. <br/>Would love to revisit this place! ",1,0.9834,Positive
83.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,7,100.0,0,7.127835851961417,4.87,4.8,4.77,4.8,3754935,War zum zweiten Mal da und wieder alles Top. Nur zu empfehlen.,1,-0.4767,Negative
203.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,24,100.0,1,3.233570223529885,4.51,4.5,4.92,4.47,4448981,"I definitely recommend this place, hosts very nice, apartment in great location, great rooftop..",0,0.9476,Positive
146.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,3.4636382799594605,4.66,4.79,4.58,4.56,322520,The studio was exactly as described in a rally nice cosy area. The supermarket was a few minute walk and public transport easily accessed. It was lovely to have the garden to sit in also. The hosts were so Lovely! After leaving my passport Alan waited and returned it to me,1,0.9344,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,1,4.861082501850892,4.75,4.76,4.6,4.7,5188216,"I have stayed in dozens of Airbnbs throughout Berlin and this was one of my favorite places. The apartment is surprisingly spacious, with a large living room area and kitchen, as well as a pretty good sized bedroom. The living room comes with a couch that can be easily converted into a bed. We were three people to the place and had more than enough room- I would say four people could stay here with no problem. We were a group of adults, but a family with kids could easily stay here too. The bathroom is small, but not so small you feel cramped. The kitchen came supplied with everything you would need- instant coffee, tea, stuff to cook, etc. The location was close to multiple U-lines and bus lines and you can easily get to anywhere you want to go in the city. There is a very large grocery store- Rewe- only a short walk from the place, as well as multiple good places to eat and drink. If you haven't stayed in this area before, I highly recommend Hamy Cafe for food, it is one of my favorite places to eat in all of Berlin. Finally, the host was very quick to answer all my questions via the app. All in all, I will be looking for this Airbnb first next time I plan a trip to the city.",1,0.9783,Positive
33.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,1,6.809556888557899,4.95,4.93,4.86,4.94,7806721,I was sleeping like a pig cause it’s so cozy for a buffer day if you are running late to Berlin.,1,0.3612,Positive
213.0,8,3.0,1.0,5.0,31,100.0,1,5.600860807992449,4.67,4.61,4.63,4.55,17384054,"The flat is gorgeous and stylish, with so much space for sleeping, eating, relaxing etc. The hosts were really thorough, giving great detail on the area, the check in process and how to get to the flat, which was much appreciated. We had a great stay and would recommend to anyone!",0,0.9769,Positive
103.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,95.0,0,11.709700539993566,4.74,4.71,4.83,4.57,1044862371289584666,"Liegt Zentral in Westberlin direkt an der Deutschen Oper, nur zwei Stationen von Bahnhof Zoo. <br/>U-Bahnstation (U2) und Supermarkt (Rewe) direkt vor der Tür.<br/>Genug Parkplätze vorhanden aber kostenpflichtig seit dem 01.12.24 (Mo-Fr 9-20 Uhr und Samstag 9-18 Uhr, Sonntags frei).<br/>Zum Apartment selber nichts dem Inserat hinzuzufügen, insgesamt super und zu empfehlen.",1,0.5994,Positive
96.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,33,96.0,1,3.788820414984087,4.81,4.85,4.83,4.71,26006558,"We had a fantastic stay at Julian's apartment. Central but quiet location, a couple of minutes from the nearest metro station. The apartment was very clean and had all amenities we needed. Communication with Julian very good. <br/>Would recommend!",1,0.9384,Positive
