125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,18,100.0,1,3.705903191854987,4.82,4.69,4.84,4.72,163287,"We had a great time at Stefano's apartment. Nice space with natural light and a great location in Kruezberg. The bed was a bit hard, but nothing unbearable. Stefano was very helpful and friendly. I would recommend renting bikes as its a nice way to explore the city. Definitely recommend it.",1,0.9836,Positive
