40.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,54,100.0,1,15.910789482970689,4.9,4.77,4.83,4.87,14839691,"Angela's reviews are great for good reason! I had a really lovely overnight stay in this property, I only wished I was staying longer. It's a beautiful light and airy room with thoughtful touches to make you feel welcome and comfortable. It is peaceful and situated in a very convenient proximity to Schönefeld airport. Public transport is frequent but I walked to the airport because I prefer to walk when i can and it took 45 minutes door to door. Highly recommended to anyone wishing to stay in this area. Thank you",1,0.9686,Positive
