319.0,7,3.0,2.0,7.0,32,100.0,0,4.165256939142919,4.66,4.66,4.82,4.52,21074683,"Such a cute place for a group of friends or family! My family and I were traveling outside Berlin for a wedding, and decided to make it an entire vacation, since half of us had never been to Berlin before. We loved the open space in the living room, which really allowed for us to hang and drink together, play cards, chat, etc. The couches and beds were super comfortable, and we loved the decor! Great location in the neighborhood, walking distance to some very cool restaurants and bars (we're all a bunch of foodies, so this was a great bonus!). The train is nearby as well, but we opted for cars or walking. The only slight downfall to this listing is the noise and lack of air circulation. You can hear every footstep and door open/close in the apartment, as well as the apartment above us - so just something to consider if you're a light sleeper! We got lucky with the weather, as it wasn't during the recent heatwave, but it can get a little stuffy in the apartment. Other than that, we had an amazing time and absolutely loved coming home to this rental at the end of the day. Thank you!!",0,0.99,Positive
67.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,0,11.10963062212248,4.78,4.67,4.94,4.39,1241223978286373305,"An impeccably clean place with extremely helpful host. The room is spacious and bright, in the middle of the town, yet quiet and peaceful. A lot of amenities for all tastes and purses. Sabine even made the effort to give me last-minute info on Berlin’s traffic, which helped a lot. Thanks for the great time!",1,0.9595,Positive
81.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,58,100.0,1,7.189446692875613,5.0,5.0,4.95,5.0,1220205338804635496,un logement très bien situé et très agréable. Carlos est un hôte accueillant et attentionné.,1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,0,0.5555591583260235,4.82,4.96,4.88,4.69,10031729,"Super netter Host, flotte und offene Kommunikation, toll gelegene und saubere Wohnung, Toilette leider außerhalb (aber sehr wenig Traffic im Haus, daher ok), Bad sehr eng... Durch Baustelle mmt doch recht laut und lahmes Wlan. Aber das ändert sich ja wieder. Also alles unterm Strich tiptop, wir kommen gern wieder! :)",1,0.5707,Positive
160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,98.0,0,1.0407544919436775,4.54,4.66,4.77,4.45,34294913,"Really clean looking apartment, friendly stuff and lovely location",1,0.8748,Positive
78.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,1,9.864623457715105,4.89,4.89,4.62,4.8,1006526890769949261,"Meine Frau und ich hatten einen super Aufenthalt, das Bett und die Kissen sind super bequem!! Insgesamt klein, aber sehr fein 😊",1,0.6688,Positive
62.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,34,94.0,0,3.662895725788621,4.8,4.8,5.0,4.2,36610240,"The apartment is beautiful and located in a courtyard which was a great and peaceful retreat from the busy city. The apartment itself is beautiful, the fact that it is a one-bedroom can be overlooked by the beautiful window and high ceilings, making the space seem much bigger than it is and the location is just great (btw the sun hits the apartment directly in the afternoon!) :D <br/>It was clean, however the walls were pretty dirty which was surprising but I guess there have been a few guests before us.<br/>Michael and his Team were very responsive to our requests and flexible with time adjustments for example.",1,0.9729,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,0,13.811832052182714,4.55,4.6,4.73,4.62,1273287,"Wir hatten mit den 15 Tage in Heikes Loft eine sehr gute  Wahl gemacht.  Die Unterkunft ist gut ausgestattet und hatte für unseren Zweck, ""Kulturschnuppern"" und die Leichtathletik EM besuchen, eine gute Lage. Die Anbindung am Nahverkehr ist sehr gut, aber haben wir nicht benutzt. Auf unseren Fahrräder waren unsere Ziele gut zu erreichen. Heike ist eine sehr aufgeschlossene Gastgeberin die uns viele Tipps gab. Der Ausblick vom 8. Flur über Berlin ist ein Traum. Alles im allem war es für uns ein SUPER Aufenthalt.",1,-0.942,Negative
118.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,0,8.01742488509254,4.46,4.48,4.88,4.41,27869320,"Super Lage (100 m zum KdW), trotzdem ruhig in einer Seitenstrasse gelegen. Gut zu Fuss von Bahnhof Zoo zu erreichen.<br/>Prima Betten! Alles was man braucht vorhanden (Handtücher, Trockentuch, Spülmittel, etc.).<br/>Ein paar Details könnten etwas Aufmerksamkeit gebrauchen. Aber angesichts des eher günstigen Preise war das ok. Ich würde das Zimmer wieder buchen.",1,0.3595,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,1,5.336391697711564,4.93,4.85,4.76,4.7,27288541,"We loved staying at Eugenia’s place and you will too! It’s beautifully decorated and super comfortable with everything you need. It’s also in an excellent location both for exploring the city and feeling like you’re a local. Eugenia is a really wonderful host, super responsive, happy to help with anything and just lovely! Thanks again Eugenia :)",1,0.9938,Positive
