125.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,51,100.0,1,2.5812538445087863,4.92,4.87,4.97,4.82,1350866854702691892,"We had a fantastic stay at Ana's place. The location of the apartment is spot-on. Looking out onto a peaceful courtyard meant we soon felt we were away from the hustle and bustle that is Berlin.<br/>The apartment itself perfectly matched Ana's description. We had all the facilities we needed, everything was spotless and it was very warm and cosy. I can't recommended this enough. Thank you Ana for your hospitality.",0,0.9337,Positive
269.0,6,2.0,1.0,5.0,41,100.0,1,1.2503182243717943,4.49,4.47,4.7,4.51,1069319700158091488,"Die Unterkunft war extrem geräumig, hatte genug Platz für alle Gäste. Die Wohnung ist in der Nähe von U-bahn und S-Bahn Stationen. Die Räumlichkeiten waren sauber und der Check-in Prozess tadellos.",0,-0.9485,Negative
