328.0,8,4.0,2.0,6.0,31,100.0,1,6.97282351203588,4.89,4.92,4.52,4.71,14333714,We had a wonderfull stay at the loft. It's very spacious and had everything we needed. The loft is nearby the metrostation and within 20 min you're in the centre. If we ever come back we would again want to stay at this place. <br/>the children loved the terrace..,0,0.6369,Positive
64.0,5,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,0,6.504978165628203,4.6,4.75,4.59,4.58,252993,"Snelle en correcte reactie van Wolfram via email en telefoon. Gastvriendelijk onthaal. Nette buurt. Handige mini-supermarkt in de straat. S, U en M Bahn en vrij parkeren op loopafstand. Schone ruime kamer. Prima zithoek, bedden, voldoende kastruimte, moderne tv, wifi, praktisch keukenblok met koelkast. Veel privacy. Schone, ruime sanitaire voorzieningen. Veel Value for money. Prachtige stad! Mooie uitvalsbasis. Wij komen zeker terug. Eugene.",1,0.4003,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,14,100.0,0,0.5784026701182039,4.46,4.52,4.72,4.41,1101241838417054700,Great location for young people !,1,0.6588,Positive
152.0,7,2.0,1.5,4.0,40,100.0,0,4.137113996689438,4.71,4.62,4.63,4.59,1150006272268927007,"Tijdens een trip naar Berlijn in deze accommodatie verbleven. De buurt voelde in eerste instantie wat minder veilig aan, maar de accommodatie zelf was keurig schoon en goed verzorgd. Een groot pluspunt is de bushalte direct voor de deur. Daarnaast verliep de communicatie met de verhuurder vlot en prettig. Zou hier zonder twijfel opnieuw verblijven.",0,0.0,Neutral
37.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,7.258519499353832,4.89,4.92,4.8,4.89,2591901,Klaus' place was wonderful! The bed was huge and very comfortable. The room was spacious with plenty of closet space and a table to sit and write at. Klaus was very kind and was able to accommodate a late night check in. He checked on us via air b&b message during our stay to make sure everything was going well. His place is also very close to public transit and easy to find with his instructions. Thank you for everything!,1,0.9708,Positive
104.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,45,100.0,1,2.5947560004363037,4.92,4.77,5.0,4.88,49947938,Excellent location to see the East. Quick to the train and tram stops nearby. Cafe and bar scene is lively and enjoyable.,1,0.836,Positive
97.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,51,100.0,1,10.628312310522414,4.98,4.99,5.0,4.87,14736577,"Sehr schöne Wohnung im wunderbaren und ruhigen Innenhof, günstige Lage, mit nahgelegener S-Bahn ist man gleich in der Innenstadt. Viele Restaurants in der Nähe. Beatrix haben wir leider nicht persönlich kennengelernt, aber sehr freundlicher Empfang durch die Haushälterin. Gerne wieder.",1,-0.5994,Negative
40.0,1,0.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,11.034398061498583,4.65,4.83,4.45,4.68,714312,"Even though the flat is located in a quiet residential neighbourhood, it is close to all essential amenities, including a vast selection of restaurants. <br/>There's an underground station only a stone's throw away, from which it is possible to  hit Alexanderplatz within half hour. <br/>The flat is very comfortable and kept sparklingly clean.<br/>Oksana went out of her way to make sure that a broken stove / oven got promptly replaced by a microwave oven.<br/>Highly recommended.",1,0.5563,Positive
95.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,53,100.0,0,13.015239763492993,4.61,4.29,4.55,4.59,684491013825440916,Gihads apartment was exactly as the photos.<br/>But the thing that made my trip to Berlin better was the flexibility with the check in and check out.<br/>Gihad is a friendly and helpful guy. <br/>Definitely perfect if you are looking for a peaceful trip.<br/>I recommend it 100%,1,0.9623,Positive
149.0,8,1.0,1.0,4.0,30,100.0,0,1.7769325020661466,4.83,4.85,4.79,4.74,31133644,"Dusan's apartment was perfect for our needs for our family trip, the location was convenient for transport, and Dusan was very responsive and communicative. We would definitely stay again.",1,0.8479,Positive
83.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,1,3.2015667482345425,4.95,4.94,4.95,4.83,16648309,"Vi var mycket nöjda med boendet. Värden var vänlig, hjälpsam och lätt att kommunicera med. Det var lugnt i området samtidigt som det var nära till restauranger, caféer, butiker och fina områden att promenera i. Det var svalt och skönt i boendet trots att det var värmebölja under vår vistelse. Vi kommer gärna tillbaka!",1,0.0,Neutral
95.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,1,17.362057894622207,4.91,4.95,4.76,4.74,49631586,"Great quiet location in a courtyard, down a side street. Flat was very clean and the kitchen and bathroom will equipped and very good quality. I travel to Berlin for work so a reliable base is important. I will be staying here again soon and am already looking forward to it.",1,0.9019,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,6.432065367275135,4.89,4.89,4.86,4.85,6599218,Wunderschöne Wohnung. Die Kommunikation mit Jan war hervorragend. Die Wohnung liegt direkt an der U- Bahn Station. Kostenlose Parkplätze in der Nähe sind auch vorhanden. Wir kommen gerne wieder.,1,-0.9136,Negative
163.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,98.0,1,1.1296896945466344,4.9,4.91,4.87,4.79,888298691845183664,"J'ai passé un excellent séjour dans cet appartement. Bob W est très disponible et réactif. L'appartement est facile d'accès et est proche des transports publics. Le checkin et le checkout se sont déroulés sans problème. Rien à redire, tout s'est très bien passé, merci !",1,0.5411,Positive
80.0,3,1.0,2.5,2.0,14,100.0,1,6.752777028015956,4.63,4.83,4.9,4.6,46207611,"Wunderschöne vintage Einrichtung mit vielen Details. Ich habe mich sehr wohl gefühlt dort. Andreas hat mir hilfreiche Tipps zur Umgebung gegeben und wie ich bestimmte Orte am besten mit den öffentlichen Verkehrsmitteln erreiche. In der Küche war alles vorhanden. Der Kühlschrank war mit verschiedenen Getränken gefüllt und es gab einer zum Frühstück. Das Zimmer war sehr sauber und ebenfalls besonders eingerichtet. Die Unterkunft ist sehr nahe an der U Bahn Station und alles ist gut erreichbar. In der Hegend gibt es mehrere Supermärkte und Essens Möglichkeiten (Rewe, Lidl, Edeka) welche alle gut zu Fuß erreichbar sind. Gerne komme ich wieder.",1,-0.9485,Negative
125.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,7,100.0,0,4.260148909474929,4.7,4.4,5.0,4.8,8245303,"Everything worked very well, it was great to stay at this location. Thanks!",1,0.8653,Positive
91.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,0,4.511823268613172,4.68,4.74,4.5,4.65,30319167,"The studio has everything you need for a short stay (2 nights in our case) and is located in a pretty nice area with a tram station super close, tram that gets you in 20 mins to Mitte, for example. Other pros are the fact that it has shops like Netto, Lidl & Edeka at walking distance, as well as the communication with the host. A con I would note (and it is not the hosts' fault) is the fact that were noises in the block (pipes I guess) and the fact that the tram line goes right in front of the flat. Other than everything was ok.",1,0.9153,Positive
191.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,9,93.0,0,2.437449202195004,4.23,4.36,4.78,4.22,40584336,"La chambre était parfaite, le personnel charmant, l'emplacement idéal. Le rapport qualité prix au top ! Je recommande.",1,0.2714,Positive
95.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,3.1833669854420146,4.83,4.85,4.8,4.58,34018418,"One of the best Airbnb's I've stayed at!<br/>The location and the apartment were fantastic, and the check-in and communication both super smooth.",1,0.9184,Positive
