64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,1.3773060525895495,4.72,4.84,4.91,4.66,1461489656921679773,Nice room! only a little too minimalistic in our opinion. like no coffee machine or mini bar,1,0.5255,Positive
67.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,31,100.0,1,0.7518298030804867,4.84,4.68,4.86,4.75,27120381,"We really enjoyed our stay. The location and view were really amazing! Within 20 minutes you could be in the city centre by foot or you could walk 2 minutes to the S-bahn and be anywhere in minutes. With windows you can keep open throughout the whole day, you could keep it cool inside. My only con would be the sound of the cars and trains when you would sleep with your window open. Overall the stay and contact with the host were really amazing!!",1,0.9428,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,10,83.0,0,1.9263546782231065,4.75,4.5,4.94,4.69,1112400457588240960,"Soggorno di coppia nel bel appartamento di Amelie.<br/>Lei è stata gentilissima sin dall’inizio. Abbiamo avuto problemi con il volo che ha ritardato e siamo arrivati la sera tardi, eppure ci ha aspettati fino a mezzanotte.<br/>L’appartamento è nuovo, pulito e attrezzato, si trova in una splendida zona residenziale, ben servita da mezzi pubblici e facile da raggiungere.<br/>Il rapporto qualità prezzo dell’alloggio è molto competitivo.",1,0.0516,Positive
