138.0,10,3.0,2.0,5.0,38,100.0,0,5.652601408210154,4.76,4.63,4.54,4.7,44483955,Stayed at Frank’s apartment last minute after booking another place that was a bit too far out of the centre of Berlin. <br/>Frank was always communicating and the whole process couldn’t have been easier. <br/>The apartment had everything you could need and I would definitely stay there again! <br/>Thanks for a 5 star stay Frank!,0,0.7256,Positive
80.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,58,100.0,0,4.446129767437939,4.76,4.81,4.95,4.65,43525766,"Very comfortable and well equipped flat in a great location, easy to find and a 15 min walk from Berlin main train station, a metro station was very close to the  flat to take you to the central attractions.<br/>We had trouble with the key when we arrived, we'd had a long journey and we're very tired but Sharhar did sort it out and eventually we got in with a replacement key.  However we did book this flat for the balcony so we could have some outside space only to find scaffolding on the balcony and workmen arriving at 7:30 every day working from our balcony which meant we could not open the blinds or breakfast on the balcony as we'd envisaged. So this was rather disappointing. <br/>I wouldn't hesitate to stay here again for all the positive reasons above but would check that all the outside work has been completed before I did.",1,0.7471,Positive
172.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,95.0,0,4.132850367965358,4.48,4.51,4.59,4.33,43811934,Kleines aber sehr schönes und gepflegtes Appartement mit Balkon  in der Nähe der U-Bahn Hermannplatz. Check in un Check out waren problemlos und schnell.,1,0.0,Neutral
