209.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,34,89.0,0,4.068771463428812,4.69,4.67,4.85,4.58,1264460351152558977,"everything was good, but there is one big problem. there is a very unpleasant smell in the apartment, like from the sewer, and we can not understand where this smell comes from. the owners know about this problem, but do nothing to fix it. all day and night we were with the windows open in the bedroom, when we slept, the windows were still open ... check-in was easy and clear. the location of the apartment is good. 20 minutes walk to the Brandenburg Gate and the Reikstag. the interior is nice and cute. the apartment has one problem - bed  smell. if you fix this, everything will be fine.",1,0.8738,Positive
