95.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,1,3.2655381260982392,4.91,4.87,4.87,4.82,456902,"We had an absolutely wonderful stay at Stefan's place. This was our first time in Berlin and this location was the perfect spot for our home base, with all the sites and activities we wanted to do easily accessible. The apartment was beautiful - clean, nicely decorated and had everything we needed! And the bed was so comfortable! Would definitely recommend to others and would certainly stay here again! Thanks to Stefan for your hospitality!",1,0.988,Positive
