135.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,3.104550941585256,4.8,4.84,4.94,4.69,39956169,"I had a great staying at Berlin in the house. the area was really nice (calme and safe) sevrel supermarkets are around the corner and nice restaurants too. the house was really confort and clean, perfect for couple or friends <br/>Alan and Kasia answered me for every question rapidly. I definitely recommand this Airbnb !",1,0.9721,Positive
41.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,1,1.86138792305612,4.87,4.71,4.92,4.89,1005341,"Maciej is a friendly, interested and kind host. I stayed in his appartment with my boyfriend for 3 days and it was great. The room is small but clean and you have everything you need (table, closet, little fridge). The appartment is nicely decorated and is suited in a lovely area in Berlin. Prenzlauer berg has a lot of nice parks, cafe's and restaurants! You can park closeby for free and we could park our bikes in the hall downstairs. Maciej told us the best places to go and the communication was very good.",1,0.9911,Positive
162.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,46,100.0,1,3.25098838227702,4.96,4.99,4.75,4.8,13711603,"Wat een fijn appartement! Ruim, schoon en van alle gemakken voorzien. Goed bed, fijne douche en gunstige ligging. We mochten onze fietsen stallen op de binnenplaats. Berlijn is een fantastische stad om doorheen te fietsen. <br/>En je krijgt nog een gratis work out door het traplopen naar de vijfde verdieping 😊",1,-0.3802,Negative
275.0,8,3.0,2.0,6.0,59,100.0,1,8.58407439041072,4.78,4.75,4.68,4.68,11643878,"Very clean, comfortable and friendly flat. Would recommend to anyone looking to stay in Berlin. Host was very friendly and understanding and catered wonderfully during my stay. ",0,0.9605,Positive
42.0,1,1.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,1,17.084357470964473,4.96,4.98,4.92,4.91,24449046,"This was my first time using Airbnb. Really comfortable room, location easily accessible from the main train station or anywhere in the centre. The hosts were very warm and welcoming. They offered me some tips on getting around Berlin and responded quickly when I wrote them.",1,0.8847,Positive
