74.0,5,1.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,0,3.788889030203912,4.73,4.61,4.86,4.66,2118068,"There was no internet up and running beginning on the first day of my stay which was a big issue for me and host did not offer to accommodate price as a result, even though internet issue was not resolved until the THIRD day of my stay. Host was inflexible and unwilling to accept liability for his failure to provide the apartment as advertised. Said I should have told him it was a critical factor (even though I did) and still would not offer to reduce the price. Would not recommend bc if something goes wrong, host will not be open to modifying price.",1,-0.894,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,0,4.485908829592629,4.9,4.9,4.84,4.88,680250759870842312,"Vanya was a really nice host, who cared about our stay and well-being. the home was really beautiful and it was quiet(no street nearby). the area has a lot of great food and cafe options :)",1,0.953,Positive
80.0,1,0.0,1.0,1.0,27,98.0,1,7.968024497910648,4.4,4.67,4.47,3.93,11483657,"Очень чистая и уютная квартира. Расположение очень удобное, метро и автобусы рядом.",1,0.0,Neutral
