125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,0,7.010380576838823,4.88,4.81,4.81,4.75,1128029445795720975,"Super schöne, gemütliche und saubere Wohnung  in einem sehr gemütlichen Viertel:)<br/>Problemlose und einfache Kommunikation mit Manuel.<br/>Sicher eines der besten Airbnbs die wir je besucht haben :)<br/>Vielen Dank 😊",1,0.0,Neutral
68.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,3.902983824639757,4.91,4.92,4.92,4.92,14006299,"​The house was very comfortable, and I had the deepest sleep of this trip. My friend and I stayed here, and even though the sofa bed is usually for groups of three or more, the host was incredibly accommodating and provided it for us upon request. The kitchen and bathroom were also very comfortable. Thank you!",1,0.9254,Positive
86.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,6.919397234051426,4.86,4.88,4.51,4.74,20942536,"Un logement, agréable, bien équipé, et bien situé.<br/>Notre seule critique : l'immeuble lui-même est bien calme, mais d'autres touristes sont un peu bruyants dans la cour, surtout quand il fait chaud, et qu'on a la fenêtre ouverte.",1,0.0,Neutral
110.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,50,100.0,1,2.7610678260408177,4.84,4.67,4.93,4.69,2610528,Great AirBnB in a great neighborhood. Gabriel was quick to respond to any questions. We would definitely stay here again.,1,0.8979,Positive
