165.0,6,3.0,1.5,5.0,43,100.0,1,5.434755992176868,4.77,4.85,4.66,4.66,1186272166891222141,"Wir hatten drei tolle Tage in Berlin, vor allem, weil wir die niceste und unkompliziertestes Unterkunft hatten! Danke dir Sebastian, kommen bestimmt nochmal :D",0,0.1091,Positive
225.0,10,3.0,1.5,6.0,50,100.0,1,1.288152201576383,4.97,4.94,4.88,4.91,1354167530114407725,"Super schöne Wohnung mit großzügigen Räumen und einer tollen Gegend mit vielen Bars und Restaurants sowie Cafés. In der Nähe sind Spielplätze und Supermärkte, auch für Familien sehr schön.",0,0.5994,Positive
52.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,20,100.0,1,7.180141027082842,4.66,4.77,4.5,4.57,22802583,J'ai passé 3 nuits dans le logement avec un ami et tout était parfait !,1,-0.2003,Negative
125.0,1,1.0,1.0,2.0,12,100.0,0,8.25707005621841,4.73,4.82,4.64,4.55,3070635,"Great apartment in a great location, very clean, safe and centrally located in a quiet neighbourhood. Suitable for longer stays. Manuel and Polina have been truly nice hosts. They are helpful, easy to talk to and charming. It was a perfect stay. I would absolutely recommend it.",1,0.9883,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,93.0,0,1.616653935510021,4.87,4.84,4.84,4.66,43795535,"This hotel has a great location very close to a tram stop. It is within a 15 minute walk or a 10 minute tram ride from Alexanderplatz. The neighbourhood seemed nice and relatively quiet, and within it you can find a good selection of breakfast places, restaurants, cafes, and a couple of grocery stores. The hotel itself did not offer breakfast or dinner since the dining area was still unfinished, but this was a fact we knew beforehand. It also did not yet have a laundry service, but right on the other side of the street there was a laundromat. <br/>The room and its furniture were clean (we stayed in a double room on the second floor). The window blocked the sounds from the street very well. The air conditioning unit was also excellent - I think a big part of our enjoyment was having an air conditioner. The bathroom had a nice amount of shelf space. Another plus was there was a safe to keep your valuables in, just in case. The hotel reception had a vending machine that had a small but good selection of cold drinks and sweet snacks.<br/>If there is something to be negative about, it might be that the cleaning staff seemed to work in a hurry. The cleanliness was good, but they had a tendency to leave things behind (cleaning equipment etc). The shower, while having good things like being inside an eclosure and having a decent size, also had a very slow-moving drain. Those enjoying long showers have to turn the shower off from time to time to avoid flooding.",1,0.9935,Positive
125.0,5,4.0,1.0,2.0,5,100.0,0,2.8033339530283823,5.0,4.85,5.0,5.0,1423398,"Det var vidunderligt at bo i Ellas magiske lejlighed. Her var masser af plads og lys i en rigtig spændende del af Berlin. Vi kunne have tilbragt lang tid her og aldrig komme længere end til Bergmannstrasse, her er så meget at se på, gode butikker og hyggelige spisesteder. Ella var imødekommende og nem at kommunikere med på mail. Nøgleudleveringen hos Ellas veninde var nem. Vi vil meget gerne vende tilbage en anden gang.<br/>Mvh Mads og Camilla",1,0.0,Neutral
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,1,8.636618175827909,4.99,4.96,4.79,4.96,704803150302052240,"Jens와 Lourdes의 집에서 머무는 동안 정말 편안하게 지냈어요. 긴 여행으로 지친 몸과 마음이 다시 에너지를 얻는 기분이었어요. 어느 순간 집으로 돌아가고 싶다는 생각만 가득했는데, Jens와 Lourdes의 공간 덕분에 베를린을 떠나는 게 아쉬울 정도였어요. 무엇보다 집이 정말 예쁘고 깨끗해서 집밖을 나가기 싫을 정도였어요🛌💭 다음에 다시 베를린을 여행하게 된다면 꼭 또다시 Jens와 Lourdes의 집에서 머무르고 싶어요. 좋은 시간을 선물해주셔서 정말 감사해요🤍",1,0.0,Neutral
