60.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,1.1530597508367482,4.91,4.83,4.97,4.85,229776,"Arne is a really fantastic host, the communication with him was really precise and he's very reactive. We had a very warm welcome, he really cares about his guests. We had some trouble at the end of the trip to get back home and Arne was always ready to help.<br/>We stayed in a comfortable room with a little bed (for 2 people) but sufficient, there was places to tidy our stuffs. The insulation of the appartment is not perfect but it's calm. The decoration  is nice and the balcony very peaceful.<br/>Mitte is an amazing district where you can find all you need, so much restaurants, galleries, stores, parks,... and also very close of the transports.<br/>We just have to say that Arne has 2 cats, cute and sweet but also very curious, so it may be annoying for some people.<br/>Anyway, we absolute recommand Arne's place.",1,0.9752,Positive
