65.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,2.142649937740168,4.91,4.94,4.96,4.89,446975,"Excellent all round, Kerstin is a very professional host.  I could spend a week cleaning my home and it wouldn’t be half as clean.  The apartment is exactly as appears in the photo and is very spacious and has excellent facilities.  Quiet location you can sit outside yet you’re a minute away from the hustle and bustle of central  Berlin, near the Ubahn and under 15 minutes by tram from Berlin HBF.  Hopefully this Air BNB is available next time I’m in Berlin.",1,0.9153,Positive
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,59,100.0,0,4.272832400491692,4.74,4.47,4.87,4.63,653677,"We spend 4 wonderfull days in Simone’s apartment who is spacious, cosy and absolutely beautiful to stay in.  I would have prefer to keep this place for myself ... but it 'won't be nice for the lovely Simone... ;-) I hardly recommend Simone’s apartment to anyone wishing to visit Berlin. Thanks a lot Simone, you makes this week end perfect !",1,0.9707,Positive
