64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,100.0,1,8.25430391764468,5.0,4.94,4.81,4.81,1050050368168083201,"I had a lovely stay at Janine’s, the apartment was very cozy and clean, just as it looked in the photos. She was very welcoming and made me feel right at home. Check in was easy and flexible as I arrive late in the evening. The room was clean, tidy and had a lovely view over the garden. I would absolutely recommend Janine’s place to anyone looking for a cozy and peaceful place to stay in the bustling city of Berlin !",1,0.9794,Positive
