98.0,5,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,0,4.998950809232622,4.7,4.57,4.75,4.65,968659794536292077,"Super Unterkunft in Berlin, ca. 500m von der Haltestelle Warschauer Straße entfernt. Ruhige Gegend, aber fussläufig einiges erreichbar. Modern eingerichtet mit schönen Kunstwerken an den Wänden. Insgesamt alles was man braucht zu einem super Preis-Leistungsverhältnis, wir würden wieder kommen! ☺️",1,0.8439,Positive
97.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,1,2.186044325557003,4.98,4.9,4.98,4.92,15645656,"Fijne en rustige locatie. Goed te bereiken met interessante expositie over de vml muur vlakbij, je voelt de emoties en de historische lading van de plek.<br/>Kamer is ruim en comfortabel. Alles is aanwezig, fijn bad in de badkamer. Lampen zijn wat fel en iets meer kleur aan de wand zou het nog wat intiemer maker. De gordijnen zijn aan de dunne kant waardoor de kamer snachts soms wat oplicht door het licht van de achterburen, maar dit zijn kleinigheden.",1,-0.5423,Negative
175.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,91.0,0,4.861047682375263,4.69,4.77,4.83,4.57,53744550,"Even when I needed to amend the number of guests, they were on it and wasted no time in helping from that point onwards. The second I walked, there was an amazing aroma, and I found out what it was when I used the shower and washed my hands - I don’t think I touch my own shower gel, the smell was too good! Free drinks in the fridge, a mini kitchen that didn’t take up too much space and allowed for the bed to be the focal point. Everything was so clean, that I was able to relax the second I got in (which was pretty late, so that was amazing). I will DEFINITELY be using numa | Sketch again the next time I’m in Berlin which will be very soon + if my friends and family ever talk about Airbnb, I’ll tell them to consider them first! :)",1,0.9794,Positive
62.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,45,100.0,0,2.1907320060884934,4.79,4.8,4.94,4.77,38729622,The apartment looks just like in the pictures. We had a wonderful stay and got to know the hosts who were very warm and welcoming.<br/>Would definitely book again.,1,0.8777,Positive
275.0,8,3.0,2.0,6.0,59,100.0,1,8.58407439041072,4.78,4.75,4.68,4.68,11643878,Good flat !,0,0.4926,Positive
92.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,0,2.7850220743469896,4.82,4.83,4.89,4.68,249419,"Frank arranged for Marie to meet me at the flat and give me keys and show me how everything worked. He had kindly left tea and good coffee for me, a hairdryer (no need to pack one!) along with some guidebooks to Berlin. The flat was great - and filled with art and art books; perfect as I was there for Berlin Art Week! <br/>The bed was comfy though I might suggest ear plugs for sensitive sleepers as the studio is on the ground floor near to the entrance way and neighbours coming in and out could be heard in the corridor and stairway.  <br/>Excellent access to public transport (I used CityMapper iPhone app to figure out how to get around) and has a young student bussling vibe. ",1,0.938,Positive
