38.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,20.197656709080835,4.79,4.65,4.5,4.75,13358868,"Olaf's place is in a clean and quiet neighborhood. Olaf is also very nice, he stayed up late to help us check in. In terms of connectivity to the place,  a tram station is nearyby.",1,0.8173,Positive
