125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,1,7.240134861209534,4.8,4.85,4.57,4.72,11775402,"It was my best Airbnb experience. You really get, what the description promise. It feels like a small paradise in the middle of Berlin. You just need 20 minutes to the city center and you can reach Friedrichshain within 10 minutes walking distance. The place is so peaceful and Carmyta is really nice and helpful. I would definitely stay here again.",1,0.9783,Positive
