129.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,1,5.219581292258965,4.85,4.91,4.88,4.63,632286550077681311,"I stayed at Steve's for a couple of days in May. Although the walls (and ceiling) were thin, the neighbours did not disturb at night and I was able to sleep nicely. The location was very convenient for my errands (a Rewe supermarket open till late at night is only 3min away) and commute. Everything squeaky clean.<br/>Thank you again for the lovely stay!",1,0.85,Positive
