153.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,55,100.0,1,2.349349810159802,5.0,5.0,4.98,4.77,37412496,Place was beautiful and the sauna was soooo wonderful.,1,0.8225,Positive
75.0,1,1.0,1.5,1.0,18,96.0,1,3.398299035841227,5.0,5.0,5.0,4.75,1261542303012741593,nice room well situated,1,0.5994,Positive
86.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,89.0,0,3.210467911644057,4.59,4.76,4.82,4.47,26771372,"Das Zimmer befindet sich in einer sehr guten Lage, Cafés, Geschäfte und Parks sind nur wenige Minuten Fußweg entfernt. Die Bahnanbindung ist ebenfalls unkompliziert und auch Nachts gut nutzbar. Das Zimmer war wie beschrieben und für einen kurzen Aufenthalt absolut ausreichend.",1,-0.8316,Negative
161.0,7,1.0,1.0,3.0,38,90.0,0,1.6132440005466837,4.58,4.54,4.87,4.44,321378,"Traveled to Berlin to visit a Friend who moved to the neighborhood.  Robin was very responsive and helped our group get situated quickly and easily when we arrived.  The apartment is in a great location with transportation, restaurants and bars all around the corner.  Would definitely consider staying again next time we're in Berlin.",1,0.9348,Positive
203.0,6,3.0,1.0,3.0,43,100.0,1,4.140963863667464,4.89,4.92,4.89,4.78,4182815,"Die Unterkunft liegt zentral im Bergmannkiez. Sie ist blitzsauber und mit allem ausgestattet, was man braucht. Außerdem list alles neu und sehr schön und durchdacht eingerichtet. Wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt. Danke für alles! Susanne & family",0,-0.636,Negative
146.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,1,3.082153024559447,4.81,4.78,4.94,4.68,16777646,"Maria’s spacious apartment is in a great location. We were able to walk to all the tourist highlights and the train stations. Many cafes, restaurants on the street and surrounds and supermarkets within easy reach. The apartment was very quiet, set well back from the street overlooking a courtyard. <br/>The only thing to note here was the second floor spiral staircase, a challenge for anyone with large luggage. Happy to recommend and would stay here again. ",1,0.9429,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,1,3.3887487396083724,4.8,4.78,4.79,4.71,14424131,Der Check In war einfach und unkompliziert. Das Zimmer war sauber und die Lage der Wohnung ist sehr ruhig und Zentral.,1,-0.9136,Negative
150.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,24,96.0,0,13.522952515456913,4.63,4.8,4.57,4.51,33707449,"The check-in and stay instructions were extremely clear - cute and funny video clips. The rooms are very very comfortable and cozy, lovely atmosphere and design. Very clean. Some gifts to the guests weren't forgotten... Iljana is a very nice person and host.<br/>The minus is that all the apartments share the same toilet and bath.<br/>Worth the cost and recommended. The best option near the airport.",1,0.9835,Positive
115.0,5,1.0,1.0,3.0,28,100.0,1,2.8150039882208566,4.84,4.85,4.88,4.79,425487,"Desde antes de nuestra llegad la comunicación con Hans y con Ute fue muy fluida, y nos dieron muy buenas recomendaciones para llegar hasta el departamento desde el aeropuerto. Fueron muy amables y muy predispuestos a ayudarnos en los que pudiéramos necesitar. El departamento es muy amplio, luminosos, bien equipado y esta en una zona muy tranquila de muy fácil acceso desde la estación central y/o hacia los centros de interés mas importantes-(varias líneas de trams en 150 metros a la redonda).  Una muy buena experiencia. Muy recomendable.",1,0.0,Neutral
81.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,0,3.7037412395346903,4.48,4.48,4.86,4.26,810667192102353036,Lovely hosts!! everything was as described,1,0.658,Positive
140.0,6,2.0,1.0,5.0,49,100.0,1,2.43464121697615,4.72,4.88,4.83,4.55,243081,"Appartement très sympathique et confortable, à recommander.<br/>L'hôte est agréable (communication via air bnb).<br/>Seul défaut, le wifi est très moyen (lent/peu fiable), ce qui a nui à notre expérience globale.",0,0.0,Neutral
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,0,7.98992850237087,4.79,4.68,4.71,4.89,5047938,"Das Zimmer befindet sich in einer 2.5 - Zimmer Wohnung mit kompletter Küche, bequemen Bad und kleinen gemeinschaftlichen Essenraum.  Die Wohnung ist schön gut gestaltet und gekümmert !  Die Lage am Seetrasse ist super, mit sehr guter Verbindung zur Straßenbahn und U Bahn.   Man kann alles finden an der Seestraße U Bahn Kreuzung.  Damla ist sehr nett und freundlich !",1,-0.8395,Negative
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,17,100.0,0,1.2170784296828043,4.67,4.58,4.96,4.5,33550908,Wonderful locations for your adventures in Berlin.<br/>Mike got back to us very quickly when we had questions.,1,0.7269,Positive
171.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,100.0,1,2.638829312933958,4.75,4.84,4.89,4.62,28510951,"Mi estadía fue genial, lo recomiendo al 100% Todo perfecto, perfecto, limpieza, ubicación, comodidad, atención, todo A1!",1,0.7712,Positive
108.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,3.617893966015014,4.74,4.78,4.82,4.57,18443210,Beautiful flat in a wonderfully quiet street. Conveniently close to the subway and Tempelhof. Very comfy bed and excellent amenities. Highly recommended.,1,0.9273,Positive
161.0,10,4.0,2.0,4.0,25,100.0,1,7.731041071020152,4.6,4.72,4.48,4.57,2599765,"Ruim appartement, goede keuken en sanitair. Bedden wel hard en laag. En weinig echt comfortabele zitmogelijkheid. Wel fijne lange eettafel.<br/>Tramnr vanaf station was handig geweest om door te geven. Is makkelijler en sneller dan metro",0,-0.1027,Negative
48.0,3,1.0,1.0,3.0,54,100.0,1,2.414898050953499,4.88,4.76,4.85,4.79,52005535,"The room was spacious and comfortable, the bathroom was always clean, and the location was unbeatable. Easy tram connections everywhere and fantastic bars/restaurants/stores within 15 minutes walk of the apartment. Great value for money!",1,0.9601,Positive
