175.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,22,100.0,0,6.308695521896677,4.92,4.78,4.74,4.75,19418481,"This was truly one of the best Airbnb apartments I've stayed in. A designer apartment in a very central location in Berlin, cosy and comfortable, high ceilings, light-filled and beautifully decorated. It's even better than all the pictures. Perfect location for a sejour in Berlin. Couldn't think of a better place to stay! Nora is a wonderful host. Thank you!",1,0.984,Positive
55.0,3,0.0,1.0,1.0,23,80.0,0,11.786533105311303,4.76,4.58,4.84,4.64,40250051,"Daniel was a great host, always friendly and responsive. He was very relaxed and clear in his instructions. The apartment is probably better for a short stay of a few nights, rather than a long stay, and/or for a single person alone. There is a lot of stuff under the bed and in the closet. The apartment is set up well enough, but there are a couple of things that detract. Mainly the mold in the bathroom and the high humidity throughout. Some of our items grew mold during our stay and we had to throw them out. Even the wooden spoon got moldy at one point. Some kind of dehumidifier, or better ventilation, would help a lot. Other than that, the apartment has basic kitchen stuff, bedding, etc. - everything you need. Netflix stopped working while we were there, but we could use the Amazon Prime account for watching movies and shows. The building was pretty quiet and we were off the street, which was nice.",1,0.9768,Positive
84.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,62,100.0,1,10.20749415539876,4.95,4.96,4.93,4.89,1064617839709831509,"Lieber Freddy, liebe Siena, liebe Maya,<br/>herzlichen Dank für die schönen Tage in eurer Wohnung.<br/>Es hat an nichts gefehlt und die Kommunikation war hervorragend.<br/>Mein erster Airbnb Aufenthalt in Berlin und mit Sicherheit nicht der Letzte.<br/>Danke und ich komme sehr gerne wieder.<br/>Herzliche Grüße<br/>Kirsten",1,-0.9136,Negative
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,0,10.000137358221522,4.82,4.82,4.36,4.73,894858144576839191,"home Sweet Home.<br/>We immediately felt at home as soon as we entered the apartment. Comfortable and functional in a great location.<br/>The apartment is meticulous in detail, bright and spacious.<br/>I recommend it! Thank you so much Louise",1,0.9558,Positive
223.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,49,100.0,1,5.599016268041934,4.9,4.86,4.62,4.71,42269510,"Definitely worth the price. Felt like I was the first one to stay because everything seems so new and clean. Loved the balcony. There’s also reception open during business hours, which was very nice and helpful.",1,0.9591,Positive
