99.0,2,1.0,1.0,3.0,46,100.0,1,11.604485324856196,4.79,4.93,4.81,4.68,4462848,"Brit sent a welcome greeting and when we had confusion about which unit to go to, the response was very fast.  The neighborhood was great, with many shops, banks, restaurants, buses and u-bahn stations, and a very good vibe!  ",1,0.8997,Positive
