125.0,6,3.0,1.0,2.0,58,100.0,0,16.238159990743956,4.88,4.79,4.86,4.67,34881718,"Very modern, well-kept house with a garden.<br/>Problematic check-in requiring a phone call, lucky for the free wifi at local REWE as we were international guests without internet on our phones.<br/>A surprise, day of departure request to clean or pay a cleaning fee added a level of unnecessary stress, hopefully this can be resolved for future guests.",0,0.8779,Positive
