94.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,1,0.9546645327029104,4.87,4.81,4.89,4.81,22662699,Location is great and the view is amazing,1,0.836,Positive
60.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,18,100.0,0,10.02194221700588,4.78,4.89,4.68,4.69,321308,良かったです,1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,26,100.0,0,9.644762661947714,4.64,4.58,4.81,4.55,3700984,"Ни секунду не сомневайтесь, какую квартиру выбрать, если квартира Кати свободна! Жить в центральной части Берлина - это прекрасная возможность прекрасно отдохнуть и почувствовать атмосферу этого города. В шаговой доступности достопримечательности Берлина: большой зоопарк, церковь памяти Курфюрста Вильгельма, театра Запада, знаменитая улица Курфюрстендамм. Рядом с домом есть и рестораны, и торговые центры, и обычные магазины. Что важно: в 2 минутах ходьбы метро и электричка, а также автобусная остановка. Отсюда берет начало маршрут двухэтажного автобуса №100, который проезжает почти все знаковые места Берлина. В квартире уютно, чисто, в ней просто приятно находиться. Катя позаботилась о нас. Очень порадовал хороший прием, сладкие подарки и цветы от нее. Мы благодарны хозяйке квартиры за отличный отдых! ",1,0.0,Neutral
121.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,27,100.0,0,4.472653939309849,4.88,4.9,4.81,4.78,10122398,"Martin was excellent. Super quick responses and great communication throughout. He even sent a video walkthrough of the check in process. Meticulously clean flat. The heated floors were definitely appreciated during the winter. There were a lot of small touches that really helped, like having two sets of keys. Although I was alone, if I had been traveling with a companion, it would’ve been nice to have our own sets of keys. Also, the location is great. Minutes walking distance to Potsdamer Platz. U-Bahn station is across the street for easy connections to public transit. Definitely recommend and will stay again!",1,0.9886,Positive
113.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,0,2.473806275762348,4.75,4.71,4.83,4.65,1259322400014007734,Very nice flat in the centre of Berlin,1,0.4754,Positive
87.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,10.082429401037324,4.86,4.86,4.77,4.78,731042640553523310,Haben uns sehr wohl in der Unterkunft gefühlt und es war uns eine Freude von dort aus Berlin zu entdecken.,1,-0.5994,Negative
94.0,5,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,1,2.1120432937326656,4.78,4.65,4.89,4.72,1814192,Ottima posizione per spostarsi facilmente con i mezzi. Appartamento pulito e acccogliente e host super disponibile e presente. Lo consiglio,1,0.5994,Positive
118.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,97.0,0,1.941053289840044,4.58,4.53,4.8,4.36,735085199089327822,Tono genial y en muy buena localizacion!,1,0.4753,Positive
290.0,4,2.0,2.0,3.0,38,100.0,1,2.9510071793882355,4.93,4.89,4.83,4.77,57049,"My family and I had a wonderful stay in this beautifully appointed apartment. Marine is a super host. She is utterly professional, always responsive to messages and attentive to detail. This apartment, set on Mauer Park is perfectly positioned to spend time in Berlin. An advantage is that there is a lift which makes staying on the fourth floor easy. We enjoyed exploring the local area and living like locals and the apartment was so well appointed we could have family diners together. We would highly recommend staying here. Than you Marine!",0,0.9877,Positive
199.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,55,100.0,1,5.219720089823107,4.89,4.78,4.88,4.78,50534643,"We thoroughly enjoyed our stay here and Ron was a lovely host. The place was spacious, clean, close to lots of cool places to eat and drink, easy to get to. Would very much recommend if you're looking for a nice place with lots happening close by!",1,0.9646,Positive
140.0,6,2.0,1.0,5.0,49,100.0,1,2.43464121697615,4.72,4.88,4.83,4.55,243081,Ann'as place was excellent. The appartment was very good and clean. The location is very good. The only thing that bothered us is that we had to add money for towels and sheets and it wasn't included in the price in the beginning.,0,0.8945,Positive
86.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,100.0,1,3.4203343748381307,4.76,4.8,4.78,4.65,2649669,"I really liked Katharina's apartment, which is very clean, comfortable, quiet and right in the centre of the city. I bumped into Katharina who is very charming, and it was lovely to chat to her and find out about her work. The apartment is perfect for a short-term stay in Berlin and I highly recommend.",1,0.9752,Positive
73.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,0,16.030177477274194,4.68,4.68,4.88,4.59,1645341,"Good breakfast, great location in residential area, quiet, host is very friendly.<br/>Be aware that the room is on 3rd fl. Climbing is required, yet the host is helpful ",1,0.8689,Positive
76.0,4,1.0,1.5,2.0,60,100.0,1,3.624198275329287,4.85,4.91,4.81,4.69,2137277,"This is a very well located apartment in the middle of Kreuzkölln. The area is perfect to hang out in one of the many cafes and restaurants close by or stroll by the canal, which is only a 10 min walk away. There are shopping facilities in the area as well. We found several bike rentals in the neighbourhood, which makes it even easier to get to other interesting areas of Berlin su hijo as Bergmannstr. (5 min), Prenzlauer Berg (25 min), Mitte (15 min) than even with public transport. The building is fully renovated and the apartment is very spacious and has lots of light, it is conveniently furnished and clean. The internet worked fine. We had a minor problem with a leak in the kitchen, but it was taken care of promptly. You cannot arrive before 15h, but can do so anytime afterwards and are properly informed of this. All in all, I recommend this place  to stay in Berlin!",1,0.9329,Positive
125.0,5,1.0,1.0,2.0,63,100.0,1,26.25494828303801,4.83,4.89,4.79,4.84,26638798,Dirk's place ligger dejlig stille omgivelser. 10 min gang til handlemuligheder og 10 min gang til tog der kører direkte indtil Berlin mitte. Dejligt ren bolig med alle fornødne faciliteter. De bedste anbefalinger herfra.,1,0.0,Neutral
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,80.0,1,3.3088530361417954,4.74,4.64,4.87,4.77,16007104,"A well located place with close supermarkets, transportation, restaurants, stores and Touristic Places. An sometimes inconvenient hostess. All my opinions are written down on the specific evaluations.",1,-0.0772,Negative
129.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,13,100.0,0,12.513638550357737,4.0,4.08,4.44,4.23,1107127820534249476,Great location in front of the trainstation. The breakfast available. Comfortable room.,1,0.8126,Positive
45.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,3.8692265936490537,4.75,4.77,4.69,4.67,693357,Had a great time at Gili's place. Ideally located near Kreuzberg and Templehof airport. Nice and warm in the cold weather too. Gili was friendly and easy going. ,1,0.9493,Positive
87.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,0,7.498812090064871,4.93,4.91,4.74,4.79,40703325,"Daniel was a great host. My trip unfortunately went differently than planned and I had to arrive without my friend, but Daniel provided me with great company and so I did not feel completely alone :) Was in any case not my last visit, very happy to return!",1,0.9653,Positive
73.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,2.27336048441501,4.89,4.87,4.95,4.82,16155678,Great place and awesome host. Super recommended. I would be staying here if I get back to Berlin. Thanks Joe,1,0.9501,Positive
77.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,50,100.0,1,3.172543311051877,4.97,4.93,4.94,4.94,4045063,"Au top !  Pour avoir beaucoup voyagé et fréquenté pas mal d'hôtels, j'avoue que cet appartement est formidable et dépasse bon nombre d'hôtels. <br/>Thor lui l'est tout autant, très accueillant et toujours prêt à rendre service, il saura toujours vous conseiller ou trouver des solutions.<br/>Il fait en sorte que vous vous sentiez comme chez vous. <br/>Évidemment si je reviens à Berlin, je ne me poserai pas la question, je sais déjà où j'irais... <br/>Allez y les yeux fermés. <br/>Sans oublier son chat qui est aussi accueilant que lui. <br/>Mieux on peut pas faire !",1,0.2225,Positive
