307.0,5,3.0,2.0,4.0,77,100.0,1,5.3390203840216754,4.91,4.98,4.68,4.81,901837,"Beautiful, sparkling clean apartment on a very good spot with fast bus connection to the city center.  Marga is a wonderful host. Highly recommended.",0,0.95,Positive
197.0,8,2.0,1.0,4.0,35,100.0,1,6.185666213811397,5.0,5.0,4.91,4.73,1384105075374990219,"It was a great apartment with lots of space. The coffee machine wasn’t working but host was responsive and offered to help. Quiet neighborhood, separate door straight to the street was useful. Not too far to attractions, but surely we did drive. Would recommend",0,0.9784,Positive
281.0,4,2.0,1.5,3.0,64,93.0,1,3.916866013805152,4.86,4.95,4.74,4.84,691469,Stefan's place is really nice! Its very comfortable and you can simply find everything you need. We were there during Christmas time and we loved the big kitchen for cooking some nice meals. Everything is very clean and spacious. We loved the neighbourhood. Twice a week there is a nice local market very nearby. Stefan also had two bikes for us to use during the time we were there. We would recommend his place if you go to Berlin!,0,0.9793,Positive
87.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,21,90.0,0,3.196091525660409,4.72,4.86,4.67,4.6,541569,"Silke replied quickly all time and she was very flexible when handing us her keys. <br/>Further she led us stay in her apartment the whole day through the day we had to check out from the apartment. She even gave us tips on where to spent the last day in Berlin.<br/>Overall we had an extremely good experience when renting the apartment. ",1,0.6582,Positive
156.0,6,2.0,2.0,4.0,51,100.0,1,2.784593796049624,4.88,4.78,4.9,4.77,3378027,"Host : We did not meet Nassa in person but his dad welcomed us with warm smile. Throughout the stay Nassa was easy to get in touch with. <br/><br/>Location: The apartment is conveniently located in a great lively neighborhood with lots of restaurants, convenient stores, a mall and subway station all within 10 mins walk.  <br/><br/>Apartment: The apartment is on the first floor so no need to carry luggages up the stairs.  It is in an old building complex, and the hall way had beautiful rococo style decorative details. The apartment itself has very modern amenities.  We especially appreciate the great water pressure of the shower. Both beds were very comfortable.  <br/><br/>Things to note:  Since the apartment is on the first floor and close to the front door of the building, we could hear people coming in and out of the building.  It did not bother us so much because we are early risers and excited to explore the city.  <br/><br/> ",0,0.9923,Positive
93.0,10,3.0,1.0,6.0,39,100.0,1,5.438577050902026,4.7,4.55,4.7,4.57,988067505174843837,magnífica estancia la que disfrutamos junto a unos amigos,0,0.0,Neutral
