64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,1,8.636618175827909,4.99,4.96,4.79,4.96,704803150302052240,"Sehr schönes Zimmer und modernes Bad in einem sehenswerten, historisch interessanten Wohngebiet.",1,-0.5423,Negative
70.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,1,2.5329341972975428,4.86,4.8,4.93,4.8,19976281,"Really helpful host, with plenty of tips on how best to explore Berlin depending on what you are interested in. The apartment itself was a perfect location to use as a base to explore, and full of everything you could need for a city break. 100% would rebook if I was coming back to Berlin!!",1,0.9358,Positive
83.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,20,100.0,0,13.253231779083176,4.48,4.42,4.7,4.35,45656534,Eine sehr schöne kleine Wohnung. Sehr zentral und somit ist vieles gut zu Fuß erreichbar. Wir waren zB zur Messe.<br/>Der Check in lief absolut reibungslos. <br/>Für einen Trip nach Berlin würde ich diese Wohnung absolut weiterempfehlen.,1,0.0,Neutral
115.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,30,80.0,0,6.188901033018674,4.92,4.83,4.84,4.78,11833825,Wonderful stay in Berlin in a brilliant apartment. Linda was so kind with offering an early check in and late check out so we didn’t have to haul our bags around with us! Great neighbourhood with lots of good cafes and restaurants with lots of local recommendations provided. Would personally recommend to friends and family.,1,0.977,Positive
240.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,60,70.0,1,1.48110149635335,4.67,4.92,4.83,4.64,29509862,Clean and in a great location!,0,0.7959,Positive
223.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,47,100.0,1,4.116733808652775,4.98,4.99,4.81,4.83,668157595596321506,"I had the pleasure of staying in this wonderful flat again. The hosts are warm, kind, and communicative and greeted me to show me the apartment. They were flexible in my arrival and checked in with me during my stay to make all was in order. The apartment is clean and comfortable and well-equipped and a great space to relax. The surrounding area is fun and full of options for eating and socializing. This is a terrific find with outstanding hosts. I will definitely be back! Many many thanks for a perfect stay,",0,0.9937,Positive
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,19,100.0,0,1.68391499939898,5.0,4.85,4.85,4.69,14872009,"Ich habe drei Monate in Rudolfs wunderschöner Wohnung leben dürfen. Sie hat einfach alles, was ich zum Wohlfühlen brauche. Eine unglaubliche Ausstattung-ich habe nichts vermisst. Die Wohnung ist in einem hervorragenden Zustand. Die Kommunikation lief optimal. Entweder per E-Mail oder über seinen Sohn, der direkter Nachbar ist. Besser geht es nicht. <br/>Die Wohnung liegt sehr ruhig und trotzdem sehr zentral. Auch das war perfekt.<br/>Ich habe mich rundum wohlgefühlt. Ein super Aufenthalt. Vielen Dank.",1,-0.743,Negative
127.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,47,99.0,0,6.070945397633094,4.68,4.69,4.71,4.5,909297144466256193,"Ottima posizione, fermata del bus e tram appena sotto l’appartamento, a pochi metri. Stazione di Ostkreuz facilmente raggiungibile a piedi, dintorni ben forniti in termini di ristoranti e supermercati.",1,0.0,Neutral
135.0,2,0.0,1.5,2.0,38,100.0,1,1.9797577383607676,4.81,4.9,4.91,4.6,257373,"Great location, quiet and beautiful apartment, responsive host—highly recommend this place.",1,0.9186,Positive
18.0,3,1.0,0.0,3.0,16,100.0,0,3.883872869353541,4.36,4.26,4.57,4.4,265402,Thanks it was really nice to stay in your hostel overnight.,1,0.7178,Positive
70.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,12.86304269897694,4.93,4.97,4.89,4.88,18014187,"A clean, spacious apartment in easy reach of both airports and the city centre using public transport. There were useful supplies in the apartment such as tea and coffee. Our hosts were very helpful and gave us plenty of useful local information regarding eating out, shopping and transport. A great stay thankyou. We would certainly book again if we return to Berlin.",1,0.9643,Positive
130.0,4,1.0,1.0,5.0,22,99.0,0,3.852471644606984,4.74,4.59,4.8,4.62,25936092,"Had an great stay at this place! There’s lots to do in the area and is on a quiet street. There’s an amazing beer garden right around the corner. Highly recommend staying here, check in was very easy and had everything we needed.",1,0.9346,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,33,100.0,0,5.107101435550384,5.0,5.0,4.95,4.98,622168719435608384,"Appartement chaleureux, calme et avec beaucoup de charme . La chambre est bien isolée du séjour. Le propriétaire laisse à disposition un peu d'épicerie de base et c'est très appréciable.",1,0.0,Neutral
58.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,38,100.0,0,3.77601590718314,4.73,4.67,4.73,4.63,29721020,Pascal was extremely helpful and the location was really good- close to public transport and supermarket,1,0.742,Positive
125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,1,4.126131739074772,4.93,4.92,4.87,4.82,26768369,"This bijoux gem of a flat is in the sweet spot of Berlin's hip – but also edgy – Wrangelkiez. Situated right next to Görlitzer Park, it's a haunt for all sorts of people who tolerate each other with typical Berlin broad-mindedness. Right opposite is a supermarket that's open till midnight; the U-Bahn and above-mentioned park are a hop and a skip away. The flat itself is pure delight; exactly the ind of quiet and peaceful haven I was looking for. Thanks to Doro and her co-host Ádám for providing this very special home from home!",1,0.9533,Positive
282.0,9,4.0,2.0,6.0,65,100.0,1,13.891160580271904,4.81,4.67,4.72,4.66,21431134,Super Wohnung und netter Gastgeber!,0,0.636,Positive
126.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,30,97.0,0,1.730125064149603,4.85,4.85,4.91,4.74,16340532,"This is a great flat to explore Berlin from. <br/>Stefan is a great host - excellent communications. He met us at the flat (and was flexible about check in).<br/>The flat is on the third floor (with a lift up). It overlooks a local park with tree cover for the balcony making it very private (and quiet apart from when Euro 2024 games were on!). It was very comfy. Great bed, lots of storage, good kitchen facilities, washing, TV and cable. The neighbourhood has great facilities. <br/>Public transport links are excellent (U-Bahn 5 mins away, tram and bus stops close by). It is very close to the Berlin Wall Museum and felt like a 20-30 min walk to lots of places Museum Island, Alexanderplatz.<br/>We would rebook if visiting Berlin again. Highly recommended.",1,0.9863,Positive
119.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,52,100.0,0,5.951534937224258,4.81,4.63,4.65,4.74,18671787,Wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt und würden jederzeit wiederkommen. Lieben Dank!,1,0.0,Neutral
158.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,1,1.6592287277224604,4.88,4.88,4.92,4.66,39685590,Die Unterkunft war sehr schön und makellos sauber. Die Kommunikation war sehr gut und zuvorkommend. Auf alle Fragen wurde prompt eingegangen und es wurde jederzeit bereitwillig geholfen. Lieben Dank!,1,-0.9508,Negative
