64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,9,100.0,0,5.590761474513242,4.82,4.73,4.55,4.55,27475554,"Super appartement, assez bien placé et avec des hôtes très sympathiques ! Je recommande !",1,0.6688,Positive
217.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,40,100.0,0,2.349563010575205,4.69,4.64,4.51,4.51,876843275486604030,"Great apartment, very cozy, clean, and with new furniture and appliances. The location is also quite central and very close to U-Bahn and bus stations. The only thing more difficult was to climb the stairs up to the 4th floor, since the building is a little bit old and it doesn't have elevators, but it wasn't something that bothered us so much.<br/>I will definitely consider it as an option again when I go back to Berlin! :)",0,0.9235,Positive
