125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,28,89.0,0,4.708464321329413,4.63,4.72,4.82,4.6,771649554456588856,"Great location, but the place wasn't clean (hairs in the bed and bathroom, grime in the shower), some things didn't work or needed maintenance. Not worth the price.",1,-0.6794,Negative
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,7,100.0,0,2.5744803132282104,5.0,5.0,5.0,4.83,10509987,"Great comfortable apartment that is centrally located to several transport options, bars and restaurants. <br/>The apartment is very clean and tidy along with been comfortable for extended stays.",1,0.9286,Positive
81.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,18,100.0,0,9.11075125640042,4.62,4.67,4.87,4.6,39662142,"Super Lage, sichere Parkmöglichkeit mit Tor, funktionierende Kommunikation und problemloser Check-in sowie Check-out. Leider hatte es sehr unangenehm im Badezimmer gerochen, weshalb wir sehr lange lüften mussten.",1,0.5994,Positive
77.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,1,7.5529282602310275,4.81,4.84,4.6,4.69,1346757,"The flat was perfect, quiet, well-equipped, tidy and very well located. I spent a nice time there. And Francesco is a very nice and helpful person. I warmly recommend it !",1,0.9598,Positive
128.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,16,100.0,0,1.492104347039923,4.76,4.84,4.78,4.63,1209226619882895927,"Alles sehr gut! <br/>Die Tram hält direkt vor dem Haus, super Anbindung!<br/>Ich kann mir nur vorstellen, dass es innerhalb des Hauses zu den Nachbarzimmern und zum Flur hellhörig ist. Ich hatte Glück und ruhige Nachbarn!<br/>Danke für die gute Unterkunft!!",1,0.0,Neutral
86.0,3,1.0,1.5,2.0,29,100.0,1,2.9693421403362885,4.97,4.96,4.86,4.93,964592244627521671,Looked just like the photos. Big space. Antonia was really friendly. We had a great time,1,0.8777,Positive
163.0,5,2.0,2.0,4.0,43,100.0,1,12.405262432642507,4.89,4.87,4.9,4.68,613399384611323325,"This house is an absolute gem and a rare find. We were thrilled to discover that both the S-bahn and U-bahn stations are just steps away from the doorstep. The house was fully equipped with everything we needed, including cooking oil, detergents, a complete set of appliances, exactly as advertised on Airbnb. The host, Hadrian, was incredibly helpful and very responsive. He took the time to explain everything clearly, which made us feel right at home. Be sure to follow his recommendations, as they were spot-on and very valuable. This place made our trip to Berlin unforgettable, and we highly recommend it. Thanks for hosting us, Hadrian!",0,0.9699,Positive
71.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,41,100.0,1,6.647912601140404,4.83,4.96,4.77,4.88,3521467,"War ein toller Aufenthalt bei Horst und Sabine.<br/>Alles da was man braucht, die Gastgeber sind sehr zuvorkommend und hilfreich, die Lage ist gut :)",1,-0.8658,Negative
85.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,0,12.454267915590298,4.63,4.74,4.75,4.63,37346562,"Mukava asunto, tilavampi kuin miltä kuvissa ehkä näyttää. Rauhallinen.<br/>Isäntä vastasi heti ja ohjeet sisäänkirjautumiseen olivat todella selkeät.<br/>Suihku oli ainoa hankala asia, veden lämpötila vaihtelee jääkylmästä lämpimään :) Mutta sen kanssakin pärjäsi kyllä.",1,0.4588,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,21,100.0,0,2.7828835656922952,4.83,4.44,4.89,4.72,29921767,"Lilli was a Great Host, always available for questions. She really made us feel at home in her great apartment. Would always recommend her flat. Hope to be back one day :) thanks Lilli!",1,0.9628,Positive
165.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,59,100.0,1,22.45533785958252,4.87,4.75,4.96,4.77,6733959,"It’s easy to find, the family are very friendly, the accommodation is very spacious and comfortable with a good kitchen and sitting room, and access to a lovely garden. Distance from the centre isn’t really a problem as we just bought Berlin travel cards and there is an easy train ride to the centre and I doubt you would have such a nice accommodation in the centre.  In fact it is a very good location if you also visit Potsdam, as we did.  The shower room / toilet is a wet room and a bit small unlike the rest of the apartment but that is the only criticism, it wouldn’t put us off staying again.",1,0.7212,Positive
86.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,52,100.0,1,14.876814991832068,4.83,4.74,4.5,4.65,53080223,Eine gemütliche ruhige Wohnung mit allem drum und dran. Man kommt von dort aus überall hin. Einkaufsmöglichkeiten und Restaurants zu Fuß erreichbar. Die Kommunikation mit Villiam war von Anfang an sehr freundlich und angenehm. Wir kommen wieder…,1,-0.8316,Negative
125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,1,5.797357429941702,4.64,4.58,4.9,4.49,29172413,"Sebastian’s space is very spacious and chic with the interior and choice of upcycling furniture - very modern and appealing. Facilities are perfect and very well equipped as described. The ceiling is so high to give extra sense of space. Easily the largest studio flat we have ever stayed in. The area of the Friedrichschain is also very nice to be in, with a lot of amazing vegan restaurants, cosy coffee shops, interesting stores and funky street art. Sebastian is also a great host who also responds very quickly for our enquiries. The issue with the huge glass door facing the bathroom pointed out by some previous visitors was well fixed with the huge matte sheet now cover the entire glasses area. You can indeed hear the street quite well but the area was usually very quiet during our stay in late hours so it wasn’t a big issue. I think the only downside in the flat was that the shower has no curtain and therefore it is near inevitable to get the floor of the bathroom very wet when you have a shower. But overall it is an amazing place to stay at Berlin. Highly recommended.",1,0.9602,Positive
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,0,1.0729754843495325,4.68,4.68,4.76,4.56,997794778761639504,"Excellent room and place to stay. Host was kind, responsive, and helpful.",1,0.9081,Positive
105.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,3.7258936986049145,4.91,4.83,4.82,4.8,19781919,"Great apartment, location and host",1,0.6249,Positive
179.0,5,1.0,1.0,2.0,63,100.0,0,8.789833766943357,4.78,4.9,4.66,4.52,243057,"Dieses Apartment sehr zu empfehlen. Es bietet ausreichend Platz und man hat alles drin, was man braucht. Wer die Stadt erkunden will, ist hier richtig. Man ist ziemlich schnell mittendrin, man kann aber auch hier oben im Dachgeschoss eine himmlische Ruhe genießen.<br/>Die Gastgeber sind toll. Es wird sich erkundigt, ob alles gut ist oder ob irgendetwas benötigt wird ohne dabei aufdringlich zu sein. <br/>Wir würden dieses Apartment jederzeit wieder buchen.",1,-0.5994,Negative
46.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,1,5.75802240655025,4.97,4.97,4.97,4.95,1330245826917155485,Sono stato ospite di Hannes per un brevissimo soggiorno. <br/>Hannes é stato estremamente gentile e disponibile ed é venuto incontro alle mie esigenze.<br/>La casa era molto bella e pulita.,1,0.0,Neutral
60.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,19,100.0,1,7.382266945119255,4.88,4.93,4.65,4.9,1153584,Ulrikes Wohnung ist sehr hell und gemütlich und mit allem ausgestattet. Ulrike achtet auch auf kleine Annehmlichkeiten und wickelt den Aufenthalt unkompliziert ab. Wir kommen gerne wieder.,1,-0.6808,Negative
298.0,8,2.0,1.0,2.0,45,100.0,1,1.6592287277224604,4.93,4.91,4.91,4.75,39529039,Thank you ! It was perfect for our stay (3 young couples for 3 days). We had an amazing time in Berlin !,0,0.8906,Positive
313.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,49,100.0,1,2.887058665280372,4.89,4.76,4.83,4.71,721749273851792523,"Vi modtog fin beskrivelse omkring ankomst til lejlighed inden vores ankomst, hvilket var super fint da vi ankom sent.<br/>Kunne parkere lige udenfor lejligheden<br/>Lejlighed er ren og pæn, kunne dog ikke få TV til at virke, men da vi ikke var særlig meget i lejlighed så gjorde der ikke noget.<br/>Billederne på væggene er måske lidt til den voksne side, når man har barn med 🙂<br/>Tak for lån af lejligheden 🌺",0,0.5994,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,0,2.530695813645333,4.95,4.86,4.86,4.92,52811490,"Cem’s flat is conveniently located near one of the coolest areas in Berlin with several restaurants and clubs nearby, along with other activities. However it is also, wonderfully quiet in the flat, even as it is near Berlin’s famed nightlife. The flat itself was clean and comfortable, the bedroom is quite spacious and is great for the traveler who wants merely to sleep there and spend the rest of the time exploring or who wants to spend a rainy day inside. There is an organic supermarket directly across the street, cafe’s nearby if you want to grab breakfast (the supermarket also has bread, coffee and other breakfast stuff) as well as a subway station just a stone’s throw from the flat. Cem, the host, is cool and thoughtful. He was a wonderful host. I’d eagerly stay in this flat again and highly recommend it to anyone visiting Berlin.",1,0.9819,Positive
54.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,15.507270682054347,4.96,4.99,4.64,4.92,17955217,Very comfortable and nice place,1,0.7688,Positive
261.0,8,3.0,1.0,5.0,42,100.0,0,3.206802294887829,4.74,4.81,4.8,4.57,11746050,"Die Wohnung hat für uns keine Wünsche offen gelassen: Toll eingerichtet und alles da, was wir brauchten. Super Anbindung zu den öffentlichen Verkehrsmitteln. In der Gegend selbst sind außerdem einige Restaurants und Bars. Wir würden die Wohnung mit mehreren Personen jederzeit wieder buchen!",0,-0.636,Negative
191.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,45,100.0,1,1.6592287277224604,4.94,4.94,4.95,4.78,39605196,"Piso con buena ubicación , limpio, zona tranquila familiar, con todas las comodidades necesarias para una estancia confortable.  Hubo detalles que sumaron a dicha estancia. Volveríamos sin dudarlo.",1,-0.5574,Negative
55.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,0,5.122220052379539,4.75,4.65,4.67,4.62,33180505,"Eine kleine Wohnung, die perfekt für einen kurzen Aufenthalt in Berlin ist. Sehr gute Lage, mit dem ÖV sehr schnell im Zentrum.",1,-0.5994,Negative
90.0,2,1.0,1.0,4.0,25,0.0,0,8.1485590660558,4.55,4.75,4.77,4.64,13669202,Would stay here again. Very accessible with the train right there on the block. Was nice to relax after a Long day.,1,0.4215,Positive
208.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,0,2.314204124898978,4.62,4.68,4.87,4.55,1273930,"Schöne Unterkunft in einer ruhigen Straße im Gewusel von Berlin-Mitte. Viele Stationen des öffentlichen Nahverkehrs in 5-10 Minuten zu erreichen. Schöne, alte Schwimmhalle direkt in der Parallelstraße. Großer REWE um die Ecke.<br/>Vom großen Wohnzimmer mit Küche geht es an der Eingangstür vorbei durch einen Flur ins Schlafzimmer mit Doppelbett. Von dort zu der langestreckten Dachterrasse.<br/>Die Wohnung ist geschmackvoll und für eine Ferienunterkunft hochwertig ausgestattet.<br/>Im Hof hat das (überteuerte) Restaurant Katz Orange seine Plätze im Freien. Trotzdem war es nachts immer ruhig.",1,-0.8316,Negative
142.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,29,100.0,1,3.3189723905154875,4.91,4.93,4.86,4.71,19654788,"Wow. Truly Excellent. This stay was even better than we expected and we were already expecting great given the reviews. There were just so many little details that were appreciated especially given that we were staying for 9 nights. <br/>The only thing important to note is that there is no freezer (only refrigerator) and while there is a washer, there is no dryer (there is a drying rack to use). <br/>Highlights: <br/>- The kitchen was incredibly well stocked - even had a blender and a pizza cutter. The little details matter! There were so many different cups, bowls, and plates, and many pots and pans to cook with. <br/>- There was exercise equipment (small weights + an ab roller) which was a nice touch<br/>- The bathroom was stocked with little extras like cotton swabs and tampons<br/>- The noise from the road was no issue at all - the apartment is so well insulated.<br/>- The bed was SO COMFORTABLE. We were a little concerned about how thin the padding was, but it was perhaps the most comfortable bed we've slept on. <br/>- Martin was incredibly accommodating and fast to answer any texts. A+++ host. <br/>Truly a perfect stay. Highly recommend!",1,0.9849,Positive
95.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,3.1833669854420146,4.83,4.85,4.8,4.58,34018418,"alles super, gerne wieder",1,0.5994,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,49,100.0,1,10.214455278207549,4.91,4.89,4.86,4.92,40463858,"Yvonne er en yderst tiltalende person 😊<br/>Meget imødekommende, venlig, smilende, oplysende og snaksalig. Vi følte os meget velkommen 😊<br/>Vil helt sikkert bo hos Yvonne igen, hvis vi skal til Berlin 🇩🇪😊",1,0.0,Neutral
