246.0,6,3.0,2.0,6.0,28,100.0,1,3.5801127537135016,4.92,4.81,4.83,4.74,42037351,"This apartment is definitely worth a visit, it's great value for money, secure, clean, modern and has all the amenities that a family would need. The location is ideal, a coffee shop across the road, a Lidl for shopping and local bars and restaurants very nearby, not to mention the apartment overlooks the River Spree too, there is a balcony too. The pictures probably don't do it justice, in real time, its an amazing space to stay. If I have another opportunity to visit Berlin I would stay again.<br/>Thankyou Remi for allowing us to stay and for being an amazing host.<br/>Kind regards <br/>Jat",0,0.9782,Positive
