161.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,44,100.0,1,3.550833267755717,4.84,4.83,4.66,4.49,33803119,"Patrick is a great host! Since the first contact, everything was done quickly and easy, including check in and check out. The apartment is amazing, huge and stylish. Loved the kitchen and the living room facing a lovely terrace and the building playground, which is very convenient if you are traveling with kids. The location is perfect, walking distance from subway and tram stations, trendy restaurants and very close to Prenzlauer Berg neighborhood. Would certainly go back and recommend!",0,0.9834,Positive
