156.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,0,2.2531285722967658,4.58,4.63,4.73,4.47,49844243,Great place to stay during the cooler months. If you plan on staying during the warmer months make sure to call ahead and request a fan. The rooms can get quite hot so you don’t want to miss out on a fan. The staff were very kind and check in was easy. Would stay again 😁,1,0.9569,Positive
