91.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,35,94.0,0,5.406665066832042,4.59,4.7,4.81,4.41,2850204,"Die Wohnung ist klein aber sehr gemütlich, wir haben uns sicher gefühlt in der Umgebung und konnten uns nach dem Erkunden der Stadt gemütlich in der Wohnung zurückziehen. Fulvia ist sehr gastfreundlich, sie war immer ansprechbar und sobald eine Kleinigkeit nicht in Ordnung war, suchte sie sofort nach einer Lösung. Berlin ist eine super tolle Stadt, und dank den nahegelegenen Busstationen (nur 3 Minuten laufen) oder sogar gleich S-Bahn Station (ca. 10 Min) war Fluvias Wohnung perfekt für einen Berlin-City-Trip! Herzlichen-Dank!",1,-0.9229,Negative
141.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,43,94.0,0,7.131273504704622,4.74,4.82,4.79,4.62,49070135,"Wonderful Apartment, clean, cuozy and quiet. <br/>Also the little Drinks & snacks were cute. Only think Is that the cromecast for tv just works for android Not ios products, but Nothing dramatic! <br/>Anytime again!",1,0.6988,Positive
51.0,6,2.0,2.5,2.0,32,100.0,0,5.839052951061753,4.76,4.64,4.7,4.73,1283324,"A great place to stay. Even better than the pictures.<br/>Vinci is a very friendly host.<br/>We were with 4 adults and everything we needed was in the apartment. We will highly recommend this apartment and when we come to visit Berlin again we will definitely stay overhere.",1,0.9431,Positive
107.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,33,100.0,1,2.922418995421466,4.86,4.82,4.71,4.66,16283253,"Pro: Very clean, well equipped kitchen, great location. <br/>Con: Price feels too high for a small apartment - maybe 45sqm. Dim lighting in main living room/ no proper ceiling light. Uncomfortable/ not suited for work from home. Conversation with host impersonal, zero flexibility for check-in/checkout times/ baggage drop off. Staircase and front of the building is completely run down - view directly into other people’s windows. Would not really recommend, despite the pro’s mentioned above.",1,0.6052,Positive
110.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,2.990654359868407,4.86,4.94,4.94,4.78,1165227481829107407,Alojamiento agradable y acogedor. La ciudad es fría y lluviosa pero el  apartamento tiene muy buena temperatura. Fácil de encontrar y saliendo de la estacion del metro. El anfitrión muy amable y me brinda sugerencias de servicios que necesitaba a mi llegada. Totalmente recomendable.,1,0.0,Neutral
