125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,12,100.0,0,2.4669884223479746,4.56,4.33,4.97,4.36,5747908,"Really lovely apartment centrally located in Mitta, many places are easily walkable but there is also a subway stop about 10 seconds outside the front door so it was very convenient.<br/>The apartment itself was lovely in an old building, with beautiful high ceilings and windows, two bedrooms and one bathroom. The shower/ bath doesn't have a shower curtain so take care not to make the whole room wet. Separate kitchen and large living room also made it very livable and spacious for a several day stay.",1,0.9593,Positive
160.0,6,3.0,2.0,3.0,46,100.0,1,5.93071369172379,4.79,4.75,4.74,4.67,685944,Een mooi rustig plekje in een drukke stad. Het is precies zoals de foto's en de communicatie was heel vriendelijk en snel. We hebben genoten van de ruimte en het rustige plekje met eigen tuintje.,0,0.0,Neutral
138.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,53,99.0,1,3.856396243645088,4.82,4.81,4.72,4.62,30515744,Excelente localização,1,0.0,Neutral
159.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,1,4.8995744932669005,4.91,4.91,4.89,4.66,1169504897983255007,"We enjoyed every moment of our stay! Vincent, our amazing host, was always available and incredibly nice and helpful. The apartment is beautiful, spacious, clean and meticulously maintained - perfect for our family of four. Every detail showed exceptional care, from high-quality kitchenware to comfortable bedding and thoughtful amenities. It was clear that our host had thought of everything to help us feel at home. we were sad to leave...<br/>We fell in love with Pankow as well, the neighborhood is full of gardens, diverse restaurants, and charming small shops, with convenient U + S train access. <br/>We highly recommend Vincent's apartment and Vincent as a host and can't wait to return!<br/>Pro tip: Don't miss Floraburger and the cozy Blaffke cafe. We even discovered the Pankow Botanical Gardens (Botanical Volkspark Pankow Blankenfelde) just 30 minutes away - a beautiful spot with open fields, trees and flowers, ponds, a greenhouse, and even a small reindeer farm!",1,0.9946,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,0,3.4759573347351385,4.87,4.8,5.0,4.8,9655481,"Nina is amazing host: everything was perfect from the beginning till the end of our vacation: the flat is amazing and stylish with good atmosphere to relax, very big and comfy for 2 persons, kitchen is well equiped, the bed is super comfy for 2 persons, good sound system and projector to watch movies. The location is just perfect to live Berlinish life-style (lots of parks and TempelHof Field iun 5 minutes by bicycle, food market and big supermarket in 10 minutes, all of the sight-seengs and clubs - in 20 munites by bicycle or metro station or 10 minutes by taxi (just in 1 munute from home).<br/>But just to beware you- the house and yard is VERY quite all the time, you need to sort well with it. And the furniture and styling require you to be very careful.<br/>Will bу glad to come back some day.<br/>Good luck!<br/>",1,0.9876,Positive
125.0,1,1.0,1.0,2.0,12,100.0,0,8.25707005621841,4.73,4.82,4.64,4.55,3070635,"The apartment is perfectly situated, Schöneberg is really nice neighborhood, many shops, bars, restaurants, etc... everything that a man needs both for longer and shorter stay. The public transportation is great, M46 goes every 10mins to Zoo, very close is U-Bahn too and man can reach many things also by foot. Perfect! <br/>The flat itself is small but wonderful and fully equipped for longer and shorter stay, internet is excellent, everything is perfectly suitable for 2 people. We lived there for three months and we really felt ourselves at home. Perfect! <br/>Manuel and Polina were excellent hosts. Very very nice and pleasant people, always ready to help, but also to have fun. We recommend them as hosts and their place for everyone who want to have a pleasant and carefree stay in Berlin.<br/>We are definitely coming again! <br/>Thanks Manuel and Polina, see you soon!",1,0.9975,Positive
94.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,95.0,1,4.513443039819955,4.61,4.31,4.75,4.57,53961297,"Gut: ruhig, schöner Wohnbereich, gute Matratzen, gute Anbindung zu Bus und U-Bahn.<br/>Schlecht: sehr unsauber im Bad und der Küche, übel verschmutzte Schwämme, Toilette wenig sauber, Haare lagen bei Check-in im Bad.",1,-0.7906,Negative
118.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,18,93.0,0,2.3052158670724103,4.8,4.79,4.77,4.7,16922853,"Nous avons passé un très agréable séjour avec mes amis, Je recommande cet appartement !",1,0.0,Neutral
120.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,64,100.0,1,16.967110280315712,4.9,4.9,4.7,4.76,20711836,"Birgit und Henry sind herzliche Gastgeber und äußerst hilfsbereit. Da ich mit Kindern/Jugendlichen von 15 und 12 Jahren unterwegs war, war es eine tolle Alternative zum Getummel mitten in Berlin. Obwohl die Unterkunft etwas peripher liegt, war das Stadtzentrum mit der S-Bahn gut erreichbar und der 10-minütige Fußweg zur S-Bahn gut machbar. Für eine Besichtigung Berlins mit Kindern ist die Unterkunft sehr empfehlenswert, v.a. auch wegen des Gartens (mit Tischtennismöglichkeit) und Pool. Herzlichen Dank an Birgit und Henry für die freundliche Bewirtung!!!",1,-0.9783,Negative
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,2.380705735722119,4.95,4.96,4.91,4.86,7571301,"Perfect location, clean, and quiet. It was exactly what I needed for a quick trip in Berlin and Tiziana was so welcoming and nice.",1,0.9217,Positive
50.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,1,6.491214895364259,4.93,4.97,4.92,4.9,37847588,"Gabriele und Günter sind sehr freundliche und hilfsbereite Gastgeber. Das oberste Stockwerk hatte ich für mich alleine, ein gemütliches und ruhiges Zimmer mit dazugehörigem Fernsehzimmer und eigenem Bad - alles blitzsauber! In der Küche darf alles mitbenutzt werden. Vielen Dank ihr beiden für die schöne Zeit in Tempelhof 😊",1,-0.8268,Negative
95.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,39,100.0,1,9.009752009078182,4.83,4.81,4.84,4.7,936101374934313281,"Super Unterkunft, tolle Lage und sehr gute Kommunikation 👍🏻",1,0.5994,Positive
296.0,6,3.0,2.0,5.0,29,100.0,1,6.97282351203588,4.92,4.9,4.55,4.7,14335678,That was a nice stay!,0,0.4753,Positive
140.0,8,1.0,1.0,5.0,30,99.0,0,1.664793290368075,4.58,4.61,4.73,4.48,791921785972465654,Alles Gut!,0,0.0,Neutral
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,1,4.412429612327707,4.99,5.0,4.9,4.95,1037272492882778968,"Wir waren zu viert und haben uns in der wunderschönen, stilvoll eingerichteten Wohnung von Stefano von Anfang an super wohl gefühlt. <br/>Die Kommunikation war extrem freundlich und Stefano und Marco einfach klasse Gastgeber. Die Lage ist toll – mitten im belebten Friedrichshain – trotzdem kommt man in einer ruhige Wohnung, in der man sich nach erlebnisreichen Tagen ausruhen kann. Gute Restaurants direkt in der Nähe, Shopping und Bars, es ist der perfekt Ort für ein paar Tage Berlin. Wir können die Wohnung absolut empfehlen!! Vielen Dank für alles!!",1,-0.8741,Negative
79.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,31,100.0,0,3.5040001369002214,4.75,4.94,4.77,4.7,52652716,"The check-in and out was extremely easy and there is everything you need. A very clean, cute place with a modern vibe. There is a big supermarket around and very easy to get to the metro or tram, so the location is great. The only thing I would note is that the apartment doesn't get that much sunlight, but that was not an issue for me, as I didn't need to stay inside during the day. Would recommend.",1,0.9028,Positive
64.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,20,100.0,0,4.993723336849769,4.7,4.57,4.44,4.66,17250059,"Enkel, ordentlig og lige til at gå til. Værterne var søde og de svarede hurtigt, så kommunikationen var i top",1,0.2023,Positive
