77.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,0,5.708776942253548,4.75,4.74,4.75,4.68,990440585775151125,"Kay hat uns super herzlich empfangen und die Wohnung gezeigt, eine wirklich schöne Unterkunft, sehr gemütlich eingerichtet! Wir waren gerne Gast und haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt.",1,0.0,Neutral
115.0,5,1.0,1.0,3.0,49,100.0,1,5.871560485458869,4.83,4.77,4.61,4.65,48181556,"Great stay with Gini and Eric, the flat was so nice and in a great location. It was easy to find, and the instructions to get in were easy to understand. Was overall a great stay, they were really nice and responsive, and the location was great.",1,0.9863,Positive
130.0,5,0.0,1.0,5.0,18,93.0,0,2.347776216465179,4.74,4.63,4.73,4.62,17413995,"The apartment was spacious and comfortable. The space worked well for our family of 5. We were there for New Year’s Eve and were able to see fireworks over the rooftops. We felt very safe and there were amazing places to eat around the neighbourhood (definitely try Burgermeister). The hosts were awesome with great local tips, prompt responses and detailed information on getting to the apartment from Berlin. Would definitely recommend.",1,0.9771,Positive
55.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,98.0,1,11.93427080906913,4.7,4.81,4.55,4.72,28064699,"Soggiorno complessivamente positivo. La nostra camera era abbastanza spaziosa, pulita e luminosa.  Il bagno al nostro arrivo era pulito, poi purtroppo meno ma a causa dell'elevato numero di persone che ne hanno usufruito. Un bagno per quattro stanze purtroppo non è molto comodo se la mattina bisogna uscire presto ma non si trattava di un'informazione celata poiché la presenza di un solo bagno era riportata nell'annuncio. <br/>La posizione dell'alloggio un po' decentrata poiché si trovava a mezz'ora di mezzi dal centro, anche se collegata bene essendo a tre minuti a piedi dal S-Bhan.",1,-0.5574,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,16,100.0,0,3.66652692477493,4.91,4.93,4.82,4.77,49788211,"I just stayed at Sharna´s apartment and it is amazing. Bright, large, lots of sunlight, tranquil and cozy vibe and energy. Her cat Velvet was so lovely! The bed is comfortable, the bathroom is luxurious. The neighbourhood is one of Berlins best, I think! And you are in the middle of Kreuzberg Neucoln and F´hain, three very cool places to hang, and very close to the U-bahn.  Sharnas place made me feel very safe (and her cat helped me too :)) and Sharna is amazing! This was truly the best place to stay ever, I would love to come back!",1,0.9925,Positive
90.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,90.0,1,1.3926964619905164,4.95,4.86,4.98,4.87,33573236,房间很好看，Elliot把公寓打理得很干净整洁，他也很友好。如果来柏林旅行非常推荐在这里停留,1,0.0,Neutral
75.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,19,83.0,0,9.461298881110482,4.93,4.72,4.87,4.87,35154766,"Danke an Cyrus für diese tolle Woche in seiner schönen Wohnung! Wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt, die Wohnung ist wirklich schön und stilvoll eingerichtet. Die Lage mit verschieden U-Bahnlinien ist hervorragend, die Gegend gemütlich mit guten Restaurants und allem, was man braucht.<br/>Der Empfang war herzlich und die Kommunikation unkompliziert und höflich. Wir kommen gerne wieder und freuen uns bereits darauf!<br/>Ein grosses Danke und herzliche Grüsse<br/>Marianne und Milan",1,-0.9715,Negative
56.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,0,7.6135852635330785,4.67,4.74,4.33,4.67,1359501934085453976,"Stayed at Daniels AirBnB for 4 nights. very quiet location, plenty of parking and a nice 15minute level stroll to the local stores, restaurants and Tram stop. <br/>Everything was as described in the listing and very happy with the deal. There is a huge bath too for a nice soak after a busy day sight seeing.<br/>We would recommend for anyone staying away from the city center hustle and bustle.",1,0.9041,Positive
105.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,12.530294378984047,4.9,4.86,4.87,4.72,50516166,"I was met by someone who came to the subway station on arrival so checkin was seamless. The huge apartment came with everything you would expect and more. There were plenty of supplies and kitchen equipment and everything functional. Thanks to Nadja the communication was prompt and reliable.  Absolutely wonderful area near Deutsche Oper and Charlottenburg Palace. Shops, restaurants, supermarket and subway only a block away! I plan to return!",1,0.7831,Positive
