115.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,1,3.478761427822,4.86,4.92,4.94,4.58,26616955,"Really glad we chose this place for our stay in Berlin. As others have said, the location is excellent and close to so many food places. The inner courtyard is really peaceful and quiet. Andreas was very communicative and helpful throughout our stay; I especially appreciated his list of recommended restaurants in the guestbook!",1,0.9597,Positive
40.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,0,4.397184687831313,4.72,4.81,4.5,4.71,30230330,"Cosy, clean and modern. The neighberhood is calm ans close to many supermarkets and specially to Berlin center. Kristina is very reactive in communication and she will answer all your questions. A remarkable host.",1,0.8225,Positive
163.0,3,1.0,1.0,3.0,20,100.0,1,2.846343242425512,4.84,4.97,4.97,4.74,17220997,"Das Apartment war wunderbar. Wir hatten alles was wir brauchten und die Lage ist einfach perfekt. Wir haben uns dort sehr wohl gefühlt, was auch an der freundlichen Begrüßung und dem netten Umgang mit unserem Gastgeber lag. Ich komme gerne wieder dort hin. ",1,-0.8807,Negative
354.0,6,1.0,1.0,3.0,23,88.0,0,9.772280703785706,4.56,4.67,4.56,4.33,1084607050986372394,"Tolle Unterkunft, die wir mit drei Jugendlichen für den Besuch des Lollapalooza Festivals für drei Nächte gebucht hatten.<br/>Liegt am Ende einer Sackgasse und ist sehr ruhig. U-Bahn Haltestelle direkt nebenan. Keine 5 Minuten bis man aus der Wohnung in der U-Bahn sitzt.<br/>Die Bad Situation ist aufgrund gefangener Räume (Zugang von zwei Schlafräumen) ungewohnt, lässt sich aber einfach regeln und hat in der Praxis zu keinerlei Problemen geführt.<br/>Gerne in Zukunft wieder, wenn es kalt und grau ist, damit auch die Sauna in eine Nutzung kommt.",0,-0.8689,Negative
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,0,3.30740998707393,4.96,4.88,4.79,4.75,6418929,Appartement très bien situé près de Mauerpark. Nombreuses aires de jeux aux alentours pour les enfants.<br/>Les stations de métro sont proches (moins de 10 min à pied).<br/>Le logement est idéal pour les familles avec de nombreux jeux pour les enfants. Il est très spacieux et confortable.,1,0.0,Neutral
68.0,4,2.0,1.0,6.0,47,100.0,1,4.1789972800781685,4.59,4.64,4.79,4.58,255722,Appartamento bello e pulito. Wolfram gentilissimo e sempre disponibile per qualsiasi cosa. Posizione ottima.,0,0.0,Neutral
85.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,0,6.932803465474853,4.72,4.68,4.84,4.58,26383628,"Appartement parfait pour 3 personnes. Emplacement idéal pour visiter le centre de Berlin et alentours . Min et Seb sont des hôtes réactifs, arrangeants  et disponibles. Ils m’ont adressé en amont toutes les informations pour arriver à l’appartement de l’aéroport et les différents points de visites. L’endroit est calme à 200 m du métro . Top !",1,0.2714,Positive
60.0,3,1.0,1.0,4.0,25,100.0,0,21.36842021343181,4.94,4.95,4.66,4.8,22924396,"Nette und ruhig gelegene Unterkunft in fußläufiger Nähe zur S Bahn Haltestelle Köpenick. Ich war zwar nur für einen kurzen Aufenthalt zu Gast bei Ralf, würde es aber auch für einen zukünftigen längeren Aufenthalt auf jeden Fall in Betracht ziehen. Kommunikation im Vorfeld funktionierte wunderbar, Inserat und Fotos vermitteln einen sehr guten Eindruck von der Unterkunft. Ich kann sie nur empfehlen :)",1,-0.2263,Negative
142.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,49,91.0,0,6.115210424417201,4.74,4.85,4.76,4.47,32539441,Great place!,1,0.6588,Positive
84.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,52,100.0,1,3.3219101132328723,4.81,4.81,4.9,4.73,1238867,"Great spot, very cute inside with plenty of space. There were great restaurants near by and close to transit for hopping around!",1,0.915,Positive
92.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,0,2.7850220743469896,4.82,4.83,4.89,4.68,249419,"We spent 5 beautiful days in Berlin staying at ""Au-studio-berlin"" and think it is perfect to explore Berlin. The whole flat is very inspiring and even without meeting Frank in person we think (know) that he must be a welcoming person. At least we felt welcome from the first second. The living/show room is very inspiring and we loved the every detail especially the couch. The bench in front of the window is very popular and we started our days sitting on it having the first coffee of the day. You can feel Franks creative spirit  everywhere in the flat. The kitchen is equipped with the things you really need and has the ambience you wish for when staying in a creative city and are looking for anything but ""the normal"". <br/><br/>The flat is situated at ""Prenzlauer Berg"" where it is quiet and laid back. From there you are everywhere within minutes. In 3 minutes walking distance there is the ""Helmholzplatz"" with cafés and restaurants. Our favourites have been ""Goldhahn and Sampson"" a must for every foodie to see. They have a good wine selection, a super nice selection of all kinds of food related books and we also had a very good cake there as well. Next to it there is ""Café Liebling"" which is perfect for sitting in the sun and having a drink. We enjoyed staying in an area where people from Berlin actually live. Not far from the flat is a bicycle store (Wheels of steel) where you can rent a bike and much more you don't need to explore Berlin. Anyway you will travel slow since every 2 minutes you will stop for an interesting café, shop or house. Sundays the flee market at the ""Mauerpark"" is a must as well. <br/><br/>What can I say more? Thank you Frank!",1,0.9953,Positive
194.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,45,85.0,0,1.5095289909770313,4.7,4.83,4.93,4.5,45475523,"A very simple process, good location and clean.",1,0.7063,Positive
