138.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,56,100.0,1,2.8661586391717453,4.91,4.92,4.9,4.79,1946067,"El apartamento de Axel y Anne es muy comodo, acogedor y muy tranquilo. <br/>Hemos tenido todo lo que necesitabamos. Muy buena comunicacion y establecimientos de todo tipo cercanos. <br/>Los anfitriones son ademas muy hospitalarios, amables y comunicativos. Muy recomendable este apartamento.<br/>Rafel y Puri",1,0.0,Neutral
139.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,1,3.5852919241394265,4.61,4.65,4.56,4.53,969200,"HIghly recommended!!! We (2 adults+ 1 child) spend there 3 nights and enjoyed some intensive sightseeing. The apartment is convenient, cute and cosy. It has all you need on a perfect family city break. It is also perfectly located for anyone, who wants to park outside the umweltzone, but still enjoy a fast and convenient connection to the city centre and Berlin's main attractions. It's very close to the S-bahn and there is a super nearby. Only 2 minor inconveniences: it's close to the street, so it can get a bit noisy on weekday mornings  plus the bathroom floor tends to get wet while the shower is being used.  ",1,0.9713,Positive
