77.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,0,6.266793012378933,4.7,4.65,4.53,4.7,6264703,"We had a wonderful stay at David's apartment! It was clean, well stocked and beautiful. It was also close to many shops and restaurants, and only a short walk to the bus to get into the city center. David was incredibly kind and well organized when we met him, even supplying us with a booklet he'd made all about things to do in Berlin! Would definitely recommend staying here!",1,0.9728,Positive
