89.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,1,2.217878053387896,4.84,4.68,4.97,4.77,1306679,"Katjas apartment was great! Great location, spacious, with a balcony and a bathtub. Fantastic! Ant the check in and check out worked without complications. I would stay there anyday aigain! Thank you Katja!",1,0.9474,Positive
131.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,36,100.0,1,4.248347186024305,4.63,4.75,4.72,4.5,13507504,"The apartment is fine, not thát expensive and has everything you need. <br/>It’s definitely nót cozy, furniture and space are very bland. Communication was pretty impersonal with a list of things I couldn’t do straight away in my inbox, which did not feel very welcoming.<br/>Neighbourhood is ok, it’s not the most lively part of FH. <br/>If you’re looking cheaper place to sleep for a few night and just want to spend time in Berlin it’s fine.",1,0.8042,Positive
20.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,19,93.0,0,4.065511825937199,4.54,4.48,4.42,4.61,41392394,"Most excellent and one of the best experiences. All staff, especially Chris, extended themselves and provided superior service. Public transit was perfect to travel to many destinations. Market on the block was delicious and many options. Locals were friendly. This stay was far above and beyond my expectations. Any questions or needs were met immediately. The support and kindness I received made this a place to return to and tell everyone to book. Breakfast buffet offered a variety and great start to the day. Rooms were clean and actually quiet so one could rest. Brochures available provided maps that helped and attractions to visit. Staff made recommendations and really made me feel like a guest of value. Thank you everyone!",1,0.9914,Positive
