117.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,0,12.029488099220984,4.67,4.6,4.81,4.4,42606303,Location is awesome! Very close to the U-bahn and lots of restaurants and bakeries nearby. Quiet neighborhood,1,0.6588,Positive
68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,13,87.0,0,7.867349248126775,4.54,4.66,4.52,4.53,3970161,"Very comfortable bed, not too far from the train. It is a cool place behind the building so no people walking around. Comfortable, only stayed two nights. I would stay here again :)",1,0.8529,Positive
187.0,6,3.0,1.0,3.0,30,96.0,0,2.555916049459229,4.33,4.19,4.83,4.38,1188507107579542864,"Stor, hyggelig leilighet. Rent, gode senger. Ganske sentralt beliggende, med offentlig transport rett utenfor døren.  Det er ganske mye støy fra gaten men det var ikke et problem for oss. Kjøkkenet er lite men har det du trenger for å lage litt mat. Mange spisesteder i nærheten.  Hyggelig og rask kommunikasjon med verten, hun var behjelpelig når nettet ikke virket. Fikset et nytt og lot oss få  sen utsjekk som kompensasjon. Takk for oss:)",0,-0.4019,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,100.0,0,12.901074216761966,4.92,4.7,4.89,4.92,24227976,"Toms was very kind to let us in a little earlier due to our traveling schedule, very nice place, cozy and functional.",1,0.7774,Positive
189.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,88.0,1,3.7686977209241928,4.93,4.94,4.98,4.89,574525872513367612,"If you are searching for a beautiful and functional home away from home, you have found it! Easy to walk to places of sightseeing, different options of public traffic are close. Right by the apartment there are a couple of restaurants, drugstore, Lidl-market and a great coffee shop. The apartment is spotles, has everything you need and is really quiet. We were travelling with a toddler, and this apartment is maybe better for a couple that enjoys pretty interior, a nice balcony and a warm bath. But with a bit of creativity a small family can work it out too.",1,0.945,Positive
68.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,0,19.49595006982221,4.57,4.46,4.58,4.58,23782669,Für uns war es perfekt. Wir waren zu 4. Würden wieder kommen.,1,-0.5994,Negative
187.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,30,100.0,1,6.8648640773871445,4.91,4.88,4.62,4.75,14930230,"We had a fabulous stay here and will definitely return next time we're in Berlin. The apartment is very-well located close to bus stops, with the U Bahn 10 mins walk away and just 4 stops from Kurfürstendamm.  Plenty of local bars, restaurants and a big supermarket within a short walk. The apartment was spacious, very well-equipped (especially with the traveller in mind, like loads of USB/C and laptop charging points), spotlessly clean and exactly as shown in the photos. The courtyard is a great spot to relax and means that the bedrooms were very quiet at night. Stephan and his team were incredibly welcoming and reactive. Simply a great place to stay!",0,0.9741,Positive
218.0,6,3.0,2.0,6.0,36,100.0,1,3.003280992717941,4.82,4.78,4.83,4.62,14649703,Beautiful and cool place. Good space. Clean. Comfortable beds. Great location. <br/>I'm definitely staying again.,0,0.9678,Positive
89.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,21,100.0,1,2.0928328090170227,4.75,4.67,4.9,4.71,2895197,"Julia's apartment is large and lovely.   It was also perfect for my 6-week stay: I is located in a neighborhood with shops, grocery stores, restaurants, and a terrific farmer's market on Saturdays.   I found the people in the neighborhood and shops to be friendly and helpful.   Transportation was also very easy into the city center, which, in fact, is less than a 2-mile walk.<br/>During the first few weeks of my stay (August) the weather was hot and humid, but the apartment had a good cross-breeze, aided by a fan.  And, mornings and evenings on the balcony were lovely.<br/>During my stay, there was a small plumbing problem we had to deal with, and Julia was very communicative and supportive.  Ultimately, she sent professional plumbers, who arrived when indicated, and fixed the problem.  That meant a great deal to me as a foreigner with limited language skills.<br/>I would stay in Julia's apartment again!",1,0.9544,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,0,2.559692009773911,4.99,5.0,4.99,4.93,23442676,Es erwartet einen eine unglaublich schöne Wohnung im 7. Stock mitten im Herzen Berlins auf der Prachtallee Unter den Linden. Allein der Balkon - der mehr eine Terrasse ist - wäre eine eigene Bewertung wert. Stephan ist ein ebenso umsichtiger wie fürsorglicher Gastgeber - großzügig und hilfsbereit - ein wahrer Superhost. Freue mich schon auf den nächsten Aufenthalt bei ihm!,1,0.0,Neutral
186.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,1.9612069952106024,4.96,4.98,4.93,4.83,588813657940544864,Great property and very hospitable and accomodating host. Highly recommend.,1,0.7841,Positive
