297.0,4,2.0,2.0,3.0,52,100.0,0,2.0001583027406,4.94,4.94,5.0,4.81,875898662074823362,"What can we say :) we loved staying at Janina’s place in the heart of Prenzlauer Berg. Playgrounds, restaurants, shops and everything else you need at your finger tips. And the apartment itself was even better than the pictures. Clean and comfortable rooms & bathrooms. Great cosy living area and kitchen. And then the terraces - adored them and allowed for cosy warm Berlin evenings. Would definitely stay again and highly recommend",0,0.9819,Positive
