62.0,3,1.0,1.0,3.0,30,100.0,0,4.614969004067335,4.37,4.28,4.43,4.4,323259,"Good location as it's near Hermanplatz station. It's also near a lot of cheap food places and there is a supermarket right round the corner. The beds were comfortable and so was  bathroom and kitchen. The balcony was a lovely touch, but be advised- bring earplugs as the street is so loud 24/7. It's very hard to sleep through it and there is a kids nursery across the street so screaming kids from 8am. apart from that there are decent facilities and the apartment is good value for what the price is.",1,0.706,Positive
