123.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,2.036088585204626,4.88,4.86,4.98,4.79,919931,"I loved staying at Verda’s place! She is such a delightful person and I loved our chats. The flat is located in a really nice area with cute shops, coffee, restaurants, and is super walkable and right outside of a tram stop! The bed is comfy & the mood lighting in the living room creates a cozy ambience. Extra points for the flat being on the ground floor—no carrying luggage up 4 flights of stairs!",1,0.9731,Positive
