197.0,7,3.0,2.0,4.0,46,100.0,1,30.241564176287284,4.91,4.8,4.81,4.8,16889808,"Dirk and Silke's apartment is amazing, with a beautiful view of the lake. The place is very spacious and can hold a medium sized group comfortably. We were in Berlin on work, and the apartment worked out very well for us, as we could keep the team together in one place, and we had enough amenities to make the stay comfortable.",0,0.945,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,20,100.0,1,3.4592595707900773,4.81,4.79,4.84,4.73,11564181,"We had a very pleasant stay at Sophia’s Airbnb. It is located in a really nice and diverse neighbourhood and the public transport connections are perfect (you can just take a direct bus from the central station, for example).  Her dog is very sweet and the house is really clean. Also, Sophia is really helpful and the communication was perfect.",1,0.9734,Positive
