68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,1,3.592155685337136,4.91,4.77,5.0,4.77,6569098,"I recently stayed at Benjamin's place and had a fantastic experience. The floor was spotless, cozy, spacious with windows looking at the clouds. Well-equipped with everything I needed. The location is perfect—situated in a quiet neighborhood but close to shops, restaurants, and attractions. Benjamin and Susanne were an excellent host, always available to answer questions and provide helpful recommendations. I highly recommend this listing and would definitely stay here again!",1,0.9729,Positive
