76.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,1,5.339352686328167,4.8,4.87,4.74,4.63,2098124,Thanks Suites & More for hosting such cool place at short notice following a dreadful previous booking that I had to cancel after 2 nights.  <br/>Suites & More have obviously put a lot of thought and effort in the high standard decor and amenities  to make for a pleasant stay.<br/>A lucky find I would highly recommend.,1,0.8479,Positive
190.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,52,100.0,1,5.999075895235788,4.78,4.8,4.54,4.7,3242577,"Die Wohnung war super!! Kann ich jeden empfehlen. Sehr sauber und schön eingerichtet. Dazu ist die Lage super und in der Umgebung findet man Supermarkts, Restaurants und Spätis. Sebastian war freundlich verständlich und immer erreichbar. Wir würden auf jeden Fall hier wieder hin :)",0,-0.7494,Negative
85.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,22,100.0,0,8.547903865133643,4.48,4.38,4.57,4.47,7916154,"Great location, in a quite neighborhood and host provieds great instructions on how to get around Berlin. Make sure to read house rules before to avoid Sunday/holiday check in fees.",1,0.8519,Positive
151.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,52,100.0,1,8.281883245071777,4.92,4.96,4.78,4.82,5281256,"Great location for exploring Schöneberg and the adjacent neighborhoods. Walking to Mitte is even possible for walkers, but there are also good transportation options. The flat was very well appointed and lacking nothing. I would gladly stay again.",1,0.7867,Positive
