63.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,8,70.0,1,1.8338160315675325,4.91,4.89,4.89,4.68,1231041951198519238,"Mein Aufenthalt war sehr angenehm, das Zimmer ist genau richtig für eine paar Nächte in Berlin. Die Wohnung hat eine gute Lage, super angebunden und viele Möglichkeiten etwas zu unternehmen. Linda ist eine tolle Gastgeberin, ich habe mich sehr wohlgefühlt. Gerne wieder.",1,-0.5994,Negative
61.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,19,100.0,1,6.962819870095334,4.74,4.74,4.46,4.69,24196054,"Un lugar que tenía de todo para una estancia corta. <br/>Tiene buena ubicación, porque esta cerca de la estación del metro y del autobús.<br/>Nos permitió dejar el equipaje unas tres horas antes del check in.<br/>Las camas estaban muy cómodas, dormimos muy bien!!!",1,0.0,Neutral
84.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,18,88.0,1,3.2402791774170403,4.77,4.89,4.92,4.69,16183018,"A charming studio apartment that offers everything for two people to stay. The location is the highlight, at one of the cutest street crossings in kreuzberg's graefe-kiez. Well-thought, charming but functional style that makes most out of the space. Ground floor, easy access. The hosts were super friendly and fast with replies, forthcoming with time arrangement. We were 100% happy.",1,0.9807,Positive
130.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,1,2.669079881682033,4.97,4.98,4.84,4.86,26180749,"One of the best airbnbs I every visited, must be one of the few where the room is actually even better than you can tell from the pictures. Very spacious and stylish, centrally located even though the neighborhood is quiet. Denise and Jürgen are great hosts!",1,0.9098,Positive
128.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,10,95.0,1,10.379845031025411,4.83,4.79,4.87,4.81,43965848,"Location is great, quiet street but close to public transportation, and lots of restaurants. Great base to explore Berlin and beyond!",1,0.8588,Positive
114.0,4,1.0,1.5,3.0,36,100.0,0,7.167460469824902,4.57,4.66,4.8,4.56,37071847,Es war alles vorhanden was wir für unseren Kurzurlaub benötigten. Check-In und Check-Out war sehr einfach. <br/>Die sehr hohen Räume waren beeindruckend. Gute Anbindung an die S1 und nahe am Südkreuz.,1,-0.9136,Negative
129.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,13,100.0,0,12.513638550357737,4.0,4.08,4.44,4.23,1107127820534249476,温馨舒适的旅馆，考虑到它的地理位置，推荐来柏林旅游的人住在这里。入口有很多小册子可以参考，Reception在二楼，跟餐厅在一起，早餐有新鲜蔬果，面包，奶酪，咖啡，酸奶，鸡蛋。<br/>虽然楼层不高，但这里没有电梯哦（也可能是我们没找到，建议提前联系Hotel），因为周边在晚上也比较热闹，所以建议旅客自备耳塞（我们睡得很好，一部分是因为白天玩得很累了）。<br/>房间很干净，卫生每天打扫，有风扇，床品很舒服。,1,0.0,Neutral
73.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,0,16.030177477274194,4.68,4.68,4.88,4.59,1645341,"This is a great place if you are looking for a room in a house. There was a slight disconnect between the AirBnB tags for what the room had and the room description: AirBnB indicated a shared bathroom, and the description said you had your own bathroom. There are two guest rooms with a shared kitchenette and a shared bathroom, so use the AirBnB descriptors to make your decisions. Host was very responsive, helpful, and friendly. The place comes with two sweet pups that will say high to you on your way out.",1,0.9697,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,1,4.625473353777098,4.96,4.84,4.77,4.79,37831600,Elias is such a nice host.,1,0.4215,Positive
80.0,2,2.0,1.0,2.0,33,100.0,0,0.3954654437488965,4.51,4.77,4.86,4.52,2110056,"I would definitely stay here again. It is not super luxurious, but it is nicely decorated and clean and comfortable. Everything worked well. The location can't be beat - five minutes from AlexanderPlatz. Checking in was easy and the doorman was very friendly and helpful. The kitchen had all of the basics I needed for making simple meals, and there were grocery stores nearby. The host, Monica, was very friendly, and provides a nice book with local site-seeing tips.  I was there for business, and I would have liked a table to work at. There is a small folding table and a high counter with some stools, but neither one was quite the right height to comfortably sit at. I think there is room in the apartment for a small table and chairs, and that would make it more comfortable.",1,0.994,Positive
320.0,10,5.0,2.0,7.0,33,100.0,1,6.97282351203588,4.92,4.93,4.43,4.77,16183489,Klasse Badezimmer - Schönes Wohnzimmer,0,0.0,Neutral
119.0,3,1.0,1.0,3.0,46,100.0,0,2.732563225420117,4.88,4.92,4.95,4.68,1381111432966242413,"We enjoyed our stay in Marcus’ apartment. The place is quiet, spacious and comfortable. It is located in a neighborhood of tree-lined streets with plenty of cafes and bars, yet calmer than the city center. Marcus is a superb host. He is very responsive and offers great recommendations. We’re very happy we stayed here.",1,0.9753,Positive
