50.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,1,4.730934592699314,4.91,4.78,4.63,4.83,53045951,"Andrea was always responsive and friendly, always made sure we had what we needed and checked in with us, as well as giving us privacy. The location was also convenient, both peaceful and not too far from the central areas. The house was also nice, clean and cozy and we had access to all its facilities.",1,0.9595,Positive
