106.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,0.8993171774740567,4.88,4.88,4.97,4.79,28146018,The view is great. Many good places to eat nearby. Very close to public transportation. It’s a high rise building and the people I met on the elevator were friendly. Karak likes to know specific times of check in and check out. The place was very clean. The bed is a firm futon which I liked.,1,0.9571,Positive
