81.0,1,1.0,1.5,1.0,29,100.0,1,5.433221982463716,4.97,4.98,4.92,4.83,28142343,"I had a lovely stay at Madeleine's place. Upon arrival, Madeleine helped me with my bags and gave me a tour of the space. She gave me space to get accustomed and we also had some very nice conversations. The place is decorated with paintings and has a quirky flair. I enjoyed taking my food onto the balcony and enjoying the sun along with going on walks and runs within the local area, which is surrounded by many cafes and parks. Thank you Herbert and Madeleine for your kindness and hospitality!",1,0.9606,Positive
