125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,0,2.295753994769258,4.81,4.84,4.93,4.75,9839151,"Lovely, clean , stylish apartment in a nice neighborhood. Lots of cafès, restaurants, and shops nearby. Short walk to the Berlin Wall memorial; convenient to the train. Finn was friendly and helpful. Be aware there are 3 flights of stairs to walk up.",1,0.936,Positive
54.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,1,13.118271209747862,4.84,4.9,4.75,4.7,53722512,"Everything was good, corresponds to the ad. Convenient and quick access to any point in the city.",1,0.4404,Positive
171.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,3.298740908664913,4.97,4.88,4.98,4.86,49413860,We had a fantastic week in Berlin - Caroline's apartment has a central location but is also very quiet and peaceful. Perfect for exploring Berlin at your own pace. We felt right at home!,1,0.9237,Positive
57.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,22,100.0,0,13.161602658779724,4.46,4.41,4.62,4.42,18352268,"This place has great potential. It's in a nice and quiet neighborhood and the facilities here are good enough if you're looking for a budget stay.<br/>Interior and amenities are basic and simple (ie: IKEA furniture), not every room has a full-length mirror, and there's not much space in the bathroom where you can put your toiletries. So sometimes you might need to improvise a little. <br/>During my stay, one of the bathrooms wasn't ready yet so sometimes it's 4+ people sharing one bathroom, so occasionally it was a bit inconvenient. <br/>The soundproof isn't great. If someone is talking with a normal volume, whether it's in the room next to yours or in the kitchen/entrance area you will hear it. My room was No.4 and the wi-fi signal was pretty weak. But it shouldn't be a problem unless you get up as late as I did... :p<br/>If you like a family-friendly and quiet environment, this is a good choice for a short stay. Nice scenery and plenty of supermarkets, shops, and restaurants nearby. The host Frank is also very helpful and warm-hearted, this airbnb tends to attract friendly people, too. ",1,0.9863,Positive
170.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,100.0,1,6.547712743829179,4.73,4.84,4.61,4.65,28532851,Super,1,0.5994,Positive
60.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,23,100.0,0,13.286499929571272,4.44,4.38,4.63,4.43,17237876,"Really good value, the automatic check in works very well and so does the wifi in the entire place. It's located on a quiet street that still has lots of food options really close by, and the Ubahn connections are good. The room is exactly how it looks in the photos and the whole place including bathrooms and kitchen is pretty well maintained. The kitchen is great actually, there's a big fridge so you can have some of your own food. All in all I would stay here again!",1,0.9659,Positive
