25.0,7,1.0,1.0,6.0,18,93.0,0,4.132403574870102,4.51,4.55,4.61,4.58,41362381,Ich war das erste mal in einem Hostel und war sehr zufrieden. Die Mitarbeiter waren sehr freundlich und es gab immer einen Ansprechpartner. Das Zimmer war sehr sauber und man hatte ausreichend Unterstellmöglichkeiten für sein Gepäck. Immer wieder gerne :),1,-0.9274,Negative
165.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,1,3.476496254708396,4.93,4.91,4.75,4.62,817473,"First off, great host!  So accommodating and friendly!  Secondly, the view from the terrace is breathtaking.  Watching the sunrise over Görlitzer Park is something I will never forget.  What a way to experience Berlin!!  Also spent plenty of time practicing on the great e-piano in the common area (complete with really nice weighted keys!!!). So many nice details, can't list them all!!  Would rebook in a second!!!  Thanks again, Ben!!!  ",1,0.979,Positive
148.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,20,100.0,0,3.883872869353541,4.43,4.27,4.63,4.56,265354,"Insgesamt war es eine gute Übernachtungsmöglichkeit. jedoch waren die Angaben nicht besonders gut. Es wurde vorher nicht gesagt, dass man die küche nicht benutzen darf oder das man das Bettzeug gegen 5€ Pfand ausleihen muss. So Informationen wären vorher gut gewesen.",1,-0.9136,Negative
77.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,50,100.0,1,3.172543311051877,4.97,4.93,4.94,4.94,4045063,"It's not a surprise that Thor and his cool cats are super-hosts. <br/>Booking was seamless given the circumstances. We were welcomed to a last minute reservation (booked same-day) even though we had a late arrival to Berlin. <br/>The hospitality was exceptional. Thor made sure we were well hydrated and fed (either sharing his own spoils or recommending great places nearby) and made great conversation throughout our staying - educating us on the history of the area and cluing us in on what it's like to live and work in Berlin. Thor was even let us tag along to a BBQ at Tempelhof on what was an extraordinarily nice late April afternoon. <br/>The apartment itself is extremely tidy, comfortable and full of light and with an elegant Scandinavian style. The location is very convenient - right in the heart of Kreuzberg (read: loads of cafes and bars around the corner) and accessible to the big sites... just a short walk the the Jewish museum and Checkpoint Charlie and short bus ride to Brandenburg Gate / Potsdam Platz / Reichstag area. There are two cats and they are very sweet. <br/>...by far one of the best Airbnb experiences we've had. I expect to be back in Berlin for business overthe next few months and look forward to staying with the cool cats again if there's availability.",1,0.9899,Positive
194.0,5,2.0,1.5,3.0,26,100.0,1,3.829066431977836,4.77,4.83,4.84,4.64,19395636,Very nice accommodation. Very friendly host. Highly recommended,0,0.8262,Positive
54.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,1,10.817962869981072,4.9,4.87,4.72,4.79,1018824076418388455,Chambre et salle de bains très propres et situés très près d'une station de métro. Jolie vue sur le centre de Berlin.,1,0.0,Neutral
89.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,36,100.0,0,9.11699498371026,4.86,4.78,4.91,4.79,21959228,"Der Aufenthalt bei Gunnar war einwandfrei! Wir kommen definitiv wieder ☺️ Die Lage ist genial; absolut zentral und trotzdem total ruhig! <br/>Das Apartment ist mit allem ausgestattet, was man für einen Aufenthalt benötigt und noch darüber hinaus  ☺️<br/>Wirklich absolut empfehlenswert 👍🏻",1,-0.7639,Negative
70.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,1,2.5329341972975428,4.86,4.8,4.93,4.8,19976281,"Muy buena ubicación, muy limpio, buena comunicacion, y sobre todo Mucha amabilidad buen trato muy respetuoso. VALE LA PENA regresary volver a encontrar a Enrique que más Anfitrión tiene el plus de asesor y muy bien.",1,0.0,Neutral
50.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,46,100.0,1,14.174901988437009,4.94,4.85,4.86,4.92,770805100173574917,"Really lovely place to stay! Close to public transport, easy to get to from the airport and from the centre of Berlin. A great spot for the Berlin Marathon in terms of proximity/ease to get to. Laurie was friendly and relaxed and always answered any messages within a short amount of time. Would recommend!!",1,0.9677,Positive
65.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,17,90.0,1,15.89312256745698,4.9,4.86,4.9,4.83,38644776,"Ich habe mich in der Unterkunft von Peter und Julia sehr wohl gefühlt! Dort ist der Theorieteil meiner Masterarbeit entstanden, denn die Gegend regt zum Nachdenken und Arbeiten an! Die Umgebung ist so ruhig, dass man gar nicht denken könnte, dass man nur ca. 25 Minuten braucht, um ins Zentrum zu gelangen. Danke für alles!",1,-0.865,Negative
43.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,80.0,1,11.296962947257724,4.93,4.96,4.63,4.89,829356727420550161,"Markus was a great host, as interactive as you need to be. The room had all the storage and amenities I needed, and I had access to my own spacious bathroom. The location is quiet and a short walk from the tram. Be aware, however, that there are not a lot of stores within walking distance of less than 20 minutes.",1,0.6249,Positive
81.0,5,0.0,1.0,6.0,33,100.0,0,6.519360364521975,4.78,4.59,4.84,4.64,44872206,"Wir hatten eine nette Zeit in Franks kleiner, aber funktionaler Wohnung. Die Lage ist ruhig, dennoch nahe dran am belebteren Teil Friedrichshains. Es war alles wie beschrieben!",1,-0.8439,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,20,100.0,1,3.4592595707900773,4.81,4.79,4.84,4.73,11564181,"My stay at Sophia's flat was great. She made me feel more than welcome in her home and I've really enjoyed her company and her sense of humour. Sophia is very kind, helpful and easy-going. There is also an adorable dog! <br/>Perfect location in a vivid area of Kreuzberg with restaurants, cafes, shops, flea markets and a park. It's definitely a place to taste the Berlin life. The apartment corresponds with the artistic spirit of the district, with its furnishing and paintings. In the spacious and bright room with a big comfortable bed one can really relax after a long day. <br/>I would definitely like to stay there again. Thank you, Sophia, for everything and good luck!",1,0.9939,Positive
33.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,1,6.809556888557899,4.95,4.93,4.86,4.94,7806721,"Garrelt ist ein sehr freundlicher, aufgeschlossener Mensch. <br/>Ich habe Garrelt als achtsam erlebt und mich über die Ruhe in der Wohnung gefreut. <br/>Danke für den angenehmen Aufenthalt bei Dir, Garrelt!",1,-0.636,Negative
