39.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,29,98.0,0,8.981555380177845,4.9,4.9,4.76,4.93,1350042460024525816,"Lokalita byla úplně top. Pár metrů od vlaku, Kaufland hned za rohem a kavárna přes ulici. V pokoji bylo vše potřebné včetně sprchy a i ručníků. Vřele doporučuji.",1,0.2023,Positive
352.0,8,4.0,2.0,6.0,33,100.0,1,7.070529925741001,4.95,4.94,4.57,4.82,35955578,Fantastic spacious apartment perfect for family groups. We really enjoyed our stay and will come again next time we visit Berlin.,0,0.8977,Positive
95.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,1,3.907468030579391,4.72,4.83,4.9,4.6,20943832,"My husband and I had a great stay at Naomi's place when we were visiting Berlin for business. The apartment, while small, is so well designed that it feels roomy and spacious. It had everything we needed and is located extremely close to train and tram stations so getting around town was easy. The coffee shop downstairs was great too for breakfast and take-away coffee. Highly recommend it.",1,0.9488,Positive
213.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,28,98.0,1,1.0060942274458289,4.97,4.96,4.97,4.85,14191082,"Excelente departamento en una ubicación inmejorable. Si quieres estar donde todo Berlin quisiera vivir,  este es el lugar. Con mucho transporte disponible a pocos pasos, buenos restaurantes, tiendas entretenidas, y súper seguro.<br/>Yo me quedé con mi familia y el departamento era perfecto para nosotros. Las dos habitaciones están contiguas una de la otra, por lo que es más recomendable para familias que parejas de amigos. Fue muy práctico además tener un segundo baño. Nos encantó la decoración del departamento, lleno de toques personales. Además, tiene la comodidad de ser un departamento que se usa para vivir (y no solo para arrendar por Airbnb), por lo que tienes disponibles todo tipo de artículos.<br/>Definitivamente me alojaré en el mismo lugar en mi próximo viaje a Berlín.",1,0.0258,Neutral
213.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,28,98.0,1,1.0060942274458289,4.97,4.96,4.97,4.85,14191082,"This apartment is the perfect location to see all that Berlin has to offer. You can get a train from the airport. It’s right in the centre of things with shops, restaurants, bars and all the main attractions walkable yet it’s so quiet when you step behind the doors. Apartment has everything you need plus a great shower and comfy beds which is what you want after walking all day. Would recommend this as the place to stay when in Berlin.",1,0.9246,Positive
70.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,65,100.0,1,7.596185065281438,4.92,4.92,4.94,4.9,43618900,"We loved staying at Jürgen's - he was a great host who was able to accomodate us even when our travel plans made us delayed. The apartment is gorgeous, sehr schön (!), and was in a beautiful neighbourhood which had some very lovely eateries, and was close to two important u-bahnstation's that could go into town or out to the airport. <br/>Jürgen was very very communicative, he provided recommendations, clear instructions, and always responded promptly. <br/>We felt really safe in the apartment, and had a lot of privacy - locking bedroom door, and separate guest bathroom. <br/>The kitchen and living spaces are beautiful, and if we had more time we would have loved to spend an evening on the gorgeous balcony. <br/>Overall, we were really impressed. The apartment added greatly to our trip.",1,0.9919,Positive
31.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,100.0,1,12.720083248666349,4.78,4.69,4.54,4.73,24154046,"Disappointing choice. The room and washroom had no locks. Guests staying in other rooms walk-in in our bedroom at night twice, it felt very unsafe. The washroom was filled with spiders and so was the bedroom. The hosts are okay, but don’t sound very welcoming. You would definitely not feel at home.",1,0.7642,Positive
70.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,15,91.0,0,14.9082021914913,4.82,4.87,4.63,4.87,849740750539984524,"Dommage que le restaurant et les séances de méditation ne fonctionnaient pas  au mois d'août - je reviendrai volontiers quand le centre sera fonctionnel.  Notre séjour en étant paisible, et reposant, nous reviendrons, c'est sûr.",1,0.0,Neutral
