64.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,18,100.0,1,7.087720540822249,4.77,4.79,4.4,4.63,22162940,"A charming oasis in suburban Berlin, this was a well-designed and well-equipped apartment, very clean, with comfortable beds and nice sheets. Communication and check-in were easy and convenient. Thank you!",1,0.9574,Positive
216.0,2,1.0,1.5,2.0,61,100.0,1,8.126007363576498,4.92,4.76,4.95,4.84,14368620,"270-degree views over Berlin with multiple balconies allow you to re-discover this penthouse each time of the day anew. Located centrally yet calm. The living space overlooks the skyline, while the master suite towers above the quite courtyard, allowing for an undisturbed night of sleep. The architect's touch is undeniable in the details and overall feel of the décor. Easily a design home with panoramic views.",1,0.6808,Positive
84.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,5.06163943405691,4.92,4.94,4.96,4.82,344856,A great apartment in a great area. Really enjoyed my stay.,1,0.9152,Positive
126.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,33,100.0,0,1.9601764025206885,4.64,4.57,4.85,4.42,45843870,"This very well appointed and comfortable ground floor flat in Prenzlauerberg was perfectly located for exploring Berlin, particular for first time visitors like us.<br/>The hosts were very efficient and the whole stay went extremely well.",1,0.9507,Positive
114.0,2,2.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,2.244050366540111,4.84,4.64,4.96,4.79,21841981,"Lovely stay, good location, friendly communication. Wish some of the amenities were more thought out. Overall it was great.  Thank you!",1,0.9612,Positive
63.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,50,90.0,1,5.065179348883468,4.83,4.65,4.78,4.8,971741172812975026,"My friend and I had a wonderful stay with Luis!! Our flight came in late so our arrival was after the normal time period, but Luis was kind enough to stay up and wait for us! He also gave transportation recommendations which was very helpful late at night! His place was very clean and welcoming and everything was as expected, and better! Luis was very responsive and helped us with everything we needed very quickly! We loved our experience with Luis and his home and would absolutely go back in the future! Thank you so much!!",1,0.9913,Positive
137.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,1.6809549157543209,4.96,4.95,4.95,4.83,2061212,"This apartment is AMAZING. The location is second to none and easily accessible. There are so many restaurants and bars around too, including a super cute wine bar on the corner, a minute away from the apt. Kitty’s communication was great - when we return to Berlin we will definitely stay here again!",1,0.9551,Positive
160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,98.0,0,1.0407544919436775,4.54,4.66,4.77,4.45,34294913,"the host was very friendly to me, but not to a friend waiting outside the building.<br/>the shower flooded the bathroom at every locations.<br/>no airco so it was very hot in the room. to few towels. there were no shelves in the closet to put away cloths.<br/>the espresso machine was a nice touch of class",1,-0.0761,Negative
83.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,1,4.036515724941701,4.95,4.99,4.87,4.81,11847541,"Super clean and Tidy,Cozy  rooms, Great location, especially for vegans!  *There's the supermarket ""Veganz"" very close.easy to get center stations.",1,0.8999,Positive
