110.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,0,4.531250343577502,4.66,4.65,4.71,4.51,744143139305808819,"Andrej’s place was just as described, spotless and cosy. He was responsive to any questions we had and very friendly. Would recommend to a friend. :)",1,0.932,Positive
