25.0,7,1.0,1.0,6.0,18,93.0,0,4.132403574870102,4.51,4.55,4.61,4.58,41362381,Das Hostel ist gut erreichbar und man kann direkt Kreuzberg zu Fuß erkunden. Für ein Wochenende in Berlin sehr gut gelegen und günstig. Die Räumlichkeiten waren sauber und das optionale Frühstück ganz gut.,1,-0.5994,Negative
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,0,13.195904696522344,4.96,4.99,4.85,4.85,3474302,"So clean, good wifi and location. Christof and his wife are so nice and helpful. Privacy and there’s our one exit and entrance. Calm area and close to the transportation and the centre city. I really recommends that. <br/>Thank you guys 🤞🏽",1,0.9464,Positive
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,1,1.799467146129325,4.99,4.97,4.96,4.84,47025864,Dominic and Ida have been super great hosts to us! They were so kind to send us a guide of the city in advance of our arrival alongside a detailed description about all we had to know about the apartment. The place was beautiful and the location was perfect as it can be found in a very cool area of Berlin. We totally loved it and we are confident that you will too!,1,0.9856,Positive
