67.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,13,100.0,0,7.28718077221213,4.12,4.04,4.38,4.19,14411608,"Lutfis apartment is very nice and much bigger than the photos suggest. The location is great, there's a bus line going to the main train station only a 100 metres away and you can reach the subway station in less than 10 minutes on foot. There are a lot of shopping possibilities close by and some great cafes and restaurants. Lutfi is very helpful and easy to reach.<br/>I would definitely stay there again!",1,0.9668,Positive
