38.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,17.901046640562885,4.85,4.84,4.72,4.75,541157805061295727,"Astrid ist eine sehr herzliche, tolle Gastgeberin, die immer ein offenes Ohr hat und bei allem hilft. <br/>Das Apartment ist großzügig und modern und mit allem ausgestattet, was man braucht. <br/>Ich habe mich sehr wohl gefühlt und komme gern wieder.",1,-0.5994,Negative
171.0,6,3.0,2.0,4.0,31,100.0,0,23.79975396474936,5.0,5.0,4.67,5.0,24223620,"We voelden ons  direct thuis in het huis van Nina en haar gezin. Er is veel speelgoed voor de kinderen, zowel binnen als buiten en het huis is ruim en comfortabel. Het is de ideale plek om thuis te komen na een dag in de grootstad. De buurt is extreem rustig en winkels zijn er genoeg. Nina is een correcte en vriendelijke gastvrouw met wie je vlot kunt communiceren. Wij verbleven er 8 dagen en hadden een geweldige tijd. Aanrader!",0,0.0,Neutral
64.0,4,2.0,1.0,1.0,7,100.0,0,2.27965897002138,4.35,3.94,4.88,4.24,3349233,"Ines has a nice house, just around the corner of the wonderful Helmholtzplatz! A very nice area, in the middle of Prenzlauer Berg!<br/>Lots of nice little restaurants en bars...and great breakfast possibilities!<br/>If you're traveling with a child (like us), this is a nice place to stay...<br/>No five star hotel, but good vibes!<br/>Enough room, a nice little garden...and two friendly rabbits!<br/>Ines is very friendly and a fast replier. I met Ines in person when we left and she is very nice!<br/>",1,0.9845,Positive
71.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,41,100.0,1,4.4726719658390985,4.9,4.78,4.81,4.78,53870090,"Beautifully designed apartment, super comfortable bed and great amenities. <br/>The apartment is in a super convenient location located less than a 10 minute walk to the ubahn. There is so much delicious food around and the canal is also close by! Highly recommend Joscha as a host :)",1,0.9834,Positive
246.0,6,3.0,2.0,6.0,28,100.0,1,3.5801127537135016,4.92,4.81,4.83,4.74,42037351,"This apartment is excellent. Check-in was easy, it was extremely clean, excellent amenities, and a beautiful home with a lovely view from the balcony. I heartily recommend it.",0,0.9735,Positive
60.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,7.035487353652006,4.89,4.79,4.57,4.84,780984431838980312,Dietrich is a great host and has a lovely place in Berlin. We had a very comfortable stay and the location was well connected by public transport to all tourist attractions in the city.,1,0.9468,Positive
