78.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,0,8.9505494061986,4.92,4.94,4.8,4.88,4424125,"I never found a host so helpful, kind and caring during my travels but Saido has been more than a host, he has been a real friend. Since our arrival he made us feel at home by giving us information about Berlin as well as all information about his wonderful apartment that we found it clean and well furnished.<br/>We're already planning a new trip to Berlin and we hope to be Saido's guests again.<br/>Thank you,<br/>Matteo e Bruno",1,0.9847,Positive
