201.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,54,100.0,1,1.372412995603046,4.81,4.83,4.79,4.66,13760375,"Great place, nice size, had everything needed, very clean. Great local options nearby.<br/>Only issue to know is that it's not actually close to Alexanderplatz. It's two U-Bahn stops away. Location is quite good, but not walkable to Alexanderplatz, at least not in the winter.",0,0.8313,Positive
120.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,1,3.14704762756928,4.88,4.85,4.91,4.75,363454,"Great place in one of the most attractive and authentic districts in Berlin. The apartment is really pleasant and comfortable, and also extremely quiet. Within easy walking distance to loads of interesting shops, bars and restaurants. Ideal for running people, as you are literally one minute away from the canal.",1,0.9742,Positive
123.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,1,1.17460082517367,4.83,4.8,4.9,4.74,238396,Perfect location and very quiet,1,0.5719,Positive
