82.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,23,86.0,1,2.7981409191281625,4.27,4.55,4.82,3.82,33003272,Great location of shops and places to go for travel. Quiet area not filled with to many unpleasant characters apart from neighbours on a weekend throwing parties.,1,0.5719,Positive
69.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,1,6.04491222918904,4.78,4.91,4.65,4.71,8026172,Lovely apartment and just as described! Easy to check in and out of.,1,0.7901,Positive
230.0,9,2.0,1.0,4.0,58,100.0,1,4.8859624137010425,4.8,5.0,4.87,4.67,1399956391866335434,"Wonderful stay for our family of 5. The apartment was spacious, well-equipped, and in a safe, convenient location with a great park nearby. Theresa was very responsive and helpful. Just a heads-up: there's no AC, so we had to open windows at night, and our son got some mosquito bites. Still, we really enjoyed our time and would happily return!",0,0.9714,Positive
120.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,41,100.0,1,2.2896975500049277,4.88,4.97,4.88,4.82,50828115,"We had a wonderful stay at Arik’s apartment! The house is located in the Mitte district, in the center of Berlin. It is a very lively area, with several cafes and restaurants, but it is also quiet and very safe.<br/>The aspect we appreciated most is that we could reach, with a pleasant walk of about 15 minutes, the main attractions of the city, such as the Museum Island. In addition, the subway and bus are at short distance from the house, about 5 minutes walking.<br/>In the building there is a lift, which is very convenient on arrival. The apartment is large, spacious, well equipped, very comfortable, and spotless clean. <br/>We specially enjoyed the balcony with a really nice view, where we had breakfast in the morning.<br/>Check-in was easy and there was a very nice person waiting for us, despite our plane being delayed by an hour. Communication with Arik was simple and clear. Arik is a very helpful, attentive, and kind person.<br/>When we return to Berlin, we would love to stay in this lovely apartment again!",1,0.9972,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,8,100.0,0,5.099658686167063,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,36090878,We were made so welcome at this place. Loved the apartment and good communication! Thank you!,1,0.9294,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,0,6.16237661417251,4.69,4.83,4.7,4.72,1192961,"This is a great spot! Arnd is a generous host. He allowed me to borrow his bike which I highly recommend as a way to get out into the city. <br/>I came in very early and was able to store my luggage, even before I could get into the room. <br/>WiFi was strong. I was able to do some work and video call with folks in the US. <br/>I didn't even mention that you can walk to the Brandenburg Gate!",1,0.9334,Positive
125.0,1,1.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,1,1.2721418429169693,4.97,4.99,4.97,4.9,20415517,"Súper recomendado, tuve un mes muy agradable en este lugar. <br/>Lugar limpio, cómodo, linda vista al patio, fácil transporte, zona muy tranquila con muchas cafeterías,<br/>Benedikt y Edi son muy amigables y siempre pendientes de lo que necesitas.",1,0.0,Neutral
112.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,0,10.170435739382182,4.51,4.6,4.54,4.48,14574834,"Good beds and good vews, beautiful",1,0.8658,Positive
45.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,0,4.356311156013005,4.65,4.78,4.54,4.73,31092213,"Kristina es muy amable y da las instrucciones muy claras, tiene detalles lindos para los huéspedes cómo dejas dulces y galletas. Recomiendo totalmente el estadio!! Es una buena anfitriona!!",1,0.0,Neutral
112.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,53,100.0,0,3.38306385628477,4.64,4.72,4.73,4.54,53350852,"We zijn hier 5 dagen geweest met 2 kinderen van 11 en 13. Een ruim appartement met bushalte voor de deur.  De auto kan je niet gratis parkeren, handiger is om deze in een parkeergarage te plaatsen dat is goedkoper dan in de straat. Het appartement heeft een comfortabel 2 persoonsbed, de bedbanken zijn minder comfortabel deze vonden de kids te hard. De douche is wel goed. Het appartement ligt bij het gedenkmonument van de Berlijnse muur in de buurt, het is niet super centraal gelegen. Het appartement is wel vrij gehorig. Er zit een kinderopvang naast waardoor in de ochtend de bel continu gaat en kinderen worden gebracht. verder wel netjes en voldoende voorzieningen.",1,0.296,Positive
422.0,6,3.0,2.0,4.0,40,100.0,1,4.235442637482252,4.93,4.97,4.57,4.69,22077707,Perfect apartment for a weekend stay.  Lots of room and very well maintained with everything you need.  Would highly recommend for a trip to Berlin.,0,0.8354,Positive
47.0,1,1.0,1.5,2.0,12,100.0,1,18.13410719926428,4.93,4.83,4.86,4.86,1032446,"Die Gastgeber sind sehr nett. Das Zimmer entspricht der Beschreibung, es ist ruhig und ich habe sehr gut geschlafen.<br/>Ich würde jederzeit wieder dort übernachten, wenn ich nach Berlin muss.",1,-0.5994,Negative
