112.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,51,100.0,1,7.069783798568355,4.81,4.92,4.62,4.73,221015,"We stayed in this nice apartment in Berlin for 4 days and enjoyed the place very much! Arzu and Tom were very friendly and helpful both before and during our stay. Next time we go to Berlin, we would happily stay in this apartment again.",1,0.9517,Positive
142.0,4,2.0,2.0,2.0,19,100.0,1,6.608155925105233,4.83,4.94,4.85,4.76,10423394,"Fantastic apartment, beds and linens are nice, kitchen is stocked with pots, pans, silverware, nice knives, etc.   If you want to cook, after your shopping, this place has a lot of useful kitchenware to use. <br/> Neighborhood is charming, with a nice Italian and Lebanese restaurant in the same block.  Easy access to the S1 subway.  Loved the location. <br/>Jens was extremely fast in responding to questions, an excellent host.",1,0.979,Positive
54.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,11,100.0,1,5.259652982108338,4.82,4.9,4.9,4.81,2657671,"Toller Kiez und sehr netter Gastgeber. Gerne wieder, so macht Berlin Spaß!",1,0.0,Neutral
