64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,52,100.0,1,3.905291406003432,4.99,5.0,4.94,4.96,17731812,"Super nette, typisch Berliner Altbau Zimmer mit sehr schönen persönlichen Akzenten. Habe mich gleich wie zuhause gefüllt, super entspannt und entgegenkommender Mensch!",1,0.8439,Positive
120.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,51,100.0,0,5.262245897190754,4.75,4.86,4.49,4.69,189288,"Great place as hide-out with a family with easy access to the city center of Berlin. Free parking in front of the house which is very convenient. The house is very comfortable with everything you need. Good class neighborhood which feels very safe. Neighborhood is quiet, but like said with a very good connection to the center.",1,0.9554,Positive
138.0,6,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,95.0,0,3.6065341707106313,4.63,4.47,4.82,4.51,637540704086864148,Great apartment in Berlin. Easy to find and exactly as the description,1,0.7906,Positive
138.0,5,0.0,1.0,3.0,39,100.0,1,2.860188071088701,4.95,4.96,4.94,4.84,17855915,Wonderful apartment in a great neighborhood!  Super convenient location to subway/tram/bus routes going to all parts of Berlin.  The flat was very quiet and looked even better than the photos.  Highly recommended.,1,0.9515,Positive
180.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,45,85.0,0,1.5095289909770313,4.75,4.84,4.9,4.6,45475252,"Fantastic location, within footsteps of the Sbahn and Metro station. Tons of restaurants and shoppes. I actually extended my stay here because I couldn’t imagine a better place to be located for my time exploring Mitte. The keycode makes checkin a breeze, and the bed was a dream. I would highly recommend the Nook. Thank you!",1,0.9199,Positive
18.0,3,1.0,0.0,3.0,16,100.0,0,3.883872869353541,4.36,4.26,4.57,4.4,265402,"The hostel is amazing, in a great position and full of friendly people! <br/>All the people I’ve met are very friendly and nice! <br/>They gave me a lot of tips about good and cheap food, monument and also different things to visit to see Berlin from another angle. <br/>All the best vibes from this Hostel! <br/>I recommend that to everyone, even just to go there and have a beer, since it’s open 22 hours every day! <br/>If I will come back in Berlin, I will definitely book a bed at the Sunflower hostel!!!!",1,0.9846,Positive
