125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,1,6.3796568015063695,4.85,4.9,4.68,4.77,6658190,Sören is a great host and the apartment was spacious and clean. The electronic check in process was also great. Location is also extremely convenient with lots of great food and bars.,1,0.9432,Positive
289.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,39,100.0,1,2.554894585161628,4.72,4.78,4.88,4.6,12002960,"Very nice place. The apartment was well cleaned and situated in a nice neighborhood in the centre of Berlin. Perfect to spend a few days in the city. The host has always been really nice and responsive, and we really appreciated the fast communication.",0,0.9658,Positive
