197.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,45,98.0,0,7.499888635971884,4.18,4.06,4.71,4.29,1284045464464850731,schöne und saubere Unterkunft.  alles war großartig.  Wir kommen immer gerne wieder.  10/10,0,-0.5994,Negative
62.0,1,2.0,1.5,4.0,54,100.0,0,7.69016531635679,4.71,4.86,4.46,4.56,769334,"This was truely a warm welcome with open arms. Semra is a really nice host and proud owner of this lovely apartment. We were with six people traveling to Berlin to celebrate New Years and we fitted right in this apartment. It has 2 comfy double beds in different rooms and a 2 persons sleeping sofa in the livingroom. This sleeping sofa is also really comfortable because it has a real matras. The sheets were all clean and fresh. Same for the towels. <br/>The bathroom is quite small but it has a really nice rainshower inside. Another plus is that the apartment has a separate toilet. <br/>The kitchen is well equipped. You'll find here an elektric cooking plate, dishwasher, watercooker and coffeemachine.<br/>So its not only a beautiful apartment, but also very complete in what you need. Other things that might be important is that the whole apartment is clean, it smells nice and the wifi works good.<br/>The location is quite good to. Its not to close to the city centre but you can park for free in street and in 5 minutes walking you are in the subway which brings you everywere you wanne be in Berlin.<br/><br/>We really enjoyed our stay in this apartment and we would really recomment this to anyone. You wont regret!",1,0.9933,Positive
225.0,8,4.0,2.5,8.0,38,100.0,0,9.743006457829084,4.92,4.93,4.54,4.83,31303101,Richard is a star! No issues whatsoever and a brilliant place - 10/10!,0,0.4912,Positive
207.0,4,2.0,1.5,3.0,47,100.0,1,11.940515173647206,4.92,4.86,4.91,4.79,3976211,"Alles war äußerst angenehm. Vom ersten - sehr netten - Kontakt per Email und Telefon, über den Empfang vor Ort, bis hin zur Wohnung. Alles wie beschrieben - saubere, schöne, zentral gelegene Wohnung.<br/>Einfach nur PERFEKT!<br/>Wir hoffen möglichst bald wiederkommen zu dürfen.<br/>DANKE.",0,-0.636,Negative
28.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,34,100.0,0,4.316599192234629,5.0,5.0,5.0,4.6,16067603,"Christina is a friendly landlord! Smooth communication during the stay and fast response time to messages. More importantly, she replaced the equipment with a new one❤️It was a excellent stay experience! (And there’s also a big dog Balou🐶)",1,0.8772,Positive
37.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,7.258519499353832,4.89,4.92,4.8,4.89,2591901,"He pasado unos días agradables en Berlín alojada en el apartamento de Klaus. La habitación y el resto del apartamento estaba bien equipado con todo lo necesario para vivir en él. La ubicación es  buena, muy cerca del metro Frankfurter Alle y de un centro comercial. Buena relación calidad-precio.",1,0.0,Neutral
