233.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,2.942766383999945,4.92,5.0,4.91,4.74,37930085,"It was a beautiful and perfect journey, way better than we expected<br/>The apartment is so cool and elegant, modern design and perfectly clean <br/>The precision and availability of the reception is so good<br/>I recommend this to everyone who would like to spend a relaxing vacation<br/>Thank you so much for the beautiful experience!",1,0.9886,Positive
