69.0,2,1.0,1.0,3.0,42,100.0,0,1.198185745408111,4.69,4.76,4.97,4.59,21808006,"Erich’s place was in a wonderful neighborhood, and he was extremely helpful with information about what to do and how to get around. His apartment is fun and eccentric. We had a great time there.",1,0.9348,Positive
