60.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,7.035487353652006,4.89,4.79,4.57,4.84,780984431838980312,"Had a fantastic and easy stay. Really good transport links, we were able to get to all parts of Berlin really easily. Dietrich was really communicative and gave us all the info we needed for an easy check-in and check-out. Would stay here again!",1,0.939,Positive
