65.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,4.168083698931513,4.83,4.86,4.66,4.71,499353,"Karsten's place is outstanding and very stylish. The location was very good and with close links to transport, shops and restaurants. There is underground station very close to the place but if you don't mind walking you can easily get to city centre on foot. Karsten was very helpful and welcoming. Our plane was delayed by an hour which meant we arrived in Berlin quite late but the host was very understanding and came to meet us at arrival giving us tips on local amenities and local transport. I would highly recommend Karsten and his appartment, without a doubt, to anyone who wants to visit Berlin.",1,0.9725,Positive
53.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,4.795358275165721,4.73,4.57,4.86,4.75,18547011,"Die Wohnung ist sehr schön und alles war sehr unkompliziert. Die Dusche ist ein bisschen gewöhnungsbedürftig, aber auch damit kommt man zurecht. Jederzeit wieder",1,-0.9136,Negative
179.0,4,2.0,2.0,2.0,61,100.0,1,0.921623581729306,4.95,4.86,4.94,4.84,34997076,"Susan’s place was in a great location right in the middle of shopping with, Subway stations close by for touring. Susan was very helpful with making sure we found our way; helping us with train from the airport. Whoever I asked a question, she responded very quickly. <br/>The place is very big with 1 full bathroom with shower and tub (which was quite nice) and a half bath which for 4 people was great. There is a coffee shop below her apartment but she had left fresh beans in a grinder, which we really appreciated. There are large windows overlooking Main Street and also opposite side, into courtyard which provide flow through breeze. <br/>It is a lovely apartment where we would definitely stay again, if in Berlin.",0,0.9776,Positive
