208.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,0,2.314204124898978,4.62,4.68,4.87,4.55,1273930,Our group of four had a great stay! This is a fantastic location close to a tram stop and quick access to the s and u bahn. The host was very quick with responses when we had a couple of questions. The apartment overlooks the patio of a busy restaurant so there was a good amount of noise until 10pm or so but we usually went to bed late so it didn't bother us. The rooftop patio was nice but the weeds were tall so we couldn't use the grassy area.,1,0.9057,Positive
