148.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,96.0,0,17.67054712010713,4.63,4.6,4.56,4.46,933151319571395755,"Wir haben eine Nacht bei Nena Apartments verbracht und waren begeistert. Ein wunderschönes Zimmer und ein perfektes Bett mit hoch qualitativen Matratzen. Die Fenster sind dick und lassen von dem Straßenlärm nichts herein. Direkt unter den Apartments ist ein Café, wo man wunderbar frühstücken gehen kann. Wir sind begeistert und kommen unbedingt wieder!",1,-0.8172,Negative
110.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,1,1.0402259311684183,4.96,4.98,4.97,4.88,934801746069287340,"zo gastvrij, open, communicatief, op zoek naar wat wij wilden, om vervolgens leuke tips te delen, waarbij de benodigde internet informatie ook makkelijk gedeeld werd. We zijn zeker op plaatsen geweest die we anders niet gevonden hadden, dank, we komen terug 😉😂",1,-0.5994,Negative
54.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,1,8.127615937955055,4.91,4.95,4.86,4.9,22779598,We loved the room with its high ceilings and large windows. The bed was one of the best we've ever slept in. The kitchen and bathroom were well equipped and ready for us. Tina is a great and very helpful host. The location is perfect for an exploration of Berlin.,1,0.9764,Positive
108.0,5,1.0,1.0,3.0,26,100.0,0,16.3517370169754,4.63,4.49,4.63,4.49,934551564754627156,"Fint lille appartement, med alt, som man ska brugel, hvis man kommer 3-4 personer. Da vi var 2 voksne og tre børn, savnede vi en femte stol og bedre madras til de to sidste sovepladser (sovesofaen var brugbar, men ikke komfortabel).<br/>Ellers et hyggeligt sted i den vestlige del af byen, med gode offentlige transportmuligheder tæt på trods af de meget rolige omgivelser.",1,0.0,Neutral
115.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,36,100.0,0,3.458646183942568,4.73,4.82,4.78,4.55,565189560386461595,"Apartment was beautiful, easy access to pretty much everywhere in Berlin. <br/>Can recommend 👍",1,0.91,Positive
99.0,2,1.0,1.0,3.0,46,100.0,1,11.604485324856196,4.79,4.93,4.81,4.68,4462848,"The flat is very clean and stylish in a safe, quiet location but enough restaurants to cater for us with our late arrival. There were 4 of us which was fine as we used the flat as a base rather than spending a lot of time there and cooking, relaxing etc. One bedroom is off the bathroom and the lounge/kitchen is on the other side of the bathroom so you have to be careful with locking the bathroom door. Hosts were friendly, gave recommendations and answered promptly. Couldn't find the letter box to post keys back but left in flat and didn't seem to be a problem. Did allow us to have later check-out of 3pm but we decided to take our bags with us.",1,0.9253,Positive
38.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,39,90.0,0,3.8844191094294063,4.67,4.32,4.89,4.8,5768047,"Super Lage, nett eingerichtetes Zimmer. Die Wohnung ist tatsächlich sehr hellhörig, also vielleicht Ohrstöpsel dabei haben!",1,0.0,Neutral
151.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,94.0,0,3.1018817858877528,4.67,4.77,4.78,4.52,721527807549293451,"great location, great automatic check in system, overall far above my expectations for that price. great work!",1,0.9273,Positive
125.0,8,4.0,1.0,2.0,11,100.0,0,5.923252158274418,4.92,4.92,4.62,4.92,35368786,"We had an amazing time. The apartment is spacious, clean and well-placed. My children enjoyed the proximity to the park and it was easy to get around on public transportation. Would definitely recommend!",0,0.9531,Positive
52.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,26,100.0,0,13.747094209166455,4.52,4.43,4.69,4.37,20166135,Der Check-in verlief super einfach und die Unterkunft war sehr sauber. Zum kochen war auch alles vorhanden. Wir waren zufrieden.,1,-0.8316,Negative
123.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,32,100.0,0,5.086004020180417,4.79,4.88,4.78,4.75,7543419,"Martin's place was great.  It was a basement apartment which was so nice to go home to when it was 93 in Berlin, and no where had AC. It was nice and cool.  It was very spacious for our family of four.  Everyone got their own beds and no pull out sofa!  The location was great.  Very easy to get into the city.  Just down the street there were so many different places to eat and a grocery store.  Just across the street was a great little store for stuff to drink and snacks.  We had an amazing time.  Martin was very responsive and helpful.  I would definitely stay here again.",1,0.9875,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,1,9.634332522645265,4.83,4.83,4.63,4.75,885605348255126593,Der Aufenthalt bei Guido war super. Ich habe mich direkt wohl und Willkommen gefühlt. Wie in einer WG. auch die Anindung an die öffentlichen ist sehr gut. Ich komme bestimmt nochmal wieder. <br/>LG,1,-0.8316,Negative
18.0,3,1.0,0.0,3.0,16,100.0,0,3.883872869353541,4.36,4.26,4.57,4.4,265402,"Ich würde von einem Besuch eher abraten, wenn man schlafen möchte. Viel zu laut im Zimmer und unangekündigte Gäste, die Nachts vom Clubausflug ins Zimmer einreiten, als wenn sie allein wären.",1,-0.5994,Negative
80.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,44,100.0,1,7.016086714529495,4.94,4.99,4.66,4.87,30466274,Neat and clean place. Anica and Maxim were very friendly and communication was swift and smooth. Highly recommended.,1,0.9019,Positive
271.0,10,3.0,1.5,5.0,56,100.0,1,5.229990782295846,4.95,4.89,4.8,4.88,17223235,"Nous avons passé un excellent séjour dans l’appartement de Werner ! Nous y étions 4 adultes et 4 enfants de 3 à 9ans c’était parfait. L’appartement est très bien agencé, et rien n’y manque. Le petit plus : nous avons chaque jour ou nous garer juste devant. Le métro est très proche également. Werner a été très attentionné, du début jusqu’à la fin.",0,0.6114,Positive
187.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,1,1.4503062227335417,4.87,4.79,4.93,4.76,1094269515845154731,Top <br/>Séjour super,1,0.6908,Positive
53.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,4.795358275165721,4.73,4.57,4.86,4.75,18547011,"Eine ganz tolle sowie ruhige Unterkunft, wie beschrieben und super sauber. Auch der Check In war super unkompliziert, freundlicher Kontakt und Gastgeber. Ich hatte eine gute und entspannte Zeit. Jederzeit gerne wieder, ich kann die Unterkunft nur weiterempfehlen!",1,0.0,Neutral
103.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,51,100.0,1,1.8422422243016237,4.91,4.86,4.81,4.83,3974716,"Apartment was very clean with plenty of space. The kitchen had all the necessities including coffee (very important), cream and sugar!<br/>Bathroom was very large and clean with an open shower.<br/>We found the apartment got warm while we were away, but cooled down nicely once the large glass door to balcony was opened.<br/>Noise from nearby construction and trains were noticeable only when balcony door open. Much less noise in the evening. At night with balcony door closed there was no noise.<br/>Overall, we really enjoyed our stay and feel others would enjoy Hans' Spree Apartment.",1,0.943,Positive
34.0,1,0.0,1.0,2.0,13,100.0,0,12.81962201279346,4.89,4.78,5.0,4.33,43288289,Wirklich nette Vermieter! Die Wohnung ist in Steglitz gut gelegen. S-Bahn-Station ist in 10 Minuten zu erreichen; Parken kann man in der Nähe des Hauses. Einkaufsmöglichkeiten sind am Rathaus Steglitz en masse. Daher fünf Sterne von mir!,1,-0.6688,Negative
79.0,6,1.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,0,5.763131223987626,4.72,4.57,4.64,4.51,644253486578824505,"Really good experience with this flat!<br/>We were welcomed by the manager of the FEE coffee who is a friend of the owner of the flat. She was really kind and welcoming. She even offered us a coffee! <br/>The flat was clean, luminous and renovated. We were 3 students and the price was really affordable.<br/>The flat is really close to a Netto supermarket and close to the Warschauerstrasse Street, that's a good place to go out at night or to eat, only 10 minutes of walk. It's close to the Ostkreuz station too.",1,0.9688,Positive
157.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,45,100.0,0,5.245003120876255,4.77,4.72,4.68,4.61,11914556,Super,0,0.5994,Positive
107.0,6,0.0,1.0,3.0,31,100.0,1,6.4861685330092405,4.6,4.45,4.56,4.54,13812209,Its an open single room different from plan indicated,1,0.0,Neutral
180.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,45,85.0,0,1.5095289909770313,4.75,4.84,4.9,4.6,45475252,Excellent,1,0.5719,Positive
137.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,26,100.0,1,3.5275124143940824,4.87,4.93,4.89,4.65,19651064,"Wunderbares Rund um Paket! Schöne Unterkunft in ausgezeichneter Lage und guten Tipps von Martin. Insgesamt eine tolle Unterkunft, die auf unserer Liste für die nächsten Berlin Reisen stehen bleiben wird!",1,-0.855,Negative
69.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,1,6.04491222918904,4.78,4.91,4.65,4.71,8026172,"Die Unterkunft war genauso gut und schön, wie sie von Rainer beschrieben wird. Alles blitzsauber und wohnlich, man sieht wirklich vom Bett aus die Sterne über Berlin, wir fühlten uns willkommen und haben uns wie zuhause gefühlt. In Neukölln pulsiert das Leben, das Apartment liegt nur um die Ecke und ist doch ganz ruhig. Und Möglichkeiten, die eigenen Fahrräder im Hof abzustellen, gab es auch noch.",1,-0.9661,Negative
179.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,2.556972227588285,5.0,4.96,4.76,4.87,1150793679060960172,"The apartment was spotlessly clean and beautifully designed. It had air conditioning that worked perfectly and was completely silent, which we really appreciated. The blackout curtains made the room completely dark at night, ensuring a good sleep. The location was also great—just a 5-minute walk to the U-Bahn station, with a direct train to the airport, and very close to the Berlin Wall.<br/>What stood out the most was the host’s kindness. Although the apartment is on the 5th floor with no elevator, he came down to help us carry two heavy suitcases all the way up when we arrived, and again when we checked out. My mother is older, so his help really meant a lot to us. We’re very grateful for his generosity and hospitality.",1,0.9848,Positive
93.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,2.54678149398414,4.86,4.96,4.9,4.84,3187735,"Barbara is a great host with a beautiful apartment.  The space is perfect for a single traveler or a couple traveling together.  The kitchen was fully equipped and the showers were hot.  The furniture was OK - think IKEA - and could have been a little more comfy.  Note that this is a walkup so be prepared to lug your bags up a few flights of stairs.  There are lots of rules here, but we had no issue with them.  The star of this place is the neighborhood.  This is not a touristy part of town.  It is slightly off the beaten path but with public transport, shops and restaurants all near by.  You will be with locals.  There is a park across the street where children play and people walking around going about their everyday lives.  This is something you won't experience in a hotel. My wife and I highly recommend Barbara and her apartment!",1,0.8715,Positive
156.0,6,3.0,1.5,6.0,29,100.0,0,2.1703395459003763,4.65,4.53,4.8,4.52,16299803,Sehr freundlicher Gadtgeber und die Wohnung ist sehr gross. Alles ist sauber und die Lage ist super für zur Besichtigung der Stadt.,0,-0.7906,Negative
253.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,25,71.0,0,21.27868856415966,4.94,4.82,4.76,4.59,10941394,"War alles sehr schön. Werden bestimmt wieder mal mit einem Hausboot Urlaub machen. Hier ist alles drauf was man für einen Woche  Urlaub braucht. Man kann baden, angeln, grillen, chillen … und die Natur und das Wasser genießen. Alle Details auf dem Boot sind gut durchdacht schön und zweckmäßig. Wenn es Fragen oder Probleme gab wurden diese schnell und unkompliziert gelöst.",0,-0.8316,Negative
