107.0,3,0.0,1.0,3.0,18,93.0,0,2.373482401219675,4.74,4.7,4.77,4.67,17399068,"Three of my friends and I stayed at MaCha's space for a week. We couldn't have been happier with our stay, much due in part to MaCha's apartment. The space exceeded expectation, the pictures do not do it justice. All amenities were taken care of and and the wifi was strong. The street/block turned out to have some of the best restaurants and bars that we went to during our whole trip. ORA and Luzia were two of our favorites and are a stones throw away. More so, the apartment is situated in a part of Kreuzberg where everything seems to be a 20 minute walk away in either direction- super convenient! On our last day, we were running a bit behind schedule, and MaCha was able to accomidate a slightly later check out time on short notice, which was incredibly helpful. All in all, we couldn't recommend this apartment more and will be recommending to friends who are traveling to Berlin in the future.",1,0.9653,Positive
165.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,88.0,0,9.710759364025048,4.72,4.67,4.81,4.47,775746578094277651,Great,1,0.6249,Positive
82.0,6,2.0,1.0,5.0,36,100.0,1,3.791871473476199,4.83,4.85,4.72,4.62,984537669074342349,"Good apartment that looks as described, and contained the amenities listed.<br/>Excellent location with two major U stations both within a 5-10m walk, with a Lidl just a short walk up the road. <br/>The host was very quick to respond to any messages that we had.<br/>This is ideal for anyone looking for a place in Berlin that also gives you quick and easy access to most of Berlin via their excellent public transport system.<br/>I would stay there again.",0,0.9169,Positive
139.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,1,3.3244676042943366,4.95,4.92,4.91,4.79,19652167,"What a wonderful apartment. In my opinion, this is the best area of Kreuzberg, near the park by Admiralbrücke, where there are lots of great restaurants and cafes. The apartment itself is perfect for a couple, with everything you might need. We stayed there in July on a record hot day (101 degrees!) and the apartment stayed astonishingly cool -- no air conditioning needed. We couldn't believe it. Martin was super nice and accommodating. This was a stress-free, easy, and super comfortable AirBnB experience, and we would absolutely stay here again.",1,0.9871,Positive
