258.0,10,4.0,2.0,6.0,20,100.0,0,4.032760918601343,4.62,4.69,4.54,4.57,20157960,"Logement vaste et confortable, très bien équipé et situé à proximité d'une station de métro.<br/>Helga a répondu très rapidement à nos questions lorsque nous préparions notre arrivée. <br/>Tout était conforme aux indications de l'annonce. <br/>De petits soucis peuvent être soulignés : il y a effectivement quelques alarmes d'ambulances la nuit, qui peuvent perturber le sommeil de certains ; l'absence de volets occultants peut également constituer une gêne la nuit.",0,0.0,Neutral
95.0,1,1.0,1.5,1.0,14,92.0,1,2.217805555407905,4.86,4.89,4.97,4.77,1647378,Katja's Wohnung ist mindestens so schön wie auf den Bildern und super gelegen. Das helle Zimmer ist ruhig zum Innenhof gelegen und ich konnte sehr gut schlafen! Sie hat mich super freundlich empfangen und mich direkt mit hilfreichen Tipps versorgt. War sehr zufrieden und würde jederzeit wiederkommen!,1,0.6688,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,5.497490692134203,4.89,4.86,4.7,4.89,28435392,Yotam was a very nice and sweet host. <br/>Made us feel at home quite quickly and respected our privacy. His place is neat and (very!!) clean. The room was exactly what we needed for our short stay. <br/>Thank you Yotam! :),1,0.9601,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,0,5.523148636430008,4.88,4.86,4.93,4.79,21430122,"Hôte très accueillant et attentif, appartement parfait, je ne peux que recommander!",1,0.0,Neutral
114.0,6,1.0,1.0,4.0,22,99.0,0,4.269791856144701,4.74,4.65,4.5,4.68,28378483,Affordable and clean stay.,1,0.4019,Positive
45.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,0,3.899548644651016,4.74,4.68,4.68,4.58,1030060,"Nice and cozy apartment for 2 persons on amazing location. Gili was amazing host! From the apartment everything is very close, various restaurants (try Hamy or Masaniello) to the music shops as Hardwax or Space Hall (only 15 minutes by walk). We enjoyed a lot ! Also U7&U8 are on 5 minutes walk! So you are connected with everything!<br/>Apartment was clean and kitchen have everything you need for a few days stay.<br/>Little tip: if you wanna watch TV bring something on USB with you cos all programs are on German language and bring your own slippers (if you have cold feet like me :P ). Thats all. We enjoyed soo much in this apartment and we will come back for sure!",1,0.9814,Positive
141.0,5,1.0,1.0,4.0,31,100.0,0,2.0739972026259084,4.5,4.28,4.64,4.46,545659043263203170,"Super freundliche Kommunikation, tolle Lage. <br/>Vielen Dank",1,0.5994,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,16,100.0,1,4.009860827310783,4.91,4.92,4.9,4.83,16979933,Die Wohnung ist eine gute Entscheidung für einen kurzfristigen Aufenthalt in Berlin,1,-0.5994,Negative
98.0,6,3.0,1.0,3.0,20,100.0,0,5.5596434050489405,4.71,4.72,4.73,4.72,29675993,"Gute Lage,  netter Kontakt mit professionellem Vermieter, Ausstattung einfach aber voll okay, sauber und ruhig, Kinderspielgerät im Hof, super Fahrradverleih auf der anderen Seite von Schillerkiez, tolles Cafe gegenüber, und das Tempelhofer Feld nur 5 Minuten entfernt. Wir hatten eine sehr schöne Zeit!",1,0.7263,Positive
75.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,24,100.0,0,4.4202884323310805,4.3,4.36,4.58,4.4,23071933,"Es verlief alles reibungslos. Super Kommunikation. Die Wohnung war sehr sauber und liegt zentral zu Bahnhaltestellen.<br/>Bei der Wohnung handelt es sich um eine typische Altbauwohnung. Wir konnten die Küche vom Restaurant nebenan hören. Uns und unserem Baby hat es nicht gestört, um ca. 22 Uhr war alles leise.",1,-0.9136,Negative
57.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,1,14.05197618587947,4.86,4.75,4.88,4.82,880324454862645598,"Katie ist eine sehr nette Gastgeberin. Die Wohnung ist super zu erreichen. Ein schöner Balkon ist vorhanden, der zum verweilen einläd. Ich kann mich über nichts beklagen und komme liebend gerne wieder :)",1,0.4588,Positive
156.0,6,2.0,2.0,4.0,51,100.0,1,2.784593796049624,4.88,4.78,4.9,4.77,3378027,Nader is a really good host!,0,0.54,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,20,100.0,1,3.4592595707900773,4.81,4.79,4.84,4.73,11564181,"How clean and charming appartment. Sophia is a kindly host, and we d love to book a new time with her. The place is really close to many restaurants, bars, bakeries,  and shops. Free parking in the street and a court for bikes. A perfect family place near the hipster's center of berlin. Thanks Sophia for your hospitality.",1,0.9744,Positive
367.0,5,2.0,2.0,3.0,50,100.0,1,5.59894475162521,4.92,4.96,4.25,4.71,42286644,"Appartements très propres, bien équipés, bien décorés, <br/>Service de conciergerie très pratique et personnel très agréable,<br/>Quartier non central mais quelques adresses sympa autour du logement pour bruncher ! Je recommande !",0,0.0,Neutral
51.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,22,100.0,0,8.343053001773283,4.75,4.33,4.58,4.25,4662175,"Our stay at Fabio was amazing and we had an amazing experience in Berlin. <br/><br/>The Neighborhood and location:<br/>The flat is located in a quiet neighborhood and is easily accessible by both S-bahn and U-bahn (it lies between both) it takes about 5 mins to get there so it was a really great location.<br/><br/>The apartment :<br/>The apartment itself was clean and renovated as described and everything was as good as new. Everything you'll see in the pictures is pretty much everything it has.<br/><br/>The host:<br/>Fabio was the highlight of our stay there; he was extra nice, extra helpful and extra friendly. Although he was away, whenever we needed anything he was there to help..... even if you called him 3 a.m you would certainly find him and he'll be more than glad to help you. *he never sleeps and always there to help* <br/><br/>just one thing that I found annoying is that the apartment had no bell and no intercom so if you are ordering online or expecting someone, knocking is the only way and just hope you can hear it. However, since they are renovating maybe by the time you reach it'll be fixed.<br/><br/>All in all, I really recommend it for anyone staying in Berlin, short or long stay; it's suitable for everything. and the host particularly is very kind and helping. even after we've departed he still keeps in touch. I don't think you could find a better host. we Love you Fabio :*",1,0.995,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,20,99.0,0,2.1897939786653327,4.41,4.5,4.83,4.42,37113779,"Although the check-in was a bit unorthodox, the waitress at the restaurant knew what we were there for and communicated with the host effeciently. The apartment was great! It was really comfortable, and always great having a private bathroom. The location was superb with lots of places to eat, tons of public transportation options, and walkable with a nice park around the corner. Great experience!",1,0.9761,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,1,3.2316156907802984,4.91,4.85,4.95,4.79,26391120,Tanja’s apartment was perfect for our stay in Berlin. It was just as shown in the pictures and descriptions. The apartment is in a great neighborhood and is conveniently located to many train lines. We would thoroughly recommend others staying here.,1,0.8908,Positive
63.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,0.0,0,15.428400947722908,4.42,4.27,4.73,4.35,19561032,"Herbert was perfect in communicating with us, giving fast responses to our questions and being very clear when explaining the whereabouts of his place. The apartment was exactly as shown in the pictures, with the fundamental furniture in it and nothing more.",1,0.8399,Positive
77.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,51,100.0,1,32.29350043093033,4.64,4.61,4.79,4.61,30628724,"Wir hatten ein sehr schönes Wochenende in Berlin/Potsdam. Die Unterkunft ist schön gelegen, es ist ruhig. Die Beschreibung trifft es sehr gut, wir würden wiederkommen.",1,-0.8316,Negative
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,5,100.0,0,3.4367114743750014,4.5,4.17,5.0,4.33,7345847,"I had a great stay here for two weeks. The room was big, the bed was comfy, there's a balcony, couch, desk etc. You can get anywhere in Berlin from here with all sorts of transport on the doorstep. Sehr gut! ",1,0.6588,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,1,3.3839110533522265,4.76,4.57,4.71,4.72,722871,"Sehr gemütliche, ruhige Unterkunft . Klein aber fein! Wir waren zu viert bei Lasse und es hat allen gut gefallen!",1,0.0,Neutral
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,4.795405551149841,4.95,4.92,4.81,4.89,13243503,"Gorgeous, comfortable and stylish space! Alex and Danielle are exceptionally kind, responsive and welcoming. I couldn't find a single thing to fault about this place. 100% recommended to anyone looking for a memorable and chill place to stay in Berlin!",1,0.9465,Positive
84.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,5.06163943405691,4.92,4.94,4.96,4.82,344856,"Great location, super host, excellent value! Would definitely stay again.",1,0.9523,Positive
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,41,100.0,0,3.554765929712049,4.76,4.71,4.82,4.76,906944043734604206,"Das Apartment ist im Hinterhaus gelegen und dadurch recht ruhig. Wir wurden mit einem leckeren Wein und Pasta empfangen und obwohl wir erst spät abends angekommen sind, war der Check in problemlos möglich ( Schlüssel war im späti hinterlegt). Apartment war grundsätzlich gut ausgestattet. wir haben nicht gekocht, aber es war wohl alles da, was man braucht. insgesamt ein sehr gelungener Aufenthalt",1,-0.9485,Negative
119.0,6,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,80.0,1,5.419875510101854,4.86,4.9,4.92,4.7,21689254,Der Aufenthalt in der Wohnung von Fadeih war toll! Die Wohnung liegt sehr zentral und ist sehr durchdacht und stylisch eingerichtet. Der Check-in war völlig problemlos und Fadeih war für uns immer gut erreichbar.  Für einen Aufenthalt in Berlin sehr empfehlenswert.,1,-0.9508,Negative
69.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,13,100.0,0,6.7316942805850495,4.83,4.92,4.88,4.75,1142511828649197800,Wir haben dank der guten Beschreibung schnell zurechtfinden können. <br/>Wer mit schwerem Gepäck anreist braucht sich keine Sorgen machen es gibt einen großen Fahrstuhl.<br/>Schön eingerichtete Wohnung mit hohen Decken und viel Licht. <br/>Die Umgebung ist sehr ruhig und sauber man fühlt sich schnell wohl. Im Haus war es auch immer sehr ruhig.,1,-0.5994,Negative
136.0,5,2.0,1.5,3.0,55,100.0,0,1.753668621661444,4.93,4.97,4.94,4.75,648256211993106145,"Nice flat in a convenient location for good transportation links. Well equipped, quiet and comfortable. Top floor which is stated in the listing so not an issue but travel light. ! Definitely recommend.",0,0.9192,Positive
164.0,5,2.0,2.0,3.0,30,100.0,1,1.753209774100189,4.83,4.72,4.83,4.75,3188899,Unfassbare tolle Unterkunft in super zentraler Lage!!,0,0.6688,Positive
72.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,32,100.0,0,21.04669302304069,4.65,4.41,4.66,4.76,9543073,"Ich hatte zwei unkomplizierte, wohnliche und freundliche Wochen bei Beate!",1,0.0,Neutral
60.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,19,100.0,1,7.382266945119255,4.88,4.93,4.65,4.9,1153584,"Mir hat die Wohnung sehr gut gefallen. Ich hab mich sehr wohl gefühlt, ab vom Großstadtleben und doch durch wenige Minuten zu den öffentl.Verkehrsmitteln schnell in der Stadt.<br/>Nette und hilfsbereite Gastgeber, die Wohnung ist sehr schön ausgestattet und ganz in der Nähe gibt es Einkaufsmöglichkeiten und Restaurants.<br/>Ich würde jederzeit wieder dort übernachten wollen, wenn ich in Berlin wäre.",1,-0.8316,Negative
62.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,1,7.753624515540955,4.83,4.83,4.83,4.79,5536095,"Hemos estado cuatro días en Berlín, y hemos estado muy agusto en el alojamiento de Amelie, nos ha hecho fácil la llegada , porque está muy bien comunicado, el apartamento es muy agradable y limpio, con todo los servicios. Lo recomiendo totalmente.",1,0.34,Positive
171.0,7,2.0,1.0,4.0,43,100.0,0,5.310747178957121,4.76,4.64,4.75,4.67,46864073,Great spacious apartment and lovely host. Perfect for a family or group. It is on the ground floor so you can hear people walking past and coming home. The security shutter was broken which the host had let us know and was very apologetic…couldn’t be helped given it was Easter but not ideal with our children. But with that fixed…which I’m sure it will be or for a group of adults who want to enjoy this colourful neighbourhood the flat is perfect.,0,0.9436,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,1,2.865184368884553,4.75,4.78,4.84,4.71,1029535508091110733,Het hotel is centraal gelegen met veel bezienswaardigheden en restaurants op wandelafstand. De ideale locatie dus. Het was makkelijk om in te checken in het hotel en alles was netjes en in orde.,1,0.0,Neutral
197.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,1,3.58830931137498,4.92,4.86,4.87,4.77,53287157,"I had such a lovely stay! The apartment was absolutely gorgeous, spotless, and had everything I needed. The view was stunning — even better than the photos! Communication with the host was easy and smooth from start to finish, which made the whole experience feel seamless.<br/>The location couldn’t have been better. I was able to walk to so many great restaurants and cafes — such a bonus to be in a spot that’s both peaceful and close to everything.<br/>Highly recommend this place, and I’d definitely love to stay again!",1,0.991,Positive
80.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,56,100.0,1,2.2102820475445166,4.85,4.82,4.88,4.76,3904895,"We had a fantastic time in Berlin staying at Carolinas apartment. Great location, with cafes, bars & restaurants in walking distance. We walked all over the city & this area was by far the best. We even tried a raw food restaurant in the area which was incredible. For the mornings there is a Columbian coffee shop just 2 minutes walk away called Columbina! <br/>The apartment was warm & lovely. Perfect for what we needed it for & a lovely base. Very easy to find & We were met by a lady called Gabriele who was helpful & suggested some restaurants to us. All in all a great break and we definitely want to come & stay again next year. Berlin is fabulous. Thank you Carolina!!! ",1,0.9929,Positive
59.0,6,2.0,1.0,6.0,21,100.0,1,7.196537570595604,4.45,4.57,4.06,4.49,355494,"The apartment was nice, a little bit out of the center so there were a lot of insect,but we passed a great time here:)",0,0.7845,Positive
175.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,91.0,0,4.861047682375263,4.69,4.77,4.83,4.57,53744550,Perfect,1,0.5719,Positive
83.0,6,2.0,1.0,6.0,23,94.0,1,0.8141273036815293,4.68,4.58,4.93,4.68,6231989,"Excellent place to stay, walking distance from great restaurants, transport & supermarket.<br/>Place was really spacious and well equipped. Fast wifi too. Would highly recommend.",0,0.9179,Positive
