160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,98.0,0,1.0407544919436775,4.54,4.66,4.77,4.45,34294913,"Wonderful apartment, staff, and location. Highly recommend. <br/>I moved here from the US and stayed here for a few days before moving into my long term studio lease. My flight landed close to when their check out time ends (after 6pm). I was initially a little worried about check in because in the description it sounds like a like arrival is a bit difficult and I was also lugging heavy bags for the permanent move. But it was quite the opposite. Once I rang the front desk, almost immediately two guys warmly welcomed me and helped schlep everything to my apartment. <br/>The apartment itself is centrally located in Kreuzberg, extremely clean, and  modern. I had to work remotely the first day there while recovering from jetlag and it felt like a quiet escape.",1,0.9611,Positive
100.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,99.0,0,0.9354947556413724,4.69,4.47,4.87,4.68,930506346504115139,"Amazing place to stay! Robert was extremely helpful and flexible, which made our visit much more comfortable. Room was very clean and exactly like the photos.",1,0.9548,Positive
90.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,41,100.0,0,2.7178291763583413,4.7,4.64,4.71,4.61,1082639105629057783,"Nice location, good amenities.",1,0.6908,Positive
80.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,0,16.324415304843132,4.78,4.72,4.61,4.6,594008251420806587,"Danke für die tolle Unterkunft! <br/>Wir waren für das Lollapalooza in Berlin und <br/>haben uns in dem Apartment sehr wohl gefühlt. Die Lage war für den Anlass optimal. <br/>Da es eine Dachgeschoss Wohnung ist haben wir uns und muss man sich auf die „Hitze“ bei heißen Tagen einstellen. Wir sind sehr dankbar, dass Can einen Dyson Ventilator im Apartment hatte. <br/>Die Kommunikation war schnell und unkompliziert.",1,-0.9601,Negative
