214.0,9,3.0,1.0,5.0,48,100.0,0,2.4338131448817624,4.69,4.67,4.71,4.58,23290410,"Wonderful location! Very convenient to public transit, grocery stores and shops and restaurants. Comfortable for our group of 6. Loved the thoughtful touches like the restaurant and activity suggestions, and loved the décor. The apartment was very clean but did seem a bit more run down than expected (carpet was coming up and had patches in some places, the floors showed some wear and tear, the couch sagged pretty badly). It was still very comfortable, but it feels like lots of people have stayed there. Would recommend if you want a stylish, comfortable, fun apartment in a great location.",0,0.9929,Positive
