158.0,8,2.0,1.0,4.0,45,90.0,1,2.5113494269416043,4.79,4.75,4.78,4.65,665666969293201423,"We had an amazing stay in Berlin thanks to the guys! They are amazing hosts and we would return to any of their properties. We loved the amenities in the apartment like the drying rack, tea and coffee maker, and plenty of towels and hot water! Thank you thank you!",0,0.9712,Positive
54.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,20,71.0,0,3.784332524831937,4.9,4.85,4.78,4.82,27864240,The place of Madlen is very comfortable and very nice decorated. The location of the place was really close to a metro station and groceries stores. Also she was very attentive to our needs and very responsive. We really enjoy our stay.,1,0.9181,Positive
305.0,9,2.0,2.0,9.0,29,99.0,0,8.905377534529459,4.3,4.5,4.71,4.41,45854967,"Very nice spot, clean and tidy. Great access to public transport. Perfect if planning on being a tourist around the city for a few days. there is a city tax to pay when u arrive it was 54 for us and a deposited 100 euro. The deposit is returned very easily after stay when no damages. The staff in the hotel were very pleasant and helpful. great spot for a big group traveling together",0,0.9713,Positive
188.0,5,1.0,1.5,4.0,24,100.0,1,3.564773251975843,4.92,4.87,4.91,4.76,27164026,"Great place! Very clean and looked exactly like the pictures. Franz was a great host and gave very detailed, clear instructions for check-in and check-out and was always very quick to respond to messages. Would definitely stay here again!",1,0.9631,Positive
85.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,1,5.397821235794952,4.98,4.95,4.93,4.89,14318884,"This was my first experience with Airbnb and my second time in Berlin. <br/>I had a really pleasant stay at Beatrice's, her appartment is clean, lovely and so is her neighborhood (safe with many nice restaurants / cafes).<br/>The location is great and convenient as well. Furthermore, Beatrice is a great host who is always available for advice and tips about Berlin. <br/>I would definitely recommend future guests to stay at her place ! ",1,0.9812,Positive
165.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,12,100.0,0,12.441028986912096,4.27,4.1,4.41,4.39,567073865333260546,"Excelente estancia.  Precio un poco inflado por el contexto de Final de Eurocopa, pero tuvimos una grata experiencia. Flexibles en recibirnos, permitirnos hacer Check-in previo para facilitar nuestra experiencia para el día y disponibilidad de zona común fuera del horario habitual. Habitación acorde, servicios correctos, todo bien. Silencio generalizado, así que descanso garantizado también. Desayuno de calidad un poco inferior quizás, pero razonable y correcto. Los recomendaría. Gracias por su amabilidad",1,-0.4019,Negative
48.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,8.38062533349986,4.75,4.84,4.54,4.67,22318827,"mina is perfect home owner...heplful,kindly...apartment is clean,comfort...absolutly recommendation...you have to mina's home because she is very smile...",1,0.5719,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,12,100.0,0,3.581264098401229,4.53,4.95,4.63,4.53,11357981,The apartment is located in a quite area not far from tram or Sbahn.<br/>Everything you need for a pleasant stay is available in the apartment. <br/>A lovely livingroom  and a seperate sleepingroom and kitchen. <br/>It was very clean by arrival.<br/>We stay for 5 month's in the house  and we feel safe and comfortable in the area.  Not far from the apartment are shops for eveything you need.<br/>The owner is very helpfull and react very fast  to make you stay Wonderful.  ,1,0.9638,Positive
