113.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,29,100.0,1,5.790385724431946,4.71,4.64,4.75,4.54,43906621,"We had a lovely time at Penelope’s flat, which is right in the middle of Neukoln, in an ethnically diverse, lively, artistic, somewhat gritty neighborhood. The flat was comfortable, very livable. Penelope was helpful and gracious when we ran into the usual problems attendant with traveling, responding immediately. There’s a good supermarket across the canal, which itself is nice to walk along. Lots of cafes along Sonnenallee and all the baklava you could ever hope for. Excellent transit to elsewhere in the city.",1,0.9776,Positive
