85.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,1.7530389931200905,4.83,4.84,4.97,4.74,4748491,"I stayed for two weeks at Marcus' place. It is extremely well located, very central in Berlin, in a lively neighborhood. The flat can accommodate one or two people and is very quiet.",1,0.6478,Positive
140.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,1,3.645240676004832,4.95,4.86,4.88,4.67,706237,"I had family visiting for two weeks, and we rented Christian's apartment.<br/>The apartment is just as shown, It has everything a tourist will ever need: good transportation (close to tram and subway), quiet and clean building, comfortable bed, the owner thought about every little detail to make it great.<br/>I will definitely have my family stay there next time they come for a visit.",1,0.9403,Positive
115.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,22,90.0,1,10.750545351348627,4.94,4.83,4.91,4.77,28044368,"It’s a beautiful furnished and quiet apartment, clean, cosy and with all amenities you need including a laundry machine and Nespresso coffee maker. The bed is very comfortable. The apartment (1st floor) is located in a very nice area of West Berlin with a grocery store, bakery shops and restaurants just around the corner. You can easily reach two different bus lines within a 5-10 minute-walk. To go to a subway station (U1 or U3) takes about 20 minutes. We enjoyed our stay very much!",1,0.9606,Positive
151.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,94.0,0,3.1018817858877528,4.67,4.77,4.78,4.52,721527807549293451,"We had a great extended weekend in Berlin while we stayed at Numa Arc. The room was nice and tidy and the friction less check in with the code for the lock made it easy. We also used the kitchen ware for breakfast, but it is also limited to support that.<br/>Thanks for a couple of great days,<br/>Best Jonas",1,0.9224,Positive
60.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,7.035487353652006,4.89,4.79,4.57,4.84,780984431838980312,"It is one of the best-looking and most functional studio spaces. Everything was as described, and the host was super responsive. There are loads of amazing food options nearby. Walking distance to the trains was the most beneficial; you can get around Berlin using these trains. I would surely recommend this space to people looking to explore like locals. We will be back for sure the next time we are in Berlin.",1,0.9705,Positive
