120.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,1,1.62837340490416,4.82,4.87,4.84,4.73,847854968696512429,"I enjoyed staying in Tracy's place.. it's spacious with a nice view over Berlin. It is located both near to Mitte and Prenzlauer berg. A nice park around the corner. <br/>As described it is on a busy street, so bring earplugs for a peaceful night. The apartment is also bright early in the morning.. not really a place for sleeping late..<br/>Unfortunately there was a problem with the warm water supply out of Tracy's control. She tried to help but I had to shower cold. Hopefully it'll be fixed soon.<br/>I had a wonderful stay in Berlin again. This place is great for an active traveller that rises early.",1,0.9804,Positive
164.0,5,2.0,2.0,3.0,30,100.0,1,1.753209774100189,4.83,4.72,4.83,4.75,3188899,We arrived quite late in Berlin. This trip was a surprise for our father and we were delighted ! Ronald was always very Nice and waited for us to arrive. He took time to explain and advise us on our stay. The flat was absolutely beautiful and very clean. A lovely bottle was even waiting for us when we arrived. I would recommand this stay to everyone I know Who would like to discover Berlin in top conditions.,0,0.9731,Positive
