422.0,6,3.0,2.0,3.0,34,100.0,1,2.9051794007943927,4.98,4.97,4.92,4.87,24019375,"Magnus’ place is a slice of heaven! Bedrooms are both comfortable and modern. Very creative. Outdoor space is lovely on a warm day. Magnus is warm and helpful with great recommendations. He’s quick with communication, too. We enjoyed sitting around the table for morning coffee and sitting on the lounge and chairs at the end of our day. Entrance is a little tricky but we got the hang of it quickly. Highly recommend!",0,0.9546,Positive
170.0,6,2.0,1.0,6.0,54,100.0,1,13.891160580271904,4.81,4.68,4.77,4.65,22217844,"The apartment was warm, well equipped, clean and comfortable.  The location was perfect for visiting central Berlin.  Would highly recommend.",0,0.9381,Positive
