98.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,22,100.0,1,3.1634061354496827,4.83,4.82,4.8,4.56,32678196,"Havng booked the apartment on the back of the photos and reviews I was fairly confident. The accomodation was described and photographed as having a seperate bedroom area via a curtain partition plus a sofa for relaxing and a sofa bed for additional sleeping. I had requested the use of the sofa bed and was assured that the bedding would be made available. On arrival however there was no curtain to seperate the bed (as portrayed in the photos) and no sofa to use to relax (as shown on the photos) There was nowhere to sit to relax and although only two of us were using the apartment it is advertised as suitable for 4 people. There is no provision of relaxing for even two people never mind four! The sofa bed was provided with a single duvet which had clearly been taken from the double bed. The bedding on the double bed was a single duvet only. Additional duvets were available but no covers provided. The towels had holes in, no coffee, tea or mild provided. Poor experience.",1,-0.4664,Negative
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,1,5.167258880847807,4.97,4.92,4.93,4.91,9938743,"Alex and I became instant friends the moment he opened the door. You'll be hard-pressed to find a host that is kinder, friendlier, more welcoming, accommodating, engaging and relaxed.<br/>This has been a perfect AirBNB experience from beginning to end.<br/>The room is huge. The apartment is clean. The kitchen is well-equipped. The area is lovely. The building is located on a quiet street, allowing you to sleep peacefully. There are many great restaurants and bars on the street and in the wider neighbourhood, and a supermarket at a stone's throw.  The metro is also very close.<br/>I would go back to Berlin, just to see Alex again. And I would stay at his place in a heartbeat.",1,0.9874,Positive
137.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,1,3.2252377063559527,4.8,4.79,4.86,4.63,27120196,"we've had a 5 star experience all the way. the apartment is spacious and clean. the location is 5 minutes walking distance to Helmholtzplatz where we found huge variety of restaurants, Caféa etc. <br/>The hosts were super professional and helpful in all of their communication.<br/>thank you very much for having us. we'll love to come again.",1,0.9423,Positive
62.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,98.0,1,12.355880726366824,4.72,4.85,4.5,4.7,26975349,"Great place, room was perfect, only thing to complain about is no oven but overall amazing!!",1,0.8531,Positive
114.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,14,100.0,0,4.700218292856508,4.61,4.6,4.74,4.44,18473062,"The flat is charming, stylish and is perfectly located! <br/>Neta was always very fast at answering and really helpful and accomodating. <br/>The flat is pleasantly cool in the 35 degree heat outside, so we could sleep pretty well. It was very quiet and we had an awesome stay in Neukölln.",1,0.9781,Positive
97.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,60,100.0,1,5.957143631808804,4.82,4.8,4.64,4.75,772627,"This was wonderful!  A great place, great location, and Andre was so supportive and helpful.  My highest recommendation.",1,0.9591,Positive
78.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,90.0,1,11.217254094674924,4.95,4.97,4.9,4.92,6011824,"Barbara’s flat is quirky, yet very welcoming. Comfortable bed, nice shower and a really excellent breakfast. 100% recommend for a memorable stay, I’ll be back!",1,0.9465,Positive
36.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,1,20.10572353840828,4.92,4.91,4.68,4.89,13070266,"Der Aufenthalt bei Helen war super. Das Zimmer bzw. die kleine Wohnung ist sehr neuwertig und das Haus recht einfach zu finden.<br/>Sowohl die Anbindung an die Tram (62 und 63 sind weniger als 5 Minuten entfernt) als auch an die S-Bahn (zu Fuß knapp 20 Minuten, mit der Tram weniger als 10) ist toll.<br/>Obwohl noch ein anderer Gast kurz vorher in meinem Zimmer war, war alles absolut sauber und aufgeräumt. Auch das Bad und die kleine Küche sind top gepflegt und nützlich.<br/>Helen ist eine tolle Gastgeberin, bei der man sich direkt wohlfühlt. Sie hat sich prima um mich gekümmert und war jederzeit ansprechbar. <br/>Ich kann Helens kleine Wohnung absolut empfehlen und werde wiederkommen, wenn es sich einrichten lässt.",1,-0.9881,Negative
52.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,1,3.473271590604837,4.84,4.81,4.93,4.81,9689519,"Schöne, kleine Wohnung. Schnelle und gute Kommunikation mit den Vermietern. Super Lage in unmittelbarer Nähe zum ÖPNV (Bus und Ubahn).",1,0.5994,Positive
203.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,47,100.0,1,1.0082912762193283,4.91,4.93,4.95,4.72,5494100,"L’appartamento di Caroline ci è piaciuto tantissimo. A partire dalla posizione, vicina a molte attrazioni, fino alla pulizia e la comodità dell’appartamento. Viaggiavamo con una bimba piccola e c’era tutto il necessario anche per lei. Non abbiamo avuto problemi nemmeno nella comunicazione con Caroline, che è sempre stata molto disponibile e gentile. Torneremo sicuramente.",0,0.0,Neutral
37.0,2,1.0,0.5,1.0,40,100.0,1,18.61658051771348,4.76,4.38,4.78,4.84,35413889,"Die Unterkunft bietet alles was man braucht, und liegt in einer schönen idyllischen Gegend. Der Kontakt mit dem Besitzer war sehr nett und es wurde einem alles gut erklärt. Die Anbindung an die S-Bahn ist sehr praktisch und sorgt für ein problemloses Reisen in die Stadt.  <br/>Absolut empfehlenswert.",1,-0.9661,Negative
70.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,12.86304269897694,4.93,4.97,4.89,4.88,18014187,"Stayed at Patrick’s place for close to two months. Would highly recommend it to anyone looking for either short or long term stay in Berlin. The apartment is located in a quiet, but well-connected part of the city with a big shopping street just around the corner. In addition, the hosts were very friendly and welcoming too. Great experience overall!",1,0.9573,Positive
181.0,6,1.0,1.0,3.0,7,97.0,0,6.011986469810734,4.42,4.29,3.97,4.58,1379759790076809671,"Leider war das Frühstück nicht so wie erwartet, der erste Tag waren viele Sachen nicht da oder auch nicht äußerst frisch. Wir hatten das Gefühl es waren die Reste vom Vortag, die nicht richtig gelagert waren. Am zweiten Tag war es besser. <br/>Die Reinigung ist nur teilweise erfolgt.<br/>Wir waren aber zufrieden, das Preis-Leistungsverhältnis passt.",1,-0.9485,Negative
77.0,3,1.0,0.0,3.0,30,98.0,1,12.36671538964168,4.76,4.86,4.55,4.77,26950491,"Tolle Unterkunft, sehr sauber und moderne Ausstattung der Betten. Gastgeberin war zeitlich sehr flexibel bei der Anreise. Die Sbahn und Bushaltestelle sind direkt vor der Tür. Ebenfalls ein Penny und ein Edeka.",1,-0.8316,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,12,100.0,0,5.676434620648897,4.87,4.8,4.93,4.87,29435475,I am very grateful to Samuel for the amazing week-end in Berlin. The room is perfectly located.,1,0.9061,Positive
256.0,5,2.0,1.5,3.0,41,100.0,0,11.149123650324338,4.52,4.56,4.85,4.47,22183259,The region is great. Very well connected and many restaurants around.,0,0.7574,Positive
100.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,0,6.182706875220964,4.07,3.73,4.47,3.93,13486922,"Great location,  near the canal and plenty of great coffee shops. The building is humble but the apartment is very spacious and has everything you need for a short stay!",1,0.6588,Positive
100.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,15,94.0,0,5.372540090409308,4.61,4.61,4.9,4.52,1302205235491038598,"War für uns eine gute und günstige Unterkunft, um eine Woche in Berlin unser Praktikum zu erreichen.",1,-0.5994,Negative
231.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,66,93.0,1,0.5825226699456977,4.95,4.98,4.94,4.82,7831357,"Wir waren drei Tage in der Wohnung von Boian und Olga und sind sehr zufrieden! Die Wohnung ist hell, sauber und hat die optimale Grösse. Die Lage ist zudem auch ideal. Gerade beim Ausgang befindet sich eine U-Bahnstation und nicht einmal 10 Minuten entfernt die S-Bahnstation. Man kommt also sehr einfach zu den gewünschten Zielen. Die Gastgeber waren auch sehr freundlich und hilfsbereit. Wir kommen gerne wieder und können diese Wohnung nur weiterempfehlen!",1,-0.9729,Negative
100.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,1,11.636737821099295,4.66,4.8,4.82,4.47,42958725,"Es war alles bestens, super leichter Check in sehr sauberes und schönes Zimmer und der Check out war genau so entspannt. Immer wieder gerne und sehr empfehlenswert.",1,-0.5994,Negative
90.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,0,12.4068471777683,4.5,4.62,4.48,4.48,31170463,Das Studio für 1 Person sehr gut geeignet. Allerdings ist für 2 Personnen eng,1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,0,24.074227060825887,4.62,4.51,4.88,4.41,24027880,"Super Lage, wenn man in Berlin, aber im Grünen wohnen möchte: Mit der S-Bahn ist man in einer halben Stunde in Berlin-Mitte, bis zur Station sind es nur 10 Minuten Fußweg. Ebenso kurz geht man zum wunderschönen Schlachtensee, wo man spazieren gehen oder schwimmen kann; auch Wälder und die Krumme Lanke sind ganz in der Nähe. <br/>Keyhan ist eine sehr nette und bemühte Gastgeberin! <br/>Eine Souterrain-Wohnung ist in mancher Hinsicht nicht ganz so komfortabel wie  andere Wohnung, aber Keyhans Wohnung ist dennoch geräumig, praktisch und angenehm.",1,0.0,Neutral
35.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,59,100.0,0,0.7009515972590313,4.75,4.8,4.95,4.74,2543760,"Total empfehlenswert!<br/>Die Lage ist grandios, direkt am Alex. Der Empfang durch Monica/Yvonne war so herzlich, ich fühlte mich direkt super wohl.<br/>Zudem bekam ich gute Insider-Tipps.<br/>Komme sehr gerne wieder!",1,0.0,Neutral
88.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,34,100.0,1,5.207381958576114,4.86,4.8,4.66,4.77,1321763113246168815,A small but very nice and well accommodated apartment.,1,0.8012,Positive
168.0,4,3.0,1.0,3.0,17,100.0,0,6.818812919788594,4.69,4.62,4.46,4.54,11960713,"Friederike's home is located in a nice quiet and green street. The apartment is in an elegant building. We were pleased about the spaciousness of the rooms. High ceilings, big rooms. Friedrike's home is full with books and games, which contributes to the cosyness. We took care of her two kittens, they were lovely! To travel from the apartment to Potsdamer Platz takes about 40 - 45 minutes. Supermarket is only a 10 minutes walk. We had a lovely stay for a reasonable price in Friederike's fully equiped home.",0,0.9633,Positive
90.0,6,1.0,1.0,6.0,42,100.0,1,4.239551966187363,4.77,4.84,4.88,4.67,6566904,"Klasse Wohnung. Die Nähe zur Ubahn macht es ganz einfach, die Stadt zu erkunden. Um die Ecke gibt es jede Menge Restaurants und Kneipen, trotzdem ist es ruhig.",0,-0.9136,Negative
