83.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,1,3.102509371524417,4.92,4.98,4.92,4.81,18506873,"Hola! Hemos estado 6 noches en el apartamento y nos ha encantado. Muy bien ubicado, limpio y acogedor. Perfecto para dos personas. Hay un centro comercial al lado donde puedes comprar en el supermercado y para comer o cenar varios restaurantes por la zona. Justo enfrente el transporte público, que te lleva en 8min a la plaza central Alexanderplatz. Volveríamos a repetir sin dudarlo! 100% recomendable!!!",1,0.3111,Positive
112.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,1,7.03606664813505,4.84,4.94,4.63,4.75,926670,Very cute apartment that fit three comfortably. Check in was easy and Tom was very responsive and easy to communicate with via the Air bnb app. The neighborhood is very quiet and residential but there are a few good options for cafes or pubs. Tom will steer you in the right direction to those upon arrival.,1,0.9089,Positive
