64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,0,7.781452884124446,4.45,4.55,4.54,4.36,993380042593079111,"Perfekt für einen kurzen Aufenthalt in Berlin mit guter Lage& recht günstig. Man sollte allerdings Ohrstöpsel mitnehmen, da es draußen morgens lauter ist und das Hotel allgemein etwas hellhörig ist. Sonst alles supi!",1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,1,2.729951294894705,5.0,5.0,4.97,4.92,39124790,"Great apartment in a perfect location! The place was clean, comfortable, and quiet, even though it's extremely close to busy Prenzlauer Allee and an active S-Bahn stop. There is plenty to do in the neighborhood (restaurants, cafes, shops), but public transport is around the corner if you want to go anywhere else in Berlin. Highly recommended!",1,0.8962,Positive
