98.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,39,100.0,0,3.9552229880247953,4.83,4.86,4.86,4.62,1653909,"La habitación es totalmente confortable, me sentí muy cómoda, mi viaje era para un encuentro profesional y pude trabajar muy bien en la magnifica mesa.<br/>El barrio es está muy bien comunicado en una de las nuevas áreas emergentes de Berlin, llena de bares, restaurantes y gente joven, es un poco alternativo, para mí ideal.<br/>Peggy es una excelente anfitriona, me he sentido acogida, he compartido la cocina cuando la necesité y me ha ayudado con información que necesitaba sobre el transporte, volvería.",1,0.7003,Positive
60.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,18,100.0,0,10.02194221700588,4.78,4.89,4.68,4.69,321308,"Check-in über Schlüsselbox problemlos. Wir hatten keinen persönlichen Kontakt mit den Vermietern.<br/>Prei-Leistungsverhältnis in Ordnung. <br/>Wer für ein paar Tage  ein Dach über dem Kopf braucht,  mit der Möglichkeit zu kochen,  und keinen Luxus erwartet, ist mit der kleinen Wohnung gut bedient. <br/>Sehr gute Anbindung mit ÖPNV in alle Richtungen.",1,0.0,Neutral
99.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,1,6.86470173657295,4.99,5.0,4.78,4.96,978182834257135575,"I had a really good stay at Johannes studio. Everything was really functional, cosy and I didn't miss anything. The place was big, clean, beautiful, with my own privacy and a wonderful balcony.<br/>The location is amazing, with green spaces just 5 minutes away and the ubahn around the corner. Truly a real Neukölln experience.<br/>Johannes was really receptive and made sure I would have everything I needed.<br/>Thank you so much! I will definitely repeat with my girlfriend next time!",1,0.9787,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,1,3.0025374842621906,4.96,4.93,4.96,4.89,1141763933913918607,Amazing apartment. Thank you 🙏,1,0.743,Positive
97.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,60,100.0,1,5.957143631808804,4.82,4.8,4.64,4.75,772627,"Andre's place was exactly as advertised: Clean, well maintained, and well equipped. If you're planning to rely on public transit during your stay in Berlin the location is ideal, as it is a very short walk to the U7 line from there. My husband and I greatly enjoyed staying in Neukölln, with its many quality shops, cafes, restaurants, and bars nearby. Andre was an accommodating host, and was quick to respond to any questions leading up to and throughout our visit, with check-in rapidly handled by picking up keys from a nearby business. We would highly recommend staying here to others, and would happily stay here again ourselves the next time we visit.",1,0.96,Positive
210.0,12,3.0,1.0,6.0,42,100.0,1,6.346740834948324,4.77,4.79,4.75,4.75,1289303037561947058,Check In Easy. <br/>Hat alles super geklappt.<br/>Betten waren sehr bequem.,0,0.7783,Positive
