241.0,6,3.0,1.0,4.0,53,100.0,1,1.3558603428081426,4.89,4.89,4.78,4.75,13663197,"We had a wonderful stay in Berlin. The apartment was in an excellent location, very close to the amazing public transportation.  Wonderful grocery stores near by, Adli's our favorite!  We did not cook but the kitchen looked to be fully stocked. We were able to get in early, which was wonderful due to our early flight arrival. We would stay here again for sure!",0,0.9586,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,9,100.0,0,2.203592676812578,4.91,5.0,4.95,4.32,12392274,"Es war für meine 2 Nächte eine top Unterkunft. Im Dachgeschoss ist es natürlich im Sommer sehr heiß, ich konnte trotzdem gut schlafen, genauso auch ohne die Rolläden. Diese Unterkunft hat sich wie ein echtes Airbnb angefühlt, Danke dafür. Gerne wieder. :)",1,-0.6124,Negative
115.0,5,1.0,1.0,3.0,49,100.0,1,5.871560485458869,4.83,4.77,4.61,4.65,48181556,"Easy to enter<br/>Clean, large space with good kitchen. Has enough utensils to cook basic meals. <br/>Shampoo, conditioner and body wash were available. Also a washing machine and dishwasher",1,0.7003,Positive
348.0,6,3.0,2.0,6.0,46,100.0,1,1.010749324263853,4.79,4.75,4.79,4.61,26508423,"The apartment was easy to get to and it’s very close to all the attractions. Everything is walkable, supermarkets, restaurants etc etc. Only thing that isn’t mention, is the fact that there’s a gentlemen’s club downstairs. The club doesn’t close until 6am on certain days so it can be loud outside.",0,0.7783,Positive
