68.0,3,1.0,1.5,2.0,70,89.0,0,5.596124749011601,4.67,4.47,4.77,4.53,42752268,"Even though Niko was not personally there, he arranged everything perfeclty for us to stay there, even some little goodies upon arrival. You can get a lot of privacy in this room as the time you have ppl to help you out (his flatmates). The location, room, terrace and neighbourhood are just perfect ! <br/>The shower could haven been cleaner.",1,0.8122,Positive
172.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,30,100.0,1,2.086859632126843,4.87,4.87,4.94,4.71,306312,"Great apartment in a lovely location. Martina couldn’t have been anymore helpful when she welcomed us to the apartment. <br/>We stayed here as a family of 4 including a 10 month old and a 6 year old. There was toys, highchair and a few toys which made the whole experience much easier. <br/>Thanks so much for a great stay",1,0.9651,Positive
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,33,100.0,0,4.747586396749488,4.94,4.67,5.0,4.59,16752243,"Wohnung ist stilvoll eingerichtet. Die Lage direkt am Rathaus Neukoelln und den Arkaden ist überragend - man kommt mit Hilfe der öffentlichen Verkehrsmittel überall hin.<br/>Badezimmer und Küche sind sauber, der Balkon lädt zum entspannen ein.<br/>Würde ich nochmal als Unterkunft buchen!",1,-0.636,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,5,100.0,0,5.883501049418282,4.5,4.5,4.65,4.71,9484382,Ted and his flatmate Max are kind and friendly hosts. The room is suitable for young and agile people who did not mind going up and down 4 floors without a lift and who would not mind using a ladder at night to climb up and down from their bed situated approx 7 feet or more from the ground.,1,0.765,Positive
52.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,6.296102388049414,4.82,4.77,4.72,4.77,16305782,"Zentrale und kleine Unterkunft. Super Preis Leistungsverhältnis mit sehr wichtigem Parkplatz 👍🏼 <br/>Top Aufenthalt, gerne wieder☺️",1,0.5994,Positive
172.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,8,93.0,0,2.528112421649852,4.28,4.19,4.82,4.33,36339392,Es ist ein etwas anderes sehr junges Hostel im Herzen von Berlin! <br/>Wer kein großes ShiShi braucht dafür das etwas andere Flair mag und hauptsächlich zum Schlafen auf sein Zimmer geht ist hier gut aufgehoben!,1,0.0,Neutral
105.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,1,2.815230046195084,4.85,4.9,4.89,4.79,425411,"Had a wonderful stay in Belin. Appartment is in a nice, relatively quiet street, with good tram/train/metro connections to the city centre. Everything you need in one room.",1,0.8555,Positive
317.0,11,6.0,3.0,8.0,57,100.0,0,3.133544323497291,4.75,4.74,4.86,4.6,1093487777629181025,"We stayed at the L apartment for our mini team retreat and it was perfect! The location is great, the apartment itself was just what we were looking for so we are all together but we still have some privacy in our own rooms. <br/>Would definitively recommend the apartment for larger groups!",0,0.8456,Positive
