136.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,48,100.0,0,5.470581932125792,4.88,4.76,4.91,4.71,128827,Kai was amazing!! So quick and communicative. The place was beyond gorgeous and the location couldn’t have been any better! Everything you need was provided for you. Cary the cat was a great companion to have during the week as well. Would stay here again in a heartbeat!!,1,0.9588,Positive
120.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,0,11.944350643751646,3.71,3.86,4.57,3.71,1370854474649776534,"The only good thing about this place is the location. Everything else was disappointing.<br/>First, check-in was confusing. The instructions said to go to the last door on the left at the end of the corridor inside the building. In reality, you have to go through a door to an outside area, and then the apartment is on the left. Not at all clear.<br/>The shower was a mess. The shower head is broken and sprays water in every direction, making it impossible not to get soaked immediately. On top of that, the drain barely works, so water starts pooling fast and ends up flooding out of the shower area.<br/>But the worst part—and the reason for this 1-star rating—is the crib situation. Before booking, I asked the host specifically if a crib would be available. They confirmed it would be. That’s the only reason I booked. When I arrived, there was no crib. When I contacted the host, they casually told me that the apartment I booked doesn’t include one. Completely unacceptable and incredibly frustrating.",1,-0.9311,Negative
100.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,36,100.0,1,2.8844703561659584,4.87,4.86,4.8,4.67,20071024,"The place was as described, clean, easy to get into. The comforters were quite nice. Lacks sugar and laundry soap, be prepared to buy your own",1,0.8955,Positive
