125.0,1,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,0,4.16370010699668,4.28,4.6,4.66,4.37,7217439,Great stay! Miguel was very helpful. Very convenient location and lovely space,1,0.9059,Positive
210.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,24,97.0,0,16.145291925220835,4.25,4.25,4.75,4.13,844142206207730138,Wir haben die Unterkunft während einem Festival gemietet. Hatten super Verbindungen mit dem ÖV und haben uns super wohl gefühlt. <br/>Jan war ein sehr freundlicher Gastgeber und hat uns mit Infos versorgt und uns bei anderen Dingen geholfen.<br/>War ein toller Aufenthalt,1,0.4939,Positive
123.0,1,1.0,1.0,0.0,35,80.0,0,2.477862624158107,4.68,4.77,4.91,4.27,26320273,"I booked Christina's home at the last minute due to an unfortunate change of plans, and I'm so thankful I got to stay with her. Her space is peaceful and calm, has modern amenities, and is well situated in Prenzlauerberg. Christina is a wonderful host and a great communicator; for instance, when I brought up that the cushions I was sleeping on weren't comfortable for my back, Christina was super responsive and swapped them out to make it more comfortable for me. Her dog is also very friendly, and even though there's a bit less privacy in an open air loft, her home always felt calm and comfortable. It was great having a peaceful place to return to after adventuring around Berlin. Thanks again for your flexibility and kindness, Christina!",1,0.9908,Positive
122.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,96.0,0,3.128194469226722,4.61,4.66,4.86,4.54,47215807,excelente ubicación,1,0.0,Neutral
