418.0,13,6.0,2.0,6.0,42,100.0,1,6.44421921589432,4.76,4.69,4.82,4.59,9273023,We had such a wonderful family time in this apartment when we stayed here as a family for our sons wedding x it was even better than staying in an art gallery and so in keeping with the vibe of East Berlin xx André was a very kind and understanding host x we would love to stay here again and can’t rate it highly enough x,0,0.9381,Positive
422.0,6,3.0,2.0,4.0,60,100.0,1,3.559770173058828,4.94,4.96,4.93,4.77,11483775,"A lovely, quiet, comfortable apartment equipped with everything we need. We enjoyed our stay. A decent sized supermarket is a short walk away. U bahn stop is at the doorstep. Marcus is a great host. Communication via watsapp was always prompt. He got in touch a few days before we arrived and we appreciate him accommodating our request for an early check in.",0,0.9432,Positive
