76.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,29,90.0,0,14.020278434129931,4.66,4.69,4.65,4.72,2079942,"Thalias place was beautiful and perfect for our stay. It fit three of us very comfortably and had everything we needed for our 2 and a half week long stay. The area was very convenient for us, it is a few minutes walk to both U-Bahn and S-Bahn stations and there are lots of supermarkets and restaurants around.",1,0.9216,Positive
