86.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,6.919397234051426,4.86,4.88,4.51,4.74,20942536,"Great place to stay for a trip to Berlin. The apartment was perfectly clean, with good internet, full kitchen and very close to bus stops and a subway station. You’ll need to get to the 4th floor using the stairs, so be ready. We felt at home and had a very pleasant stay, really recommend the place.",1,0.97,Positive
