160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,98.0,0,1.0407544919436775,4.54,4.66,4.77,4.45,34294913,"Friendly staff. Nice apartment in a fab location - so easy for Brandenburg airport by train and walking to most central things. Didn’t have lots of ‘extras’ so pack your own conditioner, body lotion etc.",1,0.9041,Positive
