64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,14,100.0,0,3.103436531878299,4.9,5.0,4.8,4.7,31347829,"The apartment was very clean and comfortable. It's in a great part of the city, with the metro a ten minute walk away. Kira and Leon were very kind and accommodating hosts!",1,0.9397,Positive
126.0,10,2.0,1.0,5.0,45,100.0,0,6.227588103865033,4.25,4.04,4.49,4.22,21458938,We were very well received by our host and the apartment fits exactly our expectations <br/>Good value for money,0,0.5849,Positive
51.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,11,100.0,0,3.2110763305782304,4.87,4.77,4.94,4.76,2096970,"I stayed at Frank's place for a month, and I loved it! The studio is super stylish, it has all the amenities you'd need for along stay, and the location was unbeatable, right in the heart of Kreuzkölln and by the canal. Totally recommended.",1,0.8803,Positive
61.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,48,100.0,1,7.68044863591312,4.95,4.94,4.84,4.81,859418112131751223,"This was our second time staying at Peter and Gabriela's place. Our first stay with them went so well that we ended up booking a second and longer stay with them. <br/>The second stay went even better than the first. Peter and Gabriela have a charm that makes you feel right at home, to the point that my wife and I will miss them a lot now that we've left. <br/>Otherwise, everything else was more or less perfect. <br/>- Great location: 2 mins to a well connected metro station and just a few stops from the city center. Many good food options, grocery stores and a pharmacy within 5 mins.<br/>- Exactly like the photo, very very clean and equipped home. <br/>- Amazing hosts, very hospitable, and helped us fit right in.",1,0.984,Positive
126.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,30,97.0,0,1.730125064149603,4.85,4.85,4.91,4.74,16340532,"Pretty much everything you're looking for in a Berlin Air BnB. Clean spot. Great neighbourhood, probably one of the most charming in Berlin. Easy walk into the central city and close to well serviced U Bahn stations. Good for singles or couples travelling on business or pleasure. If you dig a view then the spot is a winner too, with an overview of the park as well as the TV tower to remind you your in Berlin. Highly reccomend! <br/>Stefan was also a great host who was professional and easy to communicate with. Also, big bonus points as he kindly made the effort to check me in early, as my flight arrived in the AM before the official check in time. Some hosts can be a little uptight about that so I appreciated him being accomodating there too.",1,0.9934,Positive
67.0,6,1.0,1.0,3.0,44,70.0,0,6.808312019480818,4.43,4.17,4.4,4.49,1405939,"Nous avons passé un très bon séjour chez Bee : le studio correspond tout à fait aux photos, ensoleillé, décoré simplement mais avec goût, agréable. La salle de bain attenante est très spacieuse. Le quartier est bien relié aux lignes de métro, nos hôtes nous ont fourni un plan du quartier avec des adresses très utiles.",1,-0.128,Negative
35.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,0,5.585628644392337,3.0,3.0,4.0,2.0,1067369865383860809,"Claude was always friendly and attentive, quick to communicate, which is definitely crucial and valuable. The apartment is located about 300 meters from the Penny supermarket, and about 10 minutes walk from the Osloer Strabse (U-Bahn) station, and the rest of the transportation is very accessible, which is good. I had to leave the place early due to a noise problem from neighbors (kids noise upstairs, and the wooden floor doesn't help), which Claude diligently tried to resolve, but continued (I hope they can solve it). I recommend the place for someone who does not need to stay as long during the day, as is my case (remote worker). A little more attention to the garbage could reduce the presence of flies.",1,0.9337,Positive
179.0,7,2.0,1.0,5.0,45,100.0,1,13.891160580271904,4.71,4.69,4.69,4.51,21431554,sehr schöne ruhige und komfortable wohnung  (auch für 4 Personen) - gute  u-bahn verbindungen in der nähe-  wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt,0,0.0,Neutral
195.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,91.0,0,4.873172561853288,4.69,4.76,4.44,4.54,30881310,"Awesome facilities, clean, modern and functional apartment with all you need in the kitchen and bathroom. Nice comfortable bed and plenty of wardrobe space. Very convenient to be able to do the laundry on the 1st floor and refill supplies for toilet paper & paper towels. The lobby had also nice additional facilities for quick refill of energy, even fast food. Very close to train, tram and subway. Room is well isolated but when the window is open (much needed in warm weather, no IC) the noise from the train station and street is noticeable. Altogether a great experience and lovely base to have during my stay!",1,0.9663,Positive
68.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,50,100.0,0,6.026516407626963,4.74,4.76,4.48,4.7,6808626,"Wonderful stay in Berlin!<br/>Perfect quite place, with personal outdoor space.",1,0.6114,Positive
125.0,2,2.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,0,3.036032627048052,4.7,4.7,4.63,4.68,22438,"We found the apartment in Berlin Mitte to be in an excellent location.  A very short walk from the station, a supermarket five mins walk away along with some good reasonably priced restaurants to eat at.  The apartment had everything you could possibly need, like a home away from home.  One very minor negative, the sofas in the living area were a bit uncomfortable for relaxing after a long day sightseeing around Berlin.<br/>",1,0.6929,Positive
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,1,5.273029847580318,4.81,4.88,4.77,4.67,823653217890074888,Super Unterkunft! Capucine war super nett und hilfsbereit. Gerne kommen wir wieder!,1,0.6688,Positive
84.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,1,3.2375488184892025,4.89,4.92,4.88,4.83,41651093,"The place was great  and pretty close to everything really. We just used the bicycle/scooter app to get anywhere central, which was great fun and only took 15 mins. Carsten was a great host, very helpful and responsive.",1,0.9768,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,1,3.423871245301599,4.89,4.94,4.89,4.88,40149424,"Christiane ist sehr nett. Das Zimmer ist wunderschön und sehr groß. Auch das Bad und die Küche, die man mitbenutzt sind sehr schön, sauber und angenehm. Der Balkon ist traumhaft. Ich habe mich bei Christiane sehr wohl gefühlt. Ich selbst wegen einer Forblidung in Berlin, aber die Lage ist zentral und auch für alle geeignet, die in Berlin etwas unternehmen wollen. Ich kann die Unterkunft wirklich empfehlen und würde auch selber gerne wieder dort übernachten.",1,-0.975,Negative
384.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,47,99.0,0,10.55631388584574,4.83,4.78,4.96,4.69,1169020265770819584,"Das Appartement hat eine hochwertige und moderne Ausstattung. Es ist genügend Platz für eine vierköpfige Familie, nur das Bad ist etwas klein. Die Küche hat alles was man braucht und ebenfalls sehr hochwertig. Die Lage ist super zwischen 3 S- und U-Bahn Stationen. Kurz gesagt absolut empfehlenswert.",0,-0.8126,Negative
