64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,6,100.0,0,5.651333658969379,4.0,4.0,4.0,5.0,13231272,Thank you so much Michelle for allowing us your room. We had 3 large comfortable beds and really appreciated the use of your kitchen to cut down on eating out costs. The building was central as advertised so meant once we rented bikes we were able to  get everywhere we wanted. Your housemates were lovely and gave us a couple of recommendations throughout our stay. Was ideal for us students looking to explore Friedrichshain and Kreuzberg on a budget.,1,0.9381,Positive
78.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,1,3.406346218061282,4.68,4.63,4.8,4.62,11276488,"Ellen's apartment was very centrally located, yet was very quiet. It was hard to believe we were in the heart of the city!! The apartment was very clean and pick up of keys and locating the apartment were well explained by Ellen.   I was there with one friend, and thus the apartment felt spacious to us. <br/>I would highly recommend this apartment and the host Ellen. Catriona, Ireland",1,0.8826,Positive
