60.0,4,1.0,1.5,2.0,31,100.0,1,5.23649226427437,4.92,4.78,4.82,4.75,29629949,"Stayed at Lionel's beautiful apartment for a few days in January. We chose this place mainly due to the location in Schillerkiez within walking distance to Tempelhofer Feld, which is my favorite spot in Berlin. However, the location is also conveniently close to nice bars and restaurants in Kreuzkölln. There is a Lidl right next to the apartment and a great Turkish supermarket close by as well. You really have everything you need within walking distance. That said - the apartment itself is very cosy and really - as others have already said - much nicer than the photos suggest! We had a great time and would recommend it to others!",1,0.9776,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,16,100.0,0,7.145435478457794,4.7,4.75,4.8,4.7,26939247,Very Clean flat and the pictures on the airbnb website are exactly as it really is. Nice and silent neighborhood near all the local amenities and (at least) two train/metro stations. Batin is a really pleasant person and relpied quickly to my messages. I really enjoyed my stay in his studio and my holiday in Berlin.,1,0.9428,Positive
