70.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,1,2.5329341972975428,4.86,4.8,4.93,4.8,19976281,"The apartment is very central and close to a main street and a U-Bahn station, with lots of cafés, shops and places of interest within walking distance. Nevertheless none of the noise couldn't be heard in the apartment, so it was very relaxing. Enrique was very helpful and told us lots of hints for places to visit and to eat, the communication was great at all times. Big recommendation!",1,0.9322,Positive
