117.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,0,4.541309535464388,4.83,4.79,4.65,4.63,43522753,Karolina and Phillips apartment was a really nice place to use as a base whilst staying in Berlin.<br/>There was a petrol station very close to purchase small items needed for the stay and lots of nice cafes and restaurant nearby.<br/>We chose to walk each day into the city but transport was very good if needed.<br/>A lovely place to stay!<br/>Nick,1,0.931,Positive
25.0,7,1.0,1.0,6.0,18,93.0,0,4.132403574870102,4.51,4.55,4.61,4.58,41362381,"La verdad nos sorprendió positivamente, on respecto a la relación calidad-precio. Es un hostal bastante relajado,  muy limpio, tuvimos la suerte de que las personas con las que compartimos habitación fuesen muy respetuosas y educadas; además de que el personal fue muy amable y simpático en todo momento,  y nos supieron responder y hacer recomendaciones relacionadas con  todas las dudas que teníamos.",1,0.0,Neutral
68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,0,2.144674544120887,4.63,4.6,4.89,4.64,1575295,"Ich habe meinen Aufenthalt bei Franziska sehr genossen. Das Zimmer war, wie auch der Rest der traumhaft schönen Wohnung, sehr geschmackvoll eingerichtet, sauber und gemütlich. Franziska war sehr nett, zuvorkommend und hilfsbereit. Ich habe mich rundum wohl gefühlt und würde jederzeit wiederkommen. Danke Franziska!",1,-0.8439,Negative
96.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,53,100.0,1,3.078904906310064,4.99,4.98,5.0,4.92,32601729,"Choosing Hardy's apartment in Kreuzberg was one of the best decisions we made in Berlin!  It is fantastic!  The location is unbeatable.  You're in a very cool neighborhood with so many restaurants and bars and grocery stores (there were 4 in less than a 3-minute walk).  The metro (U8 Schönleinstrasse) is about a 4-minute walk away.  The apartment building sits right on the Landwehr Canal and it is so beautiful.  The apartment is on a first floor of a very quiet courtyard (on the inside of the building).  It is very comfortable and has a large queen-sized bed, large dining table, and two sitting areas with sofas.  It is well decorated with interesting art and lots of cozy touches like pillows and lamps.  The kitchen is very well-stocked, you can cook almost anything and has lots of tools to use.  The bathroom is small but very well laid out and with lots of supplies to use; the shower is great and comfortable!  The WiFi is good.  Really good apartment that had everything we needed.  Hardy is an excellent host and was very responsive and helpful during our stay.  Again, fantastic place.  We will most definitely get in touch with Hardy when we go back to Berlin.  We miss the apartment and the neighborhood already!!",1,0.9966,Positive
102.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,39,100.0,1,8.094404344978152,4.79,4.8,4.73,4.75,35116312,Sehr schöne Unterkunft und sehr freundliche Gastgeber! Sehr zu empfehlen 😊,1,0.0,Neutral
50.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,50.0,0,6.886990235332526,4.67,4.67,5.0,4.67,1108517574977596555,"To me, this was the embodiment of home in Germany. It was convenient for my needs, and I enjoyed being in a highly sought-after neighborhood. The flat was reminiscent of home, and the residents were exceedingly kind. I found everything to be both tranquil and comfortable. Vielen Dank für die großartige Gastfreundschaft!",1,0.7644,Positive
