64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,0,2.728500570972652,4.98,4.94,4.95,4.88,8775701,Arthur var väldigt omtänksam och trevlig. Svarade snabbt och lägenheten var väldigt ren och snygg. Mysig! Området är toppen. Massor av caféer och restauranger i området. Skulle lätt bo här igen.,1,0.0,Neutral
260.0,8,4.0,2.0,7.0,50,100.0,1,2.6302702497082326,4.88,4.92,4.85,4.71,1488624,"Helpful host, great apartment in an excellent location for visiting Berlin.",0,0.891,Positive
95.0,7,1.0,1.0,3.0,33,100.0,0,4.793849952314026,4.57,4.28,4.88,4.5,12723428,"Ben and Ema's place is great, and they are very accommodating hosts. Tons of great restaurants and bars in the neighborhood...we had a lovely time!",1,0.923,Positive
226.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,55,100.0,1,1.3175138909700508,4.92,4.79,4.97,4.69,19484432,"5 star rating.  Completely updated apartment in a vintage building.  We stayed here for 27 days and enjoyed the windows opening up to the court yard with lots of greenery.  Fresh air with windows open was nice in August and also a bladeless fan available. Very responsive, friendly host. Neighborhood was peaceful and safe. Plenty of kitchen utensils with tons of dishes  made for lots of home cooked meals. Plenty of bathroom supplies and paper goods. Separate washer and dryer is nice. Within walking distance of several grocery stores. Also a great Farmers Market on Saturday's that can't be missed is within walking distance.  M2 & M4 tram lines are nearby and only a few stops to Alexanderplatz providing connections to U Bahn & S Bahn trains to just about anywhere you would want to go.  Beautiful Volkspark is also nearby offering shady treelined paths and prime picnic spots.",1,0.9866,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,61,100.0,0,4.172266015536491,4.95,4.85,4.85,4.79,4933665,"Nous avons été très bien accueilli par un voisin qui nous a fait visiter l'appartement. Bouteille de champagne de bienvenue...Merci :)<br/><br/>Super appartement, grand, spacieux, chaleureux, bien décoré. Situé à deux minutes du métro, parfait! Quartier très calme. Consignes de séjour très claires et par écrit. Nous avons adoré notre séjour!<br/>L'appartement est plein de belles énergies et nous nous y sommes sentis comme à la maison!",1,0.8433,Positive
109.0,5,1.0,1.0,3.0,40,100.0,1,9.629850152801552,5.0,4.86,4.75,4.69,52553127,"Wir haben hier 2 Nächte mit 3 Personen verbracht. Die Unterkunft bietet alles, was man braucht. Sviatlana hat uns persönlich begrüßt und verabschiedet und stand zwischendurch für Fragen zur Verfügung. Ein sehr angenehmer Umgang. Wir kommen gerne wieder!",1,-0.636,Negative
64.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,11,100.0,0,5.131813314696961,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,41130331,Highly recommended,1,0.2716,Positive
158.0,5,1.0,1.0,3.0,34,100.0,1,1.1883222668954112,4.86,4.88,4.96,4.78,16152597,"My family of three stayed for 11 days at Kristian’s apartment. And it has been a great cosy home for us. My baby could crawl all over its stylish unexpectedly much more spacious rooms, we enjoyed having bath together.<br/>Kristian and Peggy were nice responsive hosts, taking into consideration our requests and pleas. <br/>Among something to improve I could probably warn people with little children that climbing stairs is a challenge at the end of the day cause high ceilings of the old type building structure make a big difference. I know it takes time to get used to but family traveling can be exhausting, so coming back home was quite a challenge for us despite my initial enthusiasm. <br/>The location itself is good for walking to Prenzlauerberg, Alexanderplatz, Mauerpark or Mitte neighborhood. If the closeness of night party life is a priority, then transport station is quite close to commute and is ok if you don’t expect to be on walking distance to Kreuzberg, Friedrichshain etc. <br/>I loved the morning feeling that this place gives - the smell of roasted coffee from neighbors. Glad we chose it in general!",1,0.9748,Positive
59.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,18,100.0,1,6.96421625237138,4.61,4.8,4.39,4.58,24615567,"Minas Wohnung war wirklich perfekt: Geräumig, schön eingerichtet, gut ausgestattet, gut gelegen und vor allem blitzsauber!<br/>Mina selbst ist eine vorbildliche Gastgeberin: Überaus freundlich, fix, hilfsbereit und spontan.<br/>Alles in allem konnten wir nicht zuletzt wegen der tollen Unterkunft unseren Berlin-Aufenthalt in vollen Zügen genießen.<br/>Minas apartment has been really perfect: Spacious, nicely furnished, well equipped, ideally located, and, above all, spotlessly clean!<br/>Mina herself has been the epitome of a host: Enormously friendly, quick, helpful and spontaneous.<br/>Not least because of this nice accommodation we were able to enjoy our stay in Berlin to the fullest.",1,0.9672,Positive
114.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,1,4.105161338425043,4.86,4.77,4.88,4.71,48732044,This was a great deal!  Lots of shops and places to eat nearby.   Love the vibe of this place!,1,0.8715,Positive
112.0,2,1.0,1.0,0.0,37,100.0,1,4.055192118125784,4.85,4.91,5.0,4.72,1096866983845743431,Excellent apartment in a lovely part of Berlin. It is set back from the Main Street and looks over a lovely courtyard which is really quiet. <br/>Would definitely recommend,1,0.9498,Positive
68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,13,87.0,0,7.867349248126775,4.54,4.66,4.52,4.53,3970161,"Florent was extremely friendly. I did not get his message to announce the arrival hour and due to a flight delay we arrived really late, however the host was really understanding and gave us the keys right away.<br/>The apartment is cozy and worm and all amenities were just as described. <br/>Would definitely stay again!",1,0.6352,Positive
138.0,2,1.0,1.0,0.0,44,100.0,1,3.767243363390227,4.91,4.84,4.88,4.66,1162100809432590438,"Apartment in a great part of town. Favourite parts were the comfy beds, amazing shower and good Sage coffee machine.",1,0.8957,Positive
238.0,3,2.0,1.0,0.0,35,100.0,1,5.580334812061375,5.0,4.67,4.71,4.71,1065750598125434517,Wir haben den Aufenthalt in der Wohnung von Max sehr genossen.,1,0.0,Neutral
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,0,4.175900401937106,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,33017083,"Ilva und Björn sind zwei wunderbare Gastgeber! Die Unterkunft war spitzenklasse: Sehr sauber und mit einem tollen Altbaucharme, top ausgestattet, sehr gut angebunden und dennoch ruhig. Der Check-in/Check-out verlief einwandfrei, wir wurden mit vielen Infos versorgt und Ilva war für uns stets erreichbar. Wir hatten einen tollen Kurzurlaub und können diese Unterkunft uneingeschränkt weiterempfehlen! Vielen Dank euch beiden und wir kommen ganz sicher wieder!",1,-0.9149,Negative
68.0,2,0.0,0.0,1.0,21,100.0,1,3.132943292576071,4.86,4.68,4.88,4.81,979758,"Jurriaan will welcome you in this very nice flat and take time to give you some hints on nice locations in the neighbourhood.<br/>We already know where we want to stay, next time we're in Berlin!",1,0.8683,Positive
52.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,7,100.0,1,3.296942172923293,4.94,4.74,4.93,4.9,1130262360981895528,beautiful home with more books to fuss over than you could ever hope for. Ulrika told me some fascinating stories about the DDR and also gave me three books about the Wall to read which was so generous. Would recommend a stay with the lovely Ulrika to anyone!,1,0.9698,Positive
155.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,53,100.0,1,22.4451925277576,4.75,4.75,4.91,4.83,1871203,Meine Freunde haben die Wohnung bewohnt und nur gutes berichtet. Alle waren sehr zufrieden!,1,-0.636,Negative
115.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,1,3.478761427822,4.86,4.92,4.94,4.58,26616955,"Andreas was a fantastic host! Was super proactive and responsive with communication and provided detailed check in/out instructions. He was also very helpful when we had questions or needed help. The apartment was very well furnished and made the space feel spacious and homely. The balcony was such and added bonus, it was lovely sitting out there looking at the plants and the apartment cats! The apartment itself is in a great area of Berlin. It’s surrounded by restaurants and shops, it’s also very close to some great parks and the canal. There is also an underground station within a 5 minute walk. Will be staying again when possible!",1,0.9894,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,20,100.0,0,1.3609132355001994,4.73,4.8,4.89,4.67,1385446247362929990,Loved the stay! The Hotel is surrounded by amazing restaurants and cafés.,1,0.8398,Positive
