60.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,1,3.259390996517508,4.96,4.89,4.94,4.79,1213533931427669908,"All the reviews I read before booking were totally lived up to. Amir is really friendly and helpful and welcoming. I loved the room, it was such a treat for me, and the bed was incredibly comfy and the room spacious. Would definitely go there again.",1,0.9569,Positive
115.0,8,1.0,1.0,3.0,32,100.0,0,2.978770363505488,4.85,4.82,4.81,4.69,44438078,"Wir hatten eine richtig tolle Zeit! Die Wohnung war super sauber und gemütlich, genau wie auf den Bildern. Die Gegend ist echt schön, ruhig, aber trotzdem ist man schnell überall. Hat sich total nach Zuhause angefühlt – würden jederzeit wiederkommen!",1,-0.855,Negative
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,2.142649937740168,4.91,4.94,4.96,4.89,446975,"Lovely studio apartment in a green garden and in a nice part of Berlin. Very clean, quiet and safe. Communication with Kerstin was easy and she was very hospitable. Would definitely stay here again on my next visit to Berlin.",1,0.9542,Positive
100.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,25,100.0,0,2.719636652879703,4.66,4.54,4.89,4.51,851458418244863960,All v straightforward - an ideal bolthole for a short stay in Prenzlauer Berg,1,0.5267,Positive
186.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,65,100.0,1,10.457398071489475,4.99,5.0,4.87,4.91,53607716,"We loved our stay here, the best Airbnb we have stayed at. It's a heaven from home. We arrived very late on Saturday (after 10pm) and the host still came to pick us up from the station and show us round. Since the local shops were closed on Sunday, the host also kindly brought us breakfast on Sunday morning! The home itself is extremely modern, very clean, quite high tech with great attention to detail. The doors open fully wide so you can feel connected to the outside. There is a sauna which heats up quickly, smells amazing and was just as good as anywhere else. The outdoor pool has lighting but is cold (we went in October). Most people would find it cold but you adjust after five minutes. The garden looks amazing, especially in sunlight and in the morning. Really beautiful. We wished we had spent more time there. The pictures are very accurate. There is a tram station a short walk, and it's about 30 minutes to centre Berlin but can be longer depending on where you are going.",1,0.981,Positive
63.0,2,1.0,0.0,1.0,36,100.0,1,4.697448788448945,4.76,4.59,4.76,4.71,31356953,Nous avons passé un excellent séjour dans l'appartement de Mohammad. Les hôtes sont très accueillants et discrets. Le quartier est assez animé et bien desservi par les transports.,1,0.5719,Positive
116.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,3.4220599717130984,4.92,4.97,4.86,4.83,362701,"Ursula's place was lovely, stylish, spacious and central to everything we wanted to do in Berlin and beyond. It was close to the river and not far from the gorgeous canal areas and Treptower Park so easy to get a good breather in the city. The only downside was lack of an additional living space to relax and eat though of course we knew this when we booked and it didn't really matter as we were out a lot.<br/><br/>We met Ursula for a few minutes when we arrived and she introduced us to the flat. She was lovely and it would have been nice to get to know her a little more as she seemed interesting and knowledgeable about Berlin's art and culture. However we didn't have much contact with her beyond this.<br/><br/>I would definitely recommend staying here. <br/><br/>",1,0.9804,Positive
