231.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,66,93.0,1,0.5825226699456977,4.95,4.98,4.94,4.82,7831357,"Highly recommend this apartment! My husband and I loved staying here. The hosts so welcoming with fresh food for us on arrival. The apartment was beautiful, so comfortable, clean, quiet and inviting. The hosts so responsive and helpful. We felt right at home and loved our stay in Berlin. The little restaurant our host recommended around the corner, the oldest in Berlin was amazing! Loved it!! Thank you for having us.",1,0.9939,Positive
164.0,5,2.0,2.0,3.0,30,100.0,1,1.753209774100189,4.83,4.72,4.83,4.75,3188899,"Artful Abode<br/>This art gallery is unique. Having grown up around art galleries it was really a joy to experience actually sleeping in one. Our hosts are easy to communicate with and helpful in every way. Check in was simple, we were given detailed instructions on how to find the gallery by using the public transport. We were then met at the door by our host Ronald (Aglaja’s husband). Ronald showed us through the gallery and explained how to operate everything. With the supplied map and brochures Ronald showed us the local favorites and supermarket locations. We did not cook here but I checked the supplies we could easily prepare a meal with this kitchen. The fresh tulips and champagne were a truly wonderful touch. The linen was good quality and the beds very comfortable. Extremely clean. Thank you for having us.",0,0.9917,Positive
63.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,50.0,1,5.882490006196684,4.88,4.93,4.81,4.88,700806,"INMEJORABLE.... TODO TAL Y COMO APARECE EN LA ROOM. BARRIO TRANQUILO CENTRICO Y BIEN COMINICADO. LA CASA MUY BONITA CON PERSONALIDAD Y MUY LIMPIA. Y LO MEJOR DE TODO EL ANFITRION. BUENISIMAS PERSONAS SIEMPRE DISPUESTAS A AYUDAR, TE INFORMARAN TE ACONSEJARAN Y AYUDARAN EN CUALQUIER COSA, EN ESPAÑOL INGLES ALEMAN Y FRANCES. GRACIAS POR TODO. BESOS",1,0.0,Neutral
84.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,5.06163943405691,4.92,4.94,4.96,4.82,344856,"The apartment was perfect for my purposes: staying for a few nights, working a bit and hanging around in Friedrichshain. Everything was according to the announcement and communication with Apostolos was quick and friendly.",1,0.7845,Positive
115.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,42,100.0,1,17.960496069020618,4.96,4.99,4.76,4.91,5335113,Wir waren nun schon zum 2. Mal bei Werner in Berlin. Wie schon das letzte Mal können wir nur sagen top Gastgeber und eine top Wohnung die modern und hochwertig eingerichtet ist. Ein idealer Ausgangspunkt für unsere Geschäftsreise. Vielen Dank für den angenehmen und reibungslosen Aufenthalt. Wir kommen gerne wieder!,1,-0.3802,Negative
80.0,2,2.0,1.0,2.0,33,100.0,0,0.3954654437488965,4.51,4.77,4.86,4.52,2110056,"I wonderful time at this apartment in Berlin. Monika was very good at getting in contact with me. Her and her husband were there to greet me, show me around and answer any questions I had. The place was very spacious and comfortable and everything worked perfectly. The location was fantastic, very close to the center of the city and close to a bunch of trains/buses/resturants/bars and all the major sites/activites you would want to do in Berlin. I cannot say enough good things about my experience with Monika and this apartment. Highly recommended!!!!",1,0.9781,Positive
141.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,43,94.0,0,7.131273504704622,4.74,4.82,4.79,4.62,49070135,"100% recommended - central, easy, clean, convenient. Thanks !",1,0.8622,Positive
