125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,31,100.0,0,2.544694651326681,4.86,4.86,4.71,4.86,1178042495788775436,"I would highly recommend this apartment, I think it’s the most beautiful and well-equipped airbnb I’ve ever stayed in. <br/>The place is spacious and bright with super high ceilings. The rooms have minimalistic design with some very nice details. Lots of food and useful utensils in the kitchen. <br/>And the living room contains a great collection of books. <br/>If, like me, you are coming to Berlin not to party and are looking for calm and quiet place, this apartment is a perfect choice. <br/>The district, the location is great, just few tram stations from Alexanderplatz. <br/>Marta is a very friendly and helpful host. <br/>I would certainly come back to this place again.",1,0.9919,Positive
