64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,51,100.0,0,2.752311422367908,4.91,4.95,4.85,4.9,8385590,"La stanza è spaziosa, ordinata e comoda (oltre a letto e armadio c'è anche un divano), l'appartamento è carino e arredato con molto gusto. Abbiamo trovato comoda la posizione, a tre fermate da Alexanderplatz e a cinque minuti in bici dal mercato domenicale di Mauerpark; la zona è vivace e nuova, piena di locali piacevoli in cui cenare o fare colazione. Karsten è gentile e disponibile.",1,0.0,Neutral
80.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,0,14.740259241210865,4.74,4.77,4.57,4.68,14619469,"Erika’s apartment is great! Me and others two friends went in Berlin for a quick holiday in February and everything was perfect! The apartment is very clean, with towels, bed sheets and also shampoo and other products. It’s located around 40 minutes to the city center but it’s very well served by metro and bus. <br/>Erika is an amazing host she was very friendly and we had to fly in very late the first night but she had us check in around 2 in the night.",1,0.9733,Positive
