125.0,2,2.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,0,5.685976598095951,4.6,4.4,4.2,4.6,27845444,"Wunderschöne helle Wohnung, viel größer als erwartet. Schlüsselübergabe verlief reibungslos, die Wohnung war perfekt ausgestattet mit allem was man sich wünschen kann und zusätzlich haben wir noch eine Menge hilfreicher Berlin Insider Tipps bekommen. Jederzeit gern wieder!",1,-0.8439,Negative
190.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,54,100.0,1,2.4373609732878974,4.84,4.94,4.7,4.72,1223854054462654789,Immaculately clean and light flat with two lovely roof terraces. Easy to find and access. We were well-prepared for the flights of stairs which were no problem. We were two children and two adults and there was plenty of space. It is not the most family-friendly of neughbourhoods but it is also not unfriendly (!) There are playgrounds nearby and a Lidl a five-minute walk away. The local u-bahn (Kottbusser Tor) is also only a few minutes away and very convenient for accessing the main sites of Berlin. Parker Bowles is a great restaurant two streets away. We did not love the dirty streets or the 'characters' in the squares and ariund the u-bahn but this is probably endemic of Berlin. Ludgar was great at replying to questions and the directions for how to access the flat - which includes a video - could not have been better. Thank you!,0,0.9516,Positive
156.0,6,2.0,2.0,4.0,51,100.0,1,2.784593796049624,4.88,4.78,4.9,4.77,3378027,Nice flat ! Perfect location. We enjoyed our trip in this appartement. ,0,0.8777,Positive
