122.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,90.0,0,15.994221373508696,4.91,4.91,4.71,4.77,41761035,"Great driveway for if you have a car to park off street, steep stairwell so keep in mind if you have lots of bags / large luggage. There are people who live or rent downstairs it seems with same lower level front door access so do not be alarmed in case you hear other people as we were at first. Definitely well out of the city but we walked / used public transport to get into Berlin which was awesome. We also found a decent Italian restaurant not far from the house in walking distance called Paparazzi. Also a very cute bakery / coffee shop on our way out would recommend as their pastries were delicious and very friendly staff - Café & Bäckerei Sahnebaiser",1,0.9834,Positive
128.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,61,100.0,1,4.880214568244147,4.95,4.99,4.9,4.88,24423970,"Gunnar est parfait : il s'occupe très bien de ses hotes, se préoccupe de son interieur et veurt rendre service !<br/>Très bon séjour",1,0.0,Neutral
80.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,1,7.221418495039817,4.87,4.8,4.88,4.75,250687,This is a charming place with the best welcome . I spent here a really good time.  I was like at home.,1,0.9493,Positive
