60.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,45,100.0,1,3.689600261518912,4.74,4.55,4.76,4.65,16237052,"the apartment is a little bit smaller than expected, but it is well equipped and has everything you need for a long weekend. Dietrich was always available and very friendly, and we definitely recommend to have a stay in his apartment. One tiny suggestion would be a bench to have a seat in front of the apartment (: <br/>Cheers<br/>David & Fabi",1,0.9612,Positive
174.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,1,2.3140250627916763,5.0,4.95,4.84,4.89,1241964448389563994,"Nice, clean and convenient place to stay. Close enough to where you need to go. Easy and convenient.<br/>Would recommend",1,0.872,Positive
132.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,47,100.0,1,3.5149528601016367,5.0,4.98,4.69,4.8,861592510465916798,"We had a fantastic stay in Berlin! My friend and I loved the apartment – it was exactly as pictured, cozy, and beautifully designed. Sarah and Martin were incredibly welcoming and gave us great recommendations for the area. They even prepared toys for my friend’s son, which made his stay extra special – he was thrilled! We would happily stay in this wonderful place again next time. Highly recommend!",1,0.9911,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,4.782028667605308,4.79,4.81,4.88,4.78,1440368404830960024,"Great stay right next to Berlin Central Station, with other busses and tram services from just outside the building. Perfect location for tourists who want to see the city without the busyness of the city centre, but within walking distance/ easy transportation in.<br/>The room and private bathroom was clean and pleasant to stay in",1,0.9509,Positive
180.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,45,85.0,0,1.5095289909770313,4.75,4.84,4.9,4.6,45475252,"Es un apartamento entero de pisos turísticos, las habitaciones están limpias y ordenadas pero el mobiliario es muy básico, la iluminación es muy mala. El barrio es muy céntrico y con muchos restaurantes cerca. AVISO: no viene en el anuncio pero está al lado de un cementerio, que se puede ver desde algunas habitaciones, a nosotros nos tocó una donde las ventanas daban directamente a una tumba, lo que afectó a nuestro descanso y debería advertirse por múltiples razones a las personas interesadas, incluyendo por motivos de salud mental.",1,-0.296,Negative
120.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,0,6.356331916640392,4.78,4.78,4.88,4.69,19099053,Great place especially if you have small children! Well located with playgrounds and cafes near by! Only minor point is that it looks like it was previously a shop so the entrance is a big glas front which resulted for us in hearing quite a lot of noise in the evening and constantly shadows walking by. Otherwise all great!,1,0.9284,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,20,100.0,1,8.820635608449871,4.86,4.65,4.77,4.74,924404302294794190,"Florian is great host, kind and responsive. The bedroom is spacious and the place is well located next to U and S trains, getting directly to Berlin top spots. Wifi is very good and there was some restaurants around the area. It was a great stay.",1,0.9647,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,0,1.4275847185017383,4.97,4.97,4.93,4.92,925753,"Superkurzfristig konnte ich bei Alexandra und ihrem Freund in einer schönen Altbauwohnung in bester Berliner Lage unterkommen! Das Zimmer war sauber, der Kontakt angenehm und unkompliziert. Hervorragendes Preis/Leistungsverhältnis! Danke :)",1,-0.3578,Negative
