99.0,1,0.0,1.0,1.0,52,100.0,1,14.520367535792728,4.95,4.99,4.85,4.85,80843,"I had a very peaceful and warm stay, the host was amazing, very responsive and helpful whenever I had any questions. I would definitely recommend this stay for anyone looking to have a warm stay in Berlin.",1,0.9669,Positive
