79.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,1,3.078469485393148,4.89,4.97,4.72,4.75,952791957348614312,"A wonderful place to stay for a weekend break in Berlin, because of its proximity to a local park we had the opportunity to attend a Sunday Market on our way to the tram which was a nice surprise and there's loads of great restaurants around. A cafe just a few minutes away on foot serves up amazing pancakes and chai lattes. It's a nice atmosphere because you are away from the mass tourism and crowds of Central Berlin. The bnb itself was clean and there are double windows and a blackout shutter which is helpful for a good nights sleep.",1,0.9826,Positive
41.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,15,100.0,0,3.558265973195314,4.77,4.84,4.88,4.79,19666219,"Good place to stay at, Günter is very friendly, not really good in english which wasn't really a problem. You get a  very clean and beautiful room in his house where you share the bathroom and toilet. You are allowed to use the fridge and tableware if needed.",1,0.9393,Positive
