196.0,9,2.0,1.5,6.0,23,100.0,1,0.5100458669657755,4.8,4.74,4.97,4.73,11577306,"We had a wonderful stay at this place. The apartment is clean, contemporary and spacious. The decoration was to our liking. The situation in Berlin Mitte is fantastic. We could walk to the Museuminsel every day. <br/>Even though the apartment is situated in a busy area (not far from the Alexanderplatz and train station), it was very quiet. <br/>We had a great time and I recommand it.",0,0.9501,Positive
241.0,6,3.0,1.0,4.0,54,100.0,1,1.3558603428081426,4.89,4.93,4.77,4.79,13651040,"Great stay in a good location, just by the U Bahn station. Clean apartment, fast internet, easy check in. Everything as advertised. Would pick this place again. Thanks!",0,0.9412,Positive
81.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,0,3.936308693497173,4.78,4.57,4.88,4.69,13010994,"Our stay at Michael’s place was okay. <br/>The location was great. It was close to a lot of restaurants and public transport and in on a safe street. The bed was super comfy. Michael was also very responsive to our needs.<br/>On the other hand, there were a few negatives to note. The proximity to the street being at street level was very noticeable . We could hear people talking as they walked past quite loudly, and we could smell cigarettes being lit up outside. The shower was also leaking when turned off, and when turned on the water sprayed across the bathroom floor. <br/>There was also a loud hammering-like noise coming from the neighbouring apartment’s wall which woke us up at 6am on our first morning and persisted continuously for 3 hours. Obviously this was out of Michael’s control but it was still very disruptive at such an early hour and on a Saturday.",1,0.719,Positive
