83.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,0,8.160231491771468,4.85,4.64,4.91,4.82,50884931,"Julian was a wonderful host. He met us in person and provided us with a brief  tour of the apartment and building. Julian's place was like home! Julian's apartment was located in a wonderful part of town close toany public transportation options, groceries stores, restaurants, and landmarks. We were in town for the Berlin Marathon and the location was very convenient... only two U-bahn stops away.",1,0.8622,Positive
