73.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,90.0,1,8.193021284977716,4.85,4.93,4.7,4.69,2147777,Der Aufenthalt bei Katharina war wunderbar.<br/>Wir konnten flexibel einchecken und haben eine saubere Unterkunft vorgefunden:),1,-0.5994,Negative
174.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,1,2.3237413988868294,4.75,4.87,4.71,4.64,1241977206055551220,"Аппартаменты находятся в пешей доступности ( в педелах 30 минут) ко всем основным достопримечательностям. Мы ходили пешком:) Это очень удобно! Но близко несколько станций метро, а напротив- автобусная остановка. <br/>В 7-10 минутах ходьбы- продуктовый Лидл. <br/>Вход в аппартаменты прямо с улицы. Заселение предельно простое! Хороший wi-fy. <br/>Хозяин всегда быстро отвечает на сообщения, даёт четкие и понятные инструкции.",1,0.0,Neutral
141.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,43,94.0,0,7.131273504704622,4.74,4.82,4.79,4.62,49070135,Ich habe mich selten so wohl gefühlt in einer Unterkunft.Eine wirklich wunderbare Erfahrung.Weiter so.Ich möchte auch meinen Dank an die Reinigungskräfte aussprechen.Ihr macht einen tollen Job.Insgesamt ein sehr angenehmes Unternehmen.Ich komme aufjedenfall wieder.VIELEN DANK.,1,-0.5994,Negative
12.0,8,1.0,0.0,8.0,16,100.0,0,3.891225125445868,4.33,4.16,4.54,4.42,3108686,"Fue fácil llegar, hay una estación a unos 10 minutos y puedes dejar el equipaje en las taquillas hasta que sea la hora del check-in. Las camas chirriaban muchísimo, entiendo que sean habitaciones compartidas pero había demasiado ruido. En cuanto a limpieza, el baño no estaba muy limpio (sobretodo las duchas) y había polvo en la habitación. Para pasar una noche está aceptable.",1,-0.296,Negative
45.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,11,100.0,0,2.365494381413607,4.97,5.0,4.93,4.88,3866928,Absolut empfehlenswert!!,1,0.0,Neutral
158.0,5,1.0,1.0,3.0,34,100.0,1,1.1883222668954112,4.86,4.88,4.96,4.78,16152597,"Beautiful apartment - just as in the photos. The owners have a great eye for color and style. All amenities were as described and worked well. Excellent location with many public transportation options nearby. Lots of natural light in the apartment and most windows open to a quiet courtyard. The kitchen-eating-area is extremely spacious and makes the feel of the apartment open and inviting. Earlier comments about lack of an elevator can be ignored as one has since been installed in the building. The stairs are also really not that bad. My only comment would be that this apartment is ideal for 2 people, but not necessarily more, as the sleeping sofa in the living room is not particularly comfortable. Maybe it’s ok for kids but not if you are looking for a comfortable rest. The big bed in the separate bedroom is very  comfortable though. We had a great stay and would come back.",1,0.7948,Positive
125.0,1,2.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,1,6.342776312538732,4.88,4.96,4.8,4.92,20171185,"Just a perfect stay ;)<br/>I really enjoyed my time in this beautiful apartment, full of care and wit",1,0.9443,Positive
85.0,6,2.0,1.0,5.0,23,100.0,0,9.797881642408234,4.61,4.56,4.65,4.52,7963887,"El apartamento es tal cual sale en las fotos! Para seis personas es perfecto. <br/>Aunque no esta muy céntrico, esta muy bien ubicado y comunicado. La parada de metro esta a muy pocos metros de la casa. En los alrededores hay varios restaurantes, panaderías y supermercados. <br/>El apartamento estaba muy limpio y tenía persianas, algo poco común en las casas de Alemania y que se agradece mucho!",1,0.1739,Positive
47.0,3,2.0,1.0,3.0,43,100.0,0,16.537509701983456,4.86,4.92,4.7,4.76,889901,"This is a fantastic place and Silvia and Michael are wonderful and conscientious hosts.  We stayed at this apartment for three weeks in the summer. Everything in the apartment is in mint condition, and it is big enough for a family of four.  We were very comfortable and enjoyed our stay in this bright and charming place.  The hosts were very patient with our somewhat complicated travel arrangements, and they were extremely helpful.  The location is great, and Metro and Bus stops are just across the street.  The well-equipped kitchen, washing machine, and high speed internet access also make the apartment suitable for longer stays.     I would highly recommend this apartment.  ",1,0.9849,Positive
37.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,0,5.662533986282327,4.74,4.77,4.33,4.71,589285,"Hana and Martin's not only saved my LIFE. But was a great home away from home on my stay in Berlin. Quiet, clean and cheap! I highly recommend them.",1,0.9262,Positive
81.0,1,1.0,1.0,0.0,33,100.0,0,3.1726879268539143,4.84,4.77,4.93,4.8,1117461323667616122,Perfect accomodation for my weekned trip. Beautiful light and spacious rooms. Clean and peaceful. In a very good leafy road with cafe and reataurant close by. Easy to reach everything on foot and well connected by public transport. I will definitely come back again.,1,0.9735,Positive
55.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,0,1.354221835889287,4.91,4.71,4.96,4.9,14257495,"La casa de Wibke está realmente bien! Es una casa muy grande y muy acogedora, hacía mucho frío en la calle pero en la casa no se notaba nada. Wibke es encantadora y fue una perfecta anfitriona, siempre nos ofrecía un café o un te. Podíamos usar la cocina sin problema. La habitación tiene todo lo necesario y es espaciosa. El baño es muy grande y esta limpio. La ubicación es perfecta. Se puede visitar los monumentos principales yendo a pie, aunque también en transporte público, hay una parada de metros a 2 minutos. Por la zona hay restaurantes y bares para comer que están muy bien! Danke schön Wibke!!",1,-0.4885,Negative
112.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,95.0,0,11.820461804372655,4.69,4.72,4.85,4.53,1039709337375906815,"Mieszkanie zgodne z opisem, dobra lokalizacja, komunikacja przyjazna a instrukcje zameldowania jasne 😊",1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,1,4.861082501850892,4.75,4.76,4.6,4.7,5188216,some noises in the night but manageable.,1,0.0,Neutral
38.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,0,3.4193947713157806,4.88,4.79,4.91,4.78,1396712,"Perfect space for me with high ceilings, large windows, working area, small and functionable kitchen (no microwave but very nifty toaster type oven). Very quiet overlooking inner courtyard: absolutely read very detailed instructions Poca sends to find apt in far left back of buildings. Very comfy, firm mattress on bunk bed.  The internet had trouble with my video calls which Poca and I tried unsuccessfully to address (super quick responses from Poca). Hot shower, cute decor, no TV, multiple grocery stores near, tons of restaurants, farmers market Tue/Fri across Kanal, all transportation options close. Check out the congregation of swans on the Landwehrkanal a few blocks west - amazing. Totally recommendable.",1,0.6474,Positive
213.0,8,3.0,1.0,5.0,31,100.0,1,5.600860807992449,4.67,4.61,4.63,4.55,17384054,"The house is nice, clean and good location",0,0.8126,Positive
