111.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,0,5.463369258195954,4.92,4.96,4.93,4.79,2027140,Julia’s place was beautiful and clean in an incredible location. Communication was great - thank you!,1,0.9259,Positive
83.0,6,2.0,1.0,5.0,56,100.0,0,11.527326485291828,4.69,4.73,4.4,4.57,11294127,"Wir waren als Familie mit 2 Teenagern unterwegs und haben viel unternommen. Die Innenstadt war gut per Auto zu erreichen, aber auch mit Bus und Bahn wäre die Anbindung gut gewesen. <br/>Wir haben uns sehr wohlgefühlt und die Zeit nach unseren Ausflügen zum Chillen genutzt. Für Partypeople ist die Wohnung nicht geeignet, aber für uns war sie genau richtig!<br/>Beim nächsten Hauptstadtbesuch kommen wir gerne wieder!",0,-0.9776,Negative
73.0,1,0.0,8.5,1.0,33,100.0,0,2.496114582405734,4.63,4.55,4.78,4.5,45339029,"The place is a great option if you're just traveling to Berlin or, if like me, you're moving to the city and struggling to find a long-term accommodation. The hostel is clean, the room I stayed had everything to make me feel super comfortable for over a week: good bed, table, space for clothes, etc. The atmosphere is calm, respectful and majority of people were professionals from different ages, which made me feel safe even to use the common areas to work when needed. I thought that shared toilets would be an issue, but quiet the opposite. Many bathrooms available in each floor, all super clean and tidy all the time! The kitchen was also clean and has good freezer storage space if you're staying longer. As it wasn't crowded, it was fine for myself to prepare and have a good breakfast and dinner at the tables. The location is also awesome, with lots of bars and restaurants (great kebabs on Dade Falafel just around the corner), cafes to work from and a nice park and supermarket by less than five minutes walking-distance. I also need to mention that the staff was beyond professional and helpful! I had a problem with internet, so needed to check-in through a phone call as I arrived late at night, and someone helped me through the whole process. Very thoughtful of him, also made me feel welcome and secure about the accommodation! I highly recommend it!",0,0.9963,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,6,100.0,0,7.472405322204024,4.38,4.63,4.38,4.38,5732900,"Myriam was a very friendly, welcoming and helpful. The apartment was very clean and tidy and looked exactly like in the pictures.  The place was near to S-bahn station and thus everything we wanted to see in the city was easily reachable. The neighbourhood was safe and quiet. The kitchen was shared but in good condition. Miryam was nice to provide us with clean towels and all necessary toiletrys. <br/>",1,0.9715,Positive
289.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,39,100.0,1,2.554894585161628,4.72,4.78,4.88,4.6,12002960,"Emplacement parfait , idéal pour visiter Berlin. La description correspond exactement à l appartement. Confort impeccable quand on rentre après une journée de visites.",0,0.0,Neutral
85.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,0,2.8482399549551234,4.67,4.66,4.74,4.55,884025877402223579,"Sehr komfortable Wohnung, in bester Lage. Perfekt für ein gemütliches Berlin Wochenende zu zweit! Gerne wieder!",1,0.0,Neutral
77.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,0,6.266793012378933,4.7,4.65,4.53,4.7,6264703,"sehr sauber, ich war sehr bequem, gerne wieder",1,-0.5994,Negative
91.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,1,1.879148370938034,4.96,4.94,4.96,4.9,344986,"A Great location: believe me, you will not find the better district to stay in Berlin. Kollwitzplatz looks amazing, absolutely safe, has all possible places to eat and have a coffee (try No Fire No Glory for a coffee and Humami for fusion asian cuisine, for example). Located just 15 mins from the Bundestag and 5 mins from the Alexanderplatz, and is simply Very Nice!<br/>A grate apartment: the unique designers apartment with a soul inside. Shift my understanding how apartment should looks like.<br/>A great hosts: absolutely friendly and supportive hosts. The only thing I'm sorry about is that we haven't spent more time with these great people!<br/>Reccomended to stay in Berlin!<br/>Julia and Nikita. <br/>",1,0.9723,Positive
106.0,4,0.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,0,8.110437312186143,4.35,4.33,4.85,4.34,27869754,I will be back again <3,1,0.4404,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,56,100.0,1,12.187651903228794,4.93,4.93,4.83,4.83,968726996578747183,"I had a great one month stay in Philippe's apartment: The apartment was beautiful and spacious, and stayed cool and airy even during hot days. The surroundings are pretty, with the river right in front of the building, with public transport access close by. Lots of good restaurants and coffee shops are located within walking distance. Philippe was very responsive, and I got quick support in any questions that I had during the stay. All in all, one of my best Airbnb stays.",1,0.9778,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,1.3773060525895495,4.72,4.84,4.91,4.66,1461489656921679773,Fin beliggenhet !,1,0.0,Neutral
31.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,20,100.0,1,12.389708472442326,4.76,4.74,4.59,4.81,31116923,"very cozy place, the host is very sweet. great stay in berlin",1,0.8258,Positive
53.0,2,1.0,1.0,4.0,46,100.0,0,3.743155686529208,4.82,4.78,4.68,4.82,2398889,"Great location with easy access to public transport and near by bike hire. The local area is laid back and friendly, my wife and I felt safe at all times of night and day. The apartment was clean and well equipped and was a perfect retreat after a busy day sight seeing. Moe was very friendly and professional when we arrived  and made us feel at home straight away. There is an interesting variety of places to eat within walking distance from reasonably priced world street food restaurants, beer gardens, local bakeries, beer and currywurst kiosks in the middle of street crossings. I would and have already recommended the apartment to friends and would definately stay again. Thank you Moe.",1,0.9878,Positive
53.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,4.795358275165721,4.73,4.57,4.86,4.75,18547011,"Cosy place to stay a few days. Everything were cleaned, the location was good, next to a bus stop , metro and a supermarket. The host was very nice, he was on time to do the check-in and check-out and he allowed us to leave the luggage until late.",1,0.5563,Positive
116.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,3.4220599717130984,4.92,4.97,4.86,4.83,362701,"Ursula’s flat was clean, beautifully decorated with eclectic art, well stocked with towels and kitchen needs, and very comfortable. Ursula was responsive, friendly, and very accommodating. 10/10 recommend. Would definitely return!",1,0.9704,Positive
