120.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,38,100.0,0,9.7340143135363,4.74,4.75,4.6,4.66,19076725,Superclose to airport and because of that there's a convenient bus ride to and from the apartment. So helpful when traveling in the city center! Easy access to the S bahn from the apt. Good deal. In residential area. So pretty secluded and quiet. Nice guy and very flexible guy as your host!,1,0.9514,Positive
