257.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,42,100.0,0,1.2937250483136316,4.63,4.63,4.85,4.51,12047604,"Nous avons adoré notre séjour dans cet appartement ! Il est spacieux, bien aménagé et très propre. Tout était conforme à la description. Le quartier est vraiment top : agréable, calme, et très bien situé avec de nombreux restaurants et transports en commun à proximité. Nous recommandons vivement cet endroit.",0,0.1511,Positive
135.0,5,2.0,2.5,2.0,30,100.0,1,13.475852084261728,4.84,4.88,4.85,4.71,13254923,"My family and I stayed at M's place for almost a week and we really enjoyed our stay in his wonderfully spacious, bright, and thoughtfully decorated apartment filled with many one of a kind furniture pieces. This apartment is one of the nicest airbnb apartments I've stayed in and I would happily come back. <br/>The apartment was bigger than captured in the photos, which rendered a very comfortable stay for four people (the two bathrooms were helpful too). There is a supermarket close by open till midnight,  as well as many shops and restaurants. The bus stop is a 5-10 minute walk and the subway a 10-15 min.<br/>",0,0.9828,Positive
