200.0,3,2.0,2.0,2.0,16,100.0,1,1.755379984504752,4.93,4.8,4.87,4.82,26033271,"Mario‘s place was great just as described on the pages. Very well equipped, quiet and peaceful even though at a very central location. Lots of the Berlin sights can be reached on foot and easy connections to public transport. Will definitely stay there again",1,0.9402,Positive
