137.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,1,2.759966591003808,4.94,4.92,4.94,4.81,768616,"From the start, Cornelius communicated with us effectively. When we asked about an earlier check-in time, he looked into it and was able to be flexible (he noted the previous guests’ earlier check-out plans). That was very helpful. We felt at home in the apartment, which is in a great neighborhood. The apartment had everything we needed for our stay, including plenty of storage space for clothing, guidebooks, soft and good quality towels, etc. There are smart little details like curtains to section off the living room alcove when needed, shades to keep out the light and heat, and several fans to combat heat. Cornelius was specific about what was not included and what we needed to bring. Instructions relating to the apartment, rules, and check out procedures were very clearly written out. The apartment was not noisy, despite being located in an area that has a lot of amenities. Comfy beds. I loved that it was close to public transportation, food stores, great bakeries and restaurants.",1,0.9816,Positive
158.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,1.4854889925211936,4.9,4.89,4.83,4.75,41918425,Beautiful accommodation and location. Jurgen was an incredible host,1,0.5994,Positive
