141.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,43,94.0,0,7.131273504704622,4.74,4.82,4.79,4.62,49070135,"Excellent option in a quiet part of Berlin, mostly free of obnoxious fans from the European Cup’s vanquished team. The café on the ground floor offered an excellent breakfast, too.",1,0.8271,Positive
109.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,0,7.979649260825924,4.39,4.37,4.84,4.46,27868762,"The firealarm had the battery removed and missing.<br/>There was no quilt, towel, pillow case or duvet cover for the 3rd guest.<br/>The host didn’t reply when we noticed the things listed above and 23 hours later he still hasn’t…",1,-0.296,Negative
78.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,6.919397234051426,4.88,4.91,4.49,4.76,21061308,Great and comfortable studio apartment. Felt right at home. Also got lucky with flexible check in — all around super kind host!,1,0.9622,Positive
