106.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,0,1.3267026286625432,4.68,4.73,4.91,4.41,1335529146665908596,"Io e la mia amica siamo state molto bene nel grazioso appartamento a pochi passi da Alexanderplatz. Per risparmiare abbiamo usufruito spesso della cucina che gode di tutti gli elettrodomestici necessari, addirittura un fornetto! L’unica pecca è stata la mancanza di alcuni condimenti base come l’olio e lo zucchero che siamo state costrette a comprare. Stessa cosa per quanto riguarda i prodotti per la doccia, bagnoschiuma e shampoo. <br/>Per il resto abbiamo dormito molto bene e il quartiere era super tranquillo, ben collegato con il tram e c’era il supermercato a pochi passi.",1,0.4574,Positive
306.0,8,3.0,2.0,5.0,44,100.0,1,6.90827181205849,4.86,4.8,4.85,4.68,311703,"We found the flat with ease from Tegel airport, even more quickly than expect. Soon after our late afternoon check in, we explored the neighborhood--good! Great restaurants are close (april, bejte ethiopian, baharat falafel, (farther off in bikini berlin) SUPER shop/eat/meet. Big grocery stores are close--kaiser, lidl.<br/>And the cozy, well appointed  flat was perfect for down-time. Beds are comfortable. The high ceilings of this lovely old building accentuate the simple elegance of the decor. <br/>We were quite pleased with our ""home"" for the week. <br/>The bus, tram, metro are easy to reach from the flat.  The metro (U2) was closed in some stations, so we searched for other options. We found bus M85 the most direct to potsdamer pl./reichstag and could see some off the city as well. ",0,0.9887,Positive
201.0,7,2.0,1.0,6.0,30,100.0,0,3.7792785408916494,4.6,4.6,4.68,4.48,17948177,"Die Unterkunft ist super zentral gelegen, perfekt per U-Bahn und Bus erreichbar, viele Restaurants, Cafés und Einkaufsmöglichkeiten in direkter Nähe.<br/>Die Betten sind ebenfalls super, die Zimmer geräumig.<br/>Das Badezimmer ist recht klein.<br/>Zur Not kann in der Küche gekocht werden, alle Utensilien vorhanden, allerdings ehr zum<br/>aufwärmen geeinigt.<br/>Wilken ist sehr freundlich und stets erreichbar. Der Checkin/ Checkout ist perfekt gelaufen.",0,0.0,Neutral
137.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,1.189406824976013,4.86,4.84,4.93,4.79,264459,"Die Lage der Wohnung ist top, ich konnte alles zu Fuß erlaufen und die Tipps von Henrik zum Essen und Frühstück waren super! Ich habe das Pasternak und Betty`n Caty ausprobiert, toll. Sehr angenehmer  Empfang durch und unkomplizierter Aufenthalt.",1,-0.5255,Negative
68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,13,87.0,0,7.867349248126775,4.54,4.66,4.52,4.53,3970161,"Very good location, very friendly host. Not bad flat for this price.",1,0.8603,Positive
