72.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,1,4.339925047826779,4.82,4.77,4.77,4.82,1161619774430273754,"The room is spacious and sunny with a balcony from which you're looking into the trees. The location is definitely 10 out of 10, inside a vibrant quarter close to everything you could need. Our communication wasn't 100% easy from the beginning, but when I was there, Olivia was very nice and everything was fine.",1,0.862,Positive
95.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,36,100.0,0,3.2861856977959745,4.78,4.58,4.85,4.65,21812927,Great location near the trains/subway.  Place was clean and well laid out with good amenities.  mattresses were foam and super comfy.  Bed pillow were weird and should be replaced.,1,0.9325,Positive
139.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,1,3.5852919241394265,4.61,4.65,4.56,4.53,969200,"Lovely place to stay, very convenient location right next to public transport links. Comfortable bed, really nice shower. Extremely good communication from the hosts! they were very flexible and understanding with a last minute change we requested. Much appreciated!",1,0.961,Positive
137.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,1,2.759966591003808,4.94,4.92,4.94,4.81,768616,"I booked the apartment for the birthday of my brother who lives in Paris and he had a wonderful Berlin experiences also because of the apartment. It was very easy to access to it, any bad surprises, everything went exactly as it was written in the description and as Cornelius told me it will be. It was clean and confortable and the terrasse and view really help to recharge the battery and have good moments. It was also very convenient because the access to Public transport is very easy.<br/>Again as it is mentioned in the description, the area is very welcoming and very convenient, and I really insist on that because I leave not far from the apartment. The communication was very good, you will get a lot of infos about the access of the apartment and the area. For all that I do recommend Cornelius apartment you will definitely have a good time there.",1,0.9773,Positive
48.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,16,87.0,0,7.889169508668093,4.68,4.76,4.58,4.7,3988568,"The room and bathroom were both clean, and it's just a short walk to public transport.",1,0.4019,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,26,100.0,0,1.8775931353195376,4.5,4.8,5.0,4.8,22300218,"Wir - zwei Freundinnen - haben eine sehr schöne Woche in Berlin in Stines und Tims Wohnung verbracht. Die Lage ist optimal, die Wohnung sehr zentral aber trotzdem ruhig. Die beiden Balkone geben im Sommer wunderbare Freiheit. Leider war die Raumaufteilung/Bettenlösung für unsere Bedürfnisse nicht optimal. Wie Stine selbst schreibt, ist die Wohnung für Paare mit kleinen Kindern wirklich wunderbar und lässt kaum Wünsche offen. Wir hatten alles, was wir brauchten für eine entspannte Woche. Stine und Tim haben wir unterstützend erlebt, Check-in und Check-out sehr unproblematisch und zuvorkommend.",1,-0.9657,Negative
100.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,25,100.0,0,2.719636652879703,4.66,4.54,4.89,4.51,851458418244863960,"The neighbourhood is great - close to the tram and metro which means you’re instantly connected! The area has some really nice restaurants too, great at the end of a long day! <br/>The second bed was really awkward to move about in, and it wasn’t cleaned very well. The kitchen also has very few cooking essentials, which is frustrating for a short stay.",1,0.8879,Positive
86.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,0,2.0121165061944306,4.85,4.75,4.9,4.78,6229070,"We really enjoyed our stay in the apartment which was really clean and modern. Wonderful hosts who couldn't do enough to help and the apartment is in a brilliant location. Right next to a supermarket, lots of restaurants nearby and not far from a train station. Thank you!",1,0.9616,Positive
165.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,1,3.476496254708396,4.93,4.91,4.75,4.62,817473,"What an incredibly amazing Loft style apartment!!! <br/>After staying there for three nights with my girl friend we didn't want to move out anymore - but we had to :(<br/>Super cool and consequent designed, but still so cosy and with great entertainment installations. Not to forget he location in Kreuzberg is close to perfect. <br/>Ben's fotos and his description give a very good picture about his Loft. Anyway, Ben is a reeeal cool and friendly, fast answering host!!<br/>After staying in different ""loft-style"" apartments in Berlin - we are very confident saying that this was our best experience so far! 7 Stars of 5 ******* ! <br/>We would love to come back! <br/>",1,0.9946,Positive
173.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,19,100.0,0,1.589145815182497,4.92,4.86,4.78,4.78,1212111796297893587,簡単なロケーションですぐにたどり着くことが出来た。動画のサブスクリプションがついており、友人たちと映画を楽しみながら宿泊ができた。安くて清潔な子の宿を気に入っている。ありがとう。,1,0.0,Neutral
87.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,10.082429401037324,4.86,4.86,4.77,4.78,731042640553523310,Wahid's place is definitely good value for money and great for short stay in Berlin. The tube is 10-13mins walk distance so not too far and the neighbourhood is quite and peaceful. Thank you for garden picked home made grown tomatoes ! We enjoyed having them for breakfast :),1,0.9748,Positive
53.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,36,100.0,1,18.66779037898675,4.9,4.91,4.66,4.68,26024313,Sehr gut und nett,1,0.0,Neutral
114.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,67,100.0,1,32.29350043093033,4.85,4.69,4.87,4.74,36360929,"Gezellig huis. Prima voorzieningen. Openbaar vervoer naar Berlijn in de buurt, mooie indrukwekkende wandeling vanuit het huis. Kortom prima vakantie gehad.",0,0.0,Neutral
151.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,94.0,0,3.1018817858877528,4.67,4.77,4.78,4.52,721527807549293451,"Excellent séjour, la chambre semblait mieux que sur les photos. Hôtel très calme et bien situé, la sortie du métro est littéralement devant la porte de l'hôtel, mais le centre-ville est facilement accessible à pieds également. Nombreux restaurants à proximité et la chambre est très bien équipé pour se faire à manger. <br/>Je recommande sans hésiter",1,0.5719,Positive
79.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,11.00520151279848,4.92,4.96,4.81,4.81,5410909,"Beschreibung passt perfekt :) sehr gute Lage mit schneller U-Bahn Verbindung, schön eingerichtetes Zimmer mit allem vorhanden, was man benötigt. Kann man nur empfehlen.",1,0.4588,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,16,100.0,0,3.66652692477493,4.91,4.93,4.82,4.77,49788211,"Die Wohnung ist super gemütlich und perfekt gelegen. Sharan und Velvet waren uns sehr gute Gastgeber, wir hatten ein tolles Wochenende in Berlin 🥰",1,0.0,Neutral
55.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,0,5.122220052379539,4.75,4.65,4.67,4.62,33180505,Iris was very responsive and extremely accommodating. We enjoyed our 5-night stay at the apartment above Kino Toni!,1,0.7683,Positive
100.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,1,7.44187505020188,4.75,4.72,4.53,4.53,1099852594584694022,Die Wohnung ist wundervoll eingerichtet und hat uns sehr gut gefallen. <br/>Bushaltestelle in der Nähe und S-Bahn auch super zu erreichen… Parkplatz (kostenfrei) gegenüber reichlich vorhanden.<br/> Wir kommen gern wieder. ⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️,1,0.0,Neutral
171.0,6,0.0,1.0,4.0,40,100.0,1,3.047254274424235,4.91,4.95,4.86,4.79,9428090,"Stylish, clean and comfortable. A lovely place to stay in a trendy part of Berlin, with some great bars and restaurants within walking distance, but also very close to S Bahn, Tram and Bus stops if you want to travel to other parts of the city.",1,0.7579,Positive
