136.0,6,2.0,1.0,5.0,41,96.0,0,6.1770612336798365,4.61,4.58,4.75,4.48,27018647,Szuper,0,0.0,Neutral
131.0,1,1.0,1.0,8.0,30,99.0,0,1.556410002666394,4.71,4.76,4.65,4.7,6097880,"Es uno de los mejores hostels en los que he estado, muy cómodo, muy limpio, y la atención es buena. Quizás al principio me pareció que el trato fue un poco distante, pero en general siempre estuvieron dispuestos para lo que se necesite, y todo fue mejorando con los días. La habitación con baño y cocina es una muy buena opción, económica y muy cómoda. El edificio está genial. La zona es accesible. Definitivamente volvería.",1,0.4215,Positive
49.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,13,100.0,1,4.992275193466498,4.75,4.5,4.94,4.5,43651453,"Ich war für einen Abschnitt meines Rechtsreferendariats in Berlin, wofür die Wohnung super geeignet war. Gut mit der U5 angebunden, ruhiges Zimmer und in der Umgebung viele Restaurants etc. Zudem habe ich mich in der näheren Umgebung und in der Wohnung sehr sicher gefühlt. Antonio war meist gut erreichbar und konnte größtenteils bei Problemen helfen. Die wichtigsten Haushaltsgegenstände wie Staubsauger, Wäscheständer etc. sind alle vorhanden und auch einige Dinge wie Putzmittel etc. Fazit: Eine super Wohnung, falls man nach etwas für die Übergangszeit sucht und sich nicht mit dem Berliner Wohnungsmarkt herumschlagen will (dafür vermutlich etwas teurer natürlich).",1,-0.9485,Negative
45.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,25,100.0,0,13.538039905399945,4.65,4.62,4.7,4.58,50789984,"Multumesc lui Frank pentru sedere.<br/>Succes in continuare si poate la la mai multe locatii prin AirBnb.<br/>Locatia era buna si aproape de metro.<br/>Supermarketuri aproape Netti,Lidl.",1,0.0,Neutral
130.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,1,2.669079881682033,4.97,4.98,4.84,4.86,26180749,"Nette kamer met een super aardige host op een goede locatie. Gratis parkeren vlakbij. Ondanks dat het bij de host thuis is, was het goed gescheiden en hadden we een eigen sleutel. Al met al een hele goede ervaring.",1,0.6249,Positive
159.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,48,100.0,0,10.16828615315772,4.39,4.12,4.24,4.32,623791863376446371,"Mehr als zufrieden und die Kommunikation war mega! Man kann super in der ruhigen Straße parken.<br/>Die Unterkunft ist ein Traum: Zentral, aber ruhig gelegen, schnell an S- und U-Bahn angebunden, modern eingerichtet, Ausstattung top- es ist alles da was man braucht. Zwei kleine Terassen ermöglichen es einem draußen zu sitzen und den Abend ausklingen zu lassen. <br/>Gerne wieder !!!",0,-0.6449,Negative
48.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,0,4.230279756706139,4.76,4.76,4.48,4.74,31006339,"I can highly recommend staying here for everyone! We had the best time there, everything was perfect! The studio is even more beautiful in real life, than in the pictures! Sergue left there sweets and snacks and also we could find towels, hair dryer and everything someone would need for their stay there. <br/>We traveled as 3 young girls and we felt completely comfortable and safe in the studio and also in the neighbourhood. With just a few minutes walk you can get to the traim that takes you to the centre really fast ans easily. The studio's location is perfect: there are several shops, bakeries, restaurants and bars nearby. <br/>The communication was also perfect, Sergue is really helpful with everything. <br/>I can only mention positive thigs. The studio is just perfect for up to 4 people, there is plenty of space, it's clean, it's perfectly located and the price is totally worth it! Definitely 10/10!",1,0.9957,Positive
68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,3.194253694245239,4.93,4.95,4.89,4.86,81081,"Die Wohnung ist ein Traum! Super Lage (ruhig aber man ist trotzdem schnell in der Stadt) und komplett ausgestattet mit allem was man braucht. Sie ist außerdem geräumig, blitzsauber und hat sogar einen kleinen Balkon auf den ruhigen Innenhof. Insgesamt absolut top. Danke nochmal an die freundlichen Gastgeber Katja und Bernd :)",1,-0.1007,Negative
111.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,51,100.0,1,3.4156959509415743,4.85,4.89,4.82,4.77,14804266,"Really great little place, homely and comfy. Anything you might need for a quick break. The shower is great which is always a plus!",1,0.8773,Positive
73.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,90.0,1,8.193021284977716,4.85,4.93,4.7,4.69,2147777,"Sehr nette Gastgeber. Sehr saubere und schöne Wohnung, kann ohne Vorbehalte weiterempfohlen werden.",1,0.0,Neutral
328.0,14,4.0,2.0,6.0,55,100.0,1,5.961083106152229,4.95,4.95,4.64,4.81,44472456,"This apartment provided more than enough space for our family of 5 adults.  The apartment is very near a subway and train station, which made it easy to reach the various parts of Berlin.  If we return to Berlin in the future, we will love to stay at this apartment again.  The communication from the Host was very good and very much appreciated.  The bottle of sparkling wine waiting for us when we arrived was a very nice touch along with the goodie bag delivered toward the end of our 3 night stay.",0,0.9599,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,10,100.0,0,4.92204315033869,4.84,4.97,4.48,4.68,9620858,"This stay was really my best experience in Airbnb. You can't be nicer y helpful as Soren did with me. I want to come back in one week hihi. The flat is amazing perfect for a single person or a couple. Very clean, well decorated, kitchen all furnishes, a good bed and balcony. <br/>Let's chill on his sofa watching tv or listening music or the best seat on the balcony looking the stars.<br/>I have never been in a silence and peaceful place like this one, after 5 days I understood that's part of the area and for shure  of the culture ",1,0.9798,Positive
78.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,7.443244193575699,4.84,4.84,4.68,4.76,42858136,"Ben is a very nice host, very responsive and helpful. I enjoyed a stay there.",1,0.9052,Positive
284.0,12,3.0,1.0,4.0,56,100.0,1,9.660413858650209,4.9,4.94,4.46,4.76,16280687,Die Wohnung ist schön geräumig und war einfach perfekt für unsere Reise in großer Gruppe. Kommunikation und Sauberkeit auch sehr gut. Gerne wieder!,0,-0.8439,Negative
112.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,15,100.0,1,7.070036931233181,4.86,4.89,4.62,4.71,1084512,"Super séjour dans un appartement au calme, quartier sympa, de quoi se restaurer, à proximité du métro et du quartier Mitte. Je recommande!",1,0.636,Positive
67.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,16,90.0,1,6.129615081104432,4.93,4.99,4.88,4.74,19683019,"My stay with Sandra was very comfortable. l felt like home,was given enough privacy and she provided with everything l asked for. The location is great since there are several options for public transport to get anywhere. Thank you very much Sandra 🙂",1,0.9179,Positive
