206.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,91.0,0,1.3231577133885242,4.84,4.87,4.9,4.5,39886151,Alles tip top gelaufen,1,0.2023,Positive
422.0,6,3.0,2.0,4.0,60,100.0,1,3.559770173058828,4.94,4.96,4.93,4.77,11483775,"Marcus's apartment was amazing and I will recommend his place to all my friends visiting Berlin. The apartment was big, had comfortable beds, 2 bathrooms, multiple balconies and a rooftop with a view of the TV tower. Marcus was extremely accommodating and made the entire process seamless. The apartment's location was amazing and was walking distance from most city center activities.",0,0.9477,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,1.3773060525895495,4.72,4.84,4.91,4.66,1461489656921679773,"Very nice location!!! But there was a lot of noise coming from the bar inside the hotel, so that was a little bit disturbing. But overal very great hotel!",1,0.7408,Positive
242.0,4,2.0,2.0,2.0,40,93.0,1,2.200766127261005,4.82,4.69,4.94,4.71,8396454,"Having experienced so many Airbnb stays, I have to say that our stay at Elena's apartment was one of the best, if not the best experience so far. The apartment is brand new, tastefully furnished, full of natural light (floor to ceiling glass windows give you very luxurious feeling), and right across from Mauerpark. We have 2 small kids and a double stroller so wide doors & elevators made life very easy and convenient. Indoor parking is always a plus. There's also a plenty of on-street parking spaces around the building. The location is excellent as well - close to everywhere including great restaurants and coffee shops, plenty of designer boutiques. Very well connected in terms of public transport. We biked whenever possible and were able to store our bike in the indoor bike storage in the building.<br/>Finally, Elena was an amazing host. She was always so prompt in replying to any of our concerns and needs. She was like a good fairy with a magic wand making things happen asap. Will definitely recommend her place and hers will be our first choice when we are in Berlin again.<br/>",0,0.9902,Positive
267.0,10,3.0,1.0,9.0,26,100.0,0,4.0467674194843655,4.35,4.32,4.73,4.09,12541792,Ich hatte bei der Unterkunft etwas mehr erwartet.<br/>Die Räume sind schön groß und es bietet auch genügend Schlafmöglichkeiten.<br/>Leider war das WLAN nicht nutzbar (keine Bandbreite).<br/>Die Sauberkeit könnte besser sein sah eher so aus als ob lange keiner da war.<br/>Der TV und die Kaffeemaschine sind nicht die auf den Bildern.<br/>Kontakt war sehr freundlich. Die Lage macht es wet.,0,-0.9661,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,1,2.865184368884553,4.75,4.78,4.84,4.71,1029535508091110733,Unser Aufenthalt war super!,1,0.0,Neutral
72.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,8.690106845303559,4.76,4.75,4.61,4.64,9356063,"Nuestra estancia en el departamento fue muy agradable. Tenía todo lo necesario para sentirse muy cómodos, además lleno de detalles que nos hacían sentir casi como en casa. Todo muy limpio y ordenado. El edificio muy silencioso.<br/>Se encuentra relativamente lejos del centro, pero a 7 minutos caminando se encuentra el sistema de transporte público (S1) que conecta directamente con varios de los principales puntos turísticos de la ciudad.<br/>Lo podemos recomendar ampliamente.",1,0.0,Neutral
105.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,12.530294378984047,4.9,4.86,4.87,4.72,50516166,"Wohnlich und praktisch eingerichtete Wohnung, Küche super, alles vorhanden.<br/>Sehr gutes sardisches Restaurant grad um die Ecke.<br/>ÖV-Anbindung perfekt.<br/>Waren zum 2. Mal in der Wohnung von Nadja und kommen wieder!",1,0.0,Neutral
