193.0,6,2.0,1.0,5.0,42,100.0,1,0.601371120108,4.76,4.63,4.94,4.73,4335533,"Rainer is een prima gastheer, ongecompliceerd, gastvrij en joviaal.<br/>Je ziet dat je dit al heel lang doet en het allemaal heel normaal geworden is om gasten te ontvangen, de rondleiding te geven en dan de reiziger de kans geeft om alles zelf te ontdekken. Wat het leukst is!<br/>We gaan zeker reclame maken voor jouw appartement in het hart van de stad.",0,0.0,Neutral
141.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,43,94.0,0,7.131273504704622,4.74,4.82,4.79,4.62,49070135,"If you’re looking for well located, well connected accommodation just a little to the west of central Berlin, then this is the place for you!<br/>So close to the Zoo and metro links to anywhere in the city. <br/>The auto check-in is flawless, the facilities are superb - whether on business or leisure, and the communication with hosts is almost instant. <br/>We had a minor issue that was unique to our stay and the hosts were as attentive and supportive as they could have been. <br/>We’re in Berlin on business at least once a year and I think we’ve found our ‘home from home’!<br/>Enjoy!",1,0.9284,Positive
