140.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,91.0,0,4.871252294318258,4.72,4.78,4.85,4.58,46812239,"Die Unterkunft war super. Für den Preis und die Ausstattung... wow. Kann man echt nichts bemängeln. Die Kommunikation war auch top, sehr freundlich und nett. Auf jeden fall empfehlenswert!!",1,-0.9115,Negative
159.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,37,99.0,0,1.8467161104240724,4.73,4.79,4.67,4.51,45230697,"Amazing! We loved the apartment! We were able to walk everywhere. Bus, tram and everything was close by. The apartment was comfortable. We would definitely stay there again.",1,0.9358,Positive
141.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,43,94.0,0,7.131273504704622,4.74,4.82,4.79,4.62,49070135,"Located directly across from the train, within walking distance of many gay bars and restaurants. <br/>The room is well equipped with a microwave, refrigerator, electric kettle, coffee maker, dishes, glasses and utensils.  <br/>I had an issue with my room and the staff was very responsive and moved me to a new room.  <br/>I saved 200 Euro on a 5 night stay compared to staying at the hotel nearby.  A great value!  <br/>I will stay at Numa Berlin Drift every time I visit Berlin.",1,0.9258,Positive
110.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,35,80.0,0,2.3934343952153427,4.91,4.94,5.0,4.83,50774478,"The apartment is just as it looks in the photos.<br/>It is quite central and you can get to the Brandenburg gate in about 10 minutes.<br/>It has everything you need for a pleasant stay and is in a residential area so quiet at night.<br/>The U bahn station is also very close by.<br/>Check in is via a key box and communication with the owner was very easy, and she was very helpful.",1,0.862,Positive
45.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,27,100.0,0,13.937893468275648,4.63,4.66,4.66,4.57,7838790,Sehr gemütliches Zimmer in gepflegter Wohnung. Hilfsbereite und nette Vermieterin! Die Wohnung liegt super Nahe am Messegelände - Absolut zu empfehlen. ,1,0.0,Neutral
45.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,11,100.0,0,2.365494381413607,4.97,5.0,4.93,4.88,3866928,Gunnar is a nice guy with a clean & nice apartment.,1,0.8074,Positive
213.0,8,3.0,1.0,5.0,31,100.0,1,5.600860807992449,4.67,4.61,4.63,4.55,17384054,"Super appartement à réserver. Hôte hyper accessible et accueillant. À proximité de la ligne U8 qui dessert directement Mauerpark ou encore le Trésor. <br/>Très confortable, propre et bien aménagé, une pépite ! Nous étions sept et nous n'avons pas eu de problème de place à l'intérieur. Plusieurs jeux de clés. À quelques mètres de supers endroits pour prendre un verre. <br/>Rue très calme, pas de problème de nuisance (malgré les travaux de façade en ce moment).<br/>Si vous venez de l'aéroport en transport en commun, vous pouvez compter 1h sinon prenez un Uber ou un taxi, c'est 25 euros et vous y êtes en 15 minutes.",0,0.636,Positive
