125.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,44,75.0,0,1.982830878298401,5.0,4.86,4.96,4.93,5531533,"Beautiful, spacious and light apartment in a prime location (spent the weekend walking around to so many lovely nearby spots). Valerie is the perfect host, generous and kind; we felt right at home. Would love to visit again!",1,0.9746,Positive
