130.0,2,2.0,1.0,2.0,51,100.0,1,2.3870466769214023,4.83,4.84,4.9,4.73,3210996,"Excellent communication from host. Was gracious even when plans changed and we arrived earlier than anticipated. Apartment is clean, comfortable. Great location, walking distance to pretty much everything. Check in and out was easy. Would definitely recommend.",1,0.9812,Positive
112.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,1,7.03606664813505,4.84,4.94,4.63,4.75,926670,Wir haben eine Woche in der Wohnung verbracht und hatten eine tolle Zeit. Die Anbindung an die öffentlichen Verkehrmittel ist super und die Wohnung war super sauber und gemütlich. Definitive Empfehlung!,1,-0.8439,Negative
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,1,7.240134861209534,4.8,4.85,4.57,4.72,11775402,Cozy place off a side street. Close to several main streets with bars and restaurants. The room is decorated with stylish antique furnishings. Felt more like a boutique hotel in some parts of the world.  Was nice coming back to after a day of sightseeing and relaxing by the fire with a cup of coffee. Outdoor space is also great if it's a nice day or evening. ,1,0.923,Positive
112.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,1,7.03606664813505,4.84,4.94,4.63,4.75,926670,"The apartment in Sprengelstrasse 24 includes all that you need for a pleasant stay in Berlin. Located in Wedding it gives you insight into an up-coming trendy and profiled Berlin area. The access to  inner city attractions via public transportation goes via the U 9 line, which may be experienced  as a bit limited. However, the apartment and the areas is really  worth giving a chance in order to get unik Berlin experience.",1,0.8843,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,9,100.0,1,6.0353994999254885,4.91,4.76,4.88,4.86,36866194,"Alexis es una persona amigable y simpática, el alojamiento era amplio pero el inodoro no estaba limpio, la cama era muy cómoda y la ducha con muy buena presión de agua.<br/>Si bien las reglas de la casa no permiten cocinar y es comprensible, nunca me había ocurrido no tener la posibilidad de calentar una comida ya elaborada en un alojamiento de air BnB.",1,-0.6808,Negative
100.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,1,7.44187505020188,4.75,4.72,4.53,4.53,1099852594584694022,"Die Unterkunft war genauso wie beschrieben – sauber, gemütlich und gut ausgestattet. Ich habe mich sofort wohlgefühlt. Besonders angenehm war die ruhige Lage und dennoch gute Erreichbarkeit.<br/>Der Kontakt mit dem Gastgeber war sehr freundlich und unkompliziert. Alles verlief reibungslos und herzlich – man merkt, dass hier mit viel Sorgfalt und Aufmerksamkeit Gastgeber sind.<br/>Ich würde jederzeit wiederkommen und kann den Aufenthalt absolut empfehlen!",1,-0.9674,Negative
168.0,6,2.0,1.5,3.0,21,99.0,0,3.880339168487847,4.63,4.39,4.81,4.5,33234428,"Stellas place was very nice, interesting layout and very quiet and spacious! I recommend for a lovely stay to explore the city :) loved the printout recommendations:)",0,0.9616,Positive
175.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,16,89.0,0,3.210467911644057,4.5,4.59,4.68,4.52,26808026,"Unterkunft war sehr sauber. Für eine Übernachtung bestens zu empfehlen. Das Waschbecken ist etwas klein, aber es erfüllt alles seinen Zweck.",1,-0.5994,Negative
260.0,5,2.0,2.0,4.0,52,100.0,1,5.145591900802804,5.0,4.98,4.9,4.88,973171385470517929,"We had a great stay in a wonderful apartment that had everything! Anja was the perfect host; attentive, responsive, and considerate. The apartment is in a great location for going out and exploring Berlin, but is also so nice and homely for just staying in and relaxing. Highly, highly recommended, and many thanks Anja :-)",0,0.9847,Positive
