161.0,8,3.0,2.0,3.0,35,100.0,1,6.906667346101181,4.78,4.72,4.69,4.75,5977917,"Apartment was in good location, overall the apartment was nice and a good size.<br/>There is no oven in the kitchen which was a little disappointing.<br/>The apartment got a bit cold in the evening and when we turned the thermostat nothing happened.<br/>Overall a nice place and good location.",0,0.9022,Positive
50.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,0,10.045446339635951,4.75,4.88,4.59,4.77,321295,"This home was modern and incredibly cozy in the wonderful city of Berlin. A perfect place for a traveling couple or maybe two friends exploring the wonders of Europe. Although rather far from the city center, the bus should take you in no problem. The apartment is impecabbly clean and stocked with kitchen supplies for cooking and the like. Heike and her husband are very kind and accommodating. Would definitely recommend!",1,0.9637,Positive
130.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,34,100.0,1,3.2495001173259874,4.89,4.78,4.7,4.75,1100147066666216822,"Thank you so much for letting us stay in your beautiful artist apartment. The balcony was so fun to relax on and everything was as described, so friendly, responsive, and felt right at home. Thank you again I would love to re-book the next time we are in Berlin. Tschüss und Tausend Dank!",1,0.9812,Positive
