125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,8,100.0,0,2.8060749505492466,4.82,4.73,4.91,4.55,36834775,Ich kann Sorsha nur wärmstens weiterempfehlen. Super schöne Wohnung mit guter Anbindung an die öffentlichen Verkehrsmittel. Klasse Kommunikation und sehr flexibel mit unseren Check in/out Zeiten. Wir hatten dank Sorsha einen super Aufenthalt in Berlin 👍.,1,0.5994,Positive
103.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,1,6.782182931571986,4.95,4.93,4.69,4.84,51181494,"Lucia is a wonderful host, and everything was very smooth from beginning to end. She had great recommendations and was always contactable if needed. The flat is the sweetest (the carefully curated pieces d’art are gorgeous!) and very warm and welcoming after a very cold stay in Berlin. It’s also right next to transport and in a great location, with lots of bars and cafes nearby. Would absolutely book again!",1,0.9603,Positive
127.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,47,99.0,0,6.070945397633094,4.68,4.69,4.71,4.5,909297144466256193,"All good. There was some work on the entrance hall and the tv was not working. Stuff that were communicated to me after the booking. No problems by the way. Nice room, clean and modern. No probs with the check in even if everything was digital. I prefer having a person to communicate with but everything went smooth. Recommended for short stays.",1,0.431,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,4.190972540353783,4.93,4.96,4.73,4.92,17688829,"I had a great time staying in Stefanie’s place as she’s a truly welcoming host who makes you feel at home. You can immediately see how the apartment is furnished with love and attention to all sorts of beautiful details, including the room for the guests. I enjoyed coziness and peace of my room which was just what I needed after roaming around Berlin all days long.",1,0.9805,Positive
