112.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,27,99.0,0,3.5203574283502013,4.13,4.03,4.69,4.25,1050424535012234861,"It could be that Berlin centre is popular and therefore a bit more expensive, therefore it might be a normal deal. <br/>But the place lacks warmth and attention. Everything is standardised and ruled in  order to minimize any potential efforts by the host. We could only enter 4 pm and were forced to leave at 10 am... unbelievable.<br/>I would not return...<br/>Olaf",1,0.3818,Positive
