151.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,28,97.0,0,3.918641789625612,4.72,4.74,4.79,4.58,11450419,Stefan's apartment in East Berlin was ideal. I stayed with my boyfriend and dad for four nights to check out the sights & the apartment was in a great location - literally a few minutes walk to a u-bahn station & great supermarket. The king size bed & bunks beds were very comfortable. Quiet & clean. We ate out every night but the apartment has everything you need to cook etc. Would be perfect for families too. Can't fault anything. Would stay again!,1,0.9572,Positive
221.0,6,3.0,1.0,4.0,29,100.0,0,3.811094276989304,4.71,4.79,4.75,4.65,31467134,Great place in heart Kreuzberg. Would recommend,0,0.765,Positive
