105.0,5,1.0,1.0,3.0,46,100.0,0,1.965451994137528,4.78,4.8,4.93,4.67,1125485718740226183,"goed apartment op een top locatie. parkeergelegenheid dichtbij, tram en metro op 100 meter waardoor je heel vlot overal geraakt. restaurants a volonté en zelfs een winkel op enkele minuten stappen.",1,0.2023,Positive
50.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,1,11.950234688344011,4.94,4.91,4.9,4.88,8331619,"Sabrina is a wonderful host and everything was very uncomplicated. The room is clean and very large, the house is well located with access to public transport and there is a nice garden with terrace. The bathroom has everything you need and the kitchen can be shared. It was definitely not my last stay at this property.<br/>Thank you Sabrina for the warm welcome and see you soon.",1,0.9601,Positive
158.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,1,1.6592287277224604,4.88,4.88,4.92,4.66,39685590,"Excellent apartment, great check-in/luggage storage/check-out experiences and host is readily available to help. Very well served of supermarkets (including bio), restaurants and bakeries as well as transportation.",1,0.9359,Positive
114.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,93.0,0,3.368430295107988,4.63,4.69,4.71,4.53,46462154,Appartement parfait pour deux. Proche des transports en commun. Balcon très agréable.,1,0.0,Neutral
40.0,2,2.0,1.5,3.0,57,100.0,1,1.1008973061098215,4.97,5.0,4.92,4.96,31466784,The location is great! From the airport you can get there in a number of ways wich she will tell you about. The appertment is very nice and clean and close to the city. <br/>We had a very nice stay.,1,0.9305,Positive
102.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,0,2.7824750390490918,4.95,4.97,4.94,4.86,10033310,"A perfect spot for a family trip. The flat is beautiful, clean and well-equipped. The kids were thrilled to find out they could use Netflix to relax after a lot of sightseeing ! Flowers and chocolate awaited us when we arrived + lots of advice from Jessy on where to go and what to see.<br/>And of course the location of the flat is perfect. ",1,0.9638,Positive
123.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,32,100.0,0,5.086004020180417,4.79,4.88,4.78,4.75,7543419,"Martin is very warm and caring, he even allowed us to store our bags in his apartment because we landed early in the morning. The apartment was clean and well-heated, the beds comfortable, and it is very close to the public transport. However, it lacks of some furnitures in the kitchen for 5-6 persons: a large saucepan, some chairs, a sieve....",1,0.8923,Positive
31.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,100.0,1,12.720083248666349,4.78,4.69,4.54,4.73,24154046,"Great place to stay!!!<br/>The room was fabulous, tidy, spacious and smells great! The kitchen was fully equipped. I didn’t make meals there but enjoyed my cuppa every morning! The bathroom is small but fully equipped. Phuong and Martin make you feel at home and was super friendly! Lent me a brolly that saved my day! Super quiet place. Just 10-15 mins walk to the station, which takes you to centre easily. Can’t recommend more! Worth 5 stars 🌟 🌟 🌟 🌟 🌟",1,0.9916,Positive
131.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,47,100.0,1,9.5977520239741,4.91,4.95,4.87,4.82,29977114,"Es ist eine sehr sehr schön Unterkunft, sehr zu empfehlen, sehr gut zu erreichen und die Kommunikation mit dem Vermieter verlief einwandfrei und super freundlich und zuvorkommend. Wir kommen jederzeit gerne wieder.",1,0.0,Neutral
82.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,6.919397234051426,4.85,4.87,4.48,4.72,20881101,"Danke für eine schöne Woche in Berlin! Die Wohnung ist so, wie im Inserat beschrieben. Sehr ruhig und dennoch ist man dank guter Anbindung an den ÖPNV schnell an den interessanten Orten in Berlin.",1,-0.636,Negative
