87.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,48,100.0,0,13.758682117445044,4.83,4.75,4.92,4.75,45984702,"Heike’s apartment is very cozy near by the Charlotenburg palace, very well furnished and very clean (I never stayed in such clean apartments on Airbnb). Heike is a very friendly owner. For us also was very important that there was a private parking lot ☺️ I would strongly recommend to stay there",1,0.9482,Positive
48.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,1,11.045433737585087,4.88,4.58,4.94,4.85,815136527628581143,"Gerhard's apartment was perfect for a short stay in Berlin. The best thing about the property is the location: The apartment is near Savignyplatz, which contains a number of beautiful cafes, restaurants and bookstores. The unit itself is an older, possibly pre-WWII building. It is thus a bit dusty, the wood floors creak, and you can occasionally hear the neighbors. Nevertheless, the old-style design is gorgeous, and I found it to be a very comfortable place to stay. The halls are lined with bookshelves, which is also a nice touch. The bathroom was very clean. Some of the pot and pans in the kitchen were a bit old, but I had everything that I needed. The bedroom was a bit spartan, but otherwise very comfortable. You might want to ask Gerhard how to work the blinds, since I could not figure them out. I wish I could have spoken to him more since he seems to have lived an interesting life. He was very friendly, though, and was willing to accommodate my early arrival. I would stay again.",1,0.9854,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,45,100.0,0,1.996224444395112,4.83,4.75,4.86,4.81,3608625,"Jose was an incredibly gracious host. When the airline lost my bag, he kept checking in to make sure I was able to retrieve it. He also reset the wifi at my request when the connection kept timing out. Just very responsive and helpful. The place itself is also amazing--very clean and well-appointed. The view is to die for. Will definitely stay again.",1,0.882,Positive
123.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,22,100.0,1,12.546920487342032,4.89,4.95,4.8,4.72,930093328752539003,Great place to stay,1,0.6249,Positive
20.0,6,1.0,0.0,6.0,21,100.0,0,3.818785253820972,4.47,4.45,4.56,4.55,30759237,Just ok<br/>Good breakfast all you can eat for 5 eurosvery close to the east side gallery and metro stationspeople were friendly<br/>There is a luggage room so you can leave your stuff if you haveto check out but you are  not leaving the city yet,1,-0.0598,Negative
