118.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,24,93.0,0,2.2997563334626485,4.63,4.61,4.74,4.55,16951874,"Schöne Wohnung, bei heißem Wetter innen angenehm kühl. Ruhig im Hinterhof, direkt vor der Haustür Kreuzberger Kiez mit vielen verschiedenen Möglichkeiten.  Kleine Terasse mit Markise. Check in unkompliziert, netter Kontakt. Absolut zu empfehlen!",1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,22,0.0,0,8.2125272429684,4.47,4.64,4.69,4.56,13669087,Spacious! Close to the Ubahn. Beautiful!,1,0.6688,Positive
78.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,100.0,1,2.4775921091657027,4.92,4.91,4.95,4.88,1172856,"The apartment is very cozy and charming. Gerit is creative and artistic and you can see it in how well decorated the space is! The room itself has lots of natural light and a comfortable bed. Gerit is super friendly and welcoming and easy to talk to and just a wonderful person overall, and her two kids are also very friendly. I felt very much at home here with them, and I couldn't have asked for a better place to stay. The location is also fantastic, right in the heart of Berlin, close to public transport, lots of cafes and restaurants nearby, and I always felt completely safe walking back home at night. If you are looking for a cozy space in a great location with a wonderful family, this is the place for you :) I will definitely try to stay here if I visit Berlin again!",1,0.9954,Positive
72.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,53,100.0,1,4.173322316586879,4.95,4.91,4.9,4.81,594731577761973352,Mano is amazing host. He always was very friendly and helpful and the place is very cozy & clean. It also very well connected to all the places you would like to visit by public transportation. This place is a real Airbnb experience as it meant to be :sharing with locals their life.,1,0.9639,Positive
