125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,0,1.7609040139934806,4.94,4.71,5.0,4.82,24907597,"The apartment is spacious and in a great location with easy access to transport, supermarkets, restaurants, cute shops and Mauer Park. The apartment had everything we needed and Katia was very responsive. Check in and out was very easy.",1,0.9402,Positive
124.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,22,90.0,1,0.9184054408592692,4.65,4.48,4.86,4.7,36445603,"Very close to the train station, (approx 150 meters), and very easy to find the incheck/building. Also easy to get in the city by S or U-bahn. The apartment is high up in a building, so you will have clear view. The rooms are big enough, and the kitchen has all you need.<br/>So, summary, we are pleased with our stay in Berlin, and will surely try to come back.",1,0.9298,Positive
90.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,42,100.0,1,1.9905011360206333,4.92,4.95,4.99,4.84,16279620,"Séjour absolument parfait.<br/>Appartement irréprochable avec une jolie déco et à proximité immédiate du tram qui dessert la gare principale de Berlin et les différents spots que nous recherchions.<br/>Bref, je recommande vivement.",1,0.0,Neutral
