90.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,5,100.0,0,3.680099838349676,4.86,4.55,4.86,4.9,863194919483679772,Wir hatten einen sehr schönen Aufenthalt bei Albrecht. Die Wohnung ist sehr schön eingerichtet und sauber. Albrecht ist super nett und die Kommunikation hat immer schnell funktioniert.,1,-0.5994,Negative
35.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,51,100.0,0,3.642892493197811,4.95,4.96,4.8,4.93,304904," Andreas é um excelente host, muito prestativo e uma pessoa ótima! A casa foi a melhor que ficamos em nossa viagem pela Europa: possui banheiro privativo, entrada separada da principal, utensílios de cozinha e frigobar, além de ser um quarto super moderno e aconchegante! O apartamento fica localizado em um bairro residencial, com pontos de trem muito próximos (3-5 minutos andando), há uma distância de cerca de 20-25 minutos dos pontos turísticos. <br/>Andreas e sua esposa são um casal muito legal e simpático. Nos convidaram para tomar um sorvete caseiro enquanto conversávamos sobre viagens no geral e ouvíamos um pouco mais sobre a história de Berlin. A minha experiência como um todo foi muito proveitosa e eu super recomendo esse quarto a quem pretende visitar a cidade! ",1,0.8392,Positive
101.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,1,3.0191512330624914,4.88,4.77,4.73,4.66,21735977,"clean place as described, and Ikea equipped with everything you would need. espresso machine was nice bonus, and neighborhood is prime location. washer worked well and helped a lot. <br/>5 story walk up was a challenge with suitcases, and the internet for some reason blocked the use of 3 major communication apps: Whats App, Skype,and FaceTime.  This was quite an inconvenience. For that reason alone I wouldn't stay here again but it depends on how connected you need to be during your stay. ",1,0.4139,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,0,9.89692240277246,4.72,4.43,4.78,4.76,23088570,"Everything was perfect! Wide, clean and beautifully decorated room. Located in a nice calm area so you’ll sleep like a baby. Andrea is  very kind, helpfull and makes you feel welcome! It’s very easy to get to the centre with public transportation from the house. When you’re here make sure to check out the flea market in the weekend that’s at walking distance. Would definitely recommend!",1,0.9875,Positive
42.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,8.241604614879243,4.7,4.65,4.88,4.66,23451359,"This apartment is extremely dirty, although that is not entirely the host's fault as the other people staying at the location when I did were complete slobs. The bathroom is filthy, the sink and shower appear to not have been cleaned in months. The ""clean"" dishes have fingerprints and lip prints. Food/grease stains are all over the stovetop. The host will come by at night to do the dishes but if she is gone, it is up to the different tenants to do the cleaning. However, the other people living in the apartment during my stay did not do their dishes for days at a time, which would cause a buildup in the sink. This apartment is cheap like a hostel but I would suggest staying in a hostel instead as they have dedicated staff to clean, whereas this apartment does not.",1,0.8281,Positive
95.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,1,3.2655381260982392,4.91,4.87,4.87,4.82,456902,Wonderful place and stay :),1,0.7717,Positive
