55.0,2,1.0,0.5,1.0,33,100.0,0,4.254453954041949,4.69,4.46,4.68,4.49,919925406080950698,"Anna is a really nice friendly and helpful person. The apartment is really well located in a quiet area well connected to transport for visiting the city. Enough amenities around for your needs. Really good value, I would  recommend it to a friend! <br/>Thank you Anna!",1,0.9759,Positive
