64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,1,19.305886449552432,4.95,4.89,4.78,4.94,907807912932543143,"I ended my 2-week-long tour of Germany at Birgit's place, far away from bustling central Berlin, in the peaceful corridors, close to the airport. My stay there was great. Birgit did all and beyond to ensure I had the best time and shared local information with some nice recommendation for things to do. Would recommend!",1,0.9686,Positive
