67.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,100.0,1,7.149002890725338,4.82,4.85,4.53,4.41,45460407,"Die Ferienwohnung ist sehr gut, gemütlich. Es ist alles da, was man so benötigt. Sie ist in einer ruhigeren Straße gelegen und von den Nachbarn ist nichts zu hören, so dass man wunderbar schlafen und sich erholen kann. <br/>Trotzdem ist die Verbindung in die City gut zu erreichen.",1,-0.9136,Negative
160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,98.0,0,1.0407544919436775,4.54,4.66,4.77,4.45,34294913,"The reception staff were fantastic - so friendly, helpful and accommodating. This really made a positive impact on our stay.<br/>The apartment was well equipped, clean and well designed. The only slight negative was that it was a little worn. Sheets and towels were very clean - as was the room itself.<br/>Location is very good and its very good value - we would definitely stay there again",1,0.9825,Positive
190.0,6,1.0,1.0,6.0,29,99.0,0,1.5910745575556304,4.64,4.71,4.51,4.54,6098179,"Nice hostel to stay, located very well. Breakfast is good, but each day is the same. <br/>Recommend!",0,0.5911,Positive
52.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,10.552267411509238,4.88,4.85,4.77,4.85,15652886,"My stay at Hardi's was great. The whole flat was very clean and tidy. The guest room was cozy and equipped with everything you need for a trip to Berlin.<br/>Hardi even prepared a nice breakfast for free on the first day which I find awesome!<br/>All in all I would definitely recommend this flat.",1,0.9741,Positive
