328.0,14,4.0,2.0,6.0,55,100.0,1,5.961083106152229,4.95,4.95,4.64,4.81,44472456,Sehr gut,0,0.0,Neutral
47.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,26,100.0,0,13.72252668419708,4.51,4.6,4.69,4.51,7828523,"It was a nice room, located in a beautiful neighbourhood, close to supermarkets, U-bahn and S-bahn.<br/>The host provides very clear instructions, so check-in and check-out are easy.<br/>Towels are provided.<br/>It was a bit noisy, as there are many rooms in the Pansion and people are always coming home or leaving. It also gets hot during the night.",1,0.8357,Positive
82.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,6.919397234051426,4.85,4.87,4.48,4.72,20881101,"The apartment was clean and tidy. We were positively surprised by the amount of equipment that was available in the kitchen, so if you plan for a long stay and you like cooking, you will most likely have everything that you might need. The area was quiet and the city centre could be reached easily by public transport or by bike. We had a lovely time there!",1,0.9468,Positive
133.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,98.0,0,5.7311235960374,4.7,4.82,4.46,4.53,1359377017583012847,Wir hatten eine schöne Zeit in Berlin und konnten uns mit nahegelegenen Einkaufsläden stets versorgen. Eine preiswerte Alternative zu einem Hotel mit Restaurant. Liegt praktischerweise direkt an der U-Bahn-Station.,1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,0,13.272071336641623,4.73,4.67,4.79,4.67,31897019,"Mein Aufenthalt war vom ersten Moment an gut. Gemütliche Wohnung, gute ÖPNV-Anbindung, nette Gastgeber.",1,-0.5994,Negative
60.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,45,100.0,1,3.7006789062140943,4.78,4.67,4.78,4.71,30660100,"The flat was large and clean. Communication with Dietrich was good. Close to sbahn and trams direct to alexander platz. The walk to pberg was longer than i realised, but try friedrichschain on tram for more convenient restaurants and cafes.  Also supermarket edeka very close.<br/>The flat was only made up for one person, so we had to root around for towels and make the bed for two. I found it odd that a double bed would only be made with one pillow anyway. <br/>A few bits to help you settle in would be nice, we had just half a toilet roll, no bin bags, no coffee or sugar, no milk. A bit annoying combined with the bedding/towels to need to plan to buy toilet rollstraight away. <br/>The showerhead is broken, the top over head one is gone. It works ok without this but the secondary shower head sometimes falls out the holder. Pressure is very good.<br/>All in all, good size and convenient location for public transport, but we wouldnt stay again.",1,-0.4497,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,14,98.0,0,2.470825343422713,4.47,4.31,4.82,4.49,46744092,Everything was fine :) thank you,1,0.743,Positive
80.0,5,1.0,1.0,3.0,33,100.0,0,4.355514717325515,4.58,4.58,4.56,4.44,1126697438171100092,Todo muy limpio y ordenado al momento de llegar al apartamento. Esta completamente equipado.,1,0.0,Neutral
141.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,43,94.0,0,7.131273504704622,4.74,4.82,4.79,4.62,49070135,"A great stay, fantastic location near public transport. The room was perfect and facilities were great",1,0.9477,Positive
60.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,4.969455123944517,4.86,4.98,4.64,4.81,13231476,"Incredibly nice host, no problems communicating with. <br/>Looks like the pictures, very close to the metro and train station. <br/>Highly recommended ⭐️",1,0.3025,Positive
207.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,33,100.0,1,1.6592287277224604,4.89,4.93,4.92,4.6,39477964,"This apartment was great! Very clean, very quiet and an awesome deck area for a morning coffee. I found the apartment a little small for two people as there is no real wardrobe to put your clothes. Maybe a good apartment for one person. The area is fantastic with lots of cafe's, bars and restaurants. You can also rent a bicycle from Simon which is conveniently located downstairs. The elevator to the apartment is a plus too!",1,0.9522,Positive
115.0,5,1.0,1.0,3.0,49,100.0,1,5.871560485458869,4.83,4.77,4.61,4.65,48181556,"I never received the entry code from hosts, who were completely unresponsive for 2 days, so I had to find an alternative accommodation at the very last minute, pay extra for it, and waste time. If I were a host and knew I had people arriving (and I told hosts exactly what time), I would at the very least check my messages. It's just common decency when you're running a business.",1,-0.5367,Negative
276.0,3,2.0,2.0,3.0,61,100.0,1,9.076307917104932,4.82,4.77,4.76,4.71,44223601,"Et virkelig godt sted. En fin, ren og rummelig lejlighed. Luksus at have en lejlighed der bliver rengjort hverdag. Opfyldning af kaffe og te hverdag. Ekstrem god value for money. De varmeste anbefalinger fra os.",0,0.5423,Positive
243.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,8,88.0,0,3.560186030012189,4.42,4.53,4.81,4.24,854251028991888522,Very nice apartment in the middle of Berlin. The apartment was clean and the check in was very easy.,1,0.8396,Positive
55.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,49,100.0,1,22.12570946122336,4.92,4.96,4.47,4.89,551948848079907495,so nice!,1,0.5244,Positive
126.0,5,1.0,1.0,3.0,38,100.0,1,2.459926794886368,4.93,4.97,4.8,4.87,3973420,"A wonderful apartment in an amazing city.  The apartment is in a quiet part of old Berlin, very close to public transport and helpful shops and cafes.  It was immaculately clean, perfectly minimal in style and free from unnecessary clutter.  Simone was simply the nicest host we've had so far - incredibly friendly and helpful, genuinely interested in helping us get the most out of our stay, going above and beyond to support and advise.  I can't recommend this apartment and host more - if only all Airbnb experiences were like this!",1,0.9895,Positive
