64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,0,0.9743374747359532,4.87,4.72,4.93,4.75,25900013,Lovely Apartment hosted by equally as lovely people. I stayed for a month as part of a summer school programme at Humboldt University. Very Good transport links and walking distance to many busy Berlin areas. Clean and bright apartment with all the facilities I could have needed and great communication between the hosts. Also near 2 supermarkets and a short walk to the mall so shopping needs are definitely catered for.,1,0.9726,Positive
