140.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,45,100.0,0,2.416427424980613,4.95,4.93,4.93,4.87,49857753,Absolutely loved the flat. It was beautifully decorated and we felt immediately at home. The local transport connections were fabulous and made life very easy. We know the area well but still managed to find new places to explore. I would thoroughly recommend. Victoria was very responsive and available which made things a lot easier.,1,0.9632,Positive
