75.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,6.379603690669542,4.8,4.68,4.8,4.76,48673134,"Een bijzonder appartement! Heel compact en slim ingedeeld zodat alle nodige voorzieningen beschikbaar zijn. Goed gelegen met veel voorzieningen in de buurt en de metro om de hoek die je in no time overal brengt waar je wezen wil. Frank is een zeer behulpzame host die de grootst mogelijke privacy combineert met een bereidwillige en gastvrije houding en heldere en directe communicatie. Van harte aanbevolen voor 1, maximaal 2 personen. Technisch kan 4 ook, maar dat wordt dan wel heel krap…",1,-0.8832,Negative
44.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,1,4.948763181664733,4.54,4.16,4.79,4.58,22736888,"L'alloggio era come descritto dalle foto e dalla descrizione sul sito, il bagno e la camera erano ben puliti e attrezzati. Luois è stato simpatico e ci ha consigliato anche che cosa vedere durante il nostro breve soggiorno. L'unica pecca era la porta che non si poteva chiudere a chiave.",1,0.34,Positive
95.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,26,100.0,1,6.909350477606368,4.96,4.87,4.87,4.76,115576,Very nice host and a lovely neighbourhood. Cozy home,1,0.7841,Positive
87.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,21,90.0,0,3.196091525660409,4.72,4.86,4.67,4.6,541569,"We have an incredible stay at Silke's place.  Spacious, clean and very well located. Only 10 minutes walk from the metro where we can get every city corner, 50 mts from the Aldi supermarket and just two step far from the Kruger Kafe where we tasted a delicious coffee mit milch. Silke helped us with every doubt and her wapp was always ready to answer our inqueries. I would stay in Silke's apartment if I had the opportunity to visit Berlin again. Thanks so much",1,0.9259,Positive
68.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,20,100.0,1,6.801132231621815,4.75,4.79,4.43,4.64,15985692,"The apartment was a great surprise. I would highly recommend a stay here and will certainly try to book again next time we are in Berlin. <br/>I was not expecting a great night of sleep, as we were sleeping on a fold out couch, but my husband and I both found it very comfortable and our children said that the single beds were also great.<br/>The information provided in the apartment was great, especially the public transport map and the little treats left for us were appreciated. Big thumbs up from us.",1,0.9757,Positive
91.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,26,100.0,0,7.579291414010911,4.61,4.57,4.89,4.6,15868988,"Nous avons passé un magnifique séjour à Berlin en famille (3 adultes, 1 ado). L'appartement est idéalement situé et bien équipé. Nous avons bénéficié d'un excellent accueil et des précieux conseils de nos hôtes. Nous y reviendrons volontiers!",1,0.6114,Positive
