77.0,2,0.0,3.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,3.19972493794385,4.84,4.91,4.91,4.66,44384786,"Ich hatte das Vergnügen, in diesem charmanten Hostel in Berlin zu übernachten, und es war einfach perfekt! Mein Einzelzimmer war tadellos sauber und gemütlich, das Bett war äußerst bequem. Die Lage war ideal für meine Bedürfnisse. Normalerweise bin ich kein „Hostel Typ“, aber es war so gemütlich und ruhig, dass ich gerne wiederkommen würde.",1,-0.9694,Negative
112.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,1,6.315146266976091,4.69,4.44,4.86,4.71,51403847,"The Airbnb is very well located, and the check-in process was smooth and extremely friendly. There are plenty of dining options nearby, making it the perfect place for my stay in Berlin. An additional plus is the luggage storage available on the day of departure, which is very convenient. Please note that this Airbnb is on the ground floor, and the windows face directly onto the street. There are curtains that can be closed, but no shutters.",1,0.5077,Positive
