97.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,50,100.0,1,7.213357439951281,4.85,4.78,4.72,4.75,11772098,This Airbnb is one of the most beautiful places I've ever stayed. The garden is amazing. Carmen was very helpful in directing us to some good local food places nearby and we found our way around very easy. We had the best stay here in beautiful Berlin and will definitely be back to visit again one day ! ,1,0.9827,Positive
