125.0,2,2.0,1.0,2.0,53,100.0,1,11.154234252072165,4.9,4.53,4.93,4.77,16414196,"I stayed in the apartment for four months from January until April. <br/>Pluses - Apartment had everything I needed so I didn't have to buy almost anything besides toilet paper, sponges, and some small stuff. The bed was also comfortable. Some parts of the apartment are renovated. The bedroom faces inner courtyard so it is very quiet and you cannot hear cars.<br/>Negatives - The toilet does not flush well and it leads to clogging, similar problem is with the kitchen sink. The kitchen was also full of clutter with lot of different things and no place to put my food. I had to basically move half of the things into the larder to free up some space in the kitchen for my groceries.<br/>Although I couldn't hear almost any outside noise, I could hear people from the apartments above and below. The downstairs neighbor was having parties/playing loud music sometimes and was rude when I asked her to keep the music down at night.",1,-0.2764,Negative
76.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,21,0.0,0,4.739235700911992,4.92,4.5,4.83,4.67,5008340,"I had an incredible stay at James's apartment. His apartment is very cool, well furnished, clean, and comfortable. The location is really amazing as well. It's a beautiful neighborhood with tons of restaurants, bars, shops, and nice people. James is great at communicating and helped accommodate me when I had some travel plans change at the last minute. I think this is a great place for anyone, but especially if it is your first time in Berlin you'll be really glad to stay here.",1,0.9666,Positive
153.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,1,6.499779374101731,4.62,4.3,4.52,4.52,50601986,"Great apartment in a non-touristy local area. Very close to a major metro station, so getting around Berlin was easy.",1,0.7906,Positive
