64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,13,100.0,0,12.847070996445092,5.0,4.5,4.5,5.0,10063584,"We didnt meet Caroline but her housemates welcomed us at the apartment. They are helpful and friendly. The room is spacious, quiet and warm. The apartment is very close to the Sbahn station, just 20 min away from the center. Highly recommended :) ",1,0.9662,Positive
