97.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,8,100.0,1,4.638119293679826,4.86,4.93,4.79,4.71,29100712,"Had a great week-long stay. The place is right in the heart of a diverse area with lots to do in the area. Hasenheide Park is within walking distance, and the U-Bahn is right around the corner.<br/>Marie’s place was warm and cozy, fully stocked with everything needed, and made me feel right at home. Marie was very communicative, friendly, and provided detailed instructions.<br/>Thank you, Marie!",1,0.868,Positive
120.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,61,100.0,1,0.7901252829143086,5.0,5.0,5.0,4.96,1128714263967602952,"My stay was wonderful, I really liked the place, it was exactly like the pictures, at a nice location, clean and nicely decorated",1,0.9493,Positive
