247.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,1,5.2396889205230845,4.9,4.97,4.94,4.85,9881695,"Three of us stayed a week and throughly enjoyed the apartment. Super clean with a lot of charm. My favorite room was the kitchen. Beds were soft and I slept well! Hosts were prompt with communication and very accommodating.  <br/>Locationwise, it is close to Boxhagenerplatz, a green area with farmer's market and flea markets on weekends. There are dozens of unique (hipster?) restaurants in the neighborhood, including vegan options, which we enjoyed. Near to ""Samariterstrasse"" U5 stop and a couple of grocery stores, it was perfect. Recommended!",0,0.9747,Positive
