90.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,0,3.511452148968892,4.69,4.78,4.69,4.59,24573909,"The place is really nice and over the expectations! Very centric, you can reach everything in 15 min by tram or Ubahn. Anne is an easygoing person, very nice to talk to! She was very helpful and gave me many tips. I recommend to stay at her place.",1,0.9295,Positive
