86.0,6,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,1,5.86478718066573,4.85,4.76,4.72,4.71,51830435,"Semaine très agréable dans cet appartement calme, accueillant et bien situé.",1,0.0,Neutral
95.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,36,100.0,0,3.2861856977959745,4.78,4.58,4.85,4.65,21812927,"This flat is on the ground floor and only a few minutes from train stations and tram stops. You can explore anywhere in Berlin without the need of a car from here. The flat has two separate bedrooms with proper beds (no sofa beds or sleeping in the living area). The kitchen facilities were adequate to prepare meals and it was great having a washing machine. The flat was clean and comfortable. Although there was no TV the wifi was excellent so it is easy to stream entertainment on your own devices. There are plenty of places nearby to have a meal, a drink and get groceries. Would recommend.",1,0.9655,Positive
