97.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,6.039969405427581,4.9,4.86,4.8,4.82,31382644,"This place is PERFECT! It’s spacious, clean, bright, and has everything you need. Benjamin is a great host & was always available and super kind. The place looks a lot better than the photos, is super close to the subway and in a really cool area near parks & landmarks. A wonderful stay, thank you!",1,0.9896,Positive
198.0,5,3.0,1.0,4.0,58,100.0,1,4.248993153501094,4.85,4.86,4.92,4.76,8603631,"Tolle Wohnung, die nicht nur super gut gelegen, sondern auch sehr sauber und schön ist! Ich wurde sehr toll empfangen und alles hat wunderbar funktioniert! :) Danke, Chris! Ich werde euch definitiv weiterempfehlen :)",0,0.783,Positive
103.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,44,100.0,1,1.656083928367451,4.81,4.88,4.61,4.76,10608680,"Tara’s place was exactly what we needed! Clean, had all the amenities necessary, comfortable beds, almost no city noise, nice views from the two balconies. Tara’s communication was also fast and clear, and we greatly appreciated the flexibility to drop our bags off a little before check in.",1,0.9318,Positive
140.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,1,3.2989117833003925,4.64,4.71,4.63,4.57,322463,Overall we had a good experience. The area was great and the room was clean and spacious. Would recommend/ visit again. Only trouble we had was upon our arrival. After arriving 1 minute early we knocked on the wrong door and a man affiliated with the airbnb spoke to us very rudely. It was jarring especially after a long day of travel and as young women traveling alone. I would appreciate a bit more kindness next time! Otherwise good.,1,0.8221,Positive
158.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,1,1.6592287277224604,4.94,4.96,4.92,4.77,39476966,Wunderbare Unterkunft im Prenzlauer Berg - Super Kommunikation und alles wie beschrieben!,1,0.636,Positive
143.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,90.0,1,11.510851452846596,4.75,4.76,4.8,4.54,699809535745814134,"Clean, easy check-in, good location.",1,0.8176,Positive
104.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,3.614936598767828,4.76,4.78,4.87,4.71,640160204406168059,"Die Lage des Apartments war für uns perfekt. Das Apartment war sauber und schön eingerichtet. Die Straße war ebenfalls ruhig und nett. Leider hatten wir viel Lärm von den Nachbarn von oben (mit kläffenden Hunden), aber eventuell war dies Zufall.  <br/>Als Host war Jan sehr hilfsbereit, gerade als es anfangs mit den Übermittlungen von Informationen mit der App von Airbnb Probleme gab. <br/>Wir würden das Apartment auf jeden Fall weiterempfehlen.",1,-0.9823,Negative
