71.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,3.967984677843368,4.83,4.61,4.88,4.68,16906146,Super séjour chez Richard ! L'appartement est idéalement situé et Richard a été très arrangeant pour notre arrivée et notre départ. Nous recommandons ce logement les yeux fermés.,1,0.636,Positive
216.0,2,1.0,1.5,2.0,61,100.0,1,8.126007363576498,4.92,4.76,4.95,4.84,14368620,"The place is just great, very conveniently located, I was impressed with every small detail in Christoph's apartment and with his impeccable taste. Kitchen is very well equipped, you can cook if you wish, everything is handy. Bed is very comfortable, having two bathrooms is very convenient. By all means, it's a very homey feeling there.  And terrace is great addition as well.  Check-in was very smooth and fast, no problem at all, as well as check-out. Christoph took good care of me by giving plenty of advices as to what to see in Berlin and where to eat.  I definitely will stay at his apartment again with no hesitation. Highly recommended! Yelena",1,0.9833,Positive
112.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,0,1.913594929863479,4.54,4.64,4.8,4.32,929010804770377239,danke!!,1,0.0,Neutral
60.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,44,100.0,1,7.1823976191311605,4.87,4.83,4.59,4.77,781011854555247751,What a lovely and quirky apartment we stayed in. The decor was stylish with an urban take. Dietrich was a very good host and the instructions were clear and straightforward. The online brochure was easy to follow and useful for our sightseeing trip. <br/>The open plan was a great use of the apartment and felt roomy and comfortable. I would recommend The Loft to others who are planning a trip to Berlin. Hire bikes and you’ll be in the main errors within about 30 mins.,1,0.9716,Positive
194.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,0,1.7905975588055774,4.93,4.93,4.93,4.93,1050797788655392455,Everything 10/10 just be careful and check that keyfob works on both keys,1,0.1531,Positive
69.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,20,93.0,0,4.065511825937199,4.57,4.47,4.44,4.48,41423018,"Nice rooms as advertised and a good location, with bus and metro stations just a stone throw away.",1,0.6908,Positive
104.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,20,100.0,0,9.176809249799454,4.47,4.5,4.72,4.39,44776173,"Die Unterkunft liegt sehr nah an der U7 (Bayrischer Platz) und in gut 20min ist man in Berlin Mitte und somit bei vielen Sehenswürdigkeiten. <br/>Das Apartment eignet sich perfekt für einen Städtetrip mit Freunden. Es ist mit den wichtigsten Dingen (zB Toaster, Wasserkocher und Kaffeemaschine) ausgestattet. Supermärkte und kleine Geschäfte sind in unmittelbarer Nähe. Das Viertel Schöneberg ist allgemein ruhiger und auch sauberer als andere Viertel. <br/>Es war sehr sauber und Check-in, wie Check-out super unkompliziert. <br/>Leider ist das Wlan nicht das schnellste und auch nicht überall verfügbar. Außerdem ist die Wohnung sehr hellhörig und man bekommt quasi alles von den Nachbarn mit. Gewöhnungsbedürftig ist auch die Lage direkt am Gehweg. Dafür befindet sich aber eine kleine Bank vor der Türe. :)",1,-0.8779,Negative
113.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,44,100.0,1,2.43028057709331,4.91,4.81,4.99,4.84,784637456544280014,"La estancia en este apartamento ha sido muy agradable. Todo súper limpio, muy bien ubicado, y Martín muy atento. <br/>Os recomiendo este sitio!",1,0.4003,Positive
184.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,1,1.859658170121276,4.96,4.87,4.94,4.82,878074,"I stayed at Camilla's apartment in Prenzlauer Berg. It was perfect. Quiet location, very nice, clean and light apartment with everything needed for a longer stay. It is tastefully decorated with quality furniture. Camilla was awesome to communicate with. The internet was down, but she did everything she could to fix it immediately. I will definitely book it again the next time I am in Berlin!",1,0.8952,Positive
143.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,1,3.291202411050151,4.87,4.83,4.84,4.75,16543844,"Great host, lovely apartment and excellent location",1,0.9118,Positive
