101.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,3.078352015251089,4.83,4.81,4.81,4.66,20282379,"Amazing place, highly recommended, good location, cozy atmosphere, and pleasant sunlight through the large windows. The photos in the profile are not very accurate, the place looks far better than how it is portrayed through these pics. *Prepare yourself for a bit of a climb to reach the 5th floor (no elevator).",1,0.9368,Positive
128.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,50,100.0,1,8.680231459990408,4.98,4.78,4.88,4.88,791179421306968763,"A really great apartment in a quiet neighbourhood. We were there for four days with our baby and the apartment was even better than expected. Very clean, child friendly and. comfortable. A huge plus is the big balcony overlooking the Spree and the green sorroundings. Easy to get around with tram and S-Bahn and Sigrid and her son were very helpful. We would love to visit again some other time!",1,0.9832,Positive
