76.0,2,0.0,3.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,3.13591973699962,4.91,4.9,4.94,4.69,44384979,"Kathrin is very kind and welcoming. The space is in the perfect location for Berlin, right by the River Spree and in central Kreuzberg. Lovely little room with tons of plants and the whole space is very cosy. Highly recommend.",1,0.9546,Positive
