53.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,11.553689008952988,4.9,4.97,4.92,4.85,13218631,"Super covenient location to the U2 Deutsche Oper stop and a good supermarket.  Quiet neighborhood, friendly people all around.  Plenty of nearby places to eat at good prices.  Room is nicely decorated.  Bathroom is a good size and clean.  You will enjoy your stay here!",1,0.9709,Positive
76.0,2,0.0,3.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,3.13591973699962,4.91,4.9,4.94,4.69,44384979,"La verdad muy bien, he estado en otro bnb de berlín y este merece mucho la pena. Barrio muy bonito, rodeado de naturaleza y muy tranquilo. Ademas puedes alquilar bici y para moverse por la ciudad va perfecto",1,0.3182,Positive
105.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,16,100.0,0,4.467322526133834,4.96,4.91,5.0,4.65,20810774,"A really stylish space in a fabulous part of town. Dot’s Cafe down the street is perfect for breakfast by the way. The flat is well appointed—great kitchen and furnishings and a dreamy bathtub. I also loved the excellent local tips that turned out to be spot on, so pay attention to those! I would absolutely stay here again.",1,0.9453,Positive
37.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,1,12.302303063837329,4.9,4.92,4.67,4.93,37581746,"Die Unterkunft von Christina und Helga ist sauber und gut ausgestattet. Helga und Christina sind sehr gastfreundliche Gastgeberinnen und kümmern sich um ihre Gäste. Es war meinen Eltern eine Freude, bei Helga und Christina eine Woche lang bleiben zu dürfen.  Wir würden diese Unterkunft wärmstens empfehlen.",1,-0.8316,Negative
