68.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,28,100.0,1,6.576517854147013,4.72,4.76,4.31,4.63,36310980,"Wir haben unseren Aufenthalt in der Unterkunft sehr genossen. Alles war wie auf den Bildern beschrieben und entsprach voll und ganz unseren Erwartungen. Das Preis-Leistungs-Verhältnis war ebenfalls in Ordnung, und insgesamt war der Aufenthalt wirklich angenehm. Die Einrichtung war komfortabel und bot alles, was wir für ein paar entspannte Tage in Berlin brauchten.<br/>Vielen Dank für die Gastfreundschaft!",1,-0.9769,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,0,9.536308717239486,4.7,4.63,4.47,4.67,24039534,"Jorg was an amazing host. The place is perfect, very cozy and comfortable. The living room and backyard is awesome to sit and work/chill. Although the place is a 25 min tram ride from city center, trams are very convenient and frequent all the way till 12:30 or 1 am. Would highly recommend.",1,0.9581,Positive
82.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,11,100.0,1,2.1954868166555097,4.97,4.98,4.96,4.84,725973277956407623,Great little studio with everything you need to explore the city,1,0.6249,Positive
247.0,10,2.0,1.0,3.0,56,100.0,1,9.660413858650209,4.89,4.91,4.48,4.78,16250536,"The Bensimon apartments are beautiful places to stay, a tablet with all the local information and contact details you could ever dream of, comfy beds and just a genuinely wonderful space. Myself and 4 friends stayed here for 2 nights and we were really sad to leave, will definitely be returning!",0,0.8965,Positive
