128.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,51,100.0,1,13.570667530645112,4.98,4.91,4.81,4.85,1106636836839331069,Excelente apartamento en un lugar de Stieglitz muy tranquilo y bien ubicado. El apartamento además cuenta con una zona verde increíble. Todos los servicios están a la mano!,1,0.0,Neutral
110.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,2.9703255715487984,4.92,4.97,4.91,4.79,15941034,"Five star ⭐️ stay at Frank’s. Nice place, great base for my work trip, transportation is a breeze, and Frank was flexible in allowing an early check in which made a big difference as I had to get straight from the airport to the apartment to drop off bags, shower, and get to where I needed to be. The place is tastefully and minimally decorated. Everything is clean and in perfect condition. I look forward to staying there again. Thanks, Frank!",1,0.9531,Positive
64.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,12,100.0,0,5.296692156667216,4.96,4.91,4.83,4.91,4468054,"Cieke's place was great! Clean, spacious and well-decorated. The room was massive-- so much space for my sister and I! Cieke and her boyfriend Alex were really nice and accommodating. The neighborhood was really nice and had some good bars and restaurants around. It was a little far from the center of Berlin but it was close to a few metro stations and the metro was easy to navigate. Would highly recommend this flat!",1,0.9506,Positive
77.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,1,20.85808942058229,4.54,4.6,4.39,4.53,36748398,"Alles super, wir kommen gerne wieder. Besonders nett ist das kleine Wohnviertel in dem die Ferienwohnung liegt. sehr ruhig und hübsch gemacht. Rieseninnenhof mit großem  Wasserbecken und Enten und Wasserspielplatz für Kinder, eine kleine Pizzeria und eine Kaffebar in unmittelbarer Sichtweite. Perfekt. Und die Dahme ist ja auch gleich dran. 2 Minuten zu laufen. Ein bissl in Richtung Köpenick am Ufer spazieren gehen. Dann kommen am Ende tolle Liegebänke aus Holz zum Sonnenuntergang schauen. 🤗❤️perfekt",1,-0.1779,Negative
161.0,10,4.0,2.0,4.0,25,100.0,1,7.731041071020152,4.6,4.72,4.48,4.57,2599765,"Jammer dat de buitenkant er niet uit zag! Steigers rommel, containers, deur en rolluiken vol met graffiti..... Je denkt echt dit kan toch niet! <br/>Gelukkig binnen ok! Mooi appartement met een hele gezellige keuken, bedden prima 👍 wij hebben het er erg naar ons zin gehad.",0,0.4724,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,0,1.88810184301572,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,50762777,cosy apartment in a great neighborhood.,1,0.6249,Positive
171.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,1,1.4847862057404695,4.84,4.88,4.9,4.72,41918427,"Had an amazing stay here in Berlin. Jürgen was able to accommodate our late check in with no problems and gave us really clear instructions about the apartment and good recommendations for the surrounding neighborhood. The apartment was super clean and had all the amenities we could possibly need. The neighborhood was very nice, close to good restaurants, convenient stores, super markets as well as very close to lots of clubs and bars. Check out was also very easy with nice clear instructions. Jürgen was great with communication and checked in on us and was available whenever we needed. Would definitely recommend and would stay again :)",1,0.9922,Positive
163.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,3.126230216762567,4.94,4.96,4.85,4.82,22696188,"This was a lovely, spacious loft in a nice private courtyard. Easy to get around the city from this location. We had a great stay!",1,0.9312,Positive
