287.0,8,2.0,1.5,6.0,46,99.0,0,2.011964640071796,4.71,4.63,4.98,4.52,1237567772949455013,"We had a wonderful stay at this spacious 2BR apartment in Berlin-Mitte! The apartment was clean, modern, and follows the minimalist principle, providing everything we needed for a comfortable and relaxing stay. The living room was perfect for our group of six, with a cute dinning table and a cozy atmosphere. The location was ideal, close to key attractions and local amenities. Communication with the hosts wasn’t needed much as the instructions were clear. Overall, I highly recommend this place and would definitely stay here again.",0,0.9863,Positive
95.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,0,4.691964222849626,4.76,4.77,4.81,4.67,28168852,"Great place. Very spacious, central and comfortable.",1,0.8126,Positive
132.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,1,3.220056431819407,4.79,4.83,4.84,4.55,43352497,"Das war ein perfekter Aufenthalt. Die Wohnung ist stylisch und super gelegen. U-Bahnhöfe sind direkt ums Eck. Ja, die Kreuzberger Nächte können wahrlich lang werden 😂. Die Kommunikation mit unseren Gastgebern war schnell und effizient.  So muss Berlin......Wir kommen gerne wieder....LG Volker und Susanne",1,-0.9485,Negative
