152.0,5,2.0,1.0,5.0,40,100.0,1,1.5968425433019005,4.81,4.77,4.93,4.69,22677,"Fantastic accommodation, very central location. <br/>Apartment was spotless and very well maintained. Provided with all facilities. <br/>Would definitely stay again and recommend to anyone.",0,0.8805,Positive
149.0,5,1.0,1.0,2.0,8,81.0,0,6.714128192155476,4.17,4.26,4.03,4.17,1223091910763945275,Muy acogedor. Repetiría sin duda!,1,-0.5983,Negative
81.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,12,100.0,1,23.433567641153218,4.8,4.91,4.62,4.52,23623112,"Alles vorgefunden wie beschrieben. Lediglich ein verlorener Ball unter dem Sofa förderte einiges an ""Vorgänger-Schmutz"" zu Tage. <br/>Besonders toll war für uns, dass wir viel früher in die Wohnung konnten als angegeben. Mit kleinem Kind im Winter war das eine große Erleichterung. <br/>Die Kommunikation war sehr freundlich und wir haben uns wohlgefühlt.",1,-0.9217,Negative
283.0,10,3.0,2.0,6.0,51,100.0,1,14.68016992172163,4.74,4.44,4.68,4.57,925174582250487112,Erittäin siisti ja tilava huoneisto isollekin seurueelle. Kommunikointi helppoa ja nopeaa.,0,0.0,Neutral
137.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,1.6809549157543209,4.96,4.95,4.95,4.83,2061212,"Me and my partner stayed in Kitty's studio apartment for six days. Amazing space! The apartment is even bigger than what it looks like on the pictures, it is bright, clean and cosy, and it contains an incredible collections of books for you to look at. You will also find lots of cool masks and artworks there! We really felt at home there, and a couple of nights we didn't even bother going out. Instead we ordered pizza from a great pizza place down the street, and watched a movie or enjoyed a beer on the balcony.<br/><br/>Kitty was a great hostess! She welcomed us and provided us with a map of the neighbourhood, where she had written down several good restaurants (among them the pizza place), cafés and bars. There is a grocery shop (with lots of good cheese and beer and everything else you might crave) nearby, a great wine bar on the corner and a nice bookshop on the next street. There's also no problem to get around, the nearest tram station is a four minute walk away. Such a lovely Prenzlauer Berg neighbourhood. Kitty and her apartment really made our vacation in Berlin the best possible, and we will definitely check if it's available the next time we're going there! ",1,0.9939,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,19,100.0,0,11.308949161991244,4.89,4.78,4.78,4.56,27866506,Very clean and well equipped apartment in a very nice area.,1,0.8151,Positive
70.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,100.0,1,3.0533340006135603,4.92,4.98,4.93,4.84,7925838,"Lovely large, bright room, modern but with character. Private bathroom was very clean and modern, had lots of towels, shower gel, handwash etc. Hairdryer was a really helpful touch as was the sparkling water and sweets! No facilities to make drinks but there is a convenience shop and nice little coffee shop right next door.  Location was great, very close to lots of great cafes, bars and restaurants yet quiet and safe in the evening. Short walk to two train stations and Turkish market. Katja was a great host, good communication and very friendly. Let us leave later as our flight was not until the afternoon which was a great help. Would definitely stay again when back in Berlin!",1,0.9967,Positive
45.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,45,100.0,1,1.871566651765182,4.88,4.79,4.9,4.78,33996221,"I had a wonderful stay at Thomas’ and Anne’s place! Beautiful room, great area, very nice people. Recommend.",1,0.9574,Positive
198.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,39,100.0,1,3.617036290600905,4.86,4.85,4.9,4.75,27627221,x,1,0.0,Neutral
40.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,11,98.0,0,2.4809600042725424,4.56,4.5,4.85,4.64,35816059,Good location and clean,1,0.6808,Positive
113.0,4,0.0,1.0,1.0,20,100.0,0,2.59358810029691,4.61,4.59,4.74,4.53,7695587,Angenehme Kommunikation mit dem Gastgeber. Die Wohnung war sauber und genau wie im Inserat beschrieben. Gerne wieder.,1,-0.8316,Negative
365.0,15,4.0,4.5,8.0,25,100.0,1,7.162089617709464,4.79,4.67,4.78,4.73,1838879,Pas de déception,0,0.0,Neutral
260.0,8,4.0,2.0,7.0,50,100.0,1,2.6302702497082326,4.88,4.92,4.85,4.71,1488624,"Alexandra home was simply gorgeous. First the picture did no justice. The large kitchen with all amenities with open living room concept perfect for everyone to converse, be together. ( although it was just me and my daughter). We only used two bedrooms but the total four would easily accommodate large family. I love firm mattress for my back. My daughter chose bedroom close to the restroom. Mattress softer. The tub was our highlight. Towels readily available. Bathrooms clean. Added bonus washer and dryer. YouTube life saver for German dryer. Please empty water receptacle after each small load. Located on left front side of dryer. Pulls right out. Will dry clothes better. The area is walkable. Nice restaurants. My daughter lives in Berlin so knew the eating spots. And check out Mauer Park. <br/>Alexandra lovely host. Will meet you upon arrival  or her husband.",0,0.9913,Positive
152.0,5,2.0,1.0,5.0,40,100.0,1,1.5968425433019005,4.81,4.77,4.93,4.69,22677,"Very spacious, quitte and tidy appartment. Great stay!",0,0.6588,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,20,100.0,1,3.4592595707900773,4.81,4.79,4.84,4.73,11564181,"We loved our stay in lovely Sophia’s apartment. The apartment was gorgeous and the location was perfect - close to public transport, places to eat, Kreuzberg, the canal etc. Everything was clean and Sophia was great at communicating before and during our stay. Thanks again Sophia!",1,0.9785,Positive
157.0,6,2.0,1.5,4.0,49,100.0,1,10.421396544921482,4.67,4.71,4.7,4.58,12044871,"Nous avons séjourné à 4 avec nos enfants de 11 et 13 ans durant 4 jours dans l'appartement de Soren. L'espace est suffisant pour 4 personnes mais nous n'avisons pas de dépasser ce nombre... <br/>L'appartement est bien situé, à quelques minutes à pied du métro Berlinestrasse. On est en 15 minutes au zoo. Pour d'autres points d'intérêts, comptez plutôt 10 min de plus. Le tout est certainement faisable et les connections sont nombreuses à Berlin.<br/>Nous avons apprécié la qualité du matelas. (même si un oreiller supplémentaire aurait peut-être été nécessaire)<br/>Sinon, il y a un très bon restaurant vietnamien juste à côté de l'appartement. C'est plutôt pratique.<br/>Seul bémol, il y a un chantier en ce moment juste en face de l'appartement. Les chambres donnent côté rue et vu que les ouvriers commencent leur journée vers 6h45 (samedi et jours fériés compris), il était difficile de faire la grasse matinée. Heureusement, l'appartement est bien isolé.",0,-0.128,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,4.433600261514431,4.61,4.25,4.85,4.51,1236282,We had a lovely stay in this beautiful location in Berlin. Even though we didn't talk much we felt very welcome to stay at Andres ' place. A big plus is all the little breakfast/lunch/dinner restaurants just when you walk out of the stair house: we feel like we've tried them all and need to visit them all over again. ,1,0.9351,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,30,100.0,1,10.10006633706935,4.7,4.62,4.56,4.59,707963798862318127,"Wahid y Máx fueron muy simpáticos y agradables. <br/> Nos ayudaron en todo momento con nuestras complicaciones para llegar y salir del alojamiento. <br/>El alojamiento increíble. <br/>El  jardín/huerto y la posibilidad de un espacio exterior en Berlín donde cenar, comer o tomarse un cafe al aire libre nos dio a nuestra experiencia un plus de relax y confort. <br/>La parte interior muy bien cuidada y decorada. <br/>Cuando volvamos a Berlín  ya sabemos donde tenemos que buscar :)",1,0.7096,Positive
172.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,99.0,0,1.542372060755756,4.59,4.74,4.53,4.54,6697033,"War Rundrum eine gute Unterkunft, lediglich der Hochdruckartige Duschkopf hätte besser sein können :)",1,-0.2263,Negative
220.0,8,3.0,1.5,4.0,47,100.0,1,5.502700704345139,4.83,4.9,4.81,4.66,53802915,"Das Apartment war sehr schön, sehr sauber und groß ! Alles was man benötigt war vorhanden. Der Check-In wurde echt gut erklärt, war sehr einfach. Es gab auch eine genaue Anleitung. Lage war auch sehr gut. Metro ist nicht mal 5 Min entfernt. Sehr nette Menschen im Gebäude und in der Umgebung. Auch das Reinigungspersonal war am letzten Tag beim Check-out voll sympathisch und witzig. Haben eine äußerst positive Erfahrung gemacht. Werden das Apartment wieder buchen wenn wir in Berlin sind !!! <br/>Wir sind aus Österreich, deshalb ist Freundlichkeit von fremden Menschen für uns etwas sehr seltenes - Das ist leider nicht mal übertrieben. Wir lieben Berlin !<br/>Ein großes Danke an den Gastgeber Ludger.",0,-0.9588,Negative
67.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,55,100.0,1,2.305726509562826,4.9,4.96,4.88,4.83,4380854,"I have enjoyed a lot my stance in Agnes home. Quiet, ample room with nice views over an interior garden, in a spacious and clean flat, located in a very relaxed and central spot in Berlin. 5 min. walking to checkpoint charlie, less than 15 min. walking to unter den linden, you are very close to the essentials attractions of the city, and also you got a lot of places to eat or take a drink near to the flat. There are several metro stations in a 5-10 min. walking distance to take advantage of the great public transport system, and let you explore the city in all directions.<br/>Agnes and Lorent are wonderful hosts. Kind and attentive, they go the extra mile to make your stance comfortable, and are willing to help with any advice you need. And they are a smart, respectful, and creative couple, that take time to meet the people that visit them and are curious and enjoyable. The moments we share have made my trip to Berlin a delightful event, and one of the best ABNB experiences i have enjoyed so far.",1,0.9957,Positive
63.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,0,2.005374688632018,4.73,4.38,4.66,4.46,51041552,"El lugar estaba bien para unos pocos días. La habitación estaba bien (tenía todo lo que necesitábamos) pero el resto de la casa estaba un poco sucia y desordenada.<br/>El barrio tenía mucho movimiento (muchas familias viviendo ahí) y no nos pareció inseguro (hemos vuelto caminando de noche y estuvo ok).<br/>Si está un tanto alejado de los transportes públicos principales (en general hay 10 minutos caminando).<br/>Día como anfitriona y parte de la casa no fue muy presente, solo la vimos al inicio cuando nos dio las instrucciones. Quisimos ir unas horas antes solo a dejar el equipaje pero nos cobraba un extra, así que decidimos no hacerlo.",1,-0.6808,Negative
140.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,91.0,0,4.871252294318258,4.72,4.78,4.85,4.58,46812239,"Magnifique logement, excellent rapport qualité prix allez y !",1,0.6114,Positive
76.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,1,5.339352686328167,4.8,4.87,4.74,4.63,2098124,"The host provided all necessary information for accessing the flat and had a helpful guest guide to the flat and neighborhood.  The neighborhood is close to shops and restaurants, as well as the U.  Great place to stay if you want to settle into Berlin life for a bit! ",1,0.8622,Positive
155.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,37,95.0,0,0.8707832520316201,4.94,4.94,4.84,4.94,1211494413366492901,Super consigliato!,1,0.636,Positive
100.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,15,100.0,0,9.035080903456278,4.82,4.78,4.92,4.7,39484375,Die Lage der Wohnung ist top. Der Kudamm ist nur wenige Minuten zu Fuß erreichbar. Auch eine U-Bahn Station befindet sich in unmittelbarer Nähe. Check-in und Check-out hat sehr schnell und einfach funktioniert. Die Wohnung ist außerdem sehr sauber. Die Kommunikation mit dem Vermieter hat sehr gut funktioniert.,1,-0.8979,Negative
