135.0,6,3.0,1.0,4.0,16,100.0,0,4.492800793369802,4.9,4.55,5.0,4.73,16405504,"Perfect location, perfect host. <br/>This place is awesome! Beautiful roof top, nice antic decoration. It's all very cosy.<br/>2 things I would like to mention for next visitors:<br/>- This place is not accessible to disabled persons.<br/>- I wouldn't say it offers 3 bedrooms. It's more like 2 proper rooms + 1 extra bed inside a beautiful veranda.<br/>We'll return there for sure.<br/>Thanks Tom!",0,0.9826,Positive
