64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,1,4.908238385378831,4.95,4.8,4.82,4.82,43540687,Super nice stay at Yumi’s place. Really convenient location to go around Berlin! Yumi was super kind🌸,1,0.8977,Positive
112.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,42,100.0,1,2.97782445506794,4.86,4.91,4.87,4.74,22275529,"A great flat for young people or short stays, but it has a couple of issues we struggled with. The flat was clean, spacious and generally well equipped. Gregor and his team were very friendly and easy to contact as they have an office in the same building. The flat is situated in a courtyard and well protected from road noise, with very considerate neighbours. The U bahn is across the road and very well connected to the rest of Berlin. The area felt safe, with many cafes and restaurants nearby.<br/>However, the area is run down. Graffiti, discarded household items by the roadside, homeless people living under the rail bridge and drug dealers operating all day.  The flat has ""block heating"", so it didn't come on until October and went off at 10pm, we had to buy an electric heater to avoid being cold during these times. The internet is an off-shoot from Gregor's office. This meant restricted access to streaming and game sites, and a low bandwidth which caused the connection to collapse. Finally, the basement ceiling is very low, with protective foam to cushion your head when you bang it. Which I did every day.",1,0.88,Positive
288.0,11,5.0,2.0,5.0,55,100.0,1,7.975202664059818,4.88,4.86,4.9,4.72,1022510628936227967,Thanks for letting us stay at your place it was fantastic,0,0.7579,Positive
331.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,1,5.828951775688696,4.96,4.98,4.81,4.83,1173687269970913954,"Phillips place is amongst one of the best you can find. Reasonably priced, beautifully furnished, stocked with amenities and in a great location close to lots of cafes, restaurants and parks. There is also a roller door shutter for added security. <br/>Phillip is also a great host and extremely responsive on message, he accommodated a last minute extension of our stay.<br/>Would highly recommend and I’ll definitely be booking this place when I’m in Berlin next!",0,0.98,Positive
38.0,1,1.0,1.0,2.0,22,100.0,1,5.415698325555599,4.85,4.77,4.91,4.84,45313043,"El departamento está en una excelente ubicación muy cerca de la estación central de trenes en Berlín.<br/>Además, hay una tienda Aldi muy cerca del departamento.",1,0.0,Neutral
