122.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,96.0,0,3.128194469226722,4.61,4.66,4.86,4.54,47215807,"Great location, and the people at the front desk were super friendly and helpful! As a solo female traveler I felt very safe in the hotel and in the area, which is right next to Check Point Charlie. I would definitely stay at this place again!",1,0.966,Positive
120.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,1,3.14704762756928,4.88,4.85,4.91,4.75,363454,"This appartment is brilliant- very clean and cleverly designed. The location was ideal, walking distance to a few stations which meant getting around Berlin was very easy. The flat itself is on a quiet street which means you can get good night's sleep, but you are only a short walk from central Kreuzberg where there are lots of lively bars and great restaurants. Would highly recommend this flat. Thank you Alexander and Klaus for a great stay and for being great hosts. ",1,0.991,Positive
103.0,1,1.0,0.0,1.0,11,100.0,0,1.652388057808875,4.42,4.64,4.62,4.3,51549694,"Nice hotel, very comfortable",1,0.7501,Positive
111.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,35,100.0,0,3.428773290668755,4.7,4.77,4.78,4.62,27259147,Enough space for three people with a nice location.,1,0.4215,Positive
247.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,1,5.2396889205230845,4.9,4.97,4.94,4.85,9881695,LOVED the neighborhood. Lots of great restaurants close by. Zeus on the corner is a wonderful restaurant with great people and fantastic food. <br/>We also thoroughly enjoyed Euphoria and Fatoush as well as the waffeleisen next to Beat Burgers. <br/>The Saturday local market at Boxhanger Platz was also very enjoyable. <br/>The apartment was definitely our home away from home. The washer and dryer were extremely helpful since we were here for 2 weeks. We even took the time to make a proper Sunday dinner in the well stocked kitchen. <br/>We completely enjoyed our time in Berlin and will definitely return for our next holiday in Berlin.,0,0.9941,Positive
54.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,15.145142188058252,4.6,4.69,4.46,4.65,4744063,"Franziska's place is locared very close to the bus, so easy connection to get downtown. Communication during our stay went smoothly!",1,0.6166,Positive
200.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,25,100.0,0,9.229524047847809,4.43,4.43,4.43,4.14,777993,"Een prachtig gerestaureerde woning in de oorspronkelijke stijl van Bruno Taut, met comfort van deze tijd. <br/>Daarbij goed ontvangen door Ben met een adequate uitleg over het gebruik van de woning met tips voor inkopen, eten etc.",1,0.5267,Positive
