160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,87.0,0,3.4802565088356308,4.54,4.54,4.6,4.41,43798011,"Very dirty elevator and destroyed hall entrance, room was ok, but the entrance of the building was very scary",1,-0.8093,Negative
119.0,6,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,80.0,1,5.419875510101854,4.86,4.9,4.92,4.7,21689254,"We (1 adult, two kids) stayed three nights at this place. It is nicely reachable from the BER airport. Getting the keys in the evening required the use of phone flashlight to help, but otherwise it went well.<br/>The flat was as the pictures show: nice, colourful and practical. It was very cold in Berlin (below 0 degrees C) when we arrived and it was quite cold inside the flat, too. We turned on the heating (multiple radiators) and next day it was much better. The blankets in beds were thick so we slept warmly.<br/>Tap water tasted good. Two handbasins in the bathroom was a bonus. Although listed in the ""What this place offers"" list, shampoo wasn't available, but basic shower gel was. Towels dried nicely on the bathroom's radiator/dryer.<br/>There were many nice cafes and restaurants nearby. We also visited at least one of the places mentioned in Fadeih’s guide: Kurhaus Korsakow was a very good traditional German restaurant.<br/>Overall our experience was positive and will recommend this place.",1,0.9909,Positive
93.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,1,5.863829222837729,4.83,4.73,4.71,4.73,42754349,"nice place, easy stay",1,0.6908,Positive
