176.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,51,100.0,1,6.494655625374104,4.87,4.79,4.65,4.73,8957894,"Super nette Wohnung in Tempelhof, sehr netter und zuvorkommender Gastgeber, gute Lage und ein sehr faires Preis-Leistungsverhältnis. Alles top👍",1,0.5994,Positive
125.0,7,3.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,0,11.780184789212733,4.75,4.5,4.8,4.95,30079746,We have been really happy staying at your flat and it exceeded all expectations! There was lots of space and a lovely terrace. :-),0,0.8856,Positive
203.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,24,100.0,1,3.233570223529885,4.51,4.5,4.92,4.47,4448981,"Die Wohnung liegt zentral, wie in der Beschreibung, im Herzen Berlins. Wer fit genug ist kann vieles zu Fuss besichtigen. <br/>Alle Zimmer waren sauber und man merkte, dass frische Bettwäsche und Handtücher zur Verfügung gestellt wurden. Das hab ich leider woanders schon anders erlebt. <br/>Das Gebäude scheint hauptsächlich von der WWF gemietet zu sein. Tagsüber viel los, abends sehr ruhig. Es gibt eine Aufzug, der aber nicht ebenerdig mit der Wohnung ist. Man muss vom 5. Stock ein paar Stufen runter und dann wieder hoch. Das gestaltet sich etwas schwierig mit Kinderwagen. Aber man kann den Kinderwagen im Treppenhaus stehen lassen, sodass nur ein Treppenblock bestiegen werden muss. Ansonsten war alles perfekt, auch das mit den self check-Inn war genial!",0,-0.8268,Negative
79.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,20,70.0,1,2.436141896725856,4.94,4.93,4.89,4.87,839779977613823745,"Marietta's place is in a great location, super cool neighborhood and very close to everything that I needed. She was also super helpful and responsive with solving any issues.",1,0.9678,Positive
152.0,5,2.0,1.0,5.0,40,100.0,1,1.5968425433019005,4.81,4.77,4.93,4.69,22677,"Ramfis’ place is great, it is situated in Prenzlauerberg, one of the most charming parts of Berlin. There are a lot of nice and cheap restaurants and hip stores in the neighbourhood. <br/>We were there with 2 grown up children and had lots of space. <br/>We took breakfast in the cosy garden and slept in very clean and silent rooms. <br/>Very good place!",0,0.953,Positive
65.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,16,100.0,1,3.0069422642949752,4.7,4.9,4.89,4.66,6220902,"I had a great time in Regina's apartment. The room was very clean, comfortable and warm, and Regina was a very kind and attentive host. The nighborhood is great and guiet, a beautiful walk at night. I had a very good time.",1,0.9808,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,0,3.711718674751055,4.92,4.92,4.69,4.85,28336409,"Maja hat uns ihre Wohnung sogar komplett überlassen. Alles super sauber und gemütlich eingerichtet. Leider waren wir nur sehr kurz da. Wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt, danke Maja!",1,0.636,Positive
260.0,4,2.0,2.0,4.0,55,100.0,0,2.5729352260986107,4.66,4.55,4.84,4.45,26543,"Six girls stayed for 2 nights had fab time. Apartment was comfy, spacious and clean.  Thanks to agent who met us with the keys, and on leaving, she was very prompt and pleasant.  The piano was enjoyed by all on saturday morning. Fab location, lots of good cafes, bars and restaurants. After a very full day sight seeing we stayed local to eat that night, had a delicious meal in a Tapas bar, lively atmosphere, good food wine and company. Sunday morning to nearby Maur Park flea market and a tasty brunch at cafe across the square to the apartment was a good end to our stay. Good transport links and safe neighbourhood.",0,0.9895,Positive
380.0,4,2.0,2.0,3.0,48,100.0,1,1.1071575355391072,4.95,4.99,4.91,4.78,16091735,"This was our first time trying Airbnb and it exceeded our expectations!  Marcus has thought of everything!  There's a convenient table by the bed, a chair to sit on while you put your shoes on, everything you need for laundry.  The apartment was extremely clean and well organized.  It was very quiet and peaceful.  Marcus answered all our questions quickly and provided a helpful guide to get us going in Berlin.  The location is fantastic.  The apartment is just steps away from the U2 line.   We bought group day passes (good for 5 people) for 33 Euros and could then get to everywhere in the city through a combination of bus, Ubahn or Sbahn (Google maps will tell you what to do.) We visited from America with our two college age children and we found a lot of great things to see, do and try in the area.  I cannot recommend this host and apartment enough!",0,0.9589,Positive
60.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,3.651055931329858,4.68,4.63,4.59,4.6,40961989,"L’host è il fiore all’occhiello della casa, la posizione è buona per i mezzi pubblici, meno per il quartiere. Purtroppo non si tratta di un appartamento vero e proprio ma di un fondo riadattato con vetrina commerciale coperta da tende. I muri sono molto sottili e siamo stati sfortunati trovando due coppie di vicini molto rumorose e maleducate. La porta dell’ingresso purtroppo non si può chiudere e ci è capitato di trovare birre scolate davanti all’ingresso al mattino seguente. Diciamo che lo consiglio per l’host che è molto bravo e amichevole e per il collegamento con il tram davvero comodo, peró per dormire non si ha un senso di sicurezza particolarmente elevato.",1,0.34,Positive
207.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,58,100.0,1,2.222288195756644,4.89,4.97,4.93,4.73,11031031,"BOOK THIS UNIT! This was the most perfect place to stay for our week in Berlin. It was in the best location (within a 15 minute walk to Alexanderplatz) in a safe area with a lot of shops and quick places to eat or drink. <br/>The unit itself is tucked behind the main building off the street which we loved because it made it even quieter and more private/secure. The house itself is awesome - great for 2 people, likely a little tight for any more than that. It's cozy, comfy bed, super clean, and just a really cool unit. We already have it saved to rebook for when we come back in summer.",1,0.9886,Positive
53.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,48,100.0,0,1.6268944485919838,4.73,4.33,4.91,4.73,1087404094181034109,"I am over 60 so take my review from an old person traveling alone. If the description doesn’t mention the 4 tall flights of stairs (over 90 steps and 7 landings) carrying a suitcase up, I have to mention how hard that is. I came at night and didn’t know there is a light to turn on hallway lights to take stairs. The single bed was comfortable and the small room was sufficient for the money.  The location with one block to tram and tons of restaurants and coffee shops was lovely. I was not there on a weekend and it was quiet. Eve was nice and there is a boyfriend but I wasn’t given towels until I asked they said use any in bathroom cupboards. Again good location but not a place to go up and down more than once a day but if your suitcase is light and u r strong to carry the place was fine",1,0.9231,Positive
95.0,7,1.0,1.0,3.0,33,100.0,0,4.793849952314026,4.57,4.28,4.88,4.5,12723428,"Emanuela's place was wonderful. The space was much larger than I anticipated and had everything I needed - washer/dryer, full kitchen, etc.",1,0.5719,Positive
70.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,90.0,1,5.051486217995905,4.97,5.0,4.71,4.71,35997951,Super schöne Wohnung! Schnelle und freundliche Kommunikation! Und man ist super schnell in der Stadt. Alles super :),1,0.9458,Positive
168.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,49,100.0,1,2.5850891972617256,5.0,4.97,4.98,4.95,12319085,"We found out why Matthias has so many 5 star reviews! Beautiful spacious apartment, spotlessly clean, convenient to Berlin trams … thoughtful snacks and drinks in the kitchen … fresh flowers in the dining room AND bathroom, are you kidding me?  Best airbnb we’ve seen. Or heard of.",1,0.9468,Positive
90.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,12,100.0,1,5.632455109074784,5.0,4.89,4.88,4.92,883388721588232673,"Alles tippitoppi! :)<br/>Wirklich sehr schöne, moderne, neue und helle Wohnung! <br/>Gemütliches Bett mit neuer Matratze, das Zimmer ist modern schlicht und hat alles was man braucht.<br/>Max war super freundlich, einfache Kommunikation, hat mir tolle Tips für lecker Restaurants in der Umgebung gegeben und hat einen süßen kleinen Dackel. <br/>Ich würde wieder kommen!",1,0.0,Neutral
141.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,43,94.0,0,7.131273504704622,4.74,4.82,4.79,4.62,49070135,"Alles top, vielen Dank. Gerne wieder.",1,0.2023,Positive
131.0,2,1.0,1.0,0.0,24,100.0,1,8.152930353958586,4.87,4.88,4.86,4.78,2566846,"I couldn’t recommend this place more, it had such a homely & cosy feel. As soon as we entered the place it was lovely and warm, we appreciated all the personal touches and how nice the interior is. We would’ve took the bed with us if we could! it was massive and so comfy. We had a great nights sleep and the blinds black out so also good for a nap in the day. You can dim the lights too which we liked. The sauna is something you rarely come across and for the price of the booking it was a bargain. Short walk to the station to get around. Friendly and responsive communication with Roi, not that we had any issues to report.",1,0.9837,Positive
85.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,0,12.454267915590298,4.63,4.74,4.75,4.63,37346562,"Richtig, die Wohnung ist klein aber gemütlich, sehr sauber und ordentlich.<br/>Wir haben Kristina nicht getroffen aber sie antwortet immer so schnell.",1,-0.5994,Negative
271.0,10,3.0,1.5,5.0,56,100.0,1,5.229990782295846,4.95,4.89,4.8,4.88,17223235,"Everything as described, great communication, very flexible. Look forward to staying again!",0,0.7639,Positive
90.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,0,6.296387057890901,5.0,4.94,4.88,4.88,803483376128064040,"Ich hatte einen wunderbaren Aufenthalt in Annikas Wohnung! Die Kommunikation war super easy und unkompliziert, bei Problemen konnten wir sie jederzeit kontaktieren, sogar sonntags :) ich würde jederzeit wiederkommen und kann das airbnb sehr empfehlen.",1,0.3164,Positive
202.0,4,3.0,1.0,6.0,36,100.0,1,3.039424449629114,4.94,4.91,4.82,4.74,1161591202710121934,Incredible panaroma loft with plenty of space and light. The home was well decorated and cosy. We loved the hammocks and windows to look out during sunset.<br/>Maik was a great host and we really enjoyed our stay here. Highly recommend!,0,0.95,Positive
103.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,1,6.782182931571986,4.95,4.93,4.69,4.84,51181494,sehr nette Host. Kommunikation hat super geklappt. Die Tipps für Bars waren super. Die Lage ist sehr zentral in Neu-Kölln mit guter Anbindung an die S-Bahn.,1,-0.5994,Negative
79.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,1,9.403941552737663,4.88,4.74,4.84,4.8,17071054,"Wir hatten eine super tolle Woche und die Wohnung war super 👍 <br/>Es war alles da, was man brauchte und Arne war auch sehr hilfsbereit. Diese Woche war für uns sehr erholsam. Jederzeit sehr gerne wieder.",1,-0.9136,Negative
86.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,90.0,1,1.7412022704154266,4.91,4.95,4.94,4.77,30373468,"The flat is very central, close to everything you would want to visit in Berlin. It was clean and private, we could cook and really liked having our own entrance. Dorit was a very good host. The only downside was the many stairs (but the building in itself was very cozy so it didn’t matter) and that it wasn’t very isolated - so you could easily hear each other coughing etc. But due to the calm area this didn’t bother us.",1,0.5466,Positive
115.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,1,9.734400040311852,4.95,4.88,4.31,4.7,1112219223479509727,"Sehr schöne zentrale Unterkunft in Moabit. Sehr sauber und schön eingerichtet, gerne wieder.",1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,1,4.861082501850892,4.75,4.76,4.6,4.7,5188216,Everything was good,1,0.4404,Positive
123.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,1,2.7486258312471903,4.76,4.28,4.82,4.73,6232450,"Andreas is a very nice and positive guy. He made us feel welcome and like at home. We forgot the key inside the house and he helped us very much with arranging a key service on a Saturday night.<br/>The house is spacious, bed and couch are comfy.",1,0.9092,Positive
