35.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,51,100.0,0,3.642892493197811,4.95,4.96,4.8,4.93,304904,"Everything was just perfect. We (me and my boyfriend) chose to stay here because of his great reviews and both Andreas and his wife didn't dissapoint us. We felt right at home, the neighborhood was really nice and quiet and well connected (although to be fair, prety much is well connected in Berlin).<br/>No complaints whatsoever. We would definitely  stay here again!",1,0.9492,Positive
217.0,5,2.0,2.5,3.0,39,100.0,1,3.5358295153616246,4.81,4.72,4.88,4.62,36266731,"Sleek, large, modern apartment on the Spree in an amazing neighborhood. The location is extremely convenient to food, culture, nightlife and transportation all over the city. My friends and I were very happy with the apartment! We had some issues with communication when our clothes got trapped in the washing machine that took a long time and a lot of waiting to sort out,  but ultimately we are left with wonderful memories. Look out for the two adorable cats who hang out in the courtyard!",0,0.9401,Positive
68.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,19,100.0,1,7.221066332038413,4.94,4.94,4.73,4.86,16684717,"Ich hatte eine sehr entspannte Zeit bei Theo. Er ist ein sehr freundlicher, ruhiger und respektvoller Gastgeber. Ich war zum Arbeiten in Berlin und es war immer schön, nach Hause zu kommen. Außerdem hatte ich das Vergnügen, die wirklich luxuriöse Wanne zu benutzen, vielen Dank dafür und für das schöne Gespräch. Ich hoffe sehr, das klappt mal wieder.",1,-0.9136,Negative
55.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,0,1.354221835889287,4.91,4.71,4.96,4.9,14257495,"Recommended! Super comfortable bed, super hot shower and definitely silent area. The location is close to the metro station and there are restaurants, cafes there. Wlbke is also very kind, friendly and thoughtful person. She left the apples, teas and chocolate at our room. We were happy with this stay.",1,0.9829,Positive
87.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,0,2.505218606030047,4.77,4.79,4.96,4.72,42243841,Todo estuvo perfecto! El alojamiento tenía todo lo que necesitamos para pasar un par de días en Berlín! Cerca de los accesos a los mejores puntos que queríamos conocer y buenos lugares donde comer. Fácil acceso y buena comunicación :) todo perfecto :),1,0.8802,Positive
