105.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,1,4.991176189716989,4.92,4.98,4.81,4.81,52019021,"Das Appartement war außerordentlich. Super sauber und geschmackvoll eingerichtet. Wir haben alles gefunden, was wir brauchten. Wir haben geschlafen wie Steine. Mit der Tram 4 ist man super schnell im Zentrum oder dort wo man hin will :D<br/>Tut euch einen Gefallen und probiert unbedingt den Vietnamesen um die Ecke und den Imbiss ""two hungry bears"" am Ostbahnhof!",1,0.0,Neutral
35.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,59,100.0,0,0.7009515972590313,4.75,4.8,4.95,4.74,2543760,"The flat was in a fantastic location, right in the centre of Berlin. Monica and Yvonne provided directions on how to reach their flat from the airport which were both easy to follow and really helpful. It was easy to reach all he main attractions from their flat, even by foot. They were very welcoming and even invited us to join in with a gathering that they were hosting in the apartment. We really enjoyed our stay and would happily return.",1,0.98,Positive
