47.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,26,100.0,0,13.72252668419708,4.51,4.6,4.69,4.51,7828523,"Kleines sauberes Zimmer, wie beschrieben, nur etwas hellhörig. Auch Küche und Bad waren funktionell und sauber. Der Check-in war schwierig, man konnte bei Nacht die Zahlen der Schlüsselbox kaum lesen. Lage war gut mit toller Pizza um die Ecke.",1,-0.9643,Negative
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,36,100.0,0,7.488974468323299,4.97,4.92,4.77,4.92,47765512,"Our stay at Timotée's apartment was great. The communication with Timotée was very enjoyable, quick responses and everything was provided for. Good price and a lot more homy and spacious than a hotel room. The place is very comfortable, only the bed is a bit small for two tall people. There are many plants and flowers in the apartment so for people with hay-fever or allergies this is a bit less convenient. <br/>The location is very convenient, close to the metro, some parks and a variety of shops. The apartment is on a quiet street so you won't hear any traffic. <br/>All in all we had a great stay in Berlin.",1,0.9577,Positive
68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,0,3.9578417824492327,4.83,4.82,4.85,4.76,5784956,"Great location and a well equipped, clean ,spacious apartment.",1,0.836,Positive
159.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,33,100.0,0,13.383075608192714,4.54,4.31,4.94,4.71,26703697,"L'appartement est très bien équipée, calme et les pièces sont très grandes. Il se situe à proximité des transports en commun, d'un magasin d'alimentation et d'une boulangerie, ce qui est vraiment pratique. La propriétaire est très avenante. A recommander!",1,0.0,Neutral
272.0,8,2.0,2.0,8.0,31,100.0,1,3.130094705675992,4.85,4.67,4.82,4.73,4027687," Large, well-equipped and comfortable apartment suitable for groups or families (we were in 6 friends). Excellent location no more than 5 min from the metro station. Particularly we enjoyed the presence of two modern and spacious bathrooms with shower over the living-really functional kitchen.<br/>Perfect stay, highly recommended.",0,0.8878,Positive
105.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,40,100.0,0,15.789359797990471,4.85,4.93,4.64,4.81,10809582,"Guest was really nice, the information are clear and the check-in is made really easy for us. The apartment is exactly as described and on the photo, thank you for your accuracy on that point. I recommend this place for its location and price.",1,0.9167,Positive
72.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,27,100.0,1,13.673862168326844,4.88,4.87,4.53,4.73,50354450,"Wir haben uns zu viert (zwei Erwachsene, zwei Kinder (0 und 5 Jahre alt)) für ein Wochenende sehr wohl gefühlt. Volker war gut erreichbar und sehr freundlich. Die Nähe zur Spree war toll.",1,-0.8591,Negative
