55.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,1,10.41352668784684,4.85,4.83,4.51,4.84,237670,"Leider hatten wir nur einen kurzen Aufenthalt. Die Lage ist sehr schön, man könnte meinen, dass man gar nicht in Berlin sei. :) Die Wohnung ist klein aber fein, lediglich mit Kopfkissen und Decke hatten wir so unsere Mühe. Nichtsdestotrotz können wir die Wohnung definitiv weiterempfehlen.",1,-0.8658,Negative
109.0,5,1.0,1.0,3.0,28,100.0,0,16.45297184148193,4.8,4.77,4.68,4.65,696306469196877312,Appartement très confortable. Transports en commun à proximité. Nous recommandons cette location.,1,0.0,Neutral
377.0,5,2.0,2.0,3.0,52,100.0,1,5.59894475162521,4.88,4.93,4.37,4.65,42270697,"Ideaal appartement voor een stedentrip naar Berlijn. Het appartement bevat goede ruimtes en het is er opgeruimd en netjes. De locatie is redelijk ver van het centrum, maar met een step is het goed te bereiken. Ik zou dit appartement zeker aanbevelen als je Berlijn zou willen ontdekken.",0,0.0,Neutral
280.0,7,2.0,2.0,6.0,42,96.0,0,6.1770612336798365,4.52,4.47,4.8,4.46,27018623,"Had a great stay here. Flat was actually a bit more spacious than anticipated, clean and functional. Good communication and all went smoothly. Would definitely stay again.",0,0.9081,Positive
53.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,4.795358275165721,4.73,4.57,4.86,4.75,18547011,"Sehr gut gelegen, viele Restaurants in der Nähe, auch Einkaufsmöglichkeiten sind super vorhanden! Wir hatten eine freundliche Einweisung.<br/>Die Unterkunft ist einfach, aber für unsere Bedarfe völlig in Ordnung.",1,0.636,Positive
136.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,1,3.2900161245726496,4.58,4.66,4.94,4.61,4636280,"For a one bedroom flat, this is extremely spacious and in a convenient part of the city. It’s an easy 10 -15 min walk to the Reichstag, Brandenburg gate and Museum island. There are 2 train stations within 5 mins, though to be honest we didn’t need to use the trains a lot to see most of the tourist sights. <br/>The flat is well set up with everything you need, TV, washing machine, coffee maker, complete kitchen. It promises Netflix but while we were there the internet was too slow to be able to enjoy this. <br/>The flat faces into a central courtyard and has a pleasant leafy and sunny outlook - its very quiet, no road noise whatsoever. <br/>The only major downside are the steps. Three stories up very steep steps. Didn’t worry us, but if steps put you off, this would be a problem.",1,0.6987,Positive
187.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,98.0,0,1.086656671143422,4.73,4.8,4.7,4.69,693905263672710940,"Apartment matched descriptions. Close to restaurants, cafes and metro. Very nice and safe area. Communication was well and check in was easy. Thank you 🙏🏻",1,0.9145,Positive
115.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,36,100.0,0,3.458646183942568,4.73,4.82,4.78,4.55,565189560386461595,Sehr sehr saubere Unterkunft super und neu eingerichtet alles da was man braucht. Zentral genug und ruhig genug.,1,0.5994,Positive
187.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,1,1.4503062227335417,4.87,4.79,4.93,4.76,1094269515845154731,Tutto bene. Ottima posizione per girare la città. Alcuni luoghi importanti raggiungibili anche a piedi. Qualche spunto per migliorare l'accoglienza: in bagno c'è odore di fogna anche tenendo aspiratore acceso. Una sola cialda per fare il caffè per 5gg di permanenza e due adulti.,1,0.0,Neutral
