90.0,5,1.0,1.0,3.0,41,100.0,1,5.309555254765008,4.92,4.98,4.9,4.83,31382592,"Nice apartment with all the services needed for a long stay. Helga was very nice too and she explained us everything. Very closed to the train station, which is very useful in Berlin to go to visit every place. The apartment is closed to Alexander Platz too, which was also very appreciated.",1,0.9132,Positive
