64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,100.0,0,4.123737842940942,4.75,4.84,4.68,4.71,15266797,I had a short stay in the room but everything went very smoothly and was just as described.  A very lively little neighborhood (though the apartment was nice and quiet) with tons of restaurants and grocery stores right outside.,1,0.8397,Positive
83.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,1,3.2015667482345425,4.95,4.94,4.95,4.83,16648309,"Generous wonderful host, place is spotless and very comfortable.",1,0.8908,Positive
62.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,3.030265439362758,4.95,4.97,4.9,4.82,752312082907975460,"Dave ist wirklich sehr zuvorkommend und hilfsbereit! Die Kommunikation lief einwandfrei, freundlich und angenehm. Die Beschreibung und viele gute Kommentare entsprechen unserem Erlebnis. Grazie Dave 😉 Eine nette und interessante Gegend runden das Ganze ab. Schaut mal in der Kulturbrauerei vorbei. Locker zu Fuß erreichbar und ein cooler Ort mit Kino, Theater, etc.",1,-0.8439,Negative
213.0,8,3.0,1.0,5.0,31,100.0,1,5.600860807992449,4.67,4.61,4.63,4.55,17384054,Very nice apartment with a great location next to a train station and very welcoming hosts!,0,0.8928,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,0,2.4506751341007647,5.0,4.86,5.0,4.71,24876567,"Wir waren eine Wochen in der stilvollen, sehr schönen, hellen Wohnung von Alice und  fühlten wir uns von Anfang an willkommen und zuhause. Ihr besonderes, künstlerisches Flair ist gut spürbar. Es fehlte uns an nichts, alles ist da. Toilette und Badezimmer sind gross und schön. Auch das Pflanzen giessen machte Spass und es ist schön von so vielen Pflanzen umgeben zu sein. Das Bett mit Moskitonetz ist sehr bequem! Die Lage der Wohnung ist  gut, man ist überall schnell, ob zu Fuss oder per Metro. Der Balkon wäre perfekt ohne Baustelle davor;) Wir waren jedoch viel unterwegs, darum war sie für uns auch nicht so störend. <br/>Alice war immer erreichbar, die Kommunikation unkompliziert und sympathisch. Auch beim Checkin kam Alice uns entgegen und wir konnten bereits am Morgen früh in die Wohnung. Herzlichen Dank!",1,-0.9755,Negative
50.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,30,100.0,1,14.897202853723911,4.96,4.9,4.92,4.93,31256397,"Tolles Haus, tolles, großes Zimmer. Carola ist eine supernette Gastgeberin!",1,0.0,Neutral
293.0,6,2.0,2.0,4.0,39,100.0,1,4.247361008084818,4.89,4.96,4.59,4.69,11899062,"Lovely apartment with everything we needed for a relaxing 3 day stay in Berlin. Comfortable beds with fresh smelling cotton sheets. Cooking facilities excellent. Great showers. We travelled with two elderly parents so the second shower and toilet was a big plus.<br/>Trudy's place is perfect for accessing the underground with easy access to centre of city. Our arrival and departure process went without a glitch.<br/>Only negative I could say is that the front bedrooms of apartment overlie the underground and this may disturb sleep for some. Fortunately we picked the back bedroom so we slept well! <br/>",0,0.9833,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,1,6.1114447900723885,4.89,4.8,4.83,4.81,619936,"Alexis ist ein achtsamer Gestgeber, der Ordnung, Sauberkeit und Klarheit liebt. Die mit bedacht sparsam eingerichteten Zimmer haben einen eigenen Stil. Auf dem eher harten Fouton + Daunendecke schlief ich gut.<br/>Alexis vermeidet vermeidbaren Konsum, lebt sehr nachhaltig. Ein toller Mensch, mit dem man perfekt französisch und englisch sprechen kann. <br/>Merci beoucoup für den offenen, netten Austausch. Es war bereichernd, Dich getroffen zu haben.  <br/>Gerne wieder. A la prochaine, Klaus",1,-0.8316,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,93.0,0,4.132403574870102,4.42,4.56,4.6,4.28,41336107,Overall clean room in a relatively accessible area. Only downside was that it wasnt facing the canal like what it stated in the description.,1,0.4939,Positive
144.0,8,4.0,1.0,5.0,29,100.0,0,5.07038523116355,4.45,4.71,4.71,4.12,1088501536142233960,"Stedet stod til forventningene. Enkelt å finne frem og enkelt å komme seg inn og ut. Verten svarte raskt og utfyllende.<br/>Vi følte at vi måtte være veldig stille pga desibelmåler i leiligheten. Det er fullt forståelig at verten ønsker at leietakere skal respektere lydnivå, men da er det litt kjipt når naboer bråker til langt på natt... Men det er en fin leilighet, god standard og til en grei pris. Vi hadde en fantastisk langhelg her og kommer gjerne tilbake 😊",0,0.2732,Positive
95.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,36,100.0,1,17.583758050772474,4.94,4.95,4.74,4.76,46021735,Schön eingerichtet. Sehr sauber. Gute Anbindung zu öffentlichen Verkehrsmitteln.,1,0.0,Neutral
89.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,51,100.0,1,6.670122906813517,4.97,4.99,4.92,4.93,16608497,You can expect amazing hospitality from Robert and a warm welcome from Jack!  The apartment is a fabulous space in a pretty part of Berlin and a stone's throw from Belle Vue station. A 10 to 15 minute walk along the river will see you in amongst some of Berlin's top sights. Roberts help in guiding us round was invaluable. The roof top terrace was the icing on the cake and a nice space to chill out at the end of a busy day sightseeing!  Would highly recommend you to stay in Roberts place. Don't bother considering anywhere else!!,1,0.9806,Positive
59.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,3.140236699479773,4.98,4.93,4.86,4.86,1028904872726256352,"Paul hat extra auf uns gewartet, als unser Zug Verspätung hatte, war super-nett und hilfreich. Am vorletzten Tag gab es Probleme mit der Warmwasserversorgung, wofür Paul aber nichts konnte (der ganze Block war wohl betroffen) - er hat uns rechtzeitig vor dem Duschen gewarnt ;)).",1,-0.8934,Negative
220.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,12.698614988429828,4.96,5.0,4.96,4.87,1173627869724929936,Seht schöne Wohnung und sehr gastfreundlicher Empfang! Sehr empfehlenswert!,1,0.0,Neutral
33.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,1,6.809556888557899,4.95,4.93,4.86,4.94,7806721,"Garrelt is a very lovely host 💌 he welcomed me himself into his apartment and showed me around. it was definitely worth for what it costed, great place for short solo travelers. the location wasas easy to find and the transportation wass not so complicated with public transportation from and to the airport. it was not far from the places i needed to be. the apartment itself was very clean and organised. Garrelt really made it all cozy and comfortable to be in. 10/10 would recommend! 🌻",1,0.978,Positive
67.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,38,100.0,1,9.589987916493834,4.79,4.49,4.68,4.78,26546193,Perfekte Wohnung und super kommunikativer Gastgeber.,1,0.5994,Positive
70.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,17,100.0,0,4.150324436872424,4.82,4.57,4.84,4.75,31562363,Stefan is very nice. he has been very helpful and easy to get in,1,0.8537,Positive
137.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,1.189406824976013,4.86,4.84,4.93,4.79,264459,This flat is perfect for exploring Berlin! It was easy to get to from Tegel and it is within walking distance of a few stops for mass transit which allows one to easily reach the city's main attractions. Henrik was very helpful and the flat is very clean and has a great charm/character. Would absolutely stay here again.,1,0.9673,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,9,100.0,0,1.5562678986918013,4.3,3.7,4.6,4.5,44053168,"Dirty,dirty,dirty,unbelievable dirty and messy.<br/>No toilet paper,no soap.bed was dirty and broken,also broken window that at morning you under the direct sun light.<br/>the Kitchen covered by rubbish and so messy.I saw a lot of dirty stains everywhere.it was unusable.<br/>The bathroom and toilet covered by deep germs from bottom to top,i m sure they had never cleaned it.it was disaster,i didnt took shower for 2 night,becuase i was afraid get sickeness from this dirty area.i didn't touch anything in this flat for 2 night.<br/>the location was far from center.also many people were living in the flat,at least i saw 4 different people in this tiny flat.i feel Eliot don't care about guest,he just rent a bed to you and nothing more responsibility.he answered my  messages after 10 days.honestly i am really angry that i booked this dirty place.it was a big mistake.<br/>The flat had got a really bad smell and also they smoken marriana inside flat.<br/>just the bed in the room belongs to you,it was full of owner stuff and he came to room to pick up them. Actually i don't feel privacy in this situation<br/>The value of this room is 0.<br/>i recomanded that never book this room..it is more like a scam",1,-0.9753,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,100.0,0,5.5383024807967525,4.73,4.64,4.68,4.68,19617756,"Jacopo’s place was amazing and we enjoyed every minute! Great location. Spacious, clean and tidy room with comfy bed. Jacopo’s (Hiden by Airbnb) are really generous and kind people, they can help you about everything and give you the best tips for Berlin. I highly recommend!",1,0.9854,Positive
156.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,98.0,0,3.700214239219251,4.72,4.81,4.74,4.58,945435635118375180,This is certainly a location I will stay in again. <br/>I felt safe here . It was very quiet and walkable to the grocery stores and other businesses,1,0.6486,Positive
84.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,52,100.0,1,3.3219101132328723,4.81,4.81,4.9,4.73,1238867,"Sehr zentrale Wohnung, in einem der schönsten Viertel Berlins. Die Wohnung befindet sich in Hinterhaus, von daher sehr ruhig. Das Check-in war einwandfrei. Sehr empfehlenswert!",1,-0.8439,Negative
204.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,1,2.046888577974296,4.85,4.89,4.83,4.77,1191147320550134464,"Vi nød bestemt opholdet i Berlin. Det var nemt at finde og at komme ind. <br/>Det er ikke et hjem, men ren udlejning og tydeligt irriterende for de andre beboere i opgangen. <br/>Et rent ikea hjem, og der mangler spækbræt, brødkniv og lign. så ikke et sted jeg ville lave mad. <br/>Køkken og badeværelset ligger lige op ad hinanden…<br/>Rigtig gode senge og dejligt opvarmet lejlighed. En butik lavet om til beboelse. Lyse værelser og meget mørkt køkken og spiseplads med TV.",1,-0.4939,Negative
97.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,1.301354295702545,5.0,5.0,5.0,4.69,29448866,"Franziska’s place is so lovely! She was very friendly and helpful to me as it was my first time in Germany. The apartment is just as described and shown in the pictures. It’s beautiful, very clean, bright, and feels spacious. It has a warm and cozy feeling despite being very clean, uncluttered and minimal. The apartment is two bedrooms (yours and then franziska’s), a kitchen, a dining/living room, a bathroom and one other small room for storage or miscellaneous things. Franziska is very friendly and easy to share space with. It’s located in an incredible neighborhood with so much to do and see literally only a few steps away from the door. There are also many train stops nearby if you want to explore other neighborhoods in the city. I had a great stay and would love to return one day!",1,0.9924,Positive
86.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,0,4.550681467828295,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,1266651604592771865,"I had an excellent stay at Rabea's. She and her daughter Aruna were direct, informative, and helpful. The studio was beautiful, with fantastic coffee. I felt right at home, and I would definitely stay again.",1,0.9493,Positive
166.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,16,50.0,0,8.694176238638248,4.7,4.55,4.81,4.41,22495883,"Wunderbar durchdacht, sehr gemütlich und überall Aussicht! Großartig, mit diesem schönen Häuschen in die Natur zu fahren. Danke für 2 wunderbare Tage! ",1,-0.6688,Negative
37.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,1,12.302303063837329,4.9,4.92,4.67,4.93,37581746,Very comfortable place and kind host. Highly recommended!,1,0.8548,Positive
