163.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,91.0,0,4.871252294318258,4.67,4.78,4.87,4.53,46864858,"Had a great stay at Numa Sketch. The localisation is perfect if you prefer an active yet calm enviroment. Lots of restuarants, bars etc. We also had the luck to visit the food and flea market on the weekend that is just around the corner which added some more good vibe to an already great stay. Communications are good and there is a lot to explore within as well from Numa. When it comes to the hotel itself it is newly renovated. Everything well done in an industrail touch and super clean really. Surprised that it was actually cleaner and more spacious then on the pictures. Overall a very good hotel which we recommend highly. The only thing that could be better is the communication that seems to be automatically generated which made our questions some times not answered. But Numa is proactive, making sure you get the information you need in time and also some advices that can be pleasant for many. We would definitly stay here again next time around.",1,0.9876,Positive
209.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,1,3.600012708602448,4.64,4.79,4.83,4.55,19944626,"Evin bulunduğu konum harika. Hem metroya yakın her yere ulaşabiliyorsunuz, bulunduğu muhit de çok nezih bir semt. Ev tertemizdi, temizlik konusu gerçekten kusursuzdu. Herhangi bir problem yaşamadık, zaten her şey öncesinde detaylı bir şekilde açıklanmıştı. Kesinlikle tavsiye ederim.",1,-0.4019,Negative
