81.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,54,100.0,1,11.098231074049592,4.93,4.9,4.71,4.83,6253378,"Ein kleines nettes Gartenhaus in ruhiger Lage. Modern ausgestattet. Alles da, was man braucht. Ich komme auf jeden Fall wieder. ",0,0.0,Neutral
84.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,1,3.2375488184892025,4.89,4.92,4.88,4.83,41651093,"What an amazing little gem this is, my partner and I had the pleasure of staying here for 3 nights and had a wonderful experience. Carsten and Jessica are lovely hosts, from booking they were in regular contact with recommendations for transport, a place for brunch when we arrived and updates on early check in availability.<br/>They allowed us to check in earlier than planned, Jessica met us at the door and introduced us to the flat. It was beautifully clean and presented, stocked with essential toiletries in the bathroom, and coffee and herbal/green tea making facilities, dishes, utensils, cutlery, even a single burner hob and pans to cook small meals if you wish. It really felt like everything had been thought of, a universal plug adapter, a USB plug, and more were also found in the drawers.<br/>In terms of the location, it is within very easy walking distance to a couple of different bus stops or underground stations in a quiet and safe neighbourhood. <br/>We cannot recommend this place enough!",1,0.9842,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,8,100.0,0,10.4089472760363,4.65,4.62,4.79,4.77,4898739,Mirjam is a friendly host and response promptly to all my questions before my trip. The room (also the whole flat) is big and just the same as described. I had a great time staying here with Mirjam and her two lovely cats! Highly recommend,1,0.9347,Positive
138.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,39,100.0,1,9.692806076286743,4.76,4.76,4.82,4.61,30919819,"This apartment is in a superb location, very close to everything and great value for money",1,0.891,Positive
