78.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,0,2.044233693147578,4.65,4.52,4.78,4.55,51097048,"Doc's place was squeaky clean and so pleasant. It felt like walking right into our own home. They have provided all amenities and fully functional kitchen.<br/>Special mention to the neighborhood, lots of great brunch places within a 5 min walk and we also loved the Stargarder Str and Pappelallee intersection which was a 15 min walk. It was our go to area for everyday evening dinners.<br/>He also helped us with luggage storage after check out.",1,0.9501,Positive
