130.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,1,2.669079881682033,4.97,4.98,4.84,4.86,26180749,"Friendly and helpful hosts, made us feel at home and provided helpful tips and recommendations for food. Super clean and comfortable stay. The room is lovely and the location is in a quiet area, with restaurants and amenities walkable.",1,0.9702,Positive
175.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,1,5.186577238960229,4.77,4.88,4.66,4.72,28535860,"Stayed here for three nights. For us, one of the important points in hotels is high-quality lighting and serviceable plumbing. All of this is excellent here. Different types of lighting, bright overhead light, large windows! Hot water in the shower at any time of the day, high-quality taps and showers. Everything you need is in the room. Enough space to organize things. The room is very warm, the beds are comfortable. The color palette of the room does not overload the eyes, everything is thought out and unobtrusive. The staff is wonderful, their English is great, always with a smile and positive attitude. The only negative specifically for us is the lack of a kettle in the room. But that was also decided. The hotel is very conveniently located. Taxis can be called directly from the hotel reception at the touch of a button. Information support is also good.  10/10! Thank you, Fjord Hotel Berlin, for a nice time.",1,0.9796,Positive
55.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,1,3.4716252179778877,4.68,4.68,4.62,4.58,40961985,"Everything needed for a short stay. Beautiful park across the road, with an outdoor cinema. Tram stop on the doorstep making it easy to get around Berlin . Shops and other amenities within  walking distance . Dietrich and his wife were quick to respond to messages.",1,0.6808,Positive
50.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,34,100.0,1,12.037235157198568,4.97,4.97,4.8,4.86,52084164,"Carola und Uli sind wunderbare Gastgeber. Das Haus ist sehr schön und ist neben der S-Bahn Station. Alles, was man für bequeme Unterkunft braucht, ist von der Gastgeber auch vorgeschlagen. Es ist auch sehr schön, dass man mit Carola und Uli schnell und bequem online kommunizieren kann.",1,0.0,Neutral
