63.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,50.0,1,5.882490006196684,4.88,4.93,4.81,4.88,700806,"there really isn't anything to say that hasn't been said before:<br/>Vincent and Micha were phenomenal hosts! they are the best I've ever had in my travels. they were kind, thoughtful, helpful, and in general just so so so lovely. i would thoroughly recommend this place and their company. <br/>oh the room was much larger than we expected. very spacious and unbelievably comfortable.",1,0.9781,Positive
79.0,4,1.0,1.5,2.0,60,100.0,1,3.902646890139105,4.84,4.88,4.9,4.71,8386451,"Clean and cozy place, great area close to transit and grocery stores. Easy checkin/checkout process, host is communicative and responsive, was able to fix issues quickly and wanted to make sure we had what we needed.<br/>Kitchen supplies were minimal but enough to do basic cooking from the local grocery store, and has what you need to be able to pick up supplies and put together some meals without going out all the time.<br/>I had a great time here, and would recommend it! Do be aware of the city tax that will be added on in addition to the amount listed on the listing if you're visiting for tourism - paid in cash on checkout (so make sure to keep some cash on hand before you leave). It's stated very clearly in the listing. Host is very responsive if you have any questions or needs and leaves good information about the apartment and the area, so don't hesitate to reach out if anything isn't working right.",1,0.9897,Positive
