70.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,49,100.0,1,1.775601826394409,4.76,4.83,4.8,4.65,786310333020320107,"Great apartment and great area! The location really can't be beat, it's equidistant from Mitte (museums + historical sites) and Kreuzberg, which is now my favorite neighborhood in Berlin. Sahin was a gracious host. Can't recommend this place enough!",1,0.9357,Positive
89.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,1,3.538392565176744,4.92,4.96,4.87,4.83,40004020,"Tom's apartment is in a great location with plenty of transportation options for sightseeing Berlin. It's in a quiet neighborhood, but with plenty of young families so it feels very safe even at night. The neighborhood has a variety of restaurants within walking distance. There are a few supermarkets close by, which are also very convenient. The bedding was very comfortable, and the apartment is kept very clean. It is fully furnished including essential kitchen tools you need. There is even a washing machine, which is super convenient although you can't use it at night due to noise. If you're coming during winter time, I recommend dressing warmly in the apartment and getting shoes with good traction for ice in the neighborhood.",1,0.9869,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,1,5.269817323835547,4.98,4.98,4.75,4.89,821670157069145247,Matteo è stato super gentile e disponibile.<br/>Camera pulita e sicura<br/>Appartamento ben collegato con i mezzi,1,0.5994,Positive
