73.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,33,100.0,0,6.432398665886561,4.53,4.44,4.71,4.48,43864181,"Thank you for the warm welcoming, we recommend!",1,0.8439,Positive
130.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,40,100.0,0,2.0461518528692397,4.96,4.92,5.0,4.85,5191010,"Our stay in Claus-Peter's apartment was flawless.  He met us when we arrived, gave us a thorough tour of the essentials and wished us well.  A map with nearby shops and restaurants completed the orientation.  It's the best accommodation we have had in 35+ years of travel.  The apartment is roomy, the kitchen very well equipped and was spotlessly clean.  The bed was wonderfully comfortable.  We will return!",1,0.9678,Positive
