64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,2.380705735722119,4.95,4.96,4.91,4.86,7571301,"This might be the cleanest Airbnb I’ve ever stayed in (and I’ve stayed in many.) The flat was immaculate. Bed was comfortable, shower was great! Tiziana and her daughter were kind, generous and accommodating. Could walk to many cute restaurants and nice parks from the flat and the train is easily accessible as well. I recommend staying here!",1,0.9787,Positive
