82.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,3.929915771235159,4.89,4.9,4.96,4.86,20660494,"We liked our stay at Uta's flat. The communication was fast and Uta showed a great hospitality.<br/>This flat is good for people who want to explore Berlin. It is situated in the lively borough of Kreuzberg. Cosy restaurants and pubs  are nearby. The former Tempelhof airport is within  walking distance. You can easily go to other parts of the city by public transport. The underground station is nearby.<br/>When you like to stay in your holiday flat and have magnificent views you'd rather pick another flat as this apartment is situated in a basement, though it's well equipped.<br/>The only downsides were the pillows, which were too flat, and the shower of which the water randomly turns colder and warmer. But I'm sure Uta will fix these little problems.",1,0.9223,Positive
