86.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,100.0,1,3.4203343748381307,4.76,4.8,4.78,4.65,2649669,"Katharina’s apartment was perfect for my week in Berlin. It was a lovely space to come back to after a full day of sightseeing, walking and exploring. It is very close to public transport. The lack of kitchen facilities was not a problem for me. There are many dining out options, a great cafe on nearby corner, and supermarkets are close by. There is a small fridge for perishables.",1,0.911,Positive
