125.0,8,3.0,1.0,2.0,45,100.0,1,5.451670615848214,4.87,4.87,4.79,4.68,9770154,"This stay was perfect for our group of 7 (2 couples, 1 toddler, 1 baby, 1 nana). The space was full of light and baby safe. Right across from the park and several great playgrounds in walking distance. A great beer garden across the street. was a short walk to the sbahn and a central location to getting to our activities associated with our family reunion. The location was peaceful and quiet but also a 15 minute walk from the edge of the bustling part of Kreutzburg.<br/>We didn't do much cooking but I loved being able to cook with a gas stove. <br/>Riccardo was very responsive to any questions about how appliances worked and had a travel crib and high chair set up for us upon arrival even when I had forgot to ask for them. We would definitely hope to come back the next time we're in Berlin.",0,0.9797,Positive
174.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,1,2.3120365438673978,4.92,4.93,4.92,4.86,1241967032582153264,"Artem gerçekten yardım sever birisi, bize her soru için çok hızlı destek oldu. Kendisinin evinde misafir olmak çok keyifliydi. Ev lokasyon olarak harika bir yerde,  evin önünden geçen otobüsler ile Berlin'in bir çok turistik yerine 5-15 dk da ulaşabilmek mümkün. Evin içi harikaydı. Burada misafir olmaktan çok mutlu oldum, bir daha Berlin'e gelirsem kesinlikle burada konaklarım.",1,0.0,Neutral
176.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,2.6109738907158704,4.83,4.91,4.9,4.75,28510664,"Muy buena ubicación, cerca de todo y muchas estaciones cerca. El personal super amable!  Eso sí, las paredes son delgadas y se oye ruido según quién tengas al lado. A parte hay una estación de bomberos casi delante, aunque por suerte no nos molestó más que una vez, y no era de noche. En resumen, calidad precio genial!",1,0.5972,Positive
