121.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,27,100.0,0,4.472653939309849,4.88,4.9,4.81,4.78,10122398,"The flat itself is really nice and definitely suitable for a longer stay. Martin is also very responsive and kind - whenever I had a question he instantly got back to me and helped me with whatever I needed (thanks for that)!<br/>The location itself is also extremely good as it is central (close to Potsdamer Platz). However, I must admit that I was a little bit surprised by the building and the street (was pretty dirty) when I arrived.<br/>All in all: Good place and I’d come back!",1,0.9745,Positive
