231.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,53,100.0,1,4.10145600811456,4.84,4.91,4.79,4.64,39507430,"We had a great time staying at Kristian and Vlad’s place at the time of Berlin Marathon. Location is very accessible via public transportation (u-bahn is 50 meters from the building) and there a lot of shops, restaurants nearby. Apartment is very nice and exactly as described in the listing. Hosts were very flexible and accommodating re early check in and last minute changes to guests. Absolutely recommend!",0,0.9095,Positive
