78.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,6.919397234051426,4.88,4.91,4.49,4.76,21061308,"The staff was very helpful, giving clear instructions in advance, so the check-in was very easy.<br/>Speaking on the inconveniences, the place lacks soundproofing: you can hear everything not only from the stairs (some neighbours are getting back late in the night or even early morning), also from the upstairs apartment above you, but especially — talks of the staff when they are chatting outside behind your window during the day time. So if you sit down and work, this is quite disturbing. If you are out to the city during the day, no problem then.<br/>Also,I would suggest avoiding using scented softener when washing bed linen. Every fourth or third customer now has allergies (including me), and high-end hotels never use scented softeners in their laundry. This relic remains only in the private hospitality and apartments sector. it takes a couple of nights before we stop coughing on bed linen with smell:(<br/>In all other aspects, my stay was really good, thank you so much for your hospitality!",1,-0.6865,Negative
123.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,2.036088585204626,4.88,4.86,4.98,4.79,919931,"Expectation exceeded! <br/>Super cosy place in central Berlin. I believe the best location you can book in Berlin: everything super near, public transportation 2min, very nice neighbourhood,. The place is super nice and most important, the bed is super convenient.<br/>And a big thank you to Verda. She is nice and super supportive—very caring!",1,0.9895,Positive
