124.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,51,100.0,1,2.588727150897194,4.93,4.93,4.93,4.68,1349401535870290415,"Great location, very clean, excellent hostess (very responsive & friendly). LOVED IT!  Neighborhood has great cafes and awesome vibe. Neat market nearby on Saturdays! AND it has a TUB! (Rare amenity in European Airbnb’s)<br/>I think it was my oversight but I didn’t realize upon reserving it that one of the bedrooms had the dining table in it. So there’s not a separate dining space or living room per se. But ultimately it was not a problem at all. Just something to keep in mind. Over all I highly recommend!!!",0,0.9734,Positive
