100.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,36,100.0,1,2.8844703561659584,4.87,4.86,4.8,4.67,20071024,"Philipp’s place was exactly as described. It’s located in a great neighborhood with easy access via public transportation to many other fun areas of the city. The kitchen was well set up for making meals but there are also many food options within a few blocks. The bed was super comfortable, which was very welcome after a long night out. My only wish was that the water in the shower could get a little hotter. I would definitely stay here again.",1,0.9794,Positive
