180.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,43,100.0,1,4.206643579256427,4.89,4.88,4.94,4.67,37359998,"I booked the apartment for myself and a colleague to stay at while we attended the Berlin Film Festival this year. It was best idea, the flat is in a lovely lovely area of Berlin, and having somewhere to get away from all the noise of the festival was great. The rooms are of an excellent standard, and everything looks as great as they do in the photos. We were just sad that we didn't get to spend enough time in the area and the flat. I would definitely recommend and would book again in a heart beat.",0,0.9864,Positive
171.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,1,3.884798609065873,4.91,4.65,4.93,4.8,32887831,"Josephs  apartment was spacious, high ceilings and stylishly decorated. Modern without being cold. My travel partner and I really enjoyed our stay, it was close to metros an don a wide blvd. I was also surprised at how quiet it was. For a first floor unit I expected more street and traffic noise but was silent. The quiet along with black out shades made for a good nights sleep",1,0.7647,Positive
167.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,0,4.149945021768397,4.93,4.88,4.89,4.74,701909,"The Loft is gorgeous! Open, spacious, very clean and comfortable! The photos are amazing in themselves, but when you see it in person, its even better. It was very hard to leave. The location is central to bars, cafes, a grocery store as well as the train. Lorant is a wonderful host who was always available over email and made our stay seamless!",1,0.9576,Positive
80.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,45,100.0,1,4.333956585500219,4.88,4.92,4.93,4.74,20447608,"War alles super. Maria ist sehr freundlich und gibt einem gute Tipps für Erkundungen und fragt auch regelmäßig, ob man etwas benötigt. Die Wohnung ist gut gelegen und man hat Bus und U-Bahn Anschlüsse in wenigen Minuten Entfernung. Einziges Manko - in der Wohnung wird geraucht. Im Zimmer riecht man es nicht so sehr, dennoch ist der Geruch präsent (falls jemand empfindlich ist).",1,-0.5994,Negative
422.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,53,100.0,0,3.756570951732456,4.97,4.93,4.99,4.81,28432988,Ana and Nik were lovely hosts. Highly recommended.,1,0.7089,Positive
138.0,6,2.0,2.0,2.0,23,95.0,0,3.765795504081476,4.67,4.77,4.76,4.51,1034665825236371167,"Apart from a mishap which meant that one of the toilet doors could not be closed, the flat was as described, only a bit dingy. The kitchen was well stocked, everything worked well, and we were so happy to have necessities such as salt and pepper, oil and diahwashing tabs. That always makes such a difference. We loved the location - there are two great bars in the street, one is next door, and lots of shops to get food, drinks and cakes! If you came with a family, kids would love the ice cream shop across the road and the cool park.<br/>Our only complaint would be that despite being only two of us chatting in the kitchen after hours, we were called and texted being asked to be quiet. Yes, it was late, but we were on holiday and we were only chatting and laughing, not having a party! I think if there is such a problem with sound being audible then the apartment isn't fit for purpose. I would say if you want to chat after being out at the pub, this flat isn't for you.",1,0.9224,Positive
100.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,41,100.0,1,1.9469096234802603,4.85,4.92,4.91,4.75,408756,"Great flat in a great area of Berlin with very easy access to Trams, U Bahn and S Bahn to get you anywhere you would like in Berlin. J",1,0.9312,Positive
