125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,41,100.0,0,3.5325508187052037,4.63,4.5,4.63,4.25,872432856424783408,Izabela is such a friendly and helpful host. Her place is beautiful and she went out of her way to help us and made it feel like home from the start. <br/>Thank you!,1,0.937,Positive
40.0,2,1.0,1.0,4.0,12,100.0,1,2.553622489327082,4.47,4.58,4.84,4.51,9063682,"We had a fantastic experience staying at Uwe's flat. The neighbourhood is perfect -- lots of places to eat and drink, good for transport, but the building itself is very quiet so you can sleep comfortably. Uwe was very flexible and easy to communicate with. The flat was spotless and had everything we needed, it was so relaxing. I hope we will stay again sometime.",1,0.9804,Positive
151.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,94.0,0,3.1018817858877528,4.67,4.77,4.78,4.52,721527807549293451,"I had one of the more nice rooms, with high ceiling and balcony with street-view. Very nice. Only downside was that it was dirty under the bed, but that's something I would expect from a regular hotel too.",1,0.1308,Positive
45.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,25,100.0,0,13.68563366869431,4.73,4.63,4.72,4.57,53146206,Es war alles sehr unkompliziert. Die Wohnung und das Zimmer waren wie auf den Bilder. Super für einen kurzen Aufenthalt in Berin :),1,-0.2263,Negative
