58.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,51,100.0,1,1.1184416403191766,4.96,4.98,4.96,4.85,37446212,"The location is perfect, only a 2 minute walk to public transportation where most things are within 20 minute reach and within 10 minutes you walk to the stores and terraces in the city! Basically everything you will need during your stay is already present for you in the apartment and Alan en Günther were amazing hosts. We had a great 5 days here, I totally recommend this place to anyone!",1,0.944,Positive
81.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,34,20.0,0,5.45527882053709,4.9,4.92,4.89,4.68,851293574153685464,"Die Kommunikation war unkompliziert und das Zimmer sehr sauber. Allerdings war das Bett für 2 Personen etwas klein. Für einen Aufenthalt übers Wochenende war es in Ordnung, aber für einen längeren Urlaub wäre es etwas eng gewesen. Alles in allem ein angenehmer Aufenthalt.",1,-0.9485,Negative
50.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,0,4.231097673854453,4.73,4.75,4.55,4.68,30384248,Leider war unsere Wohnung dreckig und verschmutzt. PRoblem wurde nur mühsam bis garnicht behoben. Kommunikation schwierig.,1,-0.765,Negative
68.0,2,0.0,0.0,1.0,21,100.0,1,3.132943292576071,4.86,4.68,4.88,4.81,979758,"My stay at Jurriaan's apartment was fantastic. Everything was well arranged, the communication was clear and the apartment is exactly as described. There's a tram stop and metro close by meaning that you can get to where you need to be in Berlin very quickly. The apartment was very clean and thoughtfully designed, with a well-curated book collection. Above all, the apartment is nice and light, while also being very quiet with high quality double windows. I would highly recommend staying with Jurriaan!",1,0.9512,Positive
90.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,1,3.5424985263229805,4.8,4.79,4.88,4.69,11029458,Excelente apartamento. Bien situado y con todo lo necesario para poder tener una excelente estancia en Berlín.,1,0.0,Neutral
223.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,47,100.0,1,4.116733808652775,4.98,4.99,4.81,4.83,668157595596321506,"Excellent stay - my friends and I stayed at Katarina  and Tomasz’s apartment for New Year. The location was perfect, spotlessly clean and fit the description perfectly. Both hosts feedback was quick and responsive with recommendations within the local area and very thoughtful personal touches including chocolates and ear plugs on the pillow. Really grateful for the wonderful stay. Cannot thank you enough!",0,0.9841,Positive
144.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,22,100.0,1,3.997566619621463,4.79,4.86,4.82,4.58,1050518864738159602,"Beautiful, beautiful apartment! In love with the wood and layout, absolutely would stay here again.",1,0.923,Positive
64.0,2,2.0,1.0,1.0,10,100.0,0,11.196854566622646,4.64,4.85,4.88,4.75,7037153,"Julia nous a très bien accueilli. Le logement est très bien. Sa situation, certes excentrée du centre historique est dans un quartier agréable et chic",1,0.2732,Positive
