88.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,0,12.760805103334942,4.7,4.76,4.71,4.68,1574592,"L'appartamento è bellissimo, per quanto ci riguarda, molto più che in foto (il bagno è più grande!). I letti sono comodi, la cucina fornita, ti danno lenzuola, coperte e asciugamani. C'è un phon, anche. Insomma una casa con tutto il necessario e, letteralmente, attraversando la strada si ha la fermata dei mezzi (treno e metro), ma essendo nel cortile interno è schermata da qualsiasi tipo di rumore.<br/>Consigliatissima, in 25 minuti raggiungi ogni attrazione e AL MASSIMO con un cambio di metro. Favoloso. Consiglistissimo!",1,0.4559,Positive
68.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,0,19.49595006982221,4.57,4.46,4.58,4.58,23782669,"Lors de notre séjour, nous n'avons pas rencontré notre hôte mais il était toujours super attentif de répondre à toutes nos questions et à nos demandes. Il est très arrangeant. L'appart est super, au calme, bien situé, dans un bel endroit verdoyant. Seul bémol, manque un peu d'ustensiles de cuisine tels que des verres à eau, à bière, à vin, plats à salade, 2 tasses en + et des bols, des couteaux qui coupent, planche à découper,...",1,0.8316,Positive
130.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,27,100.0,1,16.510276753164995,4.98,4.98,4.82,4.87,13872278,"The photos for this apartment really do not do it justice...it is is a fabulous place to stay; the room are spacious and full of light and everything you need is there to hand. The location is just great - amongst streets of smart villas that are either trendy apartments or foreign consulates and just a few minutes walk to the U-Bahn (New Westend) and them 15 minutes into the city centre. Supermarkets, coffee houses and restaurants are just a stones throw away. Kirsten was a fabulous host and if you are flying into Tegel airport, it is a 10 minute taxi ride. Highly recommended as a base to explore this great city.",1,0.9719,Positive
158.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,0,2.3009957305697566,4.68,4.76,4.9,4.64,15998589,"Clean apartment, has everything you need. The restaurant downstairs wasn't a bother, good windows. Location is very convenient, tram stop, restaurants, bars, large supermarket in walking distance. Safe but not boring neighborhood.",1,0.5149,Positive
334.0,6,3.0,1.0,4.0,37,100.0,1,1.030179872431568,4.88,4.95,4.92,4.72,927558861611554340,"We were unsure when exactly to arrive, Leonid however was very flexible with the checkin time on our arrival.",0,0.0498,Neutral
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,1,2.4282218534972566,4.69,4.8,4.77,4.59,1414396346104873502,"Gut gelegenes Hotel, sauberes Zimmer und angenehmes Ambiente im Restaurant. Gute Frühstücksauswahl und alles frisch und schmackhaft! <br/>Freundliches Personal.",1,0.0,Neutral
174.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,1,2.3138940206665635,4.92,4.75,5.0,4.83,1241959961142780221,"Die Unterkunft sah 1:1 aus wie auf den Fotos. Gut ausgestattet, super easy zum einchecken. Arten hat innerhalb weniger Minuten auf die Nachrichten geantwortet, obwohl wir wirklich sehr wenig Fragen hatten. Bis nach Kreuzberg läuft man 20 min, ganz entspannt also.",1,-0.25,Negative
79.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,11.00520151279848,4.92,4.96,4.81,4.81,5410909,"Vi værdsatte den meget rolige og private lejlighed , som ligger i et dejligt kvarter med let adgang til resten af Berlins mangfoldighed .",1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,2,2.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,3.292264678014186,4.93,4.8,4.97,4.77,16304394,"정말정말 예쁘고 내부도 깨끗합니다. 사진보다 훌륭해요. 베를린에서 4번째 숙소였는데 최고였음. 집처럼 있기에 좋아요. 식기 하나하나 깨끗하고 호스트가 좀 깐깐하다 싶었는데 납득갑니다. 무조건 다시 묵고싶은 곳. 걸어서 갈 거리에 좋은 카페, 요가원, 식당, 마트, 지하철 다 있어요.",1,0.0,Neutral
96.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,3.6244097204949255,4.79,4.79,4.88,4.61,636680772737785680,"For my 3-day trip, this accommodation was perfect. Everything was easy to find, clean, and convenient. I am completely satisfied with my choice.",1,0.908,Positive
260.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,91.0,0,4.81020597174384,4.59,4.7,4.4,4.44,28299765,Nemt og godt,1,0.0,Neutral
66.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,45,100.0,1,8.230717363177027,4.89,4.88,4.84,4.76,34243172,Thekla was a wonderful host . The apartment was clean and comfortable with a cute little patio . She provided us with an early check in and was extremely communicative during our stay .  Location was perfect and transportation was easy ! 100 % would recommend!,1,0.9697,Positive
222.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,1,4.559483850082822,4.95,4.95,4.9,4.9,776887009091683046,"Alex was a superhost, very friendly, nice to chit chat, lots of recommendations, always ready to help and extra responsive! The place was very clean and nice. Very spaceous, well equiped kitchen, public transport is near, lovely balconies. No need to walk far to find interesting and cool stuff!",1,0.9816,Positive
45.0,3,1.0,1.5,2.0,44,100.0,1,13.335712033183713,4.95,4.95,4.77,4.9,19619437,Très contentes de notre séjour à Berlin ! <br/>Mona est très gentille. <br/>Le logement est proche du métro. La chambre est très propre. <br/>Merci pour votre accueil :),1,0.5093,Positive
160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,98.0,0,1.0407544919436775,4.54,4.66,4.77,4.45,34294913,"Great central location in quiet area. Clean, comfortable, lots of amenities around and super tied into the public transport system. Would recommend.",1,0.9477,Positive
147.0,2,1.0,1.5,3.0,43,100.0,0,1.296081270021233,4.91,4.95,4.97,4.68,8564167,"Great host,very kind and helpful :)!<br/>large room ,comfortable bed, clean and  beautiful apartment. Great central location.We stayed very well,and we recommend it so much .If you're lucky and find free place take it right away! Moritz  thanks for your sympathy and availability :))",1,0.99,Positive
76.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,21,99.0,0,2.1897939786653327,4.56,4.7,4.89,4.51,41403574,Alles bestens.,1,0.0,Neutral
171.0,6,0.0,1.0,4.0,40,100.0,1,3.047254274424235,4.91,4.95,4.86,4.79,9428090,"Great place to stay, nice and cosy. Very stylish, and modern. Check-in was great and flexible to our landing time and check-out was very straightforward. Would recommend this place for anybody to stay at and I'll definitely be staying here when I next come to Berlin!",1,0.9562,Positive
283.0,10,3.0,2.0,6.0,51,100.0,1,14.68016992172163,4.74,4.44,4.68,4.57,925174582250487112,"Nous avons passé un super séjour à Berlin grâce à l'appartement de David. Bien situé, arrêt de bus en face de l'appartement. <br/>Bien décoré, bien agencé.",0,0.5994,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,0,3.2503653907727403,4.82,4.8,4.91,4.83,8726209,"When I stayed in Stuttgart this past summer, I had a few bad experiences staying in a few less-than-great Airbnb situations.  Some where too far from any good public transport or sites, and some didn't have the best oversight.  Sven's place was the polar opposite, a fantastic place right in the heart of the northern part of Berlin, just a few minutes' walk from tons of shops and restaurants, and right near a tram and S Bahn station.  Berlin was a much better stay in Germany for me than Stuttgart, and Sven's place was one reason why--great city, great place, great host, and I recommend them all.  :)",1,0.9454,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,1,4.861082501850892,4.75,4.76,4.6,4.7,5188216,"Nice place, ok location. :)",1,0.7906,Positive
89.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,0,12.72557223503116,4.66,4.69,4.68,4.53,15019290,Es hat alles super geklappt und unseren Erwartungen entsprochen 😉🙋🏻‍♀️,1,0.5994,Positive
174.0,7,3.0,2.0,3.0,31,100.0,1,8.08686445377939,4.92,4.85,4.84,4.88,23451726,This was ideal for a city break with friends.<br/>Transport in Berlin is so convenient that you could get anywhere you wanted to be in reasonable time. It was lovely to come back here on an evening for peace and quiet and a good night's sleep in a comfortable bed.<br/>Thank you!,0,0.9531,Positive
152.0,5,2.0,1.0,5.0,40,100.0,1,1.5968425433019005,4.81,4.77,4.93,4.69,22677,"Ramfis was always very accommodating to provide us information on directions, restaurants, etc.. We had a most comfortable stay at his well appointed apartment which was located at the epicenter of Berlin’s cool restaurants & bars. Note though, despite the central location it was both quiet & safe at anytime of the day. We enjoyed Berlin tremendously and would certainly return for a visit again and perhaps stay at Ramfis’s apartment. Great meeting you Ramfis! ",0,0.965,Positive
81.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,7,99.0,0,0.9354909247698387,4.71,4.61,4.9,4.64,1181979091838046551,"Se encuentra en un barrio muy lindo, céntrico y fácil de encontrar. Para la estancia de una noche está perfecto. El colchón es algo incómodo, hace mucho ruido y la ventana no tiene cortina. El espacio muy limpio y ordenado. Lo más lindo fue conocer a un gatito blanco muy tierno.",1,0.0258,Neutral
271.0,10,3.0,1.5,5.0,56,100.0,1,5.229990782295846,4.95,4.89,4.8,4.88,17223235,"We encountered several train delays, and Werner offered to provide groceries for us, especially since we had 4 hungry and tired kids with us. He surprised the kids with ice cream when we arrived - so incredibly thoughtful. The kids’ mood changed instantly and we were so grateful for this level of care and hospitality.  He gave us great recommendations and a short history lesson. The place looks just like the photos and we especially enjoyed the easy access to transport, playgrounds and Tempelhof. There are scooters and bikes to rent via app which we highly recommend for Tempelhof.",0,0.9761,Positive
31.0,3,2.0,1.0,3.0,19,86.0,0,30.90671021934421,4.52,4.39,4.65,4.56,22110197,"Прекрасное место для проживания. Это даже не комната, а отдельный двухэтажный домик со всем необходимым для комфорта и достаточно просторной спальней. Тихий спокойный район. Несмотря на некоторую удаленность от центра города, добраться сюда не так сложно. Я иногда запутывался в берлинской транспортной системе, но это из-за того что она непривычна для меня. Рекомендую это жилье и сам не прочь вернуться сюда в следующий раз.",1,0.0,Neutral
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,9,100.0,0,6.474666631989763,5.0,4.0,5.0,5.0,14830468,"Very close to the station and the airport I flew in so no need to get up really early to make along train journey. <br/>Great nearby amenities. Large room and free wifi. An enormous shared flat.  I only slept in the room and never got the chance to meet with Ylva unfortunately as I was out everyday. ",1,-0.0788,Negative
77.0,3,1.0,0.0,3.0,30,98.0,1,12.36671538964168,4.76,4.86,4.55,4.77,26950491,Das Airbnb ist sehr schön und genauso wie auf den Bildern. Me Hien ist sehr freundlich und sehr schnell in der Kommunikation! Es lief alles wie geplant und ich kann das AirBnb nur weiter empfehlen.,1,0.0,Neutral
80.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,90.0,0,1.4716913138627066,4.89,4.88,4.96,4.83,13593823,Great location in a quiet neighborhood very close to 3 tram lines.  felt like home.   She is such a warm and friendly person.  look forward to going back.,1,0.8934,Positive
