51.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,6.507053849431365,4.88,4.68,4.88,4.84,1300487,"War alles super, Zimmer sehr gemütlich, tolle Lage",1,0.0,Neutral
210.0,4,2.0,2.0,2.0,62,100.0,0,2.2389327358587434,4.78,4.79,4.81,4.66,50473684,"The apartment is spacious and has everything you need. Let me stress that the S Bahn train travels just outside the apartment and even with earplugs it was loud. The weather was cool enough to keep all windows and doors closed but to have fresh air, you needed to yell at each other sometimes when there were lots of trains going by. Also, it’s customary to leave cold water and some basics like cream for coffee and a bottle of wine in the fridge for guests. This apartment did not. Tap water is okay to drink and there was a Nespresso coffee maker with pods. Overall, we had a nice stay, comfortable beds and linens.",0,0.9446,Positive
151.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,94.0,0,3.1018817858877528,4.67,4.77,4.78,4.52,721527807549293451,"Ubytování se nacházelo ve skvělé lokaci. Poklidná ulice, ale vše bylo jednoduše dostupné. Samoobslužný proces ubytování nám vyhovoval a mohli jsme provést check-in dříve, než jsme se domluvili. Pokoj byl krásný a hlavně čistý. Vše potřebné vybavení. Jediný problém jsme měli s televizí, která blbla a nešlo se k ní z 50% času připojit.",1,0.0,Neutral
