32.0,6,1.0,1.0,2.0,14,94.0,1,3.5488970618636317,4.83,4.84,4.86,4.84,42862387,Host is very welcoming with good recommendations and place is very clean.,1,0.8537,Positive
55.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,0,1.354221835889287,4.91,4.71,4.96,4.9,14257495,"We really enjoyed staying at Wibke’s place. When she found out her hot water heater was being replaced during our stay, she let us know well in advance, and offered us a large discount among many other options. We are so glad we stayed at Wibkes, even if we have no hot water for a couple days! Her flat is adorable and well equipped as well as comfortable. Wibke is very cool and a great host. Thank you so much",1,0.9794,Positive
93.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,39,100.0,1,3.2781637723728885,4.56,4.54,4.61,4.48,1537125,"This was a nice and comfy apartment, located on a quiet residential. Though the apartment is in the basement, it has a lot of  natural light and was very cool on a hot Berlin summer day. Karen was very responsive and gave some great tips on getting from the airport. Check-in was very straightforward. The apartment was very modern with a dishwasher, microwave and very clean. Would definitely recommend.",1,0.9692,Positive
115.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,1,3.478761427822,4.86,4.92,4.94,4.58,26616955,"Really nice flat, renovated with elegance, with everything I needed. The location is just perfect, quiet and close to public transportation and many bars, restaurants etc. Andreas was responsive and helpful. I hope returning soon.",1,0.9524,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,0,2.715727914574357,4.72,4.77,4.8,4.59,1867179,"Tolle, sehr schön gelegene Wohnung. Sehr sauber und absolut unkompliziert. <br/>Die Lage ist top, in 3-4 Minuten ist man bei der Tram oder S Bahn. Es gibt Einkaufsmöglichkeiten in der direkten Umgebung und schöne Frühstücksmöglichkeiten. <br/>Wir würden immer wieder kommen ! Super",1,0.7177,Positive
95.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,1,3.2655381260982392,4.91,4.87,4.87,4.82,456902,"Stefan's apartment is a perfect base for those wishing to explore Berlin but want a more ""real"" and Bohemian experience of this amazing and vibrant city. Ideally located in Kreuzberg with easy access to all the main S and U-Bahn lines we managed to see and experience everything we hoped for in our three-day stay. <br/><br/>The apartment was clean, comfortable and everything we could have wished for.",1,0.9883,Positive
306.0,8,4.0,2.0,6.0,33,100.0,1,6.9497901337019625,4.91,4.91,4.57,4.81,14314574,Mooi appartement in een bijzonder gebouw en groot genoeg voor een groep. Dichtbij het centrum en het OV.,0,0.0,Neutral
45.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,88.0,1,22.247828051840308,4.95,4.92,4.85,4.9,1102154289806652485,"Naš boravak kod Sabine bio je i više nego ugodan. Sabine je vrlo pozitivna, ljubazna i susretljiva osoba i s njom smo se osjećale kao kod kuće. Rado nam je i s veseljem pomogla nam oko svega što nam je bilo potrebno. <br/>Kuća izgleda kao na fotografijama, no oduševit ćete se još bolje uživo. Nalazi se u mirnom području i dobro je povezano gradskim prijevozom.<br/>Preporučile bi boravak s dragom Sabine svakome i ako ćemo imati prilike, rado bi se vratile kod nje! ❤️",1,-0.3595,Negative
151.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,94.0,0,3.1018817858877528,4.67,4.77,4.78,4.52,721527807549293451,"It was a great place to stay, very central to lots of attractions and Numa communicated with us quickly whenever we needed!",1,0.8016,Positive
110.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,2.990654359868407,4.86,4.94,4.94,4.78,1165227481829107407,Die Gastgeber waren super freundlich und ich habe mich sehr wohl bei ihnen gefühlt. Alles total unkompliziert,1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,12,100.0,0,4.852002487602452,4.88,4.69,4.81,4.94,6744830,"We felt very welcome and really enjoyed our stay in Friedrichshain. It was lovely and cool in the flat despite the hot weather and though noisier at weekends, once the windows were shut it was very quiet. I would definitely stay in Sabine's flat again. Simon-Dach Straße is very close and a lovely place for all kinds of food and socialising. Sabine was also easy to contact and checked we were OK during the stay (she was away and we had the flat to ourselves).",1,0.9766,Positive
31.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,20,100.0,1,12.389708472442326,4.76,4.74,4.59,4.81,31116923,"Great place to stay, quiet, near dublin, lot buses near the place going straight to city center 24/24. Very handy.",1,0.7184,Positive
67.0,1,1.0,1.5,1.0,36,100.0,0,8.037114185806983,4.76,4.91,4.7,4.76,25314669,"Das Zimmer war sehr schön eingerichtet und mit allem Notwendigem ausgestattet. <br/>Hanspeter war ein sehr freundlicher Gastgeber und leicht erreichbar, da er nebenan wohnte.<br/>Die Nachbarschaft war ruhig und somit ideal, um sich von der lauten Großstadt zu erholen.<br/>Wir würden wieder kommen.",1,-0.8519,Negative
124.0,4,0.0,1.0,0.0,18,95.0,1,3.983572416738545,4.71,4.76,4.81,4.81,52377197,"A bit far from S-bahn especially if you have bags and children , but the room is spacious and very clean . Loooved the place !",1,0.6464,Positive
217.0,14,4.0,2.0,7.0,26,100.0,0,6.6400976550123545,4.59,4.44,4.56,4.45,38833009,"L'esperienza nell'alloggio di Marcel è stata ottima. E' stato facile trovarlo, accedere alla casa e lasciare le chiavi. Gli spazi erano puliti e c'era il necessario. Peccato solo per la serranda rotta in una delle camere, quella con il disegno del mare e delle palme sulla parete. Chi ci dormiva no ha mai avuto la luce naturale. Peccato che non sia stato possibile ripararla prima o durante il nostro arrivo. Per il resto la casa è ben tenuta, al piano terra di un palazzo abitato, quindi bisogna giustamente rispettare le regole di silenzio e decoro. GRAZIE!!!!!! ALLA PROSSIMA :)",0,0.6562,Positive
402.0,8,3.0,2.0,8.0,46,100.0,1,0.827035666703411,4.76,4.83,4.79,4.65,27476768,"Great place to stay with a family. A bit noisy downstairs, but manageable. Will stay here again in the future. Easy access to the city and transportation.",0,0.7227,Positive
75.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,1,3.7465670354738254,4.89,4.91,4.74,4.8,4581049,"Die Unterkunft war genau wie auf den Fotos. Etienne hat uns vor dem Haus abgeholt und zur Wohnung in den 5 Stock begleitet. Er hat uns viele Tips für unseren Aufenthalt gegeben.<br/>Das Bett war sehr bequem, sehr Rückenfreundlich.<br/>Nur das Waschbecken hätte etwas größer sein dürfen.",1,-0.9136,Negative
188.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,6.547712743829179,4.79,4.86,4.62,4.54,28528251,Das Urban Rooftop with Bathtub ist ein hervorragendes Zimmer! Es ist wunderschön und modern eingerichtet. Die Terrasse und vor allem die freistehende Badewanne sind ein Highlight.<br/>Wir können nur das Gegenteil von vorherigen Kommentaren über die Mitarbeiter sagen: ALLE WAREN ENORM FREUNDLICH! Ein Tipp an alle mit dem Auto Reisenden: reserviert möglichst vorab einen Parkplatz auf dem Hotelhof! <br/>Zusammengefasst: ⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️,1,-0.927,Negative
90.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,54,100.0,1,14.82311742105898,4.82,4.68,4.56,4.7,20227733,Ist eine schöne gepflegte Wohnung :) <br/>Lief alles ohne Probleme:) immer wieder gerne dahin für eine Reise nach Berlin.,1,0.4588,Positive
131.0,4,3.0,2.0,4.0,34,100.0,0,24.213983456560847,4.6,4.7,4.4,4.2,11171718,"FANTASTIC SPACE- comfortable, clean, spacious, quiet. It was the perfect place to stay for a week during an intense event. It was so peaceful. It had everything we needed and the area is so cute and charming. <3",0,0.9838,Positive
31.0,6,1.0,1.0,6.0,29,99.0,0,1.5518343874590943,4.55,4.64,4.6,4.63,6110762,Top Preis-Leistungs-Verhältnis,1,0.2023,Positive
77.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,23,96.0,0,13.06909762308404,4.81,4.8,4.59,4.73,24328002,"Iljana’s room (black and white) was easy to find thanks to the clear instructions. The room was very clean, and we immediately felt at ease. Iljana checked in to make sure everything was alright. You share the bathroom with at most one other room, but we rarely had to wait to use it. The towels smelled very fresh, and everything we needed was provided. Berlin is a bit of a journey from the location, but for the price, it was definitely worth it. Thank you, Iljana, for your hospitality!",1,0.9684,Positive
35.0,1,1.0,1.0,2.0,18,100.0,1,10.554254157229684,4.76,4.92,4.8,4.74,18848814,"Ich kann einfach sagen, dass Sie die beste Gastgeberin in Berlin und die Unterkunft am schönsten ist.",1,-0.8316,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,6,100.0,0,6.024232205460126,5.0,5.0,5.0,4.5,10874951,"Die Schlüsselübergabe verlief äußerst unkompliziert, Susanne war sehr entgegenkommend was An- und Abreisezeiten betraf. In ihrer Wohnung überraschten uns ein sehr freundlicher, persönlicher Brief und eine liebevoll gezeichnete Karte der Gegend. Außerdem hingen in der Küche kleine Notizen zur Orientierung, die ein Gefühl von Zuhause aufkommen ließen.<br/>Das Zimmer war sehr süß und gemütlich eingerichtet und hat genau der Beschreibung entsprochen. Die Wohnung liegt direkt an der S-Bahn-Haltestelle Ostkreuz, ergo superzentral - Friedrichshain ist fast komplett zu Fuß erkundbar, Späti genau nebenan und es gibt überall superleckeres Essen. Und trotz der Nähe zum Ostkreuz ist es in der Wohnung sehr ruhig und freundlich. <br/>Wir hatten ein tolles Wochenende und können Susanne und ihre Wohnung nur wärmstens empfehlen. ",1,-0.9661,Negative
80.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,56,100.0,1,2.2102820475445166,4.85,4.82,4.88,4.76,3904895,"Carolina's apartment is simply lovely. The place is well furnished and has everything you need for both short and long stays. The apartment has a very quiet neighbourhood and it is well connected through trams and S-Bahn. It is also well located in one of Berlin's warmest ""Bezirke"", close to nice cafes, shops, supermarkets and the weekly market. Communication with Carolina were always smooth and quick. I will definitely come back for my next stay in Berlin!",1,0.9485,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,63,94.0,1,7.298960270847663,4.76,4.83,4.21,4.66,1128400212435947426,Der Check-In war äußerst unkompliziert und freundlich.<br/>Das Zimmer war extrem sauber und modern.<br/>Der Stadtteil ist zwar nicht der schönste aber mit der U-Bahn (50m - Fußweg) kommt man super einfach überall hin.<br/>Alles in allem mehr als zufrieden…,1,-0.5994,Negative
54.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,17,100.0,1,6.9953085951227845,4.74,4.84,4.46,4.71,22483099,"Mina is a great host. Check-in was smooth, the apartment is close to transport and supermarkets and convenient to get from the airport. It was very clean and organized. Definitely recommend. ",1,0.9061,Positive
168.0,6,2.0,1.5,3.0,21,99.0,0,3.880339168487847,4.63,4.39,4.81,4.5,33234428,The stay was fine. Location is good and walkable from the station and fairly close to restaurants and bars. The apartment needs some work and shining up.,0,0.5719,Positive
277.0,6,2.0,1.5,3.0,40,100.0,0,6.513178847843981,4.81,4.95,4.62,4.48,50675053,"The apartment is nice, clean and in a great location. 1 star deducted from the overall score because of difficulties we had communicating with the host company to arrange check-in. They did not reply to messages on Airbnb, and after managed to get in contact with them I ended up having to speak to multiple people who were giving different instructions on check-in times. Once this was sorted though, everything went very smoothly.",0,0.8689,Positive
