69.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,13,100.0,0,3.643362040570755,4.78,4.96,4.78,4.48,1395590103101616951,The room was very moist and we couldn’t open the windows due to since people from outside could see in . The bedsheet was not very clean. The room was very warm and moist . The doesn’t even have a fan . The host however was very kind and responsive.,1,0.8164,Positive
105.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,1,2.815230046195084,4.85,4.9,4.89,4.79,425411,"Hans and Ute's apartment was spotlessly clean, comfortable and an ideal base for a short stay in Berlin, within easy walking distance of a bakery, supermarket and restaurants and close to trams/trains into the city.",1,0.9062,Positive
53.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,1,7.080626051599838,4.85,4.87,4.6,4.78,24303386,"I had a great stay, and the apartment is super nice!",1,0.902,Positive
