85.0,6,3.0,1.0,5.0,24,100.0,0,9.802619636187435,4.45,4.34,4.59,4.46,7956833,"Es wird nicht das versprochen, was auf den Bildern suggeriert wird. Die Ausstatttung war zwar gut, aber in schlechtem Zustand. Die Wohnung müsste dringend einmal gerneralgereinigt und renoviert werden.<br/>Matrztzen, Kissen, Inventar gehört zu größten Teil ausgetauscht.",0,-0.9136,Negative
75.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,24,100.0,0,4.4202884323310805,4.3,4.36,4.58,4.4,23071933,"Kurztrip nach Berlin mit einer Freundin…, gute Anbindung, direkt in der Nähe ein Cafe mit frischen Brötchen, Kuchen, Kaffee…, nette und gute Essensmöglichkeiten",1,0.0,Neutral
103.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,1,6.399061445593831,4.95,4.89,4.78,4.89,923062846482512377,"The three of us loved staying at Sophie’s for one night! Hip, modern, cool apartment and super friendly host! Easily accessible by public transport & peaceful neighbourhood. Everything matched the pictures and Sophie is quick to response. Would love to visit again :)",1,0.9792,Positive
72.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,1.4964026878485055,4.95,4.97,4.94,4.91,8805561,"Katharina's apartment is beautiful, sunny, clean and comfortable! The room is big, with a nice sofá and even a TV, lots of room for everything and a big bed and lovely windows. She had lots of small details like leaving some chocolate (Yes I ate it!). Kitchen and bathroom are also great, everything was super clean and worked. I didn't have a chance to meet Katharina in person as she had to travel, but her co-host arranged everything for me perfectly. Communication was great at all times. The neighbourhood is also nice, surrounded by restaurants and bars. Thanks for everything!",1,0.9897,Positive
100.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,3.091836209520125,4.86,4.9,4.86,4.77,869793,This is a cool apartment in an interesting area ideal for exploring Kreuzberg and easy to navigate to the city. Kirsten is a helpful and communicative host,1,0.9201,Positive
180.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,45,85.0,0,1.5095289909770313,4.75,4.84,4.9,4.6,45475252,"I arrive and the apartment hadn't been cleaned. Used towels, garbage from the previous customers...<br/>I get a downgrade room for the day at 15% discount. Next day I would be able to move to my original apartment.<br/>I get woke up at 11am from cleaners expecting my replacement room to be empty. I don't know why I need to think or adapt my schedules for the company mistake.<br/>I'm told the apartment has been cleaned and I can move there. It wasn't. Still as dirty as before. Move back to the previous room.<br/>After some time I'm told it has been cleaned. I arrive there and they are still cleaning it.<br/>Other than that it's good. Obviously the startup hasn't disrupted much, if there is any issue the processes are bad and customer service won't know what's actually happening there.<br/>15% discount for one day after they make you lose hours.. Ridiculous.",1,-0.4393,Negative
109.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,6.731875468433857,4.78,4.63,4.89,4.72,38289347,"Super logement, très agréable  pour passer un moment à Berlin, et au coeur d'un quartier sympa :)<br/>Merci beaucoup pour l'accueil",1,0.5994,Positive
