180.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,45,85.0,0,1.5095289909770313,4.75,4.84,4.9,4.6,45475252,"This has all the benefits of a classic AirBnB, but personally I view it more as a reinvention of the hotel: a clean, comfortable room with unique furnishings that give an inviting feel; zero-contact check-in and check-out; a mini-Kitchen with fridge and a few complimentary snacks/drinks, and various other minor amenities (like a very functional closet with sufficient hangers, a safe, etc.) that are attuned to modern travelers instead of businessmen in their 50's.<br/>If the price is competitive to other places you are considering, definitely go with this place.<br/>Location was also great, but that was not relevant to my stay so maybe refer to other reviews.",1,0.9858,Positive
57.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,2.6465551951544417,4.93,4.86,4.92,4.94,3308204,숙소가 굉장히 넓고 쾌적했어요! 그리고 로맨틱한 분위기가 정말 마음에 들었어요. 친절한 호스트 덕에 편하게 쉬다가요 :) 긁렇짉만 곍단읽 있읅닑깕 켉릵얽는 돍망쳙! 고마워요 sonja~,1,0.555,Positive
79.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,3.4490315071198543,4.89,4.79,4.97,4.82,971044539529937669,"Loved staying at Vincent’s place! The location of this place was close to the metro, and his place was very clean when I arrived. He was very responsive to any questions or problems I had. 10/10 accomodation :)",1,0.8828,Positive
94.0,5,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,1,2.1120432937326656,4.78,4.65,4.89,4.72,1814192,Sehr schöne gemütliche Wohnung. Optimal gelegen für Besichtigungen in Berlin.<br/>Frank hat sich umgehend nach einer Anfrage gemeldet. Sehr netter und hilsbereiter Kontakt. Diese Wohnung kann man mit ruhigem Gewissen weiterempfehlen. Es hat an nichts gefehlt. ,1,0.3612,Positive
