64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,4.433600261514431,4.61,4.25,4.85,4.51,1236282,"As a location, Neukölln was great for us, good bars, food and many vintage shops near by. Also easy access around Berlin and to airport. Even if weather was pretty terrible for couple of days, our room was warm and cozy. <br/>Apartment was clean and really quiet(!!) at night. <br/>As a host, Andres was very helpful and we felt very welcomed to his home. High recommendation! ✌️",1,0.965,Positive
106.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,0.8993171774740567,4.88,4.88,4.97,4.79,28146018,"Muy céntrico, cómodo para llegar desde el aeropuerto, al lado del barrio judío y a escasos minutos de Alexander Platz. Con un supermercado muy cerca y varios bares y restaurantes en la zona. <br/>La estancia un poco pequeña pero acorde a la descripción, con todo lo indispensable y muy ordenada. <br/>Karak muy atento, contestaba enseguida nuestras dudas. <br/>Quedamos muy satisfechas.",1,0.0,Neutral
