125.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,5,100.0,0,3.5042606825977773,4.75,4.43,4.5,4.88,4483516,"We had a really pleasant stay at Joshua's place. The appartment is very nice, clean and it is located in a quiet area in Berlin. It's just a 5 min walk to the closest u-bahn station so it was really easy to get everwhere we wanted to go. Josh was in contact with us from the beginning to make sure we had everything we needed. He was also there to greet us, he told us some tips about the city (places to visit, how to get atound, where to eat, etc.) and he even left some food and drinks that we could use. I would definitely recommend someone to stay at this appartment!",1,0.968,Positive
