64.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,88.0,0,11.614107006679774,4.76,4.44,4.63,4.66,13055986,My room was spacious with plenty of natural light and a large comfortable bed.   The home is on a large lot with trees and bushes.  My hosts were friendly and welcoming.  Nearby public transportation is frequent and efficient.  All in all I enjoyed my stay and appreciated the hospitality of the hosts.,1,0.9652,Positive
