103.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,44,100.0,1,1.656083928367451,4.81,4.88,4.61,4.76,10608680,"We were very satisfied during our stay. Alex's place has all the standard needs. For transport the U-Bahn and S-Bahn stations are very close. Lidl right next to the building. Alex himself was very helpful and provided directions for two Berlin-newbies to reach his apartment, also sorted out key pick-up for us when our bus was late and we couldn't reach the planned arrival time. :)<br/>We would recommend Alex and his place for any Berlin visitor.",1,0.8354,Positive
