44.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,1,6.435896397705523,4.9,4.93,4.87,4.86,36684410,"I had a pleasant stay at Rosario's place. The room is as described and has everything you need, including linen, towels and even city guides. The location is convenient as it's central and well connected. check-in and out was easy and communication with Rosario was smooth. Overall fair price for a simple but pleasant and convenient accomodation.",1,0.8674,Positive
99.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,1,19.17542943362573,4.97,4.93,4.97,4.86,923782569522992566,Es war einfach ein toller Aufenthalt. Uns hat es an nichts gefehlt und wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt. Vielen Dank an Marianne,1,-0.5994,Negative
229.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,61,98.0,0,16.054155175769967,4.82,4.81,4.75,4.58,14701391,We sent one of our employees to Ian’s place. She’s very picky and finding a place for her wasn’t definitely not the easiest but she loved Ian’s place. So if you expect a high standard for your apartment you can’t go wrong with Ian’s apartment.,0,0.3365,Positive
54.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,1.842782539150816,4.97,4.99,4.96,4.91,31700785,"Britta's place is incredibly nice and well located. Room is spacious, clean and bright. The neighborhood is very nice as well, with plenty of cafes and restaurants nearby and public transportation is close as well. Britta and her husband are very welcoming and warm people, I have truly enjoyed staying at their place. I recommend it very much!",1,0.9838,Positive
160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,87.0,0,3.4802565088356308,4.54,4.54,4.6,4.41,43798011,"Because of the lack of communication from the host I had to find replacement accommodations right around midnight in a new city. I arrived around 8 as I told the host I would. However, even Airbnb customer support couldn't get a hold of them to get me checked in. The company had to refund me for the stay and help me find another property at the last minute. We both tried calling and messaging them with no response.<br/> The host's rules state that you can still check in even after the reception/concierge is closed around 6 or 7, you just have to inform them about your late arrival. Well, I told them the day before but still never got a response as to how we were supposed to get into the building. We were left waiting outside the place with all our luggage with nowhere to go.. This was very frustrating. I would suggest not staying at this place or if you do, arriving during regular business hours since they don't actually accommodate late arrivals even if they say they do.",1,-0.5089,Negative
103.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,0,2.114552330707222,4.6,4.76,4.75,4.56,23677956,The studio is very cosy and clean. It's in a nice neighboorhood. Only good things to tell!,1,0.8383,Positive
