158.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,1,1.6592287277224604,4.94,4.96,4.92,4.77,39476966,"Stylish, comfortable and cosy place in a lovely neighbourhood. Highly recommend.",1,0.8718,Positive
69.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,0,4.170523487106059,4.83,4.95,4.77,4.77,1068023,"My second time in this nice place, this time not alone but with my girlfriend and was even better than the first one!!!<br/>Reinhard and Marie Ève are really nice persons and able to make you feel better. I really appreciate their hospitality: spent time talking together and eaten their delicious muffins!!!<br/>The place is very comfortable and very ""Berliner"": 2-3 times a week there is a picturesque market along the channel road nearby their bloc; you can park your car in a safe parking lot; discos, pub, restaurants and central Kreuzberg are all around! The better place to fell Berlin!!!<br/><br/>",1,0.9922,Positive
49.0,1,1.0,1.0,2.0,45,100.0,1,11.88938036942631,4.94,4.9,4.91,4.93,13215295,"Sabrina’s place was an incredible value for the price! Spacious house with access to a nice garden and a well-equipped kitchen.<br/>Sabrina herself is a very friendly and lovely host. I enjoyed how warm and welcoming her house felt and all the interactions we had.<br/>One small thing I’d improve is the initial cleaning of the room and having newer bed sheets.<br/>But overall, an unbelievable value for Berlin.",1,0.9782,Positive
158.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,1,1.6592287277224604,4.94,4.96,4.92,4.77,39476966,A great penthouse apartment close to transport. Comfortable and well appointed. <br/>Simon very responsive and generous with package treats during our stay. <br/>Would highly recommend.,1,0.9562,Positive
126.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,38,97.0,0,1.7520993087590884,4.75,4.77,4.93,4.65,18382782,"Nice location and clean apartment.   Bed was a big disappointment, low quality memory foam topper.   Even though it was cold outside and we had windows open, it was a ""sweatfest"" sleeping.  Get ready for night sweating if you stay.",1,0.3818,Positive
