243.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,8,88.0,0,3.560186030012189,4.42,4.53,4.81,4.24,854251028991888522,Excellent location. Huge apartment with lots of privacy from each other. Professionally maintained and run so not just a place with other peoples stuff. Easy walk to many sights and transit. Great restaurants downstairs.,1,0.9186,Positive
179.0,7,2.0,1.0,5.0,45,100.0,1,13.891160580271904,4.71,4.69,4.69,4.51,21431554,"Sehr freundlicher, schnell reagierender und kooperativer Gastgeber. Gerne wieder!",0,0.0,Neutral
99.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,30,100.0,0,25.88170976190907,4.69,4.67,4.83,4.61,16939260,"Mein Hund und ich haben uns bei Heiko sehr wohl gefühlt! In dem alleinstehenden und sauberen Häuschen kann man seine Ruhe ungestört genießen. Die Umgebung ist unglaublich schön - viel grün, Wasser direkt vor der Tür und die Nachbarschaft ist außerordentlich freundlich (und hundefreundlich!).<br/>Die Kommunikation mit Heiko war sehr angenehm und zuvorkommend, Check-in und Check-out gingen schnell und waren flexibel möglich. <br/>Ich kann die Unterkunft nur empfehlen!",1,-0.955,Negative
59.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,1,15.704190402628244,4.96,4.98,4.63,4.91,12337676,"Sabine and her husband were such lovely hosts! They were helpful, kind and gave us loads of good tips! Not to mention, the location was convenient and the place was clean and comfortable. We definitely enjoyed our stay and hope to return to beautiful Berlin soon! :)",1,0.9878,Positive
170.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,89.0,0,4.159105271714201,4.71,4.74,4.79,4.5,1264452626725051978,"It was great, they were flexible with the check in, they communicate very well, we had some issue with our entrance key number but they got it corrected in 5-10 minutes at most<br/>The online check in is a bit of a hassle.<br/>But it was a very comfortable stay in, worth it, I recommend it",1,0.9364,Positive
158.0,6,2.0,2.0,3.0,35,100.0,0,6.528677763046801,4.67,4.66,4.84,4.65,40414534,"It was all great. We couldnt figure out from the pictures that this place had 2 bedrooms plus the luft. Everything was smooth and nice. There's just a few things which as for the first, there is a weird noice coming from the pipes once in every 5-10 minutes. It takes a while to get used to it and be able to sleep. Beds were comfy. Everything was as clean as they could be. We enjoyed the little time we spent together with friends 🧡 Thanks Andre!",0,0.9551,Positive
193.0,6,2.0,1.0,5.0,42,100.0,1,0.601371120108,4.76,4.63,4.94,4.73,4335533,"Rainer was a very sympathic host, and helpful.<br/>The flat was very clean, very calm, and very well placed.<br/>Perfect place for few days or more.",0,0.8043,Positive
64.0,7,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,0,3.232192682932016,4.56,4.3,4.77,4.67,24094560,Propietario atento y amable. Habitación espaciosa y limpia. Ubicación buena. Cerca de una estación.,1,0.0,Neutral
86.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,47,100.0,0,4.266463726905534,4.92,4.77,4.81,4.65,16841623,"Clean, very comfortable.  You share the apartment with Lars and he makes you feel quite at home.   Ideal location for easy access to trams, subway and trains.  Stores, eateries, entertainment all nearby. Well worth the stay.",1,0.9644,Positive
297.0,4,2.0,2.0,3.0,52,100.0,0,2.0001583027406,4.94,4.94,5.0,4.81,875898662074823362,"We stayed two weeks at Janina’s home and had a fantastic experience.   Everything you see in  the listing is accurate and real.  The apartment actually seemed much larger and roomier than in the pictures.  Great amenities - everything you could possibly need for your stay.   The highlight is definitely the two great outdoor spaces - the terrace off the kitchen and the roof top deck with incredible views of the Berlin skyline.   Walkable to U- and S- Bahn and tram,  so easy to get anywhere in the city. We  would highly recommend the place with high praise.  <br/>Janina was a 5-star host!  Responsive, helpful and always there when anything came up.  The only negative from our visit was that the elevator was not working - and the unit is on the 5th floor.  Janina was fully responsive to try to get resolved, but the repair company was unavailable due to vacation.  We definitely got our steps in!",0,0.9666,Positive
52.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,10.552267411509238,4.88,4.85,4.77,4.85,15652886,"The place is very clean,quiet and relaxing.<br/>The 5€ breakfast is a must.😉😉😉.<br/>Hardi is a superhost.Everything about being a good host,he can make it superb.I hope every host should be like him.",1,0.8074,Positive
50.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,46,100.0,1,14.174901988437009,4.94,4.85,4.86,4.92,770805100173574917,Excelente anfitriona y hermosa casa. Se sintió como estar en el hogar. Muy lo<br/>Pio y de fácil acceso al metro de Berlín.<br/>Muchas gracias por la excelente experiencia!,1,0.0,Neutral
171.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,3.298740908664913,4.97,4.88,4.98,4.86,49413860,"We very much enjoyed staying at Caroline’s apartment. It is as described on the website but offers even a larger space then we expected. We loved the high ceilings in the apt. and  especially enjoyed sitting out on the balcony with drinks or meals as it faces a lovely courtyard. Transit was easily accessible, the area is filled with shops and restaurants and is close to the canal making it very easy to access the beautiful canal tours.  We walked to most sites and Caroline was helpful in offering transit info when needed.",1,0.9892,Positive
152.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,36,100.0,1,4.067121946499752,4.94,4.96,4.92,4.88,53089482,"We really enjoyed our stay in Berlin, Uta was a fantastic host. Our flights were delayed, but she waited to greet us at the flat. On the day of leaving, she advised us on where we could store our luggage. The flat is lovely,  well equipped, clean, and in a great location. Would absolutely recommend it.",0,0.9815,Positive
127.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,60,100.0,0,5.41749734445679,4.57,4.42,4.37,4.48,53491060,"Die Wohnung von Alex war super eingerichtet,  Sauber und ausreichend.  Kann man nur weiterempfehlen",1,-0.5994,Negative
84.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,18,88.0,1,3.2402791774170403,4.77,4.89,4.92,4.69,16183018,"Очень уютная квартира. Всё соответствует описанию. Хозяин отзывчивый, всегда был на связи.  Рекомендую данное место ☺️🌺",1,0.0,Neutral
161.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,44,100.0,1,3.550833267755717,4.84,4.83,4.66,4.49,33803119,"This was our second time staying at Ludger’s place, having stayed there back in March. As per last time, our experience was great, and the hosts were super accommodating - arranging for a baby bed, high chair and bath to already be in the apartment upon arrival. One of our guests also left behind a pair of headphones, and they were great at finding it and getting it back to us quickly. A great stay, and we would be more than happy to stay again.",0,0.969,Positive
50.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,0,22.897577444076315,4.75,4.79,4.86,4.79,1150578770334570272,"This a nice, clean and spacious room in a big and beautiful house situated in a quiet, nature-rich area of Berlin. It is not in the heart of Berlin and kind of away from all its famous spots, but it is well-connected by the metro. The area has a big lake and is ideal for long walks in the cold, grey autumn days. Anna was a great host!",1,0.952,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,0,2.844436022271926,4.67,4.67,4.76,4.57,8247088,"Anna is absolutely wonderful and her place is every travelers dream. It has everything you need to feel like you are right at home, if home is a modern, chic apartment close to restaurants, shopping and the overall vibe of Berlin. Highly recommended staying here and would stay again in a heartbeat only longer! Thank you, Anna.",1,0.9257,Positive
65.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,47,100.0,1,8.21663072872333,4.91,4.85,4.95,4.77,1084183,"Ceasar speaks German and English.<br/>Nice flat, everything was fine.<br/>Ceasar was very kind and took care.<br/>",1,0.8268,Positive
137.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,1.189406824976013,4.86,4.84,4.93,4.79,264459,"The flat was perfect for our short break: in a very peaceful area (when we first arrived we managed to sleep for almost 12 hours), but also within a few minutes of a supermarket and the U2 underground line. We cooked breakfasts and dinners ourselves, prepared sandwiches for the day and could then get to the main points of interest in Berlin very easily, saving a lot of money that would usually have been spent eating out. Much better than a standard hotel room!<br/>",1,0.956,Positive
214.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,1,5.709707531854269,4.89,4.96,4.74,4.81,828092897899521161,"Olaf’s apartment was spacious and luxurious, and the private balcony was an extra bonus. The modern conveniences - especially the washer - were much appreciated. <br/>The neighborhood was lively and diverse with great options for breakfast,  lunch & dinner. <br/>We would definitely stay in this wonderful apartment again.",1,0.9677,Positive
