99.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,0,5.128767153545841,4.86,4.86,4.79,4.64,1288230250905377678,"Petit appartement conforme à la description dans quartier calme avec magasin bio à 2 pas pour un petit dej tout frais, tram idem .Équipement parfait avec condiments, Sucre, bières au frigo pour être tout de suite installés, plantes vertes ( pas de grille pain si on veut ajouter un bémol)... bref super séjour,  allez y sans hésiter!",1,-0.1759,Negative
75.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,0,9.261861550789751,4.84,4.99,4.55,4.8,17968986,"Lovely accommodation,  1 minute away from public transport, clean, quiet and there is on street parking. Anita was always very responsive, helpful, flexible, and she even went out her way to receive a parcel on my behalf. I reccommend her accommodation, and I would book again in the future. <br/>The only thing that I missed was a washing machine, but the lack of it is clearly stated in the list of amenities.",1,0.7762,Positive
