49.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,7.164956109377153,4.84,4.72,4.86,4.77,2154488,"We had an amazing time with Oliver. The house was clean, the bed was great and we had all the facilities we needed. Oliver was really friendly and always there to help us! He made us feel at home and communicated with us whenever needed. <br/>The location is amazing, you can take the S-Bahn with a 5 minute walk and within 10 minutes you're in the middle of the city.<br/>Bonus points for the cutest dog we've ever met!",1,0.9776,Positive
