76.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,1,5.339352686328167,4.8,4.87,4.74,4.63,2098124,"Wow, this place was fantastic! The apartment itself is immaculately clean and really nicely designed. It's not huge but the minimalist aesthetic made it feel quite roomy for my family of 4. One of the best bonuses for us was the roll-down shutters that blacked out all light – perfect for international travelers who need to adjust to the new time!<br/><br/>The neighborhood was great. At first it seemed a little remote but we quickly found the cafes and shops to the East and the fantastic Gleisdreieck park to the West. The nearby U and S Bahn stations made getting around the city a breeze!",1,0.9894,Positive
