85.0,6,2.0,1.0,5.0,23,100.0,0,9.797881642408234,4.61,4.56,4.65,4.52,7963887,"The flat is situated in a good communication area, with plenty of travel possibilities. There is a U stop directly in front of the flat. The noise isolation was not the best according to me, as traffic could be heard during the night through closed windows. The insulation (warmth) is very good. We had 35 degrees outside and in the flat it was still cool enough.<br/>The communication with Jörn and his friend was very friendly and they provided all the necessary information for our arrival.<br/><br/>The flat offers some space, however for three people, who need separate rooms is a little bit too small. The kitchen was well equipped. <br/>Good price for the value.<br/>Would come back.",1,0.8757,Positive
43.0,1,1.0,1.0,0.0,12,98.0,0,2.483452884679037,4.75,4.75,4.75,5.0,1128117863044594886,"Great staff, clean rooms. Can’t complain.",1,0.6486,Positive
53.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,11,94.0,1,2.5102467780678728,4.9,4.9,4.93,4.8,604102943795715994,"I Couldn’t have been more lucky with my host here in Berlin. It was really a pleasure meeting Schami. She was very flexible with my very late check-in and made me feel at home in every moment I spent inside her apartment. <br/>I’m happy I had the chance to meet her because she is a very kind and gentle person and left me with a great and positive energy ❤️<br/>The room is much more bigger than it looks on the pictures, very silent and above all the bed is very comfortable and I had very good sleep.",1,0.9894,Positive
