162.0,6,3.0,2.0,5.0,62,100.0,1,2.067988388869796,4.98,4.95,4.92,4.86,38504089,"We knew this will be a good place for the 5 of us, but when we opened the door to Lexi's home we realized it was so much more than we expected. The place is beautifully remodeled, it created a home for us while being tourists in Berlin.<br/>The apartment is warm and cozy, perfect amount of room for 5 people.<br/>We were surrounded by grocery stores, bakeries, bike stores and anything else we needed. (including a covid testing station a few buildings down the street)<br/>We loved it and highly recommend this apartment !<br/>Thank you",0,0.9803,Positive
