157.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,45,100.0,0,5.245003120876255,4.77,4.72,4.68,4.61,11914556,"Dan was a polite and professional host who communicated efficiently, helpfully and kindly. He was a pleasure to deal with and I'm more than happy we chose to stay in his apartment. <br/>The apartment itself was sparkling clean, tastefully decorated in a Scandinavian style with the unique Berliner flare. Everything you could think of was supplied down to the most minute details. <br/>The area, despite being traditionally a working class neighbourhood was a relaxed yet pleasant area with amazing food and drink options! <br/>If you're thinking of staying here, pull the trigger. You won't regret it! ✌🏻️",0,0.9872,Positive
