59.0,6,2.0,1.0,6.0,21,100.0,1,7.196537570595604,4.45,4.57,4.06,4.49,355494,The place was good. It was clean and warm. After a long cold day we used the kitchen and enjoy a good dinner. It is a long way from downtown but the last bus (after 2 transfers) left us like 2 min walking from her place. The host was clear about check in time and check out time which was early from out point of view (10am),0,0.9178,Positive
316.0,8,3.0,2.0,4.0,45,100.0,1,1.2937250483136316,4.73,4.76,4.9,4.61,12048269,We loved the apartment - the open and airy kitchen / dining / living area was ideal. Facilities were excellent and had everything we needed. We enjoyed the  balcony over the courtyard. Maybe the bedrooms were on the smaller side but nevertheless comfortable. Ideal  central location with easy access to transportation.,0,0.9684,Positive
