125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,1,5.357912050650103,4.94,4.95,4.81,4.71,20399282,"If you are traveling to Berlin and need a nice private place that won’t brake the bank this is it!! Located on the outskirts of the tourist locations so we did end up paying more in Taxis, Ubers, and scooters than expected. But check in was nice and easy, place is very well maintained. You have everything you need for your stay. Lionel was very nice, always available and a fast responder. WiFi was available. Definitely recommend!! ⭐️",1,0.9756,Positive
204.0,4,3.0,2.0,4.0,32,100.0,0,5.2351728208725135,5.0,5.0,4.9,5.0,9094717,"We had a fabulous stay at Dani and Florian's place! A stylish, clean, practical apartment - with toys for our 3 kids and a very good vibe in the house.  We were welcomed with small suprises for the kids and clear instructions on how to use the house. <br/><br/>On the other side of the street there's a fantastic park - with lots of play areas for the kids. The U Bahn is a 5 minute walk through the park and shopping is just around the corner as well. <br/><br/>The apartment is located very central and all area's are easily reachable. <br/><br/>In short: we had a great stay, easy communications and would love to be back one day. Highly recommended! ",0,0.9888,Positive
105.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,44,100.0,1,19.08203722075192,4.82,4.85,4.72,4.71,1107068843238730146,"La ubicación fue mejor de lo que esperaba, Arwin estuvo siempre al pendiente de mi y el hecho de que haya un REWE junto debajo ayuda muchísimo. El espacio tenía todo lo necesario y el hecho de estar en un noveno piso le da una vista hermosa.",1,0.0,Neutral
80.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,90.0,0,1.4716913138627066,4.89,4.88,4.96,4.83,13593823,"The apartment is very cool, exactly as you see in the photos. The room is large, bright and airy, and the bed is comfortable. It's tucked away off the main hallway so it feels more of a private space than you might expect. Susan is also cool -  interesting to talk to, welcoming, accommodating. The perfect host! The neighbourhood is great, too, lots of good places in the adjacent streets to eat and drink.",1,0.9798,Positive
