125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,0,6.614182922055099,4.9,4.77,4.65,4.61,53620992,"Edouard's appartment was really beautiful and spacious. It is a perfect place to stay with some friends and have a nice dinner, but also explore the city from there. It is located in a really nice neighbourhood, with bars and nice restaurants at walking distance. Thanks Edouard!",1,0.9609,Positive
