164.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,98.0,0,0.9333653060276148,4.31,4.31,4.81,4.27,693929358810156249,"very nice cosy stay with good interior, very spacious. <br/>the location was great and very easy checkin too<br/>something that can be better is just having a few more things in the kitchen such as vinegar, tea or some other bits guests leave behind (long lasting foods of course)<br/>only problem we had was how noisy the people upstairs were because they had young kids but that’s not really something that can be controlled, some earplugs would be advisable haha<br/>overall very nice stay",1,0.8868,Positive
