64.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,0,12.1545859613401,4.89,4.84,4.77,4.7,561487373528647719,"A perfect stay! Ana Teresa is so helpful and friendly. Even though we just missed her since she was gone for the weekend, she made sure to message us back right away every time we had a question.  We loved the clean, spacious, light room. The twin bed is comfortable, the kitchen well-equipped, and the bathroom (with a bath) is nice as well. The location is quite good too, since the street is not too busy at night, but you can take the underground, which is just minutes away. Do yourself a favor and stay here for a couple of nights!",1,0.9588,Positive
119.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,51,100.0,1,3.2984353664881243,4.88,4.85,4.89,4.74,31480066,"Wonderful flat, comfortable beds, amazing shower and the location is PERFECT.  The communication with Annette was super also.  Highly recommend it.",0,0.9717,Positive
111.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,3.478761427822,4.88,4.94,4.88,4.75,24836860,"We had a great time staying in the apartment and Andreas’ recommendations on things to do and nearby bars and delicious restaurants was very helpful. The location was also ideal with the U-Bahn being within walking distance and 30mins travel time to the centre of Berlin. The interior is very cool, clean and well thought out and includes insightful information on Berlins past and present. Highly recommend staying here and would happily stay again.",1,0.9806,Positive
110.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,1,5.643910676118197,4.69,4.7,4.72,4.4,31047671,Ena’s place is very quaint and beautiful- a perfect retreat from the city.  The cafe below is also very lovely and a great place to relax and have kaffee und kuchen.  Ena was very responsive and helpful with check-in and all my further needs.  Would definitely recommend!,1,0.9853,Positive
147.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,0,1.7248289249949966,4.66,4.54,4.86,4.54,22684601,"Carlos was communicative when one of our party was unwell. Very helpful. Thank you, a lovely place to stay.",1,0.9076,Positive
144.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,49,90.0,1,1.9327347284611704,4.95,4.81,4.98,4.74,8857403,"Kasia è stata fin da subito molto disponibile. Comunicazione semplice ed efficace. La casa è provvista di tutto ed è come nelle foto. Posizione dell'appartamento ottima per visitare Berlino: la casa è vicina al centro e ad una fermata metro ed è situata in una zona provvista di bar, ristorantini e tutti i servizi necessari. Kasia ci ha permesso di lasciare i bagagli nell'appartamento la mattina presto per poter iniziare a visitare la città senza il peso dello zaino nonostante il check-in fosse alle ore 15. Flessibilità anche sull'orario di check-out. Consigliato!",1,0.4003,Positive
260.0,8,4.0,2.0,7.0,50,100.0,1,2.6302702497082326,4.88,4.92,4.85,4.71,1488624,"had a great stay at alex’s place - it was clean, spacious, and the location was fantastic. alex was a thoughtful and communicative host - i highly recommend at stay at her apartment!",0,0.944,Positive
40.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,11,98.0,0,2.4809600042725424,4.56,4.5,4.85,4.64,35816059,Ein Obdachloser war in meinem Zimmer. Der Gestank einfach eine Zumutung.,1,-0.5994,Negative
96.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,2.6441579309110788,4.94,4.95,4.85,4.88,8462220,We had a fantastic stay in Junhee's apartment. It had everything we needed and more for our short stay in Berlin. The apartment is in a lovely area and the transport links are excellent. We would definitely stay again. ,1,0.93,Positive
261.0,8,3.0,1.0,5.0,42,100.0,0,3.206802294887829,4.74,4.81,4.8,4.57,11746050,"We had the best 3 days in Berlin. Where Leo’s appartment made our stay extremely convenient. Nice big rooms, perfectly located and easy correspondence. We had problems with the Wi-Fi, and it’s was fixed immediately.<br/>A little improvement could be a smart tv.<br/>Would definitely return",0,0.9627,Positive
422.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,0,4.651868999174018,5.0,5.0,4.67,4.56,693243551914511784,"Hartwig’s place was great and as advertised! Hartwig is very friendly and responsive — I had a great time in Berlin. Thanks, Hartwig!",1,0.958,Positive
187.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,33,87.0,0,3.470214040335909,4.58,4.55,4.58,4.49,49509138,"Good vibes, great staff, and cozy place. Would stay again. Everything works!",1,0.807,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,4.795405551149841,4.95,4.92,4.81,4.89,13243503,"Had a super relaxing and easy going stay with Alex and his family. Lovely large bright room with lots of room to store clothes, a good workspace and comfy bed. Would highly recommend staying here and will try to stay again in the future.<br/>Many thanks",1,0.9758,Positive
35.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,59,100.0,0,0.7009515972590313,4.75,4.8,4.95,4.74,2543760,"Elegí este apartamento, entre otras razones, porque la anfitriona decía hablar en castellano. Sin embargo, no lo hacía, y eso dificultó la comunicación (nosotros hablamos algo de inglés y nada de alemán). En cuanto al apartamento, muy lindo y bien ubicado, nuestra habitación era un poco más chica de lo que pensábamos, pero de todos modos estaba bien. Teníamos baño privado y entrada independiente.",1,-0.7003,Negative
113.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,98.0,1,1.0001956178666358,4.83,4.91,4.96,4.78,127708,"Stephanie was a wonderful host and was very responsive throughout our short trip. The apartment was exactly as described and had everything we needed (comfortable bed, nice bathroom, full kitchen). We were a little concerned that the unit was shared with the host when stephanie said she would greet us at the door when we arrived, but it is indeed a private standalone apartment next to her home. Overall, I would definitely recommend this stay if it’s within your budget!",1,0.9272,Positive
130.0,4,0.0,1.5,4.0,20,93.0,0,2.3258672060118277,4.75,4.59,4.79,4.66,16730380,Super Lage!  Nette Übergabe!  Coole Wohnung.  Eigentlich alles Ok aber es riecht leider muffig.,1,0.7707,Positive
82.0,5,1.0,1.0,4.0,64,100.0,1,21.46363443840601,4.92,4.89,4.92,4.76,1172942769652607438,"Alle, die eine kleine Auszeit vom Alltag  brauchen, um Kraft zu tanken - oder einfach nur eine schöne Ferienunterkunft suchen, werden hier belohnt!<br/>Ich habe mich in der Unterkunft von Rafael sehr wohl gefühlt. Ich persönlich habe es für eine Auszeit allein genutzt. Die Lage ist ist sehr schön, im Grünen gelegen und die Öffis sind nicht weit weg. Ich fand den netten Empfang super mit den kleinen Details hier und da, das alles schön beleuchtet war und dass es scharfe Schneidemesser gab. Klasse Betten mit vielen Kissenvarianten. Herrlicher Garten.<br/>Und für Familen mit Kindern ist auch genug Platz, die alle in einem Wohnschlafbereich schlafen können. Auch  meine Familie fand es schön, als sie mich für 1 Nacht besuchen kam.<br/>Und das beste natürlich die Wanne zum entspannen. Mir fällt eigentlich nichts ein, was mir gefehlt hätte. Und wenn, stehen die Gastgeber unkompliziert zur Verfügung,  sollte was sein. Vielen Dank!🙋🏼‍♀️<br/>Ich kann die Unterkunft weiterempfehlen!",1,-0.9837,Negative
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,19,100.0,0,4.748136939358367,4.83,4.9,4.69,4.86,13365300,"Anna was great! She was hospitable and kind. The space was great, too. I would definitely stay with her again.",1,0.9392,Positive
130.0,5,0.0,1.0,5.0,18,93.0,0,2.347776216465179,4.74,4.63,4.73,4.62,17413995,"Great alpartment, close to a lot of restaurants, pubs and even clubs near by. Clean and orginaized place, lovley hosts that did thier best to let us feel comfortable and helped us with everything we needed. Mostly recommend 4 everyone!",1,0.9523,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,4.795405551149841,4.95,4.92,4.81,4.89,13243503,Alex's place is SO close to public transportation. We visited most major attractions and figured out the city transit fairly easily. Alex's house is very cleanly and is a welcome respite from the city below. His particular location in Pankow is very quiet and there are many families taking children to school throughout the day; the neighborhood is safe. Don't be put off by Grafitti; Berlin is full of it. Some walls in town can even be bought strictly to paint on. It's very different from the US and we'll miss Alex's home very much.,1,0.8683,Positive
131.0,2,1.0,1.0,0.0,24,100.0,1,8.152930353958586,4.87,4.88,4.86,4.78,2566846,Ein kleines bisschen zu teuer für das was es ist. Die Lage sehr gut und die Kommunikation mit Roi auch sehr gut. <br/>Wir haben uns wohlgefühlt aber die Wohnung wirkt auf den Fotos viel großer. Sie ist aber tatsächlich sehr klein. Dennoch für 1-3 Tage Berlin in einem Ruhigen Viertel super!,1,-0.8439,Negative
37.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,7.258519499353832,4.89,4.92,4.8,4.89,2591901,"Klaus is a great host! House is clean, comfortable, everything needed is provided. Quite area, easy to commute. Highly, highly recommended to any travellers to Berlin!",1,0.9454,Positive
68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,0,4.2542342563146125,4.76,4.79,4.54,4.71,35422386,Das Zimmer war supersauber und wirklich sehr schön eingerichtet. So wie die ganze Unterkunft an sich. Wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt und würden immer wieder gerne her kommen. :),1,-0.7251,Negative
