106.0,7,2.0,1.0,9.0,51,100.0,1,13.279406216070171,4.81,4.53,4.9,4.78,12398605,"Excelent appartment, all very clean and full of all the things that you could need. Frank is a very nice person and always available for anything. 100% recommendable! Would love to stay there again.",0,0.8904,Positive
216.0,2,1.0,1.5,2.0,61,100.0,1,8.126007363576498,4.92,4.76,4.95,4.84,14368620,"베를린의 어떤 곳보다 좋은 뷰를 자랑하는 곳이에요. 동네도 코지하고 좋아, 편안한 시간 보냈습니다.<br/>파노라마로 베를린을 만끽할 수 있었어요.<br/>난방 시스템, 전자레인지, 오븐 등이 잘 구비되어 있어서 편리하게 사용하였습니다.<br/>엘리베이터도 있어서 편리하게 이용했어요.<br/>동네가 한적한 주거지역이라 밤엔 불이 모두 꺼져 별들도 볼 수 있어요. 정말 특별한 경험이었습니다.<br/>집은 정말 잘 관리되어 있었어요. 하쥐만 청껼에 믾갊하신 분들은 조금 붏펺함을 느끼실 수도 있을 거 같아요. 커툴러뤼나 싟자재 등이 아주 많이 오뤠되었슺니다.",1,0.0,Neutral
422.0,6,3.0,2.0,4.0,60,100.0,1,3.559770173058828,4.94,4.96,4.93,4.77,11483775,"Marcus and the apartment were both great.  The flat was clean and spacious with a huge rooftop patio.  Public transportation was right out in front, and the €9 three day pass made it easy and cheap to get everywhere we wanted to go.  We would definitely stay a there again.",0,0.9287,Positive
149.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,57,100.0,1,6.127401826066119,4.98,4.98,5.0,4.86,643443371140828330,"Such a wonderful stay at David’s apartment. A beautiful place that was super central with amazing restaurants on the doorstep.<br/>David’s communication was fabulous, and I ask so many questions! Very welcome and I would love to stay again next time I’m in Berlin.",1,0.9808,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,0,6.16237661417251,4.69,4.83,4.7,4.72,1192961,"Amazing place, amazing location, amazing stay! Would recommend to everyone!",1,0.938,Positive
102.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,1,19.581869153216655,4.94,5.0,4.63,4.44,822290631703576691,"the house is not rented as a separate apartment, but as a room on the top floor.  the owner is very friendly and good with children.  on the last day of our stay, our child fell ill and I apologize for the pollution left behind.",1,0.8436,Positive
77.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,38,100.0,0,3.130777776464285,4.61,4.62,4.75,4.53,572161925621135232,"My boyfriend and I spent 5 nights in Lauras apartment and had a great time there! The apartment is located in the heart of Kreuzberg, yet it’s quite at night, which was great! Check in and Check out and also the communication with Laura was easy. All the rooms looked like on the pictures. Sharing the kitchen and bathrooms was no problem at all - it was nice hearing from other people what they are up to in berlin. Besides some small talk, we mostly forgot other people are in the apartment as well, because everyone is out in the city for most of the day anyways. Thanks Laura for the nice stay in Berlin!",1,0.9718,Positive
101.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,47,100.0,1,2.4379931445759557,4.93,4.93,4.97,4.83,1350792206249789489,"Really great place to stay in berlin, lovely neighbourhood. Ana was very accommodating for an early check in which was very kind. Lovely apartment , recommended .",1,0.9569,Positive
85.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,0,6.932803465474853,4.72,4.68,4.84,4.58,26383628,"Min's apartment is really well located in a cute neighborhood in Berlin with easy access to transit options. Min and her partner were very welcoming and even organized a guide for us prior to our arrival. They also checked in throughout our stay to make sure everything was going well.  There are lots of restaurants in the neighborhood but not many options for groceries nearby. The apartment itself is a cute student apartment with all the basics you will need. It was very clean when we arrived and the key transfer process went smoothly. For people who are sensitive to smoke, there is a strong smell in the apartment from a neighbor in the building who smokes.",1,0.9663,Positive
