88.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,56,100.0,1,9.466397734092387,4.83,4.78,4.61,4.67,973818673770700573,"Well, we stayed 2 nights and the apartment was very clean. The day when we arrived in Berlin, the weather was getting worse. And I asked Mrs. Ulla if i can come earlier. She is very nice and very kind. Nevertheless, in the apartment we were welcomed by Mr. Dirk and he is also a very kind person and instructed everything with a friendly manner. <br/>I have a 2 years old son with us and he felt like home. Thank you so much for the hospitality.<br/>I recommend this place to stay because at night you might see a great view from the top floor.",1,0.9826,Positive
362.0,14,4.0,2.0,6.0,50,100.0,1,5.961083106152229,4.96,4.96,4.61,4.85,44472065,"Me and my friends enjoyed our stay. The apartment was super clean, on a good location ( it is well connected with public transportation), everything matches the description. And hosts are super friendly, and a message away, for anything you might need.",0,0.9753,Positive
74.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,15,100.0,1,13.59903184963209,4.85,4.88,4.59,4.73,52052417,"Very Big apartment, clean, friendly, we had everything we needed",1,0.7322,Positive
81.0,2,1.0,1.0,3.0,34,90.0,1,8.758840073119789,4.73,4.93,4.57,4.8,36612997,"Wir waren begeistert. Bärbel und ihr Mann haben uns sehr nett empfangen. Die Wohnung liegt sehr ruhig, ist blitzsauber und hat einen hübschen Balkon mit Blick in den schönen Garten. Es ist alles da, was man braucht. Wir kommen gern wieder.",1,-0.5994,Negative
