95.0,4,1.0,1.5,3.0,27,100.0,1,4.764454384817103,4.59,4.62,4.86,4.58,11414934,"Ottima posizione, ottime indicazioni dei dintorni.<br/>Check in facile e comodo. Cucina ben attrezzata. Ci sismo sentiti a casa.",1,0.0,Neutral
95.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,3.769411114551402,4.65,4.73,4.79,4.5,4869716,We really enjoyed our time in Berlin and staying at this property. Nice neighbourhood and we enjoyed the cultural experience of living with the locals and experiencing true Berlin.,1,0.915,Positive
229.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,55,100.0,1,3.139834301169665,4.87,4.83,4.96,4.66,17317782,"Esther et son fils nous ont très bien reçu.<br/>Logement très bien placé, dans un quartier calme et typique.<br/>Petit bémol, pour les lits, le lit mezzanine très confortable au niveau literie, mais très difficile d.acces voir dangereux,",0,0.0,Neutral
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,2.142649937740168,4.91,4.94,4.96,4.89,446975,"“The Coach House” is a lovely place to stay, attractively decorated, in excellent condition and very well equipped - even the bedside reading lights were very good, in so many places they are not. <br/>The little garden in the quiet courtyard which it opens onto is a delight. Sitting there you are unaware that on the road outside there is an excellent transport hub and streets of good restaurants with a lively young population. <br/>Kerstin was very helpful in setting up the booking and giving clear directions. We were sorry not to meet since she was away on business but her friend Andrea was there to meet us even though our train was late in arriving and she kindly took us to a late-night supermarket so that we could buy our supplies. <br/>We had an excellent visit to Berlin, a wonderful city, and the pleasure of staying at the Coach House greatly contributed to the experience. We will be recommending it to friends without hesitation.",1,0.9941,Positive
195.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,23,100.0,1,2.8219601407887955,4.85,4.97,4.97,4.75,16920274,"This apartment is very conveniently situated - you can either walk or ride to almost anything interesting easily. Also, it's cosy, warm, has everything you need, incliding a private entrance - so you feel at home, not at a hotel. And big thanks to Axel for meeting us at a late hour (we had our flight postponed) with a smile and advice.",0,0.8707,Positive
103.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,51,100.0,1,1.8422422243016237,4.91,4.86,4.81,4.83,3974716,"Wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt in dem Appartement, es entspricht genau der Beschreibung, es ist schön, hochwertig und sehr durchdacht eingerichtet und es ist wirklich alles da, was man braucht. Besonders schön ist es, auf dem kleinen Balkon zu sitzen und auf die Spree und den gegenüberliegenden Holzmarkt zu blicken. Die Großstadtgeräusche werden bei geschlossener Balkontür komplett ausgeblendet. Die Kommunikation mit Hans Jörg verlief super, sehr unkompliziert. Also: sehr empfehlenswert!",1,-0.8439,Negative
110.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,50,100.0,1,2.7610678260408177,4.84,4.67,4.93,4.69,2610528,"we spent Sylvester at Gabriels appartment and stayed for 6 nights. the appartement was perfect for two adults and two children (sleeping on the couch). the appartement is large, has a nice kitchen with everything you need to prepare breakfast, lunch an dinner. the appartement is situated in a lively neighbourhood, but tucked away in a quiet hinterhofe. loved our stay, will come again.",1,0.8898,Positive
21.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,100.0,0,5.302340339632723,4.0,3.8,4.2,3.8,33549040,-tolle Lage<br/>-tolle Mitbewohnerin<br/>-bequemes Bett,1,0.0,Neutral
120.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,38,100.0,0,9.7340143135363,4.74,4.75,4.6,4.66,19076725,Appartement agreable dans le centre de berlin.<br/>Je recommande Richard,1,0.0,Neutral
179.0,5,1.0,1.0,2.0,63,100.0,0,8.789833766943357,4.78,4.9,4.66,4.52,243057,"Beautiful, sunny flat in Berlin. Plenty of space and very easy to get around to the main streets of Moabit and to hop onto buses, U-Bahn and S-Bahn.  <br/>We truly were at home in our home-away-from home and very much appreciate Arne and Ute, their hospitality and all they did to help us feel very welcome!  The apartment has all you need to live comfortably, good space and everything you need to cook (if you chose to).<br/>The flat is truly beautiful, sunshine makes it sparkle and we were grateful for the stairs as we felt it allowed us just a few extra bites of cake!<br/>Super clean and well represented by the photos!",1,0.9932,Positive
69.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,20,93.0,0,4.065511825937199,4.57,4.47,4.44,4.48,41423018,Very helpful staff!,1,0.5244,Positive
48.0,2,1.0,2.0,2.0,29,100.0,0,13.916102626188213,4.63,4.61,4.66,4.59,7824562,My boyfriend and I stayed at Parwanas place in room 1 over the weekend. Her place is very clean and comfortable. The check in is also very easy as she explained it in detail. Whenever we had a question we got an answer promptly. The metro and bus number 109 (takes you to the airport directly) are very close and lot of shops and store close by. I would definitely recommend her place and stay there again anytime.<br/>Mein Freund und ich waren über das Wochende hier im Zimmer Nr 1 und es war alles sehr sauber und gemütlich. Das Einchecken war sehr einfach durch Parwana's detaillierte Beschreibung. Parwana antwortet sofort was ich auch sehr toll fand. Die Gegend ist super sicher und es gibt viele Läden in der Nähe. Verkehrsanbindungen sind auch binnen weniger Minuten zu erreichen (z.B. Bus 109 Richting Tegel). Ich kann Parwanas Wohnung sehr zu Herzen legen und würde beim nächsten Mal in Berlin auch wieder zu ihr.,1,0.7543,Positive
54.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,52,100.0,1,8.636066373527585,4.98,4.96,4.8,4.91,792795513324956525,"Ich war für 3 Übernachtungen bei Rebecca in Moabit und habe mich sehr wohlgefühlt. <br/>Die Wohnung war sehr sauber, gut ausgestattet und optimal gelegen mit der U-Bahn, Tram und Bussen in Laufnähe, dabei aber trotzdem in einer ruhigeren Wohngegend.  <br/>Die Kommunikation mit Rebecca lief durchgehend problemlos ab. Sie war eine sehr freundliche und aufmerksame Gastgeberin. <br/>Ich kann die Unterkunft auf jeden Fall weiterempfehlen und komme gerne wieder. :)",1,-0.9022,Negative
137.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,1.189406824976013,4.86,4.84,4.93,4.79,264459,Hernik's place is great.<br/>No problems during arrival or stay. The flat is in a peaceful location and great starting spot for exploring the northern part of Berlin on foot.<br/>Henrik himself provided detailed info and was very responsive. I definitely recommend to stay at his apartment.,1,0.9207,Positive
203.0,6,3.0,1.0,3.0,43,100.0,1,4.140963863667464,4.89,4.92,4.89,4.78,4182815,"Logement parfait. Il est très bien situé, proche de 2 lignes de métro. Il y a beaucoup de restaurants très bien notés aux alentours. Le quartier est agréable et calme.<br/>L'appartement est très confortable et très bien équipé. Nous étions 5 et c'était très spacieux, chacun avait son coin et on ne se marchait pas dessus.<br/>C'était très appréciable.<br/>Rien à redire je recommande à 100%!",0,0.0,Neutral
54.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,11,100.0,1,5.259652982108338,4.82,4.9,4.9,4.81,2657671,"I stayed with my daughter (18) at Ivo’s place for 3nights. We loved the neighborhood with all its bars, restaurants and breakfast places. For us foodies it was super. <br/>The room is super spacious and the walk-up is fine. Big bonus is the private entry to your room so u don’t need to bother Ivo and his family. Bathroom is light and spacious and only once my daughter had to wait few minutes to use it. All very clean. <br/>Can definitely recommend the place. Good for young couples/friends to explore Berlin from here.",1,0.9775,Positive
422.0,6,3.0,2.0,4.0,40,100.0,1,4.235442637482252,4.93,4.97,4.57,4.69,22077707,Très bel appartement bien équipé et bien situé à proximité d’HermannPlatz.<br/>Je recommande,0,0.0,Neutral
271.0,10,3.0,1.5,5.0,56,100.0,1,5.229990782295846,4.95,4.89,4.8,4.88,17223235,"Nous avons trouvé l'appartement de Werner (Schillerpromenade) parfait pour un séjour de groupe : nous étions 8 adultes et un bébé, Werner a fourni un lit pour bébé et nous avons trouvé tout ce qui était utile pour faciliter notre séjour sur place (linge, serviettes, cuisine bien équipée ...). <br/>L'appartement était propre, nous avons reçu de bons conseils à l'arrivée. De plus il est situé dans un quartier très sympa (plusieurs bars, lieux de brunch) et facilement accessible en transports en commun : parfait pour rayonner ensuite dans Berlin.<br/>A recommander !",0,-0.2003,Negative
57.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,39,100.0,1,12.15652849511375,4.98,4.95,4.83,4.9,760108563556107857,"This home is filled with warmth and abundance.<br/>A wonderful couple, a cozy and charming room, a beautiful garden, a spacious kitchen and living room, and elegant interior design—just being here is a special experience.<br/>The private bathroom for guests was also very appreciated.<br/>It was a great opportunity to feel close to everyday life in Germany, and I’m truly grateful for the experience.<br/>It’s about 20 minutes by train from the center of Berlin, in a very convenient location.<br/>The house is also close to the station.<br/>A short walk surrounded by trees and beautiful homes brings you right to the door.<br/>I wish I could have stayed longer.<br/>This was truly a fantastic Airbnb stay, and I highly recommend it to everyone!",1,0.9937,Positive
190.0,6,1.0,1.0,6.0,29,99.0,0,1.5910745575556304,4.64,4.71,4.51,4.54,6098179,Very nice place with billiard room! Kind and professional staff and always fun to have around,0,0.8775,Positive
207.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,58,100.0,1,2.222288195756644,4.89,4.97,4.93,4.73,11031031,Petite Tiny House adorable dans le meilleur quartier de Berlin ! Un hôte hyper disponible et très agréable. Super 👍,1,0.8122,Positive
127.0,3,1.0,1.0,3.0,7,97.0,0,5.980428349382811,4.34,4.43,3.83,4.53,1379740552315153632,"Was een erg prettig hotel, vriendelijk personeel en een mooie schone kamer. Kwartier lopen van het dichtstbijzijnde metro station. Supermarkt zat ook dichtbij en een erg leuke bakkerij. De omgeving had weinig woningen en met name wat bedrijven terreinen waardoor snachts nauwelijks geluid was vanuit de omgeving, was erg prettig. Ik zou hier zeker in de toekomst nog een keer heen gaan.",1,0.0,Neutral
172.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,99.0,0,1.542372060755756,4.59,4.74,4.53,4.54,6697033,Top Hostel! Unkompliziert und einfach...,1,0.2714,Positive
80.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,0.0,0,8.015621196700712,4.54,4.69,4.77,4.52,19651885,"Bonjour,<br/>Nous souhaitons faire nos remarques en commentaire privé car cela n'aurait pas été juste de les faire en public tant nous avons apprécié le logement. Nous vous soumettons quelques observations qui relèvent de l'équipement : Tout d'abord, il est dommage que la poêle à frire ne soit pas compatible avec la plaque à induction. Elle est par conséquent inutilisable. Il serait souhaitable également d'équiper la cuisine d'une essoreuse à salade, d'une cruche à eau et d'une serpillère . Enfin un certain nombre d'ampoules d'éclairage ne fonctionnaient plus. En espérant que ces quelques remarques vous seront utiles Et encore merci pour votre disponibilité.",1,0.1531,Positive
