80.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,0,14.740259241210865,4.74,4.77,4.57,4.68,14619469,Erika is a wonderful host. The location was perfect for me and close to the train without the chaos of the downtown bustle. Very clean and very comfortable for one traveller or a couple. Thank you Erika!,1,0.9627,Positive
