93.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,39,100.0,1,3.2781637723728885,4.56,4.54,4.61,4.48,1537125,"El apartamento está bien ubicado, a 20 minutos caminando del centro. Elegimos esa ubicación para poder estacionar.<br/>Las instalaciones del apartamento no eran muy modernas y les faltaba mantenimiento pero no estuvo mal. No había señal de wifi lo cual estaba bien avisado en el anuncio antes de reservar. Siendo turista sin internet propio nos resultó un poco incómodo.<br/>La ducha es un poco pequeña pero no estuvo mal para nosotros. La cocina y la habitación estuvieron bien para dos personas, tres noches. <br/>Hay unos pocos escalones para entrar.",1,-0.886,Negative
70.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,11,100.0,0,7.099824652665866,4.84,4.82,4.76,4.76,3092794,"Berta war sehr nett und herzlich, allerdings habe ich sie leider nur per Mail ""gesprochen"", da sie wärend meines Aufenthaltes nicht zu Hause war. Das Bett ist super bequem und von der Haltestelle Sonnenalle ist alles schnell zu erreichen. Abends bin ich als Frau allerdings nicht mehr gerne rausgegangen. Sonst aber alles top.",1,-0.4767,Negative
115.0,2,1.0,0.0,2.0,16,100.0,0,1.6522173823377917,4.45,4.57,4.64,4.47,51795737,"They have fewer bathrooms for ladies.  The bedroom doors are really heavy, so it gets loud when people come in at night. The cleaning lady only takes out the trash.",1,0.0,Neutral
232.0,6,3.0,2.5,3.0,51,100.0,0,14.79272564982172,4.78,4.9,4.61,4.65,876203248074423718,Very nice and spacious apartment with big tv. Very clean. There is wveeything what you need    I recommend it.,0,0.8218,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,0,1.80800771641044,4.91,4.77,4.91,4.82,18469669,"Mahmoud is a great host! Highly recommended. He will always ensure that your stay is ok. Thanks a lot for letting me stay in your very nice apartment.<br/>The apartment is very new. It was indeed a nice condo! The room is so big with a nice bed, away from the main road so its very quiet and relaxing. The pad is new, toilet and shower are big! The bldg got lift as well.<br/>The location is pretty central, I can walk from must see attractions, and its only few mins walk from metro/train to connect to airport.<br/>I would definitely stay again in this place when Im back in Berlin.<br/>All the best mate! Cheers.",1,0.9917,Positive
77.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,0,11.814165523307237,4.21,4.14,4.58,4.32,49933100,"Nettes Personal, gut gelegen, schlicht, aber sauber. Gerne wieder.",1,0.0,Neutral
83.0,2,1.0,1.0,0.0,23,100.0,0,5.5952660192791255,4.63,4.77,4.13,4.54,1075256603704816590,Goed,1,0.0,Neutral
