20.0,6,1.0,0.0,6.0,21,100.0,0,3.818785253820972,4.47,4.45,4.56,4.55,30759237,Great deal in a convenient  location. Nicer than I expected. Would stay here again!,1,0.807,Positive
93.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,2.54678149398414,4.86,4.96,4.9,4.84,3187735,Der definitive Superhost von Barbara ist wärmstens weiter zu empfehlen!<br/>Das hat jetzt nichts mit dem heißen Wetter während unseres Aufenthalts zu tun. Die Wohnung war selbst dann kühl!<br/>Die Einrichtung ließ Nichts zu wünschen über und war sehr geschmackvoll.<br/>Es bleiben keine Fragen offen und die Tipps von Barbara trafen unseren Geschmack.<br/>Wir kommen gerne mal wieder!!!,1,-0.9569,Negative
133.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,31,90.0,0,13.168567932790063,4.53,4.61,4.35,4.35,30849280,"Very handy location to transport, local supermarket and restaurants. Perfect. Busy street noise but very quiet with window closed. We had the fan going through the night to cool down a bit. I probably would have preferred a room facing the yard rather than the street.",1,0.8047,Positive
86.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,0,2.717321609589815,4.54,4.68,4.79,4.54,1341032764231168102,"Unfortunately not a good experience. I’ve stayed in Berlin many times and never had such a bad experience. Apartment was not the same as what was advertised on air BnB. Small room with scruffy furniture, bad smell and worst of all no curtains. Room was advertised with black out curtains, however on arrival we realised this was not the case; see through voile curtains that did not fit the windows and as the room was on the ground floor on a busy street as I was unable to get changed in there or sleep in the room as the bed was next to the window, no privacy at all as everyone walking by could see straight in. Room massively overpriced and host unresponsive. I had to contact air BnB for a refund and we moved to a hotel the next day. I do not recommend!",1,-0.8488,Negative
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,10,100.0,0,2.9639589886838467,4.91,4.9,5.0,4.7,44625375,"An cosy apartment with a very nice vibe, Ben has a good eye for original interiors. Nice neighbourhood, located at a busy street but well isolated so it is very quiet. Close to public transportation. Free parking just a few blocks from the appartement. Great espresso machine! We had a wonderfull stay and would absolutely reccommend this!",1,0.9391,Positive
123.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,1,1.17460082517367,4.83,4.8,4.9,4.74,238396,Comfortable and easy to get to. Great spot.,1,0.8834,Positive
70.0,1,0.0,1.0,1.0,14,80.0,0,3.095255848504089,4.66,4.84,4.69,4.26,28156,"Our stay was great. The place is clean and quiet, 6 mins from the subway. The bed is maybe the greatest one I've slept in. And Chris was there when we arrived, to give us keys, information, etc. <br/>We recommand!",1,0.906,Positive
122.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,96.0,0,3.128194469226722,4.61,4.66,4.86,4.54,47215807,"Toller Ausgangspunkt für alle Ausflüge, Shopping, lecker Essen und vieles mehr in der Innenstadt durch die perfekte Lage und den Anschluss ans U-Bahn Netz ab Stadtmitte. Sauber, zuvorkommende Mitarbeiter und moderne Einrichtung.",1,-0.5994,Negative
