173.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,85.0,0,1.5095289909770313,4.76,4.84,4.91,4.59,45904289,"Excellent location, the room itself is spacious and well-equipped. Very responsive host as well. Would definitely recommend!",1,0.9199,Positive
145.0,6,2.0,1.0,6.0,69,100.0,1,2.539339408979795,4.98,4.89,4.93,4.76,26467675,"Lovely stay with Léa. Our two boys loved the toys, bunk beds and cozy ambiance. Right outside the door is public transit. Hop on and off to get around the city with ease. Léas house is right where the wall used to be. We felt we were really experiencing history with our stay.",0,0.8807,Positive
85.0,6,2.0,1.0,5.0,23,100.0,0,9.797881642408234,4.61,4.56,4.65,4.52,7963887,We loved staying in this apartment.  It is clean and comfortable with everything needed for a short stay.  Bakery just round the corner and U-Bahn station right outside.  Jorn and Zahid were great hosts.  Recommended!,1,0.9441,Positive
46.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,1,11.322410583731694,4.81,4.65,4.85,4.79,1272125,"Zentrale Unterkunft mit guter Anbindung an öffentliche Verkehrsmittel. Wilmersdorfer Arcaden in unter 10 Min. erreichbar. Nette Cafés in unmittelbarer Umgebung. <br/>Emir ist ein sehr zuverlässiger Gastgeber, dem das Wohl seiner Gäste spürbar am Herzen liegt. <br/>Unsere Ankunft verzögerte sich unerwartet auf 22h und Emir empfing uns herzlich mit einem Stück selbstgemachter Lasagne und einem Glas Wein. Wir haben eine sehr schöne Woche in der Unterkunft verbracht und es fehlte uns an nichts. Die Wohnung ist sehr sauber und die Einrichtung geschmackvoll. Wir würden diese wieder buchen.",1,-0.8316,Negative
102.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,0,2.7824750390490918,4.95,4.97,4.94,4.86,10033310,"We had a terrific stay at Jessy's flat in Tortstrasse. It's easy to find from Tegel airport and in a great neighbourhood with lots of bars, cafes and restaurants. The flat is very well appointed, in fact my daughter said she wants to decorate her own flat in this style! Everything is very new and clean. We had a warm welcome from Jessy's friend to hand over the key and at the end of our stay Jessy gave us a late check out meaning we could make the most of our sightseeing. Throughout our stay Jessy was on hand via email giving us tips about good places to eat - we agreed with them all! There is a helpful selection of tourist information in the flat. Overall we had a very comfortable stay and since we didn't see everything in the city if we return to Berlin we would definitely book again. Highly recommended - thank you Jessy. ",1,0.9935,Positive
101.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,1,1.9004712390561007,4.89,4.91,4.93,4.73,1079125385143422920,"El alojamiento fue justo como lo publicado. Es un lugar espacioso y las camas muy cómodas. Para dos personas es excelente y tienes todo lo necesario para una estancia corta. El proceso de llegada fue fácil y autónomo. El barrio es lindo y tiene muchos restaurantes y cafeterías cercanas, así como estaciones de metro y tram. Recomiendo este lugar.",1,0.0,Neutral
69.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,39,100.0,1,6.8031309591177695,4.86,4.94,4.76,4.86,9524021,"Anke is a great host with lots of tips for things to do in the area and for Berlin. Check in was a little awkward, but we resolved after and would happily stay here again!",1,0.8637,Positive
99.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,0,14.270365576459383,4.78,4.73,4.77,4.69,11374200,Nicole ist eine sehr sympathische Person. Kommunikation war hervorragend. Die Wohnung liegt sehr Zentral und die Umgebung ist sehr schön. Wir würden jederzeit wieder diese Unterkunft wählen.,1,-0.9136,Negative
