178.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,36,98.0,0,1.184695254880577,4.47,4.6,4.7,4.29,996110167745683025,-,1,0.0,Neutral
160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,87.0,0,3.4802565088356308,4.54,4.54,4.6,4.41,43798011,Good little spot with everything you need. A short walk to plenty of great food and close to a well-connected train line.,1,0.7906,Positive
79.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,17,100.0,0,4.1590970043295705,4.87,4.77,4.81,4.77,1015857395460992949,"The hotel staff was nice and responsive (some of the only nice people we met in Berlin). We were on one of the higher floors and there was no AC—which is what was advertised and practiced in Berlin—except we didn’t anticipate that the heat would make it hard to breathe. There was one fan that had limited functions and there were two windows. One window couldn’t open all the way and there were no screens to keep insects out. There were also no curtains which would have helped with the heat, light exposure for sleeping, and would have provided at least some amount of privacy. If you do not want to expose yourself to the neighborhood while dressing you have to change in the small bathroom. The stay wasn’t very comfortable for those reasons, but the area was active and packed with restaurants and everything was walkable. The check-in/out process was smooth, the hotel was quiet, and there was an elevator (saved us). If needing the basics and don’t care much about comfort this is decent.",1,0.9355,Positive
422.0,5,2.0,2.0,3.0,42,100.0,1,2.942766383999945,4.81,4.99,4.8,4.72,29121725,"The place was perfect ! Very easy to find, in a very good location, in front of a tram stop and a metro station. <br/>Super modern and cozy place.",0,0.8473,Positive
44.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,23,100.0,0,13.157059293117056,4.44,4.33,4.64,4.44,18066481,"Very clean, free parking",1,0.763,Positive
89.0,3,0.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,0,1.0054327061020718,4.76,4.65,4.92,4.68,25106503,"We had a lovely time staying in this Airbnb. We were three people so one of us slept on the sofa. The bed and the sofa were both very comfortable and the decor was very cute. The location was perfect and the flat was big enough for the three of us. There’s two train stations very close and a big supermarket and a biomarkt close to the flat. I’ll definitely stay here if i visit Berlin again, and recommend the flat to people traveling to Berlin.",1,0.9617,Positive
175.0,6,2.0,1.5,2.0,21,100.0,0,6.688394137444405,4.8,4.9,4.85,4.6,48387556,"Sin duda, el mejor apartamento en el que me hospedado hasta ahora,  al llegar a la casa, no me creía lo que estaba viendo ante mis ojos, ya que era enorme, el apartamento me dió la sensación de estar en un película. Los chicos nos respondían prácticamente al minuto nos sorprendían incluso hasta nos respondían a altas las horas. Estaban siempre muy atentos y se agradece mucho la empatía y paciencia, sin duda cuando vuelva a Berlin verificaré si este apartamento está libre en las fechas en las que vuelva porque no me quiero quedar en otro sitio que no sea este.",1,-0.9153,Negative
67.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,38,100.0,1,9.589987916493834,4.79,4.49,4.68,4.78,26546193,"Der Aufenthalt war wirklich sehr schön, Hans Werner hat uns herzlich Willkommen geheißen und wir haben uns wohl gefühlt, nur an einem Punkt müsste nochmal gearbeitet werden: die Sauberkeit im Bad. Die Dusche war etwas dreckig und auch die Toilette hätte einen ordentlichen Waschgang nötig. Jedoch in einem ertragbaren Rahmen, vielleicht bin ich auch zu penibel. <br/>Hans Werner ist witzig und freundlich, die Wohnung ist toll ausgestattet und die Dachterrasse ist der Wahnsinn. Wir können es nur empfehlen",1,-0.9859,Negative
79.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,1,9.403941552737663,4.88,4.74,4.84,4.8,17071054,"Efter opstigningen til 5.sal blev vi belønnet med en skøn udsigt præcis som forventet og lidt til. Mod vest tilbragte vi et par aftener på terrassen og var heldige med dejligt sommervejr. Parken overfor er fin til gåtur og bypause liggende på tæppe med en god bog. Med byen lige udenfor døren købte vi dagsbillet via BVG app. Lejligheden indeholdt hvad vi havde brug for de 4 dage. Arne er en god vært, nem at tale med og deler gavmildt ud af tips til området, byen og den muligheder. Vi kommer gerne tilbage.",1,0.4939,Positive
51.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,11,100.0,1,1.561596824087388,4.86,4.91,4.92,4.78,731285,"Sehr ruhige und gemütliche Wohnung im Herzen von Prenzlauer Berg! Französische LebensArt nicht nur wegen des Samstag Marktes, dadurch aber umso mehr - nur wärmsten zu empfehlen!",1,0.0,Neutral
71.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,0,7.128847218007489,4.49,4.69,4.67,4.36,1153457093549600015,"We really enjoyed our stay in Berlin! The space was clean and comfortable. The neighborhood was very quiet and extremely walkable, close to a cafe, a supermarket and the train. We felt very safe and the host was very proactive in reaching out to us. We would absolutely recommend staying here for a peaceful and easy stay!",1,0.9786,Positive
