65.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,0,3.715408939134692,4.76,4.83,4.76,4.75,749508,"Michael was very welcoming and showed us round the flat when we first arrived. The flat was exactly as it was described on the listing and we had a wonderful time there. The location was perfect, just round the corner from the nearest underground station and with plenty of bars and restaurants nearby. I would definitely recommend this accomadation to anyone thinking of traveling to Berlin. ",1,0.9412,Positive
