350.0,8,3.0,1.0,5.0,49,100.0,1,1.1829273409163323,4.91,4.78,4.95,4.78,938200237473175867,"Super appartement avec du style et très bien situé. Beaucoup de choses à faire à proximité.<br/>L’appartement contient tout le nécessaire, nous avons pu y faire notre repas de Noël.<br/>Propriétaire super sympa et très réactif, donne plein de conseils.<br/>Nous recommandons ! Excellente adresse.",0,0.7574,Positive
112.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,1,7.03606664813505,4.84,4.94,4.63,4.75,926670,"Tom and Azu's apartment is in a perfect location, really spacious and well equipped for everything needed for a visit to Berlin!  Tom greeted us outside the apartment block, showed us into the apartment and stayed to run through the main highlights of Berlin.  <br/>He helpfully answered all of our 'first time in Berlin' questions with real enthusiasm and genuine interest, ensuring we had all of the information we required.  Fantastic apartment and great hosts!  Thank you Azu and Tom :)   <br/><br/>Throughout our stay the communication was really quick and <br/><br/><br/>",1,0.9824,Positive
