90.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,22.148016111832643,4.76,4.86,4.59,4.73,564240199474810836,"This apartment was very nice. The host was friendly, helpful and flexible. <br/>S-Bahn, bus and tram were close. Fast and easy to get to the sights, but far enough away from the city to have some peace and quiet, if desired. Lovely restaurants, grocery stores and a great bakery all nearby. A wonderful place for a couple to stay.",1,0.9858,Positive
