384.0,5,3.0,1.0,5.0,83,100.0,0,13.830947427417978,4.89,4.67,4.76,4.56,28143091,"Very nice and well-equipped apartment. It's totally quiet at night. The bus stop is just a few minutes away, and the train station is also close, making the use of public transport in Berlin very easy. We had no problem finding parking space on the street. Our host, Tatjana, was very nice, helpful, and flexible, especially as we changed our arrival time on short notice.",0,0.8051,Positive
