261.0,8,3.0,1.0,5.0,42,100.0,0,3.206802294887829,4.74,4.81,4.8,4.57,11746050,"This is just a perfect location and apartment.<br/>We traveled with our 3 young kids for 8 days: it's perfect to visit Berlin because you have that typical ""local neighborhood"" experience in Berlin but you're 15 mins away from the Mitte via U-Bahn, taxi, etc. <br/>We would take the kids early morning to the local playground (just great) and local coffee shops before doing the ""1 a day"" site-seeing, it's just great to take advantage of the relaxed location, try out the various supermarket, the local Vietnamese or the Turkish restaurants with a cool esplanade. <br/>The spacious apartment made it at times tempting to stay at home - in particular for the kids - the apartment is sunny and it was a pleasure to chill out at day-end from all the wondering around the city.<br/>It was a pleasure to stay here.",0,0.9881,Positive
83.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,1,3.102509371524417,4.92,4.98,4.92,4.81,18506873,"Had a lovely stay at Frank’s apartment! It was very clean and stylish. The location was very handy with lots of shops and restaurants nearby, as well as the being in close proximity to the train station. The only issue that we incurred was that on the final day, there was no hot water which was a shame.",1,0.5974,Positive
