57.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,14,0.0,0,1.9959423571330963,4.78,4.7,4.83,4.68,1310620,"Dori's place was absolutely incredible. The space is extremely welcoming and has everything you could possibly need. The neighborhood is quiet but has enough great places to eat nearby to keep things exciting. Most importantly, Dori and Kai were so easy to work with and accommodating. They met us early and helped us work through things before and during our stay. The next time I come to Berlin I plan to stay at Dori's.  ",1,0.9703,Positive
