119.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,51,100.0,1,3.2984353664881243,4.88,4.85,4.89,4.74,31480066,"Lovely apartment in a fantastic location - quiet enough in a great suburb, walkable to the centre and with lots of transport options. Perfect for 2 friends, a couple or small family. <br/>Annette was very communicative and helpful - will rebook when we next visit Berlin.",0,0.9697,Positive
