80.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,100.0,1,5.477094653089554,4.88,4.85,4.78,4.83,16470400,"Was absolutely delighted to stay at Jenny's place. <br/>She is warm and welcoming. Makes you feel at home and showed me around the area. <br/>The room was big and clean and very nice. Just like the pictures. <br/>The area is very quiet, but with all you need just around the corner. <br/>Perfect for the real Berlin life experience and whit all the tourists attractions just a train ride away. <br/>She has my warmest recommendation. ",1,0.9406,Positive
83.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,0,8.160231491771468,4.85,4.64,4.91,4.82,50884931,We had a great stay at Julian's. we met Julian for check in and he was very friendly. The apartment had everything we needed for our stay. If we had a question he was quick to reply. The location was excellent. From the living room window you can see the Victory Tower and TV Tower as well as the light of the Brandenburg Gate. It's also less than three minutes to the train station which is on the main line and will take you anywhere you want to go. would highly recommend if you're looking for a cozy apartment in Berlin!,1,0.95,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,17,100.0,0,2.229992486310417,4.62,4.86,4.83,4.62,6618275,"Der var dejlig stor flexibilitet ang. tidspunkt for overdragelse af nøgler til lejligheden. Faktisk endte det med, at vi hentede den på en overfor liggende restaurant. Helt uden problemer og restauranten var oven i købet god.<br/>Lejligheden lå meget centralt og samtidig i et roligt nabolag. Dette levede fuldt op til beskrivelsen.<br/>Lejligheden indeholdt det, der var beskrevet. Lejer kontaktede os kort efter ankomst pr. telefon, for at sikre, at alt var i orden, hvilket det var.",1,0.2732,Positive
260.0,8,4.0,2.0,7.0,50,100.0,1,2.6302702497082326,4.88,4.92,4.85,4.71,1488624,"Great apartment, Alexandra was a super host and very helpful. Very clean and stylish and very close to shops and transport. Hope to stay again soon.",0,0.9535,Positive
51.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,0,5.45266710386518,4.77,4.88,4.59,4.66,30034739,"det er rart sted at bo. meget anonymt.<br/>Du passer dig selv fuldstændig og Dawid er på tråden, hvis du har nogle særlige behov",1,0.0,Neutral
70.0,1,0.0,1.0,1.0,14,80.0,0,3.095255848504089,4.66,4.84,4.69,4.26,28156,"Here's to another enjoyable stay in Berlin! <br/><br/>Location of the apartment is excellent, right in the heart of Prenzlauer Berg, close to stations, cafes and Mauerpark. The flat is clean, bright, and just right for a long weekend.<br/><br/>Chris is an excellent host, very helpful and was always quick to reply to our messages. Would definitely recommend.",1,0.9735,Positive
