104.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,31,100.0,1,4.2642040908590895,4.8,4.63,4.66,4.6,668570668765950332,Alles super. Rosa hat immer schnell und hilfsbereit geantwortet. Wir haben uns sehr wohlgefühlt. Die Wohnung ist gemütlich und geschmackvoll eingerichtet. Vielen Dank,1,0.0,Neutral
87.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,26,60.0,0,6.381010109583203,4.62,4.59,4.84,4.61,43541550,"Nette, kleine Unterkunft in zentraler Lage (5 Min U-Bahn Bülowstraße, nahe Cafés und Bars), aber dennoch ruhig. Sauber und gut ausgestattet sowie problemloser Selbst-Check-In. Wir empfehlen es gerne und uneingeschränkt weiter.",1,0.0,Neutral
35.0,1,0.0,0.0,1.0,13,83.0,0,0.8974760148327897,5.0,5.0,5.0,4.33,730804992432698434,"Yuliya is the best host — she’s always there to help you with anything you need! She came immediately to help when I locked myself outside, and sent me off to station when I had lots of luggage. Her kindness is extraordinary. As for this place, it is in perfect location, the best part of Berlin, which is basically what the price is for. The space is just enough for one person, with separate storage rooms and drying rooms in the apartment complex. I stayed for four months this time and would love to stay here again! (Note for future tenants: water is charged separately here — there is a line in the description, you need to read carefully)",1,0.9763,Positive
203.0,5,2.0,1.0,6.0,59,100.0,1,14.700123896784028,4.7,4.77,4.81,4.58,5768223,"Tolle Lage, gute Unterkunft, alles wie beschrieben.",0,0.0,Neutral
