118.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,18,93.0,0,2.3360123395652144,4.78,4.65,4.76,4.63,17396668,"The flat was perfect, would highly recommend. Great location, clean, modern and very helpful and responsive hosts",1,0.9608,Positive
158.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,45,100.0,0,2.309471505712993,4.6,4.72,4.89,4.54,16050152,"We enjoyed our stay and the host was very accommodating. Excellent location, clean, and ready for us.",1,0.9096,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,0,6.867323847212837,4.98,4.94,4.83,4.96,28172907,Die Gastgeber sind sehr nett und unterstützen mit Tipps.<br/>Fuer mich war die Unterkunft perfekt und die Lage des Zimmers sehr ruhig.,1,-0.9485,Negative
422.0,6,3.0,3.0,3.0,59,100.0,0,1.446201657247705,5.0,5.0,5.0,4.83,968576077766653158,Incredible Penthouse in a warm Berlin neighborhood. Beautifully designed with everything you need in the home. Views and interior design perfectly modern and still warm. We had a great time and the hosts were vey helpful.,0,0.9559,Positive
149.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,48,96.0,0,4.794359491893373,4.66,4.74,4.61,4.54,45732707,"Это не квартира, это отель. <br/>О том, что я должна буду заплатить сбор при заселении - узнала из комментариев, а описании к квартире об этом не уточнялось. <br/>Мы заселились с мужем и маленькой дочкой, в описании было указано, что можно попросить кроватку, стульчик или манеж. Я заказала кроватку и стул для кормления, хозяин даже не знал, что у них это указано в описании. В итоге стула не было. <br/>В ванной был ужасный запах сырости, кроме того в душе было много волос на полу и плитке. <br/>Волосы так же были на постели, что испортило впечатление, это было не приятно, я не уверенна,  простыни действительно меняли? <br/>Кухня не предназначена для готовки, есть посуда но элементарно: нет соли или масла для приготовления.<br/>В ванной нет средств гигиены, ни гелей для душа ни шампуней. <br/>В добавок ко всему, несколько раз ночью свет включался сам по себе в лампах, датчики работают не исправно. <br/>Парковка стоит 25 евро.",1,0.0,Neutral
80.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,44,100.0,1,7.016086714529495,4.94,4.99,4.66,4.87,30466274,"We hadden een aangenaam verblijf bij Anica. De woning is heel mooi en praktisch, het zetelbed ligt comfortabel en de badkamer is geweldig! Leuk dat er voldoende keukenmateriaal aanwezig was, zoals olijfolie, peper en zout en dergelijke. Ook gezelschapsspelletjes, boeken en toeristische gidsen van Berlijn ontbraken niet. Je kan ook gratis parkeren met de auto vlakbij de accommodatie. Er was bovendien een goede bakkerij op wandelafstand.<br/>Wij vonden de afstand naar het centrum van Berlijn wel best ver. Je moet een tiental minuten stappen tot aan de tramhalte en dan ben je ca. 35 minuten later op Alexanderplatz.",1,0.69,Positive
48.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,5.293059373334779,4.83,4.69,4.93,4.74,45606656,"Had a great stay at Thiago's place - convenient location right next to the central station, well-kept, and Thiago was very friendly, quick to respond, and generally just super easy to talk to!",1,0.9401,Positive
157.0,4,0.0,1.0,3.0,27,100.0,1,3.932306873935366,4.86,4.86,4.82,4.69,37737152,"Great location for exploring Berlin, located near public transport stations and a grocery store. Kitchen is stocked with bare necessities but was fine for our purposes. Really spacious and retro interior. Kind of complicated to get in initially but on the bright side feels very secure. Would stay again",1,0.903,Positive
152.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,36,99.0,0,1.6727611612237951,4.73,4.76,4.67,4.58,45011020,Alles perfekt!,1,0.0,Neutral
119.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,4,97.0,0,3.51544057363174,4.21,4.43,4.64,4.32,1196988614807603520,Gayet iyiydi. Teşekkürler,1,0.0,Neutral
101.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,3.078352015251089,4.83,4.81,4.81,4.66,20282379,"Really enjoyed our stay, check in was really easy and the hosts were really easy to communicate with. The location was brilliant and well connected to 2 ubahn lines making it easy to get to any part of the city.  The room was very clean and has everything you need for a short stay in Berlin. Would definitely book again!",1,0.9752,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,11,100.0,0,1.1130665790057352,4.88,4.95,4.92,4.86,18189635,"Very well equipped! She gave us maps and some other valuables tips to go around! Very nice, spacious and comfortable room!",1,0.9146,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,18,100.0,0,2.2309100217625213,4.29,3.31,4.94,4.33,35261758,"Eine sehr schöne charmante Wohnung. Etwas unperfekt, aber alles in allem war es sehr schön da zu sein. Würde auf jeden Fall gerne wider kommen.",1,-0.5994,Negative
68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,3.194253694245239,4.93,4.95,4.89,4.86,81081,"Loved staying at Bernd and Katja's place! It was very nice - good space and a lovely patio. I thought it would be a bit closer to the middle / city center, but we took the metro into town each day when we were there (it was super easy and a quick trip, but I love being in a place where I can walk everywhere!) There were also lots of great restaurants and cafes right around there, so that was nice, too. If you don't mind jumping on the metro to get into the city center, then this is a great place to stay - highly recommend it!",1,0.9932,Positive
296.0,6,3.0,2.0,5.0,29,100.0,1,6.97282351203588,4.92,4.9,4.55,4.7,14335678,"Wir waren über Weihnachten in Berlin und hatten den Pferdestall gemietet. Eine tolle Wohnung mit einem riesigen Wohnzimmer!! Was besonderes toll für uns war, war das Angebot für unsere Tochter! Kinderspielzeug und auch ein Dreirad wurden uns zur Verfügung gestellt!! Vielen Dank nochmal dafür!! Insgesamt war es ein sehr schöner Aufenthalt.",0,-0.9309,Negative
100.0,6,3.0,1.0,3.0,37,100.0,0,17.177847201896487,4.77,4.77,4.62,4.69,8725453,Alles Topp!<br/>Freue mich auf den nächsten Aufenthalt !,0,0.0,Neutral
109.0,5,1.0,1.0,3.0,28,100.0,0,16.45297184148193,4.8,4.77,4.68,4.65,696306469196877312,Die Unterkunft war wie beschrieben. Check-In hat problemlos funktioniert. An der Straße kann man auch kostenfrei parken.,1,-0.8316,Negative
157.0,7,3.0,1.0,7.0,21,100.0,0,11.351667179886276,4.56,4.38,4.26,4.35,3788727,Super einfache Kommunikation. Trotz Streichung des Flugs und demnach Ankunft an einem anderen Tag hat alles einwandfrei und unkompliziert geklappt. Auch die Verlängerung um einen Tag war problemlos. Einziges Manko - das Apartment liegt etwas außerhalb der Innenstadt und preis-leistungs-verhältnismäßig daher einen Punkt Abzug.,0,-0.5994,Negative
187.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,33,87.0,0,3.470214040335909,4.58,4.55,4.58,4.49,49509138,"Lief super einfach, sehr nett :)<br/>Es ist ein ganzes Haus voller einzelner Appartements. Das sollte man vielleicht wissen. Daher kann die Wohung etwas anders aussehen als auf dem Bild. (wir hatten z.B. keine Badewanne)",1,0.0,Neutral
160.0,1,1.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,0,6.214772683923241,4.92,4.62,4.95,4.68,824357263639271482,ganz wundervoll,1,0.0,Neutral
137.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,1.189406824976013,4.86,4.84,4.93,4.79,264459,The place was wonderful. It was exactly as described online. The host was very friendly and helpful! It was within walking distance to everything that we wanted to see and the underground train system was really close by. The only thing I did want to mention is the place smelled like smoke. We've noticed this being a common theme for most of our stays in Europe but just wanted to point that out here.  A very enjoyable stay!! I really recommend it if you're looking for a clean place with a good location. ,1,0.9744,Positive
58.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,51,100.0,1,1.1184416403191766,4.96,4.98,4.96,4.85,37446212,"Great spot, everything was perfect!",1,0.8439,Positive
63.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,0,6.896702536864804,4.82,4.5,4.93,4.75,45429976,"Julia has been responsible and it was really easy to organise everything. The flat is full of light, well designed, in a neighborhood not so famous but well located.",1,0.7137,Positive
69.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,1,6.04491222918904,4.78,4.91,4.65,4.71,8026172,"This was our first time in Berlin and my boyfriend and I are very happy that we stayed at Rainer’s place. The apartment is very easy to get to from TXL airport and is located in a quiet, safe  neighborhood. The neighborhood is very walkable and public transport is only minutes away. Like many others have said, there are a lot of stairs in the building going up to the apartment but this just gave us more motivation to stay out and explore the city! The apartment itself is beautiful with lots of light. Overall we enjoyed our stay very much and would highly recommend staying here!",1,0.9774,Positive
115.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,22,90.0,1,10.750545351348627,4.94,4.83,4.91,4.77,28044368,"Top Lage, top ausgestattet, super Empfang, unkompliziert - nächstes Mal wieder.<br/>Top location, top equipped, super reception, uncomplicated - next time again.",1,0.9042,Positive
61.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,44,95.0,1,3.717179362500484,4.74,4.71,4.68,4.57,18478528,Tout s’est bien déroulé! 😊,1,-0.2003,Negative
89.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,23.302240022763648,4.8,4.57,4.75,4.54,802115821947251110,"Nice place and location and easy to find. Very peaceful.<br/>Place was clean and comfortable but had a few issues with the WiFi and the TV. <br/>The printed welcome information needs to be more helpful - i.e. how to control the heating, how the roof vents work, etc. it felt like the underfloor heating was on full blast, with no obvious controls to adjust it, resulting in the bedrooms turning into a sauna at night and making it difficult to sleep. <br/>Host was friendly.",1,0.9487,Positive
61.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,19,100.0,1,6.962819870095334,4.74,4.74,4.46,4.69,24196054,"Great little place in a good location. Few mins walking from U-bahn, buses, supermarkets, bars, eating and shisha places. The apartment was clean and Mina was very responsive (we had some WiFi issues that she attended to promptly multiple times). Mina provided info prior to check in on nearby areas, how to get there etc. The apartment was smaller than expected based on the photos we saw, and the cooking area is very tight, but it is functional and comfortable, and it works. There was three of us that stayed, and any more would have been tight and uncomfortable. The sofa and TV are in the same room as the bedroom downstairs which opens into the kitchen, dining and bathroom area--apart from the bathroom door, there are no doors separating the areas. Our apartment was at the back so noise from the front road wasn't an issue, the noise from planes was barely noticeable, but the walls are thin and you can hear the neighbours. Overall, we enjoyed our stay at the apartment and the location for ease of travel across Berlin. It has secured entry, is private, and has a gorgeous courtyard with chairs for each apartment.",1,0.9723,Positive
412.0,5,3.0,1.0,3.0,62,100.0,0,11.587149694044676,4.97,5.0,4.86,4.86,17049231,This is a wonderful place in Berlin that is aesthetically very pleasing and in a great location. Philip was great at communicating with me and set up the house incredibly well. The food around the house was also delicious. I would love to stay here again!,0,0.9802,Positive
107.0,3,0.0,1.0,3.0,18,93.0,0,2.373482401219675,4.74,4.7,4.77,4.67,17399068,We had group stay here for the weekend. The place was clean and the location was great. Would highly recommend.,1,0.8622,Positive
167.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,50,100.0,1,5.50328507380831,4.93,4.93,4.78,4.79,10226031,"We had the most perfect stay at Stefan’s apartment! After an easy time finding the place and checking in we were amazed with the style of the apartment. It was so relaxing and a perfect place to retreat to after a crazy day in Berlin. The hard part was leaving each morning! Great location, easy check in, fantastic hosts, and beautiful apartment. Couldn’t have been better honestly. Thanks Stefan and Anna for your hospitality.",1,0.9913,Positive
89.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,0,12.72557223503116,4.66,4.69,4.68,4.53,15019290,"Für mich und meine Freunde war der Aufenthalt perfekt! Die Betten sind bequem, das Apartment gemütlich und es ist alles vorhanden, was man benötigt - wir kommen gerne wieder!",1,-0.855,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,5.285750537133327,4.5,4.08,4.87,4.39,25993791,"Super schöne Wohnung! Exzellente Lage mit vielen guten Restaurants, Bars und Cafés vor der Haustüre! Ganz unkomplizierte Menschen! Alles in allem ein sehr sehr guter Aufenthalt!",1,0.7243,Positive
77.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,34,100.0,1,4.4625182162657095,4.52,4.61,4.77,4.48,11078656,"Kleine, maar praktische ruimte. <br/>Binnenin was het proper en aangenaam. Jammer dat deze kamer in een minder gebouw ligt. De metro is heel dichtbij en er is een goede verbinding met het stad. <br/>Wij hebben genoten!",1,0.0,Neutral
120.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,73.0,0,11.263906019609644,4.24,4.2,4.16,4.02,31011154,"Lovely apartment! Very cosy but good for couples or close friends who want to get out and explore and have somewhere comfortable and cute to stay. It was about 40 minutes away from the centre but using the u-bahn and/or buses it was very easy to get in. It's less than five minutes walk from Aldi and penny, both supermarkets with everything you could need and about ten minutes all from some restaurants. It's in a quiet neighborhood so you don't have to worry about the hustle and bustle of central Berlin. Chris was a little slow to reply at first but he was very helpful and will always answer a call right away.",1,0.9867,Positive
187.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,33,87.0,0,3.470214040335909,4.58,4.55,4.58,4.49,49509138,"Alles in Ordnung, ein paar einfache Handgriffe mehr hätten bei der Reinigung vor uns aber nicht geschadet (Staub und Flusen unter dem Bett und auf den hohen Möbeln).<br/>Die Umgebung rund um das Apartment war leider ziemlich stark mit Glasscherben versehen, mit dem Hund muss man da etwas aufpassen.",1,-0.5994,Negative
139.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,1,3.5852919241394265,4.61,4.65,4.56,4.53,969200,Accueil très chaleureux avec de bons conseils pour profiter au mieux de Berlin. L'appartement est assez bien situé à proximité d'une station de tram et du train. Pas de problèmes particuliers dans l'appartement hormis le bruit de la rue car il est au rez de chaussé. ,1,0.1779,Positive
85.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,0.0,0,8.038293829339684,4.49,4.58,4.7,4.46,13668880,"The Airbnb is as described and clean. The checkin was also very easy and well described. The only thing we didn't liked was the very soft bed which lead to back pain. Otherwise we had a very nice stay. A metro station is right in front of the building, which was very convenient.",1,0.6925,Positive
305.0,9,2.0,2.0,9.0,29,99.0,0,8.905377534529459,4.3,4.5,4.71,4.41,45854967,Appartement propre et idéalement situé. Il convient tout à fait pour un groupe de 9 personnes.,0,-0.128,Negative
