131.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,0,3.9092721863026902,4.76,4.66,4.91,4.79,26049181,"Lovely modern apartment close to the Berlin Wall Memorial, and good transport links. We really enjoyed coming back here to relax after long days of sightseeing, and the bed was really comfy!",1,0.9258,Positive
248.0,8,3.0,1.0,7.0,28,100.0,0,1.9204539822657205,4.62,4.62,4.9,4.52,6708791,"Because of an accidentally double booking Birgit cleaned up her whole own apartment to let us stay in there. The next day she moved our luggage to the apartment which is described above. It is a lovely, spacious, light and clean apartment. We stayed with 8 friends and we had enough space. The communication with Birgit was easily, we had enough keys and because of the hassle of the double booking we didn't have to pay for one person extra.<br/>Prenzlauer Berg is a nice neighbourhood with cosy bars and restaurants close by. The U-bahn and tram are also close to the apartment from where you can easily get to the rest of the city. I would recommend this apartment when you are visiting Berlin! ",0,0.9508,Positive
110.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,38,80.0,1,5.411282332211047,4.89,4.92,4.91,4.81,21259057,Amazing space and very sweet host. Would recommend this wonderful spot to anyone thinking about staying here.,1,0.9321,Positive
79.0,4,1.0,1.5,2.0,60,100.0,1,3.902646890139105,4.84,4.88,4.9,4.71,8386451,"Beautiful, clean, spacious flat in a great location! Both beds were very comfortable. The hosts were very responsive before & during the trip. I will definitely consider staying here again the next time I visit Berlin.",1,0.9642,Positive
125.0,1,1.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,1,1.2721418429169693,4.97,4.99,4.97,4.9,20415517,"Benedikt&Edi place was beautiful, clean, comfortable, felt very at home. The apartment was well supplied with kitchen supplies, bathroom supplies, linens, laundry supplies etc. Edith was super pleasant and welcoming; also very talented. Thank you for the Archeomyth sculpture gifts (very lovely). The neighborhood is very calm, clean, and friendly, has many nice restaurants and small local boutiques around. Very close to train & tram station. Will definitely recommend this lovely apartment to anyone traveling in Berlin. Thanks.",1,0.9938,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,41,100.0,0,13.30465755260926,5.0,5.0,5.0,4.5,33340945,"Tanto Julia como su padre, Gerard, fueron muy amables con nosotros. La casa es maravillosa y muy cómoda para las cuatro personas que estuvimos allí. La cocina, enorme y con todo lo necesario para poder cocinar lo que hiciera falta.  El salón cuenta con una terracita pequeña pero suficiente para sentarse a tomar una de las miles de cervezas que tienen en Alemania. El transporte: en nuestro caso utilizamos el metro. La casa está a 15 minutos andando de la parada por donde pasa la línea U2 que te conecta con el centro (Mitte) y Alexander Platz (con conexión directa para el aeropuerto). También hay varios supermercados cerca y restaurantes muy interesantes. Altamente recomendable.",1,0.0,Neutral
40.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,13,100.0,0,6.329749781684254,4.61,4.42,4.69,4.44,1189159963596662703,"This place is close to one of the main stations, a big Lidl and not too far from various clubs/restaurants/Uber arena. The place is spacious but is 1 only guest accommodation and Rasheed was most of the time at home and the shared areas seemed to be made private, so definitely not the best if you go in/out of the house a lot, looking for more space or come back at late hours, saying this as I am taking in consideration that is his own private flat, If you are not the quietest type of person, keep this in mind.",1,0.5081,Positive
194.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,25,99.0,0,1.6133493933121683,4.65,4.74,4.54,4.69,29814952,It was a very nice place to stay,1,0.4754,Positive
