125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,7,100.0,0,5.13201306616665,4.56,4.33,4.56,4.0,4435646,Overall great experience staying in bens apartment. He was super quick replying to all messages and was very helpful and informative about how to get to the apartment. <br/>Although we never met Ben he made sure a friend was there to give us the keys and left notes for everything such as wifi codes and even recommended places close by for food and drinks.<br/>The Apartment is in an old building but is spacious and warm and only a 2/3 minute walk to the u-bahn. It has everything you'd need for a short or long stay in Berlin.,1,0.8897,Positive
70.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,1,2.5329341972975428,4.86,4.8,4.93,4.8,19976281,"Enrique is a very good and friendly host. Communication via AirBNB and Whatsapp was correct and quick.<br/>He left some nice treats in the room. He took the time to explain what was possible, matching our needs. <br/>Location is great, next to the Maur and close by the U-bahn. The appartment is very clean, and well thought on the accessoires. <br/>He made a nice map and wrote down all kinds of tips and places to eat. <br/>I felt like we were staying in a hotel! ",1,0.9736,Positive
