137.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,1.6809549157543209,4.96,4.95,4.95,4.83,2061212,"Our stay at Kitty’s place was simply great! The apartment is even more beautiful than in the pictures provided, and the place is in a very quiet yet lively neighbourhood. Kitty has been very helpful and is above all a very kind and positive person. Will come back for sure!",1,0.9776,Positive
