89.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,7.289170629982721,4.87,4.77,4.77,4.8,533523,"Frank was very hospitable and responsive. Check-in was super-easy and flexible, same with check-out. The place is really nice and is well-kept. It feels like a home away from home, which is exactly what I was hoping. A good place to spend a stay in Berlin.",1,0.932,Positive
140.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,24,100.0,1,0.821262738531645,4.63,4.73,4.71,4.57,31246982,"Great 5 night stay in Berlin for the four of us, 2 adults and 2 older teenagers.  Very clear instructions to check in. The apartment had everything we needed and was lovely and bright due to the big windows. Kitchen well equipped.  The shower drain had a slight smell first thing in the morning but that went as soon as the shower was used. <br/>Very close to the U-Bahn and less than a 10 minute walk to Alexanderplatz. We ordered an Uber at the airport to the apartment as we had a late arriving flight. We then caught the RB23 train from Alexanderplatz back to the airport. Two supermarkets close by - Netto and EDEKA.<br/>Great base from which to explore Berlin.",0,0.8124,Positive
142.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,29,100.0,1,3.3189723905154875,4.91,4.93,4.86,4.71,19654788,Very nice apartment in a good location. Martin was great at responding around pick up times and helped with adapters. Stay was easy and pleasant,1,0.9459,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,0,3.2503653907727403,4.82,4.8,4.91,4.83,8726209,"Sven ist ein sehr freundlicher und Gastgeber, der schnell antwortet und versucht, offene Fragen zu klären. <br/>Die Lage an der Schönhauser Allee ist top, zentral und trotzdem ruhig, an Ausstattung ist alles vorhanden, was man so braucht. <br/>Gerne wieder :)",1,0.5859,Positive
111.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,3.478761427822,4.88,4.94,4.88,4.75,24836860,Tolle und sehr ruhige kleine Wohnung mit besonderem Altbau-Flair. Blitzsauber und mit allem ausgestattet was man zu Zweit braucht. <br/>Kommen gerne wieder!,1,0.0,Neutral
79.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,63,100.0,1,3.3519237763680656,4.83,4.87,4.83,4.71,35731198,"Natalia's apartment was a great place to stay in Berlin and I'd definitely recommend it. <br/>The space is very clean and and Natalia was so nice and accommodating for check-in. The bed is comfortable, the shower has good water pressure and there is a coffee machine in the kitchen! It is a street facing apartment on the ground level but we didn't have any issues with noise while trying to sleep.",1,0.8819,Positive
