64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,0,3.293158805159111,4.92,4.92,4.95,4.87,36219850,"War sehr unkompliziert bei Anne und Nico, die Lage ist super,  schöne Wohnung und das Zimmer auch sehr räumig und die Preis fand ich etwas teuer, aber kann ich ziemlich nachvollziehen, dass das in Touristensaison war",1,-0.9136,Negative
85.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,0.0,0,8.038293829339684,4.49,4.58,4.7,4.46,13668880,"Great little area! The U is literally on door step of the apartment. So easy to get around.<br/>There is a cafe across the street that sells incredible vegan food called ‘Gey Veg’ we also checked out a vegan restaurant that was on a link that max sent to us called FREA, highly recommend <br/>Apartment was lovely, everything we needed for our stay. Would stay here again 😊",1,0.9346,Positive
