218.0,6,3.0,2.0,6.0,36,100.0,1,3.003280992717941,4.82,4.78,4.83,4.62,14649703,We really enjoyed our stay! Kreuzberg is bustling with great food and drink. Another reviewer listed it as the Brooklyn of Berlin and I’d agree- the neighborhood looks a bit dodgy in places but I felt very safe. The space is really cool and spacious. It was quite loud at night but we had the windows open since it was really hot during our visit- I believe it would be much quieter with the windows closed. Overall though we really enjoyed the place!,0,0.9601,Positive
83.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,1,3.102509371524417,4.92,4.98,4.92,4.81,18506873,"This is a fantastic place to stay! Super clean, all of the ‘extras’ we needed (such as extra towels, hairdryer, iron, plug, fridge). The apartment is modern and very comfortable to stay in. It is small but we did not need it to be big as we spent most of our time out and about. Frank is so helpful and was on hand for any questions! The location is superb, you can get anywhere in Berlin so quickly! We had a great time and are so happy with the experience. Thank you!",1,0.992,Positive
