160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,98.0,0,1.0407544919436775,4.54,4.66,4.77,4.45,34294913,"While this was a basic, nice offering – the price point just didn’t match the experience. We have had much better hotel accommodation in the same neighbourhood for a lower nightly rate so my expectations were set for this to be much higher. It felt like student accommodation and I was expecting something more glamorous.<br/>I would’ve been happy to stay there if it was priced differently. I will say that everything else about the experience was great from the location to the friendliness of the staff. It was clean and had a nice basic setup with kitchenette.<br/>Worth noting that these were no where near hotel beds and were more like travel cots - which was the main reason it felt like student accommodation.",1,0.9753,Positive
80.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,90.0,0,1.4716913138627066,4.89,4.88,4.96,4.83,13593823,"Наше 5-дневное пребывание в доме у Сюзанны было замечательным! Сюзанна радушно встретила нас, выдала все необходимые принадлежности, немного рассказала об окрестностях. Комната и квартира  очень уютные и красивые, семья живет очень тихо. Мы практически не пересекались. Район близко расположен к Александрплатц, 10-15 минут неспешной ходьбы и вы у главной башни. В первый день Сюзанна сказала нам, что на Винштрассе есть всё, что нам нужно и мы можем не уходить с неё. Она была права 😄 там очень много разных заведений, кафешек, магазинов и шопов, где можно впитывать атмосферу города. Улица, где расположен дом, тихая и спокойная. А район Митте - обязателен к прогулке! Мы с подругой довольны на 10/10",1,0.0,Neutral
199.0,6,2.0,1.5,3.0,41,100.0,1,6.208573989536502,4.97,4.97,4.58,4.77,1170945591607184854,Very friendly and communicative hosts that provided all the information we needed. The place was great as we were visiting Berlin with 2 kids and also my parents and the apartment was able to accommodate all of us very well.<br/>We had everything we needed to feel comfortable and at home.<br/>The location is not great regarding things to do in the surroundings but it is very conveniently located near public transportation (tram line) that connects to the main train station (only 2 stops away).<br/>Thank you!,0,0.7838,Positive
333.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,57,100.0,0,0.7735691013482425,4.65,4.71,4.98,4.43,857975239099139321,"Great place in a great location, Darius is really great too. Responsive and very helpful",0,0.9593,Positive
360.0,8,3.0,1.0,3.0,66,100.0,1,4.432978276429975,4.94,4.82,4.89,4.74,694871,"Davide is a great host - very helpful, friendly and responsive. The listing says ""three bedroom"" which is what we needed, but it is actually only two bedroom. He put two mattresses on the floor in the living room. This is what the photos show but it's confusing to me when the listing says one thing and the photos say another. It's hard to tell what is a separate bedroom. Also in the ""second bedroom"" the mattress is on the floor. The flat is huge, original and has tremendous character. We ended up liking it, especially for its spaciousness and character. It is on a very busy Boulevard, which is very noisy, day and night. The neighborhood is filled with wonderful restaurants, coffee, shops, and grocery stores. We liked it and him, with those caveats.",0,0.9654,Positive
