59.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,1,15.704190402628244,4.96,4.98,4.63,4.91,12337676,"Only one word tod describe - marvellous!!<br/>One of the best stays we ever had through airbnb. The room is beautiful, the bathroom is exquisite and everything in the house is so tastefully decorated. The backyard of the house with a swimming pool is a treat, where you can also sit and enjoy your meals. The hosts were really kind and helped us with all the information we need. They were also generous enough to allow us an early check-in. <br/>The area around the house is extremely serene and quite. The tram station is around 7 mins of walk from the house. We would love to visit Berlin once more and stay here once again.",1,0.9848,Positive
