159.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,1,0.9761501815806188,4.88,4.87,4.9,4.73,22992946,Kristian is an awesome host. Great contact and accomodation. Always tried to help us. Fast and easy communication.,1,0.93,Positive
109.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,20,100.0,0,2.6629048061278224,4.63,4.61,4.87,4.63,829241,"Katarina’s place was as lovely as described in the listing!  The surrounding area was peaceful yet hip, and we found ourselves staying closer to home during our stay because of it! A very cute apartment in a cute neighborhood. Katarina was very friendly and attentive as a host and was understanding even when there was a miscommunication on our part. Would recommend this listing to anyone staying in Berlin! We had an amazing time and hope to be back one day :)",1,0.9837,Positive
115.0,5,1.0,1.0,3.0,28,100.0,1,2.8150039882208566,4.84,4.85,4.88,4.79,425487,"Good communication.<br/>Large quiet flat, very clean.<br/>Very satisfied",1,0.7165,Positive
79.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,8,100.0,0,1.1814832908678563,4.69,4.79,4.93,4.56,1237568,"I was extremely happy with my stay at the ""concrete cabin in the sky."" It was spacious enough that I felt comfortable spending an entire month there without feeling cramped, and the views of Berlin truly are unique and breathtaking. What I wasn't aware of is that it is in the tallest residential building in Berlin, so you really get to see many kilometers into the distance. Also, the location could not be better as there is quick access to trains, busses, and subways, so you can easily travel to any part of the city you like.",1,0.9391,Positive
90.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,2.7567422181527164,4.67,4.58,4.83,4.6,674300744723900413,"A great place to stay for a weekend trip and discover Berlin. The location is great, plenty of public transport options nearby, as well as cafes and bars. The Prenzlauer Berg district is laid back and not touristic at all. On Saturday morning it was mostly families with kids walking around. The street where the appartment is located is very quiet and the apartment is towards the inner courtyard so it was really very quiet. There is a school on the same street which was closed during our stay so it might get busier on school days but as said - the window opens to the courtyard, not the street. Being a tall person I was afraid that I might feel cramped in the apartment – as the bed is located right above the door – but the bed is actually really high so I had no issues at all.",1,0.3469,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,6,100.0,0,6.04161528735501,4.17,4.4,4.5,4.0,7609239,"Patricia is very nice, the apartment is beautifully furnished and located in a great part of the city!<br/>Unfortunately, the wifi didn't work, but I could live with that. <br/>Thanks Patricia!",1,0.7601,Positive
198.0,5,3.0,1.0,4.0,58,100.0,1,4.248993153501094,4.85,4.86,4.92,4.76,8603631,You couldn't ask for more welcoming hosts.  Lucky and Maria were so sweet and the apartment was exactly what I thought it would be (only the bathroom was even more lovely in person).  The cats made the stay even cozier.  Would recommend this place to anyone visiting Berlin!,0,0.9517,Positive
148.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,23,99.0,0,1.516636995592736,4.47,4.63,4.46,4.48,9892924,"Quiet and clean room, Nice host.",1,0.6705,Positive
350.0,8,3.0,1.0,5.0,49,100.0,1,1.1829273409163323,4.91,4.78,4.95,4.78,938200237473175867,"What a fantastic apartment - we loved every second in it. It felt more like a home than a rented space. Super comfy big beds in every room, nice decor, grand architecture. The location is simply amazing! David and co-hosts were friendly and so helpful. They checked in a few times to ask if we needed anything, and also sent links to local restaurants and sights in advance of our arrival which felt really welcoming. Already planning to come again!",0,0.9871,Positive
144.0,3,1.0,1.0,3.0,18,99.0,0,8.88272809968877,4.17,4.28,4.69,4.24,46114906,"The hotel is in a very good location - nearby public transport, shops, restaurants.  At the reception, staff are available 24/7 to help with anything you need.  Cleaning comes every day.  Quiet and peaceful place.  Thanks for the holidays! :)",1,0.9508,Positive
240.0,7,2.0,1.0,4.0,40,100.0,1,3.458820921311564,4.77,4.69,4.54,4.62,1447726909806697560,"Logement facile d'accès à 7min à pied de la station de métro la plus proche, deux excellents restaurants à côté de l'appartement, des supermarchés à 5min à pied.<br/>A 10min à pied du Checkpoint Charlie. <br/>Logement propre et confortable pour 6 personnes, il y a deux chambres et un canapé lit. <br/>L'hôte est très réactif, trés bonne communication. Je recommande !",0,0.0,Neutral
70.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,11.683214028789378,4.97,5.0,4.96,4.95,12334987,Die Unterkunft ist sehr schön und die Lage wirklich toll. Der Empfang von Angelika war sehr herzlich und die Kommunikation unkompliziert. Ich fühlte mich sehr wohl und würde die Unterkunft jederzeit wieder buchen.,1,-0.9661,Negative
92.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,22,100.0,1,3.02527786586646,4.85,4.85,4.89,4.55,39377075,"Centrally located, all the essentials. A beautiful spacious flat with the easiest check in. Very comfortable bed! Highly recommended if you’re looking for something basic and close to everything.",1,0.9132,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,12,80.0,1,2.913575777648449,4.96,4.96,4.96,4.86,36647376,"The apartment and room are comfortable and artistically interesting, and it's a very friendly environment to live in. I enjoy the peace and beauty of our stay, would definitely revisit again if I am in Berlin!",1,0.9719,Positive
36.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,8,0.0,0,11.506038019274996,4.36,3.79,4.79,4.5,7726077,"Liked very much Julius's appartment, Central and comfortable. very good communication with Julius.",1,0.8516,Positive
114.0,6,1.0,1.0,4.0,22,99.0,0,4.269791856144701,4.74,4.65,4.5,4.68,28378483,"Evitez de passer par le parc se situant à côté du logement, il y a beaucoup de vendeurs de drogues, je conseille donc de passer par U Schlesisches Tor. Murs trop fins, nous entendions tout ce que les voisins de l'appartement d'à côté faisaient. C'était un groupe de jeunes Allemands super bruyant, nous sommes surement mal tombés! Mais logement très propre, il ne fait ni trop chaud ni trop froid. Les portes sont de prime abord compliquées mais en réalité l'hôte nous a envoyé toutes les informations nécessaire ce qui facilita largement la tâche! Très bon appartement. :)",1,0.7896,Positive
125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,19,100.0,0,4.968919680272744,4.54,4.59,4.86,4.47,30331629,Ottima posizione con stazione della metropolitana davanti casa. consigliato!,1,0.0,Neutral
160.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,32,100.0,1,5.5907372325032725,4.72,4.8,4.69,4.51,21249880,"Super Apartment, super nette Gastgeber. Schöne Lage in Pankow am Bürgerpark mit sehr guter Anbindung.",0,0.8316,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,52,100.0,0,18.623100777897022,4.94,4.95,4.79,4.92,229099,"Sehr netter Gastgeber, der einen vom Flughafen abholt. Nette, saubere Wohnung. 10 Minuten zur S Bahn. Ideal für Durchreisende, die vom Flughafen am nächsten Morgen auf die Bahn umsteigen müssen und nicht in den teureren Flughafenhotels übernachten wollen.",1,-0.6597,Negative
61.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,11.325351758285516,4.84,4.94,4.75,4.71,705101312287374560,"Ich habe 3 Tage bzw. 2 Nächte in Berlin verbracht. Es war bei Ulf sehr angenehm, der Aufenthalt hat sich wie eine angenehme WG angefühlt. Ich konnte mich mit ihm viel unterhalten, er hatte auch Empfehlungen bezüglich der Innenstadt. Ansonsten war er sehr entspannt und entgegenkommend. Das Zimmer war sehr angenehm, gute Aussicht, angenehme Atmosphäre.",1,-0.9136,Negative
100.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,26,100.0,0,2.489636714704028,4.41,4.38,4.35,4.26,1986327,"flat as on photos, great area, only issue was that we havent enough time to stay longer.",1,0.6249,Positive
193.0,6,2.0,1.0,5.0,42,100.0,1,0.601371120108,4.76,4.63,4.94,4.73,4335533,"Die Wohnung liegt super zentral, Alexanderplatz, UBahn, SBahn, Tram, Museumsinsel, Nikolaiviertel, Einkaufsmöglichkeiten, alles fussläufig zu erreichen. Die Wohnung bietet genügend Platz für 4 Personen,  die Küche ist ausgesattet mit allen elektrischen Geräten, sogar ein Espressoautomat, die Wohngegend sehr ruhig, obwohl die Schlafzimmer zur Straße sind, haben wir nichts gehört. Bad war mit kuscheligen Duschtüchern ausgestattet. Sogar ein Schokoleckerli lag auf dem Tisch im Wohnzimmer zur Begrüßung. <br/>Wenn ihr in Berlin Mitte urlauben wollt, kann ich es sehr empfehlen.",0,-0.9786,Negative
111.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,18,100.0,1,16.63557299959969,4.88,4.91,4.66,4.79,614980041642727308,"Wir hatten einen wirklich tollen Aufenthalt in dieser Unterkunft in Berlin! Alles war super sauber, gemütlich eingerichtet und genau so wie beschrieben. Die Lage ist perfekt – ruhig, aber gleichzeitig nah genug, um schnell überall hinzukommen. Der Check-in war unkompliziert und der Kontakt mit dem Gastgeber sehr freundlich und hilfsbereit. Ich habe mich sofort wohlgefühlt und komme bei meinem nächsten Berlin-Besuch definitiv gerne wieder. Absolute Empfehlung!",1,-0.8764,Negative
173.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,85.0,0,1.5095289909770313,4.76,4.84,4.91,4.59,45904289,Well designed apartments in a great central location with ideal access to public transport,1,0.8625,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,57,100.0,1,5.727210434402938,5.0,4.98,4.98,4.94,848252614370421716,"Michael's apartment was exactly as described, what a great place! The apartment is very spacious, quiet and in a great location. There are many amazing restaurants and bars nearby, not to mention Boxhagener Platz saturday market which is just a couple of blocks away! You can also easily take the U-bahn from the nearby station to anywhere in Berlin.<br/>The location itself was peaceful, just a small walk away from some of the busier streets. We couldn't hear any traffic or other noise whatsoever.<br/>The place is a lovely spacious penthouse apartment with balconies facing two different sides. There are also various roof windows. Not only do all of these let in a lot of natural sunlight, but they can also be opened to let a breeze in and cool down the space. It's worth noting that the building has no elevator, so you will be getting some excellent stair exercise when staying there.<br/>Michael was an extremely responsive and accommodating host and a pleasure to deal with!<br/>Highly recommended!",1,0.9857,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,48,100.0,0,12.316433403729432,4.56,4.11,4.89,4.22,44486019,Super liebe Gastgeber und die Unterkunft war wie erwartet ☺️🧡,1,-0.5994,Negative
172.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,24,100.0,1,3.363106751874121,4.94,4.83,4.91,4.8,50973537,This airbnb is one of the most interesting I've ever stayed in. It has such a beautiful feel to it and has several nice touches of decor to make you feel like you got your money's worth. I would stay here again. it was very easy to get around and we had no issues. I loved the portcullis that you could drop down at night for privacy. It made us feel like we were staying in a fortress!,1,0.9622,Positive
172.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,99.0,0,1.542372060755756,4.59,4.74,4.53,4.54,6697033,"Trotz der Größe eine persönliche Athmosphäre.<br/>Die ruhige Lage ist super, nette Mitrabeiter.",1,0.5994,Positive
114.0,8,1.0,1.0,6.0,23,99.0,0,4.40926385743728,4.69,4.49,4.45,4.61,28249744,Berlin never fail to impress and staying at Stella & Lara flat made our experience even better. We will definitely come back again and recommend this place to all our friend. Great location and great place for a group of friends looking to have fun in the wonderful Berlin.,0,0.9835,Positive
53.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,4.795358275165721,4.73,4.57,4.86,4.75,18547011,"Tolle zentrale Lage, Check In und Kommunikation liefen reibungslos!",1,0.0,Neutral
282.0,9,4.0,2.0,6.0,65,100.0,1,13.891160580271904,4.81,4.67,4.72,4.66,21431134,Incredible location- very cozy apartment in a very central location.,0,0.0,Neutral
83.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,1,3.2015667482345425,4.95,4.94,4.95,4.83,16648309,"Wir waren drei Tage in Esthers Apartment. Kommunikation war einfach, freundlich und direkt. Die Wohnung ist hervorragend vom Hauptbahnhof zu erreichen und liegt mitten im beliebten Ausgehkiez von Kreuzberg. In der Gegend gibt es einige nette Restaurants, Cafés und Läden. Ansonsten ist man schnell am Maybachufer, Kottbusser Tor oder Tempelhofer Feld. Das Zimmer liegt ruhig zum Hinterhof, obwohl das Haus selbst extrem hellhörig ist. Wohnung ist sehr sauber und aufgeräumt, das allernötigste ist in ausreichender Zahl vorhanden. Es könnte aber ein wenig persönlicher gestaltet sein. Sehr empfehlenswert, wenn man viel unterwegs sein will.",1,-0.8316,Negative
122.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,96.0,0,3.128194469226722,4.61,4.66,4.86,4.54,47215807,"Really loved this place. Great location, central to several walkable attractions, shopping, and restaurant. Rooms were clean and had all the amenities. No air conditioning but the window provided a good breeze. They are launching air conditioning and gradually enabling it for all rooms starting June 15. Comfortable bed. Friendly staff that provided a map and suggested itinerary for the day. All around good choice.",1,0.9743,Positive
130.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,1,3.188512288149995,4.71,4.71,4.86,4.71,1277548894115458327,"Eine entzückende kleine Wohnung mit kleinem Balkon, auf dem wir in der Morgensonne unseren Kaffee/Tee getrunken haben. Die Wohnung ist sauber und hat alles, was man braucht.  Wir konnten sehr viel zu Fuß erforschen. Sie liegt wirklich in Mitte -Mitte. Allerdings muss man erst einmal 5 Stockwerke hochsteigen,  dafür ist sie aber auch schön hell. Sehr gerne kommen wir wieder.",1,-0.8591,Negative
125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,0,2.399762496998238,4.92,4.88,4.96,4.63,822917,"Top Lage und eine tolle Möglichkeit Berlin Mitte mit seiner wunderbaren Vielfalt vom ""Herzen"" aus zu erleben. Wie der Name es bereits verrät war alles extrem ""Easy"". Die Kommunikation war ""top"". Gerne wieder. ",1,-0.8979,Negative
81.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,1,2.618142013757112,4.87,4.9,4.91,4.75,3717751,"Tolle Oase im Herzen Berlins! Ich habe insgesamt vier Wochen hier verbracht und mich sehr wohl gefühlt. Herzliche Gastgeber und Nachbarn, gute Ausstattung und eine super Lage direkt an der Gedenkstätte Berliner Mauer. Ich komme gerne wieder!",1,0.6688,Positive
172.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,99.0,0,1.542372060755756,4.59,4.74,4.53,4.54,6697033,Unser Aufenthalt war super. Die Unterkunft war leicht zu finden und die Mitarbeiter waren super freundlich. Das Zimmer und das Badezimmer waren sehr sauber und wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt.,1,-0.8316,Negative
181.0,6,1.0,1.0,3.0,7,97.0,0,6.011986469810734,4.42,4.29,3.97,4.58,1379759790076809671,It was advertised that our stay included breakfast however we were told that we did not pay for breakfast and did not get to have it without an additional payment for each guest. <br/>There were lots of fruit flies all over the food as well. <br/>Beds were clean and comfortable and the shower was excellent.,1,0.9021,Positive
59.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,0,6.343113924241046,4.93,5.0,5.0,5.0,1363875695267312490,에어비앤비를 많이 이용해봤지만 <br/>이렇게 섬세한 호스트님은 처음이였습니다<br/>베를린을 잘 즐길수 있는 여러가지 방법을 제안 해주셨고<br/>특히 제가 가본곳 중에 가장 깔끔하고 기분좋은 공간이였습니다<br/>지내는 동안 쾌적하고 편하게 지낼수 있었습니다<br/>베를린을 다시 가게된다면 또 찾고 싶네요!,1,0.0,Neutral
147.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,86.0,0,4.231868494303299,4.7,4.95,4.8,4.73,567786759015244606,"Sehr gute Lage und sehr sauber, etwas klein, aber ausreichend für zwei Personen und top erreichbar mit ÖPNV.",1,0.2023,Positive
137.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,1,2.759966591003808,4.94,4.92,4.94,4.81,768616,"Convenient location on a quiet residential street.  Small shops near by and a wonderful apartment with a beautiful roof top view.  Close to public transportation.  Would encourage anyone who wants a ""resident"" perspective to stay at Cornelius's place.",1,0.9136,Positive
114.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,67,100.0,1,32.29350043093033,4.85,4.69,4.87,4.74,36360929,Super entspannte Unterkunft in fantastischer Lage am Rande Berlins. Super für ein ruhiges Wochenende.,0,0.8316,Positive
124.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,10,95.0,1,10.47678908273926,4.87,4.81,4.9,4.79,43985157,"Nice apartment, conveniently located. Nice neighborhood.",1,0.6808,Positive
218.0,6,3.0,2.0,6.0,36,100.0,1,3.003280992717941,4.82,4.78,4.83,4.62,14649703,"Good place in a good location in Kreuzberg. Overall our experience was really good and we would recommend it. Also the hosts are really nice and easy in communication!<br/>The apartment comes quite spacious with three separate bed rooms. The place itself is designed pretty thoughtful for typical AirBnB use.. but do not expect high end furniture or finish. The beds are a clear minus, two bedrooms come with two single beds. One bedroom with a really poor double bed.<br/>The house rules say it clear, from 10pm onwards you should be quite.. and really... after 10pm the Neighbour from below comes knocking at your door.. even though we were not noisy beyond normal level... acoustics must be horrible for his family... just as a note of caution, this is really not a place for party people! ;-) but even for us as a family it got a bit uncomfortable because of this.. on the other side we didn’t hear any neighbour as well!<br/>Neighborhood is great! Grocery store just around the corner, plenty of pubs and restaurants. And not to forget the great “key’s cafe” :-)",0,0.9735,Positive
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,13,97.0,1,3.4267050167762894,4.88,4.85,4.71,4.83,21291976,"Alles genau so, wie es beschrieben wurde ☺️ das Zimmer war sogar etwas größer als erwartet. <br/>David war freundlich und zuvorkommend, kann ihn nur empfehlen als Host ✨",1,-0.8316,Negative
167.0,5,3.0,2.0,3.0,37,100.0,0,7.36772498293717,4.98,4.93,4.78,4.83,19727888,l'appartement d'Isabella était parfaitement adapté à notre besoin pour une semaine de vacances en famille à Berlin. un quartier calme des commerces à proximité et le métro tout proche pour se rendre rapidement au centre de Berlin.,0,-0.128,Negative
256.0,8,4.0,2.0,4.0,41,100.0,1,5.160770451667082,4.86,4.79,4.56,4.75,37734165,"We really enjoyed our stay with 7 friends. Very clean, spacious, modern apartment. Good and fast communication with the host. Quite neighbourhood, very good beds. Fast connection with 2 subwaystations (Wedding and Gesundbrunnen) Nothing negative to remark. We can only recommend. Greetings from Flanders, Belgium.",0,0.973,Positive
68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,92.0,1,4.424176503712602,4.91,4.98,4.81,4.79,23298585,"Beautiful typical berlin apartment. High roofs, creaky hardwood floors, just fantastic. I really anjoyed my time and can only recommend!",1,0.8832,Positive
60.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,1,20.09318385230389,4.84,4.95,4.65,4.82,978892,"Highly recommended! We loved every bit of it. We were coming from a long trip and could not able to find a place which accepts late check-in, so Emilia made it marvelous for us and waited us to check in and helped us with the transportation, like which bus/train we should take. The room itself is very big and have a great/big desk to work on computer and do remote work. The bed is quite comfortable and big and the room itself and the bathroom are very clean and tidy. We literally felt at home. It is also very close to the center/ just take S1 and enjoy the ride. Frohnau itself is also peaceful and private, and there is a great wood just opposite the house. Like in the other comments it is literally a small heaven. We went for a walk and run in the woods. Plus you can find a microwave , a kettle and a coffee maker in the room . Last but not the least we loved Emilia , she welcomed us heart-warmingly and helped us with the ironing board and iron itself and we loved her dog so much🐕💚",1,0.988,Positive
