95.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,3.1833669854420146,4.83,4.85,4.8,4.58,34018418,Wir fühlten uns sehr wohl und kommen gern wieder. Einziges Manko war die nicht wirklich brauchbare Kaffeemaschine. Ein einfaches Modell wäre viel praktischer.,1,-0.8316,Negative
152.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,33,88.0,1,2.917681610337092,4.89,4.96,4.93,4.76,7526348,"Great space and excellent location, though be aware there are no windows except by the front door, so the bedroom gets quite warm (probably a perk in the winter!). Otherwise, it was clean and spacious, with everything you need for a short- or longterm stay. The hosts were wonderful and incredibly helpful/responsive. I will definitely stay here again!",1,0.9568,Positive
92.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,4.3797985986367935,4.87,4.84,4.87,4.75,31401028,"Great place. Not for those easily scared off by graffiti, but if you can get past the staircase the apartment is lovely.",1,0.7416,Positive
95.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,39,100.0,1,9.009752009078182,4.83,4.81,4.84,4.7,936101374934313281,"The apartment was super clean, modern and very practical. Benjamin has always been responsive and helpful. The location was also great as the train station is just a few minutes away and we had shops close by for groceries.",1,0.9432,Positive
