80.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,41,100.0,1,1.5562283131018062,4.75,4.5,4.96,4.78,37899742,"we had an excellent stay! this place is a wonderful apartment, incredibly spacious and with a wonderful view over Berlin. it's right next to the Underground station, which was excellent. there are quite a few bakeries and places to eat. Martin was a wonderful host and very accommodating. highly recommend this place for those looking for a place in Berlin.",1,0.9714,Positive
