140.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,91.0,0,4.871252294318258,4.72,4.78,4.85,4.58,46812239,"Sehr schönes Zimmer, genau wie auf den Bildern. Mega zentrale Lage und vieles zu Fuß erreichbar. Check-In hat auch super geklappt! Perfekt für einen kurzen Aufenthalt in Berlin.",1,0.636,Positive
71.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,6.919397234051426,4.83,4.89,4.42,4.73,20939397,"We had a lovely stay, the host was extremely proactive and even let us store our bags before our evening departure. The location is close to transit and has quite a few nice restaurants near. We would definitely come back to this spot :)",1,0.94,Positive
