59.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,1,8.780949789470249,4.81,4.96,4.74,4.6,807131975159748467,Very beautiful home with complete privacy for guest. On the top floor with No lift. Good wifi support for working remotely!,1,0.8653,Positive
94.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,1,0.9546645327029104,4.87,4.81,4.89,4.81,22662699,"Everything corresponds to the description. The host was always reachable and friendly. Next to the U and S Bahn, it was easy to access.",1,0.7269,Positive
111.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,51,100.0,1,3.4156959509415743,4.85,4.89,4.82,4.77,14804266,"Sehr schnuckelig eingerichtetes blitzsauberes Appartement, ruhig und doch verkehrsgünstig gelegen. Kommunikation lief sehr entspannt und entgegenkommend, der Self-Check-In ist gut durchdacht und ermöglicht viel Flexibilität in der An- und Abreise. Das Keller-Ambiente (was geruchsempfindliche Menschen in den ersten Momenten trotz gut ausgewähltem Raumduft bemerken werden) wird durch die hochwertige Holz-Ausstattung und den Luftentfeuchter schnell wett gemacht und die Fenster zum Hinterhof lassen sich durch die dicken Vorhänge prima abdichten - ich jedenfalls habe dadurch geschlafen wie ein Stein, was die Unterkunft perfekt macht! Toll waren auch die Willkommensinfos und Insider-Tipps was Cafés und Restaurants angeht!",1,-0.9686,Negative
95.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,1,3.2655381260982392,4.91,4.87,4.87,4.82,456902,"Great apartment in a lovely part of town close to some lovely bakeries and cafés.<br/>Stefan's and his family are great hosts, hands off but there if you need them. <br/><br/>The apartment is clean, well designed, spacious and great value for money.<br/><br/>Will definitely stay here again.",1,0.9806,Positive
68.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,73,100.0,1,6.733273632528371,5.0,5.0,4.77,4.89,720326339580032003,"+<br/>It was a pleasure to stay in the place of Anna. She and her family are very friendly, responsible, responsive and communicative people. As a guest you feel how much they trust you and try to help you in every way possible. If you want to enjoy Berlin not only as the city of the German greatness, but also as a city of warm hearted and caring people, do not hesitate to connect Anna.",1,0.9606,Positive
95.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,3.1833669854420146,4.83,4.85,4.8,4.58,34018418,"Lovely, calm, clean space to rest",1,0.8316,Positive
114.0,6,1.0,1.0,4.0,22,99.0,0,4.274445125358784,4.59,4.45,4.6,4.59,27645497,L’appartement est impeccable. Idéalement situé à Berlin. Chambre confortable. Instructions claires.,1,0.0,Neutral
