422.0,8,3.0,2.0,3.0,19,93.0,0,3.482995702581734,4.71,4.73,4.69,4.6,45780452,"We enjoyed our stay. The location was quiet, but close to shops. local restaurants and check Point Charlie was just around the corner. There were no  suggestions of things to do and only very basic neccesities included, but we spent our whole time with our Berlin relatives, so were not bothered by this. <br/>Overall it served our requirements well.",0,0.5911,Positive
