72.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,32,100.0,0,21.04669302304069,4.65,4.41,4.66,4.76,9543073,"tuvimos un contratiempo legal , perdimos el pasaporte en un viaje . esperamos puedas  comprender un saludo y muchas gracias",1,0.128,Positive
84.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,1,4.00787800065126,4.73,4.67,4.9,4.65,1282857,"L'appartement est situé dans un chouette quartier. À deux pas d'une station de métro, d'un salon de thé excellent pour les petits déjeuner et de bars à deux rues idéal pour une dernière petite bière en terrasse.<br/>L'appartement est très propre. Parfait pour deux ou trois.<br/>Ilna qui nous a accueilli, a été très sympas et arrangeante pour les heures d'arrivée et de départ.<br/>Je recommande cet appartement.",1,0.5719,Positive
136.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,95.0,0,0.8707832520316201,4.73,4.81,4.88,4.55,1211490901429811494,"Clean, well appointed and extremely well located - was a great place to stay for a week in Berlin.",1,0.875,Positive
94.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,0,6.400067089636734,4.66,4.31,4.58,4.56,1067255733826613148,"Más allá que las fotos y la descripción de la publicación coincidían, y que todo estaba muy limpio y ordenado, quiero destacar la excelente predisposición de René para hacer un check-in más temprano. <br/>Respecto a la ubicación, tiene varias conexiones de transporte público para llegar como para ir hacia el centro. Totalmente recomendable.",1,0.0,Neutral
149.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,96.0,1,4.229035393385889,4.86,4.85,4.86,4.66,1294968726065349773,"Lovely room, with beautiful decor. Check in was very easy, as clear instructions were given. Very close to a Ubahn station so very accessible to other places within the city.",1,0.9294,Positive
40.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,11,98.0,0,2.4809600042725424,4.56,4.5,4.85,4.64,35816059,A great place to visit the city,1,0.6249,Positive
78.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,5.617774919601161,4.79,4.64,4.93,4.7,40663815,"Daniela 's place is extremely quiet and convenient for Central Berlin. We walked all over Mitte and Tiergarten straight from the flat. It is very handy for local services and public transport, and there is a good choice of shops, bars and restaurants nearby. The local park is lovely. The bed is very comfortable e, the flat had everything we needed. We had a very pleasant stay.",1,0.9412,Positive
79.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,9.205613934474908,4.72,4.57,4.52,4.68,2191449,"Bardzo polecam! Mieszkanie czyste, w wygodnej lokalizacji, dobrze wyposażone. Gospodarz uprzejmy, podał wszelkie instrukcje, a kontakt z nim był bezproblemowy!",1,0.0,Neutral
174.0,9,3.0,1.0,8.0,23,95.0,0,4.074167348597395,4.37,4.33,4.48,4.07,767201543860042406,"Good price, good location, very accessible. Very fast response time at first. The flat was like described and like in the photos and was nice.",0,0.9118,Positive
