56.0,2,1.0,4.0,1.0,35,100.0,0,7.942755838655635,4.57,4.46,4.52,4.52,1197644344306709834,Das Zimmer hatte eine angenehme Größe und hatte große Fenster die man auch öffnen konnte. Deshalb war der Raum wirklich sehr hell. (Im Hochsommer wird es aber wahrscheinlich sehr sehr warm im Raum sein - aber bei mir war alles OK). Die Einrichtung ist sehr spartanisch aber alles was man braucht ist vorhanden. Es waren 4 Bäder für 12 Zimmer vorhanden was vollkommen ausreichend war. <br/>Es war auch sehr ruhig weil mein Zimmer nach hinten raus ging. Aber auch die anderen Bewohner waren kaum zu hören.,1,-0.9861,Negative
278.0,12,3.0,1.0,5.0,50,100.0,1,5.961083106152229,4.94,4.94,4.7,4.82,44427430,"Die Wohnung war super! Nahe an Bus und U-/SBahn, sehr sauber und mit allem ausgestattet, was man für einen Aufenthalt in Berlin braucht. Die Lage ist gut, nicht allzu weit vom Brandenburger Tor. Die Wohnung ist äußerst sauber. Die Gastgeber sind sehr professionell, der Check-in ist gut beschrieben und alles ist transparent. Ich würde diese Unterkunft wieder buchen und empfehle Sie gerne weiter.",0,-0.9508,Negative
150.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,29,99.0,0,1.5987121570189835,4.61,4.72,4.53,4.63,9540682,"Preis Leistung top. Trotz Verbesserungspotenzial hier und da, komme ich gerne wieder",1,0.2023,Positive
132.0,7,2.0,1.5,5.0,19,100.0,0,5.21976954146456,4.68,4.4,4.76,4.49,45436574,Berlin tatilimizi harika gecirmemizi sagladi. Evde bizim ve bebegimiz için ihtiyacimiz olan hersey düşünülmüştü. Konumu merkeziydi. Aracimiz icin otopark harikaydi. Evde sadece birkac böcek ve örümcek vardı. Onlar icin ilaclama yapilabilirdi.,0,0.0,Neutral
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,11,100.0,1,7.139415048038419,4.7,4.84,4.74,4.58,1070256698037591744,"Great location and great service, will to book again the next time planning my trip to berlin",1,0.8481,Positive
93.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,39,100.0,1,3.2781637723728885,4.56,4.54,4.61,4.48,1537125,"We had a great stay in the cosy and quiet apartment. Thanks, Karen!",1,0.807,Positive
422.0,6,3.0,1.5,3.0,21,100.0,1,2.1180873876448287,4.95,4.89,4.95,4.86,12120894,"A great place to stay in if you are traveling as a group. Bedrooms are large, there are two toilets, which eases morning traffic when you are in a hurry and the  the living room offers comfy seating for all the guests to relax after a long day in the city. Two bedrooms are facing quiet courtyard, so we could leave windows open for the night. What makes this place great is also the fact that metro station is close by, so all of Berlin in easily reachable. Also there is no need go far for breakfast, lunch or dinner, as there are a lot of very good eating possibilities within walking distance.",0,0.9462,Positive
45.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,27,100.0,0,13.937893468275648,4.63,4.66,4.66,4.57,7838790,It’s a nice place close to a subway station. All you need for your trip.<br/>Parwana is super nice and quick to answer.,1,0.8591,Positive
152.0,5,2.0,1.0,5.0,40,100.0,1,1.5968425433019005,4.81,4.77,4.93,4.69,22677,"Appartamento estremamente funzionale: tanti letti, molto confortevoli, perfetto per una famiglia numerosa o due nuclei familiari.<br/>Ambiente pulitissimo con piacevolissimo giardinetto estivo, utile ovviamente solo durante la stagione calda.<br/>Comodo da raggiungere, comunicazione impeccabile. Noi ci siamo trovati benissimo, sembrava di essere a casa pur essendo in vacanza.",0,0.0,Neutral
76.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,34,100.0,1,3.4687506140659368,4.91,4.88,4.91,4.81,802181640006496668,"I loved my stay here and wish it was longer. The place was comfortable and clean, with everything you could need. The view was wonderful and I felt right at home. Hope to be back soon.",1,0.9595,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,0,2.728500570972652,4.98,4.94,4.95,4.88,8775701,房子乾淨舒服，交通也方便，屋主親切友善，連屋主的小狗也十分可愛，推薦。,1,0.0,Neutral
160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,87.0,0,3.4802565088356308,4.54,4.54,4.6,4.41,43798011,"Casa ordinata e pulita, per raggiungere il centro ci si impiega una 20ina di minuti.",1,0.0,Neutral
113.0,6,2.0,2.0,3.0,31,100.0,1,1.0852899765964672,4.63,4.81,4.85,4.6,8822071,Daniele's place was exceptional. It was a high quality property with a very old fashioned layout which added character. Everything we needed was supplied and we were even given 2 sets of keys as we had 2 different groups. I would strongly recommen this place.,0,0.2732,Positive
139.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,1,3.5852919241394265,4.61,4.65,4.56,4.53,969200,"We enjoyed our stay at Alan and Kasia's place. Everything necessary (the tram stop, grocery stores, nice restorants) are close by.",1,0.5994,Positive
155.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,41,100.0,1,1.2937250483136316,4.69,4.71,4.92,4.47,12047079,Awesome place! Great location and looks exactly like the pictures.,1,0.8999,Positive
