127.0,7,3.0,1.0,4.0,41,100.0,0,4.334292034577571,4.7,4.56,4.77,4.71,1159572,"voordelen: ruim appartement, voldoende informatie over Berlijn aanwezig, rustig gelegen aan een binnentuin achter een wooncomplex, goed aanbod van restaurants in de directe omgeving<br/><br/>nadelen: weinig glaswerk aanwezig, gescheiden badkamer en toilet zou prettig zijn (wij waren met 6 personen), geen buitenruimte (mochten geen gebruik maken van de binnentuin) ",0,0.0,Neutral
129.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,1,1.845762124055973,4.93,4.93,4.98,4.76,4830714,"Marcus (and his associate Kathleen) was (were) very helpful to me. When I arrived, without my baggage, Kathleen called the Airport authorities to make sure that they'd be sending the baggage to the right place; and when the wifi went off in the building one day, Marcus fixed it promptly. All in all, they were excellent hosts!<br/>This is a great apartment with a great location: in the heart of Berlin (the Scheunenviertel), on a street with a lot of activity (cafes, restaurants, galleries, people walking around, etc.). But the apartment is set back in a courtyard so that you don't hear or see any street activity. It is roomy for one or two people.<br/>I highly recommend this apartment, and hope to stay there again on my next visit to Berlin.",1,0.9515,Positive
279.0,6,3.0,1.5,5.0,47,100.0,1,2.705723759735617,4.85,4.84,4.93,4.72,12015708,"This place is great. We loved the location - quiet, calm and beautiful. Also, it’s a great spot to host larger groups - we had four of us and it was comfy. The two bathrooms came in super helpful, too. <br/>Everything was great - no complaints!",0,0.9788,Positive
