85.0,5,1.0,1.0,6.0,29,100.0,1,2.9368733160629987,4.5,4.68,4.56,4.5,341910,Die Wohnung ist in einer Top Lage. Öffentliche Verkehrsmittel waren gut zu erreichen. <br/>Der Check in war auch recht unkompliziert. Die Wohnung hat alles was man für den täglichen Bedarf benötigt.,1,-0.8979,Negative
55.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,0.8025330705337501,4.79,4.94,4.83,4.77,11403270,"Ece's place was lovely and exactly as pictured/described. Her mum made me feel very welcome, although I would say it was very useful for communication that I knew a little German! I didn't stay long enough to use the kitchen apart from for water, but the bathroom was spotless with a strong shower, and the bed was very comfortable. There were also a good amount of plug sockets in the bedroom, and the balcony was lovely for some fresh air in the morning. Transport was great since the station was five minutes' walk, and I could also walk into town. Basically everything I needed for a couple of nights' stay.",1,0.9881,Positive
