180.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,45,85.0,0,1.5095289909770313,4.75,4.84,4.9,4.6,45475252,"It‘s a more like an aparthotel, rather small (even the cutlery is reduced to a minimum) and not quite as cozy as „real“ apartments can be. On the other hand it was very clean, has everything one needs and is very well situated. I would definitely recommend it.",1,0.939,Positive
