240.0,6,3.0,1.5,6.0,68,100.0,0,8.6581709098516,4.86,4.79,4.67,4.69,15993543,"Great apartment, high ceilings and lots of light, 3 large bedrooms with a lovely big shower bathroom and kitchen with everything you need. It is very quiet at night. The location is very convenient for travelling to all the sights. A 5-10 mins walk to the supermarket and restaurants and take aways (great kebabs and Lebanese restaurants) and a local food  hall /market for sit down drinks and eats.",0,0.836,Positive
68.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,22,100.0,1,6.594298777125843,4.71,4.76,4.39,4.65,16469975,"We couldn't agree more with the other positive comments given here! Nice and clean and excellent communication with the host. All you need for a stay was there, nothing missing. And if some visitors think the apartment may not be centrally located: it is located in a part of town where ""Berliners"" live, and not only tourists to be seen. Neukölln is a special and interesting area in the city and certainly worth a visit in itself!",1,0.9677,Positive
110.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,35,80.0,0,2.3934343952153427,4.91,4.94,5.0,4.83,50774478,"Sehr schöne, saubere Wohung auf zwei Etagen mit schöner Terasse. Stilvoll eingerichtet in toller Lage. U-Bahn, Restaurants, Cafes, Supermarkt usw. alles in unmittelbarer Nähe. Die Wohnung ist mit allen ausgerüstet was man braucht - außer Vorhänge!! - Sehr angenehmer Kontakt mit Nele. Genaue Anweisungen für die Ankunft und einige Tips für die Umgebung. Danke.",1,-0.9229,Negative
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,14,100.0,1,7.2262726361870016,4.82,4.94,4.68,4.73,673762508454266400,"Maja und Mark haben die Wohnung mit den für einen Aufenthaltet nützlichen und sinnvollen Dingen ausgestattet. Alles befand sich in einem ordentlichen Zustand. Man fühlte sich willkommen. Die Lage am Südkreuz ist bestens und schafft gute Möglichkeiten für Unternehmungen. Im Bahnhof befinden sich u.a. ein Lebensmittel- wie auch Drogeriemarkt. Trotz Lage an einer Straße und unweit der Bahnstrecken (S-Bahn, DB) lässt sich prima schlafen. Im Haus gibt es noch Mitbewohnerinnen und -bewohner, die unter Umständen ""hörbar"" sein können. Ansonsten ist die Wohnung nur zu empfehlen.",1,-0.9485,Negative
117.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,43,96.0,0,6.177149581820329,4.55,4.47,4.83,4.48,40606892,"The apartment is as described, basic but functional and a good value for the neighborhood. The neighborhood is convenient, close to the center city and museums. <br/>The staff needs to up their game. This is the first Airbnb we have used where they neither met you at the property to answer questions nor had anything in writing to give information about restaurants or other amenities in the neighborhood. But we did text and ask for restaurants. The suggestions were dives though eventually we did find nice restaurants . We asked if the washer was a washer/dryer and how to use it and got an answer 2 days later while we were at the airport.",1,0.8922,Positive
153.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,39,94.0,0,3.1018817858877528,4.6,4.67,4.67,4.53,721519891726691474,super,1,0.5994,Positive
165.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,1,3.476496254708396,4.93,4.91,4.75,4.62,817473,"This apartment was a perfect place to stay for an extended trip in Kreuzberg. Spacious, clean, and wonderfully located. The balcony was a serious perk on sunny days, and the huge windows were  excellent for rainy days.",1,0.9552,Positive
93.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,2.54678149398414,4.86,4.96,4.9,4.84,3187735,"We've had a great stay in Barbara's apartment in Berlin! Barbara welcomed us with a glass of wine and the apartment, situated in a lovely neighborhood, was equiped with all the necessities we needed. Thanks, Liya & Marijn",1,0.9259,Positive
