59.0,1,1.0,1.5,1.0,46,100.0,1,16.1308900339473,4.85,4.76,4.8,4.87,2639933,"Andrea is a very welcoming host, I felt like ""home away from home"".  She also has advice on what to do in the surroundings.<br/>The bathroom and my room were very clean and I liked the breakfast which Andrea made for me. I never left the house hungry.<br/>As mentioned in the listing, Andrea has a cat and a small dog. Both are very calm, I hardly realized that they lived on the site, they don't enter the guest rooms.<br/>The area is a quiet residential area with town houses. I felt safe walking to and from the station (Messe Süd) when it was dark.",1,0.9455,Positive
