75.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,39,100.0,0,4.853840450584974,5.0,4.75,5.0,5.0,1365554795354558158,"We had a wonderful time staying with Irène. The room was very well decorated, the bed was comfortable , and the house felt very homey. We loved having a nice bathroom, with access to our own washing machine. The views from the balcony are a pocket of paradise in amongst the bustling suburb we were in. Irène had great recommendations for things to do and food to eat nearby. It was also very nice being close to some of the best clubs in berlin like kikat club and berghain! The only struggle we had was trying to get our luggage up the staircase, however, we had quite heavy luggage. The surrounding area can be busy and loud at times, but we still felt safe walking through the streets at night.",1,0.9664,Positive
