125.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,0,4.603581647858559,4.93,4.93,4.79,4.86,24915589,"Sultani was very friendly and replied fast when we had questions. The apartment was very cozy, spacious and we loved the decoration. The location was perfect. Nearby a metro station, nice bar's and cafe's. The Karl-Marx-Strasse is a busy street but with the windows closed it's quiet enough. Even when it's getting warmer the apartment had a nice temperature to sleep in. We would definitely return! 100% recommendation!",1,0.9557,Positive
66.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,25,100.0,1,12.69261644647349,4.9,4.89,4.68,4.85,2602460,"Flora is a lovely host, quick to respond, and helpful. She is thoughtful as she shared with us a piece of cake. <br/>Her place is clean, spacious, cosy and comfortable. The place is convenient since it is near the bus stop and metro. <br/>One of the best Airbnb  I've ever had. Thank you once again Flora😊 You and your place are truly highly recommended.",1,0.9778,Positive
