91.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,39,100.0,1,7.548749049597583,4.75,4.64,4.56,4.76,51168783,Really enjoyed our stay here. It was the prefect location for us and very close to public transit such that we could easily get around. Quanquan was very helpful and communicative. The apartment had everything one needed for a longer term stay in Berlin and lots of places to sit to do remote work (including an actual desk with a desk chair). Would especially recommend this place for longer terms stays in Berlin.,1,0.8974,Positive
88.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,80.0,0,4.3965704421174285,4.79,4.7,4.87,4.68,4361737,"Dor was a very welcoming & friendly host! The airbnb itself was very comfortable & situated in a very good location, near many bars, restaurants and clubs.",1,0.9294,Positive
183.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,53,100.0,1,5.599016268041934,4.95,4.96,4.44,4.79,42697557,"Beautifully presented apartment, looks exactly like the photos. Comfortable and spacious. Large double bed, very comfortable. Very handy to have a full kitchen and laundry facilities in the building. Very close to the bus stop and 5 min walk to train station. A few supermarkets near by, it has everything you need.",1,0.8977,Positive
156.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,0,2.2531285722967658,4.58,4.63,4.73,4.47,49844243,Sehr schönes und sauberes Apartment. Sehr gute Lage und guter Service. Wir konnten den Aufenthalt genießen.<br/>Hat alles hervorragend geklappt.,1,0.0,Neutral
115.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,96.0,1,5.993845357255435,4.81,4.85,4.87,4.7,1317969234836996610,Good,1,0.4404,Positive
70.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,12.86304269897694,4.93,4.97,4.89,4.88,18014187,"My wife & I stayed here during our honeymoon and this place is one of the best Airbnb’s in all of Europe! Location is fantastic. It’s located in West Berlin, in a quiet neighborhood away from the hustle and bustle of Mitte & Warschauer Straße but close enough to S-Bahn & U-Bahn (about a 10 minute walk). The apartment was very clean and bed is very comfortable. There is access to the elevator, however, the private entrance to the apartment requires one to go up five flights of stairs. Communication with both hosts was great! Definitely looking forward to our next trip to Berlin and would stay with at Patrick’s place again.",1,0.9765,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,0,4.398411661361795,4.83,4.86,4.81,4.8,13910233,"True home away home. Quiet but central with nature surrounding, easy communication with host, easy check in and out, thoughtful host she is. :) I will stay there again without any doubt.",1,0.9621,Positive
