64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,6.303469422976989,4.92,4.81,4.59,4.84,1521826,"Leider haben wir David nur kurz vor dem Abschied zu Gesicht bekommen, aber dafür die ganze Wohnung für uns, was auch nicht schlecht war. Wir haben uns sehr heimelig gefühlt und wir hätten uns nicht mehr wünschen können. Gerne wieder!",1,-0.8439,Negative
83.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,10.673228650460064,4.77,4.92,4.75,4.72,671958,"I had an amazing stay at Christine’s place, located in the heart of Berlin. Christine was so nice and welcoming, always up for a good conversation around a delicious cup of tea she offered and giving great Berlin recommandations. Her place was perfect, clean, and very well located in a nice and calm neighbourhood. I definitely recommend her place and I hope to come back!",1,0.9927,Positive
