81.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,6.919397234051426,4.82,4.86,4.48,4.7,20890869,"Schönes kleines Apartment, süßer Innenhof, gute Ausstattung.<br/>Lage ist gut, jedoch ist man definitiv auf Öffis angewiesen. <br/>Ohne Aufzug für Menschen mit Behinderung oder im Alter etwas schwieriger Zugang im 4. Stock.<br/>Alles in allem aber nur zu empfehlen, gerne wieder!",1,0.0,Neutral
144.0,4,1.0,1.0,0.0,25,100.0,0,1.036353653063746,4.7,4.92,4.93,4.79,1151188256067275968,"We had a great time staying here. Perfect location - right next to the train station. Place was very clean, everything you would want and expect out of a place to stay. However, it was EXTREMELY hot in our room. We reached out and we were brought a fan within minutes and they explained that their cooling system is turned off automatically based off of the outside temperature. It was so hot to the point where we barely got any sleep. I think it would have been the perfect place to stay had it not been so hot. Everything else was amazing, just miserably hot.",1,0.9595,Positive
