64.0,2,2.0,1.0,1.0,8,100.0,0,1.1089699971149662,4.73,4.72,4.87,4.82,191023,"Anne was a very nice and friendly host. She answered all my questions and helped me getting around in Berlin. Also very appreciative with me for standing up very early in the morning (one day of my stay she was also in the flat) and even for f*cking up her electricity (luckily it came out that this was a known problem already, so not my fault :), just a light switch that did what it wanted to do). The flat was clean and big enough for short stays with a great view over Berlin from the 17th floor. I can recommend to stay at Anne's place to anyone who wants to visit Berlin. It's also very central and you get to the underground or bus in a few footsteps. For longer stays space might get a bit narrow but that's nothing that downgrades the rating. Thank you Anne! Would stay at her place again.",1,0.9236,Positive
