193.0,5,1.0,1.0,5.0,26,99.0,0,9.070811946860156,4.28,4.35,4.74,4.28,34893511,"Für ein Wochenende total okay, du super zentral am Ku‘damm gelegen. <br/>Am Wochenende kann es durchaus laut sein nachts, da direkt darunter eine Bar liegt. Falls man einfach nur eine Schlafmöglichkeit sucht ist es okay. <br/>Preis finde ich jedoch zu hoch, für das was es ist.",1,0.7717,Positive
176.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,2.6109738907158704,4.83,4.91,4.9,4.75,28510664,"Wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt im CALMA Berlin Mitte. Die Mitarbeiter waren so toll. Dafür gebe ich 10 von 5 Sternen 😊<br/>Die Lage ist top. Man muss nur sagen, dass die Berliner Feuerwehr ganz in der Nähe ist und das kann man bei dem Aufenthalt dann schon hören. Wir haben zum Städtetrip da und da hat es uns nicht so gestört.",1,-0.7906,Negative
63.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,17,100.0,1,7.046080746237584,4.83,4.91,4.63,4.83,625702680054205813,"Mina was a great host. This is my second time booking from Mina’s apartment and she never failed to provide excellent service and direct response. <br/>There were minor issues with the apartment (shower head etc.) given that I was the first one living there. However, Mina was extremely helpful and fixed them in no time. <br/>Besides, the apartment is very clean and much nicer than the pictures. The bathroom is huge. The garden is also beautiful and this is a great place for work.<br/>Highly recommended!",1,0.9829,Positive
85.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,20,100.0,1,12.132524029038608,4.81,4.73,4.81,4.78,10644579,Very good!!!<br/>Ideal apartment for small family. <br/>Located just by side of a super market. <br/>Next time we are in Berlin… we will simply book here again.,1,0.6981,Positive
201.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,54,100.0,1,1.3558603428081426,4.88,4.9,4.77,4.74,13755615,"Nice apartment that is well located. Metro station a few meters walk away! All the necessities were present in the apartment.  Furthermore, Sven's communication to us was excellent.",0,0.8356,Positive
