123.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,1,1.17460082517367,4.83,4.8,4.9,4.74,238396,Great Place. Quiet at night. Excellent location.,1,0.8316,Positive
45.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,25,100.0,0,13.535801688042048,4.53,4.51,4.72,4.47,53160614,"Everything was fine, easy to find and get inside. The room is very small but Ok for a few nights. The only minus was that the TV was very bit but very silently set. This couldn't be changed, I suppose the owner did it that you couldn't disturb the other guests. But so, you also couldn't listen well enough which made the wondeful big TV a bit useless. I believe that, if I had contacted the host, he would have changed it. But as it is not so important for myself I didn't want to disturb him. The thing is: perhaps other guests want to listen while watching...;-)<br/>The kitchen and bathroom were OK, clean and sufficient. In the house it was very quiet, outside a bit noisy.<br/>Thanks for the stay, I can recommend it.<br/>A.P.",1,0.9172,Positive
300.0,9,3.0,1.5,4.0,54,100.0,1,2.312156644109463,4.9,4.85,4.95,4.81,10043384,"Apartment is nicely appointed, spacious, and in a great neighborhood near public transit, a park, and many restaurants.  Our host, Werner, communicated clearly and timely prior to our stay. Upon arrival, he spent almost an hour with us going through the apartment and sharing some tips/places to see in Berlin. It was a great experience for our family!",0,0.9508,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,16,100.0,0,3.009304989278752,4.44,4.48,4.78,4.5,519671,You would want to be assured that all repairs that guests have mentioned have been carried out. Then it would be a much better place to stay.,1,0.6908,Positive
117.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,20,100.0,1,10.209896781107588,4.84,4.66,4.83,4.7,1027362900230673217,Die Unterkunft entsprach der Beschreibung und für unseren Kurzaufenthalt war sie ideal. Die Kommunikation mit Volker war reibungslos und angenehm. Die Umgebung angenehm ruhig und bequem zu erreichen. Sehr empfehlenswert.,1,-0.9524,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,0,9.536308717239486,4.7,4.63,4.47,4.67,24039534,"Jörg ist ein aufgeschlossener und freundlicher Gastgeber. Das Haus liegt in ruhiger idyllischer Lage. Dennoch ist das Zentrum Berlins schnell erreichbar. Die Zimmer bieten alles, was man braucht um sich wohl zu fühlen. Gerne wieder!",1,-0.636,Negative
96.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,53,100.0,0,3.047161883343627,4.61,4.77,4.61,4.5,687582,This apartment was perfect for our long weekend in Berlin. Comfy bed and lovely little balcony to chill in the sun. Host was lovely and easy to get in touch with. Good location for walking/public transport to the centre. Would definitely love to stay here again when returning to Berlin. ,1,0.975,Positive
75.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,0,9.261861550789751,4.84,4.99,4.55,4.8,17968986,"Sehr sauber, die Gastgeberin ist freundlich und entgegenkommend.",1,-0.5994,Negative
84.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,18,88.0,1,3.2402791774170403,4.77,4.89,4.92,4.69,16183018,great location and helpful check in and out <br/>apartment is very small but functional <br/>looks bigger in pictures,1,0.5346,Positive
64.0,2,2.0,1.0,1.0,10,100.0,0,11.196854566622646,4.64,4.85,4.88,4.75,7037153,"AMAZING. My boyfriend and I have just stayed at Fraukes for our 3 day Berlin trip and were extremely happy with the accommodation. Firstly, it is in a beautiful, classy area with loads of wonderful restaurants, shops and 2 minutes from a train station. <br/>Frauke is a lovely and interesting host, you feel like you could talk to her for hours. She is also very helpful, and easy to get hold of should you have any questions. Check out time is 12 which was fine, but she kindly allowed us to keep our suitcase in the flat for a couple of hours whilst she cleaned so we could enjoy Berlin luggage free a little longer. <br/>The flat itself is impressive, smartly decorated, very clean and has everything you need. We loved Berlin, and will be looking to stay at Fraukes again when we return. ",1,0.9943,Positive
99.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,5,100.0,1,2.925293123927428,4.95,4.97,4.82,4.76,852097021727498326,Danke für den kurzen Aufenthalt.,1,0.0,Neutral
