64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,10.635367556695002,4.76,4.8,4.8,4.72,26943619,Hans was a friendly and polite host. The check-in was smooth and easy and the room clean & tidy. The flat is located in a quiet street with fast access to the city center (15min by bus). Would definitely recommend!!,1,0.9272,Positive
64.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,100.0,1,15.846363887643118,4.73,4.61,4.57,4.84,23509544,Reiner seems like a very nice and hospitable man.<br/>I was sorry to have arrived in such a state of confusion and with so little time to settle in. <br/>Hope all is well and want to thank Reiner for being so helpful so late at night.<br/>Juliet,1,0.8912,Positive
295.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,45,85.0,0,1.5095289909770313,4.79,4.83,4.91,4.64,45904559,"We stayed at Numa Nook just for 2 nights but the experience was overall very good. Our apartment was really nice, spacious, fully-equipped and sunny. I would say perfect also for longer stays. Cleanliness was appropriate (not the best ever but more than acceptable). The location was great, in the very center of the city, and the instructions (about the check-in and how to find the apartment) more than clear. Communication was continuous and super-easy: they kept us updated about every aspect of our stay by means of a WA chat.<br/>The only “issue” we had was with the luggage storage: even if some of the lockers in the room on-site were free there was no key. We decided to use one of the external partners they have (less than 10 mins walking) but we had some troubles in finding it since there were no signs (it was in the end a small phone shop that looked closed). All good at the end of the story!<br/>Overall I really recommend the stay in Numa Nook.",1,0.9909,Positive
213.0,8,3.0,1.0,5.0,31,100.0,1,5.600860807992449,4.67,4.61,4.63,4.55,17384054,"Great place, close to the underground. Lots of bars and restaurants around. Left very happy.",0,0.8439,Positive
112.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,1,7.03606664813505,4.84,4.94,4.63,4.75,926670,"I stayed at Arzu & Tom for a 1 week trip to Berlin with some friends and our experience was great. The apartment is within a few minutes walk to a bus station and the U9 line which makes it really easy to get around the city from here. There are restaurants, cafes and bars around the area for the days you don't want to travel that far. The apartment was tidy, quiet and well equiped and Arzu & Tom were great hosts, always ready to help.",1,0.9664,Positive
95.0,7,1.0,1.0,3.0,33,100.0,0,4.793849952314026,4.57,4.28,4.88,4.5,12723428,It is really cozy apartment. Very clean and comfortable with convenient access to good cafes and public transport.,1,0.8576,Positive
