66.0,1,1.0,1.0,0.0,30,100.0,1,2.267672407491822,4.93,4.95,4.98,4.88,6113576,"Thanks to Ulf’s home, my first visit to Berlin felt truly comfortable. Even while walking through the city’s unique streets, I would find myself thinking, “Ah, time to head back home,” as I pictured the yellow building in the heart of Mitte. That’s because Ulf’s place didn’t feel like an artificially decorated B&B—it felt like a real, warm space where he actually lives.<br/>The conversations I had with Ulf at his home were also very memorable. The time I spent with him became one of my most cherished memories in Berlin. His only flaw? That he didn’t tell me he’s a great cook! (I only found out by reading other reviews.) If you stay here, I hope you’ll also cherish the time you get to spend with Ulf. <br/>Just like he’s always been, I’m sure he’ll be a wonderful host to you. And I hope you’ll be a good guest to him, too.",1,0.9911,Positive
68.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,22,100.0,1,1.5015867319599838,4.82,4.88,4.9,4.77,4362839,Ottima posizione sia dall'aeroporto che per il centro. Host gentile e disponibile. Bagno super pulito e camera impeccabile. Casa con temperature ottimale.,1,0.5994,Positive
