138.0,5,0.0,1.0,3.0,39,100.0,1,2.860188071088701,4.95,4.96,4.94,4.84,17855915,Great apartment. Clean and well kept.,1,0.836,Positive
130.0,4,1.0,1.0,5.0,22,99.0,0,3.852471644606984,4.74,4.59,4.8,4.62,25936092,"Nette Wohnung in Berlin, die ihren Zweck erfüllt, und sauber. Basic-equipment ist vorhanden. Gute Kommunikation mit den Hosts im Vorhinein, eindeutige Instruktionen vorab bzgl Check-in. Kostenpflichtiger ‘early Check-in’/ ‘late check-out’ kam für uns nicht infrage. Das Hochbett quietscht laut, wenn man sich oben dreht. Es fehlen Haken zum Aufhängen von Handtüchern, Jacken usw  (im Bad, Küche, überall). Alright value for money in Berlin for this location.",1,-0.6124,Negative
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,4.168083698931513,4.83,4.86,4.66,4.71,499353,"We had a great time at this apartment. It's really close to all the important sights, even on foot. Also there are plenty of supermarkets and restaurants in the area. The apartment itself was clean, roomy and nicely furnished. The shower was very good and the bed was huge and really comfortable. Karsten is helpful and will provide many tips, maps and instructions. I recommend this to anyone looking for a short stay near the center of Berlin.",1,0.9747,Positive
68.0,2,0.0,0.0,1.0,21,100.0,1,3.132943292576071,4.86,4.68,4.88,4.81,979758,"Jurriaan is a great host. His flat is perfectly located. We had a great time. I recommend Jurriaan to all, who would like to visit Berlin.",1,0.9545,Positive
98.0,6,3.0,1.0,3.0,20,100.0,0,5.5596434050489405,4.71,4.72,4.73,4.72,29675993,"The apartment was clean and tidy, near an underground station and walking distance to everything you needed. The description was accurate, and price excellent for what you get. we had a great stay and was perfect for 5 people for a long weekend in Berlin. When we left some items in the wardrobe, Martin went to find them and organised their return to the UK. <br/>Some slight disturbances from the street outside as the bedroom windows are at ground level, but not the end of the world. The only improvements could have been bigger towels, but at least they were provided!",1,0.8639,Positive
40.0,1,0.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,11.034398061498583,4.65,4.83,4.45,4.68,714312," Wir haben Oksana angerufen als wir an der Unterkunft eingetroffen sind, sie war innerhalb von 15 Minuten da, um uns die Wohnung zu übergeben. Sie war sehr freundlich und hat uns auch gleich alles gezeigt. Im Haus war es ruhig ,keine Probleme mit den Nachbarn. Die Wohnung war sauber und es war auch alles so wie im Inserat beschrieben. :-) Wir kommen sehr gerne wieder und bedanken uns bei Oksana für den reibungslosen Ablauf. LG Sandra und Familie",1,-0.9799,Negative
112.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,42,100.0,1,2.97782445506794,4.86,4.91,4.87,4.74,22275529,"The place was clean and just as described – the photos are accurate. Great location if you love Kreuzberg – as I do (maybe avoid Görlitzer Park after dark though). The apartment is peculiar, with a basement and a first floor connected by large stairs and the entrance to the shower in the bedroom, but that's all according to the description and to me part of its charm. Gregor was perfect in his communication, fast, clear and friendly.",1,0.9719,Positive
133.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,50,100.0,1,3.0324799569322254,4.81,4.72,4.94,4.67,1125880662586950111,"Lovely apartment in a great location with easy access to the tram to central Berlin.<br/>Exceptionally clean and comfortable. <br/>Plenty of restaurants in easy walking distance.<br/>For people with health issues, be aware there are several flights of stairs and no elevator.",1,0.9552,Positive
178.0,12,2.0,1.0,6.0,34,100.0,0,4.365326736224875,4.39,4.42,4.26,4.08,39264252,Die Gastgeberin ist sehr freundlich und hatte uns bei Fragen stets geholfen. Jedoch wurde uns nicht das richtige Zimmer für welches wir bezahlt hatten vermietet (ärgerlich!). Vor dem Haus liegt sehr viel Müll und Schrot rum. Im Großen und Ganzen war’s okay aber würden nicht nochmal kommen.,0,-0.5093,Negative
139.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,1,3.3244676042943366,4.95,4.92,4.91,4.79,19652167,"Martin's place was perfect for our needs. We were visiting family a few blocks away is a lovely neighborhood filled with cafes, shops, beautiful residential buildings. There's a sprawling  local park nearby with paths and a pond where we photographed swans, ducks, and song birds. Also a short walk to a canal and lovely bridges. Convenient to grocery stores, a pharmacy, and all transportation – we visited many museums, galleries, and exhibits. The apartment is nicely designed, located on the ground floor facing a charming courtyard. We appreciated the attention to detail and comfort. Everything was neat, clean, and easy to navigate. Eva met us at the door when we arrived and she was very responsive to anything we needed. Martin provided excellent communication from the time we booked. Very professional team. We would definitely stay again if we return to Berlin!",1,0.9922,Positive
50.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,2.7124641454032274,4.82,4.58,4.93,4.66,31203061,Sauberes freundliches Zimmer zum Wohlfühlen…<br/>Guter Kontakt vor dem Einchecken!,1,0.0,Neutral
94.0,5,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,1,2.1120432937326656,4.78,4.65,4.89,4.72,1814192,Great appartment!! It was very clean and nice flat! You can reach most of the attraction by foot and otherwise there are bus & subway  in front of the flat! There is also a supermarket and nice restaurants.  I advise you this flat to spend a great time in Berlin!,1,0.9714,Positive
87.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,26,60.0,0,6.381010109583203,4.62,4.59,4.84,4.61,43541550,Appartement situé à une demie heure à pied du centre historique. Calme. Lumineux. Bien équipé. Restaurants et supermarchés à proximité.,1,0.0,Neutral
72.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,53,100.0,1,4.173322316586879,4.95,4.91,4.9,4.81,594731577761973352,"De kamer was van alle gemakken voorzien, super mooi en super schoon. De locatie was te gek. Er zijn allerlei winkels, cafés en leuke restaurantjes in de buurt. Daarnaast zijn Paolo en Manu super gastvrij en was het heel fijn om in hun huis te verblijven. Wij komen zeker weer terug!!",1,0.9229,Positive
27.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,1,10.521832862201624,4.94,4.95,4.77,4.92,4982472,- super nice Hosts<br/>- very clean and quiet,1,0.8655,Positive
254.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,68,100.0,0,2.570512922063975,4.96,4.78,4.93,4.74,706469663252604646,"Gustav’s 2 bedroom apartment is incredible. Will definitely be staying here again next time I’m in Berlin. Everything was clean, modern design equipped with everything you’ll need from an automatic espresso machine to a Peloton. It’s also conveniently next to a train stop so getting here from the airport is a breeze (only 1 transfer and takes about 40mins).",0,0.4939,Positive
149.0,4,3.0,1.0,5.0,31,0.0,0,8.155448061817273,4.6,4.73,4.71,4.59,14618013,Sehr gute Lage. Gute Restaurants direkt in der Straße. Wohnung wie abgebildet. Alles top!,0,0.2714,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,31,100.0,0,0.7153474208381966,4.81,4.65,4.92,4.63,12016452,Sonja is really available for any questions. The place is very nice and  clean. We  really loved the living room with its high ceiling and the natural light. This place is perfect for 2 or 4 people. Highly recommended!,1,0.9574,Positive
54.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,11,100.0,1,5.259652982108338,4.82,4.9,4.9,4.81,2657671,Was in Berlin on my own and felt super safe at Ivo & Ramona’s place. You have your own entrance so you have a lot of privacy as well - definitely can recommend for solo female travellers! And of course everyone else:),1,0.9245,Positive
92.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,48,100.0,0,0.4676368215827225,4.98,4.9,5.0,4.89,22982188,"Anis Wohnung ist der perfekte Ort für einen Kurztrip nach Berlin. Die Buslinie 100 fährt direkt vor der Tür und bringt euch zu allen wichtigen Sehenswürdigkeiten. Auch alle anderen Orte in Berlin sind sehr gut erreichbar (vor allen Dingen, wenn man auch vorhat auszugehen). Ani ist eine sehr umsichtige Gastgeberin und hat uns richtig gute Restauranttipps gegeben, von denen wir auch direkt Gebrauch gemacht haben. 100%ige Weiterempfehlung!",1,-0.636,Negative
47.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,26,100.0,0,13.72252668419708,4.51,4.6,4.69,4.51,7828523,Really comfortable room! Great location,1,0.85,Positive
159.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,95.0,0,4.132850367965358,4.39,4.36,4.47,4.23,43811867,"Perfekte Lage, alles bestens. Check in ist einfach und ich wurde sogar vorab angerufen und gefragt, wie ich einchecken möchte.",1,0.0,Neutral
183.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,53,100.0,1,5.599016268041934,4.95,4.96,4.44,4.79,42697557,"We had such a lovely stay at downtown apartments! The apartment was beautiful, we loved all the little details and it was super clean. The bed was super comfy, it had a fab power shower and the kitchen had all the bits and bobs you'd need if you wanted to eat in! Our host was super friendly and made us feel right at home! ☺️ The only downside was the area but its super easy to commute with stations only a few minutes away!",1,0.9808,Positive
149.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,95.0,0,0.8707832520316201,4.6,4.84,4.94,4.52,1211495325815600084,"Uitstekend verblijf, perfect in orde met alle nodige voorzieningen. Prima ligging om de stad te verkennen.",1,0.5719,Positive
97.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,30,100.0,0,11.802360039233566,4.59,4.62,4.66,4.39,50259416,"Ilona’s place was very comfortable, clean, and complete with all of the amenities. I also appreciated how quick her turnaround time was to make a last-minute reservation. I highly recommend staying here, and I would do so again!",1,0.9179,Positive
138.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,0,1.922981274848583,4.58,4.44,4.73,4.44,546417520591682575,Very nice apartment to stay in Berlin. Close to Alexanderplatz and other vicinities. Great restaurants in walking distance. <br/>Very clean and comfortable. Serves 1-2 guests easily. Might be a bit cozy for more.<br/>Good value for money.,1,0.9516,Positive
114.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,1,1.7854128309165902,4.85,4.78,4.89,4.75,17741498,"Fijne en gunstig gelegen woning om Berlijn te bezoeken. Lopend ben je zo in Mitte of Alexanderplatz, de U bahn en bussen zijn vlakbij. Wij komen graag nogeens terug.",1,0.0,Neutral
267.0,10,3.0,1.0,9.0,26,100.0,0,4.0467674194843655,4.35,4.32,4.73,4.09,12541792,Nice place. We stayed for two nights and everything was as advertised. Host very friendly and helpfull with everything we asked. Quiet place in a good neighbourhood with good distance to main objectives. Would definetly recomand!,0,0.9078,Positive
167.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,0,4.149945021768397,4.93,4.88,4.89,4.74,701909,"Es war einfach traumhaft. Lorant ist ist sehr entgegenkommend und ein Mann mit Still. Seine Empfehlungen waren der Wahnsinn. <br/>Das Loft ist liebevoll eingerichtet, sauber und bestens ausgestattet mit allem was man braucht. Die Lage ist ebenfalls top. Wir wären am liebsten für immer geblieben -definitiv eine Perle diese Wohnung.<br/>Danke dir und bis bald Lorant!",1,-0.807,Negative
151.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,94.0,0,3.1018817858877528,4.67,4.77,4.78,4.52,721527807549293451,"We had an excellent stay. The location was good for us and the room was great. A free baby crib was provided for us during our stay, and free luggage storage was provided for the rest of the day after checkout. The only issue was getting the baby stroller up and down the half flight of stairs between the street entrance and the interior elevators. If there was some way to avoid this, it was definitely well hidden. Still, the place seemed like an incredible bargain for Berlin on short notice! Would definitely stay again, but with a lighter stroller.",1,0.9223,Positive
112.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,1,7.03606664813505,4.84,4.94,4.63,4.75,926670,"Superschöne Wohnung , stilvoll und sehr gut gelegen. Absolut weiter zu empfehlen! Sehr nette Gastgeber!",1,0.0,Neutral
68.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,50,100.0,0,6.026516407626963,4.74,4.76,4.48,4.7,6808626,"Es war ein wunderbarer Aufenthalt bei Birgit. Das Gartenhaus ist sehr gemütlich, ruhig gelegen und schick eingerichtet. Wir freuen uns schon auf den nächsten Aufenthalt. Vielen Dank für Alles! :)",1,-0.2942,Negative
313.0,12,4.0,1.5,9.0,39,100.0,0,2.117982678328675,4.62,4.34,4.84,4.49,54035917,Tolles Apartment mit Bars und Restaurants in direkter Nähe.<br/>Ideale gelegen um Berlin zu erkunden.,0,0.0,Neutral
248.0,8,3.0,1.0,7.0,28,100.0,0,1.9204539822657205,4.62,4.62,4.9,4.52,6708791,The flat is ok and well placed.,0,0.5106,Positive
172.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,30,100.0,1,2.086859632126843,4.87,4.87,4.94,4.71,306312,"Uns hat es sehr gut gefallen. Gute Lage, gut ausgestattet und sauber. Wir hatten insgesamt einen tollen Aufenthalt. In der Beschreibung ist vermerkt, dass das Gepäck bei früher Anreise bzw. später Abreise deponiert werden kann. Dies ist jedoch nur beschränkt möglich und in Abhängigkeit der anderen Gäste. Wohnung im 3. Stock ohne Aufzug ist in der Beschreibung nicht vermerkt, war für uns jedoch kein Problem.",1,-0.765,Negative
59.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,50,100.0,1,6.553717964125431,4.89,4.8,4.82,4.82,45522353,"Before I arrived, communication with Ahmend was easy and prompt. Within minutes of booking his place, I received a message from him with all the information I would need (e.g. wifi, for checking in, etc.). When I arrived, I found the place sparkling clean. Ahmed took the time to show me where everything is and how everything worked, especially in the kitchen. Also, his apartment is extremely well situated and is more than worth the price. If you're looking for a place to stay in Berlin that is well situated and owned by a gracious host, don't hesitate to book here! I can't recommend it enough.",1,0.9465,Positive
167.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,0,4.149945021768397,4.93,4.88,4.89,4.74,701909,"Excellent hosts, with a place that is a beautiful melding of clean industrial design and warming, comforting accents and plants. <br/>Loved my  time there, and Lorant and S were so responsive and genuinely helpful to my needs and inconvenienced themselves to make my stay easier.<br/>i could not give a higher recommendation.",1,0.962,Positive
273.0,15,4.0,2.0,12.0,39,100.0,0,6.1262846843500816,4.66,4.61,4.34,4.56,14588206,"El apartamento es estupendo,  amplio,  luminoso y bien acondicionado.  Fiel a las fotos. La anfitriona atenta y muy agradable. El metro está a 50 metros la línea U1 y a 150 la U2. La calle es pintoresca pero muy tranquila a cualquier hora. La estancia ha sido muy recomendable.",0,0.34,Positive
125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,1,6.168784529557198,4.75,4.14,4.64,4.64,1101290117512050296,Verlief alles super und problemlos,1,0.5994,Positive
103.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,34,100.0,0,4.458320368303789,4.43,4.36,4.78,4.42,1096250876336497093,"I had a wonderful stay at Nihat’s apartment in Berlin! The place was spacious, cozy, and very clean—exactly what I was looking for. The location was perfect, in a great neighborhood!",1,0.9199,Positive
104.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,95.0,0,11.76101483447752,4.71,4.73,4.83,4.64,1082348067317396988,"Sehr angenehmer Aufenthalt, sehr sauber, schnelle Kommunikation. :)",1,0.4588,Positive
140.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,1,3.2989117833003925,4.64,4.71,4.63,4.57,322463,"We loved the decor and the cosiness, and the studio was plenty spacious for a family of four. We particularly appreciated all the information and tips that Alan and Kasia sent us before our trip, which meant we could plan our visit and include sights and restaurants we wouldn't otherwise have discovered. Prenzlauer Berg is a fascinating neighbourhood that we really enjoyed exploring, in addition to the better known sights of Berlin. Public transport links are good, especially the M4 tram which leaves from just around the corner and goes to Alexander Platz and Hackescher Markt.",1,0.9656,Positive
136.0,2,0.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,1,1.977233020880486,4.91,4.93,4.72,4.73,533864,"Ben’s place makes a very good home for your stay in Berlin. The apartment is very spacious and clean, with a nice balcony for warm evenings. Ben’s an excellent host with very helpful suggestions to enhance your stay. I can recommend this apartment without hesitation.",1,0.9636,Positive
125.0,6,3.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,0,1.7664996995469473,4.93,4.5,5.0,4.43,50341973,"Gorgeous apartment in a perfect location. Initially I was a bit disappointed not to be able to find anything reasonable in the Kreuzberg neighborhood, which I had heard was the place to be. However, I’m couldn’t have been more pleasantly surprised! The Prenzlauer Berg neighborhood was very cute, with lots of great restaurants. I highly recommend checking out Ushido if you’re into meat, and Plant Base if you’re not.  <br/>More importantly, it’s super connected to everything! Very easy to get everywhere fun in Berlin starting from the tram stop that’s steps from the front door. <br/>The place was clean, and communication was super quick and easy. Tomer was very friendly, helpful, and flexible. And the apartment is just gorgeous, lots of space and character. And since it’s a real, lived-in apartment, it has all the amenities you need (well-stocked kitchen, plenty of towels, cutlery, etc.). <br/>We couldn’t be happier with our stay in Penzlauer Berg!",0,0.9949,Positive
64.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,99.0,0,1.5720582450088727,4.65,4.79,4.58,4.62,25496270,"Dobry i cicha lokalizacja, nowoczesne wnętrza i duże pokoje",1,0.0,Neutral
422.0,4,2.0,2.0,2.0,57,88.0,1,13.095134324844064,4.95,4.98,4.85,4.85,1016525687008446860,The best apartment i have ever stayed in.  The modern architecture is amazing. Location is cool but 15 minutes to the centre. There is a cafe in the building was delicious. Everything was great.,0,0.9542,Positive
58.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,42,100.0,0,3.835736178845096,4.61,4.58,4.66,4.54,31629992,Great communication and a great location. Easy access to transport.,1,0.9022,Positive
94.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,1,2.8921931319330847,4.83,4.85,4.85,4.62,37081059,Nice place,1,0.4215,Positive
68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,13,87.0,0,7.867349248126775,4.54,4.66,4.52,4.53,3970161,"Absolutely recommended! The room is really delicious and treated in detail. Clean, tidy, comfortable. Also a note of credit goes to Barbara and Alexander with their friendliness made us feel at home! Professional and good!",1,0.966,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,52,100.0,1,7.03121545057233,5.0,4.86,4.57,4.57,1332608899012999730,"Our stay was absolutely wonderful! The location is very convenient and makes getting around easy. The apartment is spotless, thoughtfully decorated, and full of tasteful design details that create a high-quality atmosphere. The host was extremely friendly and helpful, with smooth and pleasant communication throughout. Overall, the experience exceeded our expectations — highly recommended!",1,0.9727,Positive
366.0,6,3.0,2.0,4.0,44,100.0,1,4.24670072100672,4.87,4.96,4.51,4.72,16245894,"Great apartment right in the middle of an extremely vibrant area. The apartment looks just like in the pictures: very clean, spacious and modern. The entire process, including check-in, check-out and the communication with the host was extremely smooth. Thomas was very helpful. If you are planning to stay a few days in Berlin, I definitely recommend checking out this property.",0,0.9665,Positive
59.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,12.619497882063683,4.85,4.8,4.71,4.76,729604965457117074,"Very kind, but it's impossible that I don't have a spare key to the apartment... it was a big problem!",1,-0.3602,Negative
125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,1,4.126131739074772,4.93,4.92,4.87,4.82,26768369,"We felt very homy at Doro's place. It is very spacious, tidy and special. We haven't missed anything and enjoyed every moment of our stay. The location is in the heart of Kreuzberg in walking distance to restaurants, markets, Görlitzer park, the canal, cafes, bars and night clubs. Highly recommended.",1,0.8394,Positive
105.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,0,7.833386708780405,4.71,4.7,4.61,4.59,18863113,Had a great stay here in Berlin! The host is very helpful and responsive.,1,0.882,Positive
213.0,8,3.0,1.0,6.0,51,100.0,0,2.843819999999603,4.76,4.68,4.82,4.55,53940835,Great location - close to S & U bahn stations as well as shopping & restaurants.,0,0.7351,Positive
110.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,1,5.643910676118197,4.69,4.7,4.72,4.4,31047671,"Cute, comfortable and clean apartment in the middle of Pankow. <br/>Very central - 10min walk to Various S-Bahn stations (Wollank Str or Pankow) as well as supermarkets (Rewe).<br/>Landing (or taking off) planes to (or from) Tegel airport are a bit irritating - as for all people living in Pankow. They adhere to the night curfew from 23h to 07h though.",1,0.7964,Positive
134.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,95.0,0,0.8707832520316201,4.78,4.8,4.87,4.68,1211489198315095154,"Muy recomendable el alojamiento. Limpio, bien ubicado, y con check in programable. Cumplió con las expectativas al 100%",1,0.0,Neutral
363.0,16,5.0,1.5,10.0,49,93.0,0,9.499488236705036,4.47,4.3,4.34,4.26,17077519,"Das Apartment war wie beschrieben. Wir waren 9 Personen und fanden für jeden einen geeigneten Lieblingsplatz. Die Kinder waren vor allem von der Schaukel begeistert. <br/>Es gab genug Geschirr, Betten, Platz, Stühle etc für uns und noch viele mehr.<br/>Lediglich die Ofensituation ist nicht für große Menues gedacht.<br/>Fragen wurden sofort  beantwortet, es gab immer einen Ansprechpartner. <br/>Insgesamt hatten wir eine Menge Spaß in einer großzügigen, raffiniert arrangierten Wohnung die uns alles bot was man für einige Tage braucht.",0,-0.9246,Negative
77.0,2,1.0,1.0,0.0,32,100.0,1,4.708440491627809,4.91,4.47,4.85,4.71,3643460,"We hebben genoten van ons verblijf. Ook al hebben we niet heel veel gebruik gemaakt van de accomodatie, omdat we de stad aan het ontdekken waren, heeft Filippo ons zeer thuis laten voelen. De instructies waren zeer duidelijk en bij vragen, was Filippo daar om die beantwoorden. Al met al een prachtige woning, met een mega ruime kamer en een fijne host. Ik raad deze woning, met deze host, iedereen aan. Bedankt Filippo!",1,-0.636,Negative
63.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,100.0,0,2.4712708553295943,4.83,4.76,4.91,4.83,7758924,"Staying at Gabrieles amazing place was a great experience. She was the perfect host, and the cats also :) The appartment is beyond fantastic and situated perfectly close to everything you need in Kreuzberg. Can recommend!",1,0.9781,Positive
144.0,3,1.0,1.0,3.0,18,99.0,0,8.88272809968877,4.17,4.28,4.69,4.24,46114906,"Was ok for 3 guys, chilling one week in berlin.",1,0.2732,Positive
115.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,33,97.0,0,1.9683104537901628,4.47,4.29,4.82,4.29,1108845196795317596,"My friend and I had a short 2 night visit in Berlin. The apartment serves the purpose, nice location with public transport and restaurants&cafes nearby.  Check in went smoothly, clear instructions and easy to find.<br/>What was slightly bothering though, that on the check out day the cleaner starts ringing the buzzer after 9am in the morning. <br/>We didn't know who would that be so we left it. Later it rings again and on the third time at 10:30 we opened the door.  To announce that that yes we will leave by 11:00 o'clock at check out time. Lana already checked that on the previous day.<br/>All in all a good place to stay in Berlin.",1,0.9359,Positive
305.0,9,2.0,2.0,9.0,29,99.0,0,8.905377534529459,4.3,4.5,4.71,4.41,45854967,The actual Air BNB itself inside was nice. It meant our needs. <br/>The receptionist was terrible. We got there 10 min before 3pm and they told us we needed to wait for 10 min. 15 minutes later I went and asked what the hold up was and he told me to wait 5 more minutes cause they were changing shifts. If check in is at 3pm and I paid for the room then it should be at 3pm!!’ <br/>They were not nice nor helpful. <br/>The one guy barely looked up from his phone when we asked questions or to get the wifi access. Our room was alittle tricky to find and they didn’t not help us with directions on how to find it. <br/>People were all around our entrance and windows the whole time. I got out of the shower to someone sitting in the window seal. Also someone clipping there toe nails in the window seal. There were people sitting right out side our front door pretty much our whole stay. <br/>As far as location. It was Perfect for our needs and visit to Berlin.,0,0.8447,Positive
64.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,0,10.896454123672829,4.72,4.08,4.53,4.72,44078312,Good place to stay the night.,1,0.4404,Positive
95.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,32,100.0,0,5.528260251923685,4.68,4.57,4.84,4.59,45998917,It is a spacious flat in a center of Berlin with very easy access by metro. It's hiper clean and with kitchen equipped with everything one needs for short or longer stay. Grocery shops are couple minutes away. <br/>Lars is very proactive and communication is very easy and very friendly. We have enjoyed our stay chez Lars very much.,1,0.9582,Positive
