125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,0,3.607414614374613,4.85,4.94,4.81,4.76,41954411,"Lovely and stylish apartment in a more quiet part of Kreuzberg! Although the apartment is located on the 1st floor and faces the street side, it was very quiet and peaceful at night! It's close to all nice restaurants and bars, and it's very easy to commute from there with the U-bahn. Definitely recommend this place for your next stay Berlin!",1,0.9603,Positive
