179.0,5,2.0,2.0,3.0,45,100.0,1,3.405358028442921,4.79,4.5,4.88,4.76,1031613426370662223,"Loved the apartment! It has industrial feel to it but we loved the quirkiness of the space. It was super clean and has everything you need in it.  There was four of us -  1 couple and 2 singles and we found the apartment really spacious. Location  had plenty of choices for food/bars.  We had stayed in Mitte previously but much preferred this neighbourhood, we felt like we were in Berlin!  Communication was brilliant as well.",0,0.984,Positive
