318.0,8,3.0,1.5,5.0,53,100.0,1,3.7256422035937673,4.95,4.94,4.85,4.83,13320037,Family of 5 with teens- all of us found Sven’s place to be a home away from home. It was incredibly spacious and well equipped. The gourmet kitchen was so appreciated and all of the appliances are top notch. The home is a beautiful example of preserved historic beauty and none of us wanted to leave. The showers were always hot with excellent pressure and the bathrooms were extremely clean. Thoughtful attention went into the soaps provided as well.<br/>We walked to most of the sites within the area but when it was cold and rainy we had no issue finding close public transport. The neighborhood was safe and quiet minus a night of ambulance runs to the hospital around the corner. Neighbors were quiet to the point that we wondered if anyone else was present. <br/>We would definitely recommend staying here and will book again when we come back to Berlin to visit friends.,0,0.9741,Positive
72.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,1,13.869679371452936,4.9,4.89,4.63,4.75,48181314,Very big space. High ceilings. Beautiful shower.,1,0.5994,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,45,100.0,0,1.996224444395112,4.83,4.75,4.86,4.81,3608625,"Jose's apartment is located in what was formerly East Berlin and being set on the top floor of a tower block, it offers a stunning view over the city, whatever time of day, it's a magnificent site. It's a short walk from some of Berlin's major attractions, but there's also a metro station right opposite the building, letting you get practically anywhere within minutes.<br/>My girlfriend and I didn't get to meet Jose, but we were greeted by his cleaner, and although she didn't speak English, she was able to show us the basics, and leave us with the keys.<br/>The apartment itself is simple but has everything you need; a decent sized bathroom, a kitchen which overlooks the large living room and an equally large bedroom. There is a private balcony running past the living room and bedroom, where you can smoke (if you're a smoker) and admire the amazing view.<br/>There is a LIDL supermarket and a few other grocery shops a few minutes walk from the building, so you don't have far to go for your day to day essentials.<br/>We visited during a particularly cold march, but the apartments central heating kept us cosy on the colder nights.<br/>Just a note for anyone with allergies: The apartment features feather pillows on the bed and sofa, so if you suffer with allergies I'd recommend going to the local TKMAXX and buying a cheap  hypo-allergenic pillow for about 10€. <br/>",1,0.9377,Positive
72.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,8.690106845303559,4.76,4.75,4.61,4.64,9356063,침대도 푹신하고 내 집 처럼 편안하고 다음에 베를린 간다면 다시 갈 의향 있습니다,1,0.0,Neutral
