78.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,0,8.9505494061986,4.92,4.94,4.8,4.88,4424125,"Saido’s place is fantastic! Very central in Berlin, good connections via different U-Bahn lines and not far from the S-Bahn. There are lots of restaurants, cafes and shops in close walking distance. The little kitchen has everything you need to cook comfortably for 2 and it is a quiet house, so no noisy neighbours and even with the windows open, the traffic noise is not bad at all. Saido is a very helpful host and was always at hand if there was a question. Check in was flexible and the check out uncomplicated. The whole place is very clean, there were extra sheets to swap your bedding yourself during a longer stay. Having access to a washing machine was very handy and we had a very reliable wifi connection. It was getting quite cold when we were in Berlin, so we didn’t make much use of the balcony, but it is a very nice added feature and I bet lovely in the more summery months. We thoroughly enjoyed our stay (we stayed 4 weeks) and will definitely book again.",1,0.9823,Positive
