125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,3,100.0,0,2.1555788461567267,4.83,5.0,4.67,4.33,8589516,"Gemütliche Altbau-Wohnung, die verkehrstechnisch mit 2 Trambahn-Linien sehr gut angebunden ist. Netter Kontakt mit Vermieterin, die in diesem Fall zwar selbst nicht anwesend, aber immer gut erreichbar war. Hat alles gut geklappt.",1,-0.9136,Negative
360.0,7,3.0,1.0,4.0,63,70.0,1,1.458418773500483,4.85,4.94,4.83,4.7,29509865,Bra boende med bra placering,0,0.0,Neutral
75.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,38,100.0,0,8.876261981994013,4.92,4.75,4.92,4.83,21453122,"Loved staying at Magdalene's place. She is so friendly and nice to talk to. Always very helpful. The apartment is spotless, spacious and even better than described. Would love to come back any time.",1,0.9693,Positive
132.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,47,100.0,1,3.5149528601016367,5.0,4.98,4.69,4.8,861592510465916798,"Helle und geräumige Albauwohnung, netter Host. Direkte Nachbarschaft nicht die allerschönste, dafür viele Einkaufsmöglichkeiten und sehr gute Anbindung mit öffentlichen Verkehrsmitteln. Berlin Mitte in nur wenigen Minuten mit Linie M4 zu erreichen.",1,-0.5994,Negative
356.0,6,3.0,2.0,6.0,23,33.0,0,2.270003192530576,4.89,4.83,4.91,4.72,16153411,"Extremely spacious apartment, irreproachably clean and very well equipped. Yael makes you feel right away at home and in a beautiful one.",0,0.8399,Positive
302.0,8,2.0,2.0,4.0,22,100.0,0,1.8693244287052848,4.67,4.6,4.94,4.52,1085314077755107955,"My friends and I had a wonderful stay in the accomodation. The area it is located in is a beautiful part of Berlin. There is a large host of restaruants, cafes and other attractions all within walking distance. The apartment itself was extemely comfortable. We felt right at home from when we entered and it made out trip even more enjoyable. I would highly recommend this accomodation to anyone",0,0.9712,Positive
71.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,92.0,1,4.49512738085394,4.89,4.98,4.75,4.68,34091731,"Airy and nicely decorated, high ceilings and lovely spaces.",1,0.7717,Positive
67.0,6,1.0,1.0,3.0,44,70.0,0,6.808312019480818,4.43,4.17,4.4,4.49,1405939,Bee was really friendly and easy going. Her place looks more like a stylish café than a simple flat. We all had the feeling that the flat was an artist's space. She gave us a lot of tips about the bars and the markets all around the neighborhood. Our room and private bathroom were really confortable and very large. If only the flat had been a little bit cleaner it would have been perfect! Thanks Bee! ,1,0.9556,Positive
56.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,5.179021895059785,4.9,4.95,4.89,4.77,27397593,"It was a great stay. I highly recommend Olga’s place. <br/>It is situated in a great location. I could not ask for a better place to stay. <br/>Room as well as other amenities as described. <br/>Olga also was flexible with checking in and out, open to individual arrangements which was a bonus.",1,0.9441,Positive
117.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,5.178102411356815,4.81,4.76,4.73,4.56,3686192,We had a pleasant and wonderful stay at Remi´s place. The organization went well and the kitchen has enough equipment to make yourself an unforgettable and awesome midnight-snack. I can totally recommend his place for everyone who is able to climb some steps.,1,0.9432,Positive
132.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,97.0,1,1.9977573269292777,4.73,4.71,4.73,4.57,36037847,We spent one night in the Old Town Hotel and it was a good stay. The room was clean and comfortable. It is right next a tram station and there are good stores in the area.<br/>Thx for having us!,1,0.902,Positive
282.0,9,4.0,2.0,5.0,63,100.0,1,13.845543965045303,4.75,4.69,4.67,4.69,22218048,"We had a great stay. Plenty of space and a well equipped apartment. We also appreciated that most of the rooms are to the back of the house so very quiet despite this being a good, central location. <br/>Excellent also to have a park right at the doorstep and a range of different restaurants, supermarkets and coffee places in walking distance.<br/>Would definitely come again and strongly recommend Soren's place!",0,0.9285,Positive
190.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,0,6.800564426780606,4.91,4.71,4.86,4.86,771675862741242014,"Patricks Wohnung beeindruckte uns mit ihrer Weitläufigkeit und Eleganz. Die Dachfenster waren perfekt für die Sommerhitze, ließen die Luft zirkulieren und hielten den Raum kühl. Die Betten waren sehr komfortabel, was für erholsame Nächte sorgte.<br/>Ein leichter parfümierter Geruch war anfangs vorhanden, verflog aber schnell nachdem wir die Fenster geöffnet hatten. Für Allergiker ist es allerdings gut zu wissen.<br/>Die Wohnung ist nicht besonders kindersicher, das ist vielleicht für Familien mit kleinen Kindern von Interesse.<br/>Die Kommunikation vor der Ankunft war herausragend. Patrick und sein Freund Erich, der uns empfangen hat, waren unglaublich zuvorkommend und gingen auf alle unsere Fragen ein, was den Aufenthalt noch angenehmer machte.<br/>Insgesamt ist diese Wohnung eine exzellente Wahl für alle, die Komfort, Raum und herausragende Gastfreundschaft suchen.",1,-0.9864,Negative
150.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,0,2.995556241133994,4.89,4.82,4.86,4.77,753152,Absolutely beautiful apartment!! Such gorgeous light during the day and lots of space. We will be back next time we are in Berlin,1,0.8682,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,93.0,0,4.132403574870102,4.42,4.56,4.6,4.28,41336107,"This hostel is very good for your short stay in Berlin,  I highly recommend it, it was very clean and also we had a large double room. <br/>The reception was very nice and the check in was very easy and flexible.",1,0.9471,Positive
67.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,38,100.0,1,9.589987916493834,4.79,4.49,4.68,4.78,26546193,"Die Unterkunftsbeschreibung entspricht zu 100% dem was man vorfindet, jedoch ist es nicht sauber. <br/>Z. B. eine verkalkte Dusche, nicht abgewischte Fronten und Oberflächen in der Küche und eine Klobürste die man nicht benutzen kann…<br/>Desweiteren gibt es keine wirkliche  Möglichkeit oben die Eingangstür abzuschließen, dies sorgte dafür dass wir uns etwas unwohl fühlten. <br/>Wir möchten noch die Dachterrasse positiv erwähnen.",1,-0.9485,Negative
106.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,15,97.0,1,3.587299160900769,4.83,4.82,4.72,4.8,21018456,"Un hôte sympathique, accueillant et prévenant. L'endroit est un peu excentré mais très sympa avec un parc en face. Pas mal de transport à côté. Interieur de l'auberge nickel et calme, rien à redire. Très bonne expérience :)",1,0.4588,Positive
81.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,6.919397234051426,4.82,4.86,4.48,4.7,20890869,"Thank you, Babett for a wonderful stay at your beautiful Moabit residence.<br/>My plan was to bring my bike on this trip, but I wasn't able to get things sorted in time. I thought this might throw a wrench in the location and how easy it would be to access things, but there are so many buses and trains around to help me get to where I needed to go. The area itself is also quite walkable, and I was able to rent bikes nearby for a few days. <br/>Unfortunately, I was sick the first two days I arrived, but the apartment had everything I needed to be comfortable and rest. Things were very clean, and there was a variety of tea that really helped me feel better. Thank you for that! <br/>The kitchen is fully stocked for cooking too, and I had fun making meals the nights I felt better. The bright orange interior is fun and cheerful. <br/>The apartment has so much light and a great view out the window.",1,0.9949,Positive
97.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,26,100.0,0,3.0813108173309143,4.76,4.85,4.78,4.67,6891866,Très joli appartement dans cartier calme. Parfait pour un séjour à Berlin.,1,0.0,Neutral
237.0,11,3.0,1.0,4.0,57,100.0,1,9.660413858650209,4.93,4.97,4.46,4.83,16252509,Aan te bevelen plaats om Berlijn te ontdekken. Gastvrije host en zeer mooi appartement. Dichtbij openbaar transport.,0,0.0,Neutral
228.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,1,7.42457626093921,4.87,4.88,4.87,4.76,648932373954864346,"What an epic location and apartment. The views are amazing and inspiring. Sitting at the desk, seeing the TV tower and statues in the park, as the sun sets... <br/>Wonderful.<br/>Siggi is a great host, communicative, and clear. His mother helped welcome me to the place, and she was equally fantastic.<br/>Strongly recommend staying at Siggi's when you visit Berlin!",1,0.9589,Positive
163.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,91.0,0,4.871252294318258,4.67,4.78,4.87,4.53,46864858,Great stay!,1,0.6588,Positive
138.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,1,3.671947948282572,4.97,4.92,4.81,4.72,1149412238763981338,"This is a great location to enjoy Berlin, you’re very close to the Mauerpark and right in the middle of Prenzlauer Berg. <br/>Everything is very new in the apartment, the host was super friendly and we felt at home. Recommended for anyone wanting to explore Berlin.",1,0.9451,Positive
296.0,6,3.0,2.0,5.0,29,100.0,1,6.97282351203588,4.92,4.9,4.55,4.7,14335678,"We had a great stay in Berlin and Babett's place is  spotless  and very spacious.  Thanks, we will come back.",0,0.8062,Positive
80.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,0,14.740259241210865,4.74,4.77,4.57,4.68,14619469,Erika ging aus ihrem Weg uns zu helfen und machte unseren Aufenthalt sehr angenehm.<br/>Erika is a very kind and thoughtful host. The apartment was super clean and surprisingly spacious. We enjoyed peaceful nights in this quiet and beautiful neighbourhood.,1,0.977,Positive
96.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,6.753647389093091,4.84,4.84,4.86,4.69,37703913,"Jen's place is cool, very well equipped and clean! It's also in a Fantatic area! The guests in the hotel upstairs coming and going can be quite noisy, and I would also admit that the boar on the wall was pretty unnerving haha, but would defo recommend!",1,0.8841,Positive
68.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,28,100.0,1,6.576517854147013,4.72,4.76,4.31,4.63,36310980,Everything about this place was wonderful. Very clean and lots of considerate touches that make a big difference. The place is a quiet oasis from the excitement of the busy Neukölln neighbourhood. <br/>Highly recommend.,1,0.9359,Positive
256.0,4,2.0,2.0,3.0,48,100.0,1,6.558096529092969,4.98,4.92,4.92,4.9,24746106,Great stay. Bernd has been very flexible to meet us while our travel plans changed. Great contact. Perfect apartment. <br/>We loved it,0,0.9583,Positive
102.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,7,100.0,0,2.0473022471534725,4.82,4.72,4.97,4.8,997825,"Julia's flat was unique and had everything one could need.  It was extremely cozy and had tons of character.  Lots of little things to look at all around.  The location couldn't have been any better in Prenzlauerberg.  A plethora of restaurants, bars, and shops right outside the front door.  Would definitely stay there again if I am in Prenzlauerberg.  Thanks Julia!",1,0.8313,Positive
99.0,2,1.0,1.0,3.0,46,100.0,1,11.604485324856196,4.79,4.93,4.81,4.68,4462848,"Wir haben uns gegen Strand und Berge und für eine entspannte Zeit in der Hauptstadt entschieden -  schon bei der Ankunft in der schönen Goethestraße sind wir positiv überrascht worden.<br/>Neben einigen kleinen Cafes und Restaurants gibt es auch einen klasse Spielplatz, der natürlich besonders unserem Sohn sehr gut gefallen hat.<br/>In Brits Appartement gelangt man durch einen sehr schönen Hausflur. Alles war sehr sauber und wir haben alles vorgefunden was das Herz begehrt. Saubere Betten, sauberes Bad und am wichtigsten stabiles WLAN und Netflix ... :-)<br/>Liebe Brit, danke für deine Gastfreundschaft und auch deine schnelle Hilfe als wir uns versehentlich ausgesperrt haben.<br/>Hoffentlich bis bald, aber bis dahin alles Liebe und Gute.<br/>Julian, Jes & Luis",1,-0.8126,Negative
198.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,39,100.0,1,3.617036290600905,4.86,4.85,4.9,4.75,27627221,"Fantastic location - lots of things in walkable distance, quiet neighbourhood <br/> We will be back and stay longer!",1,0.5983,Positive
137.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,1.189406824976013,4.86,4.84,4.93,4.79,264459,"Très bel appartement, propre et bien situé, et Henrik était très sympathique! Je recommande fortement",1,0.0,Neutral
223.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,47,100.0,1,4.116733808652775,4.98,4.99,4.81,4.83,668157595596321506,"Katarina was so friendly, and helpful. We appreciated the help with booking taxis with a child, and the nice snacks and hair products that she dropped off when we noticed there wasn’t any conditioner. <br/>It is definitely a very noisy street, so be prepared to close the windows at night and wear ear plugs.",0,0.9576,Positive
171.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,44,90.0,1,11.510851452846596,4.78,4.8,4.79,4.66,699820589487993617,"We had a great stay in this central Berlin apartment! The place was clean, quiet, and had everything we needed. The hosts were very responsive and helpful. Having a laundry room was a big plus, especially since we were in town for an event. Would definitely stay here again!",1,0.9427,Positive
170.0,6,2.0,1.0,6.0,54,100.0,1,13.891160580271904,4.81,4.68,4.77,4.65,22217844,A beautiful apartment. You feel immersed in Berlin as it isn’t in a particularly touristy area. Convenient to transport links making it easy to navigate the city.  Sören and Nina were very accommodating hosts.,0,0.7783,Positive
91.0,3,1.0,1.0,3.0,62,100.0,1,4.234690151841083,4.99,4.97,4.95,4.95,47211361,"Wir haben zu zweit 3 Nächte hier verbracht und können die Unterkunft nicht nur weiterempfehlen, sondern würden selbst wieder kommen! Sauber, gemütlich und alles da was man brauch! Sogar Kleinigkeiten waren für uns da: Kaffee, Milch im Kühlschrank usw! <br/>Wir haben uns sofort zuhause gefühlt<br/>Danke!<br/>Swetlana & Denise",1,-0.7243,Negative
