125.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,33,100.0,0,1.059061581070652,5.0,4.82,4.94,4.76,13612707,"Janina really made sure we were all set nice and cozy in her apartment.<br/>Her apartment is very well located, definitely big enough to host 4 adults. As one previous comment says, one room is a ""kid's room"", with an elevated bed about 1 meter off the ground. Although not extremely wide nor long, the bed's dimensions were big enough for my wife and I to sleep in it no problem.<br/>I truly recommend staying at Janina's for your sojourn in Berlin!",1,0.9221,Positive
185.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,1,5.110131267958084,4.94,4.97,4.69,4.78,938954131166779003,"Zeer goed appartement, ruim en comfortabel. Grote REWE supermarkt om de hoek, net als een geweldige biertuin. Ook OV is zeer dicht bij dus eigenlijk alles wat je nodig hebt voor een weekend Berlijn. Contact met Meera was ook goed en reageert op alles heel snel.",1,0.0,Neutral
