88.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,0,12.760805103334942,4.7,4.76,4.71,4.68,1574592,"A very positive and helpful welcome from Mrs W.<br/>The flat is spacious,comfortable and well equipped.<br/>The area is quiet and felt safe, residential so not a great deal of choice in the immediate vicinity for places to eat or shop. Lidl is about a 10 minute walk.<br/>The U and S Bahn are just across the road so easy to get to centre of the city.",1,0.934,Positive
130.0,4,0.0,1.0,4.0,38,100.0,0,8.787895304173501,4.2,4.13,4.27,4.27,633716638433307000,"The apartment was spacious and the neighborhood was nice and quiet. There was good and free parking in the yard for a car. The nearest metro stacion is about 1,5km away and the bus stop across the street. This is good place to stay for its price.",1,0.8658,Positive
161.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,44,100.0,1,3.550833267755717,4.84,4.83,4.66,4.49,33803119,"The place is really cool and well located. The sofa bed wasn't super comfortable, but still did the trick. Couple of downsides: the blackout did not work in the living room, so if you're sleeping there, plan on blocking the sun with eye masks. Also, we didn't have wifi, but I guess this is quickly corrected. Overall, recommended spot with beautiful decoration in a nice area.",0,0.7966,Positive
