82.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,3.929915771235159,4.89,4.9,4.96,4.86,20660494,"The flat is super well located, in a cool trending neighbourhood. The market right outside the door is a luxury one would love to have on a daily basis. Both Uta and Nora were fantastic and made us feel super welcome. The appartment is small but very clever with a layout that allows you to forget how small it actually is. Even though it is a basement, it has a surprising amount of light. The kitchen is well equiped and, in general, all the spaces are up to date. Great experience, will surely come back!",1,0.9837,Positive
