258.0,10,2.0,1.0,5.0,57,100.0,1,9.660413858650209,4.92,4.88,4.5,4.77,16254081,"The place was spacious, clean and close to the S-bahn. The tablet with information about the place and the surroundings is very helpful. We had a great stay.",0,0.8718,Positive
69.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,0,16.70263956090648,4.95,4.9,4.95,4.81,878134133002416779,"Britta ist eine äußerst freundliche und zuvorkommende Gastgeberin. Sie ist sehr gut organisiert, Kommunikation läuft schnell, effizient und freundlich. Die Unterkunft ist sehr modern, hell und komfortabel. Ich habe mich gleich wohlgefühlt und komme gerne wieder. Herzlichen Dank!",1,-0.8687,Negative
64.0,2,2.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,3.70356951818102,5.0,4.89,5.0,5.0,15197627,"The location of the house is in a nice neighborhood and the room is huge. Paz was travelling and couldn't meet her in person but she was very good at communicating and making sure the stay is comfortable. Both her roommates took very good care and are very friendly people. You will enjoy talking to them. If you wouldn't mind climbing up the stairs for four floors, it's a great place to stay for your visit in Berlin.",1,0.9912,Positive
422.0,14,3.0,1.0,4.0,73,100.0,1,30.5227146555326,4.5,4.36,4.5,4.21,49850122,"Let me start with the positives: The boat and location are nice. The deck is spacious. The skipper is friendly. All in all we enjoyed the day on the boat. <br/>However, 3 issues were quite troublesome: 1) the listing was incorrect. There were no sauna, nor hot-tub as advertised!. The host explained  it will be installed next week. We got a refund through airbnb. Another claim that is inaccurate was 12 person accomdation,  max is 8:  3 double beds + sofa bed. The skipper explained that they add two inflatable mattresses, but i think there is no space for it anywhere. <br/>2) as soon as we made the booking, the host informed us we had to check out as early as 8.30 am, as a soccer team booked the next day. He offered to check us in early in exchange.<br/>3)we booked for 6 for the night, but had guests coming over for lunch on deck.  it turned out that he charges extra for additional guests during the day. We paid for extra guests. Kids had 50% discount<br/>Conclusion: nice but extremely overpriced.",0,0.458,Positive
67.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,21,100.0,1,23.132772944210583,4.89,4.9,4.6,4.87,42419001,Es war alles zu unserer vollsten Zufridenheit.,1,-0.5994,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,100.0,0,2.470169768821385,4.69,4.54,4.9,4.73,2377008,"Kilian's house is in the center of the city, near most of the distinctive places of Berlin, for example: Branderburger Tor, Friedrichstraße,... I loved his flat. It was charming and comfortable. <br/>As to Kilian, he was so friendly and we had the chance to go out with him to take some beers and we talked with him in a relaxed way. <br/>Without a doubt I will return to his house whenever I get the opportunity.",1,0.9666,Positive
