87.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,0,7.498812090064871,4.93,4.91,4.74,4.79,40703325,"Le logement est très agréable, très propre et bien équipé. La chambre est spacieuse et confortable. Daniel a été très sympathique, accommodant et discret. Nous avons beaucoup apprécié qu’il nous laisse l’intégrité de l’appartement les deux derniers jours. Le quartier est top! Je recommande.",1,0.2714,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,100.0,0,12.901074216761966,4.92,4.7,4.89,4.92,24227976,"We had a really great time at Toms place. It was clean, near to city center and the host was really kind to us. And we also loved those books that were almost everywhere 😍",1,0.9402,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,100.0,0,2.1954107998506305,4.64,4.64,4.75,4.58,320305,"Nice stay at René's apartment. Easy communication and helpful host, I definitely recommend this place ! ",1,0.9184,Positive
137.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,1.6809549157543209,4.96,4.95,4.95,4.83,2061212,"We had a lovely stay at Kitty's apartment. Prenzlauer Berg is great (lots of restaurants, cafes, bars, grocery store) within walking distance and central for walking or riding bikes to other neighborhoods. I loved sitting on the balcony in the courtyard. The kitchen setup is basic but you can make breakfast and simple meals. Very nice bathroom, clean and full of artwork. I would definitely stay here again.  ",1,0.9586,Positive
112.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,1,7.03606664813505,4.84,4.94,4.63,4.75,926670,"Great communication with Tom who met us for an 830pm key turnover. He even volunteered to carry my wife's 20kiloish heavy suitcase up several flights of stairs. Place is clean, with strong wifi and completely stocked with basic essentials. There are several restaurants and convenience stores along the 5 min walk to the metro. We felt safe in the neighborhood. <br/>Thank you Tom for answering all my questions and arranging an early morning taxi pick up to Tegel airport on our last day. ",1,0.9186,Positive
72.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,0,3.600844804908074,4.95,4.85,4.93,4.87,39581826,"Alloggio ottimo, in una buona posizione di Berlino 👍🏻",1,0.0,Neutral
163.0,6,0.0,1.0,6.0,39,100.0,1,4.186767269218949,4.9,4.96,4.95,4.71,23731129,"die lage ist top! direkt am mehringdamm. in der umgebung gibt es tolle lokale, ess- und einkaufsmöglichkeiten. außerdem kommt man mit der bahn schnell in andere viertel. die wohnung ist sehr geräumig. man kann die betten auseinanderziehen, jeder hat genug platz. die küche ist gut ausgestattet und hat sogar eine spülmaschine und es gab eine minibar. es ist eine kellerwohnung was uns zu spät aufgefallen war, aber wir fanden das halb so schlimm. allerdings musste man deswegen die fenster auf der seite zur straße geschlossen halten. ansonsten sehr netten kontakt zu berno und alles hat gut geklappt!",1,-0.9755,Negative
95.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,53,100.0,0,13.015239763492993,4.61,4.29,4.55,4.59,684491013825440916,"Gihad war sehr nett und es hat alles super geklappt. Das Zimmer ist klein aber fein und das Bett ist sehr gemütlich. Das Bad ist recht klein und die Dusche könnte eine Tiefenreinigung vertragen, aber insgesamt war ich sehr zufrieden!",1,-0.9117,Negative
106.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,1,4.255037723745734,4.87,4.86,4.88,4.75,42486058,Fabulous apartment in a lovely quiet neighbourhood. The ideal retreat after a busy day exploring the city. Some fab breakfast places nearby and on the way to the main attractions and some great restaurants also for when you return back to the apartment.,1,0.9694,Positive
