175.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,54,100.0,1,1.816434876784729,4.91,4.82,4.95,4.72,17876581,"Location, location, location. You cannot go wrong with this area and the loft is spacious and beautiful! The five flights of stairs is a bit much with large luggage but consider it daily exercise. :-)",1,0.7557,Positive
