65.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,2.142649937740168,4.91,4.94,4.96,4.89,446975,"I stayed in the little coach house during the Berlin Marathon and it could not have been more perfect. Not only was it sparkling clean, it’s special, tucked away spot with private garden made it the perfect place to relax and unwind, especially post marathon! Kerstin and her helper Karsten were extremely efficient and speedy with communication. The location was perfect with plenty of lovely coffee shops and bars as well as great transport links less than 3 minutes walk away - heaven. I am already planning my trip back and hope to stay again. Thank you Kerstin!",1,0.9929,Positive
