320.0,10,5.0,2.0,7.0,33,100.0,1,6.97282351203588,4.92,4.93,4.43,4.77,16183489,Alles gut,0,0.0,Neutral
92.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,0,2.7850220743469896,4.82,4.83,4.89,4.68,249419,"We appreciated Frank’s responsiveness, the fact that he left us a great bottle of wine and the fire cracker for New Year. Also the fact that we could use his bikes was very nice of him.<br/>However the price value of his appartment (not loft) really was not OK. Although having booked for thee days we moved to a hotel after the first night. In our opinion the apartment is oversold under the  ‘artist’ pretext. The (older)  pictures on the airbnb site are conceptually photographed giving a misleading impression regarding size and comfort. At that price, we expect at least  3 things from an Airbnb apartment A) Comfortable bathroom with good showers B) Clean Floors C) Hotel quality bed ... unfortunately we were dissapointed on all three.<br/>We shared this feedback with the host straight away asking for him to make a gest vs. our dissapointing experience and the fact that we deciding to move out after the first night. Instead of reaching out in a caring way, he defended himself under the ‘artist pretext’ and had no understanding for our issues. This was a pity.",1,0.9694,Positive
142.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,52,98.0,1,2.2099121550415086,4.87,4.92,4.95,4.72,9707618,"We kwamen vroeger aan en Stéphanie beloofde ons om de bagage vroeger in het appartement te plaatsen. Dit liep perfect, om 14u konden we intrek nemen en kregen we een uitgebreide uitleg inzake de faciliteiten. De locatie, netheid, etc... een aanrader voor iedereen!!! ",1,0.6784,Positive
174.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,1,2.3237413988868294,4.75,4.87,4.71,4.64,1241977206055551220,"Geeat Host, responded within a few minutes. The apartment was really clean and same as pictures. He even provides with the pictures to help checkin and directions.",1,0.6901,Positive
