64.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,1,1.5608226231060494,4.83,4.61,4.79,4.79,48868784,Świetne miejsce na krótki pobyt w Berlinie! Bardzo polecam ☺️,1,0.0,Neutral
108.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,13,100.0,0,3.703131021231034,4.82,4.47,4.92,4.74,39962078,"This flat is the perfect place to stay in a walkable, fun neighborhood in Berlin. Lots of nice cafes and parks around. And Rudi is the friendliest feline host - he will welcome you in style and keep you company during your stay.",1,0.9468,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,100.0,0,13.41409874361302,5.0,5.0,4.5,4.83,28280391,"Dies war meine erste Airbnb-Erfahrung und es war toll! Ich hätte es gar nicht besser treffen können. Regine ist supernett und total gastfreundlich 😊 Ich habe mich wie zu Hause gefühlt. Als ich Bauchschmerzen hatte, hat sie mir sogar eine Wärmflasche gegeben. Die Lage in war für einen Kurs, den ich besucht habe genau richtig, alles wie sie es beschrieben hat. Die Wohnung und das Zimmer sind total schön und sauber. Wenn ich wieder mal nach Berlin möchte, werde ich zuerst gucken, ob ich wieder bei Regine wohnen kann.",1,-0.9674,Negative
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,2.142649937740168,4.91,4.94,4.96,4.89,446975,"The place was perfect, quiet and equipped with everything I needed. A beautiful retreat in the middle of a great part of Berlin. Kerstin was so accommodating and flexible throughout my stay. I would stay here again in a heartbeat!",1,0.9428,Positive
172.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,30,100.0,1,2.086859632126843,4.87,4.87,4.94,4.71,306312,"The flat was fantastic with a light and airy feel, high ceilings and generously sized rooms. The kitchen was so well equipped and we enjoyed sitting there in the mornings. The area is perfect and really made our stay in Berlin tip top! Martina was so friendly and went to enormous efforts to make sure we knew how everything worked. The late check out for our bags was greatly appreciated. We would return in a heartbeat!!",1,0.9814,Positive
87.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,44,100.0,0,26.07413943568224,4.96,4.85,5.0,4.8,680182172356497351,Wir hatten eine wirklich tolle Zeit in der schönen Wohnung mit großem Garten den wir mit nutzen können. Unsere Gastgeber waren sehr nett und hilfsbereit und die Küche war erstaunlich gut ausgestattet. Wir haben drei Wochen dort verbracht und nichts vermisst. Vielen lieben Dank für alles!,1,-0.8439,Negative
142.0,4,2.0,2.0,2.0,19,100.0,1,6.608155925105233,4.83,4.94,4.85,4.76,10423394,"Die Wohnung ist wunderschön gestimmt und toll eingerichtet. Dazu kommt das besondere Flair der vierten Etage mit freiem Blick nach oben und auf die Konturen der gegenüberliegenden Penthäuser. Ein spezielles Feature ist der untenliegende Bahnsteig. Von dort unten steigen die beruhigenden Durchsagen für die Pendler ins offene Fenster. <br/>Die Wohnung bietet alles, was man braucht. Wir hatten es leicht und beschwingt, Schlüsselübergabe sehr unkompliziert und Stefanie gut ansprechbar. ",1,-0.9485,Negative
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,1,6.3796568015063695,4.85,4.9,4.68,4.77,6658190,"La casa e' come descritto: pulita, comoda e luminosa. Si trova in una zona servita dai mezzi pubblici.  Soren e' stato sempre molto gentile e disponibile. Grazie.",1,0.0,Neutral
80.0,2,2.0,1.5,2.0,40,100.0,1,25.8764478220504,4.96,4.97,4.87,4.92,8977531,"Wir hatten einen wunderbaren Aufenthalt im schönen Friedrichshagen. Haben uns rundum wohl gefühlt, die Kommunikation mit Silke und Carsten war super freundlich. <br/>Gerne wieder!",1,-0.636,Negative
31.0,2,0.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,0,7.5771733112603155,4.51,4.68,4.72,4.54,578821,"I had such a pleasant stay at Andrew's apartment. He is so helpful in getting you acclimated to the neighborhood as well as Berlin. Any question I had he was always available to answer, and he went out of his way to make sure I was comfortable during my time in Berlin. Thanks again!",1,0.9502,Positive
79.0,4,1.0,1.5,2.0,60,100.0,1,3.902646890139105,4.84,4.88,4.9,4.71,8386451,Alles top und hat ideal gepasst. Allerdings waren die zwei unangekündigten Besuche am Abend durch den Vermieter nicht so toll.,1,0.0772,Positive
220.0,4,2.0,1.5,3.0,18,92.0,1,2.329934685135971,4.93,4.83,4.98,4.72,700982641393383373,Ett vackert och ljust hem vi snabbt kände oss hemma i. <br/>Härligt socialt kök där man gärna lagar mat tillsammans. <br/>Ligger bra till i roliga kvarter.,1,0.0,Neutral
69.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,20,93.0,0,4.065511825937199,4.57,4.47,4.44,4.48,41423018,"Excelente lugar para alojarte y disfrutar de Berlín, de encuentra cercano a la estación de tren y pasan transporte de Bus. Agradable el cuarto, no le hace falta nada.",1,-0.296,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,2.0674178351267574,4.78,4.84,4.75,4.72,7352481,"Kathi's place is bright, beautiful and very central. We so enjoyed our stay, and her suggestions of places to check out in the neighborhood. I highly recommend her place for a trip to Berlin!",1,0.934,Positive
69.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,1,6.04491222918904,4.78,4.91,4.65,4.71,8026172,"A perfect airbnb for a short stay in Berlin. Everything looked neat, a small problem with the shower head got fixed immediately and the communication went perfectly smooth. Thanks Rainer!",1,0.908,Positive
64.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,59,100.0,1,2.578564642470654,4.97,4.99,4.93,4.96,7849188,"Io ed il mio compagno Harpo abbiamo alloggiato da Bernd per cinque giorni.<br/>L'appartamento si trova in un ottima posizione rispetto ai mezzi : metro/tram e treno ed è inoltre situato in un quartiere molto tranquillo, ma allo stesso tempo vivo e ricco di bar e ristoranti.<br/>Servizi di farmacia, supermercati, tabacchino sono tutti alla portata di mano.<br/>Bernd è stato un ottimo host: gentile, ospitale e premuroso; la sua casa è spaziosa, luminosa, pulita. <br/>Sicuramente se recapiteremo da quelle parti torneremo da lui! <br/>:)<br/>Giada e Harpo, Italia",1,0.0,Neutral
72.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,8.690106845303559,4.76,4.75,4.61,4.64,9356063,Wonderful place to stay for a quiet getaway in Berlin. We would definitely come back!,1,0.7712,Positive
85.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,0,4.628526975183625,4.73,4.8,4.93,4.57,4282156,"Super schnelle Antworten, alles hat reibungslos funktioniert.",1,0.5994,Positive
223.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,33,100.0,1,9.786517555749825,4.92,4.96,4.95,4.83,23077467,"We stayed in this flat with our 2 children, aged 8 and 5.  Checking in was very straightforward and the flat itself very clean and spacious, the kitchen well equipped. It was a nice haven to come back to after a whole day out and about.  <br/>The location is a few kilometres away from the main sights, but there are excellent public transport links a few minutes walk away, of which we made good use.  That said, it was centrally located for shopping and for going out, with a good choice of restaurants.<br/>Unfortunately, checking out went a little awry, as our contact did not meet us at the agreed time and could not be contacted. <br/>However, overall, this was nice place to stay and we thoroughly enjoyed it.",1,0.9825,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,1,6.1114447900723885,4.89,4.8,4.83,4.81,619936,👍🏻,1,0.0,Neutral
107.0,3,2.0,1.5,2.0,18,100.0,0,6.774682469939278,4.77,4.89,4.88,4.67,50162244,"The appartement was sparkling clean, luminous and spacious. The location was great. An oven or a toaster oven would be nice and helpful. We would definitely come back !We enjoyed the place very much.",1,0.9633,Positive
139.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,1,3.5852919241394265,4.61,4.65,4.56,4.53,969200,"Appartamento molto carino, pulito ed in una zona tranquilla vicino a tutti i mezzi pubblici ed al centro di Berlino. Ci siamo trovati benissimo e lo consiglio vivamente!",1,0.0,Neutral
82.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,29,100.0,1,10.615905371619954,4.9,4.69,4.74,4.86,714352661687025728,"Holger and Susie are very accommodating hosts. Our arrival was really delayed and yet we could check in without issues and were greeted with a smile.<br/>The room is just as described, has a comfortable bed and the private access is great to sneak in and out at your own convenience.<br/>The entire apartment is just as lovely as its hosts.<br/>Cannot recommend them highly enough for a visit to Berlin!",1,0.9313,Positive
270.0,3,1.0,2.0,2.0,69,100.0,1,7.09688584721499,4.9,5.0,4.95,4.89,1122540298195313232,"This place is just amazing. Close to everywhere with public transportation. Very close (2 mins) there is a supermarket, and in 1 minute is the Holmes Place Gym, you can have a 7 day membership for 10 euros. <br/>The place was very clean, Eric had coffee, chocolates, still and sparkling water... There was nothing missing from the place.<br/>The only bad thing i see at Eric's place is the it is that good, that you don't want to leave it and go around the city. <br/>Definitely value for money.",0,0.8911,Positive
64.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,59,100.0,1,2.578564642470654,4.97,4.99,4.93,4.96,7849188,Bernd was super friendly and sweet. The place was really nice and big. Everything was all right. I highly recommend.,1,0.9431,Positive
102.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,39,100.0,1,8.094404344978152,4.79,4.8,4.73,4.75,35116312,"Équipement satisfaisant, accueil sympathique. Emplacement calme.",1,0.0,Neutral
115.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,30,80.0,0,6.188901033018674,4.92,4.83,4.84,4.78,11833825,"We had a GREAT stay at Bei Otto! The location was perfect for us. There are great bars and restaurants close to the apartment and a short 5 minute walk to the Ubahn! Linda was amazing with communication! After her family traveled back from a long trip that morning, she was still happy to see us and gave us great recommendations and explained  how the public transit works :) We could not have asked for a better place to stay to explore Berlin! We will definitely stay again! ",1,0.9882,Positive
67.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,55,100.0,1,2.305726509562826,4.9,4.96,4.88,4.83,4380854,Wonderfull hosts and great place. Perfectly located in the middle between tourists areas and Kreuzberg. Super nice house and we hope to come back later :),1,0.9678,Positive
46.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,97.0,1,6.8018808148250525,4.84,4.9,4.86,4.82,1028233458536518838,Fantastic stay! The location was perfect and incredibly convenient for exploring if you like to use the S-Bahn and U-Bahn. The neighborhood was lovely as well as the room itself. It exceeded all my expectations! Highly recommend this Airbnb to anyone looking for a comfortable and convenient room in Berlin!! :),1,0.9775,Positive
98.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,59,100.0,0,10.5101686862438,4.87,4.9,4.84,4.84,6951394,Ich habe mich sehr wohl gefühlt und würde das Zimmer bei bedarf sehr gerne wieder mieten!,1,0.0,Neutral
