65.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,0,3.715408939134692,4.76,4.83,4.76,4.75,749508,"Michael provided very good service. We stayed four guys in the apartment, and everything was prepared for us when we arrived. Michael even put out bread, jam and a bottle of wine. The Apartment was clean and made ready for us. The directions was good and made it easy to find the apartment. <br/><br/>We had a very nice stay, and I can really recommend the apartment! ",1,0.9664,Positive
