64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,100.0,1,13.11548104095715,5.0,4.7,4.4,4.9,28402280,"Great host. Easy-going, responsible, attentive. The room was perfect, great kitchen with all everything you need and more, exactly as a bathroom with all essentials. the appartement was situated directly close to the S-bahn station, 30 min and you are in the city center.  Perfect offer!",1,0.9595,Positive
