98.0,6,1.0,1.0,3.0,38,100.0,0,4.479387416975665,4.85,4.73,4.84,4.73,798416193829159604,Great place to stay for a couple of days. The people that are sleeping out side of the main bedroom would feel a bit uncomfortable because the bathroom is i the “same” room as where they sleep.,1,0.3612,Positive
190.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,52,100.0,1,5.999075895235788,4.78,4.8,4.54,4.7,3242577,"Der Aufenthalt in der Wohnung war perfekt. Alles wie beschrieben, gute Kommunikation und eine unkomplizierte Abwicklung.<br/>Sehr gerne komme ich wieder!:)",0,-0.636,Negative
118.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,58,100.0,0,11.700538589757622,4.15,4.25,4.27,4.16,194374,"The house was great and the location was good. We had a great time but only thing to keep in mind is there will be some minor extra charges by the host such as tourist tax, water use, gas and electricity. It wasn’t overly expensive but still something to note because they only accepted cash for these payments and no card was accepted. We had a great time and will definitely visit again in the future. Monika the host was so nice to us!",0,0.9695,Positive
125.0,12,4.0,1.0,2.0,15,100.0,0,3.478399439296858,4.19,4.45,4.46,4.06,3427815,"Good airbnb for big groups that will be in and out at different times. Location is very good and the organization with Alberto was super easy! He was a very nice host that let us kneep bags in storage until we left. Decoration is simple, only little note is that its not well equipped for cooking.",0,0.9378,Positive
148.0,5,1.0,1.0,5.0,53,100.0,1,16.15581114423226,4.82,4.92,4.78,4.63,3968204,"Mooi apartament, schoon, openbaar vervoer heel dichtbij waardoor je overal heel makelijk kan komen. Duidelijke insturcties over alles, wat betreft het aparament.",0,0.0,Neutral
171.0,9,4.0,1.5,5.0,41,100.0,1,4.936124446607811,4.63,4.5,4.43,4.63,4106583,Super Kommunikation. Wohnung ist wie auf den Bildern.<br/>Gerne wieder,0,0.5994,Positive
94.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,1.7669306902363546,4.88,4.91,4.98,4.78,9599108,"I had a really nice time staying at Marcus's studio - the place is bigger than it looks on the pictures with a comfortable bed and basic but well equipped kitchen. Conveniently located in the centre of Berlin with easy access to all attractions, surrounded by nice cafes and restaurants. Highly recommended!!",1,0.9673,Positive
116.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,5,88.0,0,11.340900365526691,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,671533966249172905,"Fina rum, god frukost på bra tider.",1,0.2732,Positive
112.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,22,100.0,0,2.685383888422717,4.51,4.54,4.8,4.34,704207060266385467,"it starts with location.  Easy access to public transport.  Neighborhood has abundant restaurants and craft beer tap room just down street.  Apartment was spacious and had all we needed.  Yaraslov was responsive, letting me know when he could confirm early check in so as not to make an agreement that could not be accommodated.  Would stay again.",1,0.8225,Positive
128.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,50,100.0,1,8.680231459990408,4.98,4.78,4.88,4.88,791179421306968763,"I had a fantastic stay! The condo was light & bright and very spacious with a stunning view of Rummelsburg Bay. The quiet neighborhood, filled with friendly, active families, made it even more relaxing. Loved sitting on the terrace in the evenings. The hosts were very responsive and accommodated my early arrival.  Will definitely be visiting again!   Highly recommend!",1,0.985,Positive
95.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,80.0,0,1.326262354928254,4.56,4.42,4.86,4.42,783118783690353126,Place was nice and had the essentials. In a nice area. Bed was very comfortable. However shower was very small and strange and inconvenient not being able to flush toilet paper down the toilet.,1,0.6936,Positive
103.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,44,100.0,1,1.656083928367451,4.81,4.88,4.61,4.76,10608680,"Affordable accommodation, central location, clean apartment, amazing view and clean instructions for the check in. Perfect for a short stay in Berlin!",1,0.9215,Positive
110.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,2.9703255715487984,4.92,4.97,4.91,4.79,15941034,"This is a beautiful apartment, very well equipped, spotlessly clean and in a great location.  There are numerous amenities in the immediate vicinity and the underground train station is just across the road however the accommodation was quiet and peaceful.  The shower deserves a special mention however there are no negatives with Frank's accommodation.  His communication was excellent, I would most certainly recommend this apartment to anyone staying in Berlin.",1,0.9775,Positive
198.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,39,100.0,1,3.617036290600905,4.86,4.85,4.9,4.75,27627221,Best apartment in Germany,1,0.6369,Positive
88.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,0,12.760805103334942,4.7,4.76,4.71,4.68,1574592,"Great place, very clean and with a lot of space, well equipped kitchen, perfect S-Bahn connection to the city center.  And we were lucky with flexibility on arrival and departure timing. I recommend Anton´s place definitely.",1,0.9694,Positive
82.0,2,0.0,1.0,6.0,39,100.0,0,7.593507322759444,4.63,4.61,4.89,4.62,19753755,"El apartamento de Gisella es perfecto para disfrutar de unos días en Berlin, situado en una zona céntrica, con acceso a transporte público a 2 minutos. Barrio bien surtido de supermercados, cafeterías y restaurantes.<br/>El apartamento es usado, pero limpio, con todo lo necesario para no sentir incomodidad, muy buena calefacción y buena presión de agua en la ducha. La cocina es pequeña pero bien dotada de todo lo imprescindible, aún que para cocinar se requeriría un extractor de humos. El edificio es muy tranquilo, no hubo molestias de vecinos.",1,-0.2732,Negative
86.0,2,1.0,1.0,0.0,31,100.0,1,6.332757890540551,4.92,4.92,4.75,4.87,8453624,"We had a great week in Florian's flat, it  had everything we needed, extremely clean and very close to public transport. Also a very handy local shop nearby.",1,0.796,Positive
136.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,48,100.0,0,5.470581932125792,4.88,4.76,4.91,4.71,128827,We had a great experience renting this apartment from Kai and Oana. It is located in a very friendly neighborhood with lots of restaurants and bars nearby. The interior looked exactly like in the pictures and we really felt at home in this creative looking apartment. Cary the cat was lovely company to have! The communication with Kai and Oana was perfect and they gave us a lot of helpful tips on where to go and how to get around in the city. Would definitely go again! ,1,0.98,Positive
31.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,100.0,1,12.720083248666349,4.78,4.69,4.54,4.73,24154046,"Nous sommes restés 4 nuits.La maison est accueillante et chaleureuse. La chambre est spacieuse et calme, le lit très confortable. Le quartier est cours de rénovation; mélange de barres et de maisons mitoyenne comme celle-ci. Possibilité de prendre le bus ou le S Bahn à10min. Les hôtes sont discrets et confiants envers les invités.",1,0.0,Neutral
94.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,1,0.9546645327029104,4.87,4.81,4.89,4.81,22662699,In dieser Unterkunft haben wir uns wohl gefühlt. <br/>Positiv:<br/>- Lage<br/>- Sauberkeit <br/>- Freundlichkeit,1,0.0,Neutral
96.0,2,1.0,1.0,0.0,21,100.0,0,9.70267913323164,4.76,4.82,4.76,4.66,1120811858951697611,"Die Wohnung entsprach voll und ganz der Beschreibung und war in einem insgesamt guten Zustand und spartanisch - aber komplett ausgestattet. Besonders positiv hervorzuheben sind der sehr freundliche Kontakt und die klaren, hilfreichen Anweisungen im Vorfeld – der Self-Check-in verlief absolut reibungslos. Auch das Bad machte auf den ersten Blick einen sauberen Eindruck, was für ein gutes Gefühl beim Ankommen sorgt. Die Lage ist ruhig und in Ordnung, allerdings sollte man beachten, dass sie am besten mit dem Bus erreichbar ist. Alles in allem ein angenehmer Aufenthalt .",1,-0.9643,Negative
106.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,62,100.0,0,17.52038866510674,4.9,4.85,4.8,4.82,2647478,Schönes Haus. Sehr ruhige Lage. Die Ausstattung ist neu und modern. Alle 5 Sterne. Ich kann nur empfehlen!,1,-0.636,Negative
97.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,50,100.0,1,7.213357439951281,4.85,4.78,4.72,4.75,11772098,"Wir haben drei Nächte im Pferdestall verbracht. Der Garten ist wunderschön und wie eine kleine Oase in Friedrichshain. Die Wohnung war sehr geräumig und gut ausgestattet. Für 6 Euro pro Tag kann man Fahrräder bei Carmen mieten. Carmen ist sehr freundlich und hat uns ein paar gute Tipps gegeben. Das Haus liegt nicht in einer Wohngegend, sondern in einem alten Industriegebiet, was seinen eigenen Charme hat. Zu Fuss ist man jedoch in wenigen Minuten in einem sehr spannenden und belebten Quartier. ",1,-0.8316,Negative
125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,17,100.0,0,9.852495122439958,4.9,4.95,4.92,4.87,7896702,It was an absolute joy staying in Philips apartment. It is beautifully designed and very clean and tidy. The transport links were fantastic and it's very close to a range of shops and supermarket. Philip is only a text a way if you have any questions and is very responsive. We absolutely loved staying here and would definitely recommend it others.  Thank you Philip for making our trip to Berlin so special and for making us feel so at home. ,1,0.9852,Positive
57.0,3,1.0,1.5,1.0,27,100.0,0,13.88836515577706,4.52,4.52,4.65,4.45,9572022,Comfortable Unterkunft ist leicht übertriebeb eher spatanisch Dusche und Küche über den Flur.Parwana warsehr nett und entgegenkommend.,1,0.5106,Positive
87.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,4.258916755608359,4.78,4.69,4.85,4.67,1016416663679900860,"Zentrale Lage, netter Vermieter. Leider nicht gut kommuniziert dass man ein Zimmer einer Kategorie bucht und nicht exakt, dass was man im Angebot gesehen hat.",1,0.0,Neutral
126.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,96.0,0,3.2108386176980583,4.7,4.76,4.93,4.62,50931491,"very good rooms, good wifi, friendly staff and perfect position",1,0.9229,Positive
112.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,0,10.170435739382182,4.51,4.6,4.54,4.48,14574834,"Gut gelegene Wohnung. Einiges in der Wohnung war kaputt, defekt und wackelig. Man sollte alles mal austauschen. Es gab zum Beispiel nur 2 Löffel und 1 Gabel. Jalousie defekt. Vorhang defekt Mikrowelle aus 1970. Brandfleck auf dem Tisch draußen. Kommode mit 2 defekten Schubladen und kurz vorm zusammen brechen. Lüfter im Bad defekt und übler Geruch. Mussten selbst mit Rohrreiniger ran übrigens gibt es noch viele weitere Probleme. Nichts weltbewegendes aber sehr viele kleine nervige Probleme. Alles andere Top.",1,-0.765,Negative
100.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,99.0,0,0.9354947556413724,4.69,4.47,4.87,4.68,930506346504115139,"Quite big room in a central flat. Polite hosts, good price and a cute cat. Would definitely recommend!",1,0.8858,Positive
