60.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,51,100.0,1,8.76289456061162,4.98,4.98,4.82,4.95,6936087,Für uns war unsere erste Buchung über airbnb ein voller Erfolg. Petra hat uns sehr herzlich in ihrer Wohnung aufgenommen. Wir haben uns sofort super wohl gefühlt. Für die vielen tollen Tipps von Petra und dem reibungslosen Ankunftsablauf sind wir unendlich begeistert. Wir freuen uns jetzt schon auf unseren nächsten Besuch in Berlin und bei Petra. ,1,-0.5994,Negative
31.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,100.0,1,12.720083248666349,4.78,4.69,4.54,4.73,24154046,"Phong and Martin were very hospitable and we felt right at home in their beautiful house! The location was perfect for us, because it was in a very quiet and most importantly safe neighborhood, while still only 20 min away from the center.",1,0.9282,Positive
150.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,0,2.995556241133994,4.89,4.82,4.86,4.77,753152,Perfect apartment for a family to stay in Berlin. Super communication with host - no complaints at all,1,0.5719,Positive
94.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,95.0,1,4.513443039819955,4.61,4.31,4.75,4.57,53961297,"Everything went smoothly. The place was clean, and nice. The host was responsive and gave a great instruction for the check-in. In is a private place, however, the backyard lights goes on whenever someone enters the area, and the bed is facing the small window above the door which don't have any shadings and if you are sensitive to light it's not so easy. The other thing is that from the reviews I expected that the bed is changed from two single bed to one double, but this was not the case so it's still needs to be fixed if possible. Other than that everything was good enough and worth the price. I totally recommend it for a visit to Berlin and it had good bus connections with other areas so very reachable.",1,0.957,Positive
103.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,0,8.034137804420043,4.74,4.92,4.85,4.67,1021636095162682784,"Excellent emplacement, juste à côte de là station de metro <br/>Restaurants et épiceries à proximité <br/>Logement propre et spacieux avec un charmant petit jardin<br/>Je recommande",1,0.5719,Positive
32.0,6,1.0,1.0,2.0,14,94.0,1,3.5488970618636317,4.83,4.84,4.86,4.84,42862387,Amazing place! Great location!,1,0.8585,Positive
