59.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,1,15.704190402628244,4.96,4.98,4.63,4.91,12337676,"Traum. Perfekte Kombination von hoher Qualität der Unterkunft (Pool! Privates Bad!) und weltoffenen, zuvorkommenden Gastgebern. <br/>Das Zimmer und das Bad sind größer, als man an Hand der Fotos erwarten würde. Und der Garten schöner. <br/>Die Anbindung ist einfach und schnell. ",1,-0.2225,Negative
110.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,2.990654359868407,4.86,4.94,4.94,4.78,1165227481829107407,"El alojamiento estuvo increíble, cómodo y coincidía con la descripción.",1,0.0,Neutral
40.0,3,0.0,1.0,4.0,31,100.0,1,5.883884268449321,4.89,4.96,4.77,4.79,26419059,"Mooi grote kamer,<br/>vriendeijk ontvangen door Maria, daarna hebben we haar niet meer gezien. fijne locatie dichtbij restautantjes, cafeetjes en openbaar vervoer. <br/>Een klein nadeel was dat er geen water was in de kamer.  hiervoor moest je naar de Badkamer. Maar verder helemaal perfect",1,0.5719,Positive
119.0,3,1.0,1.0,3.0,46,100.0,0,2.732563225420117,4.88,4.92,4.95,4.68,1381111432966242413,"The apartment was fantastic and I would recommend it to anyone. The apartment was clean, large and in a brilliant location. I have visited Berlin a few times and believe Prenzlauer Berg is the best district and also has easy access to and from the airport via the S Bahn. Furthermore, Markus was a great host, his friend provided local tips on arrival and checking in and out was really easy. Would 100% return.",1,0.9833,Positive
44.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,1,4.948763181664733,4.54,4.16,4.79,4.58,22736888,"Louis wasn't home to check me in, however his lovely mum took great care to explain everything I would need in the home and walked me through the check-in process. The apartment is very close to a U-Bahn station which made it very convenient to travel into the Berlin. Also, the locals nearby were extremely helpful!",1,0.938,Positive
145.0,8,3.0,1.5,8.0,30,100.0,0,6.012375838102713,4.52,4.38,4.69,4.52,16026861,"Appartement très bien situé et assez vaste, dans un quartier animé.<br/>L'appartement, nécessiterait quand même un grand coup de fraicheur sur le mobilier et les équipements électroménagers (usés pour beaucoup,  défectueux pour certains). C'est dommage car l'appartement a un très beau potentiel et je vois que je ne suis pas le premier client à poster ces conseils.<br/>Sinon, bonne réactivité de l'hôte et instructions claires pour notre arrivée.",0,0.4588,Positive
228.0,14,1.0,1.0,5.0,72,100.0,0,2.1286642805518605,4.24,4.0,4.76,4.03,49631398,"Leider entsprach die Unterkunft kaum der Beschreibung, Preis Leisungsverhältnis stimmt dafür leider auch garnicht!",0,-0.636,Negative
160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,87.0,0,3.4802565088356308,4.54,4.54,4.6,4.41,43798011,"Muy buen trato del personal, la limpieza y la tranquilidad del apartamento excelentes. Zona tranquila y muy accesible. Súper recomendable la estancia en Nena",1,0.0,Neutral
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,20.878746667664217,4.87,4.93,4.79,4.78,22594731,"We have truly enjoyed our stay at Marion’s house. The room was nice and clean, we had our private bathroom next to the room. There were small pleasant things that have made us feel welcomed. <br/>Marion and her husband were nice and friendly, so did their lovely pets. Oscar (orange cat), looking like a honey pot, came to visit us every morning and stole our hears for sure. <br/>The house is located an a very nice area.  But probably the only disadvantage is quite a distance from the cite center. Although there is a bus stop in 5 min walk. As for me all the advantages definitely outweigh this disadvantage.",1,0.9206,Positive
126.0,5,1.0,1.0,3.0,38,100.0,1,2.459926794886368,4.93,4.97,4.8,4.87,3973420,"Simones apartment is fabulous, great location, immaculately clean and very very comfortable.  Simones communication and care was excellent.<br/>We are a family of 5 and it worked very well for us, we highly recommend it!",1,0.9711,Positive
142.0,7,2.0,2.0,2.0,68,100.0,1,18.40506025540252,4.97,4.91,4.93,4.92,7290315,Sehr nette Gastgeber! Kommunikation top. Sehr gemütlich und viel Platz. Wir kommen gerne wieder!,0,0.3365,Positive
65.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,16,100.0,1,3.0069422642949752,4.7,4.9,4.89,4.66,6220902,"Regina's accommodation was perfect! I spent three days here during a business trip, but would have loved to stay longer! You immediately feel very welcome in Regina and Alexander's flat, but still have enough privacy to relax after a busy day! The architecturally really stunning flat is located in a very lively and vibrant neighbourhood, yet the room itself is extremely quiet and peaceful. From the balcony you can hear the leaves of the tree at night or watch the squirrels during the day. Regina and Alexander are a cool Berlin couple who are very sympatico and helpful! I can absolutely recommend the flat!",1,0.9938,Positive
166.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,15,88.0,0,11.278262757592604,4.6,4.73,4.8,4.53,672183105867055977,"The place is very well located, the room was clean and the staff was great.",1,0.8479,Positive
136.0,9,3.0,3.0,6.0,21,100.0,1,7.111156242440419,4.76,4.77,4.56,4.63,15472852,Great host & great place,0,0.8481,Positive
62.0,2,2.0,1.0,4.0,20,91.0,0,14.96877971240817,4.82,4.87,4.7,4.82,20647264,"A nice, calm place to visit or work in Berlin! I enjoyed the clean room & bathroom. Also cooking was a dream in the fully equiped and cosy kitchen. For people on a worktrip: The room has a small but comfortable workspace, with good internet reception. A place where one can focus!",1,0.9426,Positive
269.0,6,2.0,1.0,5.0,41,100.0,1,1.2503182243717943,4.49,4.47,4.7,4.51,1069319700158091488,"L'appartement est très bien et plutôt bien situé. Mitte ce n'est clairement pas le Kreusberg, et l'activité y est nettement moins chaleureuse autour mais ca va. Nous avions loué des vélos pour 4 jours et comme la ville est hyper plate c'est rés facile et rapide de se déplacer. Berlin est berlin, on aime beaucoup l'énergie un peu underground de cette ville. Et ce même si on est déjà un peu vieux pour bien en profiter. Pour l'appart , ul est très grand et modulable au niveau des lits. On avait fait le choix de dormir dans le salon avec notre petit et de laisser les chambre aux autres enfants. Après tout est très simple mais fonctionnel. Sauf le wifi !! un appartement sans wifi de nos jours? même si on avait de la 4G sur nos téléphone, j'imagine les personne qui compte vraiment dessus ? Il était sensé venir réparer mais on a vu personne et pas de mot d'excuse, rien..  très dommage. C'est pour cela que je met si peu d'étoile en fait.. pour le reste c'était correct (sauf le prix teés cher )",0,0.6303,Positive
389.0,6,3.0,2.5,3.0,28,100.0,1,4.0170607086524575,4.95,4.97,4.88,4.77,36649452,Great place. 3 HUGE bedrooms. 2 toilets and 2 baths. The apartment and the furniture are all antique style. VERY cool. The kitchen fully stocked. Great location. Lots of restaurants and cafe walking distance.,0,0.9388,Positive
363.0,16,5.0,1.5,10.0,49,93.0,0,9.499488236705036,4.47,4.3,4.34,4.26,17077519,"Me and a large group friends had an issue with our original booking who decided not to respond once we had got to Berlin, as such we had no where to stay. I decided to message on the hope that even though it was late the place may be available. Aleks got back to me really quickly and was more than to get the place in order even on very very short notice! Couldn’t be happier this saved our trip!",0,0.9236,Positive
