76.0,2,0.0,3.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,3.016097343290094,4.91,4.84,4.95,4.78,44384926,"It’s a great place to stay if you’re in the mood/are looking for a peaceful place to stay in. It’s also super cozy, the bed is really really comfortable (I wasn’t in Berlin for long but every morning I was debating if I really wanted to leave the bed cause it was worth it to stay in bed the whole day hahah). The whole place is really really clean, for what I know and saw she deep cleans it everyday.<br/>Kathrin is super friendly as well, she makes you feel comfortable the moment to step in.<br/>The flexible check-in is such a lifesaver!!",1,0.9914,Positive
