115.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,24,100.0,0,15.730253649096108,4.59,4.65,4.65,4.67,4290174,"Wir drei waren rundum zufrieden. Die Ferienwohnung befindet sich in einer tollen Lage, für Berlin sehr ruhig und mitten im Grünen. Eine schöne kleine Terrasse schließt direkt an die Wohnung an. Mit der S2 ist man in ca. 20 Minuten in Pankow/Florastraße. Alles war sehr sauber und man hat sich sehr willkommen gefühlt. Gerne wieder.",1,-0.9136,Negative
82.0,2,0.0,1.0,3.0,41,100.0,0,7.593507322759444,4.57,4.62,4.8,4.64,20668903,"While they were very easy to communicate with and the apartment was overall a fair stay, the sink and washer machine did not work and the bathroom wall had holes in it. The apartment was not the one we had reserved because the original had bed bugs in it however after we left we have noticed that some of us have bug bites. We were slightly compensated for the broken sink/washing machine which we appreciated but wish that our stay was a bit more pleasant.",1,0.9175,Positive
