102.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,5.980380964128161,4.93,4.99,4.84,4.8,748442565689302326,"Theo and his wife were very helpful and always responded quickly.<br/>The room and the bathroom are quite spacious, nice and clean.<br/>There are a coffee machine and a cattle in the room as well, which was nice.<br/>Location is very good, next to two U-bahn stations and the S-bahn ring. It was very easy to go around the city.",1,0.9281,Positive
422.0,4,2.0,2.0,2.0,57,88.0,1,13.095134324844064,4.95,4.98,4.85,4.85,1016525687008446860,"It has potential … 3 stars is too harsh but 4 stars too generous based on our experience here. <br/>Unfortunately, the communications issues really outweighed all of the marvelous things this apartment has to offer. <br/>On a positive note, the apartment itself is gorgeous and came almost perfectly cleaned, it also offers garage parking for an additional fee, the building is super modern, there are lots of places to eat and drink within walking distance, and in general, it’s a good location for most types of travelers.  The balcony was a welcome surprise, it is gigantic with an amazing view in my opinion. The apartment is gigantic, and comes with all of the bells and whistles modern German apartments offer.  I would happily move in with my family into an apartment like this one. <br/>The negative:  Beyond the comms issues, I would have appreciated a deadbolt instead of just having an electronic keypad as the door lock. This is, however, a relatively easy fix.",0,0.9962,Positive
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,58,100.0,0,0.9641709446461616,4.7,4.43,4.92,4.7,6524799,"Un séjour absolument parfait ! Le logement est encore plus beau que sur les photos : très propre, décoré avec goût et parfaitement équipé. L’emplacement est idéal, calme tout en étant proche de toutes les commodités. Communication fluide et rapide, ce qui a rendu le séjour encore plus agréable. Merci beaucoup !!",1,-0.3348,Negative
