146.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,3.4636382799594605,4.66,4.79,4.58,4.56,322520,"It was such a pleasure staying at Kasia and Alans place. We had a feeling of coming home when we entered this cozy, beautiful and clean apartment. The garden was great on top. Tram and S-Train directly around the corner, as well as bars and stores. <br/>Our hosts were so friendly. We felt warmly welcome and we surely will come back. We can highly recommend this place in Berlin <3 Thank you!",1,0.9899,Positive
