107.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,95.0,1,3.959014142965591,4.68,4.89,4.82,4.56,52180595,Alles super. Danke,1,0.5994,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,100.0,0,1.9694490738270507,4.94,4.97,4.95,4.79,20616653,"Victor and Karla are really lovely hosts with a stylish, beautiful space centrally located to lots of great city attractions. They were wonderful in giving suggestions for things to do and basically helped us map out a whole day.<br/>There’s a bicycle rental place right down the street, and I highly suggest cycling for a day if you can - it was a great way to get around and see a lot. Lots of great coffee shops and restaurants right in the neighborhood too, as well as close to train lines.<br/>I would definitely stay at their place again!",1,0.9875,Positive
318.0,8,3.0,1.5,5.0,53,100.0,1,3.7256422035937673,4.95,4.94,4.85,4.83,13320037,"Danke, war alles perfekt!",0,-0.636,Negative
155.0,7,2.0,1.0,6.0,43,96.0,0,6.1770612336798365,4.41,4.27,4.78,4.31,27018620,"Really nice location, 15 minute walk from the train station so everything was within distance from the apartment",0,0.4754,Positive
260.0,8,4.0,2.0,7.0,50,100.0,1,2.6302702497082326,4.88,4.92,4.85,4.71,1488624,"Alexandra was very nice and showed us around the great apartment. Wow! It is so beautiful. We were with a party of 8 and every couple had their own room. The beds were comfortable and the two bathrooms made it possible to get going quickly in the morning. Prenzlauer Berg is a real nice area. And the apartment is close to the public transport, but we rented bikes at Lila Bikes for €8 a day! Berlin is a great city to ride bikes. <br/>I would recommend the apartment! It has all the one needs and it is in a great area. <br/>Alexandra was so nice, we had a delay of two hours and it wasn't a big problem for her. We just texted her 10 minutes before we arrived and she was there. ",0,0.9878,Positive
140.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,45,100.0,0,2.416427424980613,4.95,4.93,4.93,4.87,49857753,"This neighborhood, for us, was perfect. It is lined up with fantastic cocktails bars and restaurants. Walkable everywhere. Close to transportation. Safe. Clean on the inside, clean on the outside. <br/>The actual place is exactly how it’s described and looks. No deceptions and really comfortable. Plus - washer and laundry.",1,0.9516,Positive
