55.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,0,1.354221835889287,4.91,4.71,4.96,4.9,14257495,"Dear Future Guest at this Awesome AirBnb!<br/>My friend and I were in Berlin for a week and truly lucked out with this place. The location could not have been more perfect — close to many great restaurants, monuments and the fantastic museum island. We enjoyed walking around as well as scootering and taking the tram. Wibke was a phenomenal host. She went out of her way to print our museum pass, help us get set up in the laundry room, and make us coffee. The space was very large and fit us perfectly for the amount of time we were there. We would definitely stay again!",1,0.993,Positive
