88.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,100.0,1,1.881496822425637,4.71,4.61,4.93,4.66,44740912,"Great location in East Berlin near many fantastic restaurants and shops. It was a very safe and lively area with a lot to enjoy. The apartment is excellent. It has a simple layout, nothing fancy, but it features a comfortable bed, a great shower, and having access to the kitchen was nice. It's rather quiet and stayed cool in July. Check-in was easy. Great value — I highly recommend.",1,0.993,Positive
118.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,18,93.0,0,2.3360123395652144,4.78,4.65,4.76,4.63,17396668,"Merveilleux endroit à proximité de tout: U-bahn, restaurants et Mitte est à distance de marche.<br/>Confortable et bien équipé.<br/>Je recommande ce logement sans aucune hésitation.",1,-0.128,Negative
69.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,49,100.0,0,10.064146455000754,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,955082401023164554,"I had an amazing stay at this Airbnb! The place was exactly as described — clean, stylish, and very comfortable. The host was incredibly welcoming and quick to respond to any questions, which made the whole experience smooth and stress-free.<br/>The location was perfect — close to everything I needed, but still quiet enough to relax at the end of the day<br/>I would definitely recommend this place to anyone visiting the area, and I’d be happy to stay here again in the future",1,0.9776,Positive
