104.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,20,100.0,0,9.176809249799454,4.47,4.5,4.72,4.39,44776173,Alles hat gut geklappt. Der flexible Check In war besonders gut.,1,-0.4588,Negative
55.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,9,100.0,1,3.1678863275056317,4.71,4.54,4.78,4.67,6123610,"Thomas was an amazing host: I wasn't able to see him the first night I stayed but the second night we had a jovial time together drinking some pilsners. Thomas is insanely responsive and super proactive, and he made expectations clear as soon as we met. His apartment is really lovely, with a great kitchen and bathroom, and the room itself was spotless. The balcony was a wonderful start and end to every day that I was there. Also, the apartment is situated super-conveniently by a couple of cute cafes (Frau Kruger, Sveda, and WIM, to name a few) and is only a 10-ish minute walk to Schonhauser allee and a 15-20 minute walk to either Gesundbrunnen or Volaltstrasse for quick access to all that the city has to offer via U or S Bahns. On top of all this, Mauerpark is only two blocks away, which has a really fun Flohmarkt on Sundays. Overall, incredible host, incredible apartment, and incredible location :-)",1,0.9949,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,0,6.047540787328081,4.29,4.29,4.86,4.57,22883174,"quick reply , good location , too safe , clean, good value .. definetely worth to stay",1,0.9287,Positive
125.0,1,1.0,1.0,2.0,37,93.0,0,1.880121251500648,4.73,4.75,4.5,4.38,1073155876800387912,"Overall this place was quite good. One significant drawback is that some areas of the building would consistently reek of fish or trash. This included in the hallway on the 10th floor and in my room despite having neither fish nor trash in the room. The location is not exactly ideal but you have reasonable access to U and S Bahn, and arrival from the airport is very easy.",1,0.59,Positive
