218.0,10,2.0,2.0,3.0,30,100.0,1,7.873335866340157,4.85,4.81,4.57,4.78,19794276,"Jan ist eine sehr nette und freundliche Person, er hat uns immer schnell auf unsere Nachrichten geantwortet. In der Zeit in der wir dort waren, konnten wir schnell die Fragen persönlich klären.<br/>Wir werden uns die Unterkunft merken und werden wieder kommen.",0,-0.8316,Negative
80.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,90.0,0,1.4716913138627066,4.89,4.88,4.96,4.83,13593823,"What a lovely neighbor! There are so many great restaurants and cafes around, and easy access to a couple of tram lines. Susan is a wonderful host who is very friendly and with a good sense of humor. She was very helpful in providing suggestions and obviously loves her neighbor and city. I would certainly stay again. For any food lovers, the Indonesian restaurant a few blocks away was wonderful, both food and ambiance.<br/>PS. The two cats that were there while I stayed were a delight, so affectionate!",1,0.9931,Positive
