133.0,2,2.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,3.954294565085237,5.0,4.83,4.83,4.83,1209247593123324051,Loved it. Would stay again anytime,1,0.5994,Positive
125.0,4,3.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,0,7.7002207293882,4.96,4.86,4.93,4.93,29276268,"My family and I had the best time staying at Marie and Sasha’s apartment. The apartment itself is absolutely gorgeous and in an amazing location. There are a ton of great restaurants, grocery stores, and lots of other shops nearby, and the bus stop and train station are only a walk away, too. Thanks to the great amenities available, everything from breakfast to dinner is a joy to make “at home”, and the apartment’s spaciousness makes a relaxed family night in a great opportunity to take a break from touring the city. One of the best parts about this stay is that Marie and Sasha are such kind and accommodating hosts. They are very helpful with all the questions you might have (about where to park your car or dinner recommendations, for example) and they respond very quickly to messages. We couldn’t have asked for a better stay in Berlin, and I really really hope we will be able to come back very soon! Thanks Marie and Sasha. :)",1,0.9958,Positive
140.0,6,2.0,1.0,5.0,49,100.0,1,2.43464121697615,4.72,4.88,4.83,4.55,243081,"Not a great experience, we found out once we arrived that the shower was not working. We had to stay in the flat until 11 am the next day because the plumber was coming to fix it. We stayed 3 days and the shower never worked. We were charged extra for blankets and towels even after having this issue with the bathroom. Not recommended.",0,-0.6894,Negative
113.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,98.0,1,1.0001956178666358,4.83,4.91,4.96,4.78,127708,Cute place at super central location,1,0.7845,Positive
253.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,56,100.0,1,1.6793067436589162,4.82,4.84,4.98,4.65,35911615,"Nina's place is in a perfect location. Close to the tram and the U-bahn stop. The flat was sparkling clean and very spacious. The two bedrooms are on the opposite ends of the flat so everyone gets their privacy. <br/>The courtyard was silent and on the furthest end from the street. The neighborhood is very family friendly and beautiful. We loved to go home there every day. And in the mornings we couldn't wait to have some yummy breakfast at the bakery next door. <br/>Nina is an amazing host, she always answered to the messages in an hour and was very friendly. I can only recommend her and her place to stay in.",0,0.9847,Positive
64.0,2,2.0,1.0,2.0,22,100.0,0,3.158943186526161,4.58,4.51,4.72,4.62,19406486,"Andrzej is a great host. Both kitchen and bathroom were quite clean. Each of us was given a towel and separate duvets. Andrzej is very communicative, kind and caring. It was quite easy to get to the center either by tram or metro. We'd definitely recommend staying at Andrzej's place!",1,0.9707,Positive
121.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,27,100.0,0,4.472653939309849,4.88,4.9,4.81,4.78,10122398,"I've booked  Martin's appartment for my brother and when i cheked It, i was So jalous that i'm not part of it! It's a nice clean place, nice welcoming from Martin and lot of attentions. Everything was good organized, There is even litl cities plan and The area is very quiet and perfect for to Make a complete touristic tour and to relax.<br/>I rocommande Martin's place With no hesitation.<br/>Thank You for everything and see You soon! Cheers. ",1,0.9615,Positive
78.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,34,100.0,0,13.1107263821009,4.62,4.46,4.63,4.56,846747833403837793,"Great bed with comfy matress and pillows. Quiet and peaceful. Gihad was very kind and stayed up late to receive us. Wifi, chocolates, water and instructions for transit provided. Highly recommend for a good night's rest before heading to the airport.",1,0.9513,Positive
98.0,2,1.0,1.0,0.0,26,100.0,0,9.870114132926757,4.71,4.71,4.69,4.53,1133054564781533769,"Im rahmen des Berlin Marathons in Anthonys Unterkunft genächtigt. <br/>Alles war sehr gut, der Check in einwandfrei, gute Anbindung durch Bus Station direkt in unmittelbarer Nähe. <br/>Einige Restaurants in direkter Umgebung der Unterkunft. <br/>Für jemand der Berlin erkunden möchte, eine sehr gute Unterkunftsoption.",1,-0.5994,Negative
