30.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,80.0,0,19.45903731603653,4.71,4.56,4.72,4.79,2682379,"Dagmar's home is in a quite neighbourhood, 10mins walk takes you to the local supermarket and the Sbahn. A bus stop is a 4min walk away. Room was clean, tidy and the bed comfortable. I didn't get to talk much with Dagmar as our schedules clashed but found her to be friendly and her English is great. If you get a chance to taste her home made elderberry jam then do so, it's delicious. Julia the cat is a little shy at first but friendly.",1,0.9765,Positive
