95.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,1,3.2655381260982392,4.91,4.87,4.87,4.82,456902,"A fantastic, stylish space in Berlin! Both my girlfriend and I were impressed with Stefan's apartment. We loved the ""loft bedroom"" space and the arched, high ceilings, plus the neighborhood was both quiet and quite central to everything we wanted to see in the city. Highly recommended.",1,0.9183,Positive
