80.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,0,14.740259241210865,4.74,4.77,4.57,4.68,14619469,"Дом расположен в тихой окраине города, до электрички пешком 10 минут, до автобусной остановки минут 5, хозяйка очень гостеприимная, выручила нас с едой (спасибо ей за это), были все базовые удобства и даже больше. В доме очень уютно и тепло,есть настольные игры, информационные буклеты, нет телевизора. По обеспеченности бытовыми удобствами это была лучшая квартира из всех, что снимали))",1,0.0,Neutral
146.0,4,2.0,2.0,3.0,51,100.0,0,11.602298556223351,4.94,5.0,4.81,4.88,908750684546690534,"Eine Wohnung zum Verlieben! Wunderschön, groß, sauber, in ruhiger Lage. Mit einem Spielzimmer für die Kinder und mit Spielplatz im Innenhof. Parkplätze vorhanden. Einkaufsmöglichkeiten in der Nähe. Sehr freundliche Vermieterin! <br/>Wir kommen sehr gerne wieder!",0,-0.3769,Negative
190.0,7,2.0,1.0,6.0,54,100.0,1,6.734576372312171,4.74,4.73,4.83,4.52,24639361,"We had a wonderful 3 week stay in Berlin. The apartment looked great, we had everything we needed in it. The location was nice, close to supermarkets and restaurants. <br/>Also the communication with Sören was great, he's very nice and we will definetly stay here again when we come back to Berlin!",0,0.9571,Positive
68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,0,13.726146405400865,4.94,4.97,4.91,4.86,1648222,I stayed at Maria's place while I visited Berlin for a conference. It was easy to communicate with her over WhatsApp and she was prompt in her responses. The building itself is old but the apartment is quite convenient and spacious. It was close to the venue of my conference but is 30 mins away (using public transportation) from Berlin landmarks such as the Brandenburg Gate. Overall I had a very comfortable albeit brief stay while I was there. I would definitely recommend her place. Do keep in mind that guests have access to a half bath (exclusive) but have to share the shower area with the host. Wasn't a big deal for me but it could be for some people.,1,0.9472,Positive
141.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,43,94.0,0,7.131273504704622,4.74,4.82,4.79,4.62,49070135,"Der Aufenthalt war sehr gut. Sehr schönes Zimmer mit allem, was man braucht.  Auch Extras wie Föhn, Kaffeemaschine, Kühlschrank und man hat die Möglichkeit sich frische Handtücher zu holen. <br/>Das einzige, was fehlte, war eine Toilette im Erdgeschoss, die man auch nach Check-out benutzen könnte.",1,-0.9485,Negative
114.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,1,4.105161338425043,4.86,4.77,4.88,4.71,48732044,"Die Kommunikation mit dem Gastgeber lief einwandfrei. Änderungen wurden uns schnell mitgeteilt und es wurde Rücksicht auf individuelle Wünsche genommen. <br/>Die Wohnung war zwar klein, aber vollkommen ausreichend und gut ausgestattet sowie eingerichtet.<br/>Für einen Kurztrip in die Hauptstadt war es eine schöne Unterkunft in guter Lage.",1,-0.9485,Negative
106.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,1,4.255037723745734,4.87,4.86,4.88,4.75,42486058,I had a great visit and felt very comfortable to the point that I just wanted to go to the store and buy food and cooked breakfast and dinner easily in the beautiful kitchen! The bed was very comfortable and the check in was hassle free and easy! I felt right at home and did not have any trouble finding what I needed. <br/>I will definitely be staying again if I’m in the area.,1,0.9823,Positive
90.0,6,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,0,6.400823146055228,4.52,4.37,4.72,4.42,27512181,Really good hospitalityand response time! Definitely would stay again,1,0.7339,Positive
95.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,1.6515574378115223,4.87,4.9,4.87,4.76,20138119,"This  apartment is in a good location, very handy for all transport options or 15/20 minutes walk to Alexander Platz. But the big bonus is the garden at this time of year. Very rare to get more than a balcony in Berlin.",1,0.7717,Positive
418.0,13,6.0,2.0,6.0,42,100.0,1,6.44421921589432,4.76,4.69,4.82,4.59,9273023,"Thank you for a lovely stay. All my friends loved the apartment. Whilst it accommodates 13, we all felt like there was a lot of space given the size. All rooms were tastefully done.",0,0.9413,Positive
