80.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,41,100.0,1,3.915872498754315,4.72,4.65,4.76,4.6,26676986,"This place is great and it was much roomier than we expected. Check in was super easy and Bettina was incredibly hospitable, she printed off our boarding passes! What a gem. Location is great too with most things you need nearby, especially food, and using transportation was incredibly easy. We loved our stay and would definitely recommend it.",1,0.9809,Positive
128.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,61,100.0,1,4.880214568244147,4.95,4.99,4.9,4.88,24423970,"Sehr privater Aufenthalt mit viel Ruhe vom Trubel. Für einen kurzen Aufenthalt gerade für Konzerte dank der Nähe zur Venue perfekt. Alles da, was man brauchte und mehr (Pflege- und Hygieneprodukte). Tolle Kaffeemaschine, entspannender Balkon, ästhetische Einrichtung - kann man nicht meckern! ;)",1,0.2942,Positive
