40.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,0,11.510752074617004,4.8,4.7,4.9,4.75,29851651,"I'm so happy I found this place! Staying at Katja's spooky place was  a unique experience and had a special vibe, Katja was super nice and attentive, and we became friends very fast. <br/>Her place is near the bus station and the U bahn just a few minutes walking in the really peaceful neighbourhood.  I also saw a restaurant right around the corner but never had the chance to visit. <br/>I had a great time in Berlin during my time at Katja's house and although a bit spooky sometimes, the spooky atmosphere had also a peaceful feeling to it. <br/>I wouldn't recommend it to non- friendly and polite people though ;)",1,0.9783,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,0,12.661512713262104,4.77,4.83,4.84,4.68,10829319,"Nice spacious apartment, perfect communication before and during the stay. Everything as advertised.",1,0.7579,Positive
