367.0,9,4.0,2.0,6.0,49,100.0,1,1.4858688200848127,4.71,4.76,4.87,4.75,1119367077207791656,"Great place to stay in. Very well located, close to a U Bahn station and many restaurants, museums. ruslan was a great guest, he provided us with excellent recommendations and showed great interest and care on us being comfortable (family of five with more than enough space). Highly  recommended!",0,0.9838,Positive
