157.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,0,2.2903095637922317,4.92,4.89,4.86,4.76,267764,"Mit drei Mädels haben wir uns sehr wohlgefühlt in der Wohnung!<br/>Ein tolles, schlichtes Design, große Küche sowie ein großes Badezimmer. <br/>Die Lage war einfach grandios! Mitten im ""Berliner Leben"", U Bahn direkt vor der Tür, Torstraße nur 10 Minuten zu Fuß, Hauptbahnhof in der Nähe und zahlreiche Coffeeshops rundherum. Klasse!",1,-0.6981,Negative
115.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,0.0,0,5.318561264477916,4.88,4.88,5.0,4.75,622990953844019427,"We stayed for 13 nights and had a wonderful experience. The apartment was very clean and comfortable; we truly felt at home. The owner, Francesca, was very responsive and helpful and provided us a smooth transaction. Highly recommend. 10/10.",1,0.9675,Positive
163.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,45,90.0,1,11.510851452846596,4.73,4.69,4.85,4.62,699825408397228433,Super Unterkunft!,1,0.636,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,0,3.036276112691593,4.74,4.9,4.75,4.69,2981102,"We had a nice stay in Gabriele's appartement. It's very comfy, well located and good described on the airbnb site. <br/>Gabriele was very kind and gave us good information about the surroundings.<br/>It was a pity that the Check-in time and the Check-out time were held very strictly, the more because we had an early time of arrival en we flew back in the evening. Check in at exactly 16.00 and check-out at exactly 11.00. It felt a bit as a hotel.  ",1,0.9095,Positive
42.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,10,100.0,1,12.03040644278449,4.82,4.84,4.71,4.82,32296033,Buen alojamiento,1,0.0,Neutral
100.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,41,100.0,1,1.9469096234802603,4.85,4.92,4.91,4.75,408756,"This apartment/flat is exactly the way the pictures show.   I had stayed in several other Airbnb during my trip and this place was the best.   The beds were very comfortable and the furniture was nice and sturdy.   It does have a small refrigerator but we only needed it for breakfast foods.   One of the bedrooms is small but the master bedroom was big enough to handle all our suitcases.   We were five and never ran out of hot water for our showers.   I will definitely stay there again,  I really felt at home while staying in this apartment.   Thank you so much Bjorn for allowing us to stay in your beautiful, comfortable and airy flat.",1,0.9745,Positive
161.0,6,1.0,1.0,3.0,45,100.0,1,1.6592287277224604,4.9,4.94,4.93,4.7,39663747,"Super unkomplizierter Check In und einfache Kommunikation mit den Vermietern.<br/>Ist gut an die Öffis angebunden über die U2 oder die Straßenbahnen. Bettbezüge, Handtücher, Kaffee, Spülmachinentabs etc wurden gestellt.<br/>Besonders gut fanden wir den Gepäckraum, in dem man auch vor und nach Inbezugnahme sein Gepäck unterstellen konnte.",1,-0.8316,Negative
101.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,0,4.929820420309423,4.77,4.73,4.77,4.64,488161,"Heinrich’s place was great, looked much bigger and nicer than the photos do it justice!<br/>We were initially a bit unsure about check in as we hadn’t had a response but and Thiele responded with 24 hours to go so we had plenty of time - she kindly let us drop our bags off early too.<br/>The place was very clean, although we think possibly quite dusty as our allergies were triggered in the flat - it’s a big flat though so difficult to manage this!<br/>Overall loved our stay - lovely flat, great location so close to transport links into Berlin, thanks ☺️",1,0.9816,Positive
78.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,100.0,1,2.4775921091657027,4.92,4.91,4.95,4.88,1172856,...,1,0.0,Neutral
