182.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,55,100.0,0,11.902401639707117,4.57,4.07,4.71,4.43,723205828710553527,"The house felt comfortable and lived in.<br/>It a unique vibe to it with many minor quirks,  and the most comfortable, soft bed I have slept in in any Airbnb.",1,0.765,Positive
125.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,7,100.0,0,4.174317452961176,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,4505069,"My wife and I stayed at Stefanie’s home in May 2015 with our 5 year old daughter. The flat is very nice and bright, with high ceilings and spacious rooms. Everything was clean and tidy. The flat has all the comfort and it’s very well equipped. We would recommend it for everyone and especially for families with children; Stefanie’s sons room is really wonderful: it’s very large and full of beautiful games. The flat is located in a quiet and very convenient area for visiting the center; the metro and the tramways are just around the corner and in five metro stops  you can reach the famous square Alexanderplatz, in the heart of Berlin.<br/>Stafanie was always available and nice. At the end we would really recommend  this solution for your stay in Berlin!<br/>",1,0.9843,Positive
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,1,5.273029847580318,4.81,4.88,4.77,4.67,823653217890074888,"Capucine was very nice and helpful. She assisted us with our check-in even it was late after midnight.<br/>The place is right next to Hermanstrase which is full of Turkish food shops and restaurants. Aldi supermarket is very near also. <br/>Apartment is 10 minutes away from S and U bahn stations. <br/>Its very cosy place, clean and full of art accessories. Not to mention the vinyl player and especially Bob Marley’s vinyl, a perfect addition to the atmosphere :)",1,0.9415,Positive
91.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,39,100.0,1,7.548749049597583,4.75,4.64,4.56,4.76,51168783,"we loved our stay! the recommendations were great. it’s a little out of the center of things, which makes it very peaceful, but still accessible. very good value and beautiful place. will definitely come back if i ever return to berlin.",1,0.9757,Positive
