112.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,1,3.5872254876023093,4.58,4.75,4.67,4.46,744264,"highly recommended! Daniele's apartment is spacious, clean, accommodating and well decorated in a rustic style. the accommodation is located in Kreuzberg and is in good distance of many things. we rented bikes during the week and there was a shared rear courtyard where we were able to keep these locked up when not in uyse. we would happily stay here again.",1,0.9335,Positive
