95.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,1,3.907468030579391,4.72,4.83,4.9,4.6,20943832,"This is a gem in a great location in Berlin. Great proximity to all things central, and smooth to go east for a night out thanks to the metro and the tram. The neighborhood itself is quiet and clean. Would definitely recommend staying at Naomi's place. Naomi is quick to respond and always gave satisfactory help whenever needed :)",1,0.9781,Positive
