310.0,8,3.0,2.0,5.0,36,100.0,1,1.1533241862111263,4.97,4.85,4.91,4.79,1353597224828612454,"My family and I had a wonderful stay at Joshua's place. The apartment was spotless, spacious, beautifully presented and amenity wise had all we needed in it. The location was fab - close to the u bahn, restaurants, cafes and felt very safe to walk around. Joshua was very helpful, quick to respond, provided clear instructions and also some great local recommendations, quite a few of which we used. I would highly recommend this air bnb to anyone who's looking for somewhere to stay in Berlin. Thank you Joshua!",0,0.985,Positive
115.0,8,1.0,1.0,3.0,32,100.0,0,2.978770363505488,4.85,4.82,4.81,4.69,44438078,"Super Kontakt mit Dusan, stets freundlich und prompt. Die Wohnung war sauber und passte zu unseren Bedürfnissen. Tolle Lage und v. a. vielfältige Gastronomie drumherum. Wir waren top zufrieden!",1,-0.5255,Negative
55.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,0,3.610177521743595,5.0,5.0,4.85,5.0,40446532,"Kay was genuinely the most wonderful host I have ever had on Airbnb and it was an absolute pleasure to stay with her. She was so friendly, hospitable and understanding, and went so far out of her way to make me feel welcome, including buying me a pack of gluten free pasta when she found out I was celiac. The apartment is also very clean and comfortable and in a fantastic neighbourhood of Berlin. Theo (Kay’s dog) also gets a special mention. I could not recommend staying here highly enough!",1,0.9836,Positive
