225.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,39,90.0,0,8.669406985601938,4.87,4.77,4.89,4.72,742211,We found ourselfs in a cozy penthouse under the night sky of berlin. We had a fantastic view into the night sky. The appartment is bright and perfect if you travel as two. All the requiered things like towels are avialable and free for use. The next train station isn't that far away (5 minutes foot walk maximum) which leads you within 20. minutes to the core of Berlin. Next to the trainstation you'll find a huge shopping mall makes this appartment a very good spot for your stay in  Berlin. <br/>The shower and the huge round bead were our highlight for the last couple of days. We enjoyed it!,1,0.9814,Positive
66.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,59,100.0,1,1.380992878539565,5.0,5.0,4.96,4.96,1373200759574432027,"Habe mich bei Ben direkt wohlgefühlt. Tolle Unterkunft in super Lage, mitten in Berlin und trotzdem angenehm ruhig. Besonders praktisch fand ich, dass Waschmaschine und Trockner mitbenutzt werden können, ein echtes Plus. Und der Volkspark direkt gegenüber war bei schönem Frühlingswetter ideal für eine Joggingrunde. Danke für den schönen Aufenthalt!",1,0.5707,Positive
