138.0,6,1.0,1.0,3.0,20,97.0,0,3.94612941831519,4.5,4.5,5.0,4.5,1282536257467127760,Good location with easy tram access and trains close by. Building looks a bit worn from the outside but inside is new enough. Apartment is ground floor but private as it's not exposed to the streets only to the courtyard. Cleanliness overall was good except the beds made some of us itchy. Beds were all doubles so lots of room but could be better in terms of comfortability. We didn't make use of the kitchen but all basics were there. Washing machine had some hair from previous wash which should have been cleaned out. An extra key would be handy. Overall good stay and recommended.,1,0.9291,Positive
