112.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,1,1.850891633131909,4.81,4.71,4.95,4.72,1205350,"Wir haben unsere Zeit bei Martina sehr genossen. Die Wohnung sieht besser aus als auf den Fotos! Das Bett ist hat eine sehr gute Matratze, die Küche hat alles was man braucht und die Wohnung ist sehr gemütlich und individuell eingerichtet. Die Lage ist wirklich klasse und wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt. Martina war super hilfreich und flexibel, so dass wir am liebsten dort geblieben wären. Wenn wir das nächste Mal in Berlin sind, kommen wir auf jeden Fall wieder. Danke :)",1,-0.9312,Negative
151.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,52,100.0,1,8.281883245071777,4.92,4.96,4.78,4.82,5281256,The apartment is as described and shown in pictures. The location is very central. I would definitely stay again.,1,0.4522,Positive
113.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,1.690089732558581,4.95,4.95,4.82,4.84,45338556,"Firstly, I want to say what a fantastic host Wibke was. Communication was great and he always had recommendations for us. Very responsive and proactive in given us details before we even thought of them ourselves - so we could tell he had our comfort in mind during our stay.<br/>The apartment is very easy to access and feels safe. The privacy is also very good, with no other apartments looking directly into the room. <br/>As for the location I felt it couldn’t have been better! Whether you want to try the many bars and restaurants in Kreuzberg or the world famous nightclubs a short walk away you can have it here.<br/>I’d happily recommend it to anyone :)",1,0.988,Positive
