82.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,3.929915771235159,4.89,4.9,4.96,4.86,20660494,"Enjoyed this place. Quiet and cozy. Wish we knew it was in the basement, a bit more humid than we would expect.  Bed was nice and comfortable. Liked multicultural area with all kind of food places. A specially fresh market  around the corner! Easy and close access to public transportation. Overall we were satisfied!",1,0.9701,Positive
114.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,96.0,1,3.789208338034772,4.84,4.86,4.88,4.74,25970203,"Unfortunately my family and I did not have the pleasure to meet you Julian but we had the pleasure to meet your father Hans who was an outstanding host. Julian’s place has a great location, close to mass transportation. Safe neighborhood, the apartment is very cozy, clean. We loved Berlin and hoped we can come back soon and of course stay at you place again.. until next time.",1,0.9751,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,45,100.0,0,3.906984458543533,4.81,4.76,4.68,4.75,19964747,"Nice place near public transportation for easy access into the city center. The place was clean and comfortable, Samir was a great host with quick and easy communication. There is a supermarket right across the street which is useful if you're staying here for a longer period of time. No issues whatsoever, everything was smooth - recommended!",1,0.9661,Positive
