64.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,0,2.0071332334698857,4.72,4.56,4.94,4.67,715728,"We hugely enjoyed our stay in April's lovely, stylish, spacious apartment. It was the perfect size for our family of three, and had the charming feel of a beautifully cared for home. April was, throughout, a most considerate, generous and courteous host, always on hand for any enquiries we had during our booking and stay. She made sure everything was in place in her daughter's room for our 18 month old - cot, toys and lots of thoughtful touches besides. The apartment is in the perfect location - really, it couldn't be bettered - for exploring Mitte's cafes, restaurants, culture and history, and it's very handy for Rosenthaler Platz and other transport links. There are also plenty of great shops nearby as well as playgrounds and pools for kids. We really have no fault to find - we spent a month in the apartment and would very happily have stayed longer! Thoroughly recommended. ",1,0.994,Positive
