125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,0,2.559692009773911,4.99,5.0,4.99,4.93,23442676,"The apartment could not be better located for sight-seeing in Berlin, and with the new U5 U-Bahn line it takes less than 10 minutes from the Hauptbahnhof.  <br/>Wonderful views along Unter den Linden.   The sound- proofing windows ensure the apartment is very quiet.     Excellent home cinema system, extremely comfortable sofa and bed.  <br/>Perfect.  We hope to stay there again some day.",1,0.8925,Positive
180.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,45,85.0,0,1.5095289909770313,4.75,4.84,4.9,4.6,45475252,"Great location, close enough to popular sites but not close enough that it’s always loud/busy. Contactless check in and out was super easy and convenient. But when you do need help, they are very responsive and very helpful! I really recommend this place!",1,0.9844,Positive
140.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,91.0,0,4.871252294318258,4.72,4.78,4.85,4.58,46812239,The room was great! close to one of Berlin's most lively squares. The check-in and check-out were seamless. I would definitely stay here again.,1,0.883,Positive
