81.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,6.919397234051426,4.82,4.86,4.48,4.7,20890869,"The flat is great if you are visiting Berlin. The hosts were great, friendly and provided local information. The location is ideal - it is in a quiet area, close to a large supermarket, and within walking distance (30/40 minutes) of some of the cities main attractions. Alternatively, the tube is within 10 minutes walk.\<br/>I would highly recommend the flat for anyone looking to visit Berlin.",1,0.9657,Positive
