154.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,41,100.0,1,1.8346218212204348,4.73,4.83,4.94,4.55,36754449,"Really nice, very well presented, well kept. <br/>The shower could have a bit better as the over shower head seemed either broken or there was a pressure issue. The other shower head worked perfectly fine, though.<br/>There was no iron in the room either.<br/>But I’d still give the hotel 9/10 for the price and location and would definitely recommend.",1,0.9326,Positive
