172.0,8,2.0,1.0,4.0,31,100.0,1,2.87994778280774,4.8,4.75,4.88,4.73,30295,"The apartment was ideal for me and 7 others as it was incredibly spacious and flexible with sleeping arrangements. Furthermore the location is superb as it's only a few stops on the tram into Mitte and loads of local restaurants and bars a short walk away.<br/><br/>Michele was a perfect host! Easily contactable, with quick responses both via phone and in person.  He ensured my stay here was highly enjoyable and problem free. I thoroughly recommend Michele's lovely apartment! ",0,0.9779,Positive
