50.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,1,6.491214895364259,4.93,4.97,4.92,4.9,37847588,"J'ai passé un très bon séjour chez Gabriele. Ils sont tous les deux très gentil et arrangeant. La maison est située dans un petit quartier agréable, elle est proche du métro et d'un supermarché. Les hôtes sont toujours là pour vous aider. Merci beaucoup",1,0.0,Neutral
173.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,57,100.0,1,6.93795828166316,4.65,4.63,4.63,4.55,2485124,"Wir wurden sehr nett von Sebastian empfangen, welcher uns das wichtigste über die Wohnung sowie die Umgebung mitgeteilt hat. Unter anderem hat er uns das ""Cafe Hubert"" empfohlen. Dort habe ich die besten French Toasts meines Lebens gegessen - sehr empfehlenswert. Des Weiteren hat es divere Cafés und Einkaufsmöglichkeiten - wie beispielsweise den ""Edeka Schatz"" - direkt um die Ecke. Dadurch kann man problemlos zu Fuß einkaufen gehen.<br/>Die Wohnung an sich ist schlicht gehalten, funktional und ruhig gelegen. Für 4 Personen ist sie ideal. Die Betten, die Küche sowie das Bad waren sauber.<br/>Auch die Anbindung zu den öffentlichen Verkehrsmitteln ist optimal. Man ist innerhalb kürzester Zeit - maximal 10 bis 20 Minuten - im Herzen von Berlin.<br/>Zudem hat die Kommunikation mit Sebastian vor sowie während unserem Aufenthalt super funktioniert!<br/>Fazit: Wir hatten einen sehr schönen Aufenthalt in Berlin. Dies können wir auch Sebastian verdanken. Wir können ihn uneingeschränkt weiterempfehlen!",1,-0.9808,Negative
125.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,33,100.0,0,11.149058041475955,4.42,4.75,4.42,4.83,900897125768291360,"Appartement war sehr schön! <br/>Viel Platz, recht gut ausgestattete Küche und echt ruhige und schöne Lage!<br/>Leider kein Lift - aber das wussten wir im Vorhinein und war kein Problem für uns. <br/>Fußweg ca 30 Minuten zum Kurfürstendamm - was auch sehr toll war, da wir nicht jeden Tag ein Ubahn-Ticket brauchten!<br/>Nette Vermieter und gute Kommunikation!",1,-0.9483,Negative
165.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,49,100.0,1,1.9500965745313548,4.91,4.89,4.97,4.82,1915904,"Adrian's place was incredible. It's brilliantly located, close to transport and a supermarket as well as some great restaurants. He was a great host, check-in was super smooth, the apartment is superb and the roof terrace was great (watching the sun go down over Prenzlauer Berg and the stars come out is an experience you have to try at least once in your life!). I'd highly recommend his place to anyone looking for somewhere great in one of Berlin's best spots.",1,0.9904,Positive
84.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,99.0,0,4.419444752873446,4.6,4.53,4.47,4.3,35107959,"The host is great, with good communication and answers and clear instructions. <br/>The apartment is very clean and has all the amenities you need. It’s small but that’s good if you’re looking to explore the city more!<br/>However it’s located on the first floor so people walk by outside which in case you don’t want them to look right in means you’d have the curtains closed a lot, and that makes it feel a bit claustrophobic. <br/>And the area was cool and only a short walk to some bars. The area was a bit sketchy. <br/>Our overall stay at Stella’s place was nice  and we didn’t feel short of anything.",1,0.9555,Positive
125.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,41,100.0,0,12.667026107263917,4.9,4.8,4.8,4.9,909527058663796716,"Sehr schöne, gemütliche und saubere Wohnung! Florian ist ein netter Gastgeber, der immer schnell auf unsere Anfragen eingegangen ist. Wir werden die Wohnung weiter empfehlen!",1,-0.6688,Negative
69.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,45,100.0,1,2.535435603225288,5.0,5.0,4.88,4.97,21075607,"Paulo y Guido son unos host impresionantes. El lugar es hermoso y bien ubicado, muchísimo mejor que en las fotos. Llegar allí es muy fácil desde cualquier lugar. Fue una experiencia maravillosa conocer Berlin con el consejo de ellos dos. Ame este lugar. Super recomendado!",1,0.636,Positive
155.0,7,2.0,1.0,6.0,43,96.0,0,6.1770612336798365,4.41,4.27,4.78,4.31,27018620,"Great location next to Ostkreuz station direct from the airport, great facilities, really friendly interactions between the owner, overall fantastic experience",0,0.9459,Positive
95.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,1,3.2655381260982392,4.91,4.87,4.87,4.82,456902,"The appartement is located in a peacefull and yet central neighborhood, and is stylish and cosey. Stefan is a great host and very flexible. Will definitely recommend it and stay there myself next time in Berlin",1,0.8947,Positive
239.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,30,88.0,0,3.686748663714778,4.43,4.61,4.79,4.15,957737492041138566,"Perfect location near the Brandenburg gate. An easy walk to Checkpoint Charlie, Potsdamer Platz, the Reichstag and about 20 mins from the Berlin Hauptbanhof. Plenty of restaurants nearby. The apartment is very comfortable and has elevator access. All the amenities were as listed. The only addition that would be helpful is some washing powder given one of the reasons for choosing an AirBnB over a hotel is the ability to do laundry. A nearby supermarket soon had that problem sorted.<br/>We arrived after the office closed but the access instructions were very clear and we had no problems getting in.<br/>Berlin is expensive and the apartment is not cheap but I would recommend it for it's location and comfort.",1,0.883,Positive
72.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,3.181843413007727,4.9,4.77,4.85,4.61,826681294814740063,"Nos sentimos muy cómodos en el alojamiento de Gillian y Tarek. La habitación es amplia, tal como se indica en las fotos. Está muy cerca de la East Side Gallery y tiene excelente conexión con distintas zonas a través del transporte público. Gillian y Tarek son muy atentos y respondieron rápidamente a nuestras consultas.",1,0.0,Neutral
123.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,2.036088585204626,4.88,4.86,4.98,4.79,919931,"This was my first Airbnb experience and I was not disappointed! <br/>Verda was easy to be in touch with and extremely welcoming when I checked in - Thank you for the lollies and beer on arrival.<br/>She also went above and beyond to make sure contact me during my stay to make sure I was happy and if there was anything she could do. <br/>The place is unique - great for a long or short stay ideally located close to transport for the travellers who want to take in all Berlin has to offer. If you are a coffee connoisseur...there are plenty of cafes to choose from :)<br/>Highly recommend this place if you are traveling to Berlin! And the next time I return, I will definitely be staying here. ⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️",1,0.9841,Positive
125.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,1,2.540873406232533,4.67,4.75,4.83,4.55,243063,"Wir waren mit der Wohnung sehr zufrieden. Sie war sauber, die Betten waren bei unserer Ankunft schon bezogen und bei Fragen stand uns Anna immer zur Verfügung. Alle Fragen wurden umgehend beantwortet. Das Zentrum sowie alle öffentlichen Verkehrsmittel kann man zu Fuß gut erreichen. Wir haben uns sehr wohlgefühlt. Freuen uns schon auf unseren nächsten Urlaub in Berlin?",1,-0.8316,Negative
134.0,4,0.0,1.0,3.0,52,99.0,1,3.704407774530013,4.63,4.77,4.8,4.46,30515176,"Centrally located, very close to central train station and 15-30 minute walk to lots of restaurants and bars. Very quiet neighborhood and clean apartment as described. Highly recommend!",1,0.6989,Positive
56.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,5.179021895059785,4.9,4.95,4.89,4.77,27397593,"Ich hatte einen tollen Aufenthalt bei Olga. Sie ist sehr freundlich, respektvoll und hilfsbereit. Die Kommunikation mit ihr lief super! Zudem war ihre Wohnung unglaublich sauber, wie in einem Hotel. <br/>Als einziges Manko muss ich anmerken, dass das Haus sehr hellhörig ist, was nicht optimal ist für Leichtschläfer*innen wie mich. <br/>Im Großen und Ganzen kann ich diese Unterkunft aber sehr empfehlen!",1,-0.4559,Negative
44.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,28,99.0,0,1.5462841842625876,4.63,4.69,4.62,4.62,1564917,Les gens sont très gentils!! Ils répondent toujours toutes nos questions :) <br/>Je recommande cet hostel! ,1,0.5962,Positive
95.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,0,0.7915420818247044,4.76,4.6,4.91,4.68,20205689,"Tolles airbnb, sehr zentral gelegen!",1,0.0,Neutral
137.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,1,3.2252377063559527,4.8,4.79,4.86,4.63,27120196,"Wirklich sehr nette Location, gute Anbindung und ruhige Lage, mit vielen Einkaufsmöglichkeiten und Restaurants.",1,0.0,Neutral
275.0,8,3.0,2.0,6.0,59,100.0,1,8.58407439041072,4.78,4.75,4.68,4.68,11643878,"Soren’s place was amazing!!! We are a family of 5 (parents, two teenage children and a grandfather) and we all had our own incredibly big and comfortable rooms with beautiful beds. Better than ours at home!!! The bathrooms were excellent and so were the kitchens. The location is perfect - very close to public transport which is a very quick trip into Berlin. The train is an easy way to get from the airport to the accommodation. There are also lovely places to eat nearby that serve delicious food and have a non-touristy feel. We had Thai and Italian - best lasagne ever! There is also a supermarket that is about a 3 minute walk away. I would definitely stay there again and would highly recommend it to my friends.<br/>Karyn from Australia",0,0.9922,Positive
57.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,23,100.0,0,13.39399800179539,4.54,4.56,4.68,4.48,17863035,房间很好，位置也很好，但是窗户让我觉得不够坚固，外面路上有人经过时让我没有安全感,1,0.0,Neutral
105.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,45,100.0,1,12.354937460642866,4.91,4.91,4.58,4.8,35818662,"Great location. Detlef is a great host who met us at the door and gave us a tour of the house. Provided many necessities. The house was exactly as shown on the listing and Detlef provided easy guides that included easy connection to the WiFi, instructions for the appliances and how to use the public transportation system. Detlef was very attentive and checked in to make sure everything was working. Would stay again.",1,0.946,Positive
48.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,0,4.230279756706139,4.76,4.76,4.48,4.74,31006339,Der Aufenthalt war sehr gut und das flexible Check-In war super organisiert von dem Gastgeber!<br/>Ich kann die Unterkunft nur weiterempfehlen!,1,-0.8168,Negative
77.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,12,100.0,0,5.823294013597665,4.37,4.15,4.4,4.31,2165255,A good value option in Neukolln and a great location for us. Check-in and communication was nice and easy.,1,0.9337,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,1,4.625473353777098,4.96,4.84,4.77,4.79,37831600,"Nice cozy place in Neukölln. Elias is a very friendly, polite and responsive host.",1,0.8313,Positive
77.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,92.0,1,6.53505644358969,4.88,4.72,4.88,4.78,765589772940538247,"Sam’s place was a quirky but fun stay. The loft bed was extremely comfortable, but the couch not so much. Would definitely recommend this as a 2-3 person stay maximum, as the loft bed is very big and can fit 3 adults if needed. Be careful with the TV in the loft though, it can be very loud for the upstairs neighbors since it is so close to the ceiling. We had an upstairs neighbor come down and very politely ask for us to quiet down while we were sitting and watching TV up there, so we moved down to the TV on the couch and that seemed to solve the issue. Great location, quiet but still close to the train station so everything was accessible. The only thing it was missing was a bath mat for the shower since hot water makes the room very steamy and slippery. All around a very fun time and Sam communicated very well.",1,0.9885,Positive
