125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,13,100.0,0,5.382205378355812,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,24201962,"One of the best apartments I have ever seen! The place is amazing, so beautiful and stylish! it's located in a very nice district, dull of restaurants shops and young people, near the public transport and its so easy go anywhere. Anna, the host, is worried about every detail about the place and about your trip. It couldn't be a better experience. I really recommend this place to have a nice and comfortable trip in Berlin.",1,0.9751,Positive
