46.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,16,100.0,1,7.419861899429263,4.82,4.72,4.81,4.81,10288865,"The room is nice, the place is near all (800m to Südkreuz and 500m to Haupstrasse), the kitchen is new and Julian let me use any time it. Julian  wait me untill I arrive there (at 1:00 AM) and he is kind, very friendly and he has helped me in anything I need. 100% recommendable.",1,0.8655,Positive
120.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,64,100.0,1,16.967110280315712,4.9,4.9,4.7,4.76,20711836,"Kleines elegantes Ferienhaus außerhalb von Berlin <br/>Zur S-Bahn kann man laufen (ca. 10- 15 Minuten),  Netto ist in der Nähe vorhanden, Haus in ruhiger Wohnlage im Garten von anderem Haus, sicherheitsbewusste Anlage,     Sauberes Anwesen, <br/>Sehr gute Ausstattung der Küche ( große GeschirrAuswahl, Moderne Messer, Wasserkocher...) , genügend Handtücher vorhanden und schöne Poolmöbel, Poolanlage gepflegt, service- orientierte Vermieter, welche vor Ort sind und man bei Problemen gerne Ansprechen kann- vergessene Sachen wurden nachgesendet",1,0.0,Neutral
77.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,12,100.0,0,5.823294013597665,4.37,4.15,4.4,4.31,2165255,"A beautiful place, safe, quiet, comfortable and quite close to transportation. <br/>Works well with an oven or toaster oven for those who enjoy cooking. <br/>The building has historical significance, and it was great to see it mentioned creatively in the flat.",1,0.9723,Positive
140.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,49,100.0,1,3.2254531575112866,4.87,4.87,4.92,4.76,11665059,Super godt det hele 😃<br/>Rigtig dejlig sted og lejlighed,0,0.5994,Positive
77.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,0,6.266793012378933,4.7,4.65,4.53,4.7,6264703,This apartment was well located with access to local busses.  David was very helpful with information on navigating by public transportation around the city.,1,0.6361,Positive
199.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,1,3.7401902545858734,4.81,4.86,4.85,4.67,22354567,"Beautiful, large space in a fantastic location in Mitte.",1,0.8176,Positive
140.0,6,2.0,1.0,5.0,49,100.0,1,2.43464121697615,4.72,4.88,4.83,4.55,243081,We had a great time thank you Anna,0,0.765,Positive
160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,98.0,0,1.0407544919436775,4.54,4.66,4.77,4.45,34294913,"Séjour de 4 nuits<br/>Points positifs: la localisation ultra centrale, joli bâtiment, prix attractif, les gens de Nena réactifs quand on a besoin de quelque chose <br/>Points moins positifs: moins joli en vrai que sur les photos, literie et oreillers 1er prix Ikea, accès à l immeuble par l entrée de service, beaucoup de vis à vis",1,0.0,Neutral
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,1,5.665290374199684,4.91,4.84,4.94,4.89,395063,"What can I say? Everything about this place was perfect. Katharina is such a sweet person. She was very helpful giving me tips of places to visit in the neighborhood and around town and she was very welcoming and friendly.<br/>I was in her flat for one month and couldn’t have asked for more. Friedrichshain is one of the most exciting neighborhoods in Berlin. The U-Bahn station is right around the corner, all kinds of stores are situated on the main road and the street behind has all the supermarkets. <br/>The neighborhood is filled with restaurants and coffee shops.<br/>I wouldn’t want to live anywhere else in Berlin but here. The room is super spacious, the bed is very comfortable, the kitchen has everything you need and the bathrooms is large. Her home is very cozy and clean. <br/>Thank you so much Katharina for your hospitality, my month in Berlin wouldn’t have been the same if I hadn’t had the opportunity to stay in your place!",1,0.9833,Positive
53.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,53,100.0,1,26.004441812448626,4.98,4.94,4.96,4.89,957931730041861276,Very clean and lovely place and nice host.,1,0.8707,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,26,100.0,0,8.270289999177802,5.0,4.83,5.0,4.5,13180619,"We spent 7 days in Dennis apartment.<br/>1.The apartment is conveniently located in a quiet, green area. Nearby there are two U-bahn stations , from Tegel Airport can be reached in 15 min.by bus TXL. Nearby located park Tiergarten.<br/><br/>2.The apartment is located in the attic of a 5-storey building.<br/>For us it was charging to climb on foot to the 5th floor :)<br/>3.The apartment is spacious, sunny and bright. Bedroom + kitchen + dining room\ living room.Many flowers and plants, which we regularly watered.<br/>4.The kitchen is fully equipped, you can cook ,all the kitchen utensil and appliances available.<br/>5.The bedroom has a double bed with a good mattress, clothes hanger and finished drawers for small items.<br/>6.In the bathroom tub, sink and toilet bowl. All fairly new.<br/>7.Good speed Internet, I was able to work remotely, it is very important to me.<br/>We liked the apartment, and even more - a balcony.<br/>There are a lot of flowers on the balcony, little table and 2 chairs.<br/>This was our favorite place for evening relaxation.<br/>Dennis and Iga, thank you very much!<br/>Best regards,<br/>Sergey&Olena<br/>P.S. We have done all your instructions, transmitted through Franciscka. ",1,0.9753,Positive
86.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,52,100.0,1,14.876814991832068,4.83,4.74,4.5,4.65,53080223,We had a wonderful stay at Villiam’s place! It is a little far from the city center but it’s well connected with tram and subway so it wasn’t inconvenient! The neighbourhood also had some good restaurants to unwind and if you don’t want to go to the city! We had a lovely time at Villiam’s and would definitely recommend staying here!,1,0.9637,Positive
140.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,91.0,0,4.871252294318258,4.72,4.78,4.85,4.58,46812239,entspannter Aufenthalt,1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,21,100.0,1,8.187543141932318,4.92,4.93,4.9,4.8,1266630,Nice stay with Roi. Cute little studio that was clean and well presented. There was an AC which was a big plus! Roi was very responsive and left us some nice coffee and wine which was appreciated. Surroundings are also really calm and relaxing. Felt safe in the night too!,1,0.9799,Positive
