125.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,36,0.0,0,10.212135250191398,4.96,4.97,4.91,4.84,9225893,"My brother and I came over New Year and Evelyn and her daughter Nadine were extremely accommodating! I made a mistake and put 1 guest instead of 2 when booking the apartment, but Nadine was very understanding of the mistake and everything was sorted very easily! It's in a nice safe quiet neighborhood and a 15 car ride from anywhere very central!<br/>The house has a wonderful warm vibe a beautiful patio, everything is perfect! Loved my stay, if I'm ever back in Berlin would love to stay here again! ",1,0.9911,Positive
