237.0,11,3.0,1.0,4.0,57,100.0,1,9.660413858650209,4.93,4.97,4.46,4.83,16252509,"We had a great time in Simon's apartment as a family of 6. It was really comfortable, clean, modern and spacious and allowed us to have a great time whilst on holiday in Berlin. It's really close to the bus and train and so very easy to get to from Tegel Airport and then into the city. Simon was on hand to help us out with any questions we had and was quick to respond. I would recommend it to anyone looking for a break in Berlin. ",0,0.9824,Positive
64.0,6,2.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,15.846363887643118,4.74,4.62,4.6,4.8,33693955,"Nice value for it's price, a lot of room, whole under floor is yours for the stay. Host is very nice older German, who doesn't speak English, but he is trying his best to help you. <br/>Of you are looking for cheap and spacious place — don't look further, it is it.",1,0.9325,Positive
130.0,2,2.0,1.0,2.0,51,100.0,1,2.3870466769214023,4.83,4.84,4.9,4.73,3210996,"Great location and a really comfortable stay. Michael was an excellent host and gave great and detailed instructions on how to reach the apartment. Really flexible with check in. The balcony is a gem, we had excellent views of Berlin landmarks.",1,0.9701,Positive
