86.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,1,5.82073416379732,4.8,4.89,4.75,4.67,38389171,"We enjoyed our stay at the Pavillion. The check-in and check-out instructions were clear, the apartment has everything you need: ample room for clothes, coffee, several towels etc. The shower leaked a bit (with both shower doors closed) but it was nothing we couldn't manage with a strategically placed towel on the floor ;-) It is located in a nice neighbourhood with good bakeries, slightly outside the city centre but easily reachable with several tram connections, which was exactly what we wanted.",1,0.9377,Positive
