76.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,88.0,1,7.588956550268365,4.78,4.72,4.78,4.57,779474059941637953,Die Gastgeber waren sehr zuverlässig und freundlich.Die Lage ist sehr grün und ruhig. Wir waren sehr zufrieden und würden diese Unterkunft weiter empfehlen.,1,-0.5994,Negative
63.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,33,100.0,1,0.8841099481967127,4.9,4.78,4.89,4.8,29000041,"Kommunikation erfolgt rasch und zielführend. Empfängt einen an der Unterkunft sehr herzlich. Ist sehr freundlich und gibt gute Tipps. Die Wohnung ist sehr ruhig. Auch die Nachbarn hört man überhaupt nicht. 3 Gehminuten zum S- und U-Bahnanschluss. Genau gegenüber des Hochhauses befinden sich ein Bäcker, ein Discounter und ein Fast Food Bistro. Besser gehts nicht. :-)",1,-0.7579,Negative
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,0,0.5555591583260235,4.82,4.96,4.88,4.69,10031729,"Renting Marius' flat was a perfect experience! Communication was super easy, the flat is perfectly located - central but still quiet and just amazing! The bathroom awaits with a massage shower... In general it is clean, super practical, beautiful and all in all just perfect! Thanks for that, any time again!",1,0.9914,Positive
78.0,4,1.0,1.5,2.0,19,100.0,0,8.966870205752064,4.45,4.5,4.7,4.31,45016027,"Our stay in the Berlin apartment was absolutely fantastic! From the moment we arrived, we were impressed by the stylish decor and immaculate cleanliness. The apartment was small but well-appointed, providing all the comforts of home and more. The kitchen was fully equipped, allowing us to prepare meals. The bed was super comfortable and perfect for relaxing after a day of sightseeing.<br/>The location of the apartment was ideal, situated in a quiet neighborhood with easy access to public transportation (2 min walk to the metro). We loved exploring the local cafes, shops, and restaurants, all just a short walk away. The quiet and safe surroundings made it a perfect retreat from the hustle and bustle of the city.<br/>The host was very responsive. Despite early flight/arrival we could enter the appartment before official check-in.<br/>The only lack was non working wifi.<br/>Overall, our experience in the Berlin apartment was exceptional.",1,0.9955,Positive
123.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,2.036088585204626,4.88,4.86,4.98,4.79,919931,"Verda was so welcoming, she waiting for me at the apartment even when I arrived much later than expected. The home was beautiful, exactly as it is in the photos. The balcony at the apartment is a great place to wake up and have a morning coffee. Verda had great recommendations and many helpful tips for our stay in Berlin. Other than the apartment being great and Verda being a fantastic host the location was prime. Very safe, next to two parks with many open markets, great cafes, and many restaurants and right next to a taxi and metro station. I would definitely stay here again if I were to visit Berlin. ",1,0.9894,Positive
45.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,0,9.87662163357203,5.0,4.8,4.6,4.6,870725114643393432,I stayed here for 8 months. The apartment had everything needed for a home away from home. <br/>If any issues or questions came up the owner was always super quick to reply and resolve it. <br/>There is a bus stop just down the street and a grocery store nearby as well. <br/>Would wholeheartedly reccommend the stay.,1,0.7506,Positive
149.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,41,100.0,0,2.613788630245264,4.72,4.6,4.86,4.61,2378401,Apartamento cercano a las zonas de interés en Berlín. Bastante cómodo y funcional. Las instrucciones de llegada fueron claras y bastante sencillo llegar al apartamento. Está muy cerca de una estación de metro por lo que el transporte no será problema. <br/>Lo recomiendo.,0,-0.296,Negative
260.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,91.0,0,4.81020597174384,4.59,4.7,4.4,4.44,28299765,"Alles gut, genau so hatten wir es uns vorgestellt.",1,0.0,Neutral
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,11,100.0,0,9.227313097418907,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,11672994,"Polecamy to miejsce, było nam w nim bardzo dobrze. Zostaliśmy miło przyjęci przez lokatorów mieszkania - sympatycznych młodych ludzi. Łóżko na antresoli jest duże i wygodne, nie słychać żadnych hałasów z ulicy. Mieszkanie jest czyste i jasne, do metra idzie się 10 min. ",1,0.0,Neutral
300.0,5,2.0,2.0,3.0,71,100.0,1,9.260527967950802,4.97,4.97,4.92,4.85,1977882,"We stayed at Frank's place over the Christmas holidays. Not having visited Berlin in the winter, our initial impression was grey. But Frank's home was warmth and coziness! It is a quiet, residential neighbourhood that is conveniently located, close to restaurants and grocery stores. The big shopping street (Ku'Damm), Kaiser Wilhelm Church & Christmas Market, and the Berlin Zoo were all a 15-25 walk away.   There is a Ubahn station 2 blocks away. Frank's apartment had everything we needed - from cozy robes to a full kitchen where we did cook a couple of meals. The tv is hooked up to Netflix (which the kids loved when we needed a lazy day) and we could even print our boarding passes for our next flight from the printer. It was a home away from home. If we needed anything, Frank was available by phone. We wouldn't hesitate to stay here again. Thanks, Frank!",0,0.9517,Positive
64.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,0,6.192706812130064,4.44,4.28,4.5,4.47,9663247,"The place is just like in the pictures, is really comfortable, with enough space, it has easy access to public transportation. <br/>Everything was great",1,0.92,Positive
