63.0,2,1.0,0.0,1.0,36,100.0,1,4.697448788448945,4.76,4.59,4.76,4.71,31356953,"Mohammad is a very kind person. We spent three nights at his apartment in a very nice neighborhood in which we found everything we needed (bars, restaurants, transport services, supermarkets); he also gave us many precious advices.<br/>About the flat: everything was as expected. Clean and comfortable. We had breakfast in the balcony and was lovely.<br/>You will feel good for sure.",1,0.9669,Positive
