75.0,2,0.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,0,3.526516085976624,4.65,4.55,4.92,4.4,922893196670431337,"Denitsa’s property was in a great location, close to good shops, restaurants and bars. However, the property was quite overpriced considering there were a few issues. Firstly, the wifi was disconnected for the entire stay and there was no access to TV either. There was also no air conditioning which made the small apartment hot and stuffy. There was not adequate towels provided, the bathroom had a terrible stench that consumed the apartment some days and overall it wasn’t very clean when I arrived. Denitsa did provide some compensation for the wifi being disconnected however I still feel the property was very overpriced.",1,-0.1212,Negative
