125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,44,90.0,0,4.876803032571889,4.63,4.47,4.74,4.53,31110614,"James is hosting this place together with Elizabeth. The place is perfectly located and super well connected in the heart of Kreuzkölln, yet totally quiet. The two were very friendly, easy and fast in communication and very hospitable. They provided us with an information sheet about the place and recommendations in the area and were very open to help out with further info. The place is simple, clean and even a bit more charming than on the picture. Recommended for a simple, friendly and convenient Berlin stay in a great neighbourhood.",1,0.9882,Positive
