76.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,1,5.339352686328167,4.8,4.87,4.74,4.63,2098124,"Well-equipped and charming apartment. It's a great place for people who appreciate design and antique stucco decorated buildings. We enjoyed both parks that are around the corner and lively Bergmannstrasse. Also it was easy to move to other parts of the city as the subway station is just a 3 minutes walk away. The host provided all the necessary information to make our check-in, stay and check-out smooth. It's a pity that we had little time to stay in Berlin, but our next stay will be longer and I will gladly choose this apartment again.",1,0.9072,Positive
