125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,20,100.0,0,5.121366905397287,4.74,4.71,4.8,4.71,19944322,"This is great.<br/>I know Berlin quite well as I have lived there for several years.<br/>So: anyone interested in 'real' Berlin, east-Berlin, has to look nowhere else.<br/>Weissensee is one of the last areas where you can breathe an authentic Ost-Berlinische air: very few, almost no tourist, not yet heavily gentrified; a silent and sweet street full of trees; a smooth, quiet atmosphere; very well-connected to the centre and close to a beautiful lake.<br/>The flat is ideal, not only because it is clean and very well-kept, but because you see it is a 'real' flat, not a standardized, fictitious and anonymous one as it often happens.<br/>For me, this is where I want to stay anytime I go back to Berlin.",1,0.8365,Positive
234.0,10,2.0,2.0,6.0,40,100.0,0,4.864411093359416,4.67,4.58,4.47,4.59,715660998471957523,Apartment in desolaten Zustand vorallem die Bäder!!! Es war fast unmöglich in das Badezimmer zu gelangen wegen des Gestankes (Kanal). Auch kann man die Wohnung schwer durchlüften mangels Möglichkeiten. Finger weg Leute,0,-0.927,Negative
70.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,100.0,1,3.0533340006135603,4.92,4.98,4.93,4.84,7925838,"Amazing stay! Apartment is clean, spacious and well equipped. Katja is a great host. Neighborhood is the best place to stay in Berlin! One word, Amazing!",1,0.9704,Positive
80.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,1,15.62145086834446,4.91,4.98,4.86,4.79,31610667,"A very cosy, confortable and welcoming apartment surrounded by a beautiful garden. So quiet and peaceful, you only hear the birds singing and the bells of the church nearby. A delightful place to come home to after a day in the hustle and bustle of Berlin. The lovely Flughafensee is only 50 meters away as well as a huge forest with lots of hiking trails. Perfect for walking!",1,0.9782,Positive
96.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,33,96.0,1,3.788820414984087,4.81,4.85,4.83,4.71,26006558,"War eine super Zeit in der Wohnung und die Wohnung hat uns sehr gut gefallen - kurze Verzögerung beim<br/>Check-in, was aber nicht weiter schlimm war. Auch hier hat er proaktiv kommuniziert und war sehr flexibel. 👍",1,-0.9136,Negative
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,0,0.7634581291070147,4.79,4.51,4.93,4.67,44601355,"If every host was like Mischo, the hotels would go out of business…The apartment was just like in photos and as described. And what I really liked is Mischo’s responsiveness and will to meet some specific requirements I made and in a very timely manner. <br/>Neighborhood calm, residential, even though it is surrounded with a lot of cafes, bars, restaurants, shops etc. Very well connected with public transport. It was truly home away from home and very suitable for business travelers as was my case.",1,0.9285,Positive
