54.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,7.403263725526816,4.91,4.92,4.78,4.85,23477057,"Tidy, clean, quiet place. We weren't that aware of sharing the place with the owners. Although this may have been our own fault. Plus it didn't matter; friendly hosts who were there to show you around the house and help you with anything you will need. Close to metro stations with direct connections to the city center and hotspots. We enjoyed the stay for 100%.",1,0.7268,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,6.303469422976989,4.92,4.81,4.59,4.84,1521826,"We enjoyed living in David's apartment, the room was large and comfortable, a nice little balcony, the kitchen inviting and open. David willingly answered every question and was very friendly. The location of the apartment is a bit far from the center (about 45 minutes by public transport). Highly recommend the apartment and David",1,0.9516,Positive
300.0,9,3.0,1.5,4.0,54,100.0,1,2.312156644109463,4.9,4.85,4.95,4.81,10043384,"Heel leuk appartement in een rustige buurt. Op loopafstand zijn leuke restaurantjes en een fiets verhuur. In het appartement zijn ruime slaapkamers, een grote badkamer en een goed geoutilleerde keuken. Fijn dat basis voorzieningen zoals koffie, thee en kruiden er al zijn. Werner is hulpvaardig en goed bereikbaar.",0,0.0,Neutral
125.0,1,1.0,1.0,2.0,15,100.0,1,2.187850547569466,4.91,4.94,4.94,4.91,12062058,"Nachdem ich doch sehr spontan Meike angefragt hat, habe ich superschnell ihre Antwort bekommen.<br/>Ihre Wohnung ist echt sehr gemütlich, groß und wunderschön hell. Wir durften ihre Einrichtung komplett benutzen und für Handtücher etc war auch bestens gesorgt, alles sehr sauber und absolut zu empfehlen.<br/>Wir haben uns rundum bestens gefühlt und konnten so unseren Aufenthalt in der Stadt genießen.<br/>Danke dir, Meike :)",1,-0.7579,Negative
182.0,9,2.0,1.0,7.0,25,100.0,0,0.5561753554406595,4.66,4.69,4.93,4.58,11764015,"Great location, big bedrooms, confortable beds, and lot of space in the flat. Agustin was helpful and responsive. Lots of good restaurants in the same street, Alexander platz in 5 minutes walk. No elevator but we didn't mind the stairs.<br/>My teens and I had a great time in Berlin.",0,0.9042,Positive
