64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,1,6.406022834833479,4.97,4.97,4.78,4.82,764305057139406056,"Florian's apartment is located in a comfortable area of ​​Neuköln.  In walking distance transport interchange S-Bahn, U-Bahn.  Easy to get to any part of the city.  The area itself is authentic, there are many shops and cafes for every taste.  The apartment itself is bright, incredibly comfortable and clean.  Everything is thought out to the smallest detail.  Highly recommend Florina's apartment for a stay in Berlin.  You will enjoy your time!",1,0.9668,Positive
