281.0,6,3.0,2.0,3.0,21,100.0,1,3.1622873483273235,4.78,4.78,5.0,4.83,1373796383985983551,Super dejligt sted helt centralt i gåafstand til mange restauranter og seværdigheder. Meget roligt sted med stor terrasse. Perfekt lejlighed til os der rejser som familie med 2 voksne børn. 3 store og fine værelser og 2 badeværelser. Vi havde et skønt ophold i Mias lejlighed,0,0.6908,Positive
99.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,0,7.404631875387605,4.62,4.69,4.08,4.41,52575214,"Das war mit dem Abstand beste Kommunikation und Verlauf bei Airbnb bis her. Sehr saubere Wohnung, alles was wir gebraucht haben war da. Saubere, bequeme Betten und Badezimmer. Küchenutensilien, neue Elektrik. <br/>Einziges Problem war mit dem duschkopf, aber hat uns nicht so dolle gestört;) sind sehr zufrieden, würden gerne wieder die Unterkunft in der Zukunft buchen, vorausgesetzt die Wohnung ist frei zu der Zeit :)",1,-0.9648,Negative
419.0,6,3.0,2.0,4.0,73,100.0,1,1.4254755529643226,4.98,4.98,4.94,4.8,50998500,"The best rental/Airbnb apartment experience that I have ever had. The place is huge, spacious, airy and full of light. The high standards are reflected in the interior design and in the attention for details that turn a good apartment into an awesome one. Location is excellent, communication is quick and accurate, and there’s this rare feeling of being truly welcomed - this is a place hosted by people who love what they do and know how to do it.",0,0.9803,Positive
111.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,51,100.0,1,3.4156959509415743,4.85,4.89,4.82,4.77,14804266,"This was the best air bnb we have ever stayed in. A cosy, warm little place to go back to after being out for the night. The wooden floor and decor gives off such lovely vibrations. It’s in a really trendy part of Berlin, near local markets. Good shop conveniently around the corner called Nah und gut. We love this place!!!",1,0.955,Positive
