128.0,6,1.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,0,2.0526253137138544,4.66,4.61,4.86,4.57,11290301,"Yair' apartement was very well situated in a quiet street in a nice area with good restaurants and bier garten, and close to  U - Ban and tram stations.  The accomodation was confortable, perfect for 4 days stay in Berlin.",1,0.8016,Positive
