112.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,51,100.0,1,7.069783798568355,4.81,4.92,4.62,4.73,221015,"super nette Gastgeber, tolle Wohnung mit super Lage - wir kommen wieder :)",1,0.8957,Positive
93.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,2.54678149398414,4.86,4.96,4.9,4.84,3187735,"The apartment was lovely and well located. There were little touches such as fresh cookies and essentials in the kitchen. Very stylish and clean. Barbara really has thought of everything! <br/>Host was very patronising about us being a little late (very stressful journey from the U.K and both our phones died due to heavy use of gps trying to log on and use maps). I can see it must be very annoying when people are late, so I haven’t let it affect my review ratings,  but she just wouldn’t let it drop after at least 5 apologies on our part. We were 45 minutes late. <br/>Having said that I would definitely stay again (if she would let us)!",1,0.412,Positive
70.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,11,100.0,0,8.741815694076292,4.62,4.69,4.66,4.67,24505475,"A great value. Location and price make this place highly recommendable. We found it a little bit small for two people. But it has all the essentials, is convenient to the U-Bahn, and Julius made the experience easy.",1,0.7964,Positive
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,26,100.0,1,1.6504053952892772,4.94,4.98,4.94,4.95,3895024,"Jacobo is very friendly. Easy going with the checkin and checkout times. Our stay was very comfortable and the appartment was very clean and also nicely decorated. The location was perfect and Jacobo offered to gave us advice on where to go and what to see, very kind.",1,0.9737,Positive
123.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,28,100.0,0,4.462782849034317,4.86,4.88,4.83,4.82,9994644,"Hey Martin, it was My first time with Airbnb. It was amazing and u're a great host! We had a amazing time in your studio and in Berlin. I hope we'll come back and can repeat the time by a beer with you. Have a nice evening my friend. Greetz Sascha. <br/>Wir haven uns echt wohl gefühlt, Danke. :-)",1,0.9726,Positive
