81.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,1,4.028603514184869,4.78,4.74,4.9,4.65,26633041,"Bens place is in the best area of Berlin. It is lively and cool without being overcrowded. Lots of great restaurants(Felix Austria). We were able to check in super early which was amazing, but the space definitely wasn’t clean enough. I let Ben know, because he had hired a cleaner and he did refund the cleaning fees, but it could use a deep clean.",1,0.9729,Positive
