125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,7,100.0,0,6.892323313731155,4.59,4.28,4.52,4.72,13775127,Nice located spacious apartment in a quite area near the soviet memorial. Surrounded by lot of green and a huge park. Supermarket and few restaurants are nearby. The apartment itself is really nice with a bath tub I especiallly liked. Checkin experience and  communication with Jan was excellent. Highly recommended to stay here when you visit Berlin,1,0.9412,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,16,100.0,0,1.1856260162878398,4.85,4.8,4.95,4.73,1977666,"This is the perfect apartment for Berlin. It’s clean, close to Mitte and the best bars and restaurants and very stylish. And even though it is close to the best quarters, it is incredibly calm and relaxing when the evening sun shines through the big old windows. <br/>The communication with Giorgio was fast and precise and everything worked smoothly. Thanks for everything and until next time!",1,0.9752,Positive
291.0,7,3.0,2.0,4.0,44,100.0,1,11.632050742075618,4.76,4.71,4.78,4.66,1185362314531639408,"Beautiful, spacious apartment!",0,0.636,Positive
