63.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,1,3.879531780254296,4.96,4.92,4.97,4.84,20672414,"Wir hatten schöne Tage in Berlin, die Unterkunft ist groß und unser Zimmer war top. Ulrike war immer für uns da und sehr gastfreundlich. Die Lage der Unterkunft ist mitten im Geschehen und sehr zentral. Ich freue mich auf einen nächsten Besuch :)",1,-0.9153,Negative
93.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,39,100.0,1,3.2781637723728885,4.56,4.54,4.61,4.48,1537125,"Je recommande l'appartement de Karen dans lequel mon mari et moi avons séjourné une semaine fin septembre. Très bien équipé, très propre, très calme, lumineux bien que situé dans l'entresol et proche des transports.",1,0.0,Neutral
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,52,100.0,0,18.623100777897022,4.94,4.95,4.79,4.92,229099,"Hannes could not have been a better host. He picked me up at the airport (and dropped me off when it was time for me to leave the city), provided me with delicious breakfasts, tour guides, and tips on how to get around the city and what to see. Hannes also taught me a lot of cultural and historical things about Germany and Berlin in particular. I would recommend Hannes as a host to anyone and everyone. Thank you again!",1,0.7496,Positive
84.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,5.06163943405691,4.92,4.94,4.96,4.82,344856,"The apartment is very cool, as seen in the pictures. Perfect for a couple to spend a few days in the city. Apostolos was a great host, gave us all the facilities to get the apartment and meet him. The space is what u need in a holidays, with a comfortable sofa, a really really comfortable bed and a fully equipped kitchen with all the basics. And of course the whole apartment was very tidy and clean.<br/>The neighborhood is cool, with shops, restaurants, bars, supermarket...There's a backyard to park the bicycles...we couldn't ask for more!<br/>Completely recommended. I'll stay there again for sure!",1,0.9773,Positive
63.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,1,3.323332029049056,4.88,4.89,4.91,4.68,26674998,Nice cozy spot. Good value,1,0.7964,Positive
348.0,12,3.0,1.5,10.0,38,100.0,0,5.889555818905056,4.57,4.74,4.46,4.28,19885029,Ruth ist eine wirklich sehr nette und aufmerksame Gastgeberin.<br/>Alles hat reibungslos geklappt.<br/>Die Wohnung hat alles was nötig ist um sich wohl zu fühlen und die Betten sind sehr bequem. <br/>Gerne wieder.,0,-0.5994,Negative
