228.0,5,1.0,1.0,2.0,61,100.0,1,3.690195125206819,4.99,4.91,4.97,4.8,704976656646850837,"Great location, right next the actual Berlin Wall. The neighborhood itself is very nice, lots of good restaurant options and plenty of parking space. The room was well kept, spacious, with adequate accommodations. I thoroughly enjoyed my stay.",1,0.9492,Positive
