90.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,47,100.0,1,3.079952985679858,4.97,4.93,4.97,4.87,1016800494683320175,"Martina es una anfitriona perfecta, amable y comunicativa. Nos sentimos como en casa. Tiene dos gatos encantadores. La ubicación es ideal para moverte por la ciudad.<br/>La habitación es espaciosa para dos personas.<br/>100% recomendable!",1,0.7263,Positive
153.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,23,80.0,1,2.4380512619709767,4.32,4.44,4.87,4.3,22556872,"Great location. <br/>I would recommend not to stay more than 2 persons, the bunk bed was unsafe and unstable. <br/>The sofa bed takes the entire space of the kitchen and living room. <br/>In general the apartment needs high maintenance and repair, the condition of it is not well ( bathroom is really broken and liking, no place for towels and the bathroom is connected with another room with the bunk bed). <br/>The apartment is also in the 4th floor which is not easy with kids. <br/> Building is very dirty. <br/>The host is super nice and helpful.",1,0.6765,Positive
