232.0,3,1.0,1.5,1.0,55,100.0,0,2.0949005621506074,4.92,4.88,4.96,4.69,28667024,"We stayed here over New Years and had an amazing time! The apartment is stunning and looks even better in person than the pictures! <br/>Nicolay and Marko have great interior style and the apartment is immaculate with all of the amenities that you would need. As soon as we booked the apartment they sent us thorough details for check in along with suggestions for local restaurants, bars, etc. The location was perfect and so easy to get around (Taxi, Walking, Train). <br/>If you're with a group and looking to stay in a trendy Berlin flat that feels like your own home then this is the place for you!",1,0.9741,Positive
89.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,45,100.0,0,3.608409914477857,4.92,4.9,4.78,4.8,251984,First of all Thérèse is a lovely host and very quick to respond. She really makes an effort to make you feel as home as possible. We arrived just before midnight but that wasn't a problem. The place was more spacious then the photo's would suggest because of the high ceilings. If you are very tall then the bathroom may be a little low. The house is absolutely not standard in the way it looks. Area is nice and quiet and in walking distance of 2 subway lines. Bike rental closeby. In the center of al the nice neighbourhoods. We would recommend it to anyone and come back if we have the chance.,1,0.9453,Positive
89.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,7.289170629982721,4.87,4.77,4.77,4.8,533523,"Loved staying at this apartment! Clean, cozy, impeccably designed, and it even has a cool disco ball! But, more importantly, it's easy to access, has everything you need too. Norberto was out of town, but he had a colleague meet me at the apartment, whom was very friendly and helpful with everything. I would definitely recommend other to check this place out while in Berlin! ",1,0.9836,Positive
