95.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,12,100.0,0,7.932419196316966,4.26,4.58,4.48,4.14,2485985,Lovely apartment with everything you could need - it’s in a quieter neighborhood and very close to public transport so you can get around the city easily. Liz was very helpful with any questions or concerns that we had. We really enjoyed our stay here!,1,0.9213,Positive
