184.0,6,1.0,1.0,3.0,58,100.0,0,5.8927812884823645,4.81,4.84,4.63,4.75,898645043518985801,"Schnelle und freundliche Kommunikation, klare Anweisungen sodass wir die Unterkunft schnell gefunden haben, check-In flexibel. Die Wohnung sehr sauber! Kann ich weiter empfehlen! 😊",1,-0.855,Negative
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,24,0.0,1,4.103393166209834,4.93,4.98,4.81,4.85,17544847,"Fantastic place in a very central location. Communication with the host was fabulous, very responsive and helpful at all times. I liked the minimalist studio a lot, it's been build in a very smart way. The bathroom is incredibly luxurious! PS Whilst for 2 people the amount of storage space is just enough, there probably wouldn't be enough space for 4 people, just fyi! :-)",1,0.9696,Positive
46.0,1,0.0,1.0,1.0,9,100.0,1,13.261308980858155,4.8,4.5,5.0,4.75,1169384989219677631,"The place offers  all the amenities that one's needs, plus a lovely and friendly host. It is located in a quiet neighborhood next to restorants, bars, supermarkets and a train station, to which allowed me to have a nice stay with access to everything that I needed.",1,0.8689,Positive
