127.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,1,1.4421228333958134,4.85,4.85,4.9,4.78,11648023,"Ubicación excelente, el apartamento espectacular con todas las necesidades cubiertas y Timo fue muy amable y estuvo atento a cualquier duda que teníamos. Sin duda volveriamos a escoger el apartamento. Así da gusto viajar",1,-0.5574,Negative
81.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,30,89.0,0,3.4062591919471514,4.88,4.63,4.88,4.88,1376569769868596901,"Mario was so lovely. I was a bit worried that I was arriving too late as my flight was delayed, but he stayed at the flat to meet me and let me in. <br/>The flat is massive and has everything you need. the upstairs flat are a bit noisy, but only during the day so doesn't impact much. I didn't use the courtyard as I was out and about, but it looked lovely.<br/>The area is great, there was a little shop opposite for all the bits you need and it wasn't a far walk to loads of restaurants.",1,0.7567,Positive
125.0,1,2.0,1.0,2.0,20,100.0,0,2.21575852316956,4.9,4.71,5.0,4.62,24057633,"The location is perfect, of course. The apartment is nice, i had some minor issues (with the bed and such) but nothing of importance. The host is great.",1,0.8039,Positive
