68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,92.0,1,4.424176503712602,4.91,4.98,4.81,4.79,23298585,"We had wonderful time staying here. The location couldn't be better and the apartment was beautiful. It was clean, cosy and exactly as shown in photos. Thank you Rehana!",1,0.893,Positive
61.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,2.188319042758802,4.82,4.91,4.88,4.71,37443723,"The Hosts were very respectful, accommodating, and helpful.  <br/>The location is good, the U5 downstairs seemed like a Berlin backbone, but there was also train station about a 5min walk away that was also useful for going express to the Airport. Also has a supermarket at the end of the block.<br/>The room was good and good value for the price. I would book again next time I am in Berlin.",1,0.9657,Positive
