131.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,2.0785333149362923,4.8,4.59,4.96,4.68,89102,"Amazing Place!<br/>The Loft couldn't be better situated - in the middle of Prenzlauer Berg, walking distance from Mitte. The Loft is well equipped and in clean, perfect state.<br/>Communication with Michele was very friendly and easy.<br/>I would highly recommend it and look forward to come back.<br/>It's just great.<br/>",1,0.9743,Positive
