78.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,6.919397234051426,4.88,4.91,4.49,4.76,21061308,Un lugar encantador y muy tranquilo y con el transporte urbano cerca y de fácil acceso. Sin duda es el mejor lugar donde alojarse en Berlín si lo que buscas es la comodidad de una casa y buena ubicación para visitar la ciudad.,1,-0.5574,Negative
125.0,6,3.0,1.0,2.0,12,100.0,0,11.325592837291136,4.67,5.0,4.83,5.0,17367031,Die Wohnung war ganz sauber. Es gab drei Badezimmer mit 3 Doppelbetten. jedoch war das Wohnzimmer nicht ausgestattet . Insgesamt waren wir zufrieden und ich empfehle die Wohnung weiter. ,1,-0.9485,Negative
82.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,0,2.2575669992715124,4.65,4.49,4.88,4.57,45170497,Lars place was very nice and cozy.<br/>location was super nice.<br/>Close to public transportation.<br/>We do recommend Lars place for a visit to Berlin.,1,0.8588,Positive
46.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,50,90.0,1,8.793085466370869,4.84,4.65,4.78,4.8,8196902,"Beautiful, cozy place in a quiet neighborhood with a nice terrace out back. Great location, not far from city center with cute shops and cafes nearby. Maria (and her cute cat) was a very nice host and easy to communicate with! She made our stay very comfortable. I'd recommend to anyone!",1,0.9825,Positive
80.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,41,100.0,1,3.915872498754315,4.72,4.65,4.76,4.6,26676986,Sehr nette und schnelle Kommunikation und individueller Check-in sowie Check-out. Die Wohnung hat alles was man braucht und die Lage ist perfekt. Alles super..würden das Apartment beim nächsten Aufenthalt auf jeden Fall nochmal buchen.,1,-0.8316,Negative
84.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,7.790190356236613,4.69,4.83,4.72,4.7,512476,"Super clean and filled with natural light, the apartment is a cheery place to stay. It’s close to metro and great restaurants- all within a block or two walking distance through a lovely neighborhood. Because it’s not in a tourist area at all, the best thing to me about the location was that I felt like a local and not a tourist- and got a chance to speak German - or at least try to speak German along with charades to communicate.  It was an awesome time in Berlin and the apartment really made it special. Thanks Birgit! I highly recommend!",1,0.9904,Positive
107.0,3,2.0,1.5,2.0,18,100.0,0,6.774682469939278,4.77,4.89,4.88,4.67,50162244,"We had a fantastic stay! The place was very spacious and impeccably clean. Despite being close to the train tracks, we couldn’t hear any train noises while sleeping, which made for a peaceful night’s rest. Highly recommend!",1,0.9166,Positive
166.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,16,50.0,0,8.694176238638248,4.7,4.55,4.81,4.41,22495883,"Süßes das Hausboot, wir hatten einen schönen Abend bei tollem Wetter und es war sauber. Leider gab es SEHR viele dicke Spinnen dort, für Leute die damit ein Problem haben rate ich definitiv ab! Ansonsten ist es empfehlenswert und mal etwas anderes. :)",1,-0.8313,Negative
65.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,34,100.0,0,15.875647711341015,4.74,4.74,4.88,4.63,15251878,"I can highly recommend Katrin and Fritjof’s place! I have had a wonderful stay with them in their beautiful home and they are such friendly people - I feel so welcome. The guests have access to their own little kitchen which is very well-equipped, and the bathroom is nice. <br/>Dahlem is a quiet, residential area and there’s a good bus service from just outside the house - the tube station is also only a 7 minute walk, so whilst the house is not central, you can be in the centre of Berlin in half an hour! There are plenty of shops around the tube station, too, so everything is close. It’s a very nice area, feels very safe (even at night) and there are lovely places for walks / runs near the house. <br/>Thank you for a wonderful stay!",1,0.9895,Positive
97.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,1,4.142685366474272,4.88,4.88,4.76,4.71,649855829822351940,"Christinas Wohnung war unglaublich sauber und so ordentlich. Sie war allzeit verfügbar. <br/>Ehrliche Bewertung: Mit Abstand das beste airbnb, in dem ich je war. :)",1,-0.8658,Negative
38.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,39,90.0,0,3.8844191094294063,4.67,4.32,4.89,4.8,5768047,Katha apartment is perfect and Katha was a great host. I would stay there again without hesitation.,1,0.8629,Positive
203.0,6,3.0,1.0,3.0,43,100.0,1,4.140963863667464,4.89,4.92,4.89,4.78,4182815,"Really great apartment! 3 comfy double beds which was handy for 3 people traveling for business. Nice touches (like a welcome gift), great communication, good location with lots of nice restaurants & bars. Lots of useful things in the flat (iron, towels, tea/coffee) - overall a great experience",0,0.9815,Positive
60.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,3.4424793835984366,4.59,4.43,4.62,4.5,40961984,It was very stylish and clean :) free parking in front of the building and doner kebab is really close ! 😂❤️,1,0.861,Positive
110.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,50,100.0,1,2.7610678260408177,4.84,4.67,4.93,4.69,2610528,"Great, comfortable flat with lots of natural light in a great area of Berlin. Nice having multiple options for public transport near, plus some good restaurants as well. Communication was fast and helpful. I definitely recommend this place and would stay here again.<br/><br/>My only wish is there were a washer/dryer in the flat. Part of my search criteria always includes the availability of washing my clothes on longer trips, so I don't have to pack as much. It was disappointing to have to leave to do it. Not that inconvenient as there's a place about 5 minutes away, but it's nicer to be able to do it in the flat.",1,0.9579,Positive
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,1,5.015530793126645,4.94,4.82,5.0,4.65,930159418744001848,"Our stay at Isabell and Oliver’s apartment was great. The apartment is beautiful, comfortable and very clean. We slept very well, the bedroom was peaceful and quiet. We were able to cook and have breakfast in the kitchen every morning. Communication with Isabell was perfect, she was very helpful and recommended delicious restaurants right around the corner to their home. From their thoughtful welcoming to their help checking out, the experience was the best. <br/>I’d only add to their apartment that it’s in a 5th floor with no elevator.",1,0.9916,Positive
161.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,45,100.0,0,2.42532743038235,4.49,4.44,4.55,4.4,930648202291914187,"This is a great apartment to stay in if you want to be in the heart of Kreuzberg. An abundance of restaurants, cafes and amenities on your doorstep and conveniently location near train station. The apartment itself was great and as described. The host was always quick to respond to any questions I had either before or during the stay.",0,0.8591,Positive
150.0,6,3.0,2.0,4.0,44,100.0,1,5.139349865848991,4.94,4.85,4.97,4.91,5766122,Stylish and spacious apartment in a great location.  We had a great stay.,0,0.8481,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,20,100.0,1,3.4592595707900773,4.81,4.79,4.84,4.73,11564181,"Eine saubere Wohnung spartanisch aber zweckmäßig,die Betten sind gut man sollte Ohropax mitbringen weil es nachts laut sein kann",1,0.0,Neutral
217.0,6,2.0,2.0,4.0,25,100.0,1,12.577655916882916,4.77,4.63,4.64,4.59,1149290662671206506,"Great location, large apartment and super helpful responsive host. AC was great during hot days. Highly recommend!!!",0,0.9685,Positive
47.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,26,100.0,0,13.72252668419708,4.51,4.6,4.69,4.51,7828523,"Parwana jest świetnie zorganizowana. System check in/out jest samoobsługowy działa doskonale. Kwatera czysta, wygodna w spokojnej kamienicy. Jedyna uwaga pokoje od ulicy są trochę głośne ale w dużym mieście to norma. Lokalizacja OK. Metrem można dojechać wszędzie.",1,0.4466,Positive
68.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,22,100.0,1,6.594298777125843,4.71,4.76,4.39,4.65,16469975,War alles unkompliziert und so wie beschrieben. Haben uns wie zu Hause gefühlt :),1,-0.2263,Negative
156.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,0,2.2531285722967658,4.58,4.63,4.73,4.47,49844243,"We had a great stay in this modern, clean and spacious apartment.",1,0.7783,Positive
143.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,90.0,1,11.510851452846596,4.75,4.76,4.8,4.54,699809535745814134,"The entirely digital schtick works far better than you might think, also because there are staff in the building to help if anything does go wrong - which mostly it doesn’t. I stayed for a week while working in Berlin and wanted to be able to eat at home mostly, and the basic, tiny, kitchen area did just fine for one Pot meals. There’s a proper table where you can eat. The small desk was perfect to work on and the furniture is comfy. The building is also a lovely old Berlin block.  The location is good if you want to access the south or west of Berlin. It’s not much in the centre, but the public transport options are excellent - 25’ over to Mitte by bus. There are all the food stores you need with a stone’s throw. Oh, and The on site locker storage works fine too - very helpful if you’ve got big bags and a long final day in the city. I definitely recommend this place if you want something between a hotel and an Airbnb. (This is not someone’s home, but has all the advantages of a hotel",1,0.9817,Positive
313.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,21,82.0,1,2.6774214719576683,4.87,4.84,4.95,4.77,43824448,"Dejligt ophold! Med undtagelse af beskidt køkken og service i skuffer og skabe, så var alt perfekt. I de dage vi havde et ophold var man igang med at renovere etagen nedenunder hvor store vinduespartier derfor var pillet ud - af den grund var der ekstremt koldt på vores værelse. Da vi gjorde opmærksom på dette til værten gik der kun 10 min så kom de med en varme læser som gav den varme vi havde brug for. God og hurtig service.",1,0.3382,Positive
125.0,1,1.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,1,1.2721418429169693,4.97,4.99,4.97,4.9,20415517,"Wunderschönes Apartment in super ruhiger Lage im Hinterhof. Die Ausstattung war bestens, man hätte sich problemlos ein gutes Essen zubereiten können. Edi hat uns mit Tee, Kaffee, Mineralwasser und frischem Obst versorgt.  Die Kommunikation mit Edi war sehr unkompliziert. Da wir mit dem Auto anreisten, hat sie uns einen Parkausweis besorgt. Parkplätze gibt es direkt vor dem Haus. <br/>Alles in Allem eine gute Adresse für einen Berlin Trip. Wir kommen wieder!",1,-0.9184,Negative
80.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,0,18.39412118822528,4.71,5.0,4.76,4.47,928835405652949015,"Bei Hassan zu übernachten war sehr angenehm, die Wohnung ist sehr sauber, schön gelegen und super ausgestattet. Hassan ist sehr zuvorkommend und freundlich, gerne wieder!",1,-0.636,Negative
101.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,1,3.0191512330624914,4.88,4.77,4.73,4.66,21735977,"We enjoyed this apartment, location is nice - in walkable distance to Graefe- and Bergmannkiez. The host shared a great list of restaurants and cafes. Apartment was very clean and well furnished. The building as such (and the entrance) isn't the nicest I think, but this didn't bother us. Would stay there again!",1,0.8753,Positive
66.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,1,5.222564273094288,4.8,4.72,4.85,4.68,39967068,Great place and very nice host that is supportive. 15 min walk from the S-Bahn that takes you to most places in Berlin.,1,0.8553,Positive
162.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,45,88.0,1,14.4210922740773,4.97,4.94,4.68,4.91,606401295328021155,"Great 1 bedroom apartment, recently renovated, large bathroom, and good size living area. Very close to many transport options.",1,0.7906,Positive
98.0,6,3.0,2.0,6.0,23,94.0,1,0.9930406419174836,4.64,4.6,4.91,4.69,6232949,"Die Kommunikation mit dem Vermieter und die Lage waren super.<br/>Die Wohnung war grundsätzlich wie auf den Fotos zu sehen. Allerdings müssen wir leider sagen, dass die Wohnung wirklich dreckig war. In wirklich jeder Steckdose war Staub, in den Bädern Schimmelflecken und ebenfalls viel Staub. Lockere WC Brillen. Da auf dem Bett von meinen Mann nur 2 Topper lagen, haben wir die Matratzen mit dem „wohnzimmer“ getauscht. Das hätten wir nicht tun sollen. Dabei haben wir leider gesehen, wie dreckig verfärbt die Schonbezüge schon waren. Da wir so spontan leider kein alternativ bezahlbares Hotel gefunden haben, haben wir 4 neue Spannbettlaken gekauft. Wir hätten gerne einmal durchgesaugt. Das mussten wir leider abbrechen weil der Staubsauger ganz schlimm gestunken hat.<br/>Wir verstehen nicht, wie die überwiegend positiven Bewertungen zustande kommen. Wir haben schon viele Wohnungen gemietet, aber diese ist vor allem für den Preis miserabel.",0,-0.9892,Negative
123.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,32,100.0,0,5.086004020180417,4.79,4.88,4.78,4.75,7543419,Sehr nette Kommunikation und einfach tolle Lage!,1,0.0,Neutral
138.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,56,100.0,1,2.8661586391717453,4.91,4.92,4.9,4.79,1946067,"We had a fabulous time at Axel and Anne's apartment. It was our first time using Airbnb and it exceeded our expectations and made our first trip to Berlin memorable and extremely comfortable. The apartment was super clean, airy, tranquil, and well laid out, with an elevator and lots of natural light. Terrific family-friendly neighborhood with excellent restaurants, markets, cafes, transportation, and a huge park (and a fun Sunday morning flea market); a perfect base from which to explore exciting Berlin. Axel was a gracious host, very helpful. We will definitely make this our home when we return to Berlin, our new favorite big city (and we are New Yorkers). Thanks again, Axel!!",1,0.9944,Positive
80.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,0,14.023702989576456,4.93,4.83,4.73,4.87,1259496407484222515,"Super Wohnung und total liebe Gastgeber, man hat immer schnell eine Antwort bekommen und auch Tipps was man sich in Berlin ansehen kann. Wir würden wieder kommen😊",1,0.5994,Positive
66.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,0,6.0845653122722405,4.97,4.93,4.87,4.94,2742817,Good apartment near to the old Tempelhof airport / airfield. Quiet and cosy.,1,0.4404,Positive
74.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,52,100.0,1,4.78303997421089,4.74,4.64,4.83,4.69,10130849,"Yigit é um excelente anfitrião. Gentil, prestativo e interessado. Seu local fica num bairro muito interessante em Berlin devido a sua diversidade, heterogeneidade e tranquilidade. Muito diferente de Mitte,  Neukolln é um bairro de trabalhadoras, imigrantes e pessoas vindas de muitas partes do mundo. Bairro rico em opções de cafés e locais para comer, Neukolln é também muito próximo de tudo pelo sistema de transporte berlinense quase infalível.<br/>Dois parques muito próximos são ótimos, caso tenha mais tempo.<br/>Recomendo com certeza o espaço de Yigit para estadias a trabalho ou a passeio.",1,0.0,Neutral
43.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,90.0,1,19.010333685269742,4.89,4.95,4.89,4.85,20247909,"Es ist eine schöne Gegend, die Unterkunft sehr praktisch gelegen in U-Bahn Nähe, das Zimmer war perfekt,  <br/>vielen Dank!",1,-0.8439,Negative
