106.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,15,97.0,1,3.587299160900769,4.83,4.82,4.72,4.8,21018456,"100% empfehlenswert. Der Check-In war sehr unkompliziert, freundliche Kommunikation, alles sauber und praktisch eingerichtet. Ich würde die Unterkunft jedem weiterempfehlen :-)",1,-0.7579,Negative
70.0,1,0.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,0,1.22855138976715,4.84,4.77,4.93,4.63,40469693,"The flat itself was nice and a good location. However, the host was not there when I arrived (even when I had communicated that I would arrive at a certain time) and I had to wait outside on the street late at night. Then when he did arrive I found out that the flat had not been cleaned from the previous guest so I had to wait another 20 minutes outside. The host was apologetic but this was an extremely poor experience.",1,-0.2936,Negative
225.0,5,1.0,1.0,4.0,51,100.0,1,1.6344270374965926,4.76,4.75,4.94,4.63,1096384933976503863,"Fantastic apartment, very nice area and easy to access and no need to worry about keys. Absolutely perfect stay!",0,0.8683,Positive
64.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,59,100.0,1,2.578564642470654,4.97,4.99,4.93,4.96,7849188,"Bernd is a fantastic host!<br/>The apartment is spacious and the balcony is especially relaxing — perfect for unwinding. Prenzlauer Berg is always a great area to stay in, with plenty to explore and enjoy. Thanks again, Bernd! I’ll definitely be back. 😊",1,0.9765,Positive
