64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,100.0,0,6.599183385275826,4.94,4.89,4.66,4.9,19486351,"Giulio’s place is wonderfully large and has a private room/area with bathroom. It’s in a very quiet neighborhood with easy dining in the square. It’s a tad farther from many attractions, but the U is only a 7min walk. Would definitely stay again.",1,0.8338,Positive
