224.0,6,3.0,2.0,3.0,27,100.0,0,10.573010744816528,4.56,4.47,4.76,4.37,39572610,"We had a great, short stay at the apartment. It was perfect for us as a group of five – two couples and one friend – as the three bedrooms and two bathrooms provided more than enough space and privacy. The apartment overall is very nice, we especially liked the big kitchen and table where we shared breakfast. It's in a nice, quiet location with many walkable restaurants and quick access to public transport. I highly recommend it!",0,0.977,Positive
41.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,15,100.0,0,3.558265973195314,4.77,4.84,4.88,4.79,19666219,A clean and large room in a top floor apartment of a typical Berlin building. Hosted by a friendly and hospitable person.,1,0.7717,Positive
135.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,3.104550941585256,4.8,4.84,4.94,4.69,39956169,"+ Smooth & professional process, easy check-in & check-out<br/>+ Great value for money<br/>+ Clean & fully functional apartment, good location<br/>+ Perfectly fast wifi<br/>+ Very organized & regular communication with all information provided in a structured way<br/>+ Provision of some basic ingredients in the kitchen to help get going :)<br/>- Ground floor, you can hear sounds from the street<br/>- Windows are covered, so either you keep them open for a view (difficult during winter/people can peep in) or you close them and might feel a bit boxed-in<br/>- Some wear & tear, but nothing that disrupts your visit, also the company is very responsive and helpful in case of difficulties<br/>- Seems to be managed by more of a professional company (StayBearlin) rather than private home-owners, which might take away from the charm, but makes up for that with efficiency - really not a matter of concern, more a matter of preference<br/>- The house rules might come across as strict & exhaustive, but better to be clear from the start - consider taking pictures on check-in just to avoid any discussions (not that we had any, just a thought)<br/>Overall a great option if you are looking for value for money. Not necessarily an apartment you want to stay in for long hours every day, but perfect for a couple who wish to have a base and spend their time mostly outdoors exploring Berlin!<br/>Thanks Alan & Kasia!",1,0.9936,Positive
85.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,22,100.0,0,8.547903865133643,4.48,4.38,4.57,4.47,7916154,Thanks for everything !,1,0.4926,Positive
