101.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,0,4.929820420309423,4.77,4.73,4.77,4.64,488161,"Really nice flat, clean, modern with plenty of space. Great location, really close to the u bahn and only a few stops away from loads of cool restaurants and bars in the kreuzberg area. It's on a main road but still very quiet inside. We had the window open all night and did not hear a thing. Also nice bars within walking distance.",1,0.877,Positive
