59.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,1,8.780949789470249,4.81,4.96,4.74,4.6,807131975159748467,"Bárbara was extremely helpful and responsive giving directions and recommendations when I arrived. The flat was lovely and comfortable, I felt very much at home while resting there between days out. Very happy with the experience.",1,0.9604,Positive
175.0,4,2.0,2.0,3.0,32,100.0,1,2.446263975064717,4.94,4.89,4.87,4.83,24035138,"Vanni's Haus is lovely, spacious, with lots of atmosphere. I spent almost three weeks, first with my husband and sister, and then on my own. Having two bathrooms was a big plus. The tram stop across the street was wonderful and connected me to all of Berlin. Vanni and Lennart were very responsive with my questions, and eager to help make the stay  pleasant.",0,0.9485,Positive
70.0,1,0.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,0,1.22855138976715,4.84,4.77,4.93,4.63,40469693,"I had a brilliant time at the micro apartment, it was just perfect for my stay in Berlin. Positioned in one of my favourite areas of the city with lots to do and see very nearby. The apartment was very well and tastefully designed. It was quiet inside the apartment, and felt very safe (even though it was ground floor). Would 100% come back here!!",1,0.9283,Positive
127.0,4,1.0,1.5,2.0,23,100.0,1,2.949656824462868,4.79,4.83,4.84,4.54,46746763,"We hadden een heel fijn verblijf in het mooie appartement. Hele leuke en fijne locatie, dicht bij metro, supermarktje en leuke restaurants. Snelle vriendelijke reacties van eigenaren. <br/>Mooi appartement, schoon en netjes. Bedden en kussens zijn wel erg zacht, moet je van houden. <br/>Al met al een heel erg fijn verblijf gehad! Zeker voor herhaling vatbaar!",1,0.0,Neutral
