94.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,0,11.718869355232192,4.38,4.37,4.65,4.12,629399957445489292,"Erkan's place is located in a very accessible spot with so many transport options. There are loads of food options around,  international food and a lot of nice cafes around. I highly recommend it.",1,0.6801,Positive
244.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,12,100.0,1,2.1699046447476857,5.0,5.0,5.0,4.63,30365864,"Antonio's spot in Prenzlauer Berg was a perfect spot. Walkable to multiple restaurants and cafes. Easy to access a Tram or U. We stayed here before leaving Berlin to see a more ""non- tourist"" area and it was exactly that. It felt like we had our own house with the self serve kitchen. There was just a very homey feeling. Would stay again.",1,0.8714,Positive
