161.0,8,3.0,2.0,3.0,35,100.0,1,6.906667346101181,4.78,4.72,4.69,4.75,5977917,"Tolle Wohnung an toller Lage. Die Kommunikation mit Micheles Vater war einfach, er reagierte immer sofort. Absolut zu empfehlen.",0,-0.8316,Negative
73.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,0,1.9561377920018532,4.81,4.69,4.97,4.75,16222479,"We had a great stay in Berlin. The apartment was spotless. Clean, well equipped, comfortable and with good location. We've been received very well, also we were given helpful tips about the neighborhood and the city and the host was available to help us if needed.",1,0.967,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,2.0674178351267574,4.78,4.84,4.75,4.72,7352481,"We had a lovely stay in Kathis apartment. <br/>The communication was easy, the apartment bright, clean  and can easily reached from the airport. <br/>We hope to have the pleasure to stay at Kathis home next time we go to Berlin.",1,0.967,Positive
250.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,59,100.0,1,3.342423071919589,4.98,4.94,5.0,4.9,12693704,"Songfei’s apartment is charming.  The location is great.  There are so many restaurants, coffee shops, groceries etc within walking distance.  The neighbourhood is vibrant and beautiful.  All of Berlin’s attractions are within commuting distance -whether by foot, train or bus.",1,0.9584,Positive
68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,3.194253694245239,4.93,4.95,4.89,4.86,81081,"It's obviously why Bernd and Katja are classified as superhosts. The check in was well-organized and welcoming, and their apartment was perfect for us and in an ideal location. I would definitely want to stay here again, and would recommend the same to others.",1,0.9382,Positive
82.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,0,2.2575669992715124,4.65,4.49,4.88,4.57,45170497,"The accommodation is very well located, with public transport stations nearby as well as a Rewe supermarket. The images are true to reality, the bed is comfortable, the kitchen has all the necessary items and a large bathroom with washing machine, the internet is good and the TV is smart. Communication with the host was good and fast, as was check-in.<br/>The only downside of our stay was that the host asked us to leave the accommodation earlier than the stated check-out time, which was a little inconvenient.",1,0.9335,Positive
60.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,51,100.0,1,8.76289456061162,4.98,4.98,4.82,4.95,6936087,"Petra was such a lovely host! From the minute I walked through the door she was very friendly, welcoming , and open. Her flat is very clean, and homely and I felt so comfortable the whole time. She prepared such a lovely spread for breakfast every morning and gave great recommendations for sights around Berlin, which didn’t disappoint. Petra had a really good vibe and energy which really made my trip even better. I can’t wait to be back in Berlin and I will definitely be staying at Petra’s.",1,0.9882,Positive
194.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,45,85.0,0,1.5095289909770313,4.7,4.83,4.93,4.5,45475523,Super Unterkunft in bester Lage.,1,0.5994,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,20,100.0,1,3.4592595707900773,4.81,4.79,4.84,4.73,11564181,Very nice apartment and host :) Very recommended!,1,0.8165,Positive
201.0,7,2.0,1.0,6.0,30,100.0,0,3.7792785408916494,4.6,4.6,4.68,4.48,17948177,This is a pretty good sized apartment with comfortable beds and a good sized living and dining room. Be aware the shower room is small with only an old shower curtain so the floor gets pretty wet. Also the apartment is in a trendy location with lots of bars and pubs nearby however it is right on the front of a busy road next to some bars and on numerous occasions we found random members of the public just sitting on the doorstep at the apartment which we had to ask to move. Once you’re inside the apartment there is a big window in the living room that is directly onto the street so it can get quite noisy however the bedrooms are at the back and a very peaceful and quiet. Wilken is a good host with good comma and we appreciated the late check out.,0,0.9779,Positive
87.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,1,4.844151532859025,4.73,4.24,4.79,4.66,15653871,"This apartment is not the same from the pics  ! Very cold , there are no blankets , very strong smell of cigarettes, dirty and not cozy ! I can’t imagine that someone can write gut review for this misery place , is a deception !",1,-0.8644,Negative
122.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,45,100.0,1,15.46531196615534,4.86,4.83,4.81,4.75,19499351,Thanks for having us. Was a great stay in your airbnb - the Sauna is definitly the Highlight of our stay!,1,0.8655,Positive
120.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,45,100.0,0,12.615498547784023,4.66,4.53,4.76,4.46,894093144693655986,Logement très propre sauf le sol de la douche. Point positif nous avons pu utiliser le compte prime vidéo de l’hôte et l’emplacement très central rend le centre très accessible.,1,-0.5574,Negative
50.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,64,100.0,0,23.37110166463029,4.9,4.89,4.63,4.9,17230578,"Ruhig gelegenes, sehr sauberes haus! Rochus macht alles für einen angenehmen aufenthalt. Das zimmer ist riesig, perfekt zum relaxen. Gutes frühstück gibts auch noch dazu, was nicht selbstverständlich ist. Kaffee (das wichtigste) gabs bis zum abwwinken! Ein sehr netter gastgeber! Gerne komm ich wieder. Weiter so, vielen dank für den angenehmen aufenthalt",1,0.0,Neutral
92.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,48,100.0,0,0.4676368215827225,4.98,4.9,5.0,4.89,22982188,Ani ist ein supernetter Host. Der Check-In war unkompliziert und wir konnten uns voll auf Berlin konzentrieren. Die Lage ist echt top! Man kommt schnell überrall hin. Also perfekt für ein paar Tage in Berlin.,1,-0.807,Negative
158.0,5,1.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,0,2.8468020977775543,4.88,4.72,4.62,4.72,958670624368596550,"Easy communication, clean spacious apartment",1,0.6808,Positive
78.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,1,3.406346218061282,4.68,4.63,4.8,4.62,11276488,"Very nice, centrally located, overall great experience.",1,0.8016,Positive
147.0,6,1.0,1.0,5.0,52,100.0,1,2.890589402820904,4.84,4.94,4.79,4.66,6295492,"Natalie's place was very nice and also super practical to be with kids. <br/>She was communicative, nice and flexible.",0,0.8998,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,33,100.0,0,5.107101435550384,5.0,5.0,4.95,4.98,622168719435608384,"Alex's place is very stylish, well-equipped, and in perfect condition. I didn't know the area before but it's fantastic: easy to get to the center by bike or the U8, very lively, and with some of the best food in Berlin. Highly recommended.",1,0.9772,Positive
102.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,0,2.7824750390490918,4.95,4.97,4.94,4.86,10033310,"Jessy was a pleasure to meet, her attention to detail was highly appreciated. The apartment was spacious, comfortable and felt like home away from home. Ideally located, everything we needed was within close proximity. Would highly recommend. Hopefully we can return in the future.",1,0.9668,Positive
60.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,44,100.0,1,7.1823976191311605,4.87,4.83,4.59,4.77,781011854555247751,Excellente décoration de l appartement avec tous ce qu il faut .<br/>Métro à deux pas,1,0.0,Neutral
