69.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,1,3.63272662803081,4.88,4.95,4.95,4.81,29664434,"Herzlicher Empfang, auch spät am Abend.<br/>Geräumiges Zimmer in einem typischen Berliner Gründerzeithaus.<br/>Man muss zu dem Kleinod allerdings in den 5. Stock steigen, aber es lohnt sich!",1,0.0,Neutral
59.0,2,1.0,4.0,1.0,35,100.0,0,7.942755838655635,4.83,4.53,4.72,4.81,1197650193381322739,"Fantastic place, a very clean and silent room, same with kitchens and bathrooms. Every important place we wanted to visit (musems, restaurants, etc.) was relatively close. Provided recommendations turned out to be fantastic. It was an amazing place to choose to stay in for the first trip to Berlin.",1,0.9412,Positive
