59.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,83.0,0,20.638103913453502,4.82,4.69,4.85,4.8,17403218,"Jutta has a beautiful house and made me and my partner feel very at home. This is the best bnb experience I've had so far. There was a little issue with another guest locking me out with a chain lock, but this was not the host's fault. I would definitely recommend staying here!",1,0.9329,Positive
46.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,55,100.0,1,9.21710508242704,4.91,4.8,4.74,4.8,37709280,Nous avons passé une excellent sejour chez Marion. Nous et nos enfants étaient ravi du logement. Marion est une hôte très accueillante et sympathique. Nous recommandons ce logement.,1,0.5719,Positive
128.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,51,100.0,1,13.570667530645112,4.98,4.91,4.81,4.85,1106636836839331069,"Eine wirklich schön in einer ruhigen Gegend gelegene Wohnungen, die super ausgestattet ist und alles hält, was sie verspricht. Die Betten sind sehr bequem und die Kommunikation mit den Gastgeber*innen war top. Schöne Parks und Grünanlagen in der Umgebung machen den Aufenthalt mit Kindern besonders abwechslungsreich. Auch sind Einkaufsmöglichkeiten in der Nähe vorhanden. Eine klare Weiterempfehlung!!",1,-0.9097,Negative
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,13.088231838082732,4.89,4.76,4.67,4.83,18195157,"Gitta's home is near Charlottenburg. The check-in was efficient and I had no problem (it's top floor). Gitta is friendly and we chatted in the evening.<br/>The room and bathroom were clean, as was Gitta's apartment. The wifi signal was decent too. The apartment is a short train ride to the centre. I'd stay there again.",1,0.6808,Positive
