422.0,11,5.0,3.0,7.0,39,100.0,1,4.247361008084818,4.91,4.96,4.52,4.69,13868134,"Sehr schöne Wohnung. Super Wohnung und perfekt aufgeteilt. Uns hat es super gefafllen, wir haben genügend Schlüssel bekommen. Die Lage der Unterkunft ist ideal neben einer U-Bahnstation gelegen. Wie für Berlin nicht ganz unüblich gibt es hier einige Obdachlose. Wir haben uns aber nie unwohl oder gar bedroht gefühlt. Alles in allem eine perfekte Wohnung für einen Kurzaufenthalt in einer größeren Gruppe.",0,0.8074,Positive
318.0,8,3.0,1.5,5.0,53,100.0,1,3.7256422035937673,4.95,4.94,4.85,4.83,13320037,"Riesige, schön geschnittene Wohnung, hell und Lichtdurchflutet, geschmackvoll eingerichtet, toller Stuck, großzügige Küche/Esszimmer/Wohnzimmer, sehr gute zentrale Lage, angenehme Kommunikation in der Vorbereitung, unkomplizierter Check-in, Hinweis für Gehbehinderte: 2 Altbautreppen bis zur Tür,",0,-0.765,Negative
141.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,43,94.0,0,7.131273504704622,4.74,4.82,4.79,4.62,49070135,Easy Check-In for a comfortable and clean stay.,1,0.836,Positive
68.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,50,100.0,0,6.026516407626963,4.74,4.76,4.48,4.7,6808626,"Нам всё понравилось. Мы жили в отапливаемом бунгало на территории дома хозяйки. Бирджит очень гостеприимная и веселая. Она рассказала, как пользоваться домом, выдала нам ключи, дала свой мобильный, и дальше мы общались через whatsapp при необходимости.<br/>В бунгало есть полноценная кухня, санузел с горячей водой. Комната уютная, но потолок невысокий, поэтому баскетболистам будет немного не удобно.<br/>Рядом с домом находится магазин, где можно купить всё необходимое по низким ценам. До центра 20 минут на трамвае, который ходит каждые 20 минут.<br/>Рекомендуем!",1,0.0,Neutral
53.0,1,2.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,1,11.493844617518508,4.94,4.93,4.94,4.86,1100549356947964090,"Maximiliano is super friendly and responsive, and made me feel right at home! Their place is just as described and convenient for public transport. Thanks for a great stay in Berlin!",1,0.953,Positive
103.0,1,1.0,0.0,1.0,11,100.0,0,1.652388057808875,4.42,4.64,4.62,4.3,51549694,Emplacement adéquat,1,0.0,Neutral
269.0,6,0.0,1.0,3.0,36,100.0,1,1.0556232531547587,4.75,4.85,4.72,4.64,1033389053096639313,war alles top,1,-0.4767,Negative
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,7.4204277078953105,4.83,4.76,4.78,4.72,43599382,"Nice and welcoming apartment for a couple, close to facilities, in a quiet neighborhood. We enjoyed our stay in Berlin, thank you Ermal !",1,0.8955,Positive
68.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,50,100.0,0,6.026516407626963,4.74,4.76,4.48,4.7,6808626,"Logement privé, tres bien équipé et très agréable, hôte très gentille",1,0.0,Neutral
160.0,6,3.0,2.0,3.0,46,100.0,1,5.93071369172379,4.79,4.75,4.74,4.67,685944,"We enjoyed staying in Claudia's place. A couple of points future guests should be aware of (a bit of a mixed review):<br/>On the positive side, the kitchen was very functional for a small kitchen.<br/>The stairs can be a bit hazardous with only one rail to hold on to. I myself almost fell down the stairs twice during our stay.<br/>The location is great, however, after 9 PM a nearby street becomes a hub for red-light activity.<br/>In summary, we enjoyed this attractive garden home in an excellent location, but possibly not suitable for everybody.",0,0.8931,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,12.767258601923896,4.83,4.92,4.9,4.82,3871990,"The apartment is in a pleasant neighbourhood of Berlin that allows easy travel to the city centre. A two minute walk from almost everything you would need such as shops, train station, incredibly nice restaurants, lively bars/pubs that enable to you to mingle with locals and sport fans, and if you require a facility to print tickets or boarding passes there is a printing shop down the road.<br/>Dagmar was an excellent host and despite our flight experiencing delays she still waited round for us to arrive before leaving (this was around 2 hours after the initial arrival time). All information that we required was readily available and if we required anything further Dagmar was there to help out.<br/>The apartment block is shared with Dagmar but you are provided all the privacy you could possibly need. Highly recommended.",1,0.8961,Positive
174.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,1,5.572103261112622,4.91,4.89,4.87,4.72,638929182228409025,"My family of 3 had a nice time staying here. The property was spacious, well-equipped, and we felt safe. The flat is located in an awesome neighborhood; if you love food of all sorts get ready to EAT because there’s so many great restaurants nearby. We rented bicycles as our primary mode of transportation, and were easily able to get around the city from this location. We had a few minor issues while staying there and the host was friendly, immediately responsive, and proactive. Enjoy Berlin!",1,0.9875,Positive
292.0,12,3.0,2.0,9.0,48,100.0,0,7.365557287816079,4.87,4.87,4.69,4.7,4027713,"Very nice and cozy place, suited our group very well. Communication with Dlauar was very welcome, clear and quick. Definitely recommended place! Hope to return in next business trip!",0,0.9561,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,36,100.0,0,0.7567571024449841,4.81,4.96,4.84,4.66,493539,"Location is great and apartment is clean.  However, te amenities are less than stellar. For instance, the toilet is located separately from the apartment. Furthermore, internet connection is awful. Apparently, the fiber optic cables in that part of Berlin are being refurbished; it's not the host's fault. However, the host should've made that clear on the listing. He didn't.",1,0.8252,Positive
193.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,1.6174058144101784,4.83,4.89,4.86,4.73,21162110,"Phenomenal view, lovely funitured, very responsive and friendly host.<br/>One, if not THE best Airbnb experiences I ever had. <br/>Perfect in every way",1,0.771,Positive
122.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,96.0,0,3.128194469226722,4.61,4.66,4.86,4.54,47215807,"For sure, I’ll stay at Hotel Gat Point Charlie again when visiting Berlin! There’s an intimacy to the hotel and soon the staff members will recognize you. Also, they’ll do their utmost to advice/ help you whether it’s to do with renting a bycicle or making reservations at the glass dome. Regardless the other reviews, I could open my windows and just wrote a note to housekeeping to keep the windows open while I was out. Last but not least, downstairs Vietnamese restaurant serves delicious fresh dishes for reasonable prices in a friendly atmosphere.",1,0.9441,Positive
208.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,44,100.0,0,2.084360411756672,4.92,4.94,4.97,4.75,2450125,"Franks leilighet i Prenzlauer Berg anbefales på det varmeste. Beliggenheten er perfekt, i nærheten av lokale kafeer, restauranter og interessante muligheter for handel, i tillegg til å ligge nær flere former for offentlig transport som gjør det mulig å forflytte seg enkelt og rimelig rundt i vidstrakte Berlin.<br/>Leiligheten er også så stilig og funksjonell at det er både lett og fornuftig også å holde seg innendørs, om vær eller andre omstendigheter tillater det.<br/>Vi hadde fem flotte dager her, og kommer mer enn gjerne tilbake. Fleksibiliteten ved ankomst og dagen vi skulle dra var suveren.",1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,1,2.540873406232533,4.67,4.75,4.83,4.55,243063,"Schöne, gut ausgestattete Wohnung. Hervorragende, ruhige Lage, fußläufig viele Sehenswürdigkeiten sowie Einkaufsmöglichkeiten erreichbar. Super freundlicher Kontakt mit der Vermieterin. Gerne wieder!",1,0.636,Positive
243.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,8,88.0,0,3.560186030012189,4.42,4.53,4.81,4.24,854251028991888522,"Very nicely located. Warm. Quiet. Clean. Comfortable. Sightly utilitarian feel, consistent with former East German era apartments, but that's kind of cool.",1,0.8014,Positive
422.0,2,2.0,2.0,2.0,57,88.0,1,12.930620902689748,4.96,4.96,4.88,4.71,1016515988099460004,"Sehr schönes Appartment liegt im Herzen Charlottenburgs und hat uns absolut begeistert! Sauber, geräumig mit vielen Extras!",0,0.0,Neutral
97.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,2.157577329691436,4.94,4.87,4.97,4.78,31084288,I stayed at Thomas' flat for a few months while I settled in Berlin for a new job. It had everything I needed and he and his family were super accommodating and welcoming to my circumstances. I would highly recommend the flat for anyone who is staying in the city both long and short term.,1,0.8622,Positive
76.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,1.983582423016539,4.79,4.72,4.94,4.73,31900671,War ein sehr schöner Aufenthalt in Majas Wohnung mit super Lage im Prenzlauer Berg und die U-Bahn/S-Bahn ist gleich in der Nähe. <br/>Die Wohnung war sehr sauber und Maja war immer für uns erreichbar😊,1,-0.9136,Negative
83.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,1,4.036515724941701,4.95,4.99,4.87,4.81,11847541,"Super beliggenhed ved både S og U-bahn. Lejligheden var endnu finere end i annoncen, meget ren og lækker. <br/>Sabine var imødekommende både da vi kom og specielt den sidste dag da vi havde brug for hjælp til at planlægge lufthavns transport om natten. <br/>Jeg vil varmt anbefale Sabines lejlighed til en hver der besøger Berlin.",1,0.5994,Positive
112.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,1,6.315146266976091,4.69,4.44,4.86,4.71,51403847,"Nous avons passé un très bon séjour à Berlin. <br/>L’appartement est au rez-de-chaussée, dans une rue un peu passante. Il est en face d’un supermarché, dans un quartier agréable animé de restaurants. Il se trouve à 10min d’une gare et à 10min du métro, qui mènent tous les deux au centre ville. Il y a également un tram tout proche.<br/>L’appartement est un studio propre, lumineux, spacieux, tout à fait adapté à un séjour court à 4 (si on aime dormir dans la même pièce). <br/>La cuisine est bien équipée, à l’exception du manque de four et du peu de plaques chauffantes (2).<br/>Point bonus pour la télé, sur laquelle nous avions accès à Netflix et Youtube (fort agréable en temps de pluie). <br/>Nous recommandons ! :)",1,0.6996,Positive
63.0,3,1.0,1.0,4.0,56,100.0,1,13.973121976945189,4.91,4.96,4.6,4.95,1160190802958821255,"Sehr sauber Wohnung , alles genau wie auf den fotos. Mit sehr freundlichen gastgeber  .",1,0.0,Neutral
