98.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,22,100.0,1,3.1634061354496827,4.83,4.82,4.8,4.56,32678196,We had such a lovely stay at the apartment - great location and the host gave us so many amazing recommendations for where to eat/drink/go and explore!,1,0.9227,Positive
113.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,2.347970120018093,4.92,4.97,4.9,4.79,32333841,"We had a great stay at Ewa’s place. She was very helpful. Early check in was not a problem. The apartment is very tidy and clean and very close to several subway and tram stations. I’m just a few minutes you are in the city centre, surrounded by lots of tourist attractions. The walls are a bit thin so you sometimes hear neighbours entering the building at night, but it was not a real problem for us. There are cooking utensils, a little stove, a microwave and a coffee maker available.",1,0.8748,Positive
80.0,1,0.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,8.131943711690111,4.89,4.85,4.68,4.79,42301772,I had a great stay at Lin's place - its a very cute and comfortable flat just as described and Lin helped me very quickly when I had a question.,1,0.8991,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,0,8.128744980647692,4.64,4.64,4.64,4.55,37700964,"Katinka has been a wonderful host and gave me all the information I needed- even some tipps for exploring the neighborhood. <br/>I had a lovely time in the apartment. It was very clean and the connection to the public transport was outstanding. <br/>Thank you for the great time! If you want to have a pleasant time in Berlin, you should definitely book Katinka‘s room 😊👍",1,0.9781,Positive
42.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,39,100.0,1,6.652974719837619,4.89,4.94,4.68,4.77,634812150072700256,"It fulfills the description stated, everything was clean and tidy. Easy communication and very comfortable sofa bed.",1,0.8805,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,17,100.0,0,6.781879177256441,4.43,4.0,4.86,4.57,30949656,"Edu was a very attentive host, checking in via messages to make sure we were doing ok and had everything we needed. The location is great and we had some great times at the nearby cafe's and bars. We were the first guests to use the Berlin apartment on airbnb so there were some things that were not quite up to our standards like cleanliness but I think they will have things sorted out a bit more for their next guests.",1,0.7964,Positive
112.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,1,1.850891633131909,4.81,4.71,4.95,4.72,1205350,"The apartment is located in a very nice area, close to the center with good communications. There is a lot of space in the rooms, Thanks Martina for your hospitality",1,0.8357,Positive
173.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,85.0,0,1.5095289909770313,4.76,4.84,4.91,4.59,45904289,"Die Unterkunft liegt in einem belebten Teil von Ost-Berlin viele Sehenswürdigkeiten per Fuss erreichbar, Velos Station in der Nähe. Auch gibt es viele Parks und Restaurants. Die Unterkunft hat uns gefallen, würden wieder dorthin gehen.",1,-0.8316,Negative
