102.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,1,8.562971671773859,4.86,4.94,4.78,4.7,38590769,"Super stylish, yet cosy loft with everything you need for a stay! Spotless clean, on a quiet street, close to the cafes and public transportation. You can hear the trains well if the windows are open, but with the closed windows they don’t bother at all. Will gladly stay here again.",1,0.63,Positive
