52.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,1,3.473271590604837,4.84,4.81,4.93,4.81,9689519,Cozy apartment in a quiet neighborhood and great location. Self check-in went really smoothly. I’d highly recommend Betty and Stefan’s apartment.,1,0.7841,Positive
104.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,99.0,0,9.113849377520202,4.49,4.66,4.73,4.44,1034594067790242581,I had a lovely stay. The entrance hall and stair case is absolutely beautiful. The room was quite and private. Highly recommend.,1,0.8953,Positive
118.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,0,8.01742488509254,4.46,4.48,4.88,4.41,27869320,"The building is in the main area of a thriving shopping area. It is in a great Location for the train network, travelling made easy.<br/>If you book WATCH the video link sent to you it makes access easier.<br/>However this listing did have a few negatives <br/>(and reading reviews I'm not the first to mention some)<br/>Soap and shampoo missing<br/>Tv controllers would not work.<br/>Coffee machine no coffee no instructions (Main user book found in draw morning of leaving) so in effect no coffee machine.<br/>Curtains let in a lot of light (blinds have been suggested before)<br/>Wooden Parquet flooring is very noisy however it is an old building.<br/>If you like a firm pillow then definitely stay away. <br/>It seems expensive for what it is. <br/>I believe this to be a fair review. If you read my others you will see I'm not a picky person",1,0.9227,Positive
75.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,41,100.0,1,1.7682308055071967,4.92,4.87,5.0,4.9,564137190485134157,"Our stay here was amazing. We were two girls travelling together and we felt very comfortable. Locations great, clean bathrooms and we were even welcomed with wine and chocolate. All in all a wonderful stay, would definitely recommend!",1,0.9777,Positive
26.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,0.0,0,4.347996952448364,4.7,4.19,4.88,4.74,4804494,"This is an amazing place to stay in Berlin. Super close to the East Side Gallery and S/U Bahn, Robert's stay is the perfect place to have a moment of peace along your travels. I traveled solo to a bunch of hostels in Berlin, and staying at Robert's was a perfectly timed oasis for me. Robert is incredibly friendly- he knows all the best spots and is a fantastic musician. He is respectful and accommodating of whatever you need! You have your own room in his apartment, very spacious (on the colder side when it is in the shade, but there are plenty of blankets). I loved this airbnb and highly recommend it to any fellow solo travelers out there!",1,0.9814,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,18,100.0,0,2.2309100217625213,4.29,3.31,4.94,4.33,35261758,Wir hatten eine sehr schöne Zeit in Berlin bei Patrick. Die Wohnung ist sehr geräumig und hat eine super Lage. Patrick ist ein sehr netter Gastgeber und war bei Rückfragen immer gut zu erreichen. Er hat uns sogar ein paar Tipps bezüglich Bars und Restaurants in Berlin gegeben. Für Gäste mit einem sehr hohem Sauberkeitsanspruch nicht unbedingt geeignet.,1,-0.5994,Negative
