128.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,61,100.0,1,4.880214568244147,4.95,4.99,4.9,4.88,24423970,"Thank you for an amazing hospitality that I have never experienced , very special and perfect my solo trip. The apartment was a beautifully decorated. You immediately feel so warm and welcomed as it is a true reflection of the host’s personality - please do yourself a favour and stay here! Thank you Istvan & Gunnar for sharing your space 😊",1,0.9822,Positive
137.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,1.189406824976013,4.86,4.84,4.93,4.79,264459,"I had a great time at Henrik's apartment.  It was in a great location, and perfect for what I needed for 3 days in Berlin!  Henrik was a gracious host and gave me all the particulars I needed for my stay!",1,0.9523,Positive
312.0,11,3.0,1.0,4.0,42,100.0,1,9.660413858650209,4.92,4.94,4.44,4.83,16237757,"Ben and Simon are great hosts and will ensure you make the most of your stay. We really enjoyed renting bikes from the apartment, Berlin is a great city for cycling. It was handy to be able to store luggage while waiting to check in and after checking out. The apartment was spacious and the beds very comfortable. We had a great experience, thank you.",0,0.9766,Positive
