175.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,1,5.186577238960229,4.77,4.88,4.66,4.72,28535860,Construction outside was a little noisy. Otherwise a great stay!,1,0.5749,Positive
161.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,91.0,0,4.871252294318258,4.65,4.79,4.85,4.47,46865074,"Entering Sketch, you will find wall displays to your left of outfits which granted the wearers access to Berghain and Tresor.<br/>This means you can expect the quality and atmosphere which achieves the standard of the young urban professional with a taste in the arts.<br/>My suite had a bit of a cyberpunk feel in terms of the color palette used.<br/>Everything was comfortable, from the bed to the temperature to the bathroom and especially the location.<br/>It’s 14 minutes away from Berghain on foot. 5 minutes away you will find top rated breakfast-oriented cafes.<br/>The subway is about 7-10 minutes north.<br/>Sketch also contains two large rooms for coworkers, which I found to be of great convenience.<br/>One minus is the quality of sound isolation. You will be able to hear everyone in the hallway, and sometimes snoring in the next room. However, this isn’t that bad if you’re not bothered by this.<br/>I otherwise highly recommend this place.",1,0.8296,Positive
158.0,8,2.0,1.0,4.0,46,97.0,1,7.826529889577852,4.77,4.77,4.23,4.77,1365227272212379765,"Timo was responsive, friendly and accommodated us well. He is very responsive too.",0,0.8519,Positive
260.0,4,2.0,2.0,4.0,55,100.0,0,2.5729352260986107,4.66,4.55,4.84,4.45,26543,"Terri’s apartment was lovely and clean, opposite a park and very near a number of coffee shops and bars, as well as a short walk to the tube. We found ourselves in a bit of a bind when our original AirBnB host did not show up and Terri helped us out immensely :-) I would definitely recommend staying here!",0,0.9536,Positive
35.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,59,100.0,0,0.7009515972590313,4.75,4.8,4.95,4.74,2543760,"Thank you Monica, short and pleasant stay. Location is amazing",1,0.8625,Positive
135.0,2,0.0,1.5,2.0,38,100.0,1,1.9797577383607676,4.81,4.9,4.91,4.6,257373,"David was really kind and easy to communicate with. The apartment was very clean and cozy. Also a bit small but enough space for two people for a couple of days in Berlin. Also it is situated to a really quiet backyard! The neighborhood really is lovely , with a lot of great restaurants and bars. Recommended!",1,0.966,Positive
422.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,34,100.0,1,3.493881504023501,4.97,4.9,4.9,4.71,663684201927336298,"Tomer's listing was fantastic - in an incredible part of Berlin, with shops, coffee, restaurants all nearby. Just a couple blocks from the canal. It has great natural light, is very clean, and extremely safe. Would HIGHLY recommend for anyone visiting Berlin!",0,0.9601,Positive
141.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,43,94.0,0,7.131273504704622,4.74,4.82,4.79,4.62,49070135,"Couldn’t ask for a better location, only thing was the electrics in the apartment And the shower was not very big for a tall guy like myself, however it was such a brilliant stay so 5 stars from me. Would happily recommend and stay again!",1,0.9392,Positive
77.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,56,100.0,1,8.0840026606752,4.75,4.65,4.79,4.7,580667,"Really enjoyed our stay at Anna's place. Great location and very clean. Purchased a week long ubahn pass and visited the city. Only a few minutes from the metro station, shopping mall and restaurants. Everything that you need is in Anna's apartment. All you need to bring is yourself!",1,0.8996,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,17,100.0,0,1.2170784296828043,4.67,4.58,4.96,4.5,33550908,"Wir haben uns bei Marcus sehr wohl gefühlt, der Check in durch die Schlüsselbox ist angenehm, da wir so zeitlich sehr flexibel anreisen konnten. Die Lage der Wohnung war für unsere Zwecke perfekt. Toll auch jetzt im Sommer, dass man den Balkon zum Innenhof nutzen kann.",1,-0.9136,Negative
