326.0,7,3.0,1.5,6.0,57,100.0,1,1.687396064265959,4.87,4.88,4.95,4.77,35037673,"Nina’s place is in a beautiful part of Prenzlauer Berg, centrally located and wonderful. The place is very spacious and clean and great for groups. Check in was easy and clear. Nina was a great host; clear, efficient, and quick to respond! Will definitely stay again the next time we’re in Berlin!",0,0.9861,Positive
158.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,45,100.0,0,2.309471505712993,4.6,4.72,4.89,4.54,16050152,"Great location, warm and peaceful with the fabulous Katz Orange restaurant on your doorstep. Easy to explore the city from here with lots of great places to eat / drink around and close access to transport links.",1,0.9618,Positive
