131.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,0,2.319079304594608,4.91,4.85,4.89,4.85,44363134,"Great airbnb! It’s definitely bigger than it looks on photos! Was perfect for the two of us for 4 days. We were also working and the internet was 👌🏼 for video calls, fast and reliable. Clean, great heating, comfy bed, kitchen with everything we needed. The flat itself is in a very quiet area, but only 2 mins away from the tram that takes you to Alexanderplatz in 10 mins. Other stop is 5 mins and take you to Berlin Wall Memorial. Supermarket nearby, 10 mins walk as well as few coffee places and restaurants. Would def consider this again if we were back in Berlin!",1,0.8713,Positive
