125.0,2,2.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,0,3.036032627048052,4.7,4.7,4.63,4.68,22438,"Great:  fast response about availability, very clear check-in email, practical key system on-site, courtesy candies and call, very convenient location, very clean, very Mitte Berlin.",1,0.9097,Positive
151.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,94.0,0,3.1018817858877528,4.67,4.77,4.78,4.52,721527807549293451,"A great place to stay. The location is close to many tourist areas, however, the subway is right out the front to get to any other part of the city. The rooms were very comfortable and clean. I highly recommend Numa apartments.",1,0.9253,Positive
