135.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,47,99.0,1,3.1208071542921334,4.89,4.79,4.77,4.59,34271196,"Beautiful apartment, clean, peaceful and very central. Check in was super easy and clear. Would love to stay again",1,0.9732,Positive
192.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,28,98.0,0,0.9707589989427288,4.78,4.74,4.83,4.53,822242777906875094,"Nice and comfortable place. Calm area, great location with lots of tasty places around. <br/>There is an elevator, but it stops between floors.  Very nice courtyard, I think it will be great in summer 😍 <br/>we (family with 3y.o. children) enjoyed our staying<br/>***<br/>We had to change our plans and find an apartment 2 hours before arrival. Thanks to the Limehome team we were successful. Communication was great!",1,0.9896,Positive
139.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,96.0,1,4.279858775670925,4.8,4.82,4.89,4.66,54126149,Everything was perfect. We booked one night but it was so nice that we extended and stayed longer. The staff is very proactive and friendly to sort out problems. The room was huge and super comfortable. The area is just the right neighborhood to be in Berlin!,1,0.981,Positive
146.0,6,1.0,1.0,5.0,5,81.0,0,1.7732750227734309,4.28,4.0,4.69,4.13,1300039926473509773,War gut,1,-0.5994,Negative
72.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,1,7.363278935671278,4.83,4.84,4.86,4.74,250007,Had an amazing time in Berlin. Jörg’s place is in an awesome location!,1,0.8478,Positive
223.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,49,100.0,1,2.573289565070358,4.97,4.99,4.84,4.91,686752584391406378,"We had an amazing stay at Denise & Jürgen's place -- their apartment is clean, spacious, bright, and well-decorated. They were incredibly responsive and helpful; they even lent me some tape when my suitcase broke. The check-in and check-out processes were easy too. And the street is very quiet and safe. The only thing is that I wish there were more cute coffee shops and restaurants within walking distance of the apartment. Berlin is much more spread out than we realized :) However, the metro is quite easy and nearby. Overall would definitely come back!",0,0.9854,Positive
68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,3.194253694245239,4.93,4.95,4.89,4.86,81081,"Hemos tenido una perfecta estancia en el apartamento de Katja y Bernd. Es una casa muy tranquila, limpia y muy bien acondicionada. La comunicación con ellos fue perfecta, lo que tiene más mérito si tenemos en cuenta que se encontraban de viaje. Además, está perfectamente ubicado (cerca de transporte público, tiendas, bares y restaurantes, etc..) y en un barrio popular y tranquilo, muy cerca del centro. Desde luego, si volvemos a Berlín (cosa probable porque nos ha encantado) esta volverá a ser nuestra residencia.",1,0.8402,Positive
126.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,38,97.0,0,1.7520993087590884,4.75,4.77,4.93,4.65,18382782,"Hôte très accueillant. <br/>Le logement est idéalement placé et spacieux. très agréable.<br/>A noter deux bémols, le rideau coulissant intérieur est en partie cassé (la moitié ne fonctionne plus) et la cafetière doit être relancé à plusieurs reprises pour faire couler la totalité.<br/>Je recommande vivement !",1,0.0,Neutral
55.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,0.8025330705337501,4.79,4.94,4.83,4.77,11403270,Just as advertised. Pleasant host and just a few minutes walk from Alexanderplaz.,1,0.5106,Positive
281.0,6,3.0,1.0,5.0,36,100.0,1,6.9684418232558265,4.9,4.9,4.55,4.75,16209988,"Vielen lieben Dank!!! Sehr nette und professionelle Gastgeber, super organisiert und gut erreichbar. Ein paar Worte zur Wohnung: Sehr schön gelegen und gut geschnitten, eine Empfehlung und ein (Geheim-)Tipp für jeden Berlin Besucher!",0,0.7243,Positive
149.0,5,1.0,1.0,2.0,8,81.0,0,6.714128192155476,4.17,4.26,4.03,4.17,1223091910763945275,"Hallo,  von sich ist die Wohnung in Ordnung und im großen Ganzen sauber, wenn man nicht pingelig ist könnte man sagen alles gut und sauber. <br/>Aber ist viel Zulaut wegen der Bahnhof hinter den Fenster. In der Wohnung von gefühl her war viel zu warm und mit offenen Fenster zu schlafen ist horror da die Züge ununterbrochen fahren. Man hat von der Veranstaltung  was dagegen unternommen und die Stöpsel für die Ohren Zur verfügen gelegt was positiv ist aber nützt nicht für jeden. Eine Nacht könnte man da übernachten aber mehrere Tage ist meine Meinung nach unmöglich. Wohnungen müssen mit der lüftungsanlage ausgestattet werden mit zentralen oder dezentrale.",1,-0.9729,Negative
125.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,0,7.669090893821904,4.77,4.52,4.92,4.61,19501540,Jederzeit wieder. Sehr empfehlenswert,1,0.0,Neutral
242.0,9,3.0,1.0,5.0,57,100.0,0,2.38030021203205,4.63,4.6,4.69,4.5,46726253,"Great place, really clean, nice atmosphere and super easy check-in! Thank you",0,0.9626,Positive
89.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,1,4.64019565298711,4.88,4.74,4.85,4.78,21759319,"Unser Aufenthalt war wirklich super schön, gerade im Sommer ist eine Kellerwohnung super praktisch, da es hier angenehm kühl war. Was auch wirklich super cool war, dass wir unser Gepäck noch bei Katrin für den letzten Tag unterstellen dürfen, da wir eine relativ späte Heimreise vorgesehen hatten.",1,0.3182,Positive
95.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,3.1833669854420146,4.83,4.85,4.8,4.58,34018418,"Fantastic light and airy apartment, really clean, and with everything we needed for our week. Check-in instructions very detailed, making process super simple. Location great -  easy short walk to U-bahn, loads of cafes, restaurants, and bars nearby, in an interesting and lively part of East Berlin. The Kurdish restaurant in the bottom of the building serves delicious food, and the beers at the Schoppe Brau taproom round the corner are tasty. Great stay!",1,0.9851,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,82.0,1,2.6808853188639663,4.67,4.68,4.92,4.59,43823296,"Sehr schöner Aufenthalt in wirklich sehr guter Lage. Die Zimmer waren sehr sauber, die Bäder auch! Bequeme Boxspringbetten. Es ist rel. laut weil man in der Mitte Berlins ist, logischerweise. Uns hat es nicht gestört. Direkt gegenüber ein Bio-Bäcker für Menschen, die nicht das Hotel-Frühstück dazu buchen wollen. Etwas irritiert hat uns nur, dass die Tourismuspauschale am Abreisetag ohne Beleg noch in Rechnung gestellt wurde, nachdem es beim Check-In hieß, die Rechnung sei soweit beglichen. Insgesamt ein sehr schöner Aufenthalt!",1,-0.9686,Negative
112.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,1,1.850891633131909,4.81,4.71,4.95,4.72,1205350,My friend Julie and I really enjoyed our stay at Martina's apartment.  The location could not have been better.  It was really close to many options for transportation and in a friendly neighborhood with an amazing variety of restaurants.  A good supermarket was a short walk away and the Sunday street market was at the end of the street.  -bliss-<br/>The apartment was simple (which I like) and comfortable and had everything a guest would need.  <br/>We made breakfast in the morning and relaxed before we ventured out to see Berlin.  I would definitely stay at Martina's apartment again and probably will on my next trip to Berlin!  Highly recommended.  ,1,0.9773,Positive
121.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,27,100.0,0,4.472653939309849,4.88,4.9,4.81,4.78,10122398,"Martin was the all time best host I have ever encountered. He was always very quick with replies before and during checking into his apartment. He gave us perfect directions from the airport and let us have an early check in. He had everything you would need in the apartment from shampoo to some milk and ice cold water. <br/>He had maps of the city as well as the metro system. He highlighted the must-dos in Berlin, gave us some great places to eat traditional German food and cheap places to grab a drink. <br/>He was extremely friendly and accommodating and it was a pleasure meeting him. <br/>His apartment is walking distance to checkpoint charlie, potsdamer platz, Brandenburg Gate with everything else just a good 15-20 minutes away. <br/>",1,0.9756,Positive
120.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,0,7.798625942260672,4.9,4.82,4.92,4.7,16292857,"Lucio is a really nice guy, he gave me a warm welcome and some trip advice when I arrvied. Not only his place is clean and Morden, but also the Location is close to the public transportation.<br/>Any way,  worth to try☺️.<br/>Ps. Pandas are soooo cute !<br/>房东Lucio挺nice的，我到了之后他亲自下来迎接我，而且也很耐心的跟我介绍了柏林哪里有好玩的。住的地方不仅干净布置也很现代，而且距离公共交通也很近，但是不会受到噪音干扰。<br/>总之是值得入住的。<br/>顺便说一句，有空可以去柏林动物园看看熊猫，还是挺可爱的😊。",1,0.8998,Positive
73.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,66,100.0,1,3.2223990157956264,4.96,4.95,4.92,4.93,24010707,"Very nice host, respectful and kind. Also, the dog is obedient and a good boy.<br/>Would come back!",1,0.9177,Positive
247.0,10,2.0,1.0,3.0,56,100.0,1,9.660413858650209,4.89,4.91,4.48,4.78,16250536,Fantastic experience ! Everything is perfect!,0,0.8353,Positive
174.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,1,2.3140250627916763,5.0,4.95,4.84,4.89,1241964448389563994,"Das Apartment ist sehr geschmackvoll eingerichtet. Es war alles sehr sauber, wir haben uns direkt wohl gefühlt.<br/>Das Bett und auch die Schlafcouch sind sehr bequem. Eine Bushaltestelle befindet sich direkt vor der Haustür.<br/>Das Apartment liegt Richtung Innenhof und ist dadurch sehr ruhig. Das Auto kann man kostenfrei auf der gegenüberliegenden Straßenseite parken.<br/>Artem antwortet innerhalb weniger Minuten auf Fragen und ist sehr freundlich.<br/>Wir würden uns jederzeit wieder für diese Unterkunft entscheiden.",1,-0.8316,Negative
57.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,19,100.0,1,7.136630170745785,4.73,4.81,4.39,4.59,23501368,The apartment was very nice. Perfect for the 3 of us. Very near a nice grocery store and the subway was nearby. We enjoyed walking the pathway around the lake one street over.,1,0.9255,Positive
109.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,3.5991715456162776,4.85,4.8,4.88,4.69,38967379,"Ich bin ""Stammgast"" bei Jan. Das sagt sicher schon einiges aus, dass ich immer wieder komme. :)<br/>Alles läuft völlig unproblematisch und entspannt ab. Location ist klasse. Kommunkiation schnell.",1,0.0,Neutral
82.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,3.929915771235159,4.89,4.9,4.96,4.86,20660494,"Amazing stay! Less than 5 minute walk to station. Very accommodating, our flight arrived early and Uta was kind enough hold our luggage until check in time. Would definetly stay here again!",1,0.8309,Positive
