44.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,23,100.0,0,13.157059293117056,4.44,4.33,4.64,4.44,18066481,2泊させて頂きました<br/>初日は23時頃到着しました<br/>雨も降っており、少し部屋を汚したかもしれません<br/>ぐっすり眠れたので体力回復しました！ありがとう<br/>2日目は次の行き先のバス停を探しに行ったりしました違うと言われ、とても寒かったので心が折れましたが、帰ってネットで検索して今に至ります<br/>ネット環境はPCで動画等を見ようとすると重いけど、スマホはサクサク行くので快適でした<br/>ロケーションも最高で、私の様な田舎者には丁度いい位の街でした<br/>またベルリンに行くことがありましたらこちらをまた使いたいと思います<br/>本当にありがとうございました,1,0.0,Neutral
25.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,24,100.0,1,27.444278790292596,4.86,4.87,4.55,4.91,21448699,The house is quite far from the center of the city but the closest bus stop is 5 mins walking.<br/>Couple of very nice and warm guys with a sweet kid.<br/>Beautiful home and backyard in a very quiet spot.,1,0.8436,Positive
125.0,1,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,0,4.16370010699668,4.28,4.6,4.66,4.37,7217439,"My partner and I were, surprisingly, greeted by Miguel's friend or flatmate, who was nice enough but he didn't tell us how exactly to get in and out of the back entrance (""leave thru the back"" seemed simple enough but turned out to be a puzzle and we ended up having to call him for him to tell us) Also, zero access to the elevator.<br/><br/>The apartment was missing some of the more homey touches in the picture such as books and posters etc. Our towels were large hand towels at best (which we got exactly two of) turned out to be a bigger problem due to the lack of a shower curtain. Every time we took a shower the two feet outside the shower got soaked, leaving us with one, small, towel to share. Also, just one roll of toilet paper for our entire stay and no trash can. Great location though.....<br/><br/>I've stayed in better dorm rooms. Would not return, would not recommend.",1,0.9412,Positive
89.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,7.289170629982721,4.87,4.77,4.77,4.8,533523,Norbert was great - very helpful and provided really great instructions on how to get to his place! It was in a nice little neighborhood that was close to a lot of cool areas and very close to the metro. It was perfect for my family and I and we're so glad we stayed there! Highly recommend this place! You will love the decorations - very cool. ,1,0.9874,Positive
