163.0,5,1.0,1.0,6.0,63,100.0,1,3.203800174246222,4.83,4.66,4.91,4.7,34586087,"Our stay at Aaron’s place was wonderful! Very clean, and we loved all of his art pieces, the apartment was bigger than expected as well! So that was a nice surprise, more than enough space for all 7 of us. He also left us fruits and beer as a welcome gift, which was very thoughtful! Overall, 5/5!",0,0.9795,Positive
