187.0,5,1.0,1.0,2.0,60,100.0,1,3.4993610437479004,4.97,4.9,4.92,4.83,701971447519071423,Amazing service ! I will definatly come back,1,0.6239,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,1,3.871692888453004,4.85,4.76,4.79,4.82,29676703,"I had the most amazing stay at Thi Kim Nhu’s. She and her boyfriend are amazing and incredibly welcoming people ! Discreet but here when needed, she always has attentions, which make your stay very enjoyable. <br/>If you come to Berlin, I hope you will have the opportunity to discover her energy and kindness ❤️",1,0.9776,Positive
124.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,52,100.0,1,1.65162815442783,4.86,4.79,4.92,4.69,2045192,Very easy and pleasant place to stay. A great location to explore Berlin from.,1,0.8969,Positive
