40.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,59,100.0,1,9.448364402503817,4.97,4.94,4.82,4.96,14259993,"I had a peaceful stay at Eckehard's beautiful home—a perfect retreat away from the city hustle. The house is just 30-40 minutes away from the city, with a few grocery stores nearby. Everything, from check-in until checkout, was comfortable. Eckehard is a great host. <br/>I'll definitely come back next time when I'm in Berlin.",1,0.9709,Positive
84.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,52,100.0,1,3.3219101132328723,4.81,4.81,4.9,4.73,1238867,"Io e il mio compagno abbiamo soggiornato da Alan due notti ad inizio giugno. Alan fin dal primo momento, e durante tutto il soggiorno, è stato molto disponibile. La pulizia di tutta la casa era perfetta ed in cucina non mancava nulla. La posizione della casa è ottima, la stazione è a pochi metri e permette di raggiungere il centro in 15 minuti circa. Siamo rimasti molto contenti dell'accoglienza di Alan e del suo appartamento in generale e lo consigliamo vivamente!",1,0.0,Neutral
55.0,3,2.0,1.0,3.0,22,100.0,0,2.721720905383492,4.34,4.44,4.45,4.45,254788,"I made reservation end of June initially for 14 months. Apartment looked freshly painted , bright and airy on the photos. When I arrived 18th of September after 500km drive with a car loaded with personal belongings and my cat the apartment turned out to be extremely worn out - stained,  covered in spots, nearly all furniture different from photos - bed, curtains, shower. Everything very filthy and outdated. Extra pieces of furniture which took space already from a small apartment. Yellowish wardrobe and bedside tables. Terrible washer which was not on the photos. Shower - single head instead of double on the photos. Dirty shower curtain with rusty spots on top. Kitchen door not closing. Door handles of bathroom door falling out. None of the bedroom doors are lockable , keys missing. Terrible damaged window's frame. UBAHN bridge 100m away - at night it feels like airplane is running over you. <br/>I had to spend 2 weeks urgently looking for another flat to rent !! UNLESS RENOVATED- AVOID!!",1,-0.9348,Negative
160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,87.0,0,3.4802565088356308,4.54,4.54,4.6,4.41,43798011,a cool place to stay,1,0.3182,Positive
