135.0,2,0.0,1.5,2.0,38,100.0,1,1.9797577383607676,4.81,4.9,4.91,4.6,257373,"This was a private studio in a beautiful neighborhood. The small tv was unfortunately only hooked up with an HDMI so if you don’t have a device to plug into it, it was unusable. Not very decorated or warm, and the bed was two small beds pushed together - but it was comfortable when it wasn’t being pushed apart! When we first got there we were given only a few towels for the 6 nights and is no laundry on site, but when I asked for more he responded promptly and stopped by with 2 more. Otherwise it was equipped with most essentials for cooking, with a mini fridge 2 electric stove tops, and 3 different coffee makers. The bathrooms are split into a small toilet and sink and another room for a shower and sink. The water pressure was okay but the entire floor gets wet. There’s a large storage cabinet to separate the room and in there you’ll find different pots and pans and an ironing board etc. <br/>Overall a nice stay in a nice neighborhood, after our other lodging fell thorough last minute.",1,0.9363,Positive
111.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,51,100.0,1,3.4156959509415743,4.85,4.89,4.82,4.77,14804266,Comfortable place in a great area - very much worth it,1,0.8617,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,0,0.5555591583260235,4.82,4.96,4.88,4.69,10031729,Marius was extremely helpful and flexible with both check in and chock out. He helped us navigate what to see and where to go to have a fun time during the day and at night. Would highly recommend this centrally located space and will always value the time spent with a great host.,1,0.9505,Positive
96.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,1,1.56460206649329,4.98,4.98,4.95,4.84,1004454780293034887,"Konrad propose une super chambre avec plein de moyen de déplacements situer à côté de celle ci. <br/>On s’est senti à l’aise, la chambre était spacieuse, propre et chaleureuse de même pour la salle de bain. <br/>Je recommande si vous passez à Berlin",1,0.5994,Positive
52.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,6.296102388049414,4.82,4.77,4.72,4.77,16305782,"Die Unterkunft war super! Sehr gute Lage, man kam mit Bus und Bahn gut in die Stadt und der Parkplatz war auch super, sodass wir unser Auto stehen lassen konnten. Zudem war die Kommunikation mit Serkan richtig toll, er hat sich von sich aus auch bei uns gemeldet und schnell und sehr freundlich geantwortet. Danke für alles 😇",1,-0.9508,Negative
62.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,1,7.753624515540955,4.83,4.83,4.83,4.79,5536095,"We had a fantastic stay at Amelie's apartment. It was clean, facilities to cook, comfy bed and so easy to get everywhere we wanted to. Exactly what we wanted for our trip. Highly recommended if you want a calm quiet place to stay but easy to reach the sights. Thank you!",1,0.9491,Positive
