64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,16,100.0,0,5.760920317883159,4.86,4.14,4.71,4.71,17708457,"We had a really great stay at Rotem's place - it felt like a real home. We stayed in Rotem's room while he was away, and he was always available to answer any of our questions. The room and house was very spacious. His housemate was also super helpful - he gave us great recommendations and showed us around. Highly recommend!",1,0.9685,Positive
180.0,6,2.0,1.5,3.0,29,100.0,1,5.511924821665748,4.85,4.85,4.75,4.59,20189998,"We had a wonderful time staying at Martin's home. The space is very bright and clean, and it's location couldn't have been more convenient with a train stop only a few blocks away. Further, it is across from a peaceful park with lots of trees and many near by restaurants. If you are looking to explore Berlin but want a quiet place away from all the tourist and traffic...this is your place.",0,0.7121,Positive
