147.0,6,1.0,1.0,4.0,22,99.0,0,2.353100516764864,4.78,4.68,4.84,4.64,30389555,"Die Wohnung war genau wie im Inserat beschrieben und liegt in einer sehr schönen ruhigen Straße. Wir waren mit zwei Kindern da und denen hat die Wohnung sehr gut gefallen. Besonders gut war, dass der Park direkt um die Ecke ist  Die Matratzen unten waren gut und die Matratzen im „ Hochbett“ sind eher für Kinder zu empfehlen, da sie doch etwas weich und durch gelegen sind. Tipp: nebenan gibt es sehr gutes Thai Essen. :-) wir hatten hier eine gute Zeit.",1,-0.9744,Negative
82.0,3,2.0,1.0,3.0,35,100.0,1,8.118722417967053,4.97,4.94,4.78,4.84,1167156301403053007,"My friend and I enjoyed our stay at Mirco’s place. The apartment was just like in the pictures and it had all we needed. We especially appreciated the cleanness. Mirco is responsive and friendly. The location is quite peaceful, a residential area.",1,0.9674,Positive
78.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,0,8.9505494061986,4.92,4.94,4.8,4.88,4424125,"Saido's apartment is a perfect home-base for an extended stay in Berlin. Although the space is compact, it's well thought out and never feels cramped. The balcony is also a delightful touch (even if, like me, you come in winter). Location really couldn't be better; the U-Bahn is just across the street, and another line available two blocks away.",1,0.8191,Positive
135.0,6,3.0,1.0,4.0,16,100.0,0,4.492800793369802,4.9,4.55,5.0,4.73,16405504,"The best location in Berlin for New Years celebration: amazing view over Berlin - all the way to Alexanderplatz and Branderburger Tor. Wunderful location in the middle of the Bergmann Kietz mit lots of Bars & Restaurants, and shop and markets... Don't miss the guided tour through Tempelhof. Just one advise: This is a foto studio/ party location/ meeting room... the sleeping options are very cosy and limited... But who sleeps in Berlin anyway ;-)",0,0.8211,Positive
