100.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,3.091836209520125,4.86,4.9,4.86,4.77,869793,"Die Wohnung sowie die Lage sind top und sehr zu empfehlen! Es ist alles vorhanden, was man für einen längeren Aufenthalt benötigt. Auch die Kommunikation mit Kirsten lief zu jeder Zeit unkompliziert und schnell ab. Werde ich mir auf jeden Fall für zukünftige Reisen merken!",1,-0.9097,Negative
84.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,47,100.0,1,5.089187673529073,4.94,4.96,4.96,4.85,1757613,"Die Unterkunft hat unsere Erwartungen übertroffen. Schön eingerichtet und sehr gut ausgestattet, liegt sie ruhig im Hinterhof. Einkaufsmöglichkeiten und Anbindung an den öffentlichen Nahverkehr liegen direkt vor der Haustüre. <br/>Wir würden persönlich begrüßt, eingewiesen und mit nützlichen Tipps versorgt. <br/>Kann die Unterkunft nur empfehlen.",1,-0.8316,Negative
79.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,31,100.0,0,3.5040001369002214,4.75,4.94,4.77,4.7,52652716,"Da es eine Buchungsverlängerung war, habe ich bereits ausführlich hier geschrieben.",1,-0.5994,Negative
208.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,45,100.0,0,2.312287728657424,4.58,4.61,4.82,4.5,1273965,"Apartment was even nicer than the listing! Great, walkable location - very central. Nice, clean apartment in cute courtyard. Highly recommend!",1,0.9608,Positive
83.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,1,3.102509371524417,4.92,4.98,4.92,4.81,18506873,"We absolutely loved frank’s apartment.  Very nice styling.  Little, but well equipped with everything we needed!  Would totally recommend.",1,0.8707,Positive
98.0,6,1.0,1.0,3.0,38,100.0,0,4.479387416975665,4.85,4.73,4.84,4.73,798416193829159604,"Great place and great host, thank you Jonas!",1,0.8999,Positive
44.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,23,100.0,0,13.157059293117056,4.44,4.33,4.64,4.44,18066481,"Die Unterkunft war wie beschrieben das einzige was fehlte war die Garderobe für die Unterbringung der Kleidung etc.<br/>Zu Zimmer 6 muss man sagen das es direkt hinter der Gemeinschaftsküche liegt, und es schon mal lauter werden kann. Vor allem wenn Gäste erst gegen Mitternacht kochen und sich dabei lautstark Unterhalten, oder über Lautsprecher telefonieren.<br/>Prinzipiell ist die Unterkunft ihren Preis wert, und hat eine gute Lage, ÖPNV in der Nähe, Restaurants, Cafés, Supermärkte sind ganz in der Nähe.",1,-0.9761,Negative
166.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,38,98.0,0,1.5417894419859457,4.65,4.63,4.93,4.51,958668285940060858,It was great! Had good fun in Berlin,1,0.8908,Positive
190.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,41,100.0,1,4.114262881105487,4.92,4.94,4.91,4.8,1177924,"The place is clean and comfortable, look exactly like on the pictures.<br/>It is really close to a bus and U-Bahn stations.<br/>There is everything you need in the apartment and the host is very helpful.",0,0.8908,Positive
118.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,18,93.0,0,2.3052158670724103,4.8,4.79,4.77,4.7,16922853,"Sehr gute Lage nah am Cotti, tolles Studio-Apartment mit ausreichend Platz zum gemeinsamen Verweilen (auf der riesigen Couch oder am Esstisch). Gerne wieder!",1,-0.1759,Negative
187.0,3,2.0,1.0,3.0,43,100.0,1,7.621822577546772,4.98,4.99,4.96,4.9,26651561,"This apartment is a very updated, airy and serene place to stay in one of the few buildings that survived the war.  It is located on a very quiet tree-lined street that is only a few blocks from the bustling Wittenberg Plaza Metro and commercial area.  The 4 large high-ceiling rooms are filled with thoughtful art, books, and collectibles which reflect the unique culture and history of Berlin, all of which adds to the uniqueness of the stay.  David was present throughout from greeting us to checking in to ensure that we had all that we needed vis a vis restaurants (his recommendation for the Dicke Wirtin pub was spot on) and food shopping at the huge KaDeWe nearby.      We would definitely return for a longer stay!  <br/>Note that there is no elevator to reach this fifth floor apartment.",1,0.8883,Positive
100.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,40,100.0,1,11.486177237653978,4.82,4.79,4.63,4.8,46274340,"Really lovely  place, perfect location for exploring Berlin especially with parking outside. Clear and easy instructions and peaceful stay.",1,0.9498,Positive
64.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,20,100.0,0,4.993723336849769,4.7,4.57,4.44,4.66,17250059,"Jonathan was nice and reacted very quickly, actually everything was fine. But it was not clean enough to feel comfortable there. But for this price and as I only slept there it was OK.",1,0.83,Positive
