112.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,51,100.0,1,7.069783798568355,4.81,4.92,4.62,4.73,221015,"We spent five days in Berlin, staying in this really sweet place. Tom is a great host, he really cared about us all along our stay ! The flat is perfect for 3 or 4 people, and if you like to go out and wish to discover what real Berlin nights are, Wedding is the perfect area ! ",1,0.9741,Positive
161.0,8,3.0,2.0,3.0,35,100.0,1,6.906667346101181,4.78,4.72,4.69,4.75,5977917,Thank you Michele for being such a great host and always readily available to answer any questions I had. Thank you for being so accommodating in terms of our early check in. It helped immensely. I would definitely stay here again and recommend it to others! Perfect for a large group and family and a great value! This truly made our stay in Prague amazing!,0,0.985,Positive
36.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,12,93.0,0,2.32696032815334,4.3,4.19,4.79,4.37,36340336,"They are horrible people, I made by mistake a reservation with them, I tried to cancel almost immediately my reservation, but it is not possible. I asked by a private message to help me out but they never replied to me!!!",1,0.2444,Positive
56.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,5.179021895059785,4.9,4.95,4.89,4.77,27397593,"It was a very nice stay :) Olga and her husband were very friendly and nice.<br/>The room is really stylish and the location is great, especially the fact that there is a tons of great restaurants, caffes and bars around in the area.<br/>If I could change something it would be to put a better mattress on one side of the bed ( one mattress is really soft and not comfortable anymore).",1,0.9598,Positive
81.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,54,100.0,1,11.098231074049592,4.93,4.9,4.71,4.83,6253378,"Das Gartenhaus von Anke liegt in einem verträumten schönen Garten. Wir haben uns dort SEHR wohl gefühlt. Leider ist es etwas abschüssig, eine bessere Anbindung wäre wünschenswert. Da wir jedoch meistens mit dem Auto in Berlin sind, wird uns das nicht hindern, wieder bei Anke nach einer Unterkunft zu fragen. Das kleine Häuschen bietet alles und noch mehr, was man benötigt, im Zweifelsfall steht Anke mit Rat und Tat zur Seite. Toll!",0,0.0,Neutral
