54.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,7.403263725526816,4.91,4.92,4.78,4.85,23477057,Great place! Andi was very nice too,1,0.8169,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,0,4.621848331760749,4.97,5.0,4.94,4.89,40716983,"Sindy's place is awesome, I highly recommend it for solo travellers or couples. Very convenient location & very peaceful surroundings. I had the most relaxing sleep here!",1,0.9345,Positive
