64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,0,10.023228212367442,4.86,4.95,4.74,4.84,17278413,"sabrina was a wonderful host! super kind and helpful and responsive. her flat is really clean and accessible, and she also gave me a bunch of local tips! her sons are also super nice and overall really great stay and nice family :)",1,0.9889,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,100.0,0,2.470169768821385,4.69,4.54,4.9,4.73,2377008,"We had a wonderfull time in Berlin! Great host, welcomed us when we arrived, gave us some advice about resto/pubs and places to visit.<br/>The appartment is located in the perfect neighbourhood. Almost every historical or cultural building is at walkingdistance. Around the corner you can find lots of good restaurants and nice pubs.<br/>",1,0.945,Positive
40.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,11,98.0,0,2.4809600042725424,4.56,4.5,4.85,4.64,35816059,如果满分是5分，我会给这家店打4.9分。我之前在别的地方住过青年旅舍，体验并不满意。这家旅店支持24小时办理入住和退房。旅店环境非常好。房间整洁干净，浴室和卫生间分开。每个床有自己的帘子，可以保护隐私。每个人有独立的储物箱。交通便利，价格实惠。我在这里碰上了来自德国，法国，美国的朋友，聊天很愉快。唯一的不足是浴室有一点异味，建议加强打扫。同时入住时前台收取了我2欧左右的城市税，这一点我并不知情。,1,0.0,Neutral
88.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,80.0,0,4.3965704421174285,4.79,4.7,4.87,4.68,4361737,The flat was exactly as described.,1,0.0,Neutral
