64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,16,100.0,1,5.377242485968316,4.89,4.88,4.89,4.81,28117561,사진이랑 똑같아요. 청결하고 침대도 넓고 방도 넓고 소파도 있어서 좋아요. 캐리어 두개 펼쳐놓고 지낼 수 있어서 좋았어요. 처음에 집 들어갈때 반겨줘서 좋았어요. 숙소에 주의사항 등 다 알려줬고 코리안이라고 하니까 구글 번역기로도 얘기해줬어요. 세탁기도 쓰게 해주셔서 세탁기도 사용할 수 있어서 좋았습니다. 늦게 들어와도 눈치 안보였어요!! 다 괜찮다고(?) 했어요. 좀 힘들었던 건 숙소 위친데 버스나 지하철 내려서 10분-15분 정도 걸리는 그리 멀지 않은 거리이긴 한데.. 돌길이 좀 있고 그래서.. 무거운 캐리어 끌고 가기엔 좀 힘들어요. 계단도 올라야하구요. 그것빼곤 다 좋았습니다 ! :-),1,0.4898,Positive
82.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,12,100.0,0,5.860893550389853,4.67,4.49,4.68,4.63,14648612,"Stephan is a very friendly, helpful and reliable host! His place is super cozy and charming. We loved that the location is quiet (the house is located in a courtyard so there are really no street noises at all!) yet close to several public transport options with a lot of nice bars, cafes and restaurants in walking distance. <br/>The place has been redone in a really clever and unique way and offers all the amenities and comfort you need to really enjoy your stay!",1,0.9828,Positive
204.0,10,2.0,1.0,6.0,27,100.0,0,2.604018907200736,4.46,4.25,4.54,4.5,1273810169487974048,"Bis auf die leeren Seifen- und Duschbadspender, war alles zu bester Zufriedenheit",0,-0.8316,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,16,100.0,0,0.6039103911177419,4.07,4.0,4.73,3.87,41788904,"Bäder und Toiletten waren ekelhaft. Hier muss viel öfter geputzt bzw. In den Bädern die Haare entfernt werden. Es kann nicht sein, dass man bis zu den Knöcheln fast in duschwasser steht. <br/>Toiletten Tür hat unten einen Riesen Spalt, so dass man schön alles hören kann.<br/>Zimmer billig (low quality) eingerichtet (Ikea Bett und alter Flohmarkt tischt.",1,-0.5994,Negative
