56.0,1,1.0,1.5,1.0,54,100.0,1,15.243183867716134,4.87,4.93,4.72,4.76,51759565,"If you are in berlin and need a place away from city hustle, and be connected as well, Kate place should he top of your list. Clean, cozy and she is great host. She was super helpful when i came late at night on my first day, it was raining heavily and she waited till 12 midnight for me. Best air bnb host till date.",1,0.9666,Positive
110.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,50,100.0,1,2.7610678260408177,4.84,4.67,4.93,4.69,2610528,"Alles war wie besprochen. Wir haben uns vom ersten Moment an sehr wohl gefühlt. Die Lage im Innenhof ist ruhig und die Nähe zur U-Bahnlinie 2 sowie zur S-Bahn ist optimal. Wir kommen jederzeit wieder! Herzlichen Dank, auch an Katja für ihre Flexibilität beim Check-out.",1,-0.8883,Negative
273.0,7,2.0,1.5,3.0,71,100.0,1,2.828064349293496,4.94,4.86,4.92,4.82,8898542,"Louis and Jess have a neat and tidy flat in former East Berlin, in a neighbourhood where it is easy to feel immediately at home. The area is buzzing with coffee shops, restaurants and boutiques - I bought two pairs of shoes while waiting for the rain to stop! <br/>Moving around is easy, the metro station is just around the corner. Taxis are cheap enough and come quickly (Uber calls go to the local taxi network). Louis has kindly left an iPhone which makes finding information, or calling a taxi very convenient.<br/>The ground floor flat has two bedrooms and bathrooms (the guests need to share the shower though). The back bedroom faces a courtyard garden and is very calm and quiet.<br/>There is a Nespresso machine in the kitchen, milk in the fridge, and plenty of guide books for inspiration.<br/>Louis is a super-communicator, providing instant information about restaurants, transport, museum - basically everything you want to know about. I'd given him seven stars, only AirBnB ratings stop on five.<br/>A perfect place to experience the Berlin vibe!<br/>",0,0.9656,Positive
120.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,28,100.0,0,6.114712040334074,4.46,4.48,4.39,4.36,52551544,"Die Unterkunft war leicht zu erreichen, die U-Bahn ist ein paar Gehminuten nur entfernt. <br/>Gute essensmöglichkeiten hat man gleich im Umkreis. <br/>Die Wohnung war gut geputzt und hat das wiedergegeben wie es in Beschreibung steht.",1,-0.9485,Negative
231.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,53,100.0,1,4.10145600811456,4.84,4.91,4.79,4.64,39507430,Tolle Unterkunft super zentral gelegen . Traumhafte Aussicht auf die Spree und mit Aufzug,0,0.0,Neutral
51.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,20,100.0,0,7.5671789602466415,4.67,4.54,4.72,4.44,667849,"I can not in good faith recommend Anatol as a host. As a frequent airbnb user, I have stayed in 31 airbnbs, and have never written a bad review for a stay. However, my experience at Anatol’s apartment was not comfortable, and we did not receive the value that we paid for.<br/>To begin, the photos make the apartment look larger than it is. The two beds (one of which is a futon) are very uncomfortable, and the chairs in the apartment are cheap and even broke and collapsed one time when we sat down.<br/>However, the biggest issue was the absence of care or effort - and eventual dishonesty - of our host regarding our stay-long lack of hot water in the shower. <br/>After we notified Anatol that there was no hot water in the shower, it took a month for him to fix it. This was only after we contacted Airbnb, who put pressure on him to fix the issue. Our stay was during the winter, and it was ridiculous to not have this basic utility.<br/>Anatol was dishonest in his communications with Airbnb in order to avoid having to refund us partially for the lack of hot water.",1,-0.9687,Negative
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,1,2.35118223867786,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,1175774383113466279,A wonderful small flat in a wonderful area of Berlin. And Simon is a great host. I would unhesitatingly recommend it - except to those people who find climbing stairs difficult - as it's on the 3rd floor.,1,0.91,Positive
82.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,5.189340223814515,4.79,4.85,4.83,4.69,1033506,"Really nice welcoming. Heidi was really available to answer to my questions before and during my trip. I personnaly recommend this familiar place, which is situated in a very quiet area.",1,0.8304,Positive
