73.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,2.27336048441501,4.89,4.87,4.95,4.82,16155678,"주방 이용이 어려운 것은 아쉬웠지만 이 점을 제외하고는 완벽한 숙소였습니다. 역 근처이 위치해 있어 이동이 편리했고, 도보 거리에 예쁜 카페와 수영장이 있어 좋았습니다. 여행하느라 집에 늦게 도착하는 날이 많았는데 시간 제약 없이 샤워할 수 있다는 점도 매우 만족스러웠습니다:)",1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,56,50.0,0,2.979751325345656,5.0,4.94,5.0,5.0,53853022,"Ce fut une expérience unique de se lever et prendre le petit déjeuner sur les toits de Berlin ainsi que d'admirer le coucher du soleil le soir venu. Le penthouse est situé dans une rue calme et les transports en commun sont à quelques minutes et les commerces à proximité ainsi que les restaurants permettent de profiter pleinement du quartier.<br/>Oliver est un hôte très accueillant, agréable et réactif. Le penthouse est un lieu magnifique, paisible et très reposant que nous aurions plaisir à retrouver lors d'une prochaine visite.<br/>Merci pour tout.",1,0.0516,Positive
66.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,45,100.0,1,8.230717363177027,4.89,4.88,4.84,4.76,34243172,"I really had a lovely peaceful time at Thekla’s studio! Comfy bed and beautiful little courtyard patio, very relaxing! Very friendly host too, thank you very much :)",1,0.9778,Positive
39.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,1,6.582330417299593,4.74,4.62,4.75,4.58,38976821,Tot bé. Bona comunicació.,1,0.0,Neutral
69.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,1,6.04491222918904,4.78,4.91,4.65,4.71,8026172,"My friend and I had a lovely stay at Rainer’s place for 6 nights— it was clean, cute, bright, and fully functional. The stairs are no joke— sometimes I would walk down and lose my train of thought completely and then come back to reality and realize I had done all of that and was still walking down the stairs. But they’re really not that big of a deal, and the flat is so lovely that even if you don’t like stairs it’s worth it. And such a great value. I would love to stay here again if I ever came to Berlin.",1,0.9864,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,0,0.8280629758659687,4.94,4.58,4.97,4.79,23958103,"Best Airbnb experience! Simon was caring about everything we needed with exceptional communications. The apartment is stunning in the best location, well designed and comfortable. Checkin / checkout times we’re flexible and there was even a cleaner during our stay that was about two weeks. I would definitely recommend Simone’s place and would be happy to stay there again!",1,0.9844,Positive
70.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,0,8.122838708117735,4.38,4.61,4.31,4.3,18150458,"Super System mit dem Check-In durch die Schlüsselbox, sehr netter Kontakt und wunderschöne, saubere und große Wohnung. Das einzige Manko war die Lage, woran ich ja aber selbst schuld war. <br/>Top AirBnB :)",1,-0.8658,Negative
67.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,31,100.0,1,0.7518298030804867,4.84,4.68,4.86,4.75,27120381,"War mit meiner Freundin ein verlängertes Wochenende in Berlin. Das kleine Apartment bietet einen Super Ausblick über die Stadt und sonst alles, was man braucht. Unterkunft ist genau wie beschrieben!",1,-0.636,Negative
