146.0,2,1.0,2.0,2.0,24,100.0,1,4.75828634214059,4.77,4.63,4.91,4.58,242794,"We loved our stay at this apartment, it is comfortable, clean, well equipped and in a fantastic location both for transport links and for all sorts of cool shops and eateries a short stroll walking. Communication with Mario was great considering we needed to inform him about a small issue he was very quick to kindly reply and address.",1,0.9763,Positive
176.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,2.6109738907158704,4.83,4.91,4.9,4.75,28510664,"Hey guys, I had a fabulous room (102) and the virtual keys to the room, night entrance, and stair well were super!!! I come to Berlin four times a year and will definitely try to always be at the CALMA Berlin Mitte! Thanks for a wonderful stay!!!",1,0.9631,Positive
48.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,16,87.0,0,7.889169508668093,4.68,4.76,4.58,4.7,3988568,"Das Zimmer ist praktisch und schön eingerichtet, alles neu renoviert. Es gibt auch einen Wasserkocher und Tee. Check-in lief unkompliziert und wie abgesprochen. Das Haus und der Innenhof sind etwas hellhörig. Und die knappen Vorhänge machen das Zimmer etwas einsichtig vom Innenhof aus (Erdgeschoss). Insgesamt eine gute Adresse in der Gegend. Danke Barbara und Alessandro!",1,-0.636,Negative
69.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,48,100.0,0,5.941138709516052,4.92,4.47,4.86,4.64,742632854284231427,Unser Aufenthalt bei Thomas war wirklich klasse. Die Wohnung und das Zimmer sind ruhig gelegen und hatten eine entspannte Atmosphäre! Würde ich definitiv weiterempfehlen.,1,-0.8439,Negative
199.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,1,3.7401902545858734,4.81,4.86,4.85,4.67,22354567,"We found this place to be exactly what is described - close to public transport, local cafes and restaurants and some of the key attractions in Berlin, Naomi was easily contactable and the apartment is really well set up. This was a great place to stay and we really enjoyed our time there!",1,0.939,Positive
