45.0,3,1.0,1.5,2.0,44,100.0,1,13.335712033183713,4.95,4.95,4.77,4.9,19619437,"Mona is an amazing host! She was very welcoming, kind and helpful. She made us home made cookies and gave us some good tips for restaurants in the city. The room is big and the bed was really good. The bathroom and kitchen are shared but we had a lot of privacy, so it wasn't a problem for us. Although the room is not in the city centre, it was easy to reach by U-bahn and the neighbourhood was really nice, quiet and green. We had a really pleasant stay and we would definitely recommend Mona as a host in Berlin.",1,0.988,Positive
