68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,0,2.144674544120887,4.63,4.6,4.89,4.64,1575295,"Me and my boyfriend stayed in Berlin for five days to visit the city, and we absolutely loved the fact that the house is located in a very walkable and central area. Places like supermarkets, street food shops and even places to visit like Alexanderplatz and Museuminsel are all around 20 minutes of walk from there, which was very convenient. Franziska and her partner were very friendly to us, also very flexible with times and clear with instructions, and their dog is quiet and super cute! Would 100% come back there!",1,0.9749,Positive
