59.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,1,5.221624642781363,4.95,4.92,4.92,4.9,13256017,"Matthias & Michele were wonderful hosts. They provided me and my friend with great recommendations around their lovely neighborhood, and made sure we felt comfortable and at home when we weren't out exploring. Their home is clean, bright, and open. We were even greeted with a special chocolate treat upon our arrival. All-around a great combination of location, hospitality, and value.",1,0.9899,Positive
54.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,17,100.0,1,6.9953085951227845,4.74,4.84,4.46,4.71,22483099,"The appartment is very light, clean and nicely decorated. The communication with Mina is friendly and accurate. Even though the apartment is far from the center, with the U Bahn it's easy to get there.  It's certainly a good place to stay for some days!",1,0.9483,Positive
