105.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,1,5.675658523373673,4.75,5.0,4.75,5.0,1483190596984600001,"Great place for a fair price. Two bedrooms, living room and separate kitchen. The bathroom/toilet are not very big but it's ok for a not very long stay.<br/>The neighborhood is very quite and beautiful. There are nice old houses, many parks and playgrounds. You can find a couple of mini zoo in the parks. Our kids were happy.",1,0.9716,Positive
35.0,1,1.0,1.0,2.0,18,100.0,1,10.554254157229684,4.76,4.92,4.8,4.74,18848814,Ayako ist sehr freundlich und geht auf Wünsche von einem ein. Die Unterkunft ist zu empfehlen. :),1,-0.2263,Negative
103.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,51,100.0,1,1.8422422243016237,4.91,4.86,4.81,4.83,3974716,"Hans and his partner were exceptional hosts, offering a serene and beautifully maintained space that provided the perfect backdrop for relaxation and creativity. Their patience with my late check-in was greatly appreciated, making my arrival seamless. The peaceful surroundings and thoughtful touches throughout the home created an environment that was both welcoming and inspiring. <br/>I was able to write quite a lot. Thanks to the calm and comfort of their lovely spot. I highly recommend their place to anyone seeking a restorative and productive getaway.",1,0.9928,Positive
149.0,4,3.0,1.0,5.0,31,0.0,0,8.155448061817273,4.6,4.73,4.71,4.59,14618013,"Leuk appartement met metro voor de deur in buurt met een gave mix van mensen, de Turkse kapper, de vega lunch zaak, het Duitse restaurant. De buurt is nog echt, 3 haltes van de Kudamn en de rest van Berlijn ook makkelijk te bereiken per u bahn en s bahn. Wij waren hier met onze zoons 13 en 16. Ook zij hadden heerlijk een eigen kamer en vonden deze stadswoning te gek. Ook een supermarkt op 5 minuten. <br/>Ik kan iedereen deze woning aanraden. We love Berlin. George <br/>Ps je moet wel goed ter been zijn. Het is drie hoog met de trap en we hadden geen sleutel voor de lift",0,0.4404,Positive
47.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,0,5.45266710386518,4.74,4.86,4.47,4.67,30052147,It was amazing and comfortable👍,1,0.5859,Positive
119.0,6,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,80.0,1,5.419875510101854,4.86,4.9,4.92,4.7,21689254,"A beautiful apartment in what is possibly one of the best locations in Berlin. The neighborhood surrounding the apartment is extremely lively and filled with parks, bars, and great little shops. Extremely close to the city center as well, so with only a short tram or bus ride, you can be almost anywhere you want to be in the entire city. Overall couldn't recommend more!",1,0.9494,Positive
151.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,41,100.0,0,4.672255527869983,4.75,4.54,4.29,4.71,1217945610089051815,"We had a great stay at Yogesh’s place. The space is clean and modern, and for the price, an incredible deal! The location is on the last stop of the M2 line, which can be taken to Alexanderplatz. It takes about 30 minutes to get to the various sights of Mitte—something to take into consideration!",1,0.7339,Positive
115.0,8,1.0,1.0,3.0,32,100.0,0,2.978770363505488,4.85,4.82,4.81,4.69,44438078,"Wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt. Das Appartement war sehr sauber und sehr modern eingerichtet. Es hat alles was man brauch. Dem Bad täte ein halber Quadratmeter mehr gut, aber das kann Dusan ja nicht beeinflussen. Vielen Dank für die gute Zeit in der Haupstadt sagt eine 5-köpfige Familie!",1,-0.9117,Negative
100.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,40,100.0,1,30.4555070060131,4.95,4.95,4.9,4.82,44679779,"This is a super comfortable place nestled in the gorgeous woods, and very close to the Müggelsee lakes. It is a perfect get away from the city center of Berlin, very much recommended! Maria is a kind and attentive host, who gave us many great recommendations and even a birthday present when we told her it was a birthday trip. Wonderful place and generous host!",1,0.9862,Positive
191.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,62,100.0,1,12.179172834399235,4.97,4.99,4.61,4.81,1040321621709668304,"Wir waren mit Kindern und Katze in Berlin und haben uns alle sofort in der Wohnung wohlgefühlt. Die Wohnung sah wirklich genau aus wie auf den Bildern. Und der Fernseher war noch größer als gedacht. Hatte was von Heimkino. <br/>Die Betten sind alle super bequem - selbst die Schlafcouch. <br/>Die Küche ist toll ausgestattet und die Küchengeräte sind top. <br/>Nur anders als gedacht ist die Tiefgarage nicht direkt vom Haus aus zu erreichen. Doch man kann das Auto auch oberirdisch gut be-/entladen. Muss nur ein paar Meter mehr gehen. Zum Glück gibts einen Aufzug im Haus. Das macht’s leichter. <br/>Für Menschen mit Rollstuhl ist die Wohnung eher ungeeignet, da der Aufzug in der Zwischenetage hält und man noch ca. 5 Stufen nach oben gehen muss.  <br/>Wenn wir mal wieder mit der Familie in Berlin sind, kommen wir gern wieder.",0,-0.9623,Negative
164.0,6,2.0,1.5,3.0,42,100.0,1,2.561101005915228,4.82,4.76,4.66,4.69,31014654,"Ruime, gezellige accommodatie voor een gezin in een leuke buurt en op loopafstand van de metro. Communicatie met Julian was prima en hij gaf ons leuke tips voor de buurt en voor activiteiten met de kinderen. Dus zeker een aanrader!",0,0.0,Neutral
152.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,1,5.636927834727325,4.8,4.66,4.86,4.66,1010095666544602511,"Great place if you can climb six floors a few times a day. There was deck paint odor on arrival making it hard to get fresh air on a hot and humid day, likely not typical. The owners are next door if there is an issue. Not their issue, had to figure how to use european showers knob :) - place is large and sort of psychedelic built decorated.",1,0.8402,Positive
260.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,91.0,0,4.81020597174384,4.59,4.7,4.4,4.44,28299765,Had a great stay. All easy and uncomplicated. :),1,0.875,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,1,3.325790068810844,4.97,5.0,4.89,4.86,19355649,"Wir waren mehr als Zufrieden mit der Unterkunft. Viktoria hat uns super freundlich empfangen und wir haben uns direkt wohl gefühlt. Die Wohnung ist sehr sauber und stilvoll eingerichtet, was uns sehr gefallen hat. Die Kommunikation lief reibungslos und da wir ohne Plan nach Berlin kamen, haben die Tipps der beiden uns sehr geholfen und wir hatten 2 tolle Tage und vor allem ein tolles Silvester.<br/>Auch die Hilfsbereitschaft und die offene Art der beiden hat uns geholfen, uns wirklich wie zu Hause zu fühlen. <br/>Absolute Empfehlung, immer wieder gern! :)",1,-0.9312,Negative
68.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,20,100.0,1,6.801132231621815,4.75,4.79,4.43,4.64,15985692,"Easy location, comfortable. Thanks for the welcoming drinks and snacks!",1,0.906,Positive
77.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,0,11.814165523307237,4.21,4.14,4.58,4.32,49933100,근처에 지하철 역과 REWE CITY가 있어 편리합니다. 알트바우라 방음이 안 되고 엘리베이터 타기가 조금 무서운 것만 빼면 완벽합니다. 방 인테리어는 솔직히 기대 안 했는데 깔끔하니 좋았고 화장실도 작지만 있을 것 다 있고 냄새 같은 것도 전혀 나지 않았습니다. 강추!,1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,1,5.768494430655579,4.96,4.96,4.79,4.74,31142160,"Het huis van Dine is echt geweldig. Mooi licht, fijne kamers. De buurt ook prettig. Rustige straat, overal fijne restaurants en cafés. De communicatie met Dine was ook perfect. Deze plek is echt een aanrader.",1,0.5719,Positive
33.0,6,1.0,2.0,6.0,36,94.0,1,3.3601837928593032,4.87,4.93,4.87,4.88,677433898395003666,위치가 좋고 숙소도 깔끔하고 좋아요. 호스트 분도 친절하셔서 잘 지내다 갑니다.,0,0.0,Neutral
163.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,91.0,0,4.871252294318258,4.67,4.78,4.87,4.53,46864858,Prima locatie. Duchy bij metro en tram en rustig gelegen. Goed bed en schone kamer / douche. Handig keukentje. Wel klein en soms gehorig   . Prima service bij vragen.  Dus zeker waar voor je geld.,1,-0.3612,Negative
39.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,1,6.582330417299593,4.74,4.62,4.75,4.58,38976821,"Sohail is an amazing host - the communication was really good, he was very helpful and accommodating. <br/>The neighbourhood is really nice and the U-Bahn to the center is right around the corner.<br/>We overall really enjoyed the stay there!",1,0.9521,Positive
112.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,42,100.0,1,2.97782445506794,4.86,4.91,4.87,4.74,22275529,Sehr ruhig und gut gelegen,1,0.0,Neutral
107.0,3,0.0,1.0,3.0,18,93.0,0,2.373482401219675,4.74,4.7,4.77,4.67,17399068,"Ruim voldoende ruimte voor 3 personen, makkelijk binnen te komen en een metrostation op loopafstand. Dit metrostation voelt savonds wel een klein beetje onveilig, dus ik zou daar niet alleen gaan lopen maar overall een hele goede ervaring!",1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,12,100.0,0,8.806995041681681,4.5,4.17,4.5,4.83,40779659,"Бронировали эту квартиру на неделю (двое взрослых и ребенок). Из плюсов Мирза очень вежливый и помогал нам в некоторых наших делах. Квартира большая, светлая, теплая. Рядом большая детская площадка, метро (но сам район просто ужас).Теперь к минусам: очень-очень грязная сантехника и кухня, было не приятно принимать душ. Кран в ванной сломан (льется только горячая вода). Душевая лейка брызгала водой в разные стороны. На кухне не работала посудомоечная машина (хотя была заявлена она) Из посуды не хватало половника. В гостиной большой диван, но спать на нем просто НЕВОЗМОЖНО, он кожаный, а следовательно все постельное белье сползало.",1,0.0,Neutral
