64.0,2,2.0,1.0,1.0,15,100.0,0,6.242464734381888,4.94,5.0,4.59,5.0,12640741,"This AirBnb was great value for money. The apartment is on a third floor (no elevator), and not very centric, but here are many bus lines close by to go downtown. Berlin is very big anyways, so public transport is necessary. Everything was clean, and Barbel was very nice. The bed is confotable, and the kitchen well equipped. We would reccomend it to couples.",1,0.9272,Positive
