172.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,99.0,0,1.542372060755756,4.59,4.74,4.53,4.54,6697033,"We had an amazing time in Berlin, and Singer109 was a great place to stay! The hostel is simple but comfortable, and it had everything we needed for our trip. The happy hour in the bar from 6-8 pm was such a fun bonus—we loved winding down there after exploring the city. The location is fantastic, close to the metro and lots of great activities, making it super easy to get around. If you’re looking for a welcoming and convenient spot to stay in Berlin, we definitely recommend Singer109!",1,0.9958,Positive
