85.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,53,100.0,0,4.661205738982606,4.86,4.93,4.62,4.69,1169215850289461732,"a magic place😍 in a bucolic quiet garden, not even 10 min by foot  from a public transportation hub that gets you anywhere in the city. but you‘ll be very tempted to stay there and just relax, watch the tomatoes, pumpkins and quinces grow. <br/>super friendly, helpful, reactive and flexible host.",1,0.9349,Positive
148.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,25.0,0,4.558926213539716,4.57,4.72,4.74,4.49,8161618,"We had a great time in Archibald's flat; a late November weekend and we found the flat warm, stylish and very welcoming. Communication and key handover was great and easy. The flat is on the ground floor across the yard in a hinter house bang on Warschauer Strasse in Friedrichshain. The flat is a cosy and comfortable place to stay with plenty of room, for a couple, small family or two-three friends. It is completely furnished and large and a clean style as can be seen in the photos. We slept very comfortably three adults. The yard is quiet, the street busy with life and excitement; just like you like Berlin to be. We can recommend Archibald's flat and would like to come back on our next visit to Berlin.",1,0.9903,Positive
245.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,39,100.0,1,2.232912741025181,4.78,4.78,4.83,4.48,34517444,"We had a great time staying at brilliant apartments! The apartment was spacious, beautiful and in a great location, albeit located in more of a family, oriented part of Berlin, there was still a bunch to do in terms of boutique shops, great restaurants, and bars. It was about a 15 minute walk from the Berlin Wall. The brunch spot underneath the apartment building is delicious and very convenient. I don’t have any complaints about my stay, except that some of the photos showing we’re not for the exact unit that we stayed in. Would definitely come back here for my next trip to Berlin.",1,0.9776,Positive
