82.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,6.919397234051426,4.85,4.87,4.48,4.72,20881101,"Nous avons passé un très bon séjour chez Babett. L’appartement est très bien situé, très propre et parfaitement conforme à nos attentes et à la description. Il est à 10 Minutes à pieds de la station de métro la plus proche. Petit point à prendre en compte, il n’y a pas de volets et les rideaux sont peu occultants, si vous avez le sommeil léger pensez à prendre un masque. Mais on est ici très tatillon car sinon tout était très bien. Gros point positif, l’appartement est très très bien équipé : une cafetière à filtre et une autre à capsule, une bouilloire, une théière, un grille pain… il y a même un attendrisseur à viande ! Parfait pour les amateurs de cuisine, surtout que tout est parfaitement fonctionnel. La literie est très bonne. Merci beaucoup à nos hôtes chez qui nous retournerons sans hésiter !",1,-0.3786,Negative
94.0,5,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,97.0,0,8.514810072350441,4.5,4.51,4.61,4.45,984944922120776917,Très bon séjour,1,0.0,Neutral
72.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,53,100.0,1,4.173322316586879,4.95,4.91,4.9,4.81,594731577761973352,"In case you're scrolling through these reviews, looking for enough reason to book your stay here: let this be your sign! 😁✨ My brother and I spent four nights at the apartment and ooh, how I wish there were more! :) I initially booked the room for just myself, but when I reached out to Paolo, asking if my brother could join in as well, that was totally fine. At arrival, even an extra bed was made and the overall communication was great - very clear information and it was also not an issue to adjust our ETA shortly in advance. (..And neither was our time of departure, by the way!) Manuel welcomed us super friendly and we felt free moving around however we wanted. It was fun crossing past each other in the hallway and it felt very homey. Both the beds were nice as well and the room seemed to be more spacious than in the pictures. Although Berlin its streets are so amazing and wonderful, we looked forward returning to our temporary home :) It was a chill experience with great hosts.",1,0.9976,Positive
125.0,5,3.0,1.0,2.0,22,100.0,0,3.593569242424957,5.0,4.92,4.82,4.91,207740,"We (family of 4) had a perfect stay at Vanessas place. Communication was fast and easy and instructions at site were helpful. We had the key handed over by a friend, Christoph, and that also worked out perfectly. Lübbener Strasse is quiet although the neighborhood itself can be a bit noisy and colorful(nothing to worry about - very big city charming!).<br/> The pictures do seem a bit outdated but still the place looks exactly the same. We found it very charming, spacious, quiet, clean and you'll find everything you need in the kitchen. The bathroom upstairs is really great as well as the small garden. We had breakfast in the garden and also a glass of wine in the evenings. <br/>Close by we found a grocery store, LIDL, and also on Skalitzer Strasse 66 we found a small, charming Italian place, Cachondeo. Just opposite also om Skalitzer Strasse we found a great place with Sicilian icecream. We also had a great time at the Badeschiff; a public pool by the river Spree.<br/>We will certainly recommend Vanessas place and we would love to come back.",1,0.996,Positive
211.0,8,2.0,1.0,5.0,43,100.0,0,2.0540222335943423,4.63,4.47,4.84,4.55,33668396,"Appartement très bien situé et convient aux photos, je recommande",0,0.0,Neutral
