145.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,39,100.0,1,7.283454106561697,4.77,4.8,4.77,4.57,923013237667372980,"Das Zimmer im 6. Stock hatte eine nette Aussicht, war ruhig und sauber.  Das Personal war sehr freundlich. Lediglich die Küchenzeile im Zimmer sah etwas abgenutzt aus. Würde es bei Bedarf wieder buchen.",1,-0.9136,Negative
142.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,0,6.416852493255721,4.86,4.86,4.43,4.29,939041712524407309,Great place. I enjoyed riding my bike around all the parks and the harbor. The place was an easy bike commute to Kreuzberg. It is a little walk to the trains but I used an Uber to the airport for $30 to be safe. I enjoyed Berlin very much. Roy’s place had a nice long bathtub which warmed me up nicely after my chilly evening rides home. Roy suggested many nice spots to eat and shop. I would most definitely stay again. Thanks you.,1,0.9888,Positive
81.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,54,100.0,1,11.098231074049592,4.93,4.9,4.71,4.83,6253378,Alles super.,0,0.5994,Positive
328.0,8,4.0,2.0,6.0,31,100.0,1,6.97282351203588,4.89,4.92,4.52,4.71,14333714,"This space is clean and beautiful! Super easy walking to public transit, restaurants, bars, and a grocery or two. It was exactly what we needed for our stay in Berlin with 6 people! Thank you!",0,0.9499,Positive
84.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,5.06163943405691,4.92,4.94,4.96,4.82,344856,Apostolos’s place is very clean and comfortable. It’s in a great location with popular sites to visit very close nearby. Apostolos was so friendly and made sure we had all the information we needed to enjoy our stay. If you are visiting Berlin I would recommend this place very much!,1,0.9773,Positive
100.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,41,100.0,1,1.9469096234802603,4.85,4.92,4.91,4.75,408756,"The apartment is in a lovely area with lots of great bars, restaurants and shops nearby plus very easy transport links to the centre. We picked up the key from the bar with no problem at all and were made to feel at home. The apartment is situated in a quiet building back from the main road, and, as many other reviewers have said, although the outsides of the buildings are run down, the apartment itself is new, spacious and spotless with everything you need. There were three of us and we used the sofa-bed which was large and comfortable. We easily found our way round the city, with trams and U-bahn nearby, it's also lovely to walk around the immediate area and it's walking distance to the Berlin Wall Memorial.",1,0.9493,Positive
135.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,2.4550497449053417,4.96,5.0,4.88,4.8,891082825526865559,"Everything was perfect, thank you !",1,0.7574,Positive
386.0,6,3.0,3.0,3.0,53,100.0,1,5.61647989496104,4.75,4.54,4.91,4.53,558489051475905817,"There were six of us there for the week and we had a great time.  Perfect location to get around, too many restaurants nearby to list, and all were real good.  We went to the Golden Fleece a block away and had some great Georgian food, theres a coffee shop literally outside the front gate, bus stop is less than a block away, and the U train station is two and a half blocks.  Will definitely be back, and will stay with Tilmann's again.",0,0.8625,Positive
155.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,57,90.0,1,2.3704488038701537,4.93,4.91,4.98,4.75,1092702878909992868,"All recommendation from ourside. Location is perfect and metro is literally in front of the door. Place is cozy and super clean. Host, thanks for wine bottle and Haribos. 10/10",0,0.9217,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,100.0,0,12.901074216761966,4.92,4.7,4.89,4.92,24227976,Entspannte Gastfreundschaft. Tom hat Lust auf liebevolle Zusatzleistungen auf Hotelniveau. Hammer Frühstück!,1,0.0,Neutral
30.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,80.0,0,19.45903731603653,4.71,4.56,4.72,4.79,2682379,"Мы были здесь в течении 5 дней. Нам все понравилось, особенно гостеприимная и радушная хозяйка. До s-bahn примерно минут 10 пешком, а оттуда пол часа до центра. Рядом с остановкой крупный продуктовый магазин, удобно. В целом все тихо и комфортно. Если выбираете место в этом районе то рекомендую!",1,0.0,Neutral
