137.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,1.6809549157543209,4.96,4.95,4.95,4.83,2061212,"What a lovely space! We absolutely loved Berlin and Kitty’s studio was a large part of that. It’s in a great neighborhood with an amazing wine bar just downstairs. Kitty checked in frequently and was available if we had any issues, which we didn’t. Highly recommend.",1,0.9637,Positive
160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,98.0,0,1.0407544919436775,4.54,4.66,4.77,4.45,34294913,"Die Wohnung war sehr schön, genauso wie auf den Bildern und auch sehr sauber. Check-in lief problemlos und alle waren auch sehr freundlich. Die Lage ist auf jeden fall super, man ist paar Minuten vom Fernsehturm entfernt. Ist auf jeden fall weiter zu empfehlen!",1,-0.8439,Negative
137.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,48,100.0,0,1.5385647353461869,4.67,4.87,5.0,4.47,1381613448115565931,"Super netter Host, super nette Wohnung hier komme ich gerne wieder her",0,0.8316,Positive
70.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,100.0,1,3.0533340006135603,4.92,4.98,4.93,4.84,7925838,"This place was perfect for my short stay in Berlin, fantastic location right on the canal, quiet & close to transport. The area has all amenities close by. Very big & spacious room which I thought was better than the photos. Building has a lift which is great. The host was really friendly, helpful and responsive. Check-in was not a problem even though I arrived late evening. I was eating out so not having a kitchen was no problem for me. Perfect place for busy days & relaxing in the evening. Would be very happy to stay here again.",1,0.9887,Positive
231.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,66,93.0,1,0.5825226699456977,4.95,4.98,4.94,4.82,7831357,"Beautiful place, great location to explore the city from, great hosts",1,0.9201,Positive
54.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,1,8.127615937955055,4.91,4.95,4.86,4.9,22779598,"It is a nice room, the area has a good offer of restaurants, I also loved the Tiergarten is quite close.",1,0.8625,Positive
75.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,28,100.0,0,7.600554526565933,4.89,4.76,4.94,4.76,13554198,"Die Unterkunft war exakt wie auf den Bildern. Es war sauber und geruchlos. <br/>Die Kommunikation lief super und die Antworten kamen unverzüglich. <br/>Die Unterkunft liegt im Nollendorfkiez, einer sehr belebten Gegend aus Restaurants und Bars. Das Haus war im Hinterhof und somit extrem ruhig. <br/>Michael war während meines Aufenthaltes anwesend. Ich habe ihn kaum gehört und er war sehr rücksichtsvoll. <br/>Die Absprache zur gemeinsamen Badnutzung lief wunderbar und reibungslos. <br/>Ich komme sicherlich mal wieder für einen Aufenthalt in Berlin!",1,-0.9769,Negative
171.0,9,4.0,1.5,5.0,41,100.0,1,4.936124446607811,4.63,4.5,4.43,4.63,4106583,"Great location,good communication. Flat is very big an cosy with well-equiped kitchen. Very convenient for a big group of people.<br/>",0,0.6249,Positive
