151.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,28,97.0,0,3.918641789625612,4.72,4.74,4.79,4.58,11450419,"This was one of the best places I have stayed in Europe for this year. We have been to Italy, Barcelona and Paris and this was by far the best Airbnb. I don't know if is a German thing but this place was huge compared to the other places we stayed. It was a pleasant surprise. We were greeted by the friendly Jennifer. The apartment was clean and well laid out and spacious. It is about 5 minutes walk from the nearest grocery and U station. It was perfect. I would definitely recommend anyone going to Berlin to stay at this location.",1,0.9907,Positive
