103.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,13,100.0,0,8.024755728431899,4.33,4.49,4.43,4.36,45681016,"This is the place if you only need a bed to sleep and a shower with hot water. It’s close to a metro station, but the area is uninteresting. <br/>The room was cleaned every day, but I was missing a desk, a chair and a lamp - and perhaps some non-German TV channels. <br/>There was some noise from neighbors during the evening, but fairly quiet from about 11pm.",1,-0.4215,Negative
125.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,45,100.0,0,0.1662482096145819,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,53085396,"Lukas was a great host! Responded very quickly, and was very accommodating to our needs. Someone was at the Check-in to show us around the flat and answers any questions we had. The flat is super stylish, well equipped and comfortable, spotlessly clean. Short walk to train station, supermarket and bus stop. Added bonus with the coffee machine, all in all the flat was a great stay and would recommend it to anyone.",1,0.9758,Positive
91.0,6,3.0,1.0,3.0,31,100.0,0,22.783250778905757,4.88,4.69,4.76,4.71,28333870,"Mooi ruim verblijf, van alle gemakken voorzien. Heerlijk zwembad, fijne tuin. Goede ligging vlakbij <br/>S-Bahn naar Berlijn, en ook vlakbij mooie natuur.",1,0.0,Neutral
