49.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,1,11.676754989143994,4.78,4.92,4.82,4.7,551848896911307140,"Handy place to stay in Charlottenburg, close to public transport, shops, supermarkets and restaurants. Very gentle host. The trains are in audible distance in case you're sensitive to noise and make sure you're not bothered by two flights of stairs.",1,0.7547,Positive
276.0,3,2.0,2.0,3.0,61,100.0,1,9.076307917104932,4.82,4.77,4.76,4.71,44223601,"Schöne Unterkunft mit guter Hotel-Infrastruktur. Das Apartment liegt in einem schönen Viertel mit vielen Cafés, Restaurants und Shopping-Möglichkeiten in der Nähe. Das einzige Manko: das Apartment war hellhörig und wir sind jeden Morgen durch Poltergeräusche geweckt worden.",0,-0.5994,Negative
68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,0,2.144674544120887,4.63,4.6,4.89,4.64,1575295,"Tolle zentrale und doch ruhige Lage, gemütliches Zimmer. Franziska ist sehr freundlich und hilfsbereit. Unbedingt empfehlenswert!",1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,1,11.520555572456846,4.68,4.67,4.91,4.58,675361851173038813,Die Kommunikation war schnell und freundlich. Die Wohnung ist ein schöner Berliner Altbau und stilvoll eingerichtet.<br/>Kurzer Fußweg zu den Öffis und zu Galerien und Bars. Super für eine Nacht.,1,-0.8316,Negative
145.0,9,4.0,2.0,8.0,33,100.0,1,7.6866045365292734,4.87,4.78,4.57,4.75,32394837,We had a great time at Jörn’s place. The house was perfect for us(3 families including a kid). In fact the place was spacious enough to accommodate one more family. Jörn is extremely friendly and cordial and provided us with whatever we required. He also allowed us to checkin early based on our arrival times in Berlin. His house has a lawn and barbecue as well and pretty well connected (bus stop is a 5 minute walk). There are grocery stores within 10-15 minutes walking range. <br/>Overall we had an amazing time and I would definitely recommend Börn’s place to anyone looking to visit Berlin for personal or official visits.,0,0.9764,Positive
59.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,0,2.3819185302817485,4.79,4.34,4.9,4.77,15850068,"I loved the location, hidden away off a courtyard behind a nineteenth century apartment block - very quiet, but for the birdsong! - and an easy walk from public transport connections. I found Alexander easygoing, and his home comfortable.",1,0.9192,Positive
137.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,100.0,1,2.4782535935866847,4.98,5.0,5.0,4.84,958002227244690598,"super lokalita, skvelé reštaurácie a pokojné, byt je slnečný a plný rastlín 🌱",1,0.5994,Positive
125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,0,6.897288485919568,4.41,4.21,4.69,4.52,39381415,"The property had cockroaches, dirty underwear on the floor and was unclean. The landlords name is not the same as the one on the doors and his ""brother"" gave us the key. Although his ""brother"" referred to him as the ""guy who owned the property"" so i assume it was not his brother.",1,-0.4404,Negative
102.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,39,100.0,1,8.094404344978152,4.79,4.8,4.73,4.75,35116312,Fijne rustige en groene plek in Berlijn. Stijlvol ingericht en alles is aanwezig. Op het gigantische bed is het erg fijn slapen. Het was opvallend stil in de buurt tijdens ons verblijf. En dat tijdens de hete augustus dagen van 2020. Op één avond konden we de televisie van de eigenaars (zij wonen naast het tuinhuis) horen omdat we allemaal de ramen open hadden staan maar ik weet zeker dat als we het gevraagd hadden ze die meteen zachter hadden gezet. Het zijn aardige mensen die open staan voor een praatje maar je ook met rust laten als je dat wilt. Het was makkelijk dat we bij vragen bij hen terecht konden. Kortom een aanrader,1,-0.8316,Negative
124.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,38,100.0,0,2.0913357382540902,4.59,4.59,4.85,4.52,36839962,"great location, looks better in person. good spacious apartment",1,0.872,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,100.0,0,12.628755326388792,4.8,4.87,4.64,4.73,24755176,"Wir sind sehr spät in Tegel gelandet und konnten aber trotzdem noch problemlos einchecken. Wir waren nur zum schlafen dort, aber das Zimmer ist groß und sauber und gut an die öffentlichen Verkehrsmittel angebunden.",1,-0.5994,Negative
193.0,5,1.0,1.0,5.0,26,99.0,0,9.070811946860156,4.28,4.35,4.74,4.28,34893511,👍🏽,1,0.0,Neutral
