141.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,0,4.573982414812573,4.67,4.57,4.63,4.55,926550612095718076,"This apartment was well-located in the middle of Berlin Mitte, very close to public transit and also in a relatively walkable area. The space matched the description and had everything we needed. It was also right up the street from a grocery store where we were easily able to get groceries for our stay. Dominik reached out often to check in and make sure we had everything we needed; he was also proactive in getting us information for check-out the day before we were to leave, which was helpful as our flight was very early in the morning. We would certainly stay here again.",1,0.8979,Positive
68.0,3,0.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,6.494077174348875,4.77,4.93,4.74,4.59,38562451,Terrific studio and very kind host. Thank you Ulli.,1,0.861,Positive
106.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,26,100.0,1,3.715196365308197,4.63,4.7,4.8,4.49,36401268,"La ubicación es muy buena, muy cerca de supermercado, farmacia, cafeterias, lugar donde comer y medio de transporte.<br/>Mía siempre estuvo dispuesta a brindar ayuda y de respuesta instantánea ante cualquier requerimiento, lo que hizo más fácil nuestra estadía.<br/>Muchas gracias!!",1,0.0,Neutral
94.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,1,2.8921931319330847,4.83,4.85,4.85,4.62,37081059,"Ulf's place is a nice and professionally run abode in central Kreuzberg. The apartment is nicely furnished and has everything you need for a comfortable stay. Communication with Caroline was good and easy and the self check-in/check-out worked seamlessly. I can highly recommend Ulf's apartment. My only recommendation would be to maybe leave a few tea bags and a coffee pod or two to put the second ""b"" (for ""breakfast"") into Airbnb. :-)",1,0.9565,Positive
52.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,26,100.0,0,13.747094209166455,4.52,4.43,4.69,4.37,20166135,"Die Kommunikation mit Parwana war super nett und unkompliziert. Die Unterkunft war wie beschrieben, und es war alles da, was man braucht. Leider wurde das Erlebnis etwas durch andere Gäste getrübt, aber dafür kann Parwana nichts. Insgesamt war es aber ein angenehmer Aufenthalt in einem süßen Airbnb – danke!",1,-0.9674,Negative
211.0,8,2.0,1.0,5.0,43,100.0,0,2.0540222335943423,4.63,4.47,4.84,4.55,33668396,"On a passé un bon séjour dans l’appartement d’Eugen. Accès facile, proximité des transports et commerce.",0,0.0,Neutral
223.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,47,100.0,1,4.116733808652775,4.98,4.99,4.81,4.83,668157595596321506,"Warme (es war draussen sehr ungemütliches Wetter…) , moderne, sehr schöne und saubere, helle Wohnung mit viel Platz und allem was es so braucht. Sehr gute Verkehrsanbindung, Supermarkt direkt gegenüber, und natürlich bezüglich Cafés etc. alles was das Herz begehrt.<br/>Katarína (Tomasz haben wir nicht kennengelernt) war eine wunderbare Gastgeberin: immer erreichbar, hilfsbereit, sehr grosszügig insbesondere was Check-in und Check-out betrifft.<br/>Ich denke all dies rechtfertigt den eher hohen Preis allemal.<br/>Vielen Dank!",0,-0.8439,Negative
134.0,7,2.0,1.5,5.0,53,100.0,1,14.471758401590211,4.92,4.85,4.71,4.8,50228043,我们在这里度过了幸福美好的一个月。如果您来柏林、这一定是绝佳的选择。<br/>房屋的位置很好，离lichterfelde火车站很近、可以方便地换乘RE，Sbann和公交车前往市中心、机场和各大型车站；不远处即有便宜的超市和快递点，生活便捷。<br/>房屋周边据说是柏林的富人区，治安良好。独享一层（基本上就是一栋）、隐私有保障。周围风景也很优美，我们很庆幸十月来到了柏林看到树叶像打翻了调色盘一样的美丽，在精致阳台上欣赏日出或者度过悠闲惬意的午后。<br/>房间打扫地非常干净，设施齐全（包括多功能的洗衣机、吹风机、暖气、咖啡机、冰箱和其它各种厨房设备等），房屋里的布置很温馨美好、让人感觉像是回到了自己的家，像是和房东一家人分享他们生活中的幸福。<br/>房东非常关心我们的请求，她回复我们非常及时，协助我们安排床铺、为我们添置桌子、更新卫生用品、很及时地维修了暖气，还为我们在柏林和欧洲的旅行提供了很多建议。一家人都很友好，Anja悉心关怀我们的生活、Laura迎接我们并耐心解释了各种家具、奶奶非常开心我们的到来、细心地为我们推荐柏林灯光节还和我们分享了很多年前她父亲来中国的往事，让我们倍感亲切。<br/>（小屋实际比照片中的更美，希望你也能喜欢）<br/>值得怀念的旅程、衷心推荐！祝福Anja一家人生活幸福！,0,0.0,Neutral
84.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,7.790190356236613,4.69,4.83,4.72,4.7,512476,Birgits Apartment bietet alles was man bei einem Städte-Trip benötigt. Die Wohnung ist sehr geräumig und war sehr sauber! Liegt in einer ruhigen Lage und die nächste U-Bahnstation ist zu fuß schnell erreichbar.<br/>Ich würde auf jeden Fall wiederkommen!,1,-0.9229,Negative
133.0,5,2.0,2.0,3.0,52,100.0,1,7.003882658275729,4.99,4.86,4.84,4.86,35566480,We really enjoyed our visit in Berlin. Beautiful apartment. Only wish we would have planned for a few more days,0,0.8805,Positive
80.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,56,100.0,1,2.2102820475445166,4.85,4.82,4.88,4.76,3904895,"We had a really pleasant stay at Carolinas lovely apartment. The apartment is nice, clean and provides everything you need for a city vacation. There are 5 min. walk to the tram (witch takes you to both Alexanderplatz and Eberswalder Straße Station, form where you can reach U-bahn, Tram, busses and Train) -and it is a lovely neighborhood for a walk. Carolina is very nice and very easy to communicate with. We will visit Carolinas apartment again, if it is possible.",1,0.9712,Positive
70.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,11,100.0,0,8.741815694076292,4.62,4.69,4.66,4.67,24505475,"Julius's apartment is very nice. Although it looks old, it is very well maintained and with many services that help the guests. Very good. conection to wi-fi. Highly recommended. The neighborhood is quiet and safe, with many supermarkets and bars open until very late (especially Arabic and Turkish food), very well connected to all places in Berlin! The instructions to reach and access the keys were excellent and always well communicated with Julius.",1,0.9728,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,26,100.0,0,9.644762661947714,4.64,4.58,4.81,4.55,3700984,"What a great place! The area is filled with shopping, great places to eat and it’s so close to the subway you can get anywhere easily. The apartment itself is really nice! Light, airy and quiet.  Katya made it super easy! This is a great place to stay if you are in Berlin.",1,0.9787,Positive
