125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,0,3.604133748872951,4.86,4.86,4.86,4.29,1144853932853963747,"We greatly enjoyed staying in Nora's apartment. The location near the train station was a big plus to getting around to other areas of the city. The apartment was clean and comfortable, all the amenities we needed (especially a washing machine) were available, and Nora left us some treats to enjoy too. Her place is lovely, we had a great stay, thank you Nora!",1,0.9735,Positive
149.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,2.0686308554688693,4.99,4.99,4.99,4.83,23315743,"A stylish decorated apartment right in the heart of Prenzlauer Berg, lots of cafès, restaurants in walkable distance, tram and U Bahn literally in front of the house. Still: As the apartment is located in a classic Berlin 'Hinterhaus' once you in there, you won't notice any of that. My husband and me even had to 'co-work' there for a day and that worked just fine. Overall, it is a very good choice if you want a real Berlin 'in the city' feel and still get a good night's sleep.",1,0.8169,Positive
