59.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,1,8.780949789470249,4.81,4.96,4.74,4.6,807131975159748467,"I'm glad I met the host. Always a kind and positive person. You have access to the kitchen, bathroom and related utilities that are listed so you feel right at home. The place is peaceful and quiet despite being only a few stations away from the center (Stadtmitte). It is just a 20 minutes drive. Shops are just a 5-minutes walk away, the nearest center Leopoldplatz a 20 minutes walk (2 minutes drive with the S-Bahn)",1,0.9217,Positive
