90.0,3,2.0,1.0,3.0,12,100.0,1,2.1522006943825973,4.94,4.87,4.93,4.9,3783117,"Wir (Hannah,  Phillip und Bettina) waren 5 Tage bei Bettina. Es war einfach wunderbar,  weil alles gut zu erreichen war. Die Wohnung war wie beschrieben. Klein aber fein, was uns nix ausgemacht hat. Bettina und ihr Mann waren super, sehr nett und hilfsbereit wir kommen sehr gerne wieder!",1,-0.9184,Negative
143.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,1,3.291202411050151,4.87,4.83,4.84,4.75,16543844,"The place was much bigger than I expected. Alexandra was quick to meet us and communication was always easy; she was also very sweet. The pizza restaurant next door also sells burgers, and they were quite good. Getting around was very easy. ",1,0.9059,Positive
114.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,1,1.7854128309165902,4.85,4.78,4.89,4.75,17741498,The apartment was very clean. We stayed with 3 guests comfortably. The beds and the couch were all comfortable for sleeping. There is a cafe nearby with wifi but we were able to get a SIM card to have service. Highly recommend this air bnb !,1,0.8413,Positive
98.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,59,100.0,0,10.5101686862438,4.87,4.9,4.84,4.84,6951394,"후기에 올려진 그대로 산드라의 집은 최고였습니다.<br/>산드라는 항상 친절하고 상냥했으며 그녀의 아들은 귀여워요.<br/>집은 깨끗하고 쾌적했습니다.<br/>집 바로 앞에 위치한 버스 정류장 덕분에 어디든 쉽게 갈수있었습니다.<br/>다음번에 다시 베를린에 온다면 또 산드라의 집으로 올 것입니다.<br/>고마웠어요, 산드라!<br/>Sandra was kind so kind and her son very cute.<br/>Her House was Clean and Comfortable room.<br/>Her House is in front of Bus stop.<br/>And I can go anywhere quickly. <br/>If I'm come again Berlin, I will come again sandra's House. <br/>Thank you so much! <br/>Danke schoen!!",1,0.9438,Positive
32.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,0,9.004424061898769,4.77,4.66,4.7,4.81,35396599,"Buvo malonus apsilankymas. Draugiški šeimininkai, tvarkinga vieta, tačiau šalia vyko kelio darbai, tai buvo labai triukšminga. Šiek tiek trukdė girgždanti lova, bet visą kitą buvo puiku. Aprašymą atitinkanti vieta",1,0.0,Neutral
35.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,59,100.0,0,0.7009515972590313,4.75,4.8,4.95,4.74,2543760,"In short, stop searching and stay here! As described by the host, best in Mitte is no exaggeration. Host took the time to make sure we were okay, provided tips, gave good recommendations, but also gave us our privacy, as the place is setup with private room and bathroom. Top recommendation.",1,0.7133,Positive
