273.0,15,4.0,2.0,12.0,39,100.0,0,6.1262846843500816,4.66,4.61,4.34,4.56,14588206,"2 adjoining apartments capable of sleeping 15 people. We booked out both for 8 people (4 couples), so a bedroom per couple. <br/>Beds comfortable, with bedlinen supplied and good storage.<br/>Bathrooms were well laid out, with a large and small towel supplied per person.<br/>Kitchen had everything you needed, with adequate cooking facilities. <br/>Fridge (with ice compartment) and Cooker in both apartments. <br/>Dishwasher in one  and washing machine in the other. Washing Tablets for both supplied. <br/>Only one dishtowel per apartment, but wasnt an issue. <br/>Apartments located on 2nd floor of residential block <br/>Mosque meeting room on ground floor. No noise heard from other apartments, stairwell clean and everyone we passed in stair or courtyard was polite and helpful. <br/>Apartments in great location with entrance next to an underground station. Public transport system was amazing. <br/>Supermarkets, cafes, restaurants, bakers, butchers, markets etc all within close proximity with excellent service.",0,0.9761,Positive
55.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,98.0,1,11.93427080906913,4.7,4.81,4.55,4.72,28064699,Sauberes gepflegtes großzügiges Zimmer mit Balkon. Top Lage und Preis für Berlin.,1,0.2023,Positive
