42.0,1,1.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,1,17.084357470964473,4.96,4.98,4.92,4.91,24449046,"Soli and Hani are really nice people, their place is cosy and clean (also it smells really good especially in the morning when they are warming up bread in the oven).<br/>Also WiFi is great 👌🏻<br/>location is green and calm, you won’t be disturbed by noise at night. <br/>It takes about 40 min to get to the downtown.<br/>As a said, hosts are just perfect, thank you guys! :)",1,0.9715,Positive
50.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,34,83.0,1,2.563400508484748,4.9,4.97,4.96,4.92,29732182,"Great communication and extremely helpful and understanding when our train was delayed. The accommodation itself is right in the centre, very spacious room and impeccable cleanliness!",1,0.7639,Positive
