279.0,7,3.0,1.0,5.0,49,100.0,1,0.6340725500661578,4.87,4.79,4.86,4.73,925210172009267061,"We had a fantastic stay in Berlin in this apartment. We took two pre teens for their first trip to Berlin and the apartment was so lovely we had to drag them away from the gorgeous apartment. The apartment is much much bigger than the photos suggest, beautiful high ceilings, fabulous furniture and decor and all the facilities you might need for a city break. The location is great, supermarkets, restaurants and bakeries within a very short walk, tram stop outside of apartment and a short walk to Alexanderplazt. Located on the first floor, a wide stair case leads to the apartment making carrying luggage short and easy. Highly recommend this wonderful apartment for a trip to Berlin.",0,0.9863,Positive
