65.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,4.168083698931513,4.83,4.86,4.66,4.71,499353,"It was pleasure to stay in Karsten's appartment. It was very nice, as seen on profile photos. It's located on silent street, so there's no noise from it. U-bahn, nice restaurants and grocery store are in walking distance. Free parking on the street nearby.<br/>It was easy to comunicate with Karsten. He gave us information about surroundings, nice places to eat and other things to make our stay very good. Highly recommended host!",1,0.9703,Positive
