64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,0,6.769528999229232,4.67,4.17,4.67,4.75,30762822,"Very nice nostalgic place in older building with high ceilings, which means do not count with any modern or united features. The place definitely have a soul, and you can easily feel like at home. Edu was very accommodating and left place in very good condition for us. You may not find Edu's roommate's household customs, as neat as Edu's, but over all no big issues. Great walking distance to S-bahn station.",1,0.9216,Positive
