64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,0,3.867139639914846,4.86,4.29,4.79,4.86,34191936,"The room was even bigger and more beautiful than in the images - high ceilings with lots of natural light and very airy and clean. We didn't meet the flatmates or Michael during the stay, and it was easy to come and go as we pleased. <br/>Michael was very communicative and responsive over messenger. The communal courtyard outside the room can be loud at night, but there were some earplugs thoughtfully provided, and I imagine this wouldn't be a problem in colder months, but as we stayed during a heatwave we slept with the windows open. <br/>A lovely and unusual apartment, easily located for transport around the city. Would recommend!",1,0.9806,Positive
72.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,0,3.600844804908074,4.95,4.85,4.93,4.87,39581826,"This is a super nice home to stay! Ina was super nice and friendly, the home was very clean and well furnished. The surrounding is peaceful, but with good connection to the metro, buss, supermarket and good restaurants. This is a very quiet area to live in, but very convenient as well. We strongly recommend the apartment, it contributed to a really good overall Berlin experience.",1,0.9865,Positive
