190.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,52,100.0,1,5.999075895235788,4.78,4.8,4.54,4.7,3242577,"Buena comunicación con el transporte público, supermercados cerca, un apartamento muy bonito y tranquilo, nos hizo sentir como en casa.",0,0.0,Neutral
100.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,7.415726243794245,4.9,4.96,4.84,4.87,147339,"Me and my husband loved staying at this apartment!! Gerhard, Hava and their son are extremely helpful with everything! Gerhard sent us tips, continiosly during our stay on what to do, where to eat, where to go for Christmas markets etc. When we arrived by train, Hava picked us up by car, we really appreciated it. At the apartment we received a booklet with a lot of tips, addressed to me and my husband. A small detail but a nice touch! <br/>The area itself is perfect for someone who wants to be close to the vibrant city and within walking distance to public transportation of all sort, but still wants to live in a quiet area with great restaurants and cozy cafes. <br/>The apartment is situated in an old building, on bottom floor with high ceilings and with all the necessities you'd need.",1,0.9817,Positive
175.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,54,100.0,1,1.816434876784729,4.91,4.82,4.95,4.72,17876581,"I absolutely recommend this place to anyone visiting Berlin! The location is perfect, right next to Mauerpark which is my favorite place to spend Sundays in Berlin where everyone is out enjoying the park, flea market, music, karaoke, BBQ; but the place is also next to so many great bars and restaurants (a pretty hip area) and very close walk to the city center. Claus was so attentive as far as check-in goes and with anything we needed help with. Of course you can see by the photos the place is beautiful, very spacious, and very clean. Absolutely perfect trip! Thanks Claus :) ",1,0.9934,Positive
103.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,34,100.0,0,4.458320368303789,4.43,4.36,4.78,4.42,1096250876336497093,Wir haben uns für die Wohnung aufgrund der Lage entschieden. Wir brauchten für eine Woche eine Übergangslösung. Die Wohnung ist eher spartanisch und funktional eingerichtet. Sie hat unseren Erwartungen entsprochen. Die Nachbarin eine Etage tiefer ist etwas lärmempfindlich. Schön ist die Größe der Wohnung.,1,-0.9485,Negative
100.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,40,100.0,1,11.486177237653978,4.82,4.79,4.63,4.8,46274340,immer wieder gern,1,0.0,Neutral
140.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,1.7323092585905189,4.91,4.9,4.99,4.75,28562096,"Excellent place!  Super clean, modern, recently renovated, with a thoughtful host.  Very convenient location on the M2 tram, about 4-5 stops from Alexanderplatz.    There is a small supermarket just a few doors down the block, and a bakery next door.  The living room also functions as a bedroom, which was totally fine for us, and there is also a separate bedroom.  The kitchen is very compact, but fully functional, with all items that we needed for family cooking, and a nice variety of teas.  The glass shower door does not fully close, so a little water gets on the floor when showering, but we found that if we put a towel down on the floor it was not a problem.  The shower itself is excellent -- modern, with good pressure and a choice of spray nozzles.  We would definitely stay here again!",1,0.9751,Positive
50.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,0,10.045446339635951,4.75,4.88,4.59,4.77,321295,Nice clean apartment. You deel the care,1,0.8271,Positive
