175.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,91.0,0,4.861047682375263,4.69,4.77,4.83,4.57,53744550,"Das Einzelzimmer ist wir in einem Hotel. Alles sehr sauber, wichtige Utensilien stehen zur Verfügung (zum Duschen und Kochen). Die Dusche ist sehr klein.",1,-0.5994,Negative
130.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,32,100.0,1,5.946969070350237,4.71,4.66,4.78,4.67,31385396,"Amazing place to stay if you want an authentic Berlin experience. The AirBNB was clean and tidy, also really great value if you’re looking for a place to stay with 3-5 people. The neighbourhood has many nice spots for shopping and cafes. We didn’t have the pleasure to meet the host in person but communication went really smooth. Bert provided us with a lot of useful info about the area, free parking nearby and the Airbnb itself. Would recommend this place to everyone travelling to Berlin!",1,0.972,Positive
