261.0,6,3.0,1.0,3.0,50,100.0,1,1.6097747972308558,4.66,4.57,4.83,4.57,1094295373335288269,Great location with direct train from airport a few blocks away and easy to walk to everything we wanted to see in the city. Loved the view from the balcony!! Douglass was a great host—would definitely stay here again.,0,0.9544,Positive
