70.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,0,4.219966140444734,4.83,4.75,4.96,4.65,680999,An ideal place for those who love silence and cleanliness.  a lot of free space and at the same time cozy.  lovely area (chosen precisely for this parameter in the first place) and a delicious coffee shop at the entrance to the building,1,0.9607,Positive
111.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,3.478761427822,4.88,4.94,4.88,4.75,24836860,"Beautiful apartment! I stayed 6 nights with my friend in september and we both loved it. The apartment has a cool vibe and a nice little balcony. It was also a quiet  place during the night! The hosts were super professional, friendly and helpful. The apartment also included maps and tips of places to check out in the era! Highly recommend (:",1,0.9863,Positive
