172.0,6,2.0,1.5,3.0,47,100.0,1,2.578511654054669,4.87,4.9,4.84,4.68,52431447,"We've had a lovely stay at Markus' apartment which is located in a walkable, peaceful neighbourhood. A supermarket is literally 2 minutes away, a tram in direction to the city center is also super close. The coffee pods in the kitchen were also a nice touch! I truly recommend this place for short or even longer visits in Berlin. Thanks!",0,0.9705,Positive
