156.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,0,2.2531285722967658,4.58,4.63,4.73,4.47,49844243,"Easy going place. Only thing that was missing was a pan (that was stated in the pictures), but it was clean and for the rest all was there and the staff very friendly and helpful.",1,0.9292,Positive
100.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,7.415726243794245,4.9,4.96,4.84,4.87,147339,Die Wohnung ist gut und komplett eingerichtet. Gerhard als Wirt trifft dich persönlich bei der Anreise. Er ist sehr nett und deutlich ein Kenner Berlins. <br/>In kurzem Gangabstand ist die Bushaltestelle. Hier fahren zwei Busse in die westliche City Berlins. Zum nächsten Supermarkt oder Bäckerei ist es nur ein kleiner Spaziergang. <br/>Ich war dort 6 Tage und werde das nächste Mal die Wohnung wieder mieten.,1,-0.9661,Negative
31.0,6,1.0,1.0,6.0,29,99.0,0,1.5518343874590943,4.55,4.64,4.6,4.63,6110762,"The hostel was almost too nice. Walking through the entrance leads you into a huge, beautiful atrium with a very helpful receptionist located at the end. Every one of my needs was met by the very helpful staff, and the 5 euro breakfast was pretty decent. The rooms were nice and the bathrooms clean. Overall, I was very pleased with the value and the hostel. Missing, however, was that characteristic hostel feel, where you go down into a lobby filled with dirtbags and backpackers unsure of the last time they even saw a bar of soap, the weird pieces of art hanging around the place that the owner's neighbor's cousin did on the side, and that nagging fear that maybe someone has cracked open your locker in the night and took every single euro to your name. Whether the absence of these things is a good or a bad thing is up to you ;) ",1,0.9553,Positive
77.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,1,20.740354990098425,4.61,4.4,4.51,4.53,38343050,"The AirBnB was amazing. Very minimal and modern. It is only a 50ft walk to the nearest tram station and it’s right next to the river. The host was very nice! I am very glad to chose this location over others! I do think the price is a little hefty though. If you’re here for work or travel, this is the place for you.<br/>Note: <br/>Some parts in the apartment are cheaply made. I sat on the toilet lid and it broke, I only weigh 155lb. So make sure you do not sit on the toilet lid.",1,0.8897,Positive
