84.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,18,88.0,1,3.2402791774170403,4.77,4.89,4.92,4.69,16183018,"The apartment was perfect for everything we needed. I would highly recommended for other couple or singles. The location was perfect. I have been to Berlin on numerous occasions before but never stayed in a location like this. It’s close to a range of different bars, cafes, restaurants and parks. Our experience was also made better through efficient communication with our host. We would 10/10 recommend.",1,0.9601,Positive
