258.0,10,2.0,1.0,5.0,57,100.0,1,9.660413858650209,4.92,4.88,4.5,4.77,16254081,Alt i den skønneste orden. Rigtig fin lejlighed. Nem kommunikation. Tæt ved S-bahnen. Kan varmt anbefales!,0,0.0,Neutral
125.0,6,1.0,1.0,2.0,8,100.0,0,5.158720432219589,4.57,4.64,4.39,4.68,20277327,"Ron's place was very clean and comfortable! When my friends arrived, he was waiting to greet us and was happy to suggest places to check out if we needed them. The shower had a good, hot pressure and the beds were very comfortable. The only thing we were missing was hand soap, and the towels were so new that lint got all over my body. But overall, it was a fantastic experience!",1,0.9512,Positive
324.0,4,2.0,2.0,2.0,55,100.0,0,1.964395577601865,4.87,4.74,5.0,4.83,1239724435193172776,"Spacious, modern and perfect location!",0,0.6114,Positive
72.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,13.967797942384964,4.96,4.96,4.88,4.92,11386702,"Schon beim Betreten des Grundstückes sieht man die aßerordentliche handwerkliche Begabung des Hausherren. Die Wohnung ist perfekt eingerichtet, sehr sauber, technisch alles in Ordnung, sogar Kaffeepads, Mineralwasser und Milch waren vorhanden. Sehr gemütlicher Sitzplatz vor dem Haus in einem schönen Garten. Sehr ruhige Lager mitten in der Großstadt, dennoch ist man mit der sehr nahen S-Bahn in 30 min. mitten in der City. Nette und sehr hilfsbereite Gastgeber!",1,-0.8439,Negative
125.0,6,3.0,1.0,2.0,33,80.0,0,4.825118802351209,5.0,4.97,4.74,4.87,16890609,"The flat of Anna is a wonderful apartment to stay in Berlin. We stayed here two weeks and it felt as “being at home”. The flat is spacious, well-equipped and very clean. Situated in a nice and quiet environment. Anna was very helpful and responding very quickly on our questions. We hope to go back.",1,0.9381,Positive
13.0,3,2.0,1.0,1.0,16,100.0,1,12.384366305084049,4.77,4.48,4.86,4.83,1274386,"Christian is a very friendly and hospitable host. He explained in detail how to get to different places in the city and offered bed linen, towels and such like things for a comfortable stay. A very nice person to talk to!<br/>The apartment is situated in a picturesque place with a great view from the balcony on the Spree. Closely located to subway-stations and bus stops, 10 minutes from Tegel airport. A large supermarket is just  round the corner. <br/>The apartment is very warm and cozy, so if you stay in winter, you will not freeze there. <br/>Highly recommend! <br/>P.S. Would like to come back anf stay at Your place, Christian, thank you!<br/>",1,0.9797,Positive
119.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,83.0,0,5.810894102984548,4.93,4.85,4.88,4.82,15235950,"Jens is an easy going and well spoken host, he made us feel right at home in his lovely apartment. We had no issues during our stay.<br/>The apartment is well appointed, larger than it appears in the photos, secure and in a quiet area. There is also a nearby underground U-Bahn station to travel to other parts of the city from.",1,0.8779,Positive
69.0,2,1.0,1.0,3.0,42,100.0,0,1.198185745408111,4.69,4.76,4.97,4.59,21808006,"Erich lebt den klassischen Airbnb-Gastgeber: Homesharer, perfekte Kommunikation, sehr engagiert, ist stolz auf sein Kiez, und man fühlt sich äußerst wohl bei ihm. Die Unterkunft ist wie beschrieben, individuell designt und kunstvoll eingerichtet, blitzsauber, äußerst ruhig, und dennoch mittendrin. Angenehmes und sicheres Viertel, U-Bahn und Tram-Station direkt vor der Haustür, umgeben von netten Höfen mit vielfältigem Gastroangebot. Volle Empfehlung!",1,-0.636,Negative
102.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,57,100.0,1,6.359076554378813,4.97,4.97,4.76,4.89,923758042096702482,"We have had THE most wonderful time at Simon’s place! It was remarkably clean, cozy and a great base to explore Berlin from. We would really recommend and feel we made a perfect choice with this airbnb.",1,0.9576,Positive
171.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,1,3.8777187124009465,4.9,4.79,4.92,4.68,8935549,My friends and I stayed at Masha's for several days while we were in Berlin for the marathon. The apartment was a peaceful spot for us to rest and hang out. Everything was super comfortable. Masha was very communicative and kind throughout.,1,0.9529,Positive
