64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,0,6.16237661417251,4.69,4.83,4.7,4.72,1192961,"It was very nice staying at Arnd's place. My friend and I found the accommodation very last-minute, but he replied to my messages with patience, which I really appreciate. We didn't get to talk much because we were usually out in the city, but Arnd always helped us with our questions and requests. He's apartment is very clean, and at a perfect location. You can take a bus right in front of the front door! Highly recommended! Thank you, Arnd! :)",1,0.9824,Positive
123.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,1,1.17460082517367,4.83,4.8,4.9,4.74,238396,"3 minutes walk to the U-Bahn. Nice neighborhood with friendly locals....not touristy at all. The apartment is very well-equipped with cutlery. The host even provided oil, balsamic vinegar, salt, pepper, coffee and tea. Danke.",1,0.7184,Positive
