125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,10,100.0,0,2.37059750740153,4.61,4.52,4.45,4.48,1312007,"What a LOVELY flat! Great location, beautifully decorated, nice and clean and tidy, and well equipped with everything you need. The only downside of the flat is that there are a lot of stairs to climb (Jon warned me about this in advance though, which was nice of him) and there is a little bit of traffic noise in two of the bedrooms. But having said that, we didn't find it too much of a problem and would 100% return!<br/>Thanks Jon for a wonderful stay in a great part of Berlin.",1,0.9615,Positive
