170.0,4,2.0,2.0,2.0,55,100.0,0,5.317292772548667,4.74,4.96,4.57,4.7,49579173,"This place should not be listed as accomodating 4 people since the second small room doesn't have curtains or a proper bed. It is also very noisy with two construction sites in the street and drilling sounds from 7am until the evening: would not recommend for anyone planning to spend any part of the day there. <br/>The place itself is disappointing for such a high price. <br/>The worst part of all: after being rude the whole two weeks, the landlord ultimately threatened me and asked me to transfer money to his paypal account. Appaling behavior, I have never seen anything like this in years of travelling. Thankfully the AirBnb support team was extremely helpful throughout this unfortunate experience.",0,-0.9173,Negative
243.0,6,3.0,1.0,4.0,51,100.0,1,1.372412995603046,4.9,4.94,4.78,4.75,13739449,"Super clean, convenient and nice apartment. Well furnished, all the basics are there plus extras (Netflix, amazing water pressure, soaps). Hosts are clear and communicative. Would definitely recommend and return!",0,0.9647,Positive
