97.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,51,100.0,1,7.205805476037972,4.91,4.91,4.49,4.74,28863960,"Really enjoyed our stay! Very clear instructions, and great recommendations on local restaurants and more. Peaceful surroundings. Only a few U-bahn stops form all the nice restaurants Neukölln has to offer. Would recommend!",1,0.9605,Positive
88.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,0,2.021408745528697,4.57,4.49,4.8,4.44,16298872,Es war wirklich alles super. Die Gegend war eine Mischung aus ruhig aber dennoch irgendwie mittendrin. Die Wohnung war live tatsächlich noch besser als auf den Fotos und auch die Kommunikation lief super. Wir konnten sogar etwas später auschecken um nicht mit dem Gepäck hin und her zu laufen. Insgesamt sehr zu empfehlen !,1,-0.9508,Negative
79.0,4,1.0,1.5,1.0,36,96.0,1,4.319753787150365,4.76,4.61,4.85,4.61,777346115714345180,"Alex is a great host, very friendly and helpful! The location is good, very close to the tram which goes frequentlyand the neighborhood was safe and quite. Overall great considering the price!",1,0.9688,Positive
142.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,52,98.0,1,2.2099121550415086,4.87,4.92,4.95,4.72,9707618,"Stephanie’s apartment is PERFECT! Location is awesome - close to cafes, bars, restaurants. The apartment was clean and stylish. 100% recommend.",1,0.9328,Positive
182.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,54,100.0,0,2.922130604883409,4.89,4.76,4.94,4.82,2945314,"Sebastian place was great in all ways, such a relaxing and beautiful space in a perfect area to explore Berlin, really couldn't ask for more.",1,0.9423,Positive
60.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,0,7.801815095559745,4.96,4.96,5.0,4.85,21119563,"Manuel´s apartment is beautiful, spacious, cozy. Decorated with beautiful art and there are a lot of lovely details. Manuel is a generous and considerate host and will point out all the places (restaurants, grocery stores etc.) in the neighborhood. Even those he has not listed on the map he has created for that purpose.  He informed us how to best get to his apartment. We had lovely conversations. The view is fantastic overlooking the rooftops of Berlin. Our beds, even the foldout sofa, are comfortable. Bedding and towels as well as a lot of other things you might need are provided.  Better than any hotel as you can stay in the comfort of a home. The coffee is excellent. We are very grateful that we have found this jewel and will be back in the future. Thank you, Manuel!",1,0.9948,Positive
62.0,3,1.0,1.0,3.0,30,100.0,0,4.614969004067335,4.37,4.28,4.43,4.4,323259,"The place was clean, warm and really close to the U ban and 6 stops from Alexanderplatz.<br/><br/>We almost didn't notice that we were living with other people in the apartment, the kitchen was stocked, overall a good place to stay in.",1,0.3182,Positive
196.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,44,100.0,1,0.8343376118810685,4.72,4.79,4.86,4.6,9292804,"Great location, good price, very clean. We had a great time. I strongly recommend.",1,0.9565,Positive
64.0,3,2.0,1.0,3.0,41,100.0,1,20.131175346192396,4.98,4.96,4.99,4.91,44995308,"Schöner grüner Ort neben einem (Bade)see der zu einem Spaziergang einlädt, dabei ist das Essen im Reiterhof-Restaurant am Ende der Strecke empfehlenswert! Sehr netter Host der uns auch ein paar Tipps gegeben hat. Die U-Bahn Station ist in weniger als 10min fußläufig erreichbar, insgesamt waren wir sehr zufrieden!",1,-0.6688,Negative
