64.0,2,2.0,1.0,1.0,14,100.0,0,5.485745328394297,4.8,4.6,4.68,4.76,4510046,"Esther is very friendly and responded as soon as we had questions. We did not need a map, as she told us very precisely how to get to her place. <br/>Note that the flat is on a 4th floor with no elevator (so a welcome workout after trying Berlin culinary treasures)! The room is stylish, quite spacious, comfortable and as described, & so is the flat. I strongly recommend having breakfast on the small balcony over the square! Neukölln is a really cool area, vibrant, very cosmopolitan and multicultural. Follow the canal and you'll reach the center and its nightlife, walk down the streets and you'll discover Tempelhof airfield. <br/>Bottom line: we loved Berlin, and Esther's accommodation took a great part in it. ",1,0.9807,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,0,3.711718674751055,4.92,4.92,4.69,4.85,28336409,"Good stay, recommended",1,0.5719,Positive
