75.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,1,3.7465670354738254,4.89,4.91,4.74,4.8,4581049,"Etienne’s place was extremely lovely, clean, stylish and cosy. The location is great, as it is within easy reach of trams, as well as local shops and cafes. Etienne was the perfect host, and he made us feel extremely welcome - we would recommend this place to anyone!",1,0.9778,Positive
