96.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,48,100.0,1,6.700512034911939,4.98,4.99,4.93,4.94,12967814,"Where to start - we've stayed in a few Airbnb's over the years and nothing comes close to this - if Carlsberg did Airbnb's this would be it ! Although we weren't able to meet Robert in person the communication was excellent and following Roberts instructions it was a doddle navigating from Bellevue the local S-bahn to the apartment.  We were simply overwhelmed by the space, design, comfort and novelty of a what turned out to be a very comfortable waterbed.  If you are coming to Berlin and we recommend you do, then there really is only one place to stay!",1,0.9198,Positive
