232.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,41,100.0,1,2.942766383999945,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,42630999,"Great location with access to public transit, nicely appointed apartment, comfortable bed and other furnishings. It felt cozy and plush. Kitchen had lots of dishes and equipment. Washer and dryer were easily found in the basement. <br/>Heated floors helped a lot due to the frigid temperatures during our time in Berlin. Front desk staff very helpful with arranging tours or neighborhood information. We couldn’t ask for more.",1,0.9412,Positive
138.0,5,0.0,1.0,3.0,39,100.0,1,2.860188071088701,4.95,4.96,4.94,4.84,17855915,Great place to stay. Very nice apartment with everything you need. Good neighborhood with nice restaurants and Cafés. I will come back. Natalie is s great hist. very fast Communication. Easy check in.,1,0.9659,Positive
