115.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,30,80.0,0,6.188901033018674,4.92,4.83,4.84,4.78,11833825,"Linda's appartment is the perfect combination between modern architecture and vintage features which make everything incredibly cosy and beautiful. The upper bed made me want to rebuild my own appartment as it is a very intelligent room concept. <br/>Communicating with Linda has been a very nice experience as she is a very polite, friendly and attentive person. All in all everything went perfect and we recommend staying at 'Otto's' very much. ",1,0.9757,Positive
77.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,17,100.0,0,4.41582610173911,4.45,4.2,4.7,4.48,7905519,"Propre, bien situé et plutôt spacieux mais la cuisine est peu équipée.",1,0.0,Neutral
99.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,30,100.0,0,25.88170976190907,4.69,4.67,4.83,4.61,16939260,"Das klitzekleine Häuschen liegt wirklich nur einen Katzensprung vom Wasser entfernt. 2 tolle Schaukeln  wurden von unseren Kindern (2 und 4) kräftig genutzt, die am Ende der Straße in Richtung Havel zeigen.<br/>Leider hat die Unterkunft (wegen des Regens?) ein wenig gemuffelt als wir ankamen, und trotz August war es unten (Küche, Bad und kleines Zimmer liegen im Souterrain) sehr kalt, so dass wir uns vor allem im Schlafzimmer (erster Stock) aufhielten. <br/>Heiko ist unkompliziert und hat auch für Salz und andere Basics in der Küche gesorgt.",1,-0.9451,Negative
97.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,60,100.0,1,5.957143631808804,4.82,4.8,4.64,4.75,772627,A very nice and homely accommodation but the greatest part is from the friendliness of the host. I’ll rate this accommodation 5 star with various good reasons on hand. Highly recommended,1,0.974,Positive
60.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,45,100.0,1,3.689600261518912,4.74,4.55,4.76,4.65,16237052,"A lovely place to stay. Good location, great communication from the Host. Recommend to everyone wanting to visit Berlin",1,0.9231,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,82.0,1,2.6808853188639663,4.67,4.68,4.92,4.59,43823296,"We checked in at 11pm so there was no reception staff and only restaurant staff to give us the key which was ok but strange as it’s such a big hotel. Our room was unbearably hot, with no working A/C, the windows went out to a large flat roof. The room was smelly, damp and had mould stains on the floor. The shower leaked all over the bedroom floor, probably a recurring issue which is why there was mould in the first place. The staff were unable to move us rooms stating all rooms were booked although the hotel was still advertising rooms available. The room was not like the photos, did not expect a shower to be in the bedroom by the bed. Check-in instructions weren’t clear. All in all a very negative experience. We ended up checking out after the first night as staying in a warm dirty room was not what we had planned for a holiday in Berlin and for what we paid. After checking out staff then offered us a new room…far too late as we had alternative accommodation sorted",1,-0.9039,Negative
88.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,80.0,0,4.3965704421174285,4.79,4.7,4.87,4.68,4361737,"Dor was an excellent host that made us feel really welcome in his home. The apartment and room is really spacious and clean. We loved the area, which was close to the train station and has a great selection of restaurants and cafes! Highly recommend.",1,0.9684,Positive
360.0,8,3.0,1.0,3.0,66,100.0,1,4.432978276429975,4.94,4.82,4.89,4.74,694871,Es war toll! danke für die schöne UNterkunft!,0,-0.855,Negative
68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,1,21.4780264234613,4.75,4.64,4.69,4.69,42488063,Von der Buchung bis zum (leider) ungeplanten frühen Check-Out lief alles reibungslos. Die Wohnung ist tiptop und Rainer ein absolut guter Ansprechpartner. Hier kann man nichts verkehrt machen!,1,-0.636,Negative
129.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,55,83.0,0,6.567199125784508,4.84,4.76,4.78,4.71,819740,"everything was pefect, organized and clean.<br/>if you want to be in the centerof Neukolln, this is a bit far (10 minutes from subway). the two bedrooms are connected so less privacy, everytime one go out, he passes through the other's room.",1,0.0772,Positive
