125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,15,100.0,0,2.2397308136915437,4.75,4.87,4.87,4.74,3397917,"Vanessa made arrangements with her neighbour to greet us, as she was on holidays. She left helpful, friendly notes to welcome us and orientate us to the neighbourhood, and had fresh flowers through her lovely apartment. Vanessa's apartment was a fabulous base to explore funky, fun Berlin.",1,0.9758,Positive
51.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,7,100.0,0,8.032911788548404,4.87,4.8,4.94,4.85,542674,Die Kommunikation mit Wolfgang verlief freundlich und absolut problemlos. In seiner super Altbauwohnung habe ich alles so angetroffen wie beschrieben und die Großzügigkeit der Räume genossen. In der Straße rund ums Haus (mit Traum-Entrée) findet man neben der sehr empfehlenswerten Frau Bäckerin auch gute Restaurants.,1,-0.5994,Negative
94.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,0,7.207149198453504,4.14,4.1,4.32,4.19,818630719501735634,"An ok place to stay a few nights, clean and simple. <br/>At our stay in January it was extremely cold and the rooms had clearly not been occupied for some days when we arrived. The first 24 hours before the space had warmed up properly were not nice, and the host was not very helpful.<br/>Lots of mold in the bathroom, and no shower gel/shampoo. <br/>But yeah, an ok place, nothing special.",1,0.7438,Positive
65.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,90.0,1,1.942933168845537,4.91,4.95,4.95,4.65,43719623,"Mari is a wonderful host and the room and other shared spaces (bathroom, kitchen, etc) were immaculate! She's very easy going and friendly. I definitely enjoyed my stay at her apartment and she gave useful tips and recommendations in Berlin. I definitely recommend!",1,0.978,Positive
