50.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,47,100.0,1,10.001730807520095,4.7,4.68,4.61,4.58,696372,"Nice place, very calm and quiet and doesn't feel like you're in a big city, but the tram is a 4 minute walk away, runs every 5 minutes and takes 20 minutes to get to the centre. From there you can take a tram or train to just about anywhere in Berlin. For me the location was perfect.<br/>I stayed here for 5 weeks while doing a course in Berlin and the only con for me was that I found the kitchen a little hard to get to because of the narrow/steep stairs, but there's a microwave and fridge downstairs and a kettle in the room so the host has made accommodations for this.<br/>Everything was nice and clean. I didn'thave to worry about much while I was there 🙂",1,0.907,Positive
