301.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,44,100.0,1,2.942766383999945,4.84,5.0,4.88,4.6,29121214,"My apartment was on the 2nd floor and over looked the children’s playground which was very busy and could be heard loudly from the apartment. The bar noise was also very audible late into the night so would recommend a higher floor. <br/>Other than the noise the apartment is a good size, good location and the effort they made to rectify the noise problems was addressed with immediacy and grace. <br/>It’s worth also noting it felt very secure and was overall a positive experience",1,0.942,Positive
