92.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,0,0.6684467555459548,4.71,4.66,4.83,4.56,1541488,"The apartment was spacious and comfortable, in a very central and convenient location for both walking and public transport. It is in an old building, and well worn-in, but that is part of the charm of Berlin. Our host was kind and welcoming and easy to communicate with. On a practical level, the facilities and equipment were basic but functional. No amenities are offered, so be prepared to bring your own, or drop down to the supermarket next door. Know that second double bed is at floor level. It was relatively comfortable, but may not be ideal for everybody. The player piano in the living room is cool for a bit of ""live"" entertainmen, and the lay-back armchairs are also very cool and comfortable.",1,0.9818,Positive
