137.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,1,2.759966591003808,4.94,4.92,4.94,4.81,768616,"Cornelius is a fabulous communicator, excellent coordination, contact information and quick responses for our pre- trip logistics.   Upon our arrival Linda was a great, explained all the details and got us oriented. The apartment was ideal for our stay; great to be among the rooftops! Kitchen had every desired and necessary appliance (loved the dishwasher) and the space was inviting, sunny, full of operable skylights and shades and all around awesome.  The neighborhood was great for public transportation ( train and tram) great grocery options and awesome  restaraunt choices ( happie was delightful!). I would  absolutely rely upon Cornelius for my next stay in Berlin.  Thanks for a great home awayfrom home!",1,0.9943,Positive
131.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,0,4.263251204069727,4.62,4.68,4.41,4.45,46113337,The space was what we needed.  The only negative was that the elevator was not working for 12 days and we were on the 5th floor - due to our ages (70’s) the walk up was difficult.,1,-0.7351,Negative
142.0,4,2.0,2.0,2.0,19,100.0,1,6.608155925105233,4.83,4.94,4.85,4.76,10423394,"Stefanie was the most helpful and responsive host. She gave us great recommendations for Berlin, and we had the best time. The flat is brilliant, so stylish, and comfy. I loved the pillows and the duvet so much I wish I could get them shipped to London. The views from the huge windows were gorgeous, and high ceilings and lights gave the apartment great heartwarming atmosphere. I would very gladly stay there next time I'm in Berlin, as we will be back :). ",1,0.9912,Positive
