76.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,55,100.0,1,8.18877499303922,4.93,4.94,4.82,4.82,607923280892227371,"I really believe this was the best possible AirBnB we could’ve booked for our stay. It’s so easy to get around Berlin using public transport from the apartment. It’s the perfect distance away from downtown without being too rural. There is an Aldi less than a five minute walk away and the walk along the river is absolutely delightful. Mirco was such a kind and inviting host and responds quickly to questions. The apartment was clean, gorgeous, and cozy. I would very highly recommend this listing!!",1,0.9859,Positive
