232.0,9,3.0,1.0,6.0,40,86.0,0,4.231868494303299,4.69,4.76,4.79,4.49,568559238557249296,"Beautiful place, conveniently located to yummy food, sites, and transit. Only challenge was a recurring sewage or mildew smell coming from the bathroom (which I've actually noticed a lot across Europe, likely due to older constructions with less ventilation). Otherwise the place was very clean, easy to navigate, beautifully decorated, and had all of the essentials. Enjoyed it very much!",0,0.9685,Positive
