319.0,7,3.0,2.0,7.0,32,100.0,0,4.165256939142919,4.66,4.66,4.82,4.52,21074683,"My family and I stayed at Will’s place in Kreuzberg for 3 days just before Christmas. The apartment is warm, cosy and stylish, as well as spotlessly clean. It has all the amenities you could require on a short break, we particularly enjoyed the coffee machine. The location is good, approx a 20 minute walk from the nearest tourist attractions and right round the corner from the metro. There weren’t as many good cafes and restaurants in the local area as I was expecting, but just depends on your tastes. Will was super speedy and friendly in his communications and everything went very smoothly in our booking.",0,0.9617,Positive
