66.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,45,100.0,1,6.6008956206638025,4.88,4.97,4.8,4.69,578236928583726571,"Juan's apt is quite Central. he's very helpful in all respects communicates well in Spanish or German mostly but does speak English as well. Many of the previous reviews cover most of what I would say so there's no need to repeat especially because everything is so positive. the one thing that's stood out for me is how well equipped the room is with the refrigerator, hot plates, pressure cooker, so you can easily warm up any meal and also use the plates cups and silverware that are provided. the room is spacious bright impeccably clean and the same goes for the bathroom that's always in tip top shape. the shower is fantastic with a very strong jet that refreshes you after a day of walking around. I would suggest two coffee shops in the neighborhood one is Impala, the other is Maxway Coffe. Both are on the Maassenstrasse nearby. The street is lined with restaurants of various ethnicity.  I recommend a place in the highest terms and will return on my next trip to Berlin.  Thank you Juan☀",1,0.9916,Positive
