53.0,2,1.0,1.0,0.0,33,100.0,0,1.7381129152330592,5.0,5.0,4.95,4.95,13326488,Wunderbar!<br/>Thank you so much to Christoph for letting us stay in his fantastic apartment. It was absolutely perfect for our needs. We spent 5 nights here while exploring Berlin and it was a great location to do it from. The apartment itself was absolutely spotless (award for the cleanest AirB&B ever!) and had everything we could need. It instantly felt like a home from home. There was plenty of thoughtful touches that Christoph supplied including fresh flowers! The whole thing was hassle free and we would highly recommend staying here.,1,0.9778,Positive
