146.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,1,3.082153024559447,4.81,4.78,4.94,4.68,16777646,"We booked an apartment on the same day we arrived and Mia reacted very fast. We enjoyed out stay in this apartment in Berlin. It's very quiet, located in the yard. It has kitchen and and washing machine. Mia, also provided us a baby coat.",1,0.0422,Neutral
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,100.0,0,1.9694490738270507,4.94,4.97,4.95,4.79,20616653,Wonderful room in a perfect location in hip Kastanienallee. We stayed a few days at Victors place and loved the location: So many great restaurants are within walking distance.  Checkin was super easy and Victor was a great host. The room has everything you need for a short stay and we loved the design.,1,0.9858,Positive
55.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,98.0,1,11.93427080906913,4.7,4.81,4.55,4.72,28064699,Super Location für einen Städtetrip. Schnelle und unkomplizierter Check-in und direkte Nähe zur S-Bahn. Supermarkt (Penny) direkt um die Ecke. Zimmer war sauber und ein super Bett. <br/>Höchstens das Gemeinschaftsbadezimmer war aufgrund der Vielzahl  an täglichen Benutzern zeitweise etwas dreckig. Das Bad wurde nach Info an die Gastgeberin gereinigt.,1,-0.9062,Negative
