70.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,1,2.5329341972975428,4.86,4.8,4.93,4.8,19976281,"Enrique's studio apartment was great value for money. Located near transport made it easy to get around.<br/>Enrique was incredible with the communication and detailed information he provided with the check in process and tips on what to do in Berlin. He even met me at the apartment to further assist. He is a lovely gentlemen.<br/>The studio has a comfortable bed with sufficient linen and pillows. The kitchenette although small, was well utilised and had many amenities to it. The shower pressure and temperature were sufficient.<br/>I'd fully recommended staying here if you're ever in Berlin.<br/>Angelo",1,0.9552,Positive
111.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,90.0,1,2.294483644645681,4.84,4.76,4.92,4.67,848461051640639475,"Checkin und jeglicher Kontakt lief mit Florian dem Co-Host problemlos. Checkin mit Schlüssel aus dem Schlüsselsafe - alles war gut beschrieben und leicht zu finden. Die Wohnung sehr sauber, funktionell eingerichtet. Wir fanden das Bett sehr bequem und da die Wohnung im Hinterhof lag, war sie auch sehr ruhig. Angenehm fand ich auch, dass es keinen Teppichboden gab, sondern Parkett/Laminat- damit war es allergikerfreundlich. Wir haben uns wohlgefühlt und bedauern, dass die Mindestmietdauer aktuell auf 3 Nächte hochgesetzt ist. WLAN funktionierte gut, daher vermissten wir auch keinen Fernseher. Danke - wir fanden es prima!",1,-0.98,Negative
77.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,1,7.5529282602310275,4.81,4.84,4.6,4.69,1346757,"L'accoglienza è stata puntuale. Francesco ed Elisa sono stati molto disponibili. La camera è stata secondo le ns. aspettative, molto pulita, con tutto quanto poteva servire, anche per la prima colazione o un pasto veloce. <br/>Ci siamo trovati molto bene",1,0.0,Neutral
141.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,1.1632932394280655,4.73,4.76,4.92,4.63,16167725,"This was my first trip to Berlin and it was very comfortable. The location was very good, easy access to everywhere, the interior of the room was stylish, and it was a nice living space. The staff who helped us were friendly and made us feel very safe.",1,0.9593,Positive
