125.0,6,3.0,1.0,2.0,53,100.0,1,5.004747143143586,4.95,5.0,4.81,4.76,670767833129996479,"this is a true gem. johannes' apartment is a beautiful peaceful homey place with lots of light and a comfy welcoming atmosphere. the large gorgeous space is very suited for families and provides lots of privacy and room for everyone. this was our favorite Airbnb apartment ever. the hosts made our family feel very welcome, everything was organized for us and there were some private notes and wonderful special guest book. highly  recommend it.",0,0.9852,Positive
158.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,45,100.0,1,4.31202827371349,4.91,4.93,4.94,4.74,2131667,"Best Airbnb stay yet! In a great location, and a perfect apartment! Doerthe is also amazing and responded quickly and helped us when needed, as well as leaving us fruit and wine upon our arrival. Would absolutely stay here again!!",0,0.9641,Positive
59.0,1,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,0,8.462949961532411,4.85,4.88,4.83,4.78,25211175,"Ich habe mich bei Süheyla sehr wohl gefühlt. Sie ist eine herzliche, unterhaltsame und unkomplizierte Gastgeberin. Man erhält von ihr interessante Tipps und Anregungen für den Aufenthalt in Berlin und vor allem in Schöneberg. <br/>Süheylas Wohnung ist großzügig geschnitten und gemütlich. Ich werde gerne wieder bei ihr buchen, wenn sich die Gelegenheit ergibt.",1,-0.5994,Negative
68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,1,5.810529559225474,4.95,4.97,4.91,4.76,1066641196227035034,"Luisa's place is one of the best I've visited in Berlin. The room, kitchen and bathroom are excellent. And Luisa  herself: one of the friendliest and most flexible hosts I've met in Germany! The location is great for those who are interested in Berlin Friedrichshain area. Many restaurants are reachable by foot as well as many local shops. U-bahn and S-bahn stations are also reachable so getting around in Berlin is easy. I can really recommend staying in Luisa's place!",1,0.9815,Positive
100.0,6,3.0,1.0,3.0,37,100.0,0,17.177847201896487,4.77,4.77,4.62,4.69,8725453,very good place,0,0.4927,Positive
306.0,8,3.0,2.0,5.0,44,100.0,1,6.90827181205849,4.86,4.8,4.85,4.68,311703,"Wir waren zu Dritt in der Wohnung, deren Lage einfach phantastisch ist. Am Samstag ist der Winterfeldtmarkt nur wenige Gehminuten von der Wohnung entfernt - einer der besten Wochenmärkte in Berlin. Die Gegend ist sicher und es gibt viele kleine Geschäfte, Cafes und Einkaufsmöglichkeiten in der Nähe. Die Wohnung ist geräumig und es ist viel Platz zum Arbeiten und Yoga-machen - da wir wegen eines Seminars in Berlin waren, war die Unterkunft perfekt, weil jede von uns Dreien einen kleinen Tisch im Zimmer hatte zum Arbeiten. Ausserdem war gut geheizt, was im kalten Februar wirklich toll war. Lediglich die Küchenzeile ist etwas klein mit wenig Abstellraum - also für grosses Kochen nicht unbedingt geeignet. Wir waren aber insgesamt sehr zufrieden.",0,-0.9836,Negative
101.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,55,100.0,1,7.229980207068463,4.92,4.91,4.76,4.81,3974304,"AirBnb's in Berlin are often a bit run down, this was the opposite. New bathroom, nice kitchen, etc.<br/>Main room is decent sized, the 2nd bedroom is rather small. But the price is right and it's on the top floor in a quiet neighborhood. Approx 5+ min walking to the Südkreuz trainstation. And there are a bunch of restaurants 5 min in the opposite direction. ",1,0.4767,Positive
72.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,0,4.961352336813071,4.85,4.95,4.83,4.73,20798454,"First off, Ulla is an excellent host who put in alot of effort in ensuring that her guests have a good experience. She was patient despite our transportation delays before check in and took the time to explain some unique aspects of her apartment.<br/>This apartment is cozy and is suitable for short stays. Strongly recommend!!",1,0.9167,Positive
125.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,0,2.2236669090713965,4.84,4.87,4.95,4.59,2718380,"Great location, everything you will need is provided for a great stay and Anh was very welcoming when we arrived. ",1,0.908,Positive
134.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,1,1.205664913522738,4.79,4.61,4.92,4.72,30527210,"Great location and fabulous space, a very comfortable apartment and helpful and accommodating hosts.",1,0.9312,Positive
95.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,56,100.0,1,3.8473519117700152,4.98,4.77,4.81,4.84,30439405,Matthieu’s place is exactly as it looks on the pictures. The apartment is conveniently located and very close to public transport. It was fantastic to have a supermarket right under the apartment as well as several others close by. Matthieu is very friendly and responsive and we could not have asked for a better host or place to stay. The coffee machine is excellent too :-) Highly recommend this place to stay in Berlin!,1,0.9717,Positive
115.0,5,1.0,1.0,3.0,28,100.0,1,2.8150039882208566,4.84,4.85,4.88,4.79,425487,"Schöne Wohnung, ruhig und zentral gelegen.",1,0.0,Neutral
89.0,3,0.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,0,1.0054327061020718,4.76,4.65,4.92,4.68,25106503,Checkin and communication was perfect. 👍🏻<br/>Everything as described.,1,0.5719,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,0,8.77876767705019,4.95,4.84,4.84,4.79,803448102308872962,"A charming apartment with high ceilings and more spacious than many others. The plants, art and decoration highlight Sophia's tastes - in her own home. Safe, quiet and interesting multi cultural area. Great location with excellent transport connections. Sophia was very happy to help and always responsive.",1,0.9819,Positive
55.0,2,1.0,0.5,1.0,33,100.0,0,4.254453954041949,4.69,4.46,4.68,4.49,919925406080950698,Cozy space but it’s on the 5th floor! and the area is about too quiet for my taste.,1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,16,100.0,0,4.943817135878168,4.56,4.6,4.88,4.59,30946969,Die kleine Wohnung ist liebevoll eingerichtet und wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt. Es war sauber und die Lage war für uns perfekt. <br/>Leider war das WLAN sehr schlecht sodass man es kaum nutzen konnte und in der Wohnung darüber wohnen wohl kleine Kinder die schon morgens früh sehr laut waren. <br/>Ansonsten alles top und wir kommen gerne wieder!,1,-0.967,Negative
242.0,9,3.0,1.5,5.0,58,100.0,0,2.8206419213540608,4.78,4.74,4.81,4.5,660906275387521476,"This space ended up offering us more than what we expected.  The apartment is spacious and open, which gave us so much privacy and personal space. The apartment is a ground floor apartment and has large beautiful windows so we felt like we were sleeping in a department store window. The apartment is outfitted with everything we needed, from laundry and extra linens, to the surprisingly necessary tool kit. My colleague was able to cook us a beautiful meal with the wares available in the kitchen and when we didn't cook, there are plenty of restaurants and bars nearby, including this incredible ice cream spot called Hooky Pokey, in close walking distance.",0,0.9147,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,1.3773060525895495,4.72,4.84,4.91,4.66,1461489656921679773,Great spot!,1,0.6588,Positive
292.0,12,3.0,2.0,9.0,48,100.0,0,7.365557287816079,4.87,4.87,4.69,4.7,4027713,"We were welcomed into the apartment and everything was as described, as there was only 7 of us we had more than enough space.<br/><br/>I would highly recommend this place as location is great, plenty shops near by with a taxi stand 30 seconds away.<br/><br/>We had a fantastic time in this city and its a must to find accommodation to your liking as you will be doing a lot of walking. <br/><br/>I would have no hesitation in stopping at Akazia again and thanks Dilo for his hospitality ",0,0.9273,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,20,100.0,0,1.806403850776428,4.77,4.84,4.98,4.51,4229389,"Mete and his partner were great hosts who made me feel very welcome in Berlin. I was able to do a late check-in and upon my arrival, they provided me with numerous restaurant, bar, and club recommendations. Throughout my stay, they were also available whenever I had any questions. To top it all off, their flat has a beautiful, front-row view of Monbijou Park and is nicely situated near the main tourist sites and trendy restaurants and bars. ",1,0.9432,Positive
