114.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,35,95.0,1,4.534008835390387,4.69,4.48,4.73,4.72,53961638,- Fantastic Location for Berlin sightseeing <br/>- Check in was smooth and very flexible<br/>- Responsive host <br/>- Amazing value for money <br/>- Fit all 5 people in easily!,1,0.9499,Positive
141.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,1.1632932394280655,4.73,4.76,4.92,4.63,16167725,"We had a wonderful time at Kristian’s place.  The location was close to transit and easy to get to when we arrived on the train. The communication from the host was excellent and it was easy to enter the apartment.  There were some cute coffee and small restaurants nearby. <br/>The apartment was fantastic,  with a fully equipped kitchen; the bed and bedding were comfortable, it was tastefully decorated. There was a thoughtful instruction/ suggestion booklet in the apartment to answer any questions.  The lighting in the apartment was wonderful and the selection of books and magazines also tip top .  We would totally stay here again.",1,0.9837,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,2.380705735722119,4.95,4.96,4.91,4.86,7571301,"Da Tiziana in den Ferien war hat mich ihre Tocher begeüsst. alles war tip top! Ich habe mich sofort wohl gefühlt bei ihr. alles sehr unkompliziert und freundloch. Meine Ankunft war erst um Mitternacht, selbst dies war kein Problem. vielen lieben Dank, Lea! wenn ich den Berlin Marathon nochmals laufe komme ich definitiv wieder zu euch 🫶 danke für alles! ich gebe euch 100 von 100 Punkte!",1,-0.9621,Negative
171.0,9,4.0,1.5,5.0,41,100.0,1,4.936124446607811,4.63,4.5,4.43,4.63,4106583,"This Airbnb has great travel connections, a train station being 3 minutes walk away. The place is clean and is perfect for whatever type of holiday people are looking for",0,0.9217,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,20,100.0,0,3.644660110695741,4.58,4.5,4.67,4.48,22748047,"The appartement was fine, didn't really talk with our hosts - but we werent really interested in anything but a bed honestly. However we booked the place partly for being non smoking, but the placed reeked of cigarettes on our second day and had cigarettes in an ashtray in the kitchen. We didn't have any towels until Day 2 when we came back (which is then 2 full days i Berlin for is). Again, place was alright.",1,-0.0804,Negative
175.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,16,89.0,0,3.210467911644057,4.5,4.59,4.68,4.52,26808026,"Luguar muito acolhedor, extremamente limpo e super bem localizado.  Aconselho vivamente a experimentarem.",1,0.5994,Positive
103.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,0,4.688864543628877,4.9,4.85,4.81,4.78,649746563001413216,"Das Apartment von Ulf befindet sich in einer ruhigen Wohngegen etwas ausserhalb von Berlin, ist mit der S-Bahn gut erreichbar. <br/>Die Wohnung ist sehr sauber und gepflegt. Wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt.<br/>Die Küche ist bestens ausgerüstet, wer will kann selbst kochen, alle nötigen Gerätschaften sind vorhanden.<br/>Besonders gut hat mir der Gartensitzplatz im kleinen Gärtchen gefallen, im Sommer sicherlich sehr gemütlich.<br/>Ich kann die Ferienwohnung sehr empfehlen!",1,-0.636,Negative
73.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,2.27336048441501,4.89,4.87,4.95,4.82,16155678,"Location, location, location. If you're interested in Mitte (ex-pat central, but really in a good way), then Jo's place is really a great place to be. The flat is clean, well equipped and within walking distance to the many lovely cafes and parks near to Rosenthalerplatz. Jo was hospitable and flexible with my arrival time. I would definitely recommend. ",1,0.987,Positive
70.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,49,100.0,1,1.775601826394409,4.76,4.83,4.8,4.65,786310333020320107,"Alles war bestens, die Wohnung war schön und sauber, und Sahin war ein toller Host.",1,-0.9485,Negative
65.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,16,100.0,1,3.0069422642949752,4.7,4.9,4.89,4.66,6220902,"Zimmer ist wie beschrieben und ruhig, die Lage ist super und Regina eine super nette und unkomplizierte Gastgeberin. Und wenn sich jemand über ( die paar wenigen)  Regeln aufregt, der/die sollte bedenken, dass man mit Regine und ihrem Mann in einer Wohnung lebt und da gehört ein bisschen Respekt, Rücksichtnahme und Akzeptanz der Privatsphäre einfach dazu. Ich habe mich jedenfalls wohl gefühlt.",1,0.0,Neutral
271.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,41,100.0,1,3.806978636583434,4.94,4.97,4.94,4.8,973151040520236566,"This apartment is spacious and filled with light, and its decor is exactly what’s pictured in the listing.  We liked the neighborhood a lot, especially the nearby restaurants and utter apparent lack of tourists. It felt really great. <br/>I was traveling with two teens, and we felt very comfortable and at home.  Extra thanks to our hosts—they are terrific.",0,0.9381,Positive
