82.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,5.189340223814515,4.79,4.85,4.83,4.69,1033506,A wonderful apartment central to Berlin. It was close to all the public transportation I needed and even walkable to most of my destinations! Heidi and her husband were very nice and made sure I was able to get checked in/out.,1,0.855,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,20,0.0,0,8.05629405024424,4.53,4.68,4.67,4.54,15277811,"Fantastic place to stay, walk out of the U-Bahn and the front door is only 20 metres away, really great after a day of sightseeing and aching feet!!<br/>The apartment has everything you need for a short break in Berlin, the area is very residential and the local amenities are excellent, it gives you a real feel for life in Berlin.<br/>Living as a local outside of the tourist areas, eating and drinking is very reasonable.<br/>We would highly recommend this apartment for your stay  in Berlin!<br/>Thanks again Marls for a lovely stay.",1,0.9514,Positive
45.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,2.0393793505131024,4.86,4.76,4.96,4.79,24446063,장소의 위치는 좋습니다. 하지만 방이 조금 좁고 욕실이 방 안에 있어서 환기가 어렵고 불편하긴 했습니다. 겨울인데 난방시설이 고장나는 바람에 하루 밤을 추위에 떨었습니다. 다행히 집주인이 다음날 전기 히터를 빌려주었습니다. 그러나 방 자체가 복도와 이어져 있어 현관문이 충분히 추위를 막아주지 못했습니다. 수잔은 매우 친절한 사람이었지만 숙소의 상황은 아쉬웠습니다.,1,0.0,Neutral
82.0,2,0.0,1.0,6.0,39,100.0,0,7.593507322759444,4.63,4.61,4.89,4.62,19753755,"It was a nice stay, but the apartment was smaller than it looked in the pictures.  There was a bad smell in the bathroom.  Good location, it was close to a subway station, supermarkets and places to eat.",1,-0.0,Neutral
115.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,1,3.478761427822,4.86,4.92,4.94,4.58,26616955,Andreas’ place is beautiful. In a great central location! Has all the essentials and is newly renovated. Would definitely recommend staying here.,1,0.9259,Positive
88.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,31,100.0,1,2.4074182995482225,4.94,4.95,4.97,4.82,21879026,Erittäin siisti ja rauhallinen asunto Prenzlauerbergissä. Lähellä useita kivoja ravintoloita ja aamiaispaikkoja. Sisäänkirjautuminen  onnistui hyvin myös iltamyöhään.,1,0.0,Neutral
112.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,51,100.0,1,7.069783798568355,4.81,4.92,4.62,4.73,221015,"This is a perfect apartment in a perfect location. First of all the flat is spotless clean and very quiet. We really felt at home there. It's well equipped. There are shops and restaurants around. Two little parks with playgrounds for children. No problem with car parking (even though we arrived on Sunday). And Tom, the owner, is such a nice and helpfull person that we can only highly recomend this place!!!<br/>The only thing that could be inconvinient for some people is a narrow bathroom. But the rest is perfect! Next time we're in Berlin we'll definitly stay here again!",1,0.9147,Positive
68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,0,2.144674544120887,4.63,4.6,4.89,4.64,1575295,Die Unterkunft war wundervoll und perfekt für eine Reise nach Berlin! Gerne wieder :),1,-0.7263,Negative
117.0,5,2.0,1.0,6.0,30,100.0,0,2.225554428923341,4.64,4.6,4.85,4.48,16299075,"Appartement très bien placé, très bien desservi par les transports en commun. Très calme, literie impeccable. L'hôte est très réactif aux demandes. Possibilité de laisser les bagages dans une bagagerie le jour du départ. Séjour globalement très satisfaisant.",0,0.0,Neutral
