419.0,14,4.0,2.0,6.0,49,100.0,1,5.961083106152229,4.98,4.95,4.56,4.84,44472274,"Really perfect apartment, exactly as listed, generous room sizes, instructions for everything, and excellent local advice.<br/>Very attractive building, entry system is slick, very useful baggage storage for after check-out, laundry room.<br/>An expertly run business and very professionally run.",0,0.9523,Positive
144.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,1,3.4508030907894973,4.99,5.0,4.96,4.94,64590,"My friend and I were thrilled with Mirjam's apartment. Beautifully designed, great view, great location. Both the regular bed and the sofabed were very comfortable. I would absolutely stay here again. We also appreciated Mirjam's flexibility with our late arrival and that she provided two keys, which saved us the trouble of coordinating when we had separate plans.",1,0.9806,Positive
