199.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,55,100.0,1,5.219720089823107,4.89,4.78,4.88,4.78,50534643,Fantastic place! Had a lovely weekend exploring Berlin and calling this lovely flat home base. Lots to see in the neighborhood and very accessible!,1,0.915,Positive
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,60,0.0,0,12.405177895495836,4.79,4.84,4.73,4.68,14228442,"El apartamento es amplio, luminoso, y limpio. <br/>Luba fue muy atenta en recibirnos, nuestra llegada fue por la noche, y nos recibió con detalles como fruta y flores. La comunicación con ella es rápida, y nos ayudó en todo momento. <br/>Cama cómoda. El apartamento dispone de todos los detalles, para una confortable estancia.<br/>Único inconveniente que el apartamento se encuentra en un cuarto piso sin ascensor. <br/>No recomiendo para ir con niños pequeños o bebés.<br/>Supermercados y parada de metro cerca.",1,-0.5574,Negative
100.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,22,100.0,0,6.213081253380102,4.46,4.31,4.54,4.54,1241329164491058145,"We had 19 days booked.  Photos make the place look much better than it is.  Needs a cleaning and replacement of toaster, kitchen sink,  duvet cover with broken zipper but above all—a horribly stained mattress only covered with a thin sheet.  Host and host’s son communicated with us but neither were in the country to immediately fix issues.  A mattress cover that had been ordered hadn’t arrived but this is the host’s problem to solve in time for guests’ arrival.  The host suggested a ‘small’ discount for us, or she could  buy a new mattress but it would arrive ‘in a few days’. She was trying to resolve the issues, but we decided we could not stay.  We were pleased that the host offered to cancel with a refund.  This left us on the street mid-afternoon looking for somewhere last minute and affordable to stay.  That evening, the host texted asking if we’d ’made the bed’ as she had another guest arriving.   We were flabbergasted that the apartment would be rented out in the same condition.",1,-0.3182,Negative
160.0,6,3.0,2.0,3.0,46,100.0,1,5.93071369172379,4.79,4.75,4.74,4.67,685944,Top,0,0.2023,Positive
