125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,33,100.0,0,3.131240943939262,5.0,5.0,5.0,4.88,714812870288594998,"Helen’s spot in Berlin is absolutely stunning and in the loveliest neighborhood. My friends and I had a wonderful time visiting Berlin and her apartment was definitely a highlight of our trip. The rooms are beautifully decorated, everything was spotlessly clean, and we felt right at home. <br/>(Also, her bathroom has definitely sold me on one day having heated floors. Such a game changer.)<br/>Thank you Helen for sharing your home with us! You are an excellent host.",1,0.9829,Positive
