136.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,1,3.2900161245726496,4.58,4.66,4.94,4.61,4636280,"Great location, clean,  organized apartment. The communication with Maria was great and accommodatting and flexible to check in times and a request for a baby crib. <br/>My only watch out if for families traveling with babies. The access to the apartment is not ideal... With internal doors and many stairs to the 3rd floor with no elevator. Apart from that,  GREAT GREAT!!!",1,0.9724,Positive
