142.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,49,91.0,0,6.115210424417201,4.74,4.85,4.76,4.47,32539441,"I booked a night here last minute and happy it worked out! The unit was clean, comfortable, high speed internet which I needed and good amenities like a co-working space and coffee machine. I was also able to check in a bit earlier than 3 PM which I was extremely grateful for as well. I was even able to borrow an adapter for my laptop and the team working was super nice. :)",1,0.9826,Positive
