65.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,19,100.0,0,9.003903056175245,4.61,4.22,5.0,4.39,2623250,"We had a great time in Hanoch's apartment! It was just like the pictures showed and we felt very much at home there. In a great neighborhood of Berlin too on a quiet side street. Communication with Hanoch was really great and even though we did not meet her, she made sure everything was ready for us. Would definitely stay here again!",1,0.9715,Positive
198.0,5,3.0,1.0,3.0,67,100.0,1,1.8499350064071256,4.89,4.66,4.91,4.75,589169,"L'appartement de Thomas est très agréable, dans ce quartier de Prenzlauerberg qui est vraiment très sympa, aéré, avec beaucoup de restaurants et de terrasses qui donnent envie de s'arrêter. En plus, il y a un supermarché très qualitatif à 100m ouvert tard, ce qui est très pratique !",0,-0.5848,Negative
84.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,5.06163943405691,4.92,4.94,4.96,4.82,344856,"Apostolos couldn't have been more helpful! Early check in, personal greeting, availability for any questions; nothing was a problem!<br/>His apartment was even better than described and situated in one of the best areas of Berlin for bars, restaurants and general chilling out yet only 10 mins from most of the sights by the super efficient public transport system. Looking forward to our return trip!",1,0.9651,Positive
207.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,48,98.0,1,2.2099121550415086,4.91,4.95,4.98,4.81,11040435,Great spot! Very easy check in and in a great location. Walkable to most of the main attractions and lots of restaurants and cafes nearby.,0,0.938,Positive
