109.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,20,100.0,0,5.100902193230284,4.82,4.91,4.97,4.56,50995381,"We had a great stay in Ia’s beautiful apartment. The entire apartment is so thoughtfully curated with Ia’s art and her design perspective. I found the space inspiring in this regard. The apartment is quiet and peaceful - both thanks to its situation in the Hinterhof and to quiet neighbors. The neighborhood is fun - lots of bars, restaurants, and cafes to choose from, and with easy access to 3 U-bahn or S-bahn stations (approx 10-15 minute walk to each).",1,0.979,Positive
