125.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,32,97.0,0,5.826874691514046,4.41,4.44,4.03,4.33,879653438579452099,"Apart from some dark spots in the bathroom,  hard to open and close windows and a non optimal placement decisions for the living room was the AirBnB almost fully worth the price. <br/>Regarding sounds from the outside, cars can be heard, but should be expectable when visiting Berlin. <br/>Also we were unlucky that there was  construction going on outside of the balcony, so that we couldn't fully enjoy that part of the apartment",0,-0.4137,Negative
