48.0,2,1.0,2.0,2.0,29,100.0,0,13.916102626188213,4.63,4.61,4.66,4.59,7824562,I had the best time staying here. It’s a clean and quiet place and it’s located in the most beautiful area. Parwana and Obaid helped me a lot and were super nice. I’d definitely stay here again.,1,0.9661,Positive
131.0,2,1.0,1.0,0.0,24,100.0,1,8.152930353958586,4.87,4.88,4.86,4.78,2566846,"Everything about the apartment and Roi is definitely 5 stars! I had flight problems and ended up arriving a day late and Roi was still there to meet me and show me around. The apartment is just as you see it. Its in a perfect location, and yet is so quiet. Looks out on a beautiful garden. All the appliances are modern and luxurious. Immaculately clean.<br/>Roi gave me recommendations on the neighborhood and all were completely spot on. If I can swing it I will definitely be back and wouldn't want to stay anywhere else.",1,0.9197,Positive
304.0,12,3.0,4.0,12.0,46,100.0,0,4.0239324951720725,4.67,4.4,4.76,4.63,38892522,Logement parfait pour 12 personnes et très bien situé. Le loft est original et permet de se plonger dans l'atmosphère berlinoise. <br/>Un des points forts de ce logement est la présence de 5 douches et 4 toilettes qui le rendent très pratique pour un grand groupe.,0,0.6486,Positive
