64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,34,100.0,1,9.606425973425123,4.43,4.14,4.57,4.0,1082491955937678672,"We stayed in Berlin for one night to attend Lollapalooza. Getting from the airport to the hotel was very easy by train, and the ride to the Olympic Stadium was also quick. To our surprise, we were given a penthouse apartment with a lovely terrace. The room was spacious, clean, and bright. The kitchen had everything needed for a longer stay: fridge, dishwasher, stove, microwave, coffee machine, kettle, pots and pans, dishes, etc. Cleaning supplies were also available. The bed was soft and high-quality. Check-in was simple and fast – I recommend using the Hotelbird app. We were very satisfied and would gladly stay here again.",1,0.9669,Positive
