96.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,33,96.0,1,3.788820414984087,4.81,4.85,4.83,4.71,26006558,"Great location. Fab little studio. We had difficulty opening the main door when we arrived, however Julian responded within seconds to help us. Toilet paper, hand wash, dishwasher tablets, sugar and coffee were provided, along with plenty of towels. I couldn't tell from the pictures that the dining chairs were actually barstools, which were difficult for us to sit on since we have limited mobility, however for most people this is no issue. The bed was very comfortable, and we were very grateful for the big fan at night.",1,0.9347,Positive
172.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,95.0,0,4.132850367965358,4.48,4.51,4.59,4.33,43811934,Amazing place to stay for a few days or even longer. Great amenities and quality. Very clean and stylish too! <br/>Thanks !,1,0.9096,Positive
