174.0,7,3.0,2.0,3.0,31,100.0,1,8.08686445377939,4.92,4.85,4.84,4.88,23451726,"A great appartment! It was very clean and looked so nice. The beds were very comfortable and the shower is good. The neighbourhood is nice and quiet, and it is very easy to go everywhere with public transport. Also very nice breakfast place across the street :)",0,0.9847,Positive
107.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,36,100.0,0,6.609127265569619,4.72,4.5,4.72,4.65,29412907,"René‘s Place was perfect. We loved the location, the recommendations, the aesthetics of the apartment, and the amenities. Would stay here again on my next trip!",1,0.8356,Positive
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,59,100.0,0,4.272832400491692,4.74,4.47,4.87,4.63,653677,"Perfect location, super apartment and stunning views of the canal. We had a really brilliant trip to Berlin. Thanks Simone!",1,0.9551,Positive
173.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,85.0,0,1.5095289909770313,4.76,4.84,4.91,4.59,45904289,"We had a really excellent stay here - I had seen some people say it was a bit noisy of an evening but we heard nothing even over the weekend. The place was really clean and had everything we needed, and was right by loads of restaurants, a supermarket and loads of other shops. It was really close to the S Bahn station and tram stops which made it really easy to get to all of the attractions and to/from Brandenburg airport - having said that many of the attractions were within a 30 ish min walk anyway.<br/>We felt really safe here and really enjoyed our stay, would definitely stay here again and would recommend to anyone visiting Berlin :) thank you!",1,0.9915,Positive
104.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,3.614936598767828,4.76,4.78,4.87,4.71,640160204406168059,Really lovely studio apartment in a nice and residential neighborhood. Plenty of fun restaurants/shops/cafes nearby and easily accessible by multiple metro stops. Definitely a worthwhile place to stay if you’re keen to be slightly removed from the super touristy spots but still central.,1,0.8944,Positive
135.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,3.104550941585256,4.8,4.84,4.94,4.69,39956169,"Nice and quiet apartment in top location of Berlin! Great restaurants and the Tram are close by. Alan & Kasia are super responsive hosts, the self check-in / check-out was super easy, too!",1,0.9701,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,0,1.5074881752639435,4.76,4.88,4.82,4.6,1445668833818929312,this is a hotel. <br/>this is a hotel. <br/>this is a hotel.,1,0.0,Neutral
