103.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,21,100.0,0,6.349585383409171,4.66,4.63,4.67,4.41,25032777,"This ground floor apartment opens directly on to street and has a boho-student vibe. Set near the cool cafes of Weserstr and busy Sonnealle it has buses past the door and the U-Bahn and Ring-Bahn an easy 10 minute walk. Light, roomy accommodation with the basics provided. (Did need to run and buy a couple of extra cups when we had a couple of people over for coffee). Neta is responsive and friendly to requests when asking for stuff like more linen as we stayed for 3 weeks. I have stayed here before and will check out if it’s available again when returning to Neukölln.",1,0.9081,Positive
59.0,6,2.0,1.0,6.0,21,100.0,1,7.196537570595604,4.45,4.57,4.06,4.49,355494,"Die Wohnung war gut eingerichtet und sehr sauber auch in der Küche war allesvorhanden.<br/>Die Gastgeberin war sehr freundlich und hilfsbereit.<br/>Wir kommen gerne wieder ",0,-0.9485,Negative
201.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,54,100.0,1,1.372412995603046,4.81,4.83,4.79,4.66,13760375,"Great little apartment with lots of natural light and some top views of the city too, perfectly situated for sight-seeing and fast access to everything central. It has a nice and simple vibe with a cute little kitchenette… best suited to people who aren’t planning on cooking a lot maybe ;-) <br/>Sven & co were all fantastic and very helpful throughout.",0,0.9834,Positive
32.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,3.2159665482867226,4.77,4.71,4.88,4.65,17904,"It was an excellent experience! The appartmenr is perfectly located, clean, confortable and next to the metro station. Max and Friedrich are friendly and attentive.",1,0.9336,Positive
163.0,5,3.0,1.5,3.0,39,100.0,0,20.76496094261932,4.92,4.81,5.0,4.73,649286524619478604,"Alles super, sauber und ruhig, Zentrum schnell erreichbar. Jederzeit gerne wieder. Kann nur weiter empfehlen.",0,0.5994,Positive
72.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,1,1.550644971164968,4.78,4.44,5.0,4.56,49475241,I really enjoyed my stay at Emre’s apartment. It’s even perfect for a long term stay (I stayed for a month).  It’s in the back house and thus very quiet at night which is perfect if you are a light sleeper like me. Emres girlfriend handled the check in and was very caring throughout the stay. LIDL is right next door which made after work shopping a lot easier. The area has many bars and restaurants and the Tram in front of the door made everything easily accessible.<br/>Thanks again for letting me stay at your cozy apartment. :),1,0.9755,Positive
364.0,13,4.0,4.0,5.0,33,100.0,1,6.435322046487018,4.83,4.61,4.78,4.56,38745388,"Nous avons passé un très bon séjour dans ce logement ! L’appartement était conforme aux photos, propre et très bien situé dans le quartier de Friedrichshain (proche du métro et des commerces), ce qui nous a permis de profiter pleinement de notre voyage. <br/>L’hôte a été réactif et courtois, il a notamment  facilité notre départ en nous offrant le ""late checkout"".<br/>Une belle expérience, et nous recommandons ce logement pour un voyage entre ami ! 😊",0,0.3147,Positive
62.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,0,4.137606345290717,4.74,4.71,4.9,4.68,1015856966123008136,"Super nice and clean, the view from the room window is very photogenic. The bathroom is spacious and clean,it’s definitely a 10 out of 10.",1,0.9022,Positive
175.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,21,100.0,1,3.1714147201840213,4.89,4.89,4.83,4.73,86090,"This place is much bigger than expected. The photos do not do it justice. Alexandra was accommodating to our different arrival times and made it super easy to check-in. She left us a lot of snacks and a bottle of wine. The place was clean, spacious and in a perfect location filled with restaurants and cafes. Transportation is also nearby. I will definitely be staying here again.",1,0.9205,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,0,2.728500570972652,4.98,4.94,4.95,4.88,8775701,"All three of the host, Arthur Marina and Zippi, were super welcoming and forthcoming.<br/>The location was very well connected and there were many different places to eat nearby.",1,0.8479,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,15,100.0,0,7.9078420847283235,5.0,4.83,5.0,4.92,22821905,"Rarely does a space and location exceed my expectations as much as this did. The flat is fantastic--with truly exceptions views and relationship to the city--and the host is extra responsive and helpful. For anyone looking for a quiet space to work for a few days in the city, situated in an inspiring environment, I would highly suggest this spot. There is no question I will be returning in the future.",1,0.8316,Positive
