127.0,7,3.0,1.0,4.0,41,100.0,0,4.334292034577571,4.7,4.56,4.77,4.71,1159572,"All in, this was a great space at a very, very reasonable price and definitely worth considering. We didn't spend too much time in the area, as we were in town for a conference in another area of the city, but did appreciate things like a few nearby supermarkets and restaurants. A few notes for potential renters: 1.) Yes, this place can easily sleep 8, but there is only one bathroom. 2.) The other comments about the apartment being a bit cold are accurate. The rooms are well heated, but the central (long) hallway is not (at least directly).<br/><br/>",0,0.9636,Positive
132.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,56,100.0,0,21.38929830525764,4.77,4.44,4.77,4.69,32511013,Gino响应非常快，热水器坏了马上安排维修，点赞👍,0,0.0,Neutral
88.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,1,6.506839503553221,4.8,4.79,4.8,4.69,53503896,"We really enjoyed our stay here. Spacious apartment, clean & tidy with everything you could need. <br/>Simon was very responsive and provided great recommendations for local eateries. Really good location for public transport connections (bus and train on doorstep) and we utilised the eScooters on a few occasions.",1,0.9467,Positive
123.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,1,1.17460082517367,4.83,4.8,4.9,4.74,238396,Henrik is always available and able to fix any issue. It was the case for us he was easy to join and really flexible.<br/>The apartment is just perfect and close to Mitte (center of Berlin).,1,0.8316,Positive
56.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,0,8.253434016995653,4.52,4.38,4.64,4.48,48135198,"Von der Größe her passend für maximal 2 Personen<br/>Leider waren sehr viele Ameisen in der Wohnung überall am Boden.<br/>Es war unglaublich heiss und die Fenster konnte man nicht öffnen! Nur den Durchgang zum Innenhof konnte man teilweise öffnen aber man musste die Haustür immer offen lassen um etwas Luftdurchzug zu ermöglichen, der vorhandene Ventilator war leider sinnlos da er ständig nur 29grad warme Luft herumwirbelte. Hier wäre im Sommer unbedingt eine Klimaanlage zu empfehlen.<br/>Das Geschirr (vor allem die Teller) waren bereits dreckig in den Schrank geräumt, da hat wohl jemand nicht geschaut beim Geschirrspüler ausräumen , da waren einige Essensreste noch dran. <br/>Bad und WC waren von der Größe her ganz ok, leider waren aber in der Dusche sehr viele kleine Mücken überall<br/>Die Hitze hat uns ziemlich zu schaffen gemacht, man schläft auf dem Hochbett direkt unter dem Dach (kein  weiterer Stock drüber) und dadurch war es wie in einer Sauna 🙈 <br/>Das Bett war aber sauber und bequem",1,-0.9806,Negative
167.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,91.0,0,4.871252294318258,4.67,4.77,4.89,4.53,46865267,"great location, quiet and comfortable with stylish rooms",1,0.8126,Positive
63.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,100.0,0,2.4712708553295943,4.83,4.76,4.91,4.83,7758924,"An amazing spacious loft! Looks much better than in pictures and in general an awesome place full of art! Loved it. Great value for the money.<br/>Gabriele was amazing and really helpful in terms of what should we see, and other local convenience shops:) <br/>We had an awesome welcome from her as well. <br/>",1,0.9898,Positive
