150.0,5,1.0,1.5,3.0,42,100.0,1,12.476267915226162,4.85,4.91,4.84,4.75,6800795,Das Appartment ist wunderschön und in einer super Lage - Leonor ist eine zuvorkommende Gastgeberin und die Lage ist für Berlin wohl auch außergewöhnich - 1A+++++ -  wir bedanken uns ganz herzlich für die Möglichkeit und Gastfreundschaft - muchas gracias y hasta pronto :),1,-0.2263,Negative
163.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,93.0,0,1.8809199957672955,4.77,4.85,4.44,4.63,1073171966820835835,"We had a perfect stay at The Circus Living. The location was near a very convenient train station, and we found the place with no problem. Everything went very smoothly from start to finish, and the room was lovely, clean, and spacious. The café in the lobby was very useful to grab take-away coffees in the morning. We would definitely come again on our next stay in Berlin !",1,0.9115,Positive
