64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,1,2.501573077242212,5.0,5.0,4.95,4.95,929799274069481852,"Natascha's apartment is as it is in the photos. I found it neat and clean. The apartment has everything you need for your stay and if you require something, Natascha can surely give you an option. You have public transportation options very close, for example in front of the building or a block away, it is also very safe and you can walk to the center if you feel like it. Natascha is an excellent host, very friendly and is available if you require anything in addition to giving you good advice, for example, of restaurants around…I highly recommend because during my stay I have been very happy and comfortable.",1,0.9864,Positive
128.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,14,100.0,1,3.473891084562703,4.7,4.63,4.97,4.54,11932837,Amazing place<br/>Location perfect<br/>Beautiful All the way<br/>Great host<br/>Easy to communicate with :)<br/>Super happy for the stay there,1,0.8176,Positive
52.0,4,0.0,1.5,4.0,35,100.0,1,8.047733173173757,4.92,4.96,4.62,4.8,35348359,"10/10. Will stay again. <br/>Getting there on public transport was difficult because of repairs/construction to transit lines, but the host will advise you if you ask and make it easier. This is only temporary and not the hosts fault.<br/>Walk north from the host's home and check out the parks and nature preserves.  Make sure you feed the deer!",1,0.7345,Positive
