150.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,94.0,0,3.1018817858877528,4.66,4.76,4.83,4.61,721523591301947759,"It’s a clean place to stay. It’s close to shopping center, Charlie point and cafeteria.<br/>It’s expensive. The boiler and coffee machine was a nice touch!<br/>The baby clot was free but it was no matras but a very soft blanket and very dangerous for a 6 months old baby so my daughter slept with us!<br/>Bathroom was clean and the towels were good and clean.<br/>Parking is a problem in this location however you can pay 20 euro per nights.",1,-0.208,Negative
149.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,29,89.0,0,4.690006289671953,4.51,4.67,4.75,4.38,771647846393350366,"Удобные геопозиция. Близко к центру. <br/>Уютная и приятная квартира. <br/>Я вам советую туда забронировать, вы не пожалеете.",1,0.0,Neutral
64.0,3,0.0,2.0,2.0,19,100.0,0,4.853538051906053,4.51,4.48,4.76,4.55,20745478,Vwry good place to stay!,1,0.4926,Positive
107.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,33,100.0,1,2.922418995421466,4.86,4.82,4.71,4.66,16283253,"We loved staying at Phillipp's place! Our little dog very easily adjusted to the new apartment, as did we! It was artistically decorated and had everything we needed--fresh linens, body wash/shampoo, hairdryer, refrigerator, nespresso machine, washing machine, fully equipped kitchen, heat, Wi-Fi, a tv. Best of all, the location was superb! The neighborhood is filled with amazing dining, coffee, walks, shops to explore. It is very easy to just stay in this neighborhood without leaving. Communication was always clear and check out was great. We asked to extend our stay due to changing plans and the host was able to direct us to another property to book immediately. Thanks for hosting us!",1,0.9873,Positive
137.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,1.6809549157543209,4.96,4.95,4.95,4.83,2061212,"Le séjour dans le studio de Kitty a été très agréable, il est décoré avec goût et situé dans un quartier plein de charme. Enfin Kitty s'est montrée à la fois discrète et attentionnée. Je recommande les yeux fermés! ",1,0.0,Neutral
130.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,1,4.983651912533883,4.92,4.98,4.84,4.78,18641674,A wonderful apartment in a great location. Sparkling clean. The host was very polite. Strongly recommend Mimi’s apartment.,1,0.9505,Positive
206.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,14,100.0,1,2.179850376172357,5.0,5.0,5.0,4.43,30392465,We had a lovely stay in Berlin at the Linnen! The whole place is just beautiful and the breakfast was wonderful. Thank you so much for everything and we will definitely be coming back ❤️,1,0.9508,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,14,100.0,0,6.068151934988203,4.88,4.76,4.85,4.78,20767601,"Super Kommunikatuon, tolle Wohnung in bester Lage! Gerne wieder!",1,0.6688,Positive
200.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,16,100.0,1,5.785969979324449,4.91,4.82,4.91,4.91,888290787020689320,"The apartment was beautiful—bright and filled with natural sunlight, stylishly decorated, and super comfortable. Manuel, the host, was incredibly helpful, responsive, and genuinely friendly. He also has amazing taste, which really shows in the space. Highly recommended for anyone visiting Berlin!",1,0.9749,Positive
