78.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,0,8.9505494061986,4.92,4.94,4.8,4.88,4424125,The room is exactly as described and is good located. Saido was very helpful and flexible in check-in and -out. He also gave us many great suggestions on sight-seeing and restaurants.  Good experience! would recommend it to Berlin-visitors!,1,0.9534,Positive
125.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,0,2.6093004941937656,4.88,4.92,4.86,4.83,52095972,I loved staying at Manfred's place. I wanted to spend my entire time in Berlin just hanging out at the apartment. <br/>I was a little worried about the construction sounds but it was nothing during the two weekdays I was there. I could have easily slept through it. All I heard was a vehicle engine.<br/>I had to text with her grandson Ole to get into the apartment but he was very accommodating of me being late and helped with my bag up the stairs.<br/>Would stay there again.,1,0.6245,Positive
