90.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,1,3.5424985263229805,4.8,4.79,4.88,4.69,11029458,"Great apartment ( located on the ground-floor) in Kreuzberg. The apartment is very clean, spacious en quiet. In the area are nice restaurants, bars and shops. The metro station ( Schlesisches Tor) just a couple minutes away. Would definitely recommend this place!",1,0.937,Positive
375.0,8,3.0,2.0,3.0,54,100.0,0,5.932736614497751,4.63,4.64,4.53,4.49,24690410,"The apartment itself is what you see in the photos. I’m not happy with the service however since the price paid is for a serviced apartment. At first, the contact tablet to reach the reception doesn’t work and no answers either through Air BnB platform then the TV doesn’t work properly. In addition, we finally booked our breakfast for the stay then it never got delivered and only when we chased after one hour delay - we were told their service provider was having an issue therefore it had to be canceled… The guy who helped us to book the shuttle service when we checked out was very nice. It would be an one star rating on service if it wasn’t for him!",0,-0.5569,Negative
132.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,27,100.0,0,4.462782849034317,4.86,4.89,4.8,4.81,10103689,"Прекрасные апартаменты в тихом месте рядом с торговыми центрами, художественными галереями и Филармонией. Если нет желания пользоваться общественным транспортом (в пяти минутах метро и автобусы), то тренированному гостю пешком можно легко дойти до Брандебургских ворот, Зоопарка и даже Александерплац. Кухня годится для приготовления завтрака. В апартаментах есть кофе и чай. Есть возможность регулировать температуру воздуха. Санузел в прекрасном состоянии. Мартин очень ответственный и доброжелательный хозяин.",1,0.0,Neutral
60.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,15,60.0,0,14.330461110864489,4.81,4.79,4.86,4.71,31109296,"Ich war Björns 1. Gast und war wirklich begeistert von der Unterkunft. Angefangen mit der Lage (super ruhig, wunderschöne Villengegend, 10 Min zum Flughafen, 5 Min zum Ku’damm) bis hin zu der traumhaft schönen Wohnung. Obwohl Björn nur 1 Zimmer vermietet fühlt es sich an wie eine eigene Wohnung, da man Bad & Toilette für sich alleine hat. Der Fahrstuhl fährt direkt in die Wohnung (kein Koffer schleppen). Björn war zudem ein super netter Gastgeber und hat meinen Aufenthalt so schön wie möglich gestaltet. Ich würde definitiv wieder kommen!",1,-0.9476,Negative
54.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,7.403263725526816,4.91,4.92,4.78,4.85,23477057,Super schöne und saubere Wohnung und auch Zimmer.<br/>Haben uns total wohl gefühlt und kommen gerne wieder.,1,0.5994,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,63,100.0,0,4.057856681771748,4.92,4.6,4.84,4.84,1419206,"We haven't had the chance to meet Renee in person, but she was very sweet and helpful to guide us by e-mail. Andreas was in the house and gave nice tips to help us in Berlin. The house is very good, spacious, clean, light, with an amazing kitchen. Vey close to the U-bahn and the neighbourhood very calm and have all the essentials nearby. Overall a really nice stay and felt like home.  We recommend to everybody going to Berlin.",1,0.9925,Positive
