80.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,3.9850852018247895,4.95,4.87,4.86,4.84,42639322,"I had a great time at Judith’s place, her home is so cool and I love the interior design and how she added her personality into it. Her cat gypsy was so cute!! Cats are always the best hosts :) The area around the air bnb was really nice with lively restaurants, a fantastic ice cream shop and friendly residents. I highly recommend🌟",1,0.9893,Positive
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,4.168083698931513,4.83,4.86,4.66,4.71,499353,"We checked in late at night and Karsten came to meet us the next morning. He was very kind to share some insights of trendy places in Berlin. <br/><br/>The apartment looks exactly like the pictures - modern eclectic with charming details. We absolutely love this place as it has super high ceilings and lots of bright light from the tall windows. The home is very clean thoughout.<br/><br/>We were definitely impressed with the 1950s kitchen cabinet which Karsten sourced for. It adds a lot of charm and personality to the place. The old style shower is also very interesting.<br/><br/>Although the apartment is located on the ground floor, it's always quiet as it's located in a quiet neighborhood.<br/><br/>The apartment is near the train station and just three stops to one of the main stations. We will definitely stay at his place again if we visit Berlin in the future.",1,0.9901,Positive
95.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,3.769411114551402,4.65,4.73,4.79,4.5,4869716,super cozy & chill - Great location,1,0.8402,Positive
