279.0,6,3.0,1.5,5.0,47,100.0,1,2.705723759735617,4.85,4.84,4.93,4.72,12015708,Marcus’s apartment was a great place to stay. There are lots of cafes and restaurants nearby and tram stops were less than a 10 min walk away. I really enjoyed staying in an actual neighborhood surrounded by locals. I would gladly stay here if I visit Berlin again. <br/>Marcus was super responsive and you can tell he cares about making sure his guests are well and have everything they need.,0,0.9694,Positive
