157.0,4,0.0,1.0,3.0,27,100.0,1,3.932306873935366,4.86,4.86,4.82,4.69,37737152,"Cool space, with comfortable beds and very clean. Central location and very safe. Wonderful stay and highly recommended",1,0.9506,Positive
161.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,91.0,0,4.871252294318258,4.65,4.79,4.85,4.47,46865074,"Nice room, but for someone could be a little bit claustrofobic) Perfect service and area full amazing reataurant and coffee!",1,0.9193,Positive
45.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,39,100.0,1,11.72366309400778,4.81,4.91,4.84,4.83,763695986682521907,"is the perfect place for stay in Berlin, really well communicate with a lot of public transportation, the room was nice and the apartment is so beautiful and clean. definitely I'll stay there in my next visit.",1,0.9615,Positive
61.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,1,3.347640201769396,4.91,4.96,4.86,4.82,50700578,"Our stay in Jonas's apartment was very enjoyable. The place was clean, the room looked exactly like in the photos. Check-in was flexible. Upon arrival, Jonas offered local recommendations. There are many great restaurants and bars near the apartment. The apartment is very close to the metro station (about 3 minutes). It is a great base for exploring Berlin. I recommend this place.",1,0.9638,Positive
59.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,1,15.704190402628244,4.96,4.98,4.63,4.91,12337676,"Sabine's place is great, we had a great time. She was very understanding when we had complications with our check in time due to external reasons. Always in constant communication and very friendly. The room is beautiful, and very clean. The bathroom is huge and very comfortable. We could not have asked for anything else. Would love to stay here again.",1,0.9829,Positive
69.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,1,3.63272662803081,4.88,4.95,4.95,4.81,29664434,It was a great little apartment in a very nice and quiet street. Exactly what I was looking for in a quiet private trip to Berlin! Claudia and Ben were really nice and their house is very cool !,1,0.9255,Positive
160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,98.0,0,1.0407544919436775,4.54,4.66,4.77,4.45,34294913,Sigara içilmemesi büyj sorun,1,0.0,Neutral
68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,0,3.9578417824492327,4.83,4.82,4.85,4.76,5784956,"Lena was very helpful getting back to me quickly and was very pleasant. The Flat was ideal! Very cosy, clean and most of all warm (as we went in January so the temperature does drop significantly.) The area is really handy, you are no longer than a 2 minute walk from the U-bahn which gets you all over Berlin! There is an indoor market at the end of the street which has all kinds of wonderful local cuisine and a whole section for Vegans (handy for my partner as she is a veggie.) The locals are very friendly and speak good English giving us all the direction to get to where we were going! <br/><br/>All in all we loved the flat and will definitely be back! <br/><br/>Thanks again Lena!   ",1,0.9851,Positive
155.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,31,98.0,0,5.719687592744844,4.7,4.79,4.43,4.53,693935596472501414,Perfect,1,0.5719,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,0.0,0,5.049641201709362,4.42,4.17,4.75,4.33,11469165,"Paulinas Wohnung ist sehr gut gelegen und hat eine sehr gute Verkehrsanbindung. Der Check-in und out ist unkompliziert. Die Wohnung reicht auch für 2 Personen. Wer Wert auf eine geputzte Wohnung legt und gerne frische Bettwäsche haben möchte, sollte sich auf die Suche nach einer anderen Gelegenheit machen.",1,-0.8316,Negative
130.0,4,0.0,1.5,4.0,20,93.0,0,2.3258672060118277,4.75,4.59,4.79,4.66,16730380,"Had a great long weekend in Kreuzberg with group of friends. The apartment was clean and cosy and matched well with the description. Lots of good pubs & restaraunts in the neighborhood but it was still quiet in the apartment at the night time. U-station was also very close, so it's easy to access other parts of Berlin. <br/>Martina was a very friendly hostess and gave us good tips.<br/>Definite recommendation!",1,0.9686,Positive
162.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,46,100.0,1,3.25098838227702,4.96,4.99,4.75,4.8,13711603,"Three of us crashed here as part of a last minute holiday, so we were lucky to land an apartment this good at short notice. Clean, modern, quiet and with all the mod cons you could want. Plus, the stairs ensure you get your cardio for the day. Overall, a great flat for a small group. #flatgoals",1,0.9574,Positive
132.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,27,100.0,0,4.462782849034317,4.86,4.89,4.8,4.81,10103689,"Martin is the best host I’ve ever had and his place is great in every sense (place, location, beds, amenities) I definitely recommend this place to everyone. Thanks so much for your hospitality!",1,0.9493,Positive
67.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,38,100.0,1,9.589987916493834,4.79,4.49,4.68,4.78,26546193,"Wir hatten eine sehr schöne Zeit in Berlin; Hans Werner ist super freundlich, die Wohnung sehr gemütlich und die Lage könnte nicht besser sein (ruhige Lage, 15 Min zu Fuß bis zur S-Bahn). <br/>Vielen Dank.",1,-0.5994,Negative
105.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,31,100.0,0,11.50819275393875,4.73,4.67,4.4,4.63,266086,"Waren zu viert dort, konnten ein Bett einfach ins Wohnzimmer umstellen, d.h. praktisch wenn jemand schnarcht. Dort kann man halt nicht abdunkeln und im Sommer ist die Wohnung im Dachgeschoss bestimmt sehr heiß. Für unsere 3 Nächte hat es gepasst, man muss halt Handtücher, Bettwäsche wie beschrieben, selber mitbringen oder bezahlen. Außerdem gibt es keinen Fön oder Waschmittel. Man hat es nicht weit zum Einkaufen oder nach Berlin. Check in und out war problemlos. Die Wohnung ist wirklich groß, d.h. genug Platz für 4 Personen.  Es hätte etwas sauberer sein können, ansonsten gab es genügend Geschirr, Besteck.....",1,-0.9136,Negative
337.0,11,3.0,2.0,4.0,50,100.0,1,5.961083106152229,4.94,4.96,4.65,4.74,44443548,Definitely value for money. Highly recommend.,0,0.7841,Positive
