77.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,50,100.0,1,3.172543311051877,4.97,4.93,4.94,4.94,4045063,This is a fantastic deal. Really nice apartment only a few blocks from the subway. Thor was gone but his communication was great. His housemate hosted and Johnny is great but was barely there so I had the place to myself (but in Berlin you don't stay in much). Really nice apartment. Fantastic deal.,1,0.9791,Positive
