300.0,9,3.0,1.5,4.0,54,100.0,1,2.312156644109463,4.9,4.85,4.95,4.81,10043384,"Vi var en familj om 5 personer som var i Berlin för första gången. Werner var en perfekt värd för oss. Tillmötesgående och vänlig. Lägenheten var perfekt för oss och likaså var läget, ett jättetrevligt område med många bra restauranger.<br/>Vi kan ge såväl Werner som lägenheten de högsta rekommendationerna",0,0.0,Neutral
164.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,46,94.0,0,7.131273504704622,4.67,4.77,4.8,4.51,49086780,I had a great stay here. The entire check-in and check-out system is really innovative and smooth & I enjoyed the communication and of course the room itself. Much thanks!,1,0.9298,Positive
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,4.168083698931513,4.83,4.86,4.66,4.71,499353,"karstens place was great! he accommodated our early check in, and we loved the place. It has a lot of character, great design, and the MOST COMFORTABLE bed.  The location was right by the train as well. we had a great stay and highly recommend it. ",1,0.9807,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,1,4.861082501850892,4.75,4.76,4.6,4.7,5188216,"Exact so eine Wohnung haben wir gesucht und gefunden um zwischendurch zu Ruhe zu kommen und dann wieder auf Wanderschaft durch Berlin zu gehen. Wir mochten sehr die Lage, den Style und die Ausstattung. Unser Gastgeber sehr sympathisch, entgegenkommend und sehr aufmerksam - der Kontakt und Abwicklung völlig entspannt. Herzlichen Dank dafür und sehr gerne (vielleicht? ) nächstes Mal wieder!!",1,-0.855,Negative
80.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,1,15.62145086834446,4.91,4.98,4.86,4.79,31610667,"Simone is very friendly and welcoming, always happy to help. The apartment is beautiful, cozy, and very clean. Very quiet location. <br/>I‘d love to stay here once more when I‘m in Berlin. Highly recommend!",1,0.9803,Positive
258.0,10,4.0,2.0,6.0,20,100.0,0,4.032760918601343,4.62,4.69,4.54,4.57,20157960,"L'alloggio di Helga è un grande appartamento fornito di tutto che si trova a 5 minuti a piedi dalla stazione dei treni della metropolitana e di fronte alla fermata del bus, con quattro camere da letto di cui due molto spaziose. La cucina è ben servita ed anche i due bagni. Note negative sono il rumore delle ambulanze e delle auto all'esterno molto fastidiose la notte e le tende presenti nelle camere da letto non sono abbastanza oscuranti , il che rende difficile il sonno. Pulizia discreta.<br/>Avremmo preferito che la tassa di soggiorno fosse stata inclusa nel costo di prenotazione piuttosto che dover inviare o dare il pagamento all'host separatamente.",0,-0.5719,Negative
106.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,0.8993171774740567,4.88,4.88,4.97,4.79,28146018,Karak's apartment is in a great Central location. Awesome view and everything you need in the apartment. Very nice and Quick communication from the host.,1,0.9061,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,22,100.0,0,5.525138256749653,4.0,4.0,5.0,5.0,22074809,"La estancia en el apartamento de Vanessa fue muy confortable. La localización es perfecta, a solo un par de minutos de la boca de metro. Viajé con mi pareja y el sofa resultó bastante cómodo incluso para dos. El apartamento tiene todo lo necesario y salvo por un pequeño problema que tuvimos con la red wifi (que confió que solucionará pronto), es un lugar muy recomendable para alojarse.",1,0.34,Positive
160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,98.0,0,1.0407544919436775,4.54,4.66,4.77,4.45,34294913,"Very nice apartment hotel in the centre of Berlin, with easy access on foot (if you like walking) and by public transport. The rooms are very well appointed and sophisticated. It's totally quiet, which means you can get a good night's sleep.  Everything was available for a medium-term stay (5 days). The only two small negative points are the ecological aspect (many rooms are left with lights on even though there is no-one in them) and the lack of privacy as all the rooms overlook the courtyard with large windows (even though there are curtains).",1,0.8856,Positive
132.0,10,3.0,2.0,5.0,33,100.0,0,7.056211941715301,4.58,4.36,4.67,4.52,1055700373321607221,"Good location, could do with abit of a redecorating",0,0.4404,Positive
422.0,6,3.0,2.0,3.0,57,100.0,1,6.837941730908452,4.83,4.86,4.68,4.6,1440278,"Adnan's place is large, stylish, well kept and clean. We stayed for four days and Adnan was in regular contact well before we arrived with check-in information and to understand our preferences regarding how we wanted beds setting up. The townhouse has a fab roof terrace which was a bonus considering how lucky we were with the weather. Overall Adnan is great host and I would definitely recommend his place.",0,0.9735,Positive
127.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,47,99.0,0,6.070945397633094,4.68,4.69,4.71,4.5,909297144466256193,"Great location, cozy local restaurants nearby, great access to public transport. <br/>Very clean and comfy, were able to arrange a slightly earlier check in. <br/>Definitely would stay at this place again.",1,0.8979,Positive
231.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,66,93.0,1,0.5825226699456977,4.95,4.98,4.94,4.82,7831357,Exactly as described !! <br/>Fabulous location and well appointed.,1,0.3987,Positive
