17.0,6,1.0,0.0,6.0,22,100.0,0,3.9019144647212056,4.37,4.18,4.62,4.48,3108376,"El hostal tiene un Bar y aún así nos pareció silencioso para dormir, la ubicación es buena ya que uno se puede mover fácilmente porque el transporte está muy cerca.",1,0.0,Neutral
85.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,22,100.0,0,8.547903865133643,4.48,4.38,4.57,4.47,7916154,"We had a great time in Jörn's appartment.  Spaceous, clean, well equipped and comfortable.  No more than 200m from the nearest bus stop, and not much further to the U Bahn, it was easy to get to Mitte in under 25 minutes.  There were plenty of nearby shops and supermarkets, and lots of varied eateries within walking distance.<br/>We also have nothing but praise for our hosts who were really helpful and flexible with our booking: first when asked to accommodate two extra guests, and finally when our trains were cancelled and we needed to stay an extra night.  Overall: highly recommended!",1,0.8512,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,3.993898700796901,5.0,4.91,4.97,4.97,44367752,"If I could give infinite stars to Julien, I would! Best apartment, super clean, has it all, Julien is kind and so so nice. It was by far the best airbnb that I’ve had, and I never actually had a bad experience - this one just was amazing. The location couldn’t be more perfect, just as the apartment and everything else. You should not think twice if you are going to Berlin and thinking about going to Julien’s place.",1,0.9875,Positive
367.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,48,100.0,1,2.236564062864836,5.0,4.97,5.0,4.81,33442714,"Such a wonderful space to enjoy holiday in Berlin. The apartment is cozy, super clean and stylish. We love the tiny balcony outside bedroom. Lovely place to enjoy sunset everyday. Walk distance to all public transport. Normally 15mins to all spots. There so many cafe and bistro nearby. Highly recommend the cafe just next to the building. They make yummy pancake. Simon and his colleague are very responsible. They provide all useful information to us. WiFi in room is fast. Definitely will come back next time.",1,0.9911,Positive
131.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,36,100.0,1,4.248347186024305,4.63,4.75,4.72,4.5,13507504,Great place<br/>I’ve spent a lovely time there with my friends.,1,0.9001,Positive
253.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,56,100.0,1,1.6793067436589162,4.82,4.84,4.98,4.65,35911615,"Great, clean and well equipped apartment where we immediately felt at home. The appartement is located in a very nice neighbourhood. If we visit Berlin again I would, without a doubt, stay at this apartment again.",0,0.9202,Positive
126.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,3.932286507593239,4.71,4.74,4.78,4.48,36648125,Cool place. Check in worked well and Mia replied fast to all my messages. Can recommend :),1,0.7717,Positive
83.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,97.0,0,1.5772646932266832,4.67,4.65,4.96,4.5,54351687,"Best location ever, and the safest and FUN place you could stay in Berlin to be out and meet people!",1,0.9047,Positive
182.0,9,2.0,1.0,7.0,25,100.0,0,0.5561753554406595,4.66,4.69,4.93,4.58,11764015,"We had a wonderful time staying in this apartment. It is very centrally located, within walking distance to Alexanderplatz, and we were able to visit a lot of attractions without having to take public transport. For activities that are further away, getting around is easy via the U-bahn, trams or buses. The only thing I will mention is that because it is located in a very urban area, it can get a little noisy at night if you're not used to that kind of thing. I would totally stay there again!",0,0.8513,Positive
132.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,1,3.3041662927286177,4.86,4.85,4.92,4.67,19957120,"One of the best Airbnb's I've ever stayed at!<br/>I had a last minute cancellation so the Airbnb customer team recommended Martin's flat and it was perfect. <br/>Martin was always quick to respond and he was very welcoming showing me around the flat and informing me about the local area and public transport. <br/>Location was ideal for what I needed, there was good internet and heating. The kitchen was well stocked and there was even some wine and water to drink! <br/>I'm glad the other place was cancelled! <br/>thanks! <br/>jon",1,0.9734,Positive
128.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,61,100.0,1,4.880214568244147,4.95,4.99,4.9,4.88,24423970,"Lovely apartment, full of character in a great location in Berlin! Amazing host, great communication, very accommodating, highly recommend!",1,0.9659,Positive
163.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,91.0,0,4.871252294318258,4.67,4.78,4.87,4.53,46864858,ons verblijf in Sketch was goed! nette kamer en badkamer. Dichtbij heb je enkele restaurants en tramhalte. Tevreden,1,0.0,Neutral
