140.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,1,1.5130716954922565,4.89,4.91,4.94,4.75,2394897,"Verda was an amazing host, very helpful and great communication. The apartment was exceptionally clean, great amenities, and in a good location. Definitely recommend to anyone. ",1,0.9792,Positive
100.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,26,100.0,0,2.489636714704028,4.41,4.38,4.35,4.26,1986327,Berndardo is a very friendly host. The apartment is very nice and perfectly located. We had a great week in berlin! Thank you! :),1,0.9692,Positive
208.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,0,2.314204124898978,4.62,4.68,4.87,4.55,1273930,"Es hat alles reibungslos geklappt, Schlüsselübergabe etc. Wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt, die Lage ist gut, alles zum Teil zu Fuß erreichbar, wir würden die Wohnung weiterempfehlen und auch wieder dort buchen.   ",1,-0.8316,Negative
125.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,41,90.0,0,15.267403273107682,4.3,4.3,4.75,4.48,4024815,"De woning ligt in een rustige wijk op loopafstand van het openbaar vervoer. Maaaaar er is nog wel het een en ander aan te doen. De woning wordt gerenoveerd en is nog niet klaar. Als je dit geen probleem vindt en vooral buitenshuis zult eten, dan kun je hier een rustig verblijf hebben. <br/>Tip: neem oog bescherming mee, de gordijnen zijn decoratief en sluiten het licht van buiten niet af. Ook warm douchen is lastig.<br/>Veel plezier in Berlijn.<br/>Groet Alex",1,0.2263,Positive
291.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,26,100.0,0,14.020560448088316,5.0,4.88,4.92,4.94,31397816,"Wir waren schon das zweite mal auf dem tollen Hausboot von Britta und würden es für einen Berlin-Aufenthalt  jederzeit wieder buchen.<br/>Das Hausboot ist super gemütlich und bietet alles was man braucht.<br/>Britta ist eine Top Gastgeberin und bei fragen jederzeit erreichbar.<br/>Die Lage ist schön und ruhig. Nach einem anstrengenden Tag in der Stadt, der perfekten Ort zum ausklingen.<br/>Beste Grüsse :)",1,0.8271,Positive
132.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,99.0,0,1.314663681707217,4.47,4.67,4.32,4.44,6098049,"Just as a note, this was my first experience in a hostel so take this with a grain of salt.<br/><br/>Singer Hostel was impeccably clean, staff was fantastic with suggestions and kindness, breakfast was plentiful and the UBahn/SBahn were only a 5 minute walk from the hostel. It's not a hip neighborhood by any means but everything was easily accessible by public transport.<br/><br/>For those who need a quiet place to sleep, I'd recommend asking for a room that faces the outside of the building as our room faced the courtyard - people are very noisy coming in and out at night and there were many large field trips. The elevator was broken twice during our 5 day stay, which wasn't that big of a deal as we were only on the 3rd floor. On our second night, there was some trouble caused by a group of high school kids and the security guard knocked on our door at 2am multiple times (still not sure what he wanted, I think he didn't know what room they were in?) until we woke up and answered, which made us nervous and uncomfortable. The rooms were a bit warm, so we left the windows open while we were out for the day, and it very much smelled like cigarettes every time we came back.<br/><br/>My travel companion had stayed in hostels before - she remarked on the cleanliness and said she would definitely stay there again. She thought the mattresses were INCREDIBLE (me too, actually).",1,0.6666,Positive
50.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,47,100.0,1,10.001730807520095,4.7,4.68,4.61,4.58,696372,Judith offers me a lot of trip booklets for Berlin. She is also very hospitable.,1,0.0,Neutral
85.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,20,100.0,1,12.132524029038608,4.81,4.73,4.81,4.78,10644579,"Der Aufenthalt fühlte sich sehr gut organisiert an, es gab klare Anweisungen, wie wir das Apartment finden und Zugriff erhalten. Der Host stand jederzeit für Fragen zur Verfügung und hat schnell geantwortet. Es lief alles sehr reibungslos, sodass wir das Angebot gern wieder nutzen würden.",1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,0,0.5555591583260235,4.82,4.96,4.88,4.69,10031729,"Marius is the perfect host! He communicates well, is a wonderful conversationalist, the place was tidy and perfect. Marius himself is very interesting and knows a lot about Berlin too!",1,0.95,Positive
42.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,10,100.0,1,12.03040644278449,4.82,4.84,4.71,4.82,32296033,"Very calm place to stay. Werner is very sympatic host. He cares about his guests. We had a very pleasant stay, and we particulary appreciated to be able to sit with a drink in his garden :)",1,0.9381,Positive
