229.0,8,3.0,2.0,3.0,45,100.0,0,3.396812199253845,4.79,4.63,4.87,4.76,22598207,"Excelente ubicación, departamento con amplio espacio,  on detalle como shampoo y jabón en ambos baño. Ivo siempre nos contestó a la brevedad. Lo recomiendo de todas maneras",0,0.0,Neutral
288.0,8,2.0,1.0,5.0,53,100.0,1,1.6478583073893625,4.79,4.71,4.96,4.54,1114495782424259173,"The apartment can be found in the center, so it was quite easy to go around in the city. The nightlife is loud on the streets until around 2am, so be aware of that. <br/>We were a group of friends, therefore this place was a great choice.",0,0.8858,Positive
102.0,5,1.0,1.0,0.0,21,100.0,0,7.819568498322497,4.55,4.14,4.45,4.45,1151636580958943551,"The apartment is perfectly located in a beautiful neighborhood, Friedrichshain district can be reached by foot in 20 minutes, there are parks, cafes and shops nearby. <br/>One of possible minuses is that it lacks windows a little bit, but I didn't care too much cause I used the apartment only for sleeping. <br/>This is a perfect options for a weekend stay, I can definitely recommend it.",1,0.9282,Positive
163.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,3.126230216762567,4.94,4.96,4.85,4.82,22696188,Handsome and well-appointed modern apartment within an old building. The location is excellent. We were very comfortable and enjoyed it.,1,0.9332,Positive
