103.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,0,8.034137804420043,4.74,4.92,4.85,4.67,1021636095162682784,Sehr schöne Wohnung! Alles sauber. Host war sehr nett und hat alles gut erklärt!,1,-0.6688,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,0,4.543044499023058,4.9,4.85,4.85,4.9,38184451,"Lovely and convenient place to stay, and it’s very central with easy access to local transportation! Janina is great with communication and is very welcoming and quick to respond to messages. I would recommend this place for sure! <br/>Note it might be a better option for a short-term visit to Berlin, as the bed can get a bit uncomfortable for longer stays",1,0.9635,Positive
60.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,4.969455123944517,4.86,4.98,4.64,4.81,13231476,"This has been the most comfortable place i’ve stayed at.<br/>How comfortable? So comfortable that we missed our first day in berlin. We arrived in the afternoon and decided to take a short nap. We woke up at 1am. <br/>Mike is a great host and great at communicating before, during and after the trip!<br/>The room itself is spacious, clean and very chic. Mike provides extra duvet and pillows to fit your needs and there’s also a small mini-fridge, kettle and cutleries to make yourself a cuppa. Extra drawers and coat rails to store your clothes too!<br/>Prepare to walk up the stairs! No lifts in the building, but it’s a great workout.<br/>The bathroom and toilet are separated but spacious too! Especially the bathroom! <br/>My favourite features are the old heaters in the rooms and the bed. The heaters are huge and can really warm up the room! And the bed..marshmallow, it’s like sleeping on a marshmallow.<br/>I would definitely stay here again and recommend friends to stay at this place!",1,0.9905,Positive
138.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,27,95.0,0,18.517243203006917,4.86,4.43,4.57,4.57,51058112,"Schön aufgeteilte Wohnung, etwas weiter vom Zentrum entfernt in Treptow.<br/>Die feste Ausstattung ist gut, mit allen nötigen Elektrogeräten. leider fehlten so etwas wie Müllbeutel, oder Gabeln und Tassen für 4 Personen.",1,0.0,Neutral
116.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,3.4220599717130984,4.92,4.97,4.86,4.83,362701,Excellent apartment and location. More than happy with it.,1,0.8261,Positive
59.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,24.975840130192744,4.97,4.92,4.67,4.89,672226112665960638,"Unkomplizierter, angenehmer Host;)",1,0.0,Neutral
45.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,11,100.0,0,2.365494381413607,4.97,5.0,4.93,4.88,3866928,"Definitely the best private room that I have ever stayed in on Airbnb. The whole place was clean, roomy and very well presented. I could see lots of thoughts were put into this flat by Gunnar, where I feel so honored to be welcomed to stay. Gunnar is also very helpful and thoughtful, giving you very good tailored advice, while respecting your privacy very much. Thank you again.",1,0.988,Positive
110.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,1,2.106930002562863,4.6,4.77,4.84,4.57,198239,"Great location near many clubs, bars and shops. Transit close by. Host is fast to respond with recommendations and help. I would recommend to anyone wanting to live like a true Berlin local.<br/>My only complaints: Lots of space taken up by hosts belongings. I didn't have anywhere to unpack my bag while I stayed. Also the apartment is very dark due to lack of lighting in the evening. This is not a problem due to the large windows in the daytime.<br/>9/10 👍👍",1,0.897,Positive
35.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,80.0,1,7.414472725561205,4.7,4.68,4.46,4.76,11634962,"Lovely apartment with big room to stay in. Well situated on the M1 tram line, and just a really nice place to stay. Elektra and her daughter were helpful and lovely, and really flexible about checking in times. I would definitely stay here again - brilliant time in Berlin helped by brilliant host and flat!",1,0.9806,Positive
196.0,9,2.0,1.5,6.0,23,100.0,1,0.5100458669657755,4.8,4.74,4.97,4.73,11577306,"Alles wunderbar - schöne große Wohnung, sauber, super Lage - wir waren mit 5 Kindern zwischen 4 und 15 zu Besuch und können es nur empfehlen. ",0,0.5994,Positive
115.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,42,100.0,1,17.960496069020618,4.96,4.99,4.76,4.91,5335113,"Nosotros viajábamos en familia con dos niños de 14 y 11 años  para conocer Berlin exclusivamente.Ha sido excelente mejor de lo esperado. El apartamento está a 5 min de la estación de tren .. y en 20 minutos en el centro de Berlín. Sacamos tíquets ABC y WelcomeCard Berlín donde los niños hasta 14 años entran en el transporte. Otra de las cosas sorprendentes q los niños hasta 14 años tampoco pagaban en museos así que vimos muchos .Al lado de la estación está supermercado Colombino donde a la vuelta de las excursiones parábamos a comprar cenas , repleto de productos alemanes q fuimos probando. Todo súper limpio y la casa con jardín y un nogal , donde comimos nueces que caían.Hicimos Postdam en bus turístico aconsejable porque se tarda 3 horas y luego paseamos x la ciudad.Esta a 4 paradas de la casa Werner.Con el transporte nos movimos hasta visita de Los Campos de concentración .Werner muy hospitalario . Con los tikets Abc podéis ir desde aeropuerto Schönefeld en tren S 45 y luego cogéis el S5 hasta su casa , muy fácil con el mapa de trenes y metro o con Google Maps poniendo dirección.Recomendamos este apartamento y si volvemos a Berlín , ya sabemos donde.Le doy un 10  cinco estrellas porque no hay más!<br/>saludos,<br/>Rosa",1,-0.3595,Negative
69.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,1,6.04491222918904,4.78,4.91,4.65,4.71,8026172,"Super schöne Wohnung, Verkehrsanbindung optimal, Lage und ausstattung hervorragend, die Kommunikation mit Rainer einwandfrei!<br/>Würden die Wohnung wider nehmen :)",1,0.2244,Positive
101.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,3.078352015251089,4.83,4.81,4.81,4.66,20282379,"Solid apartment in the Kreuzberg area. Convenient for public transit, lots of great coffee, restaurants and things to do. The river area is beautiful. <br/>Philipp and Caroline were super responsive, and the flat was a great base to access all that Berlin has to offer with the additional bonus of working off the cocktails to get home. The 5th story is 6.5 flights of stairs up as you start below the ground level!",1,0.9747,Positive
