174.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,1,5.572103261112622,4.91,4.89,4.87,4.72,638929182228409025,We felt very comfortable in the apartment and had a great stay in Berlin. It’s in a lively neighborhood with lots of international and interesting restaurants. The boutiques were great too and we bought several unique outfits. It was easy to take public transportation to the center or other neighborhoods. The apartment was well equipped and had detailed instructions for how to use various things. The team was very responsive with any questions we had.,1,0.9755,Positive
