310.0,8,2.0,1.0,4.0,44,100.0,1,7.78889712906786,4.85,4.64,4.79,4.64,1259330584881200122,"Sehr schöne Wohnung und vor allem toller Südbalkon, auf dem man schön in der Sonne sitzen konnte!<br/>Lediglich zwei kleine Kritikpunkte sind uns aufgefallen:<br/>Die Wohnung ist für bis zu 8 Personen angegeben und wir hatten für 8 Personen gebucht, leider war teilweise nicht genügend Besteck/Teller/Tassen für alle vorhanden.<br/>Für unseren Aufenthalt von zwei Tagen waren die Mülleimer zu klein, leider waren auch keine zusätzlichen Mülltüten vorhanden, sodass uns der Müll fast übergelaufen ist.<br/>Ansonsten alles top und wir waren sehr zufrieden!",0,-0.8217,Negative
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,44,100.0,0,1.2761369708817447,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,815015167691794652,"Mega schönes Apartment, perfekte Lage, einfacher Check in und out.<br/>Wir buchen dieses Apartement direkt wieder, wenn wir mal wieder in Berlin sind.😍<br/>Einfach subber klasse🙌",1,0.0,Neutral
64.0,5,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,5.604846490618774,4.87,4.73,4.71,4.81,4981709,"I had the most wonderful time at Christos place. I needed to work remotely and my original accommodation felt through due to WIFI issues. I found myself with nowhere to go the night I arrived. After messaging a few Airbnb hosts and failing to get a reply, I began to panic. Luckily I found Christos. He responded very quickly, provided clear instructions on how to get to his place. Though it was late at night, Christos stayed in communication with me until I arrived safely at his place (I didn't arrive until midnight!). His warm welcoming  made feel at home. I loved the room; 100% comfortable bed and pillows, comfy sofa, nice temperature, diverse lighting, with a perfect dedicated workspace. Another plus is how quiet the room was. Restaurants, super markets are at walkable distance. I particularly enjoyed the Passenger Cafe recommended by Christos; great coffee, cool atmosphere, vegan, vegetarian options, walkable. I can't recommend Christos' enough. Thank you Christos, I'll be back :)",1,0.9935,Positive
