69.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,6.409080116623725,4.8,4.78,4.86,4.75,24216126,"Frank's apartment was spotlessly clean, cozy and had everything (including an oven and fridge) for a very pleasant and comfortable short stay. The location is great - within minutes walk from the train station and a few stations away from the city centre. Thanks for having us!",1,0.9528,Positive
