160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,98.0,0,1.0407544919436775,4.54,4.66,4.77,4.45,34294913,"It was clean, nicely decorated and had all the basics we needed. Check in and out was easy too and the staff we interacted with were friendly and helpful. The bed was comfortable enough although could have been better as the pillows were quite flat. There was also a strange glass panel that looked into the bathroom from near the bed which meant privacy was a bit of an issue. Also, the curtains didn’t fully come together so some light was let in in the morning, although it was minimal. The location of it itself was fairly quiet but it wasn’t difficult and didn’t take too long to get to the busier areas. Overall we enjoyed our stay - thank you Bernhard!",1,0.9348,Positive
276.0,3,2.0,2.0,3.0,61,100.0,1,9.076307917104932,4.82,4.77,4.76,4.71,44223601,"Very nice hotel in the west of Berlin, walkable to restaurants etc and public transport close by so you can explore the city. Spacious, clean apartments and the gym / spa a nice bonus.",0,0.9079,Positive
