97.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,26,100.0,0,3.0813108173309143,4.76,4.85,4.78,4.67,6891866,"David's apartment was perfect for our six week stay in Berlin!<br/>The location is amazing in a cozy and quiet neighbourhood with really good public transportation as well as lots of restaurants and cafés. Supermarkets, Mauerpark and Schönhauser Allee can be found just around the corner. <br/>The apartment itself is spacious and just like in the pictures, and has everything you would need also for a little longer stay.",1,0.9391,Positive
