102.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,1,12.089503982213651,5.0,4.98,4.91,4.95,853661488885929934,"We really enjoyed our stay at Ebru’s place. The apartment was immaculate clean, really well equipped and very stylish and organized. It had all the amenities we needed. The bed was really comfortable and Ebru was always really nice and attentive. It was really easy to go anywhere as it’s next to an Ubahn station and also close to the Sbahn. Getting to know Shila was a big plus 🐱. Thanks again for hosting us!",1,0.9672,Positive
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,0,6.087256597351951,4.9,4.85,4.95,4.65,26874439,Bei Jessica ist es super! Die Kommunikation mit ihr ist sehr schnell und absolut reibungslos. Die Schlüsselübergabe war gar kein Problem und die Wohnung ist genau wie beschrieben plus liebevolle Details. Alles ist sauber und bietet eine absolute Wohlfühlatmosphäre! Zusammengefasst: eine definitive Empfehlung.,1,-0.9431,Negative
