198.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,1,6.140315533471984,4.5,4.75,4.5,4.25,1384761585748541651,"Hosts were nice in their responses and the apartment was great.<br/>The doner shop downstairs is insanely good, and you can get some great burek in 2 min walk. <br/>Closest ring train station is like 7 min walk. So it was easy to get to.<br/>Some caveats:<br/>Although the TV was huge, the remote control was not working entirely, so we had to AirPlay out of our phones. I'm sure this will be fixed with the next guests.<br/>Pillows in the bed were very uncomfortable, and the blanket material was cheap. Also something very easy to fix but I had neck pain for the days I stayed there.<br/>Location is alright but still need an Uber/Transport to get to the city.",1,0.7729,Positive
