81.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,54,100.0,1,11.098231074049592,4.93,4.9,4.71,4.83,6253378,"Das Ferienhäuschen von Anke war wie immer fantastisch. Die Ausstattung ist super, alles ist in einem top Zustand. Die Lage im sehr gepflegten Garten ist ruhig und idyllisch. Alles in allem nur zu empfehlen, besser gehts nicht!",0,-0.807,Negative
65.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,47,100.0,1,8.21663072872333,4.91,4.85,4.95,4.77,1084183,"Caesar was very welcoming. Check in and communication prior to my arrival was satisfactory and the apartment is in good location easily reachable by train, metro or bus. It's close to shopping malls and other activities in western center. <br/>Apartment was really clean and tidy and it was really pleasant stay. He even gave me his bigger bedroom just to have more comfortable stay first time in Berlin. Really nice touch.<br/>Caesar and I had a lot to talk about travels and exploring different countries and cultures. He is world traveler as I am and it was really interesting to discuss about different experiences. <br/>I would wholeheartedly recommend Caesar's place to explore city, do shopping or as a base to go outside Berlin and visit cities as Potsdam and so on.<br/>All the best,<br/>Damir",1,0.9813,Positive
79.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,1,0.9029711845900616,4.85,4.72,4.86,4.77,28355595,"Very nice apartment, everything as described in the offer. Good location, right next to Alexanderplatz, close to U-Bahn and S-Bahn + buses. I would recommend for a short stay in the city!",1,0.831,Positive
79.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,0,4.208631273050765,4.9,4.95,4.89,4.8,37120573,"Tamara’s flat is very well located, clean and cozy! Tamara communicated very clearly and we appreciated the little attentions (beers in the fridge, candies…). Thanks a lot, we will come back :)",1,0.9505,Positive
