72.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,0,4.961352336813071,4.85,4.95,4.83,4.73,20798454,This pent house is spacious and homely and perfect for a trip away. Check in was easy and friendly and it’s right next to a tube stop so you can get anyway in Berlin!<br/>I’d recommend downloading the app “citymapper”<br/>Definitely would stay here again and recommend :),1,0.9422,Positive
