98.0,6,3.0,2.0,6.0,23,94.0,1,0.9930406419174836,4.64,4.6,4.91,4.69,6232949,"Great location, close to restaurants, stores and public transportation. We used 2 bedroons wich were well sized and clean. Confortable beds. It's close to a train line so it may disturb a little bit, but we have had, in general, a good sleeping quality. Kitchen well equiped. Good wi fi signal. The only complaint (very important one) is with the bedroon suite shower: very small place with plastic curtains that keep touching you during the shower. Moreover, the water temperature goes from hot to boiling hot and then to freezing cold. This ought to be fixed.",0,0.9025,Positive
193.0,6,2.0,1.0,5.0,42,100.0,1,0.601371120108,4.76,4.63,4.94,4.73,4335533,GREAT place. Perfect location to walk to all major attractions. Stylish with lots of extra touches. Check in was a challenge due to air bnb direction link not being correct but host was responsive and helped. One of the most comfortable places (beds) we have stayed at. Well equipped kitchen so we were able to cook most meals. Internet a little hit and miss but highly recommend as a great place to stay - especially for families!!,0,0.9816,Positive
73.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,0,1.9561377920018532,4.81,4.69,4.97,4.75,16222479,"Très bon rapport qualité prix pour cet appartement calme et confortable, super bien situé! Le logement était très propre, nous avons été accueillis par une proche de Dimitris qui a pris du temps pour nous donner les infos nécessaires à notre séjour. nous recommandons ce logement 😀",1,0.636,Positive
