352.0,8,4.0,2.0,6.0,33,100.0,1,7.070529925741001,4.95,4.94,4.57,4.82,35955578,"Felt factory loft is a fantastic place. We were 8 adults and 3 small children, and had heaps of space to relax after long days exploring Berlin. Firm and comfortable beds, excellent heating and showers, plus a great communal table and light filled living area to share a meal. Full kitchen, coffee machine, dishwasher. The kids had everything they needed too, cots and high chairs, and they LOVED the big teddy bears. Stephan was a very welcoming and attentive host, check in was easy, and whenever we needed something Stephan was there to help. We used the trains to get around Berlin, it's about a 10 min walk to nearest u-bahn. Quiet neighbourhood, easy taxi ride to TXL airport. Thank you for having us all the way from Australia.",0,0.9896,Positive
