156.0,6,2.0,2.0,4.0,51,100.0,1,2.784593796049624,4.88,4.78,4.9,4.77,3378027,"We had such a lovely stay at Nassa's beautiful flat! We loved the surrounding neighborhood with lots of great cafes and restaurants, and were just a few minutes walk away to the nearby train stations to explore the rest of the city from. <br/>Nassa was easy to communicate with, responsive, gave clear check in instructions, and was very flexible with check out time which we appreciated given our late flight out.<br/>We appreciated how her flat was equipped with all the amenities to make you feel just at home, and even had some extra umbrellas for us to use on our rainy days out! The new downstairs portion of the flat was also such a pleasant surprise addition. Would definitely come back here again in our hopeful future visits to Berlin!",0,0.992,Positive
