225.0,6,3.0,2.0,3.0,59,100.0,0,4.777223488355403,4.97,4.94,4.58,4.74,8751621,The place was lovely and comfortable for our family of 3.  Its has all the major conveniences - the beds were great.  The outside space was nice and a great added feature.  We loved coming home after a busy day in the city.  It was really peaceful and relaxing to wake up in the morning and have time to chill out at the end of day.,0,0.9833,Positive
