95.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,94.0,0,1.7596080473216853,4.94,4.82,5.0,4.94,1449703603348267279,"il soggiorno è stato bellissimo, ci siamo sentiti a casa.<br/>L'appartamento era bello e pulito situato in una zona molto viva con tanti ristoranti.<br/>Dall' appartamento è facile arrivare in tutte le zone della città perché è collegata molto bene con i mezzi pubblici.<br/>Ritorneremo sicuramente, è stato molto piacevole",1,0.0,Neutral
57.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,100.0,0,7.870594618965426,5.0,4.93,4.87,5.0,1378376203656842984,"Eine sehr schöne, gemütliche Unterkunft  von einer sehr sympathischen Vermieterin, die mich/ uns gleich willkommen geheißen hat. Unkomplizierter Check-in und Absprachen immer möglich. Jederzeit gerne wieder, ich kann sie nur empfehlen.",1,-0.5994,Negative
136.0,9,3.0,3.0,6.0,21,100.0,1,7.111156242440419,4.76,4.77,4.56,4.63,15472852,"appartement type ""basement"" très bien arrangé, confortable, particulièrement propre et bien équipé. Moabit est un excellent emplacement pour circuler facilement (tram et métro à 5mn à pied) et rayonner dans Berlin, tout en ayant une base berlinoise paisible et peu touristique. Il est facile de se garer à proximité, un supermarché est à 10 mn à pied et plusieurs restaurants très agréables de l'autre côté du parc. Très bien pour 6 personnes- trois chambres avec grand lit, trois salles de bains- parfait pour 4! Oliver est accueillant et flexible, très réactif si nécessaire. Une adresse à recommander!",0,0.8264,Positive
118.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,18,93.0,0,2.315150552188887,4.79,4.73,4.74,4.68,16821725,appartement calme et bien situé si vous souhaitez découvrir Berlin,1,0.0,Neutral
93.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,2.54678149398414,4.86,4.96,4.9,4.84,3187735,"Barbara's apartment was a real gem of a find. It was a stunning apartment and the facilities were fantastic from the great coffee machine to outstanding shower! The location felt safe and family friendly. There was a convenient shop around the corner and the M4 tram was a three minute walk away and only three stops to Alexanderplatz. There were some really nice restaurants within walking distance for dinner and we found a great place for brunch only a short distance away, near the tram stop. All in all we had a very comfortable stay and I would highly recommend this apartment to couples wishing to explore Berlin!",1,0.9869,Positive
76.0,2,0.0,1.0,2.0,31,100.0,1,30.07519231666693,4.94,4.89,4.86,4.73,18924370,"Liebevoll eingerichtetes Häuschen mit zwei gemütlichen Aussensitzmöglichkeiten.Schöner Naturgarten.Absolut ruhige Lage mit guter Anbindung Bus und S-Bahn nach Berlin-Zentrum.Guter Ausgangspunkt für Radtouren.<br/>Aufmerksame Gastgeberin,die super Tips für Ausflüge bei jeder Wetterlage hat.<br/>Wir waren das 2.Mal dort:wir kommen wieder!",1,0.636,Positive
86.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,49,60.0,0,2.4543435377505323,5.0,4.8,5.0,4.88,571095790145654819,"Eine schöne Wohnung mitten im Prenzlauerberg in einer unschlagbaren Gegend. Viele tolle Restaurants und Cafes! <br/>Die Katze Momo ist uns sehr ans Herz gewachsen. Sie ist super süss und leicht zu pflegen. <br/>Für einen längeren Aufenthalt hätten wir uns etwas mehr Stauraum (Schrank, Kühlschrank etc.) für eigene Sachen gewünscht.",1,0.636,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,0,11.888855781298028,4.79,5.0,4.94,4.85,30524996,"My friend and I are extremely lucky to have found Nino and her apartment! Her place is fantastic, great location for shopping and easy access to all public transport. The apartment is large and very cosy with beautiful artwork and a nice balcony to relax on! Nino is so thoughtful  and welcoming and even though we were unable to meet her in person, we were warmly welcomed by her kindly assistant, Maria. I would highly recommend this place to make your trip to Berlin that extra bit special :) Thanks Nino and Maria!",1,0.9945,Positive
