156.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,38,100.0,0,8.696897547515768,4.6,4.56,4.67,4.4,586909089632830722,"Andrea’s apartment is a great place to stay, especially traveling solo. It’s the perfect size to feel like a home away from hone, very clean, and is super acccesibke from the major public transportation options. Check-in and all communication with Andreas was super easy as I landed in Berlin.",1,0.975,Positive
161.0,7,1.0,1.0,3.0,38,90.0,0,1.6132440005466837,4.58,4.54,4.87,4.44,321378,amazing place and area. Would love to come back:-),1,0.8402,Positive
80.0,2,2.0,1.5,2.0,40,100.0,1,25.8764478220504,4.96,4.97,4.87,4.92,8977531,"English<br/><br/>Best vacation in Friedrichshagen! Silke and Carsten were very nice. They gave us tipps and invited us to have breakfast with them. The two rooms were clean and cosy. The place was very close to the lake, restaurants and Cafés. Everything was just perfect!<br/>--<br/>Deutsch <br/><br/>Alles, was man im Urlaub sich wünschen kann. Besser kann nicht sein.<br/>Die beide Zimmer waren sehr sauber und gemütlich. Man fühlte sich wie zu Hause. Der Strand und Restraurants waren sehr leicht erreichbar.<br/>Silke und Carsten sind sehr offen, flexibel und hilfsbereit. Sie haben sehr gute Tipps gegeben und für uns einen Frühstück mit Liebe vorbereitet. Wir haben eine sehr schöne Unterhaltung über alles mögliche gehabt. Nur weiter zu empfehlen!<br/>Ich werde selber gerne wieder mal da sein!",1,0.8924,Positive
163.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,3.126230216762567,4.94,4.96,4.85,4.82,22696188,We really enjoyed our stay at Babett's place.  The location is ideal for being able to walk to all the best sightseeing places.  There are several nice restaurants and a grocery store minutes away.  The place has everything you need for a great stay.,1,0.9589,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,49,100.0,1,10.214455278207549,4.91,4.89,4.86,4.92,40463858,"Very friendly and welcoming host. The apartment is tidy, it offers all necessary anemnities and it is located very close to S-bahn stop, so it is very easy to explore Berlin",1,0.8248,Positive
114.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,6,100.0,0,8.651346416991275,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,1417313896941047094,"Meine Eltern haben in der Wohnung übernachtet und waren rundum zufrieden. Alles war sehr sauber, und die Wohnung ist mit allem ausgestattet, was man für einen angenehmen Aufenthalt braucht. Ich kann die Unterkunft auf jeden Fall weiterempfehlen😊👍🏼",1,-0.9136,Negative
343.0,12,4.0,1.5,8.0,41,97.0,0,1.9889741213247012,4.41,4.28,4.8,4.36,662252642803259249,We only had the chance to sleep a few hours in the appartement because of our flight delay but we slept very well ;),0,0.6915,Positive
157.0,6,2.0,1.5,4.0,49,100.0,1,10.421396544921482,4.67,4.71,4.7,4.58,12044871,"Lovely apartment with easy travel into the city centre. Sören and Elisabeth were very welcoming and made us feel at home with fresh flowers and drinks in the fridge. The apartment was very clean and comfortable, thank you for a lovely stay!",0,0.976,Positive
69.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,6.409080116623725,4.8,4.78,4.86,4.75,24216126,Very good location. The apartment was nice: clean and cosy. Everything was great!,1,0.9199,Positive
180.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,45,85.0,0,1.5095289909770313,4.75,4.84,4.9,4.6,45475252,"Would really recommend Numa! <br/>Very quick to respond to messages and very helpful. Check in was quick and easy and so was check out. <br/>The room did look a bit different from the photos but it was beautiful regardless. Very spacious, was spotlessly clean and the bed was very comfy. <br/>The location is very central and the train station was only a 5 minute walk. Lots of shops and restaurants close by too. <br/>The only thing we didn’t like was that the building itself was very warm, but this isn’t too major just a bit uncomfortable at times when leaving the room to use the elevator to get outside ! <br/>Overall would definitely stay here again we had a great time !",1,0.9809,Positive
65.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,4.1903954031521735,4.75,4.86,4.65,4.65,499342,Everything was great! Awesome having a location so close to the U6 line - made travel around the city very easy. Everything was exactly as advertised.,1,0.9133,Positive
112.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,1,1.850891633131909,4.81,4.71,4.95,4.72,1205350,"El departamento es muy cómodo y cuenta con lo necesario para pasar una buena estancia. los 02 cuartos tienen camas grandes dobles, 01 mueble y dónde dejar la ropa. cuenta con un buen comedor donde cenar, una cocina con lo necesario y un ambiente de sala donde está la TV. a 5 minutos tienes un supermarker y a menos de 5 varios restaurantes. El metro está a 6 minutos y la M a 3.",1,0.0,Neutral
160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,87.0,0,3.4802565088356308,4.54,4.54,4.6,4.41,43798011,"Cosy place, quiet room, conveniently located, amenities easy to use, enjoyed our stay very much.",1,0.7351,Positive
114.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,1,3.268352166045826,4.8,4.74,4.89,4.71,11294240,Ellen's place is a quiet haven. There is hustle and bustle on your door step but the apartment is set back enough for you to enjoy some down time. Great bakery very close by (cinnamon pastries that are great) many different tram bus and underground situated close by. Blackbeards - an awesome bbq place just a short walk away. Ellen was really nice and quick to reply so it made things really easy!,1,0.9805,Positive
111.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,51,100.0,1,3.4156959509415743,4.85,4.89,4.82,4.77,14804266,"Tolle Wohnung für heiße Sommertage, schön gelegen mit Ausblick auf einen  Innenhof mit vielen Grünpflanzen. Der Luftentfeuchter sorgte trotz der Lage und Wetter für eine gute Raumluft, die Ausstattung war wie beschrieben. Wir können die Wohnung auf jeden Fall empfehlen!",1,-0.9184,Negative
