72.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,5.825548473567008,4.94,4.97,4.93,4.79,1050134327804232834,"Rafael is such a wonderful host! He greeted us when we arrived and even made us coffee every morning. His place is clean, big and has comfortable bed. He is very respectful of us.<br/>The place is like 5-7 minutes walk from U5 line which.",1,0.9508,Positive
64.0,5,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,5.604846490618774,4.87,4.73,4.71,4.81,4981709,"Thanks Christos for taking good care of us, and providing us with such a lovely and clean apartment. He is indeed a thoughtful and nice host. Also, the location is very convenient. There are several bus stops close by, and lots of popular coffee shops and bakeries are just by 10minutes walk. We really have a great time staying at Christos' place. <br/>Highly recommend :-)",1,0.9838,Positive
175.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,16,89.0,0,3.210467911644057,4.5,4.59,4.68,4.52,26808026,"Excelente ubicación, cerca a 5 minutos caminando de la estación de tren. Amplio espacio, camas confortables y una limpieza impecable. La comunicación con el anfitrión fue ágil y rápida, ademas Zachar estuvo disponible para solventar cualquier inconveniente, tuvimos un pequeño problema eléctrico por nuestra culpa e inmediatamente nos solucionó. Lo recomiendo sin dudarlo.",1,-0.5574,Negative
137.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,1.189406824976013,4.86,4.84,4.93,4.79,264459,"Hosts were communicative from the beginning. The entry instructions were detailed and helpful. Unit was tidy, spacious and very quiet. The bowl of tangerines was a thoughtful and welcoming treat. The kitchen had everything I needed. Hot water on demand is a nice modern touch in this quaint historical building. The neighborhood is lively but also residential, so it was a pleasant contrast after spending the first part of my stay near the Zoo. Walkable to U, supermarket, apothecary, and other conveniences, and close to trendy boutiques and restaurants as well. I wouldn’t hesitate to stay here again.",1,0.9177,Positive
