145.0,3,1.0,1.0,3.0,21,97.0,1,1.9977573269292777,4.75,4.74,4.76,4.68,36038064,The hotel is in a great location for exploring Berlin with a tram stop right outside linking you to the city's fantastic public transport system as well Berlin Airport. Having Prenzlauer Berg on the doorstep also means there are lots of great places to eat and drink just a short walk away. The room in the inner courtyard was spacious and peacefull and everything was spotlessly clean and the beds very comfortable. The hotel staff were very friendly and helpful and we will definitely book a room here again next time we visit Berlin.,1,0.9804,Positive
85.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,4.812972415804947,4.72,4.64,4.75,4.69,16050858,"Gals place was awesome, it is in a really cool neighbourhood, the building is really safe and quiet but has fun night life just right round the corner. Everything was as Gal said it would be and looks even better than the pictures ! Gal was really great and communicating, answering any of my questions within minutes! Highly recommend this as a base to explore Berlin ! Thanks so much",1,0.9838,Positive
