207.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,58,100.0,1,2.222288195756644,4.89,4.97,4.93,4.73,11031031,"This is a fantastic place to stay. Unusual self contained house. Imaginatively designed and beautifully presented. It was spotless with some lovely extras, umbrellas, iPad, maps, drinks etc<br/>Julius responds immediately to any queries. <br/>Location is very handy for tram to centre but an interesting neighbourhood in it’s own right. <br/>I would recommend it highly.",1,0.9161,Positive
