183.0,6,3.0,2.0,6.0,27,100.0,1,3.076790657455092,4.76,4.74,4.82,4.57,8068061,Great spacious loft space.  Communication was great with the host.  The decor is nice with real live plants.  The showers are great!<br/>We enjoyed our stay here.  A few notes:  the wood floor creaks very loudly with every step.  WiFi is very slow.  Up two flights of stairs with luggage.,0,0.9392,Positive
