106.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,1,4.255037723745734,4.87,4.86,4.88,4.75,42486058,Great location and easily able to walk to many of the tourist attractions. Clean space and Patrick was always available to respond!,1,0.906,Positive
232.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,36,100.0,1,4.6007891860802905,4.91,4.88,4.88,4.82,1260623860135528737,"It was a pleasure to stay at Natasha's place. She was incredibly welcoming, helpful with local recommendations and flexible about checkout times.<br/>The apartment is very nice, like in the pictures, however do note that it is on the ground floor next to the main entry for flats so: can be a little noisy, occasionally smells of smoke, not much natural light without sacrificing privacy. If don't mind these, things, it's a great spot with lots near by and a comfortable AirBnb!<br/>Some highlights: Knodelwirtschaft (cute restaurant), La Maison (Cafe), Burgermeister (Burgers under a bridge), Fuchsbau/Fuk;s Bar (nice bars)",0,0.9717,Positive
195.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,23,100.0,1,2.8219601407887955,4.85,4.97,4.97,4.75,16920274,"Berlin is such a great city but wear comfortable shoes!! However Axels apartment is 2 mins from Checkpoint Charlie and a great base to explore the city with an underwound station which links the city or walkable for so much of the city! It also has plenty in the surrounding neighborhood for after along day out exploring, whether its for a shop or restaurant/bar!!",0,0.9415,Positive
190.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,0.0,0,1.5458160159782743,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,33102204,"Sehr saubere, moderne, schöne Wohnung. <br/>Perfekt ausgestattet - hier gibt's wirklich alles, was man braucht.<br/>In bester Lage mitten in belebter Straße mit vielen Restaurants.<br/>Die zwei Balkons sind auch praktisch: Einen zur Straße hin, mitten im Stadtgeschehen oder ruhiger zum Hinterhof.<br/>Die Kommunikation mit Marie war sehr freundlich, alles war super erklärt und wir konnten etwas flexibler aus- & einchecken.<br/>Gerne wieder!",1,-0.636,Negative
142.0,2,1.0,0.0,1.0,6,95.0,0,4.132479101551235,4.87,4.87,4.8,4.8,1208429826048762130,war super,1,0.0,Neutral
186.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,1.9612069952106024,4.95,4.96,4.96,4.79,588812803263378732,"A wonderful apartment in the most wonderful area of Berlin. Clean, comfortable, beautiful. Absolutely loved the specialty coffee shop downstairs and how close a lot of great restaurants are. Loved the parks nearby! Really A GREAT place to stay.",1,0.989,Positive
120.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,46,100.0,1,9.29605165579442,4.73,4.85,4.66,4.6,3047076,"Fai was a wonderful host, excellent and immediate communication via phone and email. Fais knowledge was so helpful. Quiet, leafy suburb, with close subway access. Very clean apartment, we loved our stay! Thank you Fai.",1,0.967,Positive
