163.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,3.126230216762567,4.94,4.96,4.85,4.82,22696188,"Great location central to Berlin and the metro nearby. Can walk to the canal and shops. Clean, comfortable and spacious bathroom, as well as easy and flexible check in. Comfortable bed and amazing shower. Well heated if visiting in winter. Overall I give this my highest recommendation would definitely stay again.",1,0.9796,Positive
