100.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,25,100.0,0,2.719636652879703,4.66,4.54,4.89,4.51,851458418244863960,Wir waren drei Nächte (2 Erwachsene  und 2 Kleinkinder) in der Unterkunft!<br/>Wir waren sehr zufrieden und alles war ideal (von Lage bis Ausstattung).<br/>Unterkunft war einfach zufinden und unkomplizierter / flexibeler check in/out.<br/>Kommunikation war sehr freundlich und schnell.<br/>Wir würden wiederkommen!,1,-0.8715,Negative
158.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,1,1.6592287277224604,4.94,4.96,4.92,4.77,39476966,"Sehr schönes Apartment in toller Lage. Easy Check-In, super sauber und auch Home Office geeignet. Nur zu empfehlen!",1,0.7959,Positive
84.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,99.0,0,4.419444752873446,4.6,4.53,4.47,4.3,35107959,"Eine sehr gute Kommunikation mit den Gastgebern, flexibler Check-In / Check-Out und es war alles da, was man braucht und wie es beschrieben ist. Die Wohnung befindet sich außerdem in einer tollen Lage - und dennoch ist es ruhig.. das war wirklich perfekt für Berlin! Ohne Zögern weiterzuempfehlen :) Danke!",1,-0.8829,Negative
405.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,59,100.0,1,2.439533040276054,4.94,4.93,4.97,4.77,19455026,"We enjoyed our stay at Stephan’s. Great location near cafes, restaurants, parks, and playgrounds. He was very accommodating with our toddler and baby by providing us what we needed.",0,0.8126,Positive
60.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,34,100.0,0,10.254583956104748,4.95,4.95,4.81,4.81,730305380045848208,"Lejligheden var super passende, og virkelig hyggeligt altan område! Virkelig en stor lejlighed og gode faciliteter for pengene. Johnny har været super hjælpsom undervejs, og har responderet hurtigt på vores spørgsmål, og man følte sig hjemme i lejligheden. Alt i alt et super dejligt ophold, vi kan kun anbefale at vælge Johnny som vært!<br/>Mange tak for denne gang🫶🏻",1,0.9229,Positive
68.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,28,100.0,1,6.576517854147013,4.72,4.76,4.31,4.63,36310980,"Bedankt Volker voor jouw communicatie en flexibiliteit. We hebben een geweldig logement gehad, we hadden alles wat nodig was. Goede uitleg, proper, ideale ligging. We raden dit zeker aan!",1,0.0,Neutral
95.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,0,0.7915420818247044,4.76,4.6,4.91,4.68,20205689,Tivemos uma estadia perfeita. Gostamos de tudo e recomendamos muito.,1,0.0,Neutral
268.0,8,3.0,1.0,5.0,49,100.0,0,10.771712194609956,4.93,4.93,4.85,4.85,1312146866258567317,"A lovely flat within walking distance of the bus and U3 or U7 train station. Comfortable large bedrooms and sitting room for all of us. We found the kitchen a little small to cater for five people. However, the whole place was immaculate and well maintained. A convenient little spot.",0,0.8481,Positive
84.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,1,3.2375488184892025,4.89,4.92,4.88,4.83,41651093,"All good, nice place as described. Clear communication.",1,0.8074,Positive
159.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,37,99.0,0,1.8467161104240724,4.73,4.79,4.67,4.51,45230697,"We really enjoyed our stay here. The place was very clean and tidy and location wise it’s amazing.<br/>The hosts communication was first class, quick responses and helpful guidance and advice.<br/>Overall  a very pleasant and good value for money stay and I would definitely consider staying here again were I to revisit Berlin!",1,0.974,Positive
54.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,11,100.0,1,5.259652982108338,4.82,4.9,4.9,4.81,2657671,"De zoon heeft ons hartelijk verwelkomd.  Er is overigens geen lift. De locatie was heel fijn. Ivo heeft ons ook tips gegeven. Veel eettentjes, winkels en barretjes op loopafstand. Het bed lag erg comfortabel. Metro/tram/bus ook in de buurt. Veel kunnen zien!",1,-0.4003,Negative
164.0,4,2.0,2.0,2.0,39,100.0,0,12.414028736491655,4.45,4.73,4.6,4.33,633244035489321026,"Mooi appartement, schoon, lekkere bedden, fijn met 2 wc's!",0,0.0,Neutral
292.0,5,1.0,1.0,2.0,61,100.0,1,3.40855932802134,4.95,4.92,4.94,4.81,699645357510342618,"Nice place, good communication.",0,0.6908,Positive
172.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,30,100.0,1,2.086859632126843,4.87,4.87,4.94,4.71,306312,"We very much enjoyed our stay. Berlin and especially Prenzlauer Berg offers much for a family with a small kid. There are many parks and playgrounds and welcoming people everywhere. And when he was asleep, so much art and history to explore...<br/><br/>The hosts provided us with a baby bed and a baby chair, which was much appreciated as we arrived by train and couldn't bring our own. There were also toys and children's books. Both Michel and Martyna (who was there for the check-in) were helpful and responsive to our questions.<br/><br/>The flat is as nice as it looks on the photos, with high ceilings and windows. It is also surprisingly quiet during the night, given its central location. The kitchen with the big stove invites you to cook, but unfortunately some essential tools (like a sharpened knife or a cutting board) are missing. <br/><br/>We also enjoyed relaxing on the sofa and watching ""Das Leben der Anderen"" so close to where it all happened.<br/><br/>A memorable experience.",1,0.9195,Positive
56.0,2,0.0,1.0,0.0,23,100.0,1,32.45887684923342,4.86,4.83,4.77,4.77,29093185,"Ich habe mich in dem Apartment sehr wohl gefühlt. Jürgen hat mich trotz Abwesenheit super begleitet, angeleitet wie alles funktioniert und oft nachgefragt ob alles in Ordnung ist. Sehr freundlich!<br/>Die Lage ist traumhaft! <br/>Alles in allem absolut zu empfehlen!",1,0.6981,Positive
107.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,33,100.0,1,12.260182751072744,4.96,4.98,4.88,4.84,22500999,Alles bestens <br/>Mit freundlichen Grüßen,1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,0,3.7734531221410665,4.57,4.6,4.43,4.43,710977502962241092,"This was a great place to stay for my few days in Berlin! The hosts were very nice, accomodating and responsive, especially regarding the check in and check out time. It’s very conveniently located (easy to get around Berlin on public transport and close to supermarkets) and the space was very comfy. It was also easy for me to get to the airport the day I left. I would definitely stay here again :)",1,0.9558,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,51,100.0,0,2.752311422367908,4.91,4.95,4.85,4.9,8385590,"Es war ein suuuper Wochenende. Es hat alles gepasst. Die Fotos bei Airbnb geben leider nicht wieder wie groß das das Zimmer und die Wohnung wirklich ist. Wir waren echt überrascht wie es dann in der Realität ist, und haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt.<br/>Ich persönlich war ein bisschen skeptisch was Berlin und Lautstärke anbelangt, aber meine Zweifel sind komplett widerlegt worden. Berlin, aber vor allem Perzlaueberg hat mir besonders gut gefallenen. In unserem Zimmer war es sogar möglich mit offenem Fester zu schlafen. Es war kaum ein Laut zu hören <br/>In der Nähe gibt es viele Restaurants, kleine Kneipen und total nette Leute.<br/>Gefrühstückt haben wir bei Butter. So ein Hammer Früstücksbuffet zu einem durchaus erschwinglichen Preis, hatten wir nicht erwartet. Zu Fuß von Karsten ca. 5 Minuten.  <br/>Leider haben wir nicht alles geschafft was wir schaffen wollten, und haben schon geplant wieder zu kommen.",1,-0.9761,Negative
89.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,1,2.217878053387896,4.84,4.68,4.97,4.77,1306679,"Katja's place was perfect for us, well equipped, quiet and comfortable, with personal atmosphere and very clean. We liked all the creative details in the apartment. Close to all kinds of interesting places, nice restaurants and public transport. I can highly recommend it. Thanks!",1,0.9814,Positive
112.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,1,1.850891633131909,4.81,4.71,4.95,4.72,1205350,"The appartement was very nice, and our welcome by Marina very welcome. The beds are big and provided a good sleep. This place is recommended. ",1,0.9152,Positive
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,53,100.0,0,9.35505398845462,4.77,4.37,4.63,4.46,497576921519560778,"Perfekte Kommunikation,<br/>schöne, helle Wohnung, <br/>gerne wieder!",1,0.0,Neutral
78.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,5.617774919601161,4.79,4.64,4.93,4.7,40663815,"Really great place, especially if you are working remotely. Me and my boyfriend both worked and there are 2 desks, which is really nice! also the kitchen is completely seperate from the room with desks so if you both have calls at the same time, one can go in the other room. the place is also clean and close to a strip with many things to do. and easy to get other places in the city too. also Daniela's helpfulness is one of the reasons I first loved airbnb - you feel like you have someone to help you in a city that you dont live in. thanks again!",1,0.9728,Positive
108.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,1,3.72790372586266,4.86,4.95,4.88,4.64,54088100,"I really enjoyed our lovely stay. It was very clean and in an lovely part of town. Quiet but well connected. I didn't realise it was one bedroom, I thought it was two, but I should have looked more closely at the description. But it did say two bedrooms which it isn't. It is one bedroom with a sofa bed. It would be better to advertise that as one bedroom, because I wanted two bedrooms. But it was lovely and perfect for a couple visiting. I was going with a friend so we it didn't quite work out. Lovely place, highly recommended. Thanks so much guys!",1,0.9926,Positive
60.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,3,0.0,0,6.018412425299548,5.0,4.86,4.86,5.0,990284346492492687,"I can only recommend this place as we received a warm welcome from the neighbour and had a really nice conversation with the hosts! I must also remark how flexible they were, even after we accidentally locked them out of the flat:(( they made us feel very comfy. The surroundings and whole Pankow district is beautiful, safe and very peaceful. The room is super cool, exactly as in the photos. If you're looking for peaceful and enjoyable accomodation in Berlin with cute hosts, this is it:)",1,0.9874,Positive
81.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,54,100.0,1,11.098231074049592,4.93,4.9,4.71,4.83,6253378,Anke’s Gartenhaus is incredibly chic and cozy. The house is outstandingly clean and Anke provides all necessities such as towels and even coffee in the furnished kitchen. The terrace is great for breakfasts and dinners outside the house. A parking place is available just in front of the house. Berlin city center is approximately 30 minutes by car. <br/>Our first choice when coming to Berlin.,0,0.8479,Positive
125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,19,100.0,0,9.40806481603953,4.57,3.43,4.86,4.71,31429500,Alex was a super nice host and we really enjoyed staying at his place!,1,0.8906,Positive
142.0,4,2.0,2.0,2.0,19,100.0,1,6.608155925105233,4.83,4.94,4.85,4.76,10423394,"Świetna miejscówka dla 4 osób. Wszędzie blisko, na dobrą sprawę można nie korzystać z komunikacji miejskiej. Pomimo, że okna wychodzą na tory kolejki S-Bahn, wewnątrz jest dość cicho.<br/>Kuchnia i łazienka są w pełni wyposażone, pod domem sklepy czynne niemal do północy. Zdecydowanie nie należy szukać innego mieszkania ;)<br/>Komunikacja z Gospodarzem ekspresowa. Dziękuję za dokładny przewodnik w sprawie kluczy i korzystania z mieszkania :)",1,0.4588,Positive
153.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,23,80.0,1,2.4380512619709767,4.32,4.44,4.87,4.3,22556872,"De locatie is uitstekend, <br/>‘s avonds is het lekker stil en toch ben je middenin deze bruisende stad!",1,0.0,Neutral
93.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,0,4.723280081352296,4.85,4.56,4.97,4.72,16106983,"I had a wonderful stay at this cozy apartment/music studio. It was incredibly comfortable and had everything I needed - and even more! The space was clean, well-maintained, and thoughtfully set up. Communication with the host was smooth and pleasant throughout. Highly recommend this place for anyone looking for a unique and relaxing stay.",1,0.9693,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,14,100.0,0,4.602419946126587,4.37,4.3,4.59,4.44,26195084,Fine stay,1,0.2023,Positive
54.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,1,8.127615937955055,4.91,4.95,4.86,4.9,22779598,Tina's place was lovely.  Very spacious with our own bathroom.  Tina was very helpful and enabled us to check in early since we had arrived on the  overnight train.  The area is well located and easy to get around Berlin. Thank you so much for a  wonderful stay.,1,0.9542,Positive
110.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,2.990654359868407,4.86,4.94,4.94,4.78,1165227481829107407,"Vriendelijke, correcte en rustige hosts. Zelfs bij deze situatie waarbij de gast een woning deelt is er sprake van privacy en discretie. De kamer en badkamer zijn modern, zeer ruim en brandschoon. De locatie aan een binnenplaats net achter Unter den Linden maakt het bijzonder stil. Bezienswaardigheden en opera Unter den Linden op loopafstand. Buurt is eerder een zaken- en toeristendistrict dan een gezellige woonlocatie maar er zijn wel winkels en een paar restaurants aanwezig. Al met al een zeer positieve ervaring en aanrader!",1,0.0,Neutral
82.0,6,2.0,1.0,5.0,36,100.0,1,3.791871473476199,4.83,4.85,4.72,4.62,984537669074342349,The apartment was great and very adequate in a quieter area. We had a great stay! Thank you.,0,0.9214,Positive
45.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,39,100.0,1,11.72366309400778,4.81,4.91,4.84,4.83,763695986682521907,"Super zentral gelegen, aber trotzdem ruhig. Das Schlafzimmer hat ein Fenster zum Innenhof, deswegen hört man selbst die S-Bahn nicht. Super sauber, nur so richtig kochen könnte man nicht, aber das wollte ich auch nicht. Komme gerne wieder!",1,0.636,Positive
82.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,5.189340223814515,4.79,4.85,4.83,4.69,1033506,Lage und Anbindung topp. Gastgeber flexibel und unkompliziert. Wir kommen wieder!,1,0.0,Neutral
167.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,0,4.149945021768397,4.93,4.88,4.89,4.74,701909,"Once again, Lorant went out of his way to accommodate us.  We had many last minute changes on our end, and Lorant was understanding and willing to work with us despite many frustrating last minute travel glitches.  Thank you Lorant for being professional, understanding, and as always a remarkable host.<br/>",1,0.8179,Positive
51.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,13.650008312470083,4.98,4.95,4.93,4.91,1185916,"Vielen Dank Andrea, für die unkomplizierte und tolle Kommunikation und das super schöne Zimmer!! Ich komme immer gerne wieder!!!",1,0.0,Neutral
94.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,95.0,1,4.513443039819955,4.61,4.31,4.75,4.57,53961297,Slight issues with the flat but extremely helpful and accommodating host. Thank you Simon,1,0.8121,Positive
95.0,4,1.0,1.5,3.0,27,100.0,1,4.764454384817103,4.59,4.62,4.86,4.58,11414934,"lovely apartment,very centrally located and has great access to public transport,had all the amenities a person might need",1,0.836,Positive
107.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,36,100.0,0,6.609127265569619,4.72,4.5,4.72,4.65,29412907,Ich würde sie wieder buchen. :),1,0.4588,Positive
110.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,61,100.0,1,9.348496837727636,4.98,5.0,4.83,4.83,21252188,"Norbert is the most kind and welcoming host we have met, very helpful and great to talk with. The apartment is very stylish, but comfortable and cosy at same time, you will feel like at home here. Great sound system and a balcony are a nice touch. Located close to U-Bahn and many shops and cafes, but in quiet neighborhood. Highly recommended.",1,0.9822,Positive
92.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,40.0,0,12.251616094708163,4.97,4.94,4.5,4.82,644774900799592854,"Sonja war wirklich sehr nett und wir haben uns gleich wie zu Hause gefühlt. Check-In ohne Probleme auch erst gegen späten Abend, alles war sehr sauber und ruhig. Späti und Edeka auch direkt um die Ecke, wirklich super!! Gerne wieder 👍🏽",1,-0.855,Negative
95.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,3.1833669854420146,4.83,4.85,4.8,4.58,34018418,"This was a return visit, as I had liked the apartment a lot the first time. It is a lovely place, with a very straightforward check-in and check-out. Communication was super clear and quick. The apartment is very nicely laid out, uncluttered, and well cleaned. It is a really good base for a stay in Berlin.",1,0.9665,Positive
241.0,6,3.0,1.0,4.0,52,100.0,1,1.3558603428081426,4.87,4.91,4.78,4.74,13761071,Nice place in a great location. Sven is a professional and helpful host!,0,0.8748,Positive
92.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,1,5.105742401111265,4.8,4.8,4.59,4.69,1193945628745797461,"The apartment is pretty and everything was very clean when we arrived. Apartment itself is quite small but the way it's organized makes it feel more spacious and was perfect for 4 people. Public transport is near which is a huge plus. <br/>Overall Emil is a very good host, gave us all the necessary information and replied to our questions quickly.",1,0.9467,Positive
125.0,1,1.0,1.0,2.0,17,100.0,0,13.14247823414207,4.5,4.88,4.88,4.63,40996550,"Schöne Wohnung, Ruhig und netter Host.",1,0.0,Neutral
