79.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,0,4.208631273050765,4.9,4.95,4.89,4.8,37120573,"Tolle Lage,  liebevoll und geschmackvoll  eingerichtete  und vor allem sehr saubere Wohnung. Die Gastgeberin ist sehr nett, jederzeit erreichbar und hilfsbereit. Absolut empfehlenswert!",1,-0.636,Negative
54.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,7.403263725526816,4.91,4.92,4.78,4.85,23477057,Beautiful and modern home with a really nice shower. Great place to stay if you love plants~,1,0.9482,Positive
331.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,51,100.0,1,7.683285698768541,5.0,5.0,5.0,4.89,774545815451647072,"Claas has a beautiful home that was in an amazing area of Berlin. We loved the orchids, plants, the balcony and all of the love and charm of the space. It was a cozy home away from home for our time in Berlin. Highly recommended!!",1,0.9689,Positive
