77.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,17,100.0,0,4.41582610173911,4.45,4.2,4.7,4.48,7905519,"Worth the money, great location. Lady was lovely on check in. Floor and sofa could have been cleaner and a proper curtain in bedroom could be a good idea.",1,0.9246,Positive
143.0,6,1.0,1.0,3.0,35,93.0,0,14.44165293547941,4.73,4.86,4.82,4.74,1094597524537374236,"Die Wohnung ist sehr schön und hell, die S Bahn Station nur ca. 200 m entfernt. Ein Supermarkt für kleinere Einkäufe ist wenige Minuten entfernt, Bäckereien sind in unmittelbarer Nähe. Für das Türschloss benötigt man eine App und der Motor hat mehrmals blockiert. Es war aber jederzeit jemand erreichbar und das Problem wurde immer innerhalb von wenigen Minuten behoben.",1,-0.9638,Negative
76.0,2,0.0,3.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,3.016097343290094,4.91,4.84,4.95,4.78,44384926,Very nice place with good location! I would definitely visit again!,1,0.851,Positive
194.0,5,2.0,1.5,3.0,26,100.0,1,3.829066431977836,4.77,4.83,4.84,4.64,19395636,"This is a lovely, spacious apartment with high ceilings in an old building within a courtyard. There are 2 good sized bedrooms and a single bed/day bed in the living area. It's very well furnished with good facilities. The location is very convenient, an easy walk to the centre and the many museums and sights of interest, lots of good restaurants and food shops nearby, and a few metres from the U station. Would certainly recommend Naomi's apartment,",0,0.9749,Positive
137.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,1,3.131262585603502,4.64,4.67,4.85,4.59,68448,Great location and great value. Cannot go wrong with this place.,1,0.921,Positive
160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,98.0,0,1.0407544919436775,4.54,4.66,4.77,4.45,34294913,"Insgesamt hatten wir einen guten Aufenthalt in dem Appartement.<br/>Die Lage in Mitte ist natürlich großartig, wo es in der näheren Umgebung an nichts mangelt und man relativ schnell zu seinen Zielen kommt. <br/>Ein Kritikpunkt ist, dass die Angaben auf dem Inserat etwas irritierend waren. Aufgrund der Bilder bin ich davon ausgegangen, dass es sich um zwei Einzelzimmer handeln würde. Auch die Tatsache mit den zwei Betten ist so nicht richtig, da eines eher als Schlafcouch einzuordnen ist. Und für die Größe des Appartements war der Preis nicht gerechtfertigt.",1,-0.9485,Negative
85.0,2,0.0,1.0,2.0,15,96.0,1,6.570866710297928,4.82,4.73,4.83,4.74,25063152,"Sehr gute Lage. U-Bahn in der Nähe. Diverse Restaurants im Quartier. Der Markt, jeweils Samstags, ist ein Highlight.",1,0.34,Positive
60.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,20,93.0,0,4.065511825937199,4.59,4.63,4.4,4.47,41422691,"Very friendly, safe, clean hotel / hostel.",1,0.8636,Positive
75.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,24,100.0,0,4.4202884323310805,4.3,4.36,4.58,4.4,23071933,"We had a great stay at Maik's apartment. The communication was clear, the apartment clean and easily big enough to host 4 people",1,0.8957,Positive
140.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,1,1.5130716954922565,4.89,4.91,4.94,4.75,2394897,"Welcomed by hosts friend.<br/>Description of the apartment very accurate, perfect location, would  reccommend the apartment without hesitation<br/>Had a wonderful few days in Berlin",1,0.8123,Positive
82.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,6.919397234051426,4.85,4.87,4.48,4.72,20881101,"Great location for a short trip in Berlin. Really, clean, well equipped ! The communication with Stephan was smooth. <br/>The location is a bit far from the Ubahn and Sbahn but really easy to catch up by bus.<br/>I highly recommend this place !",1,0.93,Positive
190.0,2,0.0,1.0,0.0,19,50.0,1,4.793511063678072,4.56,4.2,4.7,4.4,40335581,Super cool and stylish apartment in a great location! It was perfect for my weekend in Berlin. Everything was clean and I loved the design features. Nouri was also super friendly and helpful :),1,0.987,Positive
30.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,10.0,0,4.566149972406102,4.54,4.65,4.7,4.7,39560057,"Hadde et veldig fint opphold her:) kommer gjerne igjen om muligheten tilbyr seg! Veldig gode muligheter når det gjelder restauranter, park og uteliv",1,0.0,Neutral
102.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,40,96.0,0,6.1770612336798365,4.56,4.49,4.84,4.38,27018635,"The apartment is nice, clean and very well located in Berlin (lot of nice restaurants, bars, shops at 5min walk +the metro to go to the center is direct). <br/>Unfortunately, we had a problem when we arrived and couldn't get in the apartment (wrong door code). Despite this problem, everything was great.",1,0.8553,Positive
118.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,18,93.0,0,2.315150552188887,4.79,4.73,4.74,4.68,16821725,"Lovely quirky apartment in a great location, walkable to centre- Museum Island, Brandenburg Gate etc.-  but also in a lively neighbourhood with lots of good restaurants and bars. For food lovers, Market Hall 9, also walkable, should be a must visit! We had a very comfortable and enjoyable stay with our teenage son.",1,0.9812,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,0,2.559692009773911,4.99,5.0,4.99,4.93,23442676,Stephan's apartment is the perfect place to stay in Berlin. The balcony has beautiful views and the location made it easy for us to travel about easily. It's a stunning apartment and Stephan was an amazing host. We hope to be back and would throughly recommend staying there.,1,0.9741,Positive
126.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,0,7.396661717518644,4.4,4.57,3.91,4.2,13742979,Came to Berlin for a long weekend as a group of friends. Thoroughly enjoyed our stay and the apartment is about a 5 minute walk from the closest train station. There were flight issues when we were leaving and we contacted the host to ask if we could stay longer- she was extremely helpful and allowed us to stay on a few more hours in the appartment!,1,0.8773,Positive
89.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,1,2.692024625165537,4.82,4.64,4.91,4.76,29383900,"I really enjoyed the neighborhood, wish I spent more time there! If you have time it’s very easy to get to and from the airport using trains. <br/>Uber cost $45 euro on the way home because I left at 4:30am. <br/>Her place is cozy, you share a bathroom but Birte is so nice. Bedroom is large and you have couches + Netflix to chill after tourism. There are plenty of nice bars, restaurants, cafes and parks right outside. Plus it’s super safe. <br/>Comfortable bed, secure building and you probably could use the kitchen if you wanted, but why when you can walk outside to eat. <br/>The room had a mini fridge and little desk area like a hotel almost. It’s quiet and I felt the value was great",1,0.9917,Positive
95.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,0,4.691964222849626,4.76,4.77,4.81,4.67,28168852,This place is super cosy and was the perfect location for me as I was visiting family nearby. We had a couple of issues as the host forgot to leave a towel out for me and I couldn't work out how to use the cooker - but she came the next day and sorted everything out. Then I discovered the toaster also didn't work but by that point I decided to just live with it! The bedding was v basic and the pillows not at all comfy - but all clean and in fitting with the very good value price. Overall a good basic spot for a short stay!,1,0.968,Positive
76.0,3,2.0,1.0,3.0,70,100.0,0,32.92405436352736,5.0,4.96,4.97,4.95,34589316,"What can I add to the others. Fantastic bungalow, private, and with kids the yard and use of different size bikes and canoes and sup boards was brilliant. Berlin was hot when we stayed, but the bungalow did not overheat -something us Finns used to the cold feared 😅. Overall, a perfect calm place close to wonderful beaches and the city, with convenient public transport. Overall a fantastic holiday that the kids and I absolutely enjoyed, and would love to come again! <br/>Ekke as a host was responsive and wonderful, despite my own challenges with phone numbers and 30 years old German. Things worked perfectly well in English, and Ekke's tips were spot on.<br/>We thoroughly recommend this for families of even teenagers!",1,0.9954,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,1,5.336391697711564,4.93,4.85,4.76,4.7,27288541,Die Unterkunft von Eugenia ist wundervoll und sehr schön eingerichtet! Wir fühlten uns sofort wie Zuhause. Die nächste U-Bahn ist 5min zu Fuss entfernt und es gibt tolle Bäckereien in der Nähe. Wir haben den Aufenthalt sehr genossen.,1,-0.8439,Negative
123.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,32,100.0,0,5.086004020180417,4.79,4.88,4.78,4.75,7543419,"It was a nice place, next to subway. Martin is very nice host and gave us all the support we needed. ",1,0.8074,Positive
108.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,36,100.0,0,3.590589217732416,4.72,4.57,4.76,4.64,24618866,"The space is small, but it's well thought out. We were here as two couples, and we didn't feel like we are stepping on each-other's toes.  Everything is clean, and you don't feel like you are in a makeshift apartment. We chose this apartment because it is located in a quiet area, and very well connected w.r.t. public transport - you are almost anywhere within 30mins!",1,0.5875,Positive
61.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,1,5.842565215322787,4.78,4.79,4.89,4.75,678929364897072061,Die Kommunikation mit Bülent vorab war super und er war sehr flexibel bezüglich der Ankunftszeit👍,1,-0.8316,Negative
55.0,1,1.0,1.0,2.0,11,100.0,0,2.74315317561708,4.9,4.86,5.0,4.9,4415891,"Tatjana is a warm, thoughtful, caring, and professional host. She was very welcoming and greeted me in person upon arrival. She’s also an excellent cook! I enjoyed the delightful conversations with her as well. <br/>The entire apartment is clean with plenty of sunlight. The bedroom is very spacious with closet space for my personal belongings and clothes. It was very comfortable and felt like home away from home. <br/>The neighborhood has many accessible public transportation stations/stops. It was a breeze getting to the major train stations when I visited other cities outside of Berlin. It’s a very safe place to stay. <br/>I highly recommend this apartment for solo traveling! I’d totally come back when I’m in Germany again.",1,0.9902,Positive
