121.0,6,1.0,1.0,4.0,23,99.0,0,4.460781901528047,4.74,4.58,4.55,4.63,28248485,"thank you for the stay and quick replies for some of our problems. we had to change apartments in the middle of our stay but the owners were happy to help with everything - even bringing the dehumidifier as it felt humid in the ground floor apartment. Many nice cafes and bars around to enjoy our time. A little bit far from metro, but that wasn't a problem as car sharing was super cheap.",1,0.9841,Positive
272.0,8,2.0,2.0,8.0,31,100.0,1,3.130094705675992,4.85,4.67,4.82,4.73,4027687,"Tia was helpfull. Her home is cozy and nicely decorated. It was confortable, had good Linien and blankets.<br/>The bathrooms are modern and big. The Kirchen had everything we needed.<br/>I was there with 7 friends and we felt like being at home. <br/>I look forward to come back and stay at Tia again.",0,0.9517,Positive
105.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,1,2.815230046195084,4.85,4.9,4.89,4.79,425411,Esta muy bien comunicado andando se llega al centro en poco tiempo. Muy acogedor y lo tiene todo.,1,0.0,Neutral
188.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,31,100.0,1,6.895465985254408,4.93,4.93,4.61,4.78,24026444,"We had a great time in Berlin and Stephan's loft was a big part of that! It was spacious, clean, well equipped and only a short walk from public transport options, which provide fast and frequent services into the city centre. The neighbourhood was lovely and had a couple of nice restaurants. Stephan provided clear instructions and communication was smooth. Would definitely recommend this loft for anyone looking to explore Berlin!",0,0.9715,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,0,2.1982484390985064,4.94,4.97,4.97,4.85,24988882,Excelent place to stay at Berlin very near the center. Christel and her son are very welcoming and kind.,1,0.7818,Positive
60.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,24,90.0,1,12.476946890148982,4.93,4.98,4.81,4.91,53460697,"Es hat alles wunderbar geklappt, gerne wieder!",1,0.0,Neutral
157.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,45,100.0,0,5.245003120876255,4.77,4.72,4.68,4.61,11914556,"We loved Dan's place! My husband, adult son and I were visiting our daughter who is living in Berlin. The apartment had plenty of room for the 3 of us. Picking up the key went smoothly. Dan gave us a brief run-down and then we were able to enjoy a vibrant neighborhood. Apartment had all we needed. Well done!",0,0.9214,Positive
77.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,34,100.0,1,2.8922606535545543,4.92,4.78,4.84,4.8,856313349603216852,"Cute bedroom in a very central area. I was a bit stressed about the check-in, as the host happened to be away on the day I arrived and so I had to rely on a neighbor being home to get into the building. But it worked out, and I got in easily. It was nice to have the whole place to myself for the first couple of days. The location was very convenient. The bedroom is also used as a storage space for the host. It would have been nice to have more closet area if I were staying longer, but the room is big enough that there are plenty of surfaces for a short stay. The small shared porch is so nice when the weather is good. This is a very lively neighborhood, especially at night.",1,0.9793,Positive
108.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,3.617893966015014,4.74,4.78,4.82,4.57,18443210,As described and easy to check-in and check-out,1,0.4404,Positive
172.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,9,89.0,0,1.314238593749582,4.89,4.89,4.83,4.61,637503164824586245,"Amazing apartment, very well designed, close to most things.  Will stay there again!",1,0.7569,Positive
49.0,1,1.0,1.0,2.0,45,100.0,1,11.88938036942631,4.94,4.9,4.91,4.93,13215295,"Loved my stay at Sabrina’s place. The price was great and I felt I got more than what I paid for: I was comfortable in the well-equipped room and it was nice to be in a real home instead of a “made for airbnb” apartment. Sabrina made me feel welcome to use the shared spaces, the neighborhood was peaceful and walkable with excellent restaurants nearby and easy access to public transportation. Wish I could have stayed for longer.",1,0.9849,Positive
89.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,4.051033773174565,4.96,4.98,4.68,4.84,31167826,"Wunderschön gestaltete, gemütliche und saubere Wohnung. Ich habe mich sehr wohl gefühlt. Vielen Dank! Gabi, ihre Tochter (und Mann) waren sehr hilfsbereit und immer erreichbar. Z.B. als etwas kaputt ging bzw nicht funktionierte konnte es schnell repariert werden, so dass ich trotz dessen jederzeit gerne wieder hier wohnen würde!",1,0.0,Neutral
110.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,48,100.0,0,2.5459059307445027,4.86,4.93,4.89,4.74,11661596,"A delightful stay! beautiful location, great apartment and professional care from Thomas & Angelika who were very nice and kind. <br/>Very recommended and will probably return!",1,0.9754,Positive
89.0,4,0.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,1,9.213446128957443,4.68,4.53,4.51,4.68,242978,"It's an amazing place! The best apartment that I stay in five countries! The location is perfect, near buses and train station. Apartment is new and very comfortable",1,0.9507,Positive
99.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,0,15.11918943238052,4.92,4.87,4.86,4.77,26222336,"Nina‘s appartment war super sauber ,freundlich eingerichtet und hatte alle basics ,die man braucht.Die Betten waren bequem und wir haben nichts vermisst. Die Besitzerin war super freundlich und Kommunikation war schnell und hilfreich. Der einzige Grund, warum wir keine 5 Sterne gegeben haben, ist,dass die Treppe,die in das Souterrain Appartment führt, doch recht lang und steil ist. Für Ältere oder Menschen mit Gehproblemen oder schwerem Gepäck könnte das schwierig sein. <br/>Für einen angenehmen, ruhigen und doch stadtnahen Aufenthalt mit einer sehr freundlichen und hilfsbereiten Vermieterin würde ich das Appartment jederzeit empfehlen.",1,-0.9485,Negative
105.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,100.0,0,2.669731839960184,4.79,4.71,4.96,4.68,16882223,Beautiful apartment and neighborhood,1,0.5994,Positive
98.0,6,3.0,2.0,6.0,23,94.0,1,0.9930406419174836,4.64,4.6,4.91,4.69,6232949,"Die Wohnung ist schön, sauber und soweit gut ausgestattet.<br/>Etwas Grossstadtlärm muss man in Kauf nehmen, dafür entschädigt der tolle Blick über Berlin. <br/>Check-in / Check-out hat problemlos geklappt.",0,-0.5994,Negative
227.0,8,5.0,2.0,8.0,42,100.0,0,16.161495501888606,4.8,4.84,4.77,4.82,11010163,"Nice home . 10 minutes walk to the S-Ba and another 15 minutes to the center.<br/>Beautiful location around the house.<br/>Fred and Rita very nice people. In the first day when we arrived, Fred took us to the supermarket and it vas very helpful.<br/>The location is very green so there is a lot of mosquitoes outside, need to buy some spray.",0,0.7089,Positive
138.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,56,100.0,1,2.8661586391717453,4.91,4.92,4.9,4.79,1946067,"We had an amazing stay! The apartment is in a perfect location, with plenty to do in the neighborhood and transit nearby to explore the rest of the city. Axel communicated extremely well and was very responsive, kind, and friendly. The apartment is very clean and cute, a great size, and had everything we needed. Definitely recommend!",1,0.9879,Positive
87.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,10.082429401037324,4.86,4.86,4.77,4.78,731042640553523310,"Die ""Garage"" ist sehr schön in umgebaut und eingerichtet. Kleine küche, Bad und Bettecke. Ich war da mit meinem Sohn und wir haben uns da sehr wohl gefühlt. Das Doppelbett war groß genug für uns beide. Alles was wir gebraucht haben, war da. Es ist auch schön mit dem kleinen Garten vor der Unterkunft. Wir haben früher in der Nähe gewohnt und wollten eine ruhige Lage im Kiez haben. Passte perfekt für uns.",1,-0.9643,Negative
124.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,2.64161460483945,4.88,4.98,4.98,4.79,30883941,"Might be the best location in Berlin. Very clean, perfect communication and everything is nearby.",1,0.9036,Positive
86.0,5,1.0,1.0,3.0,53,100.0,1,7.289350034428508,4.94,4.95,4.7,4.79,721364103220260496,"Super Airbnb : propriétaire super sympathique, très belle chambre spacieuse, lits confortable, serviettes comprises, salle de bains privative et cuisine partagé magnifique. L'appartement se situe au rez-de-chaussée donc facile d'accès avec des valises. La rue n'est fréquenté que par les habitants de cette rue. Il y a donc qlq passants, certains semble regarder à l'intérieur mais ils regardent seulement leur reflet car de dehors il faut vraiment se rapprocher pour voir l'intérieur. Le gros plus est l'accessibilité: l'appartement est assez central, plusieurs moyens de locomotion sont à proximité, la gare est à 15min.",1,0.8316,Positive
68.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,8.802572736632277,4.8,4.8,4.89,4.67,41003884,"Apparemment très propre, fonctionnel et cosy. En plein cœur de Berlin. Le séjour s‘est bien déroulé",1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,0,5.800494003867822,4.59,4.79,4.45,4.56,849431,"Nice and cosy appartment and the host was nice too. We overlooked some things while cleaning up and got a bit of a rant and a high bill for it, but overall nice stay.",1,0.6956,Positive
196.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,44,100.0,1,0.8343376118810685,4.72,4.79,4.86,4.6,9292804,Enjoyed our stay!,1,0.5562,Positive
157.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,45,100.0,0,5.245003120876255,4.77,4.72,4.68,4.61,11914556,"Die Airbnb ist sehr gemütlich und super stylisch eingerichtet. Wir waren dort zu sechst, es war genug Platz für alle und wir hatten dort eine sehr schöne Zeit. Ich kann die Wohnung mit gutem Gewissen jeden weiter empfehlen :)",0,-0.7003,Negative
75.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,33,100.0,1,6.761987534815515,4.7,4.65,4.67,4.61,12843786,Super schöne und gemütliche Altbauwohnung. Wir haben uns sofort wohl gefühlt. Alles war so wie beschrieben und wir hatten mit dieser Wohnung eine tolle Zeit in Berlin. Christina ist eine sehr freundliche und hilfsbereite Person. Der Kontakt war sehr nett und unkompliziert. Check in war ebenfalls super! Ich kann die Wohnung nur empfehlen. Werde hier mit Sicherheit nochmal buchen. 😊,1,-0.8439,Negative
179.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,53,100.0,1,1.5908743671328385,4.96,4.93,4.88,4.86,26487848,A unique and wonderful way to experience Berlin. <br/>Will definitely come back.,1,0.7506,Positive
150.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,0,2.1186829688508024,4.71,4.79,4.92,4.59,10305300,"Veronika’s flat was well located and very comfortable.  The balcony facing the park was a nice touch for coffee in the morning. The UBahn and tram were very close making it easy to get around Berlin.  My only complaint was that there was no bath soap as promised and when I inquired I did not receive a response. So I had to buy some at the local market, which was not a big deal, but a slight inconvenience.  Other than that Veronica was very responsive, letting me check in early. I’d highly recommend her place to anyone visiting Berlin and wanting to stay away from the big tourist sites but with easy access due to the incredible transit system.",1,0.922,Positive
312.0,11,3.0,1.0,4.0,42,100.0,1,9.660413858650209,4.92,4.94,4.44,4.83,16237757,"This is a great apartment - stylish and immaculate.  Simon was easy to contact, very efficient and helpful.  Also useful information and local recommendations provided.  The S Bahn station is just round the corner and we found it easy to get round Berlin from there.  Some of us were visiting for the first time and some had been before and we all thought it was an excellent base. Can highly recommend.",0,0.9762,Positive
95.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,0,4.691964222849626,4.76,4.77,4.81,4.67,28168852,War alles wie beschrieben. Sehr gute Lage!,1,-0.636,Negative
313.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,49,100.0,1,2.887058665280372,4.89,4.76,4.83,4.71,721749273851792523,Lejligheden er stor og rummelig. Sengene er virkelig gode. Sovesofaen er fin til børn. Måske ikke til en voksen. Beliggenheden er supergod. Virkelig hyggeligt kvarter med masser af restauranter og caféer. Hoveddøren er flot men gammel og man kan høre alle der går forbi ude på trappen. Men alt i alt var vi meget tilfredse.,0,0.0,Neutral
140.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,98.0,0,7.157895638776036,4.61,4.65,4.53,4.37,731825380030233334,"Tolles Appartement, gut ausgestattet. Immer wieder gerne.",1,0.0,Neutral
190.0,12,3.0,2.0,5.0,36,100.0,0,2.9693852716855065,4.7,4.77,4.57,4.55,1221803024213121808,Overall very happy with the stay. Very responsive host and close to everything. Also I love the interiors. I recommend it.,0,0.9258,Positive
180.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,45,85.0,0,1.5095289909770313,4.75,4.84,4.9,4.6,45475252,"Terrible service! <br/>Everything would be fine, but if something happens in your room, then you should know that they will be very reluctant and extremely slow to help you.<br/>In addition, after registration, your data gets into some third-party service and again you need to fill in everything so that you are allowed to live.",1,0.165,Positive
147.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,46,100.0,1,2.45888836042137,4.69,4.79,4.61,4.61,878823475035435524,Great stay - large living area perfect for the 4 of us which was clean and everything we needed. There was a huge tv which we watched on an evening and decent fridge space etc. for snacks. Ludger was very responsive via air b and b chat and gave us recommendations to visit before. I would stay here again but just prepare for the stairs!,0,0.8219,Positive
112.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,1,3.5872254876023093,4.58,4.75,4.67,4.46,744264,Very cozy place in perfect location. Perfect for 4 people. We enjoyed the stay a lot.,1,0.8934,Positive
99.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,1,12.77543094468834,4.93,4.91,4.79,4.86,16633391,Eine wundervolle und gemütlich eingerichtete Unterkunft in einer schönen und ruhigen Lage Berlins! Heiko ist ein unkomplizierter und zuverlässiger Gastgeber und deshalb absolut empfehlenswert!,1,0.0,Neutral
70.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,12.86304269897694,4.93,4.97,4.89,4.88,18014187,"Patrick war ein großartiger Gastgeber – freundlich, hilfsbereit und schnell erreichbar. Check-in und Check-out waren problemlos. Für unser Gepäck konnten wir den Aufzug und Patricks Wohnung nutzen, ansonsten nahmen wir die Treppen.<br/>Die Wohnung war fantastisch: luxuriös, liebevoll eingerichtet und bestens ausgestattet. Patrick hat uns alles gezeigt und mit vielen Aufmerksamkeiten überrascht – Wasser, Frühstückskleinigkeiten, Kaffee, Badeschaum und Kerzen. Die große Badewanne ist absolut empfehlenswert!<br/>Alles war makellos sauber und angenehm ruhig. Die Lage am Kudamm ist top – Shopping, Bäcker, Supermarkt, Nahverkehr, alles in direkter Nähe. Sogar einen Parkplatz direkt vor dem Haus haben wir gefunden! Ein kleiner Balkon steht zur Verfügung, leider war das Wetter zu schlecht.<br/>Eine tolle Unterkunft mit einem herausragenden Gastgeber – wir kommen gerne wieder!",1,-0.9824,Negative
60.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,23,100.0,0,13.286499929571272,4.44,4.38,4.63,4.43,17237876,Clean and private. The self check-in was great. ,1,0.7783,Positive
138.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,0,1.922981274848583,4.58,4.44,4.73,4.44,546417520591682575,"This was the worst experience I've ever had with any airbnb. <br/>I arrived at the checkin time at the place and when I put the code, first thing that I see is a random couple making out on the couch, I was speechless, I didn't even know what to do. They said that the owner let them stay there more time, then the rush to leave and finally leave the place, that was actually the least of my problems, because they way the left the apartment was really disgusting, everything was dirty, so much hair in the bathroom, the bed is dirty, the kitchen is disgusting, clothes on the floor, random underwear on the floor... traumatizing. <br/>The owner said that the couple lied about the fact that he let they stay more and and that they also tricked the cleaning lady to not clean the place to the next person who was coming. Weird.<br/>The owner replied to me as fast as he could, tried to explain things and said that the cleaning lady would be there in 1 hour to clean the whole apartment. She went there and I waited till everything was cleaned. She did a great job, if the apartment was like that when I arrived it would have been great. <br/>Next day I wake up with someone trying to enter the apartment, it was the cleaning lady again, she thought I was supposed to leave that day but I wasn't. It felt really weird seeing someone else enter the apartment when I was barely dressed. But okay, I complained about it to the owner, he felt bad and offered me $50 euros refund, which I accepted. <br/>At night on the same day, I was in bed when suddenly I hear someone putting the coding and here we go again, another person enters the apartment, a random guy who was trying to find another airbnb owned by the same owner. Once again I had no privacy, I felt unsafe, what if I was not there at that time? What could have had happened with my belongs? <br/>Overall it was a very stressful situation. I left this airbnb wanting to never come back that place. <br/>But besides all of that, it's a good apartment, the shower is great, the location is awesome.",1,-0.8416,Negative
125.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,1,2.540873406232533,4.67,4.75,4.83,4.55,243063,We arrived late at night and at first glimpse surroundings seemed bit rough. Anyhow impression was totally false and location was very good. You can find almost everything at walking distance. We were really happy for accommodation and Anna was extremely friendly and helpful. A+!,1,0.9426,Positive
125.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,27,98.0,1,1.7013982816783224,4.94,4.88,4.94,4.8,19536575,"Fantastic stay in a great apartment. Perfect location with lots of shops & restaurants, a cool Thursday and Saturday market, and accessible to public transportation. Stephanie and her crew were very responsive and helpful. The apartment is well appointed and there’s plenty of room to be comfortable during the stay. Highly recommend this location for any stay in Berlin!!",1,0.9805,Positive
