68.0,2,0.0,0.0,1.0,21,100.0,1,3.132943292576071,4.86,4.68,4.88,4.81,979758,"We loved to stay at Jurriaan’s place during our time in Berlin. It’s a very nice neighbourhood close to restaurants, shops and public transportation. The apartment has everything you need and more, it is cosy and perfect for two people. Jurriaan is a great host! Very kind and helpful. We would definitely stay here again.",1,0.9765,Positive
