82.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,3.929915771235159,4.89,4.9,4.96,4.86,20660494,"Uta was very responsive and always replied immediately. She really cared about my travel plans and communicated constantly while I was en route. She met me as soon as I arrived and made the check-in process easy and seamless. <br/>She showed me how everything worked in the apartment, which was very helpful. She provided me with great suggestions and recommendations for places to visit, eat and drink. They were all perfect since this was my first trip to Berlin.<br/>I highly recommend Uta and her apartment for anyone staying in this area of Berlin. I plan on visiting again in a few months and will be sure to book her place again. This was one of my best AirBnB experiences.",1,0.9817,Positive
