77.0,2,0.0,3.0,1.0,30,100.0,1,2.982709624569858,4.97,4.97,4.97,4.84,44384838,"Lekkerurlaub und Kathrin were amazing! Incredible location, great value for Berlin, so friendly, like a house with homely feel and character. Room was spacious, super comfy bed and 10/10 sparky clean .<br/>Danke Kathrin für eine tolle Zeit in Berlin, wir haben uns wie zuhause gefühlt! Auch für eine Deutsche die schon oft in Berlin war, wie auch für meine britischen Freund der als Besucher hier ist, war die Mischung aus echtem Berlin und super Info&Lage perfekt— danke dir.",1,0.9132,Positive
215.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,55,100.0,1,9.076307917104932,4.77,4.74,4.73,4.5,44223516,Spacious and clean! This is a very comfortable and roomy apartment. The separate bath and bedroom were great. The washer/dryer combo unit worked well for us during our stay. The parking garage is easily accessible and a bargain at $25/day. Public transportation is very close to the apartment. Daily room cleaning and reliable air conditioning were a pleasant surprise. I would highly recommend a stay at this property.,1,0.9725,Positive
