151.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,94.0,0,3.1018817858877528,4.67,4.77,4.78,4.52,721527807549293451,"Great place - vert neat. Rooms are small so its really just a hotelroom with a kitchenette, but functional.<br/>Location is good and everything works. Take care not to leave your room without you stuff after checkout time - they code wont work, and you need their help to regain you possesions. :-). <br/>.... ot just checkout in time. You can actually ask for a delayed checkout.<br/>Great service.",1,0.934,Positive
