89.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,1,2.692024625165537,4.82,4.64,4.91,4.76,29383900,Birte is great! Her place is in a very safe neighbourhood in Prenzlauer if you want to be a little away from all the touristic areas yet close to public transport to get there in 20 minutes or so! Very clean and private room..totally recommend:),1,0.909,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,0,5.800494003867822,4.59,4.79,4.45,4.56,849431,"There was some problems with the cleaning people: Used toilet, some dirt/dust on the floor or dirty pans/plates. It wasn’t the hosts fault as she doesn’t live in Germany and isn’t able to check out the apartment but she assumed that maybe one of us used the toilet after the cleaner said it wasn’t them, which was a little rude. Still a mystery lol, we did end up getting half of the 110€ cleaning fee. There was also some people coming by to check out the apartment for long term rental. We did not mind that but the communication about the time wasn’t the best, as we didn’t expect them to just come in. We weren’t allowed to expand our departure time from 10am to 11am, because I asked too late and the reason was the cleaning person would come at 10am. Which did not happen again. We were still infront of the Airbnb packing the car until 11 something and no one came, there was no reason to not let us stay longer, sadly. Everything else was good.",1,0.429,Positive
174.0,11,4.0,2.0,1.0,23,100.0,0,5.182308415863953,4.59,4.71,4.54,4.36,1080198254054575244,En perfekt lejlighed i gode omgivelse<br/>Ingen støj selv om lejligheden ligger tæt på en trafikeret vej.<br/>Kan godt anbefales,0,0.0,Neutral
65.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,90.0,1,1.942933168845537,4.91,4.95,4.95,4.65,43719623,"Super location, very nice host, quiet room in a frequented and easily accessible area of Berlin. 5 min away from metro station. Many cafes, restaurants and shops around.",1,0.8553,Positive
130.0,5,0.0,1.0,5.0,18,93.0,0,2.347776216465179,4.74,4.63,4.73,4.62,17413995,We had a very pleasant stay in the apartment.<br/>the position it's in the heart of Kreuzberg nightlife and absolutely fine to reach all the most relevant places in berlin including the airpoirt.<br/>communication with the host was smooth and clear.<br/>nothing to complain about.,1,0.5499,Positive
74.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,15,100.0,1,13.59903184963209,4.85,4.88,4.59,4.73,52052417,Fijn appartement waarin de basisbehoeften voor een verblijf aanwezig zijn.  In de straat zitten verschillende eetgelegenheden. De highlights van Berlijn zijn met het openbaar vervoer uitstekend te bereiken.,1,0.0,Neutral
207.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,48,98.0,1,2.2099121550415086,4.91,4.95,4.98,4.81,11040435,"Sentralt beliggende både for kultur og shopping. Pent innredet leilighet på bakkeplan. Svært god respons på spørsmål og småproblemer, som ble løst raskt og med et smil. Alt er lagt til rette for et uproblematisk og hyggelig opphold.",0,0.2732,Positive
66.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,6.244246865563971,4.93,4.97,4.82,4.69,637506338242607868,Barbora und Kai waren sehr freundliche und zuvorkommende Gastgeber.,1,0.0,Neutral
31.0,6,1.0,1.0,6.0,29,99.0,0,1.5518343874590943,4.55,4.64,4.6,4.63,6110762,"De los mejores y mas limpios hostales en lo que he estado. El personal muy amable y atento. El hostal esta ubicado en un barrio bueno y muy céntrico con facilidades de transporte público muy cerca. Mi unicas dos recomendaciones serían, primero variar el menú del desayuno ya que es lo mismo todos los días (aunque el precio es excelente: €5 - all you can eat) y que los lockers de los cuartos permitan cerrarse con propios candados y no tener que solicitar uno en recepcion dejando un depósito de €5. <br/>Definitivamente me quedaría en Singer 109 nuevamente si fuera a Berlín ",1,-0.296,Negative
