55.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,0.8025330705337501,4.79,4.94,4.83,4.77,11403270,Gut gelegene Unterkunft für City-Explorer. Unkomplizierter Check-in und Ece´s Mama ist immer freundlich und hilfsbereit wenn gewünscht. Nach einem Tag in der großen Stadt ein heimeliger Ruhepol mit einer gelassenen Atmosphäre. Danke dafür & gerne wieder!,1,0.0,Neutral
98.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,1,3.617893966015014,4.71,4.68,4.85,4.56,43466060,"Jan ist perfekt.Sie sollten mehr auf Sauberkeit achten.  Die Lage ist super.  Da das Dämmung Hauses nicht sehr gut ist, können die Geräusche der Nachbarn manchmal störend sein.",1,-0.5994,Negative
48.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,20,100.0,1,8.37290570278294,4.68,4.74,4.46,4.6,22802121,"Espaço muito agradável. Não conhecemos a host, mas foi atenciosa nas mensagens. Estação de metrô muito próxima. Mais ou menos 25 minutos até a alexanderplatz. Supermercados muito próximos. Perfeito para duas pessoas.",1,0.0,Neutral
100.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,17,100.0,0,4.347907547706215,4.64,4.75,4.79,4.68,1015884445657478456,"It was nice place to stay in, clean and quiet",1,0.6705,Positive
154.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,41,100.0,1,1.8346218212204348,4.73,4.83,4.94,4.55,36754449,"Check-in process was lovely - they were able to check us in early which was very helpful. This room is certainly not for any physically challenged individuals - the ladder is incredibly steep. it is an intimate space! but for my friend and i who really just needed a place to sleep, it was perfect. <br/>The neighborhood is super charming with delicious coffee shops, burger joints, cute clothing boutiques and vintage stores and some art/yogi shops. We very much enjoyed walking around!<br/>I know the pool is something special of this hotel and I made sure to pay a visit (it's 5 euro, even for hotel guests). Due to the pending ""energy crisis"" in Europe, sounds like heating the pools was one of the first things to go. So, don't expect a warm pool! You may enjoy this refreshing Wim Hof experience - when I went to the pool, it was mainly people doing laps and kids/families playing. <br/>All in all: enjoyed the experience! Lovely spot.",1,0.9964,Positive
45.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,27,100.0,0,13.937893468275648,4.63,4.66,4.66,4.57,7838790,"Dear Parwana,<br/>from the beginning to the end of our trip everything was fine. The room is nice, clean and comfortable.<br/>Communication wich Parwana was always polite and helpful.<br/>It is located  perfectly for exploring the city.<br/>Thx and til next time.<br/>Olli & Aby <br/>",1,0.9595,Positive
57.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,1,14.05197618587947,4.86,4.75,4.88,4.82,880324454862645598,"Incredible room, felt like a high end suite. 5 minute walk to transit. Would highly recommend.",1,0.6478,Positive
60.0,2,2.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,0,22.431055386784468,4.94,4.98,4.9,4.82,8248629,"Sehr ruhig und dennoch gut angebunden, gemütlich mit guter Ausstattung, bequemen Betten, toller Dusche in modernem Badezimmer, mit Waschmaschine, Geschirrspüler, und Allem sonst was man braucht. Perfekt!",1,0.0,Neutral
88.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,0,2.53024719414614,4.61,4.48,4.94,4.58,825927326336386111,"We hebben een heerlijke verblijf gehad en het appartement ligt in een mooie, rustige wijk van Berlijn met al het openbaar vervoer, zoals de S bahn, U bahn en tram M10 en 5, in de buurt. Door de duideljjke aanwijzing van Jonas is het appartement snel te vinden en Jonas geeft je ook leuke tips voor de directe omgeving. Mocht je toch nog vragen hebben reageert hij snel.<br/>Het schone en leuk ingerichte appartement is gelegen onderaan een complex en is superleuk ingericht en van alle gemakken voorzien.<br/>Kortom echt een aanrader!<br/>Er is wel  één ding waar je rekening mee dient te houden: er mag geen (toilet)papier door het toilet gespoeld worden. Maar dat was voor ons geen probleem ( als tip neem kleine zakjes mee!).",1,0.0,Neutral
247.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,1,5.2396889205230845,4.9,4.97,4.94,4.85,9881695,"Really nice flat in an excellent location, perfect for exploring Berlin. Topped off with a bottle of champagne ready for our entrance :)",0,0.9531,Positive
129.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,55,83.0,0,6.567199125784508,4.84,4.76,4.78,4.71,819740,"Had a great time at Lio & Ete's place, nice sunny balcony and plenty of space. we didn't cook much so can't speak about kitchen facilities but for our trip the setup was great. location i would say is ""fairly good"" - we had a friend locally so we were able to have a tour guide. prices in Berlin generally seem pretty expensive and this was good value compared to many (albeit not super cheap sti)",1,0.9802,Positive
