116.0,5,1.0,1.0,4.0,29,100.0,0,2.281356512252844,4.49,4.56,4.75,4.42,16299453,"If a perfect stay is 5 stars, our recent stay:<br/>-2 Stars:The Internet in this apartment is horrible. There was a review about this in 2018 but I figured it must have been fixed in the 6 years since then. NOPE. The ONLY reliable place to get Internet is the dining room table. This is 2024, it is unacceptable to have bad Internet. If you need Internet for anything, do not stay here.<br/>-1 Star: The apt. is non-smoking but when we walked in it smelled like smoke. After some investigation, we discovered that the smell was coming from a hole in the wall of the bathroom. It is not clear what the smell is - to me it smelled a little like gas, which made me very nervous and we kept the bathroom door closed at all times and minimized our time in there. This could be a recent issue as it was not mentioned in any other reviews and it is impossible to miss.<br/>The listing says there is an elevator and there are ""few"" stairs but the reality is you will have 15 to get in & 40 to leave. that is not a ""few""",1,-0.8525,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,52,100.0,1,3.905291406003432,4.99,5.0,4.94,4.96,17731812,This is the best airbnb I've ever stayed in. Sylvia is a very accommodating and puts in effort to make sure hosts are comfortable. The apartment is very stylish in a unique way. Sylvia obviously cares a lot about her home. Plus the location and price are great.,1,0.9509,Positive
