121.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,41,100.0,0,4.035931634326439,4.46,4.38,4.31,4.46,1217354217059265136,"The apartment itself was fabulous,  like an ikea showroom , everything new and clean, however the building wasn't great, the neighbours upstairs were screaming one of the nights, it is however very close to lidl and the m29 bus is just up the street to bring you straight into town centre,  just make sure to validate ur ticket on the little yellow machine on the bus, we went on the back & didnt so were fined €60 !",1,0.827,Positive
