64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,1,5.082239095526703,4.9,4.98,4.93,4.77,51302980,"Mijn vriendin en haar moeder hebben hier overnacht. Ze waren beide super tevreden ook over Nadja, ze gaaf mooie en goede tips voor restaurants en plekjes om te bezoeken in Berlijn. <br/>Een echte aanrader en we komen zeker nog een keertje terug hier.",1,0.5994,Positive
65.0,1,1.0,0.5,1.0,28,82.0,1,8.560276028802951,4.93,4.92,4.9,4.82,12557900,"Staying at Linda’s is a cool experience from the very beginning. The apartment and her have a great personality. I mean, you feel cozy and welcome from the very beginning. She helped me understand the metro, gave me recommendations, and even left me a delicious snack on the bed. <br/>I highly recommend her place!",1,0.945,Positive
163.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,91.0,0,4.871252294318258,4.67,4.78,4.87,4.53,46864858,"This is my second trip to Numa | Sketch. And it was every bit as enjoyable as the last. Everything was as I remember it, which made getting around and vegging out after a long day of sightseeing easy. Definitely my home away from home when in Berlin.",1,0.8176,Positive
