103.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,21,100.0,0,6.349585383409171,4.66,4.63,4.67,4.41,25032777,This apartment was pretty good for spending short amount of time. The neughborhood is not the nicest and cosiest though but it is pretty close to some nice restaurants for example. The cleaning was late when we came there and there was still some trash on the bathroom. It was good that the host Neta answered all my questions.,1,0.9335,Positive
