94.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,1,0.9546645327029104,4.87,4.81,4.89,4.81,22662699,"Ivos' apartment is great. The location is good, right on a major station for the U and S Bahn and bus routes, so you can very quickly get around the city at any time of day or night.<br/>The apartment building itself is quiet and the view of Berlin is beautiful. The only minor issue is that it's located next to several major roads, and the ambulance/police sirens can get a bit loud (though no different than any other major city)<br/>The apartment is clean and nice, and the shower especially is very good.<br/>There really was only one small con to this place: the bed is really a futon and there was only one small pillow provided, so it was a bit less comfortable than ideal (unless I missed a linen closet with more pillows). But once you got used to it there was no issue, and I would certainly stay here again",1,0.8712,Positive
84.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,1,3.2375488184892025,4.89,4.92,4.88,4.83,41651093,"Carsten’s place was perfect for our weekend trip in Berlin. It was clean, well furnished and cosy during the winter. The check-in and check-out was very smooth and easy. It was also in a fantastic location, safe and close to public transport",1,0.9529,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,1,3.84020390851569,4.88,4.85,4.82,4.76,902241023805943804,"Très bel appartement très bien situé à Berlin. <br/>Fidèle à la description, propre et fonctionnel. <br/>Le quartier est paisible et très propre !<br/>Mahir a été très réactif et très accueillant. <br/>Je vous recommande son appartement pour un séjour à Berlin.",1,0.0,Neutral
