422.0,6,3.0,2.0,3.0,34,100.0,1,2.9051794007943927,4.98,4.97,4.92,4.87,24019375,"Superb host that gave us a useful brief about the area and appartment! The appartment was prepared well for our arrival. Free beer in the fridge and a list of wines to choose from for 15 euros a bottle.<br/>An amazing penthouse, one of, if not the best airbnb we have stayed in. We missed out on the city a little because of how nice the appartment was. There are 2 rooms with large beds and 1 room with a sofa bed. Enough to fit 5-6 ppl. Hot water is never an issue. The house is somewhat artsy with a minimalistic touch. <br/>Location is not in kruesberg or mitte but still 12 mins by car and some 20 mins by tram if you are looking to save on money. There is a free place to park a rent a car as well but berlin is best experienced on a bicycle or on foot.<br/>Would definitely stay there again.",0,0.9618,Positive
47.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,22,100.0,0,13.138017956952291,4.4,4.36,4.6,4.27,18610999,Small clean room. Exactly what we needed. Would stay again.,1,0.4019,Positive
