33.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,61.0,0,3.555156547439113,4.2,4.2,4.8,4.2,987681568498555388,Before I booked the place the host said that I could check in early. Then the morning I came in they said they needed to send me the check in instructions but couldn’t find my number but would jump on at 10am when I landed. I waited for 3 hours to hear back from here and then the location was wrong. Once I complained and ask for a discount she threatened me to say be happy that you have a place otherwise you don’t have to stay there. There was a strong lack of empathy and care about broken promises. The room itself was good but the common areas were dirty. I had come from a long trip so I had no energy to go back and forth and try to find a new spot. So I stayed.,1,-0.0828,Negative
