136.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,1,3.2900161245726496,4.58,4.66,4.94,4.61,4636280,"Location, location, location!  Very central and close to everything!  The apartment was nice however minus the little touches that make a stay so special;  wrong Wifi code was provided so it took two days to get connected (very important!!) and sofa bed was not made up as an extra bed as requested but this was rectified quickly the next day - hosts were supportive and quick to respond which was great.  Nothing provided (ie coffee pods that actually fit the machine, sugar, milk, teabags would have been helpful!)  but kitchen has all utensils needed to make a meal. Aside from having to go up and down 3 very steep flights of stairs every day, the apartment was lovely and central.",1,0.9683,Positive
272.0,8,2.0,2.0,8.0,31,100.0,1,3.130094705675992,4.85,4.67,4.82,4.73,4027687,"We had a wonderful stay in Berlin. The apartment is very spacious, well outfitted and the beds were outrageously comfortable. <br/>Lots of nice restaurants/bars nearby too.  ",0,0.8744,Positive
