143.0,3,1.0,0.5,3.0,11,100.0,0,12.49305093691696,4.14,3.71,4.57,4.19,957744261497420583,"Das Personal ist freundlich und zuvorkommend, die Pension bietet ein tolles Frühstück sowie einen Zimmerservice an und ist super gelegen mitten in Charlottenburg an der S- und U-Bahn. Die Zimmer sind zweckmäßig ausgestattet, aber sauber. Nur das Bad war soooo klein,  wir mussten den rechten Arm auf den Waschbeckenrand legen, um gerade auf der Toilette sitzen zu können, haha! Insgesamt kann man dort aber gut bleiben.",1,-0.8622,Negative
45.0,3,1.0,1.5,2.0,44,100.0,1,13.335712033183713,4.95,4.95,4.77,4.9,19619437,"Danke für das schöne Zimmer. Wir waren ja nur über Nacht da, sollte ich nochmal nach Berlin kommen, gerne wieder.",1,0.0,Neutral
208.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,1,4.248347186024305,4.61,4.72,4.78,4.59,13508386,"We really enjoyed our time in Berlin, and overall were happy with this accommodation. There were a number of really good things. There were also some things that were disappointing, although all could be easily fixed. <br/>Good things: <br/>1. Alan met us at the apartment and spent a fair bit of time providing us with useful information about it, the local neighourhood and the city more generally - much appreciated. <br/>2. The apartment had everything we needed - in particular for people travelling with young kids, it had a high chair and a box of toys/books, which were great. <br/>3. Close to transport, fairly easy to get to most places of interest<br/>4. Fairly nice neighbourhood<br/>Things that could be improved:<br/>1. Cleanliness - the floors and shower curtain were very dirty and, somewhat bizarrely, the kettle was full of vinegar (!?!). <br/>2. Some low quality things in the house which reduced comfort a bit -pillows were awful and the kitchen chairs quite rickety (one was actually broken or not assembled correctly).",1,0.979,Positive
90.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,1,20.182729076202826,4.98,4.98,4.91,4.83,44319175,"Een prachtige, schone en sfeervolle airbnb.",1,0.0,Neutral
101.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,0,4.929820420309423,4.77,4.73,4.77,4.64,488161,"El apartamento está ubicado en un excelente barrio. Es amplio y bien equipado. La comunicación con Heinrich fue rápida y eficiente . 100% recomendado hospedarse aquí . Sin duda, volvería.",1,-0.5574,Negative
156.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,0,2.2531285722967658,4.58,4.63,4.73,4.47,49844243,War gut und zentral,1,-0.5994,Negative
333.0,7,2.0,1.5,4.0,45,100.0,1,2.165211040584272,4.67,4.63,4.72,4.59,45962465,"The space is great for a big group. Having a metro stop nearby was great. The beds were comfortable and there wasn’t much street noise coming in. The only issues we did have were that the water from the kitchen sink was very hot. The actual owner was communicative and helpful, but the person managing the apartment that day was slightly rude that we were delaying from our meeting time due to metro delays that were out of our control. Other than that, everything was smooth and I would recommend this space.",0,0.7383,Positive
76.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,21,99.0,0,2.1897939786653327,4.56,4.7,4.89,4.51,41403574,"This is a solid place to stay for a day or two. Small but clean and well-equipped for all basic needs, with some nice touches too. If it's warm out, the small room can get stuffy unless you open the porch door, and noise outside (morning to mid-evening) can be unpredictable--just something to keep in mind. A guy met me at the restaurant below for check-in, as promised.",1,0.9209,Positive
200.0,3,2.0,2.0,2.0,16,100.0,1,1.755379984504752,4.93,4.8,4.87,4.82,26033271,"Convenient location, short walk to  public transportation, beautiful space for 2-3 people, (2 bed rooms and 2 washrooms) either for work or just leisure.  Excellent communication before arrival, upon checking in Mario  greeted us at the door to show us about the amenities and was available for questions during our 6 day stay .Will stay at Marios again if back in Berlin. Thumbs up!!",1,0.8829,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,1,4.861082501850892,4.75,4.76,4.6,4.7,5188216,A hospedagem está de acordo com o anunciado e não é para pessoas muito exigentes. Está apropriada aos jovens e o no Berlim Surf Hostel diz tudo. É bonitinho o apartamento e próximo da Estação de Metro Boddinstrabre. O bairro está bem servido de comércio e a comunidade é diversificada desde muçulmanos - inclusive com mulheres cobertas de burca - a punks e bears. A localização não é central mas o metrô está a alguns metros. Eu gostei.,1,-0.296,Negative
70.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,1,5.346560287895435,4.92,4.94,4.93,4.76,10214749,"Andreas Unterkunft ist zentral und doch ruhig gelegen, in einer wunderschönen modernen Überbauung. Man hat 5 Minuten zur nächsten U-Bahn-Station und nach 5 Minuten Fussweg befindet man sich bereits im Zentrum von Friedrichshain, umgeben von vielen Essens- und Einkaufsmöglichkeiten. Mit der U-Bahn ist man innert 6 Minuten am Alexanderplatz.<br/>Die Wohnung selbst ist modern und sauber, super für ein Pärchen- oder Einzelaufenthalt. Es gibt eine gefüllte Minibar und auch im Bad die gleichen Gadgets wie man in einem Hotel vorfinden würde.<br/>Andreas war wärend unseres Aufenthalts immer für uns erreichbar, er bot uns in der Mitte auch von sich aus an, uns frische Bettwäsche und Tücher zu Verfügung zu stellen. Die Kommunikation verlief sehr einfach und stets zufriedenstellend. Wir durften auch früher in die Wohnung, da sie zuvor nicht belegt war und auch aus diesem Grund am Abreisetag länger bleiben, was uns vieles erleichtert hat.<br/>Wir können die Wohnung auf jeden Fall weiterempfehlen und würden sie auch bei einem nächsten Aufenthalt sofort wieder buchen. ",1,-0.975,Negative
343.0,12,4.0,1.5,8.0,41,97.0,0,1.9889741213247012,4.41,4.28,4.8,4.36,662252642803259249,Le séjour s’est parfaitement déroulé<br/>L’appartement est très grand et correspond bien à la description,0,0.4588,Positive
79.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,8,100.0,0,1.1814832908678563,4.69,4.79,4.93,4.56,1237568,"We had a wonderful stay in Berlin. The apartment is as advertised - clean, comfortable, simple, bright and conveniently located.  The kitchen is bare bones (no oven/toaster/microwave), but there are plenty of options for food in the neighborhood. ",1,0.743,Positive
146.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,96.0,0,2.9685237429570543,4.67,4.71,4.88,4.59,50931530,Perfect,1,0.5719,Positive
79.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,0,2.3024054427486496,4.83,4.72,4.95,4.69,15778858,"Все понравилось. Нас встретили и все объяснили. Для путешественников на своем авто - паркинг подземный, нужно спускаться вниз на авто лифте. Мы были на авто Toyota LC 200 - машина большая и с трудом в него помещается, приходилось слегка попотеть при въезде/выезде. В остальном все идеально, остановка трамвая рядом, магазин в доме, до метро тоже недалеко. В двух шагах аренда самокатов и велосипедов (можно через uber). Мы ездили на такси - uber до рейхстага 12 евро. До ж/д вокзала ближе, думаю не дороже 8 евро будет.",1,0.0,Neutral
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,0,3.231579661094454,4.91,4.74,4.88,4.9,14548616,Fabio and Malu were very welcoming hosts. the appartment was very nice and clean. we had an awesome stay!,1,0.9279,Positive
