89.0,6,1.0,1.0,3.0,57,100.0,1,20.240640244355667,4.96,4.96,4.73,4.85,786833707781544447,We had fantastic weather for our weekend in Berlin at a family wedding and the house enhanced even that experience. The location is residential so shops and restaurants are not really available close by. However the main S Bahn from the airport to the centre is only 10 minutes walk therefore communication is good. The house itself is great with the swimming pool a big bonus for the weather we had - the temperature was refreshing! Everything regarding the admin was totally problem free.,1,0.943,Positive
