79.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,8,100.0,0,1.1814832908678563,4.69,4.79,4.93,4.56,1237568,"Our stay at the Sky cabin was great; clean comfortable and everything as explained by the hosts in advance. <br/>Good times :)",1,0.9201,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,2.380705735722119,4.95,4.96,4.91,4.86,7571301,"The house was exactly as described and the host's family made me feel welcome. Although I was able to spend a comfortable time, there are many places for breakfast around the house. The house was close to the tram stop, making it convenient to go downtown. There was a beautiful terrace, which was useful for spending time relaxing. I'll come again next time.",1,0.9337,Positive
125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,0,2.399762496998238,4.92,4.88,4.96,4.63,822917,Wonderful hosts and flat - I look forward to staying here again. Thank you for everything!,1,0.7574,Positive
49.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,0,8.092180844920643,4.73,4.78,4.59,4.68,222784,"This is a clean, convenient apartment which is just about exactly as depicted in the photos.  We had no problems at all with the apartment itself.  Just one piece of advice - don't forget to ask for the right apartment buzzer before you leave home!",1,-0.2561,Negative
64.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,59,100.0,1,2.578564642470654,4.97,4.99,4.93,4.96,7849188,"We were very happy with our choice of Bernd's apartment for our stay in Berlin. The flat was immaculately clean, tastefully furnished with plenty of room for us. As it happened, we did not use the well-equipped kitchen for cooking since we ate out during our stay. Nevertheless, everything one would require for self-catering was at our disposal in the flat should we have chosen to eat in. In addition we were offered use of an automatic coffee machine.<br/>Bernd was a very friendly and welcoming host, providing an explanation of how various appliances worked just after we arrived. He talked us through the many dinner/pub options in the immediate vicinity and how to get to local metro stations. In addition, he had some very useful info on Berlin for us to look at in the flat.<br/>The location of the apartment in the Prenzlauerberg area of Berlin was great for going out at night with a plethora of local and international cuisine choices within easy walking distance and metro stations within 10 minutes walk.<br/>We have nothing but positive comments regarding our stay and wholeheartedly recommend Bernd's apartment.",1,0.8918,Positive
180.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,45,85.0,0,1.5095289909770313,4.75,4.84,4.9,4.6,45475252,"Quiet place, very cosy, super organized and well-equiped.",1,0.6344,Positive
118.0,2,1.0,0.0,1.0,27,99.0,1,8.583837471119269,4.75,4.75,4.33,4.67,1286169008663339170,Very nice,1,0.4754,Positive
119.0,6,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,80.0,1,5.419875510101854,4.86,4.9,4.92,4.7,21689254,"Fadeihs appartment is an absolute bliss. The interior is very stylish and has a homely feel. Everything you need for a good stay is there and it doesn't matter which way you walk out the front door, there are plenty of amazings cafe's and restaurants everywhere. The walnut slice from the bio shop across the road is to die for and the markets are absolutely amazing. We were there when it was cold and windy outside but will come back in summer one day for sure. I will recomend this to everyone I know who wants to visit Berlin.",1,0.7438,Positive
38.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,13,100.0,1,12.052149267454162,4.85,4.88,4.57,4.79,34003008,Ganz ruhiger Platz,1,0.0,Neutral
121.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,27,100.0,0,4.472653939309849,4.88,4.9,4.81,4.78,10122398,"We absolutely loved our stay at Martin's place! He was very responsive and accommodating, and was ready with what turned out to be a great recommendation for dinner when we arrived later than expected. His place makes Berlin easily walkable but is also just a short walk from the rail system, making it super easy for us to get back to the airport. We'd definitely book with Martin again if we're back in Berlin!",1,0.9713,Positive
141.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,43,94.0,0,7.131273504704622,4.74,4.82,4.79,4.62,49070135,"Excelente lugar para alojar en Berlin, ubicación cercana al transporte público, restaurantes, bares, entre otros. Los servicios adicionales eran acordes a nuestras necesidades (petfriendly, lavandería y gimnasio). Las respuestas de los anfitriones siempre fueron muy amigables y claras, además la habitación era muy cómoda y bien distribuida. Recomendado al 100%",1,0.0,Neutral
85.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,0,2.8482399549551234,4.67,4.66,4.74,4.55,884025877402223579,lovey apartment in a great neighborhood with  all the amenities and easy access to public transport.,1,0.7906,Positive
75.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,1,3.546156767220352,4.81,4.61,4.82,4.71,20240320,"I totally recommend staying at Tamaras Place. I loved it there. You directly feel at home. It‘s has a great atmosphere. The Bed was very comfortable and The kitchen has everything you need. <br/>It‘s directly located at a busy road (lot‘s of bars, restaurants) so for me this was a absolute plus point. And I felt like the neighborhood is very safe. I could go to many places just by walking around without even taking the public transports.<br/>Tamara is a very reliable host. And her Husband welcomed me for handing me over the keys. The communication with both went very smoothly. I had some delays so I was later than expected but it was no Problem at all. <br/>I had the Apartment all to myself for my 4 Days stay. I would definitely recommend it and I would for sure book it again!",1,0.942,Positive
282.0,9,4.0,2.0,5.0,63,100.0,1,13.845543965045303,4.75,4.69,4.67,4.69,22218048,"Een prima plek om Berlijn te bezoeken! Mooi gedeelte van Berlijn,  in de buurt genoeg te doen, fijne grote supermarkt kort in de buurt en gemakkelijke verbinding naar het centrum. Net en groot appartement, alle benodigdheden zijn aanwezig en op extra wensen wordt snel en adequaat gereageerd! Zeker een aanrader!",0,0.0,Neutral
136.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,3.163483108008173,5.0,5.0,4.96,4.83,1368083120410316537,Marija was an amazing host! Right from the start she was very responsive and helpful and her place is definitely a gem. Super clean and has everything you need for your trip. The location is very central and connected really well. Marija and her apartment made our trip to Berlin a wonderful experience. I would definitely recommend it :),1,0.9856,Positive
82.0,2,0.0,1.0,3.0,41,100.0,0,7.593507322759444,4.57,4.62,4.8,4.64,20668903,"Giselle's apartment is  situated close to public transport, cafe, shops and etc. We stayed there 3 nights and it was ok!) on the photos and in real life is the same) so we approve it!))<br/>Gisella and Jens were friendly and helpful!",1,0.783,Positive
153.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,23,80.0,1,2.4380512619709767,4.32,4.44,4.87,4.3,22556872,Wonderful place to stay at. It’s location right by the Tram and underground is great to get to the city center and explore the city. The staircase has a nice view on the Wall Memorial.<br/>People that are sensitive to light when sleeping should know that the curtains don’t block the light in the morning.,1,0.8271,Positive
276.0,3,2.0,2.0,3.0,61,100.0,1,9.076307917104932,4.82,4.77,4.76,4.71,44223601,"Das Apartment hat gut für drei Personen gepasst. Check-In war exakt um 15 Uhr möglich. Die Übernachtungsabgabe könnte transparenter angeführt sein, von dieser erfuhren wir erst beim Check-In (3 Personen und 4 Nächte > 71,84€) und war extra zu bezahlen.",0,-0.9136,Negative
