160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,98.0,0,1.0407544919436775,4.54,4.66,4.77,4.45,34294913,"Great place, close to the city center.",1,0.6249,Positive
125.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,52,100.0,0,4.317514336247517,4.99,4.95,4.9,4.87,5892814,"Philipp and Lotte's apartment was a pleasure for our 10-day stay in Berlin. It is very comfortable. The rooms are big -- with high ceilings and old wooden floors, but modern windows, kitchen and  bath. The balcony offers a view of the street, there is plenty of light and the plants compliment the tasteful decor. The location is great, just a few blocks from the underground station and other trams and buses. There are many excellent restaurants, cafes and bars with sidewalk tables just steps from the apartment. It is a lively and interesting area, close to the canals and the river, with vintage and used clothing stores, art galleries and other interesting shops. The street is tree-lined and pleasant for walking. Philipp was a very responsive host and answered every question quickly. We would love to stay there again in the future.",1,0.9928,Positive
133.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,39,100.0,0,1.9320001998445444,4.45,4.36,4.89,4.4,24081986,Einfach super und reibungslos <br/>Tolle Lage und sehr ruhig,1,0.5994,Positive
93.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,2.54678149398414,4.86,4.96,4.9,4.84,3187735,We had great welcome by Barbara and the best stay in Berlin ever in her beautiful and clean apartment. Would recommend this to anyone,1,0.9657,Positive
115.0,2,1.0,0.0,2.0,16,100.0,0,1.6522173823377917,4.45,4.57,4.64,4.47,51795737,Great find,1,0.6249,Positive
422.0,10,5.0,3.0,7.0,41,100.0,1,4.239905926975667,4.91,4.98,4.54,4.76,9268629,Great stay ! Apartment is perfect and everything was convenient.,0,0.8439,Positive
144.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,94.0,0,3.1018817858877528,4.67,4.76,4.77,4.56,720839766613886451,"Das Zimmer war top und super sauber. Das Bett war sehr bequem. Einzige Manko war, dass das „Hotel“  an einer Polizeistation war. Aber die Lage war super und wenn man in Berlin kann man eh keine ausnahmslose Ruhe erwarten.",1,-0.9413,Negative
115.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,22,90.0,1,10.750545351348627,4.94,4.83,4.91,4.77,28044368,"Super eingerichtete und gemütliche Wohnung in Berlin Nähe Ludwigkirchplatz und Kurfürstendamm. Sehr liebevolle Details, wunderbar ruhige Lage, Kommunikation über die App für das Einchecken äußerst komfortabel bei sofortiger Beantwortung der eigenen Nachrichten. Für uns wirklich kein einziger Kritikpunkt. Zusammenfassend ein exzellenter Background für einen genüsslichen Aufenthalt in Berlin.<br/>Wir werden sicher für unseren nächsten Aufenthalt wieder buchen.",1,0.0,Neutral
123.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,32,100.0,0,5.086004020180417,4.79,4.88,4.78,4.75,7543419,"Martin was very quick to communicate with us and made the process very easy. He met us at the apartment on arrival and gave us lots of tips for local nightlife and eateries. Apartment was excellent, very clean and spacious. Martin provided all the basics for a self catering trip: milk, coffee, tea, towels, shower gel etc. Great location for exploring the city, only a couple of minutes walk to two U-Bahn stations and within ten minutes of Berlin centre on public transport. All in all, a great apartment and a great host. Cannot recommend Martin enough.",1,0.9686,Positive
37.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,1,12.302303063837329,4.9,4.92,4.67,4.93,37581746,"We loved the stay with convenient location (20 minutes to Berlin center by metro), lovely garden and cozy rooms! The place has a lot of privacy and space because the host and her dog live on the first floor and we were on the second one with private bathroom, balcony and sitting area. The property provides everything you need for a short stay and Helga is a great host who replied my messages very quickly. We will definitely come back here when we are in Berlin!",1,0.944,Positive
146.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,3.4636382799594605,4.66,4.79,4.58,4.56,322520,"Wir waren zu Zweit von Dienstag bis Freitag in Berlin bei Kasia und Alan in der Unterkunft, haben uns dort sofort wohlgefühlt! Es ist minimalistisch, aber trotzdem gemütlich eingerichtet, die Ausstattung der Küche, des Bads und des Bettes sowie des Esstischs war mehr als ausreichend für den Zeitraum. Der Kühlschrank, die Küche, das Bad und auch die Bettwäsche waren sehr sauber und die Lage ist optimal, auch wenn man auf den ÖPNV angewiesen sein sollte! Außerdem waren Kasia und Alan super fix und freundlich im Beantworten aller Fragen, haben einen tollen Guide in der Wohnung ausgelegt mit Tipps auf Englisch für Unternehmungen in Berlin und der Check-in sowie Check-out waren problemlos, obwohl wir eine Stunde zu früh da waren.<br/>Gerne wieder!",1,-0.9611,Negative
151.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,94.0,0,3.1018817858877528,4.67,4.77,4.78,4.52,721527807549293451,"Świetny pobyt. Mieszkanie czyste,  zadbane, przytulne, dobrze wyposażone. Na miejscu czekają drobne przekąski i napoje w lodówce (bez dodatkowej opłaty) - bardzo miły gest ze strony gospodarza. Wygodne łóżko, przyjemna pościel. Szampon, odżywka, balsam do ciała dostępne w łazience w dużych pojemnościach i fajnej jakości, myśle, że to plus,  jeśli ktoś zwraca na to uwagę. <br/>W garażu dostępne miejsce parkingowe za opłatą. My zdecydowaliśmy się zaparkować przy prostopadłej ulicy Puttkamerstraße (nie jest objęta strefą płatnego parkowania). <br/>Polecam.",1,0.0,Neutral
127.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,98.0,0,12.088531796732502,4.59,4.69,4.68,4.51,1302869509092517265,War gut,1,-0.5994,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,0.0,0,5.049641201709362,4.42,4.17,4.75,4.33,11469165,"Paulina est une hôtesse super sympa. <br/>L'appartement de Paulina est vraiment bien, moderne, fonctionnel, et propre. Il est localisé dans un quartier vraiment sympa, où transports en commun (arrêt de tram) et commerces (supermarchés classique ou bio, boulangerie, pharmacie...) sont à proximité. Je vous le recommande. <br/>",1,0.5994,Positive
115.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,30,80.0,0,6.188901033018674,4.92,4.83,4.84,4.78,11833825,"Lovely studio apartment, well decorated and in a nice neighbourhood. <br/>Great transport connections: A short 8 minute walk to the underground which takes you into the centre within 10 minutes. <br/>Linda (host) was very friendly, quick responses and allowed us to drop our luggage well before our check in. <br/>100% would recommend to anyone staying in Berlin.",1,0.9286,Positive
52.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,26,100.0,0,13.747094209166455,4.52,4.43,4.69,4.37,20166135,"Pretty good space, but it is a shared apartment. You gonna share everything with others",1,0.8381,Positive
50.0,2,1.0,2.0,2.0,26,100.0,0,13.699187577035424,4.56,4.55,4.73,4.38,41306967,they should prepare their mind that they visiting a hostel.,1,0.0,Neutral
47.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,0,8.666232428420047,4.79,4.9,4.39,4.78,5476658,We really enjoyed our stay at Massimo & Lucia's apartment. The apartment is located around 10 minute walk from beusselstrasse station and is really lovely. Exactly as described in the photos and text in the advert. The building itself is a little tired but if you are sightseeing you won't see it hardly at all and definitely great value for money. Massimo was attentive and met us at the apartment when promised- he actually met us early so we weren't tied to the time allotted. Overall an excellent experience and would recommend- thank you! ,1,0.9854,Positive
187.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,51,100.0,0,4.069085290848635,4.9,4.84,4.89,4.69,9862651,Stefans place is super nice 😊 love the location and the vibe in the house - feels right at home 🏡 nice bedrooms - and amazing livingroom and kitchen.,1,0.9552,Positive
