74.0,5,1.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,0,3.788889030203912,4.73,4.61,4.86,4.66,2118068,"We had a wonderful few days staying at amit's apartment. It's in a fantastic location, easy walk and access to everything you need and right next to a Ubahn stop also.<br/>It is very secure, private and quiet, set back from the main road. The place itself felt very clean and home like. It really was a home away from home for our 4 day stay.<br/>Thank you to Amit!",1,0.9475,Positive
99.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,33,100.0,0,3.4069315908893723,4.68,4.79,4.67,4.56,52653451,"We spent a lot of money for 2 nights at this place. It was ok, although our toddler had really dirty clothes after toddling on the floor, so it wasn't too clean. Nothing special about this place, the beds are a bit too soft, there is no couch to sit on.<br/>Also the remote control didn't work and the host didn't even bother to reply to my message about it.<br/>What was good for us, there was easy flexible check-in, and the location is really nice, peaceful, not too far from the center, and there are some nice stores and cafes around.",1,0.8932,Positive
