175.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,91.0,0,4.861047682375263,4.69,4.77,4.83,4.57,53744550,"Estuvimos muy bien en el apartamento. Tranquilo, espacioso y buenas camas. Estaba limpio y además limpiaron a los 3 o 4 días de estar allí. El barrio es muy animado, restaurantes de todo tipo, mercadillo el domingo. A mejorar el check-in y check-out, que es un poco frustrante. En cualquier caso, repetiría.",1,0.0,Neutral
148.0,5,1.0,1.0,5.0,53,100.0,1,16.15581114423226,4.82,4.92,4.78,4.63,3968204,"The apartment is very close to bus routes and the u bahn, very clean, and is exactly how it is pictured online. My family would stay here again.",0,0.4576,Positive
44.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,98.0,1,11.945313826388132,4.75,4.85,4.56,4.76,26952394,"Une super adresse à deux pas d'une station de S-Bahn avec une ligne directe et rapide vers le centre-ville. L'appartement a quatre chambres et la salle de bains et la cuisine sont partagées. Ma chambre était propre, bien chauffée, lumineuse, bien agencée (j'ai compté pas moins de 7 prises) et très confortable. L'immeuble est calme et près de deux supermarchés, dont un ouvert jusqu'à minuit pendant la semaine. Ne laissez pas sa situation à l'est de là ville vous décourager. Le rapport qualité-prix de ce logement est excellent et je n'hésiterais pas à y retourner.",1,0.8225,Positive
57.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,80.0,1,24.078510328755915,4.81,4.67,4.9,4.86,1052941,wir haben jeden morgen den herrlichen ausblick aus der wohnung genossen und fanden es sehr schade dass wir aufgrund der jahreszeit den sprung ins wasser nicht mehr wagen konnten.danke für die erholsame zeit.franz und andreas,1,-0.5994,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,1,2.4282218534972566,4.76,4.72,4.76,4.67,1414395977088158733,"Lovely hotel. Superb location, right opposite Berlin Ostbahnof. Value for money given the proximity to everything.",1,0.8834,Positive
135.0,2,0.0,1.5,2.0,38,100.0,1,1.9797577383607676,4.81,4.9,4.91,4.6,257373,"David’s place is located in a great part of the city that offers all sorts of access to a variety of wonderful experiences such as food, cafe, convenience and public transit.",1,0.8316,Positive
132.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,56,100.0,0,21.38929830525764,4.77,4.44,4.77,4.69,32511013,A great place for relaxing and feeling home,0,0.8316,Positive
75.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,1,3.7465670354738254,4.89,4.91,4.74,4.8,4581049,"Très beau logement sous les toit et bien chauffé  en hivers ! Nous avons passé un agréable séjour à Berlin , et tout les commerces de première nécessité se trouvent à 5 min à pied. Il faut par contre compter un peu plus de temps pour rejoindre les lieux à visiter , même si les transports en commun sont juste à côté.  Le quartier est tranquille et le logement très bien équipé.  Parfait pour un week-end en couple !",1,-0.2695,Negative
112.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,0,10.170435739382182,4.51,4.6,4.54,4.48,14574834,"Location was great for exploring Berlin, with a train station only 5 mins walk away. Amenities were everything we could have asked for; only disclaimer is that the apartment is on the fifth floor and the building itself does not have an elevator. Other than that the apartment and our experience there was fantastic.",1,0.8271,Positive
173.0,4,2.0,2.5,2.0,13,67.0,0,10.760786740406749,5.0,4.89,4.67,4.78,945725879369042318,Der Aufenthalt hat von Start bis Z bestens geklappt; gute und zuvorkommende Kommunikation und hilfreiche Tipps. <br/>Die Unterkunft ist sehr schön und grosszügig. Alles ist sehr neu.<br/>Auch die Gegend ist gut und wir konnten mit dem ÖV gut Stadtzentrum; Attraktivitäten erreichen und Freunde treffen <br/>Danke,1,-0.5994,Negative
64.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,13,100.0,0,2.3564110497534823,4.83,4.89,4.81,4.8,10453457,Beautiful and spacious room. The apartment was very clean and private. Located very close to u-bahn and within walking distance to many attractions. Wega was an excellent host and was very accommodating.,1,0.9245,Positive
120.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,0,7.798625942260672,4.9,4.82,4.92,4.7,16292857,Went only searching for a bed to spend my last night in Berlin and found out a new furnished apartment and a really big and comfortable bed. Although I didn't get to talk that much with Lucio he was great to me and made me feel at home. House is near to everything since it's close to a main metro station of the city.,1,0.8255,Positive
125.0,1,1.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,1,1.2721418429169693,4.97,4.99,4.97,4.9,20415517,"We stayed here for a month and wished we could have stayed even longer. The location is incredible; it's very close to many public transit options and has everything you need within walking distance. The internet is great if you need to work remotely. If you need anything, Benedikt and Edi are readily available to answer any questions or provide local recommendations. I can't stress how great of an Airbnb experience staying at Benedikt and Edi's place was for the two of us.",1,0.8893,Positive
140.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,1,1.5130716954922565,4.89,4.91,4.94,4.75,2394897,"Really nice central location. The apartment is exactly the same as the pictures; bright, clean and warm. Verda was a very nice and communicative host.",1,0.9133,Positive
33.0,1,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,5.415454756727632,4.82,4.67,4.88,4.72,777910036659949560,I stayed for 2 Months and it was very good adventure for me. House was clean and comfortable. You can use kitchen and cook whatever you want. The apartment was also quiet and neighbours are also friendly.  It was so nice that the apartment was so close to the Hauptbahnhof ( Main train station). There are 2 supermarkets (LIDL and Netto) and one tobacco shop next to the apartment. So thats why you can buy anything so easily. Thiago is very kind and friendly. You can not find any homeowner like Thiago. You can ask anything to Thiago about Berlin or about house. And i know he will help you as much as he could.  The room is enough for two person. I did not have a problem with my roommates. They are also good people. I am going to  rent this room when if i want to visit Berlin again. And i have one but so important tip for you. Do not leave the house with out taste Thiago’s delicious meals :). Peace out 👋🏻,1,0.9867,Positive
80.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,41,100.0,1,1.5562283131018062,4.75,4.5,4.96,4.78,37899742,Las vistas son muy buenas y esta dentro de la Isla de los museos.,1,0.0,Neutral
82.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,6.919397234051426,4.85,4.87,4.48,4.72,20881101,"It was great to stay somewhere so well equipped, especially in the kitchen. Good local transport links but we also walked into town from hereba couplebof times. We also really appreciated that when we went to leave our luggage after getting off the sleeper train, they let us move in early as the flat was alredy cleaned. So nice to get showered before we headed out to explore (not many hosts would have been that helpful). Thanks for a great stay.",1,0.9766,Positive
136.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,99.0,0,1.415271329251248,4.68,4.77,4.69,4.54,29891720,Enjoyed the stay. A good place with easy access to Berlin centre,1,0.8442,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,39,100.0,1,19.168850320196597,4.92,4.88,4.75,4.78,45605543,"🤞Danke, wir sind zufrieden",1,0.0,Neutral
50.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,34,83.0,1,2.563400508484748,4.9,4.97,4.96,4.92,29732182,"I don’t call Jens and Fyno a host, I can call them friends. They are really helpful and kind people. They helped us a lot, we really enjoyed the time we stay there. Great Host or I call them friends - great place to stay - great environment make u feel home. Thanks again Jens and Fyno🙏",1,0.9858,Positive
