67.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,0,2.434879564495849,4.92,4.99,4.84,4.78,929504337506547670,"Really enjoyed my stay at Nico and Bryn's place! Spacious room, modern kitchen and bathroom (love the rainshower!), large bed with an interesting ribbed mattress which was very comfortable. And most of all: super friendly hosts! The room is on the street side and at times there's quite a bit of noise from the car traffic, but that didn't bother me much once I closed the windows. Thanks Nico and Bryn, see you next time!",1,0.9493,Positive
