125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,1,2.465550130132776,4.95,4.92,4.97,4.9,11119527,"Max provided a truly 5-star experience for our trip to Berlin. His flat is perfectly situated in the beautiful neighbourhood of Prenzlauer Berg. Max provided lots of great suggestions for things to do in the area. The flat was perfectly clean when we arrived. It was a quiet, lovely space to call our own for our trip. Communication with Max was easy and, even though he was out of town during our stay, he ensured that key handover was taken care of through a very nice friend. I would stay here again and recommend his place to anyone! Thanks, Max!",1,0.9925,Positive
212.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,39,100.0,0,3.646772349969035,5.0,4.97,4.87,4.73,611278733283323802,"Manu was the most attentive host we have ever encountered. He already laid out some drinks for us in the fridge which made our arrival extra nice. We were given very clear instructions for checking in and out and Manu responded very quickly to our messages. <br/>On top of that, the apartment was squeaky clean, a great location near the center of Berlin. We had a wonderful stay, highly recommended!",1,0.9606,Positive
69.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,1,9.845286275411326,4.53,4.73,4.6,4.27,1375034549494946425,"Die Wohnung war für unseren kurzen Aufenthalt perfekt und bat alles, was wir brauchten.",1,-0.8316,Negative
78.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,0,8.9505494061986,4.92,4.94,4.8,4.88,4424125,"Saido's apartment was nice and clean, as shown on the pictures. It's well located and the check-in was really easy. Definitely a place we would recommend! ",1,0.9389,Positive
