190.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,52,100.0,1,5.999075895235788,4.78,4.8,4.54,4.7,3242577,"Sebastian's place was a good alternative to even more expensive hotel prices during the INNOTRANS convention for a group of 3 professionals. <br/>The area is not the greatest part of Berlin but it is nevertheless well connected with bus, tram/metro and sebastian has a good list of local recommendations for restaurants of all cuisines that are in walking distance.<br/>A very responsive host, tricky start ;), but it was sorted out very quickly.",0,0.8253,Positive
