51.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,6.507053849431365,4.88,4.68,4.88,4.84,1300487,"Sehr nette Gastgeberin, die Kommunikation war sehr gut. <br/>Schönes helles Zimmer in einem tollen Viertel an einer großen Straße.<br/>Die Katzen sind super süß - und geben einem noch ein paar Haare als Andenken mit ;) <br/>Ich habe mich wohl gefühlt.",1,-0.4588,Negative
318.0,8,3.0,1.5,5.0,53,100.0,1,3.7256422035937673,4.95,4.94,4.85,4.83,13320037,"Apartment was fantastic.<br/>Very Large & spacious, great for groups &/or families.<br/>Great location, easy access to public transport of any kind. Central station within walking distance. <br/>Cleanliness was great & customer service even better.<br/>Highly recommend.",0,0.9517,Positive
101.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,55,100.0,1,7.229980207068463,4.92,4.91,4.76,4.81,3974304,"It's a lovely aparment in a great location - quiet, tree-lined street with restaurants and shops plus two train stations only a few blocks away.  Carsten was kind and helpful. We had a terrific stay!",1,0.9485,Positive
