107.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,33,100.0,1,2.922418995421466,4.86,4.82,4.71,4.66,16283253,"This place was lovely. It is up a few flights of stairs, but beyond this, there were no issues with the place. It is located in a good area, and had everything I needed. I recommend this place.",1,0.7717,Positive
87.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,21,90.0,0,3.196091525660409,4.72,4.86,4.67,4.6,541569,"Too much small. It's seems there are one living room and one room with 2 beds but isn't it.<br/>Kitchen, living room, room are the same place. 12 minutes walking to the train. But isn't in the centre . Really good to home from the airport, directly line S9",1,0.6474,Positive
59.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,26,100.0,1,16.94592507079506,4.83,4.74,4.83,4.8,4043341,"Wir hatten ein sehr schönes Wochenende bei Andrea, das Haus liegt im Grünen, man wird quasi von Vogelgezwitscher geweckt. In 25 min ist man fußläufig Olympiastadion, was für uns perfekt war. Das Frühstück im Garten war ein schöner Zusatz. <br/>Wir kommen beim nächsten Konzert gerne wieder, danke Andrea!",1,-0.8439,Negative
64.0,2,3.0,1.0,1.0,9,100.0,0,6.520491849546502,4.33,3.67,4.33,4.33,23244843,"Great flat for small or medium sized groups. Nice balcony, furniture and big rooms. Literally on top of Hermastraße station!",1,0.8398,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,21,100.0,1,8.187543141932318,4.92,4.93,4.9,4.8,1266630,"Alles war prima,  die Unterkunft war sehr sauber und Berlin ist von dort perfekt zu erkunden. Gerne wieder.",1,-0.9136,Negative
