183.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,52,100.0,1,1.6509545398006231,4.58,4.58,4.79,4.3,1099345025107928638,"Tobulas butas centre, viskas pasiekiama ranka. Bute yra viskas ko reikia: net iki lyginimo lentos ir lygintuvo. Labai jaukus mielas balkonėlis pasibūti dviese. Apačioje visa restoramų virtinė - gali rinktis pagal savo skonį. Du minusai - jau atgyvenusi sofa, kuri baigia subyrėti. Reiktų jai remonto. Ir nėra nei kondicionieriaus, nei ventiliatoriaus, tad vasarą baisiai karšta miegoti.",1,0.0,Neutral
40.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,11,98.0,0,2.4809600042725424,4.56,4.5,4.85,4.64,35816059,très bien,1,0.0,Neutral
74.0,4,1.0,1.5,2.0,39,100.0,0,6.219640526782811,4.64,4.62,4.58,4.49,679607737624570621,"Très bon séjour, je reviendrai avec plaisir.",1,0.0,Neutral
79.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,11.00520151279848,4.92,4.96,4.81,4.81,5410909,A lovely flat in a very pretty neighbourhood. Alice was the perfect host and the flat had everything I needed. Would highly recommend.,1,0.9298,Positive
108.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,3.617893966015014,4.74,4.78,4.82,4.57,18443210,"A well located, small but perfectly formed studio apartment, close (walking distance) to lots of local shops, bars and restaurants, plus a weekend market, and finally, an easy walk to buses and other transport connections. Clean inside, with a simple dining area for 2 people, kitchen equipment, comfortable bed and a simple bathroom with a shower.  The windows provide lots of nice light into the apartment and can be tilt / turn to allow air in on warm days.  The only snag was the electric door lock which uses a remote fob, that I found could be a bit temperamental. Make sure the door is locked behind you if you’re staying in for the evening. Apart from that - a great place to stay with a useful written guide (in German and English) on local things to do and a communicative host who responded to any questions quickly.",1,0.9912,Positive
129.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,0,5.580550196016207,4.52,4.41,4.69,4.3,574603969538219434,Eine tolle Unterkunft wenn man Berlin erkunden will. Sehr netter Gastgeber.  Alles wie beschrieben...,1,0.0,Neutral
13.0,10,1.0,0.0,10.0,18,100.0,0,4.026491608062799,4.52,4.4,4.69,4.63,31817631,Friendly staff<br/>Enough bathrooms for everyone <br/>Good for a cheap stay and nice atmosphere,0,0.7184,Positive
60.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,45,100.0,1,3.689600261518912,4.74,4.55,4.76,4.65,16237052,"Eine gute Unterkunft für den Preis, man kann sich nicht beschweren. Die Kommunikation war Top und bei Problemen wurde schnell reagiert. Es wurde nach Feedback gefragt",1,-0.7906,Negative
190.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,71,100.0,1,4.667762360210741,4.99,4.86,4.79,4.82,534750508720710490,This apartment is beautiful. Very nice neighborhood. I would absolutely book with them again. Very nice and helpful hosts,1,0.9209,Positive
240.0,7,2.0,1.0,4.0,40,100.0,1,3.458820921311564,4.77,4.69,4.54,4.62,1447726909806697560,"Nous avons passé un excellent séjour. Le logement était très propre et  les lits faits. La literie est très confortable.<br/>La cuisine était accueillante avec du thé/café à disposition ainsi que tout le nécessaire pour cuisiner. <br/>La proximité d'un supermarché ouvert tard a été également appréciable. <br/>Le quartier, en pleine évolution, est agréable de jour comme de nuit. <br/>L'appartement est idéalement situé pour découvrir Berlin, grâce notamment aux nombreuses lignes de bus dans un rayon de 2 à 10 minutes de marche. <br/>Nous recommandons chaudement.",0,-0.0772,Negative
86.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,1.854347940651652,4.84,4.84,4.95,4.53,15227435,"My wife and I spent 40 days at Thomas place and had a great time there.<br/> Communication with Thomas was quite easy, nice, kind and professional.  The place is as shown in the pictures,  very well equipped for a long stay.<br/>The neighborhood is quite nice and lively, with lots of restaurants, bars and a beautiful park just across the street.<br/>The apartment is overlooking the inner garden of the building and is very quiet.<br/>The place is close to the main tourist attractions in Berlin with easy accesd to Transportation (Trams, U-bahn and S-bahn).<br/>We sure reccomend it.",1,0.9871,Positive
155.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,53,100.0,1,22.4451925277576,4.75,4.75,4.91,4.83,1871203,"This spacious, attractive apartment is in a lovely house in a beautiful neighborhood, very close to the Mexico Platz S-Bahn station.  This is an especially good choice for someone who wishes to be in the southwest part of the city, but the S-Bahn line that serves this area provides good access to the city center.   (I was conducting research at the Bundesarchiv.)<br/>The host Antje was very pleasant and helpful, responding to my questions and requests quickly and well.  <br/>The apartment has a washing machine!<br/>This was an excellent place for my eleven-day stay in Berlin.",1,0.9841,Positive
70.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,0,4.4389523138910185,4.9,4.94,5.0,4.84,11291073,"Susanne ist eine zuvorkommende Vermieterin. Der Raum lässt kaum Wünsche offen und überrascht mit allerhand Kleinigkeiten, welche man nicht erwartet.",1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,0,6.366394331566418,4.89,4.89,4.62,4.73,4100032,"Wir hatten eine super Zeit in Berlin! Die Wohnung war echt toll und hat unser Wochenende in Berlin noch schöner gemacht! :) <br/>Die Wohnung ist sehr groß, sauber und super gemütlich! Der Balkon ist ein weiteres Highlight, man darf die Küche benutzen und man darf sich sogar an Kaffee, Tee, Nutella etc. bedienen, einfach super gastfreundlich! :)<br/>Die Kommunikation war ebenfalls total einfach und freundlich, wir konnten den Schlüssel in einem Café um die Ecke abholen und in der Wohnung fanden eine ""Anleitung"" für alles Wichtige in der Wohnung und Tipps vor. <br/>Die öffentlichen Verkehrsmittel befinden sich direkt am Ende der Straße, sodass man in einer halben Stunde im Zentrum ist!<br/>Wir haben nichts auszusetzen, die Wohnung ist wirklich top und ist auf jeden Fall weiter zu empfehlen, kommen auch gerne selber noch einmal! :)",1,-0.3956,Negative
77.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,0,7.289770299606606,4.68,4.6,4.7,4.54,1096201717497278454,"Die Gegend hat uns sehr gefallen. Tolles Falafel Restaurant in der Straße! <br/>Die Unterkunft war gemütlich und zufriedenstellend, auch als ein Satz Bettwäsche gefehlt hat, konnten wir sie schnell mit Hilfe von Primeflats organisieren.",1,-0.8439,Negative
380.0,4,2.0,2.0,3.0,48,100.0,1,1.1071575355391072,4.95,4.99,4.91,4.78,16091735,Loved our stay in Berlin. Marcus’s place is very well located and amazing. Also he has a set of B&W speakers which were too tempting :),0,0.92,Positive
144.0,5,1.0,1.0,3.0,45,96.0,0,6.1770612336798365,4.51,4.41,4.8,4.36,27018640,"Дуже сподобалося, що нас забезпечили кавою, цукром та сіллю ❤️ У квартирі було зручно готувати самому, для цього є достатньо посуду. Нам було зручно й швидко дістатися аеропорту.",1,0.0,Neutral
156.0,6,2.0,2.0,4.0,51,100.0,1,2.784593796049624,4.88,4.78,4.9,4.77,3378027,This flat is amazing. One of the coziest places I have ever stayed and highly recommended.,0,0.7089,Positive
25.0,7,1.0,1.0,6.0,18,93.0,0,4.132403574870102,4.51,4.55,4.61,4.58,41362381,"Ostello situato in una buona posizione, vicino alla metro. Camere e bagni puliti, stanze ariose e posto dove posare il bagaglio in camere in sicurezza.<br/>Unica pecca non ha una cucina usufruibile da chi alloggia, ma per il resto tutto perfetto! Ci tornerei con molto piacere!",1,0.4559,Positive
99.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,1,5.537272677321875,4.9,4.92,4.82,4.59,906267026189397938,"Good location. I am a big fan of the BRLO brewery which is right next door. <br/>The place is good for a city trip. It’s clean, has all you need and the balcony is a big plus. <br/>The communication was flawless. Martin is very quick in his response. He allowed us to check out a bit later which was very nice 😊",1,0.945,Positive
107.0,6,0.0,1.0,3.0,31,100.0,1,6.4861685330092405,4.6,4.45,4.56,4.54,13812209,"Really nice and helpfull host, great contact. Apartment is really nice",1,0.883,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,0,0.9723023441808696,4.9,4.82,4.98,4.88,39920002,"Bright, clean and large Zimmer in a cool appartement in central Berlin.  Amazingly quiet given the place is hardly 10 minutes walk from Alexander Platz or from the Museum Island.  Gerne wieder !",1,0.8016,Positive
