190.0,5,3.0,2.5,3.0,34,100.0,0,3.372660064578003,4.9,4.98,4.7,4.93,7479300,"Andreas welcomed us with BIO jam and a friendly letter providing useful tips about nice restaurants and shops in the neighbourhood.<br/>All the communication went over email but that was never a problem. All our questions were correct and timely answered.<br/><br/>The appartment was clean and conform the description and expectations. Even above expectations: the whole place looked brand new. The WLAN was highly appreciated by the kids.<br/><br/>The neighbourhood is nice and clean with enough basic shops around: supermarket, bakery.<br/><br/>The subway line 2 is accessible after a 10 minutes walk. With this line 2 we had easy access to a lot of touristic hotspots: Alexander Platz, Gendarmenmarkt, Friedrichstrasse, the Zoologischer Garten.",0,0.9819,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,0,5.743631323763001,4.89,4.89,4.44,4.67,574346074209058474,"Die Dachterasse war genial, auch die Einrichtung der Wohnung ist sehr geschmackvoll. Die Küchenausstattung war super.<br/>Etwas nachteilig fanden wir, dass kaum Platz für unsere Lebensmittel in Kühlschrank und Küchenschränken sowie für die Kleider in den Schlafzimmern frei war. <br/>Die Lage der Wohnung war angenehm ruhig, allerdings etwas weit fußläufig von S-/U-Bahn entfernt. <br/>Zum Check-in haben wir den Schlüssel in einen nahe liegenden Squashcenter abgeholt, war völlig problemlos, allerdings haben wir keinerlei Informationen zur Wohnung etc. erhalten und ein Gästebuch gab es leider nicht. <br/>Die Kommunikation mit Benjamin lief immer prompt und problemlos.",1,-0.9875,Negative
86.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,0,2.534130794640229,4.37,4.47,5.0,4.26,1303587153205290215,"The place is as described in the pictures and the location is pretty good, I had an amazing stay :)",1,0.9169,Positive
103.0,1,1.0,0.0,1.0,11,100.0,0,1.652388057808875,4.42,4.64,4.62,4.3,51549694,"The place is basic for exactly what it is and what it is worth. All was clean, and as it was described. Some noise might be coming from the corridor when others pass, but nothing major. I liked it for what I paid and wanted at the moment. The location is excellent. Near everything.",1,0.6544,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,3.993898700796901,5.0,4.91,4.97,4.97,44367752,"extremely nice host and the place was so incredibly lovely, honestly better than i had imagined :) will definitely come back in the future if possible!",1,0.9646,Positive
117.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,0,4.541309535464388,4.83,4.79,4.65,4.63,43522753,"Thank you to both Karolina and Philipp for such a wonderful stay! The apartment is really well laid out, lots of thoughtful touches and our enquiries were always answered super quickly. A very relaxing space, would love to stay again!",1,0.9731,Positive
201.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,28,100.0,1,3.120633279720611,4.59,4.63,4.9,4.45,27955603,"Top spot, lekker veel ruimte, rustig",1,0.2023,Positive
112.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,95.0,0,11.820461804372655,4.69,4.72,4.85,4.53,1039709337375906815,"Top Lage, sehr ruhig. Check-in war sehr einfach. Einige U-Bahnstationen gleich in der Nähe. REWE nicht weit entfernt. Wohnung sehr sauber und gemütlich. Gerne wieder… 😀",1,-0.4767,Negative
132.0,10,3.0,2.0,5.0,33,100.0,0,7.056211941715301,4.58,4.36,4.67,4.52,1055700373321607221,For a group of 6 or more this was a great place and not too far away from the city center and only 30 min from airport.,0,0.6557,Positive
113.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,34,100.0,0,8.128444813154763,4.56,4.46,4.9,4.45,27870140,"amazing room, will definitely stay here if I visit Berlin again",1,0.7579,Positive
116.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,39,100.0,1,8.42482205102276,4.88,4.67,4.93,4.63,945499336867315821,"Vom Feeling einfach perfekt. Es war ein kleines Abenteuer, im positivsten Sinn.<br/>Es gibt wirklich nicht auszusetzen und in Berlin werden wir nur noch auf diesem Hausboot übernachten.",1,-0.5267,Negative
108.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,20,100.0,0,6.601971047748034,5.0,4.9,4.9,5.0,16283413,"First of all, the bed is giant. You can experience the limits of how giant a bed can be :).<br/>Beyond that, Umberto is a great host, the room is quite big, everything that you might need is already prepared for you already. Also the tips and tricks Umberto will provide you about Berlin are invaluable.<br/>The experience was on par or better than a 5 star otel. Thats all you need to know.",1,0.8126,Positive
190.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,52,100.0,1,5.999075895235788,4.78,4.8,4.54,4.7,3242577,"Schlicht aber völlig ausreichend und funktionell ausgestattete Wohnung in der obersten Etage. Schlüsselübergabe klappte super über den Nachbarn Halil, der auch mit Kleinigkeiten ausgeholfen hat. U-Bahn Haltestelle und Einkaufsmöglichkeiten direkt um die Ecke. Von den Bauarbeiten am Haus hat man fast nichts mitbekommen. Danke für die Gastfreundlichkeit.",0,-0.5994,Negative
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,14,100.0,0,5.545815942853136,5.0,5.0,4.9,5.0,19678317,"Julia was a wonderful host and everything was super easy. She replied quickly and was always very helpful. The apartment was just like it was described. It is easy to reach from airport or train station. Public transportation (bus and metro) are a couple of blocks away. The neighborhood is lively with little shops, cafes and bars.  You will love this, if you prefer neighborhoods like Neukölln. The apartment is very cozy and spacious. We really enjoyed having our breakfasts at the balcony. I definitely recommend this place and will visit again when in Berlin!",1,0.9881,Positive
54.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,15.507270682054347,4.96,4.99,4.64,4.92,17955217,"Das Zimmer der Familie ist gut ausgestattet und das Bad wirklich super. Es war alles sehr sauber und das Doppelbett groß und gemütlich. <br/>Der Anschluss mit ÖPNV in Richtung Kreuzberg und Ostbahnhof oder Hackesche Höfe ist gut. Es sind etwa 20 Minuten zu Fuß zur S-Bahn Springpfuhl und diese fährt etwa 15 Minuten? zum Ostbahnhof. Alternativ gibt's eine Tram die M8 zur S-Bahn, was etwa genauso lange dauert.<br/>Die Gegend ist sehr bürgerlich mit Einzelhäusern, Villen und Gärten.<br/>Ein Ausflugstipp sind die Gärten der Welt, die zu Fuß etwa 30 Minuten entfernt sind, eine ehemalige IGA Ausstellung, 7,- Eintritt, incl. Kleiner Sommerrodelbahn und Seilbahn, toller Wasserspielplatz und tolle Architektur der Gärten.<br/>Wir kommen bestimmt wieder..",1,-0.9196,Negative
77.0,1,1.0,0.0,1.0,17,100.0,0,3.883872869353541,3.59,3.72,4.14,3.72,265389,Sehr nettes Hostel. Man trifft nette offene Menschen dort.,1,0.0,Neutral
103.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,1,12.340502664810618,4.67,4.54,4.78,4.74,11429575,Everything was fine! It’s a good place to stay for a weekend when visiting Berlin,1,0.6114,Positive
48.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,0,4.230279756706139,4.76,4.76,4.48,4.74,31006339,"everything was fine, easy check in and out and very well located regarding to public transport",1,0.7264,Positive
140.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,20,100.0,0,30.42173800450771,5.0,5.0,4.76,4.88,49997422,"Uns hat der Aufenthalt außerordentlich gut gefallen.<br/>Die Wohnung hat eine gute, zentrale Lage und ist dennoch ruhig.<br/>Hervorzuheben sind die geschmackvolle Einrichtung, das schöne, gut funktionierende Bad und eine Terrasse.<br/>Es ist alles vorhanden, was man für einen entspannten Aufenthalt benötigt. <br/>Wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt und werden bei Gelegenheit wieder buchen.",1,-0.8126,Negative
194.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,45,85.0,0,1.5095289909770313,4.7,4.83,4.93,4.5,45475523,Danke für den tollen Aufenthalt. Ein wunderschönes Apartment !!!,1,0.0,Neutral
119.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,52,100.0,0,5.951534937224258,4.81,4.63,4.65,4.74,18671787,Die Wohnung ist genauso toll wie auf den Fotos. Die Lage ist wunderschön. Toller Stadtteil. Die Flugzeuge sind jedoch schon recht laut. Das sollte sich hoffentlich in einem Jahr erledigt haben! <br/>Sehr zu empfehlen!,1,-0.9229,Negative
151.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,52,100.0,1,8.281883245071777,4.92,4.96,4.78,4.82,5281256,Appartement confortable,1,0.0,Neutral
119.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,41,100.0,1,3.227757851884324,4.92,4.78,4.94,4.69,32066095,Fantastic location close to the river. Very clean with lovely bonus of a balcony. Hannah was very flexible and welcoming on our arrival and gave us lots of great tips. Comfy beds and great to have washing machine and freezer. This was just ideal for our mum and son 3 night stay. Super helpful hosts too! Only one thing I could recommend is to invest in a full length mirror somewhere in the apartment! 10/10,1,0.9911,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,1,19.305886449552432,4.95,4.89,4.78,4.94,907807912932543143,"Birgit est adorable et très accueillante.<br/>La chambre est grande, jolie, propre. Sans compter la salle de bains privative et le super petit déjeuner!<br/>Merci Birgit!",1,0.8264,Positive
119.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,4,97.0,0,3.51544057363174,4.21,4.43,4.64,4.32,1196988614807603520,"It was really clean, great location, comfy bed, lovely owner! Would definitely recommend and stay in again :)",1,0.9621,Positive
125.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,24,99.0,0,2.254260246133724,4.74,4.68,4.87,4.58,35047363,"Woonkamer/ keuken heel gezellig met grote tafel en goed geoutilleerde keuken. Uitzicht op tuin. Gescheiden badkamer en toilet. Heerlijke douche!<br/>Minpunten: Ruimte waar de 2 eenpersoons bedden staan is, als het licht aan is, een kijkdoos. Gordijnen moeten dan echt dicht. Ganglicht centraal geregeld. Lampen in slaapkamer gaan dan ook aan. Dit is niet ideaal. Weinig frisse lucht in de slaapvertrekken. Ligging van appartement is top. Vlak bij tramhalte en met tram 20 min van Museuminsel. <br/>Buurt heel rustig.",1,0.2714,Positive
48.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,16,87.0,0,7.889169508668093,4.68,4.76,4.58,4.7,3988568,A nice apartment with easy transport links to the city. Very clean and well maintained.,1,0.8766,Positive
137.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,1,3.131262585603502,4.64,4.67,4.85,4.59,68448,"This AirBnb was in the perfect location in the hot new neighborhood of Prenzlauer Berg.  It was safe, close to lots of restaurants, and an easy walk to the S-Bahn, U-bahn, and M.  The apartment was as described - clean and neat, with clear instructions on how to use the washer/dryer (a key for us).  The kitchen had exactly what we needed.  The apartment was clean, quiet, as described and close to so many things.  Overall - a glowing 5 stars.  This was great.",1,0.9738,Positive
85.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,34,95.0,1,4.724429146468118,4.76,4.57,4.76,4.72,53962004,place is what you expect. <br/>no surprises,1,0.2263,Positive
