64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,0,6.8030864064557015,4.23,4.31,5.0,4.54,41902456,"The place is great, very spacious and in a very good neighborhood.<br/>There are cafés all around which are fun to explore and spend your days in.<br/>For the same reason I didn't mind not having a Kitchen.<br/>WiFi Connection is good.<br/>The owner is really helpful and nice.",1,0.9497,Positive
157.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,45,100.0,0,5.245003120876255,4.77,4.72,4.68,4.61,11914556,Really nice and well decorated place with good instructions. Amazing how every bit of the apartment is used!! There are some nice bars in the area and the connections to other parts of Berlin are good. The communication with Dan was easy. I can totally recommend this place!!,0,0.975,Positive
106.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,0,7.848293691744613,4.5,4.54,4.81,4.42,229363,Had a wonderful experience.  Listing was exactly as described with a lovely view of the Spree from the patio.  Check-in was a breeze and I felt very welcome.  Loved the Berlin maps available to peruse - very helpful as a visitor!  Easy access to public transportation and close to everything.  Great location.  ,1,0.9785,Positive
110.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,49,99.0,1,3.643269927441448,4.72,4.68,4.85,4.56,30239816,"The Loft was exactly as described and perfect for our visit to Berlin. The Loft was comfortable, just the right size for our family of three and quiet as it is off the main street. Berlin‘s Hauptbahnhof was a short 10 minute walk away, and streetcar, bus, S-Bahn and U- bahn stations equally close for very easy access to the whole city. We would definitely stay here again.",1,0.9168,Positive
