71.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,1.4609881394793005,4.94,4.98,4.97,4.87,25252686,"Had a lovely stay at Ambra’s apartment! Unfortunately, I was not able to meet Ambra, but her boyfriend let me in and helped show the apartment to me when I first arrived. Both were very patient. The room itself was super clean, the bathroom was great, and very close to walk around downtown. Would recommend!",1,0.9686,Positive
