68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,0,6.064974723523067,4.89,4.91,4.8,4.73,25441857,"We had a truly lovely stay at Miljan’s place. He was an exceptional host – welcoming, discreet, and always available if we needed anything. Sharing the house with him was easy and natural thanks to his kindness and respect for shared spaces.<br/>The house was clean, tidy, and well organized, exactly as described in the listing. We felt at home from the very beginning.<br/>We highly recommend this place to anyone looking for a peaceful and authentic experience, made even better by the presence of a great host like Miljan. Thank you again for everything!",1,0.9938,Positive
