81.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,6.919397234051426,4.82,4.86,4.48,4.7,20890869,"Amazing stay here. Great flat with so many little touches, hairdryer, coffee machine, speaker, plugs with multiple usb ports for chargers without adaptors, plenty of kitchen supplies. Excellent host! Clean kitchen, linen and fresh towels. It’s a bit of a treck out of the town centre and lively areas but easy to get to on the underground, which is great and runs constantly. Also up a fair few flights of stairs to be aware of. We checked out early and they held our bags in storage for us throughout the day which was a very great touch. Amazing friendly hosts.",1,0.991,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,1,5.214230051035078,4.98,4.89,5.0,4.76,1094780733516353019,"Fantastic place, great location, felt safe and secure and it was lovely and clean. Laura was friendly and responsive",1,0.9756,Positive
161.0,4,1.0,2.0,2.0,56,100.0,1,2.045183840821759,4.95,4.97,4.94,4.88,637575697682777608,"My husband and I traveled to Berlin from Chicago to run the Berlin Marathon and decided to choose Simon's place after reading reviews. His place looked exactly like the pictures and had a very cozy feel. We loved the balcony for morning coffee and evening wine. There are several coffee shops and restaurants nearby as well as a supermarket within walking distance. We were also very close to several U (subway) lines for easy access around the city. Simon gave us several local recommendations for lunch and dinner before our arrival so I could be proactive in making reservations because of a busy marathon weekend, his recommendations were a hit! I will say the stairs are no joke in this place. My tired legs after a marathon were not pleased and neither was my husband carrying my 45 pound suitcase up and down the stairs LOL! I am so happy with our decision to stay here and would love to stay here again if we return to Berlin!",1,0.9711,Positive
49.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,0,8.092180844920643,4.73,4.78,4.59,4.68,222784,"Fantastic host, comfy apartment. Everything I needed.<br/>Only one stop away from HBF from the S bahn which is a short walk to and the U bahn is even closer. <br/><br/>Kelly is great, extremely helpful and super prompt on correspondence. Look forward to returning to Berlin. ",1,0.9294,Positive
