179.0,10,4.0,3.5,5.0,22,100.0,1,6.948660996537318,4.85,4.92,4.68,4.72,20910462,"Ha sido unos días estupendos y la casa de Oliver es perfecta! Hemos estado 2 familias y tiene todo lo que necesitas. La casa es genial, la zona tranquila y en 500 metros un centro comercial, metro, tranvía. A 10 minutos andando estación de tren que en una parada te deja en estación central o un tren regional te viene/va al aeropuerto. No está “céntrica” pero el barrio es residencial y muy tranquilo para descansar de un día de pateo por la cuidad. Oliver es un anfitrión muy agradable y ayuda sin problemas.",0,0.2714,Positive
121.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,27,100.0,0,4.472653939309849,4.88,4.9,4.81,4.78,10122398,"Martins place was fantastic. You will get exactly what is advertised on the bnb listing. Close to everything in town. We walked everywhere. Martin was helpful with local tips, prompt with his responses, very accommodating as well. Place was clean. You won’t be disappointed in staying with him.",1,0.8107,Positive
33.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,1,6.809556888557899,4.95,4.93,4.86,4.94,7806721,"Super! Highly recommend!<br/>Especially who wants a handy route to BER [ airport T1/T2]- there will be a direct bus N7X and also a train S45 to the airport, it will take about 40-50 min in the early morning!<br/>bus stop and train station are very close , both are about 10min walk distance to Garrelt's place, depends on how past you walk! <br/>And the host is a super trustworthy and thoughtful person, that will give you everything that you need to easily find his place!<br/>Room is very cozy and clean, I like it veeeery much!",1,0.9676,Positive
