171.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,44,90.0,1,11.510851452846596,4.78,4.8,4.79,4.66,699820589487993617,"Отличное жилье , подходящее для превосходного времяпровождения . Смарт тв так же было отличным бонусом , чего часто не хватает в отелях обычных . <br/>Расположение отличное , рядом есть все необходимое , центр. Берлин отличный город , в который влюбляешься сразу .<br/>Благодарю работников , за отличную организацию .",1,0.0,Neutral
164.0,6,2.0,1.5,3.0,42,100.0,1,2.561101005915228,4.82,4.76,4.66,4.69,31014654,"Great appartement for a citytrip to Berlin. Close to the Ubahn & tram. 2 stops from Alexanderplatz. So very good location! Couldn't wish for a better place to stay. Also, great shower. Thanks!!",0,0.9039,Positive
141.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,19,100.0,1,7.917329035356467,4.65,4.79,4.32,4.5,12925015,"A great apartment. We have stayed with a group of 6 for the weekend and the space was sufficient.Note that the 6th bed is not a mattress but one person foldable sofa and it was OK.  The apartment is very conveniently located on the ground floor that helps if you have bulky luggage. Also the host allowed us check-in one hour before the official check-in. Communication was a bit slow with Jan but after i have called him, thing were going great. We definitely recommend his place.",1,0.9729,Positive
65.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,3.682002514950653,4.88,4.85,4.88,4.74,703900,"Sharon is a very friendly and helpful host. Whatever you want to do, wherever you want to go, she is never lacks some great advice. We really felt very welcome and we had a great time in Berlin.<br/>The room is big as well as her amazing bathroom. You won't miss anything here, so go ahead book your trip to Berlin with Sharon.",1,0.8878,Positive
35.0,6,1.0,1.0,6.0,18,93.0,0,4.132370926663647,4.13,4.75,4.5,4.0,764317076478358046,Photos of the room are fake and doesn't represent the reality of the rooms you find in the place that was the first schock.<br/>Nice place to stay for a night and if you are a student.,1,-0.4767,Negative
78.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,0,8.9505494061986,4.92,4.94,4.8,4.88,4424125,"L'appartement de Saido est bien situé : proche des transports en commun,  de la vie nocturne gay mais aussi à moins de 10 minutes de zone commerciales importantes<br/>L' appartement est calme, bien décoré, parfait pour 1 ou deux personnes avec 2 épiceries à 1 minute ce qui est un point très agréable.",1,0.0,Neutral
48.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,63,90.0,1,12.572987688254685,4.88,4.85,4.71,4.79,47488393,"Eine gemütliche Unterkunft in der man sich wohl fühlt.  Zu Fuß ist die Bahn schnell zu erreichen, sowie auch Einkaufsmöglichkeiten. Ich würde jederzeit dort wieder eine Unterkunft buchen.",1,-0.5994,Negative
