115.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,42,100.0,1,17.960496069020618,4.96,4.99,4.76,4.91,5335113,This apartment was exceptionally clean and tidy with many good amenities. Werner is a good host who is has excellent communication and very helpful. Thank you for your understanding when we had a unexpected situation.,1,0.9543,Positive
125.0,1,1.0,1.0,2.0,15,100.0,1,2.187850547569466,4.91,4.94,4.94,4.91,12062058,"Meike was a wonderful, very welcomimg host! The apartment was beautiful and the beds were very comfortable. The showers, kitchen, heating, etc were in excellent condition. The location of the apartment is also great! I highly recommend Meike's apartment...we had a fabulous stay in Berlin! ",1,0.98,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,0,14.492380365971504,4.87,5.0,4.83,4.91,1880039,"Barbara and Hubertus were perfect hosts. Their flat is immaculate, and they were very helpful and timely in addressing the little things that came up. I would gladly stay there again.",1,0.8479,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,0,2.768868245510529,4.84,4.95,4.95,4.63,36584331,Beautiful light filled apartment in great neighbourhood. Place is nicer and larger than the pictures. Has all the amenities you’d ever need for a stay. Had some issues with the smart lock during check in but this was quickly resolved as the host was super responsive and helpful.,1,0.9688,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,57,100.0,0,7.06708233904912,4.6,4.85,4.68,4.68,29029427,"Polite, friendly and accommodating host",1,0.4939,Positive
81.0,5,0.0,1.0,6.0,33,100.0,0,6.519360364521975,4.78,4.59,4.84,4.64,44872206,Die Unterkunft hat eine super Lage. Man ist überall sehr schnell. Die Unterkunft ist sehr gemütlich und hat alles was man für ein paar Tage Berlin braucht :),1,-0.2263,Negative
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,0,2.559692009773911,4.99,5.0,4.99,4.93,23442676,"Wunderschöne Wohnung, die alles hält, was sie verspricht. Die Kommunikation war blitzschnell, zuvor kommend und sehr angenehm. Wir haben uns sehr wohlgefühlt und die Lage ist für einen Städtetrip optimal. Außerdem haben wir noch zahlreiche Tipps bekommen bzgl Restaurant Empfehlungen und Unternehmungen. Auf jeden Fall werden wir die Unterkunft weiterempfehlen",1,-0.9584,Negative
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,0,11.33442137742393,4.89,4.88,4.78,4.8,22767707,"Sascha is a very nice and thoughtful person, who takes care of every tiny detail a guest might need. He's always in touch and very responsive.<br/>I was very impressed by cleanliness of his place as well as overall neatly-organized apartment.<br/>The guest gets everything they require (Sascha even got me scales to weigh my suitcases before departure) and was very nice to allow me stay a bit longer, as my flight was in the evening.<br/>Cannot thank him more for his consideration and support!",1,0.9732,Positive
55.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,49,100.0,1,22.12570946122336,4.92,4.96,4.47,4.89,551948848079907495,"Great one night stay before we flew home the next day. It was nice to be out of Berlin a bit-it’s quiet and easy to park, etc. It has a microwave and fridge, along with a few other kitchenette items which was nice.",1,0.9118,Positive
85.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,0,3.889522362141505,4.83,4.71,4.67,4.71,40936968,"Heide's place was great for my group that included 3 adults and a toddler. The location was very convenient to the Sbahn (train) and streetcar system as well as an Edeke grocery store just down the street. Heide was responsive to all my questions, providing recommendations for nearby playgrounds and prior to our arrival, setting up a pack and play crib and high chair for my son and set up couch for sleeping in the living room. She even left a few age appropriate toys for him, and we took advantage of the outdoor patio every day for play, appreciating the extra space. Overall the space was larger in the main room and bedroom than I expected from the photos and generally for being in Europe and our size group. I would highly recommend this location.",1,0.9595,Positive
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,26,100.0,1,1.6504053952892772,4.94,4.98,4.94,4.95,3895024,"Jacopo's place was even nicer than the photos. It was very clean, had everything we needed (washer, dishwasher, toaster, etc.), and was in a great location. The apartment, being on an inner courtyard, is wonderfully quiet, especially on the weekend when school isn't in session. It's a great neighborhood with nice cafes, good coffee shops, and a low key vibe. Access to the inner city was easy and straightforward by tram or bus. Check in was very easy. ",1,0.9806,Positive
67.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,55,100.0,1,2.305726509562826,4.9,4.96,4.88,4.83,4380854,Nettes Zimmer in zentraler Lage mit toller Anbindung an die öffentlichen Verkehrsmittel. Sehenswürdigkeiten können auch zu Fuß erreicht werden. Das Zimmer war zudem gemütlich und sauber. Die Gastgeber sehr freundlich. Insgesamt sehr empfehlenswert :),1,-0.8658,Negative
