125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,0,5.551656633975451,4.75,4.63,4.88,4.75,1196751937830948074,"Appartement proche du métro et des commerces, au 2e étage sans ascenseur, vaste mais peu confortable. Sièges et canapé en mauvais état. Linge de lit insuffisant. Serviettes de bain sentant l'humidité. Prises électriques arrachées du mur. Les photos correspondent à la réalité mais dans le détail l'appartement est vétuste.",1,0.0,Neutral
138.0,7,1.0,1.0,3.0,67,100.0,1,12.18456689720396,4.89,4.79,4.89,4.89,1272525072465188986,"Great place! With lots of things already equipped in the home, like spices and shower products.<br/>we stayed with friends and felt the apartment was spacious enough for 4. <br/>Clean place, friendly host, great location!",0,0.9558,Positive
160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,98.0,0,1.0407544919436775,4.54,4.66,4.77,4.45,34294913,"Wonderful location, nice enough apartments. Apart from the stains in the curtains it was pretty clean. <br/>The front of house staff were very helpful and friendly.<br/>We did find it hard at first to find the apartments and where to go in, but the staff were brilliant and there pretty much all the time when we needed them.<br/>They also let us keep our luggage at their reception all day as the checkout was 10am but our flight wasn't till 10pm. <br/>Would stay again.",1,0.9555,Positive
