125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,18,100.0,0,6.172270156061447,4.5,4.67,4.33,4.67,48462431,"Great location and neighborhood- and amazingly convenient to get from and to airport, and some « must-see » areas if first time in Berlin. <br/>I loved my big spacious room, with space enough to do my yoga-movement-meditation practice - and the familiar reminders of this. It was simply and creatively decorated, and after travelling overseas, and busy days in Berlin (mixing business and touring around), it offered a restful respite at the end of each day.<br/>Neukolin neighbourhood held a special vibrancy and creative energy that made me want to return just to explore more - and I would definitely choose to stay at Hai Van’s place again.",1,0.9718,Positive
