89.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,1,4.64019565298711,4.88,4.74,4.85,4.78,21759319,"The place was beautiful - a cozy and well decorated apartment in one of my favorite areas in Berlin. The apartment is located in the basement, but still isn’t noisy since the house is in a rather calm street.  Karen and Adam were lovely hosts, we’re hoping to come back soon!",1,0.9441,Positive
