117.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,14,100.0,0,0.6039103911177419,4.29,4.33,4.87,4.4,36256668,"A nice place to stay in Berlin given the rates. There's a bar downstairs for the drinkers, great food and drinks offers for guests,the rooms are small and comfortable, the service is 24hrs which is cool, really close to the Rosa Luxembourg Platz thus transportation is sorted, the bathrooms are shared the only negative but again that's the balance! Would definitely go back again",1,0.857,Positive
95.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,3.1833669854420146,4.83,4.85,4.8,4.58,34018418,"Great apartment in a great area. Apartment was really beautiful to stay in - spacious with high ceilings. Neighbourhood was safe and really nice to explore - lots of food options. Canal is a short walk away with great cafes along it and nice to just chill. U-bahn stations just a short 5 mins walk away. Overall, would come back again for sure!!",1,0.9826,Positive
