51.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,1,2.1347640511305235,4.95,4.93,4.99,4.9,25217652,"Tilman's apartment is well equipped, spacious and comfortable in a very convenient location. Just 10-15  mins on tram from Berlin Central Station. As two women in our seventies, my sister-in-law and I found the stairs to the fourth floor a bit of a challenge but Tilman very graciously helped with our luggage both on arrival and departure. However, It was definitely worth the climb and we did get use to it, especially coming up and down without luggage;  it very private and quiet. It was pleasant to have breakfast on the balcony which is surrounded by tall trees and overlooks the gardens below. Tilman was available to answer queries by phone/text, which was very useful. One small inconvenience was the fact that wifi connection was switched off overnight and we were not aware of this till I enquired in the morning. Overall it was great value for money and, in spite of the stairs, I would definitely want to stay there again.",1,0.9822,Positive
45.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,2.0393793505131024,4.86,4.76,4.96,4.79,24446063,100% recommend! Susanne was very helpful and the place itself fit its description and my expectations.,1,0.8118,Positive
269.0,6,0.0,1.0,3.0,36,100.0,1,1.0556232531547587,4.75,4.85,4.72,4.64,1033389053096639313,"Lovely apartment, very clean, great location for clubs and nightlife. A lot of stairs",1,0.9036,Positive
89.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,7.289170629982721,4.87,4.77,4.77,4.8,533523,Sehr sauberes und gemütliches Apartment. Top Kommunikation zum Gastgeber! Bushaltestelle sehr nahgelegen ideal um von dort von A nach B zu kommen.<br/>Für den nächsten Berlin-Trip ein super Aufenthaltsmöglichkeit.,1,0.8553,Positive
240.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,60,70.0,1,1.48110149635335,4.67,4.92,4.83,4.64,29509862,Beautiful spot in the heart of the city. <br/>Exactly what you are looking for,0,0.5994,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,0,19.564166946194952,4.8,4.18,4.85,4.68,37695252,This place is just a dream! We’ve been working from there (good internet connection) and enjoyed this huge space and the forest a lot. The neighboring artist are all very nice and Kaya is the greatest host! We had the best week there and we are very thankful.,1,0.975,Positive
127.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,60,100.0,0,5.41749734445679,4.57,4.42,4.37,4.48,53491060,Great location and a very nice place to stay. Would definitely recommend,1,0.908,Positive
137.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,1.6809549157543209,4.96,4.95,4.95,4.83,2061212,"Lovely stylish original space studio in Prenzlauer Berg with a nice balcony wich is bigger than it seems on the foto's. Also the studio, we found bigger than it seemed on the foto's. Very spacy beautiful bathroom with rain shower and everything you may need. And very clean! The building is caratahristic for Berlin. The studio is at the back of the building overlooking the inner garden. Therefore very quick, one of my personal needs in the evening. :-). The are coffee-perculators and some coffee tea and some herbs an oil to make a simple dinner in the smal kitchen.  Al very very comfortable bed and everything you see around you, is a joy for the eyes. Kitty is living next door. If you go out you will find many places to have a drink, have dinner, lunch or breakfast en within walking distance of the Kulturbrauerei and Kollwitzplatz. Ik can only recommend this place in Berlin to everybody. Tip: the Weinbar a few meters down the road from the apartment is a lovely place who serves lovely wine and some small snacks. Also for dinner ok, is what we thought. Make a reservation and drink the Riesling. Miriam and Tom - 10-13 August 2019",1,0.9885,Positive
130.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,0,6.976213743299643,4.96,4.93,4.97,4.86,32987496,"Oliver ist ein sehr höflicher, hilfsbereiter und unkomplizierter Gastgeber. Von der Wohnung aus ist alles gut mit Bus-/Bahn erreichbar. Einkaufsmöglichkeiten in unmittelbarer Nähe. Die Lage ist in einem gepflegten Viertel Berlins. Die Wohnung ist hochwertig, gepflegt und sauber.  Es wurde möglich gemacht, die Wohnung alleine zu nutzen; das ist nicht selbstverständlich in Berlin und sehr zuvorkommend. Berlin ist nicht nur ""eine"" Reise wert.  Danke Oliver! Jeder Zeit wieder bei Dir. Wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt. Manuela und Matthias.",1,-0.9184,Negative
160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,87.0,0,3.4802565088356308,4.54,4.54,4.6,4.41,43798011,"Das Nena Appartment überzeugt definitiv mit dem Preis-Leistungs-Verhältnis. Das Zimmer ist modern eingerichtet, das Bett ist bequem und die kleine Küchenzeile bietet alles, was man benötigt. Wenn wir eine Unterkunft in Kreuzberg suchen, würden wir sicher wiederkommen!",1,-0.636,Negative
67.0,5,1.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,0,4.171651288410796,4.4,4.34,4.81,4.4,26559060,Everything was smooth and convenient about our stay. Thanks Amit!,1,0.4926,Positive
96.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,53,100.0,0,3.047161883343627,4.61,4.77,4.61,4.5,687582,Perfect stay in Berlin near the canal.<br/>The flat is very clean !<br/>Many thanks Kamal,1,0.8793,Positive
125.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,1,5.768494430655579,4.96,4.96,4.79,4.74,31142160,Dine’s place was beautiful! It was so spacious yet homey and we felt comfortable right away. The beds were super comfy and the shower and kitchen were both excellent<br/>Her communication was also really great - warm and timely. <br/>I just wish we could have stayed longer!,1,0.9681,Positive
175.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,1,5.186577238960229,4.77,4.88,4.66,4.72,28535860,"Quiet, really clean hotel with a great breakfast. Room was exactly as expected and comfortable. It’s about a 10 min walk from Potsdamer Platz and  maybe 5 to a U station. <br/>I would recommend this hotel to someone looking for a quiet place - but those traveling solo like me for the weekend who want to be in the middle of it, I would suggest another  neighborhood.",1,0.8792,Positive
77.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,23,96.0,0,13.06909762308404,4.81,4.8,4.59,4.73,24328002,"ruhige Lage, sauber, zuverlässig",1,0.0,Neutral
260.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,91.0,0,4.81020597174384,4.59,4.7,4.4,4.44,28299765,"We had a great stay in Berlin thanks to Juliáns. The location was great - there were multiple trams going which put you in the middle of the center in a few minutes. The check-in went smoothly and the apartment was clean, cozy and had everything someone needs! The windows were also very thick, so it did not allow any sounds of the S-station to come in and contributed to a good night of sleep! Would definitely recommend!",1,0.9687,Positive
248.0,8,3.0,1.0,7.0,28,100.0,0,1.9204539822657205,4.62,4.62,4.9,4.52,6708791,"Wir hatten zwei tolle Tage in der Wohnung von Birgit. Die Lage ist super und das Haus selbst mit dem tollen Holzboden,den hohen Decken und den großen Fenstern schön. Wir waren eine Gruppe aus zwei Familien und haben die Geräumigkeit, die zentrale Lage mit vielen Angeboten für Kinder direkt „um die Ecke“ sehr geschätzt. Außerdem gab es tolle Spielsachen für die Altersgruppe unserer Kinder (bis 6).",0,-0.8807,Negative
107.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,36,100.0,0,6.609127265569619,4.72,4.5,4.72,4.65,29412907,"My teenaged son and I stayed here for four nights and it was perfect for us. The kitchen was good for cooking small meals, we had our own separate spaces and we could relax and watch movies together on the couch. Many and easy public transportation options nearby.",1,0.9081,Positive
100.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,99.0,0,0.9354947556413724,4.69,4.47,4.87,4.68,930506346504115139,"Buen lugar! La ubicación es más que perfecta, está en el barrio judío. Mucha oferta gastronómica y cerca a transporte público. La habitación es bastante amplia y amena, así como limpia. La cama está súper confortable. Los host humanos y gatunos estuvieron perfectos. Gracias!",1,0.4559,Positive
172.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,24,100.0,1,3.363106751874121,4.94,4.83,4.91,4.8,50973537,Great location and incredible design! <br/>Much more spacious than expected.<br/>Wonderful stay,1,0.6588,Positive
146.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,96.0,0,2.9685237429570543,4.67,4.71,4.88,4.59,50931530,"Confortable, très bien situé dans un quartier vivant du centre-ville.<br/>Petit bonus: un client de l’hôtel a poussé des petits cris de singe une heure durant la nuit dernière, torse-nu à sa fenêtre. Dépaysement garanti",1,0.5423,Positive
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,39,100.0,1,3.069150802893347,4.9,4.7,4.92,4.81,53623941,"We had a stellar time at Ingo's. He was extremely helpful with the directions and local recommendations. He was even thoughtful enough to let us have an early check-in and late checkout as per our travel itinerary.<br/>He has a beautiful apartment which is right next to the metro, tram and a mall. In all, the perfect place to book for your trip to Berlin!",1,0.9272,Positive
107.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,33,100.0,1,12.260182751072744,4.96,4.98,4.88,4.84,22500999,"Die Wohnung liegt super zentral und man ist zugleich in der Ruhe der Berliner Höfe und Gärten. Wunderbar! <br/>Die Ausstattung ist optimal, es gibt in der Küche alles was man braucht für einen Kurzbesuch und einen gemütlichen Ess- oder Spieltisch im Wohnzimmer. <br/>Sehr empfehlenswert!",1,0.4738,Positive
126.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,0,18.915767879804527,4.96,4.82,4.82,4.77,1196457493711453031,Sehr zu empfehlen. Sehr nette Gastgeberin,1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,13,100.0,0,0.5871721641900365,4.67,4.44,4.97,4.64,5658501,"Super rapport qualité prix, l'appartement se trouve dans un bel immeuble dans le centre de Berlin avec une superbe terrasse. Nous avions tout ce qu'il faut à disposition, je recommande.",1,0.5267,Positive
113.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,1.690089732558581,4.95,4.95,4.82,4.84,45338556,Very comfortable home. The landlord is very nice and responds quickly.,1,0.7708,Positive
125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,1,5.0338916095304445,4.91,4.95,4.93,4.7,44992573,"The apartment is very nice (beautiful wall color), clean, cozy and quiet. It is located in an ideal place, close to the center, in a beautiful part of town. Another plus is the no-contact key pick-up, which in the current situation is a very good solution. Leo is a very helpful host who responds quickly to messages. I hope this place will be free the next time I am in Berlin.",1,0.9802,Positive
79.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,9.205613934474908,4.72,4.57,4.52,4.68,2191449,"We had a great experience, our host came over and explained everything about the apartment, then showed us a map of the area and explained how to get to places. The apartment was great! Very comfortable, with all the appliances you need! It was really great, we were all really happy with it. ",1,0.9701,Positive
52.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,1,3.473271590604837,4.84,4.81,4.93,4.81,9689519,"Eine schöne und empfehlenswerte kleine Wohnung in Kreuzberg.<br/>Die Ausstattung ist sehr gut und umfangreich, die Kommunikation mit den Gastgebern fix und einwandfrei, die Lage gut.<br/>Einziger Negativpunkt während des Aufenthalts war die Hellhörigkeit des Hauses, was aber wohl auf temporäre Umbauarbeiten einerseits und andererseits im Falle von nächtlichem Trittschall in Teilen auch einfach nur persönliche Empfindlichkeit und Pech ist.",1,-0.9485,Negative
125.0,5,3.0,1.0,2.0,65,100.0,0,5.4191851787607,4.83,4.77,4.77,4.83,6568956,"Appartement fidèle à l’annonce, parfaite pour une famille de 4 a 5 personnes, surtout pour les enfants (jeux dans la chambre et sur la terrasse). très belle terrasse. <br/>À 2 minutes à pied de la U8 et des magasins (aldi et magasin bio). À 20 minutes d´Alexanderplatz en metro. <br/>bonne communication avec Florian.<br/>On vous recommande.",0,0.0,Neutral
316.0,8,3.0,2.0,4.0,45,100.0,1,1.2937250483136316,4.73,4.76,4.9,4.61,12048269,"The apartment was beautiful and they were really accommodating and allowed us to check in early as we arrived early. The apartment was clean and had everything we needed and was a great location, would recommend staying here!",0,0.9259,Positive
58.0,5,1.0,1.0,4.0,23,96.0,1,6.091510504201948,4.53,4.52,4.66,4.41,4326410,"war alles super. Nette Gastgeberin, die schnell auf meine Nachrichten geantwortet hat. Anleitungen waren gut verständlich und alles, was man so brauchen könnte, war da. Gerne wieder",1,-0.8316,Negative
112.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,27,99.0,0,3.5203574283502013,4.13,4.03,4.69,4.25,1050424535012234861,"Central location with easy access, clean and good host.",1,0.8176,Positive
160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,87.0,0,3.4802565088356308,4.54,4.54,4.6,4.41,43798011,"Stor anbefaling! Lejligheden overgik vores forventninger, især mht køkkenfaciliteter, som indeholdt både kogeplader, køleskab, mikroovn, nespresso-kaffemaskine og service til to. Flot og lækkert bad. Senge ok. Eneste anke var hovedpuderne, der var noget hårde. Alt andet var super. Et sted vi vil vælge igen! Tæt på Landwehrkanalen hvor der er fine gåture, og tæt på Bergmannsstrasse med små fine barer, restauranter, madmarked og loppemarked.",1,0.6988,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,19,100.0,0,4.537903297375009,4.88,4.82,4.88,4.85,5119872,"This is a really great apartment. Bright, spacious, and very comfortable. There's a well-equipped, modern kitchen and a massive dining table in the living area for sharing meals. And that TV screen should be legendary! The location is great: it's central but quiet, with multiple transport options within a few minutes' walk. Luke was extremely helpful and was always easily contactable, even when he was out of the city for work. When I had to leave Berlin early, he had no problem communicating with my travelling buddies, something I really appreciated. I would definitely recommend this place to anyone visiting Berlin, especially if you need space for multiple guests.",1,0.974,Positive
88.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,80.0,0,4.3965704421174285,4.79,4.7,4.87,4.68,4361737,"Все было замечательно) Расположение отличное, в 5 минутах ходьбы от метро, в двух станциях от Александр платц (30 мин пешком). Рядом очень много кофеен, баров, большой продуктовый магазин и торговый центр. <br/>Дор был очень приятен в общении, не навязчив, не было шума. В комнате есть своя ванная комната, что очень удобно. Окна выходят во двор, совсем не шумно. Единственное пожелание, - берите с собой тапки, очень холодный пол в комнате и на кухне (октябрь).",1,0.0,Neutral
56.0,2,0.0,1.0,0.0,23,100.0,1,32.45887684923342,4.86,4.83,4.77,4.77,29093185,"Sehr netter Gastgeber! Saubere und schöne kleine Unterkunft mit allem was man für einen Kurzurlaub benötigt.Cafés, Restaurants und Supermärkte sind in ca 10-15 Minuten fußläufig erreichbar. Alles super, vielen Dank!",1,0.6688,Positive
208.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,1,4.248347186024305,4.61,4.72,4.78,4.59,13508386,"Wir haben uns in der Wohnung sehr wohl gefühlt. Sie war mit allem ausgestattet, was man so braucht. Die Lage war ruhig, Geschäfte und Restaurants und die S Bahn in nächster Nähe.<br/>Wir kommen sehr gerne wieder!",1,-0.9529,Negative
137.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,1,3.131262585603502,4.64,4.67,4.85,4.59,68448,"As advertised. Public transportation around the corner, 30 minutes to each and every highlight. A superb bakery for breakfast at 100 meters. Alan's recommendations were spot on. Ideal for a couple of days Berlin.",1,0.872,Positive
77.0,3,1.0,0.0,3.0,30,98.0,1,12.36671538964168,4.76,4.86,4.55,4.77,26950491,"Chambre très propre, spacieuse pour 3 et calme, nous avons tres bien dormi. Jolie petite terrasse avec géraniums et petite table pour manger. Salle de bains très propre. Me Hien aux petits soins et reactive. Logement a recommander!",1,0.0,Neutral
117.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,0,4.541309535464388,4.83,4.79,4.65,4.63,43522753,"Incredible apartment, wonderful service, beautiful neighborhood. Would definitely recommend to anyone visiting Berlin!",1,0.92,Positive
