300.0,5,2.0,2.0,3.0,71,100.0,1,9.260527967950802,4.97,4.97,4.92,4.85,1977882,Great place and a great host!,0,0.8588,Positive
72.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,53,100.0,1,4.173322316586879,4.95,4.91,4.9,4.81,594731577761973352,"The place provided enough privacy and very comfortable. Also, the host is super friendly and helpful. We feel like home when we’re staying.<br/>Location is very convenient!! You can walk just 1 minute to the supermarket and also few minutes to transportation. Some attractions can go by walk distance, if you enjoy walking.<br/>Anyway, it’s a very good experience in Berlin~!!",1,0.9785,Positive
