66.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,1,5.222564273094288,4.8,4.72,4.85,4.68,39967068,"I highly recommend you to stay at this place! Perfect location, apartment and host! Definitely will come back.",1,0.8682,Positive
