125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,0,2.8327811922008834,4.68,4.64,4.67,4.65,705644826442232554,"We had a great time living at Haluks place. Communication and check in was very easy. Two of us got sick during our stay and Haluk let us check out later, which was very kind. <br/>Close to the subway, so easy to get around when you have explored kreuzberg.",1,0.8974,Positive
