76.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,1,5.339352686328167,4.8,4.87,4.74,4.63,2098124,"The apartment looks great like in the pictures! Very well furnitured, chic and cosy. The neighbour is very nice with quite a lot of restaurants, bars and pizzerias close by. The landlord is quick and ready to answer to questions or issues. The only thing in case you want to pass a lot of time in the house: the only (big) window is covered by a frosted film since the apartment is on the ground floor and only the upper part is openable.",1,0.948,Positive
138.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,1.073737258783236,4.85,4.87,4.93,4.67,16167936,"was disappointed in the ""beds"" there was truly 1 bed that slept 2 people but the other ""beds"" should of been described more as cots. they were single chairs that had hideaway beds but the legs to hold the bottom of the""beds"" had been broken before our arrival. when I emailed her about it she said she was aware and would have it looked at on Monday. we left on Monday. while we told her we were okay with it it was because we had appointments and could change them.",1,-0.4404,Negative
222.0,14,4.0,3.0,7.0,40,100.0,0,4.241687052070171,4.59,4.5,4.78,4.56,22370109,"Marcel is a great and helpful host. The apartment is clean and in the perfect location for sightseeing, with excellent access to buses and trams. I highly recommend it for a summer stay as Berlin can be really cold in November.",0,0.9628,Positive
