125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,53,100.0,0,3.784813049240664,4.86,4.74,5.0,4.6,21299245,"this apartment is very essential and artsy at the same time.  there is plenty of space and a great vibe. having tried many neighbourhood in Berlin I have to say this is still the best one for exploring the city, also given that hermanplatz stop is very close and leads you wherever you want.  finally Kimberly was always available for questions and very helpful. 100% recommended",1,0.911,Positive
149.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,57,100.0,1,6.127401826066119,4.98,4.98,5.0,4.86,643443371140828330,Wir hatten ein perfektes Wochenende in dieser tollen Wohnung. Mitten auf einer schönen belebten Straße mit tollen Restaurants und gleichzeitig total ruhig im Hinterhof gelegen. Sehr liebevoll eingerichtet und super aufgeschlossene Gastgeber.,1,0.5994,Positive
