151.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,94.0,0,3.1018817858877528,4.67,4.77,4.78,4.52,721527807549293451,"Great location, easy to get around and a pretty decent nice neighborhood. First time in Germany so it worked out fine. The apartment itself was ok, the building had a weird smell to it for some reason but other than that it was fine. Easy to fine and have space to store your luggage if you arrive early.",1,0.9371,Positive
171.0,9,4.0,1.5,5.0,41,100.0,1,4.936124446607811,4.63,4.5,4.43,4.63,4106583,"Appartement conforme à la description, tout y est, c'est agréable.<br/>Nous y sommes allés à 6 adultes pour une semaine entre Noël et jour de l'an et tout s'est très bien passé.<br/>L'appartement peut sembler un peu excentré de prime abord mais les arrêts de transport en commun sont très proches et desservent bien le centre.<br/>Nous n'avons pas rencontré Alex mais il nous a fourni toutes les informations avant notre arrivée et était disponible si nécessaire tout le long de notre séjour.<br/>Appartement propre, bien tenu et même la salle de bain atypique (dans la cuisine) donne un petit charme supplémentaire.<br/>N'hésitez pas à prendre cet appartement pour une semaine en famille !",0,-0.4199,Negative
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,1,7.240134861209534,4.8,4.85,4.57,4.72,11775402,"Berlin is such a bike-able city and Carmen made that so easy.  She was very responsive to emails.  The rooms were spacious and we really enjoyed having the porch to use, since the weather was pleasant. Overall, a great place to stay.",1,0.9554,Positive
64.0,5,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,0,6.015018717053421,4.43,4.14,4.71,4.57,36088682,"I had a three-week stay in Luise’s flat and I can easily say it’s the best place I’ve stayed in, in Berlin. The bed is comfortable, and although there’s a lot children’s paraphernalia in the bedroom (which is entirely clear from the pictures) the mezzanine still results in a grown-up experience.<br/>I had full private use of the living room, which gave me more than enough space, Marla (the flat mate) is really friendly and easy to get on with, and the location is extremely convenient for the ring.<br/>I would thoroughly recommend.",1,0.9692,Positive
106.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,0.8993171774740567,4.88,4.88,4.97,4.79,28146018,"Я не видел хозяина, но коммуникация была отличной",1,0.0,Neutral
