65.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,1,7.994559142347801,4.97,4.98,4.82,4.93,22154155,Staying here was such a pleasure. René is one of the kindest hosts I've ever had. Went out of his way to make us breakfast every morning. Description was 100% accurate. Lovely little cozy place to stay if you're ever in Berlin. Please give this place a try you'll love it!,1,0.9359,Positive
126.0,5,1.0,1.0,3.0,38,100.0,1,2.459926794886368,4.93,4.97,4.8,4.87,3973420,"L’appartement est très confortable et bien équipé (équipement moderne). Il est particulièrement bien situé, à seulement de stations de métro d’Alexanderplatz. Idéal pour visiter Berlin. Les échanges avec Simone ont été très fluides et Simone a tout fait pour rendre notre séjour agréable !",1,-0.2003,Negative
43.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,4.980177142964137,4.93,4.92,4.61,4.81,22315950,"Marvi was such an amazing host! She was kind and considerate of my space, but also super helpful and friendly. She went above and beyond to make sure I was comfortable which I can't thank her enough for! <br/>The room itself is huge and the rest of the house was spotless. I was able to walk to a bunch of cool places from the house, and public transportation was also really easy to figure out from the apartment. I would absolutely stay at Marvi's place again :)",1,0.9908,Positive
48.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,0,4.230279756706139,4.76,4.76,4.48,4.74,31006339,"El apartamento es pequeño como aparece en las fotos, pero práctico, ya que tiene todo lo necesario para estar agusto, está a 25-30 minutos del centro en transporte público, se puede aparcar el coche en la calle sin tener que pagar, aunque nosotros reservamos este alojamiento principalmente pensando que era un parking privado,  el sofá cama estaba muy duro. Calidad/precio está bien",1,-0.5574,Negative
