76.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,90.0,1,3.8053934293318368,4.99,4.97,4.93,4.9,24111150,Jaqee ist eine wirklich nette Person und hat uns eine perfekte Unterkunft für zwei Nächte geboten. Als Gastgeberin war sie stets sehr freundlich und unaufdringlich. Ich würde hier jederzeit wieder zu gegebenen Anlass wieder ein Zimmer buchen.,1,-0.5994,Negative
60.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,3.651055931329858,4.68,4.63,4.59,4.6,40961989,"We stayed here for a few nights to explore Berlin. The apartment was great and Dietrich was a great host, providing us with flexible checkin/out times, a helpful guide with lots of tips for things to do and see and eat/drink. The apartment felt like a home away from home and we loved the quirkiness. Dietrich is very responsive and we appreciated all the helpful messages leading up to and during our stay. The location is great, we walked everywhere but it is in a very accessible location for the metro and tram too, if you prefer to use public transport- and easily access from the airport. The road outside the apartment was also very quiet and didn’t disturb us at all during our stay. Overall a great find, would definitely stay here again!",1,0.9781,Positive
