329.0,9,4.0,2.0,9.0,46,100.0,1,3.643475500693977,4.84,4.89,4.74,4.84,1261525954946384317,Ein tolles Apartment! Sah besser als auf den Fotos aus. Die Lage ist perfekt 20min vom Zentrum entfernt.,0,-0.636,Negative
120.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,51,100.0,0,5.262245897190754,4.75,4.86,4.49,4.69,189288,A lovely New Years stay in Berlin!<br/>I really recommend this place! The hosts were very kind and we had good communication via the airbnb app. <br/>The household had most things we needed and it was good communication with bus stop nearby. <br/>Close to big supermarket. <br/>Very quiet neighbourhood. ,1,0.9379,Positive
206.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,91.0,0,1.3231577133885242,4.84,4.87,4.9,4.5,39886151,"Numa Berlin Belfort is highly recommended. The checkin is automated and simple, with great communication of instructions. The room was clean as well as the facilities . Great value for money. Nice quiet street and easy to access public transportation. Kitchen was fairly unequipped and unfortunately you aren't allowed to smoke on the balcony which was a bit of a bummer. But overall good experience.",1,0.9177,Positive
60.0,3,1.0,1.0,4.0,25,100.0,0,21.36842021343181,4.94,4.95,4.66,4.8,22924396,"Ralf and Ulla were very friendly and helpfull hosts. The room was really nice and everything was very clean. The S-Bahn station Köpenik was in a walkable distance with a quick connection down town without changing trains. The area where Ralf lives is very quiet. Thanks Ralf and Ulla.<br/>Ralf und Ulla waren tolle Gastgeber. Die Kommunication hat perfekt geklappt. Das Zimmer war schön und liebevoll eingerichtet. Alles tiptop sauber. Die S-Bahn Station Köpenik war zu Fuß bequem erreichbar und wir waren ohne Umsteigen flott in der City. Danke, wir haben uns wohl gefühlt.",1,-0.5917,Negative
99.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,1,6.696389471476996,4.89,4.89,4.86,4.68,839732093095450130,"Very nice, quiet place and located in a great area.",1,0.8016,Positive
60.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,45,100.0,1,3.689600261518912,4.74,4.55,4.76,4.65,16237052,"Woning: Leuk ingericht + je hebt alles wat je nodig bent. Gezellige leuke buurt.<br/>Omgeving: Ziet er misschien een beetje spooky uit, der is genoeg te beleven. heel veel leuke cafeetjes en restaurants en een leuke lunch zaak op de hoek.<br/>Host: Fijne uitleg + gids. (:<br/>In de toekomst zou ik dit huisje weer graag willen boeken.",1,0.0,Neutral
188.0,5,1.0,1.5,4.0,24,100.0,1,3.564773251975843,4.92,4.87,4.91,4.76,27164026,"I will never forget Hardy's hospitality during my *second* stay at his apartment during the COVID-19 crisis. He went above & beyond to make sure I was comfortable. It was a perfectly clean and private place to stay, and the beautiful location by the canal kept me sane during the quarantine. I love everything about this apartment, and next time I need a play to stay in Berlin I'll be here.",1,0.9616,Positive
