70.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,90.0,1,6.999737881529928,4.92,4.92,4.65,4.73,689655649078108285,"Theresa was a fantastic host and really made me feel right at home during my stay in Berlin. I greatly appreciated her hospitality and local recommendations! Her apartment is beautiful and very well located right next to a train station. The neighborhood is walkable to many bars and restaurants and parks, and is very close to the Estrel hotel where I was attending a conference.",1,0.9297,Positive
180.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,45,85.0,0,1.5095289909770313,4.75,4.84,4.9,4.6,45475252,"This is a great location, handy for transport and there are lots of restaurants nearby. It is just a hotel room with a small kitchenette. You are paying hotel prices, but get none of the services eg reception, room cleaning, clean towels, that you would expect from a hotel. You are simply sent a code to allow you entry to the building and your room, and a phone number to WhatsApp any problems. Our code did not open the room door and when I sent a WhatsApp to report that our microwave/grill and air conditioning were not working I simply got an automated response, but no resolution to these issues. We have family in Berlin,  so visit fairly regularly,  but I am not planning on staying here again.",1,0.3716,Positive
