67.0,3,1.0,1.0,3.0,5,100.0,1,5.132849320991071,4.83,4.88,4.88,4.75,1404855145556690603,"Vincent est un hôte très sympathique et accueillant. Il prend vraiment le temps avec ses invités, nous avons eu une longue discussion très agréable et il nous a donné de précieux conseils pour découvrir les environs. Le logement est encore mieux que ce que nous imaginions : simple, joliment décoré, très agréable et parfaitement situé avec tout à proximité (restaurants, métro…). Nous avons passé un excellent séjour et recommandons vivement !",1,0.5411,Positive
163.0,3,1.0,1.0,3.0,20,100.0,1,2.846343242425512,4.84,4.97,4.97,4.74,17220997,"Axel was great to work with.  The apt is very clean and well equipped. Also, very close to restaurants and the subway. <br/>Thank you, Axel",1,0.8576,Positive
207.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,11.500551871319264,4.74,5.0,4.78,4.48,28536991,Ottime stanze in una zona molto fornita! Staff cordiale,1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,0,5.141650190903715,5.0,5.0,5.0,4.87,44373596,"We had a delightful stay at Hannah’s place! She is incredibly responsive and a great communicator. As soon as we booked, Hannah sent public transport directions from the airport—super helpful.  The place was very clean and airy, with everything we needed for our three-night stay. Lovely neighborhood, too! Had never been to Berlin, and Hannah made the lodging logistics stress-free. Would definitely stay again!",1,0.9754,Positive
117.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,25,90.0,1,0.8701104431623299,4.62,4.42,4.92,4.68,36434098,Definitely recommend,1,0.6369,Positive
125.0,8,2.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,0,2.44126047665957,4.56,4.56,4.68,4.48,585463784171353825,"Pros: Plenty of beds and linens. Washing machine in the apartment. Kitchen had plenty of utensils and dishes. Easy check in and quick communication from host. Convenient location to bus route and grocery store. Park across the street.<br/>Cons: The exterior door does not fully seal, and the interior door is broken so it didn't click closed. We had to prop the door closed with a chair. There is a plastic privacy window in the entrance to the apartment that is broken. The shower is in a state--the curtain is stained and moldy and the shower rod is broken, sagging, and barely held together with some tape. These are all easy repairs and may be fixed before the next guest. <br/>No doors on the two ""bedrooms"", so there was no privacy at all except in the bathroom. <br/>Overall this was not a great stay for us.",1,-0.8503,Negative
97.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,0,13.347444227266896,4.79,4.74,4.95,4.76,1322780,"Ein super schönes, sauberes, schickes und einfach genial gelegenes Appartement! In wenigen Minuten gelangt man von der Haltestelle des R109 (vom Flughafen Tegel kommender Bus) zum Appartement. Ebenso nah ist die S-Bahn. Ideal zB für Besucher der Messe (S3 oder S9 nur zwei Stationen) und ebenfalls nur wenige Stationen bis mitten in die City.<br/>Das Appartement selbst ist von der überaus freundlichen und hilfsbereiten Gastgeberin schick und freundlich eingerichtet, verfügt über ein großes Doppelbett, ein sehr schönes und großes Bad, eine Miniküche (mit Toaster, Wasserkocher, Mikrowelle m Grillfunktion, Kühlschrank etc.) Für das erste Frühstück sind Toastbrot, Marmelade, etwas Butter, Milch, Kaffeepulver, Teebeutel etc. bereits vorhanden und dürfen verbraucht werden, auch ohne es zu ersetzen. Es finden sich allerlei Tipps für Unternehmungen und Restaurants. Und auch in der direkten Nachbarschaft locken einige spannende Restaurants.<br/>Fazit: unbedingt empfehlenswert!",1,-0.4912,Negative
67.0,3,1.0,1.0,3.0,27,83.0,0,8.728281217656601,4.07,4.45,4.31,4.1,1080550983419728052,"Gut angebundene Unterkunft, die mit allem was man für ein paar Tage braucht ausgestattet ist. Mir hat der Aufenthalt sehr gut gefallen und ich würde sie wieder buchen. Vielen Dank!",1,-0.636,Negative
96.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,100.0,0,1.8380849331882467,4.72,4.76,4.92,4.52,1023793109539717362,"Wir waren eine Woche da und es war schön. Sandy ist sehr freundlich und zuvorkommend. Die Wohnung ist gut ausgestattet und war auch sehr sauber. Für die verhältnismässig kleine Wohnung etwas teurer aber wir sind auch Studentinnen…<br/>Die Umgebung ist sehr schön und belebt trotzdem sehr ruhig bei der selbst Wohnung.<br/>Das einzige was war ist, dass es etwas hellhörig ist ins Treppenhaus.",1,-0.9661,Negative
70.0,1,0.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,0,1.22855138976715,4.84,4.77,4.93,4.63,40469693,Great location and very nice apartment! Would definitely stay here again next time I'm in Berlin.,1,0.8803,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,13,100.0,0,3.713802325932112,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,865158054803338950,Great host who was helpful and friendly. Neighbours were also very friendly. Such an amazingly stylish apartment with huge amounts of space. Very well catered for and recommendations for all types of guests. A very cool area that caters for vegans and vegetarians. The local Vietnamese restaurants are absolutely divine! The park opposite the apartment is beautiful for a nice long walk. We absolutely loved Berlin and this apartment. Would definitely book again.,1,0.9894,Positive
225.0,7,3.0,1.0,7.0,39,100.0,0,6.474697745231319,3.0,3.0,2.5,3.0,767249323281836677,I've used Airbnb quite a bit over the past year. This experience was the worst I have ever experienced. We first had an apartment which was quite dirty and the bed was full of fluff and the towels had stains on them. The shower was so moldy that we couldn't shower there. We changed apartments and there was sewage water on the floor and it started to smell like an intense sewage smell in the whole apartment. The host was not very helpful and did not fix the problem. This was a terrible experience.,0,-0.8353,Negative
