133.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,0,13.517907059074906,4.66,4.55,4.76,4.53,940931072644357926,"A lovely little apartment in a neighborhood I know well, very peaceful, lots of beautiful houses and little blocks of flats, close to a walkable / cyclable oak forest that takes you right to FEZ. The S-bahn station, connected to the city center, is very close. You also have the second Berlin ZOO 2 tram stations away.",1,0.9133,Positive
