83.0,6,2.0,1.0,5.0,56,100.0,0,11.527326485291828,4.69,4.73,4.4,4.57,11294127,"Arriva Myriam welcomed us into their cosy family home. The appartement is on the top floor and the swimming pool in the basement. Ideal situation, you have your privacy and there is always Someone near by iff you have questions. It is great located, around 20 minutes drive from all the touristic things we wanted to visit in Berlin center. Shops and restaurants near. It was so lovely to take a swim before or after hours walking in Berlin. They are a lovely Family, everything was clean. We would recommand it to everyone who wants to visit Berlin with or without children. Thank you Myriam and Matthis x",0,0.972,Positive
