110.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,41,100.0,1,7.309120225694038,4.94,4.97,4.98,4.88,53728433,"It was an incredible stay in Berlin. Amazing studio with private garden with kids sandbox, toys and a nice table to have a coffee. Neighbours are super welcoming also:)<br/>The apartment is marvellous - very stylish and had everything that is needed. Alexander even provided baby plates and a box of toys as well as the sleeping space for our 3yo son. <br/>Location is amazing - very quite to stay but as soon as you go out on the street there are lots of restaurants and bars around. Tube is just in few minutes walk.<br/>And Alex is really very helpful, friendly and caring host. He really made this stay in Berlin as great as it could be. <br/>Parking was found just in front of the building and it was good price. <br/>Hope to come back again and to spend some great time in Berlin!<br/>Thank you Alexander ☺️",1,0.9918,Positive
