198.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,39,100.0,1,3.617036290600905,4.86,4.85,4.9,4.75,27627221,"Me and my boyfriend had an enjoyable stay at Egil’s place. It was clean when we arrived and very modern, with lots of natural light from the windows. His place is located around many attractions and it's very walkable. You will find a DM and a LIDL right by his apartment and there is a cafe right across the street. <br/>Egil was very informative and gave us plenty of recommendations for our stay in Berlin!",1,0.8805,Positive
243.0,6,3.0,1.0,4.0,51,100.0,1,1.372412995603046,4.9,4.94,4.78,4.75,13739449,"A great place for a short stay in Berlin. The place is clean & stylish and very close to a U Bahn station so all of the city’s sights are easily accessible, with Alexanderplatz only 2 stops away.  Check in instructions were clear and easy to follow and the welcome was warm and friendly. Highly recommended.",0,0.9694,Positive
141.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,43,94.0,0,7.131273504704622,4.74,4.82,4.79,4.62,49070135,"My stay was good, it matched the photos and the location is near the U-bahn. The only thing is the room had in some places some dust. But other than that, I enjoyed my stay there.",1,0.7506,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,22,100.0,0,6.556021219306657,4.78,4.75,4.75,4.63,17804004,Die Wohnung liegt in einem ruhigen Hinterhof und wir haben uns dort wohlgefühlt. Die S-Bahn und Einkaufsmöglichkeiten sind um die Ecke.,1,-0.9136,Negative
46.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,97.0,1,6.8018808148250525,4.84,4.9,4.86,4.82,1028233458536518838,"Very nice place, clean, stylish, warm and cozy. It was quiet and peaceful in this place. It is situated by two separate U-Bahn/ underground stations (one can take you right into Berlin, the other most of the way to brandenberg airport). There are plenty of Cafes and restaurants in the surrounding area to eat.<br/>Checking in was initially tricky but the owner was a quick call away and resolved it immediately so great communication too.<br/>The carpets were a nice touch in the rooms as well. Would definitely book again.",1,0.9777,Positive
75.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,0,5.016745788068612,4.83,4.83,4.91,4.8,43708933,"Really lovely authentic space as in description. Post war building, very German. Real community- a great area to have a drink in the evening.",1,0.6478,Positive
