103.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,51,100.0,1,1.8422422243016237,4.91,4.86,4.81,4.83,3974716,"Fantastic stay. Lovely place. Hans Jorg was very friendly, welcoming, and helpful. Great location. Holtzmart 25 across the river is lovely place to hang out and eat/drink on the water. His place is very clean and nicely designed. You can hear the trains very few mins so something to bear in mind if you are sensitive but we didn’t mind and weren’t disturbed by it. Would love to stay again.",1,0.9605,Positive
