87.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,48,100.0,0,13.758682117445044,4.83,4.75,4.92,4.75,45984702,"A gorgeous, spotless apartment which is small but perfectly formed and had everything we needed to enjoy our first stay in Berlin. <br/>The local area has supermarkets, bars, and food outlets nearby, and the 'centre' of Berlin is about 40 minutes away (you'll find everything in Berlin is 40 minutes away!) on excellent public transport. In addition, there is a beautiful palace next door to the Airbnb, which is very worth visiting. <br/>A great Airbnb with a great host, and we would stay here again the next time we visit Berlin.",1,0.9914,Positive
218.0,3,0.0,1.0,1.0,51,100.0,1,5.599016268041934,4.93,4.93,4.52,4.76,42269756,"Appartement propre à l’arrivé, aucun problème",1,0.0,Neutral
79.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,1,9.403941552737663,4.88,4.74,4.84,4.8,17071054,"We loved Berlin! Shout to Fat Tire Tours! Arne was very welcoming, even after we arrived at 11pm! He showed us around and was on hand for queries or recommends with a helpful visitors folder for useful and local info. The apartment is a great base for exploring Berlin, great transport links and we took the opportunity to walk to Templehof to see a bit more of the neighbourhood. The apartment was peaceful and we saw a red squirrel in the trees from the front balcony! Just to point there is a school at the back of the building in quite a tall block so it's not as private as the front of the apartment on the park side which overlooks the trees, and Arne's apartment is through a door at the far end of the hallway next to the private bathroom, but the whole apartment is contained for private use so it's not an issue and we were left alone to get on with our stay as we had a full itinerary so were out most of the time. Recommended for a good base to see the city &THF etc-.Thanks Arne!",1,0.9622,Positive
47.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,26,100.0,0,13.72252668419708,4.51,4.6,4.69,4.51,7828523,"Simple room with bed, tv, shared bathroom and kitchen. Conveniently located a few minutes walk to the u-bahn station, though the pavement from the station to the apartment is not too good for dragging luggage. Overall still a good stay, with an unbeatable price.",1,-0.3425,Negative
199.0,6,2.0,1.5,3.0,41,100.0,1,6.208573989536502,4.97,4.97,4.58,4.77,1170945591607184854,"Een mooi, luxe appartement van alle gemakken voorzien. Met smaak en gevoel voor kwaliteit ingericht. Heerlijke bedden, mooie keuken en badkamer. Van alle gemakken voorzien. Dichtbij hauptbahnhof.",0,0.0,Neutral
