49.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,1,11.676754989143994,4.78,4.92,4.82,4.7,551848896911307140,"Frau Neumann's place is in nice nad quiet neighborhood, good connections with other parts of the city, as U-Bahn and railways are just in some minutes walking distance. Also there's a huge street of big stores nearby, if you are interested in shopping. <br/>The place itself is clean, there's all you need, even kitchen with necessary equipment to prepare your own food, and food stores with local agricultural products are just nearby.",1,0.9081,Positive
