53.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,14,100.0,1,7.774143969733306,4.78,4.78,4.78,4.61,1130292978164168626,"Tariq's apartment is super good. the location can be regarded as golden, several minutes walk to bus stop(120）and u line station(u6), M23 tram stop is under construction. a lot of cafes, canteens nearby. the room itself is also good, very big and well equipped. the price is not expensive. everything is good. if i visit berlin again. i will book this room again.",1,0.9147,Positive
137.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,1.189406824976013,4.86,4.84,4.93,4.79,264459,"My parents stayed at Henrik's place during their first night in Berlin and since they have left they continuously talk about how much they loved the space, want to go back and how helpful Henrik was.  My parents got horribly lost and arrived later than planned and Henrik my them immediately to take care of their needs.  He was kind enough to even send me a message saying they arrived safe- so awesome.  Couldn't have asked for a better experience for them for their first night back in Europe without me.  I would definitely recommend this space! They loved the area- super easy access to shops and public transport.  Two thumbs up!",1,0.9855,Positive
