203.0,6,3.0,1.0,3.0,43,100.0,1,4.140963863667464,4.89,4.92,4.89,4.78,4182815,"This appartment was on a very good location in Berlin for us.in The neighboorhood we could find plenty nice restaurants and bars, but it was quite silent in the street self.The U-bahn was close so we could travel to all sides of Berlin easily. <br/>We were with 6 grown ups and a baby. The bedrooms were ok and the beds really fine. Enough place for all of us. Everything that we needed was available in the house. <br/><br/>The fridge was full of food and drinks and that was a great surprise. We felt immediately at home.   <br/><br/>A minor issue for us was that the toilet was in the bathroom. That caused some waiting time in he morning when everybody wants to take a shower, go the toilet etc at the same time. It was not a surprise because his information was on the site. <br/><br/>All in all we had a great stay in Berlin:)<br/><br/>",0,0.982,Positive
