173.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,57,100.0,1,6.93795828166316,4.65,4.63,4.63,4.55,2485124,"Nice little place in an up-and-coming neighbourhood of Berlin. Less touristy than other areas, but also quite interesting and easy to get to many different public transports. Kitchen is VERY small, bedrooms cosy. Thanks Sebastian; recommended for a quiet, no-frills, hassle free stay!!",1,0.9691,Positive
