64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,7,100.0,0,4.212224191576345,4.14,2.71,4.29,4.57,16412432,"Staying at this apartment isn't like checking in to a room, it's like becoming part of a family where everyone is open and welcoming. Very hospitable and helpful, only wish we came on another weekend when they weren't going to a festival so we could spend more time together!",1,0.478,Positive
