32.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,0,9.004424061898769,4.77,4.66,4.7,4.81,35396599,"This is such a lovely place to stay in Berlin... this was my third time in the city and it's my favorite place I've stayed yet. The location is too good -- the Nordenplatz station is just a few minutes walk away, immediately connecting you to everything in the city, yet it's in a quiet area... you will sleep sooooo well here. Also the wifi is fast, and the place was squeaky clean. Ridiculous value for money -- I can't recommend enough. Danke Elena!!!",1,0.9211,Positive
