40.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,0,3.5930506255270385,4.74,4.53,4.89,4.79,21417127,Alles war super. Johannes ist ein echt angenehmer Gastgeber. Kann ich nur weiter empfehlen.,1,0.0,Neutral
240.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,60,70.0,1,1.48110149635335,4.67,4.92,4.83,4.64,29509862,Very central location and hip places of eastern Berlin just around the corner. Bear in mind this comes with some noise during the night (street side) as well as a tram going by the street. Kitchen is well equipped but for a larger group (we were 5) sitting at the kitchen table not really possible. Shower can not be fully closed and is very small.,0,0.2732,Positive
69.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,1,3.63272662803081,4.88,4.95,4.95,4.81,29664434,"Claudia is a great host - approachable and friendly but leaves you to do as you please. The layout of the flat is large, airy and clean; it's really a beautiful space. The room was perfect for my needs and included a medium size refrigerator for any personal food and drink. The flat is located on a quiet street a few minutes walk away from U Bahn and small shops and cafés. Super convenient to travel to Neukölln and Friedrichshain in a few minutes.",1,0.9823,Positive
144.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,1,3.4508030907894973,4.99,5.0,4.96,4.94,64590,"It's a fabulous location ideally situated with canal views and very convenient for the street market every Tuesday and Friday, and great local restaurants and supermarkets too.<br/>Mirjam was very friendly and flexible we needed to extend our stay by five days which she was happy to do, and for  which we were very grateful .<br/>Mirjam was also very flexible over our check-out time too . Thank thank you Mirjam.",1,0.9831,Positive
106.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,0,1.3267026286625432,4.68,4.73,4.91,4.41,1335529146665908596,"I had a great stay! The location was perfect with excellent public transport connections and everything I needed close by. The apartment was comfortable, clean, and well-equipped with a dishwasher and washing machine—ideal for a solo traveler or a couple. Communication was quick and easy. I’d definitely stay here again!",1,0.9741,Positive
78.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,35,100.0,1,4.609388669014022,4.93,4.73,4.95,4.81,639868019000226796,"Wir haben uns super wohl gefühlt, wir wurden von allen (inklusive der Katze) freundlich aufgenommen und der Umgang war generell auf einer sehr persönlichen Ebene. Die Wohnung und das Zimmer ist super schön und wir haben direkt eine kleine Tour bekommen :) Die Tipps haben wir auch direkt ausprobiert (sowohl das Eis als auch der Kaffee war eine 10/10!!) und Friedrichshain hat extrem viel zu bieten + es ist sehr gut angebunden (Straßen- und Ubahnstation direkt vor der Haustür). Wir würden auf jeden Fall nochmal hingehen!",1,-0.7701,Negative
177.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,1,1.6538485965165064,4.72,4.78,4.95,4.64,1091884435587099503,Very good place to stay in Berlin. Very close to some good tourist destinations.,1,0.7496,Positive
80.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,56,100.0,1,2.2102820475445166,4.85,4.82,4.88,4.76,3904895,Everything about the apartment was great! I really liked the neighborhood and it was easy to get anywhere with the tram. I also appreciated having a washer and dryer and a well-stocked kitchen.,1,0.9285,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,0,5.048351510047668,4.76,4.48,4.64,4.67,37105253,"Great big room, very easy check in, would recommend!",1,0.8775,Positive
92.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,4.3797985986367935,4.87,4.84,4.87,4.75,31401028,"Nossa estadia foi ótima! O apartamento é super bem localizado, exatamente como nas fotos, e estava tudo limpinho e organizado quando chegamos. O Max foi sempre muito atencioso e prestativo, respondeu todas as nossas dúvidas com rapidez e gentileza. Recomendo demais a hospedagem e, com certeza, voltaria!",1,0.6688,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,0,2.874282790888489,4.69,4.42,4.92,4.71,31411458,Wir hatte eine schnelle und unkomplizierte Kommunikation und Anja war sehr flexibel bei unserer Anreise. Zimmer und Bad sind gut ausgestattet und sauber. Wir wurden sehr  freundlich empfangen und nach einem trubeligen Tag in Berlin war es sehr angenehm immer in ein ruhiges und gemütliches zuhause zu kommen. Die Wege zur U- und S-Bahn sind kurz (5 Minuten) und für warme Tage gibt es eine sehr schöne Dachterrasse mit Sitzgelegenheiten. Ich kann Anja und das Zimmer uneingeschränkt weiter empfehlen.,1,-0.9451,Negative
241.0,6,3.0,1.0,4.0,53,100.0,1,1.3558603428081426,4.89,4.89,4.78,4.75,13663197,This is a great apartment in a residential area but easily accessible to many sites in the city. It is right across the street from the U train and is walking distance to the S-Bahn. The apartment is clean and nice and just like the photos. The host was very responsive to our questions. The entrance was a little hard to find (the back of the building faces the main street and the entrance faces the street in the back).  There were other things that also made our stay more convenient. By mistake we left our converter at a place in the city and found one in a drawer that we could use. A light bulb went out and there was an extra one in the room. There is also a map on the wall that helped us get around.  I definitely recommend this apartment.,0,0.9719,Positive
46.0,4,1.0,1.5,2.0,31,100.0,0,9.003381252431335,4.88,4.78,4.78,4.83,1024530443045121693,Wie immer alles top und unkompliziert.,1,0.2023,Positive
