260.0,4,2.0,2.0,4.0,55,100.0,0,2.5729352260986107,4.66,4.55,4.84,4.45,26543,"Terri's place is great for our family of four and she was a delightful hostess. The place itself is better than the pics in the listing and the location is fantastic. Tons of great restaurants and shops right there and even more within a short walk. Check-in and check-out were easy and well communicated. If you're looking for a place in Berlin, definitely consider Terri's apartment.",0,0.9781,Positive
