24.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,12.219925420394336,4.6,4.31,4.86,4.72,1274387,"Christian's place is located in a very quiet location, close to a supermarket, other stores and many bus lines. What I liked the most, was the communication with Christian, he's very nice and kind person, always willing to help on anything needed. The room where I stayed has a shared bathroom, very clean, with everything needed. The place is very warm in winter and the kitchen is good to use too. Alles gut! :)",1,0.9751,Positive
103.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,95.0,0,11.709700539993566,4.74,4.71,4.83,4.57,1044862371289584666,"Great location!! Close to so many restaurants and stores, walking distance everywhere! Close to subway stations. So easy to get around from here. It wasn’t super noisy during the evenings either. Photos matched the physical space as well",1,0.9256,Positive
141.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,43,94.0,0,7.131273504704622,4.74,4.82,4.79,4.62,49070135,"I loved my stay here as it was in the perfect location and the entire stay was very easy. No room keys are nice, you just get a code for door access. The room was very nice and it was even ready a few hours in advance. They have lockers for you to use before and after checkout which was also a great touch.  <br/>Only downfall was the internet almost never worked and I really needed it a few times. The room also smelled like smoke on the day we arrived but it eventually went away. <br/>Overall I had a great stay and would stay again.",1,0.9562,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,55,100.0,1,5.599016268041934,4.93,4.9,4.24,4.66,42702752,Nice flat at just some metro stations far from Mitte and the main places of the city. The apartment is really nice and clean. Easy check in and a lot of services around.,1,0.8947,Positive
