93.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,39,100.0,1,3.2781637723728885,4.56,4.54,4.61,4.48,1537125,"Cosy appartment, faithful to the description. It was well equiped and the beds are very comfortable ! Also there's a box for the keys, which is very useful. I would recommend it :)",1,0.9505,Positive
62.0,3,1.0,1.0,3.0,30,100.0,0,4.614969004067335,4.37,4.28,4.43,4.4,323259,"Logement correspondant bien a la description, proche des transports en commun avec accès facile au centre ville. En revanche, la propreté laissait à désirer (surtout les communs), la salle de bain ne semblait pas avoir été lavé en 5 jours de séjour ...",1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,0,6.14980571766311,4.82,4.79,4.91,4.77,1775500,You should be so lucky as to stay at Sven’s place. It’s chic and strange and comfortable; Sven is kind and direct and helpful and very respectful of privacy. Staying at his place was a gentle joy. Also—so close to Oskreuz. 🥰,1,0.9733,Positive
