85.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,48,100.0,0,7.498454551632586,4.87,4.83,4.87,4.83,20740288,"I stayed for 2 nights in Clement’s flat, it was really nice. Clement is an amazing host, we talked a lot and he showed me around. The flat itself is super clean and cozy, the room is small, but cute as well. Location was perfect for me as it is close to the airport and I had already been to Berlin several times before, but if it’s your first visit and you’d like to see more of the city, I would say it is definitely not in a walking distance from main tourist attractions. Otherwise, it’s all good. Thank you",1,0.9891,Positive
84.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,23,100.0,1,13.577448174679375,4.82,4.88,4.62,4.72,50352406,Wir waren gut untergebracht. Die Wohnung liegt ganz in der Nähe einer S Bahn Station und war sauber und zweckmäßig eingerichtet. Wir hatten alles was wir brauchten für unseren Aufenthalt :) Die Kommunikation war angenehm und CheckIn/CheckOut waren ganz unkompliziert.,1,-0.9274,Negative
