226.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,31,100.0,1,7.356488886180644,4.96,4.97,4.96,4.88,22382672,"This is a really lovely apartment in an old (and I mean that in a good way) building. I knew nothing about the neighborhood or Berlin generally when I booked the place, so I didn't know what to expect, but it's right around the corner from a number of great restaurants and bars, and walking distance to many major sites. I have a few regrets in life. Staying here isn't one of them.",1,0.8098,Positive
