57.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,0,5.794812487742693,4.72,4.74,4.48,4.72,29616716,"Beautiful apartment near good public transport. The flat was just like it seemd in the pictures and communication with Ralf & Gaby was fluent and very pleasant. Loved the modern kitchen and bathroom in that old, romantic apartment. <br/>The flat is on the first floor and bedroom windows are to the street so it’s not that quiet during the day, but on nighttime the area was peaceful. Had a good sleep in that bed too! <br/>I really would recommend this place!",1,0.9729,Positive
