121.0,2,1.0,0.0,2.0,17,100.0,0,1.652388057808875,4.38,4.57,4.66,4.32,51799775,I expected an hotel since that's is in the name but it was an hostel. This is partially on me not reading the description of the room but still one bathroom for 7/10 rooms in one floor is not enough when you are spending 80eur for a double room. One broken shower for an entire floor is also not enough. The location is good and the room is comfy but the price is really high considering the offering,1,-0.0772,Negative
256.0,5,2.0,1.5,3.0,41,100.0,0,11.149123650324338,4.52,4.56,4.85,4.47,22183259,Excellent location in a quiet neighborhood and close to the metro. We had easy access to the entire city of Berlin and very much enjoyed our stay in Marie-Christine’s apartment!,0,0.8878,Positive
65.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,0,2.295349565926277,5.0,4.58,5.0,4.83,38178174,"Wonderful, cozy place to spend a week in Prenzlauer Berg. Unfortunately I had to cut my trip short by a few days at short notice due to some unforseen circumstances, but Mia was an extremely accomodating host. A true Berlin experience <br/>Minor point: the description is a bit out of date (e.g. fashion student isn't living there any more, sofa in room is mentioned but isn't there). For future guests it might be nice to update this and perhaps add a couple of photos of the common areas (kitchen, bathroom) as they were a little smaller than I had imagined given the price.",1,0.7266,Positive
155.0,7,2.0,1.0,6.0,43,96.0,0,6.1770612336798365,4.41,4.27,4.78,4.31,27018620,"Great little apartment with a nice terrace. Great location close to a lot of good restaurants and cute shops. <br/>The bedrooms are located towards a busy a street on the ground floor, and it was quite hot during our stay, so it was hard to keep a cool room without being disturbed by noise from the street.",0,0.961,Positive
