32.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,3.2159665482867226,4.77,4.71,4.88,4.65,17904,"Everything was great! Very clean, check in was easy! The best location, with coffee shops, bars and great restaurants just steps away. Friedrich, my main point of contact, was very helpful and readily available to assist me with any issue that may have arised during my stay. Theres a market every weekend just outside on Maybachufer every weekend, which was nice!",1,0.9778,Positive
