181.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,1,13.645787798249891,4.89,5.0,4.67,4.56,31427769,Es hat alles gut geklappt: super Wohnung in ruhiger und dennoch gut angebundener Lage. In Berlin war zu der Zeit fast alles ausgebucht - daher auch der Preis höher als erwartet. Auf jeden Fall eine Empfehlung J,1,0.0,Neutral
114.0,4,1.0,1.5,3.0,36,100.0,0,7.167460469824902,4.57,4.66,4.8,4.56,37071847,"Patrick's apartment was easy to find and in a great area, lovely cafes and easy to get anywhere.  Spotlessly clean with lovely high ceilings. <br/>However,  there was no iron, toaster or oven as mentioned in his listing.  There was one mug and a tiny tea set.  A toaster arrived on Thursday morning (our last day).  The bed in the back bedroom was sinking in the middle.  When we took up one of the mattresses, we found broken laths propped up with books and a saucepan. On Thursday the water ran out but came back later.  On Friday morning there was no water and we had to go to my son's house to have our showers, as a result of which we were late checking out.  He has made no apology and indeed blamed us for the water issue.",1,-0.25,Negative
92.0,5,0.0,1.0,5.0,26,100.0,0,7.760040564236738,4.23,4.04,4.34,4.17,53539117,Wir waren mit allem zufrieden.,1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,5,3.0,1.0,2.0,21,100.0,0,9.484121718076905,4.57,4.5,4.72,4.54,30728734,"Die Wohnung von Assunta war sauber. Ich kenne das Viertel und bin gern dort. Die Busverbindungen führen direkt zum Hbf und zum Tegel Flughafen in beide Richtungen in weniger als 15 Minuten. Sehr praktische.<br/>Alles, was man braucht, war in der Whg und fußläufig im Viertel erreichbar.",1,-0.9485,Negative
