65.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,1,5.167258880847807,4.97,4.92,4.93,4.91,9938743,"Alex’s place is super sweet and comfortable, our room is big and stylish, we had very good sleep there. He is a very open and well communicate guy, he gave us a lots of good advice. If you like east Berlin culture Alex’s place is perfect, very easy access to the clubs around, and a good chill skate park. And just go downstairs, there are many good restaurants on both side of the street.<br/>Definitely want to visit him again for Berghain.",1,0.9873,Positive
114.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,67,100.0,1,32.29350043093033,4.85,4.69,4.87,4.74,36360929,Maarten’s place is in an excellent location in nature near Potsdam. Communication with Maarten was smooth and nothing was a problem.,0,0.7147,Positive
171.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,44,90.0,1,11.510851452846596,4.78,4.8,4.79,4.66,699820589487993617,"Das Zimmer war nach hinten raus und es war sehr still in der Nacht und auch schön hell am Tage. Der Hinterhof ist begrünt und wir ""Landeier"" haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt.<br/>Es ist alles vorhanden um Frühstück und Abenbrot zu bereiten und vor allem viel Platz an einem  großen Esstisch zum Essen!<br/>Super!",1,-0.9323,Negative
225.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,33,100.0,0,6.292167445681836,4.93,4.87,4.93,4.8,50238034,"Beautiful apartment, super-helpful host, great connections to the airport and the centre of Berlin. <br/>Loved sitting on the balcony for breakfast and evening drinks, and the apartment was calm and peaceful. <br/>Friendly neighbours, and the area is safe and friendly too. We had no worries walking around late at night, and there were often families and single women walking around later. <br/>Cafe Evina just round the corner is great for coffee, sandwiches and pastries. Really helpful staff.",1,0.9712,Positive
84.0,3,1.0,1.5,1.0,14,100.0,1,8.424857076965763,4.73,4.64,4.79,4.7,17687950,Tolle Lage und sehr netter Kontakt. Alles wie beschrieben. Töpfe und Pfannen etwas spartanisch. Check In toll und unkomplizierte.,1,0.0,Neutral
64.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,20,100.0,0,4.993723336849769,4.7,4.57,4.44,4.66,17250059,Raissa and Jonathan are a great host. They were very responsive and helped us for what we need (late check-in and even helped printing out boarding passes). Highly recommended.,1,0.8396,Positive
260.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,91.0,0,4.81020597174384,4.59,4.7,4.4,4.44,28299765,Small but cozy apartment in a central location. It does slightly feel like a hotel but we were out most of the time do IT didn't bother us. Having a kitchen was very nice. Markus was a very helpful host.,1,0.9283,Positive
88.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,0,12.43529195299008,4.63,4.71,4.56,4.58,31172381,"Muchas Gracias por todo. Fue realmente agradable estar en el departamento de Kristina. Limpio, muy bien ubicado si llegas del Aeropuerto Tegel y además, las respuestas son rápidas. Wifi funciona bien, hay servicios para cocinar y demás.",1,0.0,Neutral
110.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,14,100.0,1,3.293196405941088,4.91,4.93,4.91,4.78,26181378,I really loved staying with Ernst; I’d only booked full apartments before but it was lovely and easy sharing the space together. Ernst and his partner are very sweet. I’d absolutely stay with them again.,1,0.9674,Positive
47.0,2,1.0,0.5,1.0,38,100.0,1,6.365795800114372,4.95,4.87,4.74,4.96,885205013477522768,"muy amable, nos explico muy bien y su departamento muy bonito",1,0.0,Neutral
44.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,23,100.0,0,13.157059293117056,4.44,4.33,4.64,4.44,18066481,"When it is written that there is a kitchen, one should be able to cook. I came prepared to make myself breakfast however, one hot plate for so meany people means waiting in line to make things warm in the morning. And not being able to cook a pancake or an egg, is not exactly a kitchen...<br/>There is no park place on the grounds as written in the add. Parking on the street takes a lot of patience and a long time to find a spot... not at all what I expected based on what was advertised.<br/>Wenn es heißt, dass es eine Küche gibt, sollte man auch kochen können. Ich bin gekommen, um mir ein Frühstück zu machen, aber eine Kochplatte für so viele Leute bedeutet, dass man morgens Schlange stehen muss, um etwas warm zu machen. Und nicht in der Lage zu sein, einen Pfannkuchen oder ein Ei zu kochen, ist nicht gerade eine Küche...<br/>Es gibt keinen Parkplatz auf dem Gelände, wie es in der Anzeige steht. Parken auf der Straße nimmt eine Menge Geduld und eine lange Zeit, um einen Platz zu finden... überhaupt nicht das, was ich erwartet, basierend auf dem, was beworben wurde.",1,0.3612,Positive
130.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,1,9.794614401031762,4.84,4.73,4.55,4.62,30504725,"We really enjoyed our stay. The location is not close to the center, but public transport is very close and there are several different options. The neighborhood is quiet and the apartment is really nice. Communication was flawless.",1,0.8976,Positive
84.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,1,4.00787800065126,4.73,4.67,4.9,4.65,1282857,Bel appartement atypique. ,1,0.0,Neutral
