83.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,0,8.160231491771468,4.85,4.64,4.91,4.82,50884931,"A great stay if you're going to Berlin.  Julian was busy, but responsive all the time. His caretaker, Rene,  is in the next building and was helpful. The apartment is  in an historical section of Berlin and is large , comfortable, and fully equipped. Within a ten minute walk is a supermarket, restaurants, and U and S Bahn stops. A longer walk will get you to Brandenberg Tor and other sites.  A green and peaceful island in Berlin with a great living space and helpful host!",1,0.9817,Positive
261.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,59,86.0,0,3.878575355977446,4.67,4.62,4.9,4.43,1106462178448509114,"We had a fantastic stay at Amine’s place!<br/>The apartment was clean, cozy, and well-located — perfect for our visit to the Pictoplasma Festival. Amine was very friendly, helpful, and responsive throughout our stay.<br/>The apartment was well-equipped and matched the description, which made our stay very comfortable.<br/>The location is great: the Natural History Museum is just a 10-minute walk away, and both the Medical History Museum and Futurium are about 25 minutes on foot. The U-Bahn station is only 3 minutes from the apartment and just 4 stops to the city center — very well connected.<br/>Highly recommended — we’d be happy to return!",0,0.9882,Positive
94.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,1,2.8921931319330847,4.83,4.85,4.85,4.62,37081059,"Súper cómodo, agradable, zona tranquila, el departamento genial espacioso, limpio, con todas las comodidades.",1,0.4215,Positive
