135.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,3.104550941585256,4.8,4.84,4.94,4.69,39956169,"Heads up for those who are not used to EU plugs. The plugs in the bedroom were a bit fiddly and difficult to figure out at first. You have to rotate your plug until it aligns with the wall socket. It took a lot of practice. <br/>The door to the apartment felt very safe and locked properly. There is a bit of a learning curve on opening the door but follow the instructions and you'll eventually get in! <br/>Location was great, fantastic transport connections, place as described. overall a good professional business and helpful hosts.",1,0.9672,Positive
