111.0,5,0.0,1.0,4.0,28,99.0,0,1.5558618357309053,4.15,3.91,4.62,4.08,53873194,"Casa piccola ma carina. zona notte molto piccola ma pulita. Cucina ben attrezzata , e facile check in e check out. <br/>Posto silenziosissimo e tranquillo , molto comodo per raggiungere i posti di interesse .",1,0.0,Neutral
95.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,1.8743775656468973,4.98,4.94,4.99,4.94,2492162,"Wir hatten eine wunderbare Zeit in der Wohnung von Renate.  Sie hatte eine echte Gemütlichkeit. Das Zimmer war groß und sauber. Das Badezimmer war kürzlich renoviert worden. Jeden Tag hatten wir ein schönes Frühstück. Renate ist sehr freundlich und nett. Sie hat mir gerne geholfen, mein Deutsch zu üben. Sie weiss so viele Sprachen. Es war beeindruckend! Ob wir nach Berlin kommen, werden wir bei Renate wohnen.",1,-0.9184,Negative
125.0,7,3.0,1.0,2.0,44,100.0,0,4.681426994972362,5.0,5.0,4.84,4.94,18309068,"We had a great vacation in Caroline's apartment! Close to S- and U-bahn stations, it was perfect for visiting Berlin. The apartment is really cozy and nice, perfect for a family. Thank you very much!",0,0.9562,Positive
80.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,0,3.399342696580596,4.62,4.83,4.59,4.45,52652026,"This place is horrible and terrifying. It lays just beside the street. I booked 4 nights and quickly run away after 1st night. There were people knocking at my door in the middle of the night and wake me up. In the morning, so noisy too.<br/>What annoyed me most is the host’s attitude. He refused to respond to any of my calls for help. Only blame me for no reason. Don’t book his house it’s the worst.",1,-0.9613,Negative
122.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,3.146245412821909,4.77,4.68,4.85,4.52,44098912,Beautiful apartment with everything you need for a convenient stay. I personally loved the huge windows most of all.,1,0.8779,Positive
156.0,6,2.0,1.5,2.0,37,100.0,1,9.644257616194537,4.84,4.95,4.46,4.57,1339691709963515386,"Tolles Apartment! Es kam uns sogar größer vor als die Fotos es vermuten ließen! Großzügiger Wohnraum mit großem Tisch, an dem wir zu sechst bequem Platz fanden, gut ausgestattete Küche und zwei Toiletten, was bei mehreren Personen schon wichtig ist. Die beiden Schlafzimmer waren sehr schön, modern und clean eingerichtet, mit allem, was man braucht inkl. Steckdosen am Bett. Auch das Sofa war als Schlafplatz sehr bequem. Bei unserer Ankunft war es zwar sehr warm, mit abgekippten Fenstern konnte man aber gut durchlüften. Parkplätze haben wir in der Straße gefunden, am Wochenende sogar gebührenfrei. Nach einem kurzen Fußmarsch konnte man einige Haltestellen erreichen, von wo man ins Zentrum fahren konnte. Die Kommunikation mit den Gastgeber ließ nichts zu wünschen übrig, nach einer kurzen Nachricht haben wir sogar einen Late Check out bekommen. Nochmal danke dafür! TOP!!!",0,-0.948,Negative
96.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,3.6244097204949255,4.79,4.79,4.88,4.61,636680772737785680,"We had a horrible experience getting in to the apartment. The key wasn’t in the place as advised and then Jan was unresponsive. Leaving us waiting in the cold at night, in a strange neighbourhood, after a long journey. We eventually got in and the room was fine. Sparse but clean, if not a bit gloomy.<br/>We wouldn’t want to stay again.",1,0.4118,Positive
132.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,97.0,1,1.9977573269292777,4.73,4.71,4.73,4.57,36037847,Great place to stay,1,0.6249,Positive
150.0,5,1.0,1.5,3.0,42,100.0,1,12.476267915226162,4.85,4.91,4.84,4.75,6800795,"Leo's home was comfortable and well stocked. A very cozy atmosphere!  Everything was clean, appliances were modern and worked well. There was easy access to markets, restaurants, shopping, and transportation. We very much enjoyed our stay.",1,0.943,Positive
153.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,59,100.0,1,9.878507659079842,4.71,4.8,4.95,4.65,20162792,Wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt,1,0.0,Neutral
165.0,7,2.0,1.0,2.0,43,90.0,0,2.2144444360828826,4.59,4.51,4.85,4.47,8063187,Skønt sted og  fantastisk placering i Berlin,0,0.0,Neutral
123.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,1,5.647612369878072,4.88,4.79,4.84,4.68,52111736,"Wir hatten eine tolle Zeit in Johanns Apartment. Es ist super sauber und sieht genau aus, wie auf den Bildern beschrieben.<br/>Die Lage ist wirklich unschlagbar, man ist fußläufig in ca. 10 min am RAW-Gelände und auf dem Weg dorthin läuft man an allen tollen Kneipen und Bars in Friedrichshain vorbei.<br/>Das einzige, was man vor der Buchung wissen sollte, ist, dass es eine EG-Wohnung ist und man direkt vom Gehsteig in die Wohnung kommt, wenn man die Tür öffnet. Dementsprechend ist es von draußen  sehr hellhörig, was uns allerdings nicht gestört hat, da es eine kleine Seitenstraße ist und sie somit nicht stark befahren wird.<br/>Ansonsten ist die Einrichtung wirklich sehr modern und neuwertig und alles wurde mit Liebe fürs Detail dekoriert.<br/>Wir werden die Wohnung definitiv wieder buchen, wenn wir das nächste Mal in Berlin sind.<br/>Vielen Dank und bis bald! ❤️",1,-0.9184,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,0,1.5074881752639435,4.76,4.88,4.82,4.6,1445668833818929312,"Had a great stay at Capri. High marks for the room: bed, curtains, lighting and location of ac vents made the room very comfortable for falling and staying asleep.",1,0.7801,Positive
125.0,2,2.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,0,3.036032627048052,4.7,4.7,4.63,4.68,22438,"Nice place, close to S-Bahn and other transport. Javier was very quick to respond which was great.",1,0.7845,Positive
101.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,3.078352015251089,4.83,4.81,4.81,4.66,20282379,"A very spacious apartment overlooking the city, a good nest for those wishing to explore Kreuzberg and environs and feel in the center of the action without the noise. The space was clean, the bed OK (not a real mattress but this might be fine for some people), the bathroom and shower excellent. The furniture and the layout are a bit impractical for a longer stay as is the layout but it does have a nice aesthetic. As other reviews note, this is at the very top of a tall commercial-residential building with a few different sets of steps and many flights of stairs before reaching the flat. Definitely not for those with much luggage. We used to live at the top of a residential building in Berlin but this was something else entirely.",1,0.9781,Positive
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,100.0,0,6.9835159306468215,4.91,4.86,4.73,4.78,51581251,Guillaume’s room was perfect. <br/>Clean quiet and had everything we needed. Guillaume was a perfect host and let us know where everything was and gave us tips on things to do in the area. <br/>We will definitely be back when in this area and highly recommend him to<br/>future guest.,1,0.9168,Positive
60.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,4.969455123944517,4.86,4.98,4.64,4.81,13231476,Great host! Very helpful and polite! <br/>Location is ideal for getting to city centre.,1,0.9038,Positive
306.0,8,3.0,2.0,5.0,44,100.0,1,6.90827181205849,4.86,4.8,4.85,4.68,311703,"sehr geräumige Wohnung in hervorragende Lage in Schöneberg. Einfacher Check in, gut geeignet für größere Gruppen oder größere Familien. Problemloser Check in, exzellente Kommunikation. Sehr gut geeignet für kurz Aufenthalt, aber auch für längere Aufenthalte mit privatem Charakter in Berlin.",0,0.0,Neutral
125.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,0,7.669090893821904,4.77,4.52,4.92,4.61,19501540,"Awesome apartments! <br/>First of all, it is nice homely and very special atmosphere of appartments. It was really comfortable.<br/>Owners are very picefull, friendly and interesting people.<br/>Me and my friends was really impressed.<br/>Wish to visit this place once again",1,0.961,Positive
365.0,15,4.0,4.5,8.0,25,100.0,1,7.162089617709464,4.79,4.67,4.78,4.73,1838879,-,0,0.0,Neutral
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,0,26.15958430302172,4.83,4.87,4.62,4.84,251398,"Wir waren nur für eine (kurze) Nacht in Berlin und froh, erst am Reisetag auf den letzten Drücker die Unterkunft noch buchen zu können. Die Gastgeberin ist sehr sympathisch, das Zimmer im Souterrain großzügig, sauber und  gepflegt. Das von uns vergessene Duschmittel wurde uns prompt zur Verfügung gestellt. Leider konnten wir Renates Gastfreundschaft nicht ausgiebiger genießen und beurteilen, möchten die Adresse aber dennoch sehr empfehlen. ",1,-0.9136,Negative
237.0,11,3.0,1.0,4.0,57,100.0,1,9.660413858650209,4.93,4.97,4.46,4.83,16252509,"We had a wonderful stay at this apartment in Berlin! The place is spacious, clean, modern, and very well-equipped with everything you might need. The host was extremely friendly and welcoming, making the check-in process smooth and easy. The location is very convenient, with excellent transport connections and quick access to the city center. I would highly recommend this apartment to anyone visiting Berlin!",0,0.9729,Positive
313.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,49,100.0,1,2.887058665280372,4.89,4.76,4.83,4.71,721749273851792523,Really enjoyed our stay!,0,0.5974,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,11,100.0,0,4.107401530371854,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,24615888,"Great Location, clean house and polite host.",1,0.7783,Positive
60.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,83.0,1,2.354783050070512,4.95,4.84,4.98,4.82,804280035406038907,"Sehr freundliche und flexible Gastgeber, schönes Zimmer, prima Lage in einer ruhigen Gegend. Dritter oder vierter Stock ohne Aufzug, aber es ist es allemal wert! Wir kommen gerne wieder!",1,0.3578,Positive
80.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,90.0,1,4.179797965704022,4.87,4.61,4.92,4.74,53102997,"L’appartement d’Alae est magnifique, très agréable, confortable et emplacement est super. Alae est sympa et réactif.<br/>Cependant l appartement n’était pas très propre, notamment la salle de bain, (poils cheveux et toilettes sales) et la cuisine (miettes et sols). Mais une fois petit nettoyage nous avons passé un très bon séjour. Probablement un problème exceptionnel. Je recommande également de prendre une housse de couette car il n’y en avait pas. Attention pour ceux qui ont le sommeil léger (pas de rideau et léger bruit de voiture car chambre côté rue) <br/>Mais à part ça, l appartement est vraiment très agréable, la décoration est très sympa, et accueillante tout comme Alae.",1,0.5267,Positive
114.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,67,100.0,1,32.29350043093033,4.85,4.69,4.87,4.74,36360929,"great down to earth place which remembers me a little bit to my grandmas old farming house in the eastern part of Germany. Great lakeside and nature beside even though its not far to the capital. The owners live beside, but they are super easy and nice and you can ask any question, even borrow (old) bicycles for a little money.  <br/>If you book, ENJOY!  Stefanie",0,0.9769,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,0,6.140127936530081,5.0,5.0,5.0,4.83,38974537,"These are simply great hosts - and they have an apartment to match. Check-in was a breeze; was given perfect local tips (fantastic Asian food place); nearby is a small train station (so hopping to the main train stations was as easy as can be); good part of Berlin; & great amenities in the (very clean) flat. In fact, the flat seems brandnew - and well-built (water pressure is great, and so is the heating - and it even is pretty much soundproof so I slept like a baby!). Very much enjoyed my stay (sth I cannot say of all my airbnb trips), thank you so much. 11/10!",1,0.9864,Positive
83.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,97.0,0,1.5772646932266832,4.67,4.65,4.96,4.5,54351687,Liked our stay here a lot. Great location that allowed us to walk to everything we wanted to see. Lots of unique history in the neighbourhood. There was a malfunction with our room safe and it was handled professionally and in a reasonable amount of time. We would definitely return.,1,0.91,Positive
106.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,1.999602020466568,4.9,4.81,4.91,4.81,1191170483930849390,"Definitely liked the neighborhood, and surrounding areas! We were close to a couple of grocery stores, an incredible coffee shop, and just a few blocks from the public transit. It was super easy to plan our days out and felt comfortable walking around at any time of the day. There was also a really cool cocktail/beer bar that we stumbled across on our walk home that was so comfy it felt like back home.",1,0.9589,Positive
301.0,14,5.0,3.0,11.0,68,100.0,1,11.17962905101956,4.82,4.78,4.53,4.68,22695354,"Un muy bonito departamento, lo recomiendo ampliamente si van en grupos grandes. Nosotros fuimos 7 personas y se nos hizo muy cómodo. Si bien el departamento está algo retirado de las zonas principales a ver en Berlín, el lugar está sumamente conectado para moverte (autobús, metro, tren)<br/>Recomiendo ampliamente este lugar",0,0.0,Neutral
150.0,4,2.0,2.0,1.0,16,100.0,0,4.6665342592765695,5.0,4.94,4.81,4.75,33272585,"Lorenzo's place is very clean and looks exactly like the photos. The location is great, there are many restaurants and bars, as well as bus and subway stops in close proximity. Instructions were clear and communication was great.",1,0.9501,Positive
107.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,36,100.0,0,6.609127265569619,4.72,4.5,4.72,4.65,29412907,+<br/>We had a great stay at René‘s apartment. <br/>The apartment is pretty nice and only a few minutes away from the subway. <br/>We felt very comfortable at this place. <br/>-<br/>WiFi signal was weak,1,0.8955,Positive
55.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,0.8025330705337501,4.79,4.94,4.83,4.77,11403270,"perfect place in berlin. near in train station   (1 train ride away from the airport) and near to the shopping center. a minor challenge is the communication, but if you read everything before you go there, then you'll understand what is she trying to explain. overall, it was definitely a nice stay.",1,0.8674,Positive
84.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,26,100.0,1,12.741124930844965,4.84,4.77,4.73,4.66,220445,"Die Wohnungsübergabe ging pünktlich und schnell über die Bühne.<br/>Keine Probleme. Vermieter hat schnell noch 2. Bettwäsche-.Set nachgeliefert per Post. Auch kein Problem. Insgesamt sehr schönes und ruhiges Objekt in gutbürgerlicher Nachbarschaft. Verkehrsgünstig gelegen, allerdings Parkprobleme nach 18:30 Uhr, wenn alle Bewohner von der Arbeit wieder zu Hause sind. Alles wesentliche in kurzer Entfernung zu erreichen.",1,-0.8885,Negative
64.0,2,2.0,1.0,1.0,11,100.0,0,5.939128724661588,4.8,4.6,4.6,5.0,32444989,"Erg huiselijk en ruim appartement. Warme ontvangst door Daniël, die erg behulpzaam was met het installeren van een tweede matras (er was gecommuniceerd dat er een tweede bed was, maar dat bleek bij aankomst niet zo), met het gebruik van de keuken enz. Je voelt je hier onmiddellijk alsof je er zelf al jaren woont... De buurt biedt talloze eetgelegenheden op wandelafstand. De twee poezen vonden wij een leuke extra.",1,-0.5994,Negative
64.0,3,0.0,2.0,2.0,19,100.0,0,4.853538051906053,4.51,4.48,4.76,4.55,20745478,"Es handelt sich um mehrere kleine Schlafräume, die alle in ein ehemaliges Ladengeschäft gebaut sind. Dadurch kann es in den Schlafräumen schon mal etwas stickig werden (es läuft sonst nur die Lüftung dort). <br/>Für uns war es völlig okay. Die Betten und Bettwäsche waren sehr bequem und wir konnten gut schlafen!<br/>Leider war während unseres Aufenthaltes eine Gruppe da, die meinte, es sei cool in den Badezimmern zu rauchen und mehrfach in die Waschbecken und Toiletten zu aschen.",1,-0.9785,Negative
91.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,1,1.879148370938034,4.96,4.94,4.96,4.9,344986,"Je pense être tombée sur l'appartement le plus sympa de Berlin.<br/>Les hôtes Haennu et Zaki sont vraiment adorables. Leur petite fille Suraya est juste à croquer. On est accueilli comme un membre de la famille, dans une ambiance chaleureuse et detendue. L'appartement est absolument magnifique et trés confortable. Dans un des quartier les plus cool de Berlin.<br/>Un grand merci à ma petite famille Berlinoise preferée et à trés bientôt, c'est sûr!",1,0.68,Positive
129.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,1,1.845762124055973,4.93,4.93,4.98,4.76,4830714,"Ruim, brandschoon en zeer smaakvol ingericht appartement, heel centraal gelegen in Berlijn. Echte aanrader !",1,0.0,Neutral
78.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,7.443244193575699,4.84,4.84,4.68,4.76,42858136,"Ich buche immer wieder gerne die Wohnung von Ben. Hier passt einfach alles und man fühlt sich rundherum wohl. Die günstige Lage in der Nähe von Tram und Einkaufsmöglichkeiten ist ideal für Geschäftsreisen und Städtetripps. Ben ist ein hervorragender und äußerst zuvorkommender Gastgeber, den man in jeder Hinsicht empfehlen kann.",1,-0.6597,Negative
106.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,15,97.0,1,3.587299160900769,4.83,4.82,4.72,4.8,21018456,"Private bathroom, great localizaton and really nice host. You definately won't regret!",1,0.8695,Positive
31.0,6,1.0,1.0,6.0,29,99.0,0,1.5518343874590943,4.55,4.64,4.6,4.63,6110762,"Весьма приличное место для отдыха и сна. Несмотря на большое количество постояльцев, очень тихо и спокойно. Все приходят спать, а не шуметь. Кровати удобные, спина не болела. Улицу не слышно вообще, очень укромное место. Везде чисто, есть гель для душа и жидкое мыло. Для желающих потусить есть бар и много столиков для уединения. Ребята на рецепшне огонь, каждый день позитив.",1,0.0,Neutral
31.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,20,100.0,1,12.389708472442326,4.76,4.74,4.59,4.81,31116923,Ruhig und mit Dorffeeling gelegen im Berliner Süden.,1,0.0,Neutral
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,12,100.0,0,4.61111595595906,4.5,4.44,4.63,4.48,14831190,Everything great,1,0.6249,Positive
119.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,52,100.0,0,5.951534937224258,4.81,4.63,4.65,4.74,18671787,The attic was a nice and quiet and peaceful. East tidy bit could have been cleaner. Beautiful views from the top floor,1,0.9081,Positive
277.0,11,4.0,1.0,5.0,57,100.0,1,4.768166471191995,4.84,4.89,4.68,4.79,1399377832795922071,"Wir haben ganz spontan einen Kurztrip nach Berlin geplant und waren super happy, dass wir die Wohnung so kurzfristig buchen konnten – wir waren zu viert, ein Mädelswochenende quasi :)<br/>Die Wohnung war dafür wirklich perfekt! Es gibt vier richtige Schlafzimmer, also hatte jede von uns ihr eigenes Zimmer – das findet man in Ferienwohnungen echt selten.<br/>Der Balkon war ein Highlight – morgens mit einem Gläschen Sekt da draußen zu sitzen, Sonne auf der Haut und der Ausblick... einfach nur traumhaft.<br/>Und was wir alle gefeiert haben: Jede (!) von uns hatte eine Klimaanlage im Zimmer. Das kennen wir sonst nur aus unseren Asienurlauben – in Berlin war das wirklich ein kleines Luxus-Upgrade.<br/>Danke für diesen schönen Aufenthalt, wir würden jederzeit wiederkommen! 💛",0,-0.8164,Negative
108.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,24,100.0,1,7.19555434532373,4.93,4.93,4.81,4.84,36471954,住过的最满意的房子！！干净优雅卫生，非常感谢🙏,1,0.0,Neutral
284.0,12,3.0,1.0,4.0,56,100.0,1,9.660413858650209,4.9,4.94,4.46,4.76,16280687,odličan smještaj  čisto uredno i savršeni kreveti za spavanje,0,0.0,Neutral
84.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,18,88.0,1,3.2402791774170403,4.77,4.89,4.92,4.69,16183018,"The location is good, the apartment is a little old but is as pictured.<br/>Towards the end of my stay I was awoken by the door violently being shaken - a man in the hallway was yelling and banging on doors, as if trying to break in. I made a few attempts to contact help, it stopped around sunrise. I took out the trash, packed up and left soon after.<br/>There was a plumbing issue. I informed the host, who mentioned that finding a plumber in Berlin was nearly impossible. While that may be true, as a guest, there wasn't much more I could do besides notify him. I canceled my morning/afternoon plans to wait for the repair, in the end it was an old part needed replacing and was fixed.<br/>I live in a city of similar size to Berlin. The host was quick to point out the issues weren’t his fault (I didn’t blame him). Nevertheless I didn’t feel especially safe at the end of my stay, and left early.",1,-0.287,Negative
70.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,49,100.0,1,1.775601826394409,4.76,4.83,4.8,4.65,786310333020320107,bien situé<br/>commerces et métro à proximité,1,0.0,Neutral
208.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,44,100.0,0,2.084360411756672,4.92,4.94,4.97,4.75,2450125,Frank ist sehr gut vorbereitet und organisiert. Er hat fertige Anleitungen für die Wohnung und Gegend sowie viele Bücher über die Stadt in der Wohnung zur Verfügung. <br/>Die Wohnung ist wunderschön und sehr angenehm. Die Gegend ist ruhig und hat eine tolle Lage!<br/>Ich hatte keinerlei auszusetzen und komme gerne jederzeit wieder.,1,-0.9184,Negative
216.0,10,3.0,2.0,5.0,41,100.0,1,6.297922554406096,4.55,4.72,4.22,4.48,39826933,"Todo perfecto, igual que en las fotos, llegada autónoma con instrucciones claras y sencillas",0,0.3182,Positive
271.0,10,3.0,1.5,5.0,56,100.0,1,5.229990782295846,4.95,4.89,4.8,4.88,17223235,"Good location, well deserved by public transport. The apartment is well furnished and very convenient. A great place to stay in Berlin!",0,0.895,Positive
253.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,56,100.0,1,1.6793067436589162,4.82,4.84,4.98,4.65,35911615,"There was a drainage problem in the building and the bathroom started to flood.We could not reach the host and when they finally answered, they did not send anybody over.The sewage water then flooded over to the bedroom floor. Even after I informed the host of this they still did not send anybody over to help us.The host did not offer us any help in finding new accomodation- they just offered to clean the floor so that we could stay. We had a lot of difficulties in finding a hotel for 5 persons, and the hotel costs were a lot higher than one nights stay. Still, the host only offered to compensate one nights cost. We reached out to the Airbnb support, who helped us very quickly and with their help we received compensation for the extra costs.We totally understand that the sewage problem is not the hosts fault, but they handled the situation very badly and left us alone to try to stop sewage water flooding over.We also had  problems with the electronic lock which did not work well.",0,-0.8983,Negative
90.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,21,100.0,1,2.4398880685801423,4.71,4.62,4.85,4.6,44723033,"very satisfied with the location and flat itself — clean, accessible and quiet. close to everything we needed and to public transport aswell. great communication with the host, too. we really enjoyed the park nearby. fully recommend!",1,0.9483,Positive
60.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,3.4424793835984366,4.59,4.43,4.62,4.5,40961984,Die Wohnung von Dietrich war sauber und die Kommunikation mit ihm war immer freundlich und unkompliziert. Gerne wieder!,1,-0.9508,Negative
72.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,5.732255805387397,4.85,4.9,4.8,4.63,43634046,"The place was just great for 3 days staying, close to the center, like 15-20 min with tram, clean, with all necessary. Didn't contact much Katrin because I already knew what my schedule in Berlin will be, but I was pretty happy with the place. Thank you Katrin for hosting us",1,0.9568,Positive
122.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,31,100.0,1,10.691776660112424,4.68,4.64,4.84,4.36,1117887447208102363,"Très bien situé dans le quartier Charlottenburg, au calme donnant  côté cour sur un jardin qui apporte de la fraicheur en été.  Il s'agit plutôt d'un grand studio, les 4 couchages sont dans la pièce principale. Très propre, accueil efficace.",1,0.4588,Positive
65.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,34,100.0,0,15.875647711341015,4.74,4.74,4.88,4.63,15251878,"This was an ideal quiet place for my brief stay in Dahlem. I never met the hosts, but they provided detailed check-in information and the room was pleasant with a firm bed as well as a large desk for working and even a small couch. The room was nicely decorated with framed images. There is another guest bedroom next door, with a shared bathroom for both. The tranquility was complemented with only a brief greeting from the nice resident dog, and an antique clock chiming the hours. Had I the time, I would have gladly enjoyed reading some of the books on the shelves, and taken advantage of the cooking facilities. A charming aerie in the heart of Dahlem.",1,0.9919,Positive
69.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,1,6.001530217144827,4.92,4.91,4.89,4.83,28194113,"Martin's guest room is very spacious, with beautiful high ceilings, two large windows, a closet, and seating. He was welcoming and had no problem sharing his entire art-filled apartment with me. He has great tips for getting an authentic Berlin experience, and I encourage you to ask him a little bit about his storied past in the city!",1,0.9281,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,24.09813898545909,4.9,4.88,4.49,4.89,27456659,"Maison très jolie. A 30 min du centre, parfait pour passer un excellent séjour. Jürgen était très accueillant et disponible. Je recommande fortement !",1,0.6114,Positive
54.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,18,80.0,1,7.57272271382633,4.86,4.91,4.91,4.83,7518928,"Leider war mein Aufenthalt aufgrund eines Zugausfalls nur kurz, aber dafür war die Unterkunft umso toller. Das Studio befindet sich im Hinterhof und ist daher sehr ruhig. Es ist modern und zweckmäßig eingerichtet und hat alles, was man für einen Städtetripp braucht. Ich habe mich sehr wohlgefühlt und kann die Unterkunft nur empfehlen.",1,-0.9485,Negative
105.0,5,1.0,1.0,3.0,41,96.0,0,6.1770612336798365,4.44,4.43,4.77,4.28,27018643,"Die Wohnung ist relativ schlicht und einfach ausgestattet, reicht aber vollkommen aus. Man findet alles, was man benötigt. Die Wohnung war ebenfalls sauber. Wenn man einen Kurztrip plant, dann ist die Wohnung absolut zu empfehlen. Auch der Standort ist gut und man ist schnell mit der Tram oder Bahn bei den wichtigsten Sehenswürdigkeiten. Anbindung ist gut. Preis/Leistung ist entsprechend okay und die Wohnung ist wie beschrieben.",1,-0.9618,Negative
125.0,1,2.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,1,6.342776312538732,4.88,4.96,4.8,4.92,20171185,"El departamento es muy bonito, esta a 10 minutos de un supermercado y del metro. El sillón cama no es muy cómodo, todo lo demás estuvo muy bueno.",1,-0.296,Negative
210.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,0,5.639010852357188,4.47,4.68,4.56,4.32,1302932,"Modern and simple, this apartment was located in a central area of Schonebrg and close to transportation making it easy to get to many tourist sights. Jens is a fantastic host who is responsive to questions via the airbnb app and made a neighbor available in case of urgent needs. The flat was homely and comfortable and I spent a wonderful week without any issues. The kitchen was well supplied with crockery and basic kitchen en necessities. The bathroom was clean with great water pressure and abundant ant hot water. <br/>Bottom line: I would stay again at this wonderful apt with a wunderbar host. :)",1,0.9837,Positive
95.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,3.1833669854420146,4.83,4.85,4.8,4.58,34018418,"I thoroughly enjoyed my stay in Kreuzberg.  Kevin's apartment is spotlessly clean, airy, quiet, and everything I needed for my week long stay.  It is a short walk to the train station.  A Bio Markt is right down the street.  The Landwehr Canal is a short walk away with cafes, swans, and parks.  I would definitely recommend this apartment.",1,0.8883,Positive
90.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,0,12.4068471777683,4.5,4.62,4.48,4.48,31170463,"This place is a budget friendly stay in Berlin. Stayed 2 nights and it worked good for our needs which was a place to sleep and shower. Communication with the host was easy. <br/>One thing to note is that there are other airbnbs attached to the building  and all the keys are for those units are accessed on lockboxes which are mounted directly to the front door frame. So at times, when other people are retreiving or dropping off keys, you might think someone is trying to break into the place. <br/>Also, when we arrived, the place smelled like smoke and we found a sock on the floor in plain sight which made us question if the place had been cleaned or not. <br/>Like I said, it's a budget stay.",1,0.8885,Positive
100.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,38,100.0,1,8.042661165242661,4.86,4.87,4.81,4.72,44112319,"El alojamiento es cómodo y tiene todo lo necesario para pasar unos días en Berlín. tiene buena comunicación, está en un barrio tranquilo y las camas son cómodas. Stefan ha estado pendiente de nuestras necesidades y ha sido muy amable. Somos una pareja con un niño de 10 años y hemos estado muy a gusto en el alojamiento. Lo recomendamos!",1,0.6239,Positive
50.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,0,10.045446339635951,4.75,4.88,4.59,4.77,321295,Heike and Heinrich were great hosts that were thorough about explaining local public transportation. The room was everything we needed for our NYE stay in Berlin!,1,0.6588,Positive
114.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,1,3.268352166045826,4.8,4.74,4.89,4.71,11294240,Sehr schön. Weiter so!,1,0.0,Neutral
148.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,44,94.0,0,7.131273504704622,4.73,4.83,4.83,4.56,49086464,"Very comfortable large bed and quite clean. Coffee machine is a nice touch. Although it has kettle, microwave hot plate, plates etc in a small cupboard, I could barely call it an apartment. The room was very small, and barely any space for more than one small suitcase. And the shower has no door, no privacy at all or any option to achieve it. <br/>Wifi was very temperamental, and we could not use it at all. We had received a small refund yet it was not ideal to be needing to do work from the local coffee shop. <br/>Customer service was very kind, responsive and personal. Contactless hustle free check in and out was flawless.",1,0.9458,Positive
115.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,22,90.0,1,10.750545351348627,4.94,4.83,4.91,4.77,28044368,"Es gab im Vorfeld ein Missverständnis bzgl. der Check-In Zeit, die leider viel zu spät war für die Anreise zu Mittag. Veronica hat dann ihr Bestes getan, so dass es ein wenig früher ging und das mit ein wenig Umplanen dann doch noch zu einem Zufriedenstellenden Ergebnis geführt hat. <br/>Hier müsste AirBNB nachbessern, denn der Support war wenig hilfreich, die Darlegung der Check-In zeit unzureichend, so steht bspw. in der Anfragebestätigung von AirBNB nur das Datum, keine weiteren Details. Auch bei anderen Unterkünften konnte man im Vorfeld nur das Datum sehen und hoffen, das es schon ab 15 Uhr möglich ist einzuchecken.<br/>Die Wohnung ist sehr zu empfehlen, charmanter Altbau in dem von Heizung bis Dusche alles funktioniert und in gutem Zustand ist. Die öffentliche Anbindung ist gut und einige Sehenswürdigkeiten auch wirklich in Gehweite. Ich würde wieder buchen.",1,-0.9709,Negative
95.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,54,100.0,1,5.879887825868721,4.96,4.98,4.91,4.83,31711514,Wonderful and very clean apartment near Hauptbahnhof. Markus and Ewa are great hosts - we had a really nice time. Would definately recommend the stay to anyone.,1,0.9467,Positive
213.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,28,98.0,1,1.0060942274458289,4.97,4.96,4.97,4.85,14191082,"Stephanie has been a great host! Her place was tidy and warm, just as depicted in the photos! She's also responsive and helpful!",1,0.9037,Positive
