106.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,15,97.0,1,3.587299160900769,4.83,4.82,4.72,4.8,21018456,"Super Hostel, reichlich Platz und sehr sauber. Empfehlung zum Essen: San Marco in der Greifswalder Straße (7 Minuten vom Hostel entfernt) . Sehr günstig und sehr gut!",1,0.636,Positive
144.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,0,8.026984704912612,4.92,4.76,4.84,4.76,4215500,"We had an amazing time at Andreas's place, and would have stayed longer if we could! We give it a wholehearted recommendation. A classic Altbau-style apartment with an elevator - a very rare combination! <br/>So many things make this apartment unique - very large rooms & super-high ceilings, artistic touches in the design and decoration, one of the only kitchens in Berlin with a professional espresso machine, excellent amenities, and kind treats from Andreas to make us feel welcome. <br/>A great base for exploring the city (multiple buses right across the street) and at the same time very inviting to hang inside and spend hours over breakfast.<br/>The neighborhood is quiet, not much night life going on but great places to eat and shop, which we were very happy about. Two thumbs up!",1,0.9759,Positive
72.0,2,0.0,1.0,3.0,40,100.0,0,7.593507322759444,4.7,4.67,4.88,4.72,19742792,Great host!,1,0.6588,Positive
208.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,45,100.0,0,2.312287728657424,4.53,4.53,4.88,4.46,1111145,"The flat looks exactly like in the pictures<br/>Really cosy and bright, very quiet area and very close from supermarket and subway station<br/>A bit ""minimalist"" if you want to cook- only one pan and nothing in the cupboards (we had to buy everything but salt and pepper)<br/>All in all good start to sightsee in Berlin!<br/>",1,0.7901,Positive
88.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,1,2.7348204012292734,4.85,4.96,4.85,4.68,937557263289597139,"The flat was beautiful, spacious and clean, and in a perfect location to start exploring Berlin’s neighbourhoods. Till was a great host as well, very easy to communicate with. Would recommend this!",1,0.9701,Positive
78.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,1,3.406346218061282,4.68,4.63,4.8,4.62,11276488,"Wir waren zu viert (3 Erwachsene und ein Baby) dort. Ellen und ihr Team, haben sofort gefragt, ob ein Babybett und ein Hochstuhl bereitgestellt werden sollen.<br/>Generell war die Kommunikation super. Es wurde innerhalb weniger Minuten auf fragen geantwortet.<br/>Der Checkin war super einfach und genauso wie beschrieben.<br/>Die Unterkunft war sauber und schön hergerichtet. Die Lage ist top um schnell zu allem zu gelangen (5 Minuten Fußweg zur S+U-Bahnstation).<br/>Alles in allem ein angenehner Aufenthalt mit top Preis/Leistungsverhältnis.<br/>Beim nächsten Mal bin ich gerne wieder dirt Gast.",1,-0.91,Negative
422.0,6,3.0,2.0,3.0,34,100.0,1,2.9051794007943927,4.98,4.97,4.92,4.87,24019375,Expect a really comfortable and easy place to stay. Lots of things to see nearby of course being in Berlin is a joy. A really easy and friendly experience!,0,0.955,Positive
135.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,63,100.0,1,1.2975790803644518,4.92,4.88,4.96,4.77,13069376,Overall a comfortable and convenient stay in Berlin.,1,0.5106,Positive
131.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,0,2.319079304594608,4.91,4.85,4.89,4.85,44363134,"Ursula's flat was lovely and in a fantastic location. Thoughtful touches throughout the space, lots of light, super clean and in a quiet, cozy building. Super easy to get to any location via public transportation and Lisa was great with communication and checked in to make sure we had all we needed. Would absolutely stay again!",1,0.9836,Positive
89.0,4,0.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,1,9.213446128957443,4.68,4.53,4.51,4.68,242978,房间很大，设施齐全。,1,0.0,Neutral
97.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,0,13.347444227266896,4.79,4.74,4.95,4.76,1322780,"Für einen Kurzaufenthalt genau das Richtige! Lage und Ausstattung der Wohnung waren gut, Gunilla hatte sogar extra laktosefreie Milch besorgt, was ich sehr aufmerksam fand! Ich würde jederzeit wiederkommen und habe mich gefreut, dass wir uns zufällig beim hervorragenden Italiener (Geheimtipp!) ums Eck getroffen haben.",1,0.0,Neutral
138.0,6,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,95.0,0,3.6065341707106313,4.63,4.47,4.82,4.51,637540704086864148,"Quiet place, with bakery and market in a walkable distance. 24/7 open shop is also nearby which was very convenient. U-Bahn Station is also not far away and can reach the city very quick. The rooms itself were hot, but they had provided us with fans so it wasn't an issue. Everything was clean, lots of space, it felt very quiet and relaxing staying there. I would definitely recommend staying there if you want to travel the whole day and come back to a cozy, comfortable & quiet place.",1,0.9682,Positive
309.0,6,3.0,2.0,5.0,32,100.0,1,6.934354434877142,4.93,4.92,4.62,4.75,14956202,Great place - beautiful apartment. In the city but really quiet. Once you get your bearings - pretty easy to get around from there too.,0,0.9209,Positive
37.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,1,12.302303063837329,4.9,4.92,4.67,4.93,37581746,"It was our first time in Germany and our stay couldn’t have been better. Me and my friend felt incredibly confortable in Christina’s and Helga’s home. It was everything you could expect from an AirBNB; great service, impeccable attention, exceptional attitude and above all, hygenic and clean! We would recommend this to everyone thinking about visiting Berlin.",1,0.9402,Positive
107.0,3,0.0,1.0,3.0,18,93.0,0,2.373482401219675,4.74,4.7,4.77,4.67,17399068,"Bra på alla sätt. Bra läge, massa restauranger precis utanför porten. Men eftersom det är via innergård så störs man inte. Vi missade att det var nyckelbox, så all kommunikation via chatten men det fungerade toppen! Lite kall lägenhet generellt, man kan sätta på TVn och lyssna på tysk radio. Perfekt!",1,0.0,Neutral
182.0,9,2.0,1.0,7.0,25,100.0,0,0.5561753554406595,4.66,4.69,4.93,4.58,11764015,"My two sons and I had a wonderful stay in Agustin's place, a large, authentic Berlin flat in a great location, from where we were able to walk everywhere.  Dieter was really helpful at the check-in and great at explaining where everything was in the neighbourhood, we felt really taken care of. The flat was also really warm, even during a cold January spell of - 8 degrees! Would readily stay there again in the future and would highly recommend.",0,0.9743,Positive
40.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,6.228031954325974,4.75,4.66,4.84,4.78,48677117,"The apartment has an excellent position - everything you want to visit is easily accessible from Frank's place. The neighbourhood is just so beautiful and quiet, I really enjoyed staying there. The host has compiled a guide for his guests with lots of useful recommendations - main attractions, along with the way to get there, public transportation prices, places to eat clubs, bars and so on.<br/>Hope to return soon!",1,0.9681,Positive
89.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,1,4.64019565298711,4.88,4.74,4.85,4.78,21759319,Tolle Unterkunft in zentraler Lage!,1,0.0,Neutral
165.0,6,1.0,1.0,6.0,27,99.0,0,1.4908853753728162,4.61,4.55,4.6,4.57,15135834,"Very friendly, the space is beautiful. I'll definitely recommend this space for anyone who wants a place to stay in Berlin and doesn't mind to share room with other people.",0,0.8935,Positive
130.0,5,0.0,1.0,5.0,18,93.0,0,2.347776216465179,4.74,4.63,4.73,4.62,17413995,"This is a unique, beautiful space.  It is an open loft so there are no closed bedrooms, but the 2 twin beds in the main area downstairs are tucked away and the other 3 beds are upstairs.  Martin & Charlotte are wonderful hosts. And after three full days in Berlin, this was our favorite neighborhood, with plenty of street life and delicious, reasonable restaurants, and conveniently located either by walking or Ubahn.  Highly recommended.",1,0.961,Positive
110.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,1,0.7841162132849239,4.94,4.91,4.95,4.79,640187256944720581,"Our stay at Dominik’s apartment was 10/10. A great place in a super nice area, convenient location to get anywhere in the city, and Dominik was responsive and extremely accommodating. I’d recommend staying here to anyone visiting Berlin!",1,0.9465,Positive
83.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,34,100.0,1,6.863916908623769,4.93,5.0,4.93,4.84,34130158,"Had a really lovely 4 nights at Mandy’s apartment. She was so welcoming and helpful, met us at the door and showed us around. The apartment was well-equipped, spotlessly clean, beautifully designed with access to the garden and within walking distance of the river Spree, buses, U-Bahn & S-Bahn. Quiet and away from the city hustle, this was the perfect place to relax and enjoy Berlin. Thank you Mandy - hope to see you again soon!! Would highly recommend.",1,0.9881,Positive
117.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,1,6.111407392164272,4.88,4.88,4.71,4.7,13893621,"Kleines, cooles Apartment, sehr durchdacht und liebevoll gestaltet und ausgestattet. Zum Wohlfühlen ab dem ersten Moment. Auch die Lage im Samariterviertel ist klasse: zahlreiche Geschäfte, Spätis, Kneipen und Restaurants zu Fuß erreichbar.",1,-0.5994,Negative
