123.0,1,1.0,1.0,8.0,29,99.0,0,1.4570613623660682,4.56,4.5,4.54,4.52,6858383,"coole Unterkunft!<br/>alle nett, definitiv komme ich wieder",1,0.0,Neutral
58.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,0,18.77117911741297,4.7,4.71,4.52,4.69,3314419,Nice offer. I would stay again if I need a place to stay in Berlin for a while.,1,0.4215,Positive
176.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,0,2.0476753393055094,4.97,5.0,4.9,4.86,14089858,"Spending 5 days in Wera's appartement was nice but enough. It's was hard to move freely and relax because on every free inch there are ""things"". Everybody should be free in what to collect in his life, for us that is memorable moments instant of things, human before useless stuff. What sense does it have to have a fancy high class stereo set, on which the radio sounds like cheap transistor radio? Why a ridiculous priced TV with only free channels and none of the extra applications used... Why sit in shower because a shower curtain doesn't fit in the tidiness?  I hope that my day that I have to sit in the shower be very long away.<br/>If your urge to pimp up you place with coral instead of leaving it where it's belong I think that shows that maybe when you visit your beloved Africa Wera maybe you could bring back a vulnerable souvenir and that is the Africans love of live instead of ""things"" or A brands. <br/>The communication with Wera was nice, she was leaving some drinks etc for us. The place was spotless clean and there is a lot of supplies to give a luxurious comfortable stay. she was helpful to pick our own check out time.",1,0.9934,Positive
95.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,17,100.0,0,4.191690841311009,4.74,4.75,4.71,4.67,1015879249578929490,"My stay at Hotel Comenius was great! The room was comfortable and clean, the staff beyond friendly and helpful. Excellent location too. Highly recommended!",1,0.9701,Positive
