211.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,28,100.0,1,3.98074662102462,4.76,4.82,4.84,4.57,37077823,"An amazing place to stay to explore the city of Berlin, two huge en-suite bathrooms an open plan kitchen and a small balcony with plenty of restaurants within close proximity. Mia the host was very informative about how to enter the building and was always on hand with any issues, will definitely be back!",1,0.8777,Positive
160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,87.0,0,3.4802565088356308,4.54,4.54,4.6,4.41,43798011,"Alles war wie beschrieben bzw wie auf den Bildern zu sehen. Sehr sauber, sehr zentral. Freundliches Personal. Gerne wieder und klare Weiterempfehlung! *****",1,-0.636,Negative
111.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,51,100.0,1,3.4156959509415743,4.85,4.89,4.82,4.77,14804266,"Cozy, clean spot to stay close to some great local spots to eat and drink. Paul and Jana were great hosts and getting checked in and all set was an absolute breeze.",1,0.8979,Positive
