65.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,4.1903954031521735,4.75,4.86,4.65,4.65,499342,"I really enjoyed staying in Karsten apartment! I loved all the details on decoration. I liked how you can see the neighborhood through the windows and the option to close the windows for privacy. I had some problems with wifi, it was very slow but maybe was a momentaneous problem, the host was available to go there and fix it but I was hurrying during my day plan and  preferred let it that way. I loved the blue walls on the toilet! Just one thing that I would suggest is to change is the curtain on the box (I don't like curtains on shower) and maybe add some light above the shower, a little too dark but this is just a suggestion, for sure a perfect apartment to stay in Berlin and I hope comeback in a near future. :)",1,0.9697,Positive
