202.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,1,13.496650489854977,4.98,5.0,4.96,4.91,51340217,"A beautiful apartment: large, light, airy and very tastefully decorated. It's in a quiet residential area but very close to transport links as well as local shops and restaurants. Paolo and Petra were very welcoming, friendly and communicative. We would definitely stay here again.",1,0.9562,Positive
89.0,6,1.0,1.0,3.0,57,100.0,1,20.240640244355667,4.96,4.96,4.73,4.85,786833707781544447,"We stayed for 2 nights and we absolutely loved it. Yannik welcomes us like old friends and had everything ready for us - even a welcome drink that was so sweet. The place was immaculate clean and we instantly felt at home. Yannik gave us local recommendations for shopping, walking etc. no question was too much to asked. We enjoyed our stay and our swims in the pool. The garden area is idyllic and perfect to chill out and have a nice dinner. Shops are in walkable distance. Nice and peaceful area. We will definitely book again when we are back in Berlin. I would highly recommend to stay here if you are travelling thorough Berlin.",1,0.9916,Positive
95.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,1.8743775656468973,4.98,4.94,4.99,4.94,2492162,"Renate ist eine tolle Gastgeberin, die zudem sehr gute Insider-Tipps für Berlin parat hat. Wir haben uns bei ihr jederzeit wohl gefühlt, gut geschlafen und sind munter in den Tag gestartet. Auch beim nächsten Berlin-Trip heißt es für uns: Renate",1,-0.5994,Negative
130.0,5,0.0,1.0,5.0,18,93.0,0,2.347776216465179,4.74,4.63,4.73,4.62,17413995,"Martina,<br/>Her loft was great and she was a stellar host that was able to accommodate three of us. <br/>I thank her for her quick correspondence and making our Berlin experience a unforgettable one.<br/>I would recommend this loft to anyone!!",1,0.8652,Positive
68.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,28,100.0,1,6.576517854147013,4.72,4.76,4.31,4.63,36310980,"Le logement est très confortable, propre et on s'y sent bien!  Il est bien placé pour rejoindre tout ce qu'il faut visiter à Berlin. Des petites attentions sympathiques.",1,-0.2003,Negative
75.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,28,100.0,0,7.600554526565933,4.89,4.76,4.94,4.76,13554198,A beautiful bnb in the center of Berlin. The place is close to the U3 station and located in a peaceful but cultural district. Michael is very friendly and helpful. I’m very satisfied to stay in his house for 5 days.,1,0.9554,Positive
100.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,36,100.0,1,2.8844703561659584,4.87,4.86,4.8,4.67,20071024,Stylish and great location. We loved it and would stay again.,1,0.8402,Positive
115.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,1,2.112162880935192,4.78,4.81,4.84,4.67,16695157,"Apartamento en el  centro de la ciudad, 10 minutos andando. Muy cerca de transporte público y muy bien comunicado con el resto de la ciudad. Apartamento más grande de lo pensaba, y estiloso. No hemos podido conocer a los dueños, y la persona encargada de hacernos el check in nos dejó las llaves en la calle, en un candado atado a la tubería del agua del edificio. A la salida tampoco la conocimos, ya que teníamos que coger el avión muy pronto, y le dejamos las tasas y la llave en el apartamento. El sofá cama estaba sin preparar y solo nos dejó 2 edredones, tuvimos que rebuscar en los cajones para encontrar las sábanas y era bastante incómodo. La lavadora estaba rota y no nos lo comunicaron. Echamos de menos un microondas y una mesa para comer, el apartamento solo dispone de una barra americada. Agradecimos que no hubiera TV a pesar de que los niños lo echaron de menos.El apartamento es para 4, nosotros íbamos 5, 3 son niños y pensábamos que nos ibamos a arreglar bien, pero nos encontramos que solo había 4 sillas y el sofá incluso para 4 mal, bastante incómodo. Por lo demás pasamos unos estupendos días en Berlin",1,-0.8481,Negative
93.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,2.54678149398414,4.86,4.96,4.9,4.84,3187735,"Barbara’s place is certainly stylish and well looked after. The apartment was very clean and tidy, close to public transport and had several shops/cafes nearby. Thanks again :)",1,0.908,Positive
