64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,13.088231838082732,4.89,4.76,4.67,4.83,18195157,"Gitta war sehr entspannt und freundlich. Der Check-in war flexibel möglich, obwohl ich spät ankam. Das Zimmer war gemütlich und sauber, ebenso die gesamte Wohnung. Ich habe mich sehr wohl gefühlt und kann die Unterkunft nur weiterempfehlen.",1,-0.9661,Negative
98.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,1,3.617893966015014,4.71,4.68,4.85,4.56,43466060,The stay at Jans apartment was just beautiful. The tucked away treasure of a home in the midst of Kreuzberg/Bergmannkiez ist just what we needed after seeing The Kooks live in Berlin. Thanks a lot for your hospitality! We highly recommend this accommodation and host.,1,0.9019,Positive
139.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,96.0,1,4.279858775670925,4.8,4.82,4.89,4.66,54126149,"It felt like stepping into a Oases after the hassle and bustle of the Mehringdamm!<br/>The room was very spacious,had all what we needed.The ground floor back garden was so tranquil, great to just enjoy a cuppa and listen to Berlin...before we steppt back out and explored the beautiful city.<br/>I can only recommend Cinderella's",1,0.9544,Positive
