125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,1,4.261406665503843,4.89,4.69,4.87,4.75,50786450,Great place to stay for our few days visit in Berlin. Ragna was quick to answer and always very helpful. Good public transport connections to everywhere in the city.,1,0.8852,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,20,100.0,1,3.4592595707900773,4.81,4.79,4.84,4.73,11564181,"La casa y la habitación son hermosas. La ubicación es muy buena, esta muy bien conectada y el barrio es muy lindo. Sophia fue muy amable, nos dio recomendaciones que fueron muy útiles. Disfrutamos mucho las charlas con ella. Volveremos a elegirla la próxima vez que estemos por berlin!",1,0.0,Neutral
59.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,12.619497882063683,4.85,4.8,4.71,4.76,729604965457117074,Andreas先生人非常好，为我们升级了住所，并且也帮助了我们很多，和他相处的时间里都非常愉快，住宿的地方环境也非常好，交通便利，房间整洁干净，非常感谢他的和善与帮助,1,0.0,Neutral
161.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,44,100.0,1,3.550833267755717,4.84,4.83,4.66,4.49,33803119,"This place is definitely worth the stay. In a great location, great decor, clean and spacious. The one thing that others need to be aware of is it lists two kings beds. Which is not entirely true, they are king size but have two single mattresses on each. I booked on the intention of it having two king beds and it didn’t make for the best sleep due always falling between the mattresses. I still rate this place a 5 star place. If I’d known before I booked I would of looked for something else. So my lesson learned. Other than that it’s a gem. Thanks for the awesome stay.",0,0.9715,Positive
114.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,14,100.0,0,4.700218292856508,4.61,4.6,4.74,4.44,18473062,"This listing is well connected to the inner city via the U8 line, has restaurants and other amenities nearby. Highly recommend staying here.",1,0.5984,Positive
210.0,6,3.0,1.0,3.0,30,100.0,1,5.782365457190099,4.92,4.87,4.66,4.78,780553102645612115,"AC would do wonders in the summer months. Other than that, felt safe and at home. Beautiful apartment well furnished for large groups. Very close to the U and S Bahn and easy to access. Would recommend for large groups.",0,0.9231,Positive
206.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,14,100.0,1,2.179850376172357,5.0,5.0,5.0,4.43,30392465,"Das Zimmer war wie beschrieben, das Badezimmer größer als gedacht. Badezimmer und Bett sind nur durch eine Glastür getrennt. Das ist super, weil das Bad so Tageslicht bekommt und schön hell ist. Wer zu zweit anreist und seine Intimsphäre schätzt, sollte dies wissen.<br/>Das Bett war super gemütlich, das Bad super groß, hochwertig gemacht und der Host super hilfsbereit. Es gab kein Frühstück, allerdings verschiedene Getränke, Müsli, Kekse und andere Kleinigkeiten in einer netten kleinen Gemeinschaftsküche, in der man sich einfach selbst bedienen konnte. Ich mag das Konzept und würde wiederkommen.",1,-0.5859,Negative
343.0,12,4.0,1.5,8.0,41,97.0,0,1.9889741213247012,4.41,4.28,4.8,4.36,662252642803259249,"Fijne plek, goede prijs/kwaliteit verhouding",0,0.0,Neutral
100.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,3.091836209520125,4.86,4.9,4.86,4.77,869793,"Die Wohnung ist super schön, sehr sauber und toll gelegen. Ganz viele Kneipen, Bars, Restaurants direkt vor der Tür oder nur ein paar Schritte weg. Man ist mitten im Kiez. <br/>Die Kommunikation mit Kirsten ist problemlos, sie reagiert gleich und man kann Dinge jederzeit absprechen. <br/>Und es ist alles da, was man benötigt, selbst Kaffee war vorhanden.",1,-0.5994,Negative
45.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,25,100.0,0,13.535801688042048,4.53,4.51,4.72,4.47,53160614,"Wegen Baustelle drumherum war der Eingang etwas unklar. Ansonsten aber völlig problemlos und einfach zu erreichen.<br/>Sehr sauber und geschmackvoll eingerichtet. Unpersönlich, da vollkommen professionell und nichts privat.<br/>Wir haben gut geschlafen und uns bald wohl gefühlt.",1,-0.5994,Negative
98.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,1,7.0857343616592825,4.85,4.87,4.55,4.7,32214669,"Totul a fost perfect! Locuința este exact ca în poze, curată, bine întreținută și dotată cu absolut tot ce ai nevoie pentru un sejur confortabil. Gazda a fost foarte amabilă și ne-a oferit toate detaliile necesare pentru o ședere fără griji. Recomand cu toată încrederea! 🌟",1,0.6467,Positive
119.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,54,100.0,1,7.664959909386412,4.98,4.98,4.93,4.92,15660868,"The apartment and Tanja are both first class! My brother and I stayed for four nights and can honestly say that this is in the nicest neighbourhood which we saw through walking the breadth and depths of Berlin. The fresh flowers were beautiful, the apartment is super clean and modern but with a warm homely feeling. Tanja provided enough communication but also left us too it. I felt we were so lucky to stay as I can see Tanja is frequently booked up. I would thoroughly recommend x",1,0.9702,Positive
60.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,1,2.5818659651694333,4.79,4.68,4.8,4.78,4780087,"Ana Maria was so nice and available for everything. The home is located exactly at Kottbusser Tor underground station, very comfortable and tidy. We recommend it",1,0.8661,Positive
