172.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,95.0,0,4.132850367965358,4.48,4.51,4.59,4.33,43811934,"Clean, quiet room (as long as the windows are closed) with a seamless late check-in. Having some kitchen features is very practical when you want to store, prepare and eat food during your travels instead of eating out all the time — or keep leftovers staying fresh. Gorgeous rainforest shower head too (with a detachable shower head option for when you want to keep your hair dry). I would stay here again.",1,0.8625,Positive
84.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,1,3.2375488184892025,4.89,4.92,4.88,4.83,41651093,Koslig leiligehet i greit område. Gangavstand til sentrum. Carsten og Jessica var veldig hyggelige! :),1,0.5093,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,10,100.0,0,2.5198418021767712,4.65,4.63,4.75,4.55,4864695,"A very nice flat in an amiable and well-connected area, everything in the flat clean and tidy.  Matthieu was very helpful and accommodating about us arriving early and leaving late.   We had a great time and would book the flat again. ",1,0.9183,Positive
165.0,6,1.0,1.0,6.0,27,99.0,0,1.4908853753728162,4.61,4.55,4.6,4.57,15135834,Great deal and great location. Perfect place to stay if you do not need immense privacy.,0,0.9169,Positive
31.0,3,2.0,1.0,3.0,19,86.0,0,30.90671021934421,4.52,4.39,4.65,4.56,22110197,"The place is surrounded by multiple lakes and close to the forest. If you’re searching for something that calms you down after being in busy Berlin, Petra’s place is right for you. Although it takes a bit of time (roughly 45-60 min) to get to central Berlin, it’s still easy to reach any place in the city. As others have said before, it is bigger than expected from the photos. You have a kitchen with enough seating space for four, one single bedroom, another double which also serves as a living room and a large bathroom. Petra is a welcoming host, supplying you with everything you might need (towels, sheets, etc.) and you might even get some of her tasty baking. There are two supermarkets close by (5 min. walk) and an Italian restaurant right next door. I enjoyed staying.",1,0.8885,Positive
81.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,1,1.1870073447536489,4.87,4.87,4.88,4.69,39861011,excellent stay! Perfect location close to the tram. Very tidy and well stocked apartment. Tanja was very friendly and helpful. Would stay again!,1,0.9509,Positive
