246.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,46,67.0,1,6.521801009062151,5.0,5.0,4.72,4.78,1224478055994962065,Tak for lån af jeres smukke bolig. Vi nød nogle hyggelige dage samt nytår i Berlin. <br/>Vi kommer igen,0,0.0,Neutral
89.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,0,12.72557223503116,4.66,4.69,4.68,4.53,15019290,"Frank’s place was perfect for our stay in Berlin. The location was very convenient as it was across for the S-Bahn and within walking distance to grocery stores and restaurants. We were traveling with our 9 month old and the extra amenities like the high chair and play yard made our lives much easier. The building was very quiet. Lights in the hallway, courtyard and stairs turn off automatically. Trash bins easy to access. Keep in mind this location is up several flights of stairs and the wood steps make noise. We did our best to be as quiet as possible so we didn’t disturb others going up and down. There are two entrances to the station, with one almost directly across from the flat at the other end of the platform.",1,0.9386,Positive
132.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,97.0,1,1.9977573269292777,4.73,4.71,4.73,4.57,36037847,Great,1,0.6249,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,0,5.236519726637563,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,1275995907051098727,"I booked Linda’s apartment not for myself but for my dad and his partner who were visiting town for a few days. I live in Berlin as well, very close by in fact, which was very convenient for their visit. I met Linda a few days before checkin for key handover, and she showed me the ropes. Linda is very friendly and helpful and communication was smooth both before and throughout their stay.<br/>The apartment is very practical and tastefully decorated, with all the essential amenities and it’s perfect for a couple. It is faced to an inner courtyard and is therefore fairly quiet, despite it being located in a very busy street. Schillerkiez, the neighborhood, is a must see for those visiting Berlin, with its many bars, restaurants, shops, supermarkets, cultural offerings and the one of a kind Tempelhofer Feld. My relatives had a great experience during their stay and we absolutely recommend anyone to stay there!",1,0.987,Positive
96.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,1,6.308107459826863,4.97,4.67,4.7,4.77,1099342718748118516,"Wir haben die Zeit in Simons Wohnung sehr genossen. Man sieht sofort, dass alles mit sehr viel Liebe zum Detail gestaltet wurde. Herzlichen Dank, für die grandiosen Tage und Nächte.",1,-0.8316,Negative
201.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,28,100.0,1,3.120633279720611,4.59,4.63,4.9,4.45,27955603,"Très beau séjour. L’appartement est idéalement situé pour visiter les principaux lieux d’intérêt pour un visiteur de courte durée. À proximité du train, métro, épicerie, etc.",1,0.0,Neutral
172.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,36,100.0,1,4.687009009425073,4.77,4.4,4.9,4.47,1136997416471600481,Very good flat in the center of West Berlin,1,0.4927,Positive
52.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,6.296102388049414,4.82,4.77,4.72,4.77,16305782,The apartment was very cozy just like the pictures shown on the website. It was nice and tidy except for the trash cans that were not emptied upon our arrival since we arrived earlier than expected. It was not a problem though since Serkan took the trashes out and kindly offered us 10€ for compensation. We enjoyed our stay and highly recommend this place to others.,1,0.9488,Positive
60.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,1.1530597508367482,4.91,4.83,4.97,4.85,229776,"Ich habe mich sehr gefreut, bei Arne und seinen beiden wundervollen Katzen zu Gast zu sein! Arne ist sehr entgegenkommend, freundlich und hilfsbereit. Er hat viele tolle Empfehlungen, wie man seine Zeit in Berlin am besten genießen kann – und ich kann nur sagen, es lohnt sich, darauf zu hören :) <br/>Die Wohnung ist  super schön und mit viel Geschmack eingerichtet, die Katzen sind einfach zauberhaft. Vielen Dank für die herzliche Begrüßung – ich wünsche dir alles Gute!",1,-0.3578,Negative
75.0,2,1.0,1.0,3.0,34,78.0,0,2.564933325624911,4.65,4.85,4.65,4.55,782997,"My girlfriend and I resided at Arnd’s apartment for a little under four months. The place was quite spacious and has a good location within Kruezberg. Arnd enabled us to have a home equipped with all of the adequate necessities but we unfortunately encountered quite a few problems during our stay. Firstly, despite having all of the heating batteries on, the unit got unbearably cold at night. Considering that the place was only a little bit above ground level, we were given little to no privacy from the outside street. Although there were blinds and curtains, we would have liked to have had some natural light during the daylight. In addition to this, a cigarette stench could be detected from outside the front door and even throughout the inside of our apartment. Although the bathroom was nice, the shower was extremely small which made showering difficult. The kitchen and living room seemed to be fully equipped, however the quality of the products provided did not meet the standards of other airbnbs that I have resided at. It was a great area with a ton of bars, clubs, restaurants around; however, my girlfriend felt unsafe outside without friends around. It is highly recommended that women are always accompanied by others- especially at night. Personally I will look for another unit next time I'm in Berlin.",1,0.2164,Positive
69.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,0,0.6160009980511233,4.87,4.83,4.88,4.75,6550264,"The apartment location is really good. It is close to Alexanderplatz and also to metro, train and bus stations. It looked exactly like the photos and it was enough for me and my friend.<br/>Dan is a great host, very friendly, he gave us recommendations for cool places in Berlin and for sure I would stay here again!",1,0.953,Positive
103.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,53,100.0,0,11.6772868920931,4.8,4.73,4.73,4.69,49770556,Claudias tolle Wohnung war sehr sauber und ruhig. Wir waren für eine Konferenz in Berlin und die Lage war für uns perfekt. In der Nähe gibt es etliche Einkaufs- und Essensmöglichkeiten. Die Kommunikation mit Claudia war sehr freundlich und unkompliziert. Der Check In war super entspannt und es hat alles problemlos funktioniert. <br/>Wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt und werden definitiv wiederkommen! :),1,-0.9571,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,48,100.0,0,12.316433403729432,4.56,4.11,4.89,4.22,44486019,Very nice location 😃,1,0.4754,Positive
139.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,96.0,1,4.279858775670925,4.8,4.82,4.89,4.66,54126149,"Its a great little hotel. The room was very nice, especially the free standing bathtub. Kreuzberg is a awesome neighborhood with a lot to see and do.",1,0.942,Positive
158.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,47,94.0,0,3.1018817858877528,4.61,4.82,4.73,4.64,721540353786100222,Great room with high ceilings feeling very spacious,1,0.6808,Positive
65.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,4.1903954031521735,4.75,4.86,4.65,4.65,499342,Karsten has a beautiful apartment in a great location. We arrived late in the evening and he arranged for us to pickup our keys from a friend of his. Mainly a residential area so it's quiet in the evenings and close to the Berlin Wall Memorial! ,1,0.9098,Positive
83.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,0,8.160231491771468,4.85,4.64,4.91,4.82,50884931,"Julian met us when we arrived and was a very helpful and responsive host throughout our stay. The location of the apartment is central and close to public transportation as well as the Tiergarten park. It was quite warm during our stay, but the apartment had a nice cross breeze when we opened the windows, as well as a terrace to sit outside. There are no curtains in the living room and kitchen, however, to keep the sun out on the hottest days. The kitchen had everything you would need for cooking, but was a little cluttered in general. The internet worked well and overall we enjoyed our stay in Julian's place.",1,0.9406,Positive
31.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,100.0,1,12.720083248666349,4.78,4.69,4.54,4.73,24154046,"Zimmer ist gross genug und sauber, nur ist es nicht verschliessbar. Auf das geteilte Bad im Erdgeschoss muss man sich entsprechend einstellen. Gastgeber sind sehr freundlich und nett. Unkompliziertes Check in und Check out.",1,-0.765,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,1.3773060525895495,4.72,4.84,4.91,4.66,1461489656921679773,"Zentral gelegen, tolle Dachterasse, sehr zuvorkommender Service!",1,0.0,Neutral
