360.0,8,3.0,1.0,3.0,66,100.0,1,4.432978276429975,4.94,4.82,4.89,4.74,694871,Great apartment with the best Berlin vibe in a great neighbourhood.  The place is a dream of taste and vintage charm.  Davide was very accommodating to our needs and generally a great host.,0,0.969,Positive
