64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,50.0,0,7.122109893992188,4.76,4.84,4.64,4.64,5610403,We loved staying at Anthony's place! Lovely rooms and a sweet host. Great location for exploring Berlin ,1,0.9441,Positive
69.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,100.0,1,12.777307393426074,4.97,4.97,4.95,4.92,25012330,"Lucas ist sehr freundlich und hat immer rasch geantwortet. Die Wohnung ist eine wunderschön renovierte Altbauwohnung mit Blick in den ruhigen Innenhof und mit viel Liebe zum Detail eingerichteten. Sie  liegt in  einer sehr schönen, ruhigen Lage unweit der U-Bahn.  Alles war tipptopp",1,-0.8316,Negative
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,29,60.0,0,6.431420018452243,1.0,1.0,1.0,1.0,666367175664102499,"Sadly nothing whatsoever to recommend about this property or its host. This apartment is in a large apartment complex, located on an intersection widely described in the media as “the brothel of Europe”, for reasons that became clear immediately upon moving in.<br/>The street outside is lined with prostitutes who also enter the property, to urinate and defecate in the gardens and perform indecent acts in public, in full view of anyone passing by. The underground parking is broken into on an almost weekly basis and cars left on blocks with their wheels stolen. <br/>The neighborhood has been designated a high-crime area by the Berlin police but, despite the increased police presence, nothing seems to have improved.<br/>The apartment itself, like the rest of the building, is infested with hundreds of weevils (small black beetles) that one must learn to live with.<br/>Hosts Blueground charged 200€ for intermediate cleaning that never took place, and declined to refund the fee. <br/>RUN from this place!!!",0,-0.7432,Negative
117.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,25,90.0,1,0.8701104431623299,4.62,4.42,4.92,4.68,36434098,"The apartment is an amazing location for restaurants, supermarkets, shopping, and transportation. The layout is great and tons of room. We had two adults and two kids under ten and it was just the right amount of space for us. Can't wait to come back to Berlin.",1,0.836,Positive
81.0,1,1.0,1.0,0.0,33,100.0,0,3.1726879268539143,4.84,4.77,4.93,4.8,1117461323667616122,"I had a wonderful stay at Rio Hamdi’s place! The host is incredibly warm and attentive, always available to answer questions and ensure a comfortable experience. The apartment itself is spotless and well-maintained, reflecting the care Rio puts into hosting. The quiet setting facing the canal adds to the tranquil atmosphere, making it perfect for a relaxing stay in Berlin. I would highly recommend this space to anyone looking for a peaceful and welcoming home away from home. I’ll definitely be returning often, as I visit Berlin quite a lot! <br/>- :)",1,0.9887,Positive
95.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,1,3.907468030579391,4.72,4.83,4.9,4.6,20943832,Vielen Dank für den tollen Aufenthalt in der kleinen aber sehr feinen Bude !,1,0.0,Neutral
