256.0,4,2.0,2.0,3.0,48,100.0,1,6.558096529092969,4.98,4.92,4.92,4.9,24746106,"Bernd is an outstanding host and was very helpful with preparing the apartment for our family with a toddler. He helped with logistics and check in and provided a delicious welcome package with wine and snacks. The location in Friedrichhain was perfect for us. The apartment is not your regular Berlin apartment. It's very modern, stylish, and of highest quality. The kitchens is very well equipped. You get a beautiful view from the balcony. And of course  the sauna was a dream. I can not recommend this place enough! Thank you Bernd for letting us stay in your beautiful home!",0,0.9844,Positive
