148.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,20,100.0,0,3.883872869353541,4.43,4.27,4.63,4.56,265354,"Alloggio carino e soprattutto funzionale, economico e in una buona posizione. Ci sono piaciuti particolarmente gli spazi comuni come il bar e il servizio lavanderia. Unica pecca era la cucina poco attrezzata e il fatto che abbiamo dovuto pagare gli asciugamani nonostante nella descrizione fossero compresi. Nel complesso lo abbiamo apprezzato molto, soprattutto in funzione del prezzo pagato. Probabilmente ci tornerò nella mia prossima visita a Berlino",1,-0.296,Negative
96.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,0,5.412201670161606,4.93,4.87,4.83,4.7,860671,"This is a remarkable apartment and it's hard to imagine ways of improving it. Michael's remodeling and decor go beyond providing a comfortable place to stay -- he's created a space that's balanced, artful and a pleasure to spend time in.<br/><br/>If you appreciate quality and attention to detail I think you'll value this apartment above the many alternatives in the area.<br/><br/>Michael was out of the country during our stay, but he might as well been down the street. He was very attentive, taking great pains to ensure that our arrival went smoothly and that our stay was without issue. In fact we did run into some problems with the Internet and Michael worked diligently to resolve them despite his absence. He takes his responsibility as a host very seriously and maintains the same high standards reflected in the apartment itself.",1,0.946,Positive
77.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,1.8784168293806285,4.64,4.8,4.91,4.46,13559199,Un piso muy acogedor. Muy bien ubicado y con todo lo necesario.,1,0.0,Neutral
