64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,9,100.0,0,6.307804198871737,4.89,4.89,4.89,5.0,18352196,"It was my first time using an AIRBNB room for my holiday and it was the best first experience I could wish for. Everything felt like home, which made the whole experience all the better. The neighbourhood is great and the area is full of fun places to hang out. Nicki and David are also amazing people, which is a huge plus.  Everything about this trip made me definitely want to return again soon!",1,0.9846,Positive
