95.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,0,0.7915420818247044,4.76,4.6,4.91,4.68,20205689,Max's place is quiet and clean. It's one station or 15-20mins walk from Alexanderplatz. Communication was great - Sophie and Max responded quick concerning the problem on the wifi. There is no lift in the building but climbing up 3 floors wasn't that much of a problem for us. There are 2 supermarkets nearby and with the cooking equipment the home had we cooked almost every night which we really enjoyed!,1,0.5546,Positive
