80.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,0,18.39412118822528,4.71,5.0,4.76,4.47,928835405652949015,"Freundlicher Gastgeber, Zimmer wie auf den Fotos, etwas spartanisch, aber funktionell und ausreichend.<br/>Traumhafte Lage mit Blick ins Grüne; durch die U Bahnstrecke aber nicht so leise.",1,-0.5994,Negative
198.0,5,3.0,1.0,4.0,58,100.0,1,4.248993153501094,4.85,4.86,4.92,4.76,8603631,"I stayed at Chris's place for a week.<br/>My flight got constantly delayed, and so did my check in, but he was very chill and understanding about it.<br/>The room is cozy and the common areas are very nicely decorated.<br/>Also, his 2 cats are always eager for some cuddles, so if you like cats you get to play with 2 here :)<br/>Regarding Chris and his wife, we didn't interact much because I was working late hours, but the short interactions were always very friendly.<br/>Overall I really enjoyed my stay at their place, and would definitely recommend!",0,0.9803,Positive
