163.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,91.0,0,4.871252294318258,4.67,4.78,4.87,4.53,46864858,"Tutto il check in ed out digitalizzati, mai incontrato qualcuno degli operatori e a malapena altri inquilini. Nessuna pulizia  Infrasettimanale. <br/>Posizione e prezzo comodi per la Città, centinaia di  camera in lunghi e inquietanti corridoi scuri. Preferisconaltre strutture, ma è andato Tutto bene",1,0.0,Neutral
140.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,1,3.2989117833003925,4.64,4.71,4.63,4.57,322463,"Such a lovely home to stay when visiting Berlin! Super easy to access from the airport, public transport 2 min walk from the apartment, 20 min to get to the city centre. The place itself was so lovely, clean and cosy. We felt at home during our stay, and had everything we needed and more! <br/>Alan and Kasia are such lovely hosts, answered all of our questions super quickly and made sure we always felt at home and had everything we needed! <br/>Would 100% recommend it and come back!",1,0.9849,Positive
157.0,4,0.0,1.0,3.0,27,100.0,1,3.932306873935366,4.86,4.86,4.82,4.69,37737152,"Great location.  A very beautiful, unique loft apartment.  We appreciated how quiet it was. We slept great!",1,0.9515,Positive
79.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,1,9.403941552737663,4.88,4.74,4.84,4.8,17071054,"Die Wohnung war super. Angenehme Lage mit direktem Ausblick über den Park. Sogar den Alex konnte man von der Dachterrasse sehen. <br/>Die Wohnung war genial. Stilvoll eingerichtet und funktional.<br/>Arne war auch sehr nett und immer gut zu erreichen. <br/>Da wir im Januar die Dachterrasse nicht ganz so nutzen konnten, freuen wir uns diese Unterkunft auch im Sommer mal zu besuchen.",1,-0.93,Negative
