422.0,11,5.0,3.0,7.0,39,100.0,1,4.247361008084818,4.91,4.96,4.52,4.69,13868134,Excellent place - lovely garden to smoke in and place is clean and modern! Location is also brilliant and Trudy is very nice. Overall - a great find in Berlin!,0,0.9721,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,52,100.0,1,3.905291406003432,4.99,5.0,4.94,4.96,17731812,"Sylvia est une hôte particulièrement accueillante et généreuse. Elle se montre aux petits soins pour ses invitées en restant très discrète. Son logement est impeccable, très confortable et idéalement situé au cœur de Kreuzberg. Vous pouvez y aller les yeux fermés !",1,0.0,Neutral
54.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,15.507270682054347,4.96,4.99,4.64,4.92,17955217,Very nice accommodation and a great location for exploring the city.,1,0.8016,Positive
40.0,2,2.0,1.5,3.0,57,100.0,1,1.1008973061098215,4.97,5.0,4.92,4.96,31466784,Great location and a lovely woman!,1,0.8478,Positive
61.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,2.188319042758802,4.82,4.91,4.88,4.71,37443723,"The place was super clean and tidy and the room was neat. Easy check in process and nice easy walking distance from Alexanderplatz and the East side gallery. Easy access to public transport too!<br/>Unfortunately though, our room had glass panels in the door and no curtain to block out the light from the main living area. This meant when others living there came home late and turned the lights on the room was pretty bright. They also made a fair bit of noise at the same time (music, loud talking) which kept us up too.",1,0.9741,Positive
256.0,4,2.0,2.0,3.0,48,100.0,1,6.558096529092969,4.98,4.92,4.92,4.9,24746106,"Luxury stay with individual artistic touch in a real berlin style and place . Very clean and convenient. A huge roof terrace and a sauna plus musical instruments as a piano and a harp are the absolute highlights. It is super spacious and the host Bernd extremely welcoming and helpful . There was a bottle of a nice wine and free espresso, milk, snacks and breakfast staples. Free WiFi and iPad and great stereo and tv system plus a washing machine made the stay a pleasant one. The location is quite close to the nice areas of Friedrichshain and Prenzlauer Berg and it’s very quiet in the Nights. Very close to the public transport and U-Bahn stations. Great stay in a great appartment",0,0.9919,Positive
136.0,9,3.0,1.0,6.0,32,97.0,0,5.989900848344668,4.37,4.32,4.02,4.41,881100962020102125,"Wir hatten einen Aufenthalt von 4 Tagen und sind sehr zufrieden! Bus und UBahn sind keine 5 Minuten entfernt, die Supermärkte sind ebenfalls in unmittelbarer Entfernung. Wir empfehlen es gerne weiter! Vielen Dank für die schöne Zeit!",0,-0.865,Negative
334.0,6,3.0,2.0,3.0,62,100.0,1,1.4069254616129323,4.84,4.94,4.85,4.74,991825698983910455,"Clean and modern apartment along Eastside Gallery/wall and River.   .3 mile walk to Berlin East Train, ‘Ostbonhof’, which we used to get around including easy trip to airport. A fun restaurant, Mina’s , in building. Nice space, clean, well furnished kitchen.  Initial communication with a manager was not great, but Pierre cleared that up.  Felt a bit removed from a neighborhood vibe if that’s what you seek.  But a great apt.",0,0.3098,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,0,1.7665987390745572,4.88,4.92,5.0,4.68,31524037,"Great apartment, perfect location. Will be staying here next time we are in Berlin. Thanks Marie!!",1,0.9059,Positive
45.0,3,1.0,1.5,2.0,44,100.0,1,13.335712033183713,4.95,4.95,4.77,4.9,19619437,Najboljša pri vsem je bila posteljnina. Egipčanski bombaž je zakon! Hvala,1,0.0,Neutral
112.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,1,1.850891633131909,4.81,4.71,4.95,4.72,1205350,"Die Wohnung von Martina hat eine super Lage, zentral und trotzdem ruhig. Prenzlauer Berg hat uns sehr gut gefallen, die Nähe zu U- und strassenbahn ist klasse, um Berlin zu erkunden.",1,-0.5994,Negative
77.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,0,6.266793012378933,4.7,4.65,4.53,4.7,6264703,"A charming and interesting place. We stayed for a long weekend. It is a former shop turned into a gallery and living space, usually decorated with artwork made by the hosts themselves. It felt surprisingly private despite having a shop front, with partially frosted glass and curtains. Our main contact was David who was kind and accommodating, and we loved seeing his paintings. The area is known as an old bohemian village, complete with cobbled stones and a diverse local community, with small shops, cafes, and indie art spaces nearby. It’s also within Neukölln, and close enough to  Kreuzberg, both known for its bars and restaurants. The rest of Berlin is easily accessible via metro with a couple of stations within walking distance. This place is worth a try if you want something a little different.",1,0.9618,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,1,6.1114447900723885,4.89,4.8,4.83,4.81,619936,"Potrei scrivere mille cose di Alexis, ma mi basta dire che in tutte le esperienze airBnB che ho fatto, è sicuramente stato il miglior Host di sempre. Grazie di tutto ❤️❤️",1,-0.4588,Negative
45.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,88.0,1,22.247828051840308,4.95,4.92,4.85,4.9,1102154289806652485,Ich war mit meiner Tochter in Berlin um ein Konzert zu besuchen. <br/>Wir haben die Unterkunft sehr gut gefunden.<br/>Sabine hat uns herzlich empfangen und wir haben uns gleich sehr wohl und willkommen gefühlt. <br/>Sabines Garten lädt zum Verweilen ein und es war uns eine Freude dort beim Uno spielen mit Sabine Zeit zu verbringen. <br/>Wir haben gut geschlafen.<br/>Der Aufenthalt hat ein biß. WG-Feelings (wieder)erweckt. <br/>Das meine ich im allerbesten Sinne :o).,1,-0.9136,Negative
58.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,50,100.0,0,2.511278097952053,4.97,4.95,4.77,4.89,882373906707433781,"Super super lieber Gastgeber, habe mich sofort wohl gefühlt. HP ist ein toller Gastgeber. Freundlich und kommunikativ, hat mich sogar zum Abschluss meiner Reise noch zu ner tollen Party eingeladen, die Freunde von ihm veranstalten. Ich war rundum umsorgt und gut aufgehoben. Es gab sogar ein Rad, was ich leihen konnte.",1,0.4019,Positive
148.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,25.0,0,4.558926213539716,4.57,4.72,4.74,4.49,8161618,"It's a great apartment, very spacious and clean, located in a lovey area. <br/>Communication with Archibald was very easy and he responded to all my questions promptly. <br/>I would definitely recommend staying here. ",1,0.9377,Positive
