67.0,5,1.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,0,4.171651288410796,4.4,4.34,4.81,4.4,26559060,"Amit ist ein sehr netter Gastgeber. Er war immer gut erreichbar und stand uns bei Fragen schnell zur Verrfügung. Die Lage der Wohnung ist sehr zentral aber trotzdem ruhig, da sie in einem Hinterhaus liegt. Vielen Dank für den netten Aufenthalt Amit!",1,-0.8439,Negative
118.0,2,1.0,1.5,2.0,18,100.0,1,13.36261494953846,4.82,4.69,4.79,4.69,712018807890898864,"The communication with the host was great,  the location and place itself was very good. The only problem we had was with hot water that was not consistent. Other than that I recommend the place and would stay there again :)",1,0.8777,Positive
56.0,1,1.0,0.5,1.0,22,100.0,1,11.988035851891173,4.9,4.88,4.92,4.83,1212016211604564146,"Julia gehört zu den besten Gastgebern, die ich je hatte. Manchmal findet man so ein Juwel - und dieses Airbnb ist ein wahres Schmuckstück. ❤️ Danke! Und nur Liebe für dich!",1,-0.6688,Negative
103.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,51,100.0,1,1.8422422243016237,4.91,4.86,4.81,4.83,3974716,Spree studio was a beautiful little apartment tucked away in Berlins best neighbourhood. So many great bars and restaurants nearby. The apartment itself was so adorable and had everything we needed for a short stay. Bed was super comfy. Hans was very friendly and open to responding to our influx of questions. Will definitely stay here again.,1,0.9812,Positive
136.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,95.0,0,0.8707832520316201,4.73,4.81,4.88,4.55,1211490901429811494,Totally worth staying at!! Loved the location it’s pretty central and close to the train station. Very clear instructions to check in and the place was exactly as described. The room was also very clean and a very comfortable bed. Very Recommend !,1,0.97,Positive
112.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,1,6.315146266976091,4.69,4.44,4.86,4.71,51403847,"Stylowe, fajne miejsce na krótki pobyt. Na dłuższą metę okna na poziomie chodnika są trudnym wyzwaniem. Komunikacja z wynajmującym bezbłędna. Dobry stosunek jakości do ceny. Serdecznie polecam.",1,0.0,Neutral
53.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,1,7.080626051599838,4.85,4.87,4.6,4.78,24303386,"The stay was great! Mina is great with communication and very friendly. <br/>The location is okay. You have to take the train into the city and it’s only about 30 minutes but apart from that, I like that it was in a safe place.",1,0.9347,Positive
