164.0,5,2.0,2.0,3.0,30,100.0,1,1.753209774100189,4.83,4.72,4.83,4.75,3188899,"Hospedarse en una galería en el centro de Berlin es una experiencia única. Magnifico lugar. Muy bien ubicado. Amplio, limpio, cómodo, original. Altamente recomendable.",0,0.6249,Positive
125.0,6,3.0,1.0,2.0,56,75.0,0,14.12608564411962,4.95,4.67,4.9,4.8,6454642,"My husband, two children and I stayed in this beautiful apartment in a lovely part of Berlin, very close to the Botanical Gardens.<br/>The apartment is very stylish with plenty of space and the children, especially, loved the children's bedroom, playroom and terrace. It is very well located being a 5 min walk to local shops, restaurants (with a delicious bakery and ice cream cafe!!) and the S-bahn station is very close by too.<br/>Caroline was extremely helpful, giving lots of information about the local area, ideas for days out and answered any questions very promptly. The Italian restaurant she recommended was wonderful and only a 10-15 min walk from the apartment.<br/>We did hire a car for the week, which we found gave us the flexibility to see sights and attractions further afield (such as Sanssouci Palace in Potsdam ... a must!), however the S-bahn station is under 5 mins walk from the apartment so public transport would be very easy too.<br/>We had a wonderful stay, thank you Caroline xx",0,0.9925,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,13,100.0,0,6.246050877386805,5.0,5.0,4.75,5.0,20946215,"Berlin is amazing, and the stay at Nadia's place made it even better! The house has everything needed and the room is spacious, very clean, bright and it looks like in the pictures. It is well connected and both the S-Bahn and the U-Bahn are at 3 minutes walk. Nadia was always at our disposal and very quick in her responses, very friendly! It is highly recommended.",1,0.9707,Positive
85.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,51,100.0,0,17.462921322619714,4.88,4.88,4.53,4.89,12117451,Unser Aufenthalt bei Jürgen war sehr schön. Alles hat sehr gut gepasst. Ein wenig außerhalb von Berlin aber mann kann auch gut die Wohnung mit dem Bus ereichen. Ich empfehle Jürgen und seine Wohnung gerne weiter.,1,-0.8316,Negative
