256.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,62,100.0,0,1.4337681418206727,4.62,4.56,4.93,4.61,35242748,"Great location. Super close to public transit, restaurants, street food, and some major landmarks. Place was clean and easy to checkin/out (some older reviews mentioned this was a problem). Would definitely recommend",0,0.9571,Positive
