67.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,1,7.306691669216258,4.9,4.9,4.55,4.41,45475789,"This space is lovely and cosy, compact, clean and really accessible with the 250 bus around the corner and the M1 tram 9mins walk. It is in a small courtyard off the roadside which meant it is free of traffic noise and generally private. I felt safe. <br/>There is an additional tiny room for clothes, storing suitcases and other household equipment which is invaluable as the apartment is essentially one room with a shower/toilet.  <br/>A real bonus is the small cosy bar called 'Souterrain' about 4 mins walk away. It has a fantastic blazing fire and offers a small cosy evening space to hang out in. It is open from 5pm Tuesday-Saturday. I also recommend 'Auszeit' opposite the supermarket Rewe. It does great breakfasts and meals and is open evenings too. You may need to book as it is very popular.",1,0.98,Positive
