223.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,47,100.0,1,4.116733808652775,4.98,4.99,4.81,4.83,668157595596321506,"We enjoyed a wonderful run of nights at Tomasz and Katarina’s place! The flat was so well organised and clean, and check in was so simple. The communication was always timely and Katarina checked in on us throughout the stay to make sure we had what we needed. Great local recommendations as well for a very cool part of Berlin to base from. We explored all over the city and slept great too - extremely comfy! Highly recommend!",0,0.9851,Positive
