154.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,0,1.0747930019316592,4.84,4.66,4.91,4.75,2076483,We enjoyed our stay at Jacopo’s beautiful apartment. It’s very close to public transport and close to several cafes and restaurants. I would suggest giving more clear directions to guests beforehand on how to enter the building to make the checkin easier. Overall a very good stay!,1,0.957,Positive
