422.0,6,3.0,1.5,3.0,63,100.0,0,12.11487999248022,4.76,4.88,4.45,4.54,13060403,"Wer eine großzügige, komfortable und schön eingerichtete Wohnung in einer ruhigen und entspannten Lage sucht, ist hier genau richtig. Das große gemütliche Wohnzimmer, der Garten und die Dachterrasse waren unser Highlight. Die Küche - samt Induktionsherd - ist sehr gut ausgestattet. Der Kontakt zu Sven war immer unkompliziert, schnell und sehr freundlich.",0,-0.8834,Negative
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,0,0.5555591583260235,4.82,4.96,4.88,4.69,10031729,"Marius is a great host. It was our first airbnb staying and we found more than we expect thanks to Marius. The house is exactly the same what it is seemed in the pictures. It is very central, walking distance to Alexander Platz, Museum Island and many other places. It is also near to train stations. Apartment was clean, and Marius did extra things for our 2,5 years girl without extra charge, it was so kind. We found everything we need in a house. It is a small but very useful apartment. Being Marius's guest was great.",1,0.9582,Positive
75.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,6.379603690669542,4.8,4.68,4.8,4.76,48673134,"A cozy flat in a nice neighbourhood. The old airfield is ideal for morning runs, there are several grocery shops and U/S banh very close to the flat. The flat is also very warm and has quite thick duvets so should be good for the everyone who loves to sleep warm. We also found 3 coffee makers(French press, filter, and table coffee makers) which was nice:)",1,0.9473,Positive
140.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,1,1.5130716954922565,4.89,4.91,4.94,4.75,2394897,"Lovely bright apartment, beautiful and modern furnishings. High quality facilities. Everything was in order and worked well. There are many good restaurants and cozy cafes in the neighborhood. There is a short distance to Alexander Plz., and there are near to tram, U- and S-bahn.<br/>Verda has been very flexible and quick to response. It has been a wonderful stay.",1,0.9661,Positive
