125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,44,100.0,0,2.525240485696349,5.0,4.86,4.95,4.91,2625389,"Great appartment at a good location in Berlin! Brenda was very welcoming, and gave us some nice tips about where to go in the city. The appartment is spacious, clean, and has everything you need. It is close to the S-Bahn (ca. 5 minutes by foot) which brings you directly to the city centre in 3-4 stops. The surroundings of the appartment are very quiet, and the neighbourhood is nice to walk around in. I would definitely recommend this appartment!",1,0.9708,Positive
89.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,14,96.0,1,6.638297810764436,4.78,4.67,4.84,4.76,1540715,"Sehr zu empfehlen! Wer sich im Nollendorfkiez aufhalten möchte, findet hier die perfekte Unterkunft!",1,-0.6688,Negative
