72.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,27,100.0,1,13.673862168326844,4.88,4.87,4.53,4.73,50354450,"Very good and spacious b&b, the amenities provided were more than sufficient for our stay. Located right in between the airport and the center, the area is quiet and with a bunch of good cafes/restaurants around. <br/>The walking distance from the nearest overground is around ten minutes, not a lot but definitely not too close.",1,0.0788,Positive
