203.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,24,100.0,1,3.233570223529885,4.51,4.5,4.92,4.47,4448981,"During booking Tanja was really helpful cause it was quite difficult to get accomodation during this busy NYE period. She also provided us lots of tips where to go and eat in Berlin. Tanja is very flexible and you can ask a lot, she reacts very quickly!<br/><br/>The apartment is big and very clean, big livingroom, 2 decent bedrooms, good kitchen (with nespresso machine) and a nice bathroom with bath. Big Balcony! Towels and sheets all provided. Location of the apartment is PERFECT! Just one tip: maybe some curtains or so to make the place more cosier would make it even better!<br/><br/> ",0,0.9622,Positive
