125.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,36,100.0,1,19.30343504577633,4.97,4.96,4.99,4.84,33847538,"Inga is an amazing host and her apartment is a true gem. She makes you instantly feel welcome upon arrival and is always available to help if needed throughout your stay with always a warm and lovely smile. The apartment has everything what is needed to make your stay unforgettable. The flat is spacious and super clean, quiet close to several parks and lakes, and has also good public transport connections and shopping opportunities close by. The flat is furbished in a tasteful and stylish look with warm colors and a personal touches. The outside wooden deck is a peaceful place to spend some nice time outside with a coffee. I can highly recommend this place and I will be for sure back again for another marvelous stay with Inga. Thank you so much, Helen🌸",1,0.9936,Positive
