64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,1,5.762669525923033,4.95,4.98,4.88,4.8,38404991,"Markus was an incredible host and went out of his way to make sure I enjoy my stay! It really felt like being at home and the location is just great. The bed is comfortable and the room is more than enough for a few nights, if you ask he might also invite you to co-use his kitchen and living room. Very clean as well!",1,0.9691,Positive
50.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,0,4.231097673854453,4.73,4.75,4.55,4.68,30384248,"Her place is exact to picture and the place is rlly clean! Didn’t know i entered it as 1 guest but she was kind to bring extra pillows n blankets, making my stay even more comfortable. Shopping places will be easier to reach by trams and there is actually a good pizza italian restaurant down the streets. I had a late flight on my last day n she kindly keep the room free for me the entire day so that my luggage would be kept safe till i went to the airport. Honestly she was one of kindest soul i’ve met before even flying to berlin!",1,0.99,Positive
