65.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,1,5.167258880847807,4.97,4.92,4.93,4.91,9938743,"Alex is an amazing host that completely caters to your needs. He is always available if you need tips, recommendations etc. Alex was super flexible with check in, since we had missed our flight and arrived much later than expected. Great stay, highly recommend",1,0.9359,Positive
63.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,41,100.0,0,8.554504629982985,4.69,4.87,4.73,4.61,15229038,Hi hate to give only 4 stars for location. You are not directly in the centre of things 1or2 tubes away that take about 10mins. Other than than I could not fault anything about the property. The host was so helpful with everything. Thank you nana. The public transport is fantastic so no issues getting anywhere. Enjoy Berlin so much to do and see,1,0.8228,Positive
90.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,1,20.182729076202826,4.98,4.98,4.91,4.83,44319175,"The home was cozy, comfortable and perfect for us! Quiet, private setting! Easy to get around and to the city for seeing sites! It was everything we needed! Gordon was very friendly and helpful and responsive! This place is wonderful! I would definitely recommend it!",1,0.9818,Positive
133.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,50,100.0,1,3.0324799569322254,4.81,4.72,4.94,4.67,1125880662586950111,We had a great stay at Aziz‘s place. Every morning we enjoyed our coffee at the lovely balcony and in the afternoon the living room was quiet nice to relax. The apartment has everything you need while staying away from home. I would definitely book this place again! The location was spot on for us too as there are lots of restaurants around and everything we wanted to explore was within walking distance. Thanks Aziz and hope to see you soon.,1,0.9769,Positive
57.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,12.686180239299691,4.91,4.94,4.95,4.9,1880216,"Der Aufenthalt war super angenehm und kann es somit jedem empfehlen, der in Charlottenburg & Umgebung eine Unterkunft sucht. Alles funktionierte sehr reibungslos und schnell. Tolle Erfahrung und würde es immer wieder machen!",1,0.0,Neutral
172.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,30,100.0,1,2.086859632126843,4.87,4.87,4.94,4.71,306312,"My travel companions and I were over all  pleased with our stay! My friends and I were running the Berlin Marathon and needed a place that was comfortable, close to restaurants and transportation, and this apartment fit the bill! Martina was quick to respond to all of my questions before arriving. The apartment was very clean, the living room was filled with natural light and was a comfortable place to hang out. <br/>A few cons : we kept stubbing our toes on the thresholds between the rooms, they were the same color wood as the floor. <br/>My husband and I got locked inside the apartment when our friends left for a run and locked the door from the outside. We had our own set of keys but they wouldn’t unlock the lock from the inside.  We reached out to Martina and waited quite a while to hear back, but it was a frustrating 2 hours stuck inside, and could have been a fire hazard since the apartment was on the 3rd floor.  <br/>But everything else about the apartment made up for those shortcomings. We’d be happy to return and stay there again!",1,0.8727,Positive
156.0,6,2.0,2.0,4.0,51,100.0,1,2.784593796049624,4.88,4.78,4.9,4.77,3378027,Vi var meget glad for at bo i lejligheden. Fantastisk beliggenhed og alt levede op til forventningerne.,0,0.4588,Positive
139.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,45,100.0,0,2.0186652384431523,4.58,4.52,4.83,4.46,11306475,"The listing was fairly accurate, would stay again. Location was the number one asset to this listing. Only issues were getting the check in info as well as the bedding having an odd smell upon check-in. Thank you for having me!",1,0.6588,Positive
