100.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,41,100.0,1,1.9469096234802603,4.85,4.92,4.91,4.75,408756,"The apartment is situated in a lovely area with lovely bars and restaurants and we were so glad we stayed in this area. Inside the apartment is modern and clean with everything you need. Great communication from Bjorn and easy check in.  We were glad we read the reviews about the court yard to get to the apartment but this added to the character.  We had a great stay and would recommend, Thankyou.",1,0.9716,Positive
