201.0,7,2.0,1.0,6.0,30,100.0,0,3.7792785408916494,4.6,4.6,4.68,4.48,17948177,"Lovely apartment, great area. A stones throw from the U makes getting about real easy. Close to Kreuzberg, a good area for bars and nightlife. Importantly for us it was close to the FEZ, the venue of the event we were in Berlin to attend for the weekend. But also very close to Berlin central and many tourist attractions. All in all an excellent place to stay on your trip to Berlin.",0,0.9535,Positive
83.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,7,100.0,0,7.127835851961417,4.87,4.8,4.77,4.8,3754935,Staying at Berta's place was a pleasure. We spend just one night but we've got everything we needed. RECOMMEND!,1,0.7901,Positive
159.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,95.0,0,4.132850367965358,4.39,4.36,4.47,4.23,43811867,"Ottima soluzione <br/>La posizione a Neukolln in piena hermannplatz è ottima sia perché fornita di mezzi pubblici sia per la zona stessa, quartiere vivo multietnico ed economico.<br/>Tanti supermercati e empori a due passi, appartamento un monolocale dotato anche di cucina per chi volesse cucinare, pulito e con tutto il necessario",1,0.0,Neutral
60.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,1,8.676851256216466,4.95,4.97,4.9,4.82,54156958,"Schöne, geraeumige, saubere und relativ ruhige Unterkunft mit modernem grossen Bad in schoener Gegend ganz nah an S-Bahn Station; freundliche Vermieterin, zuverlässige Kommunikation. Alles war unkompliziert und einfach. Alles bestens, gerne wieder.",1,-0.8316,Negative
196.0,9,2.0,1.5,6.0,23,100.0,1,0.5100458669657755,4.8,4.74,4.97,4.73,11577306,"Apparemment idéalement situé. Gare à proximité pour arriver directement de l’aéroport.<br/>Arrivée facile , Dieter a été très accueillant , Augustin très réactif. <br/>Nous recommandons sans hésitation.",0,0.0,Neutral
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,0,6.186086166979964,4.98,4.96,4.91,4.85,9275292,Just a brilliant place to stay in Berlin. So close to everything. We loved the district and the apartment was more spacious than we were expecting from the pictures. Mirko was an absolutely beautiful host. Definitely one of our best airbnb experiences ever. We hope to come back very soon Mirko. THANK YOU!,1,0.9793,Positive
97.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,22,100.0,0,5.421289090687478,4.74,4.74,4.75,4.73,29696197,"We travelled as a couple with two young children. We had a very good time and found the apartment comfortable, spacious, and conveniently located. We never needed to meet the host – but communication was quick and it was simple to gain access. It was very clean and uncluttered. The water pressure in the shower was great and the beds were comfortable. The basics were provided (kitchen utensils, Wi-Fi, etc) – but we'd have appreciated a few things we've found in other apartments such as wine glasses, children's bathroom footstool to reach sink, board games, etc. The bedroom curtains are okay – but do not block out much light – so an eye mask is recommended. The only major inconvenience was that there was no hot water from the kitchen taps to wash dishes with. Instead, as advised by the host, we had to boil water in the kettle to wash up – which was not what we had expected. Nonetheless, we enjoyed our stay and appreciated the apartment.",1,0.9893,Positive
176.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,1,0.89420589337588,4.76,4.78,4.88,4.62,41756048,"Beste Lage, etwas hellhörig durch den Altbau, aber von der Straße selber hört man nichts. Man kann total viel zu Fuß erreichen und alles was man braucht (Ubahn, Bus, Tram, Supermärkte) ist nur wenige Minuten entfernt.",1,0.0,Neutral
76.0,4,1.0,1.5,2.0,60,100.0,1,3.624198275329287,4.85,4.91,4.81,4.69,2137277,"Alles bestens! Sauber, gut ausgestattet, perfekte Lage!",1,0.0,Neutral
85.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,0,12.451501081893689,4.6,4.7,4.67,4.59,37328374,"Felt good and safe in the house, everything went smooth. There are many places in easy walkable reach.",1,0.8316,Positive
76.0,2,1.0,1.0,8.0,26,99.0,0,1.47112525778762,4.6,4.5,4.48,4.58,1565047,"Great place! We were 7 girls in our own room with a kitchen and bathroom. Nice and clean, super friendly receptionists and we loved the bar in the hostel! Easy to get to the trains and close to Alexanderplatz.",1,0.9753,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,26,100.0,0,5.121651744554596,4.76,4.68,4.71,4.76,33067092,"Suse hat sich super darum gekümmert, dass der Check-In einwandfrei funktioniert! Sehr liebe Person! Die Wohnung ist super zu erreichen, die Bushaltestelle befindet sich direkt vor der Wohnung! Einkaufsmöglichkeiten auch innerhalb von 2 min zufuß zu erreichen.",1,0.0,Neutral
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,100.0,0,6.9835159306468215,4.91,4.86,4.73,4.78,51581251,"We had a very good experience staying at Guillaumes place. Acces to public transport (U-bahn and buses) was only a few minutes walking from the apartment. Guillaume left some great recommendations for restaurants and bars in the neighborhood. The room was clean. The only thing for me, as a light sleeper, was that the bed creaked very loudly at every toss and turn and caused me to wake up a lot during the night. Other than that, we had a great time at Guillaumes airbnb :).",1,0.9336,Positive
199.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,1,3.7401902545858734,4.81,4.86,4.85,4.67,22354567,Misschien in de toekomst nieuwe sloten? Dat zou nog iets fijner zijn voor de gasten.,1,0.0,Neutral
91.0,6,3.0,1.0,3.0,31,100.0,0,22.783250778905757,4.88,4.69,4.76,4.71,28333870,"Sehr schönes Holzhäuschen im schönen grünen Berlin. Der Weg zum Haus ist ein kleines Highlight mit seinen Bäumen und am Abend beleuchtet. Die Ausstattung läßt keine Wünsche offen. Ein Pool, sowie eine Sauna konnte man benutzen wobei wir nur den Pool probiert haben. Wir haben es schon Freunden weiter empfohlen. Bei unseren nächsten Berlin Trip kommen wir gern wieder.",1,-0.3612,Negative
183.0,6,3.0,2.0,6.0,27,100.0,1,3.076790657455092,4.76,4.74,4.82,4.57,8068061,"A great apartment in cool Kreuzberg. Close to everything. We walked, 35mins or so, to checkpoint charlie. Great cafes and organic supermarket close by.",0,0.8885,Positive
76.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,3.776765009172591,4.73,4.67,4.92,4.57,1331360749251423773,"As expected, no issues👍🏻",1,-0.296,Negative
