56.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,5.179021895059785,4.9,4.95,4.89,4.77,27397593,"Minha estadia na propriedade de Olga foi incrível! Desde o momento em que cheguei, fui recebido com muita cordialidade e atenção. Olga é uma anfitriã excepcional, sempre disposta a ajudar e fazer com que me sentisse em casa.<br/>A privacidade que tive durante a minha estadia foi um dos pontos altos. O espaço é tranquilo e muito bem cuidado, o que me permitiu relaxar e desfrutar da minha estadia com total tranquilidade.<br/>Além disso, a limpeza da propriedade era impecável. Tudo estava brilhando e organizado, o que me deu uma sensação de conforto e segurança.<br/>Recomendo a hospedagem de Olga a todos que procuram uma experiência incrível no Airbnb. Certamente voltarei em minha próxima viagem. Muito obrigado, Olga!",1,-0.4184,Negative
343.0,6,3.0,2.0,3.0,45,98.0,1,0.6498545219514095,4.84,4.82,4.89,4.71,44096314,"Die Kommunikation verlief hervorragend.<br/>Die Wohnung ist genau wie auf den Bildern. Die Location ist sehr gut!  <br/>All unsere Erwartungen wurden übertroffen. <br/>Danke Alice, <br/>wir hatten ein sehr schönes Wochenende :) <br/>Beim nächsten Aufenthalt in Berlin buchen wir wieder bei Alice :))",0,-0.7263,Negative
40.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,6.228031954325974,4.75,4.66,4.84,4.78,48677117,"Great location and the apartment was clean and cozy. Even on very warm days, the apartment stayed cool. <br/>I would love to come again in the winter! Thank you Frank!",1,0.9557,Positive
187.0,3,2.0,1.0,3.0,43,100.0,1,7.621822577546772,4.98,4.99,4.96,4.9,26651561,"David is truly a super host. He met us at the entrance of the building and helped carrying up the luggage. His apartment is beautiful. Clean, light, and very tasteful. Beautiful kitchen. Because of my five year old son he bought children's tooth paste, organic children's shampoo, he brought toys from his own childhood (a tractor his grandfather made for him, so special!!). The linen for my son had trains on it and so on. Lots of details, which made our stay immediately so much more welcoming and personal. Communication with David was very easy, he is very responsive. He gave us great tips regarding the neighborhood, which is a wonderful one. A supermarket open till midnight is just a few minutes walking distance from his apartment. The famous KaDeWe department store with lots of luxury items is again just a few minutes away. Bus, train, metro are all around the corner. Restaurants, cafes, several other stores are very close. Very friendly hairdressers and a massage salon are on the same street. We enjoyed our stay a lot. My son wanted to stay in Berlin, he liked it so much, and I think David's home, which felt like true home to us, helped my son feeling that way. Thank you, David!!",1,0.9949,Positive
