111.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,35,100.0,0,3.428773290668755,4.7,4.77,4.78,4.62,27259147,Yaz is a great host and very friendly. The apartment is on a beautiful street and the location is really perfect for a stay in Berlin.  The space was clean and spacious. It’s worth noting this is a basement apartment so overall there isn’t a lot of light. We only stayed for a night so this wasn’t an issue for us but if you were staying for longer it might be worth considering.,1,0.908,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,4.795405551149841,4.95,4.92,4.81,4.89,13243503,We had a great experience. Very clean and amazing apartment. ,1,0.9033,Positive
112.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,15,100.0,1,3.2713344054375537,4.68,4.75,4.91,4.56,37442240,"The place was great, spotless and in a great location, perfect for going to different places in the city. However, there were some caveats which make me not recommend this place currently.<br/>We had trouble entering the place, as we were originally provided an incorrect code for the door. The host was also hard to reach, we had to wait some hours to get a response. Later, the front door lock was broken, and we were stuck outside. The host got it fixed the next day, but in the meantime we had to call random people inside to let us in, sometimes waiting for a long time.<br/>Another day, I was in a remote work meeting, and a technician wanted access to the place to check heating meters. This would be fine, but we were not notified beforehand so my meeting got interrupted instead of me being able to reschedule it.<br/>Finally, the wifi is really unreliable, take that into account if you plan on getting some work done from there.",1,0.1889,Positive
43.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,90.0,1,19.010333685269742,4.89,4.95,4.89,4.85,20247909,This Home was stylish and homely! You will imediately feel like you are gonna be looked after here. The hosts are sweet  very hospitable.,1,0.6996,Positive
