309.0,6,3.0,2.0,5.0,32,100.0,1,6.934354434877142,4.93,4.92,4.62,4.75,14956202,"Stephan was a great host, contact was easy and regular.   He shared his local knowledge and some recommendations with us.  The property was lovely with a wide range of equipment.   The beds were very comfy and it was lovely to hear the birds singing outside of the property first thing in the morning.    It is a short public transport ride to most tourist attractions, but the bus stop is 5 mins walk and underground around 10 mins, all public transport runs frequently and regularly.   A lovely place to spend time with my 14 year old grandson and daughter in law.",0,0.9252,Positive
48.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,1,11.045433737585087,4.88,4.58,4.94,4.85,815136527628581143,"Gerhard was a very accommodating host and the place was beautiful. So worth what we paid for, in a great location. The bedroom is bright with lovely big windows. We felt very comfortable there. So many great restaurants and 2 minutes from a metro.<br/>Thank you Gerhard!<br/>Just to note though, the neighbours were rather passive aggressive about our level of noise (speaking to each other after 11:30pm) and would bang on the wall and left a note. This created a bit of anxiety but other than that it was a great place.",1,0.9637,Positive
108.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,45,100.0,1,14.016965070403124,4.97,4.97,4.87,4.89,43340179,"Meine erste Buchung über airbnb: es war überragend! Die Abstimmung mit Kerstin war unkompliziert, die Wohnung ist super ausgestattet und in einer ruhigen Straße gelegen. Es war ein schöner Aufenthalt.",1,-0.9508,Negative
72.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,0.0,0,4.67086061188916,4.82,4.55,4.82,4.91,988073664367671801,"Polain was extremely lovely throughout the entire process. Always very responsive on the messenger with all of the questions i had.<br/>The flat is in a brilliant location, has 4 stations in walking distance with very quick transport to the centre.<br/>The flat was warm and quiet, honestly was a brilliant place to stay and explore berlin.",1,0.9606,Positive
