70.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,1,2.5329341972975428,4.86,4.8,4.93,4.8,19976281,"Within a very short walking distance of the  Berlin Wall Memorial and the Tram, Enrique's apartment was cozy, spotless and charming! The apartment exceeded our expectations and included WiFi, Netflix, kitchen, washer/dryer, refrigerator and an espresso maker! But most importantly, Enrique was an excellent host! We communicated beautifully through WhatsApp, and Enrique was there to meet us at the time of our late arrival.  When we return to Berlin, we will definitely stay at Enrique's place!",1,0.9706,Positive
