96.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,48,100.0,1,6.700512034911939,4.98,4.99,4.93,4.94,12967814,"Meine Freundin und ich haben zum Glück dieses Airbnb gefunden. <br/>Es war ein überaus schöner Aufenthalt. Das Schlafzimmer lässt einen wie zuhause fühlen, das Badezimmer ist wunderschön und die Dachterasse hat eine super Sauna. <br/>Robert ist ein sehr freundlicher und zuvorkommender Mensch. Wir durften uns jederzeit an Kaffe und Tee bedienen.<br/>Wir werden aufjedenfall, falls wir Berlin wieder besuchen, dieses Airbnb nochmal buchen.",1,-0.5994,Negative
125.0,2,2.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,0,3.036032627048052,4.7,4.7,4.63,4.68,22438,"This is a great apartment! It is very spacious, plenty of room for up to 4 people and has a lot of light. It was very clean, great bathroom and very comfortable. It is a very short walk from the S station and easy to get to, within walking distance of all the major tourist sights in East Berlin. We really enjoyed our stay and found the accommodations ideal. It was easy to find and you can arrive at your convenience since Javier arranges for everything ahead of time. We even left something at the apartment and they found it for us! Would definitely recommend staying here!",1,0.9869,Positive
72.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,3.181843413007727,4.9,4.77,4.85,4.61,826681294814740063,"The host were very nice, all communication was very easy and they helped us ehen we needed something immediately. The room was cosy and clean. We had everything we needed for our stay.",1,0.8396,Positive
