125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,4.343473543099049,4.88,4.93,4.85,4.71,40637500,"Lily's apartment was perfect for a weekend getaway trip to Berlin. Everything was just as described, very nicely furnished and extremely clean. Location was great, very quiet and easy to reach with a ten minute walk from the ubahn station.<br/>We would definitely recommend staying here for anyone who wants to be around Kreuzberg but also looking for quiet and tranquillity.",1,0.9374,Positive
