71.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,6.919397234051426,4.83,4.89,4.42,4.73,20939397,"Babett's place was perfect for us. A little further out of the centre than we expected but transport links in Berlin are outstanding so this was not an issue. <br/>Babett's home is very clean and has all the amenities one could hope for in an apartment like this. It was perfect for a week's stay to see the city, we were able to eat out or at the apartment. <br/>Babett's communication was excellent. We were provided with a document of instructions which were easy to follow and answered any questions we had. <br/>Thank you for an excellent stay!",1,0.9913,Positive
