70.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,39,100.0,1,4.144031400327651,4.94,5.0,4.95,4.88,26297971,"The movement we entered, Bert and his wife welcomed us with chocolate and green tea. Very private room and peaceful surroundings. Restaurants and shopping malls are nearby. Walkable from the main station. Good English communication. Perfect place to stay.",1,0.9042,Positive
193.0,6,2.0,1.0,5.0,42,100.0,1,0.601371120108,4.76,4.63,4.94,4.73,4335533,"L'appartement de Rainer est vraiment super ! <br/>Hyper bien situé, en plein centre de Berlin, tout est accessible rapidement et facilement ! <br/>Propre, confortable, joli et très calme avec son salon donnant sur le jardin de la copropriété, nous avons passé un séjour extrêmement agréable.",0,0.6103,Positive
