142.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,29,100.0,1,3.3189723905154875,4.91,4.93,4.86,4.71,19654788,"Definitely recommend staying here. A perfect location to stay at while exploring Berlin. Very close to great bars, restaurants, trains, bus line, and tempelhofer feld is a quick walk away.",1,0.9226,Positive
