53.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,1,1.9136892540066155,4.82,4.73,4.95,4.74,851577798843640421,Roxanne and Kiril have a gorgeous apartment in the heart of P Berg with lots of cafes and bars surrounding it. Both answered very quick and friendly and we’re flexible in timing and check in. The room is very cozy.,1,0.8542,Positive
95.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,1,3.907468030579391,4.72,4.83,4.9,4.6,20943832,"Stephanie's place is beautiful, clean, and full of light! The location is wonderful, it is right next to a subway station and near museums and the main train station, so the location is very convenient! You do have to go several flights of stairs, but the flat is beautiful! I stayed by myself, but the place would sleep 3 very comfortably!",1,0.9539,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,0,2.874282790888489,4.69,4.42,4.92,4.71,31411458,"The apartment is very well located, close to Mauerpark and restaurants.<br/>Check-in was very easy. It's a bit cold in the apartment but enjoyable with the heatwave going on. Plus, the view from the rooftop is quite nice<br/>I recommend!",1,0.891,Positive
149.0,9,4.0,1.5,11.0,30,100.0,0,10.01572830458666,4.92,4.86,4.65,4.93,35060094,Alles wie beschrieben. Top.,0,0.2023,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,49,100.0,1,10.214455278207549,4.91,4.89,4.86,4.92,40463858,"Yvonne is such a wonderful, open-minded and friendly host. As soon as I checked in, she invited me over a tea, and then we had a great conversation about many interesting things. She has a vast collection of books in the apartment, and her knowledge on a variety of subjects inspired me. The room is very well maintained and clean. There is a S + U-Bahn station right around the corner, making it convenient to commune. When I visit Berlin again, I'll definitely choose to stay at her apartment. Wonderful person and mother.",1,0.9806,Positive
96.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,2.6441579309110788,4.94,4.95,4.85,4.88,8462220,"We had a great stay at Jun's place. The apartment was clean and spacious, with good public transport connections into the city.<br/>What really made our stay special were the little touches, like Haribo candy waiting for us and maps of Berlin available.",1,0.9277,Positive
122.0,8,2.0,1.0,5.0,26,100.0,0,5.631738171626421,4.07,3.57,4.57,3.86,1247022660041684348,"Ich kann nur abraten, in dieser Wohnung zu übernachten. Als wir die Wohnung betreten haben, war diese komplett verdreckt. Überall lagen Dinge rum, auf den Betten lag noch das alte, benutzte Bettzeug. Die Fotos im Inserat entsprechen in keinster Weise der Realität. Die meisten Einrichtungsgegenstände, die auf den Fotos zu sehen sind, sind nicht mehr da. Es gibt keine Schränke in den Schlafzimmern. Die Sitzgelegenheiten sind verdreckt. Die Kaffeemaschine ist verschimmelt und unbrauchbar. Die Heizung in der Küche funktioniert nicht. Viele Dinge für den Alltag fehlen (wieso gibt es beispielsweise nur 2 große Löffel?). Anscheinend will man hier nur auf möglichst einfache Art und Weise Geld mit Feriengästen verdienen. Sowas haben wir noch nie erlebt.",0,-0.9878,Negative
64.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,20,100.0,0,4.993723336849769,4.7,4.57,4.44,4.66,17250059,"Die Unterkunft von Raissa und Jonathan ist genau wie beschrieben, liegt verkehrsgünstig, und ist trotzdem angenehm ruhig.<br/>Schlüsselübergabe war einfach und flexibel, und der Kontakt immer schnell und freundlich, konnte sogar Gepäck lagern. Beide sind tolle Gastgeber.",1,-0.8316,Negative
188.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,6.547712743829179,4.79,4.86,4.62,4.54,28528251,Wir waren sehr sehr zufrieden und würden immer wieder dort hin kommen :),1,0.4588,Positive
159.0,8,2.0,1.5,4.0,37,87.0,0,3.846506368771626,4.7,4.71,4.8,4.56,978829391155103596,.,0,0.0,Neutral
193.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,85.0,0,1.5102265017251435,4.66,4.89,4.98,4.75,1186818127998253545,5 stars throughout !,1,0.0,Neutral
366.0,7,6.0,3.5,6.0,38,100.0,0,19.310670287118537,5.0,4.94,4.88,4.88,9584066,"Das Haus war perfect für unsere 2 Familien (4 Erwachsene und 4 Kinder). Johannes hat uns empfangen mit ein Bier und Wein, die uns gut geschmeckt haben. Alles war wie beschrieben, nur die Rauchdetektoren haben wir nicht gesehen. Das Haus is ruhig gelegen aber Berlin Mitte ist pro Rad erreichbar. Auch die U Bahn ist in der Nähe und so ist man im 30 Minuten im Zentrum. Ich kann das Haus sicher empfehlen!",0,-0.9523,Negative
59.0,2,1.0,4.0,1.0,35,100.0,0,7.942755838655635,4.83,4.53,4.72,4.81,1197650193381322739,"Really lovely place.  Very clean, spacious and good value. Wifi worked well throughout and the heating was excellent  too.",1,0.953,Positive
135.0,5,2.0,2.5,2.0,30,100.0,1,13.475852084261728,4.84,4.88,4.85,4.71,13254923,"We had a fantastic stay at Mark's place. A lovely apartment, tastefully decorated, bigger than the photos suggest and well located. Mark was available by text whenever we needed. If you are planning in visiting Berlin I would highly recommend  this apartment and location - great for families.",0,0.9468,Positive
90.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,13,100.0,0,6.673883192302785,4.88,4.71,4.82,4.82,632607356395233767,"Julian ist super freundlich und hilfsbereit. Die Wohnung war so wie beschrieben, schön und gemütlich, und genau wie ich mir eine Berliner Wohnung vorstelle. Ich habe mich sehr zu Hause gefühlt und würde jederzeit wiederkommen.",1,-0.5994,Negative
95.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,0,0.7915420818247044,4.76,4.6,4.91,4.68,20205689,"Our stay at Max and Sophie’s was great, the location was amazing with only a few minute walk to lots of bars and restaurants. The apartment itself was spacious and very light with we loved, we felt right at home from the moment we got there. Max and Sophie were only a call away anytime we needed them, and always provided us with the upmost help. I don’t have anything bad to say about our stay here and would recommend it to anyone looking to be in the lively and trendy part of Berlin!",1,0.9493,Positive
153.0,6,2.0,1.0,5.0,63,100.0,1,6.5980047052121975,5.0,4.98,4.9,4.93,802651846496831799,"Tolle Wohnung. Der Checkin verlief problemlos. Der Schlüssel wird in einem Restaurant in der Nähe hinterlegt. Die Wohnung ist eine schöne Altbauwohnung mit großem Wohnzimmer, einem großen Durchgangszimmer mit Hochbett, einem großen Kinderzimmer mit Doppelstockbett +Ausziehcouch und weiteren Matratzen. Somit gibt es genug Schlafmöglichkeiten. Die Betten waren bereits bei Anreise bezogen und sehr sauber. Zudem gibt es eine Küche und ein Bad. Die Wohnung ist komplett ausgestattet und durchweg sehr sauber. In der Küche dürfen Gewürze etc mitbenutzt werden. WIFI funktioniert gut. <br/>Die Wohnung ist für Ausflüge sehr gut gelegen. Mit dem ÖPNV ist man in 30 Minuten am Brandenburger Tor, Naturkundemuseum oder Alexanderplatz. <br/>In der Nachbarschaft gibt es zahllose Caffees und Restaurants. In der Nacht (wir waren am Wochenende hier) steppt der Bär, auch in der Wohnung wenn die Fensten angekippt sind. Hat uns aber nicht so sehr gestört.<br/>In ca 10 min Entfernung kann man kostenlose Parkplätze finden.",0,-0.9643,Negative
54.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,7.403263725526816,4.91,4.92,4.78,4.85,23477057,"Super tolle Unterkunft.<br/>Nettes, ruhiges Viertel in bester Lage und mit super Anbindung. Das Zimmer, sowie Bad und Küche waren sehr gut ausgestattet und sehr sauber. Die Kommunikation, Check In und Check out sind prima verlaufen und der Gastgeber war sehr herzlich :)<br/>Sehr gerne wieder!",1,-0.5848,Negative
111.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,17,100.0,0,4.352358865706662,4.5,4.56,4.56,4.31,1016416538293383867,Alles super.,1,0.5994,Positive
357.0,11,4.0,2.0,9.0,45,100.0,0,7.6382791304973345,4.71,4.69,4.85,4.52,998580714781681988,Tolle Wohnung für eine größere Gruppe,0,0.0,Neutral
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,26,100.0,0,3.947458714793688,4.96,4.61,4.93,4.85,8411270,"Oliver was very nice, communicative, and accomodating! Highly recommend",1,0.7334,Positive
45.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,0,4.356311156013005,4.65,4.78,4.54,4.73,31092213,"Its a really nice looking place, very good value for the money in my opinion.",1,0.8387,Positive
157.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,45,100.0,0,5.245003120876255,4.77,4.72,4.68,4.61,11914556,"Cannot fault our stay in Dan’s apartment. The culture and energy in this suburb is beyond impressive and the apartment itself is equipped with everything you need + so many extra special touches. A helpful guidebook of local cafes, restaurants and vintage stores. Some great English reading material, too. And a Bluetooth speaker to create a vibe.",0,0.956,Positive
204.0,4,3.0,2.0,4.0,32,100.0,0,5.2351728208725135,5.0,5.0,4.9,5.0,9094717,"The apartment was spacious and a great fit for our family (2 adults, 3 children - 2.5 year old and twin 8 month olds). We slept the twins in one of the bedrooms and our toddler in the bunk bed room and we slept in the bed between the living room and office. The setup worked incredibly well for our family. The apartment is on the ground floor and easily accessible with a stroller. The host allowed us to use the toys there and our daughter had a great time. <br/><br/>The location of the apartment is also ideal. It's very close to the metro station (also easily accessible with a stroller) or a 15-20 min walk to Potsdam Plaza and main attractions (Hop On Hop Off, Legoland, etc.) There is also a great park near the apartment which we spent a lot of time at. <br/><br/>The hosts were responsive via email and incredibly helpful in offering us their family bike and giving us information about stores/restaurants. They were friendly and easy to coordinate with and flexible on arrival time. Highly recommend working with them.",0,0.9923,Positive
130.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,1,4.983651912533883,4.92,4.98,4.84,4.78,18641674,We had a really nice stay at Mimi's. The flat is HUGE and has a ton of natural light. The location is very trendy and walkable to most things you'd like to do in Freidricshain. Mimi is fast on communication and check-in/out was smooth. We would stay with Mimi again.,1,0.8857,Positive
165.0,9,3.0,1.0,8.0,22,97.0,0,3.973498155977464,4.15,4.15,4.46,4.15,1283153695494134596,All perfect.,0,0.5719,Positive
64.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,99.0,0,1.323319729052643,4.61,4.68,4.51,4.67,15120448,Great place,1,0.6249,Positive
170.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,51,100.0,1,1.4356958153593935,4.66,4.81,4.62,4.51,2396312,"We were in a bind for last minute housing, and Benjamin was at the apartment to welcome us  within an hour of booking. The apartment itself was clean, spacious, and well-furnished, and the kitchen was excellently equipped and stocked with the basics. There are two cheap supermarkets within a five minute walk, as well as several bus and train stations. Although it is not in a ""touristy"" area near main attractions (the community is oriented towards families), it is easy enough to get anywhere you want. Would definitely stay here again.",0,0.9618,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,0,5.089878826396497,4.95,4.97,4.83,4.92,44525002,"Tony war eine super Gastgeberin. Sehr entgegenkommend und hilfsbereit. Die Wohnung war sauber, ordentlich und gemütlich. Die nächste Bushaltestelle ist direkt vor der Haustür, man ist also sofort im Verkehrsnetz. Super Preis-Leistungs-Verhältnis. Klare Empfehlung!",1,-0.8439,Negative
140.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,16,100.0,0,12.930474409016416,5.0,4.9,4.8,4.9,2667188,"Loved the stay at Tristan’s. It was exactly what I needed and during Christmas, I was right next the Christmas market at the Palace. I was greeted with a small gift hamper and suggestions of where to go and what to do. They also catered to my small dog by leaving out a section for him to eat and drink AND even a towel and doggie bags for when I walk him. It was such a pleasure and I know anyone would enjoy it as much as I did.",1,0.9413,Positive
31.0,3,2.0,1.0,3.0,19,86.0,0,30.90671021934421,4.52,4.39,4.65,4.56,22110197,"Correspondeu ao anunciado. Camas confortáveis. A casa-de-banho estava impecável. Zona muito calma e sem ruído à noite. Tínhamos lugar para estacionar o carro. Para o que pagámos, foi óptimo.",1,0.0,Neutral
238.0,3,2.0,1.0,3.0,27,100.0,1,3.928817520387241,4.92,4.85,4.89,4.68,17200670,"Appartement spacieux, dans maison très agréable, silencieux et très bien placé pour les visites.",1,0.0,Neutral
84.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,1,4.00787800065126,4.73,4.67,4.9,4.65,1282857,The apartment was nice and just like in pictures. It was peaceful and quiet.,1,0.8176,Positive
73.0,1,0.0,8.5,1.0,33,100.0,0,2.496114582405734,4.63,4.55,4.78,4.5,45339029,Habe 2 Nächte dort verbacht und fand es gut wenn man günstig übernachten will und nicht besonders viel braucht. Check-in war super leicht und flexibel! Auch das Personal war einfach zu erreichen und die Kommunikation war sehr freundlich :),0,-0.8748,Negative
242.0,9,3.0,1.0,5.0,57,100.0,0,2.38030021203205,4.63,4.6,4.69,4.5,46726253,"I booked this location 24 hrs before checkin due to my other airbnb having to cancel on us. They were super communicative with me the whole time which was really helpful with such a last minute booking. There is a tram stop just outside the apartment which is super helpful for getting around the city. <br/>There are also grocery stores, ice cream shops, and restaurants all within walking distance. <br/>The room with the sofa bed had games and blocks which my kids enjoyed.<br/>The only thing I would mention is that we discovered the washer was not working when we go there. We had enough clean clothes for the remainder of our trip so it was fine but just a head’s up for anyone who is looking to stay here to follow up and see if it’s been fixed (they didn’t know until we told them so I’m sure they’ll promptly work on this).",0,0.8805,Positive
55.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,9,100.0,1,3.1678863275056317,4.71,4.54,4.78,4.67,6123610,"Very nice stay at this beautiful area in berlin, close to the subway and cafe, restaurants. Thomas was very nice to let me stay in his apartment, felt like home, easy to answer any questions and welcomed me in when i checked in :)) Easily recommended!",1,0.9687,Positive
217.0,6,2.0,2.0,4.0,25,100.0,1,12.577655916882916,4.77,4.63,4.64,4.59,1149290662671206506,"Sehr schönes, saubere und modernes Apartment in ruhiger Lage und jeden Cent wert. Sehr gute Kommunikation und schnelle Hilfe sowie Problemlösung mit dem Anbieter. Mit der U-Bahn in 20 min im Zentrum.",0,0.0,Neutral
248.0,8,3.0,1.0,7.0,28,100.0,0,1.9204539822657205,4.62,4.62,4.9,4.52,6708791,"this nice and tasteful appartement offered us the ideal place to feel like you are a family living in Berlin. Great neighbourhood! Shops and lots of nice restaurants are very near and 'always'  open. Efficient position in relation to public transport. And last but not least, Birgit is a very nice 'neighbour' where you can always drop in for a question or to borrow something you forgot to bring.<br/>The appartement is fully equipped for 8 persons, we really missed nothing, but maybe a second bathroom.<br/>Thank you Birgit for a great week!",0,0.9354,Positive
60.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,45,100.0,1,3.689600261518912,4.74,4.55,4.76,4.65,16237052,"Wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt in der modernen Unterkunft und konnten aufgrund der guten Lage Berlin von dort aus perfekt erkunden. Dietrich stand uns als Ansprechpartner jederzeit zur Verfügung. Danke, dass wir dort sein durften, wir würden die Unterkunft wieder buchen!",1,-0.636,Negative
98.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,16,90.0,1,10.994483825646318,4.91,4.97,4.86,4.85,6035999,"Habe mich im außergewöhnlichen Ambiente von Barbaras Wohnung wie eine Prinzessin gefühlt! Tolles Frühstück, sehr liebe Gastgeberin, auch dass das Bad mit einem anderen Gast geteilt wurde, war kein Problem und sehr gut organisiert (jede hatte ihr Waschbecken und ihre Handtuchstange). Alles super, und ich werde sehr gern wiederkommen! Wirklich eine tolle Unterkunft in Berlin mit echter Gastfreundschaft!",1,-0.795,Negative
254.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,57,100.0,1,1.7753205468984323,4.95,4.67,4.79,4.64,990656434072416178,"This is a great location, a little walk from the U8. There’s a cafe and beer/snack market right near the building. Daniel’s space was very nice and the rooftop patio is a great view. Would stay again and recommend to anyone.",0,0.9299,Positive
68.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,2.3978972662935325,4.97,4.94,4.95,4.92,1011735260949312503,"Adorei o apartamento,  é super bem localizado e conectado com o transporte público. São muitas opções de comércio próximo, como padaria e bares. Os anfitriões são incríveis. O Airbnb é muito espaçoso, confortável e bem equipado. Iremos voltar em breve,  e super recomendamos.",1,0.8316,Positive
64.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,7,100.0,0,5.638947815975883,5.0,4.83,4.67,5.0,41571982,Very spacious room and an outstanding host!,1,0.6476,Positive
241.0,6,3.0,1.0,4.0,54,100.0,1,1.3558603428081426,4.89,4.93,4.77,4.79,13651040,"This place was great and Sven was amazing to deal with.  From when we first booked, then changed dates, right up until we left Sven was incredibly responsive, proactive and helpful. We really appreciated some recommendations for NYE, proactively arranging our checking in, checking everything was ok after we checked in and when there was a small blip (totally out of Sven’s control) he was awesome. We had four adults and the place was perfect - would highly recommend and would have no hesitation staying there again next time we visit Berlin.",0,0.9829,Positive
88.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,0,2.021408745528697,4.57,4.49,4.8,4.44,16298872,Nice stay,1,0.4215,Positive
