88.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,80.0,0,4.3965704421174285,4.79,4.7,4.87,4.68,4361737,"Dor’s place is so great! We really enjoyed the hospitality. The room was very clean , very big and had enough room for all of our clothes and shopping bags :)<br/>The bed is very comfortable and the water in the shower are always hot.<br/>The kitchen is very big and is very comfortable for cooking. The room is private and gives you a chance to really feel like it is your own home.  On the street you can find many coffee places, stores to buy some cool clothes- new and vintage. There is a great Italian restaurant and two supermarkets in the same street. The train is right next to the house. It makes the transportation very easy. Within a 5 minutes walk you can find the RAW market of vintage items and some local food options. The mall is only 10 minutes walk. Over all we really enjoyed the location and hospitality. We recommend Dor’s place for all ;)",1,0.9917,Positive
90.0,3,2.0,1.0,3.0,37,100.0,1,3.488382997378137,4.91,4.89,4.73,4.75,24449713,Wir haben den Aufenthalt genossen.<br/>Alles war wie beschrieben und die Unterkunft finden wir super.,1,-0.5994,Negative
81.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,1,4.795185225671647,4.97,4.93,4.98,4.93,17508652,Martin ist ein perfekter Gastgeber! Die Unterkunft liegt super für Unternehmungen in der ganzen Stadt. Die U-Bahn ist ganz nah! Das Zimmer ist sehr geschmackvoll eingerichtet und schön groß! Martin ist sehr hilfsbereit und kümmert sich wirklich prima um seine Gäste! Ich komme gerne wieder!,1,-0.7556,Negative
301.0,5,3.0,2.0,3.0,75,100.0,1,4.454494309278697,5.0,4.89,4.68,4.75,50729742,"We would like to thank Helena for having us in her home! Despite the difficulty at the arrival she made sure that the rest of the trip went well. She was very kind and helpful. The house was like the photos, big and beautiful! Thank you again",0,0.9768,Positive
