100.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,3.091836209520125,4.86,4.9,4.86,4.77,869793,Really nice flat in a great location. Best part of Berlin for nightlife and bar next door is one of the best. Flat is big with everything you need. Nice high ceilings and old features. Would recommend,1,0.9678,Positive
216.0,7,2.0,1.0,8.0,60,100.0,1,2.242754107275327,4.82,4.83,4.83,4.64,26823620,"A very spacious and nice apartment with a very convenient location with good public transport, a major tram line just outside.<br/>Restaurants, cafes and groceries also near by.<br/>Very good beds and plenty of them for even larger groups! <br/>For larger groups good to note however that there is just one bathroom/toilet.<br/>For our family of 4 this was just perfect, all queries were replied quickly and we hope to return here!",0,0.9581,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,0,2.559692009773911,4.99,5.0,4.99,4.93,23442676,"The place was absolutely amazing! Had everything I needed and more.  The location was perfect as well. Many sights, restaurants and cafes were just around the corner. Definitely would recommend!",1,0.9401,Positive
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,2.142649937740168,4.91,4.94,4.96,4.89,446975,Logement très très bien placé avec un  très bon rapport qualité prix. Transport en commun et centre commercial très proche ainsi qu'une excellente boulangerie.<br/>Kerstin est très arrangeante pour les départs et arrivées.,1,0.0,Neutral
80.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,41,100.0,1,1.5562283131018062,4.75,4.5,4.96,4.78,37899742,"The house is fantastic, has a great view of the 16th floor, is bright, is in the center of town and convenient to move around in many places, many amenities I didn't expect to have, it was a great host and Martin helped us with everything we needed.  I would definitely recommend it, and if I ever go  in Berlin again I would prefer it.",1,0.9633,Positive
