157.0,4,0.0,1.0,3.0,27,100.0,1,3.932306873935366,4.86,4.86,4.82,4.69,37737152,"The place was very stylish and the location was great - close to the train, coffee shops and restaurants. Beautiful rooftop access. The one issue was very low quality wifi - it  continually dropped throughout our stay there and would not stay connected for more than a few minutes at a time. With that caveat, I would recommend this place otherwise. If it's improved I would stay again. Cheers.",1,0.9361,Positive
274.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,43,100.0,1,1.6592287277224604,4.91,4.92,4.91,4.75,39579556,El alojamiento es muy bueno pero demasiado elevado el precio,0,0.0,Neutral
95.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,9,100.0,0,11.594555037827089,4.09,3.85,4.57,4.16,53104636,"BED BUGS. It can't get worse than this. The moment we got inside the room we noticed a few black spots on the bedsheets. I did a quick check for bed bugs under the mattress but I couldn't see anything so I ignored it. Later my partner spotted a bug but she didn't know what it was and just assumed it was a random insect and ignored it. The room smelled like old, which covered up the scent that bed bugs usually have. We slept and woke up at 4am full of itchy bites all over our bodies and I had at least 5 bugs crawling on me and . We killed many adult bugs, which means they must have been there reproducing there for a long time and apparently the cleaning staff never noticed (not even by the obvious marks on the bedsheets which should have been washed). We sent them pictures inbox and left the hotel imediatelly. We travelled to another country and had to spend our whole first day of vacation washing and drying clothes on high heat (it destroyed a few shirts and my partner's purse) and I had to throw away my backpack and buy a new one. I called them in the afternoon and the receptionist said she didn't see my message and that it never happened before. I got a call from the manager saying again that this never happened before and that I would get a full refund in the next day. We found on booking.com a review from 20 days earlier complaining about the same problem with bed bugs, which means that it not only happened before but also the hotel did nothing to fix the issue and kept the rooms available. After many messages to the hotel, late and unfriendly replies and another call to the menager, over 1 week later I finally got a PARCIAL refund and not the full refund like promised. Besides the bed bugs, we had hair in the bathtub, the curtains wouldn't close fully, the whole place was badly cleaned and the wifi didn't work. I have no idea how this place has so many good reviews. Please don't step on this place, it should be delisted from Airbnb right away.",1,-0.9455,Negative
176.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,0,2.0476753393055094,4.97,5.0,4.9,4.86,14089858,"The apartment was cozy, and the view from the windows was simply breathtaking. I spent a lot of time just gazing out at the beautiful scenery.<br/>The bed was comfortable, and I slept well during my stay. The bathroom was also very clean and had everything I needed.",1,0.9359,Positive
156.0,6,2.0,1.0,5.0,41,96.0,0,6.1770612336798365,4.42,4.39,4.7,4.29,27018621,"Alles sehr kommerziell gehalten, recht lieblos eingerichtet. Komplettes Haus voller AirBnB‘s. Genau das, wozu AirBnB nicht da ist und wozu die Firma (zu recht) kritisiert wird. Wir hatten trotzdem einen schönen Aufenthalt.",0,-0.5994,Negative
