125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,0,0.5555591583260235,4.82,4.96,4.88,4.69,10031729,"Marius was super kind for everything. He told me about how to get his flat from berlin hbf and from shoenenfel airport to the flat for my friend. and the location was perfect to us. It was located 5min by walk from the s bahn station and 2min from tourship station at river. <br/>Flat itself was super clean and really cozy. everything was prepared even for tooth stick. Actually, toilet was separated from the flat but it still private toilet and I actually like that system more because you don't need to worry about bothering your friend. overall, I highly recommend this flat for stay!",1,0.9722,Positive
65.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,25,33.0,0,6.280772941047609,4.37,3.94,4.48,4.5,1130337,My friends and I stayed a few days at Andrea's appartement. We were welcomed by the neighbours and they were very helpful.,1,0.8221,Positive
157.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,1,5.087474880301549,4.93,4.91,4.87,4.78,26242714,"We spent two weeks staying at Martha’s lovely apartment. We found her place to be very comfortable with a lovely kitchen and an amazing garden. The location is close to Berlin’s fantastic system of bus, tram, U-bahn and S-bahn options allowing you to easily and quickly get around all the sights of Berlin. There are also shopping and restaurant possibilities nearby. If you want to enjoy Berliner Luft then Martha’s apartment is “janz Knorke!”",1,0.9771,Positive
88.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,31,100.0,1,2.4074182995482225,4.94,4.95,4.97,4.82,21879026,Nos encantó el apartamento. Muy buen gusto para decorarlo. La cama enorme y cómoda. Gran ducha! Lleno de detalles fenomenales. La ubicación muy buena porque hay varios medios de transporte cerca. El barrio super animado y lleno de lugares para comer y tomar algo. Steffi fue suoer amable y nos consiguió una cuna para el peke. Gran experiencia!!! Repetiriamos sin duda. Super recomendado!!!,1,0.7482,Positive
