125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,36,100.0,0,4.192263568934865,4.93,4.93,4.73,4.73,884538984808125857,"Cigdem and Clemens provided my partner and I with a lovely stay in Berlin. The apartment was very clean and is in the best location.<br/>Both Cigdem and Clemens were very responsive whenever I messaged, and were also flexible with the check in time which was greatly appreciated. Thanks again for a lovely stay!",1,0.9789,Positive
