320.0,4,3.0,2.0,3.0,52,100.0,0,1.5344054797867148,4.98,4.94,5.0,4.96,1869046,"My family (couple and 2 mid-twenties daughters) had a fantastic stay at Annette's home in Berlin over New Years. I felt lucky just to have found it: a beautiful two floor penthouse in a cool neighborhood in Berlin. The pictures were almost too good to believe, but other guests had said the home was really like it was in the photos. <br/><br/>Annette was great at being in contact and even insisted that we do a quick skype call beforehand so she could fill me in and answer any questions – a touch I really appreciated. <br/><br/>Arrival was easy and we were even lucky enough to find parking on the street. As everyone has said, it really did look like the pictures. This home very comfortably modern and a total treat to spend a week in. Our favorite part had to be the spectacular view from the balconies on both sides of the fireworks on New Years eve, which was truly memorable. Also have to give the showers a shout out.<br/><br/>The neighborhood was great: very close to the Ubahn, around the corner for a cute area with some shops and restaurants, and walking distance to the large shopping district and restaurant hub (but also more touristy) Mitte. We also loved nearby Impala for coffee, pastries, and smoothies!<br/><br/>The only thing we found difficult were the appliances, which were sometimes hard to understand and german instructions didn't help. Annette did send us a sheet with some instructions, but we've asked that she add a few more things for future guests. <br/><br/>You won't regret staying here!",0,0.9965,Positive
276.0,8,2.0,1.0,1.0,54,100.0,1,1.5172932643359534,4.72,4.51,4.92,4.64,1110298608004081620,"Douglas was a wonderful host, reliable & responsive.<br/>The house is in a great area, loads of shops & restaurants, right by the train station and walkable to many attractions.<br/>We were able to store our bags before check in which was so helpful!<br/>On arrival the floors were not properly cleaned but Douglas sent the cleaners straight back to go over them. He checked in on us a few times as well to make sure we were happy.<br/>We had a great time in Berlin.",0,0.9571,Positive
228.0,10,2.0,2.0,5.0,44,80.0,1,5.275405062836432,4.91,4.86,4.89,4.86,21075047,"Très beau logement, localisation parfaite pour visiter Berlin en transport en commun ou à vélo.",0,0.0,Neutral
150.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,94.0,0,3.1018817858877528,4.66,4.76,4.83,4.61,721523591301947759,Lovely stay,1,0.5859,Positive
49.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,0,8.092180844920643,4.73,4.78,4.59,4.68,222784,"Kelly made a flexible check-in for us which is very kind. <br/>The place is lovely. There are all you need in the house. It was cleaned before we arrived the place. It is a quiet area. All in all, it's  a comfortable place to stay. <br/>The space is okay for three person. Two person would be more suitable.<br/><br/>***The-most-visit restaurant***<br/>The Greek restaurant downstairs is fantastic. The atmosphere is great. The food is wonderful!! If you stay in Kelly's flat, you have to go there for once!!",1,0.9802,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,0,4.485908829592629,4.9,4.9,4.84,4.88,680250759870842312,"Vanya is a friendly, helpful, and wonderful host, who made me feel right at home. The room was clean and comfortable, as was the flat, which is also a short walk to a couple of different U-Bahn stations, and also many restaurants, cafes, and shops. I loved meeting Vanya and staying at her place! A great stay for this solo traveler.",1,0.975,Positive
