162.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,1,1.167993049442586,4.98,4.94,4.86,4.86,1248480342193136256,"Lovely peaceful place in the middle of everything you need to do and see. Perfect timing to visit during Berlin Art week , lovely galleries within walking distance .<br/>Apartment was great to stay in , well proportioned , great lighting and felt peaceful .<br/>Worth a stay if planning to be in Berlin . Lots of public transport options right within walking distance .<br/>We really appreciated immediate response from Sofia and ability to drop bags off early. <br/>Thank you ! <br/>Book! Now 🌼",1,0.9866,Positive
