115.0,5,1.0,1.0,3.0,49,100.0,1,5.871560485458869,4.83,4.77,4.61,4.65,48181556,"Good spot for a group of friends or a small family, easy access to public transport with a train station within 10 minutes walk which gives easy access to Berlin hotspots, convenience store directly across the street which is very handy. Many thanks to the hosts who were fantastic and responded to any requests we had.",1,0.9556,Positive
