89.0,3,0.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,0,1.0054327061020718,4.76,4.65,4.92,4.68,25106503,Toller Ort! Wunderbar gemütliches Bett und ruhig im Innenhof. Super Lage!,1,0.6688,Positive
146.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,49,99.0,1,3.8405306053465473,4.88,4.85,4.85,4.69,34552316,"We had a short stay at Matthew's, so location was very important to us. The location was excellent! The hotel was walking distance to Am Wiededamm where we took a boat tour and explored the city. Trams and the U bahn were a 5 minute walk away. Berlin's public transportation system was very easy to navigate and a great way to get around. I would have given the place 5 stars, but the street noise was very loud. We stayed on the 1st floor (2nd fl because 1st flr is the entrance) and woke up several times due to the street noise. Also, the tv in our unit was not a smart tv so we could not stream any of our services.",1,0.6057,Positive
161.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,9,100.0,0,2.1859235570670164,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,1267912211927835986,"Christian has a great apartment. Spacious, comfortable with everything one might need for a short or long stay. The bed is very large and soft. There’s a long and deep bath, decent shower and two toilets. The kitchen has everything. The TV and media set up is amazing. <br/>As other reviews mention, you have to consider this is Christian’s home when he’s not travelling and all his things are in the apartment. If you can cope with that rather than the usual empty, soulless professional let, then I recommend this place very highly. Christian’s friend Mandy dealt with the welcome and all communication. She was very friendly and efficient.",1,0.9781,Positive
74.0,2,1.0,3.0,1.0,31,100.0,0,2.407958180700023,4.66,4.6,4.52,4.64,1028746069347704435,perfect location!,1,0.6114,Positive
217.0,5,2.0,2.5,3.0,39,100.0,1,3.5358295153616246,4.81,4.72,4.88,4.62,36266731,Great design-style loft with lots of space inside and a great view on the Berlin wall and the Spree.,0,0.8481,Positive
71.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,48,100.0,1,8.507814024677707,4.83,4.71,4.93,4.79,17331756,"The place is in a great location, and Julian could not have been more accommodating and helpful host.",1,0.8,Positive
59.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,26,100.0,1,16.94592507079506,4.83,4.74,4.83,4.8,4043341,"Andrea was very welcoming, easy to communicate. Very nice and quite area, good connection to city center. Bonus: really good breakfast!",1,0.9618,Positive
106.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,0.8993171774740567,4.88,4.88,4.97,4.79,28146018,Dank öffentlicher Verkehrsmittel in unmittelbarer Nähe kommt man sehr schnell in alle Ecken von Berlin. Einkaufsmöglichkeiten wie ein Kaufland sind fußläufig zu erreichen.<br/>Ansonsten auch alles top. Ablauf war problemlos.,1,-0.4767,Negative
83.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,1,4.036515724941701,4.95,4.99,4.87,4.81,11847541,"Der Aufenthalt bei Sabine war wirklich gelungen. Sehr sauberes, freundliches Appartement. Die Wohnung ist mit viel Liebe zum Detail gemacht. Die Nähe zum öffentlichen Transport ist toll. Ein Viertel mit Charme. Sabine ist sehr zuvorkommend und freundlich. Wir können nur empfehlen.",1,-0.9136,Negative
124.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,39,100.0,0,15.614604986502222,4.96,5.0,4.9,4.85,28327822,"Ein traumhaftes Zimmer in einer sehr schönen ruhigen Wohngegend und trotzdem zentral gelegen. Ich fühlte mich wie auf einer Urlaubsinsel!!!<br/>Kerstin ist eine sehr freundliche, lebensbejahende und offene Gastgeberin. <br/>Ich werde wiederkommen.",1,0.0,Neutral
98.0,2,1.0,1.0,0.0,26,100.0,0,9.870114132926757,4.71,4.71,4.69,4.53,1133054564781533769,"The locks were hard to open, even with the clear instructions. Apart from that we had a great stay, close to the city centre and a clean apartment! Communication was also good and we always got a quick answer.",1,0.9041,Positive
