255.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,56,100.0,1,5.8307869986992165,4.95,4.95,4.94,4.82,935188267169193699,"Fantastic place. Lack of sink in the kitchen is bit annoying, and I personally got the impression that it was 2 full bedrooms not one and the living room with a couch bed (although incredibly comfortable). projector in the main bedroom in front of the bed was a surprise and a fantastic highlight. host allowed us to store our bags until the evening which was amazing. great for a weekend stay",0,0.9477,Positive
