88.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,80.0,0,4.3965704421174285,4.79,4.7,4.87,4.68,4361737,"This place is in a great location. Near the train, metro, and bus stations. The room was clean and had good storage. Also near many great restaurants and cafes.",1,0.93,Positive
118.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,97.0,0,1.941053289840044,4.58,4.53,4.8,4.36,735085199089327822,"This place is really good only in picture but the actual place is really bad, the neighbor knocks twice because we were talking and only walking in it’s squeeky floor and was mad bc of it, heater is broken replaced the heater after 2 nights we need to wear jackets while sleeping as the host only reply after i reported to Airbnb admin , this has missing curtain and very bright .  I don’t know if the host knows that the pillows  and blankets are garbage already they are weird lumpy looking pillow the owner needs to check it with your own eye . even the matresses are sunken already how can someone rented an expensive place without giving atleast a good condition basic needs. We were just dissappointed and i’m not supposed to leave a review but the host ask me an honest one.",1,-0.6904,Negative
180.0,8,1.0,1.0,8.0,28,99.0,0,1.3815612224222242,4.67,4.66,4.58,4.69,6663931,No me gusto tanto el hostal. La comunicación no fue la mejor y dijeron que no habíamos pagado unas cosas que habíamos consumido cuando si se había hecho solo era que entre ellos no se habían comunicado bien. Los cuartos son buenos y ya depende de las personas con las que le toque a uno compartir lo cual no fue lo mejor para nosotros. Un punto muy bueno es que si tienen un espacio para dejar las maletas mientras uno recorre Berlín por lo que ayuda mucho .,0,-0.8402,Negative
