160.0,6,3.0,2.0,3.0,46,100.0,1,5.93071369172379,4.79,4.75,4.74,4.67,685944,"Das Haus ist toll! Vor allem kreative Köpfe werden sich hier wohlfühlen. Loftcharakter, hohe Decken und ein eigener, geschützter Innenhof machen den Aufenthalt zum individuellen Erlebnis. Die Unterkunft ist sauber, gemütlich und bestens geeignet, den Trubel der Strasse hinter sich zu lassen (und in Ruhe zu arbeiten). ",0,-0.636,Negative
59.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,24.975840130192744,4.97,4.92,4.67,4.89,672226112665960638,Es war ein wundervoller Aufenthalt bei sehr netten Gastgebern. Immer wieder gerne.,1,-0.5994,Negative
221.0,6,3.0,1.0,4.0,29,100.0,0,3.811094276989304,4.71,4.79,4.75,4.65,31467134,Martin's place was better than described. It is super clean with all the amenities you would need.  The location was central to all that we wanted to do and the choice of restaurants closeby was fantastic. We had different cuisines to choose from and could walk to most places. It is approximately a 10 minute walk to the East Side Gallery. Martin is a super host.  I recommend his place for your Berlin stay.,0,0.9612,Positive
118.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,18,93.0,0,2.315150552188887,4.79,4.73,4.74,4.68,16821725,"I thoroughly enjoyed my stay here. The apartment was spacious and nicely furnished. Bed was comfortable to sleep in. Hosts were very accommodating with check-in and the check-in process was a breeze. Located near many shops, restaurants, bars, grocery stores, and public transportation, but was quiet at night and I had no issues sleeping. The WiFi was a bit slow for streaming, but worked well for everything else! I definitely recommend staying here.",1,0.9069,Positive
