52.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,0,8.561568867045306,4.78,4.83,4.72,4.56,1251538531624253567,"Denied checkin by unresponsive host & it seems that she gave our room to someone else for higher prices at Easter, meanwhile making a fool of me. Nothing else except the Airbnb chat should be used for communication to avoid falling in any trap. Details: Early morning I informed the host that I will reach around 2:45 PM, and she replied back with some stay related instructions but nothing about checkin. On our arrival, both of her contacts were unreachable by chat & normal call & messages were not answered while I kept trying between 3 PM to 4:30 PM with my 1 year old baby crying at her door in cold outside. After showing the evidences, Airbnb support helped me to cancel the stay after which around 8 PM, Josephine (the host) replied that an earlier guest had extended her/his stay, however I know this is not possible in system to overlap with my existing booking. She ruined our travel plans for the evening. Experienced this for first time in my 6-7 years of Airbnb. Totally inhuman.",1,-0.9127,Negative
