100.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,41,100.0,1,1.9469096234802603,4.85,4.92,4.91,4.75,408756,"Leiligheten var perfekt for oss: romslig, ren og velutstyrt. Nedslitt ytre men interessant kompleks av bygårder. Hyggelig område med mange restauranter, barer og butikker, nærhet til offentlig transport. Bjørn møtte oss som avtalt og vi fikk to sett ned nøkler. Vi kommer gjerne tilbake til Zaza appartment. ",1,0.0,Neutral
99.0,7,2.0,1.0,6.0,27,97.0,0,13.00004959551082,4.0,4.1,3.9,4.0,1333910684186106416,"Unser Aufenthalt war gut, wir konnten es sehr gut mit den öffentlichen Verkehrsmitteln (ohne weiten Fußweg) erreichen. <br/>Ohne das bereitgestellte Video, in dem der Zugang erklärt wird, hätten wir es allerdings nicht bis in das Appartement geschafft. <br/>Ansonsten war es sauber, aufgeräumt und vollständig. Für mich , als Dorfkind, allerdings wirklich laut, was bei einem warmen Sommertag mit geschlossenem Fenster leider etwas Punktabzug gab. <br/>Alles in allem würde ich die Unterkunft dennoch erneut wählen, weil das Gesamtpaket inkl. Dem Preis passt.",0,-0.9136,Negative
162.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,1,1.167993049442586,4.98,4.94,4.86,4.86,1248480342193136256,"This apartment was great for our stay in Berlin. It is spotless, beautifully decorated and looks exactly like the photos. We appreciated the super fast WiFi for remote work. It is on the 5 th floor with a fast elevator. It is very quiet with the windows closed and we didn’t hear any of our  neighbors. The kitchen is well stocked for cooking. It is also perfectly located with restaurants, grocery and public transportation within a very short walk. We loved the cute cafe right by the entrance. Sofia was super responsive and even allowed us to check in a little early. I would definitely stay here again when we return to Berlin!",1,0.9905,Positive
103.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,0,4.179832601624142,4.59,4.65,4.31,4.44,45809645,Wir haben uns insgesamt sehr wohl gefühlt! Die Lage war gut und das Zimmer bzw. Apartment war mit allem notwendigen und wie beschrieben ausgestattet :),1,-0.8748,Negative
69.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,0,3.077053794701885,4.8,4.71,4.93,4.7,1162120680748466012,"The space is lovely, bright and big. It was a very simple room, but having the balcony over the canal was so nice! I loved the neighborhood - lots of cafes and big trees. The shared bathrooms and kitchen were kept immaculately clean and people in the flat were very quiet and polite. I truly enjoyed my stay! (Maybe worth mentioning that the flat is on the 4th floor, not counting the ground floor, so people who have difficulty climbing stairs or with heavy bags might have a bit of trouble but it was fine for me - I liked getting the extra exercise (-:))<br/>Very good value!",1,0.9908,Positive
