418.0,13,6.0,2.0,6.0,42,100.0,1,6.44421921589432,4.76,4.69,4.82,4.59,9273023,"I took a group of my students (12) for a Berlin trip, and we couldn’t be happier with our choice of accommodation! This flat was spacious enough for the whole group. Places to withdraw to for privacy, and common areas large enough for all of us. The place is not only clean and modern, it has also the coolest interior you have ever seen! With lovely and practical hand-written notes to tell you what to do. Brilliant location with train and bus close by, excellent kebab just around the corner, several grocery stores right outside. 10 minutes walk to a shopping mall, witch my students appreciated. I never visited, though, as I much rather stayed in the flat with a book and some coffee, which the hosts provided free of charge! Thank you so much for a wonderful stay!",0,0.978,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,9,100.0,0,2.296149766892244,4.72,4.74,4.47,4.42,439631,"Sabine, thank you so much. Your apartment is great. It was very nice of you to give us Christmas Chocolat and a German wine. Also so nice that Aleen came to the train station to pick us up. It was so nice. The apartment is great, clean and big enough for a family of 4.<br/>I recommend it. I would go again for sure.<br/>Agradeco a Sabine pela atencao. O apartamento e otimo e bem localizado. Adoramos a experiencia. Obrigado, Fabi, Andre Lu and Vi<br/><br/>",1,0.9787,Positive
193.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,24,100.0,0,11.965429473179302,4.21,4.0,4.6,4.19,657271356031976665,Мы были в ноябре. Отлично провели время. Квартира расположена в удобном месте. Рядом с квартирой много ресторанов и все что нужно для комфортного пребывания. Спасибо,1,0.0,Neutral
201.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,54,100.0,1,1.3558603428081426,4.88,4.9,4.77,4.74,13755615,"This is an excellent accommodation. The apartment is in a great location, easy to take the train or walk to tourist attractions. The beds are very comfortable and the kitchen is well-equipped. It was convenient having a washing machine in the suite. Sven and Juana were great hosts. I’d be happy to stay there again.",0,0.9774,Positive
