231.0,2,1.0,1.0,3.0,63,100.0,1,9.076307917104932,4.76,4.7,4.78,4.54,44205889,"For the most part, my stay was excellent. Only issue I ended up having was with the washing dryer not properly drying. To try and rectify the situation, the hotel brought me a drying rack which did dry my clothes; however, it did cause them to smell. Maintenance might have try to come while I was sleeping to work on the dryer, but I was checking out the next morning so I didn't need the dryer working anymore.",1,0.3291,Positive
