61.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,96.0,0,13.15001188940134,4.84,4.85,4.61,4.76,24328488,"Iljana herself was so nice and she was an excellent and conscientious host. She kept the place immaculate, and there were thoughtful touches like mini toiletries and makeup removal pads in the bathroom. This is one of the best Airbnbs I have stayed in. The location was about a 10-15 minute walk to the U-Bahn station. It may take a bit of time to get to the city center but meeting Iljana and staying at her Airbnb made it worth it. It was also very close to the Schönefeld airport.",1,0.8795,Positive
62.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,6.602459616756402,4.74,4.74,4.84,4.76,13704364,"Sabine is friendly and helpful.  The flat is spacious, high-ceilinged. May be not renovated, but clean and convenient for staying, equipped with all you need . A big light room. Very quiet. You may keep a bicycle in the internal yard. Convenient transport. Lidl and Edeka, two metro stations in 10 min on feet. I felt myself comfortable and easy during that staying in Berlin.",1,0.856,Positive
41.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,15,100.0,0,3.558265973195314,4.77,4.84,4.88,4.79,19666219,"Das helle, ruhige und geräumige Zimmer befindet sich in einer im 4. Stock gelegenen Wohnung eines Gebäudes im Jugendstil. Ein Aufzug ist nicht vorhanden, für ""Bedürftige"" ;-) gibt es jedoch sogar einen Treppenlift. Die Wohnung ist sehr sauber, ebenso Toilettenraum und Badezimmer. Das Badezimmer verfügt über eine Badewanne mit Duschmöglichkeit.<br/>Die U-Bahn-Station Gneisenaustr. (U7) ist  nur 4 min entfernt; mehrere Bus-Haltestellen ebenfalls in unmittelbarer Nähe.<br/>Günter ist ein sehr freundlicher Gastgeber; ich habe mich bei ihm wohl gefühlt. <br/>Gerne wieder !!!",1,-0.5826,Negative
121.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,27,100.0,0,4.472653939309849,4.88,4.9,4.81,4.78,10122398,"Great location, easy to access, and very clean apartment that made our short stay in Berlin very enjoyable. Would recommend. Martin is also a great host, explaining in detail the check-in procedure and helping whenever we had questions.",1,0.9692,Positive
66.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,45,100.0,1,8.230717363177027,4.89,4.88,4.84,4.76,34243172,"Literally the perfect experience, Thekla was the perfect host, we had a wonderful time.",1,0.9022,Positive
