46.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,1,11.322410583731694,4.81,4.65,4.85,4.79,1272125,"Emir's place is quite conveient, easy access to S/B bahn to anywhere in the city. Emir is a quite nice guy, he even show me around the where i can eat, to shopping, to traffic & guidance me how to buy the local traffic ticket. When I arrived at the main entrance, he come downstairs and help me come in, which is quite helpful when you go there alone in the late night. Alaa is the one stay with us when i were in the town, he also help me a lot. I would definitely recommend any other guy come to the town try Emir's place. Not mention he speak different language, including English, Russia, Espana, German, Arbiac, this is really amazing.",1,0.9685,Positive
221.0,6,3.0,1.0,4.0,29,100.0,0,3.811094276989304,4.71,4.79,4.75,4.65,31467134,"Wir waren zu viert für ein Wochenende in Berlin auf einer Veranstaltung in der Mercedes Benz Arena. Dafür war die Lage und Größe der Wohnung genau richtig. Dafür dass wir nur zum Schlafen in der Wohnung waren, war es ok. Allerdings hat uns die hohe Luftfeuchtigkeit in den Räumen (Kellerwohnung) und der Kellergeruch extrem gestört. Alles (die Betten, unsere Klamotten) hat sich klamm und leicht feucht angefühlt.",0,-0.9371,Negative
103.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,1,12.340502664810618,4.67,4.54,4.78,4.74,11429575,Thomas's flat was clean and well presented. Its close to local shops and cafes and also the U Bahn. Good value and would recommend it!,1,0.8977,Positive
