93.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,56,100.0,0,2.2580045415179715,4.96,4.96,5.0,4.92,1364407494175632327,"We had a nice weekend away in Berlin, couldn’t have had it better somewhere else. We will definitely come back here. The host was very friendly and we miss the cat.",1,0.8832,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,15,100.0,0,4.9752801571872745,4.75,4.83,5.0,4.92,17936635,"Bitte WLAN genau erklären lassen, und auf kein TV einstellen (keine Tagesschau/Nachrichten).",1,0.0,Neutral
164.0,5,2.0,2.0,3.0,30,100.0,1,1.753209774100189,4.83,4.72,4.83,4.75,3188899,"We didn't get a chance to meet Aglaja in person but her husband introduced the apartment and the surroundings to us. It was a wonderful experience, one of the bests actually. The location is quite close to almost all the famous places of interests. They gave us very specific instructions so we had no problem finding all the good restaurants. The atmosphere is excellent. They even left a bottle of sparking wine for us so we could celebrate. Can't ask more. Definitely will recommend this place to our friends. We have already miss our HOME in Berlin! ",0,0.9672,Positive
39.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,1,6.582330417299593,4.74,4.62,4.75,4.58,38976821,"Sohail hat sich sehr liebevoll um uns gekümmert und wir haben und sehr wohl gefühlt.<br/>Manche Angaben sind nur leider etwas verwirrend, da bspw. der Fernseher nicht im Zimmer vorhanden ist, sondern in der Wohnung allgemein. Das Zimmer beinhaltet lediglich Schrank und Kommode, Schreibtisch, Bett und drei Beistelltische, sowie Wlan. <br/>Da dies für uns völlig in Ordnung war, bedanken wir uns bei dir Sohail und kommen immer wieder gerne!",1,-0.636,Negative
