58.0,5,1.0,1.0,4.0,23,96.0,1,6.091510504201948,4.53,4.52,4.66,4.41,4326410,Great location and value for money. Check in and out was really easy. Perfect spot for 2 or 3 people.,1,0.9283,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,0,13.07487903505446,4.4,4.2,4.6,4.4,31621074,"Die Wohnung ist gut gelegen (Bus und S-Bahn fußläufig erreichbar) und man ist in 40 Minuten in Mitte. Die Einrichtung ist schön, es ist alles da was man braucht. Während meines Aufenthalts wurden Dach und Fassade renoviert, was ich vorher nicht wusste. Dementsprechend mussten den ganzen Tag die Rollos unten bleiben.<br/>Leider war die Wohnung überhaupt nicht sauber. Extrem viele (Tier-)Haare überall, sogar im Bett, Bettwäsche hat muffig gerochen. Das Geschirr und Besteck war dreckig, genauso wie der Fußboden und die Dusche. An sich eine gute Unterkunft, aber ich habe mich aufgrund der fehlenden Sauberkeit nicht wohl gefühlt.",1,-0.9823,Negative
132.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,1,3.220056431819407,4.79,4.83,4.84,4.55,43352497,"Schöne Altbauwohnung, wie beschrieben.<br/>In der Nähe vom Kottbusser Tor und daher alles gut zu erreichen.<br/>Leichter Check-in und check-out.",1,0.0,Neutral
352.0,8,4.0,2.0,6.0,33,100.0,1,7.070529925741001,4.95,4.94,4.57,4.82,35955578,Amazing apartment for travelling with friends and family. Spacious and very well organized. We loved it!,0,0.9258,Positive
59.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,50,100.0,1,6.553717964125431,4.89,4.8,4.82,4.82,45522353,"Ahmed is a very responsive and friendly host.<br/>I rated my stay three stars because while the location was excellent, I was not super happy with the state of the bedding and the bathroom.<br/>The first and second nights in bed were super itchy. I was worried there might be bugs or something. The towels were frankly quite smelly (pungent with sweat odors). I went out bought new towels for myself, and asked to change the sheets. Ahmed suggested I may be allergic to the detergent, but I’ve never experienced an allergy. I think the sheets and some towels need to be replaced with new ones, or the ones provided to me taken out of rotation. <br/>The bathroom floor also didn’t feel clean.<br/>It’s an affordable place but should have better amenities. My first night there I was given one pillow that was so overused it hardly has stuffing, so I requested another. Simply put: the decor could be better but the location was very nice and Ahmed is agreeable.",1,0.934,Positive
90.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,0,12.4068471777683,4.5,4.62,4.48,4.48,31170463,angenehme kleine Bleibe 🍀,1,0.0,Neutral
50.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,1,28.39119372362158,4.79,4.93,4.81,4.63,35751033,"Ich war in der Unterkunft sehr aufgehoben. Sie lieg ideal, um Berlin und die Umgebung zu erkunden. Der Kontakt zu den Gastgebern war sehr freundlich.",1,-0.8519,Negative
