68.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,1,6.786146387015562,4.68,4.79,4.38,4.64,7653620,Clean and practical. Good beeds. Nice kitchen. The area is a little dirty. And the apartement is on the the ground floor. And only a little daylight from the Windows.,1,0.6997,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,0,2.559692009773911,4.99,5.0,4.99,4.93,23442676,"Amazing apartment and a great host. You cannot find a better location for exploring the city. Short walk to the Brandenburg Gate, Museum Island, and multiple public transportation stops.",1,0.709,Positive
88.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,100.0,1,1.881496822425637,4.71,4.61,4.93,4.66,44740912,"Appartement propre et lumineux donnant sur une cour calme. Literie confortable bien qu’usée et tachée.<br/>Mobilier défraîchi, donne l’impression qu’on a entreposé des affaires dont on ne veut plus. Manque d’entretien de certains mobiliers (poubelle salle de bain, bouton wc..) <br/>Dans la cuisine,  une poêle et un micro-onde ne serais pas de trop.<br/>Chaudière qui fait beaucoup de bruit.<br/>Problème lors du départ, les clés doivent être laisser à l’intérieur de l’appartement mais la porte de la cour était verrouillée, impossible de sortir jusqu’à ce qu’une bonne âme m’entende et vienne qui m’ouvrir. Désagréable et stressant lorsqu’on doit prendre un avion.",1,0.0,Neutral
138.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,56,100.0,1,2.8661586391717453,4.91,4.92,4.9,4.79,1946067,"Amazing flat, just as pictured. Good furniture, comfortable bed, all what you need for cooking food there is at the kitchen. I liked location as well - near running track, restaurants and subway stations. Axel was very cheerful. Without doubts it is in my top of visited apartments. ",1,0.9668,Positive
190.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,99.0,0,2.757489559962004,4.87,4.8,4.93,4.74,1071654509606077535,Super Location <br/>Very punctual check in (15:00) / out ( 10/00 ) <br/>Clean apartment <br/>Unfortunately ALL IKEA furniture,1,0.5994,Positive
90.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,42,100.0,1,1.9905011360206333,4.92,4.95,4.99,4.84,16279620,"Amazing flat, I pretended it was mine and I lived in Berlin. <br/>Morning 🌅 cuppa on the roof terrace Sunday morning listening to the church bells was wonderfully. <br/>Marie was so helpful and nothing was too much trouble. The bars and restaurant were on the doorstep (brilliant too), and no noise above as we were quite high up. <br/>Tempted to go back and stay a few more days in this area of Berlin 🤩",1,0.8134,Positive
114.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,1,3.268352166045826,4.8,4.74,4.89,4.71,11294240,Dejligt ophold i Ellens bolig og en god kommunikation ved behov. Kan anbefale Ellens lejlighed til andre gæster i Berlin.,1,0.2732,Positive
105.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,59,100.0,1,9.94607799465198,4.96,4.95,4.76,4.87,21546010,"A beautifully designed house in a quiet area of ​​Berlin. Anke was always committed and helpful, before and during the stay. The house is very clean, the terrace is a huge plus as is the beautiful bathroom. Everything has been thought about and is definitely recommended!",1,0.9665,Positive
