260.0,4,2.0,2.0,4.0,55,100.0,0,2.5729352260986107,4.66,4.55,4.84,4.45,26543,Elva and Terri were great hosts. This is a nice and comfortable apartment in a good location. Everything was as expected. I would recommend to families and friends.,0,0.9565,Positive
65.0,4,1.0,4.0,4.0,24,100.0,0,4.853538051906053,4.25,4.48,4.68,4.4,20752987,"Everything was pretty good: there were 4 bathrooms, the kitchen was spacious and well equipped, and everything was as clean as it could be. However, the room was hot at night and the beds were very noisy. <br/>Overall, though, a very good and cheap place to stay.",0,0.8958,Positive
407.0,6,3.0,3.0,4.0,44,100.0,0,8.355204841259384,5.0,4.95,4.8,4.95,26800964,"wir haben zum ersten Mal eine private Wohnung gebucht (in der Wohnung lebt die Familie wenn sie in Berlin ist). Trotzdem war alles tip top aufgeräumt, sauber und wir fühlten uns sehr wohl. <br/>Die Wohnung ist sehr gross, zu jedem Zimmer ein Badezimmer. Betten sehr bequem. Im Kinderzimmer/Wohnzimmer könnten allenfalls noch 2 Erwachsene schlafen (bequeme Riesenkissen). Wir waren zu viert plus Baby. Genug Platz zum chillen, spielen, kochen und schöne Terasse.<br/>Auch die Kommunikation war sehr angenehm, jede Frage wurde geduldig beantwortet (-;<br/>Empfehlenswert<br/>ps: alles wie auf den Fotos!",0,-0.9595,Negative
282.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,41,100.0,1,2.942766383999945,5.0,4.97,4.94,4.87,42631943,"Host responsive when self service kiosk was working when we arrived late in the evening.  During normal business hours they have a front desk 'concierge' that was very friendly.<br/>Apartment was great with a large patio balcony overlooking the park.  Bed was comfy, kitchen was functional for meal prep but doesn't have a microwave.  WiFi was fast but the nice Samsung  smart TV is locked to Germany cable TV with no streaming services.  I had to lift it off its mount in order to plug in a HDMI cable so we could use our iPhones for streaming Netflix etc<br/>Laundry available in basement at no charge",1,0.7254,Positive
125.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,10,100.0,0,11.41836433468906,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,1296135,"The was my best experience using Airbnb!!!  Jacqueline is a trusting host that deserves all the respect she offers.  Her home is better than how it is advertised: clean, spacious, warm, and nothing lacking when it comes to amenities.  She was also very patient with some of my foriegner errors I commited such as locking myself out of the apartment- thank you!  More importantly, my daughters felt that they were at home.",1,0.9655,Positive
150.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,24,96.0,0,13.522952515456913,4.63,4.8,4.57,4.51,33707449,Wir waren zum Konzert und haben uns dort sehr wohlgefühlt,1,0.0,Neutral
63.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,53,90.0,1,5.0238359615460935,4.88,4.73,4.85,4.73,889203458027587797,Luis is the best host I’ve ever met. Our flight got seriously delayed and he was very kind to offer us extra time to stay at his place.<br/>It is located in a quiet neighbourhood. Accessible to multiple stations and easy travel to most places by Ring Bahn. <br/>Luis gave great location recommendations - the bar just a few door step to his place is a must try!,1,0.9272,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,0,5.523148636430008,4.88,4.86,4.93,4.79,21430122,"Klaus's apartment is super calm, relaxed, green, quiet, just lovely! Across the beautiful Victoria Park and in the back the Gleisdreick Park. Lots of cafes and restaurants closeby. Really lovely. Fully recommended. Klaus is a generous and kind host!",1,0.9842,Positive
123.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,1,1.17460082517367,4.83,4.8,4.9,4.74,238396,Henrik’s place is located near to transportation and central to all tourist sites. There are food options and a grocery store nearby. The neighborhood is quiet.,1,0.0,Neutral
