97.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,39,97.0,0,0.6734773499531193,4.59,4.48,4.96,4.48,53988565,"It’s a great location - we walked almost everywhere from there, and lots of great little shops and restaurants near by. The space was lovely - just as described. There’s lots of natural light on the upstairs floor. The kitchen had everything we needed - it was very easy to settle in to the cosy home. But it’s a lot of steps up (72 to be precise) so you’ll get a workout getting home",1,0.8536,Positive
100.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,81,100.0,0,14.564009169212309,5.0,4.87,4.87,4.87,51842524,"Wirklich nur zu empfehlen, Berlin hier entspannt zu genießen. Es ist ein wundervoller atmosphärisches Zimmer mit allem was das Herz so begehrte für einen entspanntdn Aufenthalt. Olaf ist ein super herzlicher Gastgeber und ich hab mich rundum wohl gefühlt. Ganz toll, Danke!!",1,0.6688,Positive
352.0,8,4.0,2.0,6.0,33,100.0,1,7.070529925741001,4.95,4.94,4.57,4.82,35955578,"We had a fantastic stay in the loft. It's very spatious, has all the facilities we need, everything was perfectly clean and overall we felt like at home. It's very easy to move around Berlin from it. We definitely recommend it to big groups!",0,0.9669,Positive
