90.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,45,100.0,1,3.6178758418911023,4.85,4.82,4.9,4.73,540335929043609328,Had a very smooth & comfortable stay and great communication!!,1,0.8505,Positive
165.0,6,3.0,1.5,5.0,43,100.0,1,5.434755992176868,4.77,4.85,4.66,4.66,1186272166891222141,"Sebastian is a great host and his flat is beautiful and cozy. We stayed there with 6 people and enjoyed every minute. It‘s super close to Tempelhofer Feld and other Berlin hotspots. It‘s quite and has a beautiful interior design. We were one of the first guests ever and everything is new, super clean and cozy. Too bad we only had one night but if we ever come back to Berlin, this is the place we‘ll book. Highly recommended!",0,0.9329,Positive
140.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,91.0,0,4.871252294318258,4.72,4.78,4.85,4.58,46812239,"Very comfortable bed, clean bathroom and modern space, great for two people & a short stay, especially if you have a concert at Uber Arena :)",1,0.9317,Positive
