195.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,91.0,0,4.873172561853288,4.69,4.76,4.44,4.54,30881310,Highly recommend if you’re in town for a while and on a budget.  Located near a grocery store and pharmacy and easy to get around.  Felt like a nice home to come home to.  Clean and comfortable.  Staff is friendly.  Felt very at home here.  I’d stay here again.,1,0.9595,Positive
