292.0,12,3.0,2.0,9.0,48,100.0,0,7.365557287816079,4.87,4.87,4.69,4.7,4027713,"having read the reviews I must say I agree with how amazing this place was! we stayed for 3 nights as a group of 9 and I must say it was pretty much perfect for everyone. the apartment was spacious and incredibly clean, when we were in the apartment we never felt like we were on top of each other. the apartment comes with a lift but we could only fit 3 people in it at a time but not an issue really. We stayed on a busy street but noise was never a problem. the host was great and responded quickly to any questions or queries we had, the apartment was very easy to find and the bus stops right outside the apartment which was great. I couldn't recommend this apartment enough and would definitely come back!",0,0.9858,Positive
