59.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,0,4.586082103974828,4.7,4.6,4.5,4.8,4003140,"The flat was perfect, big table, plenty of space in the sitting room with two couches, nice and full equipped kitchen, a really big bathroom with bath tub, a comfortable bed with a view out of the window. <br/>Olga and Paul were extremely kind to get us the keys themselves, and everything was smooth.<br/>Books available in the flat are very interesting and the general style is cool, simple and comfortable. <br/>There's a minijack connector to get your device sounds by a nice stereo system.<br/>Total satisfaction and good price for the week. <br/>",1,0.9829,Positive
88.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,0,12.43529195299008,4.63,4.71,4.56,4.58,31172381,"Consigliatissimo!<br/>Loft curato in ogni dettaglio (pulizia, cibo e fiori freschi!), silenzioso e ben collegato a tutto, grazie alla stazione metro (Richard-Wagner-Platz) raggiungibile in 2 minuti a piedi.<br/>Market, coffee shop e ristoranti abbondanti nella via di casa.<br/>Berlino è meravigliosa!<br/>Grazie Kristina!",1,0.0,Neutral
49.0,1,1.0,1.0,2.0,45,100.0,1,11.88938036942631,4.94,4.9,4.91,4.93,13215295,"We stayed 4 nights at Sabrina's place, it was great, only positive comments! Looking at the map, you see Fehrbelliner Platz is not in the middle of the tourist attractions, but metro is 3 minutes walk and takes you quickly to everywhere. Note there's 2 lines in that station. And it's nice to be away from the tourist buzz, and live in an actual residential area/street, like a Berliner. Also getting in and out to the airport was really easy and convenient. It's really worth staying in that area, we did not try the restaurants or bars because we left early and returned late, but there's snacks and breakfast options morning at the metro station itself, and if you return late there's the Azerbaijan Döner in front of the supermarket with fast foods, it closes after 23:00hrs. Sabrina's house is very big, and guests have a lot of privacy. And it's good to have her living with us at the house, she is around, friendly, always available. Great person with warm heart, makes us feel at home. Many places now in the big cities are ""fake"" airbnbs, where you actually do not get to meet the host (which is not really an issue when you are sightseeing all day).",1,0.9893,Positive
214.0,9,3.0,1.0,5.0,48,100.0,0,2.4338131448817624,4.69,4.67,4.71,4.58,23290410,"Wir waren 2 Übernachtungen in der Wohnung. Alles in Ordnung. Die Wohnung ist sehr ruhig im Hinterhof gelegen. Einzig der Lift hat nicht funktionierr, aber Treppensteigen ist ja gesund.",0,-0.5994,Negative
