148.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,26,100.0,1,3.2241984489947213,4.88,4.93,4.76,4.71,16821096,"This adorable sleek apartment is nestled into a beautiful little courtyard which allowed us to sleep with the windows open and awake to the sound of birds while still being the center of the city. The flat is close to everything - we walked, took the train or scootered everywhere. Babett was responsive, we loved Berlin and we didn't want to leave!",1,0.9289,Positive
