167.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,54,100.0,1,2.4437854258055407,5.0,5.0,4.99,4.95,1192187641054518551,"Beautifully designed loft centrally located, lots of light and viewpoints. Patios and skylights are fantastic. Modern appliances in a well designed and fully functional kitchen. Very glad we could stay one entire week.  Many good restaurants and cafés nearby. Berlin public transport is fantastic and easily accessed from that location, no matter where you want to go (there is an awful lot of things to see in this city with such rich history). Coming  back to the loft at the end of the day was like coming back home to a peaceful place. Highly recommended and worth the price. Sascha communicated rapidly and is great host. This is definitely our first choice if we visit Berlin again in the future.",1,0.9883,Positive
