49.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,1,7.816766275257349,4.96,4.96,4.9,4.9,1067457802464449449,"My stay at Uta's place was wonderful and peaceful, which I needed since I was going there for business. <br/>The surroundings are nice and calm. The place is very well connected to the Brandenburg gate and the ring line.<br/>Besides, there are good food options in the vicinity.<br/>The place itself is very spacious and you have enough space to relax and store your things for your trip.<br/>There is no elevator in case that is relevant to you.<br/>Thank you for everything Uta!<br/>When I come back to Berlin for leisure, I will definitely consider going back to your place. 🤟",1,0.9637,Positive
