75.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,19,83.0,0,9.461298881110482,4.93,4.72,4.87,4.87,35154766,"I've had the most wonderful stay at Cyrus's flat - the flat is located in a beautiful area of Berlin, peaceful and quiet, and yet it walking distance to some of the livelier parts of the city, their restaurants and bars. The flat itself was bright and spacious, with a lovely balcony to enjoy sunny evenings on. Cyrus was a wonderful host - he was there to meet me when I arrived and happy to give recommendations of shops and restaurants nearby. He was super-quick to respond when I had a question, and everything was wonderfully straightforward. I would definitely want to stay at this place again!",1,0.9914,Positive
