65.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,1,18.95052374878964,4.84,4.64,4.73,4.83,37558386,"We had a fantastic stay at Sven's. A beautiful, quiet and comfy, private souterrain with lots of amenities and love in the little details. The whole place was totally clean and appeared very well cared for. Everything from check-in to check-out went super smooth, since Sven is a truly nice guy and seemed always keen on being as helpful and considerate as he could be!<br/>Highly recommended stay!",1,0.9901,Positive
