73.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,2.27336048441501,4.89,4.87,4.95,4.82,16155678,"Nice place for a short stay. I haven’t booked a room in someone’s home in many years, usually opting for private accommodations, and this stay was a great mix of the two. The room was larger than my last European hotel room, and is located conveniently inside the front door in a private hallway so you don’t have to walk through the host’s spaces to get to the room. I really liked staying here and Fran & Jo were friendly and responsive!",1,0.9431,Positive
132.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,31,100.0,1,2.059346229612777,4.86,4.86,4.86,4.61,1191974699728469898,"Logement propre et bien équipé, calme mais pas très lumineux car rdc sur cour; bien situé dans Prenzlauer Berg <br/>Pas simple de trouver le digicode extérieur quand il fait nuit; <br/>Trop cher pour 2 personnes mais raisonnable pour 4.",1,0.0,Neutral
48.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,0,4.230279756706139,4.76,4.76,4.48,4.74,31006339,"The apartment has a great localization, easy to come and go with public transportation. Also has supermarket really close. It was clean e awesome to stay there.",1,0.93,Positive
68.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,20,100.0,1,6.801132231621815,4.75,4.79,4.43,4.64,15985692,"Very convenient access straight from the street via an electronic lock. Apartment had all the amenities you could want, a kitchen with utensils, pans, coffee maker, etc. The place was very clean and smelled wonderful! When we checked in me and my friends were greeted by three Berliner Kindl in the fridge - a perfect welcome to our short stay in Berlin!",1,0.9667,Positive
