155.0,7,2.0,1.0,6.0,43,96.0,0,6.1770612336798365,4.41,4.27,4.78,4.31,27018620,"L’emplacement de l’appartement est parfait . La récupération des clés était trop facile.Mais un petit détail nous a un peu dérangé, l’appartement n’était pas parfaitement propre.",0,0.0,Neutral
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,20,0.0,0,8.05629405024424,4.53,4.68,4.67,4.54,15277811,"Clean, comfortable and well situated appartement. Communication with host was great and check out/in process was very easy. Only minor inconvenience was that there was no reported kettle in the kitchen and no shower products. Would definitely recommend to any group of friends/family!",1,0.9323,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,0,5.036971717818233,4.87,4.79,4.93,4.67,10051520,A lovely cool loft space in possibly the coolest area of Berlin <br/>We had a fantastic week,1,0.8658,Positive
98.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,22,100.0,1,3.1634061354496827,4.83,4.82,4.8,4.56,32678196,"Kommunikation und Check-In haben perfekt funktioniert. Das Treppenhaus wirkte zunächst etwas ernüchternd, doch das Miniloft selbst hat mich dann absolut positiv überrascht: Eine wirkliche Perle inmitten von Berlin! Groß, hell, mit Deckenstuck und tollem Ambiente. Ein echter Platz zum Durchatmen. Ich habe den Aufenthalt sehr genossen! Vielen Dank, ich komme gerne mal wieder!",1,-0.7562,Negative
146.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,3.4636382799594605,4.66,4.79,4.58,4.56,322520,Great place at a great location!<br/>Very clean and comfortable.,1,0.9381,Positive
123.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,1,1.17460082517367,4.83,4.8,4.9,4.74,238396,"The house was spotlessly clean and had everything we could need. It has character as it is a very old building, prepared with care, to provide what one needs. The area is quiet and close to Alexander Platz, just a 15 minute walk. But you can use the metro. Just a few meters from the house, there is the red subway line U2, at Senefelderplatz. There are various restaurants and bars nearby. The supermarket is very close and closes at 22.00. Henrik respond immediately at any question and he was very helpful.<br/>All convenient and nice!!",1,0.8323,Positive
70.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,1,2.5329341972975428,4.86,4.8,4.93,4.8,19976281,Enrique was a great host! Super nice guy with a lot of helpful recommendations. The apartment itself was great for 2 people. Kitchenette had everything needed to make simple meals and everything looked like the posting. Definitely would recommend staying with Enrique :),1,0.9812,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,0,7.781452884124446,4.45,4.55,4.54,4.36,993380042593079111,ist Akzeptabel.,1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,1,4.861082501850892,4.75,4.76,4.6,4.7,5188216,"Gemütliche, originelle  Wohnung in einem ehemaligen Laden, ausgestattet mit allem, was man für einen Städtetrip braucht, zahlreiche öffentliche Verkehrsmittel fußläufig erreichbar, ebenfalls Lidl und Netto in nächster Nähe.",1,0.0,Neutral
159.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,1,0.9761501815806188,4.88,4.87,4.9,4.73,22992946,"Having just completed my second long term stay here (3 months x 2) I have nothing but positive things to say (again). Seems every year there are better food and shopping options popping up in the area. Great proximity to transit, food, shopping, and nightlife. If you like good beer, there is a Mikkeller outpost is just down the street... just saying. Would recommend, and stay here again (and have!)",1,0.9535,Positive
84.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,5.06163943405691,4.92,4.94,4.96,4.82,344856,The place was even better then we expected. It's pretty big with a seperate kitchen. It's well equiped and everything you could possible need is there. Location is great (central but quiet once you are inside) very well decorated with cool vintage details. <br/>Clear and very friendly communication. Love to go again!,1,0.975,Positive
83.0,6,2.0,1.0,6.0,23,94.0,1,0.8141273036815293,4.68,4.58,4.93,4.68,6231989,"perfecte locatie en uitzicht op de Fernsehturm. bakker, supermarkt, biergartens, stations alles op loopafstand",0,0.0,Neutral
190.0,12,3.0,2.0,5.0,36,100.0,0,2.9693852716855065,4.7,4.77,4.57,4.55,1221803024213121808,"This is a stunning loft-style unit with a great kitchen and 2 reasonably sized bathrooms.  The living room and kitchen are quite spacious, but the bedrooms are somewhat problematic.  The bedroom on the ground floor did have 2 queen size beds, side tables and convenient outlets.  However, it lacked a door and storage space.  The ""gallery"" bedrooms (I'm not familiar with the term) have low ceilings-- 1 is under 6 ft high, the other is basically a crawl space. <br/>The host was very nice, helpful and responsive.  The block and general area left a bit to be desired.  The flat is on a scruffy looking block off a major intersection. The area is busy and crowded, but there are other parts of Kreuzberg that are more upscale with a less hectic feel and a better selection of restaurants and cafes.",0,0.8223,Positive
286.0,6,3.0,2.0,5.0,35,100.0,1,6.97282351203588,4.96,4.96,4.55,4.83,14327015,"A large and well equipped apartment located in Berlin Mitte. <br/>Had absolutely no issues before, during or after with the owners/apartment. <br/>I hope to come back another day!",0,0.4213,Positive
68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,0,4.2542342563146125,4.76,4.79,4.54,4.71,35422386,"Комната еще лучше и больше чем на фото. чистая, светлая, в 15 мин. езды на трамвае от центра города. В комнате есть все необходимое: фен, чайник, микроволновка, а вдобавок разные пакетики чая, кофе, сливки и сладостей. Очень приятная хозяйка. Быстро отвечает на сообщения.",1,0.0,Neutral
190.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,0,6.800564426780606,4.91,4.71,4.86,4.86,771675862741242014,"Superdejlig lejlighed med god atmosfære. Fed New Yorker lejlighed med masser af plads, interessant indretning, fuldt ekviperet køkken, centralt placeret og dog i en rolig gade.",1,0.2732,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,0,5.320206377999154,5.0,4.9,4.95,4.93,48556793,Super clean and comfortable place.,1,0.872,Positive
271.0,10,3.0,1.5,5.0,56,100.0,1,5.229990782295846,4.95,4.89,4.8,4.88,17223235,"This apartment is really perfect for a medium/large group. Some of my favourite things about this place:<br/>1) There was one bathroom with a toilet and shower, and a second smaller bathroom with a toilet and washer/dryer. With a group it's so nice that one person can be showering in one bathroom and there's still another toilet available.. it made mornings a lot faster so we could get out the door and go site-seeing!<br/>2) Patio with picnic table. We enjoyed eating pizza out there on warm evenings. :)<br/>3) Lots of restaurants and bars nearby to enjoy (Caligari is great if you like Italian, and Keith's was a cool bar for whiskey lovers).<br/>3) Fully stocked kitchen! So if you want to stay in, it's very easy to cook for yourself, all the cookware and utensils you could need are there.<br/>4) Tempelhof Park is nearby and it's really neat, it used to be an airport and it's a wonderful open space. A great place to watch the sunset with a beer or two.<br/>Overall we really enjoyed this place. Perfect for a group of friends or a family.",0,0.9941,Positive
260.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,91.0,0,4.81020597174384,4.59,4.7,4.4,4.44,28299765,"Unterkunft genau wie beschrieben, alles super und freundlich verlaufen",1,0.5994,Positive
300.0,9,3.0,1.5,4.0,54,100.0,1,2.312156644109463,4.9,4.85,4.95,4.81,10043384,"Great location, large and clean flat, amazing showers",0,0.891,Positive
123.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,0,7.774560523766015,4.59,4.66,4.71,4.55,21443258,"Our group of 4 had a great time at Michael’s place. It’s perfectly located, there are shops nearby y, the sban is really close (5 minutes away);  the apartment is cozy and warm (even whiteout the hitting on). Will recommend to everyone!",1,0.9184,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,0,9.89692240277246,4.72,4.43,4.78,4.76,23088570,Andrea is an accommodating guest. Her apartment is right at the bus stop and is easily accessible.,1,0.0516,Positive
118.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,15,93.0,0,2.300393790485076,4.71,4.62,4.74,4.62,16951349,"Outstanding location with so many options to go out for dinner and drinks one would need to stay there for few weeks at least :-). The place itself was super clean, very comfortable with a big common area to enjoy being together with friends/family. Martina was very responsive and easy going. She offered us a storage space for the case you would like to leave your suitcases after the check out which is very convenient.",1,0.9768,Positive
