55.0,2,1.0,0.5,1.0,33,100.0,0,4.254453954041949,4.69,4.46,4.68,4.49,919925406080950698,"I stayed at Anna’s place five days and the time just flew by. It locates quite close to the city centre, you can get to Potsdamer Platz in 15-20 minutes, the connections are very good, even at night. Haven’t had time to discover the neighbourhood but it seemed ok and peaceful. Anna’s place is like home, you have everything you need, privacy, good wifi, kitchen, bathroom, warm room and bed and responsive friendly host. All you need for a vacation or work trip.",1,0.9791,Positive
