64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,9,100.0,0,6.917133127821027,4.6,3.6,4.4,4.4,20414946,"Friendly and good host, he showed us how to get around and explained us the neighborhood. The location is not the best but you can easily connect everywhere in the city. The place is very comfortable to have a great time.",1,0.9477,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,52,100.0,1,3.905291406003432,4.99,5.0,4.94,4.96,17731812,"Sylvia was the most amazing host for my friend and I. She was warm and welcoming, greeted us with fresh fruit, chocolates and bottled water and the room was brilliant. Extremely spacious and had everything we needed. Her home is very clean and accessible. She took the time with us to figure out transport and other activities to while in the city. We both valued her kindness and generosity greatly. We would both love the opportunity to stay with her again. Highly recommended!",1,0.9905,Positive
77.0,2,1.0,1.0,3.0,39,75.0,0,7.703817518224641,4.78,4.49,4.76,4.62,53287280,"We had a wonderful stay at Zack's place, it was cozy and well-located, cute, filled with great art and interesting things, and really beautiful. We had everything we needed.",1,0.9565,Positive
122.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,52,100.0,0,3.5267814640550013,4.44,4.48,4.88,4.44,1305655346758643821,"We had a great time at Georg's place as a group of 3 - we had an inflatable bed installed in the common area right next to the spacious balcony - which really is more like a terrance. Our mornings on it were lovely, sipping on a cup of coffee in the warm sun.<br/>The amenities were exactly as described, and the location was very close to the metro station, which made transport a breeze. The neighbourhood itself offers plenty of spätis and corner bars, as well as restaurants which are open until late.<br/>The only potential piece of warning is that the flat is on the 5th floor of a building without an elevator. This was not an issue for us, but might be worth knowing for some.<br/>All in all, it was a great place and we'll surely look to stay here again the next time we're in Berlin!",1,0.9608,Positive
