115.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,24,100.0,0,15.730253649096108,4.59,4.65,4.65,4.67,4290174,"Toller Aufenthalt in ungewohnter Villa . Besser man mag Tiere :-), es gibt nicht nur Katzen.<br/>Erinnerte uns an eine verzauberte Welt, mitten in der Stadt. Sympathisch und Ruhig.<br/>Netter Gastgeber",1,0.0,Neutral
31.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,20,100.0,1,12.389708472442326,4.76,4.74,4.59,4.81,31116923,gut!,1,0.0,Neutral
95.0,7,1.0,1.0,3.0,33,100.0,0,4.793849952314026,4.57,4.28,4.88,4.5,12723428,Very good experience. Everything we needed was there and the apartment was also very clean and spacious.,1,0.734,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,5.46985711700962,4.97,4.97,4.84,4.97,883470688094282089,"During our recent stay at Julian and Maik's place, we had a very pleasant experience. The room was spacious and comfortable, with a large bed that ensured a good night's sleep. The location, near the subway and other public transport options, made getting around the city convenient. We particularly enjoyed the peaceful walk through Victoria Park on our way to Bergmannkiez each morning. Julian and Maik were great hosts, friendly and communicative, always ready to offer helpful recommendations and make sure we had a comfortable stay. Overall, I would recommend their place for a relaxing stay in the city.",1,0.9904,Positive
58.0,2,0.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,1,17.178707427347383,4.95,4.94,4.75,4.87,39185725,"Kerstin and Rolf were extremely friendly, I got a hug from Kerstin upon meeting her. She is a joyful soul. The place is outside the city center, about 45 minutes by bus and tram. There is a very huge world garden nearby. The bed was very firm at first but Rolf rectified the issue with a foam topper. There are also three food stores right next to each other within easy walking distance. Overall we had a peaceful stay at a very lovely warm hearted place.",1,0.9757,Positive
127.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,0,11.125405023243392,4.96,4.93,4.86,4.86,29115867,"Ein toller Aufenthalt. Karin's Wohnung ist großzügig und auch für jemand, der gerne kocht hervorragend ausgestattet. Schön fanden wir auch, dass Karin sehr nett und persönlich bezogen auf unsere Vorstellung unseren Aufenthalt verschönert hat und wir somit eine weihnachtliche Atmosphäre genießen konnten.",1,0.0,Neutral
76.0,2,0.0,1.0,2.0,31,100.0,1,30.07519231666693,4.94,4.89,4.86,4.73,18924370,"Die Kommunikation mit Ulla war von Anfang an sehr positiv und freundlich, meist proaktiv. Wir haben uns sehr willkommen gefühlt. Das Häuschen ist die Wucht, liebevoll eingerichtet, alles ist einwandfrei beschrieben und funktioniert genauso. Vor dem Häuschen im Schatten sitzend war mit Sicherheit der lauschigste Arbeitsplatz ever! <br/>Der See ist herrlich und in 5 Minuten gut zu Fuß zu erreichen. <br/>Wir sind zu ein paar Verabredungen zu spät gekommen und wären am liebsten gar nicht mehr abgereist, weil wir uns schlecht trennen konnten :-)",1,-0.9392,Negative
135.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,87.0,1,11.377361200205224,4.78,4.87,4.82,4.67,917109042412215124,I definitely recommend this place fr a stay in the heart of Berlin,1,0.6369,Positive
355.0,5,3.0,1.0,4.0,60,100.0,1,4.452003338303747,4.85,4.83,4.81,4.65,29553923,"Très beau séjour dans le<br/>Logement , à L’abris du bruit en plein kreuzberg. <br/>Beaux espaces , <br/>Un jardin accessible , mais pas attenant au logement ( accès via une autre entrée ) <br/>Nina est super réactive et donne les instructions très précises. <br/>Je recommande .",0,0.5994,Positive
125.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,17,100.0,0,5.260797778825941,4.78,4.78,4.89,4.67,16849504,Barbara and Tai were fantastic hosts. Their home was lovely. Great neighborhood. Lots of interesting cafes & bars. We'll definitely be back.,1,0.9509,Positive
140.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,32,100.0,0,2.0159436672933486,4.53,4.63,4.73,4.53,245827,"Hilles apartment is very well situated close to train stations, supermarket, Berlin Mall etc. Only negative about the apartment there is no laundry. You have to go to a laundromat to do your clothes washing. The apartment itself is nice and clean.",1,0.2484,Positive
