160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,87.0,0,3.4802565088356308,4.54,4.54,4.6,4.41,43798011,"Le logement est conforme à la description. Les infos étaient claires. La quartier est sympathique. La propreté n’était pas optimale (poussière causant allergies, odeurs dans la douche). L’accueil n’était pas chaleureux ni attentionné.",1,0.0,Neutral
290.0,4,3.0,2.0,4.0,61,90.0,0,5.391524126191458,4.97,4.85,4.81,4.73,1852328,"We spent a wonderful time in Linn's spacious and beautiful apartment! We were four adults and two children (aged 3 years and 3 months) and we all really enjoyed our stay. The neighbourhood is very quiet, just next to the nice Victoria Park, while at the same time it is only a 10-15 minutes walk from Bergmannsstrasse where there are nice restaurants and shops. The balcony is a real treasure with its nice view and sunbeds (we actually ended up spending most of our time there) and the rest of the apartment was just as good looking as on the photos. The apartment was also very clean. And the hosts very kind:-) Although the apartment was a bit expensive it was definitely worth it, and we can highly recommend it to anyone travelling to Berlin. ",0,0.9865,Positive
199.0,3,2.0,2.0,4.0,24,67.0,0,1.6734397696956833,4.97,4.94,4.95,4.86,6290291,"Nous avons malheureusement annulé le voyage au dernier moment, car ma fille était malade et pas en état de voyager, du coup j'évalue tout de même l'hôte qui est au top dans la communication et très sympathique, je pense que son appartement était à son image et c'est regrettable pour nous !!!<br/>Encore merci à Andre pour son sérieux !!!<br/>Eric",0,-0.6331,Negative
