340.0,7,3.0,2.0,6.0,70,100.0,1,3.241255499524776,4.81,4.97,4.79,4.66,176342,"I have nothing but good things to say about our experience with this apartment. Directions and information given to us in order to find the apartment was more than helpful and clear. Nino was very easy to reach if we had any questions regarding the apartment. The apartment was very cozy, clean and very accommodating. It was a beautiful/historic apartment to stay in. Also, the location was perfect. Very easy to get to any location we wanted to visit. I would definitely book this apartment again in the future.",0,0.9819,Positive
