94.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,1,3.7753972671390352,4.81,4.75,4.9,4.6,1250616245899456389,"Anca responded immediately when there was a problem in the flat and organized almost repair and I appreciated this effort. Overall, this is not 5 star accommodation, however. The apartment is fine and comfortable, but needs an update. During my stay there was construction in the building and the internet connection was slow. Otherwise, as advertised, it’s a great area.",1,0.8544,Positive
80.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,0,3.822337340646882,4.86,4.69,4.88,4.75,26245413,Iwona is a great host. Very friendly and accommodating. She was kind enough to show us how to use the washing machine and dryer. The room is nice and comfortable. Would definitely recommend for anyone staying in Berlin.,1,0.9694,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,1,30.776992366190125,4.91,4.93,4.86,4.86,1006288106268551755,Vielen Dank für die tolle Unterkunft. Sabine war immer erreichbar und sehr hilfsbereit. Zudem ein super schönes Frühstück für den ersten Morgen. Ausreichend sogar für den zweiten Tag :) Sehr ruhig gelegen. Wirklich zum entspannen und leicht mit der Bahn erreichbar. Vielen Dank noch einmal 🙃,1,-0.2263,Negative
64.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,1,1.17844157767783,4.9,4.91,4.87,4.75,53536574,Jeff was a terrific host and was very helpful and gave us lots of necessary information to help us navigate Berlin. He was very prompt with his responses whenever we needed a hand which was great. The location was perfect and close to lots of nightlife and the apartment was nice and modern and had just enough space for 3 of us!,1,0.9719,Positive
197.0,7,3.0,2.0,4.0,46,100.0,1,30.241564176287284,4.91,4.8,4.81,4.8,16889808,"Eine sehr große, schöne Wohnung mitten im Grünen. Super Kommunikation mit den Hosts. Drum herum ist richtig viel Wald und Wasser, sehr gut zum Radfahren, Wandern und Paddeln. Und der Großstadttrubel ist schnell erreichbar. Perfekte Wohnung, um sowohl Natur als auch Kultur zu erleben. 😊",0,0.5994,Positive
149.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,48,96.0,0,4.794359491893373,4.66,4.74,4.61,4.54,45732707,"The apartment was very clean and the location very central and well-connected by public transport. It is close to areas with great food and coffee places, as well as the beautiful Tempelhofer Feld. Overall great place for a short stay!",1,0.9551,Positive
