225.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,82.0,1,2.782679444066933,5.0,5.0,5.0,4.75,689620172303646710,This was an absolutely ideal first stay for us in Germany. The view of the river was absolutely lovely and the hotel itself is a gem. The front desk individuals were very helpful and we will certainly be back!,1,0.927,Positive
160.0,6,1.0,1.0,3.0,45,100.0,1,7.428675029398372,4.7,4.71,4.53,4.63,1099862201422281184,We had a lovely and enjoyable stay here in Berlin. Having the beautiful treptower park nearby was a lovely bonus and lots of electric bikes/scooters around meant we could get anywhere in Berlin quickly no matter the time. <br/>The beds were spacious and comfortable and the shower was very large and relaxing.<br/>Unfortunately the dishwasher was a bit faulty while we were there (but we got a quick response regarding its fixing) and some of the taps were a little stiff but otherwise perfect for the 5 of us. Would highly recommend and definitely return.,1,0.9722,Positive
116.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,50,100.0,1,3.566348295049236,4.86,4.89,4.78,4.71,29403218,Berlina is een fijne host die uitblinkt in heldere communicatie. Het appartementje is compact maar prima geschikt voor 2 personen. Het is zeer rustig gelegen in een wijkje in P-berg vlak bij Volkspark Friedrichshain. ‘s Nachts is het heerlijk rustig en er is vrijwel niets te merken van verkeer. Openbaar vervoer op loopafstand. Kortom ideaal als je op zoek bent naar een rustige plek op een goed bereikbare plek in deze heerlijke wijk van Berlijn!,1,-0.636,Negative
113.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,2.347970120018093,4.92,4.97,4.9,4.79,32333841,"We loved staying here! Great location, very convenient for finding nice cafes and restaurants. Convenient to get to the center and main sites. Perfect for a long weekend - highly recommend!",1,0.9576,Positive
75.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,1,3.7465670354738254,4.89,4.91,4.74,4.8,4581049,"Ich hatte einen tollen Aufenthalt in Etiennes Unterkunft. Sie ist perfekt für einen Städtetrip nach Berlin für 1-2 Personen! Es ist sehr sauber und alles vor Ort, was man brauch.",1,0.0,Neutral
