125.0,5,3.0,1.0,2.0,45,100.0,0,21.540755092802502,4.63,4.63,4.88,4.63,1194054250245251803,"Das interessante Loft hat eine ruhige Lage am Wasser, aber ca. 50 min mit Bus/U-Bahn/ S-Bahn nach Berlin Mitte. Wir haben uns extrem wohl gefühlt und Orte wie der Wannsee und die Waldbühne sehr gut erreicht. Jederzeit wieder!",1,-0.636,Negative
63.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,0,1.1926858283626978,5.0,4.3,4.8,4.8,1462275356179511660,"We had a really great time, with some really nice people on the boat. We felt instantly welcomed by everyone and that never ended. I would really recommend this boat not only as a place to stay but an experience we will have for many years to come, thanks guys :)",1,0.9348,Positive
84.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,90.0,1,5.248296102784715,4.84,4.68,4.91,4.71,28962324,"We had a great time in Alex's apartment - it was cosy, very quiet, well located and communication with him regarding check in was very smooth. The piano and the balcony were definitely perks!",1,0.858,Positive
138.0,5,0.0,1.0,3.0,39,100.0,1,2.860188071088701,4.95,4.96,4.94,4.84,17855915,"Natalie is a very nice host. She always reacted within a short time and was very helpful when our train back was cancelled. She gave us nice advise for restaurants and places to get groceries. The place is well equiped, everything we needed was there. We had a great stay. The area is very nice with long lanes and many trees. Having breakfast in a Kaffee Bar is lovely.",1,0.9656,Positive
279.0,6,3.0,1.5,5.0,47,100.0,1,2.705723759735617,4.85,4.84,4.93,4.72,12015708,"Marcus was very quick to respond to any queries and very helpful. The location is great, with plenty of cafes, restaurants and parks around.",0,0.8016,Positive
142.0,4,2.0,2.0,2.0,19,100.0,1,6.608155925105233,4.83,4.94,4.85,4.76,10423394,"This flat was clean and comfortable, and on a great street with really good restaurants.  Also close to trains and buses. Also, the staff at the Jugendhotel were really helpful.",1,0.9467,Positive
120.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,46,100.0,1,9.29605165579442,4.73,4.85,4.66,4.6,3047076,La estadía fue perfecta y el departamento es muy acogedor. Fai nos recibió personalmente y fue muy profesional y amable. No duden en tomar este departamento ya que está muy bien ubicado y tranquilo. Gracias Fai por todo. ,1,0.0516,Positive
62.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,13.74496071566584,4.86,4.57,4.79,4.59,18365897,"I book this place last minute when I was supposed to head over to Poznan but miss my bus and decided to settle in Berlin for 2 nights before flying back to Singapore. I believed things happened for a reason and that’s why I met Hanna! <br/>She is a wonderful lady who felt like a Mother too. I can’t stop tearing when I am leaving the place. Not to mentioned my favourite German sherped who I named him travel dog! So lovely and gentle and always want to be there for you! <br/>The room is really spacious with a huge desk, one double bed and one day bed. Big mirrors! <br/>Just beside the room is the shower room that provides everything. <br/>The house is just 2 minutes away from the train station and supermarket. You can get to the centre very easily as well and takes roughly 20 minutes! The place is just 20 minutes away from the airport! <br/> Use Google maps! Accurate information! <br/>You can get to potsdam easily too! <br/>I will miss Hanna and will recommend everybody this place! <br/>I was lucky that day as she actually came back from her one month trip and accepted my request! <br/>Thank you Hanna! <br/>Loves winder/ Apple.",1,0.9907,Positive
246.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,19,100.0,0,4.510420498800499,4.9,4.72,4.86,4.69,8500483,Love this place possibly my favorite ever !,1,0.8172,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,56,100.0,1,12.669101059069094,4.87,4.63,4.79,4.76,604213813500842811,Süße Wohnung mit allem was man braucht. Öffentliche Verkehrsmittel super zu erreichen. Großstadt und trotzdem grün. Wir kommen gerne wieder.,1,0.5994,Positive
81.0,2,1.0,1.0,3.0,34,90.0,1,8.758840073119789,4.73,4.93,4.57,4.8,36612997,"En la casa de Baerbel te sentirás como en casa. Una familia amable dispuesta a ayudarte en todo momento y a aconsejarte.<br/>Hemos pasado unos días super agradables en su casa, tranquila, alejada del ruido de la ciudad y bien comunicada.<br/>Muy buen alojamiento. Lo recomendamos !!",1,0.6688,Positive
