42.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,1,6.630571783489192,4.87,4.84,4.81,4.75,3509628,"Sabine's place is wonderful - clean, modern, and conveniently located. But what really makes it special is Sabine. She (and her husband) are friendly, helpful, and enthusiastic hosts. We arrived in Berlin several hours earlier than expected. Sabine said no problem, come over and leave your luggage while the apartment was cleaned. I recommend her and her place VERY HIGHLY. She is the best.",1,0.9746,Positive
80.0,1,0.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,8.131943711690111,4.89,4.85,4.68,4.79,42301772,Lin's place was great and she communicated with me to make sure my stay was pleasant and that I found everything with no issue. I would definitely stay here again when I'm in Berlin.,1,0.8807,Positive
