106.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,1.999602020466568,4.9,4.81,4.91,4.81,1191170483930849390,"Had a great stay at Joshua's place - the apartment is lovely and clean, and in a quiet area. It's also close by to supermarkets, great restaurants, shops, and tram/underground stations.<br/>Joshua also helped with lots of great Berlin recommendations, couldn't be better!",1,0.9564,Positive
