160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,98.0,0,1.0407544919436775,4.54,4.66,4.77,4.45,34294913,"Very nice and clean apartment, perfect for a short stay!",1,0.8764,Positive
47.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,54,90.0,0,3.8540959910854826,4.94,4.9,4.84,4.91,27122904,"We had a great stay at Peter’s apartment! It is in a great area surrounded by public transport and restaurants while not being too busy or loud at night. Peter’s apartment was lovely and even better than described with a lovely bathroom, kitchen and bedroom. Peter and Vera rent out another room in their apartment which is worth noting but it didn’t bother us at all as they had 2 bathrooms etc. Despite us being in Berlin when it was having a heatwave, the apartment was cool and nice to come back to after a hot day. We had a great stay and would stay again if we come back to Berlin as it is an excellent price for the space provided and they were friendly hosts.",1,0.985,Positive
144.0,3,1.0,1.0,3.0,18,99.0,0,8.88272809968877,4.17,4.28,4.69,4.24,46114906,"Hôtel bien situé, adapté à un séjour de courte durée. Permet une arrivée très tardive ce qui est positif ! Néanmoins nous avons été un peu déçus par la chambre un peu glauque par rapport aux photos et il y avait des moustiques",1,0.0,Neutral
150.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,0,2.1186829688508024,4.71,4.79,4.92,4.59,10305300,"We very much enjoyed our stay at Veronika’s place. The apartment is comfortable, had all the amenities listed, was clean and is very well located. It is close to both the u-Bahn and tram. There were also extra supplies in the kitchen. There was clear information about checking-in and checking out.",1,0.927,Positive
422.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,14,100.0,0,6.547130135601363,4.8,4.8,4.4,4.8,7807397,"Great apartment, even better than the pictures. <br/><br/>The space is large and comfortable, with sunlight for most of the day. It is very well taken care of, carefully decorated, with lots of details all around. I must highlight the confy lounge-chairs, that invite you to sit and relax, every time you see them.<br/>Kitchen is fully equipped, for cooking either a light or much more elaborated meal.<br/><br/>Ivan is really friendly, during my stay he was very flexible, helpful and was always available.<br/><br/>I had a wonderful stay, I definitely recommend this for anyone going to Berlin.",1,0.99,Positive
40.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,0,4.397184687831313,4.72,4.81,4.5,4.71,30230330,"es war sehr schön und sauber, wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt :)",1,-0.2263,Negative
