64.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,59,100.0,1,2.578564642470654,4.97,4.99,4.93,4.96,7849188,"Unser Aufenthalt bei Bernd war rundum perfekt und eines meiner besten Airbnb-Erlebnisse: Von der Kommunikation vorm ""Check-In"", dem Empfang mit Schokolade, Stadtplänen und Insidertipps für die vielen Restaurants; der angesichts der zentralen Lage sehr ruhigen Nächte bis zu Bernds Unkompliziertheit (nicht zu vergessen die Kaffeemaschine!) haben wir eine sehr entspannte Zeit in Berlin verbracht.<br/>Vielen Dank dafür, Bernd!",1,-0.9229,Negative
200.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,16,100.0,1,5.785969979324449,4.91,4.82,4.91,4.91,888290787020689320,"A perfect place, thanks again for a wonderful stay",1,0.8834,Positive
421.0,8,3.0,1.0,4.0,47,100.0,0,13.34490218851002,4.52,4.45,4.1,4.39,51440354,"The collaboration was good, we highly recommend it.",0,0.6901,Positive
93.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,2.54678149398414,4.86,4.96,4.9,4.84,3187735,"We had a wonderful stay at Barbara's apartment - as well as being beautifully decorated it was very central and the tram was only a few mins walk away... The bed was extremely comfortable and we didn't want for everything in the apartment .. On the day we left we presumed  we were to be out by 11 even though our flights were that evening - as there was no booking that day Barbara very kindly said he could stay on the extra hours - this really saved us from dragging our bags around the city as we did our last bits of shopping .., would definitely recommend - Thank you Barbara ",1,0.9749,Positive
