13.0,3,2.0,1.0,1.0,16,100.0,1,12.384366305084049,4.77,4.48,4.86,4.83,1274386,"Christian is a wonderful host, helpful, kind and generous. The apartment is on the 4th floor which is great for added exercise and is lovely and warm, very comfortable bed. The apartment is only a couple of minutes' walk from the airport bus which is 10 minutes from airport.  A few minutes walk from nearest ubahn (7) and other bus routes. There is a nearby palace and beautiful park. I stayed at Christian's for over 3 weeks and next time I am in Berlin will most definitely be checking into Christian's warm and welcoming apartment.",1,0.9893,Positive
151.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,94.0,0,3.1018817858877528,4.67,4.77,4.78,4.52,721527807549293451,My room was very clean and really appreciated the fact they had a laundry room and locker to store our luggage after checkout as our flight was a couple of hours later. <br/>The only downside i would say is the air con didn't work as well when the room was hot but it was minor and we opened the door in the night to cool the room down.  <br/>No complaints would use this hotel again.,1,0.1989,Positive
