64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,14.59679986574126,4.93,4.96,4.7,4.83,17841139,"This is the best Airbnb I have ever been in!!! The room is super clean and provided with everything you need from towels to even sugar in your room. There is also a corner with personal microwave, boiler, fridge , toaster ecc. This lady and her house it's  really 5 stars place to stay in Berlin. The house is new and the shower is amazing. Public transportation is only 10 min walk and also the supermarket. Without doubt I recommend Halka!!!",1,0.9499,Positive
