179.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,53,100.0,1,1.5908743671328385,4.96,4.93,4.88,4.86,26487848,"This is the best AirBnb I have ever stayed at - it is even more beautiful than the pictures and gets amazing natural light. The apartment has everything you need and is very tastefully put together. The location is central but is also surprisingly quiet at night. My partner and I enjoyed it so much that we extended our stay, and Julia was very flexible and accommodating. Highly recommend!",1,0.9697,Positive
