239.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,44,100.0,1,3.310054431410718,5.0,5.0,5.0,4.96,1322675067999669759,Werner is a great and responsive host. The apartment is so spacious - and everywhere scrupulously clean. We absolutely loved our stay. Easy walking distance of fantastic corner shop and one of the best bakeries in Berlin - straight out the door and up the street every morning for coffee and fantastic cake/pastries! Street is so quiet - didn’t hear any passing traffic - and lovely neighbourhood. Can’t fault our stay and so looking forward to staying again - thanks Werner ❤️,0,0.9872,Positive
