185.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,2.6131521833983453,4.8,4.92,4.9,4.65,28510393,"CALMA hotel was great as I needed to book somewhere for my mother to stay after she had a fall. It is a great location. <br/>However - Airbnb continually refused to comply with our needs for travel insurance, so Airbnb was the issue here, the hotel was great and we will book again with out the assistance of Airbnb.",1,0.9022,Positive
