114.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,47,100.0,1,16.22805984481168,4.86,4.69,4.83,4.79,889232333992340685,"Für uns eine prima Unterkunft mit allem was man braucht in toller Lage ganz nah im Grünen am Tegeler See. Die Promenade gegenüber bietet durch kleine Cafés und Restaurants schönes Ambiente zum Frühstücken ohne überfüllt zu sein. Ron ist ein sehr bemühter und freundlicher Gastgeber. Trotzdessen dass man sich die Wohnung teilt, haben wir große Privatsphäre genossen.",1,-0.8481,Negative
53.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,1,7.080626051599838,4.85,4.87,4.6,4.78,24303386,"The space was absolutely perfect for my residency for school. I had everything I needed to cook small meals, and the refrigerator had a small freezer which was very nice! <br/>The bathroom had a nice, full sized shower and the bedroom was comfortable and clean. <br/>I stayed for two weeks and Mina had the apartment cleaned for me halfway through. <br/>The courtyard is private, cozy, and lovely to enjoy a book and a beer. <br/>I will definitely look into staying here again!",1,0.9787,Positive
