64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,100.0,0,12.901074216761966,4.92,4.7,4.89,4.92,24227976,"Tom's flat is very well located and a special place with beautiful furniture, comfortable bed, books everywhere and cozy atmosphere.  We've stayed there only for one night, but it was so pleasant that I plan to return next time I am in Berlin. And Tom was a very friendly, patient guest. We've got lost in the city, couldn't get internet connection and arrived very late at his flat, but he was waiting for us with a smile and a cup of hot herbal tea.  I highly recommend Tom's place!",1,0.972,Positive
