202.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,1,13.496650489854977,4.98,5.0,4.96,4.91,51340217,Our stay was wonderful in Berlin. The location was great. The only negatIive I would say is that there is no Lyft which made getting our luggage up the first day 5 flights of stairs and down the last day very difficult. We were there 10 days so we had big suitcases. Paolo is a super host and his place is charming. Thank you Paolo!,1,0.936,Positive
