304.0,12,3.0,4.0,12.0,46,100.0,0,4.0239324951720725,4.67,4.4,4.76,4.63,38892522,"Super Entspanntes Loft, sehr zu empfehlen",0,0.5994,Positive
228.0,11,4.0,2.0,6.0,45,100.0,0,6.598731823979877,4.59,4.52,4.55,4.52,1370298258326236024,"Unfortunately this experience was a classic case of ‘don’t judge a book by its cover’. 2 hour delay on check in due to a faulty lock, and a lot of issues with locking the door each night. Paint fumes made downstairs very uncomfortable to sleep in. Staff were responsive and tried their best to resolve issues, but really - this property is not ready to host guests. <br/>Felt like everything wrong with the AirBnb model. Slap a coat of paint on it and hope they don’t complain. Made us wish we had just booked a commercial hotel.<br/>If you want to do nothing but throw house parties and stay up all night watching the door - this is your spot. If you want comfort and security, pay a bit more and stay anywhere else.",0,0.9159,Positive
90.0,2,3.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,1,0.7053599912648324,4.98,4.96,4.93,4.87,1081373049142109426,"Peter was wonderful. He is very knowledgeable, very nice, knows hidden gems, flexible. His condo is spacious, super clean, comfortable, and nice shower. Many thanks for making us feel at home and for the goodies in the bathroom. It is the perfect location as it  is central to the train station and walkable all over. There are 2 great grocery stores around the corner. Highly recommend staying here.",1,0.9879,Positive
