68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,92.0,1,4.424176503712602,4.91,4.98,4.81,4.79,23298585,Rehanna is a very sweet and available host. The bed is comfortable and the apartment is quite cool in the summer which meant that we didn’t suffer from the heat inside. We had a little balcony in our room that was a cosy space to drink coffee in the morning. The kitchen has all one needs and it’s also very pleasant to spend time in it as it spacious and clean.,1,0.8996,Positive
