214.0,9,3.0,1.0,5.0,48,100.0,0,2.4338131448817624,4.69,4.67,4.71,4.58,23290410,"Fantastic place with a great location. Wonderful host. We loved the building. It is an office building with a very convenient elevator. It is quite calm and coming in at night or leaving early is no issue, since in such an office building, nobody is around during those times. Supermarket is in the next building. Very convenient!!! Also little street food restaurants all around the area. Fantastic. We would definately like to come back sometime.",0,0.9741,Positive
