276.0,3,2.0,2.0,3.0,61,100.0,1,9.076307917104932,4.82,4.77,4.76,4.71,44223601,"Great hotel, we stayed in the apartments. The hotel and the apartment where spotlessly clean, includes shower, shampoo and conditioner - the two bathrooms worked so well in our group of three. The pool is little but we still had a refreshing swim and a sauna, towels and slippers provided - a great end to the day sightseeing. The staff were all very helpful, and spoke excellent English for us.<br/>I would totally recommend this hotel.<br/>The hotel is between 5 and 10 mins walk to many restaurants, and just round the corner from the shops. Its about a 20 min taxi to the Tower.<br/>Uber was so helpful for our journey, always easy to get and reasonably priced.",0,0.987,Positive
