62.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,1,7.753624515540955,4.83,4.83,4.83,4.79,5536095,"We was there with two kids. A 1,5 and a 4,5 year old. Everything was very nice. The apartman is so quiet and peacful, the area is perfect with families, a nice park with playgrounds is next to the house. And very easy to reach the city center, the underground which go there is about 5 minutes walk.",1,0.9252,Positive
237.0,12,3.0,1.5,7.0,76,100.0,1,5.630012025075561,4.83,4.76,4.7,4.75,179102,"Alke was a great host and Marina welcomed us and showed us the apartment and all the thing that we could use there.<br/>The apartment is super cool, with a great light. All rooms are big. Great design and paintings. And the view !! Woo.<br/>Thank you again. We had a great stay in Berlin thanks to you.",0,0.9826,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,1.3773060525895495,4.72,4.84,4.91,4.66,1461489656921679773,Amazing stay,1,0.5859,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,31,100.0,0,0.7153474208381966,4.81,4.65,4.92,4.63,12016452,"Would highly recommend this apartment - a lovely place, in a vibrant area close to both public transport and cafes, bars and restaurants. Sonja's directions from the airport were invaluable and her communication was prompt and friendly. We had a fantastic weekend!",1,0.9523,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,18,100.0,0,2.2309100217625213,4.29,3.31,4.94,4.33,35261758,"really gorgeous place, beautiful windows looking out, really authentic! just needs a tad bit of a clean but apart from that, no problems at all! lovely area and really easy to find!",1,0.902,Positive
92.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,0,13.963261489616256,4.57,4.67,4.58,4.53,6101399,"Insgesamt hat es uns gut gefallen und wir haben uns wohl gefühlt. Die Lage ist perfekt mit vielen Einkaufsmöglichkeiten in der Nähe. Man sollte allerdings genau auf die Check-in Zeit achten, die um 15 Uhr und nicht ab 15 Uhr ist. Das hat leider am Anfang für etwas Verwirrung gesorgt, da wir später angereist sind.",1,-0.9136,Negative
