422.0,16,7.0,5.0,10.0,55,100.0,1,6.474155287757895,4.93,4.86,4.66,4.85,13666450,"Werner's flat was amazing, the perfect place for a big group looking to explore Berlin. He was a brilliant host and we'll definitely be back.",0,0.9325,Positive
163.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,93.0,0,1.8809199957672955,4.77,4.85,4.44,4.63,1073171966820835835,"Complesso di appartamenti zona abbastanza centrale, molto carino",1,0.0,Neutral
122.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,45,100.0,1,15.46531196615534,4.86,4.83,4.81,4.75,19499351,"Nous avons passé un excellent moment dans ce bel appartement lumineux et cosy.<br/>Henning et Ariane sont très réactifs.<br/>Tout était parfait, merci encore pour votre accueil !",1,0.6114,Positive
76.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,20,99.0,0,2.1897939786653327,4.39,4.47,4.8,4.37,37079665,"Nice area with a tasty coffee shop around where you could enjoy a nice breakfast, also really easy to get around (Berlin is a very connected city in the sense of public transportation - but pricey) .  The apartment is not an apartment, i think it was a hotel before they started to use it as airbnb, it's a small room with limited number of plugs (not enough for two travelling people). Also NO HEATING, we were traveling in February so it was quite cold outside,  but inside seamed colder, something you would think is impossible. When we asked to get the heat higher they said that is not possible (HUGE LIE) and they sent one little electrical heater that basically was a hot iron inside a plastic ball and a ventilator to blow semi-hot air, and that's not all, the noise was unbearable, so no way u can sleep through that, in the bathroom no heating BIG 0. Beside that, the city is interesting very different from what you would expect from a German city.",1,-0.5929,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,4.168720527955252,4.92,4.9,4.82,4.82,49845622,Good value apartment in a great location. Mathias is also a brilliant host and even welcomed my friend and me with a couple beers.,1,0.9571,Positive
82.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,6.919397234051426,4.85,4.87,4.48,4.72,20881101,"Babett's apartment was lovely, clean and comfortable and located in a perfect neighborhood near lots of cool cafes, restaurants, and shopping. It was also minutes away from Berlin's main attractions and near several metro and bus stations. As a bonus, the place was well stocked with all imaginable appliances and amenities for a convenient stay. Even when we asked for a new hairdryer, it was delivered to us personally in just minutes. We are so glad we chose this apartment because it made our stay in Berlin extra special.",1,0.983,Positive
80.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,0,3.822337340646882,4.86,4.69,4.88,4.75,26245413,"Iwona hat superschnell auf meine sehr kurzfristige Anfrage reagiert. Ich wurde sehr herzlich empfangen, es hat alles reibungslos geklappt, die Wohnung war sehr sauber. In der Wohnung roch es nach Rauch (aber nicht in dem Zimmer, in dem ich geschlafen habe). Ich danke Iwona für ihre Gastfreundschaft!",1,-0.8439,Negative
129.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,21,100.0,0,6.825652376645098,4.89,4.92,4.9,4.76,21237781,Huge apartment with lots of light!,1,0.3802,Positive
108.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,70,100.0,1,2.641127618215382,4.96,4.94,4.95,4.88,267951,Tolles großes Apartment mit bemerkenswerter Ausstattung in bester Lage. <br/>Frank war zu jeder Zeit schnell zu erreichen und dabei immer freundlich und hilfsbereit.<br/>Wir kommen gerne wieder :),1,-0.2263,Negative
276.0,3,2.0,2.0,3.0,61,100.0,1,9.076307917104932,4.82,4.77,4.76,4.71,44223601,"Appartement:<br/>Großzügig<br/>Klimaanlage<br/>Gute Abdunklung in der Nacht<br/>Sehr leise mit geschlossenen Fenstern<br/>Küche<br/>Kaffeemaschine mit Nespresso Pads<br/>2 Badezimmer, 1xDusche, 1x Badewanne<br/>SEHRSEHRSEHR viel Ablagemöglickeiten im Bad und Schränken.<br/>2 TV<br/>Shampoo, Seifen, Condotioner, Zahnbürsten, Kamm, Föhn... alles vorhanden 🫶🏼<br/>Hübsche Lobby<br/>Hoteleigene Tiefgarage:<br/>Top, was will man mehr. Kosten/Tag 25€<br/>Gute ÖV Möglichkeiten",0,-0.5423,Negative
132.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,90.0,0,12.295920174570211,4.23,4.69,4.77,4.31,32544078,"Das Zimmer entsprach der Beschreibung und den Fotos Unrenovierte Altbauwohnung, aber sauber. Kein Ansprechpartner vor Ort. Preis-Leistung stimmt nicht. Die Dame beim Check-in war am Telefon sehr sehr unfreundlich. Sie gab mir das Gefühl, dass Airbnb Gäste notwendiges Übel sind. Ich bekam auch gleich noch gesagt, dass sich Übernachtungen für 1 Nacht nicht lohnten. Ich habe mich noch nie so unwillkommen gefühlt. Die Dame beim Checkout, die anscheinend das Frühstück zubereitet, war sehr freundlich.",1,-0.9661,Negative
169.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,96.0,0,4.794147054534518,4.46,4.46,4.54,4.32,34465926,"Perfect location! You could find all the best bars, restaurants and shops nearby. The apartment was really clean. They also had a reception that could help us during the day if any problems occurred. Would recommend!",1,0.9322,Positive
93.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,2.54678149398414,4.86,4.96,4.9,4.84,3187735,"Our experience of Barbara's apartment was excellent from start to finish. Barbara met us at the arranged time and gave us a thorough tour of this small but perfectly formed apartment. The pictures show the apartment exactly as you find it, note that the bed is a fold away wall bed but is very comfortable nonetheless. The apartment is equipped with everything you will need during your stay. Barbara was an excellent host who gave us a guide to the local area which is quite residential but has a few great cafes/bars along with a large supermarket just round the corner. <br/>A short (approx 5 mins) walk to the tram stop, and only 3 stops to transport hub Alexanderplatz.",1,0.9721,Positive
60.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,45,100.0,1,3.689600261518912,4.74,4.55,4.76,4.65,16237052,Fantastic apartment and a very helpful host. We had a really great time and would highly recommend to other guests,1,0.931,Positive
256.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,62,100.0,0,1.4337681418206727,4.62,4.56,4.93,4.61,35242748,"the apt is in a strategic place to move around the whole city. full of light, big, cozy and super clean. and a beautiful view  of berlin! the guys let us also an early check in and a luggage storage which literally save our trip. no doubt, 5 stars guys. thank you!!",0,0.9243,Positive
166.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,16,50.0,0,8.694176238638248,4.7,4.55,4.81,4.41,22495883,The houseboat was great - we stayed there for one night and loved it.,1,0.8402,Positive
76.0,2,1.0,1.0,8.0,26,99.0,0,1.47112525778762,4.6,4.5,4.48,4.58,1565047,"Good hostal, very nice staff, good instalations, good location. I totally recommend it.",1,0.9339,Positive
99.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,0,14.270365576459383,4.78,4.73,4.77,4.69,11374200,"Schoon, netjes, goede bedden. Dicht bij ov en supermarkt. Rustige buurt. Voor ons ruim genoeg, we konden in de slaapkamer ook nog twee campingbedjes kwijt. Parkeerplaats ook erg fijn. Aankleding van de ruimte is vooral functioneel. Enige kleine verbeterpunt: de koekenpannen waren wat aan de kleine kant, daardoor vergde het bereiden van onze maaltijd wat creativiteit.",1,0.0,Neutral
40.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,11,98.0,0,2.4809600042725424,4.56,4.5,4.85,4.64,35816059,Zu dem Preis wirklich Super.<br/>War zwar nur eine Nacht dort hätten aber auch gern mehr sein können. Sauber höflich und schnelle Abwicklung… was will man mehr?,1,0.0,Neutral
373.0,12,4.0,2.0,14.0,30,100.0,1,2.6480538372543863,4.93,4.9,4.93,4.81,504259,"Heel fijn verblijf bij Alexandra. Appartement is super voor een grote groep. Mooie keuken, leuke kelder met biljarttafel en een hele leuke buurt met allemaal gezellige barretjes<br/>Enige verbeterpunt waren de dekens. Deze waren een beetje oud en smoezelig. <br/>Bedankt voor het fijne verblijf. Ik raad het iedereen aan.",0,0.5994,Positive
35.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,51,100.0,0,3.642892493197811,4.95,4.96,4.8,4.93,304904,Wir hatten einen tollen Aufenthalt und haben uns super wohl gefühlt. Andreas und seine Frau sind super Gastgeber. Wir kommen auf jeden Fall wieder wenn wir mal wieder in Berlin sind.,1,0.8316,Positive
94.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,95.0,1,4.513443039819955,4.61,4.31,4.75,4.57,53961297,"Un logement calme au milieu d'un parc et assez central de tout ce qu'on peut faire à Berlin, que ce soit à vélo (notre principal moyen de transport grâce à la location via Simon) ou en transports en communs très bien desservis. Je recommande sans problème.",1,-0.128,Negative
