168.0,8,3.0,2.0,4.0,38,100.0,0,21.50851113016653,4.6,4.62,4.81,4.36,26701296,"Sehr  unkomplizierte und direkte Kommunikation, auf Fragen wurde super schnell geantwortet. Vor Ort wurden wir persönlich empfangen und aufgenommen. <br/>Durch seperaten Eingang hatten wir das kleinere Haus direkt neben der Villa für uns. wir kommen gerne wieder!!",0,0.6688,Positive
48.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,8.38062533349986,4.75,4.84,4.54,4.67,22318827,"The place is big and charming, the decoration is nice and all the furniture is in great shape, it has everything to feel truly at home. There are many grocery stores near, and the bus and metro station are just a few blocks away. I don't have any complains, the price is fair for the size and location of the space.",1,0.9449,Positive
131.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,0,2.319079304594608,4.91,4.85,4.89,4.85,44363134,I felt like this was my home away from home.  I appreciated how clean and beautifully decorated the apartment is. <br/>Communications prior to my visit and about check in and check out were very thorough.  The building is quiet.  Excellent location.,1,0.9423,Positive
62.0,3,1.0,1.0,3.0,30,100.0,0,4.614969004067335,4.37,4.28,4.43,4.4,323259,Really nice apartment and friendly host,1,0.7425,Positive
125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,1,2.465550130132776,4.95,4.92,4.97,4.9,11119527,"Es war alles super, genau wie auf den Fotos!<br/>Tolle Organisation, Wohnung und Lage!<br/>So macht ein Städtetrip Spaß!",1,0.0,Neutral
