58.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,38,100.0,0,3.77601590718314,4.73,4.67,4.73,4.63,29721020,Wonderful stay. Pascal quick to respond with messages when required. A clean apartment with comfy beds and a reliable hot shower. Kitchen has everything you need. 5 minute walk from U bahn 6 stops away takes you to the main shopping area. Would highly recommend.,1,0.8221,Positive
242.0,4,2.0,2.0,2.0,40,93.0,1,2.200766127261005,4.82,4.69,4.94,4.71,8396454,"Our stay was great! El and John were a huge help. The flat is within a very short walking distance from multiple hip bars and different types of restaurants. It is also situated directly next to the Berlin Wall!Apartment was clean, safe, spacious and had a nice porch. The only reason I did not give a 5/5 is because the washing machine was hard to use and El and John were unable to offer help. The door locked on its own and we couldn't get our clothes out for awhile and the dryer is weak. Other than that we had a tremendous stay!",0,0.9499,Positive
49.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,1,11.676754989143994,4.78,4.92,4.82,4.7,551848896911307140,"Das Haus findet sich ganz nah von der S- und U-Bahn, und vom Zentrum. Frau Neumann ist sehr nett und hilfsbereit.",1,-0.1027,Negative
125.0,1,1.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,1,1.2721418429169693,4.97,4.99,4.97,4.9,20415517,"We had a great stay. The house is very complete. The hosts are very friendly and helpful. It's a good location too, quiet but close to the city center. Overall we would definitely recommend!",1,0.9309,Positive
160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,87.0,0,3.4802565088356308,4.54,4.54,4.6,4.41,43798011,Good place and good communication .,1,0.7003,Positive
35.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,0,18.784010280879883,4.75,4.7,4.54,4.67,26177003,"They should expect a very clean, calm and quiet place in addition to a wonderful host (Susanna) who is devoted to making her clientele happy and satisfied at all time.",1,0.955,Positive
70.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,7.041900626314951,4.89,4.97,4.79,4.81,15107151,"Ich habe die Unterkunft für meine Eltern gebucht und für sie war die perfekt.  Bei Michael und seine Familie ist es sehr angenehm und sauber! Die Umgebung ist grün und ruhig, in unmittelbarer nähe von Tram, Bus und Supermarket. Einziges Manco: Supernettes Zimmer im Dachgeschoss während sich das Bad in den Keller befindet.",1,-0.9656,Negative
162.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,58,100.0,1,4.656526733575578,4.83,4.75,4.76,4.6,39622669,We enjoyed Jacob’s place very much - it had all one can need. The cute sunny balcony was a treat! Would definitely recommend and come back.,1,0.9459,Positive
149.0,5,1.0,1.0,2.0,8,81.0,0,6.714128192155476,4.17,4.26,4.03,4.17,1223091910763945275,Alles super.Gerne wieder.,1,0.0,Neutral
100.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,1,4.210492640107876,4.86,4.84,4.77,4.73,12060184,"We hadden een heerlijk verblijf in het appartement van Ralph. Ralph is een heel aanspreekbare persoon.<br/>Het appartement is een deel van een heel mooi pand met een geweldige binnentuin.  Jammer dat we daar niet van konden genieten gezien het feit dat het winter was. <br/>We hebben wat attributen uit de andere ruimtes in de woonkamer gezet om het wat gezelliger te maken en dat werkte.<br/>Wij houden van de vintage spulletjes die Ralph heeft. <br/>Wat heel fijn is is dat het appartement een heerlijk bad heeft waarin het heerlijk vertoeven is na een lange dag Berlijn bij -8 C. <br/>Het appartement ligt gunstig tov leuke wijken, de muur, tegenover een mooi park. metro en supermarkt om de hoek. Heerlijke Italiaan in de straat.<br/>Al met al zijn we zeer tevreden. en hadden een geweldige week in Berlijn.",1,-0.8126,Negative
175.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,91.0,0,4.861047682375263,4.69,4.77,4.83,4.57,53744550,"Cooles Zimmer in einer Top-Lage. Wichtig: es handelt sich wirklich nur um ein Zimmer mit Bett, Schalfcouch, kleiner Küchennische und einem separaten, kleinen Bad. Die Bilder täuschen ein wenig darüber hinweg und man bekommt den Eindruck, es sei größer und das z.B. die Couch in einem anderen Raum stehen würde. Das war ein bisschen ernüchternd, berücksichtigt man den Preis. Der Rest hat aber gepasst. Eine Klimaanlage wäre noch super.",1,-0.9062,Negative
202.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,0,1.7550869170780552,4.48,4.65,4.91,4.39,20858,"Very spacious and airy, comfortable and great location.",1,0.8126,Positive
135.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,41,100.0,0,1.921115965369865,4.5,4.43,4.85,4.5,53811686,"Le logement fut idéal pour un séjour de 5 jours, il était proche de tout. La communication avec Eugen a été très facile ! Rien à redire, tout s’est bien déroulé:)",1,-0.3164,Negative
375.0,8,3.0,2.0,3.0,54,100.0,0,5.932736614497751,4.63,4.64,4.53,4.49,24690410,"Modern, clean and spacious apartment! We had the 3 bedroom suite for our group of 4 adults and 3 kids. We would highly recommend a stay here, in any of the apartments. <br/>While we were not able to take advantage of the breakfast delivery service due to Covid, we appreciated the staff’s help in doing a load of laundry, helping us get a bus pass on our first day, tips on good restaurants and the closest grocery market. <br/>Location is brilliant, with dozens of great bistros, street food, bakeries nearby. Recommend “Queen of muffins” for morning smoothies and healthy muffins. Recommend Panama for a nice dinner 2 shops down from the apartment. Easy to access the U-Bahn in either direction. <br/>We had a small, senior dog and 3 kids travelling in our group and we also appreciated the friendly and accommodating cleaning staff.",0,0.9921,Positive
284.0,12,3.0,1.0,4.0,56,100.0,1,9.660413858650209,4.9,4.94,4.46,4.76,16280687,Fantastic stay in a lovely area.,0,0.8126,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,59,100.0,0,5.262970158114211,4.93,4.85,4.83,4.82,31182753,Danke für den kurzen aber sehr netten Aufenthalt :),1,0.4588,Positive
98.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,22,100.0,1,3.1634061354496827,4.83,4.82,4.8,4.56,32678196,"It’s such a great space in a fun neighborhood, everything you need is close!",1,0.8268,Positive
200.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,38,100.0,0,1.8498038499447296,4.67,4.65,4.88,4.42,1131692549156539593,Good place and <br/>Clean room,0,0.4404,Positive
139.0,5,1.0,1.0,3.0,40,100.0,1,3.707448550101749,4.87,4.87,4.78,4.65,1423092606962239877,"A great find - would definitely book again when visiting Berlin. The apartment is in a great location, very clean and has everything you need. Simons instructions were very clear and he was very helpful with any questions. A very good price for a lovely apartment!",1,0.9802,Positive
318.0,8,3.0,1.5,5.0,53,100.0,1,3.7256422035937673,4.95,4.94,4.85,4.83,13320037,"Sven apartment was very well located, with spacious and cleaned rooms, and a nice kitchen with everything you could need to enjoy a lunch or dinner. We’ve felt very relaxed and we have moved around walking because the apartment is near to the most important places in Berlin.  The communication was great although our flight landed one hour later unspectedly",0,0.9522,Positive
