281.0,11,2.0,2.0,7.0,38,100.0,0,2.6273034085348907,4.74,4.77,4.81,4.72,1188235303253843746,"Group of 6 lads over to watch the Euro 24 final. Really nice, clean apartment in a great location, right next to underground, trams, and shops. Ori was very helpful with information on how to check in and made the process very easy.",0,0.9473,Positive
