283.0,8,4.0,2.0,5.0,26,100.0,1,3.2911892621409478,4.87,4.9,5.0,4.83,1052109745197564370,"The property was just as described. Easy walking distance from both Friedrichstraße train station and an underground station, which meant we were able to easily access the city. Lots of cafes on the street, and restaurants just round the corner. The Boros Collection housed in the WW2 bunker across the road is well worth a visit (need to book in advance!)",0,0.8221,Positive
125.0,4,3.0,1.0,2.0,23,67.0,0,5.986361313227163,5.0,4.81,4.75,4.81,19629528,"The place is really stunning. Super stylish space, everything one can need is available. Wonderful location close to the park, Bergmannstraße and shops. Simone and Stefan are wonderful hosts, very welcoming, all communications was great. Highly recommend.",1,0.9765,Positive
