60.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,1,9.41240835034284,4.95,4.98,4.74,4.89,18069548,"Charlotte's apartment has everything you need, is clean and comfortable, and convenient also for longer stays. Charlotte is a very nice host and makes sure to put in every extra effort to make her guests feel welcome and at home. The location is perfect with easy access to public transportation, shops, and restaurants. I highly recommend this place!",1,0.9722,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,1,5.762669525923033,4.95,4.98,4.88,4.8,38404991,"Markus was a great host, very responsive and accommodating. His place is very modern and clean and in a great locations for restaurants, shopping, and bars. Would definitely recommend!",1,0.9609,Positive
