312.0,11,3.0,1.0,4.0,42,100.0,1,9.660413858650209,4.92,4.94,4.44,4.83,16237757,"Ben and Simon’s place was really excellent: clean, spacious and nicely decorated. It’s also very close to bus stations and an S-bahn stop, so it’s easy to use thenplace as a base from which to explore Berlin. There was coffee, tea, sparkling water, and even a small bottle of prosecco complementary and available upon arrival. My group of 6 all wish we could have stayed longer. Overall a first rate place to stay in Berlin.",0,0.9408,Positive
