76.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,1,5.339352686328167,4.8,4.87,4.74,4.63,2098124,"We had the most incredible weekend in Berlin which was only made better by staying in this apartment. It was absolutely stunning! It is much more spacious than it looks and is spotlessly clean. The location was ideal for us, just a five minute walk from the metro and a short walk to all the amazing bars and restaurants in the area! I managed to get some shopping in a nearby Kreuzberg vintage market which made be very happy! I stayed here with 2 of my friends and we had more the enough space and some much comfort and our host was super attentive and always available when we had a question. I highly recommend this property and if I go back to Berlin I will absolutely try to stay here! The perfect place for a perfect weekend! ",1,0.9909,Positive
