64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,13.088231838082732,4.89,4.76,4.67,4.83,18195157,"Gitta is a very nice person. The room is super clean, comfortable and stylish.  The bathroom is very clean and comfortable as well. The house is very close to the bus station and the S bahn .. so you dont need to worry at all about transportation, it is close to everything. <br/>I really recommend this room, and I will choose it again in my next visit to Berlin.",1,0.9758,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,100.0,0,2.470169768821385,4.69,4.54,4.9,4.73,2377008,"Kilian made us feel very welcome. He was very hospitable and understanding of the need for young people to go out in the evening! Always willing to have a chat, we didn't feel uncomfortable at home. The neighbourhood was great. Lots of decent restaurants, not badly priced, and very cool bars too. Getting to the sites was easy with the U and S Bahn too. Thanks Kilian again for a great stay! ",1,0.9756,Positive
