34.0,1,0.0,1.0,2.0,13,100.0,0,12.81962201279346,4.89,4.78,5.0,4.33,43288289,"Everything was perfect. I used the room for 20 weeks myself. Host communication is perfect, you can message them for anything and always get a reply almost immediately. The room is fully equipped with all the necessary. The location is also good, close to the S-Bahn and it's a quiet neighbourhood. For a short stay definitely recommended!",1,0.9336,Positive
