125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,0,2.519896578191311,4.73,4.7,4.95,4.63,17312576,"I, my husband and mother had very nice time at Berlin at beautiful Selin’s apartment. The apartment very clean and cozy.  Location is the best! Museum island is a 5-minute walk away. Christmas marker are also very close. Selin is very friendly and always ready to help. We hope, we come back and stay at Selin’s house again.<br/> Best wishes, <br/>Maria, Andrei, Elvira.",1,0.9847,Positive
