69.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,0,0.6160009980511233,4.87,4.83,4.88,4.75,6550264,Daniel’s place is in a very central area that is accessible to numerous bahn and tram lines. It is an advertised and worked well for us as a couple traveling for the weekend with lots of stuff to do in Berlin! We missed our train and Daniel was accommodating with check in time and had lots of local recommendations which we appreciated. The space is just a room with a shared bathroom but it worked for us!,1,0.5242,Positive
89.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,1,2.692024625165537,4.82,4.64,4.91,4.76,29383900,"Birte ist eine sehr warmherzige Gastgeberin und ich habe mich pudelwohl bei ihr gefühlt. Die Lage ist perfekt für alle Aktivitäten und verhungern kann man in dem Bezirk auch nicht, Restaurants und Kneipen in Hülle und Fülle. Aufgelockert durch Parks ist es ein Kiez, dass pulsiert und herzenswarm wirkt. Da Birtes Wohnung in einem Hinterhof liegt, hatte ich alle Nächte durch einen ungestörten Schlaf. Birte, ich bin sooo froh, dass ich Dich gefunden habe! Du bist ein Schatz! Sehr empfehlenswerte Unterkunft Leute!",1,-0.6981,Negative
61.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,44,95.0,1,3.717179362500484,4.74,4.71,4.68,4.57,18478528,Schönes Apartment mit ruhiger Nachbarschaft. Preisleistung top nur zu empfehlen 👍🏻,1,0.2023,Positive
253.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,58,100.0,1,1.1647216829785003,4.93,4.97,4.95,4.8,1828107,"Ich weiß gar nicht, wo ich beginnen soll, sowohl die Wohnung, als auch die Präsentation der Wohnung hier auf Airbnb waren tiptop. <br/><br/>Der ganze Aufenthalt und die Hilfsbereitschaft durch Stefan waren absolute Spitze. Ich benutze diese Superlative, weil die Wohnung es einfach auch ist. Alles verlief total unkompliziert und zuvorkommend. <br/><br/>DANKE an Stefan, auf jeden fall auch zukünftig meine 1. Wahl in Berlin.<br/><br/>Liebe Grüße<br/>Erol <br/><br/>",1,-0.9485,Negative
210.0,6,2.0,1.0,5.0,45,100.0,1,5.558722407910139,4.9,4.95,4.88,4.75,20985806,"Mycket bra boende, stort och rymligt samt rent och snyggt. Svårt att få en överblick av rummen utifrån bilderna och lägenheten är större än vad den ser ut att vara på bilderna. De låga sängarna går enkelt att flytta mellan rummen om man vill sprida på sovplatserna. Bra kommunikationsmöjligheter och man tar sig från lägenheten till Alexanderplats på 20 minuter. Mycket enkelt att checka in och ut, och all övrig information från värden var snabb och tydlig.",0,0.0,Neutral
117.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,20,100.0,1,10.209896781107588,4.84,4.66,4.83,4.7,1027362900230673217,"Absolut empfehlenswerte Unterkunft in Berlin. Schön, sauber und in sehr ruhiger Lage. U-Bahn ist gleich in der Nähe. Zum Kurfürstendamm ist es nicht weit. Volker ist super nett und schreibt immer sofort zurück. Würde die Unterkunft sofort wieder buchen beim nächsten Berlin Aufenthalt.",1,0.0,Neutral
60.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,3.651055931329858,4.68,4.63,4.59,4.6,40961989,Schöner Aufenthalt in einer gemütlichen und schön eingerichteten Wohnung! Alles wie beschrieben!,1,0.0,Neutral
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,0,6.16237661417251,4.69,4.83,4.7,4.72,1192961,"This was my first experience using air BNB and I was a little nervous arriving to a city I've never been not speaking German. Arnd was great and I text him when I landed and told him I was on the way. I took the txl to hauptbahnhof and walked 10 minutes to his flat. It was easy to find. I then rang the bell at the bottom and he let me in. Arnd was very nice and helped my girlfriend carry her bag up the stairs.<br/>The room was great. There is a private entrance and bathroom. Arnd provided coffee for us and a fridge where we kept our beer. I accidentally knocked a plant over and Arnd was very kind and cleaned up the dirt I spilled. Arnd respected our privacy and remained in the adjoining room most of the time.<br/>Despite what some say, this location was great. One day we walked 30 minutes to the zoo, then after we took the s bahn to the east gallery. We then took the s bahn back to hauptbahnhof and walked back to his place. Another day we did our own little walking tour. We walked about 10 minutes to the Reich building and then to the Brandenburg gate. We then walked south to checkpoint Charlie and postdamer platz. We then headed east to alexanderplatz before hitting museum island on the way back. This took us all day and we walked about 9 miles but we were able to see quite a bit and enjoy the city. Arnd's location is a good starting and end point to do the loop of all the sites.<br/>After seeing prices from all the hotels in the area, I realized this place is a steal. I would highly recommend staying here if you are coming to Berlin. It's clean, quiet and Arnd is a nice host.",1,0.9796,Positive
125.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,29,100.0,0,4.518046062365621,4.67,4.75,4.39,4.55,960718759443282693,The accommodation was great. The location was convenient to get into the centre. Tram was directly opposite which was very handy. Would recommend.,0,0.7823,Positive
84.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,52,100.0,1,3.3219101132328723,4.81,4.81,4.9,4.73,1238867,"Nice little apartment, great location",1,0.7665,Positive
112.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,0,1.913594929863479,4.54,4.64,4.8,4.32,929010804770377239,Polinas Apartment hat uns sehr gut gefallen,1,0.0,Neutral
55.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,0.8025330705337501,4.79,4.94,4.83,4.77,11403270,"Sorry for the lateness of my review! Ece’s place was perfect for a trip in Berlin. It was right next to Alexanderplatz station which means getting to any part of the city was very, very easy. It was Ece’s mother who met me when I arrived and she was very welcoming and greeted me with a cup of coffee. I found some good places nearby to drink good beer and each morning I went to Einstein Coffee for breakfast and the coffee there was very good. I had everything I needed and I can’t think of anything more I would have wanted. I come to Berlin often to visit one of my close friends and I would definitely look to stay there again next I come. Thanks for everything, I enjoyed my stay!",1,0.9858,Positive
84.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,5.06163943405691,4.92,4.94,4.96,4.82,344856,"We had a fantastic stay in Apostolos' apartment. We would thoroughly recommend Apostolos' apartment to others and would definitely stay there again! The apartment genuinely did feel too good to be true - except that it was true! <br/><br/>Apostolos himself was incredibly welcoming and friendly. He waited patiently for us despite an annoying flight delay and our late check-in was smooth and painless.  He was very responsive as well and easy to contact. I don't think I ever waited more than one hour for a response! Being given two sets of keys was a plus as well. <br/><br/>The apartment itself is gorgeous. It is even prettier than the photos! There are beautiful tall windows, high ceilings, and plenty of mirrors which bounced light. It is very spacious. Don't be fooled by the fact that it is a studio! Most importantly, it is spotlessly clean. I particularly appreciated the range of crockery and cutlery - excellent for cooking. <br/><br/>As for location, the apartment is situated on the ground floor of a main street in F'Hain. Though the street had plenty of restaurants (shout out to Chum & Friends for fantastic Vietnamese!), it was never noisy. The apartment is a short walk (not even 5 mins) to Boxhagener Platz where there are also plenty of fantastic brunch cafes and restaurants. The apartment is also super close to U-Bahn stop Frankfurter Tor and is easily accessible. F'Hain itself is a great area (bars, restaurants, cafes) and personally I felt the apartment could not have been better located!<br/><br/>Thank you so much, Apostolos! We hope to see you again in Berlin.",1,0.9977,Positive
199.0,5,2.0,2.0,3.0,37,100.0,0,5.142408737955343,5.0,5.0,5.0,4.75,905102549825683364,"Lovely spacious stylish apartment with views over park in gorgeous area.  Lots of space to eat and relax for family of four. It is a family home which feels very comfortable for a family. Plenty of cutlery and plates and cooking equipment and space in fridge and also to put clothes.  The square outside has brilliant restaurants- we loved the Vietnamese and the Italian and Macs for takeaway. The metro is v close and v easy. The beds are quite quirky - there is two sofa beds in different reception rooms, one small double in a nook off bathroom and one double up ladder. So not for everyone but worked fine for us. But it is very light as not many curtains - so bring a sleep mask. Would recommend definitely. Lovely area and I enjoyed walking round several local parks.  Would have been great to hire bikes as everyone was cycling and little traffic. We did try local climbing centre which very friendly for kids.",0,0.9923,Positive
131.0,1,1.0,1.0,8.0,30,99.0,0,1.556410002666394,4.71,4.76,4.65,4.7,6097880,Sehr schönes Aufenthalt. Definitiv besuchenswert.,1,0.0,Neutral
282.0,9,4.0,2.0,6.0,65,100.0,1,13.891160580271904,4.81,4.67,4.72,4.66,21431134,Top Wohnung die hält was sie verspricht!,0,-0.5255,Negative
31.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,100.0,1,12.720083248666349,4.78,4.69,4.54,4.73,24154046,"Eine nette Unterkunft, etwas außerhalb vom Berlin Zentrum. Die Anbindung ins Zentrum ist durch die nahegelegene Bahn und Straßenbahn super. Der Check-in war sehr unkompliziert und die Gastgeber sind sehr freundlich. <br/>Auf das geteilte Bad im Erdgeschoss muss man sich entsprechend einstellen, ist aber alles kein Problem. <br/>Insgesamt ist die Unterkunft sehr zu empfehlen.",1,-0.9712,Negative
201.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,54,100.0,1,1.3558603428081426,4.88,4.9,4.77,4.74,13755615,"Great apartment, clean, simple in interior design but with all the amenities needed for a very comfortable stay.  Loved the neighborhood, easy access to all the transportation required to get around, although we walked everywhere with ease.  Felt very safe.  The pictures are exactly what you are getting.  Lots of light, comfy beds, quiet.  There is an elevator that takes you to certain floors, so be aware of taking stairs.  Great workout after a day of walking.  Will definitely recommend this apartment to friends and family and will return next time in Berlin.",0,0.9935,Positive
18.0,3,1.0,0.0,3.0,16,100.0,0,3.883872869353541,4.36,4.26,4.57,4.4,265402,Ein sauberes Hostel mit unkompliziertem Check-in sowie Ein- und Ausgehen. Badezimmer und Gemeinschaftsbad waren sauber und modern. Preislich sehr fair! Sehr zu empfehlen,1,0.3802,Positive
84.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,1,3.2375488184892025,4.89,4.92,4.88,4.83,41651093,"I thoroughly enjoyed my stay at Carsten’s place. The place was really cozy and very quiet, as it was away from the street through a courtyard. The location was good and quite walkable to lots of things.<br/>One suggestion for the hosts: an upgrade of the bedding and pillows would make the place even cozier.",1,0.7574,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,0,5.958058255380188,4.81,4.62,4.79,4.74,25804999,"Maike and Benny went out of their way to make us feel comfortable in their home. They knew when to help and when we needed privacy for rest. Their house is beautifully decorated and in a great location with trains a max 10 min walk away and the Berlin Wall gallery 10 away. They helped us with suggesting places to eat, day activities and nightlife. I would 100% recommend you stay with them. I would stay here again while in Berlin. ",1,0.946,Positive
39.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,1,6.582330417299593,4.74,4.62,4.75,4.58,38976821,"Great stay, awesome location, really close to tempelhof park. U6 station quite close and also other S-Bahn connections . There are many Restaurants and a Lidl market nearby.<br/>Nice , spacious and comfortable room.<br/>Sohail is kind and flexible , really nice to chat with.<br/>Can only recommend.",1,0.9698,Positive
179.0,4,2.0,2.0,2.0,61,100.0,1,0.921623581729306,4.95,4.86,4.94,4.84,34997076,"Susan,  ajudou muito no Check In e facilitou muito o check out e guarda de malas",0,-0.296,Negative
