207.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,48,98.0,1,2.2099121550415086,4.91,4.95,4.98,4.81,11040435,"Amazingly well located apartment with plenty of restaurants and cafes around. Excellent spot for transport as U & S Bahn stations nearby as well as Tram stops nearby. Museum Island is within walking distance as is Brandenburg Gate (20 mins). <br/>Clean, well equipped, modern and stylish apartment, comfortably furnished for 4 people. Enjoyed our  stay very much.",0,0.9369,Positive
38.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,1,12.914209456397252,4.76,4.7,4.49,4.73,23105508,Perfect stay! Nice house and room.<br/>Very clean.<br/>Easy access by public transportation,1,0.7777,Positive
103.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,24,13.0,0,4.802164303811757,4.67,4.76,4.88,4.61,22579989,"The apartment is in such a nice location (lively Neukölln) and has been renovated very recently. Special mention to the floor heating in the bathroom :) despite some troubles unlocking the key safe on the first day, Alex was responsive and helpful, and all was resolved quite quickly. <br/>I enjoyed my stayed and look forward to staying there again during my future trips to Berlin.",1,0.971,Positive
96.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,43,100.0,0,2.1009980775333936,4.6,4.84,4.82,4.4,1125492855945930693,"The apartment is stunning & we fell in love the moment we entered. It’s exactly the way you imagine a Berliner Apartment,with high ceilings and beautiful „stuck“. The apartment is really close to the Tram & U-Bahn stations, aswell as Stores & Restaurants in walking distance. We had everything we needed in the apartment. Communication with the Host was very easy and they answered really fast, the instructions to enter the apartment were very clear and easily understandable. If I ever decide to come back to Berlin & I get the chance to stay in this Apartment again I definitely will!",1,0.9734,Positive
99.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,0,15.11918943238052,4.92,4.87,4.86,4.77,26222336,It was close to public transportation and Nina was always responsive to our questions.,1,0.3612,Positive
