158.0,8,2.0,1.0,4.0,45,90.0,1,2.5113494269416043,4.79,4.75,4.78,4.65,665666969293201423,Good location in Prenzlauerberg. The communication with the hosts was perfect.,0,0.765,Positive
149.0,6,3.0,1.0,3.0,31,100.0,0,1.374189414345675,4.91,4.74,5.0,4.91,15616319,"We had a great stay a Wibke’s cozy appartement. It is located in a great neighborhood, with lots of restaurants and bars. It is also at a short distance from several of the Berlin highlights. Wibke is a fantastic host, who was very supportive and flexible. I highly recommend it.",0,0.9598,Positive
130.0,4,1.0,1.0,5.0,22,99.0,0,3.852471644606984,4.74,4.59,4.8,4.62,25936092,"Alles war super! Die Lage ist sehr zentral man kommt schnell von A nach B. Die Einrichtung ist geschmackvoll und alle nötigen Geräte (Spülmaschine,Waschmaschine etc) sind vorhanden. Sehr gemütlich!",1,-0.855,Negative
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,0,5.800494003867822,4.59,4.79,4.45,4.56,849431,"We had a lovely stay at Tiziana’s place. It’s in a great location and was both spacious and clean, with everything you need for an excellent stay in Berlin.<br/>It’s also close to various forms of transport and is in a really nice neighborhood. We definitely recommend staying here next time you’re in Berlin!",1,0.9715,Positive
