79.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,63,100.0,1,3.3519237763680656,4.83,4.87,4.83,4.71,35731198,"A nice cosy flat in the middle of a great location for bars, restaurants, parks, and transport.",1,0.7845,Positive
77.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,38,100.0,0,3.130777776464285,4.77,4.59,4.83,4.6,612157073909883323,"The location is excellent - plenty of cafes, restaurants, and convenient access to the city center. However, be aware that the room is separated from the building’s hallway by just a thin wall, and the windows face an inner courtyard, which means there is constant noise throughout the day. Sleeping without earplugs is practically impossible.<br/>The kitchen was missing some basic essentials like knives and tea mugs. Essentially, if you plan to cook anything beyond the very basics, expect to buy both the ingredients and the necessary utensils.<br/>On the positive side, we appreciated the option to leave our luggage both before check-in and after check-out, which was really convenient.",1,0.8934,Positive
107.0,6,0.0,1.0,3.0,31,100.0,1,6.4861685330092405,4.6,4.45,4.56,4.54,13812209,"Perfect stay for a group of friends, we enjoyed being all together in one room. Apartment also has an own entrance from the street, a huge bathroom and a comfortable kitchen. Easily accessible by bus and 10 minutes walk from Treptower Park station.",1,0.9524,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,4.782471675073443,4.75,4.83,4.88,4.69,1030924721177477140,nice experience,1,0.4215,Positive
86.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,8,100.0,1,10.914093789492297,4.84,4.55,4.75,4.61,959317218517534938,"Great host, really responsive and supportive, fabulous location, great spot convenient. Great public transport links. Would highly recommend and would stay again.",1,0.9743,Positive
282.0,6,1.0,1.5,4.0,23,100.0,0,1.4487823623299123,4.75,4.68,5.0,4.63,862720730537755877,"Absolutely enjoyed our stay! The place was clean, spacious and exactly as decribed in the description. We got very clear instructions on how to check in and out and the suggestions on activities and restaurants/bar were very helpful! Definitely would stay over again!",0,0.9445,Positive
103.0,1,1.0,0.0,1.0,11,100.0,0,1.652388057808875,4.42,4.64,4.62,4.3,51549694,"Hotel Intervarko is a nice hostel as long as you know what you’re getting. Shared bathrooms, co-ed shower rooms, no breakfast or bar. Men’s/Women’s bathrooms alternate per floor and there was no women’s bathroom on my floor—just a men’s bathroom and a single bathroom at the end of the other hall. Except for towels, be sure to bring all of your own bathroom supplies. It was cheap enough, very well-located, clean, and quiet. As long as you know what you’re getting, I think it’s a good place and I would recommended it for a short trip on a budget.",1,0.8683,Positive
94.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,1,0.9546645327029104,4.87,4.81,4.89,4.81,22662699,"Ivos is incredible. Not only did he meet me at the place when I got in early but he sat down with me with the map and showed me all of the things he thought were important to visit. I’ve never had that kind of personal touch in the 20+ airbnbs I’ve stayed at. The flat is clean and perfect for someone who isn’t fussy and just needs a nice, clean, and perfectly located place in which to explore Berlin. I highly recommend.",1,0.9827,Positive
111.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,0,5.463369258195954,4.92,4.96,4.93,4.79,2027140,"Julia's flat was absolutely perfect for my needs.  One of the best Airbnb experiences I've ever had.  I can't recommend this place enough.  The kitchen is well setup with modern appliances, and a small table to eat at.   There is also a great selection of tea and coffee provided.  The bathroom has a great shower, nice sink, and clothes washer.  The bedroom has a super comfy bed, and a ample storage for your clothes.  The living room is well setup, comfortable, and has a bunch of interesting decorations.  I was there in the summer, and the flat was easy to keep cool by simply opening windows in the front and back.  And the location is amazing. 50+ restaurants and bars within a few minutes walk.  Tram station just around the corner.  Underground and train stations are under 15 minutes walk away.  Super easy to get anywhere in the city from the flat using public transport.  Julia also provided helpful information about local grocery stores, recommended restaurants, and nearby doctors.  And she responded to all the questions I had during my stay within minutes. I loved staying at Julia's flat, and can't wait to get back there in the future.<br/><br/>",1,0.995,Positive
52.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,10.552267411509238,4.88,4.85,4.77,4.85,15652886,Nos llevamos una grata satisfacción con Haidi y su departamento. Esta muy cerca de la estación del autobús como 3 minutos que literalmente te conecta con todo ! Haidi muy atento siempre preguntando si podía ayudar en algo. Totalmente recomendable,1,0.0,Neutral
270.0,6,3.0,1.0,4.0,47,100.0,1,1.3910800100424443,4.86,4.75,4.91,4.72,4114966,"Wir hatten eine schöne kurze Zeit in Berlin und in der Wohnung, die für uns von der Lage her einfach perfekt war. Die Wohnung ist wie auf den Fotos, wirklich sehr schön und sehr geräumig. Leider hatten wir Pech mit der Küche, da es dort nicht sauber war, war wir mit 2 Kindern wirklich sehr schade fanden.",0,-0.9661,Negative
75.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,14,100.0,1,3.716145391827272,4.9,4.83,4.93,4.81,27622100,"Nice room, comfortable and quiet. Happy to have a terrace!",1,0.8777,Positive
