130.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,27,100.0,1,16.510276753164995,4.98,4.98,4.82,4.87,13872278,Great experience at Kristen 's accommodation. The host was available at 1.00 am. to admit us as our flight was a late arrival in Berlin.<br/>Her instructions about getting to accommodation from airport were helpful. The Airbnb was spotlessly clean and comfortable. <br/>We had a very enjoyable stay in Berlin.,1,0.9509,Positive
180.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,64,100.0,1,7.735506689201421,4.96,4.88,4.9,4.88,1111567132715131033,"Le logement est tout simplement divin. Au dernier étage d’une résidence calme et très bien situé, nous avons pu visiter Berlin de jour comme de nuit. Raphaël a été un hôte exceptionnel, toujours disponible à nous recommander les meilleures adresses et activités.",1,-0.3818,Negative
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,9,100.0,1,11.934678775459894,5.0,4.92,4.92,4.85,853223866252321031,Julia 非常nice， 房子布置得很好，一猫一狗的生活让人感觉很有爱。房子的位置不错，很靠近地铁，晚上也相对安静，我睡得非常好。 如果再去柏林，这里会是第二次选择。很推荐。,1,0.0,Neutral
137.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,1.189406824976013,4.86,4.84,4.93,4.79,264459,"Perfect location to explore Berlin! Close to great food and shopping, and close enough to pop back in to rehydrate between sight-seeing. Super comfy bed and great kitchen!",1,0.9544,Positive
175.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,1,2.0003755294694376,4.8,4.9,4.84,4.64,23481275,"Great location in the heart of Prenzlauer Berg (less than 5 mins walk from the tram). The apartment had everything we needed for a long weekend and was well kept, very clean and Hanna was super accommodating!<br/>P.S. If you're vegan or veggie the area is great for restaurant and cafe options 🙂",1,0.9551,Positive
110.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,1,5.643910676118197,4.69,4.7,4.72,4.4,31047671,Great location next to the park. Really easy and fast communication.<br/>The only things I didn't find so convinient was the size of the oven and the size of the bathroom. It wasn't so easy to cook something in the oven. And the bathroom felt a bit small. All the rest really great!,1,0.9448,Positive
54.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,4.256716855805879,4.86,4.93,4.92,4.83,13697965,"Stayed just one night and wish I stayed longer! Janet's place is really lovely, a clean and modern oasis within the city.",1,0.8768,Positive
73.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,6.005461611108614,4.83,4.9,4.83,4.78,13798286,"I had such a pleasure staying with Klaus. It was wonderful to have had conversations with Klaus about the places I could go and thoughts about the vast topics we have had the chance to stumble upon. Klaus is very helpful throughout my stay and is very sensitive to the privacy of his tenants. If ever I had the chance to be back, I would come back again. It was nice, peaceful  neighbourhood and very close to the U & S bahn. It was easy to get around and explore the lovely inspiring city of Berlin.",1,0.9817,Positive
85.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,4.812972415804947,4.72,4.64,4.75,4.69,16050858,"Everything was easy and perfect, a lovely and cozy place!",1,0.8932,Positive
86.0,2,1.0,1.0,0.0,17,100.0,1,4.621113574301762,4.33,4.17,4.0,4.33,1120288055433572949,"La estancia en el piso de Lola ha sido agradable. El piso está muy bonito y las estaciones de metro que tiene al lado están cerca del centro. Además hay dos supermercados cerca también.  Me gustaría destacar que Lola es atenta y responde a todo, incluso nos ayudó a encontrar el tren de vuelta. Sin duda, lo recomendaría.",1,-0.296,Negative
47.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,22,100.0,0,13.138017956952291,4.4,4.36,4.6,4.27,18610999,"Frank was a pleasure to communicate with; very helpful and clear, even ordered a taxi for my departure. Understand that they are going through renovations so it's rather messy with exposed wires and tools/material everywhere in the main areas. My only complaints were that the floors were very dirty and the shower gets water all over the shared bathroom. The walls are thin and it is more like a hostel with people coming and going. The kitchen was pretty nice with lots of food and drinks being shared by other guests. (I left a good bit on my last day as well). ",1,0.945,Positive
107.0,6,0.0,1.0,3.0,31,100.0,1,6.4861685330092405,4.6,4.45,4.56,4.54,13812209,"While we never got to meet our host Alex, communication was always helpful and pretty fast. We had been given directions to a place nearby where we found the keys and had to insert a code – this was actually pretty funny, felt a bit like McGyver.<br/>The location on the map of Berlin worked well for our purposes, as there are convenient bus lines stopping just across the street.<br/>The actual location of the house and in particular of the flat, however, is at least not for the faint of heart. The house is right next to a pretty busy crossroads and the flat is on the ground floor with the bed/living room facing the street. This being said, we felt very much exposed to the urban life of Berlin – which may not bother you if you plan to spend all the time outside and just be home for sleep. However, if you look for a more intimate place where you can withdraw from the big city life outside when you feel like it then you will be disappointed. The host did a good job mounting curtains in front of the windows towards the street so you can block out the sunlight at least. However, the noise from the street in the morning, from neighbours above (*) and the pub next door (right on the other side of the wall where the bed is), can’t be blocked out. * The neighbours were super noisy (conversations, arguments, video games, summer hits of the 90s on their stereo on and off until 4 am on a Tuesday night) to the point where we couldn’t get sleep – but gladly only during the first night out of the three nights we stayed there. I told our host about it anyway and he promised to talk to them.<br/>While the flat is equipped with all the useful things that you would expect, it lacks charm, blame it to the big room, high ceiling, lack of furniture etc. The host hung several paintings to create some atmosphere but at least the one with the lady who looks like Ozzy Osbourne made a creepy impression on us. All this means: it is a good place for people who just want to crash at a place and hit the city life. It is certainly not the right pick if you happen to be on your honey moon. Also, solo or female travellers - in particular when arriving late in the evening - may feel a little uncomfortable in this setting.",1,0.9763,Positive
422.0,6,3.0,1.5,3.0,21,100.0,1,2.1180873876448287,4.95,4.89,4.95,4.86,12120894,"The appartment was nearby the metro, clean and specious for us 5. The contact with Antonio was good. Thank you for the nice stay :)",0,0.9169,Positive
112.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,54,100.0,1,3.2941847222796583,4.76,4.87,4.87,4.73,4885068,"Beautiful, well-kept, incredibly tidy apartment on a quiet block next to a park, and close to public transportation, and all the amenities you might need. Everything went smoothly. I highly recommend a stay here. ",1,0.5849,Positive
125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,12,100.0,0,6.0069890623921145,4.67,4.67,4.67,4.83,1148237111241612564,Everything perfect.,1,0.5719,Positive
77.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,34,100.0,1,4.4625182162657095,4.52,4.61,4.77,4.48,11078656,"The apartment was well decorated and and a good space management, everything was well placed in just 20 square meters. Although something we noticed it is not mentioned is that the apartment is in a 3rd floor without a elevator, but it is not weird coming from a very central Berlin studio. Also it has a very central location, a two minute walk from the U-Bahn and a 10 min walk from the S-Bahn. The host was very nice and all the messages he left were very super cordial. Very recommendable for a young couple or so.",1,0.9409,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,100.0,0,12.901074216761966,4.92,4.7,4.89,4.92,24227976,"I would wirte my feedback in English instead of German, so everyone could understand clearly <br/>The apartment is in good location (center of Berlin) but its a little tiny. But thats good. We dont complain about it<br/>The host - Mr Tom is communicative . He prepared also the breakfast for us<br/>But we have problem here. We were in two persons (me and my friend) and we are both women. Our room has not the key or locker ?!? 😳. In the morning, when my friend went to bathroom and the door closed, she knocked a little bit to see if there were anyone inside? and the person inside said yes. And then my friend replied ""oh its ok . Take your time"" and she was about to turn away. Suddenly the host (he was inside) opened the door, he had no clothes on (naked) and tried to show himself out. That made my friend jump into shock .<br/>At the same day, in the evening, we were about to go out for some drinks and essen, it was about 22:00 o'clock. Because the apartment was tiny , the aisle is just for one person walking. I was first and my friend behind me. When I turned to main door, the host suddenly went out from the room near main door and walked towards me. I immediately turned around and back to leave way for him, but my friend saw that. He walked towards us, with only underwate short , and he pulled his short down near his ""private area"". My friend saw that jumped shock again. She had really shock and fear .<br/>And after that we decided checkout in the midnight for our Safety. That was Sexual Harrassment . Our room has no key and the host tried 2 times to show his sexual behavior. The husband of my friend called her and he did not want her to stay hier anymore. <br/>We are consodering to report to police about that because we had to pay more for hotel for urgent minutes, and we were so shocked, frightened, stress..... We were women and we wondered on the street at 1:00 am to look for hotel and we met some men to make fun of us , so really dangerous and what if something had happened, who would cover for us ???<br/>I hope Airbnb would read it and consider about the problem.",1,0.9701,Positive
80.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,20,100.0,0,4.449380275016282,4.65,4.8,4.8,4.71,1599410,Great apartment in a very central area with shops and restaurants available a couple of blocks away. Gert is a good host and provided us with clean towels and shower products for our 2 nights stay. Finally the most important is that the place is really comfortable and extremely clean.  ,1,0.945,Positive
341.0,14,2.0,2.0,8.0,25,99.0,0,4.588008668136996,4.91,4.79,4.79,4.72,31181847,Stella's apartment was fantastically located within easy reach of good local amenities. Stella was very quick to respond to any requests we had and send detailed instructions regarding the apartment which made checking in and out very easy. I would thoroughly recommend this apartment for groups.,0,0.8908,Positive
