98.0,6,1.0,1.0,3.0,34,96.0,1,4.637677076052483,4.85,4.73,4.84,4.75,798466267299061181,"Alex's apartment was excellent—beautiful, clean, and well-equipped. It had everything we needed, including cleaning supplies, towels, and fresh linens. Alex was incredibly kind, and all his instructions were precise and clear, making our stay stress-free. Highly recommend!",1,0.9243,Positive
44.0,3,1.0,2.0,2.0,45,100.0,1,9.796369316399854,4.75,4.78,4.54,4.63,865222,"Good place to stay with easy access to Berlin's public transit system, 20 minutes from the center of Berlin.  Room was clean, enjoyable and had all the necessary things for a comfortable stay. The bathroom has to be shared with the other guests.  It does get a bit warm in the room during the summer and one has to be aware not to knock one's head on the ceiling, which is lower at the head of the bed because of its attic configuration.  Judith is friendly and helpful and do recommend a stay with her.  I plan to stay with Judith again when I'm in Berlin. Reasonable price for the room as well.",1,0.9761,Positive
76.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,1,4.623712960922274,4.92,4.92,4.93,4.78,27412012,"Die Unterkunft ist phantastisch gelegen. Alles was du brauchst ist fußläufig erreichbar.<br/>Alles ist sehr sauber und gut organisiert von Hanna.<br/>ich würde bei meinem nächsten Aufenthalt sofort wieder bei Hanna buchen,",1,-0.5994,Negative
