106.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,65,100.0,0,5.014025773559903,4.92,4.94,4.83,4.71,649282145197373546,"We couldn’t have asked for a better stay in Berlin. After missing a flight and needing last-minute accommodation, Nhu responded promptly to our booking request, and subsequently gave us an amazing stay. The apartment is clean, modern, and in a peaceful location with access to public transit. We were able to have privacy, but also utilize common areas. Nhu is such a kind host, and we will surely consider staying at her Airbnb next time we are in Berlin!",1,0.9376,Positive
