226.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,22,100.0,1,3.7679767081285434,4.73,4.82,4.8,4.58,53717609,"Très bon séjour passé à Berlin dans ce très très beau Airbnb. Le logement était impeccable, et plutôt calme malgré une des chambres donnant sur rue. <br/>L’emplacement proche d’une bouche de métro donnait la possibilité de se rendre dans n’importe quel quartier de Berlin en moins de 30 minutes. Comptez tout de même une bonne heure pour l’aéroport.",1,-0.128,Negative
88.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,0,12.43529195299008,4.63,4.71,4.56,4.58,31172381,Kristina hat eine kleine Wohnung mit allem was man braucht. Sehr gastfreundlich ist die schöne  Begrüßung mit Süssigkeiten usw. Leider machen die Fotos aber vielmehr her als das Apartment in Wirklichkeit ist. Bett war aber total gemütlich und die Wohnung sauber.,1,-0.9485,Negative
37.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,1,7.245995661273636,4.93,4.81,4.68,4.85,51841334,Meg is a great host. It was lovely to chat with her. The place is great! Thank you again!,1,0.944,Positive
43.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,90.0,1,19.010333685269742,4.89,4.95,4.89,4.85,20247909,"Mein Aufenthalt war wunderbar, erholsam und organisatorisch wirklich einfach zu handhaben. Ich habe mich sehr wohl gefühlt bei Rudolf und seiner Familie. Mein Kaffee schmeckte draußen  im Garten noch besser. Ich bin von der Architektur dieser Häuser begeistert. Das Zimmer im 2. Stock ist gemütlich, das Bett bequem. Das eigene Bad ein kleiner Luxus. Alles war sehr sauber und mit Liebe zum Detail vorbereitet. Die Atmosphäre im Haus ist vertrauensvoll und vertrauenswürdig. Ich konnte mich zurückziehen oder einen Abend lang im Wohnzimmer arbeiten. Absolut empfehlenswert!",1,-0.9476,Negative
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,41,100.0,0,4.380106218729023,4.84,4.88,4.8,4.8,884538994646967353,"I would not say the description of this place as the ""entire rental unit"" is accurate as the bedroom is locked off and inaccessible to guests. <br/>Unfortunately I found the sleeping arrangement extremely uncomfortable as the only bed is a full-sized futon in the office. I found this futon mattress to be quite low quality and it had a large crease down the middle which made it very difficult for me to get a good night's rest on it.<br/>Apart from the poor sleeping situation, I found the place quite comfortable. The hosts were pleasant and communicative and everything else about the stay went well.",1,0.1813,Positive
146.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,3.4636382799594605,4.66,4.79,4.58,4.56,322520,"Great location if you're looking for a quiet neighborhood. Recommend renting a scooter to get around town since this is a bit further out. The hosts were superb, they put together a detailed guide book that really helps out newcomers. Everything was well maintained and clean, although we never opened the windows in fear of flying pests (no screens on the windows). It's a charming place, but be wary when arriving. There is an open garden/common area when walking in that definitely could use some love (the flat is facing this garden). One of the nicer places we stayed at in Berlin, we prefer this over the other. For food, there's a fairly high rated German restaurant. And a market is within walking distance.",1,0.9741,Positive
151.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,94.0,0,3.1018817858877528,4.67,4.77,4.78,4.52,721527807549293451,"It’s a nice location to explore Berlin! There was some construction work outside, at our side of the building. So there was noise from 7am onwards.",1,0.4753,Positive
148.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,45,87.0,1,11.377361200205224,4.63,4.83,4.88,4.55,924375729009154375,"Das Zimmer war an sich toll, wir wurden jedoch einen Tag vor der Anreise in ein anderes umgebucht, ist ein ungutes Gefühl. Bei diesem Zimmer funktionierte der Fernsehr leider nicht, helfen konnte uns vom Service-Team leider niemand und angesehen oder repariert wie versprochen hat ihn sich auch keiner. Trotzdem war es ein angenehmer Aufenthalt.",1,-0.8316,Negative
100.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,99.0,0,0.9354947556413724,4.69,4.47,4.87,4.68,930506346504115139,Muy buena ubicación. Contacto instantáneo,1,0.0,Neutral
115.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,31,98.0,1,9.978271762204304,4.95,4.84,4.95,4.89,1112771480988290098,"Freundlich, nett, sauber tolles Bad und sehr ruhig. In der Lounge guten Kaffee",1,-0.5423,Negative
90.0,2,1.0,1.5,2.0,22,0.0,0,1.6629933908463208,4.8,5.0,5.0,5.0,32951328,"Lino's place is absolutely fantastic for a stay in Berlin. It is extremely well located, close to the beautiful neighbourhoods (""Kieze"") of Kollwitzplatz and Mitte. Most tourist sites are reachable within a nice stroll along the canal or through the governmental center of the city. The apartment is located on the top floors of an old house located in the large backyard which is very typical for Berlin. This means it is extremely quiet and has a nice view into lots of greenery (in the warmer months) with a view of the iconic TV tower above the next row of houses. It has a large south-facing balcony which is great for breakfast, lunch and dinners or just hanging out. The apartment is distributed over two levels, with a large living room, well-fitted modern open kitchen and a small guest toilet on the lower floor, while the huge bedroom and master bathroom are on the upper floor. Everything is clean and well-stocked, and on top the apartment boasts a number of nice artworks on the walls from local artists.<br/>Communication and check-in / out were fast, clear and without a hitch thanks to the amazing flat manager living in the same house on the ground floor - so any question or issues she will be able to resolve immediately. Only slight downside may be that it is 9 flights of stairs without elevator - so if you have bad knees or are really out of shape, this may be annoying. For us it just meant we got fitter while we were here :-)<br/>We can highly recommend Lino's place for any sort or length of stay in Berlin.",1,0.9845,Positive
257.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,42,100.0,0,1.2937250483136316,4.63,4.63,4.85,4.51,12047604,Location centralissima. Ottima la funzionalità e la pulizia. Soggiorno perfetto.  Lo consigliamo certamente!,0,0.0,Neutral
199.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,1,3.7401902545858734,4.81,4.86,4.85,4.67,22354567,Nice central location including U-bahn just outside your door and parking for your car. Supermarket and bakery also around the corner. Clean and well functioning appartment.,1,0.765,Positive
54.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,1,7.00373277563463,4.92,4.86,4.8,4.85,32016500,"Notre week-end à Berlin Chez Leona a été parfait du début à la fin.<br/>L'appartement est extrêmement bien décoré et lumineux. <br/>Il y a de nombreux transports juste à côté. Le quartier regorge de chouettes restaurants et bars.<br/>Leona a été une super hôte, flexible et très sympathique.<br/>Nous espérons pouvoir y retourner très vite.",1,0.7003,Positive
37.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,0,5.662533986282327,4.74,4.77,4.33,4.71,589285,"This place was exactly as described. A very soothing and quiet retreat overlooking a big garden lot that was very green even in winter. I even saw a marten in the garden, a cute little animal I have never seen before. I came to Berlin to play music and I was very happy with the location. Though the apartment was quiet and secluded, it was a great location for easy access to neighborhoods I was interested in. I can't really speak to public transportation since I mostly used Uber but there are S Bahn, U Bahn and bus stop locations nearby. Martin was responsive and concerned about any issues. Beyond that he was actually just a really nice and kind person. I had issues with the Internet for the first couple weeks so if you have your own mobile hotspot you'll be doing yourself a favor. They seemed to clear up after a while and I learned that this is really something you should expect all over Berlin and other parts of Germany and Europe ( I visited Italy for a few days as well )unless going to a high-speed Internet café and was not a failing of the internet set up at Martins place. You'll find all the necessary items for cooking. This could be a cozy little place for a couple on an adventure. A few small practical things, There are towels provided but they are very stiff and scratchy, which again is common in the area. Most people don't use clothes dryers. If that's important to you, bring your favorite fluffy towel from home. Also, I'm 6 foot one and 200 pounds. I'm not overweight or anything but the shower was a little difficult to navigate because there's a large detachable showerhead in a small shower stall. I probably knocked that thing on my feet at least 10 times while washing my face. Again, not a complaint at all, just something to be aware of. I really have nothing bad to say. It was accurately represented and a warm and comfy haven as the nights grew colder in Berlin. Thank you for opening this little place up to people like me, Martin",1,0.9953,Positive
58.0,2,0.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,1,17.178707427347383,4.95,4.94,4.75,4.87,39185725,Really enjoyed my weekend’s stay at Kerstin’s lovely place. Felt right at home with their big garden and all amenities anyone could ask for. Both her and her husband were super friendly and watching the fireworks together will be a cherished memory for me :),1,0.9674,Positive
142.0,4,2.0,2.0,2.0,19,100.0,1,6.608155925105233,4.83,4.94,4.85,4.76,10423394,Beautiful place with stunning natural light. I’m a great neighbourhood with everything in a walkable distance.,1,0.9201,Positive
