367.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,1,2.222748046653009,4.98,4.92,4.96,4.78,31970794,Stylish apartment in a great location on a lively street full of bars and restaurants. Great cafe and an excellent ice cream parlour directly below. The apartment itself is adorably quirky with everything you need to hand. A pleasure to stay there and would return most happily.,0,0.9829,Positive
