264.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,49,100.0,1,1.4717750314840643,4.73,4.73,4.94,4.73,1091905691449377431,"The apartment was perfect for our few days stay in Berlin. It was spotlessly clean, the beds were comfy, it was very warm and the kitchen was well equipped. It was within easy walking distance to the S-bahn and the Christmas Markets and there were lots of eating places nearby. It was very straightforward to get from the Airport using the S-9 which took us directly to within easy walking distance. We would thoroughly recommend it. Thanks Doug.",0,0.9659,Positive
