69.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,71,100.0,1,15.135268114068412,4.96,4.92,4.86,4.92,758552656052653402,"Andre and Daniela were great hosts.  The apartment was ready for us and the entry was easy.  Everything that is needed for a disabled person was readily available and had instructions on its use.  It was a comfortable, quiet time, in a great neighborhood.  If I come back to Berlin, I will be sure to try and book another visit with Dani and Andre.  Thanks!",1,0.9698,Positive
