108.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,70,100.0,1,2.641127618215382,4.96,4.94,4.95,4.88,267951,"Staying at Frank’s house was a breeze! Quick communication and Frank made sure I had everything I needed.<br/>The place itself is much bigger than I expected from the understated photos! The rooms are large and spacious, and there was plenty of light. <br/>I’d absolutely love to stay at Frank’s again when I’m back in Berlin!",1,0.8257,Positive
91.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,15,96.0,1,6.717388844283176,4.74,4.66,4.77,4.6,42686083,Rigtig god beliggenhed og dejlige rum med fin altan. Rent og pænt. Dirk var venlig og imødekommende (mødte ham jo ikke men det var der heller ikke grund til). <br/>Nem indtjekning. Alt i alt en rigtig god oplevelse. <br/>Vh Kresten,1,0.4939,Positive
125.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,0,2.2236669090713965,4.84,4.87,4.95,4.59,2718380,"The apartment was lovely and spacious and bright. We really loved the balconies, sat outside on the one in front in the morning and had dinner once at the back as the weather was nice. It was perfectly located with restaurants nearby and everything we wanted to see we were able to walk to.",1,0.9577,Positive
244.0,8,2.0,1.5,6.0,29,100.0,0,4.2133870341210375,4.66,4.59,4.59,4.54,27410997,"The flat was really bigger than expected and it was a great. Moreover, it was near from the most important space we had to visit. The only problem was the cleanliness of the cooking tools and dishes that we had to re-do the whashing-up in order to cook and eat. Finally, I recommend the apartment for big groups",0,0.7178,Positive
129.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,1,1.845762124055973,4.93,4.93,4.98,4.76,4830714,"Firstly, we had train delay issues from Amsterdam the night of check-in; despite arriving at such an inconvenient time, Marcus and his co-hosts helped accommodate us to the fullest! Everyone was very communicative and quick to respond and offer help. He was incredibly welcoming too. <br/>On the other hand, the space itself was more than we’d hoped for. While it did look as gorgeous as the photos, the setting overall was very peaceful and the architecture of the surrounding area was pretty as well. There was entertainment provided within the apartment, laundry, tea, and it was nice to open the windows and hear the city in the morning. It helps when you’re walking to local transit, which was very close.<br/>I’d highly recommend.",1,0.9843,Positive
