148.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,44,94.0,0,7.131273504704622,4.73,4.83,4.83,4.56,49086464,Alles super ! <br/>Leider keine Kochplatte,1,0.636,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,1,5.336391697711564,4.93,4.85,4.76,4.7,27288541,Schöne Wohnung in einer zentralen Lage. Gute Kommunikation. Check-in problemlos.,1,0.0,Neutral
159.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,64,100.0,1,12.762537927344171,4.73,4.71,4.87,4.57,21431770,"In the description of the apartment there was a balcony or terrace. In fact one get inside from the street. <br/>The apartment is big, clean and good equipped. A bottle of sparkling wine was waiting for us in the kitchen.<br/>The host Sören was very helpful and answered our questions in a moment. <br/>Just next door there is a Greek restaurant with very friendly service and atmosphere.<br/>When we are next time in Berlin, we would ask Sören to find for us another apartment not on the ground floor, because he is a great host.",0,0.9551,Positive
126.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,38,97.0,0,1.7520993087590884,4.75,4.77,4.93,4.65,18382782,"Great airbnb, the host was welcoming and had everything we needed ready for our arrival. The air bnb was perfect for our short stay and felt very warm and homely. Easy to get around Berlin from the location and had lots of things to do nearby. Will be returning one day!",1,0.9558,Positive
