66.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,25,100.0,1,12.69261644647349,4.9,4.89,4.68,4.85,2602460,"The stay was comfortable. Facilities mentioned in the site were available. Easy access to the city center with bus, S or U bahn. House owner was very cooperative and had provided information about different sight seeing spots and ways to commute. On the whole a very good place to spend holidays.",1,0.8999,Positive
