71.0,4,1.0,2.0,2.0,46,100.0,0,3.8506506351526446,4.58,4.12,4.82,4.46,9727345,La camera è leggermente piccola ma visto che la si usa solo per dormire non è un problema. Il resto dell'alloggio è all'altezza compreso lo scoiattolo che tutte le mattine veniva a salutarci sul balcone. Casa in una zona molto tranquilla e comoda per i market (200m) e per i mezzi di trasporto.,1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,0,2.519896578191311,4.73,4.7,4.95,4.63,17312576,"Great location, a very short walk from the shopping district and Museum Island. Excellent public transport close by, and a lovely bakery up the road. Comfortable, clean flat. Toasty warm with plenty of hot water. I'd be cautious of the open staircase with small kids, but otherwise great for couples and families. Great communications from Selin. Would happily stay again.",1,0.9813,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,4,100.0,0,2.638583005573755,4.84,4.79,4.85,4.85,743889,"Everything was perfect: apartment is very nice, location is perfect (in the middle of Kreuzberg, very close to nice restaurants and bars) and Lana was of very good advice. She was not there when we arrived but a friend of hers welcomed us and communication was easy with them both.<br/>I highly recommend the place!",1,0.9754,Positive
