107.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,33,100.0,1,12.260182751072744,4.96,4.98,4.88,4.84,22500999,"Dies ist eine sehr schöne Ferienwohnung, die sich perfekt für einen Wochenendtrip nach Berlin eignet. In der Nähe von Kurfürstendamm ist vieles fußläufig und alles andere mit den öffentlichen Verkehrsmitteln erreichbar. Die Wohnung bietet neben einem größeren Schlafzimmer, eine geräumige Küche, ein etwas kleineres Badezimmer und ein gemütliches Wohnzimmer. Sie war top sauber und mit allerlei Kleinigkeiten (wie Föhn etc.) ausgestattet. Der Kontakt zur Gastgeberin ist sehr freundlich und detailliert.",1,-0.8979,Negative
90.0,2,1.0,1.0,4.0,25,0.0,0,8.1485590660558,4.55,4.75,4.77,4.64,13669202,"Beautiful home, located very close to metro station and 10 mins away from Berlin Central Station. We had a hassle free check in / check out, and the apartment was exactly as shown in the pictures. Lots of eating / drinking places closeby that are open till late, as well as supermarkets making this place a comfortable home away from home.",1,0.9118,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,0,13.811832052182714,4.55,4.6,4.73,4.62,1273287,Für einen Trip nach Berlin absolut zu empfehlen!,1,0.0,Neutral
101.0,2,0.0,8.5,2.0,35,100.0,0,2.496114582405734,4.64,4.56,4.81,4.55,45354619,"Ostello fantastico, zona super collegata. i receptionis sono tutti simpatici e disponibili. ci sono tantissimi bagni per ogni piano, tipo 4 per 7 camere. cucina e spazi comuni carinissimi, ordinati e puliti. super contenti",0,0.8481,Positive
322.0,4,2.0,2.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,5.688568840331838,4.85,4.98,4.46,4.76,1117418824135366013,"This flat provided a wonderful base for my family and I as we spent a few days in Berlin.  It is immaculate and exactly as pictured.  We found the space to be large and more than comfortable for our family.  There isn't much to do in the immediate area (though there is an excellent coffee shop seconds from the flat), but it is just across from a metro station so getting out an about was easy.   We had an issue with the wifi but found the host to be responsive and helpful in finding a solution.  Overall, highly recommended.",0,0.9697,Positive
