91.0,6,3.0,1.0,6.0,34,100.0,1,3.8710959645000753,4.77,4.82,4.78,4.73,1052541605853259851,"We had a great family stay in the apartment, very good location for public transport or walking into the centre. Denis and Pascal were great hosts, easy communication and very flexible letting us stay a bit later on our last day. The kitchen was well equipped and good coffee provided which was much appreciated :-) Thanks again.",0,0.9822,Positive
