86.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,52,100.0,1,14.876814991832068,4.83,4.74,4.5,4.65,53080223,Villiam’s place was very clean and fully equipped with everything you need for a short stay. The apartment is located a little outside the Ring but is still really well connected with the tram nearby and there are still lots of spätis and restaurants in the area (can really recommend Manifattura Pizzeria around the corner!). <br/>Villiam was there to check us in and even met us a bit later in the evening due to flight delays. Thanks again for the great stay Villiam!,1,0.9631,Positive
