80.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,11,100.0,0,23.966267152990326,4.77,4.91,4.83,4.71,43549412,"Am fost cazati intr un loc minunat, casa este absolut superba, cu gradina si loc de luat masa afara, dotata cu tot ce ai nevoie in bucatarie, baia mare, camere mari și foarte curat, paturile confortabile iar locatia este excelenta pentru cine iubeste natura si linistea, situata la 15 km de Berlin intr o zona rezidentiala, se ajunge usor cu masina atat la locatie cat si in oras. Ne a placut foarte mult si recomandam cu drag  cazarea iar Regine este o gazda minunata, cum oricine si ar dori sa gaseasca! Multumim si sper sa ne revedem!",1,-0.3578,Negative
45.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,3.8692265936490537,4.75,4.77,4.69,4.67,693357,Gili was an excellent host! The apartment has everything you need and it´s located near a U-bahn station and there´s a lot of great restaurants nearby with great food. Gili was very helpful during our stay and ha was accessible all the time if we had any questions. He also was negotiable about check-in and check-out so it suited our flight times. We highly recommend Gili´s apartment!,1,0.9673,Positive
