124.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,52,100.0,1,1.65162815442783,4.86,4.79,4.92,4.69,2045192,"Perfect. Everything was clean, the place is quiet, the bed was (as you already read) really really good, bathroom was absolutely clean and nice. Kinga and her husband offered us towells and an abolute lovely breakfast. The location is perfect to walk to Mitte or Prenzlauer Berg.<br/><br/>Kinga and her Husband were very kind. These are the kind of people you want to get in touch with, when you book a location on airbnb. Next time Berlin we hope to meet them agein.",1,0.9869,Positive
