125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,44,100.0,1,4.662746317054351,5.0,5.0,4.93,4.8,1142586270665825867,"Una de las mejores estancias que he tenido en Airbnb. El departamento es súper bonito, y además de estar muy limpio tiene todo lo necesario. Verena y Cathy son súper amables, nos consiguieron una cuna para mi bebé durante la estancia lo cual agradecemos ampliamente. La ubicación también es ideal ya que está cerca del transporte público y de lugares para comer y caminar. Definitivamente recomiendo este espacio al que esperamos poder regresar.",1,0.5267,Positive
190.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,1,1.6592287277224604,4.92,4.96,4.93,4.78,39580408,Perfekt von Beginn an!,1,0.0,Neutral
92.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,0,13.963261489616256,4.57,4.67,4.58,4.53,6101399,"Die Wohnung war in einer perfekten Lage und für 2-4 Personen einfach perfekt!! Die Gastgeberin antwortet immer super fix bei Fragen - alles top! Wenn es sich ergibt, kommen wir ggf nächstes Jahr wieder!! 👍",1,-0.8469,Negative
282.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,41,100.0,1,2.942766383999945,5.0,4.97,4.94,4.87,42631943,"Our stay with Downtown Apartments - Mitte was a perfect end to our travels in Europe. The unit was lovely with a large balcony and many windows allowing us to open up and enjoy the warm, sunny weather we experienced. The location is exceptional. Close to many restaurants, stores (grocery and a liquor store!), and with a fun bar, The Castle, downstairs. Best of all, access to public transportation is right out the front door. The staff was friendly, responsive, and helpful. I recommend Downtown Apartments - Mitte to anyone looking to have a comfortable stay in Berlin.",1,0.9887,Positive
75.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,34,92.0,1,5.988336427097377,4.81,4.85,4.75,4.67,37837921,"TOP Airbnb!! Tolle, schnelle und vor allem spontane Kommunikation !! Perfekte Lage, toller kleiner Balkon, alles was man braucht. Wir haben uns sehr wohlgefühlt!! Vielen Dank und alles Liebe!!!",1,0.572,Positive
68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,3.194253694245239,4.93,4.95,4.89,4.86,81081,"This apartment is as great as it looks in the pictures: the decor is modern, everything is in pristine condition and very clean, and it has all the commodities you need. It is also spacious,  gets a lot of light, and is in a newly renovated and clean building. We were very comfortable during our stay and would strongly recommend it. Interacting with the hosts was also easy and they provided great recommendations for things to do in the neighborhood.",1,0.9758,Positive
86.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,52,100.0,1,14.876814991832068,4.83,4.74,4.5,4.65,53080223,"Schöne, saubere Unterkunft in einer ruhigen Gegend im Osten der Stadt. Villiam war sehr flexibel und verständnisvoll, nachdem wir aufgrund eines Vorfalls der Deutschen Bahn erst einen Tag später anreisen konnten.<br/>Allerdings sollte einem bewusst sein, dass das Apartment relativ weit draußen liegt und entsprechend lange Wege zu bewältigen sind, wenn man ins Zentrum möchte.",1,-0.5994,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,3.427158030204999,5.0,5.0,4.75,5.0,23411485,"Eine hübsche und sehr ruhige Wohnung, trotzdem gut angebunden. Sehr zu empfehlen.",1,0.0,Neutral
284.0,12,3.0,1.0,4.0,56,100.0,1,9.660413858650209,4.9,4.94,4.46,4.76,16280687,Excellent clean warm specious stylish. Very handy for public transport. Some great little bakeries/coffee shops new by.,0,0.9081,Positive
159.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,1,4.8995744932669005,4.91,4.91,4.89,4.66,1169504897983255007,"This Airbnb exceeded all my expectations! The hosts have clearly put a lot of thought and care into making this a truly exceptional place to stay. The apartment is clean, with good quality furnishings and finishes throughout. The large windows flood the space with natural light, creating a bright and airy ambiance. <br/>The bed is comfortable, topped with comfort linens that made for a wonderful night's sleep. I was impressed by the thoughtful amenities provided, from the well-stocked kitchen to the tableware and coffee prepared  . The location is also fantastic - just a short walk to public transportation links and supermarket's, and other conveniences. Since we are coming for summer dance camp. It’s definitely a good place to rest and recharged. <br/>The neighborhood feels safe and quiet. I couldn't have asked for a better ""home away from home"" during my visit. I would highly recommend this Airbnb to anyone looking for a relaxing, well-appointed place to stay.",1,0.9953,Positive
62.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,45,100.0,0,2.1907320060884934,4.79,4.8,4.94,4.77,38729622,I had a great time in Berlin. Super room! Lots of space and cozy bed. clean apartment and good location. Would repeat next time ;),1,0.9412,Positive
105.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,45,100.0,1,12.354937460642866,4.91,4.91,4.58,4.8,35818662,"My wife and I stayed at Detlef’s place while visiting friends in Berlin and really enjoyed our time there. The apartment is about a 15-minute walk to both an S-Bahn and U-Bahn stop, making it easy to get around the city. There’s also a large grocery store just down the street, which was super convenient. The apartment itself was clean, cozy, and had all the listed amenities. We’d definitely recommend staying here to anyone visiting Berlin.",1,0.9595,Positive
132.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,99.0,0,10.743066920351522,4.73,4.73,4.85,4.6,1147577325817808644,"Noam has provided us with great check in and check out instructions and was very considerate when replying.<br/>However, the location was inaccurate and did not mention the flat being on the lower ground floor. Moreover, the shower door does not provide enough protection to prevent the water from flowing out, resulting in a kitchen flooding. Lastly, the sheets and bedding are not clean enough, with possible bed bugs present, which resulted in me developing the worst allergic reaction of my life.",1,-0.3324,Negative
35.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,80.0,1,7.414472725561205,4.7,4.68,4.46,4.76,11634962,It’s a bit far away from the city center but the tram is pretty convenient. Elektra is super nice and provides lot of stuffs. The room is clean and I had a good sleep on the comfortable bed. If I come to Berlin again I will book this place!,1,0.9808,Positive
