170.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,51,100.0,1,1.4356958153593935,4.66,4.81,4.62,4.51,2396312,"You cant beat this location, even in a well connected city like Berlin, we barely used the Public commute, instead we just walked everywhere. U bahn and s bahn stations are 3 mins away from the house if needed.  Place was clean and felt cozy. Thanks for hosting us.",0,0.8481,Positive
