125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,21,100.0,1,8.187543141932318,4.92,4.93,4.9,4.8,1266630,"Amazing apartment in a brilliant location. So peaceful but brilliantly located to affect all that Berlin has to offer. The apartment was so clean and seemed much bigger than the photos. There was plenty of space for two of us to comfortably spend  our time here. The smart lock for the door worked brilliantly with an app on my phone, only issue was we found the balcony a bit tricky to open at times. <br/>Overall a super apartment in a great location to explore a lovely city, we will most certainly return. Thanks for everything Roi!",1,0.9956,Positive
