59.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,97.0,1,6.758292040286776,4.88,4.9,4.9,4.82,1028964485008042189,"Even though I arrived very late and had a very important thing in the morning, she allowed my stuff to stay there and was very flexible. I came home and got my luggages hours after the official check-out time but she was very nice to let my luggages stay there and let me access the apartment because I had a very important thing to do in the morning. Thank you so much for your kindness. This place is highly recommended from me :)",1,0.9713,Positive
