44.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,33,94.0,0,0.7956191654931166,4.5,4.17,4.83,4.0,28474188,"It is a great and beautiful studio, very bright and spacious. The location is excellent and all the city sights are within reach. All amenities are also included, making it easy for move in and starting living comfortably. Communication has been swift and top-notch, Michael and his team are very helpful and friendly! I was staying there during summer and the only thing to watch out for is that during the day kids are playing right outside the window, so if you are noise sensitive, just bear it in mind.",1,0.9836,Positive
