47.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,30,100.0,1,18.53574881495984,4.85,4.89,4.86,4.77,30495280,"a wrote a very long review and airbnb made me rewrite it because i included a certain website's name :')<br/>the Tl;Dr: very great place to stay, the host, bianca was very sweet and welcoming, the house was cozy and clean, the neighborhood is very quite and serene, and uma the dog was very cute and welcoming, plus the sbahn is very close and it's a direct line to city center, so not that far",1,0.9768,Positive
