147.0,2,1.0,1.5,3.0,43,100.0,0,1.296081270021233,4.91,4.95,4.97,4.68,8564167,Enjoyed staying at Moritz and Kinga’s lovely apartment in Mitte. Exactly as described and was a great home base while exploring Berlin.,1,0.9042,Positive
110.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,0,4.531250343577502,4.66,4.65,4.71,4.51,744143139305808819,Host didn’t respond at check in leaving me stranded overnight in the rain. <br/>They claim it’s a no contact check in but actually you need to be at a specific shop by 8 pm or you’ll be unable to get a key.,1,-0.1531,Negative
57.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,60.0,1,18.6213784272085,4.96,5.0,4.67,4.9,27678463,"Very friendly and nice host. The house is located in a cozy and quiet district (you can get to the centre by bus and U-S bahn). It is new and beautiful. I really appreciated the cleanness of the room and the privacy. Mine was mostly at work and her two little girls at school. I definitely recommend the place and would come there again. Danke, Mine!",1,0.9615,Positive
64.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,59,100.0,1,2.578564642470654,4.97,4.99,4.93,4.96,7849188,Een aangenaam verblijf in het sfeervolle Helmholtzkiez. Heel veel kwaliteit voor een schappelijke prijs. Ruime comfortabele kamer met een eigen balkon. Bernd is een ruimhartige gastheer met oog voor detail. Hij kwam van zijn werk naar de woning om ons de sleutel te overhandigen en wegwijs te maken. Van harte aanbevolen.,1,0.0,Neutral
