165.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,6.547712743829179,4.65,4.78,4.56,4.49,28532542,"This is my second stay at Lindemann's. The room was spacious, clean and well appointed. However, the internet was slow and unreliable. We had the room key on our phone, but often we had to wait for the wifi to connect so we could get in. Also, the room is advertised with air conditioning, but it didn't work very well. A coffee maker in the room would be appreciated. The restaurant charged a different price for coffee every time we went! The room and bathroom were not very well lit.",1,0.8818,Positive
240.0,6,3.0,2.0,3.0,81,100.0,0,6.002180564836134,4.91,4.82,4.82,4.82,51898296,"Great family-friendly flat, complete with a semi-private garden and a community sandbox in the courtyard, perfect for small children. The location is very convenient, with good tram connections and many nearby shops and restaurants. It was also lovely to go for walks around the Weißensee. The flat comes well equipped and the hosts were very gracious and responsive.",0,0.9736,Positive
