110.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,50,100.0,1,2.7610678260408177,4.84,4.67,4.93,4.69,2610528,The loft was perfect for 3 or 4 people. Clean and cosy appartement. Nicely situated in a quit part of a lively neighbourhood with lots of shops and bars/restaurants. We used the 2 bicycles (you can rent more around the corner) the whole weekend. In a radius of 20 minutes you can get near most sites. We had a geest weekend.,1,0.9042,Positive
