125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,1,6.103995871967691,4.93,4.85,4.76,4.84,23286713,"Caroline a été très attentive à nos besoins pendant notre séjour. On se sent comme à la maison, et il est facile d’accéder au reste de Berlin depuis son appartement. J’y retournerai avec plaisir et recommande les yeux fermés !",1,0.0,Neutral
145.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,1,6.881210243394802,4.87,4.6,4.57,4.69,1468872,"Sono stata molto bene e Fritz è stato un ottimo host, pronto nella comunicazione e nell'attenzione rivolta alle mie richieste. Non ho visitato la zona intorno perchè ero a Berlino per lavoro e con poco tempo libero ma la posizione dell'appartamento è stata strategica perchè ben servita e facile da raggiungere.",1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,4.733509722235622,4.87,4.71,4.89,4.69,44326622,Lovely apartment in a cool area. Andreas was always quick to respond to queries and gave us great recommendations for places to go. Would definitely stay again,1,0.9169,Positive
422.0,8,4.0,4.0,4.0,44,100.0,1,3.9696573546022167,4.94,4.85,4.85,4.88,1193559110353938411,"Great neighborhood, fabulous flat - more spacious than imagined, excellent and responsive hosts, incredibly conveniently located to all we wanted to do. We had never been to Berlin and this lovely apartment was exactly what we needed and wanted. We had a car and the parking was easy, Kreutzberg is very cool, and it was incredibly nice to return our beautiful spot at the end of a long day. Thank you to these winning hosts!",0,0.989,Positive
91.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,1,7.621220634183153,4.9,4.95,4.75,4.81,602861220353061488,房源坐M10四站到中央火车站，因此很方便。出门右转到路口再右转200米到超市。虽然临街也很安静。生活设施齐全，干净卫生。,1,0.0,Neutral
