30.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,13,93.0,0,4.132370926663647,4.53,4.47,4.74,4.63,764978494366252475,"Very friendly staff and overall a nice stay. The only thing that I was a bit unhappy about was that there were only shared bathrooms and showers with multiple other rooms. I think the showers could be in a bit better condition. But honestly, this wasn’t really an issue. Especially for the price!",1,0.8477,Positive
