68.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,28,100.0,1,6.576517854147013,4.72,4.76,4.31,4.63,36310980,"Wir haben uns wirklich wohl gefühlt. Alles war wie beschrieben und der Kontakt war super freundlich, zuvorkommend und hilfreich. Gerne wieder!",1,-0.636,Negative
198.0,5,3.0,1.0,3.0,67,100.0,1,1.8499350064071256,4.89,4.66,4.91,4.75,589169,"Thomas has been super host. He has responded quickly and has been good upon our late arrival due to a plane delay. His sister has introduced us to the apartment and has given us a good explanation. In the apartment there were clear instructions.<br/><br/>The apartment was hip, spacious with lots of intimacy. Good for our family … that consists of 2 adults, 2 adults (children) in their 20  and 2 children 9-7.The neighborhood is great. Go for a stroll around the block for hip boutiques & great café’ s. Expand your horizon by walking around the neighborhood…. Nice vibes…<br/><br/>Quick access to Alexanderplatz.. and therefore to the whole of Berlin.  If there is a good fall go to Berlin and experience just like us a Berlinian Summer ☺<br/><br/>We would love to come back<br/>",0,0.986,Positive
