151.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,94.0,0,3.1018817858877528,4.67,4.77,4.78,4.52,721527807549293451,The apartment is very clean and nicely designed. You reach the Charlie Checkpoint (U6) metro station in 1-2 minutes on foot. It is easily accessible by commuter-metro transfer from the airport.<br/>It is also within walking distance of several attractions:<br/>Jüdishes museum <br/>Topography of terror,1,0.6436,Positive
