87.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,26,60.0,0,6.381010109583203,4.62,4.59,4.84,4.61,43541550,"Todo correcto, el anfitrión amable y respondía rápido. La casa estaba limpia, cálida. Quizás por ponerle algo negativo sería la falta de microondas y la falta de extractor de humos en la cocina. Cuando cocinabas tenías que abrir todas la ventanas para evitar que saltara la alarma anti incendios.",1,-0.3182,Negative
214.0,4,2.0,1.5,4.0,34,98.0,0,1.0407544919436775,4.61,4.72,4.75,4.55,34294699,"Really nice apartment, door key was very tricky to use. There were 3 of us sharing, Advert said 2 beds and 2 sofa beds but the sofa beds aren’t really beds, they are sofas that they have just put a sheet over on the pictures which i found a bit misleading so instead of having a bed to ourselves 2 of us had to share which was not what we were originally expecting.",0,0.1901,Positive
