241.0,6,3.0,1.0,4.0,54,100.0,1,1.3558603428081426,4.89,4.93,4.77,4.79,13651040,"Nice apartment, very quiet and well situated in the town. Very close to ubahn. 10 minutes walking from Alexander Platz. It has three bedrooms a good living room and a kitchen. It has only one bathroom. The host and her colleagues were very friendly and very flexible for the check-in given our late arrival. A very nice experience.",0,0.9417,Positive
113.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,95.0,0,11.727203319803111,4.64,4.76,4.79,4.5,1096343616019487560,"Sehr schöne, saubere  Unterkunft. <br/>Tee Kaffee Kochmöglichkeiten vorhanden. Sogar eine Wärmeflasche :)<br/>Oben gibt es ein Klappbett, für längeren Aufenthalt könnte es schwierig sein. Aber die Couch ist sehr bequem, auch zum schlafen. <br/>Sie hat schnell auf meine Fragen reagiert. <br/>Würde wieder kommen.",1,-0.5994,Negative
266.0,4,2.0,2.0,3.0,38,100.0,1,4.2460946149984,4.91,4.99,4.42,4.66,810594575643752470,"Great place! The apartment was so fresh, clean and comfortable. The management were very communicative and helpful. The location is great with close access to public transport. Highly recommend!",0,0.9748,Positive
225.0,5,1.0,1.0,4.0,53,100.0,1,1.4388807165639896,4.69,4.67,4.9,4.59,1094217423852610184,"Appartamento spazioso luminoso e pulito.<br/>Comodo ristoranti, stazione.<br/>Host molto disponibile.<br/>Lo consiglio.",0,0.0,Neutral
360.0,8,3.0,1.0,3.0,66,100.0,1,4.432978276429975,4.94,4.82,4.89,4.74,694871,"Loved staying here, lots to do especially if you are here for the cafes, vintage shops and clubs. The flat was huge, the kitchen, floors and bathroom very clean. Davide was super communicative and resolved a problem we had with the shower drain expeditiously. The only note I have is that the music coming through the wall in the front bedroom on Friday & Saturday is very loud and continued well past 7AM. We were here to go out, drink, party, listen to techno and have fun but the neighbors don't sleep. Luckily the other 2 sleeping areas were not loud at all. FWIW I've lived in NYC my whole life and am accustomed to a very noisy neighborhood. Regardless I would stay again and there's enough room that if it gets crazy on Saturday night you can move around.",0,0.1164,Positive
30.0,1,1.0,1.0,2.0,21,100.0,0,10.723701440323534,4.89,4.86,4.9,4.92,25765982,"Die Kommunikation mit Isabella lief super, die Wohnung ist super schön und die Lage für uns absolut perfekt. Vielen lieben Dank!",1,-0.636,Negative
50.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,20,100.0,0,8.915019850263489,4.8,4.9,4.65,4.65,31056518,"Ayesha was incredibly responsive and accommodating to our flight delays and late arrival and departure times, as well as offering ways to communicate with her while we didn't have data. The room was perfect for the night, in a quiet neighborhood. Thank you Ayesha!",1,0.8856,Positive
121.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,27,100.0,0,4.472653939309849,4.88,4.9,4.81,4.78,10122398,Host is very kindly and warmly.Location is vety great.,1,0.8221,Positive
59.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,50,100.0,1,6.553717964125431,4.89,4.8,4.82,4.82,45522353,"예약할 때는 크게 생각 안했는데 숙소와 티어가르텐 공원이 엄청 가까웠고 그 말인 즉슨 브란덴부르크 문, 국회의사당 같은 주요 명소와도 공원을 산책하면서 갈 수 있어서 좋았습니다. 그리고 주택가에 위치해있어서 조용한 동네였습니다. 방은 사진과 동일했고 침대는 넓어서 잘때 좋았습니당 그 외의 가구들도 다 널찍널찍했어요. 화장실이나 주방도 이용하는 데 크게 불편함 없었습니당<br/>그리고 아흐메드는 명확한 안내를 하고 크게 제약을 두지 않는 호스트라 함께 지내는데 좋았습니당~",1,0.0,Neutral
138.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,56,100.0,1,2.8661586391717453,4.91,4.92,4.9,4.79,1946067,"Very well located next to the park, clean, and well equipped with soap and other basics.",1,0.7569,Positive
