196.0,9,2.0,1.5,6.0,23,100.0,1,0.5100458669657755,4.8,4.74,4.97,4.73,11577306,The apartment is in a great location and was comfortable for our stay. There was however a strong odor from the trash stored in the courtyard which made getting in and out of the apartment through the stairwell a very unpleasant experience.,0,0.8078,Positive
