140.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,49,100.0,1,3.2254531575112866,4.87,4.87,4.92,4.76,11665059,"Evertyhing checks out. Location good, Apartment good, it's clean, all facilities are there. Very happy about this stay, and with this host. Replies to messages and asks if all is ok during the stay. Recommended to all visiting Berlin.",0,0.9381,Positive
107.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,95.0,1,3.959014142965591,4.68,4.89,4.82,4.56,52180595,Blitzsauber und sehr freundlich. Sie gingen auf unsere speziellen Wünsche sofort ein. Sehr ruhige Lage und trotzdem Nahe vom Kiez!,1,0.0,Neutral
179.0,10,4.0,3.5,5.0,22,100.0,1,6.948660996537318,4.85,4.92,4.68,4.72,20910462,"Oliver is a very friendly host and a quick communicator. Check in went smooth and the house is as described perfect for a group. ( we stayed there with 8 ppl.) The location is great and only a short walking distance away from U-Bahn and shops. There are drinks on offer which you can purchase for a small price which we though was an added plus. Overall cleanliness could have been better as especially the kitchen is in need of a good wipe down. We felt there could have been more attention to detail as hocks for jackets, a shoe rack as well as mirrors and side lamps in each bedroom are not provided. It would have also been nice to have an additional couch as there was only a small 2 seater. Overall we would recommend the place based on the good location and the friendly host who added to our pleasant experience.",0,0.9863,Positive
79.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,0,4.208631273050765,4.9,4.95,4.89,4.8,37120573,"Tamaras Wohnung ist perfekt für einen Städtetrip nach Berlin. Mit U und S Bahn ist man an der Warschauer Str. gut vernetzt in alle Richtungen Berlins. Kommunikation mit Tamara war immer schnell und easy 😎 Wohnung mit allem perfekt ausgestattet, mit sehr gemütlicher Matratze. Sehr zu empfehlen!",1,-0.3164,Negative
119.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,6.121786157144007,4.81,4.66,4.86,4.72,23747428,"Große gemütliche Wohnung, habe ich mich dort sehr wohl gefühlt!",1,0.0,Neutral
185.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,47,94.0,0,7.131273504704622,4.69,4.77,4.74,4.55,49087087,It was great,1,0.6249,Positive
51.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,1,8.234159636083104,4.91,4.93,4.84,4.83,22845957,"Il mio soggiorno nel bellissimo appartamento di Ursula è stato perfetto, non potevo chiedere di meglio.<br/>Sin da subito, Ursula si è dimostrata essere un’ottima host. Mi ha accolta in casa sua e mi ha fatto sentire a mio agio da subito, mostrandomi l’appartamento e tutto il necessario utile alla mia permanenza.<br/>Mi sono sentita a casa!<br/>Inoltre l’appartamento si trova in una zona di Berlino molto ben collegata, a pochi passi c’è la metro Trumstrasse con cui (in 20 minuti più o meno) si raggiungono le principali attrazioni della città.<br/>L’unico aspetto “negativo” di questo appartamento è il suo essere troppo accogliente e perfetto a tal punto che una volta che ve ne andrete, non vorrete più lasciarlo!",1,0.4912,Positive
