92.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,53,100.0,1,2.550750052042966,4.92,4.95,4.97,4.82,1350626659330481180,"Perfect little apartment which has everything you need for a short stay in Berlin. We slept very well as the apartment is in the quiet back side of the building, although the street it's on is also not noisy, but is close to plenty of great restaunts, bars and public transport. I would stay here again.",1,0.8737,Positive
