125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,0,2.519896578191311,4.73,4.7,4.95,4.63,17312576,"The apartment and host were wonderful! Check in went smoothly - even though our train was a bit delayed - and check out time was flexible with our schedule. Selin was easy to communicate with and quick to respond with any questions.<br/>The apartment was lovely as well. It was much bigger than I anticipated, and fit our family of 4 very comfortably. Everything was very neat and tidy. Selin provided all of the essentials for a welcoming stay.<br/>It is a about a 20min walk to the major sites (Brandenburg Gates, Memorials, etc.), but we did not mind the walk. The neighborhood is very nice and walkable. The Berlin public transit system is super easy as well, and there was a stop near the apartment. ",1,0.9791,Positive
