171.0,4,3.0,1.5,3.0,44,100.0,0,3.7941628305863695,4.92,4.85,4.92,4.87,35611317,"The place is spacious and well-decorated. The apartment is full of light and has almost everything we need for our stay. The host is super friendly and responds to all our questions very quickly.<br/>The location is good, with many restaurants and cafes nearby, and it's not far from the city center.<br/>Additionally, just a note about the apartment: appartment is on the 3rd floor with no elevator, and there are quite a few of the host's personal belongings, such as clothes and other items, scattered throughout the space (including in the wardrobes). But for us, this was totally fine and added a cozy touch.<br/>The only downside we can think off was the creaky floor.",0,0.6174,Positive
43.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,29,80.0,0,23.216866775428905,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,12246011,"The place was great, just like in the pictures. The neighborhood was so peaceful, the bus stop is right in front of the doorstep and within 45 minutes you can get to Berlin central. The bus runs every 10 to 20 minutes depending on the day and the Grunau is just 7 minutes away to buy all your day to day needs. I stayed for 27 nights with my son and my Sister from from UK joined us for Christmas for six days , she loved the place too. I will be visiting my son in Berlin very often and always love to be in Gisela's since its home away from Sri Lanka since I am a person who does not adjust to change very easily, but at Gisela's it was quite the opposite. Planning to be there within the next few months.",1,0.8794,Positive
