64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,1,2.4282218534972566,4.76,4.72,4.76,4.67,1414395977088158733,"We had a good time at the Amano hotel. The location was good for our weekend trip, the hotel and the room were nice. The only thing that bothered us was that the room was not cleaned properly (dust on the floor and furniture and an unpleasant smell).",1,0.4939,Positive
140.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,32,100.0,0,2.0159436672933486,4.53,4.63,4.73,4.53,245827,"Saubere, aufgeräumte Wohnung, die unseren Anforderungen perfekt entsprochen hat. Lage top, Größe und Aufteilung für 2 top und da wir sowieso den ganzen Tag unterwegs waren hat es uns an nichts gefehlt. Lediglich die Matratze hätte ""hart"" sein können, aber das ist persönliche Präferenz.<br/>Durchaus weiterzuempfehlen. :)",1,-0.4939,Negative
373.0,12,4.0,2.0,14.0,30,100.0,1,2.6480538372543863,4.93,4.9,4.93,4.81,504259,"We had a wonderful stay in Alexandra's place. Alexandra was so accommodating- meeting us at check in and allowing for late check out, supplying a baby cot, high chair etc. The apartment is very spacious and clean and we enjoyed the games room. Once we found our bearings it was easy to hop on the tram approx 5 mins walk from the apartment. We also cooked breakfast in the apartment one morning and it had everything we needed. Highly recommend!",0,0.9428,Positive
