230.0,4,2.0,1.5,4.0,30,100.0,0,2.3001902519789743,4.79,4.79,4.79,4.61,9289390,"Very nice apartment. Wish we could stay longer next time. Located perfectly, specially during the sundays as there are 2 big flee markets litterally around the corner as well as the wall monuments and parks. Great value for the money!!!<br/>Nice and friendly hosts that prepared everything for us!  ",0,0.9754,Positive
