406.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,52,100.0,1,10.4862063301987,4.97,4.94,4.97,4.83,1046047893342301220,"The apartment is more beautiful than the photos.  Big rooms well appointed. Spotless.  The kitchen had everything that you would need. The location was fabulous, very close to the trains. Great restaurants and lots to do in the area. Antonia was a great host, attentive and responsive. May be one of the best Airbnbs that I have ever stayed in. Everything was perfect.",0,0.9823,Positive
120.0,2,1.0,1.0,3.0,34,100.0,1,2.1927332885004245,5.0,5.0,5.0,4.91,30267264,Sascha and her family were incredible hosts. They were very responsive and informative upfront to make our time in Berlin very pleasant.  My wife and I highly recommend staying at Sascha’s place as the neighborhood is beautiful and it’s easy to get anywhere in the city from there.,1,0.943,Positive
128.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,14,100.0,1,3.473891084562703,4.7,4.63,4.97,4.54,11932837,"We chose the apartment from Carla & Daniel as it was conveniently located and the description suited our needs. Although communication with the host was smooth and the place provided us with basic comfort, it definitely can use some love as it got a bit run down over time in comparison with what was advertised on AirBnb. I am sure the hosts will take care of the items we described in our private note so the apartment gets back its original value.",1,0.9559,Positive
422.0,6,3.0,2.0,4.0,60,100.0,1,3.559770173058828,4.94,4.96,4.93,4.77,11483775,Amazing space to stay with friends or family. Great view of the city and metro access right outside. I highly recommend staying here if you are traveling to Berlin.,0,0.9299,Positive
