86.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,100.0,1,3.4203343748381307,4.76,4.8,4.78,4.65,2649669,"The apartment is very central located near Checkpoint Charlie and the U bahn.  Het was well equiped for a short stay. Also clean and quiet.  Nice bathroom, good shower.  The high ceilings make the room spacious and comfortable. <br/>Lorenzo was very friendly and helpful.  <br/>We had a lovely  time in Berlin thanks to our stay here. ",1,0.9778,Positive
