58.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,0,18.77117911741297,4.7,4.71,4.52,4.69,3314419,"We were lucky to be able to book the garden house on the same day that we were flying to Berlin, and didn't regret our decision. It was in perhaps 15 minutes walking distance from the airport, in a very quite neighbourhood, and we enjoyed as much of the short night (early flight the next day) as we could. <br/>The place is decorated in a rustic fashion, with lovely old-school amenities and decorations - especially the old board and card games were super endearing to me.<br/>Thanks for your hospitality, and all the best!",1,0.9667,Positive
64.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,59,100.0,1,2.578564642470654,4.97,4.99,4.93,4.96,7849188,"Bernd is a wonderful host, we were very warmly welcomed, explained us all we have to know about our stay and the neighbourhood. He was very flexible and helpful regarding our check in and check out times as well.<br/>The place is extremely cozy, it felt like home, there are some very cute shops, coffee places and bars nearby. <br/>It was easily approachable from the city centre with tram 😊<br/>We hope we’ll get to get back here sometime 😁",1,0.9742,Positive
