127.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,0,3.257694180259946,4.84,4.84,4.77,4.67,4607356,"Ok, so Nic's a good host, friendly and very responsive to any messages.<br/>I liked the apartment, it had a quirky comfortable feel with plenty of light<br/>and big views of the surroundings. Amenities are basic but fine. Whether<br/>I would call it central, I'm not sure, it's on the very outer edge of central, but <br/>it doesn't matter because there are plenty of trams right outside.",1,0.8117,Positive
