191.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,45,100.0,1,1.6592287277224604,4.94,4.94,4.95,4.78,39605196,"Apartment was brand new, very clean and very well equipped. Great stay for a workation as I had no problems working from the apt either. Nice area with lots of good restaurants in a 10 min walking radius.<br/>The only thing I would have like to know before booking was that they require both an extra deposit from your credit card, and also that you submit photos of your passport into their shady-looking web interface. Did not feel great but the quality of the apartment made up for it.",1,0.7334,Positive
