144.0,3,1.0,1.0,3.0,18,99.0,0,8.88272809968877,4.17,4.28,4.69,4.24,46114906,I have somewhat mixed feelings about this one so I'm going to break it down into pros and cons.<br/>Pros: <br/>1) The location is great. Some really good restaurants and malls nearby.<br/>2) Walk to the train and bus stations is around 2 mins.<br/>3) The whole check in and check out process was really smooth and quick.<br/>Cons:<br/>1) The building seems to be really old and not well maintained. <br/>2) I had asked for an iron box which is also mentioned on the listing but was not given one.<br/>3) There is no telephone handset in the rooms to call reception or room service. So either you use your mobile or walk all the way up to the 4th floor where the reception is.,1,0.1128,Positive
89.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,7.289170629982721,4.87,4.77,4.77,4.8,533523,Great place. Very nice hospitality. Flexible Check-In. Hope to stay there again.<br/>Thanks to Frank.,1,0.9053,Positive
