64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,57,100.0,0,7.06708233904912,4.6,4.85,4.68,4.68,29029427,"Ahmad est un excellent hôte, sympathique et conciliant. L'appartement est idéalement situé, bien équipé et très propre.<br/>Je recommende pour un séjour à Berlin, je suis sûr que je reviendrai.<br/>Merci à toi Ahmad",1,0.5719,Positive
172.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,95.0,0,4.132850367965358,4.48,4.51,4.59,4.33,43811934,"Alles bestens! Aufenthalt war sehr angenehm, großes und gepflegtes Appartement. <br/>Check-In sehr unkompliziert.",1,-0.636,Negative
116.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,3.4220599717130984,4.92,4.97,4.86,4.83,362701,"Great apartment in a very local and ""real"" neighborhood out of the tourist area. The apartment is as publicized, close to the subway (15 minutes to the main attractions) and has plenty of food options around. A great choice in Berlin.",1,0.8481,Positive
31.0,6,1.0,1.0,6.0,29,99.0,0,1.5518343874590943,4.55,4.64,4.6,4.63,6110762,The best hostel ever! The host was extremely kind and very helpful. Information and description was accurate. The room and bathroom was also clean. Sheets were clean and everything was perfect. It was my first time in Berlin and I really enjoyed my stay. I will definitely come here again when I visit Berlin. Thank you! ,1,0.9826,Positive
90.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,45,100.0,1,3.6178758418911023,4.85,4.82,4.9,4.73,540335929043609328,"Es war super, ich würde immer wieder kommen!!",1,0.0,Neutral
103.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,0,12.008373900915986,4.81,4.97,4.83,4.69,20967430,Great place near U-bahn stations and Adenauer platz where you can catch the 109 direct to Tegel Airport. Dorothee was flexible with check in and out times. Private bathroom looks newly renovated and the shower was amazing! Recommended.,1,0.8977,Positive
60.0,2,1.0,1.0,0.0,5,100.0,0,4.266034423173598,4.93,5.0,4.73,4.93,1138073980239700997,I had a fantastic stay at Marie's place. The area is very lively and great to discover new restaurants and soak in the vibe of this part of the city.<br/>Marie was always very friendly and helpful. She even carried my suitcase down the stairs after me having run the marathon. So thank you again and a great recommendation for everyone.,1,0.9773,Positive
112.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,42,100.0,1,2.97782445506794,4.86,4.91,4.87,4.74,22275529,The apartment is in a great location in a very lively and fun area. It's a very quirky layout - three floors with the bedroom downstairs in the basement with very little natural light with the bathroom off it (the toilet is separate on the main floor). But it works. Gregor was great to communicate with and very helpful. There are some low doors and archways which could be tricky for very tall people. But a good apartment in a great location.,1,0.9761,Positive
210.0,6,3.0,1.0,3.0,30,100.0,1,5.782365457190099,4.92,4.87,4.66,4.78,780553102645612115,"Incredible, peaceful oasis in the middle of Neukölln, ideal for exploring this cool area of Berlin and well-connected to the transport network for exploring all the sites. <br/>It’s truly gorgeous inside and has been thoughtfully designed by someone with incredible taste — we loved it. <br/>And you’re right in the middle of a vibrant neighbourhood with hip restaurants catering to any time of day.",0,0.9779,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,0,5.240564981087221,4.88,4.43,4.71,4.78,44596704,"Excellent stay! The room is spacious and beautiful, the flat is just opposite to the train station and buses, it is practical ! It is very quiet! I was able to enjoy the kitchen and eat in the garden! It was lovely! Highly recommend",1,0.9616,Positive
120.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,25,95.0,1,10.04350824176978,4.85,4.8,4.91,4.73,50526605,War cool,1,-0.3818,Negative
86.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,90.0,1,1.7412022704154266,4.91,4.95,4.94,4.77,30373468,Dorit was a great host! Was very responsive and would check if we needed anything throughout the stay. Location was great only a 20 minute walk from Alexanderplatz where you can easily reach various parts of Berlin with the metro. (Less than 10 minutes to Brandenberg gate from the alexanderplatz station). The area where the place is close to many bars and restaurants. Defitnelty worth to stay in this area very underrated.,1,0.9401,Positive
141.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,1.1632932394280655,4.73,4.76,4.92,4.63,16167725,非常好，各种物品都有很全，房东很友好很有耐心，屋子里装饰的非常好看也很暖和,1,0.0,Neutral
32.0,6,1.0,1.0,2.0,14,94.0,1,3.5488970618636317,4.83,4.84,4.86,4.84,42862387,"Minimal Hostel was a really cute and great little hostel - lots of space and very cozy and comfortable. The area is really lovely, just by the canal in a lovely part of town. I would definitely  recommend staying here!",1,0.9774,Positive
161.0,6,1.0,1.0,3.0,45,100.0,1,1.6592287277224604,4.9,4.94,4.93,4.7,39663747,Great location in Prenzlauer Berg (close to some excellent bars and places to eat). Good balcony overlooking a quiet street. Check-in was quick and easy.,1,0.9274,Positive
302.0,8,2.0,2.0,4.0,22,100.0,0,1.8693244287052848,4.67,4.6,4.94,4.52,1085314077755107955,"The apartment was very comfortable and convenient. There were plenty of food and grocery options nearby that made it easy to be able to eat. The washing machine was very convenient, as well as the two showers.",0,0.8341,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,16,100.0,0,1.664766883680572,4.72,4.33,4.88,4.67,1637976,"Wir haben die Zeit sehr genossen. Die Wohnung liegt in einer interessanten Gegend mit vielen Restaurants und Kaffees, und sehr guter Anbindung an den öffentlichen Verkehr. Wir waren sehr schnell in Berlin Mitte. Die Wohnung ist schön eingerichtet, mit einer großen Terrasse zum Innenhof, viel Platz und ideal für Familien mit Kindern (nicht nur).",1,-0.8519,Negative
58.0,2,0.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,1,17.178707427347383,4.95,4.94,4.75,4.87,39185725,"Sehr gemütliche Wohnung, ruhige Gegend mit guten Einkaufsmöglichkeiten und guter Anbindung an die öffentlichen Verkehrsmittel. Kerstin war super freundlich, alles verlief reibungslos. Wir können einen Aufenthalt bei Kerstin wärmstens empfehlen!",1,-0.636,Negative
115.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,0,2.4094964149087104,4.68,4.83,4.82,4.5,1178278262649886437,"Wir hatten einen wunderbaren Aufenthalt in diesem herrlichen Airbnb. Ich kann die Unterkunft nur wärmstens empfehlen. Wir haben uns wirklich wie Zuhause gefühlt, die Kommunikation mit den freundlichen Gastgebern war problemlos und blitzschnell, und die Lage - mit tollen Restaurants ringsum und trotzdem ruhig und privat - könnte nicht besser sein. DANKE!!",1,-0.953,Negative
189.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,41,100.0,1,4.134405418281586,4.97,4.97,4.85,4.77,43721285,"The apartment was very clean and tidy. The transportarion was very easy and there are lots of good restaurants and groceries shops around.  Everything about Josephine’s place is warmfull and cozy, we loved the coffee machine, the chocolates and the amenities provided!",1,0.9228,Positive
95.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,3.1833669854420146,4.83,4.85,4.8,4.58,34018418,"Die Wohnung ist super schick und sehr gut gelegen und angebunden. Check in und check out waren unkompliziert. Da die Wohnung nur aus einem Zimmer besteht, hört man nachts leider den Boiler ziemlich laut. Ansonsten ist die Wohnung aber ruhig und sicher gelegen trotz der unmittelbaren Nähe zum Kotti. Für ein Wochenende absolut zu empfehlen!",1,-0.8439,Negative
97.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,19,100.0,0,6.388424168016833,4.62,4.7,4.25,4.45,52402770,Apartment is ok for very short stays.,1,0.296,Positive
103.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,0,4.179832601624142,4.59,4.65,4.31,4.44,45809645,"Le logement était très bien, pas très loin du centre en autobus ou train et beaucoup d’autobus à proximité. Le parc à coté est reconnu comme n’étant pas super sécuritaire, mais ça ne nous a causé aucun désagrément.",1,0.5994,Positive
103.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,1,6.782182931571986,4.95,4.93,4.69,4.84,51181494,"Lovely stay in a bright, super clean apartment with good transport links. Our house was super responsive and helpful with any queries.",1,0.9761,Positive
367.0,5,2.0,2.0,3.0,50,100.0,1,5.59894475162521,4.92,4.96,4.25,4.71,42286644,Der Empfang war sehr nett und die Wohnung wirklich super. Alles war wie neu und sehr sauber. Wir haben zu fünft in dem Appartement geschlafen und es war von der Größe her wirklich top. Würde es definitiv empfehlen :),0,-0.836,Negative
53.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,6,86.0,0,17.14557108392744,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,1441330599428000366,"Super Aufenthalt. Sehr entgegenkommend und flexibel, da wir aufgrund der deutschen Bahn später als erwartet angereist sind. Super freundliche und sehr idyllische Atmosphäre und das im nahen Umland von Berlin. Gerne nochmal :)",1,0.8957,Positive
163.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,3.126230216762567,4.94,4.96,4.85,4.82,22696188,"Completely agree with many of the comments I read before booking - we absolutely LOVED this location - it's in a beautiful building, felt very safe, was extremely easy to get to from the airport, and the apartment was clean, modern, and very comfortable. Easy to walk to many tourist attractions and right next to several UBahn/SBahn lines. We enjoyed our stay!",1,0.9871,Positive
35.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,51,100.0,0,3.642892493197811,4.95,4.96,4.8,4.93,304904,"Great location. Lola's cafe is a must do. Great place, would definitely recommend it if staying in Berlin.",1,0.9246,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,82.0,1,2.6808853188639663,4.67,4.68,4.92,4.59,43823296,"Recently stayed for a long weekend and we cannot fault the place! Perfect location, clean room and friendly staff",1,0.9032,Positive
161.0,4,1.0,2.0,2.0,56,100.0,1,2.045183840821759,4.95,4.97,4.94,4.88,637575697682777608,"Apartment, equipment, and location are just amazing and offer everything for a perfect stay in Berlin. Simon is super friendly and helpful. I would love to come back anytime soon!",1,0.9716,Positive
166.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,16,50.0,0,8.694176238638248,4.7,4.55,4.81,4.41,22495883,Eine sehr schöne und außergewöhnliche Unterkunft. Martin und Tobias haben alles gut und einfach organisiert. Wir hatten einen super gemütlichen Abend und eine schöne ruhige Nacht auf dem Wasser. Der Kamin sorgt für eine angenehme und gemütliche Atmosphäre. Wir kommen im Sommer wieder und besuchen die Kino und Musik Veranstaltungen der nebenan gelegenen Plattform. Allerbeste Grüße von Bea und Christian.,1,0.0,Neutral
177.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,45,100.0,0,3.2944250231259806,4.64,4.66,4.8,4.46,26769830,"Das Apartment hat eine tolle Lage, von der aus alles gut erreichbar ist und auch in der direkten Umgebung waren sehr nette Cafés und Restaurants. Die Einrichtung ist sehr geschmackvoll und es ist alles da was man benötigt. Der Kontakt war super, alle Angaben zur Anreise waren sehr hilfreich und man bekam immer eine schnelle Rückmeldung. Etwas sauberer hätte es sein können, aber meine Mutter und ich haben uns dort sehr wohl gefühlt.",0,-0.5994,Negative
82.0,4,0.0,1.0,4.0,47,100.0,1,7.250180211725777,4.87,4.85,4.7,4.76,11810798,"It is an extremely cozy and charming place- very comfortable. <br/>It is located in a stange area- but don't let that scare you- it is close walking distance to cool restaurants, cafe's and shops, and then it is only 30 minutes to the airport.<br/>I definitely recommend staying there.",1,0.9518,Positive
100.0,6,3.0,1.0,3.0,37,100.0,0,17.177847201896487,4.77,4.77,4.62,4.69,8725453,"Przyjemny pobyt, sprawny dojazd do centrum Berlina. Spokojna, cicha okolica. Polecamy",0,0.0,Neutral
100.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,3.091836209520125,4.86,4.9,4.86,4.77,869793,"Die Wohnung von Kirsten ist wunderbar gelegen. Gleich neben der legendären Markthalle 9, die jeden Besuch wert ist. Der Wrangelkiez in wenigen Minuten Entfernung ist das Berlin, dessentwegen Touristen aus aller Welt die Stadt besuchen.<br/>Die Wohnung ist sehr schön, stilvoll eingerichtet, hohe Decken mit Stuck und ein raffinierter Schnitt. Ich kann sie sehr empfehlen.",1,-0.9287,Negative
96.0,2,1.0,1.0,0.0,21,100.0,0,9.70267913323164,4.76,4.82,4.76,4.66,1120811858951697611,"Appartement propre , accueillant, bien situé et dans un quartier calme. Situé à proximité de stations de bus et de la Spree. <br/>Idéal pour un court séjour à Berlin ! Je recommande 🫶🏼",1,0.0,Neutral
30.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,80.0,0,19.45903731603653,4.71,4.56,4.72,4.79,2682379,"Dagmar is not only a lovely and hospitable lady, who kindly picked me up from the station and provided me with a cup of tea & a pizza, she is also very interesting! I’ve really enjoyed our conversation. <br/>Her place is very near the airport which was ideal for me with an early flight.<br/>Thank you!",1,0.8933,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,21,100.0,1,8.187543141932318,4.92,4.93,4.9,4.8,1266630,"דירה מעוצבת ומאוד יפה<br/>נקיה ונוכה. מיקום מעולה, רחוב שקט<br/>מאובזרת, לא חסר כלום<br/>בעל הנכס זמין ועונה תמיד<br/>יש מעלית, יש מרפסת <br/>ממליצה בחום",1,0.0,Neutral
110.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,48,100.0,0,2.5459059307445027,4.86,4.93,4.89,4.74,11661596,"This place is excellent for a stay in Berlin! I arrived to a completely spotless apartment with a well-stocked kitchen and a very comfortable bed. Everything worked pretty well, though the WiFi had connectivity issues based on the where you were in the apartment and if the induction stove was on or not. The shower, washer, and dryer all worked great, and the hosts were very responsive with the questions I had.<br/>I will say as part of the review that this is decidedly not a handicap-friendly apartment to get to or move around in, and I would consider packing as light as you reasonably can as there is no elevator either. I wouldn't count the design of the apartment as a negative, but the bedroom is on the upper level of a split-level floor plan with most of the storage.<br/>Overall I'd recommend it if you're in Berlin for a few days!",1,0.8916,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,82.0,1,2.6808853188639663,4.67,4.68,4.92,4.59,43823296,Perfect spot for a night or two,1,0.5719,Positive
40.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,0,3.5930506255270385,4.74,4.53,4.89,4.79,21417127,"i really enjoyed my stay at Johannes home. the room is exactly as described, but i would also add that it’s a lot bigger than what you see in the pictures, it’s narrow but with super high ceilings and enough space to chill or to sleep depending on your vibe. plus there’s a really nice balcony over-looking a park that you have all to yourself, which is lovely in the morning with a cup of coffee. the house location is well connected too and only 50 minutes away from BER airport door to door. the area itself is full of great restaurants and bars too, so plenty for you to do in the areas if you wish, but being that its on a side street you hardly hear any noise at night so you can get a good nights sleep. the only draw back is the stairs with it being on the 5th floor (i think) just be ready for that before you arrive and i’m sure you’ll be fine. but apart that, perfect place and perfect host. highly recommend!",1,0.9956,Positive
155.0,4,2.0,2.0,2.0,12,100.0,0,1.780192239618757,4.69,4.53,4.85,4.54,29005536,"Die Wohnung liegt toll und es ist ruhig. Alles ist von dort schnell zu erreichen. Die Einrichtung ist etwas in die Jahre gekommen, aber alle ist sauber und für die Gäste gut vorbereitet. Wir würden wieder kommen.",1,-0.9485,Negative
108.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,70,100.0,1,2.641127618215382,4.96,4.94,4.95,4.88,267951,"I stayed in Frank's apartment for almost 3 months and I absolutely loved it! I felt at home straight away and the living and the bedroom are super spacious and very comfortable. The kitchen has everything you need (and more!) and frank even supplied musli, coffee and other treats. Big modern bathroom and beautiful wooden floors, my friends who visited got very jealous! Frank is super sweet but not invading at all and always around if you have any question! Overall amazing stay and I'll be in touch. Andrea ",1,0.9636,Positive
55.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,4.0502852041804935,4.82,4.6,4.81,4.79,21107552,Great stay! Oli has a lovely apartment and we felt right at home.,1,0.8478,Positive
144.0,4,1.0,1.0,0.0,25,100.0,0,1.036353653063746,4.7,4.92,4.93,4.79,1151188256067275968,"My stay at MMNT Berlin was great. Amazing location, friendly staff at the Adina hotel to help me keep luggage. Room was more spacious than I thought and generally clean (I remeber there was just 1 small piece of left trash but really not big deal). <br/>My only issue was the alarm ringing for unknown reason on one day at 7AM when I desperately needed sleep, but other than that really no issue at all.<br/>I also liked the filtered water tap, super helpful for Berlin when bottled water are expensive!",1,0.9194,Positive
108.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,36,100.0,0,3.590589217732416,4.72,4.57,4.76,4.64,24618866,"Really nice apartment, Ulf was extremely helpful in getting us inside the place. The place is very quaint and perfect for our week long trip",1,0.8793,Positive
138.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,1,3.1004876793387064,4.93,4.93,4.88,4.79,632952253374838730,"Das Apartment ist prima! Die Einrichtung ist sehr geschmackvoll, gut gepflegt und sauber, alles sehr praktisch. Auch die Lage ist super. Mitten in Kreuzberg und trotzdem ganz ruhig. Falls man sich versorgen möchte, ist alles in der Nähe. Ich habe ich sehr wohl gefühlt.",1,-0.636,Negative
