96.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,2.6441579309110788,4.94,4.95,4.85,4.88,8462220,"Jun's apartment was clean, well maintained, had all the essentials and was exactly as pictured.  The neighborhood had great restaurants within a 5 minute walk and there was a very large grocery store two-doors down from the apartment.  Two different tram lines were only short walk away - making it easy to see all the sites in the city.  Jun met us personally during check-in and answered any questions about the apartment.",1,0.8957,Positive
