108.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,41,94.0,1,0.6378915892111641,4.88,4.91,4.92,4.74,839069734231196810,"Tori's place is in the centre of the town yet is quiet enough such that my baby could get a restful sleep every night. Her check-in instructions were clear as day and despite having to collect the keys in the rain, everything went super smoothly. Highly recommend for its convenient location, comfortable bed and spacious bathroom.",1,0.9336,Positive
