167.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,39,97.0,0,5.365355387714029,4.69,4.76,4.25,4.5,1005601515937305762,Jediné mínus bylo málo světla v apartmánu. V kuchyni není prakticky skoro vidět. Byt byl o mnoho menší než v inzerátu. Pobyt byl velice příjemný.,1,0.0,Neutral
88.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,3.767446125494046,4.5,4.75,4.5,4.25,1481891603793306134,Wir hatten einen schönen Aufenthalt. Die Lage direkt am Park und an der Tram Haltestelle war super! Die Unterkunft war auch sehr sauber & die Kommunikation einfach und nett.<br/>Vielen Dank!,1,-0.953,Negative
175.0,6,2.0,1.5,2.0,21,100.0,0,6.688394137444405,4.8,4.9,4.85,4.6,48387556,"We had an amazing stay at this apartment, can't recommend it enough. The location is fantastic, close to both U-bahn and S-bahn in a lovely leafy street that is quiet but has all the things you would want in terms of small shops, bars and restaurants. The wider area has a lovely vibe, with very few tourists and walking further up into Schöneberg is a must for more independent shops, cafes and parks. The space itself is massive, well appointed and clean. The kitchen is pretty basic but the coffee machine and soundsystem more than make up for it. We stayed with 2 children (Age 5 and 2) and the cot and high chair were perfect. We'll be back in future, maybe next time we will leave them at home... Overall great experience with host Stefanie too, always responsive and gave good local advice. Highly recommended.",1,0.9922,Positive
96.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,2.6441579309110788,4.94,4.95,4.85,4.88,8462220,"We don't know if Jun is a Superhost, but he certainly should be. This place hits the mark on all categories. Lovely, spacious, decorated in minimalist style which gives you lots of room - very rare in Europe. It is basically a swanky hotel suite- very large bedroom, bath and a kitchen with a breakfast nook. It is behind a courtyard and very thick walls, so you hear no street noise. Very quiet. We found the location excellent- we took public transportation everywhere- the M4 and M10 Trams are especially useful and easy to find. We stayed 6 nights and would stay again at Jun's place in a heartbeat.",1,0.967,Positive
239.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,30,88.0,0,3.686748663714778,4.43,4.61,4.79,4.15,957737492041138566,"La ubicación es excelente, a unos pasos de la puerta de Brandenburgo, el apartamento es exactamente como en la descripción, la pasamos muy bien y seguramente volveremos muy pronto",1,0.0,Neutral
37.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,1,3.5878936439086595,4.8,4.8,4.83,4.67,614877823224944365,"Wir haben uns in der Unterkunft sehr wohl gefühlt, die Lage war prima, Kommunikation hat bestens geklappt, gerne wieder! 👍",1,-0.8439,Negative
70.0,3,0.0,1.0,1.0,53,100.0,1,6.364195333339494,4.95,4.86,4.97,4.87,44385359,"Cecilias house is located 8-10 min walk from train station Ostkreuz (train,metro) . 20 minutes by train (FEX - Flughafen express) from the airport Berlin Brandenburg to Ostkreuz station (1 stop). Quiet district.<br/>We had a nice time at Cecilias apartment: cozy room, spacious apartment has everything you need for good rest!  <br/>Cecilia sent list about  interesting places in Berlin /around.  <br/>Thanks for the hospitality and friendly atmosphere!",1,0.9039,Positive
131.0,2,1.0,1.0,0.0,24,100.0,1,8.152930353958586,4.87,4.88,4.86,4.78,2566846,"A wonderful place to stay. Fantastic location, everything is clean and of the highest quality. The sauna is lovely and the apartment comfortable and beautiful. Everything you could need is provided. Roi met us in person, was friendly and accommodating and always replied instantly to any questions. The flat is in a great location near the U-Bahn and is extremely safe and secure. Highly recommended for a stay in Berlin. ",1,0.9884,Positive
422.0,15,6.0,2.0,11.0,42,100.0,0,7.556065651864161,4.63,4.48,4.83,4.62,839919420344071044,Eugen was great to work with!  Very fast response to any questions.  Area was very nice. Close to many restaurants and coffee shops. Would stay here again for sure.,0,0.8685,Positive
247.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,1,5.2396889205230845,4.9,4.97,4.94,4.85,9881695,"We had a lovely stay, the apartment was spacious and clean. Check in was stress free. I look forward to returning soon.",0,0.7906,Positive
64.0,2,2.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,0,1.6243077961088226,4.82,4.96,4.87,4.8,13086696,"Really sweet and organized host! The apartment is really clean, great location, easy to get around from her place, and everything we needed was close by. ",1,0.9307,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,0,13.811832052182714,4.55,4.6,4.73,4.62,1273287,"Traumhafte Tage in Berlin<br/><br/>Heike ist eine wundervolle Gastgeberin und die Unterkunft hat uns sehr gut gefallen. Die Wohnung ist mit allem Ausgestattet um nur mit Klamotten anzureisen.<br/>Heike hat uns herzlich begrüßt und der Kühlschrank war mit den wichtigsten Dingen wie Wasser, Wein, Eier uvm. bestückt, so dass unsere späte Anreise direkt vor dem Feiertag kein Problem war. Die Küche ist komplett eingerichtet mit allem an Geräten und Geschirr was man braucht. Im Zimmer gab es dazu noch eine Schale mit frischem Obst.<br/>Das Zimmer ist ""Ikea-mäßig"" aber sehr schön und funktionell eingerichtet.<br/>Im modernen Bad ist alles da, Föhn, Schampon, Handtücher usw. <br/>Das Schrankbett ist nur 140 cm und für unseren Geschmack etwas schmal, Andere würden sagen kuschelig:-). <br/>Die Lage der Wohnung ist toll, gelegen an einem kleine See in einer angenehmen Gegend. Wir haben uns dort sicher gefühlt und an meinem nagelneuen Auto, dass ich drei Tage an der Strasse abgestellt war alles ok. Wir sind entweder mit der U2 vom Kaiserdamm oder mit dem Bus 100m die Strasse runter, völlig enspannt in die Stadt gekommen. Der normanische Bäcker (ca. 300m) hatte das ganze Wochenende geöffnet, so haben wir immer in der Wohnung gefrühstückt, bei tollem Blick auf den See und den Funkturm.<br/>Alles in Allem ein perfektes Wochenende.<br/>Vielen Dank an Heike, wir werden dich auf jeden Fall weiterempfehlen.<br/>",1,-0.9892,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,16,70.0,0,4.989041419310945,4.64,4.55,4.64,4.36,37252558,"Strongly recommend Julian's room! he has been very nice and helpful. Location wise is just perfect, room is nice, bathroom and kitchen are well equipped. Thx. Pep",1,0.9737,Positive
