313.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,21,82.0,1,2.6774214719576683,4.87,4.84,4.95,4.77,43824448,"This location really cannot be beat! We were in the heart of Berlin. Next to the canal where we had an amazing cruise. If you are going to Berlin, I highly recommend staying here. The hotel suite is spacious, clean, and a really awesome location in the city. It walk also within walking distance of the train station. Thank you so much for the wonderful opportunity to stay in your suite! Cheers",1,0.9785,Positive
