142.0,4,2.0,2.0,2.0,19,100.0,1,6.608155925105233,4.83,4.94,4.85,4.76,10423394,Fantastisk lägenhet (stor paradvåning) med smakfull inredning. <br/>Lugnt område och välkomnande värd. Härliga stora fönster för ljusinsläpp. <br/>Absolut värt att besöka och bo i samma lägenhet igen.,1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,60,0.0,0,12.405177895495836,4.79,4.84,4.73,4.68,14228442,"Le séjour de notre famille (4 personnes) chez Luba s'est très bien passé. L'appartement est très bien situé a proximité des transports en commun. Le centre ville est facile d'accès. La description de l'appartement correspond parfaitement à l'annonce avec beaucoup d'équipements (lave vaisselle, lave linge...). L'appartement est très propre et spacieux. L'accueil par Luba était parfait et elle a été extrêmement arrangeante et réactive à nos messages.",1,0.0,Neutral
80.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,1,6.685552207334886,4.84,4.78,4.84,4.65,15365339,"Ashraf was very friendly and he had no problems moving the check-in time. He greeted me at the entrance and showed me around the apartment. Everything was great, apartment clean, bed sheets clean, kitchen clean. Ashraf lives in the same building and he offered to help out if anything was missing. I felt quite at home and though the apartment itself is rather small, it has a balcony with a nice view and lots of sun in the afternoon. Recommended, I would stay there again. It's quite central, S-Bahn and subway stations reachable in 5 minutes by foot.",1,0.9516,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,0,5.800494003867822,4.59,4.79,4.45,4.56,849431,"Totally recommended, its a very cozy, comfortable, clean place. The owner was very nice and helpful showing us many tips about the neighborhood",1,0.9299,Positive
75.0,2,0.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,0,3.526516085976624,4.65,4.55,4.92,4.4,922893196670431337,"Fué una estancia agradable. El lugar está bien comunicado.  La zona es muy agradable, junto al canal. Hay cerca restaurantes, cafeterías, supermercados, bus y metro.",1,0.0,Neutral
65.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,4.1903954031521735,4.75,4.86,4.65,4.65,499342,"Karsten is an amazing host, gave us some great places to eat and things to do. All of which were great choices. The Thursday night food festival is a must. Apartment was in a great location, right next to the underground and only a couple stops into town. Apartment was lovely and clean. Will be back as soon as I can.",1,0.9781,Positive
81.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,1,2.618142013757112,4.87,4.9,4.91,4.75,3717751,We stayed with Yvonne and Vincent for 5 days in there garden flat! It was absolutely perfect. Perfect location. Perfect room. All the amenities you need! I hope to stay again one day in the future. Brilliant value for money! Couldn't be happier. ,1,0.9645,Positive
