64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,0,6.469436699560337,4.83,4.83,4.92,4.58,634617075742308571,"It was a very nice stay with a great location and easy access to the station. The area surrounding is full of great places to eat as well. As for the apartment, we were very satisfied, it was exactly as in the photos, clean and tidy place. We would really recommend the place.",1,0.9747,Positive
81.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,0,3.936308693497173,4.78,4.57,4.88,4.69,13010994,"The room is pretty nice and spacious. The bed is very comfy and the bedroom deco is relaxing. However, the room is in what I believe is a shop space so literally by the street and some annoyances can occur at night. Michael’s office is in the flat too so it’s not an entire private space either as he comes almost daily to work there. Also, the kitchen part is small and very dark during the day because there is only a window that gives on the backyard of the building  and no other light source. Overall a nice flat for a short stay. Definitely vintage! And Michael is a friendly good host 👍",1,0.9441,Positive
92.0,5,0.0,1.0,5.0,26,100.0,0,7.760040564236738,4.23,4.04,4.34,4.17,53539117,"The location of the Airbnb was very convenient for what we needed, the tram and metro line are at the bottom of the street so city centre is easily accessed. <br/>Plenty of shops and restaurants in the local area. The area felt safe and quiet. <br/>The space itself had everything we needed and was as described in the listings and pictures. We were disappointed however with the lack of cleanliness - surfaces and floors were dusty. But bathroom and kitchen were clean. Pillows could do with updating. <br/>Overall we were happy with the space! Thanks",1,0.9286,Positive
107.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,0,2.843625461730084,5.0,4.88,5.0,4.88,38204522,AMAZING FLAT. A must-stay place for any Berlin trip. Super helpful and thoughtful host and just a wonderful flat overall.,1,0.9554,Positive
187.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,37,100.0,0,1.5962726259634354,5.0,5.0,5.0,4.9,898967187798453410,"My daughter and I had a wonderful stay for a week in Corinne's Berlin apartment. The space is open, light and spacious, with lots of character-- its high ceilings, huge interior doors and kitchen opening on to a small balcony were especially appealing to us.  The area is packed with nice cafes and restaurants and we loved the weekly farmers' market in the plaza nearby.  Corinne was very quick and responsive to our communications and she arranged for a neighbor to greet us upon arrival.  All in all, a perfect place to stay in Berlin.",1,0.966,Positive
180.0,6,2.0,1.5,3.0,29,100.0,1,5.511924821665748,4.85,4.85,4.75,4.59,20189998,"Brandneu und sehr geschmackvoll eingerichtet mit netter Terrasse und Balkon. Sehr nette Gastgeber, mit schneller Kommunikation und sehr entgegenkommend, was Check-in und Check-Out angeht. Leider in der Einflugsschneise von Tegel, deshalb doch merklicher Fluglärm bis 23 Uhr und ab morgens. Wem das nicht stört, wird sich wohl fühlen.",0,0.0,Neutral
