91.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,26,100.0,0,7.579291414010911,4.61,4.57,4.89,4.6,15868988,"Die Wohnung ist super gelegen, nahe SBahn. Sie ist sehr ruhig und trotzdem nahe an Einkaufs- und Einkehrmöglichkeiten. Der Kontakt zum Vermieter war schnell und freundlich. Er hat auch gute Tipps für die nähere Umgebung. Die Schlüsselübergabe war gut organisiert und wir wurden freundlich empfangen. Die Wohnung war sauber. Nur das Schlafzimmer sehr klein und durch die Ebenerdigkeit schlecht zu lüften. Wir hatten eine tolle Woche in Berlin und empfehlen die Wohnung auf alle Fälle weiter. Vielen Dank!",1,-0.9867,Negative
151.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,94.0,0,3.1018817858877528,4.67,4.77,4.78,4.52,721527807549293451,everything's good.,1,0.4404,Positive
81.0,2,1.0,1.0,3.0,34,90.0,1,8.758840073119789,4.73,4.93,4.57,4.8,36612997,Fint och lugnt område med ungefär 1km till kollektivtrafik. Tar ungefär 30 min att komma in till centrala Berlin! Vi trodde det skulle vara mer privat än vad det var men det gick superbra endå! Värden var mycket trevlig,1,0.0,Neutral
313.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,49,100.0,1,2.887058665280372,4.89,4.76,4.83,4.71,721749273851792523,"The apartment was beautiful. There was everything you needed for a placent stay. We did not miss out of anything. A free parking space for our car on just 15min walking (or you could go by tram). The only downside are the doors to the bedrooms, these contain some glas panels. I would prefer to cover them with some foil to have some more privacy. Still this did t bother us too much and we had a very placent stay.",0,0.6421,Positive
69.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,1,6.04491222918904,4.78,4.91,4.65,4.71,8026172,Quiet neighborhood & easy access to the main city via metro make this spot great!,1,0.807,Positive
63.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,13.54616004135495,4.82,4.94,4.87,4.77,18070061,"The room is located in a beautiful area, next to the most beautiful street we saw in Berlin! Really appreciate how clean the room was, especially the bathroom! Christoph was friendly, he gave us some advice about the best places to eat near the house and also helped us with the public transport. We had a great time there, definitely a great experience.",1,0.9868,Positive
97.0,2,1.0,1.0,0.0,23,100.0,0,1.0368255639209347,4.7,4.86,4.9,4.66,1141827850047916008,Exceeded our expectations!,1,0.0,Neutral
