144.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,56,100.0,0,3.9405046901379785,5.0,5.0,5.0,4.73,801512064531790001,"Nous avons eu un magnifique séjour, Katrin s‘est montrée très accueillante et soucieuse de répondre à tous nos besoins et envie. La communication était facile et agréable, nous avons profité de ses bons conseils pour explorer les environs et de la délicieuse pizzeria napolitaine à proximité. <br/>Et quel bonheur de profiter de ce magnifique appartement, proche de toutes commodités et de son joli balcon ensoleillé offrant une vue imprenable sur la Fernsehturm et les toits de Berlin. <br/>Nous aimerions beaucoup revenir à Berlin dans ces conditions !",1,0.2481,Positive
125.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,36,0.0,0,10.212135250191398,4.96,4.97,4.91,4.84,9225893,"I had great pleasure during my stay in the Nadine's apartment. Very stylish and cozy apartment. Most suitable for romantic and family trips to Berlin. The owners are nice, nice and caring people. Big thanks to them!",1,0.9711,Positive
97.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,5.089207549175922,4.9,4.98,4.84,4.68,813841440855271830,"I had a wonderful time staying at Anna's lovely apartment during my recent trip to Berlin. Anna was an extremely responsive, accommodating host who was flexible on my check-in time and quick to respond. Anna also gave clear instructions for the apartment. <br/>The apartment was a great size, comfortable bed and had all the amenities it needed. The apartment is better in real life than the photos and was a perfect base for my week in Berlin.<br/>Location wise it was also perfect as it was close to U-Bahn, food shops and great bars/restaurants around reuterstr/Neukolln. Would highly recommend staying here and would definitely come back !",1,0.9925,Positive
54.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,4.256716855805879,4.86,4.93,4.92,4.83,13697965,I really liked my stay. It is in the center of Berlin. The host is a very kind and nice person. The whole place is very clean and comfortable. Thank you Janet!,1,0.9595,Positive
