232.0,7,3.0,2.0,9.0,49,100.0,1,5.724698314400603,4.86,4.82,4.7,4.71,30078342,"El departamento es maravilloso!! Cuenta con 3 recamaras cada una con calefacción lo que ayuda muchísimo a mantener la casa caliente. Las camas son cómodas.<br/>La sala es hermosa con tv, en ella hay dos sofás camas súper cómodos.<br/>Los Baños están en perfectas condiciones y limpios, hay jabón para manos y cuerpo, secadora de caballero sería grandioso que hubiera shampoo.<br/>La cocina es fabulosa! Tiene un refri bastante grande y hay todo para que puedas cocinar; la enorme mesa para cenar con tu familia 8 sillas suficientes para el grupo! <br/>Hay lavadora y nos dejaron jabón para lavar ropa, gran detalle! <br/>La ubicación perfecta, 20 min caminando desde la estación de tren que te lleva al aeropuerto. Sin duda volveré a tomar el sitio de Nina. Mil gracias!!",0,-0.4153,Negative
166.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,16,50.0,0,8.694176238638248,4.7,4.55,4.81,4.41,22495883,Ein sehr schönes Hausboot mit gemütlichem Kamin. Hat alles super geklappt und wir hatten eine gute Zeit.,1,0.5994,Positive
72.0,2,0.0,1.0,3.0,40,100.0,0,7.593507322759444,4.7,4.67,4.88,4.72,19742792,"Die Unterkunft war wie beschrieben. Der Check In war problemlos und sehr nett. Gut fanden wir auch, dass man 2 Schlüssel bekommen hat, das ist sehr praktisch, wenn man mal getrennt losgeht.",1,-0.9136,Negative
93.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,2.54678149398414,4.86,4.96,4.9,4.84,3187735,"Barbara's studio was exactly as advertised, very chic and stylish in decor as well as being most importantly, completely spotless. Barbara was very welcoming host upon our arrival making us feel at ease immediately whilst sharing a lot of interesting and useful information about the studio as well as the city. The studio itself is warm and very well equipped with everything you would need to self cater. The selling point is definitely the location which is just a few tram stops into the main transport hub to get around the city. Barbara's apartment comes highly recommended. If you are travelling in Winter the bath tub is an absolute delight! ",1,0.9844,Positive
168.0,6,2.0,1.5,3.0,21,99.0,0,3.880339168487847,4.63,4.39,4.81,4.5,33234428,"The apartment is very nice and quiet, in a quiet street but in a very convenient area.  The neighbourhood is great, whether you like big techno clubs like Berghain or walking the around the former East Germany buildings. I would totally recommend Stella’s place!",0,0.9594,Positive
151.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,28,97.0,0,3.918641789625612,4.72,4.74,4.79,4.58,11450419,"Appartamento luminoso e comodo,  in posizione centrale, a pochi minuti da due fermate dei mezzi pubblici su rotaia più usati di Berlino (La U-bahn e la S-bahn) per spostarsi in tutta la città e nel circondario, dall'aeroporto a Potsdam. Stefan è stato molto reattivo e lo ringraziamo per averci fatto anticipare il check-in alla mattina del nostro arrivo. Consigliamo l'appartamento.",1,0.0,Neutral
284.0,9,3.0,1.5,7.0,40,97.0,0,1.2426170637883316,4.56,4.47,4.76,4.54,1009239484480765860,Great neighborhood.,0,0.6249,Positive
203.0,6,3.0,1.0,3.0,43,100.0,1,4.140963863667464,4.89,4.92,4.89,4.78,4182815,"A home from home! This is a perfect base, it is clean, comfortable, and homely. Myself and two friends stayed for nearly two weeks whilst attending Berlinale film festival and it was a great place to come back to each day. Great transportation links, places to eat and drink close by. Excellent communication with the host. <br/>A great trip!",0,0.9868,Positive
