125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,0,0.5555591583260235,4.82,4.96,4.88,4.69,10031729,"This is a perfect place to stay in Berlin! It is located in an authentic building and is quite central, 3 minutes walking distance to Alexanderplatz. The host, Marius, is also very proffesional. Thanks for a great stay! ",1,0.9111,Positive
110.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,48,100.0,0,2.5459059307445027,4.86,4.93,4.89,4.74,11661596,"Nice and a lovely apartment, will stay there again.  <br/>Best regards.<br/>Kristján Rafn..",1,0.765,Positive
60.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,51,100.0,1,8.76289456061162,4.98,4.98,4.82,4.95,6936087,"Petra’s apartment is such a good find and she is a wonderful host. Very responsive, loads of tips about things to do in Berlin, very nice apartment and she put on breakfast each morning! I can’t say enough positive things to be honest!",1,0.9637,Positive
77.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,38,100.0,0,3.130777776464285,4.77,4.59,4.83,4.6,612157073909883323,"Apartment with character and style, clean and a great location with many nice restaurants. I felt comfortable in the house, it was relatively quiet for a building with so many people and I slept super good! Really would like to come back to Berlin and definitely will book this room again.",1,0.9763,Positive
93.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,21,100.0,0,4.06054592628569,4.71,4.68,4.65,4.7,29701362,Wir hatten eine super Zeit in der Wohnung und einen unkomplizierten Aufenthalt. Alles war wie beschrieben und es war für 2 Erwachsene und 2 kleine Kinder mehr als ausreichend an Platz vorhanden. Immer wieder gerne!,1,-0.2481,Negative
67.0,5,1.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,0,4.171651288410796,4.4,4.34,4.81,4.4,26559060,"Die Wohnung liegt in der Nähe der U-Bahn, nur wenige Stationen vom Zentrum entfernt oder zu Fuß erreichbar. Der Hauptbahnhof ist ebenfalls in der Nähe. Der Supermarkt ist 50 Meter entfernt. Die Wohnung ist ruhig, die Fenster gehen zum Innenhof. Die Wohnung hat einen langen Flur, links ist die Küche, dann das Badezimmer, geradeaus ein großer Raum und dahinter durch die Tür ein kleiner Raum. Die Küche und die Wohnung insgesamt bieten alles, was wir brauchten.<br/>Es wäre schön gewesen, zusätzlich zu den zwei zu großen Töpfen einen kleinen in der Küche zu haben. Aber das sind Kleinigkeiten, ansonsten ist alles in Ordnung.",1,-0.9864,Negative
200.0,5,3.0,2.0,3.0,27,100.0,0,15.461426618588051,5.0,5.0,4.67,4.67,1342533694187176864,"Jörg ist ein sehr guter Gastgeber,, der stets schnell und freundlich auf alle Fragen reagiert hat. Seine Beschreibungen und Hinweise waren eine tolle Hilfe. Das Haus ist sehr geräumig und gut ausgestanden von hoher Qualität.  Es ist eine Perle in Berlin mit guter Anbindung. Es hat alles und mehr was man braucht um die Zeit in Berlin zu genießen. Wir kommen jederzeit gern wieder.",0,-0.5994,Negative
112.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,42,100.0,1,2.97782445506794,4.86,4.91,4.87,4.74,22275529,Perfect place to enjoy Berlin. Highly recommended.,1,0.8399,Positive
160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,87.0,0,3.4802565088356308,4.54,4.54,4.6,4.41,43798011,"Very nice place, good location, would stay again.",1,0.7397,Positive
274.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,43,100.0,1,1.6592287277224604,4.91,4.92,4.91,4.75,39579556,"Definitely recommend this apartment; lots of great restaurants, cafes, supermarket within easy walking distance, and a fantastic little pizza place right below. <br/>Great to have a lift, although its only a couple of flights of stairs to walk up. <br/>Very comfortable beds, and a nice little kitchen dining area to sit in. <br/>Plenty of room in the bathroom. <br/>We would definitely stay again if in Berlin. Thanks so much Simon & Ben!",0,0.9794,Positive
124.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,22,90.0,1,0.9184054408592692,4.65,4.48,4.86,4.7,36445603,"Super gelegen, um Berlin zu erkunden! Sauber und alles da was man braucht.",1,0.636,Positive
139.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,1,3.5852919241394265,4.61,4.65,4.56,4.53,969200,"Die Unterkunft war wie abgebildet, sehr sauber und geräumig. Die Schlüsselübergabe unkompliziert und die Übergabe der Wohnung sehr ausführlich.  Gute Anbindung an die öffentlichen Verkehrsmittel und gute Parkmöglk. vor dem Haus, und gute Einkaufsmöglk. in dirkter Nähe.<br/>Leider recht laut, wenn man mit offenem Fenster schlafen möchte, da direkt an der Straße gelegen. Ohropax dann empfehlenswert.<br/>Habe mich dennoch wohlgefühlt.",1,-0.9661,Negative
79.0,4,1.0,1.5,2.0,60,100.0,1,3.902646890139105,4.84,4.88,4.9,4.71,8386451,Nice 1 bed apartment for the Kreuzberg area,1,0.4215,Positive
125.0,7,3.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,1,7.544121349037586,4.88,4.81,4.81,4.85,30333965,Die Wohnung war super!<br/>Die Kommunikation war auch perfekt. <br/>Jeder Zeit gerne wieder.,0,-0.9184,Negative
112.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,1,7.03606664813505,4.84,4.94,4.63,4.75,926670,"Arzu & Tom were the best! We had a great and comprehensive intro to the neighbourhood, the surrounding nightlife and daytime activities. There were maps, leaflets and great material we used throughout our 5-day stay. <br/><br/>Updates throughout the stay were really good, too.  Sunday morning we woke to a message telling us about a flea marketing going on that was close to the flat. It was these little details and attentiveness that we loved the most!<br/><br/>We couldn't highly recommend staying in this great apartment. Thanks so much and we hope to be back in the summer!<br/><br/>Harry & Lottie",1,0.9848,Positive
295.0,8,2.0,2.0,3.0,49,100.0,1,5.961083106152229,4.94,4.94,4.59,4.84,44441834,"Simon’s place was impecable, well kept and clean.  Attention to detail was well care for, and we really liked the place…!!!!",0,0.924,Positive
316.0,8,3.0,2.0,4.0,45,100.0,1,1.2937250483136316,4.73,4.76,4.9,4.61,12048269,"First impression of the building: as a whole is well kept, recently renovated and an outside elevator to take us to the second floor. <br/>Our contact person was waiting for us in the apartment as agreed; <br/>As it was a cold autumn day, it was quite chilly upon our arrival and it took until the morning before the apartment was warmed up a bit. The heating makes some noise so better turn it off during night. We recommend to heat the apartment in due time so that on arrival of the guests it feels already warm, especially on colder days.<br/>As the apartment is on an inner courtyard, no noise from outside, despite the very busy Törstrasse. Several small stores for bread, fruits and other food and non-food items in the area on short walking distance. Also bike rentals and metro nearby. <br/>The first impression of the apartment was similar to the pictures; a place one can feel home immediately, with a large sofa, and a mixture of Ikea and other interior elements. During the day lots of light through the windows on both sides of the living area. <br/>We rented the two parts of the loft for 5 persons but only stayed with 4 persons, as 1 person had to cancel.<br/>Very spacious living room with open kitchen and nice dining table. Kitchen is well equipped. We only had breakfast.<br/>One big bedroom (occupied by 2 persons during our stay) and two smaller rooms (each occupied by 1 person during our stay). The smaller rooms can be shared by 2 persons but not very spacious. No space for hanging clothes in the smaller rooms. Quality of the beds was fine.<br/>Bathrooms are quite small, the sink in the main apartment bathroom is  very small.<br/>The apartment was clean on arrival. <br/>In general we enjoyed our stay in the apartment , and having visited already several Airbnb apartments within our group, we felt it to be one of the places that lived up to its promises. <br/>",0,0.983,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,80.0,1,3.3088530361417954,4.74,4.64,4.87,4.77,16007104,"Il mio soggiorno da Bella ha rispettato tutto cio che mi aspettavo. Comodo, confortevole, comodissimo ai mezzi<br/>Spero che Bella mi ospiti amcora. È una persona deliziosa",1,0.34,Positive
128.0,5,3.0,1.0,5.0,25,95.0,0,10.882845065585462,4.4,4.0,4.8,4.2,767230241840141794,"Wszystko było w porządku, polecam!",0,0.0,Neutral
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,52,100.0,0,18.623100777897022,4.94,4.95,4.79,4.92,229099,"Hannes was extremely helpful from start to finish. He responded to my request for booking extremely quick, and this remained consistent all throughout. It is my first time in Berlin and he was kind enough to pick me up at the airport. He has a lovely home with great space and close by to a supermarket. I definitely recommend Hannes and his home. So friendly and helpful.",1,0.978,Positive
193.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,1.6174058144101784,4.83,4.89,4.86,4.73,21162110,"It was the perfect place for my family to spend our vacation in Birger’s apartment. Near to Alexander platz , the Underground station is next to the building. And the apartment is with great view :)!",1,0.8439,Positive
334.0,6,3.0,2.0,3.0,62,100.0,1,1.4069254616129323,4.84,4.94,4.85,4.74,991825698983910455,"A very beautiful and clean place with a unique view. Lara, the communicator was very cooperative, nice and helpful :)",0,0.9436,Positive
140.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,49,100.0,1,3.2254531575112866,4.87,4.87,4.92,4.76,11665059,"L’appartamento di Marcus è molto grande, comodo, pulito ed attrezzato. Cucina grande e pulita dotata di un gran numero di stoviglie, pentole e di ogni elettrodomestico grande e piccolo. Biancheria da letto e di casa fornita in abbondanza e perfettamente pulita. Facili check-in e check out. Marcus ha inviato in anticipo informazioni precise e dettagliate per l’utilizzo dell’appartamento e quindi non è stato necessario chiedere altro. Appartamento al piano terra molto silenzioso in una via tranquilla. Ubicazione comoda per i mezzi pubblici di ogni tipo e per i negozi (supermercati ecc.). Consiglio vivamente questo appartamento",0,0.34,Positive
287.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,1,1.973935897573968,4.98,4.96,4.98,4.82,33544257,Great stay with plenty of space and lots to do within walking distance or a short tram ride away.,1,0.6249,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,0,5.240564981087221,4.88,4.43,4.71,4.78,44596704,Die Unterkunft entspricht 1:1 der Beschreibung. Das Zimmer ist super cozy und man fühlt sich direkt wohl und wie zu Hause! Yi war super lieb und nett und hat immer schnell geantwortet. Die Wohnung war direkt gegenüber von der S-Bahn Station was auch sehr praktisch war. Ich würde die Unterkunft auf jeden Fall weiter empfehlen!!,1,-0.955,Negative
96.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,2.6441579309110788,4.94,4.95,4.85,4.88,8462220,"Jun's place was the perfect base for exploring Berlin. We could easily get into the centre and to other interesting places in the vicinity by walking as well as tram/train (plenty of options nearby). The flat itself is big, modern and spotlessly clean. It was great to have breakfast out on the balcony to prepare for a busy day of sightseeing! Jun was very accommodating with our late check too. We loved our stay, thanks!",1,0.9753,Positive
61.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,1,5.842565215322787,4.78,4.79,4.89,4.75,678929364897072061,A great stay in a fantastic location!,1,0.8398,Positive
55.0,1,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,0,4.553294414311587,5.0,4.82,4.82,4.91,7511673,Katja was the prefect host. Went out of her way to help me. Her apartment is beautiful and in a great area just a 10 walk to the tube. Brilliant! ,1,0.9412,Positive
53.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,1,1.9136892540066155,4.82,4.73,4.95,4.74,851577798843640421,"Everything was easy, Roxanne is very nice and friendly. She gave me great tips, what I have could visit. Room looks exactly like on the photos and near is a lot of good cafés, restaurants and shops. I can recommend it.",1,0.9659,Positive
84.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,52,100.0,1,3.3219101132328723,4.81,4.81,4.9,4.73,1238867,"The apartment was large and spacious, the bed was also really comfortable to sleep on. Great location right next to the trains station and trams also is 5 mins away from an Arcade mall. Host was super kind and responsive even let us know about a tube strike that was happening during our stay! Shows he cares about his guests.",1,0.9652,Positive
90.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,47,100.0,1,3.079952985679858,4.97,4.93,4.97,4.87,1016800494683320175,"The room is in a lovely, bright and spacious duplex flat on the top floor of the building. Has all necessary amenities. Private bathroom and balcony. Shared kitchen and living room. The location is a real plus. Shops, restaurants and trendy cafés nearby. Located on a crossing of city train and tram lines, which give easy access to the main sights, downtown, airport and main train station. Martina is a welcoming host while respecting a guests' privacy. Her two cats, Simba and Kleo, are always around for a cuddle.",1,0.9578,Positive
71.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,48,100.0,1,8.507814024677707,4.83,4.71,4.93,4.79,17331756,very cosy appartment. Easy communication. Great transport possibilities,1,0.8055,Positive
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,16,100.0,1,6.361542574957824,4.89,4.66,4.79,4.73,33634726,"Kosta was a great host, very responsive and considerable. The  apartment is very comfortable and in a great location",1,0.9391,Positive
422.0,6,3.0,2.0,3.0,34,100.0,1,2.9051794007943927,4.98,4.97,4.92,4.87,24019375,This apartment is absolutely beautiful. Incredible taste! The location is great and lots of local bars and restaurants. Magnus was a perfect host and very accommodating. Would love stay again!,0,0.9586,Positive
134.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,39,100.0,0,2.6528807258712552,4.85,4.95,4.75,4.8,44056107,Really enjoyed our time at Julia’s place . It was very clean and airy and in a great location . Felt safe as the apartment was through a locked corridor and courtyard. <br/>The transport system is easily accessible and some nice restaurants are nearby .,1,0.9571,Positive
