88.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,100.0,1,1.881496822425637,4.71,4.61,4.93,4.66,44740912,"Very kind, was met in person to hand over the key, with some great recommendations for food and things to do.<br/>Well worth the money, it is bigger than the pictures suggest and overall a great place to stay.<br/>You will have to handle the stairs which are easy enough but plenty of them, it keeps you fit after eating too much at the street where it's located as you will be enjoying all the different options, also a REWE supermarket in 4 minutes walking so great and highly recommended.",1,0.98,Positive
