125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,0,5.388539787382648,4.83,4.79,4.83,4.67,50971154,"Big and beautiful flat. It’s in a very walkable area and just one flight up. I was able to do all my berlin exploring from a nice home base. I didn’t expect it to be their own private home with all their clothes, but still a great stay!",1,0.8832,Positive
