145.0,6,2.0,2.5,4.0,43,100.0,1,1.8267932703234075,4.89,4.74,4.92,4.82,48864380,"Great place to stay in Berlin!<br/>The place has a well-equipped kitchen, three bathrooms (two showers!), two big bedrooms and a dining room. <br/>Highly suggested for a big group! It is very close to public transport and it's really quiet. Thank you Robert for having hosted us!",0,0.8421,Positive
