37.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,1,12.302303063837329,4.9,4.92,4.67,4.93,37581746,"I couldn’t have asked for a better accommodation during my stay in Berlin, the location is fantastic, close to many public transportation options, which made it super easy for us to explore most of the city's main attractions. The apartment itself is in a peaceful and quiet neighbourhood, perfect for relaxing after a long day of sightseeing. It also has a strong internet connection. The place was very accommodating and had all the basic amenities needed for a comfortable stay.<br/>Highly recommend",1,0.9875,Positive
60.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,45,100.0,1,3.689600261518912,4.74,4.55,4.76,4.65,16237052,"Compact flat with everything you need in it! Easy to get around the east side of Berlin, with a great pizza place down the road. The bed and the sofa bed were very comfortable. The shower is powerful and warm. Dietrich and his wife were very helpful. Would recommend. ",1,0.9659,Positive
158.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,98.0,0,4.767655843053005,4.46,4.61,4.37,4.33,685224054858608898,A beautiful apartment in the centre of Berlin. It is very bright with lots of natural light and spacious. <br/>I felt at home! <br/>Easy check-in and communication. *Recommended*,1,0.8716,Positive
145.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,71,100.0,0,1.8454547012862048,4.78,4.9,4.88,4.59,1176655,"I have just had a lovely 4 night stay at Stephanie's apartment. It is bright, clean and with a very well equipped kitchen. It is well located and we were able to walk nearly everywhere. There is a great supermarket just down the road, a park over the road and a tramline just nearby. I would definitely recommend",1,0.9701,Positive
