59.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,1,5.221624642781363,4.95,4.92,4.92,4.9,13256017,Matthias很親切，謝謝幫忙協助提行李上樓，還提供我們一些額外的餐具，方便我們可以吃自己準備的食物。房間有許多有趣的收藏品，床也相當舒適。但要注意附近的140公車不是很準時。,1,0.0,Neutral
40.0,1,0.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,11.034398061498583,4.65,4.83,4.45,4.68,714312,"Great place! Oksana is helpful and responsive!<br/>The flat is very close to the train. <br/>There is a new, upscale mall right around the corner from the flat which is a great place to get last minute items for a traveler. It’s worth it to take some time to stroll around the mall. The train station is underneath the mall, so you enter the mall to get to the train. <br/>This is an affordable, convenient flat that provides a great place to sleep and wash up while visiting Berlin!",1,0.9576,Positive
