130.0,4,1.0,1.0,5.0,22,99.0,0,3.852471644606984,4.74,4.59,4.8,4.62,25936092,"The apartment is in a great location, well equipped and clean. It was a bit difficult to get in as the lockboxes did not work properly. Also, it could have been a little warmer inside. Overall, we enjoyed our stay and recommend the place.",1,0.9202,Positive
