380.0,4,2.0,2.0,3.0,48,100.0,1,1.1071575355391072,4.95,4.99,4.91,4.78,16091735,"Rarely does a description of a place accurately reflect reality -- but this one does. The place, in fact, is ""superb."" Large unit, quiet, great building, well located, clean, well appointed, high ceilings. It was a great end to a long trip for us. It was easy to hop on the U-Bahn with two convenient stations nearby. We walked to a good Indian restaurant on the river, and there were several other places in easy walking distance. Cannot say enough good things about the place -- terrific!",0,0.9918,Positive
54.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,11,100.0,1,5.259652982108338,4.82,4.9,4.9,4.81,2657671,"Perfect location, very comfortable room, clean and airy (just know it's up five floors). I met Ramona very briefly, and she was very nice and easy to communicate with.",1,0.9478,Positive
130.0,4,0.0,1.5,4.0,20,93.0,0,2.3258672060118277,4.75,4.59,4.79,4.66,16730380,"The host was very nice and the apartment is big enough and in a great location (plenty of bars and restaurants close by).<br/>Nevertheless, we had a problem with the hot water and it was only warm (the temperature was still kind of ok to take showers).",1,0.8074,Positive
156.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,0,2.2531285722967658,4.58,4.63,4.73,4.47,49844243,"Stylish apartment, clean, well equiped, location is ok, and I really loved the opportunity to leave luggage after check out in a safe place, so me and my wife could comfortably enjoy another day in Berlin without taking our luggage everywhere with us. I believe this place will keep upgrading and will get only better.",1,0.9746,Positive
55.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,4.0502852041804935,4.82,4.6,4.81,4.79,21107552,Really enjoyed my stay at Oli’s. Very clean and private. Extremely convenient location as well.,1,0.8265,Positive
77.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,34,100.0,1,4.4625182162657095,4.52,4.61,4.77,4.48,11078656,Very well located cute place close to the Bergmannstrasse. Easy communication. We spent 3 very nice days.,1,0.8922,Positive
86.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,0,2.0121165061944306,4.85,4.75,4.9,4.78,6229070,"I would like to thanks for very nice accommodation in the very nice district in Berlin. Everything was very nice. Quiet neighborhood, very nice street, but very close to one of the coolest Berlin district of Mitte. We were very happy with the apartment, its fresh and new interior. Thank You again for this nice accommodation.    ",1,0.9769,Positive
114.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,1,3.268352166045826,4.8,4.74,4.89,4.71,11294240,집 정말 깔끔하고 좋아요! 사진으로 보는것 보다 넓게 느껴졌고 공간 분리되어있어서 편했어요. 일단 너무 따뜻해요 화장실까지 따뜻함! 따뜻한물 잘나오고 욕조도 커서 반신욕하기도 좋을거같은데 못하고 온게 아쉽네요ㅋㅋ 식기류들도 깨끗하고 요리해먹기편하고 테라스도 있어서 날씨 좋을때 테라스에서 아침먹으면 너무 좋을거같아요. 한가지 단점은 집이 한층 올라가야하는데 계단으로 올라가야해서 무거운 캐리어 들고 올라가는데 힘들었네요ㅠㅠ 이거빼고는 다 좋았어요 베를린 숙소로 추천해요!,1,0.0,Neutral
355.0,5,3.0,1.0,4.0,60,100.0,1,4.452003338303747,4.85,4.83,4.81,4.65,29553923,"Tolle Wohnung im Bergmannkiez.<br/>Die Wohnung ist recht ruhig, da sie im Hinterhaus liegt.<br/>Das Wohnzimmer und Esszimmer ist gemütlich aber auch funktional eingerichtet. Am Wohnzimmerfenster laufen ab und zu Leute vorbei weshalb man abends dann lieber die Vorhänge zu macht. Auch tagsüber ist das Wohnzimmer recht dunkel (da Erdgeschoss im Hinterhaus), was uns für die paar Tage jetzt aber nicht gestört hat. Alles in allem eine tolle Wohnung für einen Besuch in Berlin.",0,-0.8316,Negative
70.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,65,100.0,1,7.596185065281438,4.92,4.92,4.94,4.9,43618900,"I enjoyed my stay at Jürgen's lovely apartment very much. The room is cozy. The private bathroom is a plus. But what I enjoyed the most was the balcony with the beautiful flowers. So if the weather is nice, make sure to enjoy a meal (maybe breakfast from Le Bretagne) or drink there. BTW, you can get still or sparkling drinking water directly from the fridge, no need to buy any water. I did not get to meet Jürgen in person, unfortunately, but his friend Monica met me upon arrival and made me feel at home right away. I also met Paulina who lives there, too, and we had a few pleasant chats about going out. I can fully recommend staying at Jürgen's. Not only is the apartment wonderful but also its surroundings with many great restaurants and bars and public transportation within walking distance.",1,0.9937,Positive
143.0,6,1.0,1.0,3.0,35,93.0,0,14.44165293547941,4.73,4.86,4.82,4.74,1094597524537374236,"Die Unterkunft war wie beschrieben. Tolle Einrichtung, bequeme Betten und alles was man braucht",1,-0.8316,Negative
