171.0,9,4.0,1.5,5.0,41,100.0,1,4.936124446607811,4.63,4.5,4.43,4.63,4106583,"Large space close to S-Bahn and subway! Great for groups. Very strange layout (shower in kitchen), mediocre mattresses, and some noise from sidewalk out front. But if you don't expect too much, it's a great value for 3+ bedrooms. We didn't meet Alex, but he was very helpful and nice.",0,0.9651,Positive
