89.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,0,12.72557223503116,4.66,4.69,4.68,4.53,15019290,"Prima locatie,  behalve dan de grote splinters in de houten vloer onder de eettafel. Het geheel mag best wel eens een likje verf krijgen.",1,0.6369,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,0,4.199833693434669,4.92,4.75,4.75,4.83,686483682741766124,"Die Kommunikation mit Annett war unkompliziert, nett und zielführend.<br/>Das Zimmer mit Bad war prima und alles sehr sauber. Die Gemeinschaftsküche war auch sehr sauber und bestens ausgestattet. <br/>Ich hätte mir einen Tisch mit stuhl gewünscht um längere Zeit am Laptop arbeiten zu können aber sonst war alles bestens.<br/>Das Objekt ist mitten in Friedrichshain, fussläufig von meinem Lieblingsnachtclub, dem Watergate entfernt. Wenn ich nochmal plane nach Berlin zu kommen, dann werde versuchen eines der drei Zimmer zu bekommen.",1,-0.9816,Negative
38.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,0,8.794289797931516,4.8,4.74,4.67,4.84,35396598,Really nice place,1,0.4754,Positive
72.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,1,7.363278935671278,4.83,4.84,4.86,4.74,250007,"Appartement décoré avec goût, tres agréable et reposant, la literie est de grand confort !<br/>Nous avons été bien accueilli et  avions a disposition toutes les informations pour passer un bon sejour a Berlin . Le quartier est de plus tres bien situé dans un quartier calme et agreable avec commerces, restaurants et station de metro tres proche. A recommander !!!",1,0.6331,Positive
158.0,6,2.0,2.0,3.0,35,100.0,0,6.528677763046801,4.67,4.66,4.84,4.65,40414534,"Top Wohnung in top Lage, optimal für einen Sauftrip nach Berlin.",0,0.6249,Positive
142.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,1,5.27558139431103,4.76,4.87,4.66,4.57,30551380,"Voyageur à vélo français je me suis arrêté ici pour visiter Berlin l’hôtel est bien situé, commerce, restaurant et attractions à visiter sont facilement accessibles à pied où à vélo pour ma part sinon aussi le métro à côté de l’hôtel. Pour le vélo aucun souci de sécurité un accès au garage avec un badge pour l’accès. La chambre est spacieuse avec une cuisine équipée pour bien cuisiner. Le quartier est calme aucun bruit.",1,0.4215,Positive
293.0,6,2.0,1.5,3.0,47,100.0,1,2.826856216058209,4.87,4.82,4.89,4.73,83614,"Everything was perfect! The apartment is really nice, well located, very clean and well decorated and Andrea is a nice host! We didn't meet but he left everything so well organized, he made contact to know if everything was nice and to offer help in the city and he left a phone with internet connection to help the guests getting around. It was really nice!!!",0,0.9825,Positive
179.0,10,4.0,3.5,5.0,22,100.0,1,6.948660996537318,4.85,4.92,4.68,4.72,20910462,"The apartment was fantastic and clean, and during Berlin’s summer 30 degree heat, the air conditioning kept it really cool. There only a few issues, but only as recommendations for Oliver. The wifi didn’t cover much of the house, so we would suggest better wifi. The curtains on the windows were small and let a lot of light in. <br/>However, I would still give Oliver’s friendliness, communication and his apartment a 5 out of 5.",0,0.9152,Positive
169.0,6,3.0,1.0,6.0,22,80.0,0,6.312791039738437,4.39,4.41,4.61,4.38,1234638,"The apartment is very clean. Good location walking distance going to pub, market, restaurants and train station. We enjoyed our stay. Thank you Enrico 😊",0,0.8995,Positive
62.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,26,100.0,0,3.629430806531379,4.76,4.8,4.68,4.69,1017368,"This apartment is in a great location. My family of four (two teens) stay here three nights. There was enough space to spread out after a long day of touring Berlin. The apartment is located less than a 7 min walk from the U-Bhan station. Michael direction from the airport was great and it only took about 30-35 minutes to get to his apartment. There is also a bus stop nearby and it can take you to most of the major tourist attraction. Michael’s apartment was clean, and we felt safe (there is a bar up the street- a little loud some nights) and it had good Wi-Fi. He showed us the apartment and how to get to bus stop and provide some other helpful information. There are couple places to eat near the apartment. I would recommend this apartment if you need to sleep four and want easy access to the metro station and bus routes. . If you prefer to take a taxi the cost is around €30. There is only one TV, but if you there to see Berlin...it does not matter. ",1,0.906,Positive
50.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,0,4.231097673854453,4.73,4.75,4.55,4.68,30384248,"Alles in allem eine gute Unterkunft. Ein paar Punkte können verbessert werden, aber die gibt es ja immer. ;)",1,-0.4588,Negative
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,4.168083698931513,4.83,4.86,4.66,4.71,499353,"This was a lovely space! It's cute/stylish, comfy, very clean, and in a quiet neighborhood while also being very centrally located and close to public transit. The apartment had everything we needed (including a french press and espresso maker!). It was actually bigger than I thought it might be based on the pictures! There's plenty of restaurants within walking distance, as well as a drug store and a grocery store.<br/>Karsten was a great host. He was easy to communicate with and replied promptly. We had numerous flight delays and so had to keep pushing back our check in time, but Karsten was very understanding and accommodating. He even offered to help us out when the airline lost our luggage!<br/>I would definitely stay here again the next time I come to Berlin!",1,0.9296,Positive
