69.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,0,3.077053794701885,4.8,4.71,4.93,4.7,1162120680748466012,"Rio was a very kind and accommodating host. The apartment is kept clean with a cleaner, but it depends on the other guests in the flat who may leave dirty dishes and towels behind. Beyond this, the room is only separated by doors so in that way is not so private. As the other reviews suggest, you can hear others music, talking, ect. so it is a great space as long as you are accompanied by respectful and peaceful guests. Overall a great space with that caveat.",1,0.9712,Positive
