123.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,28,100.0,0,4.462782849034317,4.86,4.88,4.83,4.82,9994644,"Martin's place is great place to stay - nice location, easy to reach (7 min walk from metro), clean and had all the amenities for comfort stay. Martin himself is very professional - provided easy to understand guides and even some tips for local hidden gems.",1,0.9517,Positive
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,0,14.133227289087296,4.63,4.8,4.31,4.49,590200,"Carola is an amazing host!<br/>I was well treated in the moment I arrived. Everything was so clean and it felt like home as I stepped in. The place is cozy, quiet, private and the neighbourhood is just stunishing.<br/>I can't recommend enough, you'll not regret.",1,0.9082,Positive
76.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,21,99.0,0,2.1897939786653327,4.56,4.7,4.89,4.51,41403574,"The room was just as the pictures show. Area is not bad at all and had a lot to do. You’re right next to a bus and a tram stop so it has accessibility to the rest of the city. Owner has a Greek restaurant right below you that you get 20% off, the food portions were large and it was very good. Only reason I gave 4 and not 5 stars was because almost everything hanging on the wall was loosely fissioned or falling off.",1,0.5012,Positive
