203.0,6,3.0,1.0,3.0,43,100.0,1,4.140963863667464,4.89,4.92,4.89,4.78,4182815,Lovely flat in a brilliant location. The local area has a great vibe and there's easy access into central parts of Berlin via U and S-Bahn. Dörthe was a brilliant host - very accommodating (we needed two check-ins for separate arrivals) and lots of lovely nice touches for when we arrived to make us feel welcome. Can recommend without hesitation.,0,0.9853,Positive
422.0,16,7.0,5.0,10.0,55,100.0,1,6.474155287757895,4.93,4.86,4.66,4.85,13666450,"This is a fantastic space for a large group. The apartment is very cleverly divided and actually much bigger in real life than the pictures would suggest. Kitchen is very well equipped and the location is superb: very close to transport links. Werner was very easy to communicate with, our stay could not have been better.",0,0.9379,Positive
