172.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,99.0,0,1.542372060755756,4.59,4.74,4.53,4.54,6697033,"It was a good room, nice people, I would like to have a cheap water boiler in the room at least to be able to make myself a tea at night. But other than that very good stay. People helped me with showering somewhere because the water was shut off in the city. Great help :)",1,0.9707,Positive
170.0,6,2.0,1.0,6.0,54,100.0,1,13.891160580271904,4.81,4.68,4.77,4.65,22217844,We konden het makkelijk vinden en de toegang met code tot appartement was erg handig. Het is een net appartement. Met alles wat je nodig hebt voor het verblijf. Metro op 10 minuten lopen. Supermarkt naast de deur. <br/>Berlijn is een bijzondere stad!,0,0.0,Neutral
99.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,0,15.11918943238052,4.92,4.87,4.86,4.77,26222336,"Nina was an excellent host, rapid communication, lovely spacious apartment, super clean with all amenities and really well located with good transport links nearby in a quiet area. Highly recommended.",1,0.9661,Positive
62.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,98.0,1,12.355880726366824,4.72,4.85,4.5,4.7,26975349,"Habitación limpia, amplia y con buena luminosidad.<br/>Muy cerca del metro y del bus, que te lleva al centro de la ciudad.",1,0.0,Neutral
253.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,56,100.0,1,1.6793067436589162,4.82,4.84,4.98,4.65,35911615,"Logement idéalement situe, très agréable et très calme, nous avons bien profite de Berlin et du quartier pour faire nos emplettes et aller au restaurant. Très bons conseils de l’hôte ce sujet. Attention cependant, le logement est au rez-de-chaussée sur cour donc assez sombre. Pas un problème pour nous en plein été, au contraire, mais à garder en tête si vous prévoyez de venir à une période où les journées sont courtes et peu lumineuses.",0,0.0,Neutral
100.0,6,3.0,1.0,3.0,37,100.0,0,17.177847201896487,4.77,4.77,4.62,4.69,8725453,"Perfect quiet location in the suburbs. Picked up key no problems and Tim was very responsive to any messages. The flat was clean and had everything we needed. Close to a pretty lake and pleasant walk through the woods to the train station, if you like.",0,0.923,Positive
146.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,3.4636382799594605,4.66,4.79,4.58,4.56,322520,Very very nice apartment in Prenzlauer Berg. Very well situated and very quiet. Alan welcomed us and explained us everything :) We are really satisfied by this appartement and will surely come back! The location is excellente and very close to the beautiful things in Berlin. We would absolutely stay here again Both of them helped make our stay better and if we return to Berlin we will definitely be checking their availability! :) Congratulation,1,0.9866,Positive
105.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,1,2.815230046195084,4.85,4.9,4.89,4.79,425411,"Great place to stay in you are in Berlin and want to be in a location to get out and see as much as possible. The directions from the airport were great and communication was very processional and nice.  Left me some chocolates because there was scaffolding up outside, very kind but unnecessary as it had no effect on my enjoyment of the stay.  highly recommended",1,0.9241,Positive
98.0,6,3.0,1.0,3.0,20,100.0,0,5.5596434050489405,4.71,4.72,4.73,4.72,29675993,"We had a great experience at Martin’s place. We enjoyed staying in the spacious apartment. It is located in a nice calm area with few bars, an amazing brunch place and only few walking minutes away from the metro station U8.<br/>We had no problems reaching the host, everything was running smoothly and we would definitely come back again.<br/>I think this apartment is a rare find in Berlin.",1,0.9423,Positive
73.0,2,0.0,1.0,3.0,41,100.0,0,7.593507322759444,4.72,4.68,4.87,4.7,20632571,"Ich habe zwei Wochen mit meinem Sohn in diesem Apartment am Nollendorfplatz verbracht. Die Lage ist zentral und sehr praktisch, mit vielen Restaurants und Geschäften in der Nähe. Die Wohnung ist gut ausgestattet und die Waschmaschine war ein nützliches Plus. <br/>Jens war sehr freundlich und stets hilfsbereit. Insgesamt war es ein angenehmer Aufenthalt, und ich würde es für einen Familienurlaub in Berlin empfehlen.",1,-0.9761,Negative
22.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,9,100.0,0,20.20491293010195,4.81,4.96,4.57,4.82,7143189,"She was the most perfect host! She was very caring,patient,and such a lovely person. She was helpfully to me and my husband when it came to getting around the town. She had us feel welcomed! She opened her home to us and made us feel as if we weren't strangers to her lol She even left us little notes and set up breakfast plates out for us! she was just all around amazing person and host!",1,0.9703,Positive
145.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,34,100.0,1,5.510387590768883,4.95,4.78,4.92,4.93,26158789,"Everything was simply perfect! The house was very beautiful, cozy and well cleaned. Nice location close to Viktoriapark. With a bicycle in approx 20 mins you are in the center. Self check-in was easy and Sarah very easy to communicate with. Highly recommended!!",1,0.9664,Positive
