114.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,1,3.268352166045826,4.8,4.74,4.89,4.71,11294240,"It was clean, exactly what we needed at the end of the day. Convenient. The only thing was we were woken up the first day because there was construction going on but not the owner’s fault. Lots of good stuff in the apartment that helped make our stay easier, like salt and pepper, and sugar for coffee. Would stay again.",1,0.9386,Positive
