161.0,8,3.0,2.0,3.0,35,100.0,1,6.906667346101181,4.78,4.72,4.69,4.75,5977917,"Our stay in Berlin was amazing and this flat made it that much more memorable. Very clean, open and comfortable with tons of natural light. The neighborhood is also very nice and has a plethora of restaurants and cafes to choose from (especially Giannis right next door if you're in the mood for Italian). Michele was accommodating and responded to our messages very quickly during our stay. ",0,0.9428,Positive
