25.0,7,1.0,1.0,6.0,18,93.0,0,4.132403574870102,4.51,4.55,4.61,4.58,41362381,"Excelente hostal, los espacios en comun son muuy agradables, con un bar-restauran a buen precio y el buffet de desayuno estuvo increible tambien.  A demas la atencion es muy agradable todo el tiempo. Realmentee una de mis mejores estancias en un hostal y con una buena ubicacion para ir a lugares turisticos.",1,0.0,Neutral
77.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,38,100.0,0,3.130777776464285,4.77,4.59,4.83,4.6,612157073909883323,"Es una habitación muy amplia y cómoda muy cerca del corazón de Berlin, me parece un poco caliente la habitación (seguro solo ocurre en verano) pero de resto todo impecable.<br/>Unica recomendación es revisar el tema de los Banos que se inundan con cada mano que se toman los huéspedes.<br/>Lo volveria a repetir",1,0.0,Neutral
81.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,50.0,0,7.645667833178782,4.71,4.45,4.83,4.77,39602283,"Muy buen lugar en muy buena zona, cerca al metro, amplio y bien equipado. lo recomendamos mucho. Por mejorar que el colchón es muy blando para nuestro gusto, de resto todo bien.",1,0.0,Neutral
77.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,39,100.0,0,3.130777776464285,4.61,4.52,4.72,4.53,572154090232449167,My room was perfect for just me! Welcoming and homey feeling as you entered. Laura was super helpful with tips and places to go and I would stay there again ! <br/>Thank you Laura!,1,0.9401,Positive
35.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,89.0,0,7.244947551673602,4.92,4.97,4.84,4.95,45719848,"Ich war ein Wochenende bei Suzana und Ihrem Mann und es war toll. Beide sind sehr offen, sympathisch und warmherzig. Das Zimmer und Bad sind wie beschrieben und blitzsauber. Ich hab mich ganz wohlgefühlt und komme gerne wieder.",1,-0.9062,Negative
161.0,10,4.0,2.0,4.0,25,100.0,1,7.731041071020152,4.6,4.72,4.48,4.57,2599765,"Un séjour très sympathique pour un groupe de 7 personnes dans le logement, la disposition des chambres permet une intimité dans l'ensemble. La cuisine avec la grande table permet à chacun, chacune de se retrouver facilement et il y a des espaces pour pouvoir se poser un peu à l'écart. La double salle de bain est très pratique. <br/>Le logement est à proximité de plusieurs modalités de transport et à une 20aine de minutes de marche du Tiergarten et de la Spree, le cadre elle plutôt calme et l'hôte accueillant et disponible. Il y a une distance de 1h à 1h20 de l'aéroport, cela demande un peu d'organisation mais n'est pas difficile. <br/>Le rapport qualité prix est plus que correcte. <br/>Un très bon séjour pour ce passage d'année !",0,0.0,Neutral
220.0,6,3.0,1.5,3.0,42,100.0,1,5.579082885049759,4.94,4.9,4.82,4.78,1186815887957943578,"Great apartment! The location can't be beat and the apartment itself is beautiful and perfectly appointed. It has everything you could possibly need. I will definitely stay there again. Thanks so much for everything, Malte. Your apartment made our trip so much better.",0,0.9693,Positive
320.0,10,5.0,2.0,7.0,33,100.0,1,6.97282351203588,4.92,4.93,4.43,4.77,16183489,"We stayed for a couple of days at the mirror apt. and we couldn't be more satisfied. The apt. was clean, tidy and the host was very responsive. We were 8 people (4 adults / 4 children) and we had lots of space. We will definitely consider this place again next time we are in Berlin.",0,0.6853,Positive
130.0,4,1.0,1.0,5.0,22,99.0,0,3.852471644606984,4.74,4.59,4.8,4.62,25936092,"Overall the apartment was quite good for its location (near Mercedes Benz Arena, 30 min from city center), basic equipment availability, friendly and helpful host.<br/>There are some points to consider if you consider to rent this apartment:<br/>1 - this apartment may be suitable for 7 guests as there are 2 single beds, 1 sofa, 4 beds on the upper decker; but be aware that the last on the upper decker may not be very comfortable as this was for me with my friends.<br/>2 - the bathroom is quite cold and the floor is old and molded.",1,0.0563,Positive
142.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,96.0,0,4.795897460993454,4.66,4.77,4.72,4.57,53928297,Lejos del centro,1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,0,2.295753994769258,4.81,4.84,4.93,4.75,9839151,"Great apartment with everything one might need on a trip away from home. Check in and check out was easy, Finn was very detailed in her communication. Very clean place. Great neighborhood with a lot of cafes and restaurants nearby. Loved being able to walk to Museum Island and short public transit trips to many other sites.",1,0.9583,Positive
125.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,1,2.540873406232533,4.67,4.75,4.83,4.55,243063,"Todo bien. Edificio viejo, bien conservado, un poco difícil la escalera para los que llevamos equipaje para varios días. Relaciòn calidad precio bastante razonable. Una anfitriona cordial en el intercambio por web, aunque no la conocimos.",1,-0.296,Negative
20.0,4,1.0,0.0,4.0,16,100.0,0,3.883872869353541,4.3,4.22,4.52,4.32,265408,"Great location, good value for money, and friendly staff. I recommend it.",1,0.9337,Positive
68.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,50,100.0,0,6.026516407626963,4.74,4.76,4.48,4.7,6808626,Birgit is a wonderful host. She is very kind and the house is very comfortable. There are a supermarket and a bus stop very close. Everything ok!,1,0.9108,Positive
197.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,90.0,0,13.282724223460589,4.62,4.74,4.61,4.57,28302220,"Great place to stay. <br/>Everything was a described. Me and my friend came to see IFA in Berlin and this place served us well. Located strategically next to the S-Bahn, you can get pretty much everywhere in less than 40 minutes and often times even without changing.<br/>There are many local places around and a kebab shop just around the corner if you arrive late and feel hungry.<br/>Netto grocery store is in the same building, so food is covered, unless you're looking for a wider selection in which case all other major shops are quite far away, so you'd have to take a scooter, bike or bus to get there.<br/>In terms of the rooms/flats - they were cozy and comfortable. Even though the building is located next to the main road, we never had issues with noise. All the appliances and utensils are there, and although the kitchen is small, it's convenient for quick meal prep.<br/>A thing for improvement - a place, where guests could leave non-expiring goods for others, like salt, sugar, pepper, herbs etc. Cause you cannot survive without these basics, but I cannot imagine having to take 0.5kg of sugar back into my country and throwing absolutely good food is unacceptable. Yeah, that's right if you'd like to add sugar to your morning coffee, you'll have to buy a whole pack of sugar first...",1,0.9472,Positive
68.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,1,6.786146387015562,4.68,4.79,4.38,4.64,7653620,"Sauberkeit war Top, und beim einchecken mehr als einfach, perfekte Lage,Die Kommunikation war Super, also weiter zu empfehlen,dankeschön und bis zum nächsten Besuch :)",1,-0.0258,Neutral
100.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,1,4.210492640107876,4.86,4.84,4.77,4.73,12060184,Great place in Berlin. Perfectly setup. ,1,0.8519,Positive
