55.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,9,100.0,1,3.1678863275056317,4.71,4.54,4.78,4.67,6123610,I enjoyed staying there and felt very safe. It‘s a typical old building so you hear everything through the walls but it was quiet at night. Also not too hot during hot summer days. If you are looking for a authentic Berlin like apartment and if you are easy going this is for you :),1,0.9365,Positive
337.0,11,3.0,2.0,4.0,50,100.0,1,5.961083106152229,4.94,4.96,4.65,4.74,44443548,Sehr schönes und modernes Appartement. Sieht tatsächlich genauso aus wie auf den Fotos. Zu Fuß braucht man nur 20 Minuten bis zum Hauptbahnhof. Organisation und Abwicklung waren super.,0,0.5994,Positive
