71.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,18,100.0,1,5.829371370954044,4.56,4.58,4.3,4.59,1654057,"Hallo! Die Wohnung ist super toll und gemuetlich. Eine super gute Lage, zum Einkaufen ode raus gehen. Absolut empfehlenswert! Die Gastgeber sind sehr freundlich und man kann mit Ihnen ueber alles reden.",1,0.0,Neutral
89.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,23.302240022763648,4.8,4.57,4.75,4.54,802115821947251110,It is a nice house. The host and his family are very helpful. We had a good time in Berlin.<br/>Thanks for everything!<br/>GC,1,0.8436,Positive
111.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,0,5.463369258195954,4.92,4.96,4.93,4.79,2027140,"Julia's place is amazing! It's larger than I expected and is decorated wonderfully.  The location is perfect.  This was my first time to Berlin and I loved the neighborhood.  There was a market in the park up the street on Saturday and there are many cool shops, cafes, and restaurants within walking distance.  Quite easy access to the S + U also.",1,0.9686,Positive
128.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,14,100.0,1,3.473891084562703,4.7,4.63,4.97,4.54,11932837,"Our initial reservation fell through when we couldn't reach the host, so we booked this place as an alternative. Despite booking at last minute, our host Daniel greeted us within a short time frame of about 1.5 hours. Communication with both him and his wife, Carla, was prompt and excellent. I want to thank our hosts for being helpful in every request we had.<br/>The location of the house was central, and we could easily access everything we needed. If you're planning on staying longer and cooking your meals, the weekly street market on certain days could be quite handy. The house was spacious enough for two people to be very comfortable. Although the kitchen was well-equipped with all sorts of utensils and equipment, I must say they were in need of maintenance and cleaning.<br/>Overall, we were very pleased with our stay and would recommend it. Thanks again to Daniel and Carla for their hospitality.",1,0.9777,Positive
73.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,2.27336048441501,4.89,4.87,4.95,4.82,16155678,"Very nice stay at Jo's. The appartment is very well located. Jo is really nice, very accomodating and communicates really easily.",1,0.8826,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,97.0,0,5.365355387714029,4.45,4.95,4.05,4.25,929469241017911671,"Todo muy bien, instrucciones claras,  el lugar limpio y agradable. Todos los servicios básicos de lujo",1,0.0,Neutral
76.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,29,90.0,0,14.020278434129931,4.66,4.69,4.65,4.72,2079942,Die Wohnung von Thalia war sehr sauber und super gelegen. Auch das Check-in und die Kommunikation waren unkompliziert. Wir haben uns auf jeden Fall sehr wohl gefühlt und kommen gerne wieder. Danke!,1,-0.8439,Negative
42.0,2,1.0,1.0,4.0,36,90.0,1,3.82441394863266,4.85,4.81,4.85,4.81,9376881,"I very much enjoyed staying in Hannelore’s flat. It’s well connected (4 minutes to Bornholmer or 15 minutes to Schönhauser). Mauerpark is an easy walk alway. There’s a Rewe, an Aldi, and a DM quite nearby,, and Arnimplatz is a nice place to sit and read with a beer. There’s no oven in the kitchen, which I missed, but I made do with the job and microwave. It’s an adorable kitchen and a lovely balcony. The living room is simple and cozy and it became like home in the three months I stayed. I was sad to leave!",1,0.9198,Positive
131.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,0,4.263251204069727,4.62,4.68,4.41,4.45,46113337,"Lovely flat to stay few days in Berlín,  it is clean and tidy.  It is close to a nice cafeterias,  pubs, restaurants, supermarkets, and the tube station.<br/>Un apartamento agradable, limpio para pasar unos días en Berlín. El apartamento está cerca de cafeterías y bars muy cool. Cerca de la zona hay supermercados  y la estación de tren solo a solo 10 minutos andando.",1,0.891,Positive
119.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,6.121786157144007,4.81,4.66,4.86,4.72,23747428,Heiko’s place is one of the most unique AirBnB experiences I have enjoyed. The building itself is very cool and there are several classical musicians practicing their instruments upstairs which added to ambience for me. The kitchen is the best equipped that I have ever cooked in (although the counters are unusually high). One drawback if you’re a business traveller is that the wifi is a bit dodgy but I was in Berlin as a tourist so I relied on my eSIM and it was fine. The decor in the apartment sets the mood for an interesting trip to Berlin and we were able to walk to the main train station in under 20 minutes. It’s less than 10 minutes for a walk to the Tiergarten. There’s a reasonable grocery store across the street and you can also catch frequent streetcars to the train station if you prefer. It was a perfect spot for us to launch our first visit to Berlin. Thanks Heiko!,1,0.964,Positive
93.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,2.54678149398414,4.86,4.96,4.9,4.84,3187735,"DIE perfekte Unterkunft in Berlin. <br/>Die Wohnung ist wunderschön eingerichtet und hält alles bereit, was man braucht.",1,-0.6841,Negative
