161.0,7,1.0,1.0,3.0,38,90.0,0,1.6132440005466837,4.58,4.54,4.87,4.44,321378,"Värden avbokade tyvärr vår vistelse i denna lägenhet en månad innan ankomst. Han ordnade dock annat boende åt oss i närheten så allt gick smidigt ändå.<br/><br/>Kan därför inte uttala mig om boendet i annonsen. ",1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,37,88.0,0,6.1091048127531655,4.65,4.3,4.49,4.58,45950789,"Appartement très agréable et parfait pour deux personnes. <br/>Quartier sympathique, l’emplacement est proche des transports ce qui à facilité le déplacement dans toute la ville, mais aussi d’un supermarché et de restaurants/ bars de qualité.<br/>Manuel était accessible si jamais nous avions des questions.<br/>Cet Airbnb a perfectionné notre séjour, merci !",1,0.0,Neutral
74.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,52,100.0,1,4.78303997421089,4.74,4.64,4.83,4.69,10130849,"Yigit’s place was great! Best location, everything you need just around the corner. The host is very flexible and gave us a few recommendations. The room is spacious and the apartment had everything we needed. Would definitely recommend!!",1,0.9483,Positive
74.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,68,100.0,1,10.197100954707794,4.98,4.97,4.92,4.9,947113428640648520,Casa stupenda e ragazzi gentilissimi complimenti davvero,1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,0,0.8032451170719167,4.97,4.82,4.97,4.85,18279124,"Thank you Yvonne, we had a fantastic time at your home. Our kids loved to play with your sons toys. The location is perfect and we would love to come back.",1,0.9652,Positive
130.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,1,2.669079881682033,4.97,4.98,4.84,4.86,26180749,"Super stylish, clean and cozy room with a lovely bakery downstairs. Hope to visit Berlin once more and to stay here. Owners were friendly, gave a lot of valuable advices. You will be happy to have such a great experience!",1,0.9812,Positive
107.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,33,100.0,1,2.922418995421466,4.86,4.82,4.71,4.66,16283253,"Wow! This may be in my top 5 Airbnb stays. I loved and enjoyed it so much. First, i came during a strike that effected my travel and phillip was super responsive and flexible. The space was so comfortable and welcoming (i want that bed and pillows!) and I had everything I needed. In the end I didn’t want to leave. Finally I loved the location and my block. The supermarket at the end of the block had everything i needed and some great discoveries and I highly recommend the restaurants next door (chung king noodles is a must!). Can’t say enough. Danke :)",1,0.9893,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,0,2.715727914574357,4.72,4.77,4.8,4.59,1867179,"Haus und Wohnung waren gepflegt und sauber, die Wohnung ist groß und nett eingerichtet sowie gut ausgestattet. Die Schlüsselübergabe hat gut geklappt. Die Nähe zur S-Bahn ist tagsüber sehr praktisch, nachts können die Zuggeräusche etwas stören - wir haben die Fenster zugelassen. Für einen Parkplatz in der Straße muss man 15 Euro am Tag zusätzlich einkalkulieren. <br/><br/>",1,-0.9661,Negative
398.0,5,2.0,2.0,3.0,40,100.0,1,2.942766383999945,4.88,4.98,4.86,4.77,42698451,Amazing staying in a beautiful location!,0,0.8398,Positive
