59.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,1,5.221624642781363,4.95,4.92,4.92,4.9,13256017,"When we arrived only Matthias was there and he made us feel really welcome from the first day to the last. The flat is very clean and nice and we were lucky with some great weather which allowed us to enjoy the sun on the terrace. Matthias was really helpful and recommended a few places in the area, he's also super nice and easy to chat to. Flat is well connected and easy to get to (East side bits around 30 min by transport).  Great stay and would definitely recommend!",1,0.9932,Positive
94.0,5,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,97.0,0,8.514810072350441,4.5,4.51,4.61,4.45,984944922120776917,"Leiligheten var romslig for en familie på fire. Gode senger, der vi sov godt. Noe som er svært deilig på en storbyferie. Det var svært lite bråk i området. Hyggelig bakeri med nærheten. Lett og finne rimelige og gode resturanter i området.  Det var greit rengjort, men ikke plettfritt.",1,-0.34,Negative
182.0,9,2.0,1.0,7.0,25,100.0,0,0.5561753554406595,4.66,4.69,4.93,4.58,11764015,"Super nice place in the middle of Berlin. Still very quiet in the night. We really enjoyed staying in the apartment with our two daughters of 10 and 13 years. Agustin was super helpful, flexible and nice to communicate with.",0,0.967,Positive
274.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,0.924256148910964,4.65,4.76,4.81,4.43,42238664,Great stay overall. The room did feel a bit cold but there is a heating system. Would’ve appreciated bottled water in the room. Didn’t do breakfast as it was too expensive. Comfortable bed and decently sized room/bathroom,1,0.9091,Positive
55.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,1,3.4716252179778877,4.68,4.68,4.62,4.58,40961985,"Place was lovely, quirky and met expectations. Location was great, with public transport in walking distance. Host was friendly and responsive.<br/>Would recommend and stay again!",1,0.9312,Positive
89.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,1,2.692024625165537,4.82,4.64,4.91,4.76,29383900,"Meine Schwiegereltern haben sich bei Birthe sehr wohlgefühlt. Besonders gefallen hat ihnen die tolle Lage, die Nähe zu vielen Cafes und die Ruhe (Gartenhaus). Auch die Einrichtung wurde gelobt. Für einen City-Trip sehr zu empfehlen.",1,-0.9485,Negative
166.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,54,100.0,0,3.808469689127372,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,1032480915993112743,really great place! defo would book again!<3,1,0.7164,Positive
282.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,41,100.0,1,2.942766383999945,5.0,4.97,4.94,4.87,42631943,"Great location. Trams run on the street outside (but not at night). The lively Castle Bar downstairs has an outdoor curfew at 10pm. So the apartment is in a lively part of town but you can still get a good night's sleep. Berlin Wall memorial is just across the way and Nordbahnhof is over the road if travelling across the city. Smart, modern place to stay with everything you need. Lovely large balcony overlooking the park. We would be happy to stay at Downtown Apartments again on our next visit to Berlin. Thank you so much.",1,0.9806,Positive
85.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,0,12.454267915590298,4.63,4.74,4.75,4.63,37346562,"Kristina was the best host, she answered every question I had very fast before I got there. The house was very clean, and had everything I needed. Very comfy, I expected to suffer with the Berlin cold there, but the house was very warm and comfy. Totally recommended.",1,0.7767,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,5.497490692134203,4.89,4.86,4.7,4.89,28435392,"I didn't meet Yoram in person but Caspar checked me in and helped me out with all the usual questions. It was a comfortable stay and close to shops, transport bakers etc.",1,0.6652,Positive
80.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,0.0,0,8.015621196700712,4.54,4.69,4.77,4.52,19651885,"Reasonable price for students for their stay in Berlin. Close to city centre,  easy to get around the city. Would recommend!",1,0.69,Positive
52.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,6.296102388049414,4.82,4.77,4.72,4.77,16305782,it's near bus stop or walk to train station. All facilities is good. Serkan are nice and very fast to reply my question. Nice place.,1,0.743,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,0,10.326425452638576,4.67,5.0,5.0,4.67,37391773,"Johannes est très accueillant. La grande chambre est propre, il y a un balcon agréable. Le quartier est calme et nous pouvons aller à pied dans les restaurants et commerces tous proches. Nous recommandons.",1,0.0,Neutral
186.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,1.9612069952106024,4.96,4.98,4.93,4.83,588813657940544864,"Es war hervorragend! Das einzige, was verbessert werden könnte: uns war von den Fotos und der Beschreibung her nicht klar, dass das eine Doppelbett im Wohnzimmer steht, also nicht in einem abgetrennten Zimmer. Es gibt also nur ein abgetrenntes Zimmer mit Doppelbett, nicht zwei. Das ist für eine Familie mit unterschiedlichen Schlafzeiten wichtig zu wissen.<br/>Ansonsten war aber alles wirklich super!",1,-0.855,Negative
100.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,3.091836209520125,4.86,4.9,4.86,4.77,869793,We use air Bnb a lot and have to say this is by far the best place we have stayed. Right from the start communication with Kirsten was excellent and she went out of her way to provide lots of recommendations based on questions I asked as we were celebrating my husbands birthday. The location of the apartment was excellent..a lovely local non touristy area with a great bar under apartment and fab restaurant across street oh and amazing must visit cocktail bar a short stagger away. The apartment was clean and excellently equipped for our stay..loved the decor. The balcony is lovely too for morning coffee. I would highly recommend this place and if in Berlin again will stay. Thanks Kirsten.,1,0.9921,Positive
125.0,1,1.0,1.0,2.0,32,73.0,0,11.276335938509012,4.0,3.85,3.85,3.69,50514468,Super alles sehr nice,1,0.7717,Positive
137.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,1,2.759966591003808,4.94,4.92,4.94,4.81,768616,"We loved Cornelius's place - the location was excellent, the apartment was clean and spacious and comfortable, the balcony was a great place to sit and enjoy the view in the mornings and evenings. Cornelius was an extremely considerate host, offering to let us drop our bags off early when he heard that we would be arriving early and to check out late. We would love to stay here again on a return trip.",1,0.9802,Positive
116.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,23,99.0,0,4.444732321805399,4.68,4.57,4.55,4.5,29527972,"Clean, neat and perfect location! We loved this apartment! Perfect for a couple or a small group of friends.",1,0.9669,Positive
68.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,28,100.0,1,6.576517854147013,4.72,4.76,4.31,4.63,36310980,It was really nice stay and clean apartment.,1,0.6997,Positive
168.0,6,1.0,1.0,4.0,41,94.0,1,2.838421714756275,4.88,4.83,4.98,4.78,1098549072889880800,"I stayed here with my three kids and it was great. It is near everything, yet the street it is on is very quiet and feels private. We appreciated having four beds and it was very comfortable! <br/>As the listing notes, there is no air conditioning but that wasn’t a problem for us in early June. There are two big windows in the front and one in the back so there is lots of fresh air. But the windows in the front open right on to the street so theoretically someone could come in right through them at night. We closed them and night and still slept comfortably . Just fyi if you like sleeping with the windows open!",1,0.9264,Positive
100.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,7.415726243794245,4.9,4.96,4.84,4.87,147339,Gerhards place is a comfortable establishment with good facilities and communication links. There are several reasonably good cafes within a small radius and a well stocked small supermarket within easy walking distance. If any of my friends were looking to visit Berlin I would recommend Gerhards place.,1,0.9565,Positive
254.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,68,100.0,0,2.570512922063975,4.96,4.78,4.93,4.74,706469663252604646,"O apartamento é muito bom e espaçoso. A localização é ótima, local tranquilo, ao lado do metro e com outras opções de transporte. Na vizinhança tinha muitas opções de restaurantes, padarias e cafés. O Gustav responde rápido, mas tivemos um problema de entupimento no ralo do banheiro e a solução dele foi que eu limpasse, na minha opinião o apartamento deveria estar com tudo em ordem e eu não deveria limpar sujeira dos outros pelo preço que pagamos. Quanto a limpeza, os quartos, sala e banheiros estavam limpos, mas a cozinha estava muito suja, chegamos a noite, com fome, num feriado onde tudo estava fechado, então nem dava para reclamar para ninguém, tivemos que fazer uma limpeza na cozinha antes de usa-la. Outra coisa que não gostamos é que todos os armários e todos os cantos da casa estão com os objetos e roupas pessoais dele, não tem espaço nem para abrir as malas, tivemos que improvisar.",0,-0.296,Negative
95.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,3.769411114551402,4.65,4.73,4.79,4.5,4869716,"Gut nähe Bergmannkiez gelegen, Späti um die die Ecke, einfach aber zweckmässig eingerichtet, sehr sauber. Wlan manchmal etwas langsam aber funkionierend. Alles in allem eine gute Erfahrung und für den fairen Preis sicherlich sehr empfehlenswert",1,-0.8316,Negative
63.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,41,100.0,0,8.554504629982985,4.69,4.87,4.73,4.61,15229038,"Goed appartement met 2 ruime slaapkamers en prima badkamer en keuken. Wij hebben hier 4 nachten gezeten met 2 jonge kinderen. U-bahn is 5 minuutjes lopen en in de buurt zijn verschillende restaurantjes, een bakker en supermarkt.",1,0.0,Neutral
120.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,1,3.14704762756928,4.88,4.85,4.91,4.75,363454,"The apartment is great, exactly as shown in pictures. The small kitchen was very well equipped, we could prepare fast meals for our daughter. The building and the neighbourhood are really amazing, with lots of cool restaurants and coffee shops, and with few U-ban stations within walking distance. We plan to book the apartment again next time we visit Berlin.",1,0.9167,Positive
141.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,43,94.0,0,7.131273504704622,4.74,4.82,4.79,4.62,49070135,Schön - im Zentrum von Schöneberg - am Nollendorfplatz.,1,0.0,Neutral
85.0,5,1.0,1.0,6.0,29,100.0,1,2.9368733160629987,4.5,4.68,4.56,4.5,341910,"Very nice place, perfect for a weekend with friends. Fun place to live for a few days, close to the station and in a nice area. Peter was very concilient in the discussions and always responsive",1,0.9587,Positive
170.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,98.0,0,3.700214239219251,4.67,4.74,4.63,4.41,945448927812934557,Die Zimmern besser beschreiben,1,-0.5994,Negative
80.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,1,7.221418495039817,4.87,4.8,4.88,4.75,250687,"Good, clean, comfortable apartment and good service from Ashraf. There's a very nice little restaurant about 50m from the door and a park across the road which gives a nice atmosphere with the windows open. It's a quiet street but plenty of shops within walking distance as well as very close proximity trains and buses, so exploring Berlin from here is easy.",1,0.9381,Positive
58.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,38,100.0,0,3.77601590718314,4.73,4.67,4.73,4.63,29721020,"Výborné ubytování, dopravní dostupnost na nejrůznější místa velice jednoduchá a rychlá. Hostitel velice příjemný, vyšel vstříc s časem příjezdu i odjezdu. Moje první zkušenost s Airbnb, která dopadla na jedničku.",1,0.0,Neutral
