116.0,5,1.0,1.0,4.0,29,100.0,0,2.281356512252844,4.49,4.56,4.75,4.42,16299453,Alles was gut!,1,0.0,Neutral
160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,87.0,0,3.4802565088356308,4.54,4.54,4.6,4.41,43798011,"I’m so glad I booked this air bnb for my trip. The location was great, pretty easy to get to from the airport. There are lots of bus stops right around the entrance to bring you to all the hot spots. U bahn stations are only a few minutes away by foot. We had no problems checking in (we did a late check in and the instructions provided were clear and easy to follow). The area itself was nice and quiet at night, we kept the windows open all night and were not disturbed by any noise. The cooking and cleaning facilities in the room itself were great. Will definitely book again if I go back to Berlin!",1,0.9766,Positive
41.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,15,100.0,0,3.558265973195314,4.77,4.84,4.88,4.79,19666219,Muy buen alojamiento en la mejor zona de Berlín. El anfitrión es amable y comunicativo.<br/>Relación calidad-precio inmejorable.,1,0.0,Neutral
160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,87.0,0,3.4802565088356308,4.54,4.54,4.6,4.41,43798011,A perfectly comfortable stay in a reasonably quiet yet convenient location,1,0.8176,Positive
74.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,11,100.0,1,5.182484562003074,4.75,4.75,4.71,4.71,7653603,Good location with good transport links around Berlin. Apartment was really clean and comfortable with lots of amenities.,1,0.9073,Positive
115.0,8,1.0,1.0,3.0,32,100.0,0,2.978770363505488,4.85,4.82,4.81,4.69,44438078,Nice location. Plenty of stuff around. Lidl 5 min walk. Off licence and fast food with a few minutes. Good little apartment base. Mezzanine ceiling is very low but fine for us for a few days.,1,0.5788,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,0,4.446574380104264,4.93,4.84,4.65,4.82,2616603,"Very nice and quiet flat. At 30mn from Tegel Airport by train. alexanderplatz is at 10 mn by tram. Many tram near the flat to all directions. <br/>The flat is very clean, large fully equipped kitchen.<br/> ",1,0.7258,Positive
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,1,18.95052374878964,4.84,4.64,4.73,4.83,37558386,"Kluss rajons, ļoti atsaucīgi un komunikabli saimnieki. Ar sabiedrisko transportu pilsētas centrs sasniedzams ļoti vienkārši piedevām izmantojot vairākus atšķirīgus maršrutus.<br/>   Dzīvoklī prasītos mazliet labāka ventilācija un nedaudz mazāk putekļu, taču kopumā maktsmītne ir samaksātās naudas vērta.",1,0.0,Neutral
187.0,6,3.0,1.0,3.0,30,96.0,0,2.555916049459229,4.33,4.19,4.83,4.38,1188507107579542864,"Sehr freundlich, hat schnell geantwortet, die Betten waren sehr bequem, die Wohnung war insgesamt sehr geputzt und hat eine super Lage. Auch die Beschreibung für die Abholung der Schlüssel ist sehr akkurat.<br/>Die einzigen Punkte, die mich von einer 5/5-Bewertung abhalten, ist die etwas uninspirierte Einrichtung der Wohnung. Es gab fast keine Seife und keine Spülmaschinentabs. Außerdem standen noch halbvolle Biere vom Vormieter im Kühlschrank. Trotzdem kann ich die Wohnung jedem wärmstens empfehlen, der auf solche Details keinen großen Wert legt!",0,-0.9828,Negative
164.0,5,2.0,2.0,3.0,30,100.0,1,1.753209774100189,4.83,4.72,4.83,4.75,3188899,Sehr nette Gastgeber! Haben uns trotz später Ankunft sehr freundlich begrüßt und tolle Tipps gegeben. Auch bei der Abreise war der Gastgeber anwesend und hat uns den Check out erleichtert. Das Appartement ist super zentral und dennoch ruhig.,0,0.0,Neutral
71.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,6.919397234051426,4.83,4.89,4.42,4.73,20939397,A great location and beautiful place to stay.,1,0.8402,Positive
63.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,33,100.0,1,0.8841099481967127,4.9,4.78,4.89,4.8,29000041,Ivos is an excellent host. Very responsive and helpful.  Location is very close to the rail line and simple to get there from the airport.  It took us no time to get orientated.  Suggest that you get a Berlin Welcome card at the airport giving you access to all transport. Take the add on cost to museums. Loved the Reichstag tour but book this lots of time in advance. Way better than just going up the viewing dome.  Potsdam is well worth a visit. Again just hop on the train 150m away.,1,0.9492,Positive
