64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,12,100.0,0,8.6733593070506,4.76,4.6,4.6,4.74,6779823,Luisa's apartment is really cosy and nicely decorated. She's an absolutely lovely and welcoming girl. Can absolutely recommend staying at her place.,1,0.9219,Positive
70.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,0,4.219966140444734,4.83,4.75,4.96,4.65,680999,Great location with extremely helpful host. The flat is spacious and comfortable. Would definitely recommend this place to others.,1,0.9402,Positive
