422.0,9,2.0,1.0,7.0,26,100.0,1,2.2709701332788064,4.94,4.82,4.88,4.94,1030203828756790675,"Very friendly hosts, great location as the building is fully detached from any of the other apartments meaning noise was no hassle at all. The apartment was close to many nearby public transports, convenience stores, bars/pubs, and lots of choice to eat in the surrounding area as well as connections to major tourist attractions. The pictures looked exactly as shown in the advertisement and everything was mostly clean to a high standard. I would come back here again especially for the location, value, and quick response time from Salume.",0,0.9308,Positive
