125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,0,6.488067740591113,4.44,3.83,4.83,4.44,52045531,"The place was lovely, really nice apartment in a brilliant location. There was plenty of walkable places to see like parks and museums, plenty of local shops and take always / restaurants all at local not tourist prices.<br/>Special mention must go to the host as she was kind , helpful and friendly. Thanks so much for all you did , you helped make my first visit to Berlin really special. I loved it all.",1,0.9857,Positive
62.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,0,5.275499651976651,4.73,4.52,4.81,4.63,1327609214124415135,"Die Unterkunft war sauber, gut ausgestattet und entsprach der Beschreibung. Die Kommunikation mit dem Gastgeber verlief unkompliziert und schnell. Insgesamt ein angenehmer Aufenthalt - gerne wieder.",1,-0.9136,Negative
80.0,3,1.0,1.5,2.0,21,100.0,1,11.977688290091605,4.67,4.25,4.76,4.55,9768373,"The apartment was as described, in a quieter neighborhood outside of the busy city center. Spacious rooms, and clean facilities. The host was friendly and arranged a flexible check-in and check-out for us. Overall a nice experience!",1,0.8718,Positive
83.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,94.0,1,2.5637228861967363,4.75,4.81,4.88,4.53,557975269502929217,"Excelente estadia em Berlim. A casa é mais espaçosa do que parece nas fotos. A Schamo foi impecável, sempre prestável e atenciosa. Gostamos muito e voltaremos sem dúvida 😊",1,0.0,Neutral
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,0,3.89941119978407,4.96,4.97,4.82,4.92,5368270,"I had a great stay in Sol's apartment. The room is nice and bright, comfortable bed and useful workspace when needed. Sol was very friendly and helpful, easy to communicate with before checking in. I enjoyed my stay and would definitely consider staying here again if I'm in Berlin next time.",1,0.9841,Positive
170.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,40,86.0,0,4.231868494303299,4.73,4.9,4.69,4.63,568511267628962810,"Le logement était très calme, bien qu'en plein centre. Tout est accessible à pieds. Beaucoup de club et de restaurant à proximité. <br/>Le logement était très propre, parfait pour 4 personnes !! Je recommande à 100%. <br/>Nous avons même eu de quoi nois faire cafés et thés pour les premiers petits-déjeuners. <br/>Pour avoir fait plusieurs logement à Berlin, c'était de loin le mieux, surtout avec le métro juste en face et les club à 10mns à pieds",1,-0.2695,Negative
125.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,6,100.0,0,5.192535153717936,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,7640247,Susanne is a perfect host. Everything was set up before the arrival with instructions and explanations related to everything that I should know about the apartment and the place. Also was ready all the time to answer all my questions during my stay.,1,0.7351,Positive
273.0,15,4.0,2.0,12.0,39,100.0,0,6.1262846843500816,4.66,4.61,4.34,4.56,14588206,"Sijainti asunnolle oli loistava, keskeinen paikka ja hyvät yhteydet joka puolelle. Myös asunto itsessään oli tilava ja toimiva isollekin seurueelle. Pienoinen pettymys oli, että kaikkia sänkyjä ei ollut pedattu ja lisäliinavaatteita sekä pyyhkeitä ei ollut saatavilla asunnossa. Asia kuitenkin hoitui joustavasti ja nopeasti majoittajan kanssa. Meillä oli kaiken kaikkiaan onnistunut matka ja mukava oleskelu.",0,0.0,Neutral
