113.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,48,100.0,0,7.920473815656601,4.81,4.8,4.86,4.65,36967121,"i have been to many airbnb with my family but this place really stood out! it’s bright and airy which makes the whole place so comforting! robin himself was an excellent host and helped us along the way! the amenities are all in working conditions and there’s even some food products like soy sauce and condiments available. <br/>i would say what stood out the most was the architecture and decoration of this place, along with the lighting. what would be a slight inconvenience would be that the blinds are rather translucent so people could look in. but nonetheless that contributes to the whole daylight atmosphere of the apartment",1,0.9478,Positive
145.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,39,100.0,1,7.283454106561697,4.77,4.8,4.77,4.57,923013237667372980,"Gera vieta, viskas nauja. Arti traukinių stotis, tiesioginis susisiekimas su orouostu ir centru. <br/>Kitoje stoties pusėje puikių vietų pavalgyti (rekomenduoju išbandyti ten Vietmano ar Indonezijos restoranus).<br/>Lova šiek tiek siauresnė ir banguoja, tai jeigu daug vartaisi, kitas neišsimiega :)<br/>Yra virtuvėlė, su viskuom! Kava nemokamai irgi. Šauni vieta. Ypač maratončikams.",1,0.0,Neutral
