55.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,35,90.0,0,4.688542916697204,4.58,4.74,4.83,4.39,927191932137439622,"I initially thought i would definitely stay here again, but in the end after i could not get the stove top to work, and Florian failed to respond to my requests for help, except for a cursory response that didn't solve the issue, i found the whole experience really disappointing. After spending over an hour trying to get the stovetop to work (each time ended in incessant beeping & a flickering display) i had to give up. Florian was super responsive about everything else i messaged him about, and even agreed to a late checkout, which was very cool, but his lack of communication regarding the stove was really dissapointing, and to be honest, surprising... I've never had a host ignore messages like that... Like other reviewers have said, the shower water could be hotter, the bed could be comfier, & yes there is a dumpster/garbage can not far from the window. but otherwise the space is super clean and comfortable for one in a nice area...",1,0.992,Positive
