68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,13,87.0,0,7.867349248126775,4.54,4.66,4.52,4.53,3970161,"Alessandro’s place is super clean with private bathroom so you can have complete privacy without bothering others when you get back late. <br/>The place is in a quieter but safe neighbourhood that is within 5min walk to U6 subway that connects to Alexanderplatz, TV tower, and accessible to most of the central location in 30 minutes. Super convenient. There is a convenient store opening 24 hours along Seestrasse the main road. This store is always busy with beer pals but you can get still water and beers whenever you want. <br/>Alessandro is super responsive and can accommodate our check in times and our needs. I will definitely recommend this place to others.",1,0.9848,Positive
