77.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,34,100.0,1,4.4625182162657095,4.52,4.61,4.77,4.48,11078656,"Great little apartment,  very useful for couples staying in Berlin as in great location and is a good little apartment for those really trying to take in the city - it is at the top of an apartment block so lots of stairs involved.  Place is clean and well furnished - the hot water did seem to cut out on one day but not for long.  There's lots of Bars and restaurants in the area as well as a nightclub downstairs. For us it meant a lot to do and see - the noise didn't really bother us but it does go into the early hours as well as having someone mistakenly try and get into the apartment one evening. Overall a great place and a good host. ",1,0.9726,Positive
