64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,7.814290679179861,4.9,4.77,4.69,4.69,937001075541410895,"It's cost effective. Remember there are other guests staying. Hence the ability to lock one's door would be good, and there can be a queue for the bathroom. <br/>I didn't feel able to use the living room as Van Khanh was using it with his girlfriend. This wasn't a problem as the bedroom was well equipped and comfortable and WiFi very good",1,0.9506,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,36,100.0,0,0.7567571024449841,4.81,4.96,4.84,4.66,493539,"Marius is likely the friendliest host that I've had over the couple of years I've been doing Airbnb. <br/>We had a very late arrival and he was not only accommodating, but very warm. Upon arrival he gave us a quick rundown of sights to see on a map and offered to set up some entertainment for the following night. <br/>The apartment is fairly spacious and has sliding curtain-type partitions, if you desire to create a feeling of separating the bed from the remainder of the studio. <br/>As is noted, the studio's toilet is not in the bathroom (it is located just outside of your front door). Despite that, we didn't ever feel any lack of privacy. The shower area is certainly tight for space, but is manageable. <br/>Overall, I would highly recommend this rental.",1,0.9616,Positive
125.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,27,98.0,1,1.7013982816783224,4.94,4.88,4.94,4.8,19536575,"Wir hatten zu viert einen fabelhaften Aufenthalt in der Wohnung von Stéphanie, die mit allem ausgestattet ist, was man für den täglichen Bedarf benötigt. Traumhafte und ruhige Lage mitten in Prenzlauer Berg. Diverse Cafés, Restaurants, Supermarkt und kleine Geschäfte sind in unmittelbarer Nähe. Besonders gefallen hat uns der tolle Markt am Samstag quasi direkt vor der Tür! Super war auch, dass uns (kostenpflichtig) Fahrräder bereit gestellt wurden, mit denen wir Berlin erkunden konnten! Vielen lieben Dank an Stéphanie und Plamena - wir hatten eine tolle Zeit!",1,-0.6981,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,14,100.0,0,3.285471372482295,4.0,4.0,4.8,4.2,12709456,"Marcel's place is located in a (mostly) quiet neighborhood conveniently close to public transit, restaurants, and bars. It was definitely a bachelor pad; the place could have been cleaner. The housemates were extremely quiet during the times I was there, so much so that I didn't know when they came or went. There is no living room or common area other than the kitchen. While very quiet at night, the apartment is on a well traveled street, so traffic can be heard early mornings.",1,0.5106,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,82.0,1,2.6808853188639663,4.67,4.68,4.92,4.59,43823296,Really good location. Comfortable room. Staff very helpful and friendly.,1,0.9233,Positive
