102.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,0,2.7824750390490918,4.95,4.97,4.94,4.86,10033310,"Jessy was very welcoming and full of suggestions and recommendations. The apartment was exactly as described.  Location was great and convenient to many bars, restaurants, attractions and transportation.  Don't judge from the outside - this is a city after all. I would stay here again. ",1,0.8777,Positive
109.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,3.5991715456162776,4.85,4.8,4.88,4.69,38967379,Such a great stay here. Lovely and cozy and just as it looks in the pictures. Would come again!,1,0.8478,Positive
352.0,8,4.0,2.0,6.0,33,100.0,1,7.070529925741001,4.95,4.94,4.57,4.82,35955578,Great place! Great host! We were seven people in Berlin on an extended weekend to enjoy the sights and great restaurant experiences. The apartment is perfect for larger groups. Beds are comfortable and big enough to share. Kitchen facilities are amazing. There is everything you need + extra! We met our host during our stay and she was very helpful and friendly. I can definitely recommend this place for your next Berlin trip. U+S-bahn stations are within short walking distance. 5 stars from us to this place!!,0,0.9914,Positive
