32.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,0,9.004424061898769,4.77,4.66,4.7,4.81,35396599,"La casa è molto accogliente, con tutti il necessario per rendere bello il soggiorno, pulita e con gli spazi giusti. La zona è un po' periferica (non troppo) ma a noi è piaciuta molto, tranquilla e davvero ben collegata da treni e autobus. Rapporto qualità/prezzo eccezionale. Elena e Mike sono gentili e disponibili, rispondono subito ad ogni domanda. Consigliatissimo, prenoteremo sicuramente di nuovo in caso di un altro soggiorno a Berlino! grazie mille per tutto!",1,-0.6351,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,6.401465851545372,5.0,4.93,4.93,4.93,2646856,"We loved staying at Maleks place - the room was lovely and bright & spacious, it was only 5 mins from a big train station from which you could get pretty much anywhere in berlin. The surrounding area of Fredrichshain  had loads of great bars and restaurants to choose from. Couldn’t fault this place at all!",1,0.9476,Positive
300.0,9,3.0,1.5,4.0,54,100.0,1,2.312156644109463,4.9,4.85,4.95,4.81,10043384,Lovely apartment in a good location. Perfect for a large group ,0,0.886,Positive
107.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,36,100.0,0,6.609127265569619,4.72,4.5,4.72,4.65,29412907,"Rene's place exceeded our expectations in every way. It's sparkling clean and spacious, with a great sofa to relax on after a day sightseeing. The beds are comfortable and Rene is available should you need anything. One of the best aspects of his place, though, is where it is located: with excellent restaurants and cafes right outside the door, you need not go far to find great food and drinks. And yet the neighborhood is quiet and residential, so no loud cars screech by late at night. It was great to be off the beaten path and stay in an area with so much life. All in all, I recommend Rene's place highly!",1,0.9825,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,41,100.0,0,6.868701615189391,5.0,5.0,4.92,5.0,39985869,"Die Wohnung von Katja ist super gemütlich, sauber und wie ""nach Hause kommen"" und mit warmen Farben eingerichtet. Die Loggia war mein täglicher Lieblingsplatz zum Erholen nach der ""big City Berlin"". <br/>Die Küche liegt zum ruhigen Innenhof mit grünen Bäumen. <br/>Wer bei offenem Fenster schlafen möchte, hört ab und zu die S-Bahn. Sonst für die Stadt wunderbar ruhig. Spaziergang im Treptower Park einfach herrlich. Mit dem E-Scooter/bike rasch am S-Bahnhof oder der Bus in der nächsten Strasse. Parkplatz gut zu finden. Ich kann die Wohnung für jeden Berlin Aufenthalt sehr empfehlen.",1,-0.9661,Negative
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,8,100.0,0,2.9568670782775994,4.84,4.84,4.97,4.86,6220581,"The flat is amazing.<br/>Love it. One of the best on Airbnb.<br/>Thank you micha",1,0.8402,Positive
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,0,6.921653568425913,4.89,4.87,4.69,4.88,10360635,"Great, thanks for the easy checkin.",1,0.872,Positive
123.0,1,1.0,1.0,0.0,35,80.0,0,2.477862624158107,4.68,4.77,4.91,4.27,26320273,Loved everything about Christina’s place .. lots of water and apple juice  to drink .. Christina helped  me get to where I needed,1,0.5994,Positive
149.0,5,1.0,1.0,2.0,8,81.0,0,6.714128192155476,4.17,4.26,4.03,4.17,1223091910763945275,"The property was clean, location is amazing for those who more into outdoor.",1,0.7579,Positive
300.0,5,2.0,2.0,3.0,71,100.0,1,9.260527967950802,4.97,4.97,4.92,4.85,1977882,"Frank was an incredible host. His tour of the apartment was so engaging and fun, putting us all in a great mood for the whole day, even though we started out tired. He even made us delicious fresh squeezed orange juice. <br/><br/>The apartment is beautiful, even nicer than the photos. I particularly liked the shower, the desk in the guest bedroom and the very fast wifi. The kitchen was fully stocked and the coffee machine was great. <br/><br/>Whenever we had a minor question, Frank responded very quickly and was super-helpful. <br/><br/>If you are on the fence about where to stay in Berlin, I highly recommend you choose Frank's place. ",0,0.9844,Positive
116.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,3.73414624700186,4.73,4.61,4.82,4.54,36651479,"Cool apartment in a great location to explore Berlin. Only downside was the lock on the apartment door (a bit annoying and time consuming to enter). Overall a really neat apartment, would recommend!",1,0.831,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,0,3.8446371557986394,5.0,4.93,5.0,4.93,1039919561659737496,"Die Unterkunft ist richtig schön und wir haben uns direkt wohl gefühlt. Auch der Nahverkehr war super schnell zu erreichen, die Lage ist super. Hussam war immer gut zu erreichen und hat schnell geantwortet. Alles in Allem wirklich eine schöne Unterkunft!",1,-0.8439,Negative
90.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,94.0,1,3.432553095248964,4.8,4.83,4.9,4.69,42706339,"Eine kleine, einfache und gleichzeitig schicke Unterkunft, perfekt gelegen.<br/>Gerne wieder!",1,0.0,Neutral
30.0,2,1.0,0.5,1.0,13,85.0,1,4.7815925714453815,5.0,5.0,4.96,5.0,972905991198463248,"It was 7 wonderful days in Berlin. The apartment was very clean and cozy and so close to the public transport (S-Bahn, U-Bahn, Trams), which made it really simple to travel to the city center and Berlin’s main attractions. Also, Aurelia was very sweet and kind, she made me feel right at home. And with a cat around you will never feel alone. If I ever come back to Berlin, I would for sure stay with Aurelia again. 100% recommended.",1,0.9652,Positive
107.0,3,2.0,1.5,2.0,18,100.0,0,6.774682469939278,4.77,4.89,4.88,4.67,50162244,"Super. Alles!<br/>Die Lage, die Wohnung, der Style, die Grösse, die Ausstattung, die Kommunikation.<br/>Vielen Dank für die Gastfreundschaft.",1,-0.9508,Negative
127.0,7,3.0,1.0,4.0,41,100.0,0,4.334292034577571,4.7,4.56,4.77,4.71,1159572,"Great location, great host, and clean!",0,0.9041,Positive
144.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,0,8.026984704912612,4.92,4.76,4.84,4.76,4215500,We stayed for 3 in Andreas apartment. Everything was perfect! Andreas met us as we had agreed upon and showed us the fantastic apartment. The apartment is huge with nice relaxing rooms. The apartment is very quiet and we all slept very well. The kitchen is well equipped and the Wi-Fi is working well. The area is nice for exploring Berlin and we really enjoyed how easy it was to get around from the apartment. We will for sure call back to Andreas and his fantastic apartment if we go back to Berlin. Thanks for a wonderful stay Andreas! ,1,0.9925,Positive
70.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,12.86304269897694,4.93,4.97,4.89,4.88,18014187,"Tolle Lage am Ende des Ku‘damms. Per Bus schnell in die City (3 Min zu Fuß) oder per S-Bahn (6 Min zu Fuß). Einkaufsmöglichkeit (REWE) gleich um die Ecke. <br/>Einziges kleines Manko: Mein Sohn hat jedes Mal die 115 Stufen im Treppenhaus in den fünften Stock gezählt und brauchte im Anschluss ein Sauerstoffzelt 😉. <br/>Trotzdem eine klare Empfehlung, Patrick ist ein super Gastgeber.",1,-0.8316,Negative
