69.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,0,10.192916833772689,4.9,4.91,4.79,4.87,1863324,"Olqa and her husband are very friendly, but unfortunately we have arranged the trip without too much time to talk with them. House is very nice, very clean and larger than photos, just a few minutes walk from the train station, and less than 25 minutes train to city centre. Thank you so much to Olqa and her husband. And Berlin is very good city worth to visit. ",1,0.9556,Positive
306.0,8,3.0,2.0,5.0,44,100.0,1,6.90827181205849,4.86,4.8,4.85,4.68,311703,Everything about our visit worked really smoothly. The appartment was ideal for our family and the arrangements to collect keys and access the flat very easy. Plenty of space to relax and everything was clean. The location is ideal for a short visit with excellent restaurants only a short walk away. Many thanks. We had a great time in Berlin.,0,0.9783,Positive
124.0,3,0.0,8.5,3.0,34,100.0,0,2.6157359022078506,4.67,4.51,4.75,4.59,45354685,Great Hostel with excellent communal facilities - great area with nice food places too! Easy to get into Berlin from its doorstep!,0,0.9595,Positive
89.0,4,0.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,1,9.213446128957443,4.68,4.53,4.51,4.68,242978,Wir wurden von Thomas gut zur und in die Wohnung geleitet.  Alles war wie beschrieben.  Für uns war die Lage optimal. Man kommt gut überall hin. Sehr gerne wieder.,1,-0.9337,Negative
260.0,4,2.0,2.0,4.0,55,100.0,0,2.5729352260986107,4.66,4.55,4.84,4.45,26543,"Hi to all my family of five adults spent 5 nights in the apartment.  The 2 bedrooms are large and airy. One bedroom has a large qeen bed and a sofa bed. The other bedroom has a split queen.  The storage space is good.  We had enough for all.<br/>The lounge room has a three seater sofa bed. We did not use it.<br/>The apartment has a full kitchen.  You will find what you need to cook make coffee and a cup of tea. <br/>The hot water in kitchen needs to be fiddle with to make it work but once we figured it out it was ok.<br/>There was enough hot water for all which is a bonus. Only only one bathroom with 5 aduls was interesting lol.<br/>The neighborhood around the apartment is lovely.  Great cafes. Nice little shops and wonderful delis. You can buy everything you need nearby and walk the streets enjoying the interesting buildings. <br/>The train station is easy to find and the city is only a few stops away.  We found it easy to get around. Great location in that regard. <br/>Overall we loved the location. Terri our host replied promptly to all emails and was happy to answer any questions.  Elva's English is ok but we did have a slight misunderstanding at the beginning.  When Elva does meet you at the unit ask her about the hot water in the kitchen.  If you don't read german ask her about the washing machine.  If not familiar with the area how to get to the train station.  This will save you time and a headache.  We enjoyed our stay in this apartment.  Loved the location. ",0,0.998,Positive
94.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,1,2.8921931319330847,4.83,4.85,4.85,4.62,37081059,"Tolle Unterkunft, Top Lage in einem tollen lebendigen und aktiven Quartier mit total vielen Möglichkeiten auswärts zu Essen. Kommunikation mit den Besitzern hat super funktioniert. Kommen gerne wieder!",1,0.7177,Positive
