125.0,5,3.0,1.0,2.0,65,100.0,0,5.4191851787607,4.83,4.77,4.77,4.83,6568956,"Florian’s place is perfect for a more local experience of Berlin with all the amazing bars and restaurants surrounding the flat, and having Florian’s speedy responses to any questions. It’s also close enough to the U-Bahn to ride into the centre of Berlin at any time and experience everything you could ever want to experience! We would definitely recommend Florian's place to anyone looking for a clean, comfortable and central flat to stay in.",0,0.9601,Positive
