125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,7,0.0,0,5.736687584285891,4.33,4.33,4.0,4.0,543304521392769826,"There's some nice things about this, but imho, it's not a fantastic deal. Especially if you know why Berlin is having a housing crisis and average flat prices. This was probably originally an attic space that was never intended to be a flat. From about my second or third week of occupancy, a bad smell came from the plumbing. Then the water began to backlog. Despite my being gone for nearly half my stay (I travel every couple weeks for work) - it took so much effort to get action in any kind of timely manner when I was home. It was snaked twice and still had problems. During one maintenance visit, the host's relation insinuated that my visiting friend (visiting for 2 days at 2 months after the problems began!) and I were to blame for the plumbing problem because of our hair! What!?<br/>Additionally, the surrounding area is quite noisy. Nonstrop traffic, a playground across the street sounds like bloody murder for about 12 hours a day, then the corner drunks take over til 5am.",1,-0.9885,Negative
127.0,6,2.0,2.0,5.0,45,100.0,0,11.764307913706604,4.44,4.56,4.62,4.38,250253,Nous avons passé une tres bonne semaine en famille. Le logement est bien équipé et fonctionnel pour 6. Les deux salles de bains sont les bienvenues.,0,0.0,Neutral
63.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,5,100.0,0,7.378354955981485,4.75,5.0,5.0,4.75,1377373175275223608,Udo är en mycket trevlig person. Han är trevlig och lätt att prata med. Lägenhet är ren och fräsch. Den ligger bra till kollektivtrafiken så det är lätt att ta sig runt i Berlin. Stor tack till udo och rekommendera han starkt<br/>⭐️ ⭐️ ⭐️ ⭐️ ⭐️,1,0.0,Neutral
152.0,5,2.0,1.0,5.0,40,100.0,1,1.5968425433019005,4.81,4.77,4.93,4.69,22677,"Die Unterkunft ist super ruhig gelegen - trotzdem, dass man mitten in Berlin ist. Die Unterkunft bietet sehr viel Platz und ist mit dem kleinen Garten eine wirkliche Oase. <br/>Ramfis ist super freundlich, zuvorkommend und wir haben uns sofort wie zu Hause gefühlt. Wenn wir noch das nächste mal nach Berlin kommen werden wir auf jeden Fall noch einmal buchen.",0,0.0,Neutral
101.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,3.078352015251089,4.83,4.81,4.81,4.66,20282379,"It is definitely a place I will recommend to my friends, and I hope to return again soon!<br/>What you see is exactly what you get. Located near restaurants and bars and close to public transportation, the location is great.",1,0.9392,Positive
144.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,49,90.0,1,1.9327347284611704,4.95,4.81,4.98,4.74,8857403,Kasia’s lejlighed var rummelig og godt indrettet og dejligt at bo i et privat og personligt hjem fremfor de mange kommercielle udlejere. <br/>Alt fungerede og dejligt at bo i et hjem hvor der er børn når man selv har børn med. Bedste anbefalinger.,1,0.0,Neutral
195.0,4,3.0,1.5,3.0,41,100.0,1,2.9858830817363757,4.96,4.99,4.95,4.83,929443,"The apartment is awesome, well located, super quiet and huge. Thomas and Alexandra are very nice people, they also live close and are very helpful. Great place for a great city.",0,0.98,Positive
45.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,2.0393793505131024,4.86,4.76,4.96,4.79,24446063,"The private room was very easy to find, Susanne was very responsive and communicated great! The room was a very close walk (under 5min) to the public transportation which made it very easy to get around Berlin. The room was clean and was as expected based on pictures. The room is small, but it is perfect for a short stay and had a good amount of room for two people. Another bonus was that it was located on a restaurant street which gave us many close options for our meals! The neighbours in the building were a little noisy at times, we found that the room wasn’t very sound proof but it was nothing too major. If we are ever in Berlin again, we would definitely consider Susanne as our host! Thank you 👍",1,0.9837,Positive
54.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,11,100.0,1,5.259652982108338,4.82,4.9,4.9,4.81,2657671,"Everything was very nice, thanks",1,0.7408,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,1,4.908238385378831,4.95,4.8,4.82,4.82,43540687,Alles wie in der Anzeige angegeben und zu empfehlen. Yumi ist sehr hilfsbereit.,1,0.0,Neutral
91.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,0,4.511823268613172,4.68,4.74,4.5,4.65,30319167,"Amazing stay! Kristina was very friendly and understanding. The apartment studio is cozy, clean, and well equipped and there were snacks included in the price. I consider the self-check in a big plus, especially as we were arriving late in the night. The location is a bit further away but easily accessible by public transport and the neighborhood is very quiet and welcoming. We enjoyed our stay very much and would happily recommend it.",1,0.9804,Positive
104.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,0,12.544245593904789,4.56,4.77,3.79,4.26,25535508,"Wirklich alles sehr sauber und auch die Mitarbeiter alle freundlich und immer hilfsbereit. Wir sind als 2 Personen angereist mit Kind. Leider war das Zimmer viel zu klein und beide Babybetten,die wir bekommen haben, waren kaputt. Musste also mit dem kleinen im Bett schlafen, was deutlich zu klein war. Auf die Nachfrage, zwecks Umtausch vom Zimmer, ging es leider nicht, weil keine Kapazitäten waren, angeblich. Hotel hat kein Fahrstuhl, also musste Kinderwagen unten in der Lobby stehen bleiben. <br/>Check-In lief reibungslos und easy. <br/>All-in All war okay, würde aber mit Kind nicht nochmal kommen und auch als 2 Personen nicht , weil das Zimmer einfach wirklich viel zu klein ist. Man kann kaum stehen dort oder sich bewegen. Dennoch, war alles sehr sauber und gepflegt. <br/>Lage ist okay. Circa 10.m Fußweg zum Bahnhof dort .",1,-0.9153,Negative
