228.0,12,2.0,1.0,8.0,37,100.0,0,4.395960174638087,4.29,4.13,4.48,4.08,53796458,...,0,0.0,Neutral
422.0,12,4.0,2.5,6.0,88,88.0,1,18.372677750391578,4.86,4.91,4.95,4.8,865749783949095999,"Thomas’ place is the perfect stay in Berlin. My family and I were visiting Berlin for my brothers wedding and needed somewhere near to stay for the week, Thomas’ place was the perfect spot. We were travelling with twins and Thomas was so accommodating to us going out of his way to make sure all of our needs were taken care of. In terms of the house, you can’t ask for anything more, Thomas and Ela have all of your needs covered. We will most definitely be back and thank you Thomas for such a lovely stay.",0,0.969,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,0,0.5555591583260235,4.82,4.96,4.88,4.69,10031729,"Wonderful stay, with a very kind and friendly host, who has perfected the air BnB process.",1,0.9388,Positive
