81.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,1,4.028603514184869,4.78,4.74,4.9,4.65,26633041,"Let me start off by saying this was my first air bnb experience and I was blown away. The pictures dont do this place justice , located right in the heart of city in Kreuzberg. The flat offers every basic amenity including wifi, ( which is awesome because you can use the same hotspot around the city) . The place was spotless and perfectly arranged for our arrival, Ben even allowed us to check in earlier than his normal check in time ( Huge plus since we were traveling the next day from Moscow, Russia. ) Overall I highly recommend this place, the location, the sleek space and the above and beyond service was highly appreicated! <br/>",1,0.9523,Positive
