64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,100.0,1,9.131807822797295,4.77,4.72,4.74,4.63,1130338732311946203,Me encantó la atención de personal me ayudaron para darme info de direcciones muy amablemente,1,0.0,Neutral
133.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,41,100.0,1,1.3967029600966876,4.92,4.94,4.97,4.86,1003550014251405426,"A Gem in Berlin! ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐<br/>This cozy apartment was the perfect base for our Berlin adventure! It truly felt like a home away from home, with everything we needed for a comfortable stay. The peaceful and silent atmosphere was exactly what we were looking for after busy days exploring the city.<br/>The location couldn't be better! We were able to walk to all the major sights and attractions, and there were plenty of fantastic restaurants, bars, and shops right on the doorstep.  It gave us a real feel for the neighborhood and we loved experiencing the local scene.<br/>We highly recommend this apartment to anyone visiting Berlin, but please be aware that there are 5-6 steps leading down to the entrance, so it may not be suitable for those with limited mobility.<br/>Overall, we had a fantastic stay and would definitely book again!",1,0.9777,Positive
145.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,59,100.0,1,7.17316663043628,4.94,4.95,4.82,4.9,17002284,"We had such an amazing stay at Michael's place and if we could give it 6 stars we would. The neighbourhood is super quiet, so we slept like babies. But it's very near public transport. The appartment is so spacious and Michael is very generous with all his things. The kitchen is super equipped and there is a big welcome bowl on the kitchen table with some essentials (including some bottles of wine). There are bakeries, supermarkets and great little restaurants around the corner in Leberstrasse. We particularly liked Nosh Deli. Michael has an informative manual and we also tried the coffee shops he had suggested. All great. Would definitely stay here again if ever in Berlin again. Thanks Michael, hope to see you in Australia one day.",0,0.9942,Positive
56.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,8.674910442002028,4.96,4.97,4.81,4.88,607836165565073961,无可挑剔的好，来柏林必再订！<br/>整洁，和描述一样，大男孩主人；<br/>什么都有，洗衣，烘干，特别方便；<br/>步行可达地铁站，各种大小型超市。,1,0.0,Neutral
