213.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,28,98.0,1,1.0060942274458289,4.97,4.96,4.97,4.85,14191082,"Central apartment, set back off the road which makes for perfect location that is quiet too. The host is lovely and the apartment was great! Clean, neat and lovely decor. More than enough room for 4 guests. There are lovely restaurants, cafes and bars that are all easy to walk to. With an underground station at the end of the road- getting around is easy if you don't fancy walking.",1,0.9848,Positive
