45.0,2,0.0,0.0,1.0,15,100.0,0,10.992727678356308,4.79,4.65,4.27,4.71,49607178,"War ein gemütlicher, ruhiger Aufenthalt in Timos Wohnung. Kommunikation war super, sehr freundlich, sehr flexibler Check-in und Check-out, alles vorhanden, was man macht braucht.",1,-0.5994,Negative
137.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,1,2.759966591003808,4.94,4.92,4.94,4.81,768616,Cornelius' apartment is wonderful. It has everything we could have needed and more. The location is perfect. Easy to get around the city and loads of great restaurants right in the neighborhood. Although we didn't meet Cornelius he was so responsive and helpful. He arranged a taxi for us at 3:30 am. he left a book with all the instruction for everything in the apartment. We were lucky enough to have great weather and we had breakfast on the little balcony with an amazing view. I would stay here again for sure. ,1,0.9869,Positive
114.0,6,1.0,1.0,4.0,22,99.0,0,4.269791856144701,4.74,4.65,4.5,4.68,28378483,"This apartment was clean, comfortable, and located in a hip area with lots of places to eat and enjoy a beer. There were other people renting the rooms nearby, so there was some noise as expected, but it was a lovely place for our girls weekend trip!",1,0.8908,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,11.52471391621076,4.8,4.69,4.77,4.83,25439364,"the flat is clean and organized, speccially the bedroom which is <br/>roomy aswell.<br/>there are many aplliances in the kitchen so you can prepare/cook almost everything.<br/>and whenever i had questions about everyday life in Berlin he helped me a lot.",1,0.4019,Positive
99.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,0,15.11918943238052,4.92,4.87,4.86,4.77,26222336,"If you want to stay in the Frei University/Dahlem area, this place is perfect. It is exactly as described and very cozy.  Plays, Nina is very helpful and a super host!",1,0.9304,Positive
61.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,44,95.0,1,3.717179362500484,4.74,4.71,4.68,4.57,18478528,"Staying at Jana's made my first trip to Berlin so easy, many of the places I wanted to visit were no more than 40 minutes away by public transportation or bike. I have to say Jana's friend, Maria, was very helpful with any question I had and also left an European adapter plug so I can use, very nice. I loved the apartment and the building, had a very retro feel to it. There's a grocery store right down the block,  so many places to eat at, many forms of transportation nearby.  Really enjoyed my stay at Jana's.",1,0.9501,Positive
