57.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,0,13.266221905995646,4.7,4.43,4.57,4.6,1335021052877774112,"I had a great stay here! The apartment is very spacious, clean and well furnished. Getting public transit to the city center, train station and airport was very simple and straightforward. Gihad was very responsive whenever I had a question. There are also supermarkets close by. I recommended this as a base for your Berlin vacation!",1,0.924,Positive
123.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,28,100.0,0,4.462782849034317,4.86,4.88,4.83,4.82,9994644,"Great neighbourhood, 5 mins from subway station, 15 mins walk to Potsdamer Platz (lots of shops, restaurants, etc.).  Also 15 mins from Checkpoint Charlie and surroundings.  Martin provided excellent instructions for public transportation (subway/bus) from Tegel Airport to the apartment.  He was at the apartment to greet us and provided maps and info on the surroundings as well as things to do, etc.  There was tea, coffee, milk and bottles of water for us - NICE TOUCH!  As the date of our arrival approached, Martin was very quick in replying to our queries.<br/><br/>This was our first Air B'nB stay, Martin made it a GREAT one!",1,0.9688,Positive
