157.0,8,2.0,1.0,7.0,48,100.0,0,8.94968963214356,4.7,4.72,4.43,4.49,14381251,"Good location, easy access to transport links into central Berlin to visit all the historical attractions.  The apartment has Large rooms with plenty of space for a large family or a group of friends.",0,0.8934,Positive
240.0,4,2.0,2.0,2.0,35,100.0,1,4.916814507636096,4.98,4.9,4.78,4.86,35662653,"We had an amazing stay at Modern Penthouse in the Heart of Berlin. From the moment we booked, Erik was incredibly kind, attentive, and communicative. He went above and beyond to make sure we felt welcome, providing us with all the information we needed and preparing the apartment perfectly. It was clear he genuinely cared about ensuring our vacation was special.<br/>The apartment itself was spotless, well-equipped, and perfectly located. Everything we needed was thoughtfully prepared, which made our stay so comfortable and enjoyable.<br/>Thank you, Erik and Nova, for your warmth and hospitality! We highly recommend staying here to anyone visiting Berlin. If we return, we’ll definitely book again. 5/5 stars without hesitation!",0,0.9929,Positive
118.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,18,93.0,0,2.3360123395652144,4.78,4.65,4.76,4.63,17396668,"This place was exactly as described, it was really close to lots of gorgeous bars and restaurants. The place was nice and spacious and well equipped for mainly two people but if you don’t mind drinking wine from a normal glasses then no problem!. There is a tube that takes you everywhere close by, a Lidl very close by and we would recommend going to Klinke for dinner which is at the end of the road - but you will need reservations! One thing which could have been better was the lighting especially for makeup purposes!",1,0.8786,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,1.3773060525895495,4.72,4.84,4.91,4.66,1461489656921679773,pretty good for the price except no fridge which sucked,1,0.2263,Positive
35.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,59,100.0,0,0.7009515972590313,4.75,4.8,4.95,4.74,2543760,"Although we didn't have to much time to talk ('cause Berlin is such a great and interesting city to get to know for the first time), Monica and Yvonne are very nice persons and made us feel comfortable. They always made sure that we were ok. The house is big and corresponded to everything that was announced about it. The location is great, with a nice neighborhood and close to everything. I'd recommend it to other brazilians travelling to Berlin! Thanks, Monica and Yvonne!",1,0.9832,Positive
125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,19,100.0,0,9.40806481603953,4.57,3.43,4.86,4.71,31429500,"Well located, good communication, easy check-in and check-out thanks to Alex.",1,0.8689,Positive
95.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,3.769411114551402,4.65,4.73,4.79,4.5,4869716,"Very convenient check in, comfortable and clean space and the neighborhood is quite lovely!",1,0.8856,Positive
109.0,4,0.0,1.0,4.0,40,96.0,0,6.177149581820329,4.55,4.49,4.84,4.38,40609244,"Had a very nice stay. All amenities worked perfectly fine. The area itself is wonderful with lots of restaurants and bars. Had some confusion getting into the apartment, but the host responded immediately and solved the issue",1,0.815,Positive
138.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,52,100.0,1,8.608505724880466,4.88,4.69,4.76,4.85,18605817,Sven's place is gorgeous and he was such an amazing host. Definitely recommend!,1,0.923,Positive
187.0,5,1.0,1.0,2.0,60,100.0,1,3.4993610437479004,4.97,4.9,4.92,4.83,701971447519071423,"Kathrin's apt was perfect for my family's week long stay in Berlin.  Clean, spacious, great location and Kathrin was an excellent host.  Communicative and helpful.",1,0.9517,Positive
77.0,5,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,57.0,0,2.781258670170601,5.0,4.75,5.0,5.0,1229417917885180544,"Wir waren eine Woche in Petes Wohnung zu Gast und haben es sehr genossen: tolle Lage, super große Wohnung zum wohlfühlen, alles da, was man braucht, super sauber, geschmackvoll eingerichtet, Frühstück auf dem Balkon - wir kommen sehr gerne wieder! Vielen Dank für alles",1,0.8439,Positive
90.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,45,100.0,1,3.6178758418911023,4.85,4.82,4.9,4.73,540335929043609328,"Fijn verblijf, mooi, licht en ruim appartement op een leuke locatie. Duidelijke communicatie met vriendelijke host.",1,0.0,Neutral
248.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,2.942766383999945,4.96,4.98,4.86,4.74,28091977,"Very design and clean hotel apartment, with all quality equipment you need, and a nice view on a little park on one side. Just be careful if your sleep is fragile, the tram station is just under the bedroom's windows :(",1,0.5367,Positive
285.0,11,4.0,2.0,6.0,37,100.0,1,4.438559541337636,4.79,4.93,4.72,4.76,42485855,"Great location, stunning views, and outstanding amenities make this Berlin apartment a top choice for travelers.<br/>Overlooking the city, and provide a unique perspective of Berlin's beauty.<br/>Lavishly furnished with modern decor and comfortable furnishings, the apartment offers a luxurious and inviting atmosphere.<br/>Amenities abound, with a well-equipped kitchen, high-speed internet, and all the comforts of home.<br/>Nestled in a vibrant neighborhood, this apartment is the perfect base for exploring Berlin's rich culture and attractions.",0,0.9869,Positive
66.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,25,100.0,1,12.69261644647349,4.9,4.89,4.68,4.85,2602460,Der Kontakt vorab mit der Gastgeberin war super freundlich. Das Apartment ist wirklich sehr schön und es hat nichts gefehlt. Die Wohnung war auch sehr sauber gewesen. Ich kann es wirklich nur weiter empfehlen!!!,1,-0.865,Negative
161.0,7,1.0,1.0,3.0,38,90.0,0,1.6132440005466837,4.58,4.54,4.87,4.44,321378,Super Lage der Wohnung und 2 schöne Dachterassen. Wir hatten uns die Wohnung etwas größer vorgestellt und es gibt nur eine Badewanne in der geduscht werden kann.,1,0.0,Neutral
88.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,1,2.7348204012292734,4.85,4.96,4.85,4.68,937557263289597139,Bin ich seh zufrieden.<br/>Würde jeder Zeit empfehlen!!<br/>Danke Till,1,0.0,Neutral
