126.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,38,97.0,0,1.7520993087590884,4.75,4.77,4.93,4.65,18382782,"Great place! Such a good location, with great restaurants, cafes and shops nearby. The apartment was really lovely with a great view over the park. I'll stay again next time I visit Berlin!",1,0.9677,Positive
328.0,8,4.0,2.0,6.0,31,100.0,1,6.97282351203588,4.89,4.92,4.52,4.71,14333714,We stayed with 4 friends and it was perfect for us,0,0.7783,Positive
179.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,96.0,0,4.783955903862496,4.59,4.8,4.6,4.54,53928585,"Wir hatten eine wunderbare Zeit in dem schönen Apartment. Die Fenster erlauben einen tollen Blick auf Berlin und sind so gut isoliert, dass es in der Wohnung sehr ruhig ist. Wir kommen gern einmal wieder.",1,-0.5994,Negative
70.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,45,100.0,0,24.494454606732948,4.77,4.73,4.39,4.67,10229937,The place was clean and the host was polite and helpful.,1,0.6705,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,5,100.0,0,5.095474314035609,5.0,4.0,5.0,4.5,35798200,"Mein Freund Samuel und ich haben eine sehr schöne Woche bei Marie und ihrer Mitbewohnerin Carlotta verbracht.<br/>Wir waren auf WG Suche und haben von beiden super Insidertipps bekommen und sogar Kontakte für mögliche Zwischenaufenthalte in der Zukunft. Es war alles sauber und wir durften uns in der Küche an allem bedienen. Die Lage wäre auch für Sightseeing super gelegen gewesen, nicht weit von sowohl U-Bahn-, S-Bahn-Stationen als auch Bushaltestellen und jeder Menge Einkaufsläden und Schnellimbissen entfernt - also insgesamt ein toller Ort, um auch einen längeren Aufenthalt in Berlin zu verbringen! Danke! :D",1,0.6825,Positive
69.0,1,1.0,0.5,1.0,36,100.0,1,1.962559433520971,4.98,5.0,4.94,4.92,1039150311277547002,"Beautifully decorated and well appointed apartment, perfectly located for getting around on public transport. Peggy is a warm and easygoing host, with impeccable taste. Can’t recommend it enough.",1,0.9403,Positive
82.0,4,0.0,1.0,4.0,47,100.0,1,7.250180211725777,4.87,4.85,4.7,4.76,11810798,"Alles super, sehr gerne wieder.",1,0.5994,Positive
215.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,55,100.0,1,9.076307917104932,4.77,4.74,4.73,4.5,44223516,"The residence was a very comfortable and welcoming staying. The wellness spa was so relaxing and peaceful and was a welcome retreat after running around the city. <br/>It was in a quiet neighborhood and there weren’t a lot of restaurants super close to the place. If you walk about 15 minutes you can end up in some of the more touristy parts of Berlin. Personally it wasn’t my favorite neighborhood but might be nice for some. <br/>Transportation was close, but you were usually having to hop on multiple lines to get places. <br/>Overall I really enjoyed the stay!",1,0.9746,Positive
422.0,15,6.0,2.0,11.0,42,100.0,0,7.556065651864161,4.63,4.48,4.83,4.62,839919420344071044,Great location and super good value for money. Perfect for groups of active people who just need a place to crash. Many separate bedrooms provided personal space which was important for our group.,0,0.9571,Positive
118.0,2,1.0,0.0,1.0,27,99.0,1,8.583837471119269,4.75,4.75,4.33,4.67,1286169008663339170,War sehr schön und die Lage sehr zentral.,1,-0.8316,Negative
