63.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,13,100.0,0,4.068779664251412,4.64,4.64,4.82,4.64,37003601,"It was a really nice experience to stay here, Her roommate was absolutely kind and helpful. The location is perfect and comfortable. <br/>If you stay here you need to climb up but it’s totally worth it.",1,0.8937,Positive
