64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,1,19.305886449552432,4.95,4.89,4.78,4.94,907807912932543143,"Birgit und ihre Unterkunft sind uneingeschränkt zu empfehlen. <br/>Besonders toll ist das Frühstück, dass Birgit einem extra zubereitet und Birgits freundliche Art",1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,22,0.0,0,2.247768362887687,4.7,4.82,4.87,4.7,3606797,"Otto was a very nice and helpful guy. The apartment was clean with fresh towels, sheets and a welcome pickup cookie! Also the area is very nice, public transport behind the corner and located in the center.<br/>I would recommend this apartment for those who want to travel to berlin!",1,0.9619,Positive
