160.0,6,1.0,1.0,3.0,45,100.0,1,7.428675029398372,4.7,4.71,4.53,4.63,1099862201422281184,Schöne Location am Park. Alles von hier gut zu erreichen. Alles fein und wie beschrieben - gerne wieder.,1,0.0,Neutral
187.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,33,87.0,0,3.470214040335909,4.58,4.55,4.58,4.49,49509138,"Great location, great value, easy check in, would stay again!",1,0.9299,Positive
165.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,12,100.0,0,12.441028986912096,4.27,4.1,4.41,4.39,567073865333260546,"""It was all great, we really enjoyed the 2 nights we spent here. I would go back to this accommodation anytime.""",1,0.8268,Positive
128.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,61,100.0,1,4.880214568244147,4.95,4.99,4.9,4.88,24423970,"The design and decoration is amazing and so cozy for stay. Gunnar and Istvan are really good person. The place is Very close to the east side gallery, lots of public transportation nearby. Istvan introduced us a hamburger restaurant beside their apartment is really deserve to try. Most recommend you to chose their place for holiday.",1,0.9097,Positive
89.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,0,12.72557223503116,4.66,4.69,4.68,4.53,15019290,"Alles super! Wir haben die Unterkunft für Familienmitglieder gebucht, die sehr zufrieden waren. Gerne wieder.",1,-0.636,Negative
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,7,100.0,0,2.9133522757122288,4.86,4.71,4.86,4.71,7566563,"Notre séjour à Berlin s'est bien déroulé.<br/>Nous avons passé 7 nuits dans l'appartement de Chloé. Celui-ci est confortable, propre et bien aménagé.  Le séjour est spacieux, la cuisine bien équipée et la salle de bain étroite mais fonctionnelle. Les lits et le canapé lit sont très confortables. <br/>Il est très bien situé, à moins de 10 minutes à pied de la station Schonhauser Allee (métro et Tram) <br/>Le quartier est bien animé en soirée, beaucoup de restaurant et de bars et calme la nuit, agréable pour bien se reposer après une longue journée de visiter. <br/>Nous recommandons chaleureusement cet appartement, il convient pour un couple voir groupe de 3 à 4 personnes. <br/>Merci Chloé pour nous avoir permis de séjourné chez toi et pour les nombreux conseils que tu nous as prodigués. Bien que nous ne nous soyons pas rencontrées,  ce fut un plaisir d'échanger avec toi par mail.",1,0.0,Neutral
156.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,90.0,1,11.510851452846596,4.71,4.59,4.86,4.41,699815533129730302,It was great. the bed was really comfy! coffee was tasty and the location allows you to travel into the city easily by public transport.,1,0.7777,Positive
125.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,32,97.0,0,5.826874691514046,4.41,4.44,4.03,4.33,879653438579452099,"We enjoyed our stay, most of the things were better than expected.<br/>I only recommend booking there.",0,0.8271,Positive
149.0,4,3.0,1.0,5.0,31,0.0,0,8.155448061817273,4.6,4.73,4.71,4.59,14618013,"Lovely and great sized place to stay! We really liked the area and found some great places to go for breakfast such as the Wald Cafe. With an U-Bahn stop in front of the house, Mitte and all the main attractions are a short (20/30mins) ride away. Unfortunately, we ran out of time to see more of Moabit i.e. the Arminius Markthalle is supposed to be another great food market hall right on the door step of this flat. It’s definitely worth exploring a bit more of this part of town too. Thanks for having us Max and Marlen and all the best.",0,0.984,Positive
44.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,6,100.0,0,9.26217695815614,4.52,4.35,4.65,4.44,1183941128374898613,"excelente, muy gentil la anfitriona, todo limpio, y comodo",1,0.0,Neutral
79.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,31,100.0,0,3.5040001369002214,4.75,4.94,4.77,4.7,52652716,Great place to stay with easy accessible public transport nearby!,1,0.807,Positive
180.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,45,85.0,0,1.5095289909770313,4.75,4.84,4.9,4.6,45475252,"Booked Numa as a last minute resort. The studio unit I got was a spacious corner unit and was nice, clean and tidy. They provided with compliments a bag of chips, bottled water, beer and limencello. There is also an electric stove, kettle, fridge and coffee pod machine which was nice for espresso in the morning. REN toiletries are provided for and there are restaurants and among them, Curry61 on the street below. It is walkable distance from S Hackescher Markt station, Berliner Dom and the Pergamonmuseum. I enjoyed my stay there and will recommend it to others.",1,0.9413,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,0,6.0872377735226655,4.63,4.48,4.44,4.52,31847084,"Die Unterkunft war sehr schön, ich habe mich rundum wohl gefühlt. Das Zimmer ist geräumig, gut ausgestattet und sauber. Auch eine gute Ausstattung der Küchenzeile.",1,-0.8316,Negative
75.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,53,100.0,1,9.574645165106466,4.99,4.91,4.76,4.92,51421881,"Sehr liebevoll eingerichtete Wohnung, tolle Küche! Alles sehr sauber und gemütlich, haben uns direkt wohl gefühlt :) Kommunikation mit Alex war super einfach und angenehm! Wir kommen gerne wieder.",1,0.555,Positive
174.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,1,1.6592287277224604,4.91,4.92,4.94,4.76,39474542,"Great apartment, very spacious. The pictures don’t do it justice. The neighborhood is great, so many good restaurant’s & boutiques. Would definitely visit again!!",1,0.9587,Positive
175.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,21,100.0,1,3.1714147201840213,4.89,4.89,4.83,4.73,86090,"Alexandra heeft een heel fijn appartement in PrenzlBerg. Supermarkten, restaurants en barretjes zijn op loopafstand. En een bezoek aan Mauerpark op zondagmiddag was onvergetelijk. Het apparte,emt komt overeen met de beschrijving en de foto's. De keuken is goed uitgerust en de badkamer met wasmachine is lekker ruim. <br/>Parkeren rondom de woning is mogelijk maar er is niet altijd plek. Elektrisch laden kan bijna voor de deur, parkeren is gratis zolang je laadt. De paal is slechts 11 kw dus je kan lekker lang staan ;). Daarna auto naar P+R verplaatst en met de elektrische step terug, ideaal!<br/>We hebben genoten van Berlijn en Prenzlberg en ik zou zo weer bij Alexandra aankloppen om hier nog eens te verblijven.",1,0.126,Positive
195.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,23,100.0,1,2.8219601407887955,4.85,4.97,4.97,4.75,16920274,It was a really comfortable place with an amazing location - a must stay if u want to stay in Berlin!,0,0.8395,Positive
180.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,1,1.4873772199748572,4.62,4.62,5.0,4.59,1094193214636923697,Wir waren 4 Mädels in der Unterkunft von Douglas! Die Wohnung ist perfekt für einen Wochenendtrip geeignet !,1,-0.6688,Negative
174.0,11,4.0,2.0,1.0,23,100.0,0,5.182308415863953,4.59,4.71,4.54,4.36,1080198254054575244,Nice place and good location,0,0.6908,Positive
96.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,39,38.0,0,3.818422827533855,4.91,4.82,4.8,4.71,552151799222439302,"Marcs Wohnung liegt ruhig und gut angebunden, um an einem verlängerten Wochenende die Stadt zu erkunden.",1,-0.5994,Negative
74.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,1,2.748432840152626,4.98,4.96,4.97,4.92,1013163231104328617,"Sehr zu empfehlen, die Lage ist super zentral und es gibt alles, was man braucht in der Umgebung. Die Kommunikation mit Toni und seiner Frau war super! Wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt und wer Katzen mag freut sich über Kater Simba, der gerne mal vorbeischaut (:<br/>Ein perfektes Zimmerchen für einen Berlin-Trip mit eigenem zu nutzenden Badezimmer. Vielen Dank, wir kommen mit Sicherheit wieder! (:",1,-0.3147,Negative
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,41,100.0,0,4.473280857279366,5.0,5.0,4.92,4.92,33273541,Its has been great to live at Sams flat. True Berlin living experience. Sam has provided us with some tips for coffees and restaurants around. We tried some and loved them. I hope we can come again. Thanks a lot.,1,0.9485,Positive
62.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,26,100.0,0,3.629430806531379,4.76,4.8,4.68,4.69,1017368,"Michael greeted us when we arrived at the apartment and gave us a quick tour of the place. The apartment was clean and spacious for even four people. Location was convenient, everything we wanted to do was a 20 min bike ride away. I would not mind staying here again!",1,0.6239,Positive
143.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,89.0,0,8.515595064754182,4.79,4.82,4.79,4.73,1162087911576592009,Nice apartment in very good location.,1,0.7178,Positive
107.0,3,0.0,1.0,3.0,18,93.0,0,2.373482401219675,4.74,4.7,4.77,4.67,17399068,"The apartment is specious and very clean. Located was good, near bars, places to eat and near a train station. Overall we found the experience very easy, due to good communication of the hosts and because we had all we needed (towels, kitchen, trash bins, etc). I totally recommend this apartment.",1,0.9297,Positive
101.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,1,3.0191512330624914,4.88,4.77,4.73,4.66,21735977,Toller Gastgeber und eine super Wohnung in zentraler Lage. Das Design der Wohnung ist traumhaft und die Ausstattung lässt keine Wünsche offen. Jederzeit gerne wieder.,1,0.0,Neutral
172.0,8,2.0,1.0,4.0,31,100.0,1,2.87994778280774,4.8,4.75,4.88,4.73,30295,"The apartment was in a central part of the city. Apart from a few cough ups due to miscommunication at the start of the stay we were happy with our stay. I texted Michele and he took care of immediately, very pleased with that. No problem staying at Michele's apartment at a later date.<br/><br/>Thanks!",0,0.7569,Positive
64.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,9.727546858221675,4.78,4.39,4.85,4.89,26584781,"Eine schöne Wohnung, mit toller Lage direkt am Fluss, kleine aber ausreichende Küche und Andrea ist auch sehr nett, und ist bei allen möglichen Fragen für einen da👍",1,0.0,Neutral
130.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,1,4.983651912533883,4.92,4.98,4.84,4.78,18641674,Very nice!,1,0.5244,Positive
175.0,5,2.0,2.0,4.0,47,100.0,1,15.027300855160744,4.95,4.96,4.89,4.8,52588641,"We had a nice time at Jan’s apartment. It is in a quiet neighborhood & easily accessible to the city. The apartment was spacious & well equipped for a family.  I had forgotten my laptop power chord & Jan’s wife helped me out with that. <br/>All in all, we had a good stay. Thanks again. We will surely stay with you next step when we come to Berlin.",0,0.9201,Positive
100.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,1,7.44187505020188,4.75,4.72,4.53,4.53,1099852594584694022,"Tout était impeccable, logement très agréable et juste en face du Park. Transports proches. <br/>Le logement est très bien équipé et on s’y sent très bien. <br/>On entend un peu la route passante d’en face, mais ce n’est pas si embêtant avec les fenêtres fermées :) <br/>Communication facile, merci beaucoup",1,0.3612,Positive
