179.0,5,2.0,2.0,3.0,45,100.0,1,3.405358028442921,4.79,4.5,4.88,4.76,1031613426370662223,David’s place was excellent. Good location and close to the station. Very nice neighborhood with supermarkets and coffee shops nearby as well as places to eat. The place was very warm as it was very cold in Berlin and super clean. Spacious and very beautifully decorated. Everything we were looking for. David and Francesca were very helpful with everything we needed and always responding on time. Definitely coming back to stay when I come to Berlin again. Totally recommending this.,0,0.9824,Positive
