83.0,6,2.0,1.0,5.0,56,100.0,0,11.527326485291828,4.69,4.73,4.4,4.57,11294127,The appartment is as described as far as the facilities but the kitchen and the belonging tableware and utensils  were not very clean so we had to wash it before use. We could have wished that basic householding items were filled up upon arrival of our stay but we had to ask for them.<br/>Unfortunately at bedtime in the late evening we experienced some disturbing noise several of times coming from within the building of the appartment.<br/>The response time of the host couple was fine though - always quick to reply.,0,-0.7552,Negative
332.0,14,4.0,2.0,6.0,49,100.0,1,5.961083106152229,4.96,4.95,4.6,4.76,44443842,"Een heel fijn verblijf op een rustige plek in Berlijn. Het appartement is schoon, modern en van alle gemakken voorzien. Communicatie met Simon ging erg vlot en vriendelijk. Er hing zelfs een kleine goodybag aan de deur wat een leuke verassing was.",0,0.0,Neutral
106.0,2,1.0,1.0,0.0,55,100.0,0,33.40271277788651,4.82,4.91,5.0,4.64,1068957417302702114,"Ok, biggest selling point here is the garden, which is a bit of a miracle, really. Crazy tall pines create a light canopy over a curated lush garden below. Loved the fun little minigame of dodging the sprinklers that turn on in the late evening. When the dawn or dusk hits just the tree crowns it feels like a magical place really. The stroll down to the beach is so short that its not worth the effort to bring a lot of things down there, and in the late and early hours its also very quiet there, even if its a very popular beach on sunny days. I highly recommend the 700m swim out to the little island.<br/>The host are kind, helpful, and also protective of the privacy of the space, so its a wonderful place for cosy dates and couples who need some quality time. Hottub takes a while to heat up, so preparation is key, but the area will kill any stress with its quiet calm and nature anyways. The solution with the external bathroom works quite alright, and the host are very helpful with providing",1,0.9466,Positive
172.0,8,2.0,1.0,4.0,31,100.0,1,2.87994778280774,4.8,4.75,4.88,4.73,30295,simplement si tornem a Berlin no dubtarem en tornar a aquest apartament per tot plegat. Gràcies Michel i Ricard per el tracte rebut,0,-0.296,Negative
