40.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,68,100.0,0,1.857434346296564,4.33,4.11,5.0,4.33,23299893,"The place is amazing. Location is really great, everything is near (apotheke, supermarket, Alexanderplatz, Alexa mall,  you can walk to several turistic site der Fernsehturm, der Berliner Mauer). You only need to walk 3 minutes to get the train. The apartment was clean and had everything that I needed. The bed (which individual covers) was comfortable. To summary: Die Wohnung war fantastisch.",1,0.7501,Positive
279.0,7,3.0,1.0,5.0,49,100.0,1,0.6340725500661578,4.87,4.79,4.86,4.73,925210172009267061,Super appartement avec tout le confort nécessaire pour passer un bon séjour. <br/>Une grande flexibilité de la part de notre hôte qui nous a permis d’arriver plus tôt en matinée. <br/>Il n’y a pas vraiment de point négatif à recommander !,0,0.5707,Positive
125.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,1,2.540873406232533,4.67,4.75,4.83,4.55,243063,"Perfekt beliggenhet og romslig leilighet med tre store rom. Vedlikeholdet kunne vært bedre, gulvene og dørene knirket veldig høyt, noe som gjorde det vanskelig å bevege seg stille når andre ville sove. Det er toalettpapir her, men for eksempel ingen dusjsåpe eller kaffe. Vi fikk beskjed da vi kom at døren i dusjen var ødelagt, men det var ikke et stort problem. Anna er hyggelig, men litt vanskelig å få kontakt med da vi lurte på enkelte ting før utsjekk. Legg merke til at du må betale ekstra for håndklær og sengetøy.",1,-0.4019,Negative
131.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,0,2.319079304594608,4.91,4.85,4.89,4.85,44363134,Vielen Dank das wir in Ihrer Wohnung zu Gast sein durften. Es hat uns sehr gut gefallen. Das ganze drumherum hat sehr gut geklappt. Wir würden bei Gelegenheit gerne wieder kommen.<br/>Liebe Grüße aus Kiel ⛵,1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,73,100.0,0,2.2427054875748604,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,21009437,"I cannot say enough good things about my experience at Till's place. Staying for three weeks was not enough, and I would have extended for another few weeks if I could. The apartment is absolutely gorgeous. The natural light was a dream. The bed and sheets are super comfortable. Tons and tons of space. The balconies (particularly the front-facing one) were a great place to have a glass of wine or a quick lunch or even work from home. The apartment is in the perfect neighborhood with tons of good restaurants, coffee shops, and natural wine bars. Everything you could need within a few minutes' walk. Till was also very responsive and friendly. Highly recommend Till's place if you're in Berlin!",1,0.9853,Positive
