172.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,24,100.0,1,3.363106751874121,4.94,4.83,4.91,4.8,50973537,Franz is an excellent house and we adore his place. If you fancy these parts of Berlin you can’t find a better one. It’s also a very cool place as a former bar. I really recommend this.,1,0.9391,Positive
157.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,89.0,0,4.068771463428812,4.67,4.7,4.76,4.62,1264387511715820970,"Hotel room was really nice visually and had a great night sleep. <br/>Had issues with the room as shower wouldn't drain so were not able to properly shower the entire trip as was never repaired adequately over the 4 day trip. As is fully digital with no staff on site any issues had to go through an AI chat bot which is unhelpful for anything past an FAQ. Transfer to real human team members took ages so solving issues was a lengthy and time consuming process. Had to have daily conversations about the shower to no solution and was very frustrating. Was offered a small 10% refund on cost of the stay but no confirmation or communication on this yet. <br/>If you have no issues that require a staff member, this is a great stay. Solving problems is a very difficult process which takes 3x the time to solve without anyone on site. Major issues like the one we had, massively affect the trip due to this.",1,0.5129,Positive
49.0,1,1.0,1.0,2.0,45,100.0,1,11.88938036942631,4.94,4.9,4.91,4.93,13215295,ein wunderschönes haus in toller umgebung.<br/>eine sehr freundliche gastgeberin.<br/>kann man nur empfehlen.,1,0.0,Neutral
320.0,10,5.0,2.0,7.0,33,100.0,1,6.97282351203588,4.92,4.93,4.43,4.77,16183489,"Babett’s was a lovely spacious place to stay. It was great for our family holiday. It was very spacious and gave us all the space and privacy we needed. The living room was great for us all to relax in the evening. We had 2 bathrooms, 1 on each floor. We were greeted by the lovely Maria when we arrived. She was super helpful. I would happily recommend it as a place to stay.",0,0.9885,Positive
237.0,11,3.0,1.0,4.0,57,100.0,1,9.660413858650209,4.93,4.97,4.46,4.83,16252509,"정말 너무 좋았습니다. 시설도 물론이지만 호스트인 benjamin과 simon이 너무 친절하고 반갑게 맞아주었고 부족한 물품을 요구하거나 문제가 생기면 한걸음에 달려와 해결해주었습니다. 아파트에서 지내는 마지막까지 좋은 기억 뿐이었습니다. 호스트의 태도에서 가장 많은 감동을 받았고, 대중교통이 가깝다는 장점이 있었으며 버스 한정거장 거리에 큰 마트가 있다는 것도 도움이 많이 되었습니다. 진짜 추천합니다!!<br/>It was really good. I was impressed by the facility as well as the host. <br/>When we require some items or have some troubles, the hosts immediately solved.<br/>It was a good memory until the end! The hosts were perfect, traffic was convenient, mart was close.<br/>I really recommend this apartment.",0,0.9453,Positive
76.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,100.0,1,5.169307301776869,4.86,4.89,4.79,4.76,16119275,"Super-schöne und saubere Unterkunft. Fußläufig viele Geschäfte, Restaurants und die Markthalle erreichbar. Parkplatz allerdings nur gegen Gebühr. Berlin ist aber eine Reise wert!",1,-0.636,Negative
46.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,0,8.776776387375822,4.7,4.7,4.7,4.61,5717063,"Small, but nice flat with perfect location.",1,0.8674,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,6.432065367275135,4.89,4.89,4.86,4.85,6599218,"Sehr zu empfehlen! Die Wohnung ist super schön mit einer großen, sonnigen Dachterrasse und einer sehr gut ausgestatteten Küche.<br/>Wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt und würden die Unterkunft wieder buchen.",1,-0.636,Negative
220.0,8,3.0,1.5,4.0,47,100.0,1,5.502700704345139,4.83,4.9,4.81,4.66,53802915,"Patrick’s apartment is fantastic really. We stayed with 5 friends and actually were the first guests in the new apartment. To start with, it’s beautifully decorated, modern, clean, cosy and fully equipped. It’s in a lively neighborhood with bars and restaurants around the corner, while at night it was very quite and we slept wonderful in the nice, big beds. The check-in was easy as was the fast communication via the AirBnb chat. They were always available to answer any of our questions. In short, we felt very lucky staying in this apartment and already decided to come back another time in summer. :)",0,0.9841,Positive
59.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,1,0.858088154562163,4.84,4.73,4.96,4.77,52696285,Super netter Kollege immer wieder gerne hatten einen schönen Aufenthalt in Mitte Berlin,1,0.5994,Positive
68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,3.194253694245239,4.93,4.95,4.89,4.86,81081,"Sehr schöne Unterkunft und nette Host, die wirklich bemüht sind, dass es einem gut geht und an nichts fehlt.",1,-0.5994,Negative
95.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,1,3.907468030579391,4.72,4.83,4.9,4.6,20943832,"Nice, stylish and clean appartment in  great location! We can enjoyed it and can really recommend it.",1,0.9431,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.5,1.0,22,90.0,1,2.376576622396677,4.94,4.83,4.93,4.74,4515108,Really nice place close to the centrum. Enjoyed relaxing on the balcony. Highly recommend Lilia’s place if you are staying a bit longer in Berlin. She’s a wonderful host!,1,0.9467,Positive
160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,98.0,0,1.0407544919436775,4.54,4.66,4.77,4.45,34294913,"A very cool interior design, and very welcoming staff.",1,0.699,Positive
85.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,22,100.0,0,8.547903865133643,4.48,4.38,4.57,4.47,7916154,"Die Wohnung sah aus wie auf den Fotos und war wie beschrieben. Wir waren mit 5 Personen zu Gast und haben gut Platz gehabt. Die Wohnung ist recht einfach eingerichtet und wirkt etwas abgewohnt. Das Geschirr und insbesondere das Service sind zusammengewürfelt und nicht schön. Wir hatten auch Pech, dass die Spülmaschine nicht mehr funktionierte. Besonders nachteilig war die Lage von zwei der drei Schlafzimmer zur Strasse und zur Sonnenseite. Entweder war es laut oder warm. Für 70,- Euro Endreinigung sollte sie aufgeräumter und sauberer sein. Die Fenster sind wohl schon seit Jahren nicht mehr geputzt. <br/>Die Lage war mit Nähe zu einer U-Bahnstation und der Bushaltestelle ziemlich gut. Restaurants sind einige in der Nähe. Empfehlung: Landhaus und Viet Rice.<br/>Die beiden Gastgeber sind sehr nette Personen und sehr hilfsbereit und unterstützend.",1,-0.9884,Negative
52.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,6.089108840586048,4.9,4.57,4.85,4.83,897873050963171703,"Daniele was very enthusiastic, since there was no elevator, he helped me carry the boxes to the fourth floor, told me about some special attractions, prepared a lot of food, I can enjoy it; The accommodation is also convenient",1,0.8977,Positive
98.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,1,7.0857343616592825,4.85,4.87,4.55,4.7,32214669,"Great Airbnb unit…really beautiful, clean, new apartment in a cool building with a nice courtyard. Very accommodating hosts, too",1,0.9413,Positive
149.0,5,3.0,2.0,3.0,28,100.0,1,3.3058123759604063,4.61,4.65,4.78,4.39,863593505561736460,"Très chouette loft, fidèle à la description et aux photos, dans un quartier très sympathique. <br/>Frais aux moments des grands pics de chaleur. <br/>Et Arthur est très sympathique. <br/>Je recommande.",0,0.0,Neutral
125.0,1,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,0,11.865578553466111,5.0,4.67,5.0,4.67,1032468946427023419,Schöne geräumige Wohnung an einer super Lage. Die Wilmersdorfer Straße ist zwei Gehminuten entfernt. Carina ist sehr nett und hilfsbereit. Danke!,1,0.0,Neutral
135.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,3.104550941585256,4.8,4.84,4.94,4.69,39956169,"Eine mit ÖV gut erreichbare Unterkunft, sehr ruhige, angenehme Lage. Die Wohnung ist gut eingerichtet, alles Nötige ist vorhanden. Da die Wohnung im Parterre liegt, braucht es für Küche und Essbereich künstliches Licht. <br/>Man fühlt sich sofort wohl in der Wohnung und schätzt die Sauberkeit und Ordnung im Logis.<br/>Eine Unterkunft, in die man gerne wieder zurückkommt.",1,-0.9485,Negative
102.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,0,2.7824750390490918,4.95,4.97,4.94,4.86,10033310,"Highly recommend for your stay to Berlin. Jessy's place is centrally located (Walkable to Museum Island, Cathedral, Alexanderplatz, and many many restaurants). Jessy was always quick to respond and added several touches to make it a very comfortable stay (Espresso, maps, recommendations galore). Thanks, Jessy- we loved our stay exploring Berlin!",1,0.9257,Positive
172.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,8,93.0,0,2.528112421649852,4.28,4.19,4.82,4.33,36339392,"Había reservado una habitación con 4 camas . Como llegamos antes de la hora de check in nos facilitaron otra más rápido pero muy pequeña. La distancia entre camas era de una persona parada no cabían dos .<br/>Pero lo bueno es la atención, la limpieza, y el lugar todo salió perfecto de igual manera. Y volvería a ir sin dudas.",1,-0.5423,Negative
114.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,67,100.0,1,32.29350043093033,4.85,4.69,4.87,4.74,36360929,"Sehr zu empfehlen! Top Lage (ruhig und stadtnah zugleich), schönes Objekt und sympathischer Kontakt. Die Kinder haben sich super wohl gefühlt!",0,0.6792,Positive
279.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,32,80.0,1,4.723172315107649,5.0,5.0,4.94,4.82,1129776017486307465,"Appartement de rêve très bien situé.<br/>Les prestations sont très belles (quelle salle de bain, quelle cuisine !!) et ces 2 terrasses !<br/>La communication avec l’hôte est parfaite et Karin a été très arrangeante. Merci, c’était un week-end plus que parfait !",1,0.0,Neutral
328.0,8,4.0,2.0,6.0,31,100.0,1,6.97282351203588,4.89,4.92,4.52,4.71,14333714,"An excellent airbnb for a large group. An extremely large place, all modern equipment. We spent most of our time on the roof terrace. The location is just outside the city centre so we used the freenow taxi service a good bit. But depending on your fitness levels walking would also have been possible.",0,0.714,Positive
152.0,5,2.0,1.0,5.0,40,100.0,1,1.5968425433019005,4.81,4.77,4.93,4.69,22677,"Very nice guest, very convenient, great location, good tips for restaurants and bars !",0,0.8925,Positive
46.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,9,100.0,0,4.2226527858717295,4.9,4.8,4.86,4.85,846755641670590656,Sebastian is an excellent host. He was very communicative and accommodating around check in and leaving times. The bed was very comfortable and I slept well.,1,0.8553,Positive
207.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,58,100.0,1,2.222288195756644,4.89,4.97,4.93,4.73,11031031,"Dejligt, lille hus i et skønt område. En anderledes men god måde at bo i Berlin.",1,0.2732,Positive
89.0,3,0.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,0,1.0054327061020718,4.76,4.65,4.92,4.68,25106503,Really great studio apartment. From the central train station take the M8 tram and get off one block from the apartment.  Easy!,1,0.8324,Positive
59.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,5.193937069353019,4.81,4.74,4.92,4.64,28068656,"Clean, quiet room not far from Potsdamer Platz. Next to a historic church, the philharmonic, and the soon-to-be renovated neue nationalgalerie Even though the common areas and bathrooms are shared, I never felt as if I couldn't have my privacy. Rosina and her family were kind and considerate. I would 100% recommend her place to anyone visiting Berlin!",1,0.9215,Positive
88.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,0,12.43529195299008,4.63,4.71,4.56,4.58,31172381,"The big issues with this one were no internet nor no hot water the day we arrived. A city of 3.7 million people and no internet, would of been nice to have. The second thing was no hot water. After figuring out the plumbing was backwards, it was too late we had to leave. Also was weird you had to lock the apartment with the key after opening the door.",1,-0.7096,Negative
55.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,49,100.0,1,22.12570946122336,4.92,4.96,4.47,4.89,551948848079907495,Super friendly host!,1,0.8122,Positive
89.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,1,4.64019565298711,4.88,4.74,4.85,4.78,21759319,Es war sehr schön dort und für einen Berlin Trip genau der richtige Aufenthalt. Die Gastgeber waren sehr freundlich und hilfsbereit.,1,-0.8316,Negative
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,0,6.14980571766311,4.82,4.79,4.91,4.77,1775500,"This place is amazing!!! The apartment is well fanitured, cozy and big, we had everything we need in it and more! The location was great, right next to a big train station so the transportation is so easy. There are cool bars, restaurants and club all around it so it suits more for young guests. GET THIS APARTMENT. You won't be disappointed ;)",1,0.959,Positive
85.0,6,2.0,1.0,5.0,23,100.0,0,9.797881642408234,4.61,4.56,4.65,4.52,7963887,"Die Wohnung ist sehr praktisch gelegen, direkt an der U-Bahn-Station und dadurch  gut angebunden (auch nachts durch den Nachtbus). Allerdings liegt die Wohnung an einer großen Straße, das hört man, auch wenn die Fenster geschlossen sind. Ansonsten ist sie aber sehr schön, wir waren zu 5., das hat sehr gut gepasst.",1,-0.9136,Negative
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,0,1.6904702353187655,4.83,4.72,4.97,4.79,2024548,"Uwe's apartment is a spacious, comfortable and peaceful place to return to after a day in the city (if you can make it past all the lovely cafes and restaurants on Kastanienalee!). There was plenty of room for two of us sleeping separately, one on the sofa bed in the main room and one in the bedroom. If you are very tall like me you may want to take the bed! Everything in the apartment works well, the shower is lovely and hot and there's a good coffee machine for the morning along with the kitchen basics. It also feels very secure and the area is safe to come back to late at night. I can't fault Uwe's impeccable hosting! He gave us excellent directions and messaged us during our stay with extra tips, replying really quickly when I had any questions. It made the logistics of our holiday so easy and this was a real bonus. The apartment really is in an amazing location, with easy links into the centre on the U-Bahn and also delicious, reasonably priced food and drink on the doorstep.  As a vegetarian it was easy to eat out, and there were loads of vegan options too. We can recommend Kyo Grill across the road, falafels from Babel (also on Kastanienalee) and drinks at 'An Einem Sonntag im August'. There were also lovely weekend markets within walking distance in Mauerpark, Arkonaplatz and Kollwitzplatz that Uwe kindly recommended. Definitely check them out if the weather is good!",1,0.9973,Positive
164.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,23,100.0,0,3.29071102468726,4.87,4.6,4.77,4.74,9632005,"Very cosy flat in a nice quarter, we will come back at Farid's for sure!",1,0.6588,Positive
145.0,6,2.0,2.5,4.0,43,100.0,1,1.8267932703234075,4.89,4.74,4.92,4.82,48864380,el alojamiento ha respondido a nuestras expectativas. es muy amplio y tiene de todo. está muy bien comunicado,0,0.34,Positive
238.0,3,2.0,1.0,3.0,27,100.0,1,3.928817520387241,4.92,4.85,4.89,4.68,17200670,"L'appartement est spacieux, avec de grands volumes et un beau plancher ; on s'y sent très bien. Il y a en plus un joli jardin pour tout l'immeuble. La situation dans Berlin est très centrale par rapport à la zone plus monumentale,  et le quartier est desservi par de nombreux transports en commun.  On peut aussi faire des courses facilement pour le quotidien. Enfin,  le propriétaire est très attentif au bon déroulement du séjour. ",1,-0.128,Negative
93.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,28,100.0,0,7.258758486122637,4.68,4.71,4.21,4.47,1196392469976086264,"Casa limpia, cómoda, bien decorada, bien situada y húesped fácil de contactar",1,0.0,Neutral
