62.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,15.65506730661029,4.95,4.97,4.93,4.88,23096426,War alles super!,1,0.0,Neutral
63.0,1,0.0,1.5,1.0,47,100.0,1,22.29200110852519,4.83,4.94,4.83,4.72,34069313,Perfect! A serene place with a great host and adorable dog. Definitey recommend this place!,1,0.9523,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,0,6.150616171255118,4.93,4.99,4.65,4.88,162111,"The apartment was absolutely beautiful and exactly how described. It was an amazing area and so so so cute. Verena was patient, flexible, kind, and relaxed. Truly an amazing place! ",1,0.9818,Positive
33.0,6,1.0,2.0,6.0,36,94.0,1,3.3601837928593032,4.87,4.93,4.87,4.88,677433898395003666,"The staff and owner of MH were super friendly! They gave excellent travel instructions from the airport to the neighborhood, I had no problem checking in later in the evening and I felt right at home upon arrival. The surrounding neighborhood is full of great bars and restaurants and several supermarkets. Other guests were respectful of private space, quiet hours and generally friendly. There is a locked drawer for your valuable items. The showers are super clean and comfortable (sometimes hard to find). For the price, pleasant atmosphere and the service this is the best deal I’ve found in a hostel to date. Thank you for hosting me!",0,0.9908,Positive
58.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,46.0,0,6.724481428442534,4.0,4.13,4.25,3.75,1304359316509800249,"I had a long stay at this apartment and highly recommend it. Firat and Annija were kind and helpful from the start—Annija even helped me with my bags. They gave great local advice and were always supportive without being intrusive. I stayed with two cats, and they were very relaxed and accommodating about having pets. The apartment was clean, cozy, and well-equipped for day-to-day living, with a dishwasher, washing machine, and drying rack. The room had a bright balcony, and the furnishings and bedding were refreshed during my stay. The shower was powerful, adjustable, and stayed hot. I felt comfortable cooking, working, and living in the space throughout my time there. Firat and Annija speak English well and made settling in very easy. I truly appreciated how welcoming and supportive they were.",1,0.9926,Positive
151.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,94.0,0,3.1018817858877528,4.67,4.77,4.78,4.52,721527807549293451,Rapport qualité prix excellent mais un peu en dehors du centre Mitte Berlin.,1,0.5719,Positive
105.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,44,100.0,1,19.08203722075192,4.82,4.85,4.72,4.71,1107068843238730146,"Arwin was a great host with a lovely apartment, it was exactly like the photos and was very clean. Arwin was attentive and friendly with any questions we had. The apartment is in a great location, lots of lovely shops and walking distance of the train station. Very good value for money.",1,0.984,Positive
89.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,7.289170629982721,4.87,4.77,4.77,4.8,533523,"Zentral gelegen, wunderbar um die Ecke vom Bahnhof Südkreuz. Ein Gebäude mit Geschichte und einer unfassbar geilen Wohnung. Super Ausstattung, super Gastgeber, super Aufenthalt! Jederzeit wieder, unfassbarer Wohlfühlfaktor.",1,0.8439,Positive
59.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,26,100.0,1,16.94592507079506,4.83,4.74,4.83,4.8,4043341,"Wunderbare Unterkunft, ideal für Konzertbesuche und Urlaub. Ich war eine Woche hier, habe mir ein Rad beim Select Hotel Spiegelturm/S-Bahn Stresow geliehen und herrliche Ausflüge an die Havel/Wannsee und Potsdam/Werder Havel gemacht und man kann von der Haustür in 5 min in den Wald spazieren.<br/>Andrea ist super! Hatte sehr viel Freude und gute Erholung dort.",1,-0.2003,Negative
188.0,5,1.0,1.5,4.0,24,100.0,1,3.564773251975843,4.92,4.87,4.91,4.76,27164026,"We absolutely loved staying at Franz’ place. It is a block from the bus stop and about a 10 minutes walk (through a beautiful neighborhood) to the train station. The kitchen had everything we needed to cook and there was a conveniently located Aldi 5 minutes away. The neighborhood was quiet and we enjoyed visiting local food and craft markets. Towels, extra bedding, a hair dryer, and our favorite, the towel warmer, made this experience extra special. Franz was very quick to respond to messages and answer any questions we had. I would absolutely stay here again and recommend it highly.",1,0.9493,Positive
116.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,50,100.0,1,3.566348295049236,4.86,4.89,4.78,4.71,29403218,"Imke is a Great host! Really open minded and always there when we needed her, she lives next door but you don’t notice that she is there.<br/>Thank you very much for everything Imke!",1,0.4826,Positive
276.0,3,2.0,2.0,3.0,61,100.0,1,9.076307917104932,4.82,4.77,4.76,4.71,44223601,"Alt i alt veldig fornøyd. Overnattet 4 netter og kunne lett bodd der lenger. Ansatte var svært vennlige og hjelpsomme. Rommet bar preg av å være litt slitt i forhold til bildene, men størrelsen var slik som forventet og det var mye lagringsplass. Følte oss veldig hjemme og kan absolutt anbefales! Kommer gjerne tilbake igjen.",0,0.0,Neutral
125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,21,100.0,0,4.742369097413815,4.89,4.67,5.0,4.78,45075816,"My partner and I stayed at Felix's cozy, beautifully/quirkily decorated home for 4 nights in Oct/Nov. The location is fantastic - Tempelhof Field, our favourite public space in Berlin for recreational biking, is quite close by. Felix himself is super sweet and very helpful.",1,0.9273,Positive
207.0,8,3.0,2.0,5.0,40,100.0,1,3.3610068667738973,4.85,4.8,4.85,4.71,31037448,"Perfect location and super well kept appartment. Description completely matched, we had a great time in Berlin. Thanks!",0,0.9516,Positive
125.0,7,3.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,0,20.926923613539163,4.95,5.0,4.94,5.0,5097341,"Meine Familie und ich wurden herzlich empfangen. Es war alles vor Ort was man benötigt und wir haben uns schnell sehr wohl gefühlt. Ein freundliches, helles und gepflegtes Zuhause in guter Lage von Berlin. Zwar benötigt man etwa 30 min bis in die Innenstadt dafür hat man es ruhig und Supermarkt und Busse sind flott zu Fuß erreichbar. Bei fragen bekamen wir immer schnell eine Antwort per Email oder WhatsApp. <br/>Wir hatten 4 tolle und erholsame Tage! Vielen dank Terrie! ",0,-0.855,Negative
90.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,0,12.4068471777683,4.5,4.62,4.48,4.48,31170463,Klein aber alles vorhanden. Gute und nette Kommunikation. Für einen kurzen Aufenthalt in Ordnung.,1,0.0,Neutral
369.0,4,2.0,2.0,2.0,27,100.0,1,1.9942284646671569,5.0,4.66,4.91,4.81,878725849430335668,"Had a lovely time at this mid century artsy apartment. Valentin was very responsive to anything we needed. Very comfortable bed linens and a fully stocked kitchen if you choose to cook. Building is in a great location close to shops, restaurant public transportation.  I would highly recommend staying there!",0,0.9543,Positive
104.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,3.614936598767828,4.76,4.78,4.87,4.71,640160204406168059,"Ancas place was perfect! <br/>It was really easy to get in with the key box, and when we did get in the house was very clean and stocked with basic aminenities. <br/>Whenever I had a question Anca got back to me really quickly - I would definitely recommend this place, and also come back and stay here!",1,0.9426,Positive
60.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,45,100.0,1,3.689600261518912,4.74,4.55,4.76,4.65,16237052,Perfect place with a great location! Loved our stay here with the easy walks to local restaurants and transportation. Would stay here again!,1,0.9449,Positive
