422.0,6,3.0,2.0,3.0,34,100.0,1,2.9051794007943927,4.98,4.97,4.92,4.87,24019375,"Everything was perfect!! From the amazing penthouse that looks much more beautiful in reality than in the pictures. And to Magnus who is the best host I have ever experienced! He knew how to help us even before our vacation even started, he made sure to ask how we were and send us recommendations every day. Anyone who comes to stay in this wonderful apartment of Magnus will have both a quality experience and a service experience. It is highly recommended! Hope to be back soon.",0,0.9858,Positive
85.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,22,100.0,0,8.547903865133643,4.48,4.38,4.57,4.47,7916154,Great host and apartment with great food nearby.<br/>Easy to reach the nearest subway station by foot in about 5 minutes. <br/>Less than 10 minutes by foot from Rüyam Gemüse one of the best kebab in Berlin.,1,0.926,Positive
