55.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,13,100.0,1,7.168357397765313,4.76,4.83,4.5,4.71,42301754,Mina was very communicative and the place was wonderful. The U-bahn station was a short walk away and there were many places to eat in the area. The street can be a little noisy at night but it was nothing I was not used to. I will absolutely pick Mina’s place as my go to for future trips. Vielen dank!,1,0.3482,Positive
64.0,5,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,0,5.711890563946457,4.67,4.53,4.8,4.8,3701258,"Excellent flat, easy to get to, clean, well maintained with very friendly hosts. There was virtually no disruptions and when we needed to, we were able to relax. Bathroom and kitchen  were fully functional and clean as well.",1,0.9516,Positive
89.0,4,0.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,1,9.213446128957443,4.68,4.53,4.51,4.68,242978,"Thomas' place is well located with regard to Tegel airport. Getting to and from there is easy. Connections toward any other direction is smooth and there's a lot of possible means of transportation available. There are also a couple of really nice cafes down on the street, and a few nice food places just around the corner, so the location is really good. <br/>The flat itself is spacious and comfortable. The kitchen is really well equipped, especially for Berlin. Can't remember having a dishwasher before! Also the bathroom is nice, compared to many other places around Berlin. <br/>Overall we were really happy with our stay, and I will probably first look for this place, when coming back the next time. ",1,0.978,Positive
96.0,5,1.0,1.0,4.0,28,100.0,0,2.0462165834774058,4.71,4.73,4.81,4.64,16296818,Lejligheden er meget velegnet til et weekendophold med børn. Der er gode parkeringsforhold og offentlig transport til alle steder i Berlin fungerer upåklageligt.<br/>Vi fik lejligheden flere timer tidligere end aftalen og Duc Son var meget venlig ved indcheckning.,1,0.0,Neutral
