136.0,6,2.0,1.0,5.0,41,96.0,0,6.1770612336798365,4.61,4.58,4.75,4.48,27018647,"The apartment is in a great location, very close to a main train station and supermarket. My parents stayed there and they were very comfortable (it was also very good that it had an elevator). The communications with the management were very easy and fast.",0,0.9335,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,16,100.0,0,1.1856260162878398,4.85,4.8,4.95,4.73,1977666,"Giorgio’s place worked well for me. It’s in a convenient location and he was a good host, responsive and welcoming. The place itself is small, but clean. The building isn’t lovely, a bit run down, but the location is good and there are plenty of stores and restaurants in the area, plus good public transportation.",1,0.9707,Positive
