243.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,50,100.0,1,12.581113618062616,4.83,4.88,4.66,4.65,11627489,"If you are looking for a place to stay in Berlin, look no further!  Soren's two bedroom flat is fantastic.  The decor is beautiful; the location is convenient to shopping, restaurants, and transportation.  <br/>Soren is a wonderful host.  Upon our arrival, he gave us a map and shared directions giving great suggestions for getting our basic needs met.   The kitchen was supplied with basic condiments: coffee, tea, spices, and even champagne.    Everything you need or want will be here in your home away from home.<br/>Thanks again, Soren!<br/>Heidi",0,0.9682,Positive
77.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,12,100.0,0,5.823294013597665,4.37,4.15,4.4,4.31,2165255,Stephan was a very easygoing host. The apartment was bigger than the pictures and clean. There are 3 big supermarkets at just a few minutes walking. Metrostation is 5-10 minutes walking and is located next to a very big park. We had everything we needed!,1,0.6793,Positive
63.0,3,1.0,1.0,4.0,56,100.0,1,13.973121976945189,4.91,4.96,4.6,4.95,1160190802958821255,"I am writing this with so much joy and gratitude in my heart for the love shown to myself and my husband during our stay at Felix’s home. Felix and Lisa are angels in human form. They made us feel at home, were super responsive, highly helpful and accommodating, very considerate family. The place is all it says in the listing. They even offered us free foods , allowed us check in and out at later times and were always ready to help. God bless their beautiful family. I will definitely go back there anytime I am in Berlin again. I highly recommend!!!",1,0.9932,Positive
