76.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,99.0,0,2.1897939786653327,4.2,4.3,4.67,4.18,38971259,A place to stay for a day and not more<br/>- Very Squeaky bed<br/>- We could hear everyone in the corridor and cars from the road<br/>- The fridge is right beside the bed so you could hear it in your sleep<br/>- The lights were very dim only good for sleeping nothing else,1,0.4877,Positive
