78.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,1,9.864623457715105,4.89,4.89,4.62,4.8,1006526890769949261,"Ilona was very welcoming, responding fast to messages. Her place was great to stay in as it was clean, perfect for a small group and nearby to many public transport facilities and the supermarket.",1,0.9286,Positive
122.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,3.146245412821909,4.77,4.68,4.85,4.52,44098912,"Kevin's 'loft-style' apartment was as advertised.  It is located 5 minutes from the UBahn, so very convenient Check-in seemed complicated but the very clear instructions made it a breeze. The kitchen was very well equipped and there was lots of clothes storage space, with plenty of hangers (not always the case!). It was very hot in Berlin during our stay, and we appreciated the large windows that could be opened to create a cooling cross-draft. Communications with the landlord team was both proactive and very responsive, and clear.",1,0.9789,Positive
70.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,12.86304269897694,4.93,4.97,4.89,4.88,18014187,Good location and very convenient apartment.,1,0.4404,Positive
64.0,2,2.0,1.0,1.0,12,100.0,0,1.5561123215241064,4.79,4.71,4.96,4.71,18185955,"Das Zimmer ist groß, schön eingerichtet und gut ausgestattet, die Wohnung von der Lage her perfekt, gut mit ÖPNV zu erreichen und inmitten vieler netter Cafés, Restaurants und Läden. Wir kamen spätabends an, aber Luisa und ihr Freund waren sehr entgegenkommend. Wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt und empfehlen das Zimmer uneingeschränkt weiter!",1,-0.636,Negative
89.0,4,0.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,1,9.213446128957443,4.68,4.53,4.51,4.68,242978,"Wir hatten sehr schöne Tage in Berlin! Dank der Wegbeschreibung von Thomas haben wir die Wohnung sofort gefunden. Die Wohnung war sauber und mit der Beschreibung übereinstimmend. Thomas hat uns sehr nett empfangen und neben der Infomappe, die in der Wohnung bereit lag, noch weitere hilfreiche Tipps gegeben! Die Anbindung zu allen ""wichtigen"" Orten Berlins ist dank den vielen Bushaltestellen in naher Umgebung wirklich super.<br/>Ich kann die Ferienwohnung nur weiterempfehlen! Gerne wieder!",1,-0.9752,Negative
64.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,59,100.0,1,2.578564642470654,4.97,4.99,4.93,4.96,7849188,Eine elegante und exzellente Unterkunft. Ein absolut hilfsbereiter und wunderbarer Gastgeber.,1,0.0,Neutral
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,0,3.965838782124013,5.0,5.0,4.89,4.89,24916216,"i loved staying in this little room, and sabine was really generous when i needed last minute accommodations during my stay",1,0.8173,Positive
217.0,12,3.0,1.0,7.0,28,99.0,0,5.532921273123223,4.28,4.0,4.7,4.29,928114741395000896,"Einfach, aber modern eingerichtet, alles da was man braucht. Super Lage: ein paar Schritte zur U-Bahn und ein paar Minuten zu Fuß zum Boxhagener Platz/ Simon-Dach-Str. <br/>Die Wohnung liegt im Erdgeschoss direkt am Gehweg, wo bis nachts Menschen unterwegs sind. Bei offenem Fenster hört man jedes Gespräch der Passanten mit.",0,0.5994,Positive
343.0,6,3.0,2.0,3.0,45,98.0,1,0.6498545219514095,4.84,4.82,4.89,4.71,44096314,"Eine wunderbare, hoch moderne und ruhige Wohnung mit allem was das Herz begehrt, um sich während seines Aufenthaltes in Berlin wohl(er) zu fühlen. Super eingerichtet, sauber und multifunktional...wunderschöner Balkon mit Blick auf den Fernsehturm. 2 Parkplätze in hauseigener TG als tolles Extra. Wir kommen wenn möglich jeder Zeit wieder, auch weil die Abwicklung so super freundlich und ohne Probleme verlief.",0,0.6361,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,1,17.493380322859164,4.95,4.67,4.79,4.86,50251689,"Die Wohnung ist viel größer als auf den Bildern. Es ist modern, geräumig, tonnenweise natürliches Licht, Fenster an den Decken & vom Biden zur Decke. <br/>Christiane ist sehr offen und kommunikativ, kulant und kooperativ. Sie hilft immer aus und ist äusserst freundlich.<br/>Die Dusche war toll, die Küche, das Wohnzimmer, das Schlafzimmer ebenfalls also nichts auszuschliessen. <br/>Es war mir ein Vergnügen und ich würde jedesmal wieder vorbeikommen.<br/>Ein schönes ruhiges Plätzchen, die u-Bahnstation ist 500m zu fuss entfernt, wenn man weg will.",1,-0.9661,Negative
137.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,1,3.131262585603502,4.64,4.67,4.85,4.59,68448,"This place is really amazing! Hot , clean , in center, near train station and really quiet! I am glad for my choice... and if I ever visit Berlin again I would love to stay in that house again!",1,0.9468,Positive
53.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,1,1.9136892540066155,4.82,4.73,4.95,4.74,851577798843640421,"Beautiful, clean, and cozy room. Looks just as it is shown in the photos. Place is easily accessible by various modes of public transport. There are lots of things to see and do: the English-language bookstore is downstairs, and Mauerpark is just a short walk away.",1,0.8402,Positive
75.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,1,3.546156767220352,4.81,4.61,4.82,4.71,20240320,"Tamara is an amazing host, very friendly and responsive. I had the whole place for myself during the weekend and enjoyed staying there. The place is nice and clean, located in the heart of Kreuzberg. Tamara provided me with coffee and tea and gave useful tips about the area. I can definitely recommend her as a wonderful host!",1,0.9833,Positive
60.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,51,100.0,1,8.76289456061162,4.98,4.98,4.82,4.95,6936087,Truly a 5 star experience! Petra is so kind & helpful and the room is beautiful and very big. She gave great recommendations on sight-seeing & places to eat and produced wonderful  varied breakfasts every morning. Everything was so classy that you'd assume Petra is an interior designer! It felt like staying in a an expensive hotel but at an affordable price and with all the personal touches of staying with family/friends. Thanks Petra! ,1,0.9631,Positive
75.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,1,3.7465670354738254,4.89,4.91,4.74,4.8,4581049,"Wir waren sehr zufrieden mit der Unterkunft. Die Verbindungen (S-Bahn, Tram) sind nahe der Unterkunft. Die Umgebung ist sehr schön. <br/>Gerne wieder.",1,-0.8316,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,0,2.7158957748781662,4.95,4.98,4.88,4.88,33647437,We had nice and Beautiful stay with Maike and Simon. Very exciting neighbourhood and lovely apartment!,1,0.9358,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,12,100.0,0,8.091347645757432,4.7,4.45,4.75,4.7,32156244,"O Henri é um ótimo anfitrião, sempre estava disposto a me ajudar com tudo.<br/>O quarto é lindo e o apartamento super bem localizado. Super recomendo.",1,0.8316,Positive
32.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,3.2159665482867226,4.77,4.71,4.88,4.65,17904,"Chambre très bien située, propre et bien équipée ",1,0.0,Neutral
160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,87.0,0,3.4802565088356308,4.54,4.54,4.6,4.41,43798011,"Die Wände im Apartment waren deutlich stärker verschmutzt, als das zu diesem Preis vertretbar erscheint. Ebenso die Flure. Die Wohnung ist nicht klimatisiert und wird selbst bei niedriger Außentemperatur sehr warm.",1,-0.8957,Negative
160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,87.0,0,3.4802565088356308,4.54,4.54,4.6,4.41,43798011,"Dobry kontakt z najemca, apartament ładny i duży jedyny mankament, to chłodno w pokoju brak ogrzewania w łazience. Byliśmy z małym dzieckiem i to stanowiło problem. Ogólne wrażenie bardzo pozytywne.",1,-0.4019,Negative
202.0,5,2.0,2.0,1.0,45,100.0,0,1.8845881262763091,4.92,5.0,4.95,4.82,582473762475300993,Anna and Constantine are great hosts! Their home is just lovely.<br/>This stay was a 10 out of 10 in all aspects.,0,0.6588,Positive
149.0,4,3.0,1.0,5.0,31,0.0,0,8.155448061817273,4.6,4.73,4.71,4.59,14618013,"Very clean and as described, with a great bathroom.  The tube station is literally outside, but there's no noise, so it's convenient for public transport.  That said, it's a long walk (45 minutes to an hour) into the tourist centre if, like us, you prefer to walk.  Ali who runs the little shop next door (and handles check-in) is really friendly.  However, Max's communication, although accurate, is purely a business-like check-in rather than anything more personal.  So if you like that ""get local advice"" side of Airbnb then this isn't for you.",0,0.9183,Positive
40.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,0,3.5930506255270385,4.74,4.53,4.89,4.79,21417127,非常舒适的房间，非常愉快的居住体验。房东很开朗，很热心。房间设施齐全，还有很多Joe的小收藏，布置的很温馨。窗外就是一个小公园，有儿童游乐设施。步行200米有地铁站，楼下有很多小餐馆。,1,0.0,Neutral
70.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,1,2.5329341972975428,4.86,4.8,4.93,4.8,19976281,Wonderful host gave personalized recommendations and put a lot of effort into my stay. Thanks and hope to see you again!,1,0.8687,Positive
75.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,33,100.0,1,6.761987534815515,4.7,4.65,4.67,4.61,12843786,"Eu amei o espaço. Tudo muito organizado e aconchegante. No momento do check in o colega da Elik me recebeu com tanto cuidado, delicadeza e atenção. Um senhor muito querido, me deu varias dicas de berlin e arredores do airbnb. O lugar é um charme, me senti em casa. O banheiro é um pouco estreito, mas nada que tenha incomodado em 1 semana. Voltaria mais vezes :)",1,0.2023,Positive
90.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,1,20.182729076202826,4.98,4.98,4.91,4.83,44319175,Wunderschöne mit viel Liebe sanierte Wohnung in perfekter Lage. Absolut empfehlenswert!,1,0.0,Neutral
