260.0,5,2.0,2.0,4.0,52,100.0,1,5.145591900802804,5.0,4.98,4.9,4.88,973171385470517929,"We had a wonderful time with friends in Anja's apartment. The hosts were very helpful, welcoming and friendly. The location is absolutely fantastic and quiet, and the many activities, bars and restaurants all around were fantastic! We'll be back again!",0,0.9767,Positive
