210.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,60,100.0,1,0.3977859658151902,4.94,5.0,4.72,4.44,1425389097106243263,"Fantastic place for a first visit to Berlin! Our family of three had a very comfortable stay here. The immediate area is quiet but it’s so easy to walk to the sights and great neighborhoods from here. Being so close to Alexanderplatz there are lots of public transportation options. Check-in and checkout with the 24-hour doorman services was easy and convenient. Novi was a friendly and responsive host. Highly recommend. Thanks for your hospitality, Novi and Bjoern!",0,0.9903,Positive
