77.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,1.8784168293806285,4.64,4.8,4.91,4.46,13559199,"Lovely neighborhood, and great communications with the host, but extremely dark and not perfectly clean.<br/>Everything you need in the apartment, except AC and washing machine (even a coffee machine is there!). However, it's the darkest apartment I've ever been in. There is hardly a difference in the lighting between day and night. The sky is only visible if you look up close to the window. Plus I had to wet wipe the floor because it was too dusty, also some of the shelves and other surfaces (you don't want to touch books or plastic flowers).",1,-0.7599,Negative
79.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,3.855076183138641,4.78,4.17,4.78,4.67,672909276306860227,"Bel appartement, bien situé et facile d'accès.<br/>il y a toutes les commodités à proximité. <br/>Très pratique, je recommande.",1,0.0,Neutral
30.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,1,5.884812685829892,4.82,4.88,4.75,4.8,42490523,"Susann, de host, was buitengewoon gastvrij en zorgde ervoor dat alles tot in de puntjes geregeld was. De locatie was perfect, en de ruimte was comfortabel en stijlvol ingericht. Ik waardeerde de aandacht voor detail en de snelle communicatie met Susann. Zeker een aanrader voor iedereen die Berlijn wil verkennen en zich thuis wil voelen. Dank je wel, Susann!",1,-0.126,Negative
60.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,24,90.0,1,12.476946890148982,4.93,4.98,4.81,4.91,53460697,Alles hat super geklappt sehr nette Gastgeber.,1,0.5994,Positive
146.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,3.4636382799594605,4.66,4.79,4.58,4.56,322520,"We've stayed at Alan and Kasia's place for 4 days, and it was all we ever wanted from a studio. It was close to the city center, just on the Berlin ring U-Bahn, so you could get anywhere relatively quickly. Apart from that, they've provided us with guidelines on how to get along in the city, trying to avoid the so-called ""tourist traps"", which is very helpful if you're trying both the touristy and non-touristy attractions of the city. <br/>Would definitely stay there again.",1,0.7501,Positive
