136.0,9,3.0,1.0,6.0,32,97.0,0,5.989900848344668,4.37,4.32,4.02,4.41,881100962020102125,"Vše bylo skvělé, děkujeme 🤞",0,0.0,Neutral
81.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,6.919397234051426,4.82,4.86,4.48,4.7,20890869,Ubytování bylo krásne a čisté. S hostitelem byla dobrá komunikace.,1,0.0,Neutral
138.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,97.0,0,1.7945030515439095,4.7,4.84,4.93,4.58,11450430,An clean and nice apartment at an fantastic location. Stefan communicate quickly and properly. We recommend his appartement.,1,0.891,Positive
103.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,0,4.179832601624142,4.59,4.65,4.31,4.44,45809645,"Perfekte Lage:<br/>- in der Nähe vom Kiez -trotzdem nicht zu nahe<br/>- es gibt Parkplätze<br/>- schöne Grünlage<br/>- Appartement sauber, zweckmäßig gut ausgestattet (Töpfe, Wasserkocher, Kaffeemaschine, ...)",1,0.0,Neutral
40.0,2,0.0,1.0,2.0,60,100.0,1,15.960145141962643,4.83,4.75,4.73,4.72,13737022,"Angela hat uns sehr herzlich empfangen! (Obwohl wir sehr spät in Berlin gelandet sind und unser Flug noch Verspätung hatte.)<br/>Das Zimmer ist schön und es standen Wasser, ein kleiner Snack und frische Handtücher bereit.<br/>Der Bus zum Flughafen fährt direkt um die Ecke ab. Wenn wir also noch einmal spät oder früh fliegen, dann sind wir sehr gerne wieder bei Angela zu Gast.<br/>DANKE!",1,-0.6688,Negative
114.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,93.0,0,3.368430295107988,4.63,4.69,4.71,4.53,46462154,"Ein kleines Appartment mit viel Charme und allem was man braucht. Vor allem die Lage war super, da es sehr zentral gelegen ist. Ein Supermarkt und ein Späti sind gleich ums Eck und auch Bars und andere Essensmöglichkeiten sind nicht weit. <br/>Alles in allem eine tolle kleine Wohnung in der einem an nichts fehlt für ein paar Tage.",1,-0.5994,Negative
288.0,8,2.0,1.0,5.0,40,100.0,1,1.195944493048261,4.73,4.67,4.87,4.64,1166429151300530583,"Bell’appartamento, ordinato di tutto e spazioso. <br/>Abbiamo avuto un problemino durante il soggiorno e l’host ci è venuto incontro nel migliore dei modi <br/>Davvero ottimo",0,0.0,Neutral
285.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,23,100.0,1,3.4818350414831745,4.96,4.88,4.64,4.8,16729649,"We had the best time at Ben & Martha’s apartment! It such a beautiful and light space. Everything was clean and the beds were super comfortable. Everything was even more beautiful in real life. The location is great too, many good restaurants and cafes closeby. And very good and easy communication with the hosts. Thanks a lot, Ben & Martha! We highly recommend this place to everyone.",0,0.9913,Positive
209.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,53,100.0,1,16.07970458739853,4.91,4.88,4.89,4.76,4056601,"Mooi, ruim huis in rustige straat. Openbaar vervoer en supermarkten dichtbij. Ideale uitvalsbasis voor een stedentrip. Ruime tuin met overkapping. We hebben het heel fijn gehad hier.",0,0.0,Neutral
96.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,6.753647389093091,4.84,4.84,4.86,4.69,37703913,"proper en gezellige flat. rustig gelegen. <br/>heel aangename buurt met cafés , restaurants en winkels. prima openbaar vervoer (S en U Bahn) vlakbij.",1,0.0,Neutral
163.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,91.0,0,4.871252294318258,4.67,4.78,4.87,4.53,46864858,"Nemt, skønt og ligetil. Vil bruge dem igen, når jeg skal til Berlin",1,0.0,Neutral
90.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,0,12.4068471777683,4.5,4.62,4.48,4.48,31170463,"I chose this apartment due to it's proximity to my friend's residence. Instructions for check in is easy. Sergue was helpful and got the laundry detergent for me when I requested. The kitchen is well stocked with cereals, tea, coffee. Sergue stocked up a bowl of chocolate candies on my arrival. The location is good. The metro and bus station is of reasonable walking distance.",1,0.8658,Positive
422.0,10,2.0,2.0,2.0,63,70.0,1,1.3491140189398434,4.83,4.95,4.93,4.62,29509869,"Really nice, clean apartment in a great location. We had issues with the late check in after not receiving the correct code to gain access to the property, other than that it was great.",0,0.9563,Positive
203.0,6,3.0,1.0,3.0,43,100.0,1,4.140963863667464,4.89,4.92,4.89,4.78,4182815,The apartment was exactly like advertised and in a great location with train and bus services really close. It also was close to a number of really good food options that we would come back to after a long day of being out. Being able to do laundry while on the trip cut down on the amount of bags we had to carry and check. Elisa was quick and responsive to any questions and left us chocolate and wine as well. Highly recommend this amazing apartment.,0,0.9648,Positive
196.0,9,2.0,1.5,6.0,23,100.0,1,0.5100458669657755,4.8,4.74,4.97,4.73,11577306,"Excellent location. Great atmosphere, well equipped.",0,0.872,Positive
37.0,6,1.0,1.0,6.0,28,99.0,0,1.3918005791420711,4.54,4.57,4.54,4.49,1565012,Eu adorei o hostel. Adorei a equipe. excelente variedade do café da manhã. Boa ventilação nos dormitórios. Espaço de banho confortável. Super recomendo!,1,0.636,Positive
50.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,1,11.950234688344011,4.94,4.91,4.9,4.88,8331619,"Wow! We LOVED staying here! The location is perfect, the room is spacious with such comfortable sleeping, and Sabrina is absolutely lovely. We walked to all different parts of the city from her home but it's so close to the train if you prefer that. Street parking was so easy. Such good value - Highly recommended! ",1,0.9803,Positive
112.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,1,3.5872254876023093,4.58,4.75,4.67,4.46,744264,Interesting and comfortable and beautifully decorated apartment in a good location.  Quiet area but close to the local shopping strip and restaurants.  Lots of bike hire places around.  Highly recommend hiring bikes to get around Berlin as it's very flat with lots of bike tracks.  We rode everywhere.,1,0.8747,Positive
85.0,2,0.0,1.0,2.0,15,96.0,1,6.570866710297928,4.82,4.73,4.83,4.74,25063152,"Wir haben 5 Tage in Berlin verbracht und haben uns in der Wohnung sehr wohl gefühlt. Von dort aus ist die U- Bahnstation zu Fuß super schnell zu erreichen und man kommt zu allen wichtigen Punkten innerhalb kürzester Zeit. Auch die Umgebung wirkte selbst abends noch sicher und es war nachts nicht zu laut.<br/>Die Wohnung selbst ist für 2 Personen zweckmäßig ausgestattet, es ist alles dort was man braucht. <br/>Wir würden die Wohnung weiterempfehlen :)",1,-0.8658,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,52,100.0,0,6.176910542528849,4.88,4.71,4.69,4.69,17615699,Gerne wieder.,1,0.0,Neutral
68.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,3.9036997247486753,4.9,4.94,4.82,4.71,692420666800645878,"Rejdi was such an accommodating host with flexible check-in and went above and beyond in helping me with helpful information and instructions, from arrival at the airport to check-out. The location is fantastic and the room is spacious and clean. Would definitely stay with Rejdi again next time I'm in Berlin.",1,0.9313,Positive
60.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,19,100.0,1,7.382266945119255,4.88,4.93,4.65,4.9,1153584,"A recommander! Quartier très calme en retrait au nord de Berlin. Appartement très lumineux au dessus des jardins, vaste et confortable, un hâvre de paix. Hôtes discrets et très sympatiques, fournissent toutes informations utiles. Magasins et restaurants à proximité. Superbe!",1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,7,100.0,0,3.870795367686119,4.5,4.0,5.0,5.0,23757288,"Our stay in Matías‘ flat was great! Beautiful old apartment in perfect location. Communication was easy and fast. It was a bit cold though because it’s an old apartment. But If you’re not too sensitive about temperature, I would definitely recommend!",1,0.9401,Positive
154.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,41,100.0,1,1.8346218212204348,4.73,4.83,4.94,4.55,36754449,"Tolle Unterkunft, prima Lage. Wir würden jederzeit wieder kommen.",1,0.0,Neutral
177.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,0,5.199565625742882,4.3,4.52,4.39,4.26,33542164,"We really enjoyed staying there. So clean and comfortable. Easy access and a perfect location. <br/>We stayed at app 101, it was very nice and clean. I enjoy noticing that the owner is paying attention to small details and it was like this with the place. Everything was very nice and clean and we didn't have any problem with anything. So comfortable with the place.<br/>The place had a small balcony that was perfect for chilling in the mornings and afternoons as you could have a little bit of sun and shadows of the trees.<br/>I liked the design so much, colors and choices of furniture. It even has heavy tick curtains which are perfect to make the room dark from street lamps.",1,0.9938,Positive
128.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,14,100.0,1,3.473891084562703,4.7,4.63,4.97,4.54,11932837,2nd time I come here. That means more than a comment !<br/>I definelty would come back a 3rd time!,1,0.0,Neutral
72.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,63,90.0,1,6.699006984531719,4.96,4.94,4.92,4.95,48202559,If there is an Airbnb to book in Berlin is Jens. He is an amazing host and has an amazing pet. Felt very welcome and very at home. He opened his home to us and was always worried to make us feel at home.,1,0.8655,Positive
135.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,87.0,1,11.377361200205224,4.78,4.87,4.82,4.67,917109042412215124,Ideale Unterkunft für einen kurzen Aufenthalt in Berlin,1,0.0,Neutral
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,11,100.0,0,6.114656728983445,5.0,4.78,4.67,5.0,9787499,"Lovely room, great communication from Johanna and wonderful flatmate in Jan Felix.",1,0.9118,Positive
64.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,7,100.0,0,5.753094984458515,4.7,4.63,4.67,4.59,13029305,"Bent’s place is situated in a great neighbourhood close to public transport, restaurants and bars. The building is really quiet and in the apartment there was everything we needed during our stay. Bent was really welcoming and responded quickly. Loved our stay!",1,0.9097,Positive
60.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,70.0,1,3.220903912573032,4.75,4.62,4.85,4.7,846883611117027671,"Wir konnten alle Fragen im Vorfeld mit Katharina absprechen und klären. Katharina ist sehr freundlich und zuvorkommend. Sie hat uns mitgeteilt, wo wir am besten kostenfrei parken können, was gerade in Berlin schon sehr wichtig ist. Am Abreisetag konnten wir unser Gepäck noch in der Wohnung lassen und am späten Nachmittag abholen (und dann die Schlüssel dort lassen).<br/>Auf jeden Fall empfehlenswert.",1,-0.5994,Negative
133.0,5,1.0,1.0,3.0,29,99.0,0,1.664793290368075,4.15,4.31,4.77,4.08,1238256118683166438,Es war alles weitesgehend ok. Check in und checkout Zeiten sind nicht zu ändern gewesen und 10 Uhr ist etwas früh für den checkout. <br/>Es machte den Eindruck als wären die Betten nicht neu bezogen worden da vermehrt Haare in den Betten war.,1,-0.8885,Negative
77.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,56,100.0,1,8.0840026606752,4.75,4.65,4.79,4.7,580667,"Me and some friends had a great time at this place! although the appartment wasn't centrally located, it was easily accessible from anywhere in the city, and we were never travelling for longer than half an hour when trying to get home. The appartment was beautifully decorated with Anna's own art and is full of light throughout the day. The nearby supermarkets meant we could prepare ourselves some dinner in the nice clean and easy to use pitchen. I would easily recommend this appartment to anyone and Anna was a very great host, and gave us much useful information for our stay ",1,0.986,Positive
136.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,98.0,0,7.157895638776036,4.67,4.75,4.56,4.57,731809279716237058,"Einfach toll!<br/>Mein Aufenthalt bei Limehome war ausgezeichnet. Die Lage ist mit den öffentlichen Verkehrsmittel gut erreichbar. Außerdem ist es nicht sehr weit von der Stadtmitte entfernt. Das Zimmer war ordentlich, sauber und die Küche gut ausgestattet. Erhlich Klasse. Komme auf jeden Fall wieder! :)",1,-0.9347,Negative
142.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,52,98.0,1,2.2099121550415086,4.87,4.92,4.95,4.72,9707618,Stephanie's place is located on a very nice street in Berlin. We were close to all attractions using the close by metro.  We really recommend this apartment to anyone.  Great restaurants all around. ,1,0.915,Positive
45.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,2.0393793505131024,4.86,4.76,4.96,4.79,24446063,"Susanne’s place was great, lots of bars and restaurants near by. Very easy to get to via an array of transport links near by. Room is private with your own key. Susanne always very quickly replied to messages and was very helpful, her apartment is next to the Air BnB. I would highly recommend staying at Susanne’s to anyone travelling to Berlin.",1,0.9213,Positive
85.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,34,95.0,1,4.724429146468118,4.76,4.57,4.76,4.72,53962004,"Great location and place, excellent communication and a pleasure to stay",1,0.91,Positive
57.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,19,100.0,1,7.136630170745785,4.73,4.81,4.39,4.59,23501368,A good value for the money. Very new and clean and good access to transportation.,1,0.8797,Positive
228.0,5,1.0,1.0,2.0,61,100.0,1,3.690195125206819,4.99,4.91,4.97,4.8,704976656646850837,"Beste AirBnB und Kathrin ist einfach eine super hostin <br/>Von Anfang an war die Kommunikation top, ich hab mir sehr unterstützt gefühlt! <br/>Ich würde 100% nochmal hier bleiben und wenn es möglich wäre, ihr 6 Sterne geben",1,-0.5255,Negative
260.0,8,4.0,2.0,7.0,50,100.0,1,2.6302702497082326,4.88,4.92,4.85,4.71,1488624,"Grosse, sehr gemütliche und genial gelegene Wohnung in einem schönen Quartier von Berlin (Prenzlauer Berg). Mit liebevollen Details eingerichtet,  sehr sauber. So gute Matratzen habe ich selten gesehen, wir haben geschlafen wie zu Hause. Überhaupt hatten wir jedes Mal ein Gefühl von ""nach Hause kommen"", wenn wir jeweils zur Wohnung zurück kamen. Auch die beiden Badezimmer in der Wohnung empfanden wir als Luxus. Und der ""chillige"" Raum im Untergeschoss mit dem Fussballkasten war auch cool. In der Umgebung gibt es viele tolle Cafés, Restaurants und auch kleine Läden. Unser bestes Frühstück haben wir im Café Butter und im Kanaan gegessen. Sehr sympathischer Kontakt mit Alexandra.<br/>Wir kommen ganz sicher wieder!",0,-0.6114,Negative
65.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,25,33.0,0,6.280772941047609,4.37,3.94,4.48,4.5,1130337,"Positiv: Andreas ist sehr nett, engagiert und flexibel, die Wohnung ist einfach mit ÖV zu erreichen, hat gute Verbindungen und einen Supermarkt in der Nähe.<br/>Negativ: Die Wohnung ist unsauber.",1,-0.8316,Negative
60.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,90.0,0,19.50406483528244,4.91,4.81,4.88,4.81,1040671718863711728,Christian is responsive and friendly host. We had a great stay at his place. Location is near to olympic Stadium and S Bahn and he provided all needed information.,1,0.8689,Positive
85.0,2,1.0,3.0,1.0,30,100.0,0,2.407958180700023,4.77,4.67,4.46,4.65,1030977774648108300,lo consiglio per soggiornare a Berlino!,1,0.0,Neutral
13.0,10,1.0,0.0,10.0,18,100.0,0,4.026491608062799,4.52,4.4,4.69,4.63,31817631,"Todo bien, tienes locomoción que te lleva a todas partes, es un lugar acogedor, el café a 1 euro se agradece! La gente que atiende muy amable, lo único que es molesto, es el olor a alcohol que todos los días tienen los otros huéspedes jajaja pero supongo que en una ciudad como Berlín sería mucho pedir que eso no sucediera. Buen hostal, volvería :)",0,0.2714,Positive
125.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,1,2.540873406232533,4.67,4.75,4.83,4.55,243063,"We had an amazing time in Berlin. Anna’s apartment is really close to the S bahn station and central for all major sites. Bars and restaurants just around the corner. Apartment was clean, warm and perfect for a city break.",1,0.9022,Positive
171.0,4,0.0,1.0,0.0,24,100.0,1,7.991264436983507,4.89,4.8,4.69,4.77,21532395,This is a lovely flat. Really modern and simple decor. Very close to public transport. Great hosts. Would recommend to anyone.,1,0.886,Positive
122.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,3.146245412821909,4.77,4.68,4.85,4.52,44098912,"I was able to book and check in last min which I really appreciated. The space is in a great location, clean, bigger than I expected and nicely furnished with a great view. It has everything you need and a comfortable bed. There’s some noise from the school next door during the day which did not bother me much. It’s a cool old school Berlin loft and I would stay here again.",1,0.9751,Positive
150.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,29,99.0,0,1.5987121570189835,4.61,4.72,4.53,4.63,9540682,Me encanto todo. Muy amables y siempre dispuesto a ayudarnos todos . Connor excelente guia y ayuda . Las niñas quedaron encantadas y nosotras también. Muy recomendable 💪😄,1,0.0,Neutral
82.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,44,100.0,1,6.735519877930783,4.8,4.54,4.86,4.71,863106789917399523,We had a really nice stay at Ashley & Niklas’s flat! <br/>Everything was well explained and the communication smooth.<br/>The place was really beautiful and well located. It was also very quiet <br/>I definitely recommand it 👍,1,0.9293,Positive
99.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,0,8.910755137949812,4.47,4.8,4.43,4.5,9421220,"Un séjour très agréable à berlin. L'appart d'alessandra est bien situé la rue est calme même si proche d'une grande artère avec plein de commerces et de petits resto , et proche de terrainsvde sport. Alessandra avait eu la gentillesse de prévoir des choses pour le petit déjeuner et quelques provisions dans le frigo, bien agréable quand on arrive à 22h.  Merci pour tout !",1,-0.2003,Negative
74.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,52,100.0,1,4.78303997421089,4.74,4.64,4.83,4.69,10130849,Yiğit is a wonderful host. He knows when you want to talk or when you want to make your own plans. He cooked a GREAT breakfast for us and the rooms are very clean.,1,0.9205,Positive
33.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,1,6.809556888557899,4.95,4.93,4.86,4.94,7806721,Be careful because the bed is quite small,1,0.1531,Positive
98.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,1,3.617893966015014,4.71,4.68,4.85,4.56,43466060,"Super responsive host, beautiful space, great location. Will absolutely stay again!",1,0.9402,Positive
90.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,12,100.0,1,5.632455109074784,5.0,4.89,4.88,4.92,883388721588232673,"Alles prima, gerne wieder. Die Wohnung liegt ruhig gelegen und in unmittelbarer Nähe zur S Bahn. Zum Alexanderplatz sind es nur 20 Minuten mit der Bahn.",1,-0.5994,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,0,3.523205396366895,4.41,4.45,4.73,4.55,780141184520327706,Tifanny was very helpful and communicative!,1,0.5244,Positive
80.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,0,3.822337340646882,4.86,4.69,4.88,4.75,26245413,"Graziosa la camera con tv e un con balcone piccolino ma carino. Bagno con vasca dotato di tutti i confort. Danno la possibilità di usufruire della cucina. L’host, molto flessibile, anche se non c’era ha soddisfatto tutte le nostre richieste mettendoci a disposizione un suo amico per il check-in e per i nostri bisogni. Abbiamo usufruito del servizio lavanderia e ci hanno chiesto 7,00 €.<br/>Posizione molto comoda in quanto a 450 mt da Hermannplatz dove c’è metro e bus. Vicino ci sono supermercati e ristoranti soprattutto di cucina orientale. Se capitate di martedì consigliamo una visita al vicino mercato turco, molto caratteristico e con prelibatezze culinarie orientali.<br/>Unica pecca la pulizia (soprattutto al bagno) non soddisfacente per i nostri gusti ma comunque normale per una casa a Berlino.",1,0.34,Positive
54.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,15.145142188058252,4.6,4.69,4.46,4.65,4744063,"Квартира полностью соответствует описанию. Условия, предоставляемые Franziska позволяют использовать все возможности домашнего проживания. Качество жилья полностью соответствует цене. Квартира несколько удалена от центра Берлина, поэтому гости должны это учитывать при бронировании и организации поездок по достопримечательностям, хотя проблем с транспортной доступностью нет. В квартире чисто,  тихо в ночное время. Бытовых проблем в период проживания не возникало. Franziska находилась постоянно на связи и быстро отвечала на вопросы. Квартира Франциски может стать хорошим местом временного проживания для тех, кто хочет узнать Берлин и его окрестности.",1,0.0,Neutral
127.0,5,1.0,1.0,3.0,25,95.0,0,3.573470841773057,4.82,4.77,4.9,4.77,546251628485543772,"Enjoyed Berlin. Florian’s place is great to look at but a few things let it down. <br/>The location is right next to a busy road, making it loud in the apartment. It could do with AC as it gets very warm at night (we stayed at start of June) and you can’t open the windows due to the noise.<br/>A couple of silly things - the shower was broken and the bathroom door so squeaky it would wake everyone up. Hopefully these will be fixed soon.<br/>In terms of seeing Berlin it is ideally situated a short walk from a U-Bahn station and you can easily walk around Kruezberg. There is a small convenience shop next door which is handy.",1,0.9159,Positive
185.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,91.0,0,1.3231577133885242,4.68,4.87,4.95,4.58,39885065,"Einfaches Check-In Prozedere, ruhige Apartments im Innenhof. Innenhof ist super schön gestaltet, für eine Nacht hat man alles was man braucht! <br/>Großes Plus: Tee und Kaffeemaschine auf dem Zimmer!",1,0.6688,Positive
143.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,55,100.0,1,1.1060094707808927,4.91,4.94,4.81,4.8,878313640342175143,"We enjoyed staying here, it was close to the Museum intel, close the the underground and some nice cafe's just around the corner.<br/>Thomas was very responsive and even sorted out the weather for us, sunny skies, good times!",1,0.9311,Positive
70.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,1,2.5329341972975428,4.86,4.8,4.93,4.8,19976281,"Enrique’s place is in an excellent location. Many great spots and sights are easily walkable. But if you prefer to get transport, the U-Bahn station is within touching distance. it’s quiet (save for the occasional sound of the u-Bahn) and close to local transport links and shops. It’s a small space but you don’t need it when there’s so much to see and do in the city!<br/>Enrique himself is very friendly, helpful and responsive. He gave us times for the trains from the airport and was flexible with check in. He was also available if we needed anything further as well. <br/>Would 100% recommend if you are staying in the city.",1,0.9782,Positive
77.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,50,100.0,1,3.172543311051877,4.97,4.93,4.94,4.94,4045063,"I'm glad that I picked Thor's place for my stay in Berlin. It made my first Berlin visit more memorable.<br/>Thor's hospitality is truly exceptional. He goes above and beyond in order for you to feel truly welcomed and have pleasant experience during your stay. He offers to share what he cooks with you.<br/>Thor's place is clean, functional and comfortable. As someone who loves cats, spending a few days with his adorable cats was truly great.<br/>If you're a avid runner, Thor's place being close to Tempelhofer Feld (a former airfield) is a plus and Bergmannkiez neighborhood on your way to Tempelhofer Feld is lovely.",1,0.9887,Positive
105.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,44,100.0,0,1.522384727359821,4.63,4.52,4.92,4.61,3176,"Recommended! Nice, informative and easy to deal with.  Beautiful flat in great location. ",1,0.9412,Positive
31.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,100.0,1,12.720083248666349,4.78,4.69,4.54,4.73,24154046,"The place was great!! I little far from downtown Berlin but I didn’t mind. The room was comfortable, clean and spacious. I really enjoyed staying there. ",1,0.9518,Positive
155.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,41,100.0,1,1.2937250483136316,4.69,4.71,4.92,4.47,12047079,Really good communication with Yoren and all questions answered quickly! Easy to get to and in a great location,1,0.8881,Positive
81.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,1,1.1870073447536489,4.87,4.87,4.88,4.69,39861011,"This is a lovely place to stay to experience Berlin. It is usually well served by public transport (the week I was there they were working on the tram track and also renovating the closest rail station) but this place is very walkable from Alexanderplatz, is quiet and close to parks, and restaurants and ambience close by so engaging.",1,0.7978,Positive
74.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,11,100.0,1,5.182484562003074,4.75,4.75,4.71,4.71,7653603,"Great little chic apartment - perfect for small groups. It's a bit of a walk to any of the real Kreuzberg nightlife, but all easily accessible by nearby public transport. <br/>Volker was so helpful to us, and set the place up really well. <br/>Would highly recommend.",1,0.9637,Positive
63.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,13.54616004135495,4.82,4.94,4.87,4.77,18070061,"Für uns hat die Unterkunft gut gepasst. Wir kamen sehr spät an, weil unser Bus Verspätung hatte, aber Christoph hat uns trotzdem sehr freundlich in Empfang genommen. <br/>Die Unterkunft ist ausgesprochen sauber und ruhig und liegt nahe einiger ÖPNV Haltestellen. Wir konnten Christoph jederzeit erreichen und er hat immer schnell geantwortet. <br/>Sehr empfehlenswert.",1,-0.5994,Negative
