213.0,8,3.0,1.0,5.0,31,100.0,1,5.600860807992449,4.67,4.61,4.63,4.55,17384054,"This was a convenient place for us in Neukoln. Funky more than polished space, but clean and with everything we needed. No stairs!  This did mean that there was some street noise in the front rooms (so we slept in the back room). We appreciated the kitchen with its little sitting area as well as the dining room table where we could gather with a larger group. Good nearby grocery options. Excellent public transportation access!  We were sorry we couldn’t take advantage of the bicycles and Templehof because of the weather!<br/>Recommended!",0,0.9673,Positive
