173.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,57,100.0,1,6.93795828166316,4.65,4.63,4.63,4.55,2485124,Seb was an amazing host - super friendly and helpful. He made a small tour around the area and even organised an extra cleaning. The place is nice and conveniently located close to 3 tube stations. Loved the Italian restaurant on the same street. Definitely recommend.,1,0.9766,Positive
