91.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,1,1.879148370938034,4.96,4.94,4.96,4.9,344986,"Hanno and Zaki are lovely and friendly hosts with a beautiful apartment. Though we were a little tired and quieter towards the tail end of our whirlwind honeymoon trip in Europe and only had a few nights in Berlin, they were wonderfully understanding and attentive, taking our lead on how much or little we were able to communicate. For example, we got in after a long train ride and asked for a recommendation for laundry and they immediately offered their washer and dryer and showed us how to use it. Also, they were very eager to check in and see that we were enjoying our time in Berlin despite the heat. On that note, I’d like to mention this room is lovely and cools down quite nicely even after a 30C day. This was a concern of ours after several hot days with little reprieve, but we had some restorative sleeps in this cozy but spacious setup.",1,0.9318,Positive
56.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,70.0,0,12.736787612522122,4.88,4.84,4.86,4.87,22768220,"It is a quiet and private room. The neighbors are friendly and there are many nice places to go on foot. Piter is very kind  and helpful with quick check-in. If I come back to Berlin, I would love to visit Peter's place again. Thank you so much.",1,0.961,Positive
