64.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,1,3.969121758790188,4.53,4.41,4.76,4.4,37836,"The flat was located in a very nice street and Desiree's roomate was a very nice girl but I was disapointed of the cleanliness of the place, Desiree did not make any effort tidying the place out before my arrival, the kitchen and the bathroom were dusty and messy. anyway, it was over all an o.k. stay. ",1,-0.0405,Neutral
