207.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,58,100.0,1,2.222288195756644,4.89,4.97,4.93,4.73,11031031,We enjoyed our stay at the Berlin City House. The location is accessible and quiet at the same time. The Saturday market is a gem! There isn’t a lot of sunlight in the mornings. However the shower is super warm and one of the highlights of the apartment.,1,0.8553,Positive
190.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,41,100.0,1,4.114262881105487,4.92,4.94,4.91,4.8,1177924,"Dorethe was extremely nice and accommodating, she gave us the key at the time we asked, left us some nice chocolate and wine in the apartment and it was a smooth transition all the way. The apartment is really great - comfortable, clean, with very good facilities, in a very nice area and close to the underground. I definitely recommend staying there.",0,0.981,Positive
