68.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,8,100.0,0,4.166461554844611,4.63,4.63,4.13,4.63,3152009,"The host was very nice, and the communication online was very fast and clear. We got there, not realising it was on the third floor, but it was in the description though... The neighbourhood was nice and quiet, but it is not the most lively neighbourhood of berlin, we had to go to other neighbourhoods in order to get a drink in a cafe, which was quite a bummer. But the appartment itself was lovely, clean, modern and very nice! I definitely would recommend it to others, and return here. Thank you Nicola!",1,0.9771,Positive
