320.0,10,5.0,2.0,7.0,33,100.0,1,6.97282351203588,4.92,4.93,4.43,4.77,16183489,"The apartment was very clean, very comfortable for us,  nicer than in photos. Love the warm comfortable spacious toilets, huge living room, very clean kitchen and clean bedsheets. Sofi was so kind to give us a walkthrough and recommended a nice Christmas market nearby which we enjoyed. Only downside is that the bus 123 that goes to the main train station and to most places from the apartment has a 20mins interval.",0,0.9893,Positive
