125.0,1,1.0,1.0,2.0,18,100.0,0,1.8543941185466213,5.0,4.94,4.88,4.75,24814230,"I had a lovely stay at Judith’s place - very nice modern appartement. Clean, pretty and comfortable place to stay at. Very calm at night if you need to catch up on sleep! Safe location, easy to access and also pretty straightforward communication with Judith, overall very smooth and great experience!",1,0.9857,Positive
69.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,6.409080116623725,4.8,4.78,4.86,4.75,24216126,"Great cozy place, in a great location right by the station. The park is nearby and is easily accessible. It's also great having an Aldi within 4 minutes of a walk. Frank got everything set up so that we could check in early. It was great.",1,0.9628,Positive
130.0,4,1.0,1.0,5.0,22,99.0,0,3.852471644606984,4.74,4.59,4.8,4.62,25936092,"Die Wohnung ist insgesamt schön und die Lage in Berlin ist wirklich toll. Wir haben uns in der Umgebung sehr wohl gefühlt und hatten trotz einiger Mängel einen schönen Aufenthalt.<br/>Allerdings gab es leider ein paar Punkte, die den Komfort beeinträchtigt haben: Das Sofa war ziemlich schmutzig, sodass wir es ungern genutzt haben. Zudem gab es hier und da Spinnenweben, was bei einem extra berechneten Reinigungspreis nicht sein sollte. Der Teppich im Wohnzimmer ebenfalls sehr unhygienisch.<br/>Ein weiterer Punkt, den wir gerne vorher gewusst hätten: Die Parkplätze vor der Tür sind zwar vorhanden, wie in der Beschreibung angegeben, aber kostenpflichtig. Von 09:00 bis 22:00 Uhr zahlt man 0,15 Euro pro 3 Minuten – das kann sich schnell summieren.<br/>Mit einer gründlicheren Reinigung und klareren Informationen zu den Parkmöglichkeiten könnte die Wohnung wirklich top sein. Die schöne Lage hat uns aber trotzdem geholfen, den Aufenthalt zu genießen.",1,-0.9808,Negative
151.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,28,97.0,0,3.918641789625612,4.72,4.74,4.79,4.58,11450419,Very clean and a most peaceful And great location.,1,0.8968,Positive
55.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,0,5.122220052379539,4.75,4.65,4.67,4.62,33180505,"I stayed with my parents in this studio. Iris was very kind and answered all my questions. I also appreciated the small details like the earplugs and popcorn. The kitchen is small but functional, with everything you need, including a dishwasher. The bathroom was clean and the towels were fresh. The main room was also comfortable. There is a small air conditioning unit, which was helpful. The street can be noisy, but with the windows closed it was fine. The apartment is on the third floor, but the steps are not too steep, which was important for me as my parents are elderly. The tram stop is very close, and you can reach the city center in about 20 minutes. Overall, thank you!",1,0.9724,Positive
58.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,50,100.0,0,2.511278097952053,4.97,4.95,4.77,4.89,882373906707433781,Excellent all around. Thanks HP!,1,0.784,Positive
