80.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,56,100.0,1,2.2102820475445166,4.85,4.82,4.88,4.76,3904895,"After traveling through 2 airports it was wonderful to be met by Athena at her door. She had bought me a botte of water AND a loaf of bread and some cheese to make a snack of GRILLED CHEESE TOAST!! I was amazed and starving. It held me over until I could go shopping for the week. She also left a TWIX candy bar for me. She is wonderful and friendly!! The flat is better than the photos. Huge tub and big table to spread out on. Close to the metro and hip Rykestrasse and other neighborhoods. The bed, if you are an American is a memory foam style. But, there is a lovely pull out bed that is much more firm for you or a guest. The kktchen is great with all you will need and a PANINI PRESS! Just what I wanted to make my grilled cheese! The contact for this flat is across the courtyard for any emergencies. The doors are easy to open and the wifi works perfectly. Her floors are immaculate so bring your soft indoor slippers. Also, ENJOY Berlin. If you are NOT familiar with this exact location I suggest NOT walking all the way to Prezlaurberg Alee metro. Take the scenic route to Senefelder Platz. When you find a short cut you will be happier at this more central line of the U2. In the vicinity are several Unesco Moderne buildings designed my Bruno Taut, if you are into that. Also, several grocery stores and a BIO market within a few blocks from this flat. Do not expect fancy, expect a HOME, so ENJOY! You will be happy here.",1,0.9945,Positive
187.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,33,87.0,0,3.470214040335909,4.58,4.55,4.58,4.49,49509138,Vielen Dank! Es war ein sehr angenehmer Aufenthalt. Das Apartment war sehr sauber und das Check-in verlief einwandfrei.,1,-0.8439,Negative
