73.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,66,100.0,1,3.2223990157956264,4.96,4.95,4.92,4.93,24010707,"Really great stay with Chris, I was sad to leave.  He’s a wonderful host and was even kind enough to receive and store some packages on my behalf and let me store my bags while my room was being prepared.  Location is brilliant, super close to public transportation and running in the Mauerpark.  I would definitely stay there again if I’m ever back in Berlin.",1,0.9661,Positive
