85.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,1,6.2731641898172565,4.92,4.85,4.89,4.72,11904018,"I stayed at Misbah's place for 2 weeks for work and really enjoyed it. Misbah is very kind, heartwarming person, he has a great balance between letting you feel welcome and leaving enough personal space. He's a great cook and will always invite you to join him for a meal. The room was simple, quiet and very bright. The location is very convenient, close to public transport. It is surrounded by lots of parks that are ideal for a morning run. I would totally recommend staying at Misbah's place. I will be back for sure.",1,0.9885,Positive
