125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,12.767258601923896,4.83,4.92,4.9,4.82,3871990,"Dagmar’s apartment is in a great location, near the metro and S Bahn. Lots of bars and restaurants close by.  Apartment was clean and tidy and had everything we needed we would stay there again.",1,0.7783,Positive
93.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,2.54678149398414,4.86,4.96,4.9,4.84,3187735,"This is the perfect flat for a stay in Berlin! Barbra was an excellent host, good communication and showed us around on our arrival. The flat has everything you could need, very clean and a cosy feel. Lovely neighbourhood and great transport links. Would recommend to anyone wanting to visit.",1,0.975,Positive
216.0,2,1.0,1.5,2.0,61,100.0,1,8.126007363576498,4.92,4.76,4.95,4.84,14368620,"This is a large, beautiful apartment in a great neighborhood, with a stunning view.  Public transportation is just a few minutes away.  Viktoria-Luise-Platz is a great place for a stroll or a grocery shop.  The kitchen is well appointed. The street does not have free parking, but we found free parking a few blocks south.  We loved our stay here and would love to come again.",1,0.936,Positive
