64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,1.3773060525895495,4.72,4.84,4.91,4.66,1461489656921679773,"Tolles Hotel, sehr Zentral, saubere Hotelzimmer, praktische Parkplätze und sehr freundliches Personal. Also im ganzen sehr zu Empfehlen.",1,0.0,Neutral
59.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,18,100.0,1,6.96421625237138,4.61,4.8,4.39,4.58,24615567,Great environment and value for money!,1,0.7777,Positive
125.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,0,1.2351761599063862,4.71,4.86,4.59,4.71,174560,"I booked this apartment for my staying of 3 days in Berlin and it was an amazing.<br/> <br/>Aparment: on the last floor of a building with elevators, it's a REALLY big place for 2 people, with lovely decoration and nice forniture - we even slept a bit in the cozy sofa on the second night - and a great view for the TV Tower at Alexanderplatz from the big windows of the living room.<br/><br/>Neighbors: we had a bit of difficulty trying to find the place when we first arrived, and they were really helpful to us. <br/><br/>Neighborhood: a calm and green place, with a bus stop and a U station easily close, and a big supermarket on the other side of the block that's a great help. Oh, there's a delicious Döner Box near 2 of the U exits.<br/><br/>The only negative point it was that the walk from the bus stop/U station was really dark on the night time, so it looked strange until we get on the building.<br/><br/>With all that, it was really hard to say goodbye to such a wonderful place. I truly recommend the place and would surely return to it on my next stay in Berlin.",1,0.9846,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,16,100.0,1,5.377242485968316,4.89,4.88,4.89,4.81,28117561,"Die Wohnung von Sarah und Jonas liegt in einer sehr schönen Gegend. Sie ist Teil eines zu Wohnungen umgebauten, ehemaligen Brauereikomplexes. Die Wohnung und das Schlafzimmer an sich sind schön und gemütlich eingerichtet. Die Sauberkeit war in der ganzen Wohnung makellos. Zu hervorheben ist auch die sehr unkomplizierte Kommunikation mit den Gastgebern. Besonders toll waren die Insidertipps und Empfehlungen für Berlin und der unmittelbaren Umgebung. Rundum also ein sehr gelungener Aufenthalt und definitiv empfehlenswert.",1,-0.9761,Negative
64.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,59,100.0,1,2.578564642470654,4.97,4.99,4.93,4.96,7849188,If you're looking for a super comfartable bed and feel like in a hotel you have to check out Bernd's !<br/>He's super uncomplicated and explains everything perfectly to you! He's indeed a super host. <br/>Even on the weekend you'll get some good rest though it's pretty central :),1,0.9819,Positive
85.0,1,1.0,0.5,1.0,27,100.0,1,13.105091735111786,4.92,5.0,4.69,4.54,1258089192039301795,I had quite peaceful stay at narine's house.  Private bathroom was a plus point and the house was quite clean and beautiful.,1,0.8922,Positive
113.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,98.0,1,1.0001956178666358,4.83,4.91,4.96,4.78,127708,"Stéphanie a été très accueillante, nous a fait visiter l'apartement et indiquer clairement les divers fonctionnements des appareils. Chaleureuse, elle nous a offert une bouteille de Gluewein et une patisserie du temps des fêtes. L'équipement de cuisine et de la salle de bain est moderne  et fidèle aux photos du site Web. Par contre, l'apartement est vraiment un 2 1/2, en ce sens qu'il n`y a que la cuisine et la chambre (qui est très petite), l'apartement ne comporte pas d'autres pièces pour s'asseoir ou se détendre, ex. sofa. Le quartier est charmant et près du transport en commun et rempli de bons restos et bars.  L'endroit est calme. Pour les gens plus âgés, il est à noter que l'apartement est au 2ième étage et qu'il n`y pas d'élévateur",1,0.0,Neutral
