117.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,0,12.029488099220984,4.67,4.6,4.81,4.4,42606303,"My word of caution. We have made our reservations, paid what was required, and were left stranded. The photo shop we were supposed to pick our keys was closed (early), did not answer calls, did not call back. Did not reply to sms. Yael did not answer mails, did not answer calls. All contact evaporated. We waited for 2 hours, and eventually went elsewhere. Yael reemerged the following day. I have no idea what kind of business is this.  On the lucky side we have at least received a partial refund.",1,0.1531,Positive
