69.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,6.071801157292599,4.89,4.62,4.85,4.78,9816472,"Would you like to experience an authentic Berlin apartment with all its flavor and charming chipping?  It's your place.  Looking for a newly restored apartment?  It's not your place.  It's a 4 without a lift (like almost everything in Berlin), but in return you get a huge room with a balcony in a very quiet street, a super cool kitchen with old fires and full of light, and a perfectly new bathroom.  Hurry up before this light- peaceful culture of how to live disappears!",1,0.978,Positive
93.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,2.54678149398414,4.86,4.96,4.9,4.84,3187735,"Das Apartment ist extrem schön und selbst das Klappbett hat nicht gestört, worüber wir uns vorher kurz Gedanken gemacht haben. Wir haben uns total wohl gefühlt und kommen gerne wieder!",1,0.0,Neutral
122.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,52,100.0,1,3.086747946124509,4.95,4.96,4.85,4.88,22064519,"The apartment was huge, with plenty of room to spread out and not feel like you’re living out of a suitcase. It has been really well designed with a variety of different living spaces and made our stay in Berlin very comfortable. The bed was large, comfortable and cosy. The pillows were pretty basic, but there were plenty of extra ones to ensure a cosy night’s sleep.<br/>It was spotlessly clean and there was a three page guide to use the apartment and navigate the city which was very helpful.<br/>The local neighbourhood has a fantastic range of bars cafes and restaurants. There was a local market outside the apartment with groceries, material and craft Tuesday, Friday and a smaller one Saturday with just craft and local jewellery and a few food stalls.",1,0.9603,Positive
46.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,1,11.322410583731694,4.81,4.65,4.85,4.79,1272125,"L’appartamento è a Charlottenburg, un quartiere molto tranquillo, un po’ lontano dal centro ma ben collegato con la stazione metro che si trova a 3 minuti a piedi dall’appartamento. <br/>L’appartamento è ben fornito, bello, luminoso e ben curato. <br/>Io e la mia coinquilina abbiamo trascorso li 3 mesi ed è diventata per noi come una seconda casa, grazie soprattutto a Emir,  che è sempre stato disponibile e ha avuto sempre cura di noi. Consiglio vivamente un soggiorno in questo appartamento.",1,0.0516,Positive
48.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,0,4.230279756706139,4.76,4.76,4.48,4.74,31006339,"Хорошие аппамртаменты в удобном спокойном районе, очень гостеприимная хозяйка. Очень доступно объяснила как заселиться, получить ключи. Особенно приятно было при позднем заселении увидеть продукты для нормального ужина, сладости для детей и билеты на проезд в общественном транспорте. Аппартаменты отличаются чистотой, удобным расположением (близко остановки обществегного транспорта).",1,0.0,Neutral
222.0,14,4.0,3.0,7.0,40,100.0,0,4.241687052070171,4.59,4.5,4.78,4.56,22370109,ottima posizione in quartiere tranquillo e allo stesso tempo vicinissimo una zona ricca di ristoranti e night Life. Comodo ai mezzi,0,0.0,Neutral
203.0,6,3.0,1.0,3.0,43,100.0,1,4.140963863667464,4.89,4.92,4.89,4.78,4182815,"This apartment was perfect for us, a family of four. The living space was big enough for all of us to relax in and all three bedrooms were big enough. The location is quiet but just a short walk to a street of cafes and restaurants. The nearest tube station is just a two minute walk in the other direction. <br/>We really enjoyed staying here and would highly recommend it.",0,0.9166,Positive
96.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,33,96.0,1,3.788820414984087,4.81,4.85,4.83,4.71,26006558,"Die Wohnung war sehr schön eingerichtet, sauber und an einem zentralen, dennoch ruhigem Ort. Für eine Woche Berlin war es genau das richtige! Danke!",1,-0.9229,Negative
126.0,2,0.0,1.0,2.0,36,100.0,0,7.726007835831755,4.52,4.56,4.22,4.37,658030654409944656,"Il soggiorno è stato piacevole, Pulian è un host molto gentile e premuroso.<br/>La casa è comoda e pulita, con tutti i servizi descritti a disposizione.<br/>Grazie",1,0.0,Neutral
74.0,5,1.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,0,3.788889030203912,4.73,4.61,4.86,4.66,2118068,"Amit’s place was fantastic, and ideal for one person staying a while in Berlin or two. The apartment block is very secure and area safe. The location is very central with easy access to trams, ubahn or walking to places of interest. I was there for a month visiting the University and felt very settled and at home. Everything you need was very much in a short walking distance. Although I did not meet Amit, he checked in regularly by text to make sure all was Ok and if I needed anything. All up, excellent apartment and host, highly recommend.",1,0.9773,Positive
77.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,34,100.0,1,4.4625182162657095,4.52,4.61,4.77,4.48,11078656,"The place was lovely, well-located, and clean. There was a helpful list of tips and recommendations for things to do and see in the neighbourhood and picking up/returning the keys was very convenient. Thank you for making a marvellous Berlin weekend possible!",1,0.9076,Positive
