125.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,56,50.0,0,2.979751325345656,5.0,4.94,5.0,5.0,53853022,"What a gem! Beautiful apartment above the roofs of Berlin. Spacious, flooded with light and beautifully decorated. The location is very central, yet quiet, with easy access to metro, street car and S-Bahn. Oliver was very kind and responsive. Cannot recommend the place enough.",1,0.9445,Positive
