141.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,43,94.0,0,7.131273504704622,4.74,4.82,4.79,4.62,49070135,Super Unterkunft in Mitten der Stadt eher Hotelzimmer als Apartments aber lohnt sich sehr. Auch wegen der Zentralität und der Sauberkeit des Zimmers,1,0.5994,Positive
66.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,1,2.432968332407865,4.93,4.94,4.86,4.85,17262468,"I went to Berlin to do a research internship for three months (September, October and November 2022). I stayed at Brigit and Hassan's place during that time.<br/>My general opinion of the accommodation is pretty good. The house is very nice and Birgit and Hassan are welcoming and friendly. The room is very comfortable and well equipped, as well as the kitchen. Birgit recommended many places in the city that I liked very much. <br/>As things to know, the windows in the kitchen and the bathroom are always open so that there is no smell in the kitchen and no damp in the bathroom. You get used to it, but if you get cold easily and you go in winter, it can be a problem.<br/>Also, the terrace can only be accessed through Birgit and Hasan's room.<br/>Finally, it is common for Birgit to go into the room to ventilate, adjust the thermostat, take clothes to do the laundry, etc. In my case this was not a problem, but I think it should be discussed if it was a problem for someone else.",1,0.9627,Positive
106.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,0.8993171774740567,4.88,4.88,4.97,4.79,28146018,"L'appartement était juste parfait pour un couple, très agréable et confortable. Karak est une hôte accueillante et serviable. Nous recommandons sans hésitation!",1,0.0,Neutral
68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,0,3.3749878106448183,4.59,4.35,4.85,4.62,33389721,Alles war gut! Ute ist eine sehr nette und hilfsbereite Gastgeberin. <br/>Gerne wiederkommen :),1,-0.2942,Negative
115.0,5,1.0,1.0,3.0,28,100.0,1,2.8150039882208566,4.84,4.85,4.88,4.79,425487,"Hans’ and Ute’s apartment was excellent. It was a lot bigger than we expected from the pictures, making it perfect for five of us. It is well located, 5 minutes walk to the Sbahn and close to supermarkets and restaurants. Hans and Ute were very accommodating hosts. They include a folder with lots of helpful advice for travelers. Overall excellent stay and I would definitely come again.",1,0.9565,Positive
125.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,1,3.42434910048599,5.0,4.94,4.94,4.96,34460859,"Eine schöne Wohnung (4. Stock) mitten in Kreuzberg zum Wohlfühlen mit tollen Features und Platz. Küche klasse eingerichtet. Außerdem sehr ruhig wegen der Lage im Hinterhof. Nahe dem Tempelhofer Feld, was uns super zum Radfahren gefallen hat. Edeka in der Nähe, Restaurants und Imbisse ebenso. U-Bahnstation direkt vor der Tür (50m). Auch der Kontakt mit Gastgeber Florian war sehr freundlich und generell mit schneller Antwort. Rundum sehr empfehlenswert!",1,0.0,Neutral
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,88.0,0,3.493221395073447,4.94,4.56,4.83,4.78,1350171810191392286,"Äußerst freundliche und sympathische Gastgeber, sehr schönes Zimmer und eine gute Lage. Also alles was das Herz begehrt! Ich würde jederzeit wieder gerne bei euch wohnen :)",1,0.5093,Positive
50.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,46,100.0,1,14.174901988437009,4.94,4.85,4.86,4.92,770805100173574917,Ich hatte eine sehr schöne Zeit in Lauries Unterkunft. Die Lage ist perfekt. <br/>Auch Jack war ein toller Gastgeber.,1,-0.8316,Negative
53.0,1,2.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,1,11.493844617518508,4.94,4.93,4.94,4.86,1100549356947964090,"Super séjour. Les hôtes sont adorables et m’ont fait un très bon accueil. L’appartement est confortable, tres propre et silencieux. La chambre est grande, avec un lit très confortable. Proximité du métro à 5 minutes à pieds. <br/>J’ai beaucoup aimé séjourner dans cet apparemment. <br/>Merci beaucoup",1,0.5994,Positive
283.0,6,2.0,1.0,5.0,43,0.0,0,2.455356129933201,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,1178916759134383360,"De origineel geboekte plek was niet beschikbaar door rioolproblemen, maar er werd snel en goed gecommuniceerd zodat wij in deze plek terecht konden. Het appartement was mooi en netjes met in de buurt een groot park, een supermarkt en een tramhalte.",0,0.0,Neutral
163.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,91.0,0,4.871252294318258,4.67,4.78,4.87,4.53,46864858,"We loved our stay! The room was great, as was the price but the location was amazing! As someone else has mentioned we also had trouble with our Chromecast so we weren’t able to use it, but they tried to help us and everything else was great. Great amenities - the bathroom is stocked with shower gel, shampoo, conditioner, hand soap and lotion as well as a hair dryer. We would definitely book here again!",1,0.9881,Positive
190.0,7,2.0,1.0,6.0,54,100.0,1,6.734576372312171,4.74,4.73,4.83,4.52,24639361,"I like this place very much. The flat is beautiful, clean and quiet. Very comfortable location. A lot of different stuff in the kitchen, all technic, including washing machine, drying mashine, dishwashing mashine.<br/>It was a big pleasure to live there.",0,0.9468,Positive
176.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,0,2.0476753393055094,4.97,5.0,4.9,4.86,14089858,Conforme à la présentation,1,0.0,Neutral
51.0,1,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,77.0,0,3.7439659926340014,4.86,4.76,4.96,4.76,957835292314114907,"Ich hatte sehr schöne Tage bei Florentine in Kreuzberg! Die Lage der Wohnung liegt perfekt, man kann das Kiezleben im Bergmannkiez erkunden oder einfach um die Ecke in Bus oder Bahn steigen, um in Berlin noch Unbekanntes zu finden. Die Kommunikation mit Florentine war entspannt und sehr einfach und die  Insider Tipps fürs Stadt- und Nachtleben das I-Tüpfelchen. Gerne wieder!",1,-0.9686,Negative
