57.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,22,100.0,0,13.161602658779724,4.46,4.41,4.62,4.42,18352268,Warunki adekwatne do ceny. Bardzo dobra lokalizacja.,1,0.0,Neutral
41.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,88.0,1,12.846743380347386,4.63,4.79,4.64,4.43,42727731,"I booked this based on the reviews and wanted to give a more honest and realistic expectation. I stayed at 8 Airbnbs in the past two weeks, and this host/listing is the only one would not recommend. <br/>First off the location is actually very far from central Berlin by transit, my fault for this, just something to keep in mind.<br/>As for the place itself, the shower was very dirty with black stuff in the grout (I hope it's not mold). The host also rents out the unit next door and cheaped out on a shared wifi. During our last day and a half here we had no wifi. The Netflix did not work for this reason too. This place is the bare minimum you would expect any place to have, no snacks, no teas, nothing but a kettle and coffee maker. The dish soap supplied was almost empty too which I thought was really funny. Berlin also has no noise periods and during our first night here we woke up to some building construction during the quiet hours.<br/>The other reason for the negative review is the host. As mentioned she owns the unit next door and this place was the bare minimum making me believe the host doesn't care. To add to this, the host ghosted me when I asked for a taxi number. I needed to get to the airport to head back home, so I messaged the host 12 hours in advance and was ghosted. On top of this, the host didn't ask how things went with check in, if we needed anything, and did not give any recommendations for places in the area. I only mention this because all 7 hosts I've had did so. <br/>So for a 4.* listing, I am surprised for what I got. I guess you get what you pay for? Will not recommend, hoping to see you improve!",1,-0.8259,Negative
96.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,6.753647389093091,4.84,4.84,4.86,4.69,37703913,Eine tolles Loft mit super Ausstattung. Wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt und die Zeit dort sehr genossen. Die Kommunikation hat bestens funktioniert - die Lage ist optimal - ruhig und doch zentral. Also eine echte Empfehlung!,1,-0.7644,Negative
