125.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,33,100.0,0,2.314818441800487,4.76,4.67,4.79,4.57,28603917,"Wir sind als eine Gruppe von 6 Freunden gefahren und hatten eine tolle Zeit. Der Check-In war unproblematisch und in der Wohnung ist alles so wie beschrieben. (Die Balkone sind sehr stark.) Ansonsten hat auch alles funktioniert, wie es sollte, Fernseher, Küche, Duschen, Klos, alles super. Der einzige Mangel waren eigentlich die eher wenigen Gläser und Schalen/tiefe Teller, aber wenn man das gut untereinander regelt, sollte es eigentlich auch da keine Probleme geben.<br/>Alles in allem eine angenehme Wohnung in toller Umgebung, wenn man alles schnell erreichen will. Direkt vor dem Hauseingang gibt es einen großen Lidl, bei dem man alles nötige problemlos kriegt.",1,-0.5994,Negative
151.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,87.0,0,3.4802565088356308,4.67,4.6,4.67,4.43,43798150,"Love it!! The receptionist was fine and kind, room was really clean and minimalist, and access was great even though it's a bit far from train station.",1,0.9522,Positive
115.0,8,1.0,1.0,3.0,32,100.0,0,2.978770363505488,4.85,4.82,4.81,4.69,44438078,great communication and easy to handle all.,1,0.7906,Positive
69.0,2,1.0,3.0,1.0,47,100.0,1,4.975867039672649,4.97,4.97,4.77,4.86,39213715,"It was a lovely accomodation, well organized and located.<br/>I’d definately recommend for a friend",1,0.891,Positive
77.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,90.0,1,3.00130441228309,4.8,4.86,4.94,4.61,915716695194593283,"We had a great few days at Hendricks place! We couldn't have asked for a better location, you can get anywhere easily with the U-Bahn or tram, the mauerpark is close by and you definitely find something delicious to eat very close by too. <br/>We where lucky and where visiting on a holiday so we only had to deal with the supermarket unloading once, which wasn't too bad. I woke up from it (not using any ear plugs, my own fault) but could easily fall asleep again, so no problem at all. <br/>Other than that we really appreciated the sepperate front door as well as that we had our own bathroom, as sharing one with other roommates sometimes makes it a bit awkward. I gladly trade in a full kitchens for that, don't want to cook anyway. Though the mini kitchenette actually had everything we needed, fridge, water cooker, microwave, plates and cutlery and even a hot plate in case we actually did want to cook. <br/>All in all great and we will gladly come back! :) Thank you for offering this nice place!",1,0.9915,Positive
62.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,45,100.0,0,2.1907320060884934,4.79,4.8,4.94,4.77,38729622,"The apartment is very close to public transportation and it’s easy to access any place in the city. Their neighborhood is full of restaurants to explore. The room doesn’t have a lock but both Haider and Sebastian are super nice, so I felt safe the whole time. There’s a fridge in the room so you can keep things there if needed and besides the room being very spacious, the bed is also comfortable. The building doesn’t have an elevator, so you have to walk up to the 4th floor - I had a heavy suitcase with me but after all it was fine.",1,0.9717,Positive
91.0,6,3.0,1.0,6.0,34,100.0,1,3.8710959645000753,4.77,4.82,4.78,4.73,1052541605853259851,good location and we had everything we wanted,0,0.4404,Positive
89.0,6,1.0,1.0,3.0,57,100.0,1,20.240640244355667,4.96,4.96,4.73,4.85,786833707781544447,"Schöne ruhige Lage und super Pool. Liegt zwar etwas außerhalb, aber der S-Bahnhof ist sehr nah und die Innenstadt gut zu erreichen.<br/>Wir haben uns sehr wohlgefühlt und nichts vermisst.",1,-0.1027,Negative
93.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,39,100.0,1,3.2781637723728885,4.56,4.54,4.61,4.48,1537125,"Super zentral gelegen, aber trotzdem ruhig. Alles, was man braucht, um sich in Berlin eine schöne Zeit zu machen. Karen ist super gut zu erreichen und flexibel. Sehr netter Kontakt.",1,0.8316,Positive
