273.0,15,4.0,2.0,12.0,39,100.0,0,6.1262846843500816,4.66,4.61,4.34,4.56,14588206,The apartment was clean and much cosier than we have expected. Perfect choice for bigger groups. Thank you very much and best of luck!,0,0.949,Positive
53.0,1,2.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,1,11.493844617518508,4.94,4.93,4.94,4.86,1100549356947964090,"I had a wonderful stay with Max and Luciana. I love the apartment location; it is only a few short blocks from Ubahn station, Bus Stop, and WILMA Shoppen (local main store shopping street), to another direction also within a 10-15 minutes walk, selections of restaurants (I love the Thomas-Eck Berlin - German restaurant). The closest supermarkets are Rewe & Penny, which is only an 8-minute walk away, and there are four more supermarkets around the Wilma Shoppen area. The area is very safe and family-oriented, and in 200 meters distance, a very friendly Cafe-Kali.<br/>The apartment is excellent; the guestroom has an open view, looking over a park; it provides a fan; it is quiet, and the double bed is very comfortable and clean. The hosts, Max and Luciana, welcomed me to use their kitchen facility to make some simple meals; the bathroom was nice and simple but super clean. All amenities that listed in their profile do matches. Last but not least, they both are super friendly and helpful. 😊",1,0.9917,Positive
150.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,29,99.0,0,1.5987121570189835,4.61,4.72,4.53,4.63,9540682,"The hostel is perfect. I slept in 4 bed room, it was clean, and even had shampoo and shower gel. The location is ok. You can do a 5 minute walk to the nearest station, is a really quiet neighborhood. The break fast is also good. I will stay at this place in my next time at Berlin.",1,0.8885,Positive
79.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,26,100.0,1,11.656939169835429,5.0,5.0,4.96,4.91,45681566,"Bei unser Ankunft wurden wir sehr herzlich von Eric und seiner Frau empfangen, die uns alles Wichtige in der Unterkunft gezeigt haben. Alle Fragen wurden schnell und unkompliziert beantwortet. <br/>Wir waren  begeistert, dass das Zimmer und die Wohnung genau so charmant und gepflegt wie auf den Bildern sind. Da sich die Unterkunft in einer ruhigen Friedenauer Seitenstraße in U-Bahn Nähe befindet, waren alle vorgenommenen Ziele schnell erreichbar und die Ruhe nach der Rückkehr garantiert. <br/>Insgesamt war unser Aufenthalt eine guter Start in die Airbnb Welt. Eric ist ein super Gastgeber und uneingeschränkt zu empfehlen. Danke für eine die Gastfreundlichkeit und die gute Zeit!",1,-0.9828,Negative
45.0,3,1.0,1.5,2.0,44,100.0,1,13.335712033183713,4.95,4.95,4.77,4.9,19619437,Everything was great. Both mona and her housband are so nice and so is the apartment <3 totally reccomended to everyone,1,0.8914,Positive
95.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,0,4.691964222849626,4.76,4.77,4.81,4.67,28168852,"The place is exactly as described but better. Super clean, even more spacious than it looks in the photos, excellent location but still quiet and it's on the ground floor - a rare find in Berlin and an important factor for people with suitcases and poor cardio. Highly recommended!",1,0.9627,Positive
82.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,6.919397234051426,4.85,4.87,4.48,4.72,20881101,"Lovely clean, bright apartment in a lovely area of Berlin. The place has everything you need for a short trip in the city. Around a 20 minute walk from the main centre in a nice quiet suburb with great little quirky bars nearby which we loved. Would definitely recommend staying here. Thank you for having us! ",1,0.9848,Positive
105.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,3.7790660350936855,4.73,4.71,4.83,4.53,37800166,Loved the apartment and the location!,1,0.636,Positive
76.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,54,100.0,1,1.775601826394409,4.87,4.8,4.9,4.63,786310180116401185,"Great value and location, was ideal for our trip to Berlin.",1,0.872,Positive
273.0,7,2.0,1.5,3.0,71,100.0,1,2.828064349293496,4.94,4.86,4.92,4.82,8898542,"Very comfortable apartment in a great location, right in the centre of some great bars and restaurants. Louis is a great host and provided us all the information we needed for a great stay.",0,0.9682,Positive
59.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,19,100.0,1,0.858088154562163,4.84,4.73,4.96,4.77,52696285,"Un lugar increíble. Amable, céntrico, bello.",1,0.0,Neutral
203.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,24,100.0,1,3.233570223529885,4.51,4.5,4.92,4.47,4448981,"Excellent location and a quiet retreat. Plenty of space for a family of three. Comfortable beds and pillows. The towels are remarkable: we had one set for three people and they were very rough and thin. They felt softer when wet; the washcloth was a good exfoliator! We made it work. Close to the train stations with good cafes, shops and restaurants nearby. Washing machine and drying rack worked well. Fans were provided, as we visited when it was quite warm. Slept comfortably with the fans and windows open. Good stay for a reasonable price.",0,0.9793,Positive
90.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,57,100.0,0,4.532030906337868,4.88,4.78,5.0,4.86,6501830,tolle lage direkt am potsdamer platz. alles super gewesen,1,0.5994,Positive
48.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,0,7.506709490328987,4.78,4.55,4.74,4.79,1240704072631065496,"Wir wurden herzlichst empfangen, offen und hilfsbereit. Das Appartement ließ keine Wünsche übrig. Die Gegend bietet Alles,was man braucht, sei es der Hausbäcker in der Seitenstraße oder die Fleischerei Döring in der Hauptstraße. Drumherum erlebt man einen schönen Teil sehenswurdiger Architektur und genug Grünflächen um ausgediegen spazieren gehen zu können. <br/>Pankow ist kein Bezirk, Pankow ist eine Weltanschauung.",1,-0.8316,Negative
