174.0,7,3.0,2.0,3.0,31,100.0,1,8.08686445377939,4.92,4.85,4.84,4.88,23451726,"The apartment was spacious enough for four people - with ample information provided prior to check in to ensure a smooth arrival. The local restaurant tips were also appreciated. The location is close to trams, however a walk to the train - not that it bothered us. There is a little bit of street noise being a ground floor apartment, but nothing out of the ordinary. Lovely hosts.",0,0.8635,Positive
60.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,45,100.0,1,3.689600261518912,4.74,4.55,4.76,4.65,16237052,"Had a really great stay at this Airbnb. Easy to get to and clear instructions on how to access the apartment. Was super close to public transit and easy to navigate from this area. The apartment itself was clean and well kept. Dietrich was very responsive when we couldn't figure out the Chromecast (this unfortunately had been taken by a previous guest but Dietrich gave us a small reimbursement as a result) and she was also quick to respond when we needed more toilet paper. Overall, it is a really great location in Berlin and a wonderful host. Thank you for the stay!",1,0.9801,Positive
