228.0,5,1.0,1.0,2.0,61,100.0,1,3.690195125206819,4.99,4.91,4.97,4.8,704976656646850837,"Great apartment, very clean and accessible location to the wall, and train stations. Various grocery stores nearby as well so it makes it easy if you want to cook in the fully furnished kitchen. Kathrin was a helpful, friendly host and would highly recommend a stay at her property.",1,0.9647,Positive
91.0,6,3.0,1.0,3.0,31,100.0,0,22.783250778905757,4.88,4.69,4.76,4.71,28333870,"Möchtest Du herzliche Gastfreundschaft, ein Holzhaus bewohnen wie aus dem Märchen, der Nachtigall lauschen, Dich einfach wohlfühlen ?<br/>Wir sind begeistert und freuen uns, dass es eine solche Oase in Berlin gibt!",1,0.0,Neutral
