113.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,98.0,1,1.0001956178666358,4.83,4.91,4.96,4.78,127708,BEAUTIFUL APARTMENT! It's hard to imagine but it's even nicer than in the pictures. Everything is very new and clean and well decorated. The location is superb. Right in the middle of excellent shopping and hackescher market which has delicious food that can satisfy anyone's taste.<br/>Easy to get to from the train station through the sbahn and a 3-5 minute walk. And last but not least - the bed was super comfortable! Would highly recommend. ,1,0.9942,Positive
65.0,2,2.0,1.0,4.0,62,100.0,1,2.228627084753903,4.9,4.92,4.99,4.8,3883715,"Der Aufenthalt bei Marie war toll. Die Wohnung war sehr gemütlich und sauber, man fühlte sich gleich willkommen. Die Straße und Umgebung war sehr ansprechend: kl. Cafés und Restaurants zum verweilen. Rundum wirkte alles gepflegt. Marie trafen wir zwar nur kurz, dennoch gab es keinerlei organisatorischen Probleme wie zB Schlüsselübergabe etc. ! Gerne wieder!",1,-0.9686,Negative
