280.0,5,2.0,2.5,4.0,60,90.0,1,1.7562047349782663,4.94,5.0,4.89,4.83,1166486193905245666,"The apartment itself was immaculate, beautifully decorated, and equipped with all the amenities I needed for a comfortable stay. The location was perfect, situated in a vibrant neighborhood.<br/>One of the highlights of my stay was the cozy atmosphere of the apartment, making it feel like a home away from home.<br/>Overall, my stay at Philip's Airbnb was fantastic, and I would highly recommend it to anyone visiting Berlin. Thank you, Philip, for your hospitality—I can't wait to return!<br/>Regards,<br/>Wael",0,0.9771,Positive
40.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,54,100.0,1,15.910789482970689,4.9,4.77,4.83,4.87,14839691,"Hatte eine schöne Zeit in Berlin. Die Anbindung in die Innenstadt von Berlin ist durch die BVG echt super. Alles war wie beschrieben und wenn mal Fragen aufkamen, konnten diese immer schnell und gut beantwortet werden.<br/>Falls es mich nochmal nach Berlin verschlagen sollte, würde ich direkt wieder dorthin gehen.",1,-0.9136,Negative
