348.0,6,3.0,2.0,3.0,47,98.0,1,0.5104310590078546,4.9,4.9,4.91,4.73,20561833,"Wir sind zu siebent mit 3 Kindern (10, 8 und 1,5) und den Großeltern gereist. Die Aufteilung der Wohnung (3 separate Schlafzimmer), sowie ein großzügiger und sehr gemütlicher Wohn-/Essraum samt toller Küche waren einfach perfekt für unsere Ansprüche. Die Lage ist spitze (nur eine U-Bahn-Station vom Alexanderplatz) und trotzdem ruhig.",0,-0.8316,Negative
118.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,0,8.01742488509254,4.46,4.48,4.88,4.41,27869320,Nice and historic flat. Amazing.,1,0.765,Positive
64.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,20,100.0,0,4.993723336849769,4.7,4.57,4.44,4.66,17250059,"Alles Bestens, gut und günstig, gerne wieder !",1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,1,2.540873406232533,4.67,4.75,4.83,4.55,243063,"Anna's place is clean, has all the amenities you need, was easy to communicate with and the location was great, near lots of restaurants, pubs,  stores and public transportation. I would certainly consider using Anna's place again on another trip to berlin.",1,0.9022,Positive
62.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,3.030265439362758,4.95,4.97,4.9,4.82,752312082907975460,"Dave is awesome. I got the key from a bakery around the corner while he was at work and getting in was so easy, he’s great at communicating and quick to respond. <br/>He was super friendly and gave me lots of recommendations for the area, along with a little folder with nearby locations and b&b details. <br/>The area is cute and you walk a few minutes you can reach great places to eat and drink. Park and stations also closeby.  <br/>He was flexible with checkout and even said I could leave my suitcases there for a bit, since my flight wasn’t until late,  before the next people came. <br/>Overall great vibes, loved staying there.",1,0.9897,Positive
31.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,20,100.0,1,12.389708472442326,4.76,4.74,4.59,4.81,31116923,"Brigitte ist eine tolle Gastgeberin!<br/>Das Haus ist sehr ruhig gelegen und man hat alles, was man während des Aufenthaltes brauchen könnte😊",1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,36,100.0,0,2.1840166048136207,4.9,4.8,4.8,4.8,1277277,"Anne's apartment is spacious, lovely and wonderful.  It has a long balcony with a nice view of the French Cathedral and the German Cathedral.  A small supermarket is right opposite of the main entrance and U-bahn stop is app. 15 mins walk.   Anne was not in Berlin during our whole trip but she had the towels and the apartment ready.  The apartment is well secured.  However, there are some small problem, 1)I couldn't find the hair dryer.  2) couldn't find any coffee either but plenty of tea though.  ",1,0.8735,Positive
193.0,6,2.0,1.0,5.0,42,100.0,1,0.601371120108,4.76,4.63,4.94,4.73,4335533,"Rainer's apartment is very comfortable and clean with a lovely outlook from the back window. Nice spot to have your tea or coffee in the morning. Super convenient location to shops, cafes and bike rentals. Also, has many pamphlets available to see Berlin. Kitchen equipped with everything you need for a comfy stay. Highly recommend.",0,0.9631,Positive
15.0,8,1.0,1.0,8.0,17,93.0,0,4.132403574870102,4.62,4.55,4.53,4.65,41359889,很不错，但是八人的个房间略微有些吵，地板有些松动走上前很吵。室友很不错，床的大小设计很不错,0,0.0,Neutral
103.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,36,100.0,0,3.8718004496750975,4.58,4.36,4.78,4.52,778808739489367432,"Great location in a walkable neighborhood, easy access to U-Bahn and public transportation. Was perfect for our stay there!",1,0.8999,Positive
61.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,2.188319042758802,4.82,4.91,4.88,4.71,37443723,"We really enjoyed Burak’s place. Everything was perfect. The apartment was super clean and cozy with a great location (we haven’t used public transportation for the entire trip). The communication was flawless. Burak Is quick to reply and very considerate. We really appreciated the fact, that we could leave our bags for a few hours after check out. Definitely would recommend :)",1,0.9883,Positive
146.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,3.4636382799594605,4.66,4.79,4.58,4.56,322520,Perfect little studio apartment in an excellent spot. Hosts Alan and Kasia made us feel very welcome and did a great job letting us in on some of Berlin's best-kept secrets. Highly recommended!,1,0.953,Positive
68.0,4,2.0,1.0,6.0,47,100.0,1,4.1789972800781685,4.59,4.64,4.79,4.58,255722,"Wolfram,  thank you so much for hosting us!! We had a great time at your place!! it was clean, organized, and very comfortable. Well located to move around Berlin. Wolfram was very helpful and kind as he welcomed our family.",0,0.9766,Positive
185.0,6,3.0,1.0,3.0,56,100.0,0,3.075683414934069,4.87,4.85,4.91,4.71,899007097668994721,"great place, everything as on photo<br/>Host is very friendly",0,0.8221,Positive
57.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,1,5.303631689785804,4.87,4.77,4.89,4.76,36825557,"Der Empfang war super freundlich, Louisa und ihr Partner sind sehr offen und kommunikativ. Keine abgeschlossenen Zimmer. Die Lage ist erstaunlich ruhig. Ich konnte problemlos mit gekipptem Fenster schlafen. Trotzdem nicht weit zur U-Bahn. Wenn man kein Schicki-Micki braucht (weder Unterkunft noch Umgebung), ist man hier total richtig. Ich hatte einen genialen Aufenthalt zum Karneval der Kulturen. Ach ja - die beiden haben immer lange geschlafen. Wie ich auch. Perfekt ;-)",1,-0.7783,Negative
38.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,20.197656709080835,4.79,4.65,4.5,4.75,13358868,Olaf bietet eine unkomplizierte und entspannte Unterkunft die mir den Aufenthalt in Berlin sehr erleichtert hat. <br/>Kann ich nur weiterempfehlen 👍🏼,1,-0.5994,Negative
67.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,38,100.0,1,9.589987916493834,4.79,4.49,4.68,4.78,26546193,corretcly apartament,1,0.0,Neutral
68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,13,87.0,0,7.867349248126775,4.54,4.66,4.52,4.53,3970161,sehr schöne Unterkunft,1,0.0,Neutral
158.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,45,100.0,1,4.31202827371349,4.91,4.93,4.94,4.74,2131667,"Die Tiefparterrewohnung hat einen schönen Schnitt und liegt trotz der zentralen Lage sehr Ruhig zum großen Innenhof. Für unseren Konferenzbesuch war es genau richtig zum Runterkommen. In der Umgebung auch spät noch einkaufen oder essen zu können ist großartig.<br/>Praktisch waren die zwei Duschen. So konnten wir morgens Zeit sparen. Die Kommunikation lief optimal und es war kein Problem, dass wir erst nach 21 Uhr aufschlugen.<br/>Wäre wieder eine Option, wenn ich in der Nähe bin. :)",0,-0.9565,Negative
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,2.142649937740168,4.91,4.94,4.96,4.89,446975,"De ruimte was precies zoals omschreven in de advertentie. Ruim, licht en schoon. Ook heerlijk om buiten te zitten in de zomer. Was voor ons nu niet van belang met 8 graden boven nul. Kerstin is een vriendelijke en behulpzame gastvrouw. Afspraken over komen en gaan zijn makkelijk te maken. De locatie ligt op nog geen 300 meter van de Kulturbraurei: de culturele hotspot voor muziek, met een museum over (Oost) Berlijn, filmtheater en dansmogelijkheden. Daar kun je ook voor 10 euro per dag een fiets huren. Heerlijke eettentjes naast de deur.",1,0.0,Neutral
348.0,6,3.0,2.0,6.0,46,100.0,1,1.010749324263853,4.79,4.75,4.79,4.61,26508423,"We had a lovely stay in this apartment! Really well located - near shops, supermarkets and public transport. We walked everywhere from here as it wasn’t too far. The photos are very accurate to the place, the only things to mention are there are quite a lot of stairs and the building is next to a gentlemen’s club (we didn’t see any thing dodgy though).",0,0.6793,Positive
90.0,6,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,0,6.400823146055228,4.52,4.37,4.72,4.42,27512181,great location walking distance from main transport hubs and also for scenic points.  the house had everything one needs besides Alex was always responsive to handle issues. All in all had a great 5 days,1,0.8934,Positive
