66.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,1,5.222564273094288,4.8,4.72,4.85,4.68,39967068,It’s total private room in a quiet and nice location. You would have around 18 min walk to train station and then you can get everywhere. <br/>Thomas is so nice and helpful. I totally recommend this place.,1,0.8874,Positive
122.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,96.0,0,3.128194469226722,4.61,4.66,4.86,4.54,47215807,部屋は清潔で受け付けで先に荷物を預かってくれて朝についてたくさん観光できた。枕が黄ばんでいたのが残念でした。ここは朝食付きではなかった。別料金で20ユーロが必要です。,1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,0,3.502406202170197,4.89,4.78,4.72,4.78,28200309,"Die Wohnung von Ori ist ein super Ausgangspunkt um Berlin zu entdecken, durch die gute Anbindung mit öffentlichen Verkehrsmitteln ist man schnell in jede Richtung unterwegs. Das Bötzow-Viertel im direkten Umkreis ist toll und bietet eine große Auswahl an Cafes, Restaurants usw. <br/>Wir fühlten uns in der Wohnung sehr wohl, auf dem großen Sofa kann man gemütlich ausruhen, vom Balkon hat man einen Blick ins Grüne mit großen Bäumen und viel Ruhe. Die Kommunikation mit Ori war sehr nett und sehr freundlich. Ich würde die Wohnung auf jeden Fall weiterempfehlen.",1,-0.9485,Negative
169.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,96.0,0,4.794147054534518,4.46,4.46,4.54,4.32,34465926,"Location and apartment itself were very good, more than we expected! Very clean, modern interior with electrical curtains etc. Location is right next to market and metro station. A bit noisy during weekends as it’s above an intersection. Small miscommunication when arriving as the place has a reception and even though email was asked before in order to send guide to self check-in, we never got that guide. Also small city tax is added to the fee. So the arrival guide could be more clear.<br/>In general, great place! Would recommend for anyone visiting in Berlin!",1,0.922,Positive
200.0,6,2.0,2.0,3.0,39,100.0,1,2.185083704689691,4.79,4.73,4.92,4.7,19023126,Top. Gerne wieder!,0,0.2714,Positive
120.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,1,3.14704762756928,4.88,4.85,4.91,4.75,363454,Really great apartment - walkable to bars and restaurants and the river which is nice to walk along or have a drink on the river boat bar. The apartment itself is great for a few days stay. Alex was really quick to respond to any questions and left us an iron when I asked for one which was really appreciated. Clean and modern apartment and was really comfortable in a great location. Would definitely stay here again if I visited Berlin again. Highly recommended!,1,0.9852,Positive
145.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,39,100.0,1,7.283454106561697,4.77,4.8,4.77,4.57,923013237667372980,sehr moderne und saubere Unterkunft,1,0.0,Neutral
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,1,2.865184368884553,4.74,4.86,4.89,4.67,1029535507944401198,Great place. Great interior. SErive fits the price and nice people,1,0.9001,Positive
62.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,98.0,1,12.355880726366824,4.72,4.85,4.5,4.7,26975349,"First time in Berlin and Me Hien's place was great! Super convenient location with the train station 2 mins away, food shops & supermarket opposite. It took me 30mins or less to get me anywhere.<br/>The room itself was spacious, toilet was spotless & kitchen was clean too!<br/>Thank you",1,0.9059,Positive
130.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,34,100.0,1,3.2495001173259874,4.89,4.78,4.7,4.75,1100147066666216822,Such a great place to stay! Location is wonderful and overall Marian’s place is really lovely and comfortable. I hope to stay here again next time I’m in Berlin :),1,0.9707,Positive
46.0,2,1.0,0.5,2.0,9,100.0,1,5.136116805453283,4.6,4.71,4.81,4.64,1373943993862283055,It was a good airbnb experience. We recommend it to other guests :),1,0.8126,Positive
290.0,4,2.0,2.0,3.0,38,100.0,1,2.9510071793882355,4.93,4.89,4.83,4.77,57049,"We, a family of 3 with a teenage daughter, stayed in Marine’s place for five days at the end of July, and – in short - we had a great time. The apartment is very spacious, very clean, with great features (the host obviously loves chairs – there are plenty of them in the apartment - and the place is dotted with some lovely design/art pieces), conveniently located near Mauer Park and with easy access to other attractions via a short Tram ride. Unfortunately, the five days were the hottest in Berlin this year so far, and aircon was dearly missed (we live in Hong Kong; I know what I’m talking about!). The host provided fans in every room, which gave us some much-needed relief, as stated by some previous visitors. As in the summer months, the sun rises very early, and the curtains are not black-out, I would advise to bring sleeping masks. We always travel with them, so we were okay. Overall, we had a wonderful time in Marine’s place and would not hesitate to return !",0,0.9875,Positive
64.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,1,3.969121758790188,4.53,4.41,4.76,4.4,37836,I came to Berlin for a weekend and really enjoyed living at Desiree's apartment: the room was very spacious with lots of natural light. Desiree is a very empathic and helpful host with a good knowledge of Russian btw :) Definitely recommend!,1,0.9615,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,0,6.164994760289644,4.37,3.53,4.47,4.58,33156755,"Really nice place, nice people and not really far from the center. Comfortable and stylish.",1,0.8586,Positive
119.0,3,1.0,1.0,3.0,46,100.0,0,2.732563225420117,4.88,4.92,4.95,4.68,1381111432966242413,"Nice big flat, good beds, perfect location, very easy communication with Marcus. I recommend it 100%!",1,0.937,Positive
176.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,54,100.0,0,5.03520170247685,4.87,4.81,4.97,4.7,4201970,"First I must say I bought my ticket to Berlin very last minute, and requested to stay at this apartment HOURS before arriving. Nini was kind enough to accept my request. <br/>Arriving to Nini's apartment was extremely memorable for me because I was on a nearby street and she just happened to see me looking for her apartment while driving by. (Oh and her neighborhood is filled with the cutest little restaurants, bars, and cafes!  Quite hip and very close to the metro and bus!)I hopped into her car and was greeted with a warm smile and giant hug. Without seeing the apartment, I knew I picked the right host.<br/>Walking into Nini's apartment was dreamy! I'm very particular about cleanliness and I know Nini must be too. Despite having cats and me booking last minute, I didn't spot the things that weird me out like hair on the floor/drains, grout scum, etc. It was spotless. She made sure to explain everything about the house and basics, even the printer! (Yes, there is WIFI!) <br/>Imagine an eclectic collection of classic furniture contrasting against the white walls and white wood floors. I'm not used to homes with such high ceilings, so the reclaimed wood furniture and branches used throughout the house were comforting and brought warmth to each room. <br/>The room I stayed in was so cool! The bed has been converted into a loft bed--it was the perfect firmness for me. I actually overslept New Year's Day--whoops! :x <br/>Nini has two wonderful cats who I got the pleasure of cuddling with! I was lucky to meet Nini's friends who came to take care of the cats while she was out of town for the holiday. What a treat! We had quite a celebration for NYE. It was an experience that parallels my stay at Nini's apartment--unforgettable! <br/>Best to you, Nini! &lt;3<br/>",1,0.9951,Positive
172.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,99.0,0,1.542372060755756,4.59,4.74,4.53,4.54,6697033,"Superfijne plek, centraal gelegen en op loopafstand van een biologische winkel. De bus en metro ook om de hoek. <br/>Hele aardige mensen in het hostel, heel gastvrij. Het ontbijt voor €5 was dikke prima. Bedden erg goed.<br/>Je moet wel echt om 10 uur uitgecheckt zijn, want anders word je je kamer uit gebonjourd ☺️",1,0.0772,Positive
118.0,2,1.0,1.5,2.0,18,100.0,1,13.36261494953846,4.82,4.69,4.79,4.69,712018807890898864,Es war eine nette zeit,1,-0.5994,Negative
153.0,8,3.0,1.5,8.0,16,100.0,0,5.991812489722929,4.71,4.86,5.0,4.86,1406413160728701594,"zeer vriendelijk en behulpzaam  wat, mede door het ruime en complete appartement, ervoor heeft gezorgd dat wij super dagen hadden op een toplocatie!",0,0.636,Positive
87.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,10.082429401037324,4.86,4.86,4.77,4.78,731042640553523310,"Cozy & private space with your own kitchen & bathroom, that was all built by the owner. Wahid is friendly. We didn’t interact much, which was fine for us, as we were out and about every day. The WiFi & 5G connectivity is not very good in the space, probably because it is a former garage, with thick concrete walls. For us that was no problem, as we just wanted a good place to sleep and to be able to cook our own breakfast. <br/>Not a busy neighborhood; a residential neighborhood with a bakery on the corner, and a park close by. I don’t know if I’d feel comfortable as a woman walking alone at night in this neighborhood, as it is mostly deserted at night. However, with two of us, I felt perfectly safe, especially as the whole building (Wahid’s house & the converted garages) are surrounded by a locked fence. <br/>We hope to come back and rent some bicycles and try the sauna.",1,0.7995,Positive
133.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,50,100.0,1,7.204877896647712,4.94,4.82,4.85,4.79,930991535571741535,"El baño estaba un poco sucio y el desagüe de la ducha se inunda tuve que limpiarlo yo,<br/>La comunicación fue muy buena pero nunca informaron que había que subir 4 pisos y medio por escalera fue muy agobiante ya que teníamos 3 valijas",1,0.0,Neutral
59.0,1,1.0,1.5,1.0,46,100.0,1,16.1308900339473,4.85,4.76,4.8,4.87,2639933,Bon accueil. À recommander!,1,0.0,Neutral
48.0,2,1.0,2.0,2.0,29,100.0,0,13.916102626188213,4.63,4.61,4.66,4.59,7824562,"Die Unterkunft bietet alles, was man für einen zweckgerichteten Aufenthalt in Berlin braucht. Sie ist eher für Alleinreisende zu empfehlen. Das Zimmer ist sehr großzügig und gemütlich. Das Badezimmer ist trotz Gemeinschaftsnutzung sehr sauber. <br/>Die Küche hat nur die allernötigsten Utensilien, so dass man sich eher außerhalb versorgen muss, was bei einem Zweck gerichteten Aufenthalt kein Problem darstellt und meinen Erwartungen entsprach. <br/>Ich konnte zwar Spülmittel und Schwämme finden, aber leider kein frisches Geschirrtuch. <br/>Für den Zweck meines Aufenthaltes hatte ich eine gemütliche saubere Unterkunft, die ein sehr gutes Preis- Leistungsverhältnis bietet. <br/>Positiv ist darüber hinaus die gute fußläufig zu erreichende Versorgungsstruktur und der nahegelegene Park mit See zu erwähnen!",1,-0.9617,Negative
187.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,1,1.4503062227335417,4.87,4.79,4.93,4.76,1094269515845154731,Excellent apartment and great host...,1,0.8316,Positive
110.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,1,2.106930002562863,4.6,4.77,4.84,4.57,198239,"I had a fantastic stay at Boris, the place has an awesome view, very tidy and is perfectly situated to visit the city. I would definitely recommend it.  ",1,0.9524,Positive
57.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,22,100.0,0,13.161602658779724,4.46,4.41,4.62,4.42,18352268,"The location is peaceful and cultured and I was very happy. Another Veteran of this Air BnB, who I met in the Kitchen, pointed out that the main point of concern are the other guests. If somebody cooks at 1am or is loud, it can be less relaxed. But I had only humble Cosmopolitans and even a Professor, which lead to a super great experience for me. There is opportunity to talk a bit in the kitchen, but also there is the privacy of your room if that is not your cup of tea. This part of Berlin is my absolute favorite of Berlin as of now.",1,0.9782,Positive
105.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,3.7790660350936855,4.73,4.71,4.83,4.53,37800166,Beautiful place. Lovely roof terrace. The area is very convenient and chill.,1,0.8271,Positive
192.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,1,7.356488886180644,4.92,4.96,4.96,4.84,23082151,"Tutto perfetto.<br/>Ottima accoglienza!<br/>Ottima posizione! Parte delle maggiori attrattive, raggiungibile anche a piedi.  <br/>Mezzi pubblici vicinissimi, per ogni destinazione ( U Bahn, S Bahn, Bus.....)!<br/>Quartiere tranquillo, con tutte le necessità (supermercato, farmacia.....)<br/>Arredamento bello ed essenziale.<br/>Appartamento ""Gemuetlich""<br/>Ottima pulizia!<br/>Ottima disponibilità!<br/>Quando torneremo a Berlino, torneremo da Andrew.",1,0.0,Neutral
