128.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,44,99.0,1,3.64766077518306,4.71,4.58,4.81,4.48,927447780970559591,"My review is based on comparisons with several other apartments I’ve stayed in.<br/>Overall, it’s a cute apartment, but relative to the price, it feels a bit too expensive. The location is fairly close to entertainment and dining options, though you’ll need to use public transportation to get around.<br/>The property owner is very kind, helpful, and always available for questions. <br/>The access road to the apartment is inconvenient for baby carriages, wheelchairs, or luggage due to the preservation of the old flooring. While it’s clear there’s no elevator, climbing the stairs with luggage or a baby carriage is uncomfortable.<br/>The internet was very slow, and the landlord fixed it.<br/>The kitchen is fully equipped, though it would be nice if there were an iron available. The bathroom and the apartment itself were both clean and tidy.<br/>The TV was quite small, closer to the size of a computer screen. Given the price, the apartment feels a bit outdated and lacks extra features that could improve the",1,0.9763,Positive
74.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,11,100.0,1,5.182484562003074,4.75,4.75,4.71,4.71,7653603,"Tolle Unterkunft, super Lage und fairer Preis.",1,0.5994,Positive
102.0,5,1.0,1.0,0.0,21,100.0,0,7.819568498322497,4.55,4.14,4.45,4.45,1151636580958943551,"Philipp was heel duidelijk en fijn qua communicatie voordat we aankwamen bij het appartemebt. Maar op het moment dat we in het appartement zaten reageerde hij nergens meer op. De wifi deed het niet de eerste dagen (uiteindelijk opeens wel) en de gratis parkeer plek was nergens te bekennen. We hebben hem geprobeert te bereiken hierover maar geen reactie. Omdat we geen reactie kregen en dus geen goeie parkeerplek konden vinden, hebben we 2 boetes gekregen toen we de auto naast het huis hadden geparkeerd. <br/>Verder was het appartement ruim en fijn qua locatie, maar een beetje viezig (haren en vieze glazen) en best gehorig, je kon de buren horen praten.",1,0.6597,Positive
171.0,9,4.0,1.5,5.0,41,100.0,1,4.936124446607811,4.63,4.5,4.43,4.63,4106583,"Nice apartment, bigger than it looks in the picture. Made for a very nice family get together in Berlin! Super easy to get around as the bus and train were close by.",0,0.9183,Positive
