187.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,50,100.0,1,1.4503062227335417,4.87,4.79,4.93,4.76,1094269515845154731,"Had a great stay at the apartment. The location was perfect and very centrally located. However this great location meant that the street outside was very loud throughout the day and night. The apartment was also incredibly hot (and there was only 1 fan for the two rooms), so we had to choose between open windows for a cooler temperature or closing the windows for it to be quieter when we slept.  A second fan could have helped with this. Overall would definitely stay again.",1,0.9595,Positive
