90.0,3,2.0,1.0,3.0,37,100.0,1,3.488382997378137,4.91,4.89,4.73,4.75,24449713,"Ich kann die schön gestylte und gleichzeitig funktional eingerichtete, sehr saubere  Wohnung sehr empfehlen. Alles entspricht der Beschreibung und Claudia ist eine sehr zuvorkommende Gastgeberin. Ca. 8 Minuten Fussweg bis zur U-Bahnstation Schönhauser Allee, ruhige Umgebung.",1,-0.5994,Negative
122.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,96.0,0,3.128194469226722,4.61,4.66,4.86,4.54,47215807,"Super Preis Leistung Verhältnis. Sauber, freundlich und direkt am Checkpoint Charlie. Reichstag, Brandenburger Tor zu Fuß in etwa 20 Minuten zu erreichen.",1,0.5994,Positive
46.0,3,1.0,1.5,2.0,38,100.0,1,8.11865933626093,4.85,4.93,4.68,4.81,936860732328180487,"Die Unterkunft von Ugur habe ich für meine Eltern gebucht. Vorab und auch während des Aufenthalts war Ugur super erreichbar. Die sehr freundliche Kommunikation auch beim Check-In hat mir sehr gefallen. Der Check-In und Check-Out hat einwandfrei geklappt. Das Zimmer und die weiteren Räume waren sehr ordentlich und sauber. Wer gerne eine ruhige Unterkunft bevorzugt, abseits der Touristischen Gegend in einer schönen Umgebung ist hier richtig. Wir werden die Unterkunft sehr gerne wieder buchen.",1,-0.9485,Negative
367.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,1,2.222748046653009,4.98,4.92,4.96,4.78,31970794,Wir hatten einen wunderbaren Aufenthalt im schönen Apartment in bester Lage. Der Service und die Kommunikation waren außerordentlich zuvorkommend und uns wurde mit jedem Anliegen weitergeholfen. Wir kommen sehr gerne wieder.,0,-0.5994,Negative
60.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,11,100.0,0,1.635934403636217,4.33,4.33,4.78,4.38,14649359,"I fully recommend this place. It is clean, warm, safe, quiet and in a very good location. Zana is also a great host. It is perfect for a single person or a couple that don't spend much time in the apartment.<br/><br/>Great shower.<br/><br/>For my own liking it is too close to tourist areas that don't represent the true Berlin but that is a personal choice. However, there are very few amenities like supermarkets or affordable places in the area. ",1,0.9322,Positive
99.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,50,100.0,1,7.646664400913231,4.89,4.87,4.74,4.79,16865367,"My parents stayed at the airbnb and they had a wonderful stay. <br/>Everything was clean and tidy, we got clear instructions, and the apartment is full of everything needed for a short or long stay. <br/>Public transport is close by. <br/>We would gladly come back and recommend.",1,0.9169,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,51,100.0,1,25.664851623972027,4.9,4.96,4.88,4.71,609129211670073626,"Süße Souterrainwohnung, direkt am Schlachtensee. Der schöne See ist direkt durch ein Gartentörchen erreichbar. Trotz der Nähe zur AVUS und S-Bahn erstaunlich ruhig gelegen. <br/>Sehr nette Gastgeberin, die Kommunikation hat hervorragend geklappt. Auch war die Wohnung sehr sauber (es riecht leider etwas nach Keller) und ansonsten genau so,  wie beschrieben. Es gibt außerdem ein Regal mit Büchern und Spielen und eine hübsche Terrasse im Grünen. <br/>Empfehle ich gerne weiter!!",1,-0.9229,Negative
175.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,21,100.0,1,3.1714147201840213,4.89,4.89,4.83,4.73,86090,It's a great apartment. Has everything you need and is close to some lovely restaurants. Also very quiet at night.,1,0.836,Positive
373.0,16,4.0,2.0,7.0,73,91.0,1,9.801494975217691,4.96,4.92,5.0,4.92,1066700616308697452,It was a lovely place and great location. She was very flexible and nice. It will be great for a big group.  It was 5 of us but it could easily been 7-8. We enjoyed our time there,0,0.9492,Positive
210.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,0,5.639010852357188,4.47,4.68,4.56,4.32,1302932,"The apartment was nice for the two of us, with all of the basic needs covered.  There was easy access to the city via the local transport, friendly people in the community and Marco was helpful on arrival.<br/>Jen’s regularly communicated with us and we settled in well, feeling safe during the day and night as we often travelled to and from the city at different hours.<br/>We would recommend Jen’s place and climbing the stairs to the apartment helped with our fitness regime too!",1,0.9642,Positive
171.0,9,4.0,1.5,5.0,41,100.0,1,4.936124446607811,4.63,4.5,4.43,4.63,4106583,"The flat nicely suited our needs: big enough for 7 people, easy to find, close to public transportation. <br/>We didn't spend a lot of time in the flat as we wanted to fully discover Berlin.<br/>Even if we didn't meet Alex, he was reactive and always answer our questions. <br/>",0,0.7003,Positive
75.0,4,1.0,2.0,1.0,16,0.0,0,5.945811643711822,4.84,4.5,4.86,4.82,14481572,"This place is lovely and Adele is a sweetheart! The apartment is located at the 4th floor, in a wonderful, quiet area close to everything. Upon my arrival Adele was very helpful and kind, she showed me the neighborhood and even helped me in finding a place where to print some papers. Her house is super clean, furnished with great taste and full of beautiful plants. Bathtub, large balcony and super comfortable suspended egg chair were the cherry on the cake. I really felt at home. Would 100% advice this place. Grazie Adele!",1,0.9905,Positive
