88.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,1,6.506839503553221,4.8,4.79,4.8,4.69,53503896,"Airbnb was not helpful at first, but a special team intervened and truly helped I can’t thank them enough. They honestly brought tears to my eyes. This is my first disappointing Airbnb experience. I was excited about Simon’s place, but it turned out to be a huge letdown. The listing says “entire home,” yet it’s just a room inside an apartment modified to look like a studio. This is misleading and cost me two days of my vacation. After a long flight, I had to deal with stress, confusion, and finding another place. The setup is awkward you enter what feels like your unit, but there’s another room that could be rented or someone else might live in it. Simon was inconsiderate and manipulative with the rules. When I asked for a refund, he only offered $100 “from goodwill,” which is insulting. I hadn’t been to Berlin in a year, and I couldn’t even let friends visit because the buzzer rings to a neighbor. This experience caused major emotional and financial stress. I urge Airbnb to investigat",1,0.281,Positive
