60.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,4.969455123944517,4.86,4.98,4.64,4.81,13231476,"Alles war wie Beschrieben - sogar noch besser - Mike war bei Check-In und Check-Out persönlich vor Ort - Alles ist picobello sauber - Das Zimmer ist groß, es ist sogar ein kleiner Balkon dabei - Öffentliche Verkehrsmittel (S & U Bahn mit guten Verbindungen nach allen Richtungen) sind in der Nähe und einfach zur Erreichen - Bei Mike fühlt man sich sofort wilkommen, man bekommt auch jede Menge Informationen zur Stadt - von daher meine klare Empfehlung! ",1,-0.8439,Negative
144.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,0,1.866111056984158,4.87,4.83,4.96,4.61,653528947981181834,"This flat is in a fantastic location in  Prenzlauer Berg. It is very central, and has excellent u-bahn and tram connections. The area has lots of great restaurants and shops.",1,0.9081,Positive
76.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,1,5.339352686328167,4.8,4.87,4.74,4.63,2098124,"We really enjoyed our stay in this apartment. The bed is super comfortable!! It’s in a great location, within walking distance to the station and many restaurants, bars, cafes and parks. It  was nice and clean, with everything we needed and great communication from the hosts. Also some very unique qualities, such as various colour settings for the lights and quirky rocket ship pictures on the walls. I highly recommend.",1,0.9815,Positive
90.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,36,94.0,1,3.3601837928593032,4.77,4.81,4.81,4.43,51169438,Thank you for making us feel at home in Kreuzberg!,1,0.4199,Positive
52.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,6.296102388049414,4.82,4.77,4.72,4.77,16305782,"I recommend this place. The self check-in is really helpful and the communication with Serkan was good. Even though I arrived one hour later than what I had told him, he still answered me when sending a message (at 11:30pm !). The apartment was great, just need a little bit of finishing touches to be even better but nothing really important. It is well furnished and in a quiet district. The location is great as there're bus stops close  but also a train station at 15min by foot (that goes directly to the airport).",1,0.929,Positive
138.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,56,100.0,1,2.8661586391717453,4.91,4.92,4.9,4.79,1946067,"Axel and Anne’s place was perfect. The location was perfect, the place it self was clean and tidy and beautiful as well. And alsi it was so helpful that their instruction how to get there and how to check-in. And also they were so responsive as i had problem with picking up the key but it resolved very quickly. I would recommen to my friends wheb they are planning to visit Berlin!! Bc of this place, i started to love Berlin and would love to visit again! Thank you both💕",1,0.9873,Positive
