47.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,0,6.978476072216619,4.78,4.73,4.72,4.68,29721616,"The place was great and was perfect for my short stay in Berlin. There's a bus stop a few minutes from the place that takes you to the main station from where you can go to every part of Berlin. The neighborhood is also very safe with Police patroling frequently.<br/>The place itself has everything you need and is very nice overall. There's a pub and a nice cafe in the building, pretty much everything you need is within a walkable distance. The host is very responsive and nice, provides recommendations as well.",1,0.978,Positive
