103.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,0,4.179832601624142,4.59,4.65,4.31,4.44,45809645,"Great place to stay, easy access to public transport",1,0.7906,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,100.0,0,4.614969004067335,4.5,4.47,4.56,4.62,323243,"I used to book in a hotel but this is the first time I felt as If in my own house. It was very cheap, clean and in a safe and nice area. The host Yorg was very kind as well as his wife who was very friendly. They treat you as one of their friends. ",1,0.9877,Positive
67.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,100.0,0,6.946289007074119,4.84,4.9,4.89,4.68,53766971,"great place to stay in a chill neibourghood ! clean, big window with a view on a nice tree. there was a classroom holiday at the time I was staying and people were loud in the building (especially early mornings) but would definitely love to stay there again when I come back to Berlin :)",1,0.9674,Positive
92.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,37,100.0,0,3.396812199253845,4.84,4.76,4.85,4.69,21278809,Ivo is always available and willing to support for all genuine needs.    Families view may be more in details but for business travellers like us peaceful neatly maintained with perfect location for travel and outdoor eating.  <br/>Wifi water and definitely for 3 adults if not 2adult and two children. <br/>New comers to Berlin can consider more as host is willing to be part of you during your stay which gave us confident that we have someone.,1,0.9786,Positive
243.0,6,3.0,1.0,4.0,51,100.0,1,1.372412995603046,4.9,4.94,4.78,4.75,13739449,We loved the apartment. It's better than in pictures. It´s well located and it has everything you need to spend some wonderful days in Berlin. We fully recommend it.,0,0.9371,Positive
