46.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,97.0,1,6.8018808148250525,4.84,4.9,4.86,4.82,1028233458536518838,Sehr zentral gelegen . Bus und SBahn wenige Fussminuten entfernt,1,0.0,Neutral
203.0,6,3.0,1.5,3.0,42,100.0,1,4.25247765412155,4.84,4.84,4.92,4.74,28182613,"This is such a great apartment! Three bedrooms, two toilets, two-person shower, spacious fully equipped kitchen, washing machine and dryer, dish washer, and a great combined living-dining room with two couches. The host is exceptional as well...flexible, thoughtful, and timely. We couldn't be happier with our stay!",0,0.8627,Positive
312.0,11,3.0,1.0,4.0,42,100.0,1,9.660413858650209,4.92,4.94,4.44,4.83,16237757,It might be the best apartment one can live during their trip in Berlin.,0,0.6369,Positive
96.0,5,1.0,1.0,4.0,28,100.0,0,2.0462165834774058,4.71,4.73,4.81,4.64,16296818,"Sehr Verkehrsgünstig gelegen. Einkaufsmöglichkeiten direkt fußläufig erreichbar. Schöne Altbauwohnung, zweckmäßig eingerichtet. Sehr zu empfehlen",1,0.0,Neutral
152.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,72,100.0,1,16.794229790335766,4.86,4.85,4.76,4.78,29017267,"Alles perfekt, gerne wieder.",1,0.0,Neutral
360.0,8,3.0,1.0,3.0,66,100.0,1,4.432978276429975,4.94,4.82,4.89,4.74,694871,"The host Davide was fantastic and always went above and beyond to make our stay perfect. Some examples being that he was very flexible and able accomodate us with both a late check in and check out. He also provided 4 sets of keys and enough toilet paper to last a week for my group of friends (most other places I have stayed at only provided 1 key/roll of toilet paper usually, so this was a nice touch). The place itself was beautiful, in an awesome location close to shops, restaurants  and perfect if your travelling with a group of friends. I would highly recommend staying here if you get the chance and I hope to stay again in the future",0,0.9892,Positive
157.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,89.0,1,1.0479113444668116,5.0,4.67,5.0,5.0,1345617742189913012,Thank you for a wonderful stay,1,0.7351,Positive
257.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,42,100.0,0,1.2937250483136316,4.63,4.63,4.85,4.51,12047604,-> tolle Altbau-Wohnung<br/>-> im Haus ist es sehr ruhig<br/>-> netter Kontakt,0,0.0,Neutral
58.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,3.5462846252525453,4.91,4.86,4.9,4.85,1009209,I really enjoyed my stay. Stefan is really welcoming and he takes care of his guests. <br/>The room is very spacious and cleaned. The flat is very well located. I highly recommend it ;),1,0.9463,Positive
158.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,1,1.6592287277224604,4.88,4.88,4.92,4.66,39685590,Super !,1,0.636,Positive
84.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,1,4.00787800065126,4.73,4.67,4.9,4.65,1282857,"Hmmm felt a bit tricked by the photos of this place, its actually a studio, not a 1 bedroom and they make it appear as if there is several living areas, eg another bedroom or a seperate living area but its all one tiny little space in a basement with no real air ventilation, the bedroom has no cut off so if you are going to use the second bed they provide you will be sleeping next to that person as if you were in a hostel - Had to rush to leave the airport so locked the door and ran without even completing the entire duration of my stay, meaning the host got the place back for free and i had to continue paying instead of offering me a refund or even anything along thoselines was accused of not locking the door, not the friendliest of hosts. ",1,-0.8775,Negative
67.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,15.467702278089046,4.89,4.89,4.78,4.77,821713078935347975,"Schönes kleines 1-Zimmer Apartment in schöner ruhiger Lage.<br/>Alles super sauber und sehr ruhig. <br/>Das Einzige was mir gefehlt hat, war ein Fernseher. ;-)",1,0.25,Positive
258.0,10,2.0,1.0,5.0,57,100.0,1,9.660413858650209,4.92,4.88,4.5,4.77,16254081,"One of the best Airbnb apartments where I've been to: the design, the decor, the quality of the mattresses and the bedding, etc. Our flight arrived early and we were only going to leave our bags, but when we got there, the apartment was ready and Simon was waiting for us outside the building. He gave us tips to visit the city, explained how to get to the subway/bus (quite close, about three minutes walking), he even helped us with our suitcases and arranged our airport transfer. Ohhh and the details... We arrived on Easter Sunday and Simon left us a welcome pack (chocolate eggs and bunnies, bottled water...), and when we left he also left a couple of nice goodie bags for the trip. Kudos to Simon, an excellent host!",0,0.9757,Positive
55.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,1,10.41352668784684,4.85,4.83,4.51,4.84,237670,"Von der Buchung bis zum auschecken hat alles gut funktioniert, wir waren sehr zufrieden und haben uns wohl gefühlt. Man fand vor dem Haus auf der Straße immer einen Parkplatz, die Einkaufsmöglichkeiten sind optimal und die Vermieter sind sehr nett. Die Wohnung ist gut ausgestattet, die Matratze ist für uns optimal gewesen, da wir gerne auf einer harten schlafen.<br/>Wir haben nichts vermisst;-)<br/>Wir werden wieder kommen…",1,-0.9118,Negative
122.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,42,100.0,1,2.3747642583840918,4.73,4.84,4.83,4.58,21554958,"The place looks exactly like in the pictures but even better, with stylish furniture and comfortable beds! Me and my friends enjoyed our stay at Sören and Nina’s very much and would highly recommend! Easy access to the trains and communication from the hosts in case there would be any questions!",1,0.9826,Positive
129.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,1,5.219581292258965,4.85,4.91,4.88,4.63,632286550077681311,"Ich habe mich super wohl gefühlt in dem Appartement von Linda & Steve. Man hat alles was man braucht (außer man legt Wert darauf Fern zu sehen) es war sehr sauber, schick eingerichtet, easy zu erreichen und die Kommunikation war sehr harmonisch und liebevoll. komme gerne wieder!",1,-0.7345,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,20,0.0,0,3.0671132988032963,4.63,4.0,4.79,4.79,1343424831356195600,"ho soggiornato da Yurii una notte, è andato tutto bene e senza problemi! consiglio molto :)",1,0.5093,Positive
186.0,8,2.0,1.0,5.0,60,100.0,0,9.536842706974657,4.7,4.63,4.81,4.7,1339794277514513862,"Wir waren sehr zufrieden mit der Unterkunft. Als wir kurz nicht wussten wo wir genau einchecken sollten konnten wir sofort jemanden über eine angegebene Nummer kontaktieren und diese Perspn hat uns sofort und sehr höflich weitergeholfen. Als wir Tipps für Ausflüge gebracht hatten, hat Florian uns direkt auf unsere vorlieb etwas empfohlen. Wirklich eine 11/10.",0,0.0,Neutral
42.0,4,1.0,2.0,4.0,39,94.0,1,4.573119588414803,4.83,4.83,4.33,4.78,1285354459573047767,"Mir ging es sehr gut bei ihnen, und es war sehr viel ruhiger als erwartet.<br/>Super sauber und sehr schön gestaltet",1,-0.5994,Negative
209.0,6,3.0,1.0,3.0,50,100.0,1,3.0117204762227474,4.89,4.85,4.87,4.68,30058984,"We want to thank Patrick for clean, comfortable and cozy accommodation. Very convenient location, 10 minutes to the Brandenburg gate, the historic center within walking distance. The owner is very friendly and always on-line. Accommodation is recommended for rent.",0,0.92,Positive
48.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,52,100.0,0,3.510872622041488,5.0,4.87,4.87,4.73,34020845,"Marcel is a very friendly, helpful and responsive host! The flat is well located in the Graefekiez, in a quiet and private courtyard. The creative furnishing provides plenty of storage room, and the flat, although small, is very easy to live in. Marcel even created a Netflix profile for me, which was a lovely touch! The neighbours are friendly, too.",1,0.978,Positive
149.0,5,1.0,1.0,2.0,8,81.0,0,6.714128192155476,4.17,4.26,4.03,4.17,1223091910763945275,no AC made the night sleep quite bad. If the weather would have been any hotter (more than 25 C) we would probably die in our sleeps. The ventilation did not seem to work properly either.,1,-0.8718,Negative
216.0,5,2.0,2.0,3.0,43,100.0,1,3.461614507264301,4.79,4.68,4.88,4.58,17990722,"2nd time @Arthur’s place, perfect!<br/>Can’t wait to come back soon.",0,0.0,Neutral
172.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,30,100.0,1,2.086859632126843,4.87,4.87,4.94,4.71,306312,"Een geweldige plaats om Berlijn te verkennen , levendige maar toch rustige buurt . Enkel jammer dat het bad/douche een is, opstap is hoog . Verder erg genoten van gezellig smaakvol ingericht appartement met goede uit geruste keuken. En twee ruime slaapkamers 👍",1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,17,100.0,0,7.8681223902150625,4.9,4.9,4.7,4.9,24031184,"Amazingly stylish and cosy loft, was a bit worried when I read that they had a dog, but turns out that wasn't a problem at all, everything was sparkling clean, and she explained everything perfectly. Apartment has floor heating, so even though it was freezing outside it was nice and warm. Really appreciated the shower as well! Ada was so sweet, she wrote me a letter at the beginning and prepared some fruit and wine for us. Thank you so so much!!!",1,0.9909,Positive
127.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,67.0,0,1.9519204029878112,4.39,4.44,4.78,4.39,2742389,"Valerie's place is, in many ways, fantastic. This is a fabulous location, quiet, enough room, and a lovely outdoor area to look down upon. The neighborhood is just marvelous, Mitte at its best! Valerie was helpful, providing a fan when the temperatures shot up into the 90's, and extra sheets and towels when we requested them. A new mattress and slapping a new coat of paint on the apartment would make this a truly perfect Berlin rental.",1,0.9853,Positive
