195.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,23,100.0,1,2.8219601407887955,4.85,4.97,4.97,4.75,16920274,Great location and very comfortable place. The place is really close to many touristic places: Checkpoint Charlie is just around the corner and there is a 20 min walk to Branderburger Tor or Museuminsel and a 15 min walk to Postdamer Platz. It is also well connected to the public transportation with a 2 min walk to the Stadmitte station (U2 and U6). The street is very calm (we stay during week days) and you have nice bakeries very close and a Rewe supermarket (5 min walk). The communication with Axel was very good and helped us during a hot week with two powerful fans.,0,0.9647,Positive
