92.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,0,2.7850220743469896,4.82,4.83,4.89,4.68,249419,"Truly a unique space.  It is clearly a very used and appreciated space that is well taken care of. The organization of the art/interior is different then the photos - as expected from a space that is actually used and not cookie cutter always AirBNB space.  But, I would say that the reorg. Makes it better.",1,0.8905,Positive
46.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,20,100.0,1,6.675581158835449,4.61,4.55,4.55,4.48,20368223,I had a comfortable time staying at Kais . Would definitely like to stay again.,1,0.8176,Positive
137.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,1,2.759966591003808,4.94,4.92,4.94,4.81,768616,"Cornelius' apartment was perfect for us - great location, great communication, easy check-in, and a very pretty view. Everything was seamless. I definitely recommend booking with him for an easy, pleasant stay in Berlin.",1,0.9829,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,9,100.0,1,6.102448989749944,5.0,5.0,4.8,4.8,32028928,Die Wohnung ist gut ausgestattet und die Lage ist gut. <br/>Meine Tochter und ihre Freundin hatten eine tolle Zeit in Melinda’s Unterkunft! <br/>Check In und Checkout sehr unkompliziert.,1,-0.8439,Negative
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,21,100.0,1,8.187543141932318,4.92,4.93,4.9,4.8,1266630,"What an amazing place. It was such an terrific location, great unit, and we cannot wait to go back!<br/><br/>The area that the apartment is in is close to all the shopping and great restaurants of Schoneberg. You're also close to tons of great bars. We loved coming back home here after a day of sightseeing to relax and regroup before dinner and going out. <br/><br/>It has an adorable patio, adequate kitchen with a dishwasher, washer/dryer, and nice bathroom (with shampoo, body wash, and tons of towels.) <br/><br/>The bed... it's incredible. We are still a week later are talking about the bed! So luxurious. <br/><br/>The U/S Bahn is super close in a variety of directions and you can walk to most things. East Berlin is an easy 20 minute train ride but you are in a quiet residential street that we always felt safe in. You're surrounded by history in this area and it seems very high end. There is a lovely bakery right by the building for morning coffee and pastry and you are close to tons of late night food if you are up late/very early. Try the Currywurst! <br/><br/>Close to two supermarkets for quick shopping and cheap wine. The big shopping area of KaDeWe is great and there is a Saturn (German Best Buy) where you can get your prepaid SIM card. You have everything you need at your fingers. We only took two cabs in 4 days but one was very late at night and we were tired and the other was when we were pressed for time. Otherwise we took the train or walked everywhere. The trains in Berlin run like clockwork and you can get to them all from this unit. <br/><br/>The host was called away but he had a friend let us in and she was very lovely and punctual (it's Germany after all). She told us where to find things in the apartment and how to work everything. Roi, the host, emailed us halfway through the stay to see how things were going. The greeter arrived before we left to see us off. <br/><br/>It has all the amenities you'd need including the building had a lift which helps when carting luggage! <br/><br/>I cannot say enough great things about this apartment and would recommend this place to a friend or family member with out hesitation. It is luxurious, well-equipped, nicely appointed, and perfectly situated. <br/><br/>Thanks for a great stay! <br/><br/>Michael and Joh. ",1,0.9981,Positive
49.0,1,0.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,1,17.558875247122227,4.92,4.88,4.7,4.85,39223612,"Cozy apartment, quiet place, attentive landlord.",1,0.0,Neutral
156.0,6,2.0,2.0,4.0,51,100.0,1,2.784593796049624,4.88,4.78,4.9,4.77,3378027,"Overall 3.5/5 stars. Excellent location: close to awesome shops, bars, and restaurants, and close to public transportation and parks. Cute aesthetic and a communicative host. The rating is docked because the Airbnb could have been cleaner (bathroom and washing machine), and the mattress is an uncomfortable old spring mattress.",0,0.872,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,0,6.401201775143437,4.02,4.04,4.38,4.15,1096244816645288389,Ales war gut,1,-0.5994,Negative
140.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,91.0,0,4.871252294318258,4.72,4.78,4.85,4.58,46812239,"Das Zimmer war sehr schön und sah im Großen und Ganzen aus wie auf dem Foto. Unsere Fenster waren in Richtung Innenhof und nachts hallten doch teilweise die lauten Stimmen anderer Gäste wider, die ihr Fenster ebenfalls geöffnet hatten - mit etwas lauteren Nachbarn in der Nacht muss man also rechnen aber wir empfanden es als ertragbar. <br/>Leider war der Minikühlschrank im Zimmer nicht zu gebrauchen. Dieser ist in einen Schrank eingebaut und aus dem Grund staut sich dort drin so viel Hitze an, dass im Kühlschrank bestenfalls Zimmertemperatur herrscht. Kühlen kann man also wirklich nichts, das war etwas ärgerlich. Der Abfluss der Dusche hatte auch einen starken Geruch, wenn man aber die Duschkabine geschlossen hält, ist es aushaltbar. Das sind allerdings wirklich unsere zwei einigen Kritikpunkte. Ansonsten haben wir uns wohl gefühlt. Keine Probleme mit dem Check-In oder mit der Hygiene. Die Umgebung zeichnet sich durch viele tolle Restaurants aus und mit der U-Bahn ist man schnell überall.",1,-0.9823,Negative
86.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,0,17.660111302321962,4.8,4.8,4.7,4.6,49707808,"We had a great, comfortable stay at Reinhard's flat. The flat was extremely clean and well-thought out, with new furnishings and appliances. The bathtub was comfortable and relaxing. We did not cook in the flat but noticed a full set of new cookware for guests. Reinhard is very responsive and offered to answer any questions 24/7. We would highly recommend this flat to any adult guests visiting Berlin, the Freie Universität, or even Potsdam, since the S-bahn is so close by. Great value!",1,0.9794,Positive
85.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,0,12.454267915590298,4.63,4.74,4.75,4.63,37346562,Alles ok.,1,0.296,Positive
