73.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,90.0,1,8.193021284977716,4.85,4.93,4.7,4.69,2147777,"Perfectly located, 3 minutes walking to a u-Bahn and s-Bahn station, and very quiet neighbourhood. The hosts are super nice, always available for every request and always answered fast at our messages. The apartment looks exactly like you can see in the pictures, everything was clean and most of the forniture is brand new. Highly recommend it!",1,0.9595,Positive
103.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,0,2.114552330707222,4.6,4.76,4.75,4.56,23677956,"Sehr großes, schönes und sauberes Appartement. Celly ist sehr hilfsbereit und antwortet schnell, wenn man Fragen hat. Die Lage der Wohnung ist auch super.",1,0.0,Neutral
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,1,7.994559142347801,4.97,4.98,4.82,4.93,22154155,"Es war klasse bei René und Anja. Wir hatten alles, was wir uns hätten wünschen können: Hervorragende Gastfreundschaft, unkompliziertes Entgegenkommen beim Check-in, tolles Frühstück, einen herrlichen Garten, wertvolle Tipps für Berlin und interessante & spannende Gespräche.<br/>René ist ein klasse Typ und genau wie Anja auch: humorvoll und sympathisch. <br/>Das Tinyhouse war sauber und gepflegt, das Bett/ Schlafsofa erfreulich bequem und die Küche mit allen Basics ausgestattet, die man braucht.<br/>Auch auf die speziellen Hygieneanforderungen in der Corona-Zeit hat René besonders geachtet.<br/>Wir würden jederzeit wiederkommen und können das Tinyhouse guten Gewissens weiterempfehlen. <br/>Danke René und Anja für die gute Zeit.",1,-0.9761,Negative
84.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,1,3.2375488184892025,4.89,4.92,4.88,4.83,41651093,We really enjoyed our stay at Carsten’s place. We were two friends so one of us slept in the lower bunk and another one in the actual bed; the apartment worked well like that too. The neighborhood is really nice.,1,0.9039,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,14,98.0,0,2.470825343422713,4.47,4.31,4.82,4.49,46744092,Alles top würde ich nochmal buchen :),1,0.5859,Positive
118.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,18,93.0,0,2.315150552188887,4.79,4.73,4.74,4.68,16821725,"Great location, great appartement.<br/>Everything was super clean, beds comfortable, small bathroom, but everything needed is in it. <br/>We really enjoyed the neighborhood.<br/>",1,0.9376,Positive
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,32,100.0,0,6.941162921009759,5.0,5.0,4.75,5.0,2727771,"Jana's apartment appeared to be really awesome. It's huge, with two large separate rooms where one can find enough shelves and closets - and two toilets, which is especially worthy when you stay here with two children. The kitchen is equipped more than enough. Another feature I appreciated a lot was the doors that provide a great isolation from any noise.<br/>We liked the location also. About 20 minutes from the Museum island, 25-30 from Hauptnahnhof, 10 minutes walk from a big park with boats to rent... That's great indeed. <br/>Hope to come again!",1,0.9721,Positive
125.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,0,1.2351761599063862,4.71,4.86,4.59,4.71,174560,"(The comment application is not functioning very well and is shortening my comment). In brief: great location, great apartment up to 5 people, well furnished, easy contact with the owner, etc. We had a great time visiting Berlin and this apartment was our ""headquarters"" to rest, eat, sleep and discuss about what to do the next morning!",1,0.925,Positive
