64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,0,6.150616171255118,4.93,4.99,4.65,4.88,162111,"The best possible experience. Verena was so kind and nice, the apartment just as lovely as in pictures. Everything worked more than well. The bike was great. With the bike all the most exciting and beautiful cafes and bars on Weserstrasse and Friedelstrasse etc. were easy to catch as well as Tempelhof and Kreuzberg. Also U-bahn and S-bahn were pretty close. I felt like being in a boutique hotel except that this was more fun and real. Five stars for everything. Highly recommended! Thanks so much Verena!",1,0.9939,Positive
