95.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,7,99.0,0,2.301937954006857,4.62,4.64,4.57,4.57,596259346432142153,"I had read the other reviews about it being noisy, but had expected noise from the street and not the subway train every 5 minutes all night long.<br/>I had to sleep with my AirPods in and then mistakenly left one the morning that I left.  The host responded and told me the cleaner had found it, but has not replied to my request to send it to me (I offered to pay for postage and his time)<br/>The place is spacious, beds are comfortable.  Transportation is close by (!) and convenient.",1,0.4664,Positive
