125.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,32,97.0,0,5.826874691514046,4.41,4.44,4.03,4.33,879653438579452099,"Stayed here for 3 nights, booked for a business trip with my colleague because the price was lovely. Unfortunately the place didn’t match the photos (no bathtub, one of the bedrooms doesn’t exist). The lock is electronic and it didn’t work upon arrival, the host didn’t respond for 3 hours (7ish PM on a Thursday). Three stars only because Airbnb was super helpful and paid for our hotel to stay for the first night. Oh, and getting a hot shower required an engineering degree because the heater was working only when it was in the mood.<br/>Listing needs to be updated.",0,0.8442,Positive
