320.0,10,5.0,2.0,7.0,33,100.0,1,6.97282351203588,4.92,4.93,4.43,4.77,16183489,"We loved our stay. plenty of room, nice and clean. Hosts super easy to contact and went above and beyond to make us comfortable. We also really appreciated the lovely welcome message. Would happily stay again.",0,0.987,Positive
