157.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,89.0,0,4.068771463428812,4.67,4.7,4.76,4.62,1264387511715820970,"We might have been unlucky but unfortunately our stay was pretty disappointing as so many things went wrong.<br/>Firstly our accommodation had to be changed to another location but this was never communicated and we turned up at the wrong place.<br/>We had a leak in our apartment as soon as we arrived, we spoke with cs and they changed us to another room. The code wasn’t working so we were left waiting again trying to get into our room. Our power stopped working and we had to fiddle with the fuse box and then things like coffee machine weren’t working properly but at this point we didn’t want to move again. We ran out of toilet paper so located the “supplies cupboard” which was basically empty, just a few hand towels and that was it. So the last evening we had to use kitchen roll we found downstairs. <br/>Quite disappointed really and it did put a dampener on our stay. <br/>Location was really good, customer service was good also.",1,-0.1207,Negative
84.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,7.790190356236613,4.69,4.83,4.72,4.7,512476,"Lovely flat, she is lovely. The area is perfect near to the tube station.. perfect for visit the city ",1,0.9432,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,24,0.0,1,4.103393166209834,4.93,4.98,4.81,4.85,17544847,"Kim apartment is fantastic! We met Natalie (Kim's contact person) when we arrived. She was very kind and showed us the apartment and how everything worked in it. There you can find anything you may need a toaster, a coffee machine, a kettle ... The neighbourhood it’s also great! Really quiet! From the apartment you can go walking everywhere, but if you prefer not to do so, it’s closed to the subway and other public transports. You can also find a supermarket in a two minutes walk!<br/>No doubt in choosing it again if we come back! Thanks a lot Natalie & Kim!",1,0.8387,Positive
88.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,1,2.7348204012292734,4.85,4.96,4.85,4.68,937557263289597139,Schönes Zimmer. sauberes Bad. Insgesamt nicht ganz günstig aber ok. Till war ein sehr freundlicher und bemuhter Gastgeber.,1,-0.7351,Negative
