97.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,98.0,1,8.10707989548037,4.3,4.5,4.3,3.8,44564481,"This is a modern, clean apartment with comfortable furnishings. Laundry costs two euros and there is convenient bike storage. Due to the thin sliding doors in the bathroom and bedroom, it may be better suited for one person than for two. The neighborhood is out of the way from main tourist attractions, but is very pretty and near several good restaurants. My biggest issue with the rental is the price, which is a lot higher than standard market value for one-bedroom apartments in Berlin (as I learned to my chagrin from locals.) If you are willing to use other sites that I'm not allowed to name here, you will find significantly lower rates.",1,0.8977,Positive
