61.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,25,100.0,1,3.347640201769396,4.91,4.96,4.86,4.82,50700578,Very clean place- the room is massive and the location is well situated! The host is friendly and willing to help wherever possible. 100% recommend his place to anyone looking for a room in Berlin.,1,0.915,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,1,2.380705735722119,4.95,4.96,4.91,4.86,7571301,"Tiziana and her charming children were most welcoming. Their apartment is absolutely lovely, very modern, spacious and warm (I stayed in November!). The bed is extremely comfortable and the shower is excellent - two very important factors for comfort and satisfaction! The guest room has a desk and chair, excellent lighting and reliable wi-fi. I was able to keep in touch with family and friends on the other side of the world very easily. Tiziana was there if I needed something explained or a cup of tea but the whole family are very respectful of your privacy and I felt as though I had the place to myself most of the time.<br/>Lastly, the location is brilliant for Berlin. Very safe, classy residential area with a beautiful park at one end of the street (about 200m away) and the M4 tram that takes you directly into the centre of the city at the other end. This is a fantastic AirBnB - I can not recommend it highly enough, especially for solo woman travellers (which I was this time).",1,0.9936,Positive
95.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,12,100.0,0,7.932419196316966,4.26,4.58,4.48,4.14,2485985,"The location is very convenient, close to the park and metro station, and communication with the owner were very nice and efficient. <br/>But the apartment itself is quite disappointing: very old, shabby, overfilled with furniture and decorations and very dusty therefore. <br/>The shower was leaking, some lamps damaged. When we turned on heating it started smelling very badly. <br/>We were asked to leave a 200 eur deposit and I was really worried something else can get broken while our stay just because of the average apartment condition. <br/>So to my mind didn’t worth it’s cost.",1,-0.8187,Negative
65.0,2,2.0,1.0,4.0,62,100.0,1,2.228627084753903,4.9,4.92,4.99,4.8,3883715,"Marie’s place is great! Check in was easy, and the place was nice and clean and as described. Would stay here again for sure!",1,0.937,Positive
170.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,100.0,1,6.547712743829179,4.73,4.84,4.61,4.65,28532851,Super liebes Personal & ein sauberes Zimmer. Sehr preiswert - gerne wieder 🙂,1,0.5994,Positive
231.0,2,1.0,1.0,3.0,63,100.0,1,9.076307917104932,4.76,4.7,4.78,4.54,44205889,This apartment has every amenity and is perfectly outfitted. Unlike many places there was ample closet and clothes storage space. The bed was almost too comfortable! Clean and spacious and highly recommended.,1,0.901,Positive
180.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,45,85.0,0,1.5095289909770313,4.75,4.84,4.9,4.6,45475252,"Clean, contemporary and stylish apartment with wonderful security measures. We enjoyed our stay and the accommodations. Communication with the host was always timely.  Would certainly recommend this studio apartment.",1,0.9432,Positive
125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,0,1.8228383364962517,4.94,4.86,4.97,4.89,30042609,"Great hostess!!<br/>Good service, good communication.<br/>Best apartment we ever rented on Airbnb! Great spacious light apartment with everything you need!!<br/>We loved every single moment here!!<br/>Location is super, you are within walking distance to most attractions",1,0.9755,Positive
149.0,6,1.0,1.0,3.0,45,100.0,1,3.2543180393984152,4.88,4.94,4.86,4.6,52142935,Bon emplacement et domicile confortable,1,0.0,Neutral
79.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,1,24.74326903682093,4.93,4.93,4.88,4.85,24790763,"Carolas Wohnung entsprach genau der Beschreibung. Die Wohnung ist sehr ruhig, in einer traumhaften Umgebung und genau das, was wir haben wollten! Carola und ihr Mann sind sehr nett!<br/>Die Kommunikation war schnell und unkompliziert. <br/>Es passte einfach alles! <br/>Wenn wir könnten, würden wir in allen Bereichen 6 statt 5 Sterne abgeben. Gerne möchten wir wieder bei unserem nächsten Besuch in Berlin dort wohnen, wenn die Wohnung dann hoffentlich frei ist.",1,-0.927,Negative
48.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,1,11.045433737585087,4.88,4.58,4.94,4.85,815136527628581143,"In der gemütlichen Wohnung von Gerhard fühlt man sich schnell zuhause. Ich mochte besonders die Küche, die angenehm hohen Decken sowie den Blick in Baumkronen im Innenhof. Das Viertel hat sehr viele Restaurants und Cafés für jeden Geschmack. Die S-Bahn ist in wenigen Minuten erreichbar. <br/>Gerhard ist offen und unkompliziert. Er war auch sehr flexibel mit den Check- in & -out Zeiten.",1,-0.9485,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,8,100.0,0,13.689961924946964,4.17,3.25,4.5,4.33,6782133,"Everything went well, instructions were clear. <br/>The flat is ideally located for what I needed, accessible from the airport and practical with a little supermarket just at the corner of the street.<br/>",1,0.7579,Positive
125.0,8,3.0,1.0,2.0,45,100.0,1,5.451670615848214,4.87,4.87,4.79,4.68,9770154,"Riccardos apartment is so wonderful and beautiful!! It was perfect for a big family as ours!! Great area, and the Viktoria park just next door - with fun for both kids and adults! Riccardo made the apartment perfect for us! We will definately come back another time!",0,0.9796,Positive
54.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,11,100.0,1,5.259652982108338,4.82,4.9,4.9,4.81,2657671,"Staying with Ivo was terrific. He was very quick to respond to my messages, provided clear instructions, gave great tips, and was a lovely guy!",1,0.9312,Positive
197.0,7,3.0,2.0,4.0,46,100.0,1,30.241564176287284,4.91,4.8,4.81,4.8,16889808,"Die Lage des Airbnbs ist perfekt! Check-In war sehr unkompliziert, es war sehr viel Platz für alle Personen (5 Erw. + 2 Kinder) und der Ausblick auf den See war super :) Bäcker, Einkaufs- und Spaziermöglichkeiten in der Nähe (maximal 1,5km Entfernung).",0,-0.8748,Negative
203.0,6,2.0,2.0,1.0,49,99.0,0,2.9563770599583177,4.46,4.56,4.85,4.19,979394943253152771,"The appartement is very well located and easily accessible. The beds are comfortable and the communication with Noam was excellent. He was always very reactive and solution orientated. <br/>However there are a couple of negative points as well. In my opinion, the appartement is not really made for 6 people. There's barely cutlery and plates for 6 people, a tiny fridge, one (leaky) shower and the third bedroom, which is also the living area, is downstairs and smells of moisture with very little natural light.",0,0.9265,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,52,100.0,1,4.839723855066247,4.96,4.89,4.8,4.88,25151856,"Sophie’s place is the best place to stay in Berlin. It is 5 min walk to all train stations that take you to the city center in 20 minutes, the room is amazing and has a cozy warm lamp that makes you feel at home. The kitchen has everything you need to cook and make as much tea as you want ☕️ <br/>Sophie is what I call “Saint Sophie” because she is so nice. She always wants to do the best she can for everyone in her life, even if you are just staying at her bnb for a short while ( a month in my case), you will have someone in Berlin that will make you feel comfortable and happy. She is very kind and talkative and will always talk to you about Berlin or life in general! There are many plants and candles/lamps around her house that make a lovely kind of cozy and happy environment all the time. Coming home from a day working in Mitte and being around such a calm space was always so nice. There is an amazing cafe next to Sophie’s place that I spent a good amount of time at in the weekends reading and eating as well ...she will tell you the name ;)<br/>If you get to book Sophie’s place, you will have the best time possible.",1,0.9958,Positive
287.0,8,2.0,1.5,6.0,46,99.0,0,2.011964640071796,4.71,4.63,4.98,4.52,1237567772949455013,"Fijn verblijf, fijne communicatie. Zeker aan te raden!",0,0.0,Neutral
