112.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,0,10.170435739382182,4.51,4.6,4.54,4.48,14574834,"Philipp’s place is just wonderful. It is very close to Lichtenberg station, where there’s both the S-Bahn and the U-Bahn going straight to the heart of Berlin. There’s supermarkets and kiosks nearby and it’s a lovely neighbourhood. The apartment is at fourth or fifth floor (not sure) and there’s no elevator, so we were quite out of breath and sweaty when we reached the apartment, but then it’s great that there is a big balcony where you can cool off. It is easy to find the place and easy to get the key. All in all it was a great experience staying there.",1,0.9813,Positive
79.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,62,100.0,1,10.248971512483678,4.99,4.97,4.95,4.93,1064635560081750500,"This place was amazing. I loved that I could do laundry. They had a wicked fast response rate, it was amazing. IMMEDIATE response. The kitchen was beautiful, next time I come back during the holidays sometime I will take advantage of it. Please do get a metro pass though cause you will need it. I love walking but I’m glad I got a pass. <br/>It’s about an hour away from the airport with one train and the 249 bus near the house! <br/>I would love to come back",1,0.9724,Positive
132.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,1,3.18203063241107,4.93,4.97,5.0,4.82,1069369790058455388,"Stefan and Suzan have a beautiful home, the perfect base to explore Berlin! The apartment was very clean and had everything we needed. Stefan and Suzan were excellent communicators, very proactive and responsive. We very much enjoyed our stay, thank you for having us!",1,0.9795,Positive
