65.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,100.0,0,8.858712573291939,4.47,4.52,4.81,4.47,21276630,"excellent apartment location, near metro, to the city center 10 minutes.  the apartment itself is large, spacious, comfortable, excellent bedroom with a comfortable mattress, its own balcony overlooking the courtyard.  in the next building there is a supermarket, a bar, an excellent pastry shop is nearby.  I highly recommend these apartments!",1,0.9674,Positive
