35.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,51,100.0,0,3.642892493197811,4.95,4.96,4.8,4.93,304904,Mr. Andreas and his wife were wonderful and his place was amazing. He did not create any fuss about us reaching at midnight (our flight was delayed) and we were 2 girls in a new city so he made sure we got in safe. The room is clean/quiet/comfortable for 1-2 people. Walking distance to the Train (S-Bahn which takes you directly to the city centre). And the tram/ bus are right outside the house. The Surroundings are quiet and safe with shops and cafes on the street. There is a separate entry door so one can come and go as they please. We could not have got a better place at this price!,1,0.9436,Positive
