94.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,1,0.9546645327029104,4.87,4.81,4.89,4.81,22662699,"It was a pleasure to stay at Ivos's apartment. He was very friendly and provided all of the information we needed to easily arrive from the airport and to check in. <br/>The place is across the street from both S-Bahn and U-Bahn stations. It is so easy to get anywhere in Berlin from there. Take advantage of Alexanderplatz just one station away, which has everything you need for dining and entertainment. However, you also have a couple grocery stores just five minutes away from the apartment on foot. Very convenient!<br/>Most important: It was a pleasure to meet and to have a nice conversation with Ivos. He has so much to say about local and German history in general. You will also find him to be well-versed in English to discuss just about any topic. I hope you have the chance to converse with Ivos as we did.<br/>I would absolutely stay here again if I visit Berlin.",1,0.9833,Positive
