54.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,1,0.594795341020709,4.98,4.98,4.98,5.0,1190952177328173572,"Piero was a great host, friendly and welcoming. Made every effort to make me feel at home. He was proactive and checked my arrival times and gave clear instructions with pictures on how to get to the apartment. The apartment itself was a short distance away from the Berlin central station, just close enough to be convenient but also peaceful. The room and shower was spotless. Had all the amenities I was expecting. I highly recommend Piero’s place to anyone.",1,0.9459,Positive
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,1,4.168083698931513,4.83,4.86,4.66,4.71,499353,Sehr sauber und alles wie beschrieben. Kann ich nur weiterempfehlen für die nächste Reise nach Berlin. Auch die Kommunikation mit Karsten verlief tadellos und war sehr unkompliziert.,1,-0.9136,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,8.1954375367654,4.91,4.8,4.88,4.9,13542344,"Rebecca was a friendly host, good value stay! Would recommend to other travellers! Only thing to note is the fairly extensive flights of stairs without an elevator to the apartment.",1,0.8906,Positive
63.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,17,100.0,1,7.046080746237584,4.83,4.91,4.63,4.83,625702680054205813,Das Apartment sowie der dazugehörige Innenhof haben mir gefallen.<br/>Ich habe sehr wohl gefühlt und vielen Dank Mina für die herzliche Gastfreundschaft.,1,-0.5994,Negative
155.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,53,100.0,1,22.4451925277576,4.75,4.75,4.91,4.83,1871203,I very much enjoyed staying at Antje's. The apartment is in the most lovely green neighbourhood with easy access to the city centre. The place itself felt cozy and the bed is extremely comfortable!<br/>Antje is the most wonderful host and made me feel right at home. <br/>Very much recommended!,1,0.9513,Positive
130.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,1,2.669079881682033,4.97,4.98,4.84,4.86,26180749,Fantastic room and great location from everything. Enjoyed staying here a lot! Thank you,1,0.9299,Positive
144.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,22,100.0,1,1.3754293028724145,4.84,4.72,4.97,4.73,320279,"Le logement de Stamatis a un charme fou . Aménagé avec goût .<br/>Très calme  dans la verdure  dune cour intérieure. Si vous restez longtemps , ça manque  de rangements <br/>(et d’ustensiles de cuisine si vous êtes plus de 2.) <br/>Le quartier est vraiment sympa et le propriétaire  très réactif. un appartement que je recommande chaudement .",1,0.0,Neutral
