68.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,92.0,1,4.424176503712602,4.91,4.98,4.81,4.79,23298585,"Super appartement, idéalement situé",1,0.5994,Positive
117.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,0.6211895609232261,4.86,4.65,4.9,4.8,1175456528646587467,"We had such a great stay at Mohammed’s place in Berlin Alexanderplatz. The apartment was clean, comfortable, and in a perfect location for exploring the city — just steps away from everything we wanted to see and do.<br/>What really stood out to us though was Mohammed as a host. He was always responsive and friendly, and his communication made everything so much easier. We were late for check-in because the airport was extremely busy, but Mohammed was so patient and understanding. He regularly checked in with us while we were on the way, and reassured us that if we needed anything at all, he was only a message away. That really put us at ease after a long day of travel.<br/>Overall, the combination of a fantastic location and such a thoughtful host made our Berlin trip even more enjoyable. We would definitely stay here again and highly recommend Mohammed’s place to anyone visiting the city.",1,0.9902,Positive
199.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,1,3.7401902545858734,4.81,4.86,4.85,4.67,22354567,"A stylish apartment in a nice neighborhood. Grocery store, pharmacy, coffee shops all very close by. We’ve stayed as a group of 4, easily fit and had space. Had no problems from check in to check out thanks to Stephanie.",1,0.6908,Positive
106.0,4,0.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,0,8.110437312186143,4.35,4.33,4.85,4.34,27869754,Tout s’est bien passé! On reviendo surmènent pour un séjour à Berlin!,1,-0.2695,Negative
152.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,33,88.0,1,2.917681610337092,4.89,4.96,4.93,4.76,7526348,"neues, modernes, sauberes Apartment in günstiger ruhiger Lage<br/>Küche mit allen elektrischen Geräten<br/>gutes Bett, jedoch keine 2-teilige Matratze<br/>Bad mit Waschmaschine und hervorragender Dusche<br/>großer Flachbild-Fernseher<br/>Sternabzug, da die Einrichtung noch komplettiert werden muss:  z.B. Verbesserung der Beleuchtung, mehr Besteck und Geschirr, Wäscheschrank, Bilder im Wohnraum",1,-0.5994,Negative
