146.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,3.4636382799594605,4.66,4.79,4.58,4.56,322520,"We had some trouble with our flight and Alain and Kasia were so nice with us, they gave us quick answers to phone calls and emails.<br/>The apartment was exactly as described,and it is located in the noth side of Prenzlauerberg. Very quite neighborhood, nice outdoor garden, we find the snow. <br/>Easy access to public transports. We have a very good time there. ",1,0.8283,Positive
