125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,44,100.0,0,1.2761369708817447,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,815015167691794652,"This place was amazing. Great location right next to public transportation, on a private street with some of the most beautiful houses in Berlin, around the corner from a bustling shopping district, and within walking distance to museum island and Alexanderplatz. The apartment itself has everything you could ask for and it’s gorgeous and comfortable. Instructions were super easy to follow. I would absolutely stay here again, though I suspect Jannik will have to increase his prices in the future.",1,0.9804,Positive
