116.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,50,100.0,1,3.566348295049236,4.86,4.89,4.78,4.71,29403218,"Perfect for a short, quiet stay in Berlin! Not too close to the center but still walkable if you don’t mind a 30 minute stroll to Alexanderplatz. Otherwise, there are good transport options within a short walking distance. The apartment is clean and suitable for a single person or couple. Great communication from Berlina before and during our stay! Recommended.",1,0.9595,Positive
