67.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,31,100.0,1,0.7518298030804867,4.84,4.68,4.86,4.75,27120381,"Nice apartment located in a nice place. You can find S-bahn station, U-bahn station and bus stations near the apartment. You can get to all those stations on foot in 5 minutes. There is also a Netto Supermarket in front of the building. The apartment was clean and tidy, you can find almost everything you need in the apartment.  The appartment owner,Mr.Ivos, answered our questions  very fast and  gave us some guides and  suggestions about sightseeing in Berlin. Mr.Ivos also prepared some beer and mineral water in the refrigerator.In one word, we are quite satisfied with the apartment and the owner.",1,0.9061,Positive
