360.0,8,3.0,1.0,3.0,66,100.0,1,4.432978276429975,4.94,4.82,4.89,4.74,694871,"The appartment is as advertised, you feel right at home only in size XXL as per Berlin space parameters. It's a very functional, cosy appartment with enough space for 8 people if you don't mind camping in the ballroom style living room. F'hain is well connected and there is much to discover in the area from great food to shops to historic sights. Davide is very responsive and allowed for flexible check in when our plane was delayed. We had a great time and hope to be back !",0,0.9458,Positive
