231.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,66,93.0,1,0.5825226699456977,4.95,4.98,4.94,4.82,7831357,"We LOVED our stay at Boian’s place. Very quiet, next to a beautiful church . You first entered a beautiful garden. The place is spotless. The kitchen has everything you need. A very nice touch: nice complementary breakfast: croissant, jam, cheese. Great location: 2 minutes from the subway, tons of bike/scooters :also 2 minutes from the place. <br/>Tons of restaurants near by . Highly recommend it. We would definitely go back",1,0.9821,Positive
