54.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,15.507270682054347,4.96,4.99,4.64,4.92,17955217,"Sabine and Thomas are very nice, welcoming and friendly people. I arrived quite late, but Sabine met me and showed me around. You can use the kitchen for breakfast and coffee - the latter is very important to me because my eyes only open to coffee in the morning :) You are also offered plenty of tea to choose. The room is very clean, spacious and warm. I was very comfortable sleeping on the bed.<br/>Sabine and Thomas house is in a very quiet and cosy place, but you can easily get to the centre of Berlin. The tram stop is a 5 minute walk from the house.<br/>I highly recommend this place and would love to stay here again! 11/10",1,0.9874,Positive
