125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,0,2.8855724048621725,4.94,4.94,4.91,4.72,13993559,"Guido’s apartment was truly worthy of a five-star review. It was clean, well-located, well-appointed with amenities and had great high-speed wireless internet. Clearly this is a host who has taken time to think about and prepare for his guests’ needs. Basically it is almost a perfect place for two people. <br/>First, the location is very good: only a couple minutes walk from the U-Bahn and it is easily walkable to many sites including (of course) Checkpoint Charlie, Unter den Linden, the Brandenburg Gate, Museum Island, and many others. There’s a grocery on the same block, a variety places to eat nearby and of course Friedrichstrasse is right there for shopping if you need it.<br/>The apartment itself is quite nice, very well-appointed and very clean. Guido left us with a bottle of wine and a note welcoming us to the apartment (which was very welcome site upon arrival after a long travel day!). He also has a very thorough guidebook with basic instructions and information about the apartment and the surrounding areas including recommendations for food, etc. We also found up-to-date guide books for Berlin if you need to research places to see. Beyond that there were many nice touches such as slippers, robes and towels supplied that were more like a hotel quality than is typical in many AirBnb places. <br/>I’d also note that Guido was always very quick to answer all my questions before I got there, with information about the apartment and instructions on how to check in (which are also very thoroughly given in the “check in instructions” part of AirBnb) – the process was very easy and convenient with a doorman there to give you the keys and take them back at check out which avoided the need to coordinate a meeting time.<br/>Overall I would highly recommend Guido’s place – we cannot overstate how much we loved our stay there. We are already missing our sitting on the balcony sipping wine after a long day sightseeing, and would definitely love to stay here again.  I can assure you, if you stay here you will not be disappointed.",1,0.995,Positive
30.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,1,12.505820701969188,4.91,4.93,4.96,4.83,352998,"Ein tolles Zimmer mit Nutzungsmöglichkeiten der restlichen Wohnung. Da hat man das Gefühl, dass man allein in der Wohnung ist. Alles vorhanden, was man sich wünscht: Geschirrspühler, Badewanne, Waschmaschiene...",1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,14,100.0,0,1.7100291244883077,5.0,4.67,5.0,5.0,17901717,"Just one word : perfect. The flat is beautiful, clean, very very well located : the neighborhood is great, with a lot of parks, cafés, bars, restaurants etc. when had an amazing time, we didn't want to leave ! Isabel is a great host, she gave us a lot of information and was very reactive and helpful ",1,0.9822,Positive
309.0,6,3.0,2.0,5.0,32,100.0,1,6.934354434877142,4.93,4.92,4.62,4.75,14956202,"Excellent location to the main train station via bus and the U Bahn.   Large amount of space.  We'll equipped kitchen and large fridge.  The bathrooms are large. Everything appears newly renovated.  Originally had booked the place for 5 of us, but only 3 ended up coming. Probably too big for just three but we each got our own room. Washing machine worked well and nice to have a dishwasher.  A cute courtyard right outside the front door where only neighbors have access.    Not too many places to eat in the neighborhood, but there is a grocery store an 8 minute walk away that is huge.  Would definitely stay here again.",0,0.9595,Positive
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,2.0387590917028584,4.87,4.93,4.79,4.82,1146439,"Sin duda volveré a alojarme aquí, céntrico, cómodo, la terraza inmejorable, y la anfitriona increíble, un finde muy top<br/>Muchas gracias por todo",1,-0.5574,Negative
25.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,24,100.0,1,27.444278790292596,4.86,4.87,4.55,4.91,21448699,"La maison de Dirk est top ! Tout ce dont ont à besoin s’y trouve, la chambre est confortable et Dirk est vraiment super sympa et se fera un plaisir de vous guider pour visiter Berlin durant votre séjour ! Vraiment rien à dire, tout était parfait 👍 nous pensons même revenir car 3 jours c’est court pour visiter la capitale😜",1,0.3147,Positive
96.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,6.753647389093091,4.84,4.84,4.86,4.69,37703913,"Jederzeit wieder, super geräumig, gute Lage, nette Leute.",1,0.5994,Positive
78.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,6.919397234051426,4.88,4.91,4.49,4.76,21061308,"awesomeee, would definitely come back again",1,0.4019,Positive
