49.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,7.164956109377153,4.84,4.72,4.86,4.77,2154488,"Very nice and friendly host, always up for a small chat and sharing recommendations on foody spots (even offering to have sthg from his dinner and wine :)) or interesting sights to visit, how to reach there. Very nice Flat Ambiente, nice atmosphere. The bed was comfortable and the room was spacious. Location is really good, sight seeing spots easy to reach with public transport, nice restaurants, bars and cafes in the neighbourhood in walking distance. My partner and I  can recommend staying at Oliver's place. Only weak point for us was cleanyness, but apart of that, top.",1,0.9474,Positive
86.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,0,2.0121165061944306,4.85,4.75,4.9,4.78,6229070,"Wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt. Die Wohnung war schön, sauber und gut ausgestattet. Die Lage ist prima, die Umgebung ruhig. Die Kontaktaufnahme mit Katja war sehr gut. Ich kann die Wohnung gut weiterempfehlen.",1,-0.9823,Negative
218.0,6,3.0,2.0,6.0,36,100.0,1,3.003280992717941,4.82,4.78,4.83,4.62,14649703,"Lovely apartment in an excellent location. We enjoyed our stay and all the lovely details. Multiple supermarkets, restaurants etc close by.",0,0.9393,Positive
156.0,6,2.0,2.0,4.0,51,100.0,1,2.784593796049624,4.88,4.78,4.9,4.77,3378027,"Saubere Wohnung, netter Gastgeber, die Anreise war auch 22 Uhr noch möglich und alles war gut organisiert.<br/>Die Umgebung muss man lieben 😆",0,-0.9136,Negative
141.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,43,94.0,0,7.131273504704622,4.74,4.82,4.79,4.62,49070135,"Great place to stay in Berlin! <br/>Very nice location - walkable distance to the main shopping area and 100m. to the nearest subway.<br/>Very well organized check-in and check-out! A great benefit was the luggage storage option located in the building, which allowed us to have a great time in the city while waiting for our late flight with no need to carry all our stuffs with us.<br/>I highly recommend it to everyone who is visiting Berlin!",1,0.9708,Positive
284.0,8,3.0,1.0,4.0,42,100.0,0,10.473236697919464,4.68,4.95,4.95,4.79,1172248683526256301,"Tobias’s place is impeccable and the location is fantastic. The apartment is very well appointed, with everything one would need for a short stay. I highly recommend.",0,0.831,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,36,100.0,0,0.7567571024449841,4.81,4.96,4.84,4.66,493539,"It was a great place to stay. Perfect location (easy to everywhere), friendly and great host ( and very accomodative), beautiful apartment (good space for 2 people). <br/>I would definitely stay again there if i come to Berlin in the future and will recommend to my friends who will visit Berlin too:)",1,0.981,Positive
248.0,8,3.0,1.0,7.0,28,100.0,0,1.9204539822657205,4.62,4.62,4.9,4.52,6708791,"Simple, but great apartment! There's enough space for eight people and it's at a great location in Prenzlauerberg which was easy to reach via public transport! ",0,0.9577,Positive
119.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,8,100.0,0,0.630563338345305,4.5,3.5,5.0,4.5,812164857012178054,"Ubicación perfecta, todo cerca y lo que no está cerca es de súper fácil acceso porque Alexanderplatz está  a una distancia caminable sin ningún problema.<br/> Espacio espacioso, lleno de luz y ventilación. <br/>Lo único que hace falta es un microondas.<br/>Está al nivel de la calle entonces si eso te incomoda puede ser un problema, pero la verdad es que vale la pena completamente. La habitación se oscurece bastante entonces a pesar de que el departamento está bien iluminado dormir no es un problema.",1,-0.6808,Negative
