52.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,39,100.0,1,15.393245393425294,5.0,4.98,4.89,4.97,1056422879991854914,"Flawless accommodation, definitely the top choice for staying in Berlin. You’ll be greeted by the adorable little host, Tilli, who is very well-behaved and cute. Communication with Sigrid was also perfect. All in all, a perfect place to stay!",1,0.9721,Positive
