86.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,1,5.82073416379732,4.8,4.89,4.75,4.67,38389171,"Die schönste Airbnb-Wohnung in der wir je waren. Alles sehr schön eingerichtet, blitzsauber und es gibt alles, was man unteranderem zum Kochen braucht. <br/>Die Lage ist top, die Haltestelle ist direkt vor der Haustür und man kann alles schnell erreichen. <br/>In Nähe ist direkt der Weißensee, wo man sich sehr gut abkühlen kann. <br/>Wir werden auf jeden Fall nochmal wiederkommen!",1,-0.807,Negative
79.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,1,9.403941552737663,4.88,4.74,4.84,4.8,17071054,Arne's place was a wonderful stay with a beautiful terrace all the way around the apartment. It's got everything you need and Arne went above and beyond to accommodate us during check in and check out. The bed is especially comfortable. 10/10!,1,0.9097,Positive
67.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,0,2.434879564495849,4.92,4.99,4.84,4.78,929504337506547670,"Exactly as described. Very close to U bahn to get anywhere I wanted. Extremely clean room, kitchen and bathroom and a lovely shower. Check in instructions clear and easy to understand. Host always responded quickly and let me drop my bags before check in and gave me flexibility with check in....if I return to Berlin I will be staying there again.",1,0.9117,Positive
95.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,1,3.2655381260982392,4.91,4.87,4.87,4.82,456902,great apartment in a fantastic area of berlin. a great base for exploring.,1,0.9153,Positive
120.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,46,100.0,1,9.29605165579442,4.73,4.85,4.66,4.6,3047076,"Fai’s apartment was a lovely quiet little retreat in the city! Super comfortable beds and bedding, well equipped kitchen, and big windows in every room. We’d been traveling a while so the laundry in the apartment was so welcome. Wonderful bathtub and shower too!<br/>Easy to pick up anything you might need in the neighborhood.<br/>We appreciated the parking spot too, which is quite a premium in Berlin! <br/>We would definitely stay here again! Highly recommended.<br/>-Minnesota Travelers",1,0.9828,Positive
159.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,91.0,0,4.861047682375263,4.57,4.61,4.83,4.48,53744429,Nous avons passé deux autres très bonnes nuits. <br/>Merci à nouveau pour cette chambre plus qu’agréable,1,0.0,Neutral
149.0,5,1.0,1.0,2.0,8,81.0,0,6.714128192155476,4.17,4.26,4.03,4.17,1223091910763945275,"Cool, dass das Geschirr gespült wurde :)",1,0.6486,Positive
127.0,7,3.0,1.0,4.0,41,100.0,0,4.334292034577571,4.7,4.56,4.77,4.71,1159572,"Ralph's apartment is very well situated and ideal for a group. We had a lot of space, the beds were comfy, the kitchen well-equipped and very clean. The place is near some of the busiest and most exciting streets of Kreuzberg, and yet it is quiet, since separated from the street by a pretty communal garden. Communication with Ralph was easy and friendly, and our host proved flexible when it turned out we would arrive later than expected because of a train strike! Definitely recommended!",0,0.9778,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,7,100.0,0,5.5944688239813125,4.71,4.14,4.52,4.67,42673754,Schöne Wohnung und zentral gelegen. Bei Fragen habe ich auch immer schnell eine Antwort bekommen. Super!,1,0.636,Positive
76.0,4,1.0,1.5,2.0,60,100.0,1,3.624198275329287,4.85,4.91,4.81,4.69,2137277,We had a fantastic stay at this apartment in Berlin. It is located very central with lots of restaurants (e.g. nice & authentic italian resutaurant acrros the street) and easy connections to the metro. The handover was super smooth and the host was extremly friendly and flexible! Would recommend this place any time and use it again if back in Berlin.,1,0.9642,Positive
80.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,56,100.0,1,2.2102820475445166,4.85,4.82,4.88,4.76,3904895,"L'appartamento di Carolina e Athena è molto accogliente, silenzioso e si trova in un quartiere di grande atmosfera. Il trasporto pubblico è molto efficiente e permette di raggiungere qualunque zona in maniera ottimale. Athena è stata precisa e disponibile.",1,0.0,Neutral
71.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,3.4038368703672583,4.94,4.88,4.96,4.77,795738568541225211,"Chris is very friendly, place is clean, in really quiet neighborhood so we slept really well, sunny, spacious room in really good location. Apartment has nice old vibe to it, we really enjoyed it's ambience. It's 4th floor so reconcider taking up something heavy :D you can park on the street but there is parking meter and it's quite expensive. We'd come back for sure.",1,0.9392,Positive
291.0,7,3.0,2.0,4.0,44,100.0,1,11.632050742075618,4.76,4.71,4.78,4.66,1185362314531639408,"Great apartment, very high ceiling, lot of space. Fantastic bath tube and very nicely designed bedrooms. Amazing time with friends in Berlin!",0,0.9589,Positive
95.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,36,100.0,0,3.2861856977959745,4.78,4.58,4.85,4.65,21812927,"The apartment was easy to find, public transport stops were close by, walking distance from a mall, lots of restaurants and convenience stores nearby.<br/>The apartment was easily accessible, very clean with a lot of amenities. Would stay here again.",1,0.7713,Positive
298.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,23,80.0,0,5.367401987126061,4.93,4.9,4.87,4.7,29452996,"Our stay at Julien was really great. The apartment is big and really nicely furnished. Julien was easy to communicate with, replies quickly and gave us some good tips. Would deff. recommend.",1,0.9421,Positive
130.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,97.0,0,2.148340982642172,4.79,4.66,4.9,4.69,13838662,Sehr nett und modern mit einer zentralen Lage,1,0.0,Neutral
52.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,1,11.309392358305647,4.93,4.97,4.56,4.89,19215782,Susanne has a lovely family and a great place. It is in a quiet neighborhood and close to public transportation. I highly recommend her!,1,0.8997,Positive
71.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,1,6.977890672359348,4.97,4.87,4.86,4.89,26176334,"Eine ganz tolle und gemütliche Wohnung. Libor haben wir nicht persönlich kennengelernt, aber die Kommunikation war problemlos möglich. Hier kann man ruhig wohnen und ist schnell im Trubel, wenn man möchte. Absolut empfehlenswert und zurecht ist Libor ein Superhost! Wir haben uns selten so wohlgefühlt! Vielen Dank!",1,-0.865,Negative
98.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,1,3.617893966015014,4.71,4.68,4.85,4.56,43466060,Die Wohnung ist sehr sauber & der Check-In sehr unkompliziert.,1,-0.5994,Negative
214.0,9,3.0,1.0,5.0,48,100.0,0,2.4338131448817624,4.69,4.67,4.71,4.58,23290410,"The apartment was good, clean, well furnished with all amenities available. Location was also convenient 2 mins walking distance from a tram stop and a supermarket is right under the building. <br/>Only thing a bit annoying was the bed making squeaking sound.<br/>Awesome host and great hospitality.",0,0.7845,Positive
240.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,24,100.0,1,2.3728458862090056,4.89,4.44,4.94,4.78,20599550,"In one word Amazing! The apartment itself is beautiful, neat and large. It’s perfect for a family with two children as there is a parent’s room and an attached children room with two beds (on top of each other). There is a large saloon with a very comfortable sofa, a study room with a Piano (my daughter loved it) and large kitchen. Location is also excellent and you can get to the many beautiful sites in Berlin either walking or by the exceptionally great and practical public transport system which is easy to use with Google maps + BVG app to pay for tickets. There are lots of restaurants and coffee shops, bakeries and supermarkets nearby making it easy to by your own groceries. The host Anselm is great and responsive and made the checkin and checkout a seamless experience. I would come here again.",0,0.9937,Positive
158.0,4,0.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,1,1.6592287277224604,4.94,4.96,4.92,4.77,39476966,"The apartment was spot on, very well appointed and as described.<br/>Check-in<br/>The check-in was easy with Besimon (Sascha) touching base with us prior to the time and date of our arrival. <br/>Upon arrival, we used our personalized code to get in the main door and met Sascha in the lobby. We were 15 minutes ahead but he told us our apartment was ready so we went upstairs with our luggage. <br/>Apartment<br/>The apartment was sparkling clean. It was super well appointed with everything we needed during our 2 night stay. The bed was comfortable and the linen was fresh. There was soap, shampoo, conditioner and a blow dryer. <br/>The kitchen has everything you need and they supply excellent coffee for the coffee maker. <br/>Location<br/>The location is away from the downtown core but fantastic. We visited Berlin because we wanted to see the Christmas markets. We found one of the best around the corner beside the Rewe grocery store. Very nice and quaint. Awesome Glüwein. <br/>Parking<br/>We rented a car so we had to find parking. You can pay for on street parking however it’s costly and it doesn’t last long. No overnight on the street. Sascha recommended that we park in the underground car park at the Rewe.  Literally 5 minutes walk. I grabbed an apple danish at the bakery downstairs from the apartment on Choriner Straße. <br/>All in all it was fantastic!!! Thank you Bensimon.",1,0.9965,Positive
68.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,73,100.0,1,6.733273632528371,5.0,5.0,4.77,4.89,720326339580032003,"Anna is by far one of the best hosts I’ve ever had as a traveler.<br/>She was very responsive and communicative.<br/>My bedroom was pristine clean and very quiet with a balcony, and you will naturally awake with the sunrise.<br/>The apartment is incredibly well equipped.<br/>Also it’s 10 min away from  U6 Alt Tempelhof (or 1 min with bus 46/246) which was very convient for me because I was on a business trip and my office was at U6 KochStrasse Charlie Checkpoint.<br/>Her daughters were so funny, I would try to practice my German and they would try to practice their French.<br/>This Airbnb doesn’t have a lot of reviews because it’s quite new on the platform but it deserves only great comments!<br/>Vielen Dank Anna! Bis nächste mal!",1,0.9427,Positive
324.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,45,100.0,1,9.311365506589608,4.88,4.8,4.92,4.8,1317987912508199007,"Nur zum Empfehlen.Wenn ich 50 Sterne geben könnte,würde ich gegeben.genau sowie Fotos und Beschreibung.zu erst;Der Team waren wirklich sehr nett und freundlich und erreichbar.dort war wirklich topp und sauber.ich muss noch mehrere mal nach Berlin fahren und übernachten,ich werde nur dort buchen.meine Frau und Kinder sind sehr zufrieden gewesen.neben Citycenter.preis ist dafür sehr günstig.<br/>Vielen dank Florian.👍👍👍🙏🙏🙏",1,-0.1779,Negative
199.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,1,3.7401902545858734,4.81,4.86,4.85,4.67,22354567,"Appartement bien situé dans le quartier Mitte, proche du métro, même si nous avons choisi d’explorer la ville à pied! Instructions claires envoyées par l’hôte mais la serrure de la porte d’entrée est un peu difficile. Petit supermarché à proximité très pratique. L’appartement est en rdc mais très calme car il donne dans la cour intérieure. Superbe deco, les murs foncés de la pièce principale donnent une belle ambiance mais il est vrai que cela assombri bien la pièce…",1,0.0,Neutral
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,64,100.0,0,25.690983978590776,4.83,4.83,4.63,4.65,13276162,"Wir wurden sehr herzlich empfangen. Anja ist eine sehr nette und freundliche Gastgeberin. <br/>Die neuwertige Wohnung ist sehr geschmackvoll eingerichtet und hat alles was man sich wünschen kann. <br/>Die Lage der Wohnung war für unsere Zwecke optimal, sehr ruhig und reichlich Parkplätze vorhanden. Es gibt viele Restaurants in der Umgebung in denen man lecker essen gehen kann. Einkaufsmöglichkeiten um die Ecke...<br/>Auf alle Fälle kann ich die Wohnung nur empfehlen und werde definitiv beim nächsten Berlin-Aufenthalt  wieder bei Anja anfragen. <br/>Vielen Dank und bis zum nächsten Mal. ",1,-0.8807,Negative
114.0,6,1.0,1.0,4.0,22,99.0,0,4.269791856144701,4.74,4.65,4.5,4.68,28378483,"She was very accesible, the place was how it explained. Thank you,",1,0.3612,Positive
