95.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,16,83.0,1,6.99392009423186,4.94,4.88,4.44,4.69,33035580,"We loved our stay at Anja and Phillip's place in Berlin!  The bed and bedding were the nicest, most comfortable we've ever slept on.  The floors were beautiful and the space was easy to live in.  The bathroom and kitchen were both small but functional.  As far as the location, the place was accessible by walking or public transportation pretty much anywhere we wanted to go.  Highly recommend the space and the hosts.  Thank you!",1,0.9685,Positive
