64.0,1,1.0,1.5,1.0,22,90.0,1,2.376576622396677,4.94,4.83,4.93,4.74,4515108,"I couldn't have wished for a more homely place to stay. Lilia messaged me regularly to check that everything was ok, plus the other flatmates were super friendly and made me feel really comfortable.<br/><br/>The room itself was great, as was the rest of the apartment. Really well looked after and the kitchen had everything I could have needed.<br/><br/>Location was ideal, generally very quiet but only a short walk from shops, restaurants, bars, etc.<br/><br/>My two weeks here were part of a bigger, permanent, move to Berlin from London and the girls living here were more than willing to offer some advice on the move and even contact friends regarding rooms available in the city.<br/><br/>Thanks for everything guys!",1,0.9463,Positive
