125.0,1,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,0,1.361819974744174,5.0,4.95,5.0,4.9,678627636478047083,"I really enjoyed my stay at Edith’s place! The apartment is so cozy, and has everything you need. The location is also great! The neighborhood is very nice, and a tram station is 2 minutes away, which makes it super easy to get around the city. I would love to stay here again the next time I’m in Berlin 😊",1,0.9731,Positive
