64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,100.0,0,12.628755326388792,4.8,4.87,4.64,4.73,24755176,"Ein sehr nettes Pärchen und ein schönes, grosses Zimmer, mit allem was man braucht. Schön war, dass es trotz Flughafennähe so ruhig war. Der Bus und die Ubahn sind schnell zu erreichen. Wir würden auf jeden Fall wieder kommen. :-)",1,-0.9042,Negative
77.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,15,100.0,0,3.4964511140018613,5.0,4.79,5.0,4.71,36961808,"Super friendly and welcoming hosts. The spacious and beautiful flat is perfectly located at the Maybachufer. Thanks for a great, but little too short, stay.",1,0.9194,Positive
100.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,28,100.0,1,11.636737821099295,4.66,4.8,4.82,4.47,42958725,"Good location. There's even a farmer's market on Saturdays at the park next to it. Plenty of restaurants to choose from. Room was good size. They have cribs and baby chairs if you need it. Unfortunately, for check-in, there was a typo for the code they sent by email and had trouble getting the key. The parking was actually smaller than they said (1.5m not 1.65m) so we couldn't park there after all. However, the staff was very helpful in helping us solve these issues. So thank you for that!",1,0.8791,Positive
45.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,2.0393793505131024,4.86,4.76,4.96,4.79,24446063,"Emily's room is in a very strategic position in Berlin! It is small but it is what you need, pretty cozy! We had a good communication for a small issue which Emily immediately fixed, she is very kind and discrete person. Highly reccomended!",1,0.9439,Positive
196.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,94.0,0,7.131273504704622,4.71,4.75,4.8,4.44,49087222,Das Appartement ist modern und sauber!<br/>Außerdem mit tollen Pflegeprodukten ausgestattet.<br/>Die Lage direkt an der U-Bahn war sehr praktisch. Wir haben uns dort mit zwei Kindern und einem Baby wohlgefühlt!,1,-0.6688,Negative
172.0,8,2.0,1.0,4.0,31,100.0,1,2.87994778280774,4.8,4.75,4.88,4.73,30295,"Sehr zuverlässige und freundliche Kommunikation, die Lage der Wohnung ist super und trotz EG-Lage sehr ruhig.<br/>Kommen gerne wieder.",0,0.0,Neutral
145.0,6,2.0,2.5,4.0,43,100.0,1,1.8267932703234075,4.89,4.74,4.92,4.82,48864380,"Super Lage! Für alle, die Kreativität, Gemütlichkeit und Komfort schätzen. Alles nützliches war dabei. Schlafen war bequem und ruhig. Check-in (-out) kontaktlos und top organisiert. Kommunikation  angenehm und schnell. Gern wieder zurück!  100%  Empfehlung.",0,-0.8217,Negative
