119.0,3,1.0,1.0,3.0,46,100.0,0,2.732563225420117,4.88,4.92,4.95,4.68,1381111432966242413,"Marcus's apartment was fantastic. Very close to multiple trains, it was very easy to get around the city and to the airport. The apartment was very well maintained and everything was as listed. Prenzlauer Berg was a great place neighborhood to stay in with lots of food, drinks and weekend markets. Will definitely be back!",1,0.9458,Positive
98.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,56,100.0,0,2.73390633012658,4.56,4.63,4.78,4.41,1236647235229544763,good host,1,0.4404,Positive
316.0,8,3.0,2.0,4.0,45,100.0,1,1.2937250483136316,4.73,4.76,4.9,4.61,12048269,"Die Wohnung ist sehr schön, hell und groß. Es war alles wie erwartet, außer ein paar Kleinigkeiten. Zum Beispiel war bei einer Dusche der Schlauch defekt, sodass nur sehr wenig Wasser herauskam. Alles in allem aber gerade durch die Lage eine sehr schöne Wohnung.",0,-0.969,Negative
65.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,1,7.994559142347801,4.97,4.98,4.82,4.93,22154155,"I cannot say enough about René’s wonderful tiny home!   René went above and beyond to make our experience comfortable and enjoyable.  His tiny home is spotless and built and designed with care.  He took the time to give us a tour of the home and all the features he’d added and was thinking of adding in the future as well.  We live in a tiny house in California and enjoyed hearing about Berlin’s solar power details and seeing René’s chickens and garden.  The value of the home and experience were more than expected on their own... but René also made us a fresh, home-made Breakfast with delicious bread and home-made jam before he left for work.  We would highly recommend this place to friends and love to come back ourselves in the future.",1,0.9871,Positive
57.0,3,1.0,1.5,1.0,27,100.0,0,13.88836515577706,4.52,4.52,4.65,4.45,9572022,"Спасибо большое за прекрасные и удобные апартаменты! Все было чисто, уютно и в удобном месте возле красивого парка!",1,0.0,Neutral
193.0,6,2.0,1.0,5.0,42,100.0,1,0.601371120108,4.76,4.63,4.94,4.73,4335533,"Warm welcome bij Rainer. Nice, clean, modern apartment. Space enough for us, family with two young adults. Good location, nearby   Alexanderplatz and Hackesche Hofe. Next time in Berlin, we'll come back!",0,0.9117,Positive
68.0,4,2.0,1.0,6.0,47,100.0,1,4.1789972800781685,4.59,4.64,4.79,4.58,255722,"Voor deze prijs gewoon een heel goede plek om Berlijn te verkennen! Douche en toilet zijn tevens doorgang naar slaapkamers met eettafel. Sanitair derhalve iets minder privé, maar geen probleem als je elkaar kent. Metro en reastaurantjes op loopafstand",0,-0.4199,Negative
