65.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,16,100.0,1,3.0069422642949752,4.7,4.9,4.89,4.66,6220902,"This is a perfect spot for exploring Berlin. It's in a nice part of Kreuzberg, where I felt safe walking around even at night. A beautiful neighbourhood, on the river, with many cafés and restaurants nearby. The room is comfortable and the view on the garden makes it feel extra quiet.",1,0.9485,Positive
72.0,2,0.0,1.0,3.0,40,100.0,0,7.593507322759444,4.7,4.67,4.88,4.72,19742792,"El apartamento es perfecto. Limpio cómodo y muy bien situado. Jens, el chico que entrega las llaves genial. Tuve un problema con una llave que me solucionó inmediatamente. Sin duda volveré y lo recomiendo.",1,0.128,Positive
