61.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,1,11.325351758285516,4.84,4.94,4.75,4.71,705101312287374560,Ulf is a really nice and friendly person. He’d make tea for me every morning by a simple question. It’s a quiet and nice place to be.,1,0.8641,Positive
74.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,100.0,1,4.427630272877027,4.0,5.0,5.0,4.0,45331964,"I stayed at this apartment for 3 months to experience Berlin and to improve my German. Apart from the lockdown that started 7 weeks into my stay, I had a great time. <br/>The apartment is very close to good transport links. It's easy to get east, west and central using the tram. A supermarket is also around the corner and an organic supermarket within in 10 minute walk and a bakery and pharmacy nearby. But, on Sundays, the supermarkets don't open - I was not used to that - but that seems to be the German way. There is also a fantastic pizza place about 15 minutes walk away towards Anton Platz and a few other decent takeaways.<br/>Inside the apartment it was exactly as the photos showed. Everything was pretty comfy and it had more or less everything I needed. I had two small issues whilst I was there which the host solved pretty quickly. As a woman traveling alone, I felt very safe here and the whole area was quiet and respectable.<br/>I would absolutely recommend staying here as it's comfortable, clean, surrounded by amenities and the landlord was very responsive.<br/>My German still needs work..!",1,0.9902,Positive
138.0,6,3.0,1.0,3.0,35,100.0,0,2.22949047167734,4.65,4.88,4.77,4.46,1203863255601523466,"We were very happy with the place, it was very spacious for three people. The surroundings were a bit noisy during the weekend night, but that's Kreuzberg.",0,0.2838,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,43,100.0,0,4.706237947682096,4.82,4.71,4.78,4.76,5669402,"This is a beautiful apartment that completes any stay in Berlin. Located in a central location, it's bright atmosphere made our time there very pleasant.<br/><br/>Our host was incredible and would recommend her an her apartment to our friends.",1,0.9432,Positive
45.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,13,100.0,1,6.509304433578063,4.89,4.88,4.77,4.84,24764185,"Amazing cozy place with creative atmosphere. <br/>Comfortable location : between two underground stations U-Bahn, near  train stop S-Bahn and bus stop.<br/>So soft and big bed.<br/>My airplane was in the evening. After checkout Angela kindly allowed  to leave my luggage and pick it up before evening departure.",1,0.8176,Positive
86.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,6.919397234051426,4.86,4.88,4.51,4.74,20942536,We had a great time in Berlin! Babett was an amazing host who responded quickly to any questions we had. The apartment was bold and stylish. A+ experience!,1,0.9018,Positive
