135.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,47,99.0,1,3.1208071542921334,4.89,4.79,4.77,4.59,34271196,"My partner and I stayed in this small, concrete, studio apartment for a few nights. It’s pretty small, sterile, and felt a bit pricey for what it was. <br/>That said, the space was functional and we appreciated the walkable location. The kitchen was fairly bare-bones (salt but no pepper) but we were able to cook a few meals. We worked remotely during our stay and the WiFi worked just fine. <br/>Matthew and his team were friendly, accommodating, and very responsive. For example when we asked for a second key we were able to get one without any problem.",1,0.9264,Positive
