322.0,4,2.0,2.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,5.688568840331838,4.85,4.98,4.46,4.76,1117418824135366013,"Amazing place! <br/>The two bedrooms are at opposite ends of the huge loft area. <br/>The 2nd bedroom has a shower/sink inside, restroom outside. <br/>The loft has another shower/restroom. The apartment was perfect for us, we were two couples. <br/>There are dark blinds on the bedroom doors and roof windows, so you can sleep very well and there is privacy.<br/>The glass doors don't insulate sound but there is a nice Sonos speaker in the loft :) The concrete floor is obviously cold, so get some thick socks in winter :)<br/>The team provided me with extremely clear instructions how to get in and a cute little greeting - thank you!<br/>I would definitely stay there again, it was really lovely!!!",0,0.9904,Positive
