84.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,1,3.2375488184892025,4.89,4.92,4.88,4.83,41651093,"Carsten's place was quite comfortable, as I hoped it would be. I felt as if I were a visitor, not a ""tourist."" The neighborhood has much to offer. I had planned on buying a multi-day BVG (public transport) ticket, but there were so many things to do within walking distance that I only needed tickets to and from the airport.",1,0.4987,Positive
163.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,91.0,0,4.871252294318258,4.67,4.78,4.87,4.53,46864858,"This was my last stop of the Europe trip and probably the worse experience. Check in was confusing, housekeeper was so rude, they also start vacuuming right outside of your door at 6am in the morning. One day the elevator was not working I had to wait in the rain for 30 minutes for them to just reply to me through messages. <br/>Just don’t stay there",1,-0.8769,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,52,100.0,1,3.905291406003432,4.99,5.0,4.94,4.96,17731812,"Es hat alles super geklappt und Sylvia war eine tolle Gastgeberin. Ich war sehr dankbar, dass ich an so einem schönen und netten Ort übernachten konnte. Ich fand das Zimmer richtig gross, das Bett voll bequem und alles war total sauber. Das Badezimmer war richtig cute und die Küche total gemütlich. Sylvia hat mich richtig zu Hause fühlen lassen.",1,-0.9493,Negative
