63.0,2,1.0,0.0,1.0,36,100.0,1,4.697448788448945,4.76,4.59,4.76,4.71,31356953,"Mohammad is very nice and is full of good recommendations! we only stayed two nights, but he gave us a list of all the best things to see and do while in the city! public transport is fairly close by and everything you need is within walking distance.",1,0.8855,Positive
