125.0,5,2.0,1.0,2.0,17,100.0,0,4.720437320842506,4.85,4.9,4.7,4.75,554693813476271719,"Alice’s place was everything we needed. It was perfect for three girls, it will be nice for a family too. Alice provided us a list to places to go, which was very helpful and also a list of notes about what to do with her place. It was easy to understand and her taste was definitely above my expectation! I would recommend her place to anyone. I enjoyed Berlin even more, thanks to her and her family! 😃",1,0.9744,Positive
