99.0,5,1.0,1.0,6.0,32,100.0,1,3.8990004161325023,4.79,4.65,4.94,4.79,39931462,"I stayed at Tia's place over a 3 month period and had a great time there. The apartment is nice and spacious with most things you need, and Tia was always quick to help if I needed something. Also, the area around the apartment is great. I can highly recommend the apartment.",1,0.9628,Positive
102.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,39,100.0,1,8.094404344978152,4.79,4.8,4.73,4.75,35116312,The place was great -  a beautiful tiny home. The host also provided a very good tradition German breakfast for us. We enjoyed breakfast outside on the porch every day and it was very lovely. It is ~10 min walk to the tram stop that can take you anywhere. There are some great parks and restaurants nearby as well.,1,0.9738,Positive
152.0,7,2.0,1.5,4.0,40,100.0,0,4.137113996689438,4.71,4.62,4.63,4.59,1150006272268927007,"Andrej è un host gentile e premuroso. La casa è nuova, in posizione comodissima per i mezzi e in un quartiere molto vivo. particolarmente bella la zona del lungocanale, a pochi passi da casa.",0,0.0,Neutral
