20.0,6,1.0,0.0,6.0,21,100.0,0,3.818785253820972,4.47,4.45,4.56,4.55,30759237,Sunflower is located in a great spot - a quiet street but very close to tons of neat things to explore and the train station will get you anywhere within a few minutes. <br/>I had a tiny penis drawn on my sheets. I thought it was kind of funny but someone else might not. <br/>I had a nice experience here and I would recommend to anyone looking to meet people and explore Friedrichshain and Kreuzberg :),1,0.935,Positive
