38.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,0,8.794289797931516,4.8,4.74,4.67,4.84,35396598,The stay at Mike's was really nice. The room is quite spacious and is its own separate unit. It feels more like a studio apartment. Everything was really clean and well organized and comfortable. Mike was also really response and gave tons of great recommendations for what to do around the area as well as which food places to visit.,1,0.9638,Positive
