77.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,50,100.0,1,3.172543311051877,4.97,4.93,4.94,4.94,4045063,"Thor and Sara were great hosts for my weekend in Berlin! Before my arrival Thor provided ample information about the flat, how to get there and made sure everything was clear for me! Upon arrival I met Sara who was super sweet and welcoming, I immediately felt comfortable! The place was great, great neighborhood- lots to do within walking distance but also close to lots of public transport. Absolutely recommend :)",1,0.9767,Positive
