39.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,31,100.0,1,23.901689384127245,4.91,4.91,4.44,4.88,26841304,"Jürgen was very nice and provided us all informations (about location, what public transport use..., about check in/out...) His place is nice and very clean. Big kitchen and very nice garden. Location is a bit far from city centre, but conection with Sbahn is good and it was totally worth it. Me and my girlfriend had a great time.",1,0.9608,Positive
