118.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,18,93.0,0,2.315150552188887,4.79,4.73,4.74,4.68,16821725,En trevlig och rymlig lägenhet som motsvarade beskrivningen mycket bra. Den ligger dock i ett ganska slitet område där det inte finns så mycket att göra. Vi kan rekommendera ett besök på den italienska restaurangen som ligger på bottenvåningen i huset bredvid.,1,0.0,Neutral
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,0,9.066139233924318,4.71,4.55,4.68,4.77,31441468,"El alojamiento de Peter fue correcto, la habitación es grande, la cama cómoda, si abres la ventana si se escucha mucho el ruido de la carretera pero cerrada es totalmente insonorizada, lo del cementerio es anecdótico y no hay porque preocuparse, peor es lo del ascensor... La ubicación aunque no es céntrica, está bien comunicada ya que tiene muy cerca paradas de buses, metro y cercanías",1,-0.5267,Negative
334.0,6,3.0,2.0,3.0,62,100.0,1,1.4069254616129323,4.84,4.94,4.85,4.74,991825698983910455,This is a beautiful modern apartment that easily slept our family group of 6 people. There is a large balcony right on the Spree river. We watched the sun go down on the balcony a couple of nights. Bathrooms are modern. Everything is high quality. <br/>The apartment is right on top of the Berlin wall... it was amazing to arrive and realize we are living right on top of the Berlin wall.  <br/>You can walk in 8 minutes to the Uber arena area where there are lots of restaurants and shops. <br/>The 300 bus takes you right into the center and passes every 10 minutes.,0,0.9136,Positive
132.0,10,3.0,2.0,5.0,33,100.0,0,7.056211941715301,4.58,4.36,4.67,4.52,1055700373321607221,"Good communication, and the place was as described. The only but was they missed to provide some pillow covers; we shared with them and apologised. Overall good experience!",0,0.7901,Positive
163.0,3,1.0,0.0,3.0,16,100.0,0,1.6522173823377917,4.49,4.47,4.62,4.35,44590435,"We had a great stay! The room was very nice and spotlessly clean. At first, we were a little unsure about the shared bathrooms, but they turned out to be super clean and private - just a room with shower for yourself. The location is fantastic—just a few stops from Alexanderplatz, surrounded by cozy coffee shops, great brunch spots, wine bars, and more. You really get to experience the authentic Berlin community vibe here. We loved it!",1,0.9806,Positive
143.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,90.0,1,11.510851452846596,4.75,4.76,4.8,4.54,699809535745814134,Fantastic place to stay in Berlin for work or pleasure. Location and room were superb and tech platform was easy to use and follow! The folks behind Numa have built a great technology in hospitality.,1,0.9622,Positive
140.0,6,3.0,1.0,3.0,33,80.0,0,5.000489879771975,4.73,4.64,4.8,4.7,5426613,"This is a very nice apartment equip with all facilities for an extended stay. It is well located in an area that comes alive at night and is surrounded by reasonably priced restaurants and bars frequented by a predominantly young clientele. There is a good supermarket near by and it is very convenient for Berlin's excellent transport system.  S Bahn, U Bahn, buses and trams will get you anywhere in Berlin swiftly.<br/>Communication with Anders is easy and his warden was waiting to meet and greet us with the key as promised.<br/>Thanks Anders. Us oldies had a great time!",0,0.9719,Positive
88.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,0,2.53024719414614,4.61,4.48,4.94,4.58,825927326336386111,El apartamento está en Mitte pero en un barrio muy tranquilo.<br/>Transporte público muy cerca.<br/>Nos ha encantado la zona.<br/>Es un apartamento independiente y  cuenta con una pequeña cocina que ha sido muy útil.,1,0.5859,Positive
160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,87.0,0,3.4802565088356308,4.54,4.54,4.6,4.41,43798011,"Unser Aufenthalt im Nena Apartment war gut. Das Zimmer war sehr sauber, die Lage zentral. Die Heizung hat bestens funktioniert, was bei den kalten Temperaturen sehr angenehm war. Das Badezimmer hat unangenehm gerochen, sonst haben wir nichts auszusetzen.",1,-0.9661,Negative
89.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,36,100.0,0,9.11699498371026,4.86,4.78,4.91,4.79,21959228,The best AirBnb i had! Great place ideal for couples.<br/>Really worth the money: very clean few restaurants around and very close to the KaDeWe...book it!,1,0.953,Positive
115.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,1,3.478761427822,4.86,4.92,4.94,4.58,26616955,"Great stay. Basic studio, but everything you need in a cool pied-a-terre; I really loved the little courtyard and had coffee out there every morning. A peaceful retreat. Great location: hip place in a hip neighbourhood.",1,0.9762,Positive
