137.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,1,2.759966591003808,4.94,4.92,4.94,4.81,768616,"Just got back home tonight from Berlin and we miss it already. Our family of 4 with a baby and toddler found this apartment to be perfect for a family with or without young children. The neighborhood has lots to offer for children. It was close to public transportation, restaurants, and supermarkets. <br/>The apartment exceeds the description. We would definitely stay here again if visiting Berlin and recommend it! ",1,0.8221,Positive
