85.0,6,2.0,1.0,5.0,23,100.0,0,9.797881642408234,4.61,4.56,4.65,4.52,7963887,Jörn was very responsive to questions we had leading up to our arrival.  The flat was exactly as described in the description.  The flat was located across the street from a U Bahn station which made it extremely convenient to base ourselves at this location and travel around the city.  There are plenty of shops and restaurants within a 5 minute walk.   There is even a great bakery around the corner from the flat.  Check in and check out was smooth and easy!  We would stay here again when in Berlin.,1,0.8775,Positive
