48.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,8.38062533349986,4.75,4.84,4.54,4.67,22318827,"This apartment is a great little place for a stay in Berlin. Very close to the U-Bahn, so access to city centre and other places of interest is very easy. The neighbourhood is great too; with shops very close by,  and parks also to chill out at the end of a busy sightseeing day.<br/>The place itself is very clean and very cosy, with basic but sufficient equipment.<br/>One thing to note though is that this place wouldn't be suitable to light sleepers. The bedroom windows are street side and there can be a lot of traffic.And also it's very close to the airport, so planes flying low above are a regular occurrence. I personally don't mind, as I can sleep pretty much through anything; but I believe it's worth mentioning.",1,0.9152,Positive
