59.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,90.0,0,5.089314048946627,4.97,4.97,4.81,4.85,672856416916705202,"This is one of the best Airbnbs I have been too. The location is awesome, right next to the metro, which brings you to the city in 20 min. An abundance of options to eat out - all cuisines of the world are nearby. The room has a very nice interior design. Dierk has thought through all the details both in design and how to make it comfortable for thw guests. I can only recommend this place for your great stay in Berlin!",1,0.9705,Positive
