231.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,53,100.0,1,4.10145600811456,4.84,4.91,4.79,4.64,39507430,"Our stay was perfect ,the hosts were nice and helpful , the apartment was clean , tidy well designed. the only problem we had was picking up the key from the sharebox which is 10 min away from the spot, It was closed when we got therealtough it was supposed to be open, but someone came on behalf of the host to give us a key.. I would recommend a better solution for the keys like a locker outside the apartment..<br/>but overall everything was 10/10",0,0.9584,Positive
44.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,1,4.948763181664733,4.54,4.16,4.79,4.58,22736888,Louis is very nice and friendly.  Showed me around the area and told me where i should visit during my stay.  Bedrooms nice and big plenty of space for your things. Bathroom and kitchen were quite small but i think thats the same for all the apartments in this area,1,0.6514,Positive
176.0,4,2.0,1.5,3.0,62,100.0,1,14.084331961186797,4.83,4.74,4.58,4.73,19548993,"Beautiful and stylish apartment! Would definitely stay there again. A bit outside central Berlin however. (Approx. 20 min by car to the very center of Berlin) Would recommend having a car whilst staying there. Anyways,  the region was still very beautiful and quite.",0,0.9272,Positive
132.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,24,100.0,1,3.220056431819407,4.79,4.83,4.84,4.55,43352497,"A really nice appartment in good condition in a great area. Everything you need is within walking distance. The appartment is clean and well equipped, only thing missing is a closet to put your clothes away. Apart from that: everything was great, would really recommend.",1,0.9617,Positive
106.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,15,97.0,1,3.587299160900769,4.83,4.82,4.72,4.8,21018456,"Der Gastgeber war sehr freundlich zu uns und hat uns gute Tipps gegeben, außerdem ist das Preis-Leistungs-Verhältnis sehr gut.",1,-0.5994,Negative
180.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,27,100.0,1,6.165406546084308,4.75,4.8,4.9,4.54,797758856144797765,"Linda und Steve waren super Gastgeber. Der Checkin verlief flexibel und einfach über ein Codeschloss an der Tür. Die Zimmer und das Bad waren aufgeräumt und sauber. Die Küchenzeile und der Kühlschrank sind sehr klein, aber dies wurde im Vorfeld kommuniziert und wir waren eh andauernd unterwegs und haben außerhalb gegessen. Zur U-Bahn sind es 5 Minuten zu Fuß und die U5 bedient auch die meisten bekannten Sehenswürdigkeiten. Wir würden jederzeit wieder bei euch buchen.",1,-0.9451,Negative
52.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,1,3.473271590604837,4.84,4.81,4.93,4.81,9689519,"Ich war nun schon das 3. Mal bei Betty und Stefan und kann das Studio vollumfänglich empfehlen. Es ist sehr sauber, ruhig und sicher. Ich freue mich schon auf das nächste Mal. Die Gegend am Südstern ist übrigens unheimlich schön, sehr grün , nette Restaurants. Zur U-Bahn sind es 3 Minuten und zum Bus, der zum Bahnhof fährt 5 Minuten.",1,-0.8316,Negative
