62.0,2,1.0,4.0,1.0,35,100.0,0,7.942755838655635,4.72,4.47,4.72,4.77,1197652925808283147,"I felt right at home:)<br/>Clear instructions were given by Laura and it was very easy to find the building. Found my room (the room is huge) and the bed linen spotless and The property was always clean.<br/>There’s buses 24/7 and also a well known shopping centre called Kadawe at a walkable distance.<br/>Overall it’s a great place for travelers and also for business trip.<br/>Yes, yes and yes I would recommend Bonnie’s property and will stay there again when I visit Berlin next time :)",1,0.9601,Positive
90.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,46,100.0,1,20.182729076202826,4.98,4.98,4.91,4.83,44319175,Fabulous property in a great location - excellent recommendations for local restaurants - easy to get into central Berlin via public transport - John was friendly and chatty (and spoke perfect English) - the walk to the Müggelsee along the river that he suggested was beautiful - thoroughly recommend,1,0.9812,Positive
