103.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,43,83.0,0,13.123702559129434,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,1308134584207063063,"We stayed at this apartment for a month and had a fantastic experience! The flat itself is spacious and comfortable, easily accommodating four people. The location is in a quiet, green area that’s perfect for relaxing walks and enjoying nature. There are lots of families living nearby, which gives the neighborhood a friendly and welcoming vibe.<br/>The host was amazing—very responsive and helpful with any questions we had. They always answered quickly and made sure we had everything we needed for a comfortable stay.<br/>Overall, I highly recommend this Airbnb for anyone looking for a peaceful, nature-friendly place to stay. It was a wonderful experience!",1,0.9927,Positive
