185.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,40,100.0,0,12.4571539611784,4.88,4.91,4.83,4.72,159454,"We had such a great time at Prasad’s apartment! The apartment was beautiful, just as described, the location was excellent, and the facilities were fantastic! Prasad listened to our requests prior to the trip and went above and beyond to ensure that we were comfortable at the apartment.  <br/>The location is great, just a short train ride into the city centre. A lovely peaceful street with great food shops in the area! <br/>We will be back :)",1,0.9914,Positive
