163.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,23,100.0,1,2.7911715335500924,4.77,4.92,4.95,4.63,17276017,Fantastic location with metro station just around the corner.  Axel was a very genial host.  He made sure we had everything we needed and gave heaps of tips about places to visit and places to eat.  We had a very comfortable stay.,1,0.9116,Positive
