118.0,7,2.0,1.5,8.0,13,100.0,0,11.733101788132604,4.82,4.47,4.41,4.88,1318416677187259703,"Smidig incheckning trots att vi bokade med kort varsel. Rent och stort boende, perfekt för ett större sällskap. Modernt kök med all nödvändig utrustning. Lyxigt med både dusch och badkar samt tvätt och diskmaskin. Vänlig värd. Rekommenderar varmt",0,0.0,Neutral
38.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,39,90.0,0,3.8844191094294063,4.67,4.32,4.89,4.8,5768047,"Katha og Fabian er virkelig søde og hjælpsomme! Jeg følte mig hjemme og godt taget i mod. Vi havde et par kortere inspirerende samtaler og ellers passede vi hver vores. <br/>Det er altid en oplevelse, at blive budt ind i folks hjem, det er jeg meget taknemmelig for!<br/>Værelset var hyggeligt og rent, men man skal være indstillet på, at bad og køkken er beskidt og rodet, og at der bliver røget cigaretter indenfor (ganske vist med vinduet åbent, men det hænger alligevel lidt i luften bagefter).",1,-0.6229,Negative
62.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,1,7.753624515540955,4.83,4.83,4.83,4.79,5536095,"Die Wohnung von Christiane ist ein Kleinod. Das Haus, die Lage, die Anbindung an den öffentlichen Verkehr, die Sauberkeit, die Einrichtung - einfach zum wohlfühlen!<br/>Außerdem ist die Begegnung eine Freude! So freundlich und unkompliziert! Ich kann das Angebot von Christiane bestens empfehlen. Führen meine Wege wieder nach Berlin hoffe ich sehr wieder hier landen zu können!!!",1,-0.9789,Negative
71.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,6.919397234051426,4.83,4.89,4.42,4.73,20939397,A strange suburb maybe not the best for tourists but a very nice place.,1,0.3727,Positive
96.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,48,100.0,1,6.700512034911939,4.98,4.99,4.93,4.94,12967814,"Beautiful loft, well located in Berlin - expect warm welcome and host",1,0.872,Positive
164.0,5,2.0,2.0,3.0,30,100.0,1,1.753209774100189,4.83,4.72,4.83,4.75,3188899,"Superhosts are superhosts for a reason so I already had high expectations. These were met admirably by Aglaja who welcomed me like an old friend and presented a welcome gift of a bottle of actually good East German sparkling wine. After booking the Gallery Apartment, but before my arrival I asked if my friend from Amsterdam could also stay in the second bedroom (and bathroom) to which Aglaja was 100% accommodating and had the room made up in advance.<br/><br/>Surrounded by art in the place you stay is a special feeling which was also agreed by my friend in the second bedroom. I immediately recognised that the 'Gallery Apartment' was intelligently designed and when Aglaja mentioned that her father was an architect, it all made perfect sense. The furniture is both appropriate and interesting. Thoughtful design is evident everywhere, but I would not describe it as a 'design apartment', as the main focus is still an art gallery.<br/><br/>Some minor housekeeping issues were noticed, such as nearly empty roll of toilet paper, no paper kitchen towels (for wiping up coffee I spilt) and perhaps a good idea would be to provide ground coffee to use with the filter coffee machine (only instant coffee was present). But overall experience and enjoyment was excellent and I would choose to stay in the Gallery Apartment again if it is available next time I visit Berlin. It represents good value and is particularly suited to those who appreciate fine art.",0,0.9967,Positive
216.0,7,2.0,1.0,8.0,60,100.0,1,2.242754107275327,4.82,4.83,4.83,4.64,26823620,"Magnifique appartement, grand et fonctionnel avec tout ce que l’on recherche pour passer un bon sejour! Seul petit bémol, 1 seule salle de bain partagée avec les WC ! Mais rien d’insupportable, je recommande!",0,0.5229,Positive
195.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,91.0,0,4.873172561853288,4.69,4.76,4.44,4.54,30881310,Nothing to say... it’s just perfect,1,0.5719,Positive
152.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,33,88.0,1,2.917681610337092,4.89,4.96,4.93,4.76,7526348,"Die Unterkunft ist sehr Modern eingerichtet und liegt direkt am Nordbahnhof, von wo aus man überall Problemlos hin kommt! Es war sehr sauber und es war alles was man braucht vorhanden! <br/>Trotz das die Unterkunft direkt am Nordbahnhof liegt, war es sehr Ruhig dort!<br/>Unser Auto konnten wir in die Tiefgarage stellen, was für Berlin Mitte echt unschlagbar ist!<br/>Die Kommunikation zwischen unserem Gastgeber und uns war total Problemlos! Wir haben sogar noch ein Paar Tips von ihm bekommen. <br/>Alles in allem war es eine Top Unterkunft, die wir gerne weiter Empfehlen.",1,-0.9895,Negative
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,52,100.0,0,18.623100777897022,4.94,4.95,4.79,4.92,229099,"It was a great stay at Hannes' house. You do feel like home away from home. The bed was great for one person, the room was plenty with a couch and working table. Hannes and Leo (his son) were lovely to talk to. In the morning, Hannes even went out of his way to prepare an awesome breakfast and helped me with the transportation. We had a great chat and I learned a lot from him. The location was very convenient to the airport, although it might be a bit far from the city centre but it was manageable by S-bahn and bus. Will stay here again next time!",1,0.9125,Positive
104.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,0,12.544245593904789,4.56,4.77,3.79,4.26,25535508,Great place to stay. liked that.,1,0.7845,Positive
109.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,16,100.0,0,12.374985031045489,3.84,3.6,4.44,3.68,52914115,La ubicación de l’hotel és molt bona.,1,0.0,Neutral
123.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,40,100.0,0,2.6617513009290934,4.58,4.59,4.81,4.47,1827536,"Appartamento molto accogliente e ben riscaldato. Ottima posizione rispetto ai mezzi pubblici, facili da raggiungere in brevissimo tempo. Zona molto tranquilla con ottimi ristoranti, bar e supermercati. Grande disponibilità e gentilezza da parte di Alla e Markus.",1,0.0,Neutral
65.0,4,2.0,1.0,4.0,25,33.0,0,6.280772941047609,4.37,3.94,4.48,4.5,1130337,"Andreas,il proprietario, e` una persona molto simpatica e disponibile!E` venuto a prenderci con la macchina alla fermata U bahn Osloer strasse,che si trova a pochi minuti dalla casa.Il posto è pulito e fornito di tutti i confort in cucina,bagno e camera da letto.Ha provveduto a lasciarci tutte le informazioni riguardo la casa e come muoverci in citta`,inoltre la casa è fornita di libri e opuscoli,in diverse lingue, che faciliteranno la scelta delle mete turistiche berlinesi.Grazie Andreas!",1,0.0,Neutral
296.0,6,3.0,2.0,5.0,29,100.0,1,6.97282351203588,4.92,4.9,4.55,4.7,14335678,"Great place to stay , just need new pillows on the beds !",0,0.6588,Positive
