125.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,33,100.0,0,3.821641018423892,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,1165222656781074265,"Antonia was a fantastic host! Flexible, responsive and extremely hospitable. Her apartment was pristine and in a perfect location.",1,0.8999,Positive
238.0,3,2.0,1.0,3.0,27,100.0,1,3.928817520387241,4.92,4.85,4.89,4.68,17200670,Lovely stay! Beautiful and spacious apartment. The area was walkable and also super easy to get around by public transport. Thomas was very helpful. Would definitely stay the next time we’re in Berlin!,1,0.9688,Positive
