64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,0,9.838277909904056,4.96,4.94,4.94,4.89,17489023,"The room is amazing and we had no problem at all with the communication. It's located almost directly in from of a S-Bahn Station, which is super easy to access anywhere in the city. Would definitely recommend this room to people traveling to Berlin!",1,0.9041,Positive
91.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,15,96.0,1,6.717388844283176,4.74,4.66,4.77,4.6,42686083,"We LOVED this location! the apartment had all the basics and we found the place to be quiet. We were not so thrilled with the wear and tear of the place and some dishes had to be washed before we could use them, but overall, it was a good value and we enjoyed our stay.",1,0.9259,Positive
125.0,6,2.0,1.0,2.0,27,98.0,1,1.7013982816783224,4.94,4.88,4.94,4.8,19536575,"Top Lage! Super Ausstattung und alles sauber. <br/>Einzig kleiner Nachteil, wenn man sich dazu entscheidet mit 6 Erwachsenen anzureisen, ist das Schlafsofa. Größe war für zwei schlanke Frauen okay, aber hat sehr gequietscht und geknarrt, die Matratze nicht sonderlich bequem. Für zwei Nächte aber ausreichend. <br/>An einem Fenster könnte man noch ein Rollo oder Milchglasfolie anbringen, da man aktuell bei Dunkelheit und wenn man Licht anhat, drinnen alles sehen kann( Wohnzimmer)und Flur.",1,-0.3595,Negative
111.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,3.478761427822,4.88,4.94,4.88,4.75,24836860,"Ich kann die Unterkunft vollkommen uneingeschränkt weiterempfehlen. Geschmackvoll, tiptop sauber , beste Lage und total ruhig . Kommunikation bestens .",1,-0.5994,Negative
76.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,100.0,1,5.169307301776869,4.86,4.89,4.79,4.76,16119275,"Nos ha encantado el apartamento. Muy limpio, cómodo y silencioso . Birte es una anfitriona sobresaliente",1,0.34,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,9,100.0,1,6.0353994999254885,4.91,4.76,4.88,4.86,36866194,"Atendeu-me muito bem. Explicou todas as coisas que necessitava. Até fala português, que é meu idioma nativo. O quarto é grande, vc tem acesso a deixar suas coisas na geladeira e o banheiro é bom.<br/>Alexis é um ótimo host.",1,0.0,Neutral
127.0,6,2.0,2.0,5.0,45,100.0,0,11.764307913706604,4.44,4.56,4.62,4.38,250253,"Zentral gelegen, Einkaufsmöglichkeiten direkt vor der Tür, gute Ausstattung der Küche, sehr sauber",0,0.0,Neutral
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,10,100.0,0,4.92204315033869,4.84,4.97,4.48,4.68,9620858,Great place! Very cool design and everything you could need. Close to public transport. Highly recommended.,1,0.8433,Positive
60.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,83.0,0,3.4567449553879968,4.75,4.83,4.75,4.92,4002356,"We stayed at Annette's apartment in the heart of Kreuzberg for 10 days (17-27/9/2014). This is not our first sublet in Berlin, but i think this is the best one so far. Taking care for the small details really does the difference. <br/>The apartment is located in a great and estrategic place in Graefe kiez. It is renovated and fully equiped. And i mean fully! Even a machine to foam milk. It is cozy but big. The entire  apartment is furnitured in good taste (in my opinion :-)) even some special elements, and there's the porch/terace which adds a nice place to seat.when we had a question we contacted Annette and got a response quickly (an god knows we had some owners before, who avoided us without a blink...). <br/>I fully and happily reccomend staying in this apartment. Not only for it's content and host, but also for its location.<br/><br/>The apartment was exactly what we could have wish for.<br/>The host's willing to assist in anything we asked, really made the difference.<br/>",1,0.9928,Positive
81.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,1,2.618142013757112,4.87,4.9,4.91,4.75,3717751,"Yvonne’s place is really unique and comfortable. The ground heating in the bath is so cozy that shower is never a problem. The place is right next to the Berlin Wall, great for history lovers.",1,0.9235,Positive
70.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,100.0,1,3.0533340006135603,4.92,4.98,4.93,4.84,7925838,Wir waren sehr zufrieden mit unserer Unterkunft. Ruhig trotz super zentraler Lage. Wir kommen gerne wieder.,1,0.5994,Positive
108.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,41,94.0,1,0.6378915892111641,4.88,4.91,4.92,4.74,839069734231196810,"Super schnelle Kommunikation unkomplizierte und kurzfristig eine Option, wenn man mit dem aktuellen Preis Glück hat. <br/>Sehr zuvorkommend und freundlich! :)",1,0.8016,Positive
144.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,94.0,0,3.1018817858877528,4.67,4.76,4.77,4.56,720839766613886451,Nice modern feel. Great location. I would definitely do it again,1,0.8625,Positive
72.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,27,100.0,1,13.673862168326844,4.88,4.87,4.53,4.73,50354450,"Unser Aufenthalt war sehr gut. Saubere Wohnung saubere Bettwäsche, geräumige Dusche und ein top Service",1,-0.4767,Negative
245.0,7,2.0,1.0,5.0,42,97.0,0,1.9911215766494572,4.42,4.49,4.84,4.28,10483677,"Une très bonne expérience! Un appartement très bien, propre, avec le minimum nécessaire, très bien situé dans Mitte, proche metro, location vélo, etc.<br/>Lana, bien que je ne l'ai pas rencontrée, a été très disponible par message afin de préparer au mieux notre arrivée et très arrangeante sur les horaires. ",0,0.0,Neutral
47.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,0,5.45266710386518,4.74,4.86,4.47,4.67,30052147,"The place is wonderful, the hosts too. I miss the place already.",1,0.4767,Positive
140.0,6,2.0,1.0,5.0,49,100.0,1,2.43464121697615,4.72,4.88,4.83,4.55,243081,"Sehr grosszügige, schöne Altbauwohnung mit hohen Decken und hohen Fenstern. Grosse Zimmer, grosse Küche inkl. Sofaecke und TV. Die Küche hat alles, was man braucht. Es hätte sogar Kaffee, Tee, Salz, Essig, Öl, solche Sachen gehabt -, haben wir leider erst nach dem Grosseinkauf entdeckt. Und das WLAN war etwas (zu) gemütlich. <br/>Weitere Plus: Perfekte ÖV-Anbindung, mitten im Zentrum, hübsches Quartier und: im Erdgeschoss befindet sich eine Bäckerei ;-). Unbedingt empfehlenswert!",0,-0.8439,Negative
350.0,8,3.0,1.0,5.0,49,100.0,1,1.1829273409163323,4.91,4.78,4.95,4.78,938200237473175867,The apartment was amazing! Beautiful place in a central location,0,0.8398,Positive
88.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,13,100.0,0,3.1022410985121005,4.94,4.94,5.0,4.83,33358993,"Dirk has a lovely apartment near the center of Berlin (good public transport to both Berlin Centre as wel airports).  His apartment is in a lovely quiet neighborhood with lot of bars,  breakfast bars and restaurants at walking distance. He even has a bakery next to the apartment. <br/>The apartment is neat, spacious, clean, usual facilities and we loved it. We really enjoyed our stay.<br/>Communication was fantastic via message or whatsapp. <br/>Definitely we recommend Dirk. He is a 5* host.",1,0.9796,Positive
85.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,4.812972415804947,4.72,4.64,4.75,4.69,16050858,The appartment is nice and cosy. Its clean and there is everything you need. The communication with Gal was also good and clear. I had a pleasant stay!,1,0.9273,Positive
46.0,2,1.0,1.0,0.0,28,0.0,0,12.065363217010958,4.93,4.96,4.96,4.86,1255664,"Nik's apartment is exactly as pictured and described.  Comfortable for 2 people, it was very clean, well organized and quiet. Everything worked well, good internet connection and we liked the neighbourhood for its amenities, including 2 Ubahn stations nearby, grocery stores, restaurants, cafes and bars where the locals go. Berlin is a great city to visit and we would recommend this apartment.  The transit system in Berlin is fast and efficient and we found this location perfect for our visit. Would go back if available.",1,0.9815,Positive
125.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,20,100.0,0,3.5451372124226435,4.96,4.92,4.96,4.92,38897223,"Wir waren begeistert von der Wohnung und der Umgebung. Es war mal ein echtes AirB&B Erlebnis, so wie es sein sollte. In dieser Wohnung lebt jemand. Die Wohnung ist hell, geräumig und still. <br/>Wir haben uns super wohl gefühlt. Danke!",1,-0.8687,Negative
141.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,0.6039103911177419,4.25,4.34,4.85,4.23,36259013,Nice place to stay in Berlin! Super Lage!,1,0.8065,Positive
293.0,6,2.0,1.5,3.0,47,100.0,1,2.826856216058209,4.87,4.82,4.89,4.73,83614,Really lovely apartment.  About 30 minutes to city centre. Nice neighbourhood with good selection of restaurants and bars. Louis provided great local recommendations. One of the bedrooms looks onto busy pavement so privacy a slight issue. Also noisy at night so take ear plugs or sleep at rear if you are a light sleeper. Would stay again.,0,0.9216,Positive
139.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,45,100.0,0,2.0186652384431523,4.58,4.52,4.83,4.46,11306475,"Yair ist ein sehr freundlicher und kompetenter Gastgeber der kleine Infos über Berlin parat hat. Die Wohnung ist sauber und ordentlich, allerdings hatten wir Probleme mit den Nachbarn. Bei einer gemütlichen Zigarette nach 22 Uhr sollten man eher flüstern, da sonst sehr schnell Beschwerden kommen. Ich würde die Wohnung aber weiterempfehlen. Mit etwas Rücksicht lässt es sich dort ganz gut leben.",1,-0.8316,Negative
77.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,50,100.0,1,3.172543311051877,4.97,4.93,4.94,4.94,4045063,Thor's place was great! He was very kind and accommodating. I'd highly recommend staying with Thor when you are in Berlin!,1,0.9036,Positive
54.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,7.403263725526816,4.91,4.92,4.78,4.85,23477057,"L'appartamento di Andre ha superato le mie aspettative e quelle della mia amica. Insieme abbiamo soggiornato in questo appartamento, in una zona residenziale di Berlino, dalla quale é facilmente raggiungibile il centro. Camera spaziosa, luminosa, ben arredata con tutti i comfort necessari per trascorrere una vacanza nella capitale. Arredamento moderno e curato nei minimi dettagli.  Pulizia impeccabile, anche del bagno condiviso. Istruzioni per il check in semplici e chiare. É sicuramente un posto in cui tornare volentieri.",1,0.4019,Positive
112.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,15,100.0,1,3.2713344054375537,4.68,4.75,4.91,4.56,37442240,"Nous avons séjourné 4 jours chez Mia.<br/>L’emplacement est parfait, proche des transports et très central.<br/>Le logement correspond bien aux photos, il est très agréable.<br/>Je recommande !!",1,0.0,Neutral
337.0,11,3.0,2.0,4.0,50,100.0,1,5.961083106152229,4.94,4.96,4.65,4.74,44443548,"Tolle Altbauwohnung, gute Aufteilung, sauber und perfekt gelegen.<br/>Wir waren mit 7 Personen für 3 Nächte da. Alles wie beschrieben, gut ausgestattet mit allem was man so benötigt. Der Zugang mit Code ist einfach und schnell. Die Lage ist prima, in wenigen Geh-Minuten ist die U-Bahn und S-Bahn zu erreichen, ebenso ein Bäcker für die frischen Brötchen am Morgen. Eine absolut empfehlenswerte Wohnung in Berlin!",0,-0.9184,Negative
69.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,39,100.0,1,6.8031309591177695,4.86,4.94,4.76,4.86,9524021,"Great to stay at Anke's place. Anke was really responsive and had lots of amazing suggestions for cafes, clubs, etc.",1,0.8932,Positive
79.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,0,4.208631273050765,4.9,4.95,4.89,4.8,37120573,"Die Lage war super, die Kommunikation super schnell, Studio sehr gemütlich! Am Morgen hört man die Leute sehr gut, die beim Eingang ein und ausgehen. Aber wir waren ja nicht da um lange zu schlafen ;)",1,-0.902,Negative
54.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,7.403263725526816,4.91,4.92,4.78,4.85,23477057,"This is a lovely place in East-Germany, in a nice neigbourhood with plenty of parking spots. The room was nice and had a huge television. The bathroom was equipt with shampoo, shower gel. etc. We also loved the kitchen and the awesome sink! Glad we stayed here!",1,0.9729,Positive
52.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,10.552267411509238,4.88,4.85,4.77,4.85,15652886,"Hardi est très sympa et bienveillant, on passé un super séjour à Berlin. Il nous a donné des conseils précieux. On trouve tout dont on a besoin dans son appartement, il est bien placé, proche du transport public. Si on revient aà Berlin un jour, on n'hésitera pas réserver encore avec Hardi!",1,0.5707,Positive
49.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,36,100.0,0,8.092180844920643,4.73,4.78,4.59,4.68,222784,Lovely apartment - lots of light. Pictures are accurate! Were greeted at the door by Kelly's husband who showed us the place very thoroughly and was able to offer advice on bus routes. Easy to get to from the airport.,1,0.8439,Positive
132.0,6,1.0,1.0,4.0,28,98.0,0,2.774133008375683,4.43,4.2,4.72,4.31,53653291,Top,1,0.2023,Positive
83.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,12,100.0,0,6.7464992788854845,4.87,4.88,4.88,4.71,50359049,Ein sehr schönes Konzept und ein toller Einrichtungsstil. Man fühlt sich gleich zuhause.,1,0.0,Neutral
96.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,2.6441579309110788,4.94,4.95,4.85,4.88,8462220,Location was spot on. Jun was very responsive and accommodating. Apartment is beautiful,1,0.7713,Positive
75.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,24,100.0,0,4.4202884323310805,4.3,4.36,4.58,4.4,23071933,"Apartamento grande y bien ubicado,  con buena accesibilidad al tram y al metro. Reno es un host atento y disponible, con buenas recomendaciones para todo lo que necesiten respecto a Berlin.",1,0.0,Neutral
90.0,2,1.0,1.0,4.0,25,0.0,0,8.1485590660558,4.55,4.75,4.77,4.64,13669202,"Tolle Unterkunft, sehr zentral gelegen große Wohnung viel Platz",1,0.0,Neutral
39.0,2,1.0,1.5,1.0,31,100.0,1,23.901689384127245,4.91,4.91,4.44,4.88,26841304,The house is very clean and host is very nice. It‘s a little bit far from the city but the transports are convenient. If I come to Berlin one more time  I‘ll stay here again :),1,0.7931,Positive
205.0,8,2.0,2.0,3.0,32,95.0,0,4.732874564416474,4.63,4.48,4.89,4.48,52762746,"Beautiful, spacious, and convenient apartment in a nice apartment building. The neighborhood is so interesting and fun and full of restaurants (lots of vegan options all around!). It is very close to a tram station and a subway station. Comfortable beds and beautiful windows. Very responsible and helpful hosts. Thank you!!",0,0.9834,Positive
112.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,51,100.0,1,7.069783798568355,4.81,4.92,4.62,4.73,221015,"Me and two of my friends stayed at this place for a short Berlin vacation. First of all, the place is very beautiful, we enjoyed the spacious living room and balcony. Our only critique of the accommodation would be the squeaky floors, which is expected given the building is rather old. Otherwise, it’s a great place to stay. We found a lot of nice restaurants and cafes nearby and it only took about 20-30 minutes to get to the city center by public transport. The area felt private and safe, which is a great plus! Thanks to Arzu and Tom for hosting us!",1,0.9822,Positive
203.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,47,100.0,1,1.0082912762193283,4.91,4.93,4.95,4.72,5494100,Von Anfang an sehr freundlich und hilfreich. Die Begrüßung war sehr freundlich und bei Fragen konnte man sich direkt an Sie wenden.<br/>Die Unterkunft war sehr zentral und auch in einer ordentlichen Gegend. <br/>Alles sehr sauber und ordentlich!,0,-0.9184,Negative
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,15,100.0,0,2.2397308136915437,4.75,4.87,4.87,4.74,3397917,"We had an amazing stay in Vanessa's beautiful apartment - I really cannot recommend it enough! Vanessa was really accommodating with everything, and has a great airbnb guide to Berlin, with lots of tips for places to go and things to do in the area and beyond. The apartment is perfectly situated, very clean and absolutely gorgeous - it is designed beautifully with lots of small personal touches, all done with great taste - the photos really don't even do it justice! Vanessa was the perfect host, and left really helpful instructions for everything we might need to know about the place and our stay, and even some beers in the fridge to welcome us! <br/>Would love to stay here again, we had the best time, thanks so much for everything Vanessa! &lt;3 ",1,0.9954,Positive
192.0,4,1.0,1.0,0.0,36,100.0,0,3.8848763123169134,4.85,4.77,4.85,4.62,53928247,"Enklare boende i en mycket trevlig del av Berlin. Vi hyrde mycket på grund av bilderna och det stämde överens med verkligheten.  Trevlig värd och allt fungerade perfekt. Nackdel, det blev extremt varmt i hytten, trots fläkt.",1,0.0,Neutral
86.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,52,100.0,1,14.876814991832068,4.83,4.74,4.5,4.65,53080223,L'appartement de William est très confortable et bien équipé.  Tout était conforme à la description faite sur le site. Il est certes excentré mais les transports en commun permettent de rejoindre facilement le Berlin Mitte et à  proximité se trouvent un supermarché et quelques restaurants. L'accueil  que nous a réservé Villiam était très chaleureux.  Je recommande très fortement cet hébergement.,1,-0.128,Negative
35.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,59,100.0,0,0.7009515972590313,4.75,4.8,4.95,4.74,2543760,"The house was right in the centre of Berlin. Close to everything (museums, shops, night life). The room and the bath was very clean, making you feel like home!!! The view was absolutely amazing... Monica and Yvonne were very kind and willing to help you with anything... Thakng you very much for the wonderful accomodation!!",1,0.9498,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,21,100.0,0,4.782028667605308,4.79,4.81,4.88,4.78,1440368404830960024,地理位置绝佳，早上很早就到了酒店，前台帮忙找了打扫好的房间。对于刚结束长途飞行的我来说非常有帮助,1,0.0,Neutral
209.0,8,4.0,2.5,4.0,72,100.0,0,12.809254275601033,4.8,4.61,4.48,4.73,53720272,"We had a really nice stay at the house. Lisa was very nice and responsive. The house is spacious and bright and has everything you might need. There is a 10-15 minutes walk to the train station, so it takes a while to get into the city centre and it is quite expensive as train tickets are quite expensive for a family of 5.",0,0.8968,Positive
163.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,91.0,0,4.871252294318258,4.67,4.78,4.87,4.53,46864858,geweldige omgeving om in te verblijven,1,0.0,Neutral
