135.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,100.0,0,2.0872474953398257,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,845669163777809688,"I stayed in Anne and Jürgen's apartment for the entirety of my ten-month research sabbatical in Berlin. In the simplest terms, I could not have asked for a better home away from home. It provided comfort, great views, wonderful natural light, and space to think, write, relax, and socialize with friends. <br/>The apartment offers a range of specific amenities that make it a highly desirable place to live. These include: 1) its proximity to public transportation (M-lines and U-bahn), 2) a variety of nearby restaurants, cafés, spätis, and grocery stores, 3) the genuine beauty of Oderberger Straße and Prenzlauer Berg, and 4) the opportunity to meet/visit with Anne and Jürgen. <br/>From walks along the historical Gedenkstätte Berliner Mauer to exploring the Kultur-Brauerei and its welcoming alleyways and side streets, one has much to enjoy while staying in this apartment. I highly recommend it to anyone who wants to experience the very best of Berlin. It was nothing short of perfection.",1,0.9908,Positive
123.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,30,100.0,1,2.7486258312471903,4.76,4.28,4.82,4.73,6232450,"L’appartamento e’ bello e accogliente, situato in una bella palazzina d’epoca, arredato da Andreas con creativita’ e buon gusto, ben attrezzato con tutto cio’ che serve sia in bagno che in cucina, biancheria pulita, bella zona della citta’ con tutti i servizi, strada tranquilla.<br/>Andreas e’ gentile e disponibile, esperienza molto piacevole, ci ritornerei volentieri.",1,0.0,Neutral
76.0,2,1.0,1.0,8.0,26,99.0,0,1.47112525778762,4.6,4.5,4.48,4.58,1565047,"My stay here was fine, and staff were very kind and helpful.",1,0.8204,Positive
161.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,44,100.0,1,3.550833267755717,4.84,4.83,4.66,4.49,33803119,Nice apartment in a quiet neighbourhood but still near to bus and tram. Also there is a  lot of restaurants in the area and if you like to go to a park Volkspark Friedrichshain is five minutes away. The apartment was like the pictures and there was a good communication with the host.,0,0.9052,Positive
380.0,4,2.0,2.0,3.0,48,100.0,1,1.1071575355391072,4.95,4.99,4.91,4.78,16091735,"Fantastic apartment, a real steal to book this one. The host is generous and thoughtful, the apartment is large, comfortable and very tidy.<br/>We enjoyed our stay a lot!",0,0.9256,Positive
79.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,43,100.0,1,17.764827440117966,4.94,4.95,4.64,4.78,921535608661475926,Wir waren für ein paar Tage zu Gast. Die Wohnung liegt in einer ruhigen Gegend. Parkplätze sind kostenlos auf der Straße genügend vorhanden. Einkaufsmöglichkeiten zu Fuß gut zu erreichen. <br/>Das Bett und die Kissen waren für uns sehr unbequem. Aber das hat sicherlich Geschmacksache.,1,-0.8316,Negative
187.0,5,1.0,1.0,2.0,60,100.0,1,3.4993610437479004,4.97,4.9,4.92,4.83,701971447519071423,Alles gut.,1,0.0,Neutral
84.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,7.790190356236613,4.69,4.83,4.72,4.7,512476,"Ruhige und sehr zentrale Lage, wenige Meter von der nächsten U-Bahn-Station. Sehr gemütliches und feines Appartement in einem schönen und ruhigem Haus. Ich komme gerne wieder. ",1,0.0,Neutral
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,7,100.0,0,4.956507847103614,4.91,4.94,4.81,4.91,16736758,"Hiang was the sweetest host. She made sure that her friend was there to meet me and let me in since she was still on vacation. She always made sure I was warm enough and had the best public transportation tips. She gave me a shorter route to the train station I needed to go to than what google maps had said. She even did my laundry for me when she didn’t have to, super super sweet! <br/>The train S-bahn station coming out is a little rough looking compared to other stations there but it definitely  looks more gross than it is. As a solid female traveler I felt super safe walking every around her neighborhood since everything was well lit. She’s also near two popular food places Curry 36 and Mustafa’s Kebap. <br/>Would definitely book here again :)",1,0.9888,Positive
122.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,3.146245412821909,4.77,4.68,4.85,4.52,44098912,Alles super,1,0.5994,Positive
213.0,8,3.0,1.0,5.0,31,100.0,1,5.600860807992449,4.67,4.61,4.63,4.55,17384054,"Convenient, lovely apartment with plenty of room in a fun neighborhood.",0,0.7964,Positive
186.0,6,2.0,1.5,3.0,39,100.0,0,5.538943551470177,4.96,4.86,4.88,4.86,817200066944099193,"Wir haben jetzt schon das zweite Mal mit kurzem Abstand gebucht, weil uns die Wohnung und die Umgebung so gut gefallen. Zu der Wohnung muss man nichts mehr sagen; sie ist exakt so, wie auf den Fotos. Alles perfekt. Der Stadtteil ist voll mit jungen Leuten, Künstlern, unzähligen kleinen, guten und im Vergleich zu Mitte sehr preisgünstigen Restaurants, und ebenso vielen Kneipen. Die Wohnung liegt aber in der Mitte einer Wohnstraße, daher trotzdem ruhig. Bis zum nächsten vernünftigen Restaurant, Bar, Späti, etc. dennoch keine 200 m. Auch unsere drei Kinder sind absolut begeistert.  Wir werden definitiv dieses Jahr noch mal buchen.",0,-0.8591,Negative
62.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,0,5.275499651976651,4.73,4.52,4.81,4.63,1327609214124415135,Very nice place in a cool neighborhood. Lots of restaurants around and easy to get to downtown.,1,0.807,Positive
62.0,2,2.0,1.0,4.0,20,91.0,0,14.96877971240817,4.82,4.87,4.7,4.82,20647264,"Hôtes accueillants et bienveillants. Situé au calme à vingt minutes du centre de Berlin (vous pouvez vous passer de la vignette si vous êtes en voiture : le centre est juste en dehors de la ""Umweltzone""). Il faut savoir que la salle de douche est commune à deux chambres, mais ce n'est pas très gênant. Bon resto végétarien sur place de 12 à 19 heures.",1,-0.3612,Negative
54.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,1,13.118271209747862,4.84,4.9,4.75,4.7,53722512,"Mein Aufenthalt bei Van Chien war wunderbar.  <br/>Es hat nichts gefehlt und alles lief super. Die Wohnung ist von der S Bahn Haltestelle leicht zu erreichen. Zudem habe ich eine tolle, hilfsbereite und freundliche Familie kennengelernt! Die Gespräche und das Frühstück fand ich ebenfalls sehr schön. <br/>Ich würde aufjeden Fall wiederkommen.",1,-0.8439,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,0,10.53639724756125,4.69,4.75,4.74,4.6,1120133598974304854,"Ich bin nur eine Tag dort übernachtet, ich kann sagen, dass ich für die kurze Zeit zufrieden war.<br/>Ich kann wieder empfehlen.",1,-0.5994,Negative
