84.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,0,2.119096359925999,4.58,4.69,4.86,4.43,1006363629503914037,I enjoyed my stay in this small but clean and tastefully furnished apartment. I loved the location in a quiet „Hinterhof“ and a stunning hallway. There is a movie theater and park right around the corner. Bus No.200 takes you to Alexanderplatz in 10 minutes. Neighborhood is friendly and quiet with nice cafes and restaurants.,1,0.9734,Positive
129.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,21,100.0,0,6.825652376645098,4.89,4.92,4.9,4.76,21237781,"Very nice apartment. Clean, bright and big. Has everything you need to enjoy your stay.",1,0.9033,Positive
110.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,61,100.0,1,9.348496837727636,4.98,5.0,4.83,4.83,21252188,"Die Wohnung ist top; geschmackvoll und funktionell eingerichtet, sehr sauber und perfekt gelegen - ruhig und trotzdem zentral. Norbert ist ein toller, fürsorglicher Gastgeber und ein richtig netter Mensch, mit dem ich jederzeit gerne ein Bier trinken gehen würde - vielen Dank nochmals für alles, Norbert!",1,-0.5255,Negative
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,55,30.0,0,4.0309652674516965,4.63,4.35,4.83,4.59,4083538,"Апартаменты замечательные. Район отличный - очень тихий, уютный, вокруг много зелени. В трех минутах ходьбы - 2 крупных супермаркета, метро в пешей доступности. Также, вокруг есть кафе, бары и маленькие магазинчики. В апартаментах очень чисто, уютно, есть вся необходимая техника, а также посуда, специи и прочие мелочи. Игорь отвечал на все наши вопросы очень быстро, никаких проблем не было!  Отличное место, очень хотелось бы вернуться еще!<br/>The apartments are wonderful. The area around apartments is very quiet, cozy, around a lot of green. Three minutes walk - 2 large supermarkets, 2 metro lines within walking distance. Also, there are cafes, bars and small shops around. The apartments are very clean and comfortable, has all the necessary equipment and dishes, kitchenware, spices, and other stuff. Igor answered all our questions very quickly and informatively. Great place to stay, would love to return again!",1,0.9658,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,0,7.781452884124446,4.45,4.55,4.54,4.36,993380042593079111,value for money . highly recommended,1,0.5413,Positive
125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,5,100.0,0,3.902394086942081,4.86,4.57,4.14,4.86,6970346,"Christian's apartment was great for the 4 days my friends and I spent in Berlin. It's sunny and spacious and has the cozy air of a real home to it because Christian himself lives there throughout the year, so you get a more authentic feel of how life in Berlin really is like. I personally appreciate this kind of thing but if you prefer more impersonal, hotel-like apartments this may not be the place for you.<br/>The flat was clean and tidy and has a nice balcony, where you can have lunch or dinner in summer and veeeeery comfortable beds which was a relief after several nights sleeping on trains and hostal beds :) It is located in a nice and quiet area and has great connections by tram but you have to walk a little longer to get the u-bahn (12min) or s-bahn (20 min).<br/>Christian has been very responsive and friendly both before our arrival and during our stay, which we really appreciate! Thank you so much, Christian, we had a wonderful stay!",1,0.9956,Positive
45.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,27,100.0,0,13.937893468275648,4.63,4.66,4.66,4.57,7838790,"Die Wohnung hat in Summe 7 abschließbare Zimmer, 2 Bäder und eine Küche/Kochzeile. Alle Gäste waren so gut wie unsichtbar und wenn sichtbar nett und ruhig. Zimmer 3 ist direkt neben der Küchenzeile und war trotzdem ruhig. Prima Privatsphäre und Zimmer geräumig mit eigenem Sofa und Sessel als Sitzecke. Sehr schön. Komme gerne wieder.",1,-0.8316,Negative
143.0,6,1.0,1.0,3.0,35,93.0,0,14.44165293547941,4.73,4.86,4.82,4.74,1094597524537374236,J’ai passé 4 jours à Berlin avec 3 adolescents et le logement était parfait. Le coin est assez calme et on est dans le centre de Berlin en 35 minutes. Donc je recommande ce logement.,1,0.0,Neutral
114.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,100.0,0,3.873735986824365,4.86,4.92,4.95,4.71,866727804300473635,"Vi havde et vidunderligt ophold med Johannes som vært. Han var meget proaktiv og gav os en masse brugbare anbefalinger, der gjorde os klogere på området og dets muligheder i bylivet.<br/>Vi boede i et fantastisk område, som er værd at tage tilbage til! <br/>Sara-Sofie og Amir",1,0.0,Neutral
162.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,46,100.0,1,3.25098838227702,4.96,4.99,4.75,4.8,13711603,"The appartment is lovely, clean and nicely decorated. It has a lovely large balcony with sitting area. It is also very quiet. The area is very peaceful yet it is only a couple of minutes walk to the tram . There is a reasonable supermarket 2 minutes walk away.<br/>Natalie was very welcoming and helpful, looking up transport information for us. We would definitely like to stay here again. Highly recommended.",1,0.9822,Positive
78.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,72,100.0,0,2.1550429170898844,4.79,4.79,5.0,4.43,53527178,"Tolle Lage, super sauber und alles was man braucht. Dazu unglaublich sympathisch, schnelle Kommunikation und es war immer eine Freude, zwischen meinen beruflichen Terminen ein paar Takte persönlich zu quatschen. Da ich beruflich so wahnsinnig viel zu tun hatte (und kaum zum einkaufen etc. gekommen bin) wurde ich mit allerhand gutem Essen etwas „mit versorgt“. Ruhige und dich zentrale Lage nah dem Rosenthaler Platz erleichtern Arbeitstermine aber auch, wenn man etwas die Stadt erkunden möchte. Kurz: eine meiner besten AirBnB Erfahrungen. Danke 🙏🏻",1,-0.6486,Negative
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,0,7.947179088016036,4.77,4.55,4.83,4.7,32742375,Nice stay at a cosy home with two very friendly hosts :-) Great!,1,0.9224,Positive
