77.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,1,7.5529282602310275,4.81,4.84,4.6,4.69,1346757,"Really comfortable, quiet studio apartment. The windows open onto a private courtyard area so there's no noise from the street, and it's close to lots of plenty of bars and shops. This is more of a locals' neighbourhood so it's ideal for travellers who want to stay away from the tourist hotspots, but there are U-bahn and S-bahn links a short walk away, so it's easy to get to other neighbourhoods. Francesco welcomed us and provided very helpful advice about the area and good places to eat or drink. As the listing shows, there isn't an oven or microwave but there's still plenty you can cook on the 2 hobs and the flat has plenty of pans and stuff to use. There's also a launderette just round the corner that's pretty cheap if you need to do laundry. Overall a very comfortable flat and a helpful host, ideal for a Berlin visit.",1,0.9904,Positive
94.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,47,100.0,0,2.573794892526899,4.65,4.79,4.93,4.56,42972615,"Very compact, spotlessly clean, great location",1,0.7943,Positive
