140.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,28,98.0,0,7.157895638776036,4.61,4.65,4.53,4.37,731825380030233334,"Apart from an issue with the key code to my room on arrival - the provided key didn't work on the door - I had a great time at Limehouse. I called the 24hr support line and was very quickly sorted out with a new code so it wasn't much of an issue. I did wish there was a manual deadlock inside the room for closing while sleeping, though, as the idea of anyone being able to get in with a key code was almost alarming. But the flat was comfortable, clean, and well appointed.",1,0.9337,Positive
142.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,29,100.0,1,3.3189723905154875,4.91,4.93,4.86,4.71,19654788,"Great host and apartment, very central place in one of the best neighbourhood in Berlin.",1,0.8519,Positive
51.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,9,70.0,1,5.069122935735952,4.89,4.84,4.8,4.75,698419375578435815,"Für mein Wochenende in Berlin war die Unterkunft perfekt. <br/>Einfach und leicht zu erreichen, super ruhig und grün gelegen und doch mittendrin, mega Aussicht, alles wunderbar sauber und ordentlich, es kann alles mitbenutzt werden, Elisa ist fabelhaft, sehr sympathisch, da aber dezent - gerne wieder.",1,-0.5994,Negative
