139.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,1,3.5852919241394265,4.61,4.65,4.56,4.53,969200,Fantastic experience. Really enjoyed the stay in the apartment and Berlin itself. Hosts were very helpful and communicated very well so we had an easy time. Couldn’t be happier with the place we stayed and it made our trip even better than we thought. <br/>Thanks very much.<br/>Jamie and Estelle,1,0.9678,Positive
