117.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,10,95.0,1,10.379845031025411,4.88,4.75,4.93,4.84,43974559,Eine sehr schöne Unterkunft und ein sehr toller Gastgeber. Kann die Wohnung mit guten Gewissen weiterempfehlen. Gerne wieder!,1,-0.636,Negative
288.0,11,5.0,2.0,5.0,55,100.0,1,7.975202664059818,4.88,4.86,4.9,4.72,1022510628936227967,"Eine wirklich schöne Unterkunft. Wir waren mit 11 Personen da und standen uns nicht im Weg. Alles ist künstlerisch und mit der Liebe zu Details eingerichtet. Wir haben uns direkt wohl gefühlt und die Wohnung hat einen ganz eigenen, schönen Charme. <br/>Wir würden diese Unterkunft für viele Personen auf jeden Fall wieder buchen.",0,-0.5994,Negative
69.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,71,100.0,1,15.135268114068412,4.96,4.92,4.86,4.92,758552656052653402,We have stayed with Daniela a few times now and it never fails to deliver<br/>Every extra you can think of is there and the apartment is set up perfect <br/>Plenty of space for a family of four and the kids loved every second with the large screen and various games and games console<br/>Lots of tech with blind and heaters and air con <br/>Couldn’t ask for more,1,0.8037,Positive
110.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,38,80.0,1,5.411282332211047,4.89,4.92,4.91,4.81,21259057,"Fadeih’s place was in a good location, close to nice restaurants but a bit far from the main city (but public transport is nearby). The place was comfortable and had ammenities as described.<br/>Fadeih was responsive and provided great local recommendations.",1,0.9531,Positive
49.0,1,0.0,1.0,1.0,41,100.0,1,17.558875247122227,4.92,4.88,4.7,4.85,39223612,"Kurzfristige Buchung war möglich, schöne ruhige Lage 👍",1,-0.5994,Negative
160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,98.0,0,1.0407544919436775,4.54,4.66,4.77,4.45,34294913,"This is an absolutely beautiful property. My mother felt right at home in the flat she ended up in, although she had to move three times because the first two apartments were unlivable. But the last apartment was comfortable, beautifully designed, well supplied, provided great natural light, lots of closet space and comfortable bed and sofa.",1,0.9836,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,10,100.0,0,4.614969004067335,4.5,4.47,4.56,4.62,323243,"Een uitstekende locatie om Berlijn te verkennen.  Het ligt in een wijk met veel islamitische restaurantjes. Met de Bus (of Metro) ben je binnen 30 minuten in het centrum. Naast een kamer bed,  tafel en kast is er buiten de kamer ook een wasruimte, toilet en keuken.<br/>Omdat de verhuurde kamers zowel aan de voor- als achterkant is ook 's nachts en 's morgens vroeg het lawaai verschillend. ik kon er goed mee omgaan, maar begrijp dat anderen daar moeilijkheden mee hebben.<br/>Heb Claudius in een week drie keer gezien, en is heel behulpzaam. Toch is contact zonder smartphone met databundel hier moeilijk.<br/>Al met al heb ik de locatie en omstandigheden positief gewaardeerd en raad mensen die Berlijn willen verkennen ook hier naar te gaan.",1,-0.5994,Negative
318.0,8,3.0,1.5,5.0,53,100.0,1,3.7256422035937673,4.95,4.94,4.85,4.83,13320037,"Het apparement was werkelijk fantastisch. Wat een sfeer en prachtige ruimtes, waaronder de keukenruimte. Verder heel erg prettig contact gehad met Sven.",0,0.0,Neutral
143.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,59,100.0,1,4.082628890408757,4.9,4.73,4.92,4.71,603656499321928631,Super schöne gemütliche Wohnung… ein Gefühl wie zu Hause.. wollte garnicht wieder gehen… sehr freundliche Gastgeber … würde sofort wiederkommen! Danke ☺️,1,0.636,Positive
84.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,52,100.0,1,3.3219101132328723,4.81,4.81,4.9,4.73,1238867,"The flat was exactly as described int he listing and the photo is a good representation of the flat. <br/>Alan was a very good communicative host and he was very helpful on seeing us in to the flat.<br/>The flat was excellent for us. It is very well situated, near transport and  shops and restaurants but still very quiet because it is in the hinterhof.<br/>It was comfortable and warm with an impressively large television which our grandchildren appreciated when they visited us.<br/>I can happily recommend Alan and the flat. It is perfect for a holiday in Berlin.",1,0.9912,Positive
74.0,4,1.0,1.5,2.0,39,100.0,0,6.219640526782811,4.64,4.62,4.58,4.49,679607737624570621,"John und Vicky waren sehr sympathisch und hilfsbereit. Mega leckeres Essen konnten wir genießen im Airbnb. Unterkunft war für uns top, alles wie beschrieben. Vielen Dank",1,-0.4767,Negative
340.0,14,4.0,1.5,5.0,59,100.0,1,9.66589172714028,4.91,4.95,4.46,4.78,9536912,Super Appartment zu einem super Preis für Gruppenausflüge,0,0.8316,Positive
135.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,87.0,1,11.377361200205224,4.78,4.87,4.82,4.67,917109042412215124,"Excellent séjour, chambre terminée propre avec tout dedans, des capsules café, du thé, une bouteille d’eau avec des verres, un réfrigérateur avec un tire bouchon, des serviettes franchement tout était impeccable, facile à trouver et très sécurisé, je recommande fortement 🥰🥰",1,0.4019,Positive
151.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,94.0,0,3.1018817858877528,4.67,4.77,4.78,4.52,721527807549293451,"The room was nice, a bit dusty but overall ok. It is in a perfect position near a metro stop and near various points of interests.<br/>Unfortunately we had a problem in the first night when we saw two guys in the hotel’s hall destroying everything such as the plants vases and throwing beer bottles around. It was quite an unusual situation for us as we were scared and feeling in danger.",1,-0.8807,Negative
153.0,4,1.0,1.5,2.0,39,100.0,0,11.510900200513026,4.33,4.46,4.79,4.17,27499168,I stayed at this apartment for five nights for a work trip. Everything was smooth and easy. Apartment is well equipped and clean with easy access to U-Bahn. Guests need to bring their own shampoo.,1,0.8625,Positive
64.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,42,100.0,0,7.370746532516475,4.95,4.9,4.9,4.85,665220863485290773,"I had really nice time in his appointment. The house, room, kitchen and bathroom everything is clean. Also he and his girlfriend are so kind. We had nice conversations.",1,0.9224,Positive
142.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,52,98.0,1,2.2099121550415086,4.87,4.92,4.95,4.72,9707618,"Stephanie’s apartment is always a great base for us in Berlin. Close to art museums, galleries and archives, supermarkets, cafes and stylish shops! We have stayed here several times over the last few years and it is always a pleasure. A very comfortable and quiet place to stay. Thank you again Stephanie.",1,0.9347,Positive
196.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,94.0,0,7.131273504704622,4.71,4.75,4.8,4.44,49087222,"Easy check in,  check out, alles was man braucht",1,0.4404,Positive
76.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,49,100.0,1,5.339352686328167,4.8,4.87,4.74,4.63,2098124,"The apartment is chic and well appointed. All the amenities add a nice touch and helped with the home away from him feeling. It was a very nice comfortable and stylish experience. <br/>Because my  mom has a bit of a problem walking, the ground floor facing the street was a bonus. I was concerned about the noise factor since there was what looked like a construction in progress right outside the window, but because it was the weekend there was no work. In fact it was surprisingly quiet being that it is not far from an intersection. <br/>Many restaurants nearby, mehrigdamm, Viktoria Park, gleiesdreieck.... this is an ideal place for more mature responsible independent travelers thank the party people, which personally I very much appreciated. <br/>I’d definitely come back again when i get a surplus / bonus at work.",1,0.9921,Positive
137.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,44,100.0,1,1.6809549157543209,4.96,4.95,4.95,4.83,2061212,"We had a great stay! The check-in was absolutely uncomplicated (it was even possible to check in earlier!) and whenever I had a question I got a quick response. Furthermore Kitty had some great tips she shared with us. <br/>The studio itself was sparkling clean and really lovely. <br/>Thank you again, Kitty! :)",1,0.9734,Positive
348.0,12,3.0,1.5,10.0,38,100.0,0,5.889555818905056,4.57,4.74,4.46,4.28,19885029,We were 8 people staying in Ruth’s apartment. The size of the apartment was perfect and the rooms and beds very comfortable. A nice big table in the kitchen where we could all sit and do some work and have meetings. <br/>There’s tram lines right around the corner so you can be in the city center within 15-20 minutes. We didn’t have too much time to discover the area but the Weißensee lake is nice for a good walk or maybe swim during the summer :). <br/>Only 2 people could connect to the WiFi. But if we had called Ruth she might have been able to fix it and we didn’t. Also it would have been great to have more keys for the apartment as we only got 2 keys and we were 8 people. <br/>But all in all we had a great stay and we can definitely recommend a stay in Ruth’s apartment.,0,0.987,Positive
77.0,2,1.0,2.0,1.0,39,100.0,0,3.130777776464285,4.61,4.52,4.72,4.53,572154090232449167,"Location, contact, easy set in, nice space - very nice :)",1,0.8952,Positive
75.0,6,2.0,1.0,4.0,24,100.0,0,4.4202884323310805,4.3,4.36,4.58,4.4,23071933,"Great time, very clean. We were greeted on arrival and found us when looking for the apartment.",1,0.8479,Positive
