74.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,1,5.595938481907904,4.82,4.65,4.73,4.74,4563394,Happy with the accomodation.,1,0.5719,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,12,100.0,0,5.344011394870014,4.67,4.17,5.0,4.67,31303886,"Very well designed flat, spacious, top location and Mike was very kind and communicative!",1,0.8008,Positive
160.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,35,98.0,0,1.0407544919436775,4.54,4.66,4.77,4.45,34294913,"I wouldn’t recommend staying here, we stayed at metrolpark branch.<br/>Little to no contact from the hosts, quite frustrating as after several messages sent over the course of months and days - we received an adequate response 1 day into our trip. We advised then several times about our arrival time, with only an automated response. <br/>Actual apartment was okay, but facilities were limited. Small details like no more than three forks, or knifes and no drying wrack. ( the photos make it look more minimal chic than it is ) <br/>  it’s show that there is ‘quiet time’ in the apartment, I think it’s fair to say it’s more silent time - everyone who is air B’n’b guest, is very much secondary to what must be an actual residence apartment. ( me and my partner were talking from one door to the next and we were shhh’d ) by security.<br/>We had to wait 30 minutes to get into the apartment, two random people in the flats let us into the apartment block..luckily a resident knew the security guy to call them, and we were informed the security guard was at another building dealing with an emergency..of course this wouldn’t have been an issue had any of this been communicated.",1,0.8162,Positive
25.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,10,100.0,1,12.411049431736249,4.74,4.36,4.76,4.77,1883235,"Die Wohnung ist super gelegen - toller Blick vom Balkon - und gut zu erreichen. Ich war nur für eine Nacht dort und alles entsprach meinen Erwartungen. Christian hat mich sehr nett begrüßt, war sehr hilfsbereit und unkompliziert in der Kommunikation. Vielen Dank für die Gastfreundschaft!",1,-0.9184,Negative
