70.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,1,2.5329341972975428,4.86,4.8,4.93,4.8,19976281,"Best host ever, and thank you for having me and Friend, we have a really great time here. See you soon at Berlin!!! Everyone is going to Berlin this is a very great place to stay.",1,0.9664,Positive
360.0,7,3.0,1.0,4.0,63,70.0,1,1.458418773500483,4.85,4.94,4.83,4.7,29509865,"we had a great few days stay, from check in to check out everything was so smooth and made the stay so much better. I highly recommend this accommodation.",0,0.8771,Positive
171.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,44,90.0,1,11.510851452846596,4.78,4.8,4.79,4.66,699820589487993617,Great stay,1,0.6249,Positive
56.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,0,8.253434016995653,4.52,4.38,4.64,4.48,48135198,"Die Wohnung ist sehr schön gelegen, gut ausgestattet und wir haben uns grundsätzlich sicher und wohl gefühlt. Leider gab es aber auch einige Punkte, die unseren Aufenthalt getrübt haben. Der Boden war bei unserer Ankunft ziemlich dreckig, das Sofa krümelig und fleckig – es machte insgesamt einen ungepflegten Eindruck. Außerdem war der zusätzliche Schlafplatz für die dritte Person nicht vorbereitet, obwohl ich das im Vorfeld ausdrücklich kommuniziert hatte.<br/>Ein weiterer Punkt war die Belüftung: Die Wohnung war sehr stickig, aber die Co-Hosts oder Nachbarn baten uns, die Rollläden zum Garten nicht zu öffnen um die Privatsphäre zu wahren, wodurch kaum frische Luft hereinkam. Das war besonders im Sommer ziemlich unangenehm.<br/>Insgesamt hat die Unterkunft viel Potenzial, aber an der Sauberkeit müsste gearbeitet werden. Vor allem weil es so wirkt als würden sie beinahe vom Gast erwarten zu putzen (No-Shoe Policy, Bett ab beziehen, Müll wegbringen)",1,-0.9955,Negative
82.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,39,100.0,1,2.6312481831758783,4.9,4.93,4.87,4.71,911483835514887240,Till is a wonderful host. The place was beautiful and very comfortable! I would highly recommend! Would go there again!,1,0.9419,Positive
80.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,48,100.0,1,6.045138877561001,4.94,4.89,4.81,4.78,11901953,"Absolutely beautiful studio in a super convenient location, just steps from the S-Bahn and U-Bahn! The decor was gorgeous and so much care had obviously been taken with every aspect of the flat. We had enough space for 2 people on our 4-night stay, including a little balcony where my partner could smoke; the fridge was stocked with beer, wine, and Apfelschoerle, and maps on the fridge and the back door gave helpful recommendations of places to eat, shop (and avoid!) in Neukoelln and Berlin as a whole. We loved it here and would definitely stay again!<br/>A couple things to note--we both found the mattress a little firm, and could have used another set of pillows (so 2 each); also, the electric fan provided didn't work, which wasn't a problem in early May but might be inconvenient later in the summer. The bathroom is also quite small with a door that opens inward, so some careful manoeuvring was required! :)",1,0.962,Positive
70.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,45,100.0,1,7.344433921617253,4.92,4.98,4.63,4.81,44537031,"Thanks Marlen for having us! The apartment is really nice and clean and we felt very much at home. Went running in the mornings around the canal, which was great - beautiful nature around! The WiFi was good for us to do some remote working. Had a lovely stay :)",1,0.9803,Positive
98.0,6,3.0,2.0,6.0,23,94.0,1,0.9930406419174836,4.64,4.6,4.91,4.69,6232949,"Wir haben einen herrlichen Aufenthalt verbracht und wir hoffen zurückzukommen. Alles ging gut gut, die Wohnung ist praktisch und angenehm, und natürlich sehr schön lokalisiert.<br/>Die allgemeine Beziehung mit Hae-Ok war leicht und angenehm, sie hat auf unsere Bequemlichkeit geachtet.  Wir sind sehr zufrieden! Vielen Dank für alles!<br/>Eric B.",0,-0.855,Negative
128.0,6,1.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,0,2.0526253137138544,4.66,4.61,4.86,4.57,11290301,Amazing air bnb with an amazing host!,1,0.8356,Positive
152.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,36,100.0,1,4.067121946499752,4.94,4.96,4.92,4.88,53089482,"The apartment was beautiful and everything was nearby!  Uta was an amazing host, highly recommended!",0,0.8854,Positive
384.0,5,3.0,1.0,5.0,83,100.0,0,13.830947427417978,4.89,4.67,4.76,4.56,28143091,"Die Wohnung liegt wirklich nur 3 Minuten vom Ku’damm entfernt und ist trotzdem ( und vor allem was die Schlafzimmer angeht) ein Ort der Ruhe! Selbst mit geöffneten Fenstern zum Innenhof kann man nachts ruhig schlafen, super!<br/>Man fühlt sich in der Wohnung sofort wohl, das ein oder andere Möbelstück ist vielleicht ein bisschen zu viel, aber uns hat es sehr gefallen. Die Küche ist fantastisch, hier fehlt es an nichts.<br/>Parkplätze sind ausreichend und sogar kostenfrei direkt vor der Tür zu finden, top! <br/>Tatjana ist eine äußerst freundliche Gastgeberin, der Check-Inn hat problemlos geklappt. Wir können die Wohnung absolut empfehlen!",0,-0.9514,Negative
48.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,27,100.0,1,5.293059373334779,4.83,4.69,4.93,4.74,45606656,"Thiago had great local recommendations and was very friendly at first. He had many rules about how to use the apartment. Some were reasonable while others seemed very anal retentive. He wanted me to close doors silently, not bring over guests and not make noise past 10pm. All of those were reasonable and stated clearly in the listing. The unreasonable ones were that I wasn't allowed to use the trash bin in the bathroom (I put a toothpaste container in it before he informed me of this rule) and the shower curtain needed to remain open when not in use. He was very incensed by me breaking those last two rules. <br/>The major issue was all the noise. After a long day of travel I tried taking a nap but kept getting woken up by someone blasting techno mixed with memes, like something you'd hear on TikTok. This made staying there impossible so I cancelled my stay and booked a nearby hotel for about the same price.",1,0.5148,Positive
64.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,0,4.614969004067335,4.39,4.23,4.51,4.45,323255,We had a really great stay!,1,0.6893,Positive
79.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,32,100.0,1,4.29592945123625,4.87,4.85,4.7,4.72,39387823,"Getting the keys to the place was a little complicated because the address was a tewnty minutes walk away! But we had a very enjoyable week in Berlin! The place was very well equiped with all things necessary!  We did not have to buy tea, toilet paper, cleaning utensils etc.  We  could  regulate the heating as to our needs.<br/>We did not meet Paulina personally, so we had the whole flat to ourselves! There wasn`t anything to complain about!  I can recommend this place wholeheartedly!",1,0.8607,Positive
89.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,51,100.0,1,6.670122906813517,4.97,4.99,4.92,4.93,16608497,My stay at Roberts was short but sweet and he made sure that I was well prepared for exploring Berlin. This place is brilliant and Robert was extremely helpful during my stay in Berlin and I could not recommend this place more.,1,0.9619,Positive
77.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,0,6.266793012378933,4.7,4.65,4.53,4.7,6264703,"Had a good stay- location was convenient and Berlin was easily accessible by subway. Some stores and restaurants within walking distance. The description was fairly accurate but the apartment did lack airflow, had a garbage disposal outside the window, and was occasionally noisy late at night. Despite this, the space was sufficient and we enjoyed our stay.",1,0.5483,Positive
123.0,4,1.0,1.0,4.0,32,100.0,0,5.086004020180417,4.79,4.88,4.78,4.75,7543419,"Martin ein netter und hilfsbereiter Gastgeber. Die Kommunikation verlief schnell und problemslos. Es war nur ein kurzer Aufenthalt bei Martin, aber der Aufenthalt war angenehm. Die Unterkunft hatte alles, was man so braucht. Das Einizige, was etwas Probleme bereitete war die Parkplatzsuche, aber bei einem langen Transporter war das zu erwarten in einer so großen Stadt wei Berlin, trotzdem gerne wieder!",1,-0.9828,Negative
159.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,37,99.0,0,1.8467161104240724,4.73,4.79,4.67,4.51,45230697,Heerlijke plek in berlijn. De Airbnb is makkelijk bereikbaar en van alle voorzieningen voorzien. Het ligt op een goede plek in Berlijn omring door leuke restaurants en barretjes!,1,0.0,Neutral
164.0,5,2.0,2.0,3.0,30,100.0,1,1.753209774100189,4.83,4.72,4.83,4.75,3188899,"Couldn’t recommend staying here any higher. Ronald went above and beyond and was incredibly helpful. The apartment itself is great, in a fantastic location, and has everything you need. Many thanks for a great stay!",0,0.9665,Positive
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,34,100.0,0,6.40921007149076,5.0,4.68,4.89,4.75,8757753,"Hier hat alles gestimmt. Wir sind zu viert für 10 Tage in Berlin in Antonios Wohnung gewesen. Es ist alles in der Wohnung , was man braucht und die Lage ist klasse. Mit Bus oder Bahn kommt man schnell überall hin, auch in die Stadt laufen geht von da aus. Es gibt einen Parkplatz für das Auto hinterm Haus. Kommunikation klappte wunderbar. Antonio ist sehr nett  und hat viele gute Tipps. Wir kommen gerne wieder!",1,-0.8439,Negative
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,15,100.0,0,4.989454444937099,4.57,4.36,4.79,4.64,26766933,"Leah's place is really good, and she was really easy and helpful with everything. The apartment is in Neukölln and the street itself is a bit dirty, but the place is cute, comfortable and well communicated (close to Tempelhof and Kreuzberg). Nice rooms, lots of light, open spaces and cool vinyls. Thanks!",1,0.978,Positive
97.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,50,100.0,1,7.213357439951281,4.85,4.78,4.72,4.75,11772098,A fabulous find in a quiet street close to two stations and plenty of cafes and restaurants.   Spacious and private with an outside eating area and hammock relaxation which we used most days.,1,0.7783,Positive
171.0,7,2.0,1.0,4.0,43,100.0,0,5.310747178957121,4.76,4.64,4.75,4.67,46864073,Logement spacieux pour une capitale comme Berlin,0,0.0,Neutral
89.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,17,100.0,1,4.64019565298711,4.88,4.74,4.85,4.78,21759319,"Katrin apartment is perfect, near the sbahn or ubahn, plenty of restaurants and markets outside.<br/>Above all I've appreciated the quiet neighborhood and the silence around.<br/>I do really suggest this place if you wanna enjoy Berlin at the most",1,0.8807,Positive
141.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,43,94.0,0,7.131273504704622,4.74,4.82,4.79,4.62,49070135,"Had a great stay. It was as seen in the preview photos, their responses were super fast, no complaints. All in all very good experience and the cafe downstairs serves a huge and cozy breakfast!",1,0.8716,Positive
77.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,96.0,0,2.3542346381151287,5.0,5.0,5.0,4.88,1459204037106927570,"Absolutely loved my stay here! Nice and quiet, super clean and equipped with everything you could possibly need! Lovely host, super responsive and helpful, can’t recommend this place enough, I’ll be back for sure next time I’m in Berlin:)",1,0.9848,Positive
111.0,2,1.0,1.0,3.0,41,100.0,1,5.790929574161853,4.94,4.97,4.87,4.79,45088260,"Die Wohnung ist in perfektem Zustand, schick, gemütlich, praktisch eingerichtet und sehr ruhig. Germàn ist ein sehr aufmerksamer Gastgeber und war immer erreichbar. Die Schlüsselübergabe hat sehr gut funktioniert. Wir kommen gern wieder und hoffen, dass die Wohnung dann frei ist.",1,-0.9485,Negative
