91.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,1,8.817911680222384,4.97,4.95,4.74,4.82,1091873635038967035,"That was really nice, clean, cosy appartment, located in really quiet part of the city. The public transport stop is not far away and it's easy to get to any Berlin center. A grocery is not far away from the apartment (5 or some more minutes to get to it by walk) .  We came very late at night, but the host was waiting for us to show around everything.  Thank you!",1,0.7862,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,29,82.0,1,2.6808853188639663,4.67,4.68,4.92,4.59,43823296,"Really enjoyed our stay. Friendly reception staff and got a river-facing room upgrade free of charge. The rooms were stylish, clean and practical. Amazing waterfall shower and had everything to hand. Would highly recommend",1,0.9705,Positive
