257.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,42,100.0,0,1.2937250483136316,4.63,4.63,4.85,4.51,12047604,"We had a great stay: the apartment is in a very central location, in a lively neighbourhood but the bedrooms are very quiet at night as they are facing the courtyard. The apartment is well equipped. <br/>The communication with the host was fast and easy.<br/>Be aware that the apartment is on the 3rd floor without an elevator. And the pillows on the beds are huge, so you might want to bring your own pillow if you're a difficult sleeper:-)",0,0.7714,Positive
