125.0,4,2.0,1.0,2.0,22,100.0,0,6.90097935654005,4.75,4.81,4.68,4.72,23878511,Perfect for what we needed for .<br/>Nice and quiet place to relax after all the activities in town. Easy to get into the center with public transportation at any time.<br/>Enjoyed the stay and Steffen was responding very quickly at all times even we didn’t get a chance to meet him. We all highly recommend his place.,1,0.923,Positive
