64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,22,100.0,0,7.0443944263505145,4.75,4.25,4.5,4.75,37287052,"I stayed in Alexandra’s place for 4 days and i really enjoyed it. The location is amazing, about 20-30 mins walk to Tiergarten, 5-8 mins from the U-Bahn.  A lot restaurants, few shops and supermarkets nearby. Communication with Alexandra before and during the stay was fast, smooth and clear. She was flexible with the check in and check out. The place is superbly clean and quiet. Totally recommended.",1,0.9402,Positive
83.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,21,100.0,0,6.622363259335782,4.09,3.64,4.64,3.82,1354292453017099110,"Ergin was an amazing host, he kept checking up to see if we needed anything. The apartment was beautiful and in such a great location if you want to stay outside the city. It was just around the corner from Neukölln station making it easy to get anywhere. I would 100% suggest staying with Ergin",1,0.9432,Positive
