91.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,35,94.0,0,5.406665066832042,4.59,4.7,4.81,4.41,2850204,"I can highly recommend Fulvia's place! A relatively quiet area but very close to the Bergmannstrasse and Kreuzbergs other hot areas! Also, it is only a 5 minute walk to public transportation :-) The apartment itself was clean and comfortable, everything we needed was there.",1,0.925,Positive
141.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,19,100.0,1,7.917329035356467,4.65,4.79,4.32,4.5,12925015,"Jan's apartment was well situated near a U-Bahn Station in a quiet area but with a commercial district nearby.  The Central Berlin area as well as Tegel Airport was very accessible. Jan was an excellent and accommodating host, met us at the apartment and offered great suggestions about places to eat! He always responded to questions in a timely manner.  Highly recommended!<br/>",1,0.9476,Positive
111.0,5,2.0,1.0,4.0,35,100.0,0,3.428773290668755,4.7,4.77,4.78,4.62,27259147,"Yaz's place was perfect for our one night stay when attending a concert in Kreuzberg! easy self check in, clear communication and a clean apartment!",1,0.9097,Positive
40.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,59,100.0,1,9.448364402503817,4.97,4.94,4.82,4.96,14259993,"Little bit further out, bus & train into Berlin, easy to navigate public transport which keeps costs down. Room & bathroom separate area, able to do laundry, use of kitchen & fridge. <br/>Made to feel welcome, highly recommend.",1,0.8268,Positive
120.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,46,100.0,1,9.29605165579442,4.73,4.85,4.66,4.6,3047076,"Fai's apartment was a perfect spot for our only night in Berlin. Easily accessible by Sbahn from the airport, her friend was there to let us in. The beds are comfy, and the morning coffee is tasty on the balcony surrounded by leafy trees.",1,0.8519,Positive
141.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,43,94.0,0,7.131273504704622,4.74,4.82,4.79,4.62,49070135,Super! Ich komme gerne wieder,1,0.636,Positive
141.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,23,100.0,1,1.1632932394280655,4.73,4.76,4.92,4.63,16167725,"This is the most stunning high ceiling apartment with amazing decor. It really did feel like I was in Berlin even when I was inside. Really good location for restaurants, bars, nightlife and transport links. The windows blocked out all the outside noise and kitchen had all the needed amenities. <br/>Only piece of improvement would be the squeaky bed frame which I didn’t mind myself but it’s to keep in mind. <br/>I’ll definitely stay here again when I’m back in Berlin, so overall i was super happy and satisfied. Also the host was very friendly and accommodating. We were offered a space for our luggage before and after our stay. <br/>Thank you so much",1,0.9856,Positive
125.0,12,4.0,1.0,2.0,15,100.0,0,3.478399439296858,4.19,4.45,4.46,4.06,3427815,"Clean budget apartment, location is good. ",0,0.6808,Positive
90.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,45,100.0,1,3.6178758418911023,4.85,4.82,4.9,4.73,540335929043609328,We had a great stay! everything was clean and anca was a really friendly host :),1,0.9306,Positive
64.0,5,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,5.604846490618774,4.87,4.73,4.71,4.81,4981709,"Staying with Christos was a very smooth and a pleasant experience. Quick correspondence, enough privacy, nice room and useful ideas on how to enjoy Berlin. Christos didn't mind our son building with legos on his kitchen table most mornings and evenings either... For somebody with an asthma the air could be a bit difficult to breath. For our family this was a great stay - thank you!",1,0.9506,Positive
156.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,89.0,1,1.0479113444668116,4.85,4.84,4.92,4.7,1345611651216239245,Sehr gute Lage.<br/>flexibler check-in und check out.<br/>Sehr gute Erreichbarkeit,1,0.0,Neutral
