104.0,5,2.0,2.0,3.0,54,100.0,0,7.094164488225506,4.61,4.68,4.53,4.48,53350871,"perfect for couple. if you looking fir an appartment with windows and a lot of light, there is no day light in this appartment.",0,0.3612,Positive
118.0,3,1.0,1.0,1.0,41,97.0,0,1.941053289840044,4.58,4.53,4.8,4.36,735085199089327822,"Der Aufenthalt war für drei Personen gut. Das einzig Problem war, dass wie im Appartement trotz den Heizungen in der Nacht frierten.<br/>Sonst alles tiptop.",1,-0.8885,Negative
125.0,3,2.0,1.0,2.0,35,100.0,0,2.6093004941937656,4.88,4.92,4.86,4.83,52095972,"Great clean, tidy warm and cosy room. Plenty of hot water for bath/showers. Constantly warm and comfy space. Close to all public transport. Great host.",1,0.9287,Positive
131.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,38,100.0,0,12.838397360460151,5.0,5.0,4.94,4.88,4539101,"It was a great stay for us.  We had a long stay of 2 weeks as my son had to attend summer school at Berlin Freie University. It was a walking distance to the university and many  beautiful restaurants, supermarkets and shopping areas. The house was very clean and  equipped with all what you may need. We extremely enjoyed our stay, thanks to Gabriela",1,0.9551,Positive
54.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,33,100.0,1,6.916406228715269,5.0,5.0,4.82,5.0,1172468847858504087,"My stay was wonderful! Their place spoke through the photos and warm description of their home. Truly, the photos don't do it enough justice. The unique flat comes with everything: The large bedroom has a super comfortable double bed, and the bathroom is right next to it, private to me. Every morning I had a hot cup of tea sitting in the window nook in my room while the sunlight sparkled. Both Bruni & Andreas are warm and kind people, so I felt right at home. After a long day, or on our way out to work we shared interesting conversations. At the same time, the flat is big enough to take time in solitude. I had the luck of being in Berlin during the public transport strike. Bruni offered to drive me on those days, which was super hospitable! Also, at the end of my stay the two of us had a lovely Saturday in which we explored Berlin by foot and food. This a memory which I hold dear, as is my whole stay. A creative flat with openminded people. Definitely recommend this gem! Big thank you!",1,0.9943,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,24,100.0,0,5.199767246963943,4.9,4.87,4.87,4.8,32599870,"Danke an Claudia, für das schöne Gästezimmer, die netten Gespräche und Deine offene Art. Wir haben uns sehr gut aufgehoben gefühlt!",1,-0.636,Negative
163.0,3,1.0,0.0,3.0,16,100.0,0,1.6522173823377917,4.49,4.47,4.62,4.35,44590435,Good stay,1,0.4404,Positive
45.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,37,100.0,1,22.127511864216213,4.98,5.0,4.85,4.94,957308273153301840,I had a great stay. Silvia is an awesome host. Very good communication and smooth check in. The place is super comfy and i felt right at home. Highly recommended 10/10<br/>PS: additional info for bikers - be aware of the cobblestone road. Especially when you are riding a heavy touring bike like me,1,0.9632,Positive
209.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,42,100.0,0,5.703512471819497,4.71,4.63,4.27,4.56,26051342,Very good,0,0.4927,Positive
86.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,28,100.0,1,6.919397234051426,4.86,4.88,4.51,4.74,20942536,"Nous avons été ravis d’avoir été dans cet appartement pendant 1 semaine. Un appartement très bien situé pour visiter Berlin et les alentours. C’est un appartement calme et très beau, où il y a tout ce que l’on a besoin à l’intérieur, il est complet. Je recommande vivement, l’hôte nous a expliqué clairement où se trouvait l’appartement. Merci encore.",1,-0.128,Negative
54.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,15.507270682054347,4.96,4.99,4.64,4.92,17955217,"Nice interior design, reasonable price compared to the popularity of accomodations in Berlin. It's about 40mins away from the city centre by public transportation). They welcomed us so warmly and kindly gave some advises regarding the trip. The place was cozy and even got some free chocolates and a bottle of sparkling water. There was about 7-cm-large spider in the bathroom(it's brown-colored, similar to the color of the floor, so might have been hard to notice) and a head of a hair dryer was broken, but everything except those was fine!",1,0.8711,Positive
205.0,8,2.0,2.0,3.0,32,95.0,0,4.732874564416474,4.63,4.48,4.89,4.48,52762746,"Great stay, exactly as described. Good for a weekend in Berlin with friends.",0,0.8779,Positive
121.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,47,100.0,1,11.509792384341948,4.84,4.82,4.83,4.72,922577986444346265,Erik is very attentive and responsible. <br/>He’s apartment is clean and comfortable. Location is easy to find and public transport is very close.,1,0.8876,Positive
191.0,9,1.0,1.0,9.0,27,93.0,0,2.0004038622479867,4.0,4.0,4.4,4.0,1233351304497423532,Great accommodation with easy check in and out and very close to Alexanderplatz so accessible to the city with the nearby tram stop.<br/>Room was very spacious and clean and had everything you would need for a comfortable stay! + coded entry with no keys etc was greatly appreciated! <br/>Highly recommend for  groups travelling to Berlin!,0,0.9601,Positive
114.0,3,1.0,1.0,2.0,48,100.0,1,1.7854128309165902,4.85,4.78,4.89,4.75,17741498,"Comfy, clean, and well located. Only thing which would make it better is if there was wi-fi - make sure you have mobile data!",1,0.8516,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,36,100.0,0,6.995237261165367,5.0,4.64,4.82,4.82,14778320,"We had an extended stay at this airbnb and were completely comfortable and enjoyed our time there. We cooked in the kitchen and had everything we needed. Easy access to public transportation. Spacious apartment with a beautiful balcony. Great local restaurants and a cafe across the street. Only complaint is the pull out mattress is pretty uncomfortable. Very firm and you can feel the bars underneath it. Honestly helped us enjoy the city to get out of bed early! Tons of windows to keep the apartment cool in the heat, and the natural light was nice. Fast WiFi and desk setup made working remotely better than at home!",1,0.987,Positive
146.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,90.0,1,11.510851452846596,4.66,4.71,4.8,4.53,699804614899553353,"Great stay, highly recommend",1,0.7841,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,25,100.0,1,13.184210212864448,4.95,4.78,4.97,4.84,233083,"Nach aktiven Arbeitstagen war die Wohnung wie eine wunderbare Oase der Entspannung.<br/>Sie ist ruhig, hell, sehr klar gestaltet - und die kleine Dachterasse lässt morgens den Tag gut anfangen und ihn abends bei schöner Sicht über die Dächer noch ausklingen.<br/>Schnelles Internet, eine gute Musikanlage, Fernseher (für den ich nie Zeit hatte) , die nötigen Sachen für die Küche - alles verfügbar! <br/>Auch das Viertel, in dem die Wohnung liegt, ist hübsch und die Verkehrsanbindung ins Zentrum ideal.<br/>Insgesamt sehr empfehlenswert - ich habe die Wohnung genossen!<br/>Annegret Sch. aus Murnau<br/>",1,-0.9905,Negative
382.0,10,4.0,3.0,7.0,67,100.0,1,0.3818051753636292,4.96,4.9,4.98,4.88,1260209089340243876,"Perfect place for the weekend! <br/>Exactly as the description and the images, very functional and modern. <br/>Highly recommended !! <br/>Location is great too, very accessible.",0,0.8879,Positive
203.0,6,3.0,1.0,3.0,43,100.0,1,4.140963863667464,4.89,4.92,4.89,4.78,4182815,Die Wohnung ist ein Traum und wir haben uns sehr wohl gefühlt.  Schlüsselübergabe beim Ein-und Auschecken war problemlos und auch die Auscheckzeit (12 Uhr) sehr angenehm.Die Lage (mitten in Kreuzberg und trotzdem ruhig ) ist super. Wir kommen gerne wieder.,0,-0.8316,Negative
53.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,23,100.0,1,1.9136892540066155,4.82,4.73,4.95,4.74,851577798843640421,Appartement très bien situé. Les déplacements peuvent se faire à pied ou en transport en commun. Le quartier est très agréable et vivant. Nous recommandons vivement pour des jeunes !,1,0.0,Neutral
