280.0,7,2.0,2.0,6.0,42,96.0,0,6.1770612336798365,4.52,4.47,4.8,4.46,27018623,"Probably the best area for visitors that stay for 5-7 days. Can easily fit 7 people, it’s near to the town centre and metro stations can be easily accessed. Definitely my first book when visiting Berlin again.",0,0.9217,Positive
