386.0,6,3.0,3.0,3.0,53,100.0,1,5.61647989496104,4.75,4.54,4.91,4.53,558489051475905817,"Great location, it was perfect for us. The house is in a quiet court yard. Lively surrounding, lots of cafes, restaurants and bars. Tilmann and Florian are very responsive hosts. Thanks guys!",0,0.9513,Positive
71.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,38,100.0,1,1.4609881394793005,4.94,4.98,4.97,4.87,25252686,"A superb place: <br/>- Nice Room, that feel's bigger then in the photos<br/>- Comfy Bed<br/>- Stylish, clean and comfy bath with a perfect shower<br/>And of course Amber is a super nice Host, that was always super helpful with great advise where to get the most tasty dinner, breakfast, etc. She has the perfect balance of making you feel very welcome and still leaving you all the privacy you need.<br/>I would definitely book again.",1,0.9909,Positive
69.0,4,1.0,1.0,1.0,26,100.0,1,6.409080116623725,4.8,4.78,4.86,4.75,24216126,"Die Wohnung ist super gelegen.<br/>Discounter um die Ecke, Restaurant s ebenfalls, für Speis und Trank ist also gesorgt. Ein Sprung über die Straße und man steht direkt auf dem alten Flughafen Gelände Tempelhof, super für groß und klein sich auszutoben.<br/>Der S-BAHNHOF Tempelhof ist ebenfalls nur zwei Gehminuten entfernt, von dort ist man, mit einmal umsteigen am Südkreuz, in zehn Minuten am Potsdamer Platz, Super.<br/>Meine Empfehlung.",1,-0.5994,Negative
184.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,40,100.0,1,1.859658170121276,4.96,4.87,4.94,4.82,878074,Perfekt sted! Vi kam varmt anbefale at bo hos Camilla 👍,1,0.0,Neutral
138.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,28,94.0,1,1.3414679907056335,4.86,4.89,4.96,4.77,1021570018421874003,"Ideal apartment in a great location. Close to Hackescher Markt station making links to the city centre easy. <br/>Communications were excellent and checking in could not have been easier. <br/>The apartment was clean and had everything we needed. <br/>The shower is raised therefore may be tricky to enter for some, but once in the shower is amazing. <br/>All in all the perfect apartment for our needs in this great city.",1,0.9772,Positive
