207.0,4,2.0,1.5,2.0,48,98.0,1,2.2099121550415086,4.91,4.95,4.98,4.81,11040435,"Beautifully decorated space, spacious areas, great location and very nice hosts. We absolutely loved the apartment and will sure try to book again when we return to Berlin.",0,0.9544,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,37,100.0,0,4.446574380104264,4.93,4.84,4.65,4.82,2616603,"Stylish 2 bedroom apartment with everything needed for a long term stay. Wife and I spent 2 weeks at Julia's while I worked remotely from Berlin and it was perfect for our needs. Wifi is very strong in the router room but gets a little weak in the kitchen and main bedroom, but the apartment is located very close to supermarkets and public transport. A 10 - 15 minute walk to Karl Marx Allee with nightlife and restaurants. Really enjoyed it, the only issue was that there was construction in the early mornings and also a school with children screaming in the afternoons, so I wouldn't recommend planning to sleep in!",1,-0.1653,Negative
65.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,31,100.0,1,4.1903954031521735,4.75,4.86,4.65,4.65,499342,This was a lovely little apartment in a quiet neighbourhood. The apartment was clean and very nicely decorated (so nicely infact that I feel decoration took precedence over comfort in one instance - there was no comfy place to sit other than the bed... but that's a minor niggle). Karsten was super friendly and attentive and we really enjoyed our stay.,1,0.9724,Positive
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,52,100.0,1,2.730050050817645,5.0,4.98,5.0,5.0,931605296858056737,"A stylish top floor apartment with a spacious layout, fully stocked, and wonderful host.",1,0.6969,Positive
35.0,1,1.0,1.0,1.0,15,89.0,0,7.244947551673602,4.92,4.97,4.84,4.95,45719848,I had an enjoyable stay with this kind and beautiful couple - Suzana and Mannal. They were very helpful and friendly.I will miss the coffee with Mannal in the morning :) ! Hope to visit this place again in near future!,1,0.9627,Positive
171.0,4,3.0,1.5,3.0,44,100.0,0,3.7941628305863695,4.92,4.85,4.92,4.87,35611317,"We had a lovely stay at Ingo and Susanna's flat! Susanna was extremely friendly and responsive and made us feel right at home upon arrival. <br/>The apartment is lovely, well-decorated, and spacious with tons of natural light — just like the photos. It's very quiet but also right in the middle of one of Berlin's best neighborhoods with tons and coffee shops and good restaurants nearby. It's also half a block away from a U station. <br/>We would definitely stay here again in the future.",0,0.9641,Positive
