98.0,6,3.0,2.0,6.0,23,94.0,1,0.9930406419174836,4.64,4.6,4.91,4.69,6232949,"Apartment was in a great location, looking out on Hackescher Markt and 10 mins walk to Alexanderplatz. TXL bus to Tegal airport dropped us off 5 mins walk from apartment. Ideal location for bars/restaurants/shops and very central for viewing tourist attractions.  It was equipped with all the necessities required. If you are looking for a 4 star hotel then this apartment is not for you. It is a basic apartment but has everything we needed for our 4 night stay in Berlin. ",0,0.6858,Positive
