228.0,5,1.0,1.0,2.0,61,100.0,1,3.690195125206819,4.99,4.91,4.97,4.8,704976656646850837,"I have had a lot of good experiences with AirBnBs, but this was the best. Check in instructions were very detailed and easy to follow. Apartment was very nice and very clean. Location is perfect, Mercedes Benz arena, Verti Music Hall, a large mall and several food choices just minutes walk away.<br/>Kathrin was very friendly and responsive to my messages. One of the best hosts I have encountered, will definitely be staying again next time I am in town for a show.",1,0.9931,Positive
