90.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,34,100.0,0,18.49343314749856,4.74,4.77,4.5,4.81,5065008,Gerd's apartment is very clean and perfect for a small family. I had a great time in his apartment during my vacation in Berlin. I will definitely recommend someone who has a small family/a group to stay in his apartment during the vacation in Berlin.,1,0.9456,Positive
