201.0,5,2.0,1.0,3.0,30,99.0,0,3.1379311708738555,4.87,4.79,4.82,4.68,1049406291021535100,"Such an amazing place to stay - it was flawless!<br/>Very spacious flat, located on the ground floor with nearby and easy access to public transport. No loud noises at night.<br/>Beautifully renovated and decorated - pictures are highly accurate.<br/>Very responsive  and friendly hosts.<br/>Easy keyless check-in at night (we arrived close to midnight).",1,0.895,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,11,100.0,0,8.83642339756307,5.0,4.7,4.7,4.9,18386291,"Très agréable séjour au prés de Dorothea et de sa fille qui ont été de parfaites hôtes, très a l'écoute et sympathiques. L'appartement de celles ci est très bien placé (proche métro et non loin du centre), avec une chambre très spacieuse, propre et agréable (un petit balcon privatif vous est dédié ). On recommande vivement Dorothea pour un super séjour à Berlin et de parfaits conseils en Français (un gros plus quand on ne parle pas la langue locale, comme cela a été le cas pour nous) . ",1,0.5994,Positive
104.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,31,100.0,1,4.2642040908590895,4.8,4.63,4.66,4.6,668570668765950332,Sehr schöne Wohnung mit allem was man braucht und toller Lage,1,0.0,Neutral
188.0,2,0.0,1.0,2.0,40,100.0,0,9.518637747787295,4.49,4.56,4.68,4.45,45905820,"Great apartment, facilities and also location.<br/>מתאימה מאד לשומרי כשרות, קרובה מאד למסעדת בלייברגרס.",1,0.6249,Positive
123.0,6,2.0,1.0,3.0,40,100.0,0,2.6617513009290934,4.58,4.59,4.81,4.47,1827536,"Marc was a superb host. He was there when we arrived to welcome us, it was very hot day and he went out and got us a large electric fan that made the apartment much cooler (the windows could be opened wide as well). The apartment is very spacious - even though the living room had a double bed in it, it still felt large and airy. There is a separate dining room, double bedroom, a small kitchen area and a nice bathroom with a very powerful shower. All toiletries were provided which was a lovely touch. The kitchen was very well equipped with crockery and utensils, and also tea bags, coffee, basic cooking condiments. There is a microwave and a small electric hot plate, plus a large fridge freezer. We didn't do any cooking, but if we had wanted to, everything was provided. The apartment is about 7 mins walk from the metro. Nearby are loads of shops, cafés, restaurants and a very nice organic supermarket where we shopped for breakfast every morning. The only thing I would say is that the apartment can be a little noisy from the street outside (I don't suppose this would happen if the windows were closed but it was too hot for that in July). We didn't really mind, it was just ordinary street noise (people laughing  and talking, cars going by etc) but if quiet is very important to you, you should bear it in mind. <br/>We loved the apartment and the area and would definitely consider returning. Thank you Marc for a lovely stay (and for the fan!)",1,0.9905,Positive
108.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,30,100.0,1,3.72790372586266,4.86,4.95,4.88,4.64,54088100,"This was a very clean, quiet and convenient place and perfect for what we needed. Instructions were super clear. Neighborhood is very charming and close to the subway. Highly recommend!",1,0.9656,Positive
118.0,4,1.0,1.0,3.0,36,100.0,0,4.139944932745458,4.65,4.65,4.84,4.57,1127604970222666191,Nice flat in really good neighbourhood in a beautiful building with outdoor area. The hosts were responsive and such a cuties. Everything was comfortable and clean. And in the backyard you can be greeted by the cutest cat. Highly recommmend!,1,0.9794,Positive
