137.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,47,100.0,1,2.759966591003808,4.94,4.92,4.94,4.81,768616,"Beautiful and clean apartment. Loved the space and location. Only problem was that there is only one lift and it was broken for the duration of our stay. So it is not family friendly. We struggled up 7 floors with a baby, car seat, pram, luggage etc. I accept that this was out of Cornelius's control. He is a very attentive host and he did give us a partial refund for the broken lift. I would stay here again, but not with a baby! Despite the lift, we had a really great time here. 10/10 apartment.",1,0.816,Positive
