32.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,18,100.0,0,3.2159665482867226,4.77,4.71,4.88,4.65,17904,"Our stay at Max's apartment was wonderful. The place is exactly as described/pictured, and in a very lovely location right near the canal. The Turkish market right outside twice a week is a great bonus too!<br/>Check-in was effortless, and Friedrich (landlord) explained everything to us and even let us drop our bags off early. <br/>The apartment was clean and spacious, and had everything we needed for a 2 week stay. Definitely recommend this place.  ",1,0.9701,Positive
