202.0,5,2.0,2.0,1.0,45,100.0,0,1.8845881262763091,4.92,5.0,4.95,4.82,582473762475300993,"The bedroom and the bathroom are both clean, spacious and quite comfortable. The whole apartment is warm and welcoming and the hosts are lovely people. It was our first time renting just a room and sharing the apartment with the hosts, and it was a very positive experience. The location is great, walking distance to metro, buses and trains plus great local cafes, bars and restaurants. Would definitely rent again.",0,0.9855,Positive
