94.0,3,0.0,1.0,2.0,29,100.0,1,0.9546645327029104,4.87,4.81,4.89,4.81,22662699,"Location made it easy to get around to all the places we wanted to go in Berlin. Neighbors were extremely loud at all hours of the night, made sleeping very difficult.",1,0.0276,Neutral
