251.0,3,1.0,2.0,1.0,50,100.0,0,1.1141862410300436,4.79,4.74,4.89,4.68,50860772,"You really must see Larissa's place to believe it. It is spectacular! And the beautiful pictures don't do it justice because it is even more beautiful than the pictures. In addition to the elegance of the place, it has everything you will need for a comfortable stay, including two large, well-equipped bathrooms. We loved the two terraces, and the one with the city view is simply breathtaking. I highly recommend this apartment!",1,0.9709,Positive
167.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,46,100.0,0,4.149945021768397,4.93,4.88,4.89,4.74,701909,"This was a wonderful stay at Lorant and Sonja's place. The loft is roomy, airy, full of light and quiet. The neighborhood is very nice and lively, full of shops, restaurants and cafes. Lorant and Sonja were great hosts, responsive, attentive, knowledgeable, generous, full of recommendations and suggestions.",1,0.9631,Positive
