197.0,7,3.0,2.0,4.0,46,100.0,1,30.241564176287284,4.91,4.8,4.81,4.8,16889808,"Wunderbar gelegenes Haus. Die Einrichtung ist sehr geschmackvoll und es ist alles vorhanden, was man braucht, um sich wohl zu fühlen! Es ist schön nach dem Gewühl in Berlin Stadtmitte an einen so malerischen Ort zurückkehren kann. Absolute Empfehlung!",0,-0.6688,Negative
125.0,2,1.0,1.0,2.0,21,100.0,1,8.187543141932318,4.92,4.93,4.9,4.8,1266630,"Apartment was very clean, modern and exactly as shown.   Location was better than I expected-close to U-bahn and excellent local restaurants.  Communication was easy and rapid.  Wifi was excellent.",1,0.945,Positive
84.0,2,0.0,1.0,1.0,18,88.0,1,3.2402791774170403,4.77,4.89,4.92,4.69,16183018,"Fine neighbourhood, cosy apartment, easy communication. Would recommend!",1,0.7574,Positive
48.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,16,100.0,1,7.638274883014644,4.98,4.98,4.68,4.86,39213674,"Es handelt sich um ein schnuckeliges Zimmer, dass sehr gemütlich ist, und sehr ruhig. Wir haben sehr sehr gut geschlafen. Die kleinen Geschirr und Kochutensilien machen ein Frühstück gut möglich. Alles andere haben wir unsere Bewertungen ausführlich gesagt. Wir kommen jederzeit sehr gerne wieder. Kontakt Begegnungen mit den Vermietern zugewandt und freundlich",1,-0.5994,Negative
125.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,64,100.0,0,25.690983978590776,4.83,4.83,4.63,4.65,13276162,"Liebevoll eingerichtete Wohnung. Perfekt für Familien, aber auch für uns als Paar.",1,0.0,Neutral
95.0,4,1.0,1.0,2.0,12,100.0,0,7.932419196316966,4.26,4.58,4.48,4.14,2485985,"We loved the location, it's surprisingly quiet and close to everything. In the lockdown times, we tried to avoid the crowds as much as possible, and we really appreciated the proximity to the uncrowded Ring trains, the nearby Edeka center with shopping open until 10 pm when it's never crowded, and long walks in the giant parks of Tiergarten and Schloss Charlottenburg. That's not the kind of Berlin time we remember from the past visits, when the nightlife, eating out, and museums and shows ruled our plans. A different and differently beautiful Berlin and a perfect fit for Liz's cozy place.",1,0.9558,Positive
64.0,2,1.0,1.0,1.0,11,100.0,0,3.4874165058389592,4.29,3.93,4.64,4.11,23348793,"We had an amazing trip in Berlin overall and as always, good trip requires a good accommodation like a nice crisp on a muffin crust. <br/>We don’t regret much of choosing this place, although at first we were confused since we chose it from the map where it was shown right at the Alexander Platz when it was not a walkable distance from there. <br/>This is airbnb website and our fault I would say. We didn’t check it through. After all, we biked every where, which I find very easy and stress-free. Rolling bike in Berlin is awesome. <br/>The room was spacious, more than enough for us two. <br/>There were two separate bed-one shown on the picture Blanca posted and a mattress standing next to the closet. Since my friend had a fever, I wanted to give her space on her own to rest. So I used the mattress and had it on floor, which Blanca kindly accepted. <br/>I must say those were some bed that I would like to have it on my bedroom. We rested really well on those. <br/>Two big towels were provided, two keys were provided along with wifi password and although there were no soaps and shampoo for guests, Blanca kindly offered to use hers. <br/>Bathroom had interesting aspects! You would wanna check it out. I personally loved the little funky things popping around the whole place. (Map on the wall, a painting at the corridor hanging above your eyesight watching over you, schick designed lamp on the room and etc.)<br/>She responded very well and clear, also just in time. She magically knew what we needed and provided us all with no-tacky-manner. <br/>Absolutely cool host, I recommend to stay. ",1,0.9921,Positive
119.0,4,2.0,1.0,3.0,52,100.0,0,5.951534937224258,4.81,4.63,4.65,4.74,18671787,Sehr hübsche Wohnung in einer gepflegten Umgebung. <br/>Die Kommunikation mit Ulrich und Ines im Vorfeld war sehr freundlich.,1,-0.5994,Negative
